<p. 1>

rīśīlavṛttaphalaṃ śrutaṃ || 15 ||

kvacciddho guru śuśrūṣā sa phalāmuni puṃgavāḥ |
kaccidvaḥ sa phalaṃtapūṃtapaścāṃdrāpaṇādikaṃ || 16 ||

bhavadbhirapi sarvajñaiḥ kiṃ praṣṭavyosmyahaṃ dvijāḥ |
yathāmati pravakṣyāmi vadaṃ tu munipuṃgavāḥ || 17 ||

śatānaṃdādayo viprāḥ itthamuktāstapodhanāḥ |
kṛtāṃjali purā ūrcurnattvā sāṣṭāṃagamādarāt || 18 || 

ṛṣaya ūcuḥ 

bhagavanyogīnāṃ śreṣṭhaṃ sarvaśāstraviśāradaḥ |
kathaṃ brahmavijijñāsyaṃ kīdṛśairniyata vrataiḥ || 19 ||

kathaṃ syādbrahmatādātmyaṃ kālamṛtyoścavaṃcanaṃ kathaṃ |
kālasvarūpaṃ dādibhirdvijaiḥ vibhāṃḍakasutaḥ prāhanāmṛṣīnśaṃsitavratān || 22 ||

 ṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāśca 

yathāmati pravakṣyāmi bhavadbhiḥ pṛṣṭamādarāt |
śrotavyaṃ yogināṃ śreṣṭheḥ sāvadhānaiḥ samāhitaiḥ || 23 || 

narāṇāmakṣi yakṣmāmunmīlananimīlanāt |
nimeṣakāla ityuktaḥ kāṣṭhātetriṃśadīditāḥ || 23 ||

triṃśatkāṣṭhāḥ kalāḥ proktātāḥ ṣaṣṭirnāḍikāḥ smṛtāḥ |
gaḍīrūpaṃ muhūrtaḥ syādyāmasteṣāṃ catuṣṭayaṃ || 24 ||

nāḍyastriṃśadahaḥ proktaṃ triṃśannāḍyoniśāsmṛtā |
ṣaṣṭināḍyo dinaṃ prokta mahorātraṃ tadevahi || 26 ||

taiḥ paṃcadaśabhiḥ yakṣājñat dvayaṃ māsa ucyate |
pakṣe pakṣe paurṇamāsī puṇyātithiramāpi vā || 27 || 

yāmadvayaṃ ṛtuḥ proktamayanaṃ syād tu trayaṃ |
māsairdvādaśabhirviprāḥ saṃvatsara iti smṛtaḥ || 28 ||

(*) (?) nuṣovatsaro divyaṃ dinamekamudīritaṃ |
catvāryāhuḥ sahasrāṇi vatsarāṇāṃ kṛtaṃ yuge || 29 || 

tasya tāvacchratī saṃdhyā devamānena (***)(?) |
(**) (?) varṣa sahasrāṇi tretāyugamiti smṛtaṃ || 30 ||

tasya tāvacchatī saṃdhyā devamānena gaṇyate |
sahasradvayamandānāṃ dvāparaṃ yugamīritaṃ || 31 ||

tasya tāvacchatī saṃ(***)(?) mānena gaṇyate || 32 ||

<p. 2a>

tithayugavatsarāṇāṃ sahasramiti kīrtyata |
tasya tāvacchatīsaṃkhyā devamānena gaṇyate || 

itthaṃ dvādaśasāhasrama(**)(?)devayugaṃ smṛtaṃ || 33 ||  

manvaṃtaraṃ tu divyānāṃ yugānāmekasaptatiḥ |
caturyugānāṃ sāhasraṃ brahmaṇo hatadīritaṃ || 34 ||

tadva(*****)(?)sraṃ niśā brahmaṇa īritā |
caturyugānāṃ sāhasraṃ dvayaṃ brāhmaṃ dinaṃ smṛtaṃ || 35 ||

pūrvoktavidhinā pakṣamāsādi parikalpanā |
caturvaktasya tasyāmasargakṛtparameṣṭinaḥ || 36 ||

tasyāpi svenamānena śatāyuḥ kīrtitaṃ vudhaiḥ |
brahmaṇaḥ paramāyuḥ syāddivasaṃ viṣṇurudravoḥ || 37 ||

īśvarasya vibhoḥ sākṣānnārāyaṇamayasya tu |
naivāhastasya na niśā nityasya paramātmanaḥ || 37 ||

kālaḥ sṛjati bhūtāni kālaḥ pālayati prajāḥ |
kālaḥ saṃharate viśvaṃ kālādhītamidaṃ jagat || 38 || 

layaṃgatā asaṃkhyātā brahmāṇo harayopi ca |
layaṃgatā asaṃkhyātā rudrā api tapodhanāḥ || 39 ||

saṃkhyātuṃ naiva śakyaḥ syācchakrādīnāṃ hi saṃkṣayaḥ |
narāṇāmapi tiryaścākā kathāpipra puṃgavāḥ || 40 ||

tasyākālaṃ durādharṣaṃ sṛṣṭisaṃhārakārakaṃ |
bhakṣayaṃtaṃ jagatsarvaṃ sṛjaṃtamakhilaṃ jagat || 41 ||

pālayaṃtaṃ jagatsarvaṃ śaktojetuṃ na kaścana |
brahmatatvamavijñāya prajayā karmaṇāpi vā || 42 ||

na dhanena na dānairvājetuṃ kālo hi śakyate |
aśrutvācārya śuśrūṣāmavijñāya cidātmakaṃ || 43 ||

brahmatatvaṃ mahadguptaṃ kālojetuṃ na śakyate |
kālasyāpi pitāsākṣādbrahmarūpī śriyaḥ patiḥ || 44 ||

nārāyaṇo mahāyogī satyānaṃdo cidātmakaḥ |
parasya brahmatatvaṃ sākṣānnārāyaṇātmanaḥ || 45 ||

saṃsārasāgarānmuni ravijñāturnavidyate |
ācaryasya kṛpā mūrteḥ sākṣānnārāyaṇātmanaḥ || 46 ||

<p. 2b>

vijijñāsyaṃ brahmatatvaṃ vahukālena sevayā |
tasnānairna tapobhirvā na bhasmasnānatopi vā || 47 ||

nā hiṃsayāmuktisyādbrahmānaṃdasukhātmikā |
gaṃgādi sarvatīrteṣu matsyāśca makarādayaḥ || 48 ||

majjamānā hi tiṣṭhaṃti kiṃ muktāste tapodhanāḥ |
vakāmaunena tiṣṭhaṃti mīnā udakapāyinaḥ || 49 ||

vratairanaśanādyaiste muktāḥ kintu tapodhanāḥ |
rāsabhātryādhicaścāno bhasmāhaṣitavigrahāḥ || 50 ||

satataṃ muktibhājaḥ kiṃścāghāste brāhmaṇottamāḥ |
saṃcaraṃto mṛgānityamahiṃsādharma tatparāḥ || 51 ||

mṛgāḥ kiṃ muktibhājaḥ syurvadaṃ tu munipumgavāḥ |
tasmādācārya śuśrūṣāṃ kṛtvā nityaṃ ciraṃ dvijāḥ || 52 ||

vijñāyā brahmaṇastatvaṃ brahmānaṃdamavāpnuyāt parasya bramaṇo 
bhītyāvānāṃ vāti hasaṃ tataṃ || 53 ||

udeti bhānustādbhītyā jvalatyagnirbhayātataḥ |
tadājñaṣaivakālopi viśvaṃ sṛjati haṃti ca || 54 ||

parasya brahmaṇasta samācāryāt karuṇāmayāt |
vijñāya vaṃcayitvā saukālaṃ sarvabhayāsūrāṃ || 55 ||

brahmānaṃdamayīṃ muktiṃ prāpnotyeva tapodhanāḥ |
saiṣānaṃdasya mīmāṃsā vakṣyate vipra puṃgavāḥ || 56 ||

yuvāsakalavidyānāṃ pāragovalaṃ saṃyutaḥ |
arogī pakvabhugnityaṃ sarvadharmaparāyaṇaḥ || 57 ||

sādhvīpatyanukūlā ca putra(**)(?) samṛddhimān | 
sārvabhaumatvamāsādyamānuṣānaṃdamaśnute || 58 ||

mānuṣānaṃdaśatakaṃ yatproktaṃ śāstravedibhiḥ |
ekomat(**)(?) gaṃdharvānaṃdamuktaḥ śrutau smṛtau || 59 ||

ācārya kṛpayā brahmavidopye tatsukhaṃ dvijāḥ |
śataṃ manuṣyagaṃdharvānaṃdānāṃsataṃ dvijapta || 60 ||

(**)(?) ko devagaṃdharvānaṃdo vedeṣu padyate |
tadānaṃdaśataṃ divyaṃ pitṝṇāṃ munipuṃgavāḥ || 61 ||

ānaṃda eko viprasya brahmatatvavidopi ca |
ānaṃdānāṃśataṃ prokta (**)(?) ājānajāmare || 62 ||

<p. 3a>

ājānajāmarānaṃdaśataṃ karma sureṣvapi |
ānaṃda ekaḥ saṃproktastato mukhyasureṣvapi || 63 ||

tadānaṃdaśataṃ (**)(?)prānaṃdaḥ procyate budhaiḥ |
tadānaṃdaśataṃ śakrasyaika ānaṃda ucyate || 64 ||

gurostadānaṃda śatameka ānaṃda īritaḥ |
gurvānaṃda(*****)(?)vasyānaṃda ucyate || 65 || 

tadānaṃdaśataṃ tveka ānaṃdaḥ syāt prajāyteḥ |
hiraṇyagarbhānaṃdānāṃ śataṃ viṣṇoḥ śivasya ca || 66 ||

virājapuruṣasyaika ānaṃdaḥ samudāhṛtaḥ |
tadānaṃdaśataṃ sākṣānnityasya paramātmanaḥ || 67 ||

brahmānaṃdābhistveka ānaṃdasyā chriyaḥpateḥ |
nārāyaṇasya nityasya brahmaṇaḥ paramātmanaḥ || 68 ||

brahmānaṃdābhidhaṃ saukhyaṃ manovācāmagocaraṃ |
ācāryapādaśuśrūṣā niratasya yatātmanaḥ || 69 ||

brahmatatvavidaḥ sākṣātkṛtanārāyaṇātmanaḥ |
jīvanmuktasya tasyāpi brahmānaṃda udāhṛtaḥ || 71 ||

brahmānaṃdābhidhaṃ saukhyaṃ vedāṃteṣvapi kīrtitaṃ |
koṭijanma tapobhirvā mahādānāyutairapi || 72 ||

aśvamedha sahasrairvā labhyatena tapodhanāḥ |
tasmādbrahmavijijñāsā kāryācārya mukhāṃvujān || 73 ||

kālamṛtyumapi prāptamasau japati saṃtataṃ |
iti kāla japopāyaḥ kathito brahmavittamāḥ || 74 ||

praṣṭavyaṃ kimato viprāvuvaṃtvaṃ sugopitaṃ |
iti dāśarathīye smin sarvavedārthasaṃgrahe || 75 ||

athamodhyāya uktoyaṃ taṃtrenuttaranāmake |

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye vedārthasārasaṅgrahe taṃtre 
prathamodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 3a>

ṛṣaya ucuḥ 

bhagavan yogināṃ śreṣṭhaśāṃtābhartarmahāmate |
brahmatatvaṃ kathaṃ jñeyaṃ śrotavyaṃ kathamādarāt || 1 ||

kathamācārya śuśrūṣā kartavyā saṃsitavrataiḥ |
sarvametatsamāsenavadāsmākaṃdayānidhe || 2 ||

ṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca 

asti brahmaparaṃ sākṣādādi madhyāṃtavarjitaṃ |
śāśvataṃ śuddhamavyaktaṃ sadānaṃdamayaṃ hi tat || 3 ||

<p. 3b>

satyaṃ paraṃ taporūpaṃ jarāmaraṇavarjitaṃ |
cidānaṃdamayaṃ nityaṃ manovācāmagocaraṃ || 4 ||

nārāyaṇābhidhaṃ jyotisvamaḥ pāre pratiṣṭitaṃ |
na strī na ṣaṃṭho na yumānnadvāmaparamaṃ mahat || 5 ||

anaṃtamacalaṃ sūkṣmaṃ durjñeyamaparairapi |
hṛdguhāsusthitaṃ sarvaprāṇināṃcitapaṃkaje || 6 ||

aṃtarvahistamorāśinivārakamanuttamaṃ |
na tatra sūryo na vibhātiṃ caṃdramānāsāvagnirvidyuto || ||

naiva bhāṃtittamevabhāṃta (*******) |
manubhāti sarvaṃ tasya bhāsāmidaṃ vibhāti || 8 ||
	
tanmahāpauruṣaṃ rūpaṃ vedāmte ramyagocaraṃ |
sargāsthiti vināśānāṃ hetu bhūtasanātanaṃ || 9 ||

oṃkāravācyaṃ viśvasyakāraṇaṃ pārameśvaraṃ |
tasmānnādātmakaḥ sākṣādakārātmāsanātanaḥ || 10 ||

abhūghaṃvāsudevākhyāmāhurbrahmarṣayo'malāḥ |
viṃdussamabhavatasmājjīvātmāṃ tassanātanaḥ || 11 ||

sa īśvara iti proktaḥ suddhājñānamayaḥ pumān |
tayormadhye samudabhūtkalā cidrūpiṇī parā || 12 ||

yāmāhurbhagavacchaktiṃ trayīrūpāṃ sanātanīṃ |
tata āvirabhūt sākṣātpaṃcāśadvarṇamātṛkā || 13 ||

sai śrīḥ paramāśaktiścitkalā parameśvarī |
sākṣānnārāyaṇamayī brahmābhinnā cidātmakā || 14 ||

svarāḥ ṣoḍaśa tatrasyuḥ syarṇāḥ paṃcaviṃśatiḥ |
athāṃtasthā athoṣmāṇa ityevaṃ mātṛkāsmṛtā || 15 ||

akārādyā visargāṃtāḥ svarāḥ (**)(?)śakīrtitāḥ |
aca ityevamākhyātāḥ kādamohala īritāḥ || 16 ||

cidātmakāparāśaktiḥ ṣoḍaśasvararūpiṇī |
kādayohala ityuktā vyaṃjanāni vidurbudhāḥ || 17 ||

kakārādi kṣakārāṃtā varṇā nārāyaṇātmakāḥ |
tasmādi yamakārādi kṣakārāṃtākṣarātmikā || 18 ||

lakṣmīnārā(****)(?)mātṛkā samudīritā |
mātṛkā paramāśaktirabhinnā brahmaṇo dvijāḥ || 19 ||

nārāyaṇājñayā viśvaṃ sṛjatyavatihaṃti |
ca anayai samudbhūtā vedāḥ sāṃ(*)(?)sanātanāḥ || 20 ||

<p. 4a>

dharmaśāstrapurāṇāni sarvopaniṣadopi ca |
catuṣṣaṣṭi kalāvidyā vidhā aṣṭādaśāpi ca || 21 ||

sarvaṃ (**)(?)kayotpannaṃ jagadatī(**)(?)caraṃ |
parāsisṛkṣā bhagavadbrahmaṇaḥ paramātmanaḥ || 22 ||

tadā virājaṃ puruṣaṃ viśvakāraṇavigrahaṃ |
asṛjatadbrahmarūpī puru(****)(?)dvijāḥ || 23 ||

dvidhā kṛtvātmanodehamardhena 	puruṣo bhavat |
arddhena nārī tasyāṃ tu virājamasṛjadvibhuḥ || 24 ||

yo mahāpuruṣaḥ proktaḥ parabrahmātmakāmayā |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarātmāsāveka eva parocyutaḥ || 25 ||

nārāyaṇa iti khyātaḥ sarvalaukaikakāraṇaṃ |
sa evādyaḥ pumānnityaḥ paramātmā sanātanaḥ || 26 ||

aṣṭākṣara (**)(?) vedavedāṃtairapyagocaraḥ || 27 ||

na tasya kāryaṃ kāraṇaṃ ca vidyate na tasya kartā na hi tasya goptā |
parāsya śaktirvividhaiva śrūyate svābhāvikī jñānabalakriyā ca || 28 ||

yosau dvidhā bhavat sākṣādāgho nārāyaṇo vibhuḥ |
sā nārīśrīrmahālakṣmīḥ khyātāparakalāmayī || 29 ||

tatpatiḥ puruṣoyosau nārāyaṇa itīritaḥ |
strīpuṃrūpamidaṃ tasya brahmaṇaḥ paramātmanaḥ || 30 ||

nārāyaṇasya nityasya lakṣmīnārāyaṇābhidhaṃ |
cidrūpiṇīṃ śriyaṃ guptāṃ vibhrannārāyaṇo vibhuḥ || 31 ||

cidābhinno vibhuḥ sārvakālaṃ trijagatīpatiḥ |
śrūyate vedavedāṃtairapi vigrahadhāribhiḥ || 32 ||

śrīmadṛṣṭākṣarātmāsarākarāvasanātanaḥ |
sargakāle yadā vibhrat strīpuṃrūpamakalmaṣaṃ || 33 ||

dvidhevadṛśyate nityairlakṣmīnārāyaṇābhidhaṃ |
tadvādaśārṇamaṃtreṇavācyaṃ brahmaparātparaṃ || 34 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇātmāsau nārāyaṇamayaḥ pumān |
virājaṃ puruṣaṃ sargādikālesṛjadīśvaraḥ || 35 ||

prapaṃcātmā kālarūpī satitā sarvanāyakaḥ |
puruṣaṇavirāduktaḥ sarvakāraṇakāraṇaṃ || 36 ||

caturviṃśati tatvātmāgāyatrīrūpadhṛgvibhuḥ |
yamāha sarvajagatāṃ kāraṇaṃ parameśvaraṃ || 37 ||

<p. 4b>

savitāramajaṃ śuddhaṃ kālātmānaṃ sanātanaṃ |
tasya vaktrādāvirabhūtpraṇavaḥ śāśvatovyayaḥ || 38 ||

samastavidhāvījaṃ yadbrahmarūpaṃ vidurbudhāḥ |
bhūriti vyāhṛtiḥ paścādbhuṣaḥ suvariti dvayaṃ || 39 ||

maharjjanastapassatyaṃ gāyatryā virabhūtataḥ |
etadeva mahadviśvaṃ vairājaṃ rūpamuttamaṃ || 40 ||

kālātmakaṃ bhagavatī brahmaṇaḥ paramātmanaḥ |
savitāviśvarūpo sau virāṭpuruṣa īśvaraḥ || 41 ||

hiraṇyagarbhamāhuryaṃ pradhānapuruṣaṃ vibhuṃ |
ayameva jagatsarvaṃ sṛjyatyavatihaṃti ca || 42 ||

kālātmākālakālo sau sākṣānnārāyaṇātmakaḥ |
ayaṃ savitṛrūpiṇyagyāyatryākālarūpayā || 43 ||

stūyate savitāsākṣāturuṣosau hiraṇmayaḥ |
kālātmako vedamayo yenedamakhilaṃ jagat || 44 ||

sa carācaramutpannaṃ rakṣitaṃ paramātmanā |
amāduha tato vedānbhūrādivyāhṛti trayaṃ || 45 ||

caturbhyopyatha vedebhyo yāgāssāṃgādikṣiṇāḥ |
utpannāḥ sarvalokānāmihāmutragatipradāḥ || 46 ||

yosau virāṅmayaḥ sākṣādvāsudevo jagatpatiḥ |
nārāyaṇamayonityomahāpuruṣa īśvaraḥ || 47 ||

sa mahāpuruṣaḥ sargaṃ kartumicchan prajāpatiḥ |
aya eva sargādautāsuvīryamavāsṛjat || 48 ||

tadaṃḍa mamavaddhaimaṃ sahasrāṃśu śataprabhaṃ |
tasminjajñe vidhirbrahmāsvayaṃ bhūritiḥ śrutiḥ || 49 ||

āpo nārā iti proktā āpo vai narasūtavaḥ |
ayanaṃ tasyatāḥ pūrvaṃ tena nārāyaṇaḥ smṛtaḥ || 50 ||

hiraṇyagarbho viśvātmā svayaṃ bhūrbhagavānprabhuḥ |
aṃdhakā(****)(?) saṃtatāya sumahattayaḥ || 51 ||

tapasā tasya tuṣṭotha paramātmā sanātanaḥ |
nārāyaṇotha brāhmāṇaṃ puruṣaḥ kṛṣṇapiṃgalaḥ || 52 ||

ādhi(*****)(?) sarga kārye (****)(?) śat |
lajjayāvanataṃ sargakarmāśaktaṃ svayaṃ bhuvaṃ || 53 ||

dṛṣṭātha pradadau vedānsāvitrīsahitānvibhuḥ |
śrutyuktena vidhānena sargaṃ kurvititi (***)(?) || 54 || 

ukto bhagavaddākārasākṣātkārasya siddhaye |
bhagavatejasaḥ prāptyai bhūyopi sumahattayaḥ || 55 ||

<p. 5a>

tatāya tatra bhagavānbhāskarāyuttasanni(*)(?) |
mahāpuruṣo bhūtvā vidhūyāṃ dhanamokhilaṃ || 56 ||

uvācanaṃ vidhātāraṃ prajāpatimakalmaṣaṃ |
śrībhagavānuvāca bho bho vra(**)(?)pitāṃhaṃ yoyakastava || 57 ||

sākṣātkṛtosmibhavatā saṃtuṣṭastapasāvidhe |
ahameva paraṃbrahma paramātmā sanātanaḥ || 58 ||

kālātmako haṃkā(***)(?) lasyāpi pitāsmyahaṃ |
vāsudevosmyahaṃ viṣṇurvirādrūpī hiraṇmayaḥ || 59 ||

aṃtaryāmyasmi bhūtānāṃ jīvātmā trijagatpatiḥ |
cinmayohamanaṃtohamādi madhyāṃtavarjitaḥ || 60 ||

ahaṃ praṇavavācyosmivedānāmapyagocaraḥ |
vedāṃtavedyoviśvātmā viśvarūpohmyahaṃ vibhuḥ || 61 ||

vidyāmayohaṃ lokānāṃ bhagasvargāpavargadaḥ |
yosāvaṣṭākṣaro maṃtraḥ svabhāva praṇavādikaḥ || 62 ||

vidyānāmapi sarvāsāṃmahārājokhilārthadaḥ |
nārāyaṇastadātmāhaṃ cidrūpiṇyāśrimānnitaḥ || 63 ||

ekaevādvitīyohaṃ śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarātmakaḥ |
asyaivāṣṭārṇamaṃtrasyaśrīmatvaṃ trijagatsvapi || 64 ||

śrīmatvaṃ nāsti sarvāsāṃ vidyānāṃ ca śruterapi |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīvidhā tasmāt vyātā jagattraye || 65 ||

vedāmahūdanodbhūtā lokānāṃ sthiti hetavaḥ |
vedeṣu sārabhutayaṃ śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarī mama || 66 ||

ṛcomajūṃṣi sāmāni sāhiśrīramṛtāsanāṃ |
iti madvadanodbhūta śrutibhissamudīritā || 67 ||

prasiddhāmṛtalakṣmīḥ śrīrmamaśaktiścidātmikā |
nārāyaṇetimannāma paraṃbrahma śriyānvitaḥ || 68 ||

mamaivāṣṭārṇavidyāyāḥ śrīmatthaṃ hi svabhāvaḥ |
anyāstu sakalāvidhāḥ prakṣipraśrī samanvitāḥ || 69 ||

cidrūpiṇīṃ śriyaṃ guptāṃtrayī vījātmikāṃ parāṃ |
paratejomayīṃ saṃvinmahāsāmrājyanāyikāṃ || 70 ||

guptāṃvibhrannabhedena nāmnā nārāyaṇosmyahaṃ |
dadāmyetāṃ mahāvidyāṃmatejaḥ prāptaye tava || 71 ||

<p. 5b>

gāyatraṃ chaṃdasāṃ śreṣṭaṃ sarvatrāpi nigadyate |
(**) chaṃdaḥ syāgāyatraṃ nānyaduktaṃ jāyate || 72 ||

caturviṃśākṣīrītasmāhāya trīveramātṛkā |
madaṣṭārṇamayī jñeyā mama tejaḥ kalānvitā || 73 ||

yohaṃ puruṣanārmātmavirājo heturasmihi |
madardhatejasāyuktānārīlakṣmīritīritā || 74 ||

nārāyaṇohaṃ puruṣoviśadrūpī sanātanaḥ |
dvādaśārṇamahāvidhārūpo brahmamayomyahaṃ || 75 ||

brahmavidyetiyāmāhurmamaivadvādaśākṣarīṃ |
ahaṃ jaganmayatvenacchaṃdasāṃ jāgataṃ varaṃ || 76 ||

jagatī dvādaśārṇeti khyātā vidheyasuttamā |
brahmavidyeti vikhyātā pradānādittastava || 77 ||

brāhmemuhūrtedānena brahmavidyetyapi smṛtā |
imāmapi mahāvidyāṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇabhidhāṃ || 78 ||

gṛhāṇa mamatejoṃśaprāptarṭhāṃte mahāmate |
yosau virāṅmayaḥ sākṣāt puruṣohaṃ purātanaḥ || 79 ||

sarvavedamayaḥ sarvapaṃcātmā sanātanaḥ |
sa eva vedapuruṣo vedanārāyaṇomyahaṃ || 80 ||

kiṃ ca madraśmayaḥ sarvalokānāvṛtya satataṃ |
sahāyaṃte kariṣyaṃti sargakārye prajāpate || 81 ||

yeyaṃ madrūpiṇī sākṣādgāyatrī vedamātṛkā |
tadvācyaḥ savitā brahman devo nārāyaṇosmyahaṃ || 82 ||

kālānmāsarvabhūtātmāvedātmā sarvato mukhaḥ |
janmamṛtyujarāvyādhi saṃsārabhayanāśanaḥ || 83 ||

sarvāvidyāmayī śuddhaṃ paṃcāśadvarṇarūpiṇī |
mātṛkāyā samākhyātā sāmadrūpaiva vāvayate || 84 ||

strīrūpaṃmakhilaṃ yadyatpuṃrūpamakhilaṃ tathā |
lakṣmīrūpaṃ ca madrūpaṃ tatatsāraṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 85 ||

dvādaśārṇā brahmavidyā tasmādviśvamayī smṛtā |
brahmavidyopāsakomevirāṭpuruṣarūpadhṛk || 86 ||

jyotirmayī tasmātmadātmikā mahāvidyāvasvakṣaramayī |
mamatāmupāsmanaraḥ sākṣān mamasāyujya mahyute || 87 ||

śabdabrahmaṇi niṣṇātaḥ paraṃbrahmādhi gacchati |
madātmakaṃ (**)(?) maṃtrayītatasmātmadātmikā || 88 ||

brahmavidyāmupāsyādau brāhmekāle prajāyate |
gāyatrīṃ samupāsyātha hutvāṃmāṃjātavedasi || 89 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇīṃnāmnāmā(*)(?)vidyādirūpiṇīṃ |
yāvaccha samupāsyātha śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃ yata || 90 ||

mama tādātmyasidhyarthaṃ caturvarga phalāptaye |
upāsyamatkālāmuko bhūtvā sṛsṭikarobhava || 91 ||

putrohaṃ rudra ityākhyāṃ (****)(?) prajāpate |
tvayā sṛṣṭamidaṃ viśvakāle kāle harāmyahaṃ || 92 ||

vārāstvadādayo jīvāsteṣāmaya namāśrayaḥ |
nārāyaṇosmyahaṃ tena sarvalokeśvareśvaraḥ || 93 ||

(***) (?) khyāṃ gṛhāṇemāṃ māyāṃ trailokyamātṛkāṃ |
grahāṇatvatsahāyena sṛjatya vahaṃti ca || 94 ||

<p. 6a>

idameva mahatatvaṃ parabrahmamayasmaye |
etadācārya vadanādvijñāyā (***)(?)rthanaḥ || 95 ||

avaśyaṃ mama tādātmyaṃ prāpnotyekena janmanā |
ahiṃsā satyamasteyaṃ śaucamiṃdriyanigrahaḥ || 96 ||

ācāryapāda śuśrūṣā sarvadharmaratissadā |
mama tādā(**)(?) siddhiṃ pratyete saptahetavaḥ || 97 ||

etadanyacca bhagavānupadiśya prajāpateḥ |
aṃtarddhānaṃ jagāmāśu nityamuktairamiṣṭutaḥ || 98 ||

brahmāpi bhaga(*****)(?) tatvaṃ paraṃ mahat |
sṛṣṭvādau sanakādibhyo vaśiṣṭāddibhya uktavān || 99 ||

tepi vijñāya paramaṃ tattvaṃ brahmaikyakāraṇaṃ |
brahmabhūtāstaponiṣṭhā adyāpi sukhi(***)(?) || 100 ||

varṇātmakāḥ śabdamayāmaṃtrāḥ sarve sanātanāḥ |
aciṃtyaśaktitā sarvamaṃtrāṇāṃ dvijapuṃgavāḥ || 1 ||

saṃtsaṃpradāyamārgeṇa sadācārya prasādataḥ |
śraddhayācārya vākyeṣu sarvasiddhistapodhanāḥ || 2 ||

svacchaṃdamaraṇaṃ jātismaraṇaṃ brahmadarśanaṃ |
kālasya vaṃcanopāyakāraṇaṃ nānyadīṣyate || 3 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ sāṃgāṃ ca sa rahasyakāṃ |
jñātvācāryamukhāṃbhojāt saṃsevyācāryamanvahaṃ || 4 ||

jitvākālaṃ durādharṣaṃ brahmāpnoti tapodhanāḥ |
parasya brahmaṇastatvasvarūpaṃ kiṃcidīritaṃ || 5 ||

suguptamapi vipreṃdrāḥ kiṃ punaḥ śrotumicchatha |
iti dāśarathīyesmintaṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe anuttara brahmatatvarahasyedhyāya īritaḥ || 
106 || 

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
dvitīyodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 6a>

ṛṣaya ūcuḥ 

ṛṣyaśṛṃgamahābhāga sarvajñāna taponidhe |
suguptamapita tatvaṃ brāhmaṇaḥ paramātmanaḥ || 1 || 

śrutamācārya śuśrūṣā kartavyādāvititvayā |
ācāryaḥ kīdṛśo lokeśiṣyo vāpi kathaṃ mune || 2 ||

kathaṃ śuśrūṣaṇaṃ kāryaśiṣyeṇācāryapādayoḥ |
tatpāda padmabhaktānāsmākaṃ tadvadāśubho || 3 ||

śrīṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca 

śṛṇudhvamṛṣayo yūyaṃ sarvajñā api sattamāḥ |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojaśuṣaṇavidhiparaṃ || 4 ||

vedavedāṃtasārārtha tatvavicchutipāragaḥ |
satataṃ vaidikācāranirataḥ śāstrapāragaḥ || 5 ||

śāṃtodāṃtojitāmitrojiteṃdriyaḥ vedādhyayanakṛnnityaṃ vedārthasya vicārakṛt || 6 || 

svaśiṣyaputravātsatyasahito brahmavittamaḥ |
aharniśaṃ śruterjāmī śrautācāraratasyadā || 7 ||

ahiṃsārahitonityaṃ brahmatatvārthaciṃtakaḥ |
śivaviṣṇorabhedena nityopāhitarato dvijāḥ || 8 ||

mahākulaprasūtaśca gururityucyate vudhaiḥ |
sahasrakṛtto gāyatrī japakartā dine dine || 9 ||

anasūyojita krodho vedādhyāyanakṛtsadā |
sarvāgamarahasya 

<p. 6b>

dadāmyetāṃ mahāvidyāṃmatejaḥ prāptaye tava || 71 ||

gāyatraṃ chaṃdasāṃ śreṣṭhaṃ sarvatrāpi nigadyate |
chaṃdaḥsyādasya gāyatraṃ nānyaduktaṃ prajāpate || 72 ||

caturviṃśākṣarī tasmādgāyatrīvedamātṛkā |
maddaṣṭārṇamayī jñeyā mamattejaḥ kalānvitā || 73 ||

yohaṃ puruṣanāryātmāvirājo heturasmihi |
madardhatejasāyukānārīlakṣmīritīritā || 74 ||

nārāyaṇohaṃ puruṣovirāṭrūpī sanātanaḥ |
dvādaśārṇa mahāvidyārūpo brahmabhayosmyahaṃ || 75 ||

brahmavidyetiyā māhurmamaiva dvādaśākṣarīṃ |
ahaṃ jaganmayatvena chaṃdasāṃ jāgataṃ varaṃ || 76 ||

jagatī dvādaśārṇeti khyātāvidhemamuttamā |
brahmavidyeti vikhyātā pradānādādittastava || 77 ||

brāhmemuhūrtedānena brahmavidyetyapi smṛtā |
imāmapi mahāvidyāṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇābhidhāṃ || 78 ||

gṛhāṇagamatejoṃśaprāptyarthaṃte mahāmate |
yosau virāṅmayaḥ sākṣātpuruṣohaṃ purātanaḥ || 79 ||

sarvavedamayaḥ sarvaprapaṃcātmāsanātanaḥ |
sa eva vedapuruṣo vedanārāyaṇohmyahaṃ (*)(?)jño gururukto mahānayaṃ || 10 ||

bahuśona japedyastu gāyatrīṃ vedamātaraṃ |
tatsānnidhyenavidhānāṃ kartavyaṃ grahaṇaṃbhuvi || 11 ||

maṃtramātraparijñānādgurutvaṃ vidyatena hi |
nyāsānāma parijñātā pūjāyaṃtrādikasya ca || 12 ||

nācāryaḥ procyate sadbhiḥ kiṃcidjñātvāttapodhanāḥ |
sarvāgamarahasyārthapāragaṃ śrūti tatparaṃ || 13 ||

yojanānāṃ sahasraṃ vā gatvātaṃ gurumāśrayet |
a(****)(?)to nityaṃ daṃbhalobhādi saṃyutaḥ || 14 ||

piśunoniṣṭuro mūrkho mithyāvādī ca saṃtataṃ |
tamoguṇapradhānaśca paranārīratassadā || 15 ||

(***)(?) parito vāpi guruniṃdāśrutaurataḥ |
jihmaḥ kaṭhinavittau sau satataṃ krodha tatparaḥ || 16 ||

asūyāmatsaragrasto vaidikācāraniṃdakaḥ |
vadavāhyodurālāpī(***)(?) grahakārakaḥ || 17 ||

śiṣyatve varjayedetānkulīnānapi satataṃ |
vedādhyayana kṛnnityaṃ daṃbhalobha vivarjitaḥ || 18 ||

<p. 7a>

asūyā krodharahitomātsa(****)(?)ssadā |
satataṃ vaidikācāra tatparaḥ śrutipāragaḥ || 19 || 

mahākulaprasūtaśca satkarma phalanispṛhaḥ |
piturmātuśca śuśrū(*****)(?) vivarjitaḥ || 20 ||

arthaprāṇaśarīrāṇāmapidātāgurordvijāḥ |
anvahaṃ gurupādābja śuśrūṣurvītamatsaraḥ || 21 ||

etādṛśānparīkṣyaiva vidyādayāśrayatvataḥ |
sakṛdvā guruniṃdāyāṃ samāsaktamanāyadi || 22 ||

tādṛśāyana dātavyā prāṇaiḥ kaṃṭhagatairapi |
ākruṣṭastāḍito vāpikaśābhiḥ pādatāḍanaiḥ || 23 ||

mahāprasāda ityājñāṃnollaṃghayatiyaḥ sadā |
avaśyaṃ tasya dātavyā vidyāsvargāpavargadā || 24 ||

pitāmātā tathā bhrātāsāṃgavedopadeśakṛta |
catvāro guravaḥ proktāḥ pūjyāḥ pratyahamādarāt || 25 ||

gurutvaṃ nāmapūjyatvaṃ namaskāryatvamanvahaṃ |
sevyamanvahaṃ bhaktyāpāda śuśrūṣaṇādibhiḥ || 26 ||

upādhyāya iti proktaḥ śāstrāṇāmupadeśakṛt |
akṣapādakṛtaṃ śāstraṃ mīmāṃsā dvitayaṃ tathā || 27 ||

kāpitaṃ pāṇinīpaṃcayogaśāstramataḥ paraṃ |
śāstraṣaṭkamiti proktamapavargādikāraṇaṃ || 28 ||

manvādi dharmaśāstrāṇāmupadeśakaropi ca |
upādhyāya iti proktaḥ pūjyo guruvadanvahaṃ || 29 ||

dvādaśārṇāṃ brahmavidyāmupadeṣṭvāśriyaḥ pateḥ |
sāṃganyāsādi sahitāṃ yaṃtrapūjādisaṃyutāṃ || 30 ||

śrīmaddaṣākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ datvāśrutibhirīritaṃ |
ācāraṃ śikṣayennityaṃ rahasyamapi vodhayan || 31 ||

ācārya ucyate loke guruṇāṃ paramoguruḥ |
sākṣānnārāyaṇātmāsau vijñeyaḥ puruṣo namaḥ || 32 ||

adhītyaikatramadvidyāṃ jñātvā vidhimathānyataḥ |
yaṃtraṃnyāsavidhiṃ vāpi tadrahasya mathāpi vā || 33 ||

tayorapi gurutvaṃ syāt pūjātvamapi vā vahaṃ |
yaṃtrapūjārahasyādividhānaṃ sa rahasyakaṃ vidyāṃ dadāti śiṣyāyataṃ 
vidyāllokavacakaṃ || 36 ||

<p. 7b>

ajñātvāyo mahāvidyāvidhānaṃ sa rahasyakaṃ |
gṛhītvā prajapedvidhāṃ sa jñeyo naragarddamaḥ || 37 ||

sarahasya kalāparasyāmyajñātuḥ sannidhau dvijāḥ |
vidmāmāśramadhītyānyaṃ sarahasyajñamuttamaṃ || 38 ||

śrotriyaṃ brahmatatvajñamācāryaṃ varayetpunaḥ |
vahuyojana sāhasradūraṃ gatvāpi vā dvijāḥ || 39 ||

sāṃgavidyopadeśārthamanyasācāryamāśrayet |
ekena janmanā sākṣādbrahmānaṃdābhidhaṃ sukhaṃ || 40 ||

saṃsārataraṇaṃ prāptumicchan śreyaḥ paraṃ mahat |
ācāryamāśrayennityaṃ prāṇairarthairdhipāpi ca || 41 ||

brahmavidyāprado loke mahānācārya īritaḥ |
bhagavadraśmi vidyābhissahitāṃ sarahasyakāṃ || 42 ||

śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ yo dahāti dvijottamāḥ |
ācāryarūpiṇaṃ vidyātasevaśrīpatiṃ vibhuṃ || 43 ||

yajñotsavevivāhādau sarveṣu śubhakarmasu |
ācāryamagrato vastrālaṃkārādyairghanairapi || 44 ||

abhyarcya sarvadharmāṇāṃ siddhiprāpnoti śāśvatīṃ |
brahmaviṣṇumaheśādipurogyācāryamagnataḥ || 45 ||

saṃpūjyaiva mahāsiddhiṃ labhate nānyathā dvijāḥ |
sarvasvamapi datvā vā prāṇānapi kalevaraṃ || 46 ||

ācāryatuṣṭiṃ janapedyadīcchetsiddhimuttamāṃ |
athekākṣaradātāraṃ guruṃdhikṛtyavāsakṛt || 47 ||

tvaṃ kṛtvāpyatha huṃ kṛtyaṣaṣṭivarṣasahisrakaṃ |
śvānajanmasamāsādhacaṃḍāleṣvabhijāyate || 48 ||

vyādhiyuktodaridro vā krodhī vāpya jiteṃdriyaḥ |
ācāryonāva saṃtavyaḥ prāṇaiḥ kaṃṭhagataiḥrapi || 49 ||

ācāryaniṃdāśravaṇaṃ sakṛdvā yasya jāyate |
mahāpātakinaṃ viṃdyātameva varakālayaṃ || 50 ||

brahmavidyādi vidhānāmeka eva gururyadi |
nahi dhanyattarastasmādadhikovidyate bhuvi || 51 ||

ekaiva śrīgurupāstirbrahmā tādātmya siddhidā |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarī vidyā (**)(?) vidyā tathaiva ca || 52 ||

<p. 8a>

vidyādvayamidaṃ sarvavedavedāṃtasaṃgrahaṃ |
tṛtīyaṃ raśmimālākhya sūktamatyaṃtapāvanaṃ || 53 ||

vidyātrayamidaṃ purāyamekasyaiva guru(*)(?)t |
labhyate yadi dhanyosau brahmānaṃdayuto bhavet || 54 ||

pāṣāṇalohakāṣṭhāminirmitaṃ pratimāsu ca |
kurvaṃti bhagavadbudhyāprāsādāṃvarabhūṣaṇaiḥ || 55 ||

lokemaṃ dadhiyo nityaṃ bhavavaṃdhayutāhite |
mūlaṃ sakaladharmāṇāṃ hetuṃ svargāpavargayoḥ || 56 ||

sākṣānnārāyaṇātmānamācāryaṃ brahmarūpiṇaṃ |
nārcayaṃti vimūḍhāste pratimāsu yathā tathā || 57 ||

tasmādācārya tatvaṃ tu guptaṃ sarvasmṛtiṣvapi |
ācārya eva bhagavānsākṣānnārāyaṇo vibhuḥ || 58 ||

vijñeyaḥ paramātmāsau satyaṃ satyaṃ tapodhanāḥ |
narākṛtirasausākṣādbhagavāniṃdirāpatiḥ || 59 ||

tamabhyarcye satataṃ vidyāṃ sakṛdapisman |
saṃsārasāgaraṃ tīrthāyāti brahmapadaṃ mahat || 60 ||

anabhyarcya sadācāryaṃ bhagavanmayamādarān |
mahādānāyutairvāip vājimedhāyutairapi || 61 ||

na paraṃ padamāpnoti tīrthayātrāyutena vā |
dhikṛtyavāpi huṃ kṛtyaniṃdāṃ kṛtvāpi vāsakṛt || 62 ||

putramitra kalatrādi saṃpamdyaḥ pracyavaṃtite |
majjaṃti narakaudyeṣutyatkādehamataḥ paraṃ || 63 ||

ācāryapatniputrāṇāmapi niṃdāṃ tapodhanāḥ |
śrutvāpātakamāsādyanimajjaṃtyapi raurave || 64 ||

ācārya eva saṃpūjyaḥ prāṇairarthairvidhiyānvahaṃ |
ācārya evastottavyorājavidvatsabhāsu ca || 65 ||

ācārya eva vaṃdyaḥ syāt trisaṃdhyāsu dinedine |
ārcā evayoṣmo hi dhanavāsonnabhūṣaṇaiḥ || 66 || 

ācārya eva sanmānyassatataṃ sarvasiddhaye |
ācāryasadguṇā eva śrotavyāḥ pratyahaṃ budhaiḥ || 67 ||

draṣṭavyaṃ sarvadācārya pādājvadvayamevahi |
ācāryāyaiva dātavyamapi sarvasvamādarāt || 68 ||

ācāryasannidhāvevasthātavyaṃ pratyahaṃ budhaiḥ |
itthamācārya śuśrūṣāṃ kurvannapyekavatsaraṃ || 69 || 

<p. 8b>

maheṃdrārdhāsanārūḍho bhaviṣyati na saṃśayaḥ |
itthamācārya śuśrūṣāṃ kṛtvā varṣatrayaṃ bhuvi || 70 ||

avaśyaṃ brahmaṇo lokamāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
kurvannācārya suśrūṣāyāṃvajjīvamataṃdritaḥ || 71 ||

ihaiva brahmabhūtausau jīvanmukto na saṃśayaḥ |
itthāmācārya śuśrūdhā kuryan pratyahamādarāt || 72 ||

śrutyuktācāra saṃpanno vedādhyayana tatparaḥ |
brahmavidyānusaṃdhātāraśmimālānuciṃtakaḥ || 73 ||

sāṃganyāsādi sahitaśrīmadaṣṭākṣarīrataḥ |
kalevarāṃte sāyujyaṃ māpnotyeva śriyaḥ yateḥ || 74 ||

bhagavadvadanodbhūtā śrutissāṃgāsanātanī |
vidhyarthavādamaṃtrātmarūpiṇī sarvasiddhidā || 75 ||

svāyaṃbhuvādayaḥ paścādṛṣayaḥ kṣīṇakalmaṣāḥ |
dharmaśāstrāṇi divyāni kṛtavaṃtastapodhanāḥ || 76 ||

akṣapādādayo viprā maheśa samatejasaḥ |
kṛtaṣaṃtodarśanāni ṣaḍete paramarṣayaḥ || 77 ||

eteṣāmupadeṣṭāpi samahānguru rucyate |
upanīyatuyaḥ śiṣyaṃ vedamadhyāyayedvijaḥ || 78 ||

sakalpaṃ sarahasyaṃ ca tamācāryaṃ vidurbudhāḥ |
dvitīyo brahmāpidyāyāḥ pradātācārpaṭhacyate || 79 ||

tṛtīya ukta ācāryo bhagavadraśmi maṃtradaḥ |
nyāsayaṃtrarahasyādisahitāmidirāpateḥ || 80 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī vidyāṃ dadyādyo viprapuṃgavaḥ |
tameva bhagavadrūpaṃ prāhurācāryamuttamaṃ || 81 ||

anena sadṛśonānya ācāryo vidyate bhuvi |
nārāṇo jagatsvāmī bhagavāniṃdirāpatiḥ || 82 ||

tretāyugedaśarathātkauśalyāgarbhasaṃbhavaḥ |
śrīrāma iti lokesminvyāto dāśarathi vibhuḥ || 83 ||

hatvā duṣṭaṃ durādharṣaṃ rāvaṇaṃ rajanīcaraṃ |
guptaṃ rākṣasakorībhirbhinnāṃjanacayopamaṃ || 84 ||

rājyābhiṣiktassahito bhrātṛ(*)(?)lakṣmaṇādibhiḥ |
vaśiṣṭhādimaharṣīsammitaṃ (******) || 85 ||

<p. 9a>

kathayāmāsa rudrāya pṛcchate munipuṃgavāḥ || 87 ||

hitāya sarvalokānāṃ dharmasaṃsthāpanāya ca |
(**)(?) bhūtamidaṃ vedavedāṃtārtha rahasyakaṃ || 88 || 

muktiratnaṃ mahacchāstramuktavānjānakīpatiḥ |
patraiva brahmaṇastatvarahasyaṃ śrutisaṃgrahaṃ || 89 ||

brahmavidyāṣṭavarṇādividhānaṃ sāṃgamuttamaṃ |
rahasyamapi yatroktaṃ bhogasvargāparvargadaṃ || 90 ||

taṃtraṃ dāśarathīyākhyamidaṃ tasmādvijottamāḥ |
bhagavadvadanāṃbhojādāvirbhūtamidaṃ śubhaṃ || 91 ||

śāstraṃ sakalavedāpināṃsārabhūtārthasaṃgrahaṃ |
ācāryavadanāṃbhojādvijñeyaṃ nānyathā dvijāḥ || 92 ||

vyākhyāturasya taṃtrasya prāṇānapi samarpayet |
ślokamekamathātrāpi japtvā jīvan vimucyate || 93 ||

jānakīśamukhāṃbhojādetacchāstramanuttamaṃ |
śrutvā caturmukhaḥ paścāt sanakādibhpaṭhaktavān || 94 ||

asmāt pitāmahaḥ pūrvaṃ brahmaṇovadanāṃvujāt |
śrutvā vibhāṃ ukāyātha svasuttāyoktavānidaṃ || 95 ||

idaṃ samastavedānāṃ sārabhūtārthasaṃgrahaṃ |
adhītavān piturvaktrādvibhāṃḍakatunedvijāḥ || 96 ||

varṇa ekopi śāstretra vedavedāṃta sammitaḥ |
brahmadarśana sidhyarthaṃ mokṣalakṣmīsamṛddhaye || 97 ||

adhyetavyamidaṃ śāstraṃ jānakīpatinirmitaṃ |
idaṃ dāśarathīyākhyaṃ taṃtraṃ dṛṣṭvā maharṣayaḥ || 98 ||

saṃhitā paṃcakaṃ cakrurvedayedāṃtasaṃgrahaṃ |
sanatkumāro bhagavāndattāteyo jagatpatiḥ || 99 ||

brahmarṣīṇāmagragaṇyo vaśiṣṭho ruṃdhatīpatiḥ |
bhārgavo jāmadagnyopiyosau bhagavadaṃ śataḥ || 100 ||

dvaipāyanasutaḥ sākṣādbrahmavidyogināṃ varaḥ |
paṃcaite saṃhitāśca krurvedavedāṃtasaṃmmitāḥ || 1 ||

uktaṃ dāśarathīyesmin yadyadbhagavātāpurā |
tat tadācārya vadanād jñātavyaṃ tatvamuttamaṃ || 2 ||

tasmādācārya pādābjadvayemeva dinedine |
sevitavyaṃ bhagavataḥ sākṣātkārasyasiddhaye || 3 || 

<p. 9b>

bhidyatte hṛdayagraṃthiḥ chidyaṃte sarvasaṃśayaḥ |
kṣīyaṃte cāsyakarmāṇi tasmindaṣṭe parātmani || 4 ||

kalevaramidaṃ bhaumaṃ raktamāṃsāsthisaṃkulaṃ |
jarāmaraṇasaṃyuktaṃ malamūtraughasaṃkulaṃ || 5 ||

vicārya satataṃ brahmatatvadarśanasiddhaye |
sevitavyaṃ sadācārya pādāṃvujayuṃgādvījāḥ || 6 ||

punarjanmapunarmṛtyurbhūyopi ca kalevaraṃ |
punarjarāpunarvālyamādhayovyādhayaḥ punaḥ || 7 ||

tasmādavaśyaṃ bhagavatādātmyaprāptaye dvijāḥ |
ācārya caraṇāṃbhojadvayemeva dinedine || ||

stotavyamarcanīyaṃ ca sevitavyaṃ dvijottamāḥ || 8 || 

iti dāśarathīyesmintaṃtrevedārthasaṃgrahe anuttarabrahmatatvarahasyedhyāya īritaḥ || 9 
||

 [iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
tṛtīyodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 9b>

ṛṣaya ūcuḥ 

ṛṣyaśṛṃgamahābhāgavibhāṃḍakasutaprabho |
jānakīpatināsākaṃrāmeṇa paramātmanā || 1 ||

kathaṃ mayāgamo gaurīpatterāsīnmahātmanaḥ |
kimarthamuktavānetta taṃtraṃ vedārthasaṃgrahaṃ || 2 ||

rudrāya gaurīpatayevadāsmākaṃ mahāmate |

śrīṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca 

śṛṇudhvamṛṣayaḥ sarve rahasyamapi vakṣyate || 3 ||

yattadāśarapi proktaṃ brahmatatvaṃ purātanaṃ |
pulastyavaṃśasaṃbhūtadurātmānaṃ mahābalaṃ || 4 ||

sarvarakṣogaṇādhīśaṃ rāvaṇaṃ rajanīcaraṃ |
sākṣātparabrahmamayaḥ śrīrāmojagatīpatiḥ || 5 ||

setunāsāgaraṃ tīrtvāvā putrīdibhirvṛtaḥ |
raṇehatvādurādharṣaṃ vīraṃ trailokyarāvaṇaṃ || 6 ||

rājyebhiṣiktaḥ śrīrāmaḥ sākṣānnārāyaṇo vibhuḥ |
bhrātṛbhiḥ sahitorāyo vaśiṣṭhādhairmaharṣibhiḥ || 7 ||

jā(**)(?)māhito devyātiṣṭhan siṃhāsane śubhe |
ayodhyānagare ramye pālayāmāsamedinīṃ || 8 ||

taṃdraṣṭupāgatā aṣṭauśakrādyālokapālān | 
sarvadevagaṇairyuktāssiddhavidyā dharānvitāḥ || 9 ||

<p. 10a>

sāṣṭāṃgadaṃḍavannatvā rāmaṃ trijagatīpatiṃ |
tadājñayā samāsīnāḥ suśubheṣāsaneṣu(*)(?) || 10 ||

mūrtimadbhiścaturvedaissevitaḥ sanakādibhiḥ |
narākṛtidharaṃ sākṣānnārāyaṇamajaṃ hariṃ || 11 ||

kauśalyāgarbhasaṃbhūtaṃ rāmaṃ dāśarathiṃ vibhuṃ |
draṣṭumabhyāyayau devaṃ brahmāpi caturānanaḥ || 12 ||

jaigīṣavyo mahāyogīśatānaṃdothagautamaḥ |
dattātreyopi bhagavānagastyaḥ ka eva eva ca || 13 ||

medhātitirbhāradvājo viśvāmitro mahātapāḥ |
ekanaścadvitaścaivayavakrītothagālavaḥ || 14 ||

mahirṣiḥ kapilācāryaḥ sutīkṣṇomunisattamaḥ |
jāmadagnyastatorāmyedevarāto mahātapāḥ || 15 ||

nāradaḥ parvatotriścamārkaṃḍeyo mahātapāḥ |
yogācāryotha vālmīkiramamanyustaponidhiḥ || 16 ||

etecānye ca vahavo narākṛtidharaṃ hariṃ |
śrīrāmaṃ paramātmānaṃ nārāyaṇamajaṃ vibhuṃ || 17 ||

rājīvāpatanetrāṃtaṃ prasannamukhapaṃkajaṃ |
abhyāyayustayoniṣṭhā ṛṣayodīptatejasaḥ || 18 ||

abhyāyayau mahādevaḥ kailāsādgirijāpatiḥ |
taṃdunaṃdīśabhṛṃgīśavīrabhadragaṇeśvaraiḥ || 19 ||

sahitaḥ pramathādhīśaiḥ koṭiśye mātṛbhirvṛtaḥ |
draṣṭumiṃdīparaśyāmaṃ prasannaṃ jānakīpatiṃ || 20 ||

teṣāmardhaṃ cayādyaṃ ca nivedharaghunaṃdanaḥ |
śivasya brahmaṇonyeṣāmāsanāni samādiśat || 21 ||

vidhirudrādayo devā āsīnā āsaneṣute |
idamūcurvacotyaṃtarāmaṃ rājīvalocanaṃ || 22 ||

jahobhāgyamahobhāgyamaghāsmākaṃ jagatpate |
yatadakṣayamavyaktaṃ paśyāmastvāṃ jagatpate || 23 ||

tapaḥ phalitamasmākaṃ bahujanmārjinaṃ vibho |
aghanaḥ saphalā yajñā vahuśo dakṣiṇānvitāḥ || 24 ||

devaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ sākṣātpaśyāmastvāṃ narākṛtiṃ |
vedā api ca vedāṃtā svāmeva brahmarūpiṇaṃ || 25 ||

saṃstuvaṃti yathānityaṃ vaṃdina parameśvaraṃ |
yato vāco nivartatepyaprāpyamanasāsaha || 26 ||

<p. 10b>

satyānaṃdacidākāraṃ tvameva bhagavan vibho |
trailokyakaṃṭakaṃ vīraṃ durdharṣa mamarairapi || 27 ||

trijagadrāvaṇaṃ hatvā jaganniṣkaṃṭakaṃ kṛtaṃ |
pālayitvā gajadidaṃ punarāgaccha tatpadaṃ || 28 ||

iti stutvā surāstūṣṇīmāsīnā āsaneṣute |
rājīvalocanaṃ rāmaṃ paśyaṃtassamupāsate || 29 ||

satyānaṃdacidākāraṃ dṛṣṭvī śrīrāmamacyutaṃ |
suprasannasukhaṃ śātaṃ gaurīsahita ādarāt || 30 ||

dṛṣṭvāharṣa samāyuktaḥ rājīvalocanaṃ rāmaṃ |
paśyaṃtī kṛtāṃjali puṭo vibhuḥ uvāca paramātmānaṃ raghunaṃdanamīśvaraṃ || 31 
||

īśvara uvāca 

bhagavan devadeveśa nārāyaṇa jagatpate |
rāmacaṃdrakṛpāsiṃdhośaraṇāgatavatsala || 32 ||

kiṃcidvijaptukāmohamāgatastvāṃdidṛkṣayā |
ime brāhmādayo devāḥ śakrādyāścadigīśvarāḥ || 33 ||

brahmarṣayo vaśiṣṭhādyāssanakādyāśca yoginaḥ |
kapilādyā mahāsiddhā dattātre pādayopi ca || 34 ||

eteṣāṃ sannidhau devatvāmahaṃ jagatīpate |
kiṃcidvijaptumicchāmidedānujñāṃ mama prabho || 35 ||

ityukto bhagavānmastatheti karuṇānidhiḥ |
ājñāyayāmāsa tathā brūhīti girijāpatiṃ || 36 ||

īśvara uvāca 

bhagavan devadeveśa lokanātha jagatpate |
hitāya sarvalokānāṃ maharṣīṇāṃ ca nityaśaḥ || 37 ||

brahmatatvavijijñāsāṃ draṣṭumicchāmi sāṃprataṃ |
nārāyaṇātmanaḥ sākṣāt parabrahmamayaspate || 38 ||

vijñātavyaṃ paraṃ tatvaṃ kathaṃ vipraissamāhitaiḥ |
saṃsārasāgaremagnāḥ kathaṃ tvāṃ brahmarūpiṇaṃ || 39 ||

prāpnuvaṃti dvijāstīrtvā kathaṃtvaddarśanaṃ bhavet |
satyānaṃda cidākārastvameva brahmarūpabhṛt || ||

kathaṃ tuṣṭaḥ paraṃdhāma prayacchasi jagatpate || 38 ||

tyadrahasyaṃ samāvakṣyamenamuktiṃ prayāṃtyamī |
dānaṃ vātha vratavāthamaṃtrastotra japothavā || ||

kratustayo vā bhagavan tava prītikaraṃ vada |
vedā api ca vedāṃtāstavarū(***)(?) mahat || 40 ||

nārāyaṇātmakaṃ tatvaṃ na jānaṃti hi tatvataḥ |
māṃ prerayaṃti brahmādyā amī ca paramarṣayaḥ || 41 ||

<p. 11a>

vijñaptuṃ tava pādābjayugale jagatīpa(*)(?) |
(*)(?)tyukto bhagavāṃstatra śrīrāmojagatīpatiḥ || 42 ||

caturmukhādi devānāṃ maharṣīṇāṃ ca sannidhau |
prasannavadanaḥ prāhaśaṃkaraṃ lokaśaṃkaraṃ || 43 ||

śrībhagavānuvāca gaurīpate pravakṣyāmi tatvaṃ |
bhagavato mama rahasyamapi vedāṃtasārabhūtārthasaṃgrahaṃ || 44 ||

saṃtyaṃ vijñānamānaṃdarūpamakṣaramacyutaṃ | 
guhāyāṃ nihitaṃ jyotiracalaṃ śāśvataṃ dhruvaṃ || ||

tadeva me parabrahmarūpaṃ nārāyaṇābhidhaṃ || 45 ||

vedāṃtavodhosmi tathaiva padaiḥ stulyosmi nityaṃ paripūrṇakāmaḥ |
dhyeyosmi yogeśvara siddhasaṃghaiḥ pūjyosmi nityaṃ bhuvaneṣu sarvaiḥ || 46 ||

vedāṃ rūposmyahameva vederūposmi kālosmi caturmukhātmā |
nārāyaṇohaṃ nararūpadhārī rudrosmi kālokādhipatiśca śakraḥ || 47 ||

yattadbrahmamayaṃ dhāmaparaṃ jyotissanātanaṃ |
satyānaṃdacidākāraṃ nityaṃ śāśvatamakṣayaṃ || 48 ||

akṣayaṃ paramaṃ divyaṃ śuddhaṃ sadasadātmakaṃ |
nārāyaṇābhidhaṃ sākṣāttamaḥpāre pratiṣṭitaṃ || 49 ||

tadeva me paraṃ rūpaṃ manovācāmagocaraṃ |
na vratairnamahādānairnayāgairbahuvakṣiṇaiḥ || 50 ||

na tīrthayātrāsāhasairneṣṭārpūrtaśatairapi |
aśakyaṃ mama tadrūpaṃ prāptuṃ gaurīpate vibho || 51 ||

ācāryapādukāsevānirataiḥ śaṃsitallataiḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyājapahomādi tatparaiḥ || 52 ||

 vedapārāyaṇaratairbrahmavidyānuciṃtakaiḥ |
raśmimālālāpakaistadrūpaṃ prāptuṃ hi śakyate || 53 ||

mama śaktirabhinneyaṃ jānakī śrīścidātmikā |
bhinnevabhāti lokesminmamāyāduratyayā || 54 ||

āsyā evāṃśa saṃbhūtāpayā viśvaṃ vimohitaṃ| 
śrutirmadvadanādāvirbhūtāsāṃgāsanātanī || 55 ||

ayaṃ me dakṣiṇe vāhuḥ sṛṣṭikartā pitāmahaḥ |
vāmavāhurmadīpastvaṃ viṣṇurhṛdayamevame || 56 ||

<p. 11b>

ihaṃ vipāpmaṃ varaveśmabhūtaṃ yatpuṃḍarīkaṃpuramadhyasaṃsthaṃ |
tatrāpi dahūṃ gaganaṃ viśokastasminpadaṃ tasvadupāsitavyaṃ || 57 ||

yo vedādau svaraḥ prokto vedāṃte ca pratiṣṭhitaḥ |
tena vācyosmi satyātmā paramabrahma śabdabhāk || 58 ||

śrīnārāyaṇanāmāhamasmitrailokyanāyakaḥ |
nārāyaṇābhidhaṃ brahmarūpaṃ yattsaccidātmakaṃ || 59 ||

tadeva me paraṃ tatvaṃ triguṇātītamakṣayaṃ |
viśvataḥ paramaṃ nityaṃ viśvanārāyaṇātmakaṃ || 60 ||

sahasraśīrṣe viśvasya sargasthityakāraṇaṃ |
akṣayaṃ śāśvataṃ divyaṃ vedāṃtairapyagocaraṃ || 61 ||

ādimadhyāvasāneṣu patatsaditikīrtyate |
tadeva me mahadguptaṃ rūpaṃ jyotirathākṣayaṃ || 62 ||

viśvamevedaṃ puruṣastadviśvamupajīvati |
patiṃ viśvasyātmeśvaraṃ śāśvataṃ śivamacyutaṃ || 63 ||

nārāyaṇābhidhaṃ jñeyaṃ mahadviśvātmakaṃ śivaṃ |
nārāyaṇābhidhaṃ jyotistatvaṃ nārāyaṇātmakaṃ śivaṃ || 64 ||

mamaitanmahadrūpaṃ nityaṃ nārāyaṇābhidhaṃ |
nārāyaṇa paraṃbrahmatatvaṃ nārāyaṇaḥ parā || 65 ||

nārāyaṇaḥ paraṃjyotirātmānārāyaṇaḥ paraḥ |
yacca kiṃcijjagatyasmindadṛśyate śrūyatepi vā || 66 ||

aṃtarvahiśca tatsarvaṃ vyāpya nārāyaṇaḥ sthitaḥ |
nārāyaṇopaniṣadāyadetetpratipādyate || 67 ||

nārāyaṇābhidhaṃ rūpatadeva paramaṃ mama |
nārāyaṇeti mannāmayesmaraṃ tyapi saṃtataṃ || 68 ||

caturvargaphalāvāptisteṣāṃ siddhiḥ pade pade |
matsvarūpa parijñāne yadi vāṃchā prajāpate || 69 ||

ācāryapādukāyugmamarcayitvā dine dine |
śuśrūṣaṇa parobhūtvā prāṇairarthairdhiyāpi ca || 70 ||

ācāryapādakamalamāśrityānvahamādarāt |
brahmavidyānusaṃdhānaṃ kṛtvā mama dine dine || 71 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ mamaguptaśriyānvitāṃ |
madraśmi vidyāsahitāṃ samastanyā sa saṃyutāṃ || 72 ||

ācāryānugrahātprāpya tasya śuśrūṣaṇe rataḥ |
prajaptvā satataṃ bhaktyā mama sāyujya maśnute || 73 ||

na vratairnatapobhirvānavedairnāgamairapi |
mama vidyānusaṃdheyāsvācāryānugrahaṃvinā || 74 ||

<p. 12a>

bahujanmārjitaiḥ puṇyairmayibhaktiḥ prajāpati |
madvidyā japahomādi karmānuṣṭhānamuttamaṃ || 75 ||

bahujanmārjitaiḥ puṇyarāśibhiḥ prāpyate phalaṃ |
tatrāpyācārya pādābja śuśrūṣaṇamanuttamaṃ || 76 ||

labhyate yadi gaurīśa pratyahaṃ viprapuṃgavaiḥ |
ekena janmanovāsau madrūpaṃ soṣṇute dhruvaṃ || 77 ||

iti śaṃkarasarvajña kiṃciduktaṃ mayā tava |
matsvarūparijñāne kiṃ bhūyaḥ śrotumicchāsi || 78 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
caturthodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 12a>

ṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca 

iti śriyaḥ patervaktrācchrutvā gaurīpatirśivaḥ |
bhūyopi jānakīnāthaṃ prāha lokahitaṃ vacaḥ || 1 ||

īśvara uvāca 

bhagavan jānakīnātha nārāyaṇadayānidhe |
ete brahmarṣayaḥ siddhāstvatprasādāptavaibhavāḥ || 2 ||

māme vacodayaṃtīhapraṣṭuṃ brahmarahasyakaṃ |
manvādi munibhiproktamapyācāraṃ śrutīritaṃ || 3 ||

kautūhalayutāḥ śrotuṃ bhavadvadanapaṃkajāt |
lakṣaṇaṃ gurubhaktasparaśmisūktaṃ śriyaḥ pateḥ || 4 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇa māhātmyaṃ sarahasyaṃ viśeṣataḥ |
māhātmyaṃ brahmavidyāyāḥ śrotuṃ kautūhalānvitāḥ || 5 ||

brahmāparokṣavijñānaṃ kathamekena janmanā |
bhavatīhadvijātīnāṃ sarvametadvadasvanaḥ || 6 ||

śrībhagavānuvāca 

śṛṇu rudramahābhāga caturvaktrapitāmaha |
brahmarṣayopiśṛ evaṃ tu siddhāye ca tapodhanāḥ || 7 ||

atrārthe saṃpravakṣyāmi iti hāsaṃ purātanaṃ |
yacchrutvācārya vadanā brahmabhūto bhavediha || 8 ||

mathitvā jñānamaṃthena vedāgama mahārṇavaṃ |
sārajñena mayā guhyaṃ brahmadarśanamuddhṛtaṃ || 9 ||

śvasurojanakosmākaṃ sarvadharmaparāyaṇaḥ |
medinīṃ pālayāmāsaḥ vedādhyayana tatparaḥ || 10 ||

aśvamedhādibhiryāge riṣūvipuladakṣiṇīḥ |
tulāhiraṇyagarbhādyairyajan devaṃ śriyaḥ patiṃ || 11 ||

<p. 12b>

brahmā parokṣya vijñāna sidhyarthaṃ girijāpate |
ārādhayāmāsamuniṃgautamaṃ brahmatatparaṃ || 12 ||

padmarāga samāyukta taptasvarṇavinirmitaṃ |
kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ nityaṃ dadātyācārya karṇayoḥ || 13 ||

navaratna samāyuktaṃ suvarṇena vinirmitaṃ |
pādukādvitayaṃ kṛtvā muktālavibhūṣitaṃ || 14 ||

gurupādāṃvuja dvaṃdvārūḍhaṃ tatpādukā dvayaṃ |
ācāyaṃ pādukāvidyāmuccaranpratyahaṃ śuciḥ || 15 ||

gaṃdhākṣataiśra kusumaiśchatra vyajanacāmaraiḥ |
pādukādvitayasyātha kṛtvā śuśrūṣaṇaṃ namaḥ || 16 ||

ekaikakarṣamānena suvarṇena vinirmitaiḥ |
ācāryadupādukāyugmamarcayitvānvahaṃ śuciḥ || 17 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojayugmeryayati cānvahaṃ |
itthaṃ dvādaśavarṣāṇi pādukādvayapūjanaṃ || 18 ||

pādukādvayapūjane vidyayā kṛtvā brahmadarśana |
siddhaye brahmavidyāmavāpyādau bhagavadraśmi saṃyutāṃ || 19 ||

samastanyāsa sahitāṃ yaṃtrapūjāpuraḥsarāṃ |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ prāptavān gautamādguroḥ || 20 ||

śarīramarthaṃ prāṇāścanivedya gurupādayoḥ |
kṛtavānniyamaṃ ghoraṃ brahmadarśanasiddhaye || 21 ||

ācāryapādukāyugmarcayitvaiva saṃtaṃtaṃ | 
sauvarṇapuṣpasāhasrairbhokṣyāmyahamataḥ paraṃ || 22 ||

sa itthaṃ niyamaṃ kṛtvā svaguroḥ pādukādvayaṃ |
prātaḥ samutthāya samabhyarcyopacārakaiḥ || 23 ||

brāhmaṇaiḥ sahabhuṃktennamitthaṃ dvādaśavatsaraṃ |
jāti smarattvaṃ prāpto saupādukā dvitayārcanāt || 24 ||

ekadāpādukāyugmaṃtirobhūtaṃ svamaṃdire |
anaśnanneva bhūposau japannācārya pādukāṃ || 25 ||

brahmavidhāṃ raśmimālāṃ śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃ japan |
prārthitaḥ pitṛmātṛbhyāmapi brahmarṣi puṃgavaiḥ || 26 ||

prārthigautamenāpi svācāryeṇa mahāmatiḥ |
anaśnanneva bhūpālo bhagavanyarpitāśayaḥ || 27 ||

tuṣṭosya gautamastasmai janakāya mahātmane |
prādādaṣṭākṣarīṃ siddhiṃ (**)(?) darśanasiddhidāṃ || 28 ||

<p. 13a>

tathāpi na hi bhuṃkte sau pādukābhāvato nṛpaḥ |
athājagāmataṃ saṃbhūyaṃ draṣṭumunmattaveṣabhṛt || 29 ||

jaṭākalāpasahito(**)(?)lāṃvarasaṃvṛtaḥ |
kṛṣṇājinottarīyaśca śiṣyeṇaikena saṃyutaḥ || 30 ||

yo sauvadarīkāvāsī trijagatparipālakaiḥ |
bhūtvā paramahaṃ soyaṃ sākṣānnārāyaṇāvibhuḥ || 31 ||

jñātvā paramahaṃ saṃtasāgataṃ svasvamaṃdiraṃ |
pādukā dvitayārūḍhaṃ śiṣyeṇaikena saṃyutaṃ || 32 ||

prāyugmyābhivādyātha janakomithilāpatiḥ |
dadarśapādukāyugmaṃ tenārūḍhaṃ mahātmanā || 33 ||

brahmānaṃdayuto bhūtvā dṛṣṭvā tatpādukādvayaṃ |
bhūyo bhūyonamaskṛtyasvarṇapuṣpairapūjayat || 34 ||

puṣpajālaṃ hemamayaṃ  pādukādvitayerpitaṃ |
tanmastaketha dṛṣṭvāsau vismayaṃ prāpasādaraṃ || 35 ||

ācāryagautamaṃ paścāttadā kṛti samanvitaṃ |
dṛṣṭvā na māmasāṣṭāṃgaṃdhanyosmīti muhurvadan || 36 ||

ācāryarūpiṇastasyatejaḥ kodyarkasannibhaṃ |
dṛṣṭvā nimīlitākṣausau pādayugme yamāhataha || 37 ||

tamutthāpya dadau divyaṃ cakṣurasmai jagatpatiḥ |
athāyaśmaccharīresya sarvametaccarācaraṃ || 38 ||

brahmāṇaṃ bhāskaraṃ śeṣaṃ tvāṃ ca gaurī samanvitaṃ |
śakrādīniṣṭa dikpālānsādhyāṃśca samarudgaṇān || 39 ||

mitrādīndvādaśādityān rudrānekādaśāpyatha |
viśvametadaśeṣeṇa dṛṣṭvā macchaśuronyāḥ || 40 ||

ācāryāpādayordatavyajālamathākṣayaṃ |
dṛṣṭvā vismayamāpannaṣyunastatpādukādvayaṃ || 41 ||

nikṣipyamastake svasya tatpādāṃbhoruhadvayaṃ |
sāṣṭāṃgaṃ daṃḍavannatvā śruti sūktairanekaśaḥ || 42 ||

stutvā kṛtāṃjali puṭohaṃsaveṣadharaṃ vibhuṃ |
apaśyat pūrvavadvipraṃ jaṭāvalkyalasaṃyutaṃ || 43 ||

ekībhūtaṃ svagurūṇā bhūyopyāścarya sāptavān |
ācārya pādukāyugmapūjanādgurutoṣaṇāt || 44 ||

janmame saphalaṃ jātaṃ jātaṃ me brahmadarśanaṃ |
sākṣānnārāyaṇāsyedaṃ darśanaṃ paramātmanaḥ || 45 ||

<p. 13b>

gautamānugrahājjātamitimattvā sa bhūpatiḥ |
āsanaṃ kalpayāmāsayogiveṣadharasyahi || 46 ||

śiṣyeṇasahito yogīsamupāviśadāsane |
arghyapādyādibhirdivyagaṃdhaiśca kusumaiḥ śubhaiḥ || 47 ||

arcayāmāsa tatpādau sa śiṣyaṇasā mahāmatiḥ | 
ācāryapādukāyugmamagnebhyarcyaiva śaṃkara || 48 ||

tasya tuṣṭastatassādhyo devo nārāyaṇo vibhuḥ |
uvāca vacanaṃ bhūyaṃ kṛtāṃjalipuraṃ sthitaṃ || 49 ||

śrībhagavānuvāca 

prītohaṃte mahīyālayadyadiṣṭatamaṃ tava |
tattaddāsyāmi bhūyopi prārthitādadhikaṃ phalaṃ || 50 ||

rājovāca 

tvatpādadarśanaṃ jātaṃ tvadrūpaṃ dṛṣṭamadbhutaṃ |
kimanyadvarayebhīṣṭaṃ sakalaṃ prāptamadya me || 51 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoje nityaṃ bhaktirdṛḍhāstume |
ācāryapādukāyugmapūjāpratyahamastume || 52 ||

ratirmevaidikācāre bhaktirācāryapādayoḥ |
tvadvidyābhajanemestudṛḍhābhaktissadā mama || 53 ||

ityukto bhagavāṃstatramithilādhipatiṃ nṛpaṃ |
prāhanārāyaṇoyogīnareṇasahito vibhuḥ || 54 ||

tuṣṭohaṃ mithilādhīśayadyate phalamīpsitaṃ |
tatadastu mahīpāla nityamācāryasevayā || 55 ||

ācāryatoṣaṇānnityaṃ yathātuṣṭo bhavāmyahaṃ |
tvatayaḥ phalataḥ sarvetvadanyapa sa muktvāḥ || 56 ||

sarvepi mama sāyujyaṃ prāśyaṃtyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
ahaṃ dāśarathirbhūtvālakṣmaṇānucaro bhuvi || 57 ||

jāmātāte bhaviṣyāmi rāma ityabiviśrutaḥ |
śrīryācidrūpiṇī śaktirmamavedeṣu viśrutā || 58 ||

bhaviṣyatīyaṃte putrīmatprasādanmahīpate |
avāpta sarvabhāgyastvaṃ bhūtvā vigatakalmaṣaḥ || 59 ||

matpradātparaṃdhāma prāśyase pitṛmissaha |
ityuktvā bhagavāṃstūṣṇīmāsīnaḥ samyagāsane || 60 ||

prasādābhimukhastasya janakasyagahe bhavat |
prasādābhimukhaṃ vīkṣya (****)(?) sanātanaṃ || 61 ||

<p. 14a>

nārāyaṇaṃ narasakha mahāyogiśvaraṃ vibhuṃ |
uvāca janakorājā kṛtāṃjaliridaṃ vacaḥ || 62 ||

rājovāca 

bhagavan devadeveśa nārāyaṇa jayatpate |
hitāya sarvalokānāṃ kiṃcidvijñaptumudyataḥ || 63 ||

brahmāparokṣavijñānaṃ katha me kena janmanā |
gurupādābja śuśrūṣā kartavyā kathamādarāt || 64 ||

kathaṃ vai vedikācāraḥ kartavyogahavāptibhiḥ |
vidhinā kena kartavyaṃ tvadvidyābhajanaṃ vibho || 65 ||

etadanyācca saphalaṃ brūhi me bhagavan vibho |

śrībhagavānuvāca 

pṛṣṭametattrijagatāmupakārakamādarāt || 66 ||

tubhyaṃ janaka vakṣyāmi gurubhaktāyadhīmate |
yatatsatyaciānaṃdamakhaṃḍaṃ brahmanirguṇaṃ || 67 ||

avalaṃ śāśvataṃ divyaṃ vedavedyaṃ parātparaṃ |
saguṇaṃ nirguṇaṃ ceti rūpadvitayamuttamaṃ || 68 ||

vidyate brahmaṇastasya tejorūpaṃ hi nirguṇaṃ |
saccidānaṃdamadvaitaṃ jyotirūpaṃ parātparaṃ || 69 ||

nirguṇaṃ brahmaṇo rūpaṃ viśvātītaṃ mamaiva tat |
saguṇaṃ sṛṣṭisaṃhāra sthitikāraṇamadbhutaṃ || 70 ||

brahmaviṣṇumaheśānāṃ kāraṇaṃ triguṇānvitaṃ |
saguṇasya mamodbhūtāvadanācchutirāśayaḥ || 71 ||

nārāyaṇājñālokānāṃ śrutirevasanātanī |
ajñāchedī mamadrohīdehāṃte narakālayaḥ || 72 ||

vedādhyayana kṛnnityaṃ vaidikācārasaṃyutaḥ |
nārāyaṇapadaṃ nityaṃ dehāṃte praviśatyasau || 73 ||

svakarmaniṣṭhaḥśatajanmabhirdvijoviraṃcitāmeti tataḥ paraṃ śivaṃ |
ācāryapādāṃvujasevamāthanārāyaṇānugrahabhāgasau bhavet || 74 ||

nārāyaṇamukhodbhūtāvedāssāṃgāsanātanāḥ |
teṣuniṣṭhassadācārayutomadbhajanerataḥ || 75 ||

prāpnoti paramaṃdhāmayatannārāyaṇābhidhaṃ |
ācāryapādukāsevāpurassaramathādarāt || 76 ||

kurvanvaidikamācāraṃ brahmavidyāṃ japansadā |
samastanyāsasahitaśrīmadṛṣṭāsarīṃ japan || 77 ||

<p. 14b>

prāpnotyavaśyaṃ kaivalyameke naiva hi janmanā |
brahmacārī gṛhasthaśca vānaprasthopi saṃtataṃ || 78 ||

kṛtvaiva vedādhyayanaṃ brahmaṇo bhavti dhruvaṃ |
devatāṃ maṃtrarūpiṇyo maṃtrāvedeṣu saṃsthitāḥ || 79 ||

tasmād vedamayāviprā vedādhyayanasaṃyutāḥ |
sarvavedamayā viprāḥ sarvadevamayo hariḥ || 80 ||

devo nārāyaṇaḥ sākṣāt paramātmāsanātanaḥ |

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
paṃcamodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 14b>

śrīrāmacaṃdra uvāca 

śṛṇu rudramahābhāgajanakena mahātmanā |
pṛṣṭo vadarikāvāsīprāhanārāyaṇo vibhuḥ || 1 ||

śrībhagavānuvāca 

śṛṇu rājanmahīpāladeveṣu samudīritaṃ |
sadācāraṃ parabrahmāparokṣajñānasiddhidaṃ || 2 ||

tadācāravattābhāvyaṃ dvijena jagatīpate |
ācārāvyāpyane saukhyamācārāt prāpyate yaśaḥ || 3 ||

ācārāt prāpyate lakṣmīrācārāt prāpyate gatiḥ |
adhītyavedānvedau vā vedaṃ vā śaktitodvijaḥ || 4 ||

taduktācāra saṃpannobrahmapaśyati tatparaṃ |
rajanī prāṃtayāmasya pūrvārddhaṃ brāhmyanāmakaḥ || 5 ||

samayaḥ procyate sadbhirbrahmadarśanasiddhidaḥ |
saṃdhyāparārdhakālaḥ syāccaturnāḍī mahīpate || 6 ||

brāhmesamaya utthāya śayanasthita eva hi |
jananīcaraṇau smṛtvā sarvatīrthottamottamau || 7 ||

tridhā pituḥ pādayugaṃ natvācāryasya bhūpate |
caraṇau paṃcadhā smṛtva śriyaḥ patimathācyutaṃ || 8 ||

smṛtvā daśārṇamanunā dvādaśāvṛtimādarāt |
gajāsyamatha saṃsmṛtya viśveśaṃ pārvatī vibhuṃ || 9 ||

vāṇīpatiṃ vidhātāraṃ maheṃdrādidigīśvarān |
aruṃdhatyādi sādhvīśca devarṣīnnāradādikān || 10 ||

kapilādi mahāsiddhān dattātreyādi yoginaḥ |
kavīvālmīkimukhyāṃścatvadādīndvayatinapi || 11 ||

kaustubhādītmaṇigaṇān dumānkalpadurādikān |
kiṃ karānyāyuputrādīnmahādidṛḍhān || 12 ||

<p. 15a>

brahmarṣīśca vaśiṣṭhādīnnaṃ diśādigaṇyanapi |
vasuṃdharāṃ namaskṛtya daṃkṣaṃ pādaṃ mahītale || 13 ||

nikṣipyapurato vāmaṃ pādaṃ paśca(*)(?) nikṣipet |
prāṃjaliḥ svagurūnsarvānnatvā brahmaviletanaḥ || 14 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojadvayaṃ brahmavileśubhe |
dhyātvā tatpadakamalagalatpīyūṣa viṃdubhiḥ || 15 ||

saṃplāvitamathātmānaṃ dhyātvā śuddho bhavatyasau |
mūlādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ jvalaṃtīṃ saṃvidaṃ parāṃ || 16 ||

dhyātvā tejomaya tanurvāsasī paridhāya ca |
āsaneramyagāsīnaḥ prāṇānāyasya vāgpataiḥ || 17 ||

ācāryapādukāvidyāmaṣṭāviṃśatidhā japet |
jptvā dvādaśadhāvadhinatvācārya padāṃvujaṃ || 18 ||

atha vā pratyahaṃ bhaktyā prātahatyāya vāgyataḥ |
ācārya caraṇāṃbhojārūḍhaṃ śrīpādukādvayaṃ || 19 ||

svarṇaratnamayaṃ vāpi rājataṃ lohajaṃ tu vā |
dāruṇā nirmitaṃ vāpi śubhalagneśubhedine || 20 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojārūḍhaṃ kṛtvā tadāditaḥ |
prātaḥ prātaḥ samutthāya śreya icchannanuttamaṃ || 21 ||

ananyadarśano dṛṣṭvā pādukā dvitayaṃ guroḥ |
ācāryapādukāvidyāmuccaranpraṇamenṛpa || 22 ||

tulasījāhnavīgodāṃnadīṃ sumahatīmapi |
pāpakaṃ bhūpatiṃ vipravaryaṃ vedāṃtapāragaṃ || 23 ||

prātarutthāpayaḥ paśyen sa āpamdyaḥ pramucyate |
prātarutthāyayo nityaṃ pādukā dvitayaṃ guroḥ || 24 ||

pūrvaṃ paśyati cakṣurbhyāṃ sa paraṃbrahma paśyati |
jāhnavyādīni tīrthāni saptako pṛṣayopi ca || 25 ||

tena dṛṣṭāna saṃdeho brahmādyā api devatāḥ |
ācāryapādukābhāvepyācārya caraṇadvayaṃ || 26 ||

brahmaraṃdhre sahasrāre dhyātvā ciramananyadhīḥ |
upacāraiḥ samabhyarcya manasā kalpitaiḥ śubhaiḥ || 27 ||

paścānnārāyaṇaṃ devaṃ saṃsmarodidirāpatiṃ |
brahmavidyāpradātāyasmarayācārya ucyate || 28 ||

samastanyāsa sahitāṃ yaṃtraṃ pūjā purassarāṃ |
bhagacadraśmi vidyābhiḥ sahitāṃ sarvasiddhidāṃ || 29 ||

<p. 15b>

śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ śiṣyāya pradadātiyaḥ |
sarāvabhagavadrūpī mahānācārya ucyate || 30 ||

dharmārthakāmamokṣāṇāṃ sarāvādimakāraṇaṃ |
tameva brahma tādātmya siddhimūlaṃ vidurbudhāḥ || 31 ||

bahunā kimihoktena sākṣānnārāyaṇo hariḥ |
ācāryākṛtimannityaṃ saṃpūjyoghaṃghodinedine || 32 ||

ācāryapādukāvidyāṃ brahmavidyāṃ prajapya ca |
bhagavadraśmi vidyānāṃ kramasūktamathojape || 33 ||

paṃcadhā vā tridhā dvedhā caturdhā sa kṛdapyatha |
saṃsmṛtya bhagavatsūktaṃ japennārāyaṇaṃ sakṛn || 34 ||

paścādvahissaptamāgatyatyajenmūtramalādikaṃ |
vāsasāśira āvṛtyaṣṭīvanocchāsavarjitaḥ || 35 ||

tṛṇairāstīrtha vasudhāṃ malaṃmūtramathatyajet |
udaṅmukho malaṃ mūtramaharbhāge parityajet || 36 ||

dakṣiṇābhimukho rātrautyajenmūtramalādikaṃ |
śuddhāṃ mṛdaṃ samādāyadadyālliṃge mṛdaṃ sakṛt || 37 ||

tisro vāmakaredadyātyaṃ cāyāne mṛdaḥ smṛtāḥ |
daśavāmakare dadyādubhayossaptamṛtikāḥ || 38 |||

pādapṛṣṭe pādatale tisrastisraśca mṛtikāḥ |
etacchau ca gṛhasthasya dviguṇaṃ brahmacāriṇaḥ || 39 ||

vaninastriguṇaṃ proktaṃ yattīnāṃ tu caturguṇaṃ |
śaucācāravihīnasya niṣphalāḥ saphalāḥ kriyāḥ || 40 ||

śaucamitthaṃ dvijaḥ kṛtvā daṃtadhā vanamācaret |
pratipaddarśa ṣaṣṭhīṣu navamyāṃ ravivāre || 41 ||

daṃtakāṣṭha samāyogo dahatyā saptamaṃ kulāṃ |
tṛṇaparṇaissadā kuryādayādamāmekādaśīṃ vinā || 42 ||

kṛtvācārya padāṃbhojadvayaṃ manasi saṃsmaret |
snānaṃ kuryānmahānadyāṃ taḍāge vā hṛdepi ca || 43 ||

śarīra(**)(?) raṃdhrebhyaḥ sravatyeva malaṃ sadā |
tasmāt snānamṃ prakartavyaṃ vāhyāṃtarmalanāśanaṃ || 44 ||

prātaḥprātastu yatsnānaṃ saṃjāte cāruṇodaye |
prājāpatya samaṃ prāhustanmahādyavighātanaṃ || 44 ||

<p. 16a>

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoja tīrthameva nadījalaṃ |
dhyātvā snānaṃ prakurvīta sarvapāpa viśuddhaye || 45 ||

(*)(?)ṇānāyamya saṃkalpasnānaṃ kuryā dine dine |
keśavādi caturviṃśannāmāni manasāsmaran || 46 ||

yaḥ snātya haraho vipraścaturviṃśatithā nṛpa |
ekasmin divase vāpi snānaṃ kṛvattha mādarāt || 47 ||

mahāpātaka koṭibhyaḥ sadya eva vimucyate |
snātvātha vāsasī śuddhe paridhāya samāhitaḥ || 47 ||

saṃdhyā karma tataḥ kuryāt prāṅmukho daṅmukhopi vā |
udayāt prāktaṃnī saṃdhyāṃ ghaṭikā tritayāṃ viduḥ || 48 ||

astagādbhāskarādūrdhvaṃ tathaiva ghaṭikā trayaṃ |
saṃdhyākarma paṭityāgī sarvakarma vahiṣkṛtaḥ || 49 ||

yadyattu kurute karma na tasya phalabhāgbhavet |
tyaktā saṃdhyābhidhaṃ karmayonyatra kurute pratiṃ || 50 ||

sa śūdra vahvahiṣkāryassarvasmādviprakarmaṇaḥ |
prātasāṃdhyāṃ sa nakṣatrāmupāsīta yathāvidhi || 51 ||

sādityāṃ paścimā saṃdhyāmardhāstamitabhāskarāṃ |
arddhāmita nakṣatramaṃtarikṣaṃ yadā bhavet || 52 ||

saṃdhyākālassavijñeyodiyasamyamukhaṃ nṛpa |
prāṇānāyamma saṃkalpa saṃdhyākarma samāret || 53 ||

vidhi nāpi kṛtā saṃdhyā kālātītā phalāsmṛtā |
ayamevahi dṛṣṭāṃto vaṃdhyāstrīsaṃgamo yathā || 54 ||

maṃdehadehanārśārthamudayāstamayauravaiḥ |
gāyatrī maṃtratoyādyaṃ dattaṃ yenājalitrayaṃ || 55 ||

kāle savitre kiṃ nasyāttenadattaṃ jagāttrayaṃ |
tena vajrodakenāśumaṃdehānāmarākṣasāḥ || 56 ||

sūryārayaḥ pralīyaṃte śailāvajrāhatā iva |
saṃdhyākarmaparityāgī maṃdehorākṣaso bhavet || 57 ||

asāvityādimaṃtreṇa tataḥ kuryāt pradakṣiṇaṃ |
pradakṣiṇī kṛtā tena saptādvīpavanīmahī || 58 ||

tāvat prātarjayaṃstiṣṭhedyāvadardhodayaṃ bhavet |
āsanastho japenmaunī pratyagātārakodayāt || 59 ||

<p. 16b>

adhānya madhyamāṃ saṃdhyāṃ kuryādāditya sanmukhaḥ |
savinābhagavānsākṣādbrahmarūpīśriyaḥ patiḥ || 60 ||

ādityamaṃḍalāṃjñastho mūrtitritayarūpabhṛt |
tanmaṃḍalagataṃ dhyātvā devaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ vibhuṃ || 61 ||

yathā bhaktyā japennityaṃ gāyatrīṃ vedamātaraṃ |
sahasra paramāṃ devīśatamadhyaṃ daśāparaṃ || 62 ||

gāyatrīṃ prajapennityaṃ pātakodyaiḥ pramucyate || 63 ||

taṃ vaśiṣṭāṃśa saṃbhūtaṃ prāhurbrahmarṣayomajāḥ |
japetyaṃ ca śataṃ vāpi catuśatamathāpi vā || 64 ||

triśataṃ vā japannityamuttamo dvija ucyate |
aṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ japtvā brāhmaṇaḥ syāddinedine || 65 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā japatvā brāhmaṇo nāmadhārakaḥ |
sahasra kṛtvo gāyatrīṃ japaṃtaṃ pratpadaṃ śuci || 66 ||

vaśiṣṭamivataṃ nityamarcayedupacārakaiḥ |
na vedapāṭhādbrāhmaṇyaṃ na śāstrapaṭhanādapi || 67 || 

devyāstrikālamadhyāsādbrāhmaṇyaṃ nānyathā bhavet |
aśaktaḥ prajapennityaṃ tiṣṭhannāsī na eva vā || 68 ||

trisaṃdhyamapi śuddhātmā sāvitrī vedamātaraṃ |
udite tu sahasrāṃśau tanmaṃḍala lagataṃ vibhuṃ || 69 ||

vedāśvarathamārūḍhaṃ trayīmūrti hiraṇmayaṃ |
dhyātvā nārāyaṇaṃ devaṃ śriyāsahitamacyutaṃ || 70 ||

kṛtāṃjali rūpāsītamaitrasūktena nityaśaḥ |
diśāmapi namaskuryāddi devebhyastataḥ paraṃ || 71 ||

ātmapādautanaḥ spṛṣṭvā svātmānaṃ praṇamedbudhaḥ |
punarācamaśuddhātmā ravimaṃḍalamadhyagaṃ || 72 ||

dhyātvā nārāyaṇaṃ devaṃ śrīmāsahitamīśvaraṃ |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃ saṃdhyāṃ kṛtvā sidhyarthamādarāt || 73 ||

vaiṣṇavīmathagāyatrīṃ yathā śaktyā prajapya ca |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ nyāsādi rahitāmapi || 74 ||

ādityābhimukho nityamaṣṭottaraśataṃ japet |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā vāpi noce(*)(?)rddharna jāyate || 75 ||

sūktena pauruṣeṇātha stutvā nārāyaṇaṃ vibhuṃ |
kṛtāṃjali puṭo bhūtvā sūktaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ japet || 76 ||

prāṇānāthamya saṃkalpya homakarma samārabhet |
gāyatryā vāhya tanmadhye yajñeśaṃ  śrīpatiṃ vibhuṃ || 77 ||

<p. 17a>

upacāraissabhyarcya hutvā dvādaśadhā kṛtaṃ | 
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣareṇāthagavyamājyaṃ tadnahīpate || 78 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā śrīmaṃtreṇāpyataḥ paraṃ |
hutvā dvādaśadhā vahnāvaddhaṃga śrīpateratha || 79 ||

manunā ca yathā śaktyā hutvā gavyājya samādarāt |
ṛksrāmayajuṣāṃ pāṭhaṃ brahmayajñārthamācaret || 80 ||

devānṛṣīmapi pitṝn tarpayedudakaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
ravau śukre trayodaśyāṃ saptamyāṃ niśisaṃdhyayoḥ || 81 ||

śreyorthī svagṛhe jātu na kuryātilatarpaṇaṃ |
kāmya vrateṣu juhuyādraśmividyābhirekadhā || 82 ||

vedapārāyaṇaṃ kuryā yathā śaktyā dine dine |
ācāryacaraṇāṃ bhojadvayaṃ brahmavile śubhe || 83 ||

kṛtāṃjali puṭo natvāsasyagāsīna āsane |
prāṇā nārāyamya saṃkalpya samastanyāsasaṃyutāṃ || 84 ||

śrīmadṛṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ sahasraṃ prajapecchuciḥ |
japenpaṃcaśataṃ vāpi catuḥśatamathāpi vā || 87 ||

triśataṃ vā japennityamaṣṭādhikaṃ śataṃ tu vā |
nārāyaṇena sūktena stutvā devaṃ śriyaḥ patiḥ || 88 ||

sahasrārṇa mahāvidyāṃ saṃsmaret sakṛdapyatha |
upeyādatharājānaṃ yogakṣemārthasiddhaye || 89 ||

madhyāhnakāle saṃprāpte snātvā camya tataḥ paraṃ |
saṃdhyāṃ māhnikīṃ kuryādādityābhimukhaḥ śuciḥ || 90 ||

jalenoṣṇena vā snāyādaśaktorogasaṃyutaḥ |
prātarmadhyāhnavelāyāṃ snāśaktopi satataṃ || 91 ||

ādreṇa vāsasādehaṃ parimṛjya śucirbhavet |
madhyāhnepi yathā śaktyā gāyatrīṃ samupāsya ca || 92 ||

śālagrāma śilācakre pūjayediṃ dirāpatiṃ |
ācāryapādukāyugmaṃ yadi tiṣṭhati maṃdire || 93 ||

sarvopacāraiḥ saṃpūjya paścācchīpatimarcayet ||
pādukā sannidhau nityaṃ kiṃcidārpadakṣiṇāṃ || 94 ||

datvā saṃkalpya vā citte māsi māsi samarpayet 
vatsaratritarpanaiva pādukārcanato guṇaiḥ || 95 ||

paśyatyavaśyaṃ cakṣurbhyāṃ sākṣādevaśriyaḥpatiṃ | 
prāpnoti mahatīṃ siddhiṃ maṃtrāṇāṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ || 96 ||

<p. 17b>

sālagrāma śilācakre lakṣmīnārāyaṇau yajet |
liṃge vā pūjayennityaṃ pārvatīparameśvarau || 97 ||

vaiśvadevaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā manunārdharamāpateḥ |
hutvā dvādaśadhā vahnāvannaṃgavyaghṛtaplutaṃ || 98 ||

datvā bhūtavaliṃ paścādannaṃ sūryādisaṃyutaṃ |
ācāryaṃ bhojayetasya patnīmapi sutānapi || 99 ||

āmaṃsūpādisahitamācāryāyātha vārpayet |
yadvā varṣāśanamitaṃ dhanamācāryapādayoḥ || 100 ||

arpayet parvakāleṣu yadīketsiddhimātmanaḥ |
tathāpyaharahaḥ kiṃciddeyamācāryapādayoḥ || 1 ||

saṃkalpyamanasāvāpi māsi māsi samarpayet |
rudreṇa bhuṃktaṃ nirmālāmabhojyamiti kathyate || 2 ||

viṣṇu bhuktaṃ nivedyaṃ syādabhojyaṃ tadapi smṛtaṃ |
ācāryabhuktaśiṣṭaṃ syādamṛtaṃ pāpanāśanaṃ || 3 ||

nirmālyaṃ ca nivedyaṃ ca haviḥ śeṣaṇasaṃyutaṃ |
pavitraṃ kathyate vedeno cedaśuci tatsmṛtaṃ || 4 ||

asnātvāśīmalaṃ bhuṃkte ajapīpūyaśoṇitaṃ |
ahutvāśī kṛmīnbhuṃkte adatvā viṣabhugbhavet || 5 ||

dūrādhvānaṃ pathiśrāṃtaṃ vaiśvadevāṃta āgataṃ |
atithiṃtaṃ vijānīyādbhojayetaṃ prayatnataḥ || 6 ||

ācāryaḥ svapitāmātāpatnīputrotithisvathā |
ṣaḍeneharaharbhojyā annairbahuvidhairapi || 7 ||

avaśyaṃnityamācāryaṃ bhojanācchādanādibhiḥ |
aparāmṛśyayobhuṃkte sabhuṃkte narakaṃ dhruvaṃ || 8 ||

śākaṃ sūpaṃ ghṛtaṃ vāpi svācāryāya dine dine |
aparāmṛśyate bhuṃkte sabhuṃkte kilviṣaṃ dhruvaṃ || 9 ||

avaśyaṃ pitaraṃ mātṛpatniputrātithinapi |
bhojayedaśanādyaiśca coṣyalehyādibhistathā || 10 ||

paṃcārdrobhojanaṃ kuryānmanasāśrīpa(*)(?)mara |
bhuktvā yatheṣṭaṃ hastau ca prakṣālyacaraṇau mukhaṃ || 11 ||

devatāsmaraṇaṃ kuryādbhojanāṃte samāhitaḥ 
saṃsārayogakṣemāṃtamathagacchedvahiḥ pumān || 12 ||

atha sāyaṃtanī saṃdhyāṃ sāyaṃkāle samārabhet |
kṛtvā sāyaṃtanaṃ homamarddhāṃgaṃ śrīpatermanuṃ || 13 ||

<p. 18a>

aṣṭādaśārṇaṃ prajapecchatamaṣṭottaraṃ budhaḥ |
cakrarvyūhātmakasyātha maṃtrāmānuṣṭumaṃ paraṃ || 14 ||

yathāśaktyā prajaptvātha bhuṃjīpādvaṃdhubhissaha |
tāṃbūlāmodivadano gurupādāṃvujadvayaṃ || 15 ||

kṛtāṃjā(*)(?)puṭonatvānarmadāṃ manasāsmaran |
smṛtvā śriyaḥ patiṃ devamāṃjaneyaṃ tataḥ paraṃ || 16 ||

śayīta śubhraśavyāyāṃ tato vāmadvayaṃ svapet |
kurvannitya mahorātraṃ karmavaidikamādarāt || 117 ||

dehāṃte samavāpnoti paraṃ tadbrahmaṇaḥ padaṃ ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre 
vedārthasaṃgrahe ṣaṣṭhodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 18a>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

bhūyopi saṃpravakṣyāmi śrautācāraṃ yaśaskaraṃ |
yatkṛtvā manujoloke śreyo mahadavāpnuyāt || 1 ||

niṣekādi śmaśānaṃ tadvijānāṃ vaidikī kriyā |
vaidikācārahīnoyojīvanneva sa paṃcamaḥ || 2 ||

jāpe putre dvijasyādau sa cailaṃ snānamucyate |
hiraṇyābhyudayaśrāddhaṃ kuryādācamya yatnataḥ || 3 ||

godānāni hiraṇyaṃ ca dadyātyajha phalāni ca |
tāṃvūlagaṃdhamālyānibhūṣaṇānyapi suvrataḥ || 4 ||

apavitro daśāhaṃ syāt yajetkarmātha vaidikaṃ |
jātake mṛtake cāpi saṃdhyākarma na saṃtyajet || 5 ||

manasoccārayenmaṃtrān prāṇāyāmamṛte dvijaḥ |
ekādaśehni kurvītanāma karma tataḥparaṃ || 6 ||

tṛtīyādvetataścaulaṃ kuryādbrāhmaṇabhojanaṃ |
garbhāṣṭamemāvdevābrāhmaṇasyoyanāthanaṃ || 7 ||

ekādaśābderājñāṃ syādviśāṃ dvādaśavatsare |
brahmacārī tadāramya vedādhyana siddhaye || 8 ||

gatvā gurukulaṃ nityaṃ vedādhyayanamācaret |
ājñāṃnollaṃghaye tasya samitpuṣpakuśādikān || 9 ||

āharet satataṃ bhikṣācaryāṃ kuryānmahāmatiḥ |
kṛtvā bhikṣādanaṃ nityaṃ gurave vinivedayet || 10 ||

tasyājñayevarbhujīyāttacchiṣṭānnaṃ samāhitaḥ |
tatpūśūnyālayennityaṃ tadgṛhaṃ mārjayet sadā || 11 || 

<p. 18b>

vastraprakṣālanaṃ kuryātpādasaṃvāhanādikaṃ |
vedānadhītyavedau vā vedaṃ vā śaktito dvijaḥ || 12 ||

avipluta brahmacaryaullakṣyaṇyāṃ striyamudvahet |
ananyapūrvikāṃ suptāṃ niṣkrāṃtāṃrudatīmapi || 13 ||

vācādatāmathānyasmaimuṃḍāṃrogi kulodbhavāṃ |
raktakeśaśmaśumatīṃpiṃgākṣīṃ vikṛtastavīṃ || 14 ||

laṃvodarīṃ dīrghagalāṃ vyādhi vāhulyasaṃyutāṃ |
varjayedvaraṇe kanyārātārājanmahāmate || 15 ||

arogiṇīṃ bhrātṛmatīṃ suṃdarīṃ lakṣaṇānvitāṃ |
śrotriyānvaya saṃbhūtāṃ gṛhārcanaratāṃ sadā || 16 ||

nityaṃgṛhīsukhaṃ bhuṃkte strīlakṣaṇavatīyadi |
gṛhasaukhyasamṛdhyarthaṃ lakṣaṇyāṃ striyamudvahet || 17 ||

anukūlaṃ kalatraṃ cettridive kiṃ sukhaṃ nṛpaṃ |
pratikūlaṃ kalatraṃ cetkiṃduḥkhaṃ narakobhavet || 18 ||

vaśyāḥ sutāvṛttakarī ca vidyābhāryānukūlā ca pativratāśca |
dharmeratiḥ sajjanasaṃgatiścaduḥsvasya mūloddharaṇāni paṃca || 19 || 

ṣoḍaśartuniśāḥ strīṇāṃ tasminyugmāsu saṃviśet |
ca tasro rātrayaḥ styājyā viṣamāsuna saṃviśet || 20 ||

ekādaśagate caṃdre caṃdratārāvalānvite |
ekādaśīparvavarjaṃ strīṣu saṃgamamācaret || 21 ||

na divāmaṃgamaṃ kuryāttadyoniṃ na nirīkṣapet |
anṛtaṃ madyagaṃdha ca divāhyā paṃcamaithunaṃ || 22 ||

punāti vṛṣalasyānnaṃ sāyaṃ saṃdhyā vahiṣkṛtā |
devāścapitaronityaṃ gṛhastha mṛṣayopi ca || 23 ||

 havyārthamāśramaṃyaṃtīhakṛmikīṭādayopiśca |
sarvāśrama variṣṭhoyaṃ gṛsthāśrama ucyate || 24 ||

nyāyārjita dhanastatvajñānaniṣṭho tithipriyaḥ |
śrāddhakṛtsadyavādī ca gṛhasthomuktamucyate || 25 ||

vedapārāyaṇaṃ kurvanvedasyārthaṃ vicāra(*)(?) || 15 ||

arogiṇīṃ bhrātṛmaṃtī suṃdarīṃ lakṣaṇānvitāṃ |
śrotriyānvayasaṃbhūtāṃ gṛhārcanaratāṃ sadā || 16 ||

nityaṃ gṛhīsukhaṃ bhuṃkte strīlakṣaṇavittīyadi |
gṛhasaukhyasamṛdhyarthaṃ lakṣaṇyāṃ striyamudvahet || 17 ||

<p. 19a>

anukūlaṃ kalatraṃ cennidivekiṃ sukhaṃ nṛpaṃ |
pratikūlaṃ kalatraṃ cetkiṃduḥkhaṃ narake bhavet || 18 ||

vaśyāḥ sutāvṛtakarī ca vidyābhāryānukūlā ca pativratā ca |
dharmeratiḥ sajjanasaṃgatiśca duḥkhasya mūloddharaṇāni paṃca || 19 ||

ṣoḍaśartuniśāḥ strīṇāṃ tasminyugmāsu saṃviśet |
catasrorātrayaḥ styājyā viṣamāsunasaṃviśet || 20 ||

ekādaśāgate caṃdre caṃdratārāvalānvite |
ekādaśīparvavarjaṃ strīṣu saṃgamamācaret || 21 ||

nadi vā saṃgamaṃ kuryātadyoniṃk na nirīkṣapet |
anṛtaṃ madyagaṃdhaṃ ca divāsvāyaṃ paṃcamaithunaṃ || 22 ||

punāti vṛṣalasyānnaṃ sāyaṃ saṃdhyāvahiṣkṛtā |
devāścapitaronityaṃ gṛhasthamṛṣayopi ca || 23 ||

havyārthamāśrayaṃtīhakṛmikīṭādayopi ca |
sarvāśramavariṣṭhoyaṃ gṛsthāśrama ucyate || 24 ||

nyāyārjitadhanastatvajñānaniṣṭhotithipriyaḥ |
śrāddhakṛtsadyavādī ca gṛhastho mukta ucyate || 25 ||

vedapārāyaṇaṃ kurvanvedasyārthaṃ vicārayan |
viprajanmaśatenāsau brahmaloke mahīyate || 26 ||

pratijanmaśarīrāṃte bhuṃkte kṣayasukhaṃ divi |
kalyāṃtaṃ satyalokepi bhuktvā bhogānmanoharān || 27 ||

bhūtalaṃ punarāgatya śrotriyānvaya saṃbhavaḥ |
sadācāraratonityaṃ vedapārāyaṇerataḥ || 28 ||

kalevarāṃte kailāsaṃ prāpyarudrasamobhavet bhuktvā |
kṣayaṃ mahatsaukhyaṃ kalpasahasramādarāt || 29 ||

punarbhūtalamāsādya vedavitkulasaṃbhavaḥ |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoja śuśrūṣaṇarataḥ śuciḥ || 30 ||

brahmavidyāṃ ca bhagavadraśmividyā samanvitāṃ |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ samastanyā saṃyutāṃ || 31 ||

upāste taccharīrāṃte śāśvataṃ bhagavatpadaṃ |
punarāratirahitaṃ prāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ || 32 ||

parabrahmātmakaṃ tejo yaccharīre na tiṣṭhati |
na tena prāpyate vidyā śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarī śubhā || 33 ||

aśvamedhādibhiryāgairiṣṭvā saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇaiḥ |
maheṃdralokemādaṃte kalpāṃtaṃ divyabhoginaḥ || 34 ||

<p. 19b>

punarbhūtalamāsādyacitkule mānuṣīṃ yonimāgatāḥ |
kṛtvā sukṛtakarmāṇi punaḥsvargasukhānvitāḥ || 35 ||

bhūyopi mānuṣī yoniṃ prāpnuvaṃti mahīpate |
punarjanma punarmṛtyuḥ punarduḥkhaṃ punassukhaṃ || 36 ||

kalevaresminmartyānāṃ sukhama evapi nāsti hi |
pāpe narakeduḥkhaṃ puṇye na tridive sukhaṃ || 37 ||

kṣīṇe puṇye svargaloke pātayaṃtyapi devatāḥ |
svargepi duḥkhasaṃmitaṃśraṃ viṣayuktānnavatsukhaṃ || 38 ||

yatsaukhyaṃ paramedhānnitadanaṃtaṃ hi śāśvataṃ |
brahmānaṃdābhidhaṃ prāhurbrahmatatvavidomalāḥ || 39 ||

dine dine sadācārya pādābja dvaṃdvasevayā |
brahmavidyānusaṃdhānācchīmadaṣṭākṣarī japāt || 40 ||

brahmānaṃdasukhaṃ prāpyamodate paramepade |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojadakṣiṇārahitaṃ dinaṃ || 41 ||

madhyaṃ dinamiti prāhurbrahmatatvavidomalāḥ |
yadyekajanmanā brahmatādātmyapadamicchati || 42 ||

kṛtvācāryasya śuśrūṣāṃ prāṇairathairdhiyāpi ca |
brahmavidyā samāyuktāṃ raśmividyāsamanvitāṃ || 43 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣaropāstiṃ sarahasyāṃ samācaret |
gṛhastha eva sarveṣāmāśramāṇāṃvara smṛtaḥ || 44 ||

nānyamāśramamāsādya brahmānaṃdasukhī bhavet |
gṛhasthāśramamāsādya sadācāreṇa saṃyutaṃ || 45 ||

devatānāmṛṣīṇāṃ ca pitṛṇāṃ tṛptimācaran |
devarṣi pitṛsaṃtoṣātatprāsādāpta vaibhavaḥ || 46 ||

ācāryatoṣaṇāt sākṣānnārāyaṇakṛpānnitaḥ |
modate apramedhāmni daśapūrvairdaśāparaiḥ || 47 ||

dṛṣṭipūtaṃ nyaset pādaṃ vastrapūtaṃ jalaṃ pivet |
satyapūtaṃ vadedvākyaṃ nyāyapūtaṃ dhanaṃ grahet || 48 ||

āpatkāle caturvarṇabhikṣābhāve tu sādhakaḥ |
aṃtyajānapibhikṣitvā dadyādācārya dakṣiṇāṃ || 49 ||

aśvamedhādi yāgeṣu koṭīśatasahasrakaṃ |
suvarṇadakṣiṇāṃ datvā yāgasya phalamaśnute || 50 ||

atyalpadakṣiṇoyāgoya jamā(**)(?)nāśayet |
vahuśo dakṣiṇādeyātasmādyāgasamṛddhaye || 51 ||

<p. 20a>

varṣāśanamitaṃ dravyamathavācārya pādayoḥ |
datvāśvamedhasāhasradakṣiṇāphalāmaśru(*)(?) || 52 ||

satyena vāyurāvāti satyenadivibhāskaraḥ |
rocate caṃdrabhaumādyā ahāpi divisthitāḥ || 53 ||

satyenaiva maheṃdropi trailokyaiśvaryavānabhūt |
satyena lokān jayati muktiḥ satyena pratiṣṭhitā || 54 ||

śrutismṛnātanīsatyaṃbhagavadvadanodbhavā |
yoginaḥ sanakādyāśca vaśiṣṭhādyā maharṣayaḥ || 55 ||

devarṣayonārādyāsmiddhāśca kapilādayaḥ |
maheṃdrādyāśca dikpālāḥ pūrvabhūtapatayopi ca || 56 ||

satyena paramāmṛddhiṃgatāḥ paramadhārmikāḥ |
bhagavadvacanaṃ satyaṃ satyaṃ vedoditaṃ tathā || 57 ||

brahmarṣīṇāṃ vacaḥ satyaṃ satyaṃ devavacopi ca |
brahmatatvavidonityaṃ vedavedāṃtapāraṇāḥ || 58 ||

gahavāsibhirajyarcyā brahmadarśanasiddhaye |
etannārāyaṇīyākhyaṃ satyamevocyate mayā || 59 ||

vedārthasaṃgrahaṃ taṃtraṃ vedavedāṃtasasmitaṃ |
ahaṃdāśarathirbhūtvā rudrāya paripṛcchate || 60 ||

vaktāsmye tanmahacchāstraṃ brahmarṣīṇāṃ ca sannidhau |
taṃtraṃ dāśarathīyākhyaṃ tadārabhya maharṣayaḥ || 61 ||

vedārthasaṃgrahaṃ nāmnā prāhure tanmahīpate |
asmindāśarathīyākhye taṃtre yadyadudīritaṃ || 62 ||

tatsarvaṃ vedavadgrāhyamācāryavadanāṃvujāt |
tasmādgṛhasthaḥ satataṃ devānāṃ tṛptiḥmācaran || 63 ||

vaidikācārasahitovedādhyayana tatparaḥ |
brahmavidyānusaṃdhātā śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīrataḥ || 64 ||

brahmāparokṣaṃ cakṣurbhyāṃ dṛṣṭvā nārāyaṇābhidhaṃ |
nārāyaṇamayo bhūtvā modate paramepade || 65 ||

ravisaṃkrame puṇye ravīṃdugrahaṇādiṣu |
prāpteṣva labhyayogeṣu navarātrāpratepi ca || 66 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojadvitayevahulaṃdhanaṃ |
dātavyaṃ ca mahīdānaṃ godānaṃ cāvaśeṣataḥ || 67 ||

sālagrāma śilādānaṃ brahmadarśanasiddhaye |
ācāryakarṇayorddevamavaśyaṃ kuṃḍaladvayaṃ || 68 || 

<p. 20b>

vittaśāṭhyaṃ parityajya navarātravṛtaṃ śubhaṃ |
vāsare bhārgavevaśyaṃ kartavyaṃ śrīsamṛddhaye || 69 ||

suvāsinyassamabhyarcyābhūṣaṇācchādanāśanaiḥ |
tryācāryapatnīsatataṃ vahulaṃ karaṇādibhiḥ || 70 ||

viśeṣeṇa samabhyarcyā samasteṣu vrateṣvapi |
mahālakṣmīdhiyā śiṣyaiścaturvargaphalāptaye || 71 ||

parvakāleṣu dātavyaṃ pātrebhyopi dhanādikaṃ |
ācārya eva pātrāṇāmuttamaṃ pātramucyate || 72 ||

vedādhyayanavānnityaṃ sadācāra samanvitaḥ |
pātramityucyate vedeśāstreṣu ca mahīpate || 73 ||

apātramucyate vedavāhya eva dvijādhamaḥ |
ṣaṇmāse vatsare vāpi dehasaṃśuddhi hetave || 74 ||

ācāryamaṃdire bhuktaśiṣṭaṃ bhojyaṃ mahīpate |
ācāryadakṣiṇādravyaṃ yācayennāpi tatkule || 75 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojadvaye saṃpādyayasvataḥ |
datvā yāgadhanaṃ sākṣāttaddarṣe brahma paśyati || 76 ||

kulānāmapi sāhasraṃ tārayennarakasthitaṃ |
paṭhanaṃ dharmaśāstrāṇāmitihāsapurāṇayoḥ || 77 ||

ācāryavadane naiva śrotavyaṃ pratyahaṃ nṛbhiḥ |
ācāryadakṣiṇāhīnaṃ vaṃdhyamityucyate dinaṃ || 78 ||

yatkiṃcidapi vā deyaṃ nityamācāryapādayoḥ |
samastavidyā sidhyarthaṃ brahmajñā phalāptaye || 79 ||

pustakaṃ dharmaśāstrāṇāmiti hāsasyapustakaṃ |
purāṇapustakaṃ vāpi dadhānmuktiphalāptaye || 80 ||

dānamāvaśyakaṃ deyaṃ saṃpādya yatnataḥ |
aviyogavatīmṛddhiṃpatnīputrāditissadā || 81 ||

bhārgave vāsare kāryaṃ vrataṃ sādhakaṃ puṃgavaiḥ |
paṃcayajñāḥ sadākāryā brāhmaṇaiḥ śaṃsitavrataiḥ || 82 ||

devayajñaḥ pitṛyajño bhūtayajñastataḥ paraṃ |
tato manuṣyayajñaḥ syādbrahmayajñastataḥ paraṃ || 83 ||

samidbhirapi homoyaṃ sāyaṃ prāta(**)(?)dine |
devayajña iti proktaḥ svargaḥ sādhana īritaḥ || 84 ||

tarpayedyastilairnityaṃ pitṝnathapitāmahān |
pitṛyajña iti proktaḥ kālavādhānivārakaḥ || 85 ||

bhūtebhyo yo valirhato bhūtayajñarahocyate | 
yadvijebhyonnadānaṃ syānnarayajñaṃ sa ucyate || 86 ||

<p. 21a>

ṛcamekāṃ yajurvāpi sāmaikathā cānṛpa |
yodhīte brahmayajñoyaṃ sa ukto brahmavittamaiḥ || 87 ||

śrīmaddaṣṭhākṣarīvidyā japahoma samṛddhaye |
ācāryadakṣiṇāṃ kiṃcidyathā śakta(*)(?)marpayet || 88 ||

yāgovaiṣṇuvanāmapratyahaṃ kāryaṃ ādasat |
sadguṇaiśvaryasaṃpatiḥ patiḥ padbhiryāgaiḥ prājāyate || 89 ||

ṣaḍyāgakartā satataṃ bhagavanmayatāṃ vrajet |
devarṣipitṛpītyarthaṃ pacayajñāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 90 ||

kartavyo vaiṣṇavoyāgo mokṣalakṣmīmamṛddhaye |
madhyāhnakāle saṃprāpte datvā bhūtavaliṃ bhuvi || 91 ||

tato godāhemātravaikālaṃtiṣṇedrahāṃgaṇe |
atithiṃ tatra saṃprāptaṃ pūjayet svagatādinā || 92 ||

tathāsanamradānena pāraprakṣālanena ca |
śraddhayānna pradānena priyamaśrotareṇa ca || 93 ||

gacchattaścānuyānena prītimutyādayedgṛhī |
ajñātakulanāmācadūradeśāddumāgataḥ || 94 ||

atithirnnāyavijñeyonaikagrāmasthitodvijaḥ |
svādhyāyaṃgotracaraṇamapṛṣṭāṃ ca tathākulaṃ || 95 ||

hiraṇyagarbhavīthyāṃtapanyetātithimāgate |
atithināṃ sahasrāṇi yasya bhuktānimaṃdire || 96 ||

ācāryaṃ bhojayetvekamavaśyaṃ tatphala labhet |
ārcācaraṇāṃbhojadvayaprakṣālitaṃ jalaṃ || 97 ||

pītvāṃtaḥ śuddhimāpnoti vahiḥ śirasi dhāraṇāt |
samastatīrthasnānasya phalasiddhan mahīpate || 98 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoja pravakṣyāmi tajalaṃ pivet |
yatiśca brahmacārī ca pakvānnasvāmināvubhau || 99 ||

tayorannamaddatvā tu mutvā cāṃdrāyaṇaṃ caret |
yatihaste jalaṃ dadyāt bhaikṣyaṃ dadyātyubharjalaṃ || 100 ||

tadbhaikṣaṃ meruṇā tulyaṃ tajjalaṃ sāgaropamaṃ |
ācāryo vimukho gṛhṇāngṛhānpratinivartate || 1 || 

<p. 21b>

tanaiva yāṃti smarate devatāḥ pitṛbhissaha |
ācāryapatniputrāṇāmavaśyaṃ poṣaṇaṃ vudhaiḥ || 2 ||

prātaḥprātassamusthāyaciṃtanīṃ vicakṣaṇaiḥ |
pratijñātaṃ manovāgbhyāṃ daridrāya kuṭuṃvine || 3 ||

aṇādapyadhikaṃ tatsyāt paralokabhayaṃkaraṃ |
śīghrameva pradātavyaṃ tadṛṇaṃ svargasaukhyadaṃ || 4 ||

saṃkalpitā sadācārya dakṣiṇāniṣkasasmitā |
api merusamājñeyāmāsādūrdhvamṛṇaṃ mahat || 5 ||

saṃkalpadinamārabhya taddravyaṃ vṛddhi saṃyutaṃ |
māsābhyaṃtarattodeyaṃ dvimāsābhyaṃtarepivā || 6 ||

śrotriyāṇāṃ sahasrebhyo datvā koṭiśataṃ dhanaṃ |
yatphalaṃ samavāpnoti sadācāryasya pādayoḥ || 7 ||

niṣkamekaṃ pradatvāpi tatodhikaphalaṃ labhet |
trīṇyāhuratidānāni kanyāpṛthvīsarasvatī || 8 ||

kanyāṃ sālaṃ kṛtāṃ datvā daridrāya mahīpate |
brahmalokaṃ vrajatyaṃte pitaraḥ svargabhāginaḥ || 9 ||

kanyādravyaṃ dvijātīnāṃ paratranarakapadaṃ |
vipraṃ vivāhapitvaikaṃ daridraṃ vedapāragaṃ || 10 ||

avaśyametaddehāṃte narakasthānpitṛnapi |
kachṛtyupuṣpakaṃ divyamāruhya pitṛbhissaha || 111 ||

avaśyaṃ bhagavadvāma prāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
gaṇyaṃ tepāṃśavobhūmergaṇyaṃte divitārakāḥ || 12 ||

nagaṇyate vidhātrāpi brahmasaṃsthāpane phalaṃ |
viprāya vedaviduṣe daridrāya mahīpateḥ || 13 ||

vivāhāyadhanaṃ datvā vaṃśavṛddhimihākṣayāṃ |
āṃcaṃdratārakaṃ prāpya brahmalokevasatyasau || 14 ||

mahīṃsasya samāyuktāṃ vahudakṣiṇayānvitāṃ |
śrotriyātha daridrāya caturvṛṣayutāṃ dadan || 15 ||

bhagavansannidhāvaṃte pitṛbhissahamodate |
pakvasasyayutāṃ pṛthvī catuḥpuṃgavasaṃyutāṃ || 16 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃ(**)(?)dvaye datvā sadakṣiṇāṃ |
pitṛṇāmapi sāhasraṃ nimagnaṃ narakārṇave || 17 ||

uddhṛtya puṣpakaṃ divyamāruhya pitṛbhissaha|
bhagavatsadṛśākāromodate bhagavatpade || 18 || 

<p. 22a>

brāhmaṇebhyo vedavidyāṃ pradatvā sarahasyakaṃ |
brāhmaṇaḥ pūjyatāṃ prāpya brahmaṇā sahamodate || 19 ||

itihāsapurāṇānāsatha rāmāyaṇasya vā |
pradattvā pustakaṃ sarvavidyānāṃ pārago bhavet || 120 ||

etaccharīrapātāṃte satyalokamavāpnuyāt |
śālagrāmaśilādānavamīvamahaṃdaṃtaraṃ || 21 ||

śuddhacakrasamāyuktāṃ vajvakīṭāvinirmitāṃ |
śālagrāma śilāmekāmapi dakṣidāyānvitāṃ || 22 ||

alaṃkṛtya pradatvāṃ bhagavansannidhiṃ vrajet |
brahmāṃḍakoṭidānena yatphalaṃ labhate naraḥ || 23 ||

śālagrāmaśilādānātatphalaṃ samavāpnuyāt |
annaṃ nityaṃ pradātavyaṃ brāhmaṇebhyo viśeṣataḥ || 24 ||

annadviguṇamāmaṃsyādvaiśvadevādikaṃ yataḥ |
payasvinīṃ savatsāṃgāṃkāṃsyarohasamanvitāṃ || 25 || 

suvarṇakhuraśṛṃgāgrāṃmālyasvarṇayutāṃ tu vā |
alaṃkṛtya daridrā yayo dadāti kuṭuṃvine || 26 ||

golokeṃ samavāpnoti divyabhoga samanvitaṃ |
patrakṣīravahānadyo yatra pāpa sakarddamāḥ || 27 ||

bhūruhāḥ parijātādyā yatra tatra vasatyasau |
ācāryāya viśeṣeṇa savatsāṃgāṃ payasvinīṃ || 28 ||

ekadhā vā dvidhātredhā vahudakṣiṇayānvitāṃ |
samarpya bhagavaddhāmni pitṛbhiḥ sahamodate || 29 ||

yasyāḥ kṣīraṃdadhighṛtaṃ pivedācārya ādarāt |
taddātāpitṛsāhasrasahito bhagavatyade || 30 ||

modate divyabhogāḍhyobhagavatsadṛśākṛtiḥ |
gavāṃvikrayakṛdviprāḥ gṛhītānāṃ mahīpate || 31 ||

pitṛbhissahakalyāṃtaṃ narakeṣu nimajjati |
tryalaṃkāreṣu sarveṣu padmarāga samanvitaṃ || 32 ||

saṃtaptahemaruciraṃ kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ śubhaṃ |
divyāṃ laṃkaraṇaṃ proktaṃ tadatvācāryakarṇayoḥ || 33 ||

tulāpuruṣadānādi mahādānaphalaṃ labhet |
bhagavatsadṛśākāro vaikuṃṭheva sati dhruvaṃ || 34 ||

modate śakranagare sūkṣmavastrapadāyakaḥ |
aśvadānākuvereṇa sāmyaṃ prāpnoti tatpade || 35 ||

<p. 22b>

kailāse gajadodivyabhogabhāgbhavati dhruvaṃ |
āṃdolikāṃ pradadyādya ācāryāya viśeṣataḥ || 36 ||

tajjīvanadhanopetāmathakṣetradhutāṃtu vā |
garuḍadhvajamāruhyavimānaṃ divyabhogayuk || 37 ||

bhagavatsannidhāvaṃte bhṛtyānāmagragaṇyatāṃ |
prāpnoti pitṛbhiḥ sākaṃ nārāyaṇasasākṛtiḥ || 38 ||

ācāryā yadiśeṣeṇayo dadyācchidhikāṃ śubhāṃ |
nityasaṃpūjito brahmapade saramate dhruvaṃ || 38 ||

śuddhaṃ suvarṇarasānivāsolaṃkaraṇādikaṃ |
brāhmaṇebhyaḥ samarpyārtha svācāryāya viśeṣataḥ || 40 ||

pitṛbhissahadehāṃte satyalokevasatyasyai |
śākarūpa ghṛtādīniyodadyādguravenvahaṃ || 41 ||

vinnamṛtamāpnoti dehāṃte svargabhakṣayaṃ |
annaṃ niveditaṃ viṣṇorhaviḥ śeṣeṇa saṃyutaṃ || 42 ||

ācāryabhuktaśeṣānnasahitāṃ yāsimāsyapi |
bhuktvā sakṛtaiḥ pāpaistatkṣaṇādevamucyate || 43 ||

anidyaṃ bhakṣyedannaṃ vāgyatonnamakutsayan |
paṃcagrāsaṃmahāmaunaṃ prāṇādyāpyāyanaṃ yataḥ || 44 || 

nekṣatodyaṃtamādityaṃnāstaṃyāṃtaṃ divākaraṃ |
noparaktaṃ navāristhaṃ na nagnāṃ ca parastriyaṃ || 45 ||

kadācidapinotiṣṭhedācāryeṇa sahāmane |
noccāsane ca nivasennaśamyāyāṃ guroḥ svapet || 46 ||

nācāryapādukā yugmamārohedapi ca kvacit |
divāpādukamāruhya na codgrāma madhyamai || 47 ||

parvasvabhigamaḥ strīṣu mahāmara kaṭuḥ khadaḥ divāpāpa |
pradāṃ puṃsāṃ divāpāpapradāṃ puṃsāṃ tadyoniṃ na nirīkṣapet || 48 ||

dināṃta saṃdhyāṃ sūryeṇa pūrvāmṛkṣeḥ samanvitāṃ |
upatiṣṭhedyathānyāyaṃ samyagā campakpārthiva || 49 ||

sārvakālamu(*)(?)dyānaṃ saṃdhyayoḥ pārthiveṣyate |
anyatra sūtakāśau ca vibhramāturabhītitaḥ || 50 ||

sūryeṇābhyuddito yastutyaktaḥ sūryeṇa vāsvapan |
prāyaścitāyate bhūmāvapi viprottayo nṛpa || 51 || 

<p. 23a>

tasmādanudite sūrye samutthāya mahīpate |
upatiṣṭhennaraḥ saṃdhyāya svayaṃścadināṃtyajāṃ || 52 ||

upatiṣṭhaṃti ye saṃdhyāṃ pūrvo na ca paścimāṃ |
vrajamtite durātmānastāmisraṃ narakaṃ dhruvaṃ || 53 ||

itthaṃ gṛhāśramī bhūtvā ekenaivahijanmanā |
avaśyaṃ muktimāpnoti daśapūrvairdaśatparaiḥ || 54 ||

nityanaimitikaireva kurvāṇoduritakṣayaṃ |
jñānaṃ ca vimalīkurvannabhyāsenanuyācayet || 55 ||

abhyāsatyakvavijñānaḥ kaivalyaṃ labhate naraḥ |
anāśramī na tiṣṭhetakṣaṇamekamapi kvacit || 56 ||

brahmacārī gṛhasthopi vānaprasthotha bhikṣukaḥ |
catvāra āśramā ete dvijānāmavanīpate || 57 ||

vānaprasthāśrame buddhirjātācedgṛhamedhinaḥ |
putreṣu bhāryāṃ nikṣipya kalatrasahitopi vā || 58 ||

tatrāpyācārya śuśrūṣāṃ kurvanne varjiteṃdriyaḥ |
hutvā sāyaṃ tathā prātaḥ kṛtvā cāṃdrāyaṇādikaṃ || 59 ||

jīrṇaparṇāśano vāpi phalamūlāśanopi vā |
devatānāmṛṣīṇāṃ ca pitṛṇāṃ tṛptimācaran || 60 ||

vedapārāyaṇaṃ kurvan śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃ japan |
smarannārāyaṇaṃ devaṃ padaṃ viṣṇoravāpnuyāt || 61 ||

jāyate yadi vairāgyaṃ prajedatha paṃḍitaḥ |
viśeṣaṇa sadācārya śuśrūṣāmeva saṃtataṃ || 62 ||

kurvannaikātramaṣṇīyāt praṇavābhyā sa tatparaḥ |
vibhūte sannamusalevyaṃgorebhuktavartite || 63 ||

paṃcāgāraṃ caredbhaikṣyaṃ saptāgāramathāpi vā |
sadānārāyaṇecittaṃ kṛtvācāryasya vaṃdanaṃ || 64 ||

ahorātraṃ sadācārya śuśrūṣā nirato patiḥ |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāmavaśyaṃ prajapan śuciḥ || 65 ||

nityaṃ triṣaḍvaṇastāyī niḥspṛhovijiteṃdriyaḥ |
ekavastra dhanodaṃḍa kamaṃḍalu dhanastathā || 66 ||

kāṃcanarajataṃ lohamapi nekṣeta kutravit |
adhomukhaḥ sadāstrīṣu vedāṃtaśrayaṇerajaḥ || 67 ||

sadopaniṣadāvṛtiṃ kurvan siddhimatvāpnuyāt |
ācārya eva sarveṣāṃ gatirnānyo vidhīyate || 68 ||

<p. 23b>

dhātāvidhātā brahmāpi bhagavān śaṃkaropi ca |
raviḥ somo mahendraśca pitāmātāguruḥsakhā || 69 ||

ācārya eva saṃsāraṃgatistartumihecchatāṃ |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoje dvayameva satāṃgatiḥ || 170 ||

idaṃ muktaṃ mayā vedoditaṃ karma śubhapradaṃ |
ataḥ paraṃ mahīpāla kiṃbhūyaḥ śrotumicchasi || 171 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
saptamodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 23b>

rājovāca 

bhagavandevadeveśanārāyaṇa jagatpate |
vedoditaḥ sadācāraḥ śruttastavamukhāṃvujāt || 1 ||

brahmāparokṣavijñānasiddhyarthaṃ satataṃ nṛbhiḥ |
brāhmaṃ samayamārabhya kiṃ vā kartavyamādarāt || 2 ||

ekena janmaiveha kathaṃ muktirnṛṇāṃ bhavet |
raśmimālā prajapyeti tvayoktaṃ bhagavanmama || 3 ||

bhagavadraśmi sūktaṃ me vadadeva kṛpānidhe |

śrībhagavānuvāca 

śṛṇu rājanpravakṣyāmi yanmāṃ tvaṃ paripṛcchasi || 4 ||

śravaṇādapi yasyā śupātakaudyovinaśyati |
utthāya samaye brāhme sāvadhānamanādvijaḥ || 5 ||

ācāryapādukāvidyāṃ japedādau dine dine |
praṇavaṃ citkalāvījamuccāryādau samāhitaḥ || 6 ||

viṃduhīnaṃ śriyovījaṃ bhagavacchadamapyatha |
rūpācāryapadaṃ paścāchrī pūrvācārya nāma ca || 7 ||

śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmītyaṣṭākṣaramataḥ paraṃ |
ācāryapādukāvidyāguptatarāśubhā || 8 ||

mayeritā mahārājamahāsiddhipradāyinī |
mahāpātakaṃ saṃhartrīvidyānāṃ siddhidāyinī || 9 ||

ācāryapādukā vidyāmunirasmyahamevahi |
chaṃdogāyatramityaktamācāryo bhagavanmayaḥ || 10 ||

devatāsadguruḥ svāmīsarvajñaḥ karuṇāvidhiḥ |
ācāryakaruṇāsiddhai viniyoga udāhṛtaḥ || 11 ||

sahasradalapaṃkajesaka(**)(?)śītaraśmiprabhavaṃ vamarāpakarāṃvujaṃ 
sakaladevatārūpiṇaṃ |
samastamanusuddhidaṃ sakalatejasāmālayaṃbhajeśirasihaṃsakaṃ 
tadabhidhānapūrvaṃ guruṃ || 12 ||

brahmaraṃdhre sahasrāre pūrṇacaṃrā punaprabhaṃ |
karuṇāpūrṇanetrāṃtaṃ prasannamukhapaṃkajaṃ || 13 ||

<p. 24a>

varābhayakaraṃ śuklagaṃdhamālyādibhūṣitaṃ |
śuklavastraparidhānaṃ divyabhūṣaṇabhūṣitaṃ || 14 ||

svaśaktisahitaṃ vīrāsanāsīnaṃ kṛpānidhiṃ |
dātāraṃ sarvavidyānāṃ śaraṇāgatavatsalaṃ || 15 ||

bhaje sarvajñamācārya(*)(?)kṣādbhagavadākṛtiṃ |
dhyātvetthaṃ samaye brāhme japedācāryapādukāṃ || 16 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā nityaṃ japedvādaśadhāpi vā |
japahomārhatā sarvavidyānāmasya jāyate || 17 ||

anenācārya maṃtreṇapādukādvayamādarāt |
paṃcopacārairabhyarcya puṣpairdvādaśadhārcayan || 18 ||

ācāryapādukāyugme yatkiṃciddakṣiṇāmatha |
samarpyācāryapādābje pradatvātha dine dine || 19 ||

māsimāsi pradatvā vā varṣe varṣepi vā nṛpa |
apiśākaghṛtādīni samarpya pratyahaṃ bhuvi || 20 ||

viditānāṃ veditavyaṃ vidhānāmapi saṃtataṃ |
japādāvadhikārīsyādrupadeśaṃ vināpi ca || 21 ||

ācāryapādukāyugmaṃ puṣṭhauḥ svarṇavinirmitaiḥ |
arcayitvā puraścaryāṃ vinā siddho bhavatyasau || 22 ||

ācāryapādukāyugmaṃ saṃprāpte śubhaparvaṇi |
abhyarcyagaṃ puṣpādyairvarṣāśanamitaṃ dhanaṃ || 23 ||

pādukoparinikṣipya samarpyācāryapādayoḥ |
pradatvā tadabhāve tu tasya putrāya vārpayet || 24 ||

samarpya tasya patnyai vā meruṃ niyutayojanaṃ |
datvā yatphalamāpnoti tatodhikaphalaṃ labhet || 25 ||

vidyānāmapi sarvāsāṃ tridaśairapi durlabhāṃ |
mahatīṃ siddhimāpnoti tasmin varṣena saṃśayaḥ || 26 ||

ācāryapādukāvidyāṃ prātaḥ prātarāthāpi vā |
japtvādau mahatīṃ siddhiṃ vidyānāṃ labhate nṛpa || 27 ||

samastavidyā saṃsiddhiṃ kalyāṇāni dine dine |
icchatā mahatīṃ lakṣmīṃ japtavyācāryapādukā || 28 ||

ācāryāpādukāvidyāmajaptvā pratyahaṃ nṛpa |
koṭi sahasraṃ japtvāpi vidyā siddhi na viṃdati || 29 ||

raśmimālākramaṃ vakṣye śṛṇu rājanmahāmate |
yasya smaraṇamātreṇa nityaṃ pāpairvimucyate || 31 ||

<p. 24b>

gāyatryādau mahāvidyā vedamātā phalapradā |
hyāvitryaṣṭākṣarī vidyā sarvādhivyādhibhaṃjanī || 32 ||

dattātreya dvādaśārṇa mahāvidyā dvayaṃ tataḥ |
caturdaśākṣarī vidyādvaipāya nama mahāmuneḥ || 33 ||

sarvavidyāmayī sākṣācchī śrīśadvādaśākṣarī |
brahmavidyā trijagatāṃ smartavyā sarvasiddhidā || 34 ||

paṃcāśadakṣaramayī mātṛkā ca tataḥ paraṃ |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarī vidyā smaraṇī patitaḥ paraṃ || 35 ||

aṣṭākṣarī mahālakṣmī vidyā sakalasiddhidā |
śrīṣaḍarṇa mahāvidyā dvādaśārṇaṃ tataḥ śriyaḥ |
samastasaṃpatsāmrājya mahāsiṃhāsaneśvarī || 36 ||

saptaviṃśākṣarī vidyābhogamokṣapradātataḥ |
tato vasuṃdharā vidyāmokṣātkalpalatābhidhā || 37 ||

aṣṭādaśākṣarī paścāddardhaṃ pāśrīpateratha |
dvādaśārṇā mahāvidyā tato nārāyaṇīśubhā || 38 ||

ādyaṃta praṇavopetā brahmanārāyaṇī tataḥ |
haṃsanārāyaṇī vidyāsmaraṇīyā tataḥ paraṃ || 39 ||

śrīṣadurṇenasahitā vidyānārāyaṇī punaḥ |
aṣṭākṣara mahālakṣmīsahitāpi tataḥ paraṃ || 40 ||

āvahaṃti samāyuktā vidyānārāyaṇīśubhā |
ānuṣṭubhākhyavidyāthahayagrīvaya bhūpate || 41 ||

tato matsyasvarūpasya vidyābhagavataḥ śubhā |
tataḥ kūrma mahāvidyāvarāhasya tataḥ paraṃ || 42 ||

nṛsiṃhānuṣṭubhākhyā ca yāmanasya tato nṛpa |
tato bhārgavarāmasya vidyādāśarathestataḥ || 43 ||

tataḥ śrīkṛṣṇavidyā catuddhavidyā tataḥparaṃ |
vidyāthakalkirūpasya śrīpateḥ paramātmanaḥ || 44 || 

nāmatraya mahāvidyā tataḥ sarvaphalapradā |
sudarśanamahāvidyā samastabhayanāśinī || 45 ||

tato garuḍavidyā ca tato hanumataḥ śubhā |
bhagavadraśmi mālepaṃ proktā sakalasiddhidā || 46 ||

sarvādhivyādhi saṃhaṃrtrī pātakaudyāvibhedīnī |
ādau mayaiva kathita brahmaṇe parameṣṭine || 47 ||

<p. 25a>

rudrāya gauripataye punaḥ śrīrāmarūpiṇā |
vakṣyate sarvadevānāṃ maharṣīṇāṃ ca sannidhau || 48 ||

iyaṃ prajapyate kaiścidāvahaṃti manoḥ paraṃ |
arddhāṃga śrīpatebhirvighāṣoḍaśārṇā taponidhe || 45 ||

vinaiva japyate kaiścidāṃjaneyagarutmatoḥ |
vinā vasuṃdharā vidyāṃ japyate kaiścidapyathaḥ || 46 ||

 sapaivagnathitāmālāraśmināmnīdirāpateḥ |
vidyāmetāṃ vijānī hi saṃpūrṇāṃ raśmimālikāṃ || 47 ||

ekaikāpi mahāvidyā raśmimālāṃtarasthitā |
ekaikasyāśca vidyāyāvarṇituṃ phalamuttamaṃ || 48 ||

na śaktaḥ parameṣṭī ca kimuttaraśmisrajonṛpa |
raśmisrajamimāṃ vidyāṃ samastaphalasiddhidāṃ || 49 ||

jānīptātharvaṇīṃ sākṣādbrahmadarśanasiddhidāṃ |
ācāryakaruṇāpūrṇā yasya viprasya jāyate || 50 ||

tasyaiva mahatīṃ siddhiṃ raśmimālā dadāti hi |
vahusaṃvatsaraṃ vāpi svācāryaṃ karuṇānidhiṃ || 51 ||

prāṇairarthaiśca saṃsevyaprāptavyā raśmimālikā |
raśmimālāpradaḥ svāmīraśmimālāpradaḥ pitā || 52 ||

raśmimālāpradomātāraśmimālāpradoguruḥ |
ayameva sadācāryo vijñeyaḥ śāstravittamaiḥ || 53 ||

āvedepi yajurveda sāmavedepi bhūpate |
ātharvaṇa mahāvedesārabhūtā manūttamāḥ || 54 ||

bhagavadraśmimālāṃtarītāye tena cāpare |
imāmātharvaṇīṃ vidyāmācāryaṃ bahuvārṣikaṃ || 55 ||

api saṃsevyasakalairarthaiḥ prāṇairdhiyāpi ca |
saṃprāpya satataṃ brāhme samayeśaṃsitavrataḥ || 56 ||

ekadhā vā dvidhātredhācaturdhāpaṃcadhāpi vā |
prajñaptvā sarvavidyānāṃ puraścaryā phalaṃ labhet || 57 ||

samastaśreyasāṃrāśimicchan sakalasaṃpadaḥ |
ācāryakaruṇāpūrṇāḥ prajapedraśmimālikāṃ || 58 ||

sarvavidyāmayaḥ savedevatātmāśriyaḥ patiḥ |
sarvavedemayastasmādbhagavadraśmimālikāṃ || 59 ||

japtvā nityaṃ viśuddhātmā sākṣādbrahmamayo bhavet | 
yena prajapyate nityaṃ bhagavadraśmimalikā || 60 || 

<p. 25b>

tenādhītāssamastāsyurvedāssāṃgā dine dine |
samastadevatā asya varadāḥ syurnasaṃśayaḥ || 61 ||

brahmānaṃdābhidhaṃ saukhyaṃ dehāṃtevaśyamicchatā |
raśmimālā prajaptavyā paṃcadhā vā tridhāpi vā || 62 ||

adatvā bhagavadraśmimālāmetāṃ śubhapradāṃ |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīvidyāmapinyāsa samanvitāṃ || 63 ||

datvātmanaśca śiṣyasya paṃcakosau gururbhavet |
ekasyā api vidyāyāssaptadvīpavatī mahī || 64 ||

ācāryadakṣiṇādeyā kimuraśmisrajonṛpa |
tasmādavaśyamācāryaṃ gatvāpi bahuyojanaṃ || 65 ||

sarvajñamāśrayedvīmān toṣayansarvavastubhiḥ |
saṃsarasāgaraṃ tartumicchanne kena janmanā || 66 ||

ācāryavadanāṃbhojādvāpyemāṃ raśmimālikāṃ |
brahmavidyā japāṃte vā tatpūrvamatha vā sadā || 67 ||

prajaptvā samaye brāhme sa rahasyāmataḥ paraṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japatvā brahmānaṃdasukhī bhavet || 68 ||

saṃśayaṃ mā kuruṣvātra rājan janakabhūpate |
idaṃ dāsarathīyākhyaṃ taṃtraṃ vedārthasammitaṃ || 69 ||

sa rahasyaṃ vijānātiya ācāryakṛpānvitaḥ |
saṃprāpya bahudūraṃ vātamevācāryamāśrayet || 70 ||

ācāryaṃ bhagavaddudhyāyercayaṃti dine dine |
ta eva mahatīṃ siddhiṃ vrajaṃtīha paratra ca || 71 ||

kimatra bahunoktena sāramekaṃ vadāmyahaṃ |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoja dvayameva dine dine || 71 ||

prapannāḥ śaraṇaṃ ye vaitarāva bhagavanmayāḥ |
ihāpi mahatīṃ siddhiṃ prāpyaṃte muktimāpnuyāt || 72 ||

iti te raśmimālāyāmāhātmyaṃ kiṃcidīritaṃ |
itaḥ paraṃ mahārāja kiṃ punaḥ śrotusicchasi || 73 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthaṃsaṃgrahe 
aṣṭamodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 25b>

rājovāca 

bhagavanbhāṣitāśeṣa viśeṣakaruṇānidhe |
bhagavadraśmimāleyaṃśutā tavamukhāṃvujāt || 1 ||

<p. 26a>

samastavedaśāstraudyasārabhūtārthasaṃgrahā |
ekaikasyāśca vidyāyā māhātmyaṃ kramaśo vada || 2 ||

śrībhagavānuvāca 

śṛṇu rājanpravakṣyāmi yanmāṃtvaṃ parijpṛcchasi |
tasya śravaṇamātreṇa mahatīṃ siddhimaśnute || 3 ||

brāhmekāle samutthāya saṃsmṛtvācāryapādukāṃ |
śriyaḥpaterbhagavattoraśmimālāttataḥ paraṃ || 4 ||

smartavyā sarvasiddhināṃ hetubhūtāsanātanī |
tatrādau saṃpravakṣyāmi gāyatrīṃ vedamātaraṃ || 5 ||

yasyā vijñānamātreṇa sākṣādbrahmamayo bhavet |
praṇavo bhūrbhuvaḥ paścātsuvarītyakṣaradvayaṃ || 6 ||

tatpadaṃ savituḥ paścādvareṇīyamataḥ paraṃ |
bhargodevasya śabdaṃ ca dhīmahīti tataḥ paraṃ || 7 ||

dhiyoyonaḥ pracodeti yādipatha samuddharet |
vyāhṛtitrayasaṃyuktāgāyatrī triṃśadakṣarā || 8 ||

mātāsamastavedānāṃ brahmatādātmyasiddhidā |
mahāpāpopapāpaugha saṃhatrī siddhidāyinī || 9 ||

ekataḥ sa kalāvedā gāyatrī ca tathaikataḥ |
tulitā brahmaṇā pūrvamadhikābhūdiyaṃ parā || 10 ||

na vedānāṃ purāṇānāṃ smṛtīnāṃ ca prapāṭhanaiḥ |
brāhmaṇyaṃ jāyate rājan sāvitrya dhyayanaṃ vinā || 11 ||

tadbrahmaparamaṃ tatvaṃ savituḥ paramātmanaḥ |
śriyaḥpaterbhagavato devasya jagatāṃ pateḥ || 12 ||

vareṇīyaṃ paraṃ śreṣṭha bhargoviśvaṃ bharatvataḥ |
vayaṃ dhīmahi hṛtpadme sohameveti sattataṃ || 13 ||

yosau śriyaḥpatiḥ sākṣāt savitāddeva īśvaraḥ |
asmākaṃ nodhiyo nityamaṃtarpyātmyānāsthitaḥ || 14 ||

pracodayāt prerayati sarvadharmeṣu saṃtataṃ |
vedamātturayaṃ proktaḥ śrutyukto yo mahāmate || 15 ||

vācyo sau savitā sākṣādbhānumaṃḍlamadhyagaḥ |
nārāyaṇo vedamayo mahāpuruṣa īśvaraḥ || 16 ||

tadvācikevaṃ sāvitrī vedamātāphalapradā |
na gāyatrī samosaṃtronāyodhyā sadṛśī purī || 17 ||

na jānhavī samaṃ tīrthaṃ devaṃ na śrīpateḥ samaṃ |
nācārya caraṇāṃbhojadvayena sadṛśī gatiḥ || 18 || 

<p. 26b>

nātmalābhāt paraṃsaukhyaṃ na vedasadṛśaṃ śrutaṃ |
sāvitrīmanupāsyāddauyonyatra kurute matiṃ || 19 ||

tamaṃtyajaṃ vijānīyāt sarvadharma vahiṣkṛtaṃ |
anupāsyānvahaṃ vedamātaraṃ vahuśo nṛpa || 20 ||

koṭi śopi manūn japtvā na siddhiṃ kiṃcida śrute |
tasmādvaśyaṃ gāyatrīṃ prajaptvā vahuśotvahaṃ || 21 ||

sakṛtsmaraṇato vāpi vidyāsiddhiṃ parāṃ vrajet |
sahasraṇe japedyastu sāvitrīmanvahaṃ śuciḥ || 22 ||

brahmarṣitaṃ vinājohi sākṣādbhagavadākṛtiṃ |
bahuyojana sāhasramapi saṃprāpyataṃ dvijaṃ || 23 ||

ācāryaṃ ghṛṇuyāt śrīmaṣṭārṇajñānasiddhaye |
ekataḥ sakalā vedāyāgāstīrthavratādayaḥ || 24 ||

ekato vedamātetthamadhikānulitā bhavet |
sāhasrakṛtvo gāyatrīmavaśyaṃ pratyahaṃ japet || 25 ||

japet paṃcaśataṃ vāpi catuḥśatamathāpi |
vā triśataṃ dviśataṃ cāpi japedaṣṭottaraṃśataṃ || 26 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhāyatsujapedrogāddipīḍitaḥ |
gāyatryeva paraṃbrahmagāyatryevaparohariḥ || 27 ||

gāyatryeva parobrahmāgāyatryeva paraḥ śivaḥ |
gāyatryevatrayī sākṣācchabdabrahmasvarūpiṇī || 28 ||

prabhāve naiva gāyatryāḥ kṣatriyaḥ kauśiko vratī |
rājarṣitvaṃ parityajya brahmarṣi padamāptavān || 29 ||

viśvāmitromunistasmādgāyatryā ṛṣirucyate |
chaṃdo gāyatrame tasyāḥ savitā parameśvaraḥ || 30 ||

śriyaḥ patirmahāyogīdevonārāyaṇaḥ smṛnaḥ |
mukhamagniḥ śirobrahmāśikhārudroṃvikāpatiḥ || 31 ||

hṛdayaṃ viṣṇurekhāsyā pṛthivīyonirucyate |
viniyogaścaturvargāphalasiddhyarthamīritaḥ || 32 ||

daśapraṇavasaṃyktā saptavyā hṛti pūrvikā |
prāṇāyāme prajaptavyākulaṃbhakena tridhānvahaṃ || 33 ||

japetu tripadā proktāvyādati tritayānvitā |
gāyatrī vācamādyaṃtarahitaṃ sarvakāraṇaṃ || 34 ||

<p. 27a>

sarvatejomayaṃ nityaṃ brahmanārāyaṇābhidhaṃ |
dhyātvā samastavedānāṃmātaraṃ pūjayetparāṃ || 35 ||

avicchinnopāsanāsma trisaṃdhyaṃ pratyahaṃ nṛpa |
puraścaryāsya kathitā bhagavadrūpasiddhidā || 36 ||

aṣṭottarasahasraṃ yaḥ sāvitrīṃ pratyahaṃ japet |
mahāpāpopapāpaudyairapimāsena mucyate || 37 ||

sahasrakṛtvo gāyatrīṃ varṣatritayamādarāt |
prajaptvā bhagavadrūpīsiddhānāmadhiyo bhavet || 38 ||

caturviṃśatilakṣāṇi prajaptvā vedamātaraṃ |
brahmaghnaśca surāyaśca svarṇastepī ca mucyate || 39 ||

gāyatrīṃ koṭiśo japatvā yatphalaṃ labhyate naraiḥ |
sahasraṃ sahaṇe hutvā tilaistatphalamaśnute || 40 ||

hutvā sahasraṃ savituḥ saṃkrāṃtiṣu tilairnṛpa |
bhānumaṃḍala madhyasthaṃ bhagavaṃtaṃ prapaśyati || 41 ||

brahmatādātmyāsidhyarthaṃ pāvanatvāya saṃtataṃ |
mātaraṃ sarvavedānāmanvahaṃ bahuśo japet || 42 ||

mātaraṃ sarvavedānāma japtvā vahuśonvahaṃ |
puraścaraṇā koṭyāpi maṃtrasiddhiṃ na viṃdati || 43 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā nityamapi dvādaśadhā ghṛtaṃ |
hutvādau sarvavidyānāṃ homasya phalamaśnute || 44 ||

yoyaṃ sarvasya jagatastejasā saṃprakāśakaḥ |
sarveṣāṃ mahasāṃ rāśiḥ kalātmākālanāyakaḥ || 45 ||

tadaṃtaryāmyasausākṣātasyāpi prerakonvahaṃ |
bhagavānsavitetktaḥ śrīśonārāyaṇocyutaḥ || 46 ||

ayameva paro viṣṇurayameva paraḥ śivaḥ |
ayameva parorudrastrayīrūpoyamacyutaḥ || 47 ||

vedāśvarathamārūḍhoyosau nārāyaṇau vibhuḥ |
taṃ vijānī hi hṛtpadmamadhyagaṃ sarvadehināṃ || 48 ||

acarānaṃ parātmānaṃ pūrvāhne brahmarūpiṇaṃ |
nārāyaṇaṃ jagannāthaṃ stuvaṃti satataṃ vibhuṃ || 49 ||

madhyāhne saṃstuvaṃtyenaṃ rudrarūpaṃ śriyaḥ patiṃ |
yajūṃṣi trijagadvaṃdyaṃ viśvarūpaṃ parātparaṃ || 50 ||

sāyaṃkālo sāmataṇāḥ sākṣādviṣṇumayaṃ vibhuṃ |
sāmāni saṃstuvaṃtyenaṃ śriyaḥ patimanīśvaraṃ || 51 ||

<p. 27b>

vahiraṃtastamorāśihartāsāviṃdirāpatiḥ |
savitābhagavānsākṣāttriguṇostrijagatpatiḥ || 52 ||

tasmādavaśyaṃ sāvitrīmupāsyāṃ vahuśonvahaṃ |
trayāṇāmapi vedānāṃ phalamadhyayanāllabhet || 53 ||

yaṣṭāsāvaścamedhādiyāgeṣu bhavati dhruvaṃ |
jāyakaḥ sarvavidyānāmapi nityamasau bhavet || 54 ||

brahmalokagato brahmasabhāsvaṃte prapūjyate |
sāvitrāśaṣṭākṣaraṃ vakṣye śṛṇuṣvā vahito nṛpa || 55 ||

yadjñātvā sādhakodhīmānlabhate siddhimakṣayāṃ |
praṇavaṃ ghṛṇirityuktvā sūrya ityakṣaradvayaṃ || 56 ||

ādityomiti vaidyaikṣāsāvitrāṣṭākṣarī śubhā |
sarvādhivyādhisaṃhartrī sarvaroganivarhiṇī || 57 ||

tejovalayaśorvacaḥpradāsaṃpakarīśubhā |
devabhāgosya saṃprokto munirbrahmavidāṃvaraḥ || 58 ||

gāyatraṃ chaṃda ityuktaṃ savitādeva īritaḥ |
bhagavatprītaye prokto viniyogo maharṣibhiḥ || 59 ||

satyabrahmāviṣṇurudra vahni sarvādiśabdataḥ |
tejojvālāmaṇipadaṃ huṃ phaṭ vāhnipriyāmatha || 60 ||

utkāṣaḍaṃgaṃ vinyasya raviṃ dhyāyejjagatpatiṃ |
dhṛtapadmadvayaṃ bhānuṃ tejomaṃḍalamadhyagaṃ || 61 ||

sarvāvyādhiśamanaṃ chāyā śliśtanuṃbhaje |
dhyātvetthaṃ prajapeddāstu sāvitrāṣṭākṣarīṃ śubhāṃ || 62 ||

sarvādhivyādhirahitastejasvī brahmapaśyati |
pratyekaṃ sarvaraśmīnāṃ japahomādikarmasu || 63 ||

pratyekamāṣe chaṃda iścavijñāyaiva japenmanūn |
bhagavadraśmividyānāṃ mālikādhyayanenvahaṃ || 64 ||

chaṃda āryādikaṃ smṛtvā japtavyā pratyahaṃ nṛpa |
bhagavadraśmi vidyānāṃ samudāyasya bhūpate || 65 ||

ahameva muniḥ prokto dvaipāyana sutopi vā |
gāyatryādīnicchaṃdāṃsi viśvāmitrādayodvijāḥ || 66 ||

vedamātrādi vidyānāmṛṣayaḥ kathitānṛpa |
tatrāpi nānāchaṃdāṃsi sarvatejomayo vibhuḥ || 67 ||

<p. 28a>

sarveśvaro virādupī śrīpatirjagatāṃpatiḥ |
harirnārāyaṇaḥsvāmīdevatāsamudīritaḥ || 68 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇaprītyai viniyoga udāhṛtaḥ |
asaṃkhyātamaḥ puṃjapijarīkṛtadiṅmukhaṃ || 69 ||

raśmimālātmakaṃ vaṃdebhagavaṃtaṃ śriyaḥpati |
raśmimālāṃ japitvaivamārṣachaṃdādikaṃ nyaset || 70 ||

pratyekaṃ raśmividyānāṃ japāśaktirbhavedyadā |
pratyekamārṣaṃ chaṃdaśca vinyasyātha ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ || 71 ||

prajapet sakalānmaṃtrān juhuyādapi sādhakaḥ |
sāvitrāṣṭākṣarī vidyāmahāsiddhipradāyinī || 72 ||

rogaśokaharīnityaṃ brahmānaṃdasukhapradā |
aṣṭalakṣaṃ puraścaryāddaśāṃśaṃtaparyayetpayaḥ || 73 ||

daśāṃśaṃ juhuyādājyaṃ siddhimaṃtrobhaviṣyati |
athavāravivāreṇasahiteraviparvaṇi || 74 ||

sparśakālaṃ samārabhyamokṣakālāṃtamādarāt |
tilairgavyājyasahitairhutvāgnau saṃskṛte śubhe || 75 ||

ācāryakarṇayordatvā kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ śubhaṃ |
vahusasyayutāṃ pṛthvīṃ datvā dakṣiṇayānvitāṃ || 76 ||

sāvitrāṣṭākṣarī vidyāsiddhimāpnotyanuttamāṃ |
japtvā dvādaśalakṣāṇi tarpayitvā gavāṃ payaḥ || 77 ||

hutvā dvādaśa sāhasraṃ tilairgavyasṛtaplutaiḥ |
kuṣṭharogāt pramucyate tadurvicitrādanekaśaḥ || 78 ||

japtvā lakṣatrayaṃ maṃtrādiśāṃśaṃtri madhuplutaṃ |
pāyasānnamatho hutvā vātarogādvimucyate || 79 ||

ājyena juhuyānnityaṃ māsamekaṃ sahasrakaṃ |
bhagaṃdarānmeharogādagnimāṃdyācca mucyate || 80 ||

triśataṃ juhuyānnityaṃ paṃkajairgoghṛtaplutaiḥ |
maṃḍalānmahatīṃ lakṣmīmacalāṃ prāpnusānnityaṃ māsamekaṃ 
sahasrayāddhuvaṃ || 81 ||

nīlotpalairhunennityaṃ madhutritayasaṃplutaiḥ |
ajīrṇarogānmucyete netrarogāccadāruṇāt || 82 ||

aśokakusumairhutvā nityamaṣṭottaraṃśataṃ |
śirorogādvimucyetamūlarogāccaduḥsahāt || 83 ||

triśataṃ juhuyānnityaṃ dadhyannaṃ trimadhuplutaṃ |
nānāvidhānnalarogānmaṃḍalena vimucyate || 84 ||

<p. 28b>

abhimaṃtryajalaṃ maṃtrīvityamaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ |
prakṣālyamukharogebhyo vimukto bhavati dhruvaṃ || 85 ||

japtvā ṣoḍaśalakṣāṇi lakṣaṃ hutvā ghṛtaṃ gavāṃ |
asādhyairapi mukto saurogajālaiḥ suduḥsahaiḥ || 86 ||

nirāmayaśca tejasvī dīrghāyurihasādhakaḥ |
saṃprāpyamahatīṃ lakṣmīmaṇimādi guṇānvitām || 87 ||

tadviṣṇoḥ paramaṃdhāma vrajatyaṃ tena saṃśayaḥ |
aṣṭottara sahasraṃyaḥ prātaḥ snātvānvahaṃ japet || 88 ||

śrīsutārogyatejāṃsivarddhate vāsya saṃpadaḥ |
dehāṃte samavāpnoti tadviṣṇoḥ paramaṃ padaṃ || 89 ||

veamātuśca māhātmyasāvitrāṣṭākṣarasya ca |
idamuktamathātreyavyāsayorapi vakṣyate || 90 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
navamodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 28b>

śrībhagavāna uvāca 

dattātreyamanorvakṣyaiṛṣṇadvaipāyanasya ca |
māhātmyaṃ yasyavijñānaranmahatīṃ siddhimaśnute || 1 ||

praṇavaṃ pāśavījaṃ ca māyāmaṃkuśamapyatha |
aiṃdrasvaraṃ vyomavījaṃ tṛtīyasvarasaṃyutaṃ || 2 ||

dattātreyaparaṃ paścādvahnipatnīmathoccaret |
ityekoktāmahāvidyādattātreyasyayoginaḥ || 3 ||

praṇavaṃ hṛdayaṃ paścāttato bhagavate padaṃ |
dattātreyapadaṃ paścāccaturthāṃtasamanvitaṃ || 4 ||

atrinaṃdananidyeyaṃdvitīyāsamudīritā |
pratyekaṃ vājapedvidyāṃmilitaṃ vā dvayaṃ japet || 5 ||

mamaiva mūrtirdatākhyā yogasiddhikarī śubhā |
samastavidyāsāmrājyasiddhidāmuktidāyinī || 6 ||

ye muktipadamicchaṃto yoginaḥ sāṃkhyakāpilāḥ |
dattātreya mahāvidyā japtavyāttairmahīyate || 7 ||

acalaṃ mahadaiśvaryaṃ vāgaiśvaryamathākṣayaṃ |
aṣṭāṃgasahitaṃ yogaṃ brahmajñānaṃ sanātanaṃ || 8 ||

jāti smaraṇamanviccheddattātreya manuṃ japet |
pādukāṃjana khaḍgādi siddhāṣṭakamamīpsatā || 9 ||

dattātreya mahāvidyā prajaptavyāpamahīpate |
corāriduṣṭasaṃdhebhyomahābhayanivāraṇaṃ || 10 ||

<p. 29a>

anaṣṭadravyaṃ saṃrakṣāṃ naṣṭasya punarāgamaṃ |
icchratādattatavidyeyaṃ prajaptavyā mahīpate || 11 ||

ṛṣirannirmahātejādattātreyasya vidyayoḥ |
jāgataṃ chaṃdaṃ ityuktaṃ brahmaviṣṇuśivātmakaḥ || 12 || 

dattātreyoharisvāmībhagavān deva īritaḥ |
śaktirmāyāpāśavījamaṃkuśaṃkīlakaṃ smṛtaṃ || 13 ||

dattātreyādvā vidyāyāḥ praṇavo vījamapyatha |
nattiṃ śaktimiti prāhurbrahmatādātmyasiddhaye || 14 ||

dattātreyasya tuṣṭyarthaṃ viniyoga udāhṛtaḥ |
ṣaḍdīrghayutamāyārṇāṃ kuśārṇābhyāṃ ṣaḍaṃkaṃ || 15 ||

pinyasya hṛdaye sākṣādattātreyaṃ hariṃ smaret |
nīlajīmūtasaṃkāśaṃ jarāmaṃḍalaśomitaṃ || 16 ||

bhūtibhūṣitasarvāgaṃ vīrāsamasamanvitaṃ |
pārijātatarormūledivyasiṃhāsanāśritaṃ || 17 ||

sanakādi mahāyogisevitaṃ bhaktavatsalaṃ |
mudrāṃ jñānamaryāṃ dakṣahaste vāme'bhayaṃ tathā || 18 ||

padmanāga samāyukta hemakuṃḍalaśobhitaṃ |
prasannavadanaṃ śāṃtaṃ susmitāna na paṃkajaṃ || 19 ||

anasūyātrisahitaṃ brahmarṣibhirabhiṣṭutaṃ |
siddhavidyādharagaṇaiḥ sevitaṃ ca maharṣibhiḥ || 20 ||

divyābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ vāmabhāgasthayā śriyā |
sahitaṃ nāradādyaiśca sevitaṃ trijagatpatiṃ || 21 ||

dattātreyamahaṃtiyaṃ bhajāmi parameśvaraṃ |
dattātreya mahāvidyāmiti dhyātvā japat śuciḥ || 22 ||

sarvāsāmapi vidyānā tatvajño bhavati dhruvaṃ |
lakṣatrayaṃ puraścaryādekaikasya manornṛpa || 23 ||

daśāṃśaṃ juhumādagnau pāyāṃ trimadhuplutaṃ |
guravedakṣiṇāṃ datvā sarvasvamapi sādhakaḥ || 28 ||

dattātreya mahāvidyāt siddhimāpnotyanuttamāṃ |
upoṣaṇaparoyadvāvyatīpāte mahīpate || 25 ||

japtvā sahasra tritrayaṃ kāpilājya maho hunet |
daśāṃśaṃ jvalite vahnau gurave kuṃḍaladvayaṃ || 26 ||

datvā tatkarṇayugalekarṣahemavinirmitaṃ |
yajñopavīta triayaṃ datvā vāso yugānvitaṃ || 27 ||

<p. 29b>

dattātreya mahāvidyāsiddhiṃ prāpnoti śāśvatīṃ |
ekāmapi mahāvidyāṃ dattātreyasya yoginaḥ || 28 ||

triśattādhika sāhasraṃ japtvā pratyahamādarāt |
ṣaṇmāsādaṇimāghaṣṭaguṇaiśvaryayuto bhavet || 29 ||

samudratīregoṣṭhe vā lakṣaṃ japtvā payovrataḥ |
pāyasenājyamuktena hutvā vidyānidhirbhavet || 30 ||

brāhmesamaya utthāya dhyātvā trisutamādarāt |
japtvā sahasramekāṃ vā vidyāṃ vidyādvayaṃ tu vā || 31 ||

militaṃ vātha ṣaṇmāsāddattātreyaṃ jagatpatiṃ |
sākṣādevasasva cakṣurbhāṃpaśyatyakhilasiddhidaṃ || 32 ||

caurairyadāhṛtaṃ paśyetpaśvādidhanamātmanaḥ |
trisahasraṃ japedrātrau nityaṃ paścimadiṅmukhaṃ || 33 ||

saptarātreṇa labhate naṣṭadravyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
śasyāsamīpe japtve vidyāmaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ || 34 ||

na corādibhayaṃ śokadācidapi bhūtale |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā mārgaṃ gacchatiyaḥ pumān || 35 ||

na duṣṭacauravyāghrāpyairbhayaṃ syātparipaṃthibhiḥ |
sarvarogādipīḍāsu japanyaṃ ca sahasrakaṃ || 36 ||

asādhyairapi muktaḥsyādrogajālairdina trayāt |
aṣṭāṃgayogamanvicchanphalāśīniyatavrataḥ || 37 ||

sahasratritayaṃ japtvā nityaṃ māsamataṃdritaḥ |
aṣṭāṃgayogamāsādhakhecarojāyate dhruvaṃ || 38 ||

samāsīnośvatthamūlevanegavā payovrataḥ |
sahasratritayaṃ nityaṃ japtvāśaṃśitavrataḥ || 39 ||

dhanadhānyākulāṃ lakṣmīmavalāmaṃḍalāllabhet |
atrisūno māṃ vidyāmekaikāmanvahaṃ śuciḥ || 40 ||

viṣṇalaye vā rudrasya gṛhe vā śaṃsitavrataḥ |
japtvāsaṃ saṃvatsaraṃ maṃtrīsahasraṃ vijiteṃdriyaḥ || 41 ||

saṃvatsarādavāpnoti śriyamaṣṭaguṇānvitāṃ |
aṣṭāṃgasahitaṃ yogaṃ vāksiddhimatulāṃ śubhāṃ || 42 ||

putrapautravatīmṛddhiṃ dīrghamāyuranuttamaṃ |
bhogānaṣṭavidhāṃścāpi labdhāṃte muktimāpnuyāt || 47 ||

ṣaṭkoṇamaṣṭakoṇaṃ ca vasvāraṃ caturasrakaṃ |
atrisūnoridaṃ yaṃtraṃ mahābhāgyasamṛddhidaṃ || 48 ||

<p. 30a>

ṣaṭkoṇamadhye saṃpūjya dattātreyaṃ śriyānvitaṃ |
ṣaṭkoṇeṣu ṣaḍaṃgāni pitaraṃ cānasūyayā || 45 ||

sanatkumāraṃ sanakaṃsanaṃdamataḥ paraṃ |
sanatsujānaṃ prahlādaṃ kārtavīryamataḥ paraṃ || 46 ||

aṣṭakoṇe samabhyarcya śakrādīnaṣṭapatrake |
itthamatrisuttaṃ sākṣādbhagavaṃtaṃ śriyānvitaṃ || 47 ||

abhyarcyagaṃdhapuṣpādyairnityaṃ kalyāṇamaśnute |
ataḥparaṃ pravakṣyāmi dvaipāyanamanornṛpa || 48 ||

sādhanaṃ sarvabhaktānāṃ samastekṣittasiddhidaṃ |
praṇavaṃ namasāyuktaṃ vadan bhagavate tataḥ || 49 ||

halādhaṃ dakṣanāsādvyādvitīyoṣmāṇamapyatha |
ekatriṃśārṇasahitaṃ dvaipāyanapadaṃ tataḥ || 50 ||

caturthyaṃta samāyuktaṃ vidyaiṣā samudīritā |
parāśarasutasyeyaṃ vidyāmanvakṣarīśubhā || 51 ||

vedavedāṃta tatvārthasārabhūtāyaśaskarī |
mamaiva mūrtiraparākṛṣṇadvaipāyanābhidhā || 52 ||

satyavatyāṃ samudbhūtāśaktiputrātparāśarāt |
vibhāgakartrīvedānāṃ jagatāṃ hitakāriṇī || 53 ||

ācāryaḥ sarvajagatāṃ parāśara suto vibhuḥ |
dvaipāyanābhidhaḥ sākṣādbhagavān hariracyutaḥ || 54 ||

śiṣyebhyaḥ sarvavidyānāmupadeṣṭāvabhūvaha |
brāhmesamaya utthāya saṃsmṛtyācāryapādukāṃ || 55 ||

dvaipāyana mahāvidyāṃ triśataṃ tameva vā |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā vāpi prajaptvādau samāhitaḥ || 56 ||

brahmavidyāṃ japetyakṣādraśmimālāpurassarāṃ |
ācāryaṃ bhāvayennityaṃ vedavyāsa svarūpiṇaṃ || 57 ||

dvaipāyanasyācāryasya bhedaleśopināstihi |
ācārya paramātmānaṃ sākṣādvaipāyanākṛtiṃ || 58 ||

dhyātvā nityaṃ samabhyarcya brahmānaṃda sukhaṃ labhet |
vādarāyaṇirasyokto munirbrahmavidāṃvaraḥ || 59 ||

jāgataṃ chaṃda ityuktaṃ sākṣānnārāyaṇātmakaḥ |
vedavyāso mahāyogī deva ukto mahīpate || 60 || 

<p. 30b>

vedavyāsa prāsādārthaṃ viniyoga udāhṛtaḥ |
ekenākṣara yugmena caturbhiratha saptabhiḥ || 61 ||

punastribhiśca rudrārṇaiḥ ṣaḍaṃganyāsa īritaḥ |
divyasiṃhāsanāsīnaṃ kālanīlāṃvudaprabhaṃ || 62 ||

vyāghracarmāṃvaradharaṃ jaṭāmaṃḍaladhāriṇāṃ |
vibhrāṇaṃ cinmayīmudrāṃvīrāsana samāśritaṃ || 62 ||

bhūtibhūṣita sarvāṃgaṃ prasannamukhapaṃkajaṃ |
kuṃḍaladvayaṃ saṃśobhimukhāṃbhojaṃ jagadguruṃ || 64 ||

mūrtimadbhiścaturvedaiḥ śukādyairyogināṃvaraiḥ |
sevitaṃ siddhasaṃdhaiśca brahmavidbhiḥ samāvṛtaṃ || 65 ||

vaktāraṃ sarvavidyānāṃ karuṇāpūrṇalocanaṃ |
dvaipāyanamuniṃ sākṣādbhagavaṃtamahaṃbhaje || 66 ||

itthaṃ nārāyaṇātmānaṃ dhyātvā dvaipāyanaṃ guruṃ |
arcayet ṣaḍareyaṃtre paṃcakoṇasamanvite || 67 ||

aṣṭapatra samāyukte caturasra vibhūṣite |
ṣaṭkoṇa madhye saṃpūjya vedavyāsaṃ jagadguruṃ || 68 ||

parāśaraṃ śukaṃ pailaṃ pāpanamapyatha |
jaiminiṃ ca sumaṃtuṃ ca ṣaṭkoṇeṣu prapūjayet || 69 ||

ṛgvedaṃ ca yajurvedaṃ sāmaveda mataḥparaṃ |
atharvaṇaṃ tato vedamitihāsamatatparaṃ || 70 ||

paṃcakoṇe samabhyarcya vasupatretha paṃkaje |
romaharṣaṇanāmānaṃ yājñavalkyaṃ mahāmuniṃ || 71 ||

karāvaṃ kātyāyanamunimudakodālakau tathā |
vaudhāyanāyastaṃvau ca caturasredigīśvarān || 72 ||

itthamabhyarcyayedhastu nityaṃ dvaipāyanaṃ guruṃ |
ākaraḥ sarvavidyānāmāśrayaḥ sarvasaṃpadāṃ || 73 ||

brahmavidbhavati kṣipraṃ jīvanmukto bhavatyasau |
lakṣatrayaṃ japecchuddho vedavyāsa mahāmanuṃ || 74 ||

daśāṃśaṃ juhuyāt kṛṣṇatilairgavyaghṛtaplutaiḥ |
ācāryapādayordatvā niṣkadvādaśakaṃ nṛpa || 75 ||

vedavyāsa mahāvidhā siddhimāpnotyanuttamāṃ |
athavaikādaśī śuddhākārtike māghamāsi vā || 76 ||

virāhāro japennityamamuttaṃ saṃśitavrataḥ |
sahasraṃ juhuyādagnau dvādaśyāṃ kāpilaṃ ghṛtaṃ || 77 ||

<p. 31a>

ācāryakarṇayordatvā kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ śubhaṃ |
samastaparvasahitaṃ bhāratākhyānapustakaṃ || 78 ||

sabhāṣyaṃ dharmaśāstraṃ vā purāṇamathavā nṛpa |
triniṣkadakṣiṇāmuktamācāryāya samarpya ca || 79 ||

brāhmaṇān bhojayitvātha siddhimāpnotyanuttamāṃ |
aśvatthamūlamāśrinityaṃ niyamataḥ śuciḥ || 80 ||

triśatādhika sāhasraṃ vedavyāsa manuṃ japet |
tribhirmāsairnasaṃdehovidyānāṃ pārago bhavet || 81 ||

śuklāṃvaradharonityamāsīno vyāghracarmaṇi |
vedavyāsa mahāvidyāṃ japtvā lakṣaṃ yata vrataḥ || 82 ||

japtvā lākṣamimaṃtraṃ gurumārādhya yatnataḥ || 84 ||

dhanairdhanyaiśca vāsobhiḥ sarvavidyānidhirbhavet |
śriyaṃ cāpnoti vipulāṃ brahmavidbhavati dhruvaṃ || 85 ||

jaḍabuddheriyaṃ vidyābuddhijāḍyanivāriṇī |
mūkasyāpyaparairjaptā mahāvāksiddhidāyinī || 86 ||

ācāryasannidhau nityaṃ vedavyāsamahāmanuṃ |
japtvā sahasraṃ śuddhātmā varṣamekaṃ jiteṃdriyaḥ || 87 ||

āyurārogyamaiśvaryaṃ vācāṃsiddhimanuttamāṃ |
saṃprāpya paramaṃbrahmasākṣādevaprapaśyati || 88 ||

dattātreyadhiyānityaṃ vedavyāsadhiyāpi vā |
ācāryamarcayeddhīmān vastubhiḥ sakalairapi || 89 ||

aṃvarīṣādayobhūyāḥ kacādyāśca maharṣayaḥ |
vṛṣaparvādayo daityā udaṃkādyādvijottamāḥ || 90 ||

gālavādyāśca viprāgprāḥ pratyahaṃśaṃ sitavratāḥ |
śarīraṃ naśvaraṃ matvā saṃsāraṃ duḥkhasaṃkulaṃ || 92 ||

dhanadhānyādyalaṃkāraiḥ sarvavastubhirādarāt |
ācāryacaraṇāveva samabhyarcyānvahaṃ nṛpa || 92 ||

nirahaṃkāriṇaḥ śāṃtāḥ saṃsevyācārya manvahaṃ |
ekena janmanaivaitesiddhiṃ saṃprāpya durlabhāṃ || 93 ||

bhagavatkalayāyuktā jīvanmuktāstato bhavan |
tasmādbhaumaṃ samāsādya śarīraṃ duḥkhasaṃkulaṃ || 94 ||

<p. 31b>

janmamṛtyujarākrāṃtamācāryaṃ yo na pūjayet |
ācāryānugrahaḥ pūrṇoyasya nāsti mahītale || 95 ||

(***) saṃsāragaremagnau bhūyopi jāyate |
saṃsārasāgaraṃ tartuṃya icchatyeka janmanā || 96 ||

nityamācārya śuśrūṣāṃ kṛtvaivāddauyatavrataḥ |
ācāryapādukāvidyā pūrvikāṃ raśmimālikāṃ || 97 ||

brahmavidyāṃ prajatvāpya śrīśadvāddaśākṣarīṃ |
samastanyāsasahitāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japet || 98 ||

brahmānaṃdasukhaṃ prāpyabhagavatkalayānvitaḥ |
bhagavansadṛśākāro bhagavat kiṃkaro bhavet || 99 ||

dattātreyasya vidyeya dvaipāyana munerapi |
uktātubhyaṃ mahārāja kiṃ punaḥ śrotumicchasi || 100 ||

iti dāśarathīyākhyetaṃtrevedārthasaṃgrahe |
daśamodhyāya uktoyaṃ brahmajñānibhirāvṛtaḥ || 101 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
daśamodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 31b>

rājovāca 

bhagavandevadeveśanārāyaṇa jagatpate |
śrutā tava mukhāṃbhojādbhagavadraśmimālikā || 1 ||

māhātmyamapi sāvitryāsāvitrāṣṭākṣarasya ca |
dattātreyasya māhātmyaṃ śrutaṃ dvaipāyanasya ca || 2 ||

māhātmyaṃ brahmavidyāyāḥ śrotumicchābhimāṃprataṃ |

ṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca 

iti dāśarathiḥ pṛṣṭo bhagavānjānakīpatiḥ || 3 ||

rudrāyakathayāmāsapurānārāyaṇeritaṃ |

śrībhagavānuvāca 

śṛṇu rājanpravakṣyāmi śrīpateḥ paramātmanaḥ || 4 ||

māhātmyaṃ brahmavidyāyāḥ yacchrutvā muktibhāgbhavet |
vedeṣu sarvavedāṃteṣvapi sārārthasaṃgrahe || 5 ||

śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣaryāmāhātmyabhayanāśanaṃ |
yadakṣaraṃ paraṃbrahma manovācāmagocaraṃ || 6 ||

ādimadhyāṃtarahitaṃ svecchayā puruṣo bhavet |
tacchaktiścitkalānāmaśrīḥ sarvajagadaṃvikā || 7 ||

<p. 32a>

sa mahāpuruṣonāmnā nārāyaṇa itīritaḥ |
cidrūpiṇyātayāśaktyāsahitaḥ paramaḥ pumān || 8 ||

sohaṃ svanābhikamalesṛṣṭvādhātāramīśvaraṃ |
ajaṃ svayaṃbhuvaṃ nāmnā viśvasṛṣṭividhāyakaṃ || 9 ||

aśaktaṃ jagataḥ sarge dṛṣṭvāhaṃtaṃ prajāpatiṃ |
parabrahmamayaḥ sākṣādahaṃ nārāyaṇo vibhuḥ || 10 ||

brahmatādātmyasidhyarthaṃ śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣarīṃ |
dakṣavānasmimadvidyāṃyayāmatphalayānvitaḥ || 11 ||

brahmatvamagamaddhātādvādaśārṇopadeśataḥ |
yasminkāle mahāvidyāṃ śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣarīṃ || 12 ||

dattavānasmisamahākālo brāhma iti smṛtaḥ |
vidyāyā brahmarūpatvādbrahmavidyetitāṃ jaguḥ || 13 ||

brāhmekāle pradānena brahmavidyeti śabditā |
yasmātadbrāhmasamayedateyaṃ brahmaṇe mayā || 14 ||

brāhmakāle prajaptavyā tasmādiṣṭa phalapradā |
brahmatādātmya hetutvādbrahmavidyeyamīritā || 15 ||

brahmatvasiddhihetutvādvidhāturapi bhūpate |
brahmavidyāmimāṃ prāhuḥ śrīśrīśabdādaśākṣarīṃ || 16 ||

asyāgrahaṇamātreṇa svayaṃbhūścaturānanaḥ |
parabrahmamayobhūtvā sasarjanikhilaṃ jagat || 17 ||

brahmavidyājapānnityaṃ bhagavacchaktirakṣayā |
śarīre saṃpraviṣṭābhūdbrahmaṇaḥ parameṣṭinaḥ || 18 ||

mattejasāvṛtto brahmātrijagatsvapi pūjyatāṃ |
kartṛtvaṃ sarvajagatāṃmaṇimādi guṇānapi || 19 ||

prāptavānmahatīṃsiddhiṃ brahmatādātmyarūpiṇīṃ |
śrīśrīśadvādaśārṇeyaṃ brahmavidyā tataḥ smṛtā || 20 ||

avaśyaṃ samaye brāhme japtvā sarvaśubhapradā |
brāhmesamaya utthāya saṃsmṛtyācāryapādukāṃ || 21 ||

brahmavidyāṃ japannityaṃ śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣarīṃ |
labhate nityakalyāṇamakṣayāḥ saṃpadopi ca || 22 ||

anenaiva pramāṇena śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣarī 
rājñī sakalavidyānāmadhikābhūcchutiṣvapi || 23 || 

<p. 32b>

yadvidyā japahomādyaiḥ kalyāṇāni dine dine |
siddhyaṃti saiva sarvāsāṃ vidyānāmadhikā smṛtā || 24 ||

yadvakāllabhate vidyāṃ yasminsudivase nṛpa |
ārabhya tadinaṃ nityaṃ yataḥ śreyaḥ paraṃparā || 25 ||

sarvāriṣṭanivṛtiśca sa eva bhagavanmayaḥ |
vijñeyaḥ paramācāryastameva satataṃ vibhuṃ || 26 ||

arcayeddhanadhānyādyaiḥ pādasaṃvāhanādibhiḥ |
nācarenmanasādrohamapi tasya guroḥ kvacit || 27 ||

na niṃdāmapi kurvīta manasā kutracit kvācit |
na tasya niṃdāśravaṇaṃ yatra kutrāpi vā caret || 28 ||

brahmavidyāpradācāryacittakṣobhobhavedyadi |
putramitrakalatrādisaṃpabhyaḥ pracyavaṃtite || 29 ||

brahmavidyāpradācāryā niṃdāṃśutvāpi vā sakṛt |
grāmasūkaratāṃprāpya caṃḍāleṣvapi jāyate || 30 ||

puṇyeṣu deśakāleṣu brahmavidyāpradaṃ guruṃ |
tyaktvānyasmaidhanaṃdhānyamalaṃkārādikaṃ śubhaṃ || 31 ||

api brahmavide datvā bhagavadvimukho bhavet |
śrutyuktaṃ vihitaṃ karmatyaktvānyatraratodvijaḥ || 32 ||

ācaṃdrārkaṃmahāghoranarakeṣunimarjani |
ācāryapatnīputrādipoṣaṇaṃ nityamādarāt || 33 ||

vedairapi ca vedāṃtairbrahmavidbhiśca coditaṃ |
tasmādavaśyamācāryacaraṇāṃvuruhadvayaṃ || 34 ||

pūjayitvaiva ratnaudhairdhanairyāsobhirādarāt |
api brahmavidenyasmaidadātu na dadātu vā || 35 ||

ācāryapūjanaṃ sākṣādbhagavatyūjanaṃ viduḥ |
satpatnīpūjanaṃ sākṣānmahālakṣmyārcanaṃ viduḥ || 36 ||

ācāryāsaṃnidhau tasya putramācāryavadyajet |
ācāryapatnīputrāṇāmasāṃnidhye śriyaḥpateḥ || 37 ||

saṃnidhau sakalaṃ vastudeśekāle samarpayet |
tatsarvamarpitaṃ vastu gatvāpi bahuyojanaṃ || 38 ||

ācāryāyāryayettasya patnyaiputrāya vārpayet |
pautrāya vātha tadbhātre gurudravyaṃ samarpayet || 39 ||

niṣiddhācārakaraṇādaniṣiddhasya varjanāt |
aṃdhaṃ tamaḥ pravitrāti yāvadābhūta saṃplavaṃ || 40 ||

tasmādavaśyamācāryapatnīputrādipoṣaṇaṃ |
kartavyamanvahaṃ nityaprayatnenāpi sādhakaiḥ || 41 ||

puṇyeṣu deśakāleṣu japahomādikarmasu |
pitṛsaṃpoṣaṇaṃ paścāt patnīputrādipoṣaṇaṃ || 42 ||

ācāryamāṃvijānīyātatpatnīmapi ca śriyaṃ || 45 ||

<p. 33a>

tatputraṃ ca vidhātāraṃ tatpautramapiśakaraṃ |
tadvaṃśasaṃbhavānviddhisanakārīnmahāmate || 46 ||

svargabhogokṣayastasyapiturmātupoṣaṇāt |
patnyādipoṣaṇenehasaukhyamakṣapyamaśnutte || 47 ||

ācāryapatnīputrādipoṣaṇādanvahaṃ nṛpa |
etatkālevarāṃtesya matsvarūpaṃ dadāmyahaṃ || 48 ||

tyajet svamātāpitarautyajedanyān gurunapi |
tyajet svapatnīputrādīn tyajedbhrātṛṃścavāṃdhavān || 49 ||

raśmimālāpradācāryaṃ pralayepi na saṃtyajet |
mātaraṃ pitaraṃ vāpi bhrātaraṃ vāṃdhavaṃtu vā || 50 ||

putraṃ kaletramatha vā vadevidyāguruṃ tu vā |
ācāryaniṃdākartāraṃ hanyādyadvā parityajet || 51 ||

niṃdaṃ tu vāṃdhavāḥ sarvetyajaṃtustrīsutādayaḥ |
janāhasaṃtumāṃ dṛṣṭvā rājānodaṃḍayaṃ tu vā || 52 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojadvayemevagatirmama |
eva māpadgatasyāpimatiryasya bhave dṛḍhā || 53 ||

sa saṃtaratisaṃhāraṃ bhuktiṃmuktiṃ ca viṃdaṃti |
janāḥ stuvaṃtu kutsaṃtu lakṣmīstiṣṭhatu gacchatu || 54 ||

mṛtiradyayugāṃtevāsvācāryaṃ na parityajet |
brahmavidyāpradaḥ svāmībrahmavidyāpradaḥ pitā || 55 ||

brahmāvidyāpradomātā brahmavidyāpradoguruḥ |
brahmavidyāpradaḥsākṣādācāryonānya ucyate || 56 ||

daśasaṃvatsaraṃ vāpi śatasaṃvatsaraṃ tu vā |
saṃsevya bhagavadrūpamācāryaṃ karuṇānidhiṃ || 57 ||

brahmavidyāmadhīpītaśrīśrīśadvādaśākṣarīṃ |
praṇavaṃ pramoṣmāṇaṃ vāmanetravibhūṣitaṃ || 58 ||

jātaveda samārūḍhaṃ viṃduyuktaṃ samuddharet |
tadeva viṃdurahitaṃ tṛtīyāṃtasthyamapyatha || 59 ||

kṣetrekṣaśaṃ sa caturthaṃ ca sparśāṃ matyārūḍhamapyatha |
sa dīrghaṃ vāmapādānagravījaṃ vahnimataḥ paraṃ || 60 ||

mukhavṛta samāyuktaṃ vāyuvījamataḥparaṃ |
ekatriṃśākṣaraṃ paścāddīrghasvaradibhūṣitaṃ || 61 ||

catvāriṃśākṣaraṃ vāyudīrgha viṃduvibhūṣitaṃ |
hṛdayena samāyuktaṃ śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣarī || 62 ||

ukteyaṃ brahmavidyākhyā vedatatvārthasaṃgrahā |
sarvayogamayī sarvayāga tīrthasvarūpiṇī || 63 ||

sarvavidyāmayī srvavāṃchitārthaphalapradā |
sarvapātavāsaṃhartrī sarvavyādhinināśinī || 64 ||

hartrī samastavipadāṃkartrī sakalasaṃpadāṃ |
āyurārogyaputrārtharājyalakṣmīsamṛddhidā || 65 ||

<p. 33b>

brahmatādātmyasaṃsiddhihetubhūtāsanātanī |
mayāpi varṇitu naiva śakyeyaṃ dvādaśākṣarī || 66 ||

ya icchennitya kalyāṇamakṣayāḥ sarvasaṃpadaḥ |
ekena janmanaivāṃtebhagavatpadamakṣayaṃ || 67 ||

avaśyaṃ tena japtavyā śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣarī || 69 ||

pārijātādayovṛkṣābrāhmavidyāprajāpinaḥ |
maṃdirenivasaṃtyevayāvadācandratārakaṃ || 70 ||

devatvamamaratvaṃ vā brahmarṣitvamathākṣayaṃ |
brahmavidyānusaṃdhānamahimnātraiva labhyate || 71 ||

bahujanmasahasreṣu yāgāḥ saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇāḥ |
kṛttādyathatenaivalābhyate dvādaśākṣarī || 72 ||

brahmavidyānusaṃdhānaṃ raśmimālānuciṃtanaṃ |
nālye na tapasālabhyamihalokemahīpate || 73 ||

brahmavidyāmimāṃ nityaṃ śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣarīṃ |
ācāryānugrahādbrāhmekāle japtvānvahaṃ nṛpa || 74 ||

sahasraṃ vā paṃcaśataṃ catuḥśatamathāpi vā |
triśataṃ vā śucirdhīmān smṛtvācāryasya pādukaṃ || 75 ||

 raśmimālāmanusmṛtyapaṃcadhā vā tridhāpi vā |
anenajanmanaiyāsomatkalāsahito bhavet || 76 ||

nāsādhyaṃvidhatte bhūmau tridaśairapi durlabhaṃ |
adyāpi brahmarudrādyāḥ sanakādyāścayoginaḥ || 77 ||

brahmavidyā japādeva saṃprāptāḥ siddhimakṣayāṃ |
āyurārogmamaiśvaryaṃ paśavaścavasūni ca || 78 ||

bhogā aṣṭavihāścāpi prajapturnāsya durlabhā |
ācāryāpādukāyugmapūjakasya dine dine || 79 ||

brahmavidyānusaṃdhānakarturbrāhmemuhūrtake |
brahmavidyānusaṃdhānāṃnaṃtaraṃ raśmijāpinaḥ || 80 ||

dāsīvatsatataṃ tasyu gṛhelakṣmīvaraṃcalā |
dhanadhanyākalāvājimuktāratnaughasaṃkulā || 81 ||

kiṃ ca vāgīśvarī sākṣātkiṃkarīvatadānane |
āvirbhavati vidyābhiḥ saṃkulāsatataṃ nṛpa || 82 ||

sāṃṅgeṣu sarvadeveṣu saptakoṭimanuṣyapi |
na dṛśyate mahāvidyādvidaivatyāśi mahāmate || 83 ||

sarveṣvapi ca vedeṣu vidyāsu nikhilāsvapi |
cūḍāmaṇyātmikaikaiva brahmavidyāparānahi || 84 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇau vāṇīdhātārau girijāśivau |
śacīndraurohiṇīcaṃdrau svāhā vahnī prabhāravī || 85 ||

agniṣomau viṃdunādau tathā prakṛtipūruṣau |
strīṣuṃ rūpāṇi sarvāṇi śrīśrīpatyaṃśaṃjānihi || 86 || 

<p. 34a>

śrīśrīśadvādaśārṇeyaṃ tasmāt sarvamayī bhavet |
sarvavidyāmayīṃ tasmāchrī śrīśadvādaśākṣarīṃ || 87 ||

japan virārāmayaḥ sākṣādasaunārāyaṇo bhavet |
carācarasametāni bhuvanāni caturdaśa || 88 ||

brahmavidyānusaṃdhātṛdehetiṣṭhaṃti sataṃtaṃ |
asau viśvaṃbharaḥ sākṣādbrahmavidhāprajāpakaḥ || 89 ||

asāvevaharirbrahmāśaṃkarausau mahīpate |
ācāryapādukāyugmamabhyarcyānvahamādarāt || 90 ||

brahmavidyānusaṃdhānaṃ ye kurvanti dine dine |
gṛhe svargasukhaṃ teṣāmakṣayaṃsyāddinedine || 91 ||

garvitāḥ praṇamaṃtyeṣāṃ bhuyāḥ kiṃ karatāṃgatāḥ |
śatravomitratāṃ yāṃtimāyaṃ ca sukṛttāyate || 92 ||

bhogoyogāyateteṣāṃ vaidyaḥ syāddharmarāḍapi |
dhaneśaḥ śakramukhyāśca surāḥkaikaryamanvahaṃ || 93 ||

kurvantyapi maheśādyāḥ suhṛtvaṃ prāpnuvaṃti hi |
yoginaḥ sanakādyāśca vaśiṣṭhādyāmaharṣayaḥ || 94 ||

api saṃpūjayaṃtyenaṃ brahmavidyā prajāpitaṃ |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojadvayārcanaratonvahaṃ || 95 ||

brahmavidyānusaṃdhātāyatratiṣṭhati bhūpate |
siddhakṣetraṃ tadevoktaṃ samaṃtādyojanāyutaṃ || 96 ||

tatraiva sarvatīrthāni nivasaṃti pade pade |
asādhyamapi devānāmapi dīpāṃtarasthitaṃ || 97 ||

satataṃ tasya sādhyaṃ syādbrahmavidyā prajāpinaḥ |
brahmavidyānusaṃdhānādapyasyānvayasaṃbhavāḥ || 98 ||

brahmatādātmyasaṃsiddhiṃ sarvegacchaṃti bhūyate |
brahmavidyānusaṃdhānaṃ kriyate yena nityaśaḥ || 99 ||

tena vedā adhītāḥ syuścatvāraḥ sa rahasyakāḥ |
tadgahadvāritiṣṭhaṃti siddhayoṣṭāṇimādayaḥ || 100 ||

caṃḍikādyāmātṛkāṇārakṣaṃtyenaṃ svaputravat |
tasmādiyaṃ mahāvidyā śrīśrīdvādaśākṣarī || 101 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojadvayārādhanapūrvikā |
upāsitavyā yatnena pratyahaṃ niyatavrataiḥ || 102 ||

anuttara brahmatatvarahasye muktisādhane |
iti dāśarathīyesmin taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe || 103 ||

ukta ekādayodhyāyo brahmavidyārthasādhanaḥ |

iti śrīmanuttarabrahmatatvarahasyedāsarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
ekādaśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 34b>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

sādhanaṃ brahmavidyāyāḥ śṛṇu rāja pravakṣyate |
yasya vijñānamātreṇa brahmavidyāśu siddhyati || 1 ||

vedavedāṃtaśāstredyasāraṃnā sanātanī |
brahmavidyādvidaivatyośrīśadvādaśākṣarī || 2 ||

anayāmadaśāvidyā na ca daṣṭāna ca śrutā |
sādhanaṃ brahmavidyāyāḥ śṛṇu vakṣyāpi nṛpate || 3 ||

ācāryapādukāvidyāṃ brāhmesamaya utthitaḥ |
śirasyaṃ jalimādhāya daśadaṣṭvādvādaśadhāpirā || 4 || 

prajaptvācāryapādābjārūḍhaśrīpādukādvayaṃ |
ānanyadarśanau dṛṣṭvā saṃpūjyāpi svaśaktitaḥ || 5 ||

yatkiṃciddakṣiṇāṃ nityaṃ samarpya niyatavrataḥ |
brahmavidyāṃjapaṃtyaśvābhaśrīśrīśadvādaśakṣarīṃ || 6 ||

athavā prātarutthāya prajaptvācārya pādukāṃ |
ācāryapādukāvidyābhāvepi svasya mūrddhani || 7 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃjadvāyaṃ dhyātvā prasannadhīḥ |
mānasaiḥ svarṇapuṣpādyaiḥ samabhyarcyopacārakaiḥ || 8 ||

brahmavidyāṃ japennityaṃ śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣarīṃ |
ṛṣirasyamahāyogīmādhyonārāyaṇo vibhuḥ || 90 ||

 ṛṣirbrahmāthavoddiṣṭāḥthaṃdojāgatamucyate |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇo sarvajagataḥ pitarau vibhū || 10 ||

dvidevatātvādvidhāyā devatetyute nṛpaḥ |
svāpinau sarvagaṃ jagatāṃ puvānāvatimuṃdarau || 11 ||

citkalāparamātmānau devatā procyate nṛpaḥ |
trayī vījaṃ ca vidvājaṃ vījamatranṛponama || 12 ||

śaktirnatiḥ samuddiṣṭā lakṣmīlakṣmīśaporatha |
prītyarthaṃ viniyogotra samudāhṛta iṣṭadaḥ || 13 ||

ṣaḍdīrghapraṇadādyena cidvījena ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ |
cinyasya panamānmānaṃ dhyāyeccitkalayānvitaṃ || 14 ||

ayodhyānagarenaṃtakoṭiyojanavistṛte |
kalpavāṭī samāyuktesaṃtānārāmaśobhite || 15 ||

harivaṃdanavṛkṣaudhārāmasāhasraśobhite |
maṃrāravāṭī mahite pārijātavanāhṛte || 16 ||

puṣparāmamahāratnaprākāreṇa virājite |
padmagagākhyamāṇikyaprākāreṇātha śobhite || 17 ||

<p. 35a>

gomedharatnaprākāravajraprākāraśobhite |
vaiḍūryaratnaprākāraśobhitenaramevite || 18 ||

idanīlamahāratnaprākāreṇa ca śobhite |
muktāphalamahāratnaprākāreṇāthaveṣṭite || 19 ||

tathā marakatābhikhyamaṇimākārasaṃvṛte |
hrasva vidgumaralodyapākāreṇa ca veṣṭite || 20 ||

navaratnamaye tatra maṃḍaye sumanohare |
tasminmaṇimayatnaṃbha sāhasrāyutaśāṃbhive || 21 ||

vālasūryasahasrābhavitānedivyavarcami |
tatra cādhāraśaktyādi dhṛtehīrahiraṇyayaṃ || 22 ||

nānaralamayerivye nānāmaṃtramadyeśubhe |
tasminnaṣṭadaleyagne maṃtrākṣarapayeśubhe || 23 ||

karṇikāyāṃ suramyāyāṃ lakṣmīvīnenmubhākṣare |
tasminvālārkasāhasrakoṭinulyamabhānvite || 24 ||

devonārāyaṇaḥ śrīmānāsīnaḥ paṃkatāsane |
īśvaryā sahaviśve śā vāsudevaḥ manānanaḥ || 25 ||

narabhaketakījātīkavarīkṛtaveṣavān |
srigdhaviṃvaphalābhoṣṭaḥ musmitānana paṃkajaḥ || 26 ||

anarghyamauktikābhāsadaṃtā valivigajitaḥ |
haricaṃdana liptāṃgaḥ kastūrītilakāṃcitaḥ || 27 ||

monnatāṃsa bhujaidīrghaiścaturbhirūpaśobhitaḥ |
japākusupasaṃkāśakarapallavaśobhinaḥ || 28 ||

sphuratkeyūrakaṭakaiṇaṃlīyaiścaśobhitaḥ |
śrībhatsakaustubhābhyāṃ ca śobhitaḥ pṛthukkṣamā || 29 ||

muktāhāraiḥ suśobhabhādvyairdivyamālauralaṃkṛtaḥ |
vālārkamadaśajyotsrapītāṃvarapugāhṛtaḥ || 30 ||

māṇimanapuropetaparaghugmavirātitaḥ |
akalaṃkitacaṃdrābhananakhapaṃktivibhūṣitaḥ || 31 ||

raktotpaladaśaślakṣṇaśubhāṃpripugapaṃkajaḥ |
pāṃcatanparathāṃgābhyāṃ vigajitakaradvayaḥ || 32 ||

ijagabhyāṃ śriyaṃgāḍhamā śliṣṭā jagadaṃvikāṃ |
sphuradvidyullatākrāṃtāsitāsibhra ivarājane || 33 || 

taptajāṃkṛnadaślakṣṇakāṃsālakṣmyāniraṃtaraṃ |
gade ca paramekrī utpanna sākṣājjagatpatiḥ || 34 ||

<p. 35b>

tasya kāṃcanasaṃkāśā sarvābharaṇabhūṣitā |
divyacedaṃnalīsāṃgīkanakāṃvarabhūṣaṇā || 35 ||

susnigdhanīlakurilakacabhāravirājitā |
maṃrārapārijātādi divyapuṣpasraganvitā || 36 ||

maṇiratnasīmaṃtākastūrī tilakāṃcitā |
ratnāvataṃ sa śobhādyācikurāṃtelimannibhe || 37 ||

pīnobhuṃgalanābhyāṃ ca sukhayaṃtī hare haraḥ |
keyūrāṃgadahārādyairbhūṣaṇai ete śobhitā || 38 ||

ārūḍhayauvanānityaṃ sarvalokaikarakṣiṇī |
anyonyā śliṣṭahṛdvāhūdivyābharaṇaśobhinau || 39 ||

divyasragavastrasaṃchabhauyuvānāvatisuṃdarau |
śaraṇyo sarvalokyanāṃśaraṇāmanavatmalau || 40 ||

pitarau sarvajagatīnidyāvaṃdasavanvitau |
kartāraumarvajagatāṃ viśvaraśvarakṣaṇa tatparau || 41 ||

sarvasaṃpanmadātāra sarvavidyādhināyakau |
nīlādevyā ca bhūrevyāvāmadakṣiṇaśobhitau || 42 ||

navanirvimalādyābhiḥ śāktibhiḥ pariveṣṭitau |
brahmarudra maheṃdrādiśigemāṇikyakāṃtibhiḥ || 43 || 

virājitapadadvaṃdvaunaktatrāṇaparāyaṇau |
ralartihāsanāsīnaurājitāvilabhūṣaṇau || 44 ||

parasyaratayorāśiphalabhūtaujagatpatī |
yogihṛtpadmasaṃpūjyau nityadaivanasevitau || 45 ||

siddhaiḥ sādhyaiḥ parādhyeyau bhaktānāmiṣṭasiddhidau |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇau nityaṃbhajāmi pratyahaṃ vibhū || 46 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇāvitthaṃ dhyātvā hṛtpadmamadhyagau |
prajapet samaye brahme śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣarīṃ || 47 ||

brahmavidyāpradācāryamathavā hṛdayāṃvuje |
dhyātvā nārāyaṇāṃ sākṣāt sarvabhūṣaṇabhūṣite || 48 ||

tasya patrāṃ śriyaṃ dhyātvā sarvānaṃkāraśobhitāṃ |
ācāryapalīmāyaṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇai vibhū || 49 ||

abhedenaiva satataṃ dhyātvā vidyāmimāṃ japet |
ācāryanāṃ vijānīhi tat patnīmapidhaściyaṃ || 50 ||

<p. 36a>

bhedo nāstyeva nāstyeva svācāryasya śriyaḥ pateḥ |
athavā saccidānaṃdasvarūpasthamavyayaṃ || 51 ||

ravīṃdukoṭi sadṛṣṭaṃ manovācāmagocaraṃ |
niṣkalaṃke nirupamaṃtejorūpeparātparaṃ || 52 ||

dhyātvā japtvā brahmavidyāṃ sākṣāt brahmamayo bhavet |
ekaiveyaṃ dvidaivatyā lakṣmīnārāyaṇīśubhā || 53 ||

anayāsa vidyānāsrināstyadhikāpi vā |
yāṃ vidyāṃjapatonityaṃkalyāṇaṃ sakalabhavat || 54 ||

amutrāpī jayādasyajāyate śubhamakṣayaṃ |
śubhemāsi śubhelagne divase ca śubhe nṛpa || 55 ||

brahmavidyādidyānāṃ kuryādadhyayanaṃ nṛpa |
sadguruḥ śubhadaḥ proktaḥ sanmāsaḥ śubhadaḥ smṛtaḥ || 56 ||

sa dvidyāśu bhadājñeyāsallagnaṃ śubhadāyakaṃ |
madhumāse mahaduḥkhaṃ sādhakasya prajāyate || 57 ||

mādhavemāsilarabhateralasaṃpaddamakṣayāṃ |
jyeṣṭhamaraṇamāprotividyomaprapivaṃdhubhiḥ || 58 ||

āṣāḍhe putramitrādi viyogaṃ prāpnuyāduvaṃ |
śrāvaṇe mahato lakṣmīṃ saṃprāptotya ca lośubhāṃ || 59 ||

māsi bhādrapade dehapīḍāṃ prāpnoti dāruṇāṃ |
muktāmāṇikyasaṃpūrṇāmāśvine labhatethiyaṃ || 60 ||

vāgaiśvaryaṃ kārttikesyādācāryakaruṇāvataḥ |
mārgaśīrṣe bhavellakṣmīrdhanahānyādisaṃkulā || 61 ||

jānakṣayobhavesuṣyekaṣasaṃkramaṇaṃ vinā |
sākṣādbhagavatā lakṣmyā api saṃdarśanaṃ nṛpa || 62 ||

jāyate māghamāekṣa kiṃca sidhyaṃti siddhayaḥ |
phālgunemāsi siddhiḥ syāt tridaśairapi durlabhā || 63 ||

dvitīyā ca tṛtīyā ca paṃcamī saptamīśubhā |
daśamyekādaśī śuklādvādaśī ca trayodaśī || 64 ||

paurṇamāsyapi vidyānāṃ siddhidāstithayaḥ śubhāḥ |
siddhidāṃ kecidapyahuḥ śuklapakṣāṣṭamīṃ śubhāṃ || 65 ||

ādityasomyānāṃ jīvabhārgavayostathā vārāḥ |
śubhapradājñeyā hānidau bhaumabhānujau || 66 ||

<p. 36b>

eveṣu śubhakāleṣu brāhmaḥ samaya uttamaḥ |
śubhagnahāṇāṃ daṣṭvānye muhūrttā api siddhidāḥ || 67 ||

tasmādavaśyaṃ sarvajñaṃ śrotriyaṃ vedapāragaṃ |
sarvāgamarahasyatamācāryaṃ vṛṇuyā dvibhuṃ || 68 ||

 deśakālāvajñāyayaṃtrapūjādikānapi |
rahasyamapi vidyānāmavijñāya mahīpate || 69 ||

yaḥ prayacchati siddhidhāṃ yo gṛhṇāti mahītale |
tāvubhāvapiduḥkhauyairihāpi sahitau śṛpa || 70 ||

gacchatoṃdhaṃ tama paścādyāvadācaṃdratārakaṃ |
bhūyopyavaśyaṃ vedeṣu dharmaśāstreṣu pāragaṃ || 71 ||

sarvāgamarahasyaṃjña vaidikācāra tatparaṃ |
bahuyojana sāhasramapi gatvā mahītale || 72 ||

ācāryamāśrayeddhīmānapi prāṇadhanādikaṃ |
datvā rahasyaṃ vidyānāṃ sāṃgamācāryavaktranaḥ || 73 ||

vijñāyātha mahāvidyāṃ gṛhītvā tanmukhādujāt |
tameva toṣayennityamācāryaṃ bhavāvanmayaṃ || 74 ||

gurūnpūrvopadeṣṭaṃścakāle svagṛhamāgatān |
yathāktyārccaye tatra niyamonāsti bhūpate || 75 ||

bhagavadraśmisahitāṃ brahmavidyāpurasmarāṃ |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ samastanyāsa saṃyutāṃ || 76 ||

yodadātisa ācāryassākṣābhārāyaṇānmakaḥ |
samadvīyavatīṃ pṛthvīṃ dhanadhānyauya saṃkulāṃ || 77 ||

ācāryāya samarpyāpi ṛṇavoneva saṃtataṃ |
tasmādyegaṃ ca kālaṃ ca sarahasyānmanūnapi || 78 ||

vijñāyaiva pradātavyā vidyāḥ sakalasiddhidāḥ |
sarvajñasyaiva sānnidhye gṛhṇīyāt sakalānyanūn || 79 ||

gṛhītvānajña sānnidhye manūnapya valānnṛpa |
avaśyamapi gṛhṇīyādbhūyaḥ sarvajña sannidhau || 80 ||

niyamena tathācārya pādābjapurāleśune |
arpayeddakṣiṇāṃ sāṃgā japahomādikarmasu || 81 ||

āśvamedhādiyāgārānityaṃ sukṛtamicchatā |
āvāryadakṣiramādeyāyatkiṃcidapi bhūpate || 82 ||

<p. 37a>

aśvamedhādiyāgepudhanaṃ kori sahasraśaḥ |
datvāyatphalamuddiṣṭaṃ dharmaśāstra śrutiṣvapi || 83 ||

ācāryadakṣiṇādānā tatphalaṃ pratyahaṃ smṛtaṃ |
aśvamedhādi yāgeṣu datvā koṭi sahasraśaḥ || 84 ||

śakralokekṣayānbhogān prāpnuvaṃti vudhottamāḥ |
naṣṭe puṇye martyalokaṃ bhūyopi prāpnuvaṃti hi || 85 ||

ācāryadakṣiṇādānājjāpahomādikarmasu |
punarāvṛttirahitaṃ śāśvataṃ padamaśrute || 86 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojadvayārcanaratāssadā |
brahmavidyājayāsaktāraśmimālānuciṃtakaḥ || 87 ||

samastanyā sasahita śrīmadaṣṭārṇaciṃtakāḥ |
samānarūpāḥ śrīviṣṇordivyālaṃkārabhūṣitāḥ || 88 ||

divyasragvastrasaṃchannādivyacaṃdanacarcitāḥ |
ayodhyānagare sākṣātyade bhagavataḥ śubhe || 89 ||

brahmatādātmyanāpannāmodaṃte tasya sannidhau |
gatvātrananivarjaṃte viṣṇunāsahasasthitāḥ || 90 ||

avicchinnasadāteṣāṃ viṣṇunāsaṃgatiḥ śubhā |
tatsamānasukhaṃ nityaṃ prāpnuvaṃti manīṣiṇaḥ || 91 ||

yatra harerlokamāpnuvaṃti manīṣiṇaḥ |
nāmuvaṃ nipunaḥ sargaṃ sargasthā iva jaṃtavaḥ || 92 ||

yathāsaumitribharatau yathā saṃkarṣaṇādayaḥ |
tathā tenaiva jāyaṃte murtyalokeyathecchayā || 93 ||

punaste naiva yāṃtismatatyaṃdaśāśvataṃ paraṃ |
na karpavaṃdhanaṃ janmabrahmavidyāratātmanāṃ || 94 ||

bhagavatkiṃkaratvaṃ vai mokṣanāhuḥ purātanāḥ |
nadāsyaṃ vai pareśasyavaṃdhanaṃ parikīrtitaṃ || 95 ||

sarvavaṃdhavinirmuktā haridāsānirāmayā |
ābrahmabhuvanāllokāḥ punarāvṛttilakṣaṇāḥ || 96 ||

karmavaṃdhabhayāduḥkhamiśrasaukhyabhayapradāḥ |
vahvāyāsaphalāduḥkhajanmakāṇūhetavaḥ || 97 ||

<p. 37b>

svargopabhogāstunṛṇāṃ viṣamiśrāśanā iva |
svargamaṃsthānnarān dṛṣṭvā kṣīṇe karmaṇi devatāḥ || 98 ||

kupitāḥ pātayaṃtye ca saṃhate karmavadhane |
tasmāt svargasukhaṃ bhūpavahuyatnaikasādhanaṃ || 99 ||

anityakurilaṃduḥkhamiśraṃ yogī parityajet |
yajña na taporūpaṃ karmavedesu codita || 100 ||

brahmārpaṇādhiyā kurvankarmavaṃdhairnaniṣpate |
ācāryapatnīputrādīnabhyarcya pratyahaṃ tataḥ || 1 ||

vedamārgaratonivyaṃ brāhmavidyājaperataḥ |
raśmimālāmanuspṛtya śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japan || 2 ||

ihāpi brahmabhūtosau śāśvataṃ padamāpnuyāt |
ācāryācaraṇāṃbhoja dvayameva madāsmaret || 3 ||

śucinā saṃprajaptavyā śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣarī |
ādyaṃ vījadvayaṃtyatkā śrīśrīpatidaśākṣarīṃ || 4 ||

satataṃ saṃramareddhīmānyadīcchecchreya ātmanaḥ |
araṇye vānaraṇye vāsvagṛhevānadītaṭe || 5 ||

caṃḍālavāṭikāyāṃ vā rājavidvatsabhāmuvā |
āsīnovāśayānośrivātiṣṭhan gacchanathāpi vā || 6 ||

śucirapya śucirvemāṃ śrīśrīpatidakṣākṣarīṃ |
ācāryānugrahaṃ prāpya sabhataṃ masmarannapa || 107 ||

mahāpāpopapāpaudyairapi muktaḥ sudāṇaiḥ |
vratakoṭi tapastītha mahāyāgaphalānvitaḥ || 108 ||

vrajatyaṃte bhagavataḥ padaṃ śāśvatamakṣayaṃ |
daśārṇavidyāmātraṃ vā sadācāryā kṛpānvitaḥ || 109 ||

saṃsmṛtya pratyahaṃ bhūmāḍūtāpi śriyamakṣayā |
samāpya sarvavidyānāmādhipatyaṃ ca durlabhaṃ || 110 ||

putrapautravṛttīmṛddhiṃ prāpya bhgānanekaśaḥ |
dehāṃte tatparaṃdhāma vrajatyeva śriyaḥ pateḥ || 111 ||

vedeṣu vihitaṃ karmayajñadānataṣomayaṃ |
tanniṣṭassatataṃ bhūtvā bhagavaṃtamanussaret || 112 ||

śrutismṛtīhaṇejñā lokānāṃ hitakāriṇī |
śrīśājñollaṃghakaḥ sarvajagadohī mahīpate || 13 ||

adhye tavyāḥ sadāvedāḥ kāryāyāgāssadakṣiṇāḥ |
dātavyānyapirānāti satpātrebhyoviśeṣataḥ || 14 ||

<p. 38a>

na vidyayā kevalayātapasā vāpi pātratā |
yatravṛtamimevobhe tatpātraṃ pracakṣyate || 15 ||

vedānadhītyasatataṃ vedasyārthaṃ vicārayan |
kurvan vaidikamācārepātrabhūtobhaveddvijaḥ || 16 ||

vedādhyayanahīnaśca vedācāravivarjitaḥ |
jīvanneva sa śūdraḥ syātanmukhaṃ nāvalokayet || 17 ||

vedahīnasya vipraya na vākyaṃ śrāvya parāvapi |
apātradānānnarakaṃ pātradānāt paraṃ padaṃ || 18 ||

satpātrāṇāṃ sahasrebhyo datvā koṭisahasraśaḥ |
dhanaṃ yatphalamuddiṣṭaṃ tadācāryatya pādayoḥ || 19 ||

niṣkamātrasuvarṇaṃ vā datvā tatphalamaśrute |
rahasya manyadvakṣyāmi śṛṇu rājanmahīpate || 20 ||

na vācyaṃ yatra kutrāpi putrāya prāṇadāya vā |
bhagavadraśmimālākhyāvidyāpeyemayeritā || 21 ||

ācāryānugrahādenāmanusmṛtyānvahaṃ śuciḥ |
brahmavidyājayāsa sakto vedoktācāra tatparaḥ || 22 ||

sa rahasyo mahāvidyāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japan |
pātrāṇāmutamaṃ pātra mayamevocyate budhe || 23 ||

vedavidyāvihīnopiyāgahīnopi vā sahā |
uktācārarato nityamācāryacaraṇārccaka || 24 ||

caturṇāmapi vedānāṃ nitya adhyayanātpālaṃ |
avāpya sarvayāgānāṃ phalaṃ pratyahamaśrutaṃ || 25 ||

brahmāryaṇadhiyānityaṃ kṛtvā karmaśrutīritaṃ |
brahmaṇaḥ padamādyanodatekālamakṣeyaṃ || 26 ||

ācāryapatnīmāṃcāryaṃ śrīśrīpatidhiyārccayan |
brahmavidyājapedyastu śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣarī || 27 ||

taṃpālapati devyenaṃ mahālakṣmī svaputravat |
bhagavānapittaṃ nityaṃ pitṛvadkṣati dhruvaṃ || 28 ||

yasyācāryapadāṃbhojārūḍhaṃ śrīpādukādvayaṃ |
samarcayati hastābhyā taddhastaṃ śaṃkhakravat || 29 ||

yasye netra dvayaṃ nityaṃ pādukādvitayaṃ śubhaṃ |
ananyadarśanaḥ prātaḥ prātarutthāya paśyati || 30 ||

tabhetrayugalaṃ sākṣātparabrahmeha paśyati ācāryadukāyugmaṃ namedyasya śiro 
nṛpasaṃghārya mukuṭaṃ tena śirasā ratna nirmitaṃ |
ācāryakarṇayeyo nirmitaṃ kuṃḍaladvayaṃ dhriyanedātṛvaddanaṃ bhagavat 
kalayānitaṃ || 32 || 

<p. 38b>

vaśiṣṭādyā mahābhāgā japahoma parāyaṇāḥ |
brahmavidyānusaṃdhānādbrahmarṣitvamupāgatāḥ || 33 ||

rudrakoyāgninādagdhodakṣaḥ pūrvaṃ prajāpatiḥ |
punaḥ prācetaso bhūtvā brahmavidyānu ciṃtanāt || 36 ||

brahmatvamāpta vā sarvajagatkartṛtvamapyatha |
pulahādyā mahābhāgā brahmaputrā mahīpate || 35 ||

brahmavidyā japādeva brahmatvaṃ samupāgatāḥ |
brahmavidyānusaṃdhānamācāryacaraṇārcanaṃ || 36 ||

durlabha triṣulokeṣu munīnāmapiyogināṃ |
tasmācchubheṣumāseṣusuśrubheṣvapi || 37 ||

saṃprāptavyā mahāvidyānānyathā siddhirucyate |
navāramāsadoṣaḥ syādgadurbrahmaṇe caṃdrasūryayoḥ || 38 ||

japahomādikaṃ tatra svatya madhyavanīpate |
akṣayaṃ japahomādiphalaṃ syāttatra saṃtataṃ || 39 ||

strīṃdugrahaṇedattayatkiṃcidapikāṃcanaṃ |
meruśailasamaṃ viddhitatsvarṇaṃ nātrasaṃśayaḥ || 40 ||

samūmnānyapidānāniravīṃdugrahaṇenaya |
dātavyānimayatena vittalobhavivarjinīṃ || 41 ||

grahaṇeṣu puraścaryāṃ sāṃgadakṣiṇayānvitāṃ |
ācāryasannidhau kṛtvā mahālakṣmī samanvitaṃ || 42 ||

nārāyaṇaṃ jagannāthaṃ sākṣādeva prapaśyati |
pūrvopadiṣṭā vidyāścaravīdugrahaṇe śubhe || 43 || 

adhyetavyāḥ punarapi svācāryavadanāṃvujāt |
sākṣādayaṃ parvakālo mahānukto maharṣibhiḥ || 44 ||

parokṣakālā anyesyuratnabhyā api bhūyate |
yahaṇe sarvavidyānāmuktamāmeṣu saṃtataṃ || 45 ||

māghāmāso mahānukto mādhyādisahito yadi |
srvāsāmapi viyānāmācāryavadanāṃdujāt || 46 ||

kāryamadhyayanaṃ tatra devatā darśanapradaṃ |
pādyamāsepradeyāni sarvadānāni bhūpate || 47 ||

brahmatādātmyasaṃsiddhipradātṛṇi na saṃśayaḥ |
yasyopanayanārthaṃ vā mādyamāsi prayacchati || 41 ||

<p. 39a>

brahmarṣitvamavāpnoti sonyasmin janmani dhruvaṃ |
māghamāse daridrāya vivāhadhanamuttamaṃ || 42 ||

datvā vivāhapitvātha pitṛnātha sahasraśaḥ |
narakasthān samuddhṛtya brahmaloke mahīpate || 50 ||

kṣīyaṃte sālilenyacce bhaumoścatra sareṇavaḥ |
kṣayona nasyapurāyasya tadvisyoḥ parame pade || 51 ||

 yāvadmaṃḍalamiṃdasaśailavanakananaṃ |
tāvadvaṃśābhivṛddhiḥ syādiha loke mahīpate || 52 ||

ekaikadivasaṃmāghemāsiparvasamaṃ smṛtaṃ |
padyānakṣetra saṃyuktā paurṇimā tatra pāsmṛtā || 53 ||

mahāpādhīti sā proktā paurṇamāsī phalapradā |
vaiśākhaśrāvaṇādīni māghamāsa samānihi || 54 ||

caitrapuṣpādimāmāḥ syuḥ pūrvoktā aśubhāḥ smṛtāḥ |
aśubheṣvapimaraseṣu ravīṃdugrahaṇaṃ nṛpa || 55 ||

sarvasiddhipradaṃ jñeyaṃ sarvadoṣa vivarjitaṃ |
alabhyā api yogāsyuḥ śubhātaśubhamāsyapi || 56 ||

tasmāddeśaṃ ca kālaṃ ca parīkṣyāṃcārya ādarāt |
vidyopadeśaṃ kurvīta nānyathā siddhi rucyate || 57 ||

ajñātvā śubhamāsādi rahasyaṃ māgamapyatha |
nadadyātra ca gṛhṇīyādvidyājāta mahīpate || 58 ||

vahunātra kimuktena sārabhūtavavaḥ śṛṇu |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvabhajanīyaṃ dine dine || 59 ||

brahmavidyānusaṃdhānaṃ raśmimālāpurassaraṃ |
ādau kṛtvā prayatnena samastanyāsa saṃyutāṃ || 60 ||

śrīmadṛṣṭvākṣarīvidyāṃ japeddhahmatvasiddhaye |
etadeva paraṃtatvaṃ vedāṃteṣu śrutiṣvapi || 61 ||

naitasmādaparaṃvedarahasyaṃ tatvamīsitaṃ |
iti dāśarathīyesminnaṃ vedārthasaṃgrahe || 62 ||

iktoyaṃ dvādaśodhyāyo brahmatatvārthasādhanaḥ || 63 ||

iti śrīmadanutarabrahmanatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
dvādaśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 39b>

ṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca 

bhūyopi bhagavānsākṣājjānakīramaṇohariḥ |
sādhanaṃ brahmavidyāyāḥ kathayāmāsa śabhave || 1 ||

purārājaṣi'caryāyajanakāyamahātmane |
nārāyaṇo mahāyogī kathayāmāsa yatparaṃ || 2 ||

śrībhagavānuvāca 

śṛṇu rājanmahīpālanimivaṃśa samudbhava |
sādhanaṃ brahmavidyāyānavācyamapi kutracit || 3 ||

nāstyasyānyā sajālaṃ vānapnuraścaraṇādikaṃ |
nahomastarpaṇaṃ vāpi siddhavidyeyamiṣṭadā || 4 ||

guhyādguhyatarāvidyāsārātsāratarāśubhā |
parasya brahmaṇaḥ sākṣādāśudarśanasiddhidā || 5 ||

brahmānaṃdarasāvāprikarī sarvaphalapradā |
avaśyaṃ savaye brāhmeja savyāsiddhimicchatā || 6 ||

śreyaḥ paraṃparāpicchankalyāṇāni dine dine |
pūjayet samaye brāhme brahmavidyāmimāṃ śuciḥ || 7 ||

sahasraṃ prajapennityamatha paṃcaśataṃ tu vā |
catuḥśataṃ japedyadvātriśateśatameva vā || 8 ||

paṃcadhānātridhā smṛtvā bhagavadraśmimālikāṃ |
maṃsiddhiṃ mahatīmiṣṭāṃ prāpnotyāśrunasaṃśayaḥ || 9 ||

saviturgrahaṇeprāpte caṃdrasyagrahaṇepi vā |
eva bhaktāśanonityaṃ tatpūrvadivasatrayaṃ || 10 ||

sparśakālenataḥ prāptestātvātīrthatale śubhe |
saṃkalpyakeśavādīnimataśoccaran || 11 ||

caturviśati saṃkhyāni snātvā maunena sādhakaḥ |
mahāpātakakoṭibhyassadya eva vimutyate || 12 ||

 ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojayugmaprakṣālanodekaṃ |
pītvāṃtarapi śuddhaḥ syāt sadyo niṣkalmaṣo bhavet || 13 ||

snātvā campaparīdhāya śubhraṃ vāso yugaṃ tataḥ |
trirācampa sadācārya sannidhauśaṃsita vrataḥ || 14 ||

sparśamārabhyamokṣāṃtaṃ brahmavidyāmimāṃ japet |
ācāryapatnīmācīryāṃtrātvā śrīśrīśarūpiṇau || 15 ||

japāṃte bhūṣaṇaistrairalaṃkṛtya sasamāhitaḥ |
padmarāga samāyukte taptahema vinirmitaṃ || 16 ||

<p. 40a>

ācāryakarṇayordatvātkuṃḍala dvitayaṃ śubhaṃ |
muktāratnamayaṃ vāpitasatyā api bhūṣaṇaṃ || 17 ||

datvācāryapadāṃbhoje vahusasya samanvitāṃ |
maṃhīdakṣiṇayuktāṃ godvayaṃ ca tamarpayet || 18 ||

athavā bhāskarasyeṃdoḥ prāpteparvaṇi bhūpate |
sarvāvaraṇasaṃyuktau lakṣmīnārāyaṇau vibhu || 19 ||

vailvairvātulasīpatraiḥ kamalaihasalestuvā |
sparśakālaṃ samārabhyamokṣakālāṃtamādarāt || 20 ||

arcayetyayato vidvān śrīśrīśabrahmavidyayā |
suvarṇapuṣpalakṣeṇavarṣakodyarcanātphalaṃ || 21 ||

avāpya lakṣmīśau sākṣādeva prapaśyati |
ācāryadakṣiṇāṃ dadyāt pūrvamuktāṃ tataḥ paraṃ || 22 ||

sālagnāmaśilāmekāmapi dakṣiṇayānvitāṃ |
tasminkāle gurordatvā māsātryāgevasādhakaḥ || 23 ||

natyatyā api vā sāṃsibhūṣaṇāni savarpayet |
viṃśāḍhakamitānmudrānatha vā dvādaśāṭhakān || 34 ||

āṭhakārdhavāśarkarāṃ vā guḍaṃtu vā |
prasthaṃ cātha tadarthaṃ vā ghṛtaṃ dhenu samudbhavaṃ || 35 ||

paṃcadhiśāṃṭhakān yadvātaṃḍulān dvādaśāṭhakān |
palīputra sametāyasvācāryāya samarpayet || 36 ||

brāhmaṇānbhojayenpaścādvādaśātha suvāsitīḥ |
dvādaśārṇāgahātidyāmadyaḥ siddhyati bhūpate || 37 ||

bhagavaduviyāśca sadyaḥ sidhyaṃtitastha hi |
śrīśrīśayoḥ prasādena tasmicarye mahīpate || 38 ||

prāpnoti mahatīṃ lakṣmīmacalāṃ ralasaṃkulāṃ |
dhanadhānya samāyuktāṃ saṃtati vyāpinīṃ dhruvaṃ || 39 ||

prāpnoti mahatīṃ vācāṃ siddhimapyatulaprabhāṃ |
mahadārogyammasādyadīrghamāyuranuttamaṃ || 40 ||

bhuktvehasakalānbhogāndaṃte brahmaṇi līyate |
śuklā tṛtīyo vaiśākhe bhṛgutvāsaraṃ saṃyutā || 41 ||

<p. 40b>

rohiṇītārasahitā saṃtatākṣayasiddhā |
tretādyā sā tithirjanmatithivālamahātmanaḥ || 42 ||

śrīgaurīyoganāyaṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇābhidhaḥ |
umāśaṃkarayogaśca kathyataitaddine vudhaiḥ || 43 ||

etatyaṃ vakayogoyaṃ durlabhastridaśairapi |
atra dattaṃ japtanityā kṣayaphalapradaṃ || 44 ||

akṣayākyāṃnṛtīyāyāmakṣayaiścaryavarddhanaṃ |
ācāryājñāṃ samāsādya prātasnātvā viśuddhadhīḥ || 45 ||

nityakarmasamāpyāthamallikāpuṣpamiśritaiḥ |
vilvapatra samāyuktaiḥ komalaistu sa sīdalaiḥ || 
anyarcya kusumairyāvatphalaṃ prāpte bhūtale || 45 || 

tāvadekaikatulasīdalamotreṇasādhakaḥ |
prāpyayusmyaṃ viśuddhātmā || 46 ||

tata ācāryapādābjayugalaṃ daṃḍavannabhet |
phalacittayamādāyapānasaṃsumanoharaṃ || 50 ||

arkaniṣkamuvarṇena tadardhārdhena vā punaḥ |
niṣkadvayayutaṃ vāpi dadyādācāryapādayoḥ || 51 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayaṃrampamarpyayettasyakārṇayoḥ |
dadyādācāryayanmaiva vahvālaṃkaraṇādikaṃ || 52 ||

ekaṃ vāsopi dadyāddaridraścenmahīpate |
gavyaṃ dadyadhyaryayetpaścādāḍhakaṃ vā tadardhakaṃ || 53 ||

dadyādvahūni cānyāni phalānyāvāryapādayoḥ |
akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāmitthaṃ kṛtvā dvijottamaḥ || 54 ||

akṣayaṃ sumahatyuṇyaṃ tridaśairapi durlabhaṃ |
asādhyamaṃtrasaṃsiddhimakṣayāṃ prāpya bhūtale || 55 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇau sākṣādvarṣa madhye prapaśyati |
maṃdabhāgyopi saṃmāpyaśriyamaṣṭaguṇānvitāṃ || 56 ||

śriyādhanadasaṃkāśo vidyayājīvasannibhaḥ |
sākṣātkaśyapavanputrapautrasaṃpatisaṃyutaḥ || 57 ||

bhuktve sakalānbhogān tridaśairapi durlabhān |
aṃte vaikuṃḍamāpnoti daśapūrverdaśāparaiḥ || 58 ||

<p. 41a>

akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāṃ yadyadācāryapādayoḥ |
vastvarpayati śuddhātmātrasareṇumitaṃ tu vā || 59 ||

tata dakṣayamevāsmaibhagavāniṃdirāpatiḥ |
pradadāti na saṃdehasmasminneva hi vatsare || 60 ||

icchannakṣayaṃ sasiddhimakṣayabrahmadarśanaṃ |
akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāmitthaṃ kuryānmahīpate || 61 ||

āśvinemāsi saṃmāpte varṣa madhyamaṇau nṛpa |
navarātrabhidhaṃ parvaratnaṃ sakalasiddhidaṃ || 62 ||

ayāvahaṃ jayetsūnāṃ daridrāṇāṃdhanāvahaṃ |
bhāgyavahamabhāpānāṃ sākṣādbrahmatvahetukaṃ || 63 ||

tasminnekaikadivasaṃ ravigrahaṇesannibhaṃ |
yā mahānavamī tatra samastaphalasiddhidā || 64 ||

raviparvaśataprakhyāṃ vijayāśrīphalapradā |
mahānavamyāsadṛśī na puṇyatithirucyate || 65 ||

mahānavamyāsadṛśaṃ parvāṃstina hi bhūtale |
yadyatkerāti karmeṣṭaṃtanmahānavamīdine || 66 ||

tattanmeru samaṃvidyājjapahomārcanādikaṃ |
nakṣatramutarāṣāḍābhārgavovāsaro yai || 67 ||

pareyu vaiṣṇavaṃ tāraṃ sā tithissarvadurlabhā |
svāyaṃbhu vākhyamanvādisahitā sā mahātithiḥ || 68 ||

 sāmrājyalakṣmīyogoyaṃtatithaudurlabhonṛpa |
alabhyonāmayogoyaṃ durlabhastridaśairapi || 69 ||

maṃdabhāgyādaridovāpi savaladvāgatmyabuddhimān |
navarātravrataṃ kuryādavaśyaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ || 70 ||

navarātravrate cīrṇe yatphalaṃ jāyate nṛṇāṃ |
koṭiṇovi vratairanyaiṃ kṛtairnāproti tatphalaṃ || 71 ||

sāmrājyalakṣmīyogītra prāpte tannavamītithau |
datamiṣṭaṃ hutaṃ japtamanaṃta phalasiddhidaṃ || 72 ||

sāmrājyalakṣmīyogena samoyogostināparaḥ |
kṛtaṃ kamarmātra sāmrājya śriyamevadadātphalaṃ || 73 ||

pratipratithimārabhyanavagyaṃtamathādarāt |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇau nityamarcayedbrahmavidyayā || 74 ||

<p. 41b>

sālagrāmaśilāyāṃ vā śrīpadaṣṭārṇayaṃtrake |
ekabhaktāśanastatrasahasraṃ vārcayeddhīmān || 75 ||

patraiḥ puṣpadhimiśritaiḥ mahābhavamyāṃ prāptāyāṃ |
sahasraṃ triśatāyikaṃ || 76 ||

arcayetulasīpatrairvilyaiḥ puspavimiśritaiḥ |
tata ācāryapādābjaṃ natvā sāṣṭāṃgamādarāt || 77 ||

saṃtaptahāṭakakṛtaṃ padmarāgasamanvitaṃ |
kuṃḍaladvitayāṃramyaṃ madatvācāryakarṇayoḥ || 78 ||

bahusasyasamāyuktāṃ sāṃgadakṣiṇayānvitāṃ |
dadyādācārya pādābja caraṇāya vasuṃdharā || 79 ||

sālagrāmaśilāmekīgrāmekāṃcapayasvinīṃ |
alaṃkārān vahūnanyānapitasmai samarpayet || 80 ||

susūkṣmīṇyapi vāsāṃsinatyalyā api bhūṣaṇaṃ |
dadyādvāsoyugaṃ kṣaumaṃ kāryā saṃvāsusūkṣmīkaṃ || 81 ||

suvāsinīnāmanyāsāmapi vastraṇyarthārpayet |
sahānavamyāṃ vasudhācāryāya samarpayet || 82 ||

saptadvīpavatīṃ pṛthvīṃ dhanadhānyādi saṃkulāṃ |
datvā sahasvaśaḥ puṇyaṃ labhate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 83 ||

sālagrāmaśilāṃ śuddhāṃ datvā dakṣiṇayānvitāṃ |
brahmāṃḍakoṭidānasya phalamatyaṃta maśrute || 84 ||

ācāryakarṇayordatvā kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ śubhaṃ |
pitṛṇāmapi sāhasraṃtārayettisthitaṃ || 85 ||

kiṃ cāsyavaṃśa saṃbhūtāssarvepi maṃgavatpriyāḥ |
divyabhogasamāyuktā jīvanyuktā bhavetyapi || 86 ||

ratvāgomi punaṃtatragāmekāṃ vā payasvitī |
sāṃgadakṣiṇayāyuktagosahasarapradānaja || 87 ||

phalaṃ prāpya viśuddhātmā brahmasākṣātprapaśyati |
karṇālaṃkaraṇaṃ hematāṭaṃka dvitayaṃ śubhaṃ || 88 ||

karṣasvarṇamitaṃ triṃśaccihvukasvarṇameva e | 
muktājāle samāyuktavālīyugalameva vā || 89 ||

<p. 42a>

gurupatnyaisamavyārthanāsikānaraṇaṃ tu vā |
sākṣālakṣmīnivāsosmaibhagavatpatra na saṃśayaḥ || 90 ||

ācāryāyātha tatpatnyai datvādhāso yugaṃ śubhaṃ |
divyāṃ varadharo divyaratnābharaṇabhūṣitaḥ || 91 ||

divyakanyāśanayutaṃ vimānadhiśehati |
bhūdānadakṣiṇoṃ proktā sarvastaṃ aṃdirasthitaṃ || 92 ||

vaṣośanaminaṃ dravyamathacottamadakṣiṇā |
caturviśati niṣkaṃvānadabhāvetadardhakaṃ || 93 ||

tadalābhetadartheṃ vā vitalobhaṃ vivarjayet |
mahīpratinidhi dravyamathavā dakṣiṇānvitaṃ || 94 ||

ācāryapādayordevaṃ bhūdānaphalakāṃkṣiṇā |
vatvāronaḍuhodeyā bhūdānerājavallabha || 95 ||

niṣkaṃniṣkārdhamekaṃ syānmaulyaṃ cānaḍuhonṛpa |
caturṇāmapyanaḍuhāṃ caturniṣkamathāpicā || 96 ||

itthamācarataḥ puṃsaḥ ekavāramapi prabhuḥ |
prasīdati hariḥ sākṣānmahālakṣmīsamanvitaḥ || 97 ||

kimasādhyaṃ bhavetasya prasanne kalāpatau |
śuklātṛtīyāvaiśākhīṃ yā proktā kṣayatijñitā || 98 ||

āśvayuk śuklanavamītithidvavapidaṃ śubhaṃ |
asmin dinadvayenityaṃ sarvamakṣayasiddhidaṃ || 99 ||

asyāṃ navamyāṃ sāmrājyalaṃkṣmāyogaḥ sudurlabhaḥ |
labhyate vahubhirvarṣairdurlabhaṃ stridaśairapi || 100 ||

anena sadṛśo yogonāstyalabhvo jagattraye |
pare ghurvijayānāmadaśamī śravaṇānvitā || 1 ||

tatrāpi puṣpaiḥ patraiścai śrīśrīśadvādaśārṇayā |
śrīśrīśāvarcayedvīmānsahasraṃ sādhakonṛpaḥ || 2 ||

tatrāpyācārya pādābjai goyugmaṃ dakṣiṇānvitaṃ |
nighadvayasuvarṇāṃ vā niṣkaṃmekamathāpi vā || 3 ||

vijayaśrī samanvicha yadadyādādarānnṛpa |
samāśrurāja sānnidhye vivodepi mahādraṇe || 4 ||

karaṇye giri durge vā satataṃ vijayī bhavet |
itthamācarataḥ puṃso bhāgyārāśinyadepade || 5 || 

<p. 42b>

bhavatpatra na saṃdehassatyaṃ vadāmyahaṃ |
anakurddhaṃ pravakṣyāmi patrapuṣpārcanāt phalaṃ || 6 ||

yatkṛtvā manujoleke sākṣādbrahmamayo bhavet |
vilvapatraissamabhyarcyatya sahasrakaṃ || 7 ||

mahāpātakakoiṭibhyo māsasyāreṇa mucyate |
acalāṃ mahatīṃ lakṣmīsaṃtativyāpinīṃ bhavet || 8 ||

mallikā kusumairlakṣmīlakṣmīśaunityamarccayan |
sahasraṃ māsamātreṇa śatajanmasamudbhavaiḥ || 9 ||

vimuktaḥ pāpasaṃghaiśca dhanadenasamaḥśriyā |
mahākavirmahāvāgmī bhavatyeva natyena na saṃśayaḥ || 10 ||

nīlotpalaissamabhyarcya nityaṃ sāhasramādarāt |
mahāpāpopavāpodyairapi māsādvimucyate || 111 ||

madane samaḥ kāṃtyāvaśī kuryājjagattrayaṃ |
ketakī kusumairnityamabhyarcya brahmavidyamā || 12 ||

sahasraṃ māsamātreṇa vimuktassarvapātakaiḥ |
madadāyuṣyamārogyamaiścaryamacalaṃ labhet || 13 ||

naṃdyāvartaissamabhyarcya nityaṃ sāhasramādarāt |
mahāpātakodyāpi māsamātreṇa mucyate || 14 ||

vidyayājīvasadṛśo bhūtvā lakṣmīmavaṃcalāṃ |
saṃprāpya putrapautrādi samṛddhiṃ mahatīṃ labhet || 15 ||

namālīkusumairnityaṃ sahasraṃ pūjayan śuciḥ |
saṃbhayatyarisaṃghātānacalāṃ ca śriyaṃ labhet || 16 ||

caṃpakairvakulairvāpi punnāgairvā sahasrakaṃ |
abhyabhyarcya lakṣmī lakṣmīśau māsamātreṇa pātakaiḥ || 17 ||

vimuktoṣṭāṃgasahitaṃ yogamāpnotisādhakaḥ |
jakṛtahasamudbhūteḥ komalaiḥ pallavaiḥ śubhaiḥ || 18 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇā viṣvāsahasraṃ brahmavidyayā |
anekakoṭijanmotthairapi pāpairvimucyate || 19 ||

āśrayaḥ sarvabhāmyānāmādhārassarvasaṃpadāṃ |
ālayassarvabhogānāṃ bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 20 ||

komalaistulasīpatraiḥ sahasraṃ brahmavidyayā |
abhyarcya māsamātreṇa mahāpāpaiśca dāruṇaiḥ || 21 ||

vimukto mahadārogyamāyuṣyaṃ cācalāṃ śriyaṃ |
putrapautrādisaṃpatimapyasau labhate nṛpa || 22 ||

<p. 43a>

vikasakṛmalairnityaṃ sahasraṃ brahmavidyayā |
abhyarcyamāsamātreṇa vimuktaḥ pāparāśibhiḥ || 23 ||

adhipassarvavidyānāmādhasūssarvasaṃpadāṃ |
divyabhogayuto bhūtvā putrapautravaṃtī śriyaṃ || 34 ||

avāpya ciramāyuṣyaṃ mahādārogyamakṣayaṃ |
vrajatpatena saṃdeho bhagavansannidhiṃ nṛpa || 25 ||

haumaṃ kusumasāhasraṃ kusumānāṃ śataṃ tu vā |
sauvarṇaṃ puṣpamekavā datvā bhagavāte nṛpa || 26 ||

śriyaṃ māsatrayeṇāsau māheṃdrīṃ ca tṛṇāyate |
ekaṃ suvarṇapuṣpaṃ vā daśacihukanirmitaṃ || 27 ||

navīnaṃ pratyahaṃ datvā tasyā datvā guravenvahaṃ |
maheṃrasadṛśo lakṣmyāvidyayādhiṣaṇaprabhaḥ || 28 ||

ādhārassarvabhāgyānāṃ bhūtvāṃte muktimāpnuyāt |
sau varṇapuṣpamekaṃ vā puṣpamanyansugaṃdhi vā || 29 ||

ekaṃ vilvadalaṃ vāpi tathaika tulasīdalaṃ |
lakṣmīlakṣmīśayoddetvā pratyahaṃ dvādaśārṇayā || 30 ||

prāpnoti mahatīṃ siddhiṃ sarvapāpaimamucyate |
ghṛtaṃ haviḥ phalaṃ vāpi madhuratritayaṃtu vā || 31 ||

hutvā dvādaśadhā vahnau śrīśrīśabrahmavidyayā |
agniṣṭomaphalaṃ nityaṃ protyatra na saṃśayaḥ || 32 ||

brāhmesamaya utthāya brahmavidyāmanusmaran |
raśmimālāmanusmṛtya kalyāṇānidinedine || 33 ||

prāpnoti dṛḍhabhaktāścedārcāryacaraṇānuje |
anenaiva pramāṇebha saptakoṭimanuṣvapi || 34 ||

brahmavidyā samāvidyānāstināsti mahāpate |
anenaiva pramāṇena brahmavidyābhadaṃguru || 35 ||

guruṇāmapi sarvevāmadhikaṃ viddhi bhūpate |
brahmavidyāpradācāryasadaśaṃvajagattraye || 36 ||

vidyatedaidhatamapiyānaseṣu tu kākathā |
tasmādavaśyamācāryapādukāyugamādarāt || 37 ||

ananyadarśanodṛṣṭvā brāhmesamaya utthitaḥ |
namākṛtyāpi saṃpūjyaśreyasāṃrāśimaśnute || 38 ||

ācāryapādukābhāve tulasīvilvameva vā |
mahānadīṃ śrotriyaṃ kamaṇi ratnamathāpi vā || 39 ||

ananyadaśarnodṛṣṭvā brāhmesamaya uthitaḥ |
sarvāpadmovimuktaḥ syācchreyānnityamavāpnuyāt || 40 ||

brahmavidyāṃ prajavaivanityakarmānvahaṃ śuciḥ |
samāpya śrīmadaṣṭārṇajapādikamapyārabhet || 41 ||

<p. 43b>

itite brahmavidyāyā māhātmyamaghanāśanaṃ |
kiṃciduktaṃ yayā bhūpapunaḥ kiṃ śrotumicchasi || 43 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīyetatrevedārthasaṃgrahe 
trayodaśodhyāyaḥ] 13 ||
<p. 43b>

ṛṣaya ūcuḥ 

ṛṣyaśṛṃgamahābhānasarvajñānavattāṃvara |
māhātmyaṃ brahmavidyāyāḥ śrutamasmābhirādarāt || 1 ||

ajapākhyaṃ mahāvidyā mātṛkāṃnovadamabho |

śrīṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca 

vaśiṣṭādi maharṣīṇāṃ sannidhau jānakīpatiḥ || 2 ||

yathādāśarathiḥ pūrvaṃ prāharudrāya pṛcchate |
yathā nārāyaṇenādau janakāyoktamādarāt || 3 ||

tadahaṃ sapravakṣyāmi śṛṇudhva munipuṃgavāḥ |
anaṃtaviṃdusahitaṃ śaktirvidudvayānvitā || 4 ||

punastrayodaśayutāśaktirvyomasaviṃdukaṃ || 5 ||

haṃsavidyeyamākhyātā catuvarṇā phalapradā |
dehāṃtarvarti jīvātmā parabrahmāṃśasaṃbhavaḥ || 6 ||

niśvāsollāsarūpeṇa japatyanudinaṃ manuṃ || 6 ||

ṛṣirbrahmāsyamaṃtrasyagāyatraṃchaṃda ucyate |
haṃsarūpīhariḥ sākṣātparamātmaivedevatā || 7 ||

ādyaṃ vījamiti proktaṃ śaktiḥ śaktirūdīritāḥ |
paramātmānusaṃdhāne viniyoga udāhṛtaḥ || 8 ||

haṃsaṃ sohamiti prokto karayudhiṃ samācaret |
haṃsamityādi ṣaṭvīryavarṇairaṃguliṣunyaset || 9 ||

haṃsaḥ sohamiti proktvā sarvatrāhau samāhitaḥ |
sūryātmane hṛdinyasya pūrvadirghādimaṃ tathā || 10 ||

haṃsī somātmane mūdhinyasya haṃsamathoccaret || 11 ||

nisphalātmāśikhāyāsmānniraṃjanānmane tathā |
kavacaṃ nyasya haṃsai ca padaṃ brahmānmanetasaḥ || 12 ||

naitreścatanusūkṣmaradyā pravodhātmāstramisapi agnīṣā gurudvayaṃ praṇavakaṃ 
viṃdugnikoṇejvalaṃ bhākhadrudumukhaṃ śivāṃ |
primanulaṃ pārśvasya somānalaṃ vidyudbhāskarakoṭi sahaśaṃ haṃsajagadvāpinaṃ 
śabdabrahmatanuṃ hṛdaṃnujakuṭīnīḍesahāsaṃsmaret || 13 ||

śriyāvitkalayāyuktaṃ brahmanārāyaṇābhidhaṃ |
māheśvaraṃ paraṃdhāmasmarāmimanasāhṛdi || 14 ||

prāṇānāyamya gāyatryā pūrvasmin divaseplutaṃ |
devatābhyo japāvidyā japaṃ nityaṃ samarpayet || 15 ||

na vidyate japoyasyāḥ sā japā parikīrtitā |
vyomavījena jīvātmā somena parameguraḥ || 16 ||

nārāyaṇa paraṃbrahmasāstramasmīti saṃtataṃ |
jīvojapatyanudinaṃ parabrahmaibhyasiddhaye || 17 ||

nāsāpurādya ucchvāsocāyurgacchati vaivahiḥ |
japatyanudinaṃ haṃsahaṃsahaṃseti dvijapuṃgavāḥ || 18 ||

punardehaṃ praviśatiyoniḥ śvāsaḥ svarūpabhat |
japatyanukṣaṇasohaṃ sohamityevasaṃtataṃ || 19 ||

hakāreṇa parabrahmarūpī nārāyaṇaḥ pumān |
anaṃtatvāddhakārasya sakāreṇacidīritā || 20 ||

parāśaktistrapīrūpāśaktivījatayaiva hi |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇīmetāṃ vidyāṃ tasmānmaharṣayaḥ || 21 ||

<p. 44a>

prāhussakalavedāṃtasārabhūtāṃ vimuktidāṃ |
cinevedananvidhiṃ vakṣye japasyai tanmanordvijāḥ || 22 ||

 sudhāvījāhikācūrṇānpūrvamuccāryayantataḥ |
mūlādhārapardamaṃḍape caturdalaśabdataḥ || 23 ||

padmesthitāparaktādi varṇāpayadamuccaret |
gaṇeśāyamayāpaścātkṛtamityajapāpadaṃ || 24 ||

gāyatryāḥ ṣaṭśatapaścānnivedetyathayāmi ca |
vādilāṃta vījaṣaṭkaṃ samuccārya tataḥ paraṃ || 25 ||

svādiṣṭāna padaṃ paścāmaṃḍape ṣaḍadalaṃ padaṃ |
padmesthitāya hemādyavarṇāya brahmaṇe padaṃ || 26 ||

mayetyādi samuccārya ṣaṭsahasraṃ nivedayet |
gadiphāṃtān samuccārya maṇipūrakamaṃḍape || 27 ||

tato daśadalapadmesthitāya śrīmahāpadaṃ |
viṣṇavetha mayetpādi ṣaṭvahasraṃ nivedayet || 28 ||

kakārādikārāṃ navarṇadvādaśakaṃ tataḥ |
anāhatapadaṃ maṃḍape dvādaśadale tataḥ || 29 ||

padmesthitāya śuddhotmi sphaṭikādi padaṃ tataḥ |
varṇāpātha sadāpūrvaśivāyeti padātparaṃ || 30 ||

mayetyādi samuccārya ṣaṭsahasraṃ nivedayet |
svaraṣoḍaśakaṃ proktvā viśuddhābhidhamaṃḍale || 31 ||

ṣoḍaśādyadalepadyesthitāyendra parātparaṃ |
gopaketyathavarṇāya tato jīvātmane padaṃ || 32 ||

mayetyāyekasāhasraṃ japaṃ ca vinivedayet |
haṃ kṣaṃ bhrūmadhya ityuktvā ājñāmaṃḍapa ityatha || 33 ||

padaṃ dvidalapadmenvasthitāyeti padaṃ tataḥ |
vicitravarṇāya padaṃ paramātmana ityatha || 34 ||

mayetyadhika sāhasraṃ japaṃ tasmai nivedayet |
akārādi kṣakārāṃtānvarṇānuccārya yatnataḥ || 35 ||

haṃsaḥ sohaṃ brahmaraṃdhramaṃḍape padamuccaret |
sahasradalaśabdaṃnna tataḥ padmesthitādya ca || 36 ||

nānāvarṇāyaśabdaṃ ca tataḥ śrīgurave padaṃ |
nayetpādyeka sāhasraṃ japaṃ tasmai nivedayet || 37 ||

evaṃ samarpya bhūyopi prāṇānāyamya vāgyataḥ |
tithi vādādi saṃkalpyārabhyārkohyamapyatha || 38 ||

śvaḥ sūryodayaparyaṃta muktāhorātrayoḥ padaṃ |
ṣaṭśatāṣaṭśatādhikamutkaikaviṃśatiṃ proccaret padaṃ || 39 ||

sahasraṃ saṃkhyā kapadaṃ nāsāpuṭayadaṃ tataḥ |
ucchvā sanniśvāsāmyāmevātha jāgrat svapnapadaṃ tataḥ || 40 ||

suṣupsavasthāsvapi ca tamatojñānatastathā |
ajapādimagāyatrīṃ maṃtravākyamataḥ paraṃ || 41 ||

japaṃ kariṣya ityeva saṃkalpaṃ proccaret sadā |
eva mucchvā saniśvāsa japaṃ śrīparamātmane || 42 ||

samarpya kṛta kṛtyaḥ syāt siddho bhavati sādhakaḥ |
na vidyate japo yasyā vidyāpāparamātmanaḥ || 43 ||

sājayā procyate vidyāsadyaḥ siddhipradāyinī |
ahomaṃdadhiyo viprāḥ kāmamohavaśaṃgatāḥ || 44 ||

pṛthaivocchāpṛthaivocchvāsaniśvāsairdivasāninayaṃtihi |
ajayā maṃtrasārajñoyaṃ kiṃcidapi vā manuṃ || 45 ||

<p. 44b>

japtvā dine dine siddhimāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
haṃsavidyāmavijñāyayomaṃtrānna parā bhavet || 46 ||

na tasya jāpate siddhiḥ kalpakoṭi śatairapi |
vedā api purāṇāni dharmaśāstrāṇi saṃtataṃ || 47 ||

haṃsavidyā parijñānārtānyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
japtvā dvādaśasāhasraṃ caturvarṇamimaṃ manuṃ || 48 ||

ṣaṇmāsābhyaṃtare sākṣādbrahmapaśyati tatpadaṃ |
niyamoyaṃtīnāṃ syānnānyeṣāṃ samudīhṛtaḥ || 49 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityamaṣṭāviṃśatidhāpi vā |
ajayā manumuccārya gṛhasthassahpalau bhavet || 50 ||

anācārau śucirvāpi nityaṃ saṃkalpya yatnataḥ |
caturarṇamimaṃ maṃtraṃ saṃsmṛtya satataṃ śuciḥ || 51 ||

kasarābhyaṃtare sākṣādātmānaṃ brahmarūpiṇaṃ |
paśyatyevasva cakṣurbhyāṃ jarāmaraṇavarjitaṃ || 52 ||

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi mātṛkāṃ sarvasiddhidāṃ |
yasyāmanupalabdhāyāṃ maṃtrāḥ sarvevṛyaivahi || 53 ||

ṛṣirbrahmāsya maṃtrasya chaṃdo gāyatramīritaṃ |
śrīmātṛkā samākhyātā devatādeśikottamaṃ || 54 ||

aklī vahasvadīrghāṃtargataiḥ sarvevṛthaiva hi |
ṛṣirbrahmāsya maṃtrasya chaṃdogāyatramīritaṃ || 54 ||

śrīmātṛkā samākhyātā devatā ṣaḍvargakaiḥ |
kramāt ṣaṭgānyabhidheyānihvaṃgulīvapi saṃtataṃ || 55 ||

daśadhā mātṛkānyāsaṃ kuryātchakto bhavedyadi |
ṣaḍaṃgamātramapi vā kṛtvā vaśyaṃ japedimāṃ || 56 ||

paṃcāśallipibhirvibhaktamukhadoḥ parāmadhyavakṣasthalāṃ 
bhāsvanmaulinivaddhacaṃdraśakalāpāyīnatuṃgastanī |
mudrāmakṣamayīṃ sudhāhyakalaśaṃ vidyāṃ ca hastāṃvujairvibhrāṇāṃ 
viśadaprabhāṃ trinayanāṃ vāgdevatāmāśraye || 57  ||

svarāḥ ṣoḍaśapūrvesyuḥ sparśāḥ paṃcātha viṃśatiḥ |
yādikṣāṃtādaśoktāścarāka paṃcāśadakṣarā || 58 ||

śrīdevamātṛkā proktā viṃduyuktā sarasvatī |
japtavyā viṃdurahitā viṃduyuktāpi vā sasa || 59 ||

vedāḥ śāstrāṇi vijñānaṃ sāṃkhyayogādayastathā |
saptakoṭi mahāmaṃtrādharmaśāstrāṇyathāpi ca || 60 ||

śrīmātṛkā samudbhūtā vidyāsyarvāssanātanāḥ |
ajaptvā mātṛkā vidyāṃ yo manūna parān japet || 61 ||

japahomādikaṃ tasya koṭiśopi vṛthā bhavet |
kṣakārāṃte japāyaṃtraṃhaṃsatyuccaransadā || 62 ||

sohaṃ kṣamiti vai lomyānmātṛkārṇān samuccaret |
prajaptvānudinaṃ maṃtrān puraścaraṇapuṇyabhāk || 63 ||

akārādi kṣakārāṃtamātṛkāviṃduṃ saṃyutāṃ |
yojayennityamekāgraḥ sa eva parameśvaraḥ || 64 ||

mātṛtvāt sarvavidyānāṃ mātṛkā śrīrudiritā |
haṃsarūpī hariḥ sākṣātparamātmāśriyaḥ patiḥ || 64 ||

<p. 45a>

śrīrmātṛkā samuditācitkalāparadevatā |
samarpya pūrvamajayāṃ saṃkalpyāpi tataḥ paraṃ || 65 ||

śrīmātṛkāmahāvidyāmaṣṭottaraśataṃ japet |
phalaṃ sakalavidyānāṃpārago jīvavadbhavet || 66 ||

sakṛcchravaṇamātreṇagnahedveda catuṣṭayaṃ || 68 ||

āśrutānāṃ ca śāstrāṇāṃ vyākhyāttāvatsarād bhavet |	
itihāsapurāṇānāṃ sārajño bhavati dhruvaṃ || 69 ||

saptakoṭi mahāmaṃtrā api mūrtidharāssadā |
dṛśyaṃte vatsarādūrdhvaṃ prasannāvaradā api || 70 ||

acalāmahatīlakṣmīrjāyate tasya maṃdire |
tasya hastastu na sparśāt sākṣātmūkopi vatsarān || 71 ||

pāragassarvavidyānāṃ bhavatyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
tadṛṣṭi kṛṣṭo bhavati nidhissahalasaṃpadāṃ || 72 ||

svānvayaṃ narakasthaṃ ca samuddhṛtya tataḥ paraṃ |
divyaṃ vimānamāruptya vaikuṃṭho nivasatyasau || 73 ||

triśataṃ yojayennityaṃ paṃcāśadvarṇamātṛkāṃ |
sarvajñatvaṃ manojñatvaṃ brahmarṣitvamanuttamaṃ || 74 ||

siddhatvaṃ vā maratvaṃ vā kāmarūpatvamakṣayaṃ |
varṣādvarṣadvayādvāpi labhate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 75 ||

akārādi kṣakārāṃtairviṃdumanmātṛkākṣaraiḥ |
anulomavilomasthaiḥ kḷptayā varṇamālayā || 76 ||

pratyekavarṇayugmaṃ yā japātsyuḥ sarvasiddhidāḥ |
vairimaṃtrā api nṛṇāmanyemaṃtrāśca kiṃ punaḥ || 77 ||

samastanyāsasahitaśrīmaddaṣṭārṇajāyakaḥ |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhānityaṃdaśadvādaśadhāpi vā || 78 ||

paṃcadhā vā tridhā vāpi mātṛkāmanvahaṃ japet |
avaśyaṃ mahatī siddhiṃ prāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ || 79 ||

dvādaśārṇānusaṃdhānaṃ gāyātryā vahuśojapaḥ |
nyāsajāla samāyukta śrīmaddaṣṭārṇaciṃtanaṃ || 80 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoja śuśrūṣā ca dine dine |
śrīmātṛkānusaṃdhānālasthatapasaḥ phalaṃ || 81 ||

tyajet sakalavedāṃśca tyajedapi mahāmanūn |
tyajet sakaladharmāṃśca na tyajen mātṛkā parāṃ || 82 ||

ajapākhyānusaṃdhānaṃ vidyā śrīmātṛkāparā |
labhyaṃte yasya vaktrābjāt prāṇāṃtepinataṃ tyajet || 83 ||

vedeṣvaṃ targatā maṃtrāḥ paurāṇāstāṃtrikā api |
ācāryavadanāṃbhojāllabdhasti saphalāḥ smṛtāḥ || 84 ||

asādhāraṇa sāmarthyaṃ maṃtrāṇāṃ bhuvanatraye |
gururyadittayaḥ siddhastasya vidyāśusiddhyati || 85 ||

śrīrāmarāmeti manuṃ sarvejāmaṃtibhūtale |
dehatyādāvatāṃ kāśyāṃ gurorīśasya vaktrataḥ || 86 ||

saṃprāptau parāṃmuktiṃ kīṭasyāpi prayacchati |
vālmīkirvipramātro saukiṇāṃtastrī samāgamāt || 87 ||

svarṇasteyādibhirapi pratilobhūnmahītale |
anugrahānmaharṣīṇāṃ dhanyastaṃ rāmanāma ca || 88 ||

<p. 45b>

adhītya japataḥ paścādbrahmarṣīṇāṃ ca yogināṃ |
prāptavānagragaṇyattvaṃ brahmādyairapi pūjyatāṃ || 89 ||

tasmādyadi tapaḥ siddha ācāryo jāyate dvijāḥ |
sadyaḥ siddho bhavecchiṣyaḥ sākṣādbrahmāpi paśyati || 90 ||

vedādhyayana vānnityaṃ trapyaṃtādhyapatterataḥ |
sahasrakṛtvo gāyatrī japakartā dine dine || 91 ||

vedasāramahāvidyājapavānapi saṃtataṃ |
īdṛśaḥ sadgururyeṣāṃ bhavatyatra dvijanmanāṃ || 92 ||

bhāṣāracitamaṃtropi teṣāṃ siddhiṃ prayacchati |
niṃdaṃ tu vāṃdhavāssarvetyajyaṃ tu strīsutādayaḥ || 94 ||

anāhasaṃtumāṃdṛṣṭvā rājānodaṃḍayaṃ tu vā |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojadvayameva gatirmama || 95 ||

ācāryameva satataṃ vrajāmiśaraṇaṃ vibhu |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoja dvayānnānyagatirnama || 96 ||

ityācārya padāṃbhoje yasya bhaktiḥ suniścalā |
sasaṃtarati saṃsāraṃ muktimuktiṃ ca viṃdati || 97 ||

janāstuvaṃtukutsuṃ tu lakṣmīstiṣṭhatu gacchatu |
mṛtiradyayugāṃtesyādācāryaṃ parityajet || 98 ||

tyajet svapitaraṃ nityaṃ mātaraṃ vāpi suvratāṃ |
putrānphaleṃnnaṃ bhrātṛṃśca vedāṃtāṃśca śrutīstathā || 99 ||

etaccharīrapātāṃtethācāryaṃ natyajedbudhaḥ |
mātṛkāṃ yo nagṛhṇati mātṛkāṃ na dadātiyaḥ || 100 ||

nāvubhau devatāśāyabhāginau nātra saṃśayaḥ 
mātṛkājapataḥ puṃsaḥ pratyahaṃ niyatātmanaḥ || 1 ||

sāgāśca caturovedā anadhīnā api sphuṭaṃ |
tasya vaktrāṃvujādbhāṃti sakalyāssarahasyakāḥ || 2 ||

anadhītāni śāstrāṇi purāṇānyapi bhāṃti ca |
tasmādācāryakāruṇyānmātṛkāṃ prāpya sādhakaḥ || 3 ||

daśadhā paṃcadhā vāpi prajaptvānyānmūnūnjapet |
anāvāsena saṃsiddhiṃ labhate mahatīṃ parāṃ || 4 ||

ajapā mātṛkāvidyānaṃ pātakāyahaṃ |
jānakīpatinā proktaṃ mayāpi samudīritaṃ || 5 ||

anuttara brahmatatvarahasye śrutisaṃgrahe |
iti dāśarathīye yesmin taṃtre dhyāyaścaturdaśaḥ || 6 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
caturdaśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 46a>

ṛṣaya ūcuḥ 

ṛṣyaśṛṃgamahābhāgasarvajñamunisattama |
asmābhirbrahmavidyāyāmāhātmyaṃ tvanmukhācchrutaṃ || 1 ||

sāvitrāṣṭākṣarādīnāṃ śrutaṃ māhātmya mapyatha |
vedavedāṃtaśāstraughasārabhūtārthasaṃgrahāt || 2 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarītyuktā samastaphalasiddhidā |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī vidyāmāhātmyaṃ saṃgamādarāt || 3 ||

bhagavankaruṇāṃbhodhe brahmasmākaṃ mahāmate |

śrīṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca 

śṛṇudhvaṃ brāhmaṇāśreṣṭhāssarvajñādīrghadarśinaḥ || 4 ||

yataddāśarathiḥ māharudrāya paripṛcchate 

śrīmaheśvara uvāca 

bhagavandevadeveśa jānakīvallabhaprabho || 5 ||

caturṇāmapi vedānāṃ trayāṇāṃ jagatāmapi |
śrīmaṣṭākṣarīvidyāmūlahe turitīritā || 6 ||

kicaikajanmanyevātra narāṇāmalyacetasāṃ |
saṃsārābhodhitaraṇaṃ brahmajñānamathājñayaṃ || 7 ||

brahmānaṃdābhidhāmuktirdarśanaṃ syācchriyaḥpateḥ |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃvānyāṃ vidyāṃ kathayame prabhe || 8 ||

iti rudreṇa saṃpṛṣṭo bhagavānjānakīpatiḥ |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ kathayāmāsatatvataḥ || 9 ||

śrīrāma uvāca 

śṛṇu śaṃkara vakṣyāmi yanmāṃ tvaṃ paripṛcchasi |
purā vaidehanagare janakāya mahātmane || 10 ||

anugrahāya lokānāṃmayānārāyaṇātmanā |
śrīmaddaṣṭārṇa māhātmyaṃ yaduktaṃ tacchṛṇu prabho || 11 ||

śrībhagavānuvāca 

samastavedavedāṃtasārabhūtaṃ sanātanaṃ |
śrīmaddaṣṭarṇā māhātmyaṃ tvayāpṛṣṭaṃ pravakṣyate || 12 ||

śṛṇu rājanmahīpāla sarvabhāgyasamṛddhidāṃ |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ brahmadarśanasiddhāṃ || 13 ||

yattadavyaktamāghaṃtarahita brahmanirmalaṃ |
nirguṇaṃ nirvikāraṃvattamaḥ pārepratiṣṭhitaṃ || 14 ||

satyānaṃdamayaṃ śuddhaṃ jyotirekaṃ parātparaṃ |
tadeva puruṣākāramabhūnnārāyaṇātmakaṃ || 15 ||

<p. 46b>

samahāpuruṣo bhūtvā devo nārāyaṇābhidhaḥ |
svāminnacitsamāyukto jagatsargemanodadhe || 16 ||

sṛṣṭvā purādaupūrṇa paramātmanjagatpate |
bhavāndraṣṭuṃ kathaṃ śakya āvābhyāṃ jagatīpate || 19 ||

kathaṃ bhavanmayatvaṃ naubhavedbrahmarasātmakaṃ |
brahmāṇamimaṃ vācāṃ patiṃ prabhuṃ anaṃtaraṃ || 20 ||

mahārudraṃṣṭaṣṭavānparameśvaraṃ || 17 ||

anaṃtakoṭi savitṛtejasaṃtataṃ jagatpatiṃ |
aśaktautau vibhuṃ draṣṭaṃ brahmarudrānatho catu || 18 ||

sarvajñakaruṇā kaṇāpūrṇanetrastvaṃ vadāvābhyāṃ maheśvaraḥ || 20 ||

śrībhagavānuvāca 

ahaṃ nārāyaṇonāmnā mahāpuruṣa īśvaraḥ | 
paramātmāparabrahmasacidānaṃdalakṣaṇaḥ || 21 ||

vedajālamidaṃ mamavaktrāddhiniḥ sṛtaṃ |
etadgṛhītvā satataṃ kurutāṃ sargamuttamaṃ || 22 ||

varṇātmakohaṃ vedātmāmaṃtramūrtissanātanaḥ |
acyutohamānaṃ tohaṃ śivohaṃ śaṃkarosmyahaṃ || 23 ||

kiṃ vānyat saṃpravakṣyāmi sārabhūtaṃ śrutiṣvapi |
rahasyaṃ paramaṃ guptaṃ navācyamapi kutracit || 24 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīnāmavidyāmamasugopitā |
kṛtvā tadanusaṃdhānaṃ sadātmānau viṣpattaḥ || 25 ||

asādhāraṇa sāmarthaṃ śrīraṣṭaguṇasaṃyutā |
jarāmṛtyuvihīnatvaṃ yuvayossidhyati dhruvaṃ || 26 ||

etadanyacca sakalamupadiśya jagatpatiḥ |
nārāyaṇo mahāyogīvabhūvāṃtarhito nṛpa || 27 ||

tasmādaṣṭākṣarātmāyaṃ śrīpatirbhagavānahaṃ |
bhūtānāmaṃtarānmāhaṃ paramātmāsanātanaḥ || 28 ||

māmeva paraṃbrahmavidhi nityaṃ sanātanaṃ |
aṇoraṇīyānmahatomahīpānasmyahaṃ nṛpa || 29 ||

saṃsāratārakaścāhamācāryohaṃ purātanaḥ |
yadādityagataṃ jyotissarvalokaprakāśakaṃ || 30 ||

jātavedasivaṃdre ca tattejoviddhimātmakaṃ |
ahaṃ vaiśvānaro bhūtvā śarīre prāṇināṃ sthitaḥ || 31 ||

prāṇāpānayutonityaṃ yacāmpannaṃ caturvidhaṃ |
prajāpatīnāṃ brahmāhaṃ rudrāṇāṃ śaṃkarosmyahaṃ || 32 ||

ādityānāmahaṃ viṣṇurvasūnām. pāvakosmyahaṃ |
amarāṇāṃ maheṃdrosmivitteśo yakṣarakṣasāṃ || 33 ||

<p. 47a>

phaladaḥ puṇyapāpānāṃ kālātmāhaṃ sanātanaḥ |
sṛjāminikhilaṃ viśvaṃ saṃharāmi punaḥ punaḥ || 34 ||

pālayāmyakhilaṃ viśvemaṣṭārṇātmāhamavyayaḥ | 
yajñeśoṃyajñabhoktāsmivedanārāyaṇosmyahaṃ || 35 ||

sādhyanārāyaṇaścāhaṃ vadarīvanamadhyagaḥ |
yajñanārāyaṇaścāsmi sarvayajña phalapradaḥ || 36 ||

caturṇāmapi vedānāṃ sārabhūtāṃ sanātanīṃ |
samastanyāsasahitāmaṣṭārṇāṃviddhimāṃ nṛpa || 37 ||

praṇavātmāsmivedādiryatīnāṃ muktisiddhidaḥ |
akṣarāṇāmakārātmāvaruṇoyāṃyatistathā || 38 ||

ādityānāmahaṃtrissavitāsmijagatpatīḥ |
jīvātmā sarvabhutānāmahameva mahīpate || 39 ||

jñāneṃdriyāṇāṃ cittātmā cakṣurātmā ca karmasu |
digīśo lokapālātmā śrīmadaṣṭākṣarosmyahaṃ || 40 ||

stamastavedasārārthamaṃtrohaṃ trijagatpatiḥ |
vedasāra mahāmaṃtraḥ śrīmānaṣṭākṣaraḥ smṛtaḥ || 41 ||

śrutisāramahāvidyāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ śubhāṃ |
ācāryavadanāllabdhāye japaṃti dine dine || 42 ||

te dhanyāḥ kṛtakṛtyāścata eva bhagavatpriyā |
ācāryaṃ māṃ vijānīhi maṃtramūrtidharāṃ vibhuṃ || 43 ||

samastanyā sa sahitāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ śubhāṃ |
bhagavadraśmi vidyābhissahitāṃ sarahasyakāṃ || 44 ||

yo dadāti tamācāryaṃ viddhi māmeva bhūpate |
vedasāramahāvidyātrayameva mahīpate || 45 ||

prāṇāṃ vo vedamātā ca śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī parā |
anyesaṃpuṭitā maṃtrāvetthaṃ sarvaphalapradāḥ || 46 ||

vījairmaṃtrāṃtarairvāpimmaṃ trāssaṃpuṭitāḥ pare |
iṣṭasiddhipradāḥ proktā na cānye saṃpuṭī kṛtāḥ || 47 ||

ekameva mahadvījaṃ praṇavākhyaṃ sanātanaṃ |
asaṃpuṭitanevedaṃyatīnāṃ muktisiddhidaṃ || 48 ||

vyāhṛti trayasaṃyuktā caturviṃśākṣarī śubhā |
gāyatrī sarvavedānīmātā sakalasiddhidā || 49 ||

śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīvedasārabhūtā sanātanī |
svabhāva praṇavāghaiva mahāsiddhipradā smṛtā || 50 ||

<p. 47b>

aṣṭākṣarī saṃpuṭitā vījairmaṃtrāṃtadairyadi |
tāvanmātraphalaṃdātuṃśaknoti na mahatphalaṃ || 51 ||

miśritaṃ mākṣikaṃ yadvatsvarasaṃ na dadātihi |
miśritāṣṭākṣarī vidyā svasāmarthyaṃ nayacchati || 52 ||

śuddhaivāṣṭākṣīrī japyā śreyaskāmena saṃtataṃ |
śuddhaivāṣṭākṣarī vidyāsvācāryavadanāṃvujāt || 53 ||

icchatā mahatīṃ siddhiṃ śreyaḥ paramamakṣayaṃ |
sarvavedamayī sarvavedāṃtārthasvarūpiṇī || 54 ||

sarvadharmamayī sarvadharmaśāstrasvarūpiṇī |
sarvayogamayī sarvasāṃkhyavedāṃtarūpiṇī || 55 ||

sarvatīrthamayī sarvajñānarūpāyaśaskarī |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarī vidyānānyāvidyedaśīnṛpa || 56 ||

samastasaṃpatsāmājyahetubhūtā sanātanī |
samastabhogadā sarvavidyāsiddhipradāyinī || 57 ||

sarvasaṃpatkarī sarvamahālakṣmī smṛddhidā |
samastamuktāratnaughavarṣiṇī bhaktamaṃdire || 58 ||

brahmānaṃdarasākāramuktisāmrājyahetukī |
jatṛṇāṃ rūpasaubhāgya samastaiśvaryasiddhidā || 59 ||

sarvapātakasaṃhartrī sarvatīrthaphalapradā |
samastarogasaṃhartrī sarvaduḥkhaprabhaṃjanī || 60 ||

janmamṛtyujarārogahārīṇīśokahāriṇī |
sarvopadravasaṃhartrī mahādādivyabhaṃjanī || 61 ||

etayā sadṛśī viṣāvidyatenādhikāpi ca |
samastaśreyasāṃrāśirmahāsalakṣmīracaṃlā || 62 ||

sidhyaṃti siddhayaḥ sarvāḥ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī japāt |
aśvamedhādiyāgānāṃ phalamicchan dine dine || 63 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ japedyāgahpalāptaye |
tulāpuruṣadānādiphalamicchan dine dine || 64 ||

yathā śaktyādhanaṃdadyādācāryacaraṇāṃvuje |
caturṇāmapi vedānāṃ pārāyaṇa phaleptunā || 65 ||

śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīvidyā japtavyānyāsa saṃyutā |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīviyā japakarturathānvahaṃ || 66 ||

carācaraṃmidaṃ viśvaṃ dṛśyate dehasaṃsthitaṃ |
samastanyāsasahitaśrīmadṛṣṭākṣarī japāt || 
yaśetiṣṭhaṃti śakrādyādikpālāḥ kiṃ karā iva || 67 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
paṃcadaśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 48a>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

purāsāṃkhyāyanoyogīmaharṣistapasāṃ nidhiḥ |
saṃcaransakalānlokānbhāskarāyutasannibhaḥ || 1 ||

jvalaṃtaṃ divyapuṣaṃ brahmarṣibhiraṣṭitaṃ |
mūrtimadbhiścaturvedaiḥścaturddikṣusamanvitaṃ || 2 ||

svāhākārasvadhākāra vaṣaṭkāraissamūrtibhiḥ || 3 ||

mūrtimatpraṇavenāpidīpyamānaṃ svatejasā |
dadarśayajñapuruṣaṃ maṃtramūrtidharaṃ vibhuṃ || ||

vāmāṃkasthitayā devyā cidrūpiṇyā śriyānvitaṃ |
satyaloke divyaratne mahāsiṃhāsanesthitaṃ || ||

dṛṣṭvāsau vismito bhūtvā sāṣṭāṃgaṃ praṇanāmaha |
praṇamya punarutthā dṛṣṭvā tasyasmitānane || ||

śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃvidyāṃ jihvāyāṃ pradadarśaha || 5 ||

tataḥ keśavakīrtyādinyāsānapi caturdaśa |
āpādamastake tasya dṛṣṭvāsau vismito bhavat || 6 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇa māhātmyapratipādana tatparān |
dadarśa caturovedān dīvyamānāt svatejasā || 7 ||

nimīlyanetre sahasā punarnatvā kṛtāṃjaliḥ |
uvāca yajña puruṣaṃ nārāyaṇamanāmayaṃ || 8 ||

sāṃkhyāya na uvāca 

parātpara jagannātha bhagavat parameśvara |
tvāṃ matye sarvalokānāṃ kartāraṃ sthitikārakaṃ || 9 ||

athāṃtakāle saṃhārakartāraṃ jagataḥ prabhuṃ |
tathāpīyaṃ mahāmāyāmāṃ yohayati satataṃ || 10 ||

kastvaṃ varṇamayo maṃtramūrtistejomayaḥ pumān |
kemīsvaṃtejasādīptā vidyāmahātmyasūcakāḥ || 11 ||

bhavataḥ sannisannidhau nityaṃ kathaṃ sthāsyāmyahaṃ vibho |
kasyopāsamayānityaṃ tvāṃ paśyāmyagrataḥ sthitaṃ || 12 ||

etanmevada tatvena bhagavatparameśvara |

śrīyajñapuruṣa uvāca 

saṃkhyāya na mahābhāgaṃ yatvaṃ māṃ pṛṣṭavānasi || 13 ||

tadahaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi samāhitamanābhava |
śrīmaddaṣṭārṇamaṃtrātmālokānāmīśvaromyahaṃ || 14 ||

<p. 48b>

samastavaiderījyohamasmiyajñayumānmune |
nārāyaṇaḥ paraṃbrahmaparamātmāhamīśvaraḥ || 15 ||

ime keśavakīrtyādinyāsā avayavā mama 
mamavāca ime vedājagatsargādihetavaḥ || 16 ||

ime brahmarṣayaḥ siddhāḥ śrīmadaṣṭārṇaciṃtakāḥ |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojadvaṃdvārcanarattāssadā || 17 ||

ime divyagṛhāḥ pūrṇādhanairmāṇikyarāśibhiḥ |
divyakanyā sahasraśca kāmadhenubhiranvitāḥ || 18 ||

śrīmaddaṣṭārṇa japtatṛṇāmetedivyagṛhāmune |
ciṃtāmaṇiḥ kalpataruḥ kāmadhenuḥ sudhārasaḥ || 19 ||

śrīmaddaṣṭārṇa japtṛṇāṃ bhūtalepi na durlabhāḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyānyāsa pūrvādinedine || 20 ||

prajaptavyānyathā japtātāvanmātraphalapradā |
nyāsahīnāmimāṃ vidyāṃ yo dadāti vimūrḍhyāḥ || 21 ||

yo gṛhṇātyapimaṃdātmātāvettau narakālayau |
pūrvaṃ nyāsairvirahitāṃ gṛhītvāpi mahāmate || 22 ||

nyāsaissahopadeśārthamanyamācāryamāśrayet |
bhagavadraśmi vidyānāṃ pāraṃgatamakalmaṣaṃ || 23 ||

śrīmaddaṣṭārṇaṃvidyāyārahasyajñāṃ jiteṃdriyaṃ |
bahuyojanasāhasramapi gatvā śrayedguruṃ || 24 ||

rājñāṃ vaullaṃghaye tasya prāṇaiḥ kaṃṭhagatairapi |
pitāmātā tathā bhrātā caturveda pradopi vā || 25 ||

bhagavadraśmividhānāmupadeṣṭa samānahī |
yattadbrahmaparaṃ jyotiśrīṃmaddaṣṭākṣarātmakaṃ || 26 ||

akhaṃḍānaṃdamadvaṃdvaṃ prakṛteḥ parataḥ sthitaṃ |
tadeva sūkṣmaparamaṃ sthūlaṃ cāpi sadeva hi || 27 ||

tadātmā yajñapuruṣa āghonārāyaṇosmyahaṃ |
ādyaṃ trayīmayīvījaṃ praṇavākhyaṃ samātanaṃ || 28 ||

tadeva mokṣa śrīvījaṃ śrīvījaṃ catuducyate |
acoyajūṃṣi sāmānisāhi śrīramṛtāsatāṃ || 29 ||

iti madvadanodbhūtā vedā api vaddaṃti hi |
akṣarāṇāmakārosau prathamaḥ parikīrtitaḥ || 30 ||

ādyatvāt sarvavarṇānāmakarātmāśriyaḥ patiḥ |
ādyonārāyaṇaḥ sākṣādakāreṇocyase mune || 31 ||

<p. 49a>

ukārarūpiṇī lakṣmīścicchaktiḥ śrīrudīritā |
iyaṃ trayīmayī nityā mama vāmāṃkasaṃścitā || 32 ||

makāreṇāvayordāso jīvoyaṃ kathyate budhyaiḥ |
tasmāt praṇava vācyaṃ yallakṣmīnārāyaṇāṃ || 33 ||

matsvarūpapradaṃ viddhi jīvasyeha śarīriṇaḥ |
praṇavākhyamidaṃ vījaṃ śrīvījamiti kathyate || 34 ||

praṇavena parabrahmarūpī nārāyaṇo vibhuḥ |
aviprairapijapyāḥ syurmaṃtrāḥ praṇavavarjitāḥ || 35 ||

kiṃcitphalapradā eva maṃtrāḥ praṇavavarjitāḥ |
avaśyaṃ brāhmaṇairjapyā nikṣipta praṇavā api || 36 ||

svabhāvavedavījādyā vidyā kutrāpi naśrutā |
iyamaṣṭākṣarīvidyā svābhāvapraṇavādikā || 37 ||

tasmāde tatsamāvidyānādhikāpi ca vidyate |
muktilakṣmī vījabhūtājñānalakṣmī phalapradā || 38 ||

sarvaṃvidyāvījabhūtāśrimaddaṣṭākṣarī parā |
aṃte nārāyaṇapadaṃ caturthyaṃta samanvitaṃ || 39 ||

cidātmakaṃ paraṃbrahma tadeva praṇavātmakaṃ |
praṇavena paraṃbrahmaśrīrapyuktā mahāmune || 40 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇīnāmnāsārabhūtā śrutiṣvapi |
iyaṃ samastavidyānāṃ vījabhūtāparāsmṛtā || 41 ||

namaskāreṇa jīvasyadā satvaṃ pratipādyate |
nārāyaṇaivyaṃ jīvasya kathyate namasāmune || 43 ||

nārāyaṇapadāvedānārāyaṇaparāmakhāḥ |
nārāyaṇapadaṃ dānaṃ nārāyaṇaparaṃtapaḥ || 43 ||

nārāyaṇaḥ paraṃbrahmatatvaṃ nārāyaṇaḥ paraḥ |
nārāyaṇaḥ paraṃjyotirātmānārāyaṇaḥ paraḥ || 44 ||

nārāyaṇeti mantrāmasmaraṇaṃ vā dine dine |
japtṛṇāṃ brahmahatyādi mahāpātakanāśanaṃ || 45 ||

kimutākhilavedāṃtasārabhūtā sanātanī |
vidhānāsayaṇāvarṇāvarṇituṃ naiva śakyate || 46 ||

ekena janmanā pūrvajāti smareṇamuttamaṃ |
aṇimādi guṇaiśvaryaṃ brahmajñānamakalmaṣaṃ || 47 ||

icchatā saṃprajaptavyā śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīśubhā |
etesādhyāstayāssiddhā ācāryacaraṇārcakaḥ || 48 ||

<p. 49b>

śrīmadṛṣṭākṣarīṃvidyāṃ japtvāmanyadamāśritāḥ |
etemadvadanīdbhūtā vedāssāṃgāssanātanāḥ || 49 || 

paripṛcchasvacaturovedāṃtetānmahāmate |
athattecaturovedāmūrtimaṃto mahāmatiṃ || 50 ||

ūcuḥ sāṃkhyāyanaṃ brahmatanayaṃ vītamatsaraṃ |

vedā ūcuḥ 

sāṃkhyāyana mahābhāgavākyamasmākamādarāt || 51 ||

 śṛṇuṣvayetabhagavatyadaṃ paramāśyasi 
ayaṃ samastajagatāmādyo nārāyaṇocyutaḥ || 52 ||

etasyabhāsakaralaṃvibhātīraṃ jaganmune |
aṇoraṇīyānmahatomahīyānahamīśvaraḥ || 53 ||

saguṇonirguṇaścāyamanaṃto jagadaṃtakaḥ |
maṃtramūrtirayaṃ sākṣātparamātmā sanātanaḥ || 55 ||

aṣṭākṣarātmābhagavānnyāsāvayava saṃyutaḥ |
hitāya sarvajagatāṃ svasvarūpopa labdhaye || 55 ||

sṛṣṭāvayamenādauyairakṣmābhiridaṃ jagat |
asmābhiḥ kathyate yadyatatkartavyaṃ dvijottamaiḥ || 56 ||

nityaṃ naimittikaṃ kāmyaṃ karmatrividhamucyate |
trividhaṃ karmakartavyaṃ brāhmaṇaiḥ pratyahaṃ mune || 57 ||

kartavyāḥ sakalāyāgāssamagravaradakṣiṇāḥ |
dātavyaṃ sakalaṃ dānamihāmutraphalāptaye || 58 ||

japtavyāssakalāvidyāmahatīṃ siddhimīpsubhiḥ |
asmābhirapi yadguptaṃ tadvakṣyā mokṣasāṃprataṃ || 59 ||

ye yamaṣṭākṣarīvidyā śrīmannārāyaṇīparā |
sarvavidyāmayīṃ viddhitāmeva paramāṃmune || 60 ||

amauvaraśmayo devābhagavattejasaḥ kalāḥ |
tadraśmi vidyāsahitāye yaṣṭākṣarī śubhā || 61 ||

ācāryakaruṇālabdhā japtāḥ sarvaphalapradāḥ |
api prāṇaiḥ kaṃṭhavātairnavaktavyādurātmane || 62 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojācchāstratopi dine dine |
vidyārahasyaṃ vijñeyaṃ japtavyāṣṭākṣarī śubhā || 63 ||

dine dine mṛtyulokaṃ yāṃti bhūtāni bhūtale |
bhūyopi janmasaṃprāpyamajjaṃti narakārṇave || 64 ||

janmamṛtyujarāroganivṛttirnāstyapi kvacit |
saṃsārasāgaraṃ tartuṃ janmamṛtyu jarā api || 65 ||

<p. 50a>

sarahasyā prajjaptavyā śrīmaṣṭākṣarī śubhā |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīvidyā yena nityaṃ prajapyatte || 66 ||

janakaḥ kṛttakṛtyosya jananībhāgyasaṃyutāḥ |
muktā asya na saṃdehāḥ pitaropi pitāmahāḥ || 67 ||

tadvaṃśyā api sarvesyurmahāsukṛtasaṃyutāḥ |
pāvanā api tanmitra vāṃdhayājñātayastathā|| 68 ||

 śrīmaddaṣṭārṇamāhātmyaṃsāṃkhyāya na mahāmate |
bhagavāneva jānāti nānyo jānāti tatvataḥ || 69 ||

ihāpi kāmacukvalyataruściṃtāmaṇirgṛhe |
śakrādyā aṣṭakikpālāḥ kaikaryaṃ prāpnuvaṃtyapi || 70 ||

tiṣṭhaṃti sannidhau tasyaniyassaṃpadālayāḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā japahomādibhirmune || 71 ||

asādhyamapidevānāmapi dvīpāṃtarasthitaṃ |
vāṃchitaṃ samavāpnoti yogināmapidurlabhaṃ || 72 ||

śarīraṃ satataṃ janmajarāmṛtyusamanvitaṃ |
malamūtrāttayaṃ māṃsamajjāmedosthisaṃyutaṃ || 73 ||

netrayoḥ karṇayorjihvāddaṃtanāsāpuṭeṣu ca |
sravatyeva divārātraṃ durgaṃdhimalamevahi || 73 ||

apānasaṃsthito vāyurapi durgaṃdhi saṃyutaḥ |
yadvastu jihvayāyuktaṃ tatsarvaṃ dehamadhyagaṃ || 74 ||

jaṭakhehnināpakvaṃ malamevahāmate |
sadyomuktaṃ vastujātamapyudgīrṇaṃ punarmukhāt || 75 ||

malādapyadhikaṃ heyaṃ sadyo bhavati bhūtale |
upastheṃdriyatomūtraṃ srakameva divāniśaṃ || 76 ||

kakṣapradeśātkhedopi durgāṃdhassaṃprajāyate |
saṃtānakāraṇaṃ vījamapi durgaṃdhi satataṃ || 77 ||

pārthivaṃ naśvaraṃ heyamaśucīdaṃkalevaraṃ |
atra krodhaśca kāmaścarāgadveṣādayoguṇāḥ || 78 ||

taissaṃvṛtosau duṣṭātmāratopi varayoniṣu |
khastrīyoniṣucāsaktaḥ kāmīparvadine api || 79 ||

māsatrayaṃ mātṛgarbhe malamūtrādisaṃkule |
anubhūyamahaduḥkhaṃ mātṛyone vinirgataḥ || 80 ||

matkuṇairmaśakādyaiścapīḍyate harahomune |
sasataṃ malamūtrādyaipīḍitaḥ kṣudhayānvitaḥ || 81 ||

<p. 50b>

upanītaṃ gururgehetacchikṣāsahitovasan |
yauvane viṣayāsakto dhanārjanarataḥ sadā || 82 ||

vārdhikye kaphavātadyaiḥ pīḍitaḥ kṣudhayānvitaḥ |
bhavattītthaṃ mahārājaḥ prākṛtopi narassadā || 83 ||

vālyenāyurgataṃ kiṃcidviṣayairapi nirgataṃ |
nidrayāyadṛtaṃ kiṃ cidāyurvyādhimirapyathā || 84 ||

kiṃcidāyurbhojanādyaiḥ kiṃcidarthārjanādibhiḥ |
ālasyena ca vṛddhatve kiṃcidāyurgataṃ mune || 85 ||

tatto mṛtyussamāyāti vidhvāne tu mimaṃjanaṃ |
vaddhau sau kālapāśena dharmarājasya kiṃkaraiḥ || 86 ||

bhuṃkte ciraṃ mahaduḥkhaṃ magnausau narakārṇave |
atha pātakaśeṣeṇa punarbhūtatmamāgataḥ || 87 ||

viṣṭāsukṛmijanmādi saṃprāpyamaśakādiṣu |
saṃprāpyaśvāna janmādijñataścaṃḍālayoniṣu || 88 ||

śūdrayoniṃ tataḥ prāpyakramātkṣatriyavaiśyayoḥ |
puṇyaśeṣeṇaviprāṇāṃkule jāto bhavenmune || 89 ||

yadi tatra mahatpuṇyaṃ karoti śruticoditaṃ |
tadā svargasukhaṃ bhuṃkte punarbhūmau ca jāyate || 90 ||

janmamṛtyu samāyogādviṣamiśrānnavatsudā |
svargasaukhyaṃ duḥkhamiśraṃ duḥkhameva samīrītaṃ || 91 ||

tasmādavaśyamācāryaṃ sarvajñaṃ vedapāragaṃ |
piśarjitamapi dravyamathavā prapitāmahaiḥ || 92 ||

svakarārjitaṃ vittaṃ ca sarvamācāryapādayoḥ |
svaprāṇānapi datvāsmaiciraṃ śuśrūṣaṇorataḥ || 93 ||

vahuyojanasāhasramapi gatvā mahāmate |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojayugalaṃ kalmaṣāpahaṃ || 94 ||

saṃsevya vahuvarṣaṃ vā dehaprāṇadhanairapi |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ bhagavadraśmipūrvikāṃ || 95 ||

gṛhītvānyāsasahitāṃ kṛtārthassyānmahītale |
ācāryapādayugale śuśrūṣaṇaratttassadā || 96 ||

śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃvidyāṃ japtvaikenaiva janmanā |
avaśyaṃ paramaṃdhāma punarāvṛttivarjitaṃ || 97 ||

etaccharīrapātīte saṃprāpnoti na saṃśayaḥ |
na vidyāmātradāne namahānācārya ucyate || 98 ||

<p. 51a>

nyāsamātrapradānenādvānapūjāmaṃtradānataḥ |
anyatra vidyānyāsādīngṛhītvāpi mahāmate || 99 ||

sarvajñaṃ vedaviduṣamapi śāstrārthapāragaṃ |
vahuyojanasāhasramapi gatvā mahāmate || 100 ||

ācāryaṃ varayedanyaṃ sāṃgavidyārthamādarāt |
śubhedine śubhelagne caṃdratārāvalānvite || 1 ||

māghaphālgunavaiśākhaśrāvaṇāśvinakeṣu ca |
kārtikemārgaśīrṣe vā dehaprāṇadhanairapi || 2 ||

saṃtoṣya tasya patnīṃ ca putrapautrādikānapi |
gṛhṇīyāt pūrvamācārya vaktrājādraśmimālikāṃ || 3 ||

nyāsapūrvāṃ tataḥ śrīmaddaṣṭārṇāṃ sarvasiddhidāṃ |
gṛhītvācāryapādābja dvaye sarvasvamapyatha || 4 ||

samarpyatadadhīnaḥsyādyāvajjīvaṃ mahāmate |
prātaḥprātassamuṣyāya nityamācāryatoṣaṇe || 5 ||

avaśyaṃyatnavānbhūtvā bhagavadraśmipūrvikāṃ |
samastanyāsasahitāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japet || 6 ||

itthaṃ prajapurācāryayādabhaktasya saṃtataṃ |
aṇimādiguṇaiśvaryaṃ vā vijñaddhiścātulā śubhā || 7 ||

putrapautrādisahitā samṛddhiśca pade pade |
sarvajñatvaṃ manojñatvaṃ kāmarūpatvamakṣayaṃ || 8 ||

parakāya praveśādi sāmarthyaṃ cānadurlabhaṃ |
brahmatvamapi rudratvaṃ viṣṇutvaṃ ca na durlabhaṃ || 9 ||

itthamācārya bhaktasya śrīmaddṛṣṭārṇaciṃtanāt |
pādukāṃjanakhaḍgāṣva api sidhyaṃti siddhayaḥ || 10 ||

anenaiva śarīreṇa jyotirmayattanuḥ pumān |
aṣṭāṃgasahitaṃ yogaṃ prāpya khecaratāmapi || 111 ||

jarāmṛtyuvihīnatvaṃ prāpyāpurapidurlabhaṃ |
śvetadīpādi bhagavatyadeṣu viharatyasau || 12 ||

ācāryo bhagavānevetyavaśyaṃ dṛḍhabhaktimān |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoja dṛḍhabhakto dine dine || 13 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā japahomādi tatparaḥ |
jāti smaraṇamāsādya lakṣmīnārāyaṇātmakaṃ || 14 ||

avaśyaṃ paramaṃbrahmasvacakṣurbhyāṃ prapaśyati |
etadeva paraṃ śreya idameva tapaḥ paraṃ || 15 ||

<p. 51b>

iyameva parādīkṣā idameva mahaddhanaṃ |
ayameva paroyoga idameva paraṃ phalaṃ || 16 ||

ayameva sadācārohyayameva mahāmakhaḥ |
idamva trayovedāssaśāstrāṇyāgamāni ca || 17 ||

iti matvā japennityaṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ parāṃ |
pitāmātāsuhṛddhātāprāṇavaṃ dhussuhṛtsakhā || 18 ||

ācārya eveti sadāśrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japet |
ācārya eva bhagavān brahmāviṣṇurmaheśvaraḥ || 19 ||

sākṣānnārāyaṇaḥ svāmīparaṃbrahmāpi kevalaṃ |
iti matvā sadācāryaṃ vidyāmaṣṭākṣarīṃ japet || 20 ||

aśvamedha sahasrasyaphalamicchan dine dine |
sarahasyāṃ mahāvidyāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japet || 21 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāmāhātmyaṃ bhaktumanvahaṃ |
sarahasyāvayaṃ sṛṣṭā iṃdirāpatināmune || 22 ||

cicchaktiḥ śrīrbhagavattaḥ śaktiryā agadaṃvikā |
śrīmaddaṣṭārṇamāhātmyaṃ sarasvatyaivadatyapi || 23 ||

dharmaputromahāyogī bhūtvā nārāyaṇo bhuvi |
śrīmaddaṣṭārṇa māhātmyaṃ maharṣibhyaḥ prayacchati || 24 ||

mithilāpataye paścājjanakāya pravakṣyati |
ayodhyānagare paścādbhūtvā daśarathātmajaḥ || 25 ||

śrīrāma iti ca khyātiṃgatolokemahāyaśāḥ |
vaśiṣṭādi maharṣīṇāṃ sannidhau jānakīpatiḥ || 26 ||

śrīmaddaṣṭārṇa māhātmyaṃ śaṃkarāya pravakṣyati |
tatraṃ dāśarathīyākhyaṃ vedasāraṃ mahodayaṃ || 27 ||

kṛtvā śreyaskaraṃ loke kathayiṣyaṃti saṃbhave |
śrutvā samastavedānī sārabhūtaṃ yaśaskaraṃ || 28 ||

taṃtraṃ dāśarathīyākhyaṃ brahmaputro mahāmahāmatiḥ |
sanatkumāraḥ sarvajño vaśiṣṭaśca mahāyaśāḥ || 29 ||

jamadagnisuttorāmodvaipāyanasuttaḥ śukaḥ |
dattātreyo mahāyogīsau bhagavadaṃśajaḥ || 31 ||

saṃhitāyaṃ ca kaṃcakruḥ śrutisārārthasaṃgrahaṃ |
śrīmaddaṣṭārṇa māhātmyaṃttepi vakṣyaṃti sādaraṃ || 32 ||

āṃjane pādayobhaktā api nārāyaṇo harau |
śrīmaddaṣṭārṇamāhātmyaṃtepi vakṣyaṃti sāraṃ || 33 ||

<p. 52a>

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāḥ prabhāve naiva saṃtaṃ |
brahmarṣayovaśiṣṭādyābhāradādyāḥ surarṣabhaḥ || 34 ||

śakrādayaśca dikpālāyogissanakādayaḥ |
vasurudrārkacaṃdrādyāḥ siddhāḥ sādhyāśca saṃtataṃ || 35 ||

aravāpya mahatīṃ siddhimadyāpi prajapaṃtyamī |
śrīmaddaṣṭārṇa tatvajño yatra tiṣṭhati bhūtale || 38 ||

divyakṣetraṃ taduddiṣṭaṃ samaṃtādyojanāyattaṃ |
yatrācārya padāṃbhoja dṛḍhabhakto viyatsvapi || 39 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃvidyāṃ saharasthāṃ japanyaset |
tatra gaṃgāgayākāśīkurukṣetraṃ sāgaraṃ || 40 ||

sarahyatī ca yamunātīṣṭhatyeya na saṃśayaḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā japahomārcanādibhiḥ || 41 ||

ayaṃ nārāyaṇaḥ sākṣādyajñeśo jagatāṃpatiḥ |
tuṣṭo bhavati bhaktasya prasīdatyapi satataṃ || 42 ||

śriyaḥ pattau prasannesya prasannaṃ syājjagattrayaṃ |
martitritayamagnīṃnāṃ tritayaṃ ca jagattrayaṃ || 43 ||

śaktitrayaṃ bhagavataḥ padatritayamapyatha |
śrīmaddaṣṭārṇavidyāyāḥ padātraya samudbhavaṃ || 44 ||

vasavoṣṭau maheṃdrādyā aṣṭadikpālakā api |
brāhmādyāmātaropyaṣṭau bhairavā asitādayaḥ || 45 ||

vaikuṃṭhādyaśca lokāśca siddhayoṣṭāṇimādayaḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyā aṣṭavarṇasamudbhavāḥ || 46 ||

sarvadevamayī tasmādiyamaṣṭākṣarīśubhā |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ bhāvenatāṃ sadā japan || 47 ||

nārāyaṇakalāyukto jīvanmukto bhaviṣyasi |
iti sāṃkhyāyanaṃ brahmasutaṃ yogivaraṃ prabhuṃ || 48 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇa māhātmyaṃ bhavāt sannidhau tadā |
utkābhavāvatāsākaṃ vedāṃ aṃtarmukhānṛpa || 49 ||

śrībhagavānuvāca 

rājanjanakabhūpālayogī sāṃkhyāyano muniḥ |
tadārabhya sadācārya padaṃ dvaṃdvaṃ samarcayan || 50 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ japtvā siddhiṃ parāṃgataḥ |
ititaṃ śrīmadaṣṭārṇa māhātmyamadyanāśanaṃ |
kiṃciduktaṃ mahīpālasādhanaṃ ca pravakṣyate || 151 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre 
vedārthasaṃgraho ṣoḍaśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 52b>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

athātaḥ śrīmadaṣṭārṇanyāsadhyānādikaṃ nṛpa |
pravakṣyāmi samāsena samahitamanābhava || 1 ||

brāhmemuhurte utthāya svācārya caraṇadvayaṃ |
praṇamyaśayanasthopi daśadvādaśadhā tataḥ || 2 ||

gurunanyānapi smṛtvā lakṣmīnārāyaṇau vibhū |
smṛtvā gaurīmaheśaucavāṇīṃdhātāramapyatha || 3 ||

śacīṃdrādyaṣṭadikpālān brahmarṣīnapiyoginaḥ |
prāṅmukhodha sudhāṃ natvā bhūtale dakṣiṇaṃ padaṃ || 4 ||

nikṣipyapurato vārmapādaṃ paścāddhi nikṣipet |
ācārya caraṇāṃbhojārūḍhaṃ śrīpādukādvayaṃ || 5 ||

nirmitaṃ rahane sahitaṃ hemnāvādāruṇāpi vā |
ananyadarśano dṛṣṭvānatvā sāṣṭāṃgamādarāt || 6 ||

ācāryapādukābhāve tulasīṃ vā mahānadīṃ |
ananyadarśino dṛṣṭvā dhenu pṛṣṭamathāpi vā || 7 ||

prakṣālitapadṛdvaṃdvakaradvaṃdva samanvitaḥ |
śuddhaṃ vāsaḥ parīdhāya śrīmadācāryapāduko || 8 ||

smṛtvā dvādaśadhā pūrvaṃ brahmavidyāṃ tato japet |
bhagavadraśmividyāṃ cayaṃcadhā vāsredhā japet || 9 ||

stutvātha vaiṣṇaveḥ sūktaistavai paurāṇikaistu vā |
sahasrāṇāṃ mahāvidyāmekāvṛtyātha vā japet || 10 ||

tataḥ śaucādikaṃ kṛtvā kṛtvātho daṃtadhāvanaṃ |
prātaḥ srātvā viśuddhātmāmārjayedvārdravāsasā || 11 ||

saṃdhyāmupāsyavidhivadupasthāyadivākaraṃ |
yosau tapanmudetyādi saurasūkte na nityaśaḥ || 12 || 

maṃtrasaṃdhyāṃ tataḥ kuryāllakṣmīnārāyaṇośituḥ |
yosau tapanmudetyādi sāvitraṃ sūktamanvahaṃ || 13 ||

ācāryavadanāt prāpya saṃdhyānaṃtaramanvahaṃ |
ādityāmukhoptvā dīrghamāyurarogatāṃ || 14 ||

saṃprāpya patnīputraidyairnaviyogaṃ labhet kvacit |
dhanena paśubhirvāpi na viyuktau bhavetyasau || 15 ||

<p. 53a>

dehāṃte bhagavaddhāmasaṃ prāptotyakṣayaṃ nṛpa |
prāṇānāyamya saṃkalpyamaṃtrasaṃdhyāṃ samārabhet || 16 ||

maṃtramasmajalasnānaṃśviṣṭaṃ snānaṃ vidhāya ca |
udake vilikhedyaṃtraṃ sāṃgaṃ vījādisaṃyutaṃ || 17 ||

ṣaṭkoṇamaṣṭakoṇaṃ vā likhitvā yaṃtramādarāt |
ārṣachaṃdo daivataṃ ca vījaśaktīnyasettataḥ || 18 ||

nyāsaṃṣaṃḍaṃgamātraṃ vā kṛtvā dhyātvā śriyaḥ patiṃ |
āvāhanāhimudābhiḥ pūjayitvā tataḥ paraṃ || 19 ||

jalaṃ dakṣiṇahastasthaṃ kṛtvā dvādaśadhā manuṃ |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣaraṃ japtvā vāmahaste viniḥkṣipet || 20 ||

vāsudeva dvādaśārṇavidyāyā śirasi tridhā |
mārjayitvā vaiṣṇavena ṣaḍarṇena jalaṃ pivet || 21 ||

jalamaṃjalimādāya gāyatryācābhimaṃtrītaṃ |
arghyaṃ datvā tridhā paścādgāyatrīṃ vaiṣṇavīṃ jayet || 22 ||

trayī vījaṃ samuddhṛtya caturthyaṃta samanvitaṃ |
nārāyaṇapadaṃ paścādvidmahe padamapyatha || 23 ||

vāsudevāya śabdaṃ ca dhīmahīti padaṃ tataḥ |
dhiyoyonaḥ pracodeti yadityakṣaramuccaret || 24 || 

gāyatrī vaiṣṇavī proktā mahāpātakanāśinī |
bhuktimuktipradāsākṣādbrahmadarśanasiddhidā || 25 ||

etasyā viṣṇugāyatryāmuninārāyaṇosmyahaṃ |
chaṃdo gāyatramityuktaṃ paramātmāśriyaḥ patiḥ || 26 ||

devonārāyaṇaḥ sāk.ājjagatāṃpatiracyutaḥ |
aṣṭāṃviṃśatidhānityaṃjapedvādaśadhyāpi vā || 27 ||

prāṇānāyamya saṃkalpya kṛtvānyāsaṃ ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ |
ādityamaṃḍalagataṃ dhyātvā nārāyaṇaṃ vibhuṃ || 28 ||

ādityābhimukho nityamaṣṭottaraśataṃ śuciḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidhāṃ nyaset sakalasiddhidāṃ || 29 ||

nārāyaṇākhyasūktena dvādaśarghena nityaśaḥ |
stutiṃ kuryādbhagavataḥ paṃcādhā vā tridhaikadhā || 30 ||

tato maṃdiramāgatyanityahomaṃ samācaret |
tarpayitvā pitṛdevānmanuṣyāṃśca tataḥ paraṃ || 31 ||

śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ japennyāsapurassarāṃ |
ekena janmanāmuktimucchitā sarvasiddhidā || 32 ||

<p. 53b>

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā japyānyāsapurassarā |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyā japahomādikaṃ sadā || 33 ||

kartavyāṃ mahatīṃ siddhimicchataikena janmanā |
nityahomaṃ samāpyāthanatvācāryapadāṃvujaṃ || 34 ||

yatkiṃciddakṣiṇāṃ dadyādapi śākaghṛtādikaṃ |
yatkiṃciddakṣiṇāṃ hīmapyācāryapadāṃvuje || 35 ||

vaṃdhyaṃ dinamiti prāhustanmahāghaughavarddhanaṃ |
atha vā pratyahaṃ hutvā smṛtvācāryapadāṃvujaṃ || 36 ||

suvarṇamatha vā raupyaṃ dhānyaṃ dhātāmrataṃḍulān |
sūyaṃ śākaṃ ghṛtaṃ vāpi yatkiṃcidapi dakṣiṇāṃ || 37 ||

avaśyaṃ gurave datvā nityaṃ pāpairvimucyate |
karotyavaṃ divasamapiyāgaphalaṃ labhet || 38 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoje yatkiṃcidapi dakṣiṇāṃ |
saṃkalpyamanasā nityaṃ māmimāsāthavārpayet ||  ||

śrotriyāyāthavā dadyādapi teṣāmasannidhau || 41 ||

vidyāṃ tapobhyāṃ sahito dvijāgnyaḥ pātramucyate |
apātrebhyo dhanaṃ dattamapi merusamaṃnṛpa || 42 ||

sadānarakaduḥghaughahetukaṃ pātakāvahaṃ |
vaidikācārasahito vedavicchotriyaḥ smṛtaḥ || 43 ||

dvijo vedavihīnoyaḥ patitaḥ sasmṛto vudhaiḥ |
avedaviduṣedānaṃdattaṃ yatkiṃcidapyatha || 44 ||

bhasmavīvahutaṃ proktaṃ kiṃcasyānnarakālayaṃ |
japahomasamiddīptehutaṃ śrotriyapātake || 45 ||

tārayennarakemagnānapi koṭi pitṛnnṛpa |
dānamācāryapādābje daṃtayatkiṃcidapyata || 46 ||

brāhmasāyujyadaṃ prāhustatpitṝṇāṃ ca bhūyyate |
vipramātre pratijñātamapi vācādhanādikaṃ || 47 ||

ṣaṇmāsābhyaṃtaredeyamata ūrddhvaṃ śṛṇaṃ mahat |
pratijñātaṃ ca yadvācāṣaṇmāsābhyaṃtarenṛpa || 48 ||

nadattaṃ narakaudyeṣu vahuduḥkhapradaṃ nṛpa |
ācāryebhyaḥ pratijñātamapi śākaghṛtādikaṃ || 49 ||

māsādavaṅnidataṃ cetaddṛṇaṃ merusannibhaṃ |
ihāpi devatāśāpaṃ prāpyāṃte narakaṃ vrajet || 52 ||

<p. 54a>

bhagavankaruṇāsiṃdhyai nityamācāryapādayoḥ |
yatkiṃcidapi datvātha siddhiṃ cāpnoti durlabhāṃ || 53 ||

ekādaśyāṃ paurṇamāsyāṃ mamāyāṃ dvādaśīdine |
saṃkrāṃtau bhārgavevāre dattamakṣayasiddhidaṃ || 54 ||

ācāryapatnimācāryaṃ vinā bhārgavavāsare |
api sākṣādbhagavatena deyaṃ śreya icchatā || 55 ||

śuklātṛtīyāvaiśākhī tasyāṃ dattamathākṣayaṃ |
japaṃtīṣvapi sarvāsudattama evapi siddhidaṃ || 56 ||

navarātravrate caṃdrabhāskaragrahaṇādiṣu |
alabhyayogeṣu dattamakṣayaṃ bhogamokṣadaṃ || 57 ||

nityadānaṃ sukhakaramāyuḥ svargāpavargadaṃ |
bhārgave vāsaredānamakṣayaśrīsamṛddhidaṃ || 58 ||

caṃdrasūryagrahedānaṃ mahāpātakanāśanaṃ |
anaṃtasaukhyadaṃsvargabhogamokṣasamṛddhidaṃ || 59 ||

samasteṣvapi dāneṣu mahadānapaṃcakaṃ |
prathamaṃ sumahaddānaṃ vahuśasyaughasaṃkulaṃ || 60 ||

caturvṛṣabhasaṃyuktaṃ godvayena samanvitaṃ |
yathoktadakṣiṇāyuktaṃ mahīdānaṃ mahīpate || 61 ||

nānena sadṛśaṃ dānamihāmutrasukhapradaṃ |
śrotriyāya daridrāya vivāhamadravyamapyatha || 62 ||

datāṃtārayatedātuḥ pitṛnathāpitāmahān |
dvitīyaṃ sumahaddānamettadvaṃśābhivṛddhidaṃ || 63 ||

śālagrāmaśilādānaṃ niṣṭhapaṃcakasaṃyutaṃ |
padmarāgamaṇisvarṇakuṃḍaladvitayānvitaṃ || 64 ||

tṛtīyaṃ kusumadānaṃ brahmasāyujyakāraṇaṃ |
sālaṃ kṛtaṃ vahukṣīraṃ savatsaṃdhenupaṃcakaṃ || 65 ||

ekaikadakṣiṇā tatra niṣkatrayamitaṃ dhanaṃ |
dattamācārya pādābje parvakāle viśeṣataḥ || 66 ||

caturthametaddānaṃ syāt pātakaudya vibhedanaṃ |
sadyaḥ sakalaḥ duḥkhauhyaharaṇaṃ bhuktimuktidaṃ || 67 ||

varṣāśanamitadravyadānaṃ vāso yugānvitaṃ |
navamaṃdirasaṃyuktaṃ samastakleśavarddhanaṃ || 68 ||

mahāpāpaughaharaṇaṃ sakṣayasvargamokṣadaṃ |
tulāpuruṣamukhyānidānāni sumahaṃtyapi || 69 ||

<p. 54b>

sadya eva mahāpāpaharāṇyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
āṃdolikāṃkaśivikāṃyaḥ prayacchati parvasu || 70 ||

bahudakṣiṇayāyuktāṃ mahāduritarāśibhiḥ |
sadya eva vimuktosau pitṛmātṛkulānvitaḥ || 71 ||

divyaṃ vimānamāruhya satyalokepidurlabhān |
kalpyāṃtepyakṣayānbhogānbhuṃktesau brahmaṇaḥ pade || 72 ||

tavīnaṃ maṃdiraṃ ramyanirmāyadivase śubhe |
varṣāśatamitadravyadakṣiṇāsahitaṃ nṛpa || 73 ||

datvā maheṃdradharmādyaiḥ pūjyamāno yathā sukhaṃ |
bhuṃktepi durlabhān bhogānnaṃdanādivaneṣvasau || 74 ||

yāgārthaṃ dakṣiṇādravyaṃ sāṃgamācāryapādayoḥ |
datvā sadyo vimukto sau mahāpātakarāśibhiḥ || 75 ||

vimuktaḥ pitṛbhitsākaṃ pūjyamānomarādhipaiḥ |
vaikuṃṭhe paramedhāmnimodanekālakṣayaṃ || 76 ||

annapradānasatataṃ mahāduritanāśanaṃ |
vastradānaṃ mahātpuṇyaṃ divyabhogasamṛddhida || 77 ||

suvarṇadānaṃ satataṃ harisānnidhyasiddhidaṃ |
ratnadānaṃ mahatpuṇyaṃ merumūrdhisukhapradaṃ || 78 ||

divyarakta samāyukta mudrikādānamiṣṭadaṃ |
karṇeṣu muktāmaraṇadānaṃ māheṃdrabhogadaṃ || 79 ||

ratnābharaṇadānaṃ hi karṇayo sadya eva hi |
mahāduritasaṃghānāṃ nāśanaṃ muktimuktidaṃ || 80 ||

purāṇadharmaśāstrāṇāṃ saṃhitānāṃ tathaiva ca |
dānaṃ kalmaṣarāśimaṃ saukhyadaṃ brahmaṇaḥ pade || 81 ||

yadyanyanoharaṃ vastu svagṛhe saṃsthitaṃ śubhaṃ |
tatadāvāryapādābje datvā siddhiṃ parāṃ vrajet || 82 ||

tiladānaṃ mahatpuṇyaṃ yamavādhānivāraṇaṃ |
dhānyadānamihāmutra samasteṣṭaphalapradaṃ || 83 ||

samastatīrthasāṃnidhyaṃ samastaduritāmahaṃ |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoja dvayameva na saṃśayaḥ || 84 ||

āyuścalaṃ manuṣyāṇāṃ saṃpadaḥ kṣaṇabhaṃgurāḥ |
duḥkhamiśraṃ sukhaṃ bhaumaṃ tasmāddharmarato bhavet || 85 ||

dharmopyadharmovedokto dharmokṣayasukhapradaḥ |
adharmonarakakleśasiddhidoyamamaṃdire || 86 ||

tasmācchutīritaṃ dharmaṃ kurvannatvahamādarāt |
maharṣisiddhaṃ gaṃdharvaiḥ pūjyaḥ syādapidaivataiḥ || 87 ||

<p. 55a>

vedamāturjapakaro vahuśo vedatatparah |
vaidikācāranirataḥ śrotriyaḥ pātramucyate || 88 ||

pātrabhūtāyaviprāya deyaṃ vastudhanādikaṃ |
apātraṃ vedarahitaḥ sarvakarma vahiṣkṛtaḥ || 89 ||

avedavidupedatamaṇumātraṃ ca bhūpate |
ākalyaṃ narake ghore vahuduḥkhapradāyakaṃ || 90 ||

ekasmaiśrotriyāyāpidatvā vastu dhanādikaṃ |
kulaṃ tārayate dāturddaśapūrvaṃdaśāparaṃ || 91 ||

śrotriyārṇā sahasrebhyopyeka ācārya uttamaḥ |
ācāryāyāstu mātraṃ vā datvā yāti parāṃgatiḥ || 92 ||

brahmacārīgṛhasthaścavānaprasthaścavānaprasthaśca bhikṣukaḥ |
śrīmaddaṣṭārṇa sidhyarthaṃ vibhumācāryamāśrayet || 93 ||

brahmacārīgṛhasthānāṃ vanīnāṃguravastrayaḥ |
pitāmātāttathāvārya ihāmutrāpinaṃ tataṃ || 94 ||

pattīnāmeka ācāryo gururbhagavadātmakaḥ |
yativeṣadharoviprovaṃdyaḥ pitrāpisataṃtaṃ || 95 ||

mātuścapoṣaṇaṃ kuryāttatrādharmonarmonavidyate |
garbhadhāraṇapoṣābhyāṃ piturmātāgarīyasī || 96 ||

sarvavaṃdyena yatinā prasūrvaṃdyā prayatnataḥ |
ācārya eva tatrāpi daivasaṃpūjyameva hi || 97 ||

sākṣādbrahmaṇi dṛṣṭesyanamātānapitāguruḥ |
ācārya eva tasyāpi pratyahaṃ daivataṃ nṛpa || 98 ||

sākṣādbrahmaṇi saṃdṛṣṭe jñāni nāmapi bhūyate |
ācāryasya parityāgānnarakaugheṣu saṃtaṃtaṃ || 99 ||

bahuduḥkha samāyuktāgartirnānyāvidhīyate |
api sākṣātkṛta brahmasvarūpajñānināmapi || 100 ||

yohyaṇīyo namaskāryestrisaṃdhyaṃ pratyahaṃ nṛpa |
tasmādavaśyamācāryaṃ sarvaṃjñaṃ bhagavanmayaṃ || 1 ||

dhyācārcayennamaskṛtyavāsobhirbhūṣaṇaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
kuṃḍalodaravaṃdhādyairmudrikābhiranekaśaḥ || 2 ||

<p. 55b>

dhanairdhānyaiśca ratnaiśca poṣayedyatnatonvahaṃ |
etadeva mahacchreyaḥ sādhanaṃ nānyaducyate || 3 ||

nāṣṭākṣarī samāvidyānapuṇyaṃ gurupūjanāt |
naddaivamadhikaṃ śrīśānnamuktisadṛśaṃ phalaṃ || 4 ||

na puṇyacāryapadāraviṃdaṃ saṃpūjanāduttamastiloke |
nāṣṭārṇavidyājapahomapūjanādgatipradaṃ nāsti paratraveha || 5 ||

ācāryayāddhāṃvuja yugmameva gatirvaṭūnāṃ gṛhiṇīṃ yatīnāṃ |
ācāryapādāṃvujayugmatīrthānnavidyate pāvanamanyatīrthaṃ || 6 ||

nācāryapatnīsadṛśī samarcyā lakṣmīrumāpisarasvatī vā |
ācāryapatnyaivagirīṃdvakanyakāvāṇīśacībhūmiraruṃdhatī ca || 7 ||

ācāryamitthaṃ harimīśitāraṃ dhyātvānvahaṃ pūjyatamaṃ vareṇyaṃ |
abhyarcya saṃpoṣya dhanairanekairavaśyamaṃte harirūpametitaḥ || 8 ||

śrīṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca 

iti gītaṃ bhagavatā jānakīpatināpurā |
uktaṃ nārāyaṇe nādau yadyadbhagavatā dvijāḥ || 9 ||

tasmāt sarvajñamācāryaṃ nityamabhyarcyasādaraṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ japennyāsapurassaraṃ || 10 ||

iti dāśarathīyesminnaṃtrenuttaranānake |
uktaḥ saptadaśodhyāyaḥ pātakaudya vibhedanaḥ || 111 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
saptadaśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 55b>

śrīṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca 

athātaḥ śrīmaddaṣṭārṇanyāsadhānyādikaṃ dvijāḥ |
uktaṃ bhagavatāpūrvaṃ pravakṣyāmi samāsataḥ || 1 ||

sādhyo nārāyaṇaḥ svāmī bhagavānṛṣirucyate |
chaṃdogāyatramityuktaṃ chaṃdaṃ sāmuttamottamaṃ || 2 ||

śriyā cidrūpayā lakṣmyāsahitaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
nārāyaṇāstrijagatāṃpatirdevassanātanaḥ || 3 ||

akāro vījamityuktaḥkāraḥ śaktirucyate |
viniyogo bhagavataḥ prasādārtha sudāhṛtaḥ || 4 ||

gautamotrirbharadvāje viśvāmitro mahāmuniḥ |
jamadagnirvaśiṣṭaśca kaśyayogastya eva || 5 ||

<p. 56a>

aṣṭākṣarāṇāṃ vijñeyā ṛṣayoṣṭhau yathākramaṃ |
gāyatryudimaganuṣṭupyavṛhatīpaṅktireva ca || 6 ||

triṣṭupa jagatī cāpi virāṭ chaṃdāṃsi vai kramāt |
dharodhruvastathā soma āyaugnirvāyureva ca || 7 ||

pratyūṣaśca prabhāsaśca prabhāsaśca vijñeyā devatāḥ kramāt |
kruddholkāyāgnijāpāṃtai kṛṣṇavarṇā yadṛdyatha || 8 ||

maholkāyāgnijāpākanakavarṇāya mūrdhnātha |
vīro kṛpāgni jāpāṃte piṃgaleti padātparaṃ || 9 ||

varṇāyātha śikhāsthāne dvyūlkāyāgni priyāmatha |
hemavarṇāyakavacaṃ sahasro klāyaśabdataḥ || 10 ||

vidyudvarṇāyaśabdāṃtenyasedastraṃ tataḥ paraṃ |
aṃgulīpaṃcakanyāsamevameva samācaret || 11 ||

tarjanyāṃdi kaniṣṭhāṃ tāṃgulīṣvarṇānsaviṃdukān |
vinyasya nama sāyuktānnābhau guhye tataḥ paraṃ || 12 ||

jānvāyoḥ pādayuge mūrddhākṣināsāhṛdayeṣu ca |
sa viṃdukākṣasyāsaḥ kartavya iti bhūyate || 13 ||

hṛdi mūrddhni śikhāyī ca kavacenetreyorathā |
astraṃ tathodare pṛṣṭhe nyāsamaṣṭāṃgamācaret || 14 ||

itthaṃ paṃcāṃgamaṣṭāṃgaṃnyāsaṃ kṛtvā samāhitaḥ |
aṃtavīhirmātṛkākhyānyāsaṃ kuryādanyadhīḥ || 15 ||

ṛṣirbrahmāsamuddiṣṭacchaṃdo gāyatramīritaṃ |
devatāmātṛkāsākṣāccidrūpāśrīḥsarasvatī || 16 ||

vījāni hala uktāni svarāḥ śaktaya īritāḥ |
hrasvadīrghāṃdyaṃtayutaiḥ ṣaḍvirvargaiḥ ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ || 17 ||

kṛtvānyāsaṃ tatodhyāyenmātṛkāṃ parameśvarī |
ādikṣāṃtākṣaraśreṇīmāṇikyākalpadhāriṇīṃ || 18 ||

cidrūpiṇīṃ mahālakṣmīṃ vāgdevīmātṛkāṃnumaḥ |
athāṃtarmātṛkānyāsaḥ kaṃṭhahṛnnābhiguhyake || 19 ||

pāye bhrūmadhyagepadyeṣoḍaśadvadaśabdade |
daśapatre ca ṣaṭpatre catuḥpatredvipatrake || 20 ||

paṃcāśadvarṇavinyāsaḥ patrasaṃkhyā kramādbhavet |
ekaikavarṇamekaikapatrāṃtarvinnyasenṛpa || 21 ||

<p. 56b>

evamaṃtaḥ pravinyasya manasātha varhinyaset |
śirovadanavṛttepi cakṣuḥ śrotrayugepyatha || 22 ||

nāsākapolayugale tathokagugalepi ca |
urdhvādhodaṃtapaṃktau ca vinyaset ṣoḍaśasvarāt  || 23 ||

kacavargadvayaṃ hastapaṃcasaṃdhisthalenyaset |
ṭa ta vargadvayaṃ pādasaṃdhyagreṣu tathānyaset || 24 ||

pavargaṃ pārśvayugale pṛṣṭanābhyudareṣu ca |
hṛdormūlakakulkakṣahṛdādikarapavaye || 25 ||

jaṭharānanayoścaiva vyāpakaṃ viniyojayet |
paṃcāśadakṣaranyāsaḥ krameṇaivaṃ vidhīyate || 26 ||

oṃ mādhaṃto namoṃto vā saviṃduvarjitaḥ |
māyālakṣmī kāmavījapūrvonyastavya iṣyate || 27 ||

keśavāya ca kīrtyai ca tathā nārāyaṇāya ca |
kāṃtyai tathā mādhavāya tuṣṭau iti nyaset namaḥ || 28 ||

goviṃdāya ca puṣṭyai ca viṣṇaye ca ddhṛtistataḥ |
madhusūdanaśāṃtī ca trivikramakriye tathā || 29 ||

vāmanā padayāyai ca śrīdharāyacade tataḥ |
medhāyai ca hṛṣīkeśoharṣāyai ca namastathā || 30 ||

payanābhāya śraddhāyai tathā dāmodarāya ca |
lajjāyai vāsudevāya lakṣmyai saṃkarṣaṇāya ca || 31 ||

sarasvatyai ca pradyumnaḥ prītyai nama itīṣyate |
aniruddhā paratyai ca svarāṃte pravadedatha || 32 ||

cakriṇe vijayāyai ca gadineśārṅgiṇe tathā |
durgāyai ca prabhāyai ca khaḍgine vinyasedatha || 33 ||

satyāyai śaṃkhine caṃḍāyai namaḥ pravadedatha |
haline ca tathāvāṇyai tathāmuśalinevadet || 34 ||

vilāsinyaiśūline ca virajāyai tataḥ paraṃ |
pāśine vijayāyai ca tathaivāṃkuśinevadet || 35 ||

satyāyamutsyai sattvāyamatyai nama viśvāyai ca mukuṃdāya |
vimadāyai namastataḥ naṃdajāsunaṃdāyai naṃdine ca smṛti tathā || 36 ||

narāyannaṛddhyai ca tathā vadennarakajitaḥ |
samṛddhyaiharayeśuddhyai kṛṣṇaṣuddhīnataḥ paraṃ || 37 ||

satyāya muktyai satvāyamatyai nama itīrayet |
śauraye ca kṣamāyai ca śūrāya paramātataḥ || 36 ||

<p. 57a>

jarā īnārāya ca yadecchriyaisyādbhūdharāya ca |
kledinyaiṣiśca mūrtiśca klinnāyai tadanaṃaraṃ || 39 ||

vaikuṃṭhāya namaḥ paścādvasudhāyai tataḥ paraṃ |
puruṣottamaśca vasudāvaline ca parā tathā || 40 ||

valānujāya ca parāyaṇāyai ca tataḥ paraṃ |
valāyāpyatha sūkṣmāyai vṛṣāghnāya tataḥ paraṃ || 41 ||

saṃdhyāyai ca vṛṣāyātha prajñāyai ca tataḥ paraṃ |
haṃsāya ca prabhāyesyādvarāhāya niśātathā || 42 ||

vimalāyāpyamodyāyai ca nṛsiṃhāya tataḥ paraṃ |
vidyutāyaitvagātyā ca hyasṛgātmā ca hyasṛgātmā tataḥ paraṃ || 43 ||

māṃsātmane tathāmeda ātmane'sthyātmanepi ca |
jīvātmane ca paramātmane nama itīrayet || 44 ||

sarvadevamayīṃ sākṣādvaiṣṇavīṃ mātṛkāṃ parāṃ |
vinyasyaivaṃ kramādbhūpavirāḍrūpī na saṃśayaḥ || 45 ||

māyāśrīkāmapūrvaṃ vā kāmapūrvamathāpi vā |
śirovadanavṛtādiścayaṃ nyāsakramaḥ smṛtaḥ || 46 ||

keśavādirayaṃnyāso mahāpātakanāśanaḥ |
dehināṃ nyāsamātreṇa brahmatādātmyasiddhidaḥ || 47 ||

sarvadevamayīmenāṃ vaiṣṇavīṃ mātṛkāṃ parāṃ |
vinyasya satataṃ dhīmānbhagavanmayanāṃ vrajet || 48 ||

vinyasya vaiṣṇavīmenāṃ mātṛkāmanvahaṃ śuciḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japtvā sākṣānnārāyaṇo bhavet || 49 ||

vaiṣṇavī mātṛkāmekāmapi vinyasya vānvahaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japtvā yathā śaktyā dinedine || 50 ||

sarvadevamayaḥ sākṣādvirādrūpāṃ śriyaḥ patiḥ |
ācāryānugrahādbhūtvā mahatīṃ siddhimaśnute || 51 ||

vaṃdyo sau sarvadevānāṃ munīnāṃ ca bhavatyasau |
keśavādirayaṃnyāsonyāsamātreṇadehināṃ || 52 ||

acyutatvaṃdadātyeva satyaṃ satyaṃ vadāmyahaṃ |
tatvanyāsamatho vakṣye śṛṇuṣvāvahitonṛpa || 53 ||

vinyasya tatvavinyāsaṃ tatvavidbhavati dhruvaṃ |
mādayaḥ pratilomyenakāṃtāḥ sparśasaṃjñakāḥ || 54 ||

<p. 57b>

namaḥ parāya pūrvetu tu praṇavāṃte vyavasthitāḥ |
jīvaḥ prāṇaśca buddhiścāpyahaṃkāromanastathā || 55 ||

sarvāṃge hṛdivinyasya śabdādi viṣayāstataḥ |
pūrddhni ghrāṇe ca hṛdayepyupastho pādayorapi || 56 ||

śrotratvakcakṣurjihvāghrāṇarūpeṇadehināṃ |
jñāneṃdriyāṇiyaṃ cāpi tatasthāne nyaset punaḥ || 57 ||

vākpāṇi pādayāyūyasthānīti karmeṃdriyāṇi ca |
tathaiva tatatsthāneṣu tattadeva pravinyaset || 58 ||

śiromukhepi hṛdaye tathā guhyepi pādayoḥ |
ākāśānilatejāṃsi salilaṃ pṛthivī tathā || 59 ||

vinyase pūrvavaccaivanyāsavidbhirudīritaṃ |
śahau ca saṣalāḥ paṃcatathāyaśca valā(-)api || 60 ||

kṣauṃceti daśavarṇāni praṇavāṃte ca pūrvavat |
hṛtpadma somasūryāya svakalāyuktaṃ maṃḍalāṃ || 61 ||

trayaṃ hṛdyeva vinyasya vāsudevādayastathā |
parameṣṭhī ca puruṣo viśvavyāpīnivartakaḥ || 62 ||

nārāyaṇo nṛsiṃhaśca sakarovākyapūrakau |
mūrdhnāsye hṛdiguhye ca pādayorvyāpakaṃ tataḥ || 63 ||

tadātmane nama iti tatatsthāneṣu vinyaset |
atatvasyāpya pūjyasya tatprāpterhetunāpunaḥ || 64 ||

natvanyāsamiti prāhurnyāsaṃ tatvavidobudhāḥ |
yaḥ kuryātatvavinyāsaṃ sa eva bhavati dhruvaṃ || 65 ||

tadātmanānu praviśya bhagavānihaṃtiṣṭhati |
tatassa eva tatvāni sarvaṃ tasminpratiṣṭhitaṃ || 66 ||

ajñāta sarvatatvopi tatvanyāsena saṃtataṃ |
sarvatatvamayaḥ sākṣātatvadhidvavidbhavet || 67 ||

tatvanyāsena satataṃ pūjāprāpnoti śāśvatīṃ |
viśvaṃmarovijāḍātmāsākṣānnārāyaṇo bhavet || 68 ||

tatvanyāsamarthevaṃ vā vinyasyānvahamādarāt |
ācāryānugrahaṃ prāpya śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ japan || 69 ||

vaṃdyassamastadevānāmapi viśvaṃbharo bhavet |
tanmūrtipaṃjaranyāsasya tanmūrtisiddhaye || 70 ||

ākarṇayaicitatvaṃ yatosmin phalāṃtaraṃ |
namo bhagavate vrūyādvāsudevāya ityatha || 71 ||

<p. 58a>

oṃ mādedasyamaṃtrasyacādāyai kākṣaraṃ tataḥ |
śrīmaṣṭākṣarau vidyāmādāveva samuccaran || 72 ||

vātetaśca svarastadvat śrīmaṣṭākṣaraṃ tataḥ |
vāsudevadvādarśārṇasyaikekākṣaramuccaran || 73 ||

nāmaikaikamupādāya viṣṇordvādaśanākasu |
nāmaikaikamuapadāya sūryasyāpi ca nāmasu || 74 ||

caturthyaṃtaṃ namoṃtaṃ ca nyastavyaṃ nyāsayogataḥ |
lalāṭenābhi hṛdayakaṃṭhapārśvāṃsakaṃdhare || 75 ||

pārśvāṃtarevaskaṃdhe ca pṛṣṭe kakudi mūrdhnapi |
keśavaśca tato vrūyānnārāyaṇa iti dvayaṃ || 76 ||

mādhavaścaiva goviṃdo viṣṇuśca madhusūdanaḥ |
trivikramo vāmayaśca śrīdharo navamaḥ smṛtaḥ || 77 ||

hrṣīkeśaḥ padmanābhastathā dāmodara kramāt |
viṣṇorddhādaśanāmānicāmūnimunisaptama || 78 ||

dhātāryamācamitraśca varuṇo śubhamastathā |
iṃdrocitravasānpūṣā ca parjanyo daśamaḥ smṛtaḥ || 79 ||

tvaṣṭā ca viṣṇurityevaṃ nāmāni dvādaśātmanaḥ |
tanmūrtipaṃjaranyāsastubhyamuktomayāvibho || 80 ||

tanmūrtipaṃjaranyāsaṃ kṛtvā bhagavadātmakaḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japtvācāryānugrahātsadā || 81 ||

mahatīṃ siddhimāsādya bhavet sākṣācchriyaḥ patiḥ |
tanmūrtipaṃjaranyāsaṃkṛtvā tanmūrtisiddhaye || 82 ||

 ācāryānugrahādāśubrahmatādātmyasiddhibhāk |
varṇanyāsaṃ daśavidhaṃ pravakṣyāmi tataḥ paraṃ || 83 ||

ācāryānugrahādyasya vijñānādbrahmarūpabhāk |
ādau yogāsanamayaṃ svadehaṃ bhāvayeddhiyā || 84 ||

pīṭhapādamayaṃ hastapādayugmaṃ ca bhāvayet |
pīṭhoparitalaṃ pārśvadvayanābhimukhātmakaṃ || 85 ||

talyātmakaṃ svodaraṃ ca dhyātvā svahṛdayāṃvuje |
navaśakti mahāpīṭhamaṃtrayukte tataḥ paraṃ || 86 ||

anugrahāya bhaktānāṃ līlānirmitavigrahaṃ |
svātmānameva dhyātvātha na gavanmayamacyutaṃ || 87 ||

kuryāddaśavidhaṃ varṇanyāsaṃ brahmaikyasiddhidaṃ |
ādhāre hṛdivakaktre narormūlayugale tathā || 88 ||

pādamūlayuge nābhaunyāsa eka udāhṛtaḥ |
ekaikaṃ mūlamaṃtrārṇanamoṃtaṃ praṇavādikaṃ || 89 ||

<p. 58b>

sa viṃdukaṃ nyaseddhīmāndevatābhāvasiddhaye |
kaṃṭhe nābhau ca hṛdayestanayugme ca pārśvayoḥ || 90 ||

pṛṣṭhenyāsodvitīyoyaṃ maṃtrasya samudāhṛtaḥ |
mūrdhnāsye netrayugalokarṇayugme tataḥ paraṃ || 91 ||

nāsāpurayuge paścātṛtīyonyāsa īritaḥ |
vāhusaṃdhyaṣṭakepādasaṃdhiṣvaṣṭa subhūpate || 92 ||

caturthonyāsa ādyo sau paṃcamaśca tataḥ paraṃ |
aṃgulīṣvaṣṭasunyāsaḥ ṣaṣṭoguṣṭhaṃ vineritaḥ || 93 ||

pādāṃguṣṭhaṃ vinā pādāṃgulinyāsaśca saptamaḥ |
tvagasṛṅmāsamedosthimajjāśuṣkamāyānnṛpa || 94 ||

vinyasya mūlamaṃtrasya saptavarṇānathākramaṃ |
prāṇarūpaṃ svahṛdayāṃvuja evākṣarānnyaset || 95 ||

aṣṭamonyāsa uktoyaṃ mūrdhninetrayugemukhe |
hṛdayeccoderapaścādūrujaṃthāpadeṣu ca || 96 ||

nyāsoyaṃ navamaḥ prokte devatābhāvasiddhidāḥ |
kapolaskaṃdhayugaloruddhayecaraṇadvaye || 97 ||

nyāsoyaṃ daśamaḥ proktā varṇairmūlasyasiddhidaḥ |
itthaṃ daśavidhaṃ varṇanyāsaṃ kṛtvā dine dine || 98 ||

devatābhāvamāpnoti yena syuḥ sarvasiddhayaḥ |
mūlamaṃtrākṣaranyāsaṃ kṛtvānyāsaṃ kṛtvā daśavidhaṃ nṛpa || 99 ||

bhagavatkalayāyuktaḥ siddhiṃ prāpnotyanuttamāṃ |
mātṛkākṣaravinyāsaṃ kecidbrahmavidomalāḥ || 100 ||

kurvaṃti bhagavadbhāvasidhyarthaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ |
mātṛkāvarṇavinyāsa ādyaḥ śuddha itīritaḥ || 1 ||

praṇavādyo dvitīyaḥ syātṛtīyo vāgbhavādikaḥ |
māyāvījādikonyāsaścaturthaḥ samudīritaḥ || 2 ||

lakṣmīvījādikonyāsaḥ paṃcamah samudīritaḥ |
vāṅmāyākamalādyaścanyāsaḥ ṣaṣṭhā udīritaḥ || 3 ||

kāmavījādikonyāsaḥ saptamatsamudīritaḥ |
haṃsamaṃtrādikaḥ paścānnyāsoṣṭama udīritaḥ || 4 ||

śrīkaṃṭhamātṛkānyāso navamassamudīritaḥ |
vaiṣṇavomātṛkānyāsodarāmaḥ samudīritaḥ || 5 ||

daśadhā mātṛkānyāsaṃ bhagavadbhāvasiddhidaṃ |
kecidbrahmavidonityaṃ kurvaṃtya khilasiddhidaṃ || 6 ||

<p. 59a>

daśadhāmātṛkānyāsaphaladāvaiṣṇavīparā |
vedāgamapurāṇeṣu kathitā brahmavittamaiḥ || 7 ||

daśadhāmātṛkānyāsaṃ nyasya vānyasya vā nṛpa |
nyāsaṃ keśavakīrtyādyamavaśyaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ nyaset || 8 ||

daśadhā mātṛkānyāsaphalaṃdaṃ syānnasaṃśayaḥ |
vinyasya mātṛkāmaṃtarvahiḥ pūrvaṃ dine dine || 9 ||

vaiṣṇavīṃ mātṛkāṃ paścānnyasya sarvārthasiddhidāṃ |
tatvanyāsaṃ tataḥ kṛtvānyasya tanmūrtipaṃjaraṃ || 10 ||

mūlamaṃtrakṣaranyāsaṃ nyaseddaśavidhaṃ tataḥ |
itthaṃ vinyasya vidhivat sākṣānnārāyaṇo bhavet || 11 ||

maṃtrīcātra na saṃdeho nigrahānunnahakṣamaḥ |
nyāsaṃ caturaśavidhaṃ kṛtvedyaṃ nityamādarāt || 12 ||

vatsarādiṃdirānāthaṃ bhagavaṃtaṃ prapaśyati |
upadiśyaivapuratonyāsajālamidaṃ guruḥ || 13 ||

athāṃte vāsine dadyācchrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ śubhāṃ |
caturdaśavidhanyāsamajñātvāyogururnṛpa || 14 ||

śrīmaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ pradadāti mahītale |
nāvātmavaṃcakau proktau vubhāvapi na saṃśayaḥ || 15 ||

sarvajñameva satataṃ tasmādācāryamāśrayet |
satataṃ siddhamaṃtrasya vahujñasya mahātmanaḥ || 16 ||

vyāptavyā mahatī vidyā sadahasyāmahīpate |
sahasraṃ yojanaṃ vāpi gatvā vedārthapāragaṃ || 17 ||

caturdaśavidhanyāsasahitāṃ paramātmanaḥ |
pradadyādapi gṛhṇīyācchrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃ śubhāṃ || 18 ||

anyathā japahomādyaiḥ koṭiśopi na siddhibhāk |
nyāsaḥ syānmaṃtrasantāhonyāsahīno na siddhidaḥ || 19 ||

nyāsaḥ keśakīrtyādi caturdaśavidhaḥ śubhaḥ |
caturdaśavidhinyāsaṃ kṛtvā japtvā dine dine || 20 ||

caturdaśasulokeṣu pūjāṃ prāptonyanuttamāṃ |
caturdaśavidhanyāsapūrvikāmiṃdirāpateḥ || 21 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃvidyāṃ yo dadāti mahītale |
tamācāryaṃ vijānīhi sākṣānmadrūpiṇaṃ vibhuṃ || 22 ||

vidyāmātrapradānenanācāryatvaṃ dvijanmanaḥ |
sarahasyamanordātājñeya ācārya īśvaraḥ || 23 ||

<p. 59b>

avijñāya rahasyāni gṛhītvā maṃtramātrakaṃ |
vahuyojana sāhasramapi gatvā mahīpate || 24 ||

saṃsavya vahuvarṣaṃ vā datvā prāṇadhanādikaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ samastanyāsapūrvikāṃ || 25 || 

gṛhṇīyādapyathānyasmānyunarviprottamānnṛpa |
sa eva sakalanyāsa pūrvavidyāpradovibhuḥ || 26 ||

ācārya ucyate loke sākṣānnārāyaṇātmakaḥ |
tameva daivatāṃ viddhi sadācāryaṃ ghṛṇānidhi || 27 ||

sa eva svapitāmātā sadgururvidhirīśvaraḥ |
paramātmā paraṃbrahma sa eva harirucyate || 28 ||

prayatnenāpi saṃsevya tasmādācāryamīśvaraṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ samastanyāsapūrvikāṃ || 29 ||

prajaptvā pratyahaṃ sarvaśreyasāṃ rāśimaśṇute |
caturdaśavidhanyāsakartā svācāryamīśvaraṃ || 30 ||

vinānyasmainavaṃdetavināsvapi tarāvapi |
adevo na yajñedevamityeṣāśāścatīśruti || 31 ||

nyāsena bhagavadrūpī bhūtvāttasmādyajeddhariṃ |
ācāryānujñayā nityaṃ kṛtvetthaṃ nyāsamādarāt || 32 ||

varṣādūrddhaṃ na saṃdehovaṃdhaḥsyādapi daivataiḥ |
ājñāsiddho mahāyogī bhavedbrahmasamonṛpa || 33 ||

ekena janmanaivāsaudustaraṃ ca bhavārṇavaṃ |
tīrtvā siddhimavāpnoti devānāmapi durlabhāṃ || 34 ||

prajaptvā śrīmadṛṣṭārṇamanvahaṃ nyāsapūrvakaṃ |
sakṛsmaraṇatovāpi japakoṭiphalaṃ labhet || 35 ||

ajñātvā sakalanyāsaṃpuraścaryāśatairapi |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīsiddhiṃ kalpakoṭiśatairapi || 36 ||

na kiṃcidapyavāpnoti satyaṃ satyaṃ mahīpate |
sārātsāratadaṃ puṇyamāgameṣu śrutiṣvapi || 37 ||

atiguptataraṃ nyāsamapyekaṃ pravadāmyahaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāmādāvuccārya yatnataḥ || 38 ||

 vinyasenmātṛkāvarṇānakhilātpūrvavannṛpa |
vidrūparmātṛkānāma prokteyaṃ sarvakāmadhuk || 39 ||

caturdaśavidhanyā samakṛtvāpi dine dine |
cidrūpamātṛkānyāsamavaśyaṃ pratyahaṃ nyaset || 40 ||

śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīvidyā pūrvikāṃ mātṛkāṃ śubhāṃ |
vinyasya pratyahaṃ japtvā śatamaṣṭocaturaṃ tu vā || 41 ||

<p. 60a>

puraścaryā phalaṃ nityaṃ prāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
caturdaśavidhaṃ nyāsaṃ nyasyācidrūpamātṛkāṃ || 42 ||

brahmaviṣṇumaheśādi daivatairapi pūjyate |
samastanyāsasahitā śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīśubhā || 43 ||

prajaptvā saphalājñeyā niṣphalaivānyathā smṛtā |
brahmatādātmyasaṃsiddhimaṇimādiguṇāṃśriyaṃ || 44 ||

 icchatācāryavaktrābjādgṛhītvānyāsapūrvikā |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāprajapyā sarvasiddhidā || 45 ||

raśmimālāṃ prajaptvādaunyāsa jālamataḥ yataḥ paraṃ |
śrīdaṣṭākṣarīṃvidyāṃ dadyācchiṣyāya sadguruḥ || 46 ||

satyaṃ satyaṃ pravakṣyāmi bhūyo śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā japtavyānyāsa pūrvikā || 
47 || 

anuttara brahmatatvarahasye śrutisaṃgrahe |
taṃtre dāśarathīyesminnadhyāyoṣṭādaśaḥ smṛtaḥ || 48 ||

iti śrīmadanuttara brahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
aṣṭādaśodhyāyaḥ] ||

<p. 60a>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

itthaṃ nyastatanurnityaṃ sākṣādbhagavadātmakaḥ |
dhyāyennirāmayaṃ vastu sarvabrahmāṃḍanāyakaṃ || 1 ||

vācāmagocaraṃ sargasthitisaṃhārakārakaṃ |
anuttamaṃ durādharṣaṃ durvijñeya manūpamaṃ || 2 ||

vālārkakoṭisadṛśaṃ caṃdrakodyayutaprabhaṃ |
ādimadhyātarahitaṃ niṣkalaṃ niraṃjanaṃ || 3 ||

na sthūlena ca sūkṣmaṃ yannadraṣṭuṃ śakyamadbhutaṃ |
mūādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ tejaḥ paramakṣayaṃ || 4 ||

tanmahatejasaḥ puṃjapiṃjarīṃkṛta vigrahaḥ |
dhyāyet svahṛdayāṃbhoje paramātmānamacyutaṃ || 5 ||

amṛtāṃvunidhermadhye pārijātavanāvṛtaṃ |
kalpadrumagaṇākīrṇāṃ divyaprākāraśobhitaṃ || 6 ||

nānāmaṇigaṇākīrṇaṃ nānājanapadāvṛtaṃ |
tadviṣṇoḥ paramaṃdhāma vaikuṃṭhamiti viśrutaṃ || 7 ||

prākāraiśca vimānaiśca ratnasaudhaiścaśobhitaṃ |
tanmadhye nagarī divyāsā'yodhyeti prakīrtitā || 8 ||

devānāṃ pūrayodhyeti śrutisiddhāsanātanī 
maṇikāṃcanacitrāḍhyāprākārairvahubhirvṛtaṃ || ||
divyākṣarogaṇaiḥ strībhissarvataḥ samalaṃ kṛtāṃstoraṇairvṛtā || 9 ||

<p. 60b>

caturdvāra samāyuktāratnagopurasaṃvṛtā |
caṃḍādidvārapālaiśca kumudādyaiḥ surakṣitā || 10 ||

koṭibhānupratīkāśairgṛhapaṅktibhirāvṛtā |
ārūḍha yauvanernityaṃdivyaṃ nārīnarairvṛtā || 11 ||

tanmadhyeṃtaḥ puraṃramyamayodhyāyāṃ mahoharaṃ |
ratnaprākārasahitaṃ hematoraṇaśobhitaṃ || 12 || 

vimānairgṛhamukhyaiścaprākārairvahubhirvṛtaṃ |
divyākṣarogaṇaiḥ strībhissarvataḥ samalaṃkṛtaṃ || 13 ||

tanmadhye paṃḍapaṃ divyaṃ rājāsthānaṃ mahoccayaṃ |
māṇikya staṃbha sāhasrajuṣṭaṃ ratnamayaṃ śubhaṃ || 14 ||

nityairmuktaissamākīrṇaṃ sāmagānodyaśobhitaṃ |
madhye siṃhāsanaṃ ramyaṃ sarvadevamayaṃ śubhaṃ || 15 ||

dharmādi daivatairnityairnityaṃ pādamayātmakaiḥ |
dharmajñānavaraiśvaryavairāgyaḥ pādavigrahaiḥ || 16 ||

ṛksāmātharvaṇayajūrūpainityairvṛttaṃ kramāt |
ādhāraśakti cicchukti mukhyaśaktibhirāvṛtaṃ || 17 ||

vahni sūryeṃdusahitaṃ vainateyādibhirvṛtaṃ |
chaṃdomayaṃ sarvamaṃtramayaṃ ratnavibhūṣitaṃ || 18 ||

sarvākṣaramayaṃ divyaṃ yogapīṭhamanuttamaṃ |
tanmadhyeṣṭadalaṃ padmamudayārkaśataprabhaṃ || 19 ||

tanmardhyekaṇikāyāṃ tu sāvitryāṃ jagatīpatiṃ |
āsīnaṃ paramātmānaṃ śriyā sahaparātparaṃ || 20 ||

iṃdīvaradalaśyāmaṃ koṭikaṃdarpasuṃdaraṃ |
yuvānamudayādityasamakoṭi samadyutiṃ || 21 ||

komalāvayavairyuktaṃ koṭipūrṇaidusannibhaṃ |
prabuddhaṃ puṃḍarīkākṣaṃ kāmadevāya samabhruvaṃ || 22 ||

sunāsaṃsukapolāḍhyaṃ suśrotrāna na paṃkajaṃ |
muktāphalābhadaṃtādyasasmitadharavidrumaṃ || 23 ||

pūrṇeṃduśatasaṃkāśaprasannamukhapaṃkajaṃ |
taruṇāditya varṇābhyāṃ kuṃḍalābhyāṃ virājitaṃ || 24 ||

susnigvanīlakuṭilakuṃtalairupaśobhitaṃ |
maṃdārapārijātāḍhyakavarīkṛtakeśakaṃ || 25 ||

prātarudyatsahasrāṃśunibhakaustubhaśobhitaṃ |
hārasvarṇasragāsaktakaṃṭhuṃgrīvavirājitaṃ || 26 ||

<p. 61a>

siṃhaskaṃdhanibhaiḥ proñcaiḥ pīnairaṃsairvirājitaṃ |
pīnavṛtāyatabhujaiścaturbhirupaśobhitaṃ || 27 ||

aṃgulīyaiścakaṭakaiḥ keyūrairatimaṃḍilaṃ |
vālārkakoṭiśaṃ saṃkāśakaustubhādivibhūṣisau || 28 ||

virājita mahāvakṣyasthalaṃ sarvāṃgasuṃdaraṃ |
divyamālāṃvaradharaṃ vanamālīvirājitaṃ || 29 ||

vidhātujjananasthānanābhipaṃkajaśobhitaṃ |
vālātapanibhaślakṣṇapītavastrayugāṃvṛttaṃ || 30 ||

nānāratnavicitrāḍhyakaṭakābhyāṃ virājitaṃ |
sajyothyacaṃdrapratimanakhapaṃṅktivibhūṣitaṃ || 31 ||

koṭikaṃdarpalāvaṇyasaudaryanidhimacyutaṃ |
divyācaṃdanaliptāṃgaṃ divyapuṣpasraganvitaṃ || 32 ||

saṃkhacakragṛhītābhyāmuhubhyāṃ virājitaṃ |
varadābhayahastābhyāmitarābhyāṃ tathaiva ca || 33 ||

vāmāṃkesaṃsthitāṃ devīṃ mahālakṣmīṃ maheśvarīṃ |
hiraṇyavarṇāṃ hariṇīṃ suvarṇarajatatprajāṃ || 34 ||

sarvalakṣaṇasaṃpannāṃ yauvanāraṃbhavigrahāṃ |
ratnakuṃḍalasaṃyuktāṃ vālīyugalaśobhitāṃ || 35 ||

divyacaṃdanaliptāṃgīṃ divyapuṣpopaśobhitāṃ |
maṃdāraketakījātīkusumāṃcitakuṃḍalāṃ || 36 ||

muktāmāṇikya khacitanāsikābharaṇānvitāṃ |
bhagavaccāyasadṛśa bhūyugmena virājitāṃ || 37 ||

rājīvāyatanetrāṃtāmaṃjanāṃccitalocanāṃ |
alaṃkaśaraccaṃdra sahasrasadṛśānanī || 38 ||

muktājālasamaprakhyaṃ daṃtapaṃṅktivibhūṣitāṃ |
ekaviṃvaphalaprakhyādharaṃ dvayavirājitāṃ || 39 ||

taruṇādityasaṃkāśakarṇapuṣpopaśobhitāṃ |
susrignanīakuṭilakuṃtalairupaśobhitāṃ || 40 ||

smitavaktrāṃ viśālākṣīṃ prasannavadanāṃvujāṃ |
ādyabhūṣaṇaciṃtākapadakādivibhūṣitāṃ || 41 ||

hārasvarṇasragāsaktakaṃ yugnīvavirājitāṃ |
taptakāṃcana varṇābhāṃ taptakāṃcanabhūṣaṇaṃ || 42 ||

hastaiścaturbhissaṃyuktāṃ kanakāṃvarabhūṣaṇāṃ |
nānāratnavicitrāḍhyakanakāṃvujamālayā || 43 ||

<p. 61b>

hārakeyūrakaṃṭakairaṃgulīyaiścaśobhitāṃ |
bhujadvayadhṛtodagra padmayugmavirājitāṃ || 44 ||

gṛhītamātuluṃgākhyājāṃvūnadakarāṃñcitāṃ |
mātaraṃ sarvajagatāṃśaraṇāgatavatsalāṃ || 45 ||

brahmarudra maheṃdrādimaulimāṇikyajātayā |
kāṃtyāvirājitapadāṃbhaktatrāṇaparāyaṇāṃ || 46 ||

evaṃ nityātapāpinyā mahālakṣmyā samanvitaṃ |
aṃ	takoṭibrahmāṃḍenāyakaṃ bhaktavatsalaṃ || 47 ||

tejomayaṃ jagadvaṃṣṭyaṃ śrīpataṃ parameśvaraṃ |
pārśvayodharaṇīdevyānīlādevyā samanvitaṃ || 48 ||

saṃsevitaṃ cāṣṭadikṣu vimalādyaṣṭasaktibhiḥ |
anaṃtavihagādhīśaṃ senānyādyaiḥ sureśvaraiḥ || 49 ||

nityamuktaiḥ samākīrṇamanyaiḥ parijanairapi |
sarvadevottamairvaṃdyaṃ dhyeyaṃ sakalayogibhiḥ || 50 ||

nārāyaṇamahaṃ vaṃdebhaktaprāṇaparāyaṇaṃ |
itthaṃ lakṣmīpatiṃ dhyātvā nārāyaṇamajaṃ vibhuṃ || 51 ||

ācāryaṃ mastakenatvā śrīmaddaṣṭākṣarīṃ japet |
ācāryavadanādevadhyānasūktamidaṃ śubhaṃ || 52 ||

gṛhītvā satataṃ dhyātvā paṭhitvāpi dine dine |
brahmatādātmyasaṃsiddhiṃ vrajatyāśu na saṃśayaḥ || 53 ||

vālārkamaṃḍale yadvā saṃsaptakanakaprabhaṃ |
vedāśvarathamārūḍhaṃ pītāṃvaravirājitaṃ || 54 ||

kirīṭakuṃḍaladharaṃ muktāhāravirājitaṃ |
suvarṇaratnakhacitamudrikābhiralaṃkṛtaṃ || 55 ||

rājīvāyatanetrāṃtaṃ prasannavadanāṃvujaṃ |
vālāditya sahasrābhaṃ kāmakoṭi samadyutiṃ || 56 ||

akalaṃkaśaratpūrṇacaṃdrasāhasrasannibhaṃ |
suvarṇaratnakhacitamudrikābhiralaṃkṛtaṃ || 57 ||

<p. 62a>

śaṃkhacakragadāpadmadharaṃ śrīvatsavakṣasaṃ |
kaustubhodbhāsitoraskaṃ vanamālāvibhūṣitaṃ || 58 ||

mūrtimadbhiścaturvedaiḥ saṃstutaṃ parameśvarī |
munibhirvālakhilyādyairbrahmarudrādidaivataiḥ || 59 ||

yogibhissanakādyaiścastūyamānamaharniśaṃ |
vīrāsana samāśīnaṃ vidyutkoṭi samāśriyā || 60 ||

śriyā devyā mahālakṣmyā rājyalakṣmyāsamanvitaṃ |
śriyaḥ patiṃ trijagatāṃ hetu bhūtaṃ sanātanaṃ || ||

bhajāmi paramātmānaṃ śrībhūnīlāpatiṃhariṃ |
dhyānasūktadvayaṃ puṇyamidamuktaṃ mayā tava || ||

ācāryānugrahādeva gṛhītvā suśubhedine |
toṣayitvā śubhairarthairjaptvā dhyātvā ca saṃtataṃ || ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japtvā sahasraṃ vā catuḥśataṃ |
triśataṃ śatamekaṃ vā sākṣānnārāyaṇo bhavet ||

āścaryānutayānitya dhyānasūktadvayaṃ tu vā |
paṭhitvā pratyahaṃ dhīmān vimukto khilapātakaiḥ || ||

dihāṃte paramaṃdhāmapātī viṣṇossanātanaṃ |

iti dāśarathīyesmintaṃvedārthasaṃgrahedhyānasūktadvayadhyāya uktā 
ekonaviṃśakaḥ || 68 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
ekonaviṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||

<p. 62a>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

yaṃtroddhāramathovakṣye śṛṇuṣvāvahito nṛpa |
yatra saṃpūjya lakṣmīśaṃ brahmānaṃdasukhaṃ labhet || 1 ||

nyāsajālaṃya uditaṃ mayā pūrvaṃ mahīpate |
avaśyaṃ sakalanyāsāḥ kartavyā gurvanujñayā || 2 ||

nyāsena bhagavadrūpī bhūtvā maṃtramayaḥ pumān |
tataḥ hṛdayāṃbhoje dhyāyennārāyaṇaṃ vibhuṃ || 3 ||

<p. 62b>

yadvā nārāyaṇātmānaṃ dhyāyet svacāryamīśvaraṃ |
tatpralīmapi ca dhyoyettrijaganmātaraṃ śriyaṃ || 4 ||

bhagavanmūrtisidhyarthamātmanothamahīyate |
kirīṭavidyāmuccārya manasā kusumāṃjaliṃ || 5 ||

paṃcavāraṃ hṛdaṃbhoje pradadyānmaunamāśritaḥ |
trayīvījaṃ kirīṭetike pūreti padaṃ tataḥ || 6 ||

hāreti mukuṭetyuktākuṃḍaleti dharetyatha |
śaṃkhacakragadāpadmahastaśabdamataḥ paraṃ || 7 ||

pītāṃvaradharetyuktā śrīvatsāṃkita śabdataḥ |
vakṣasthalapadaṃ paścācchrībhūmisahitetyatha || 8 ||

svātmajyotiriti proktā tato kṣayapadaṃ nṛpa |
padaṃ dīpti karāpānaṃtādityeti padādatha || 9 ||

tejase hṛdayopeta vahni patnī padaṃ nṛpa |
ayaṃkirīṭamaṃtraḥ syādbhagavanmūrti siddhidaḥ || 10 ||

yaduktamaṃtradevasya maṃtresmin bhūṣaṇādikaṃ |
taddivya bhūṣaṇaṃ proktamanyanmānuṣabhūṣaṇaṃ || 11 ||

divyairvibhūṣaṇaiḥ śiṣyauya ācārya samarcayet |
avaśyaṃ bhagavadrūpī svayameva bhaveddhruvaṃ || 12 ||

mukhālaṃkaraṇaṃ divyaṃ yaduktaṃ kuṃḍaladvayaṃ |
taduktamālaṃkaraṇameteṣvapi mahīyate || 13 ||

tasmādavaśyaṃ saṃtaptakanakena vinirmitaṃ |
suśuddhapadmarāgākhyaṃ maṇiviṃduvibhūṣitaṃ || 14 ||

śubhedine śubhelagne puraścaryādi karmasu |
ācāryakarṇayordatvā praṇipātapurasaraṃ || 15 ||

suvarṇavālīyugmenatāṭaṃkābharaṇena vā |
ācāryapatnīmabhyarcya ṣaṇmāṣādiṃ dirāpatiṃ || 16 ||

paśyatyeva svacakṣurbhyāṃ satyameva mahīpate |
ācāryarūpiṇaṃ viddhimāmeva jagatīpatiṃ || 17 ||

tatpatnīṃ matpriyāṃ viddhi śriyaṃ trijagadaṃvikāṃ |
makarākṛti saṃtaptakāṃcanena vinirmitaṃ || 18 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ ramyaṃ padmarāgavibhūṣitaṃ |
ācāryakarṇayordatvā śubhalagne śubhedine || 19 ||

<p. 63a>

avaśyaṃ pitṛsāhasraṃmagnaṃ ca narakārṇave |
uddhṛtya kāṃcanamayaṃ vimānaṃ divyamakṣayaṃ || 20 ||

āruhyakoṭikaṃdarpasuṃdaro divyabhogabhāk |
brahmāṃḍamakhilaṃ bhitvā padaṃ prāpnoti śāśvataṃ || 21 ||

ihāpi paramāmṛddhiṃ dhanadhānyādi saṃkulāṃ |
putrapautravatī māyurā rogyasahitāṃ labhet || 22 ||

yadyadvibhūṣaṇaṃ divyamācāryāya samarpayet |
brahmānaṃda sukhāvāptikaraṃ tatanna saṃśayaḥ || 23 ||

pītāṃvarayugaṃ nityaṃ vāsassubhagavaddhṛtaṃ |
tadeva bhagavatyalyāśriyāpidhṛta bhanvahaṃ || 24 ||

ācāryāyāpi tatpatnyaidukūlayaḥ prayacchati |
grahaṇādiṣu puṇyeṣu kāleṣu niyatavrataḥ || 25 ||

divyapītāṃvaradharodivyālaṃkaraṇānvitaḥ |
brahmatādātmyasaṃsiddhimavaśyaṃ prāpnuyādasau || 26 ||

tasmādavaśyaṃ dātavyamalaṃkāradhanādikaṃ |
ācāryāya kapalyai tatsutebhyopi saṃtataṃ || 27 ||

yaṃtrasvarūpaṃ vakṣyāmi śrīyetaḥ paramātmanaḥ |
yatra saṃpūjya lakṣmīśaṃ brahmānaṃdasukhaṃ labhet || 28 ||

vilikhya ṣaḍaraṃ pūrvaṃ vṛtamaṣṭadalaṃ tataḥ |
tadvahirvilikhedvṛtaṃ caturasramataḥ paraṃ || 29 ||

ṣaṭkoṇamadhye praṇavadvayāṃtaravidarbhitaṃ |
sādhyaṃ karma samālikhya ṣaṭsukoṇeṣvataḥ paraṃ || 30 ||

saṃdarśana nṛsiṃhasya varṇaṣaṭkaṃ samālikhet |
śrīmadṛṣṭākṣarī varṇān vilikhedaṣṭapatrake || 31 ||

tadagreṣu śrīkarasyamanorekaikamakṣaraṃ |
likhitvā dvādaśāreṣu vāsudeva mahāmanoḥ || 32 ||

ekaikaṃ varṇamālikhya dvātriṃśāre tataḥ paraṃ |
nṛsiṃhānuṣṭubhanorekaikaṃ varṇamālikhet || 33 ||

nṛsiṃhaikākṣareṇāthaveṣṭayeddhṛtamaṃtataḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīviyāyaṃtramatadudīritaṃ || 34 ||

paṃcāśadakṣarau paścāddeṣṭayeccaturasrakaṃ |
caturasraṃ vināṣṭārṇayaṃtraṃ laghusamīritaṃ || 35 ||

<p. 63b>

caturasra samāyuktaṃ vṛhadyaṃtramudīritaṃ |
yaṃtrametalikhitvādau saivarṇaṃ rājataṃtu vā || 36 ||

bhūtaṃ yatramayaṃ tāmralikhītaṃvāṃ śriyaḥ pateḥ |
prāṇasaṃsthāpanaṃ kṛtvā subhalagne śubhedine || 37 ||

khācāryacaraṇāṃbhojahayaṃ saṃpūjya vastūbhiḥ |
alaṃkāraiścavāsobhirapi tasya kalatrakaṃ || 38 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ śamastanyāsa saṃyutāṃ |
triśagreśubhedine (*********) || 37 ||

khācāryacaraṇāṃbhojahayaṃ saṃpūjya vastūbhiḥ |
alaṃkāraiśca tādhika sāhasraṃ japtvā hutvā śataṃ ghṛtaṃ || 39 ||

raśmimaṃtraiḥ sakṛtvā pūjayet pratyahaṃ naya |
athavādhārayeyaṃtraṃgulīkṛtya yatnataḥ || 40 ||

dhāraṇārthaṃ va pūjārthayaṃtradvitayamādarāt |
vilikhya dhārayitvādau pūjayedyadisaṃtataṃ || 41 ||

maṃdabhāgyopi sakalasaṃpadā māśvāyo bhavet |
calaṃti saṃpadonyasya maṃdire kutracit kvacit || 42 ||

ādhivyādhi bhaye rakṣaḥ kūṣmāḍāṃdibhayeyu ca |
rakṣākaraṃ śubhakaraṃ sarkāriṣṭavimardadanaṃ || 43 ||

dhāraṇāt pūjanādasya mṛtyukālabhayaṃ na hi|
ācāryānugrahātasye mokṣa śrīśāśvātīśrubhā || 44 ||

tatyāṇi kamaleṣṭhatyavaṃśyaṃ nātraṃ saṃśayaḥ |
atha pūjāvidhānaṃte pravakṣyāmi dvidhāndaya || 45 ||

yasya vijñānamātreṇa mākṣādvikṣu mayo bhavet |
vimalotkarṣiṇī jñānākriyāyogā tathaiva ca || 46 ||

madvo satyātatheśātānānupahānavaśaktayaḥ |
navasakti dhṛtaṃyīṭamabhyarcyādauśriyaḥ pateḥ || ||

śaṃkhaṃ oṃ namaḥ yadamāmāṣyapadaṃ bhagavate tataḥ || 47 ||

viṣṇave yadamuccārya sarvabhūtātmane padaṃ |
vāsudevāya śabdaṃ ca tataḥ sarvātmaneyaddaṃ || 48 ||

yogapīṭhātmane paścātmane yaścānnati śabdasamanvitaṃ |
anena pīṭhaṃ maṃtreṇapīṭhaṃ bhagavatī yajet || 49 ||

ṣaṭkoṇamadhye mūlet lakṣmīmaṃtreyutenava |
śrīśrīśabdāvṛśākṣeryā samāvāhyaśriyaḥpatiṃ || 50 ||

kuryāt sarvopacārāṃśca śrīśrīśabrahmadiṣṭāyā |
mūlavidyāṃ śriyāṃśriyo maṃtrānbrahmavidyāṃ sāmuccaran || 51 ||

abhyacyeyaṃ ca dhāyaścāllakṣmīnārāyaṇau vibhū |
hṛdayādi ṣaḍaṃgāti ṣaṭkauṇaiṣathāccayaṃt || 52 ||

vāsudevaṃ saṃkarṣaṇaṃ pradyumnamaniruddhakaṃ |
dikṣvabhyacyeściyaṃ vāṇīṃ ratiṃ prītiṃ vidikṣu ca || 53 ||

<p. 64a>

dvitīyāvaraṇaṃ proktaṃ cakraṃ śaṃkhaṃ gahāṃvuje |
kaustubhaṃ muśalaṃ khaḍgaṃ vanamālā mataḥparaṃ || 54 ||

tṛtīyāvaraṇaṃ proktaṃ dhvajaṃ padmanidhiṃ tataḥ |
garutmaṃtaṃ śaṃkhanidhiṃ dikṣu vidmeśvaraṃ tata || 55 ||

vaṭukaṃ ca tatodargāṃ viṣṇuvate tataṃ vidikṣu ca |
caturthāvaraṇaṃ proktaṃ dikpālaiḥ paṃcamaṃ vidaḥ || 56 ||

tvadyu pūjāvidhāmaṃtre proktametadabhīṣṭadaṃ |
itthaṃ taṃtre sasamabhyarcyaramānāthaṃ jagatpatiṃ || 57 ||

vimuktassarvayathodyaismamastaphalasiddhibhāk |
vṛsūjāvidhānaṃte rahasyamapi saṃtataṃ || 58 ||

anugrahā suvakṣyāmitubhyaṃtra na kabhūyate |
caṃdraṃ pracaṃ ītyagdvāreyāśebhadrasubhadrakau || 59 ||

jayaṃ ca vijayaṃ paścādvārapālosamarcayet |
dhātāraṃ ca vidhātārasutaradvāti pūjayet || 60 ||

kubhudaṃ kumudākṣaṃ ca puṃḍurīkaṃcavāmana |
aṃvukarṇaṃ saṃvaṃ netraṃ susamukhasujhatiṣṭitaṃ || 61 ||

dikpatīnarcayeddisthamayo dhyānagaroṭhahiḥ |
tanmadhye bhagavaddivyāṃtaṃ pureti gṛhāya ca || 62 ||

nama ulkābhagavatogahītaḥ puramervayet |
maṇiprākyarasahritatomareti yadāsaraṃ || 63 ||

bhagavaddivyaya ito vimānayanamastathā |
vimānaṃ tatra saṃpūjyaṃ tanmadhye divyaśabdataḥ || 64 ||

aśarastrībhya ityuktā hṛdayenāśarastriyaḥ |
tanmadhye yadasaccārya rājāsthānayaṃdaṃ tataḥ || 65 ||

mahoccayapadaṃ maṃḍayoti nama uccaret |
itthaṃ mamḍayamabhyarcya tanmadhye yadamadhyatha || 66 ||

māṇikya staṃbha sāhasrajuṣṭā yadamapyatha |
ratnamaṃḍapamabhyarcyaṃ caturthyaṃtaṃ namocitaṃ || 67 ||

abhyacye maṃḍapaṃ paścādbhayopivasudhāyate |
tanmadhye sarvarvaveheti samaddiṣyapadāṃtparaṃ || 68 ||

ratnasiṃhāsanāyeti nabhimuccāmaṃḍapamabhyacye caturthyaṃtaṃtanānvitaṃ || 67 ||

abhyarcya maṃḍapaṃ paścādbhūyopi vasudhāyate |
tanmadhye sarvavedeti sumaddivya padātparaṃ || 68 ||

ratnasiṃhaṃ siṃhāmanāyetinabhimuccārya bhūyate |
siṃhāsanaṃ saṃmabhyarcya dharmaṃ jñānamataḥ paraṃ || 69 ||

vairāgyamapyathaiśvaryaṃ śiśvadharmataḥ paraṃ |
ajñānamapyavairāgyamanaiśvaryaṃ vidikṣa ca || 70 ||

samabhyarcyayatetyaścādṛgvehaṃ yattuṣāṃgaṇaṃ |
sāmavedaṃ tato vedamatharvaṇamataḥ paraṃ || 71 ||

<p. 64b>

śatirmādhāraśaktiṃ ca cicchaktiṃ ca sadāśivāṃ |
abhyarcya maṃḍalaṃ vahneryarjadarkasyamaṃḍalaṃ || 72 ||

caṃdraṃ maṃḍalamabhyarcya kūrmaṃ nāgādhiyaṃ tataḥ |
cainateyaṃtrayīrājaṃ yajecchaṃdāṃsyataḥ param || 73 ||

sarvamaṃtrānsamabhyarcya sarvamaṃtrākṣaretyatha |
yā yaddivyapadaṃ yogapīḍāyanama ityatha || 74 ||

yogapīṭhaṃ samabhyarcya pūrvokta manūnāpi ca |
tanmadhye yadamuccāryavāla sūyaśatetyatha || 75 ||

sannibhāyāṣṭadalataḥ padmāya mama uccaret |
padmamabhyarcya tanmadhye sāvitryai nama uccaret || 76 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtrasyahyārtha caṃdhautha daivataṃ |
vījaśatī tatonyasya devadevaṃ śriyaḥ pati || 77 ||

dhyātvā tvāsvaduduyāṃbhoje yaṃtrepyā vādyātrataḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃvidyāṃ vāsudevamanaṃtataḥ || 78 ||

ṣaḍakṣarī vaiṣṇavīcīśrīmaṃtrānatha saṃsmaret |
brahmavidyāṃ samuccārya samāvāhya śriyaḥparatiṃ |
savovacārānkurvīta śrīśrībrahmavidyayā || 79 ||

praṇavaṃ citkālāvījaṃ śrīśāṣṭākṣaraṃ tataḥ |
ratnasiṃhāsanaṃ yaścātkalpayāmi namaḥ padaṃ || 80 ||

upacāryāsanamukhyaiśca yattet sarvoyacārakaiḥ |
ratnasiṃhāsaṃsanaṃ yādyamarghyamācamanīyakaṃ || 81 ||

kṛtvā paṃcāmṛtasnānaṃhyanaṃ śuddhodakairatha |
ca sradvayaṃ svaparṇaccoyavīḥtayaṃ tataḥ || 82 ||

divya śrīcaṃdanaṃ yaścīdakṣatānkalpayedatha |
nānāvidhāni divyāniṃ kusumāni ca kalpayet || 83 ||

nānāvidhīniddivyānibhūṣaṇanparyayedatha |
dhūpadīpaṃ kalpayitvānīrājanamataḥparaṃ || 84 ||

chatraṃ ca cāmaraṃ dvaṃdvaṃ darpaṇaṃ cāpi kalpayet |
rakṣīmācamanīyaṃ ca bhūyo naivedyamādarārāt || 85 ||

yānīyamapihastāhāprakṣālanamataḥ paraṃ |
tāṃ kṛṣṇaṃ ca caturviśatyupacārān prakalapayet || 86 ||

pūrvoktavidhinālakṣmīpatiṃnārāyaṇaṃvibhuṃ |
ṣālagrāmaśilācaktodhyāyaṃtteḥthavāṃ tataḥ || 87 ||

brahmavidyāṃ samuccārya paṃcavāramathāyeta |
bhūdevīṃ dakṣiṇeyāśvaivāmenīlā samarcayet || 88 ||

ṣaḍaṃgānyarcayetpaścāddagrīśāsuradikṣu ca |
vāyavye madhyabhāge ca sarvadikṣu krammatraya || 89 ||

<p. 65a>

aṣṭadikṣudalāgreṣvavimalāstataḥ paraṃ |
vimalāmāditobhyarcya tata utkarṣiṇīṃ nṛpa || 90 ||

jñānāṃ kriyāṃtathā yogāṃ prahvīṃ satyāmataḥ paraṃ |
iṃśāmānugrahe paścārcayedvasudhāyate || 91 ||

tataḥ prācyādibhāgeṣu vāsudevaṃ śriyaṃ yajet |
saṃkarṣaṇamathovāṇīṃ pradyumnaṃ ratimapyatha || 92 ||

aniruddhatathā śāṃtiṃ dvitīyāvaraṇaṃ smṛtaṃ |
keśaṃ ca nārāyaṇaṃ mādhavaṃ goviṃdaṃ viṣṇumeva ca || 93 ||

mmadhusūdanamabhyarcyatau trivikramavāmanau |
śrīdharaṃ na hṛṣīkeśaṃ yamanābhamataḥ paraṃ || 94 ||

dāmodaraṃ saṃkarṣaṇaṃ vāsudevamataḥparaṃ |
pradyumnamaniruddhaṃ ca puruṣottamamapyatha || 95 ||

adhokṣajaṃ nārasiṃhamacyutaṃvajanārdanaṃ |
upeṃdraṃ ca hariṃ paścāccharī kṛṣṇaṃ cakramāghanet || 96 ||

tṛtīyāyaraṇaṃ paścānmatsyaṃ kūrmaṃ varāhakaṃ |
nārasiṃhaṃ vāmanaṃ ca jāmadagryamataḥ paraṃ || 97 ||

rāmaṃdāśarathiṃ paścādvalarāmamataḥ paraṃ |
buddha ca kalkimihyetānaṃvāṃ ratārāntramādyajet || 98 ||

caturthācaraṇaṃ proktaṃ satyamacyutameva ca |
anaṃtaṃ sarvamabhyarcya viṣṇarṣunamataḥ paraṃ || 99 ||

gajānanaṃ śaṃkhanidhiṃ yajetya pratinidhiṃ tataḥ |
paṃcamāvaraṇaṃ proktamṛgvedaṃ yajuṣāṃgaṇaṃ || 100 ||

sāmavedamatharvāṇaṃ sāvitrīṃ vihageśvaraṃ |
dharmaṃ ca yajñapuruṣaṃ ṣaṣṭhāṃvaraṇamīritaṃ || 1 ||

śaṃkhaṃ cakraṃ gadāṃ padmaṃ khaḍgaṃ śārṅhalaṃ tathā |
muśalaṃ sasamaṃ proktaṃ hevasyāvaraṇaṃ śubhaṃ || 2 ||

śadhīmaheṃdrausvāhāgrī tathā saṃhāriṇī yamau |
tāmasīnisṛtīyayaścabhārgavīvarūṇau tathā || 3 ||

gativāyucaṃ sa patikuveṇai ca tataḥ paraṃ |
rudrāṇīśaṃkaraupaścādurddhve vākcaturānanau || 4 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇaiśca paścādaṣṭamāvaraṇaṃ smṛtaṃ |
vajrāyudhaṃ śaktidaḍaukhaḍgaṃyāśaṃdhvaṃjaṃgadāṃ || 5 ||

triśūlamaṃvujaṃ cakraṃ navamāvaraṇaṃ smṛtaṃ |
dhyānmaruhuṇāścaiva viśvedevānataḥ paraṃ || 6 ||

yoginaḥ sanakādyāṃśca devaṣīnnāradādikān |
kapilādi mahāsiddhāṃ nṛtātreyādiyoginā || 7 ||

prahrādādi mahābhaktānāṃjjaneyādi kiṃ karān |
jñāninojanakādyāścanṛyākṣaśarathādikān || 8 ||

arcayitvāyanaḥ śrīśabrahmavidyāṃ samuccaran |
arkāvṛtyā samabhyarcya lakṣmīnārāyaṇau vibhū || 9 ||

upacārāndhūpadīpanaivedhādīnsamarpayat |
tata ācāryamuddiśya bhagavatsatridhau nṛpa || 10 ||

<p. 65b>
	
yatkiṃcidapi vā deyaṃ suvarṇaṃrataṃtaṃ tu vā |
tāmraṃ dhānyaṃ ghṛtaṃ vāpi prasahaṃśceya icchatā || 111 ||

yadvā saṃlpitaṃ citedītavyaṃmāsināsiva |
avaṃdhyaṃ divasaṃ kuryādanyathā pāpabhugbhavet || 112 ||

pūjāvidhānametate sampaṅnaha udīritaṃ |
mahāpātakasaṃdyaudyanāśanaṃ bhuktimuktida || 13 ||

aśaktaḥ prasahaṃ kartuṃ kuryādbhārgavavāsare |
māsimāsyathā vā kuryāt prathamebhāgarvadine || 14 ||

navarātravratevaśyaṃ kuryāt brahmahamarcanaṃ |
alabhyayomegeṣu sadākartavyaṃ pūjanaṃ nṛpa || 15 ||

taṃpālayati lakṣmīśaḥ prasahaṃ putravatsaṃdāḥ |
itthamarcyataḥ puṃsaḥ śreyo rāśirdinedine || 16 ||

sidhyaṃti saṃpadaḥ sarvabhogā api sudarlabhāḥ |
itthaṃ śrīśrīśayajanaṃ mahānyāga udāhṛtaḥ || 17 ||

rājasūyośca medho vānai tena sadṛśo bhavet |
nyūnātirikta saṃpūtyai yāgasāphalyasiddhaye || 18 ||

ācāryadīkṣiṇādadyādvitalobha vivarjitaḥ |
ācāryadakṣiṇāhīnaṃ yaddinaṃ vasudhāpate || 19 ||

yamahṛtairyamenāpitatra dṛṣṭo bhavatyasau |
yamabhītihaṃ puṃsāṃ bhogakhargāyavargarda || 20 ||

ācāryadakṣiṇādānaṃ pratyahaṃ vasudhāpate |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇainityamitthamarcatonṛpe || 21 ||

sidhyaṃti siddhayaḥ sarvāstridaśairapi durlabhāḥ |
pūjāvidhānametate proktaṃ janakabhūyaja || 22 ||

vedādhyanasuktasya sadācāravatīnvahaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā jayāsaktasya saṃtataṃ || 23 ||

anena vidhinā pujā karturanvahīmādarāt |
samastābhīśitaṃ tasyā sidhyapi sudurlarbha || 24 ||

anutarabrahmatatvarahasye śrutisaṃgrahe |
iti dāśarathīyetraviṃśodhyāya udīritaḥ || 125 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīyetaṃtre viṃśodhyāyaḥ samāptaḥ] ||
<p. 65b>

śrīrāmāya namaḥ

traṣaya ūcuḥ 

ṛṣya śṛṃga mahābhāgabhagavanyogināṃvaraṃ |
vedoditaṃ sadācāraṃ manvādyairapyudīritaṃ || 1 ||

ślatvanmukhācchyetu micchāyaḥ paraṃ kautūhalaṃ hinaḥ |
yathāśriyathatistuṣo bhaktānāṃ sataṃ bhavet || 2 ||

yathācitsyuśuddhiḥ syādyathā śuddhaṃ kalevaraṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī vidyāraśmimālāsamanvitā || 3 ||

yathānāyāsataḥ sidhyetatyaṃraṃ kahino mune |

śrīkratha śṛṃpra uvāca 

purā bhagavatā prokaṃ rudrāya paripṛcchate || 4 ||

<p. 66a>

jānakīpatinā śrautaṃ sadācāraṃ vadāmyahaṃ |
sādhya nārāyaṇe nādāvuktaṃ rājñe mahātmane || 5 ||

punardāśarathiḥ prāhaśaṃbhave jānakīpatiḥ |
brahmacaryaṃ vagāhamsthyaṃ vanavāsaścatikṣutā || 6 ||

catvāra āśramārāte dvijātīnāṃ nahāmate |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā samastāśramiṇāmapi || 7 ||

japtvābhīśita saṃsiddhiṃ hṛdyānmukti ca śāśvatīṃ |
sadācāravatānityaṃ samastanyāsasaṃyutā || 8 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā dadyānsiddhiṃ ca durlabhāṃ |
saṃkṣeyādadittaṃ pūrvaṃ sadācāraṃ mahāmate || 9 ||

punarviśeṣato vakṣye sāvadhānamunāḥ śṛṇu |

śrībhagavānuvāca 

śṛṇu rājanpravakṣyāmi sadācāraṃ mahāmate || 10 ||

yacchrutvāpi narodhīmānnājñānatimiraviśet |
brāhmaṇākṣatiyāvaiśyāstrayovarṇādvijāḥ smṛtā || 11 ||

prathamaṃ mātṛṃtojanmadvitīyaṃvoyanāpunāt |
yeṣāṃ kriyābhiṣekādi śmaśānāṃtā ca vaihikī || 12 ||

ādadhīta sudhīrgarbhamṛrtomūlayarmāṃsmajaṃ |
tasyaṃdanātyākyuṃ savanaṃ sīmaṃtīnnayanaṃ tataḥ || 13 ||

māsiṣaṣṭoṣṭamevāpijātetho jātakarma ca |
nāmahyekādaśegehāñcaturthemāsinikṣamaḥ || 14 ||

māsenna prāśanaṃ ṣaṣṭe ṛgadvevā yathākulaṃ |
śamamenī vrajatyeva vījagarbhajameva ca || 15 ||

strīṇāmetāḥ kriyāstūṣṇīpāṇigrāhastu maṃtravān |
samamevāṣṭame devā sāvitrīṃ brāhmaṇohaṃti || 16 ||

nṛpustvaikādaśevairayodvādaśevāyathākulaṃ |
brahmatejobhivṛdhyarthaṃ viprobdeyaṃ vamerhati || 17 ||

ṣaṣṭevalāthīnṛpratimauṃjīvaiśyoḥṣṭamedhiye |
mahāvyāhṛti pūrvacivedamadhyāyayedguruḥ || 18 ||

upanīya tataḥ śiṣyaṃ śaucari ca śikṣayet |
dhūrvoktavidhinā śaucaṃ kuryādā ca manasadā || 19 ||

daṃtān jihvāṃ sa viśodhyatvāmata viśodhanaṃ |
srātvāṃvudetairmaṃtraiḥ prāṇānāyamyayasrataḥ || 20 ||

upasthānaṃ sveḥ kṛtvā saṃdhyayohabhayorapi |
agnikārye tataḥ kṛtvā śrīmadadaṣṭākṣarīrataḥ || 22 ||

ācāryamabhivādyāthaviprāgryāṃścābhivādayet |
vuvaścasāvahamitisvupāptīta tato guruṃ || 23 ||

abhivādanaśīlasya vṛddhasevāratasya ca |
āpurvalaṃ yaśokṛddhirvarddhetaheraharniśaṃ || 24 ||

<p. 66b>

adhīte guruṇāhrataḥ prātyaṃ tasmai nivedayet |
karmaṇāmanasāvācāhitaṃtasyatvaret sadā || 25 ||

udhyāpyādharmatonvathaṃtsādhvātyajñānavatathā |
śaktā kṛtajñāḥścacayodrīhikalyānasūyakāḥ || 26  ||

kurvaṃtaḥ saduserājñāṃ pālanaṃ dharmamāsuyuḥ |
śrīmadaḥṣṭākṣarīṃ sāṃgāṃ jñātuṃjasu ca saṃtataṃ || 27 ||

āśrayehahyacaryepi brāhmaṇomuktisiddhaye |
vedīdhyayanasidhyarthaṃ prātyayeṣṭākṣarastha ca || 28 ||

āśrayet sahṛrūṃdhīmān gurudvayamathāpi vā |
dhārayenmekhilādaṃḍeya vīlājinameva ca || 29 ||

anidyeṣu carevaikṣyaṃ brāhmaṇedhālavṛtaye |
brāhmaṇakṣatriyaviśāmādimadhyāvasā tataḥ || 30 ||

bhaikṣyacaryākrameṇasthābhdṛvachahvopalakṣitā |
vāgyato gurvanujñātībhuṃjītānnamakutsayan || 31 ||

ekānnaṃ na samaśrīyācchāddheṣṇīyā tathā yadi |
anāyurogyamanāyuṣyamasurgyaṃ cāti bhojanaṃ || 32 ||

apurāyaṃ lokavidviṣṭaṃ tasmātatparivarjaryat |
na dvirbhujītacaikasmin divākvāpi dvijottamaḥ || 33 ||

sāyaṃ prātadvijīṣṇīyādagrahotra vidhānavat |
madhumāṃsaṃ prāṇihiṃsāṃbhāskarālokaṃnāṃjame || 34 ||

striyaṃ yayuṣitīcchīṣṭaṃ vasvidevavajjeyet |
aupanāyanikaḥkāso brahmakṣatraviśāṃparaḥ || 35 ||

āṣoḍaśāt dvārviśādā caturviṃśatidabdataḥ |
itothyūrvena saṃskāryāḥ patitādharmavarjitāḥ || 36 ||

brāhmarstāmena yajñena tatpati saṃparisajet | 
sāvitrīyatitaiḥ sārdhaṃ saṃsārgaṃni samāvaret || 37 ||

vaiṇaṃ ca rauravaṃ cāstaṃ kramāccarmadvijanmanāṃ |
upavītaṃ krameṇasyātkāryāsaṃśāṇamāvikaṃ || 38 ||

trivṛdvardhruvrataṃ tacca bhavatyāyurvivṛddhaye |
vilvayālāśayordvaṃge brāhmaṇasthanṛyasthatuṃ || 39 ||

nyagredha vāladalayovāṃdaroduṃvarauviśaḥ |
āmaulitvālalāṭaṃ vā nāsikoddhe pramāṇataḥ || 40 ||

brāhmakṣatraviśādaṃ śrutvagāvyīnāgnibhūṣitaḥ |
pradakṣiṇaṃ parīsāgnimuyasyāpadivākadaṃ || 41 ||

dehājinīpavītākya ślodbhakṣaṃ yathohitaṃ 
mātṛmātṛdyasūpitṛpitṛṣṇasṛpurasmarāḥ || 42 ||

prathamaṃ bhikṣaṇīyāḥ syurvaṃdhunārthastataḥparaṃ |
aupanādya nikekāletato viprāgryamaṃdira || 43 ||

bhikṣacaryaṃ careddhīmānanidhevasudhāpate |
yāvadvedamadhītesaucaredvedatānitra || 44 ||

<p. 67a>

brahmacārī bhavetā vahūrddhvaṃ snānogṛhī bhavet |
upakurvan gurornityaṃ tadakteṣu naiṣṭikaḥ || 45 ||

tiṣṇetāvadvarukule yāvatsyāhāyuṣaḥkṣayaḥ |
gṛhāśramaṃ samāśrisayaḥ punarbrahmacaryabhāk || 46 ||

nāsauyativaṃ nasthauvāsyāt sarvāśramavarjitaḥ |
anāśramī na tiṣṭheta dinamekamapidvijaḥ || 47 ||

āśramaṃ tu vinātiṣṭhanprāyaścittīyate hisyaḥ |
jayaṃ hīmaṃ vrataṃdānaṃ svādhyāyaṃ pitṛryaṇaṃ || 48 ||

vināśramaṃ prakurvāṇo nāsau tatphalamaśrūte |
mekhalājinadaṃḍāścaliṃgaṃ syādbrahmacāriṇaḥ || 49 ||

gṛhiṇo vedayallyāddinakharomavihīnatā |
tridaṃḍādiyateruktamupalakṣaṇamatravai || 50 ||

etallakṣaṇahīnastu prāyaścittī dine dine |
jīrṇaṃ kamaṃḍalaṃ daṃḍamayavītādine api || 51 ||

aśrucaitāni nikṣipya gṛhṇīyānya ca maṃtravat |
vidṛdhyāsṣoḍaśevarṣekeśāṃtaṃ karma cakramāt || 52 ||
	
dvāviṃśevā caturviṃśegāhaṃsthyasya pravṛtaye |
tapomajña vratebhyaśca savesmācchrubhakarmaṇaḥ || 53 ||

śrutirekodvitātīnāṃ heturni śreyasa śriyaḥ |
vedāraṃbhe visargeva vidadyāstraṇavaṃ sadā || 54 ||

aphalonoṃkṛtto casmāyasmātyaṭitīpina siddhaye |
vedasyavadanaṃ proktaṃ gāyatrīnniyaddāparā || 55 ||

tisṛbhiḥ praṇavādhābhirmahīvyā hṛtibhissadāḥ |
sahasraṃsādhikaṃ kiṃcittrikametajjayaṃtyamī || 56 ||

māsaṃ vahiḥ pratidinaṃ mahīvādṛpimucyate |
ātryavdṛmetadhobhyasthe srutidyastramananyadhīḥ || 57 ||

savyomamūrtiḥ śuddhātmāyāṃ brahmodhi gacchati |
trivarṇamayamoṃkāraṃ bhūrbhuvaḥ svāmititrayaṃ || 58 ||

padatrayaṃ tu gāyatryāstrayovedānadadṛhatarāt |
dakṣrametāścajayaḥ vyāhṛti pūrvakaṃ pūrvakaṃ || 59 ||

dhyayorvedaviddhi provedhyurāyena yujyate |
viḥdhikratordaśaguṇo japakraturudīrit || 60 ||

veṣmātjaṃyovi saṃśrīmadaṣṭāsarījayaḥ |
aśvamedhādiyāgebhyo dvāvuktāvaṃdhikaukrat || 61 ||

ācāryadakṣiṇādānaṃ mahādānaśatādapi |
adhikaṃ proktamācāryaivedavedāṃtaceddibhiḥ || 62 ||

adhītyavedān vedau vā vedaṃ vā śaktito dvijaḥ |
saṃpūrṇadhānyadharaṇīddānasyakalamaśrute || 63 ||

<p. 67b>

śrutimevaḥ sadābhyasyetapastapyan dvijottamaḥ |
śrutyabhyāsohi viprasya paramaṃ tapa ucyate || 64 ||

hitvā śruteradhyayanaṃyonyasahitumicchati |
sadogdhīṃ dhenumutsṛjyagrāmakoḍaṃ dadhukṣati || 65 ||

upanīyatuyaḥśithaṃ vedamadhyāyayedvijaḥ |
sukalyaṃ saradvasyaṃ ca tamācāryāṃ vidurvadhāḥ || 66 || 

bhagavadraśmisahitāsamastanyāsaṃsayutā |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīsāṃgālabhyateyanmukhāṃvujāt || 67 ||

ācāryoyaṃ śataguṇedhikaḥ pūrvagurorapi |
yodhyāya vedekadeśaṃ śrute raṃgānyathāpi vā || 68 ||

vṛtyarthaṃ su uyādhyāyovidvadbhiḥ paripaṭhyate |
yathāvidhi niṣaṃkādiyaḥ karma kurute dvijaḥ || 69 ||

saṃbhāvaye tathānyena gurussa iha kīrtyate |
athādhānātyākayajñādagrīyomādikānmakhyāt || 70 ||

sahasraśaḥ pitāmātāgauraveṇātiricyate |
piturmāturūpādhyāyā'harorācāryatopi ca || 71 ||

bhagavadraśmisahitaśrīmadaṣṭākṣarīpradaḥ |
sahasraśodhikaḥ prokta ācāryobhagavānasau || 72 ||

brahmanārāyaṇīvivāhaṃ sabhārāyaṇābhidhā |
ṣoḍaśārṇādividyāśca nṛsiṃhānuṣṭubhādayaḥśu || 73 ||

śuddhāṣṭasyara vidyāyāḥ kalāṃnāṃhaṃtaṣoḍaśīṃ |
sa sa koriyannūnāṃvaśāstrāṇāmapi saṃtaṃtaṃ || 74 ||

caturṇāmapi bhūvedānāṃ purāṇanāṃ ca bhūyate |
śuddhaiva śrīmadaṣṭārṇā rājñīnātodhikāparā || 75 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ sāṃgāṃ raśmisamanvitāṃ |
yaḥ prayacchati viprosau sādhakāya mahīyate || 76 ||

piturmāturūpādhyādvarovācāryatopyasau |
brahmaviṣṇūmaheśebhyopyadhikaḥ śataśonṛpa || 77 ||

vijñāyetthaṃ sadācārya tatvaṃ gusamapiśrutau |
ācāryacaraṇaṃbhoje bhaktassadā bhavet || 78 ||

viprāṇāṃ jñānatotyaitthaṃ vāhuttānāṃ ca vīryataḥ |
vaiśyānāṃdhānyadhenataścaturthānāṃ tu janmataḥ || 79 ||

yathādārūmayohastī yathā ca mamayogaḥ |
tathā vipronadhīyāmastrayomīnāmadhāriṇaḥ || 80 ||

svakarmaniratāṃnāṃ ca vedayajñākriyāvatāṃ |
brahmacārīvaredaikṣyaṃ veśyasuprayatīnvahaṃ || 81 ||

yatheṣṭaceṣṭonabhavehṛdornayanagocare |
na nāma pratigṛhṇīyātparokṣepyavahaṃ na || 82 ||

guruniṃdābhavedyatra parivādastu yatra ca |
karṇaupidhāvavāstheyaṃ yātavyaṃ vātatonyaktaḥ || 83 ||

kharoroḥparīvādāt śvābhavehurunidṛkaḥ |
matsakṣarīkṣadrakīraḥ syāti raskārādbhāvet krimiḥ || 84 ||

<p. 68a>

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarācāryaṃ nidāṃ śrutvāpi vā sakṛt |
puṣṭirvaṣa sahasrāṇivaṣṭāsukṛmitāṃ vrajet || 85 ||

nāmivādyā gurauḥpatnī spṛṣṭā strīpuvatiḥ satī |
kṛpiviṃśativarṣeṇajñāṇāgurudoṣayoḥ || 86 ||

svabhāvaścaṃ valastrīdīrṣaḥ puṃsāmataḥ smṛtāḥ |
pramadāsaprabhāvaṃti kṛcinnaivavipaścitaḥ || 87 ||

vidvāṃ samapyaviddhāṃ saṃstriyastādharṣavatsalaṃ |
svavaśaṃ cāpi kurvaṃti sūtravaddhaśakuṃtavat || 88 ||

namātrānadahitrāvānasvasraikāṃtaśīlatā |
valavaṃtīdriyāṇpatramohayaṃtyapikovida || 89 ||

guruśuśrūṣayānityaṃ prāṇairarthaiśca puṣkalaiḥ |
vidyāsidhyatitalpaścādbrahmapaśyatikevalaṃ || 90 ||

sūtasya saṃbhavakleśaṃ sahaṃti pitaraucayaṃ |
śaktyā varṣaśatenāpinokartuttasya niṣṇutiḥ || 91 ||

atastayoḥ priyakuryodācāryasya vasaṃtataṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīsāṃgā bhagavadraśmisaṃvutā || 92 ||

yasya vaktrāṃ vujāllabdhābhogasvargopavargadrī |
tasyoyakartaṃ kenāpi na śakyaṃ kalpakoṭibhiḥ || 93 ||

tamavaśyaṃ yajeddhīmān nārāyaṇamivāyāṃ |
janakemātariguṇairuṣutuṣṭeṣu saṃtata || 94 ||

tatayaḥ paramaprāhubrahmasāyujyasiddhidaṃ |
trīnyussamatikramya trikalpaṃ niyatatyatha || 95 ||

trīnevāsūnsamārādhyatrolphraukātsajayetsudhī |
pītāmātā ca veddānāyuyadeṣṭā tataḥ paraṃ || 96 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīdātā caturthogururucyate |
caturvargaphalaṃ proktaṃ caturgurusamarcanāt || 97 ||

pitaraṃ mātaraṃ vāpi tyajedvedagurutapi |
brahmavidyāpradācāryaṃ prāṇāṃtepinaḥ saṃtyajet || 98 ||

ekaikāpi mahāvidyāya savatre labhyate |
taṃptaktānarakeghoretiṣṭhasācaṃdratārakaṃ || 99 ||

raśmimālāpradācārya sāge vaktuṃ na śakyate |
sarvā api makṣavidyā yatrā tiṣṭhaṃti siddhidaḥ || 100 ||

tasmādbhagavato raśmividyādātāgururmahān |
sa eva sākṣādbhāgavānbhogasvargāyavargadaḥ || 1 ||

naṃtasateccaprāṇāṃtasarāvakuladaivataṃ |
raśmividyāpradāvāryosvasamīpasthite paraṃ || 2 ||

taṃhātkāyorcayedarthairākalpaṃ narake vaset |
ratnajātaissūvahnibhismatoṣyācāryamanvahaṃ || 3 ||

api brahmavidenyasmaidadānunadadātu vā |
nirvāṇāryapraktoyaṃ sadācāraścadhīmatāṃ || 4 ||

<p. 68b>

sadācāro gṛhe yadvanmatathāstyāśramāṃtare |
vidyājātaṃyavitvā tu gṛhāśramamathāśrayet || 5 ||

gṛhāśramātya iṃ nāsti yadiyatnovaśaṃvahā |
ātrukūlyaṃ hidaṃyatyostrivargaphalahetave || 6 ||

anukūlaṃ kalannaṃ cettridivenahi kiṃ tataḥ |
pratikūlaṃ kalatrecennaskeṇahi kiṃ satataḥ || 7 ||

gahāśramaḥ sukhārthāya bhārgyā mūlaṃ hi tatsukhaṃ |
svabhāryāyaṃ vinītāyāṃ trivargovarddhate dhruvaṃ ca || 8 ||

talaukayoyamīyaṃte pramadāmaṃdabuddhibhiḥ |
jalaukākevalaṃ raktamādadānāmamasvinī || 9 ||

pragohaśāṃjalaukānāṃ vicārānmahadaṃtaraṃ |
pramadā sarvaṃmādate cittaṃ vittaṃvalaṃ sukhaṃ || 10 ||

dakṣīprajāvatī sākṣāstriyavākyavaśaṃvado |
gurṇeramībhissaṃyuktājñāstrīḥhrāyanāṃ 
vicārānmahadaṃtaraprayadāsarṣamādatecitaṃvilaṃvalaṃ sukhaḥ śrīrūpadhīrīṇī || 
111 ||

guroranujñayā srātvāvrartavehaṃ samāpya ca |
udvahena tato bhāryāṃ savarṇe sāhulakṣaṇaṃ || 12 ||

rogahīnāprāptamatīṃ khasmāt kiṃ viṣṇadhīyasīṃ |
udvahetadvijobhāryāṃmyāsyāṃ mṛdubhāṣiṇīṃ || 13 ||

lakṣaṇāni parokṣyādau tataḥ kanyā samudvahet |
sulakṣaṇamucāritrāya surāyurvivarddhayet || 14 ||

sulakṣaṇāpiduḥśīlākulakṣaṇaśiromaṇīḥ |
kulakṣaṇāpiyāsādhvī sarvalakṣaṇayūsusā || 15 ||

sulakṣaṇā sucāri āsvādhīnāyati devatā |
lakṣmīśānugrahādeva gṛheyopi daṣavāpyate || 16 ||

alaṃkṛtāh suvāsinyodhābhiḥ prāktanajanmani | 
nānāvidhairalaṃkāraissurūyāstābhavaṃtihi || 17 ||

sutīrtheṣu vayuryāmiḥ kṣālitaṃ tyājitaṃluvā 
tālāvarāyataraṃgirāyo bhavaṃti hi sulakṣaṇaḥ || 18 ||

arcitājagatāṃmāḥtāpābhiḥ śivavadhūriha |
nārāyaṇapriyāśrīrvāśacīvāśakravallabhā || 19 ||

tābhavaṃti sucāritrāyoṣāḥ svādhīnabhartṛkāḥ |
 svādhīnayatikānāṃcasuśīlānāmṛgīdaśāṃ || 20 ||

svargāṃ yavargāvatraiva sulakṣaṇaphalaṃ hi tat |
sulakṣaṇaiḥ smacāritrairapi maṃdoyuṣaṃpatiṃ || 21 || 

dīpoyuṣaṃ prakurvaṃti pramadāhyaṃ yadāsyada |
ācāryapatnīśrīvudhyāvāsolaṃkaraṇādibhiḥ || 22 ||

<p. 69a>

prāgjanmanyarcitāśiṣyaistasatrībhirevavā |
te sarvabhāgyasahitāḥ kaṃdarpasadṛśaprabhāḥ || 23 ||

putrapautrādisahitārājñarājasamāśriyaḥ |
anuttarabrahmatatvarahasye śrutisaṃgrahe || ||

adhyāya ekaviṃśoyaṃ taṃtre dāśarathīrite || 124 ||

[iti śrīmadanutarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
ekaviṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 69a>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

vivāhānapi vakṣyāmi nivodhavasudhāyate |
yeṣāṃ vijñānamātreṇa sarvayāyaiḥ pramucyate || 1 ||

vivāhābrāhmadaivārṣāḥ prājāpratyāsuṇaitathā |
gāṃdharvorākṣasaścīpiyaiśācoṣmaducyataṃ || 2 ||

sa brāhmo paramāhūya yatra kanyā svalaṃkṛtā |
dīyate tatsutaḥ eyāsuruṣānekaviṃśati || 3 ||

yadārthamṛtvijedaivastajraḥ pāti caturdaśa |
parāhādāpagoddaṃ dvayārṣastajjaḥ punātiṣadra || 4 ||

sahomaucaratāṃ dharmamītyuktādīyaterthine |
tatkanyāyāṃ samuhānnovaṃśyānaṣṭau punātisaḥ || 5 ||

catvāra ete viprīṇāṃdhamyāṃ pāṇiṃ grahīḥ smṛtāḥ |
āsuraḥ krayaṇādravyairgāṃdharvonyonyaṃdyaṃtaḥ || 6 ||

prasahyakanyoharaṇaṃ rākṣasoniṃditassatāṃ |
chalena kanyāharaṇātyaiśācogahiṃtoṣṭamaḥ || 7 ||

prāyakṣatraviśāmuktāgāṃdhavosurarākṣasāḥ |
aṣṭamasteyuyāpiṣūḥpāṣiṣṭhānāṃ hi saṃbhavet || 8 ||

savarṇayārogrāsvodhāyaṃ sutriyapāśaraḥ |
pratodorveśyayādeyovāsoṃtaḥ śūdrayā tathā || 9 ||

asavaḥrṇordyeṣavidhiḥ smṛta utkṛṣṭavetane |
savarṇābhista sarvābhiḥ pāṇirgrāsvāsvayṃvidhiḥ || 10 ||

dharmyaivivāhairjāyaṃte dharmyā evaśatāguṣah |
adharpyairdharmarahitāmaṃdabhāgyadhanāyuṣaḥ || 11 ||

ṛtukālābhigamanaṃdhamaiyaṃ gṛhiṇaḥ paraḥ |
strīṇaṃ varamanusmṛtvā yathā kāmyatha vā bhavet || 12 ||

divābhigamanaṃ pusāmatā puṣpaṃ paraṃmataṃ |
śrīddhārhasarvaparvāṇi yatvāsājyānidhīmatā || 13 ||

tatra gaṣṭan śriyaṃ mohāyutocaṃmodbhavatyasau |
ṛtukālābhigāmoyaḥ svadāratirataścayaḥ || 15 ||

sasādhubrahmacārīhavijñeyaḥ sahṛhāśramī |
ṛtuḥ ṣoḍaśayāminyaścatastrastāsuvahiṃtāḥ || 16 ||

prakrāstāsvaviyāyugmā ayugmāḥ kanyakāprajāḥ |
yuktvā caṃdramasadusthaṃ madyāṃmūlaṃ vihīya ca || 17 ||

śuciḥ sannirviśetpatnīṃ punnāmarkṣe viśeṣataḥ |
śuciṃ putraṃ prasūyeta puruṣārthaprasādhakaṃ || 18 ||

<p. 69b>

ārṣevivāhogodvaṃdvaṃ yudaktaṃ tanna śasyate |
śuklamarāyapi kanyāyāḥ kanyāvikrayāya yakṛt || 19 ||

ayatyavikrayīkṛtyaṃ vaset vidkrimibhojane |
atonā evapi kanyāyā upajīve sitādhane || 20 ||

strīdhanādayajīvaṃtiye mohādihavāṃdhavāḥ |
kevalaṃ nirayagāsteṣāmapi ca yūrvajāḥ || 21 ||

patnyāthyati yatra strītuṣyeyatra strīyāpatiḥ |
tatra tuṣṭhā mahālakṣmīrnivesedvānavāriṇāḥ || 22 ||

vāṇijyaṃ nṛpatessaivāvedānadhyayanaṃ tathāḥ |
kuvivāhaḥ kriyālopaḥ kulepāta na hetavaḥ || 23 ||

kuryādvaivāhikevahraugārhyaṃ karmānvahaṃgṛhī |
paṃcayajñakriyāṃ vāpi patnīdainaṃdinīmapi || 24 ||

gṛhasthāśramiṇa paṃcasūnākarmaḥ dine dine |
khaṃḍinī yeṣiṇī cukṣo khadakuṃcamārjanī || 25 ||

tāsāṃ ca yaṃcasūnāṃ nānirākaraṇahetavaḥ |
ṛtavaḥ paṃcanirdviṣṭāpṛhīśreya vivarddhanāḥ || 26 ||

paṭhanaṃ brahmayajñaḥ syātarpaṇaṃ ca pitṛkratuḥ |
homodaivovalibhautotithyacāṃdikratuḥ kramāt || ||

khupitu prītiṃ prakurvāṇaḥ kurvītamaśrīddhamanvarhaṃ |
atrodakupayobhūlaphalaivopi gṛhāśramī || 28 ||

dhenudānena yatpuṇyaṃyāḥtrāyaviddhipūrvakaṃ |
satkṛtya bhikṣave bhikṣāṃ datvā tu māpnuyāt || 29 ||

tayo vidyā samidīṃ sehutaṃ viprāsthayāvake |
tārayedvighnasaṃghebhyaḥ yāyaudhādapidustarāt || 30 ||

anarcitotithigeṃhādbhagrāśo yasya gacchati |
ājanmasaṃcitātpuṇyāpṛtchaṇātsavahirbhavet || 31 ||

sāṃtvahṛrvāṇivākyāniśapyāyaṃ bhūtaṇedake |
etānyapi pradeyāni sadābhyāgatatuṣṭaye || 32 ||

gahasthaḥ parayākādīpretyatatyaśutāṃ vrajet |
śreyaḥ parānnapuṣṭasya gṛhṇīyādannadoyataḥ || 33 |

bhuṃjāno tithiśeṣānnamāyurvardhanabhādbhavet |
praṇodhātithimannāśīkiliṣī ca gṛhāśrīmī || 34 ||

vaiśvadevāṃta saṃprāptasūryādhotithirāgataḥ |
na pūrvakāla āyā tīnacadeṣṭa tataḥ kvacit || 35 ||

valipātrakarevipreya padyannyotithirāgataḥ |
adatvātaṃvaliṃ tasmai yathā śaktyannamapye yet || 36 ||

kumāryaśca suvāsinyogarbhirāyotiruttāktitāḥ |
atithiścārthinopyeṃtebhojyā nātra vivāraṇā || 37 ||

<p. 70a>

pitṛdevamanudyebhyo datvā mosumṛtaṃ gṛhī |
svārthaṃ yacannadyaṃ bhuṃkte kevalaṃ svodaraṃbharaḥ || 38 ||

ācāryapatnīputrāṇāmatrasūyaghṛtādikaṃ |
aparāmṛśyayobhuṃṅkte sabhuṅgapāpamakṣayaṃ || 39 ||

madhyāhnikavaṃ vaiśvadevaṃ nityaṃ kuryāt pratyatnataḥ |
vaiśvadevavivihīnāye ātithyena vivarjitāḥ || 40 ||

te sarvevṛṣalājñeyāḥ prāvehā api dvijāḥ |
akṛtvā vaiśvadevaṃ tu bhuṃjate yadvijādhaḥ || 41 ||

ihalokepihīnāsyuḥ kākeyoniṃ vrajaṃtyatha |
vedoditaṃ svakaṃkarmanityaṃ kuryādataṃdritaḥ || 42 ||

tatyakurvanyathāṃśaktiprānyuyātsvagītiṃ parāṃ |
ṣuṣṭyāṣṭamyosmyajedbhayaṃ tailaṃ māsasyabhakṣyaṃsāṃ || 43 ||

cunudeśyāyaṃ ca daśyāṃ strīsaṃgamapi varjayet |
nodayaṃtamavekṣyet nāstaṃ yāṃtaṃ na madhyagaṃ || 44 ||

na rāhuṇema spṛṣṭaṃ canāṃvusaṃsthaṃ dvivākaraṃ |
na vīkṣetītmanīrūpamasadhāvennavarṣati || 45 ||

nollaṃghayedvatsatarīṃ na nagrojalamāviśet |
devatāyatanaṃ vipraṃ dhenuṃ madhumṛdeghṛtaṃ || 46 ||

jānavṛddhaṃ vayovṛṃddhaṃ vidyāṣṭaṃtasvinaṃ |
aśvatthacaisavṛkṣyaṃ ca guruṃjalaghṛtaṃ ghaṭa || 47 ||

siddhānnaṃdabhisiddhārthaṃgacchankuryātyadakṣiṇaṃ |
hajasvalāṃ na sevetanāṣṇīyāt sahabhāryayā || 48 ||

ekavāsānabhuṃjītanabhuṃjītītkaṭāsane |
nāṣṇaṃtīṃ striyamīkṣetatejaskāmodvijottataḥ || 49 ||

asaṃtarpyayindandevānnādyādannaṃ navaṃ kvacit |
asaṃtarpye sadācāryaṃ na ratnaṃ dhārayet kvacit || 50 ||

paściṣṭī ca vināmāṃsaṃ dīrghakālaṃjijīviṣu |
na mūtraṃ gauvrajekuyonnavalmīkena bhasmani || 51 ||

na garteṣu na satveṣu na tiṣṭhan jannapigo |
viprasūrya vāyvagricaṃdrārkovagustapi || 52 ||

abhipaśyannakavītamalamūtravisarjanaṃ |
divāṃ saṃdhyāsukarṇasya brahmasūtra udamukhaḥ || 53 ||

palaṃ mūtraṃ sajennityaṃ niśāyāṃ dakṣiṇāmukhaḥ |
mukhenopadhamennāgriṃ nagrāṃ nekṣetayoṣitāṃ || 54 || 

naṃdhrīpratāpayedagnauḥ navastya śuci nikṣipet |
praṇihiṃsānukuvitanāṣṇīyāt saṃdhyayordvayoḥ || 55 ||

naṃ saṃviśecca saṃdhyāyāṃ pratyagryāpya śirā api |
virāmūtraṣṭhivanaṃ nāsyukuryāddīrghajijīviṣuḥ || 56 ||

<p. 70b>

nācakṣettadhayaṃtīṃgīṃ nedracāyaṃ prarśayet |
naikaḥ svadhyātkṛcicchatyenaśayānesavodhayeyet || 57 ||

naikoyāpānnaṃyaṃthānāṃnavāryaṃ jalināpivet |
nadivoddhatasāraṃ ca bhakṣayedadhinoniśi || 58 ||

strīdharmiṇyānābhivadennādyādātṛprirā viṣutau |
yaṃtrikapriyo nasyātkāṃ syeyādaunadhāvayet || 59 ||

śrīddhakṛtvāyaraśrāddhayoṣṇīyījñānavarjitaḥ |
dātuḥ śrīdvraphalanāstibhoktā kilviṣa bhāgbhavet || 60 ||

na dhārayedanyanuktaṃ vāsaścoyānahāyapi |
nabhinnabhojaneṣṇīyānnāṣṇītāgnyādihṛṣitaṃ || 61 ||

ārohaṇaṃgacāṃ pṛṣṭe pretadhūmasaritamaṃ |
vālātayaṃdivāsvāyaṃtyajedīryajajīviṣuḥ || 62 ||

srotvā na mārjayehātraṃ visṛjennaśikhāṃpathi |
hastauśironudhanuyānnākarṣehāsanaṃ yadā || 63 ||

notyādayellomanakhaṃ daśanena kadācca |
karajaiḥ karajaccheraṃ tṛṇavedaṃvavarjayet || 64 ||

śubhāyanayadāyātityajetatkameyatataḥ |
nāyadvoreṇagaṃtavyaṃ khaṃ veśmaparaveśmanoḥ || 65 ||

krīḍetrākṣaiḥ sahāsītanadharmadyainarrāgibhiḥ |
naśayīta kṛcigraḥ prāṇairbhuttotanaiva ca || 66 ||

ārdrayādakarāsyonnaṃ dīrghakālaṃ ca jīvāti |
saṃviśennārdracaraṇonīcchīṣṭaḥ kvacidavrajet || 67 ||

śayanasyona vāṣṇīyānnapivennajayedvijaḥ |
soyānatkaścanācāmannatiṣṭan dhārayārṣivet || 68 ||

sarvaṃ tilamayaṃ nādhātsāyaṃ śarmābhilāṣukaḥ |
na ca vīkṣetavirāmūtrenocchiṣṭasaṃspṛśedviraḥ || 69 ||

nācitiṣṭhetuṣāgārabhasmadeśakayālīkāḥ |
patitaissahasaṃ vā saṣyatanāyaiva jāyate || 70 ||

śrīvayedvaidikaṃ maṃtraṃ na śūdrāddādyakadācana |
brāhmaṇyāddhāyate vipraḥ śūdrodhamoccahīyate || 71 ||

dharmopadeśaḥ śūdrāṇāṃ svāṃśreyaḥ pratipādayet |
dvijuśrūṣaṇaṃ dharmaḥ śūdrāṇāṃ paramaḥ smṛtaḥ || 72 ||

kaṃḍayanaṃ na śirasaḥ pāṇibhyāṃ śubhadaṃ mataṃ |
āṃdolanaṃ karābhyāṃ ca keśānāṃ keśaluṃchanaṃ || 73 ||

aśastravartino bhūyāllabdhāt kṛtvā pratigrahaṃ |
brāhmaṇaḥ sānvayo yāti narakānaikaviṃśati || 74 ||

akālavidyustaniteṣarṣayoryāṃ śuvarṣaṇe |
mahāvātardhanaurātrāvanadhyāyāḥ prakīrtitā || 75 ||

ulkāpātadhanaukaṃ yedihāhemadhyarātriṣu |
saṃdhyayordṛṣaloyāṃte rājavādhe ca sūpake || 76 ||

harśeṣṭakāsubhūtāyāṃśrādvikaṃ pratigṛhya ca |
pratipadyapi pūrṇāḥ vāmamāyāṃ sarvayasu || 77 ||

<p. 71a>

svaroṣṛaktroṣṭuvirute samudoyerutyapi |
upākarmaṇivotsargenāvibhānautarautale || 78 ||

āraṇyakamadhītyāpiśāṇasonnoratidhvanau |
anadhyoṣu caiteṣunādhīyīvradvijaḥ kvacit || 79 ||

kṛtāṃtarāyonṛpaṭhetphakalāsādivabhrubhiḥ |
bhūtāṣṭamyoḥ paṃcadaśyorbrahmacārī bhavet sadā || 80 ||

avāpuṣpaṃ paraṃ cehaparadoroyadharṣaṇaṃ |
tasmāta dūratastyājya variṇāṃ copasevanaṃ || 81 ||

pūrvādibhiḥ parityaktamātmānaṃ nāyamānayet |
mavatāṃ yasmāchreyovidyānadarlabhā || 82 ||

satyaṃlūyāsviyaṃ krayānnadbhayāt sa samapriyaṃ |
prīpaṃcanānṛtaṃ vrūyādeṣadhamau mahīyate || 83 ||

bhadramevavadennityaṃ bhadrameva viciṃtayet |
bhadrairavahisaṃsargonābhadraiśca kadācana || 84 ||

stūpavitakulaihīnānasudhīrnādhiśiyenna |
etavīkṣītanāśricissatyabrahmarṣigrahatārakāḥ || 85 ||

vādhovegaṃ manogaṃ dihvāvegaṃ ca varjayet |
utkocadhūtadīnārtadravyaṃ dūrātparityajet || 86 ||

gobrāhmaṇāgrīnucchiṣṭaḥ vāṇitā naiva saṃspṛśet |
na spṛśedanimitetasvānikhānitvanāturaḥ || 87 ||

guhyajānyapiromāṇi tatsyarśādaśucirbhavet |
pādaśododakaṃ sūtrannmucchiṣṭatrodakāni || 88 ||

niṣṭīvaṃca śreśmīdyaṃ gṛhādraurevikṣipet |
aharniśaṃ śratijoyāṣṇautā vāniṣevaṇāt || 89 ||

adrohavatyāṃ matyāṃ ca jātiṃ smaratiyauvikīṃ |
vṛddhānprayatnādvaṃdetaneṣāṃdadyāt khamāsanaṃ || 90 ||

vinamramānasastvaiṣāmanuyāyāvataścatān |
śrutibhūdevadevānāṃ nṛpasādhutayasvināṃ || 91 ||

pativratīnāṃ nārīṇāṃ niṃdī kuryātra kutracit |
namanuṣyastutiṃ kusyātrātmānaṃ vahumānayet || 92 ||

abhyudyataṃ na praṇametyaṃ ramarmāṇinīccaret |
adharmānsevate pūrvaviṣūnavisarjayan || 93 ||

sarvato bhadragamyāpi naro naśyati sānvayaḥ |
uddhṛtyaṃ paṃcamṛtpiṃḍātsāyātyarajalāśaye || 94 ||

anuddhatya ca tatkarturenasaḥ syātuṃroyabhā |
kuśrāddhayāṃ pātrabhūtāyatkiṃcidīyatevasu || 95 ||

brahmabichatakoṭibhyodataṃdānasahasrakaṃ |
ācāryadānaleśasyakulāṃ nāṃhīti ṣoḍaśīṃ || 98 ||

śraddhayā pratigṛhṇāti śraddhayā pradradāti ca |
svargerṇautāvubhausyātāṃya tato śraddhayā svadhaḥ || 99 ||

anṛte nakṣaredyajñasnayovismayataḥkṣaret |
kṣaretkīrtanatodānamāyurviprāvamānataḥ || 100 ||

gaṃdhapuṣpakuśānśayyāṃkaṃśāmāṃsaṃyayodadhi |
maṇimālyagṛhaṃdhānyaṃ grāhyametadupasthitaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 71b>

madhudakaṃ phalaṃ mūlamedhāṃsya bhayadakṣiṇāṃ |
abhyudyatāni grāhyāṇi cetānyapinigṛṣṭātaḥ || 2 ||

itthamānṛrāyadyadevarṣiyitṛjādaṇāt |
mādhyasyamāśrayeddedīsutevidyagnisṛḥjya ca || 3 ||

gṛhevijñānamabhyasyecchīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ jayet |
avaśyaṃ gṛhiṇīkāryamācāyecaraṇārcanaṃ || 4 ||

ekena janmanāmuktiḥ śrīmaddaṣṭākṣaritarpat |
ekana tanmanāmuktirnaranārāyaṇāśrame || 5 ||

ekena janmanā muktirvārāṇasyāṃ mahīyate |
janmanāmuktirācāryacaraṇarcanāt || 6 ||

manasāpi sadācāmalaṃ vidvānna laṃghayet |
sadācāra paro nityaṃ misamācāryasevakaḥ || 7 ||

bhagavadraśmisahitāṃ samastanyāsa saṃyutā |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japtvā sākṣādbrahmamayo bhavet || 8 ||

gṛhasthasya sadācāra iti prokto mahīyate |
yamākarṇya narodhīmānmuṃcatyajñānajataṃmaḥ || 9 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttara brahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīyetaṃtrevehorthasaṃgrahe 
dvāviṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 71b>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

punarviśeṣaṃ vakṣyāmi sadācārasya bhūṣate |
yaṃ śrutvopi narohīmānmucyateyāyarāśibhiḥ || 1 ||

susohitārthasaṃsiddhillabhyartapuṇyabhārataḥ |
tatra puṇyaṃ bhavedviprasmṛtivartmanānubhājanāt || 2 ||

stutivanmaṃjuṣaṃ puṃsaḥ sasparśāttapyatte mune |
kalikālādvapi sadāchidraṃ prāthajighāṃsataḥ || 3 ||

varjitasya vidhānena proktasyākaraṇīyataḥ |
kalikālāhapi hato brāhmaṇe raṃdhradarśanāta || 4 ||

niṣiddhā caraṇaṃ tasmāt kathayiṣyeta vāgrataḥ |
tadrarataḥ parityajya naro na nirayī bhavet || 5 ||

brahmaścanānvṛkṣaniryāsān pāyasākṛpa eyūlīḥ |
adauvapitryaṃ palalamavatsāṇoya yasyajet || 6 ||

laśunaṃ gajanamapi palāṃḍuṃ ca parityajet |
vayavekaśaphaṃdvepatakramerakamāvikaṃ || 7 ||

rātrau hadhinabhoktavyaṃ hi vā ca navanīnakaṃ |
āyuṣkāmaiḥ svargakāmaiḥstyājyaṃ māṃsaṃ prayatnataḥ || 8 ||

yajñārthadyaśruhisāyāsākhagyānetarā kvacit |
tyajetyaryuṣitaṃ sarvamakhaṃḍasnehanirmita || 9 ||

prāṇāhāyekratau śrāddhebheṣaje vipradrākāmyayā |
kālyamitthaṃ yalaṃ bhakṣayanna ca doṣabhāk || 10 ||

na tādṛśaṃ bhavetyāyaṃ mṛgayāvṛttikāṃkṣiṇaḥ |
yādaśāṃbhavatīpratyalaulyānmāṃsoyajñevinaḥ || 11 ||

makhārthaṃ brahmaṇā sṛṣṭāḥ paśudamalaḥ tauṣadhīḥ |
nighrannahiṃsakoviprastāsāmapiśubhagatiḥ || 12 ||

pitṛdevakra tu kṛte madhuparkvārthameva ca |
atra hi sātha hiṃsāsyādviṃsānyatra sudastarā || 13 ||

yojaṃtūnānmatatyarthaṃ hi nastijñānadurvalaḥ |
darācārasyatastheha nāmatrāpi sukhāṃ kvacit || 14 ||

<p. 72a>

bhāktānumaṃtāsaṃskartākrayavikrayahiṃsakāḥ |
upakartāghātapitāhiṃsakā aṣṭadhā smṛtāḥ || 15 ||

pratyabdamaśvamedhena śatavarṣāṇi yo yajet |
aṃmāsabhakṣako yastu dvitīyotra viśiṣyate || 16 ||

yathaivātmāparastavadvṛvyaḥ sakhamicchatā |
sukhaduḥkhāni tulyāni yathātmrani tathāpare || 17 ||

sukhaṃ vā yadivācān yat yatkiṃtkitkriyate pare |
yakvātaṃ hi punaḥ yaścitsārvamātmanisarbhavet || 18 ||

nalkeśena vinā dravyamarthahīnehīne kutaḥ |
kriyāṃ kriyāhīne kuto dharmo dharmahīne kutaḥ sukhaṃ || 19 ||

hi sarvairākāṃkṣyaṃ tatraṃ dharmasamudavaṃ |
tasmāddhermotrakartavyaścāturvaṇe na yatnataḥ || 20 ||

sāyāgateva dravyeṇa kartavyaṃ yāralokika |
dānaṃ ca vidhinādeyaṃ kāleyātrevamāvataḥ || 21 ||

vidhihīnamayātrepiyo dadāti pratigrahaṃ |
na kevalaṃ hi dhāti śeṣaṃ tasya ca naśyati || 22 ||

vyasanārthe kuduvārthe yadagārthe ca dīyate |
tadakṣaṃya bhavedatra yaratra ca na saṃśayaḥ || 23 ||

āmacāyepatnīputrādiṣopaṇārthaṃ yatavrataḥ |
grahaṇādiṣu kāleṣu yodhvādādārādhṛta || 24 ||

tasya puṇyaphalaṃ vaktuṃ nathaktosmi mahīyate |
varṣyaśanamitaṃ taddravyaṃ śataniṣkamudāhṛtaṃ || 25 ||

tadardha vā tadardhaṃ vā tatryūniniṣyahyaṃ smṛta |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoje varṣāśanamitaṃ dhanaṃ || 26 ||

ekasmindivase datvā pratiptaṃ vatsaraṃ nṛpa |
tulāpuruṣamukhyāni mahādānāni bhūriśaḥ || 27 ||

kṛtvā dine dine vaśya tatphalaṃ prāpnuyādasau |
pitṛvaśyaśataiyukto mātarvaśya śatairapi || 28 ||

bhagavatsunnidhāvatte sukhamakṣayamaśrute |
mātāpitṛvihīnaye maujīpāṇi grahādibhiḥ || 29 ||

saṃskārayatiyevitaisteṣoṃ śreyokṣayaṃ smṛtaṃ |
brāhmaṇāyadaridrāyapāṇigrahamitaṃdhanaṃ || 30 ||

yaḥ prayacchati dharmātmātasyapurāṃpayacchati |
nāgnihotrairnatarccaiyonāgniṣṇomādibhirmakhaiḥ || 31 ||

yacchreyaḥ prāpyataṃ martyaika viprapratiṣṭhite |
pittagehepiyākanyārataḥ paśya sasaṃskṛnā || 32 ||

bhūṣaṇahātatpitājñeyo jñeṣalīsāpi kanyakā |
yastāpariṇayenmohāt sabhavedvaṣalopatiḥ || 33 ||

tena saṃbhāṣaṇaṃ lājyamayāṃjgeyena saṃtataṃ |
vijñāpya doṣabhayoḥ kanyāyāśca varasya ca || 34 ||

saṃkadharacayetpaścadanyathādoṣabhākpitā |
striyaḥ pavitrāḥ satataṃ naitādaṣyaṃtī kutravit || 35 ||

<p. 72b>

strīṇāṃ sau dadau somaḥ pāvakaḥ sarvamedhyātāṃ |
kalyāṇavāṇīṃ gaṃdharvastenamedhyāssadāstriyaḥ || 36 ||

kanyāṃ bhukte rajaḥ kālegriḥ śaśiromadarśane |
śrutodbhavettugaṃdharvāstalyāge ca pradīyate || 37 ||

daśyaromatvayatyaghnīkulaghryuhatayauvanā |
pitaghnāvikṛtarajāsratastāṃ parivarjayet || 38 ||

kayādānaphalapreśustasmādṛvādagnīkāṃ |
anyathā tatphaladātuḥ pratigrāhīya tatyadhaḥ || 39 ||

kanyāmabhuktaṃ somādyairdaghhānaphalaṃ labhet |
devabhuktāṃ dadadātā na svargamadhigacchati || 40 ||

śayanāsanadānāni kutayaḥ strīmukhaṃ śrukaṃ |
yajñeyātrāṇi sarvāsinaduṣyaṃti vudhāḥ kvacit || 41 ||

vatsaḥ prastavane vane medhyaḥ śakuniḥ phalayātane |
nāryorati prayogeṣyaśghrāmṛgagrahaṇeśuciḥ || 42 ||

ajāścayomukhaṃ medhye gāvo medhyāstuṣṭaṣṭhataḥ |
brāhmaṇāh yādato medhyāḥ striyomedhyāśca sarvataḥ || 43 ||

valāreṇa bhuktāvācorahastagatāpi vā |
natyātyādūṣitānārīnārupāgonavidhīyate || 44 ||

aślenatāmraśuddhisyācchadviḥ kāṃsyaṃptyabhasmanā |
saṃśuddhārajasānāryastaṭinīvegataḥ śuciḥ || 45 ||

manasapinayānārīsmaretpuruṣāṃtaraṃ |
somayāsasaukhyānibhuṃjecātrīpikīrtibhāk || 46 ||

yitāpitāmahobhrātāsukulyojananī tathā |
kanyāpradaḥ prarvanāśe prakṛtisthaḥ paraḥ paraḥ || 47 ||

apracchansamāmotibhūṇahasāmṛtaunṛpa |
gamyaṃ tvabhāvedātaṇāṃ kanyākuryāt svayaṃvaraṃ || 48 ||

hatādhikāsamalināṃ piḍamātro yajovinī |
paribhūtāmadhaḥ śayyāṃ vāsayedhabhicāriṇī || 49 ||

vyabhicārāhatau śuddhirgarbhautyārgoviṣoyatte |
garbhabhartavadhādau ca bhakṣatyapicayātake || 50 ||

āropya śūśūdrāṃ śavayane viprogacchatyadhī |
gattiṃ utyādyaputraṃ śūdrāyāṃ brāhmaṇyādevahīyate || 51 ||

daivapi ātithīpyāti tatpradānāni yasya tu |
devāghāstanavāśraṃti sa vahva ca svārgaṃ na gacchati || 52 ||

yāgayogyānihehāniśyaṃ sa pratipūjitāḥ |
kṛtyābhirnihatānīvayaśyeyuṣmānyaṃ saṃśayaḥ || 53 ||

tadabhyarcyāḥ suvāsinyo bhūṣarāgachādanāśanaiḥ |
bhūtikāmaitaraitityaṃ saṃkaṭeṣūtkaṭeṣu ca || 54 ||

yatranāryaḥ pramuditā bhūṣaṇācchānāśanaiḥ |
ramaṃtevatāstatra tatrasyuḥ saphalāḥ kriyāḥ || 55 ||

akṣayaśreya icchādbhervāsonnairdivyabhūṣa |
ācāryapatnī saṃpūjyā viśeṣādbhārgavedine || 56 ||

<p. 73a>

akṣayāyāṃtatīyāyāṃ na gvarātra vratepi ca |
tāṭaṃkahemaciṃtākavālī yugmādibhūṣaṇaiḥ || 57 ||

ācāryapatnīmabhyavye sākṣāllakṣmīdhiyā nṛpa |
vimuktaḥ sakalāyabhṇedustarātsaṃkaṭādapi || 58 ||

kuverasadṛśolakṣmyāttatotemuktiḥbhāgbhavet |
yatra tuṣyati bhartrā strīyayābhartācatuṣyati || 59 ||

tatra veśmanikalyāṇaṃ saṃyadheta pade pade |
tayo hato hato hato homaḥ prahutobhautikovaliḥ || 60 ||

prāstitaṃ pitṛ saṃhṛpriḥrhutaṃ brāhmadvijārghanaṃ |
paṃcayajñānimānkurvanbrāhmaṇonāsīdati || 61 ||

etasyā ananuṣṭānātyaṃ ca sūnīmavāpnuyāt |
brāhmāṇaṃ kuśalaṃ pṛcchedvāhujātamanāmayaṃ || 62 ||

vaiśyaṃ sukhaṃ svamāgapyaśūdraṃ saṃtoṣameva ca |
jātamātraḥ śiśrustāvadhāvadaṣṭau samāḥ smṛtāḥ || 63 ||

bhakṣyābhakṣyepunoduṣyedyāvannevopanīyate |
bharaṇaṃ yoṣyavargasya dṛṣṭādaṣṭaphalodayaṃ || 64 ||

prasavāyo svabharaṇe bhartavyasta prayatnataḥ |
ācāryaḥ svayittāmātvapasāni samāśritāḥ || 65 ||

anyāgato tithiścāgrīḥ proṣyavargā amonava |
sajīvati yumānyatraivahnibhiścīyajīvyate || 66 ||

jīvanmatothavijñeyaḥ kevalaṃ svodaraṃbharaḥ |
do nānāḥtha viśiṣṭebhyo dātavyaṃ bhūti kāmyayā || 67 ||

adatadānājapaṃteyarabhāgyoyajīvinaḥ |
vibhāgaśīlasaṃyuktodayāvoṃśca kṣamānvitaḥ || 68 ||

devatātithibhaktaśca gṛhasthodhārmikaḥ smṛtaḥ |
śarvarāmadhyamauyāmauhutaśeṣaṃ ca yaddhaviḥ || 69 ||

tatra svayastadaścaśca brāhmāṇo nāvasīdati |
navaitāni gṛhasthena kāyorāyabhyāgateguro || 70 ||

mudā vyayāni yatsāmyaṃ vāṣyaṃ catukṣurmanomukhaṃ |
abhyutthānamihāyātasastehaṃ pūrvabhāṣaṇaṃ || 71 ||

upāsanamanuvajyagṛharsthennati hetavaḥ |
tathaivavyayayuktāni kāryāṇyetāminaiva || 72 ||

āsanaṃ yādaśaucaṃ ca yathāśaktāśayanaṃ kṣitiḥ |
śayyātṛṇajalābhyaṃgadivāgārhasthāsiddhidāḥ || 73 ||

tathaiva navakarmāṇi tyājyānigṛhāmedhinā |
paiśūnyaṃ yaradārāścadrohaḥ krodhānṛtāpriyaḥ || 74 ||

dveṣodaṃbhaśca māyā ca svargamārgārgalātyihi |
navāśyakakarmāṇi kāryāṇi prativāsaraṃ || 75 || 

snānasaṃdhyājapohomaḥ svādhyāyo devatārcane |
vaiśca devaṃ tathātithyaṃ navamaṃ pitṛtarpaṇaṃ || 76 ||

navagopyāniyānyatramunetāni niśāmaya |
janmarkṣamaithunaṃ maṃtrīgṛhachidra ca vanaṃ || 77 ||

<p. 73b>

āyurdhunāmadānaṃ ca strī na prakāsyāni sarvadī |
navaitāni prakāśyānirahaḥ pāpamakutsitaṃ || 78 ||

prāyīścamaṇaśuddhiśrīsvānvayaḥ krayavikrayau |
kanyādānaṃ guṇotvā ṣonānyatkenāpi kutracit || 79 ||

yātramitravinīteṣudīnānāthoyakāriṣu |
mātāpitṛgṛruṣvevanavakaṃdatamakṣaya || 80 ||

niṣphalaṃ na vastatkaṃ cāṭavāraṇataskare |
kuvaidyekitave dhūrte śaṭhe malle ca vaṃdiṣu || 81 ||

āpaḥtsvapi na deyāni navavastūni sarvado |
putreṣu sātsasarvasvaṃdārāśca śaraṇāgatāḥ || 82 ||

nyāsārthaḥ kulavṛttiśca nikṣepaḥ strīdhanaṃsutaḥ |
yo dadāti sabhūḍhātmā prāpraśritairviśūdhyati || 83 ||

ācāryāyaiva sarvasvaṃ puraścaraṇakarmaṇi |
deyaṃ ca viśvavidyāgenānyatkasmāpi kutracit || 84 ||

etannavānāṃ navakaṃ jñātvā śriyamavāpruyā |
anyati navakaṃ vacmi sarveṣāṃ svargamārgadaṃ || 85 ||

satyaṃ śaucamahiṃsā vakṣāṃtidonaṃ dayādayaḥ |
usteyamiṃdriyākrodhassarveṣodharmasādhanaṃ || 86 ||

amyasthaṃ navati caitāṃ svargamārgapradīpikāṃ |
satāmabhimatāṃ puṇyaṃ gṛhasthonāvasīdati || 87 ||

jihvābhāryāsutobhrātīmitradāsa samāśritāḥ |
yasyaitaivinayāḍhyāśca tasya sarvatra gauravaṃ || 88 ||

yānaṃ durjanasaṃsargaḥ yatyā ca virahoṭanaṃ |
syāyonyagṛhavāsaścanārīṇāṃ dūṣaṇānī ṣaṭ || 89 ||

samardhadhānyasudvasahyanaryeyaḥ prayacche |
savārdhuṣika ityuktassarvakarmavahicchrutaḥ || 90 ||

mahiṣo sucyate bhāyoyā bhaveḍhyabhiriṇītāṃ |
daṣṭāṃkāmayāto sonāmrāmāhiṣikah smṛtaḥ || 91 ||

agraimāhiṣikaṃ dṛṣṭvā madhye tu dvāṣalīpatiṃ |
atevārdhuṣikaṃ dṛṣṭvā nirāśāḥpirāmāḥ pītarogatāḥ || 92 ||

yāvadaṣṇaṃbhavatyannaṃ yāvatmonīmabhujyate |
tāvadaśraṃtitaroyāvabhīktohavirguṇaḥ || 93 ||

vidhāvinayasaṃpanneśrītriyegṛhamāgate |
krīḍatyoṣadhayaḥ sarvāyāsyāmaḥ paramāṃgatiṃ || 94 ||

bhraṣṭaśaucavratācāre viprevedavivarjite |
rodityannadīpamānaṃ kiṃ mayāduṣṭataṃkṛtaṃ || 95 ||

yasyodaṇatasyātraṃ vedābhyāsenatīryate |
satārayati dātāraṃ daśapūrvāndṛśāparān || 96 ||

na strīṇāṃ vayanaṃ kāryaṃ navagāḥ samanuvrajet |
navarātrauvaserjāṣṭena kuryādvaidikāṃ śrutiṃ || 97 ||

sarvānkaśānsamudvatyachedayedvaṃgulīdvayaṃ |
suvāsinīnāmevaṃ syānnāthaścāmuṃḍanaṃ bhavet || 98 ||

rājā vā rājaputro vā brāhmaṇo vahuśo śrutaḥ |
keśānāṃ rakṣaṇārthāyaṣvādviguṇadakṣiṇāṃ || 99 ||

yo gṛhītvā vivāsinī nāmevaṃ syānnānyathā muṃḍanaṃ bhavet || 98 || 

<p. 74a>

rājā vā rājayukto vā brāhmaṇo vahutho śrutaḥ |
keśānāṃ rakṣaṇārthāya dadyādviguṇadakṣiṇāṃ || 99 ||

yo gṛhītvā viṃvādvāgro gṛhasthāṃti manyate |
annatasya na bhoktavyaṃ kṛthāyākohi saṃsmṛtaḥ || 100 ||

dārāgrī hītradīkṣī ca kurute yo grajosthite |
parivetā sa vijñeyaḥṣarivitī ca pūryataḥ || 1 ||

sarve sarvete narakaṃ yāṃ dātayājakayaṃcamāḥ |
pīṭhedeśāṃtarasthe ca sūke pravratitaṃ jaḍe || 2 ||

karṣṭukharvecayati tena doṣaḥ varivedane |
vedākṣarāṇi yāvaṃti niyuṃjyādarthakāraṇāt || 3 ||

tāvaṃti bhūṇahatyā nirvadavikrayakṛllabhet |
yasvasuvrātito bhūtvāsevagtemaithunapunaḥ || 4 ||

vaṣṭirvarṣa sahasrāṇiviṣṭāyāṭe kṛmiḥ śūdrīnnaṃ |
śūrasaṃsaṃparkaṃ śūdreṇa sahāsanaṃ || 5 ||

śūdrādvidyāgamaḥ kaścijjākṣalaṃtamapi pātayet |
śūdrādāhṛtyanirvāyaṃye yatyavudhādvijāḥ || 6 ||

teyāṃti narakaṃ ghorakaṃ brahmatejo vivarjitatāḥ |
hastadatātilavaṇavyaṃ janādīni saṃtataṃ || 7 ||

dātāraṃ noyatiṣṭaṃvibhoktārbhahetu kilviṣaṃ |
āsase naiva pātreṇayadannamupadīyate || 8 ||

bhoktaḥ syādviṇaṃ yāyaṃ dātā ca narakaṃ vrajet |
aṃgulyādatakāvyaṃ pralakṣalavaṇaṃ ca yat || 9 ||

mṛtikābhakṣaṇamavisamaṃgotyāṃ sabhakṣaṇaṃ |
agratonivasensūkhohṛraiścaguṇānvitaḥ || 10 ||

guṇānvitāya dātavyaṃ nāsmimūrkahivyatikramaḥ |
brāhmaṇāti kramonāsti vipre vedavivarjita || 11 ||

jvaletamagnimutsmṛjya nahibhasmanihūyate |
sānnikṛṣṭamadhīyātaṃ brāhmaṇaṃ yo vyatikrāmeta || 12 ||

bhojanai ca vadāne ca vinācāryaṃ sa kilviṣī |
gorakṣakān vāṇitakātstathā kāmakuśīlakān || 13 ||

proṣyānvāhuṣikāṃścāpi viprān ṣyadravadācaret |
devadravyavibhāgenācāryaṃ sa kilviṣī gorakṣākān vāṇijakātstathā 
kāmakuśīlakān || 13 ||

preṣyānvārddhaṣikāṃścāpi vidrānṣyadrāvadācaret |
devadravyanibhāgena brahmasvaharaṇena ca || 14 ||

kulānyāśuvinaśyaṃtiśvāhāryotikreṇegāca |
mādeehīti vacaḥ proktogavādi brāhmaṇeṣū ca śyatiryagyoṇmāsābhyaṃtarepi vā || 17 
||

payalenāpi dātavyamicchadbhiḥ śreya uttamaṃ |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojepuraścaraṇākarmaṇi || 18 ||

sadya eva pradātavyādathriṇāśāstradhodinā |
māsāsyaṃtaratovaśyamathavā dakṣiṇāśubhā || 19 ||

ācāryāya pradātavyā mahatī siddhimicchatā |
māsādvayāttribhirmāsairdāḥ tavyāvṛddhisaṃyutāḥ || 20 ||

<p. 74b>

māsatrayamatikramya dātavyā dviguṇānṛpa |
māsaṣasūmatikramyasvarṇeyīpatatyadhaḥ || 21 ||

ācāryayapratijñātaṃ yatkiṃcipitrāvaptu |
māsenanenerusadṛśaghṛṇaṃdasudhāyate || 22 ||

 tasmātavaśyaṃmācāryayādābjayugaledhane |
sadya eva pradātavyaṃ puraścaraṇakarmasu || 23 ||

eva nānapibhikṣitvā svaṃtyajānaṣi |
sadyovitaraṇaṃ kāryamācāryārthe mahīyate || 24 ||

kruṇaṃ kṛtvāpi vā devaṃ sadya ācāryapādayoḥ |
bhikṣānnamapivācāryakule bhikṣe tatraiva hi || 25 ||

agrīṣṭomādiyāgepi dakṣiṇāśastra coditā |
sadharāvapradātavyāmāsatritayatoṣi vā || 26 ||

suputro yajamānīsau vinaśyatyanyathā nṛpa |
vidyasāśī bhavennityaṃ cāgratabhojanaḥ || 27 ||

amṛtaṃ yajñaśevaḥ syādvidyasaṃbhuktaśeṣakuṃ |
hastau prakṣālyagahvaṣayaḥ pivedbhojanottaraiḥ || 28 ||

daivaṃ pitmṛtathātmānaṃ trayaṃ sa upadhātayet |
(******) gaṇā aṃgaṇikānnaṃ cayāke || 29 ||

strīṇāṃ prathamagarbheṣu bhuktācāṃdrāyuṇaṃ caret |
pakṣe vā yadi māse vā yasyageheti na dvijaḥ || 30 ||

nuktādurātmanastasya caraiccaṃdrāyaṇa vrataṃ |
satriṇāṃ dīkṣitānāṃ ca yatīnāṃ brahmadhāṇāṃ || 31 ||

eteṣāṃ sūtakaṃ nāsti krahitāṃ karmakurvatāṃ |
ajīrṇotyuditavāṃte śmaśrukarmaṇi maithune || 32 ||

duḥsvapnedujenasparśestīnameva vidhīyate |
caisuvṛkṣedhiṃtiṃpūyaṃ śivanimolyabhojanaṃ || 33 ||

vedavikrayiṇaṃ spṛṣṭvā savāsātalumāviśet |
agryāgrāragavāṃgoṣṭhedeva brāhmaṇasannidhī || 34 ||

svādhyāyebhojameyāneyāduke parivarjayet |
khalakṣetragataṃ dhānyaṃ kūpavāriṣu tajjalaṃ || 35 ||

agrākhādapitadbhākhaṃ yacca goṣṭhagataṃ yayaḥ |
yadveṣṭitaśirābhuṃkte ghāndaṅge dakṣiṇāmukhaḥ || 36 ||

soyānatkaḥ pivedbhetadvairatyāṃsibhuṃjate |
dharmaśāstrarathāruṣavedakhaḍgadharādvijā || 37 ||

kroḍorthamapi yadvāyuḥ dharmaparamaḥ smṛtaḥ |
gaṃdhābharaṇayātyāniyaḥ prāyacchati saṃtataṃ || 38 ||

sa sugaṃdhiṃ sadādṛṣṭo yatra yatra prajāpate |
amṛtaṃ brāhmaṇaṃ syābhaṃkṣatriyānnaṃ yayaḥ smṛtaḥ || 39 ||

vaiśyasyasya cāḥnnamevātraṃ śūdrānnaṃ rudhiraṃ smṛtaṃ |
vaiśvadevena homena devatābhyarcanairjayaiḥ || 40 || 

amṛtaṃ tena viprānnamṛgyayuḥ sāmasaṃ smṛtaṃ |
vyavahārānurūpeṇanyāyena yaddayājjanaṃ || 41 ||

kṣatriyasya yayastena prajāpālana kodravaṃ |
pravāhānaddha vāyamatramutvādhamicchati || 42 ||

<p. 75a>

nirāyajñavidhānena vaiśyānnaṃ tena saṃsmṛtaṃ |
ajñānatimirādhasyamadyapānaratasyatra || 43 ||

rudhiraṃ tena śūdrānnaṃ daivamaṃtra vivarjitaṃ |
navṛthāṃśayathaṃ kuryāt svalyepyarthenarovudhaḥ || 44 ||

vṛthā hi śayathaṃ karvanpretyaveha vinaśyati |
kāminīṣu vivāheṣu gavāṃ bhaktaṃ janakṣaye || 45 ||

brāhamaṇādyuyayatauvaśayathe nāsti yātakaṃ |
nayamaṃ yamaṣṇāharātmāvaiyama ucyate || 46 ||

ātmanaṃ yamito yena taṃ yamaḥ kikariṣyati |
ekaḥ kṣamāvatāṃ doṣānadvitīyaḥ kathaṃcana || 47 ||

yadenaṃ kṣamayāyuktamaśaktaṃ manyate janaḥ || 48 ||

na tasya śāstrābhiratasya mokṣo na caiva ramyāvasatha priyasya |
na bhojanācchādanatarasya na lokacitagrahaṇeratasya || ||

ekāṃtaśīlasyasu daivatasya savaidriyaprītinivartakisya |
svādhyāyayogeratamānasasya mokṣo dhruvaṃ nityamahiṃsakasya || 49 ||

śrībhagavānuvāca 

nyāyāgatadhanastatvajñānaniṣṭhetivyipriyaḥ |
śrīdvratsatyavādī ca nityamācāryasevakaḥ || 50 ||

bhagavadraśmisahita śrīmadaṣṭākṣarītaḥ |
devatānāmṛṣīṇāṃ vāpyanugrahāt || 51 ||

ācāryānugrahānmuktiṃ prāprotyeva gṛhāśrāmī |
anuttarabrahmatatvarahasye śrutisaṃgrahe || ||
adhyāyoyaṃtrayo viśastaṃtre dāśarathīrita || 152 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
trayoviṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 75a>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

uṣittvaivaṃ gṛhe vipro gṛhasyādāśramāsaraṃ |
valīyavita saṃyuktasūtīyāśramamāśrayet || 1 ||

apatyāya samālokya yāmyāhārān visūjya ca |
patnīputreṣu niḥkṣipya yatmāvāvanamāviśet || 2 ||

 vasānaścarmacīrāṇisāgnīnmunyannavartanaḥ |
śākamūlaphalaivopi paṃcayajñānpravartayet || 3 ||

jaṭīsāyaṃ vrahetsāyīśmaśrulonakharonabhṛt |
amūlaphalabhikṣābhirarcayedbhikṣukātithīn || 4 ||

anyathā śākadātāvādāṃtaḥ svādhyāya tatparaḥ |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojaśuśrāṣaṇaparāyaṇaḥ || 5 ||

bhagavadraśmisahitaśrīmaraṣṭākṣīrataḥ |
vaitānika ca juhuyādagnihotraṃ yathāvidhi || 6 ||

mutpannaiḥ svayamānījaiḥ puroḍāśāṃśca nirvayet |
svayaṃkṛtaṃ calacaṇanāyānmadhuphalapradaḥ || 7 ||

varjayedvilvaśinūścakatakaṃ palanaṃ madhu |
utyabhūmāścignemāsityajenṛtyūvaṃ saṃcitaṃ || 8 ||

<p. 75b>

ragrāmyāni phalamūlāni pālajāṃ na vasaṃtyajet |
triṣadvadvādaśamāsānnaphalamūlādisaṃgrahī || 9 ||

naktāśyekāṃtarāśī vā pakṣakālāśenopivā |
cāṃdrāyaṇavratīvāsyātyakṣabhugvāthamāsabhuk || 10 ||

vaisvānasamaṃtastho vā phalamūlāśanopi vā |
tapasāśoṣayedvehaṃ pitṛdevāṃśca tarpayet || 11 ||

agnimātmanicādhāyavicaredamikaṃtanaḥ |
bhikṣayet proṇayātrārthaṃ tāpasān ṣanavāsinaḥ || 12 || 

grāmādānīya vā śrīpādaṣṭaugrāsānvasanvateḥ |
itthaṃ ranāśramīviprobrahmatokemahīyate || 13 ||

ativāhvāyuṣobhāgaṃ tṛtīyamitikānane |
āyuṣyasyaturīyāṃśetyatkāsaṃgānparivrajet || 14 ||

krāṇatrayamasaṃśodhyatvatuyādyasutānapi |
tathā yajñānaniṣṭācamokṣanicchavrajatyadhaḥ || 15 ||

manāgapi na bhūtānāṃ yasmādutyādyate bhayaṃ |
sarvabhūtāni tasyeha prayacchaṃtya bhayaṃ sadā || 16 ||

ekaeva carannitya managriraniketanaḥ |
sidhyarthamasahāyaḥ syādbrāmamannārthamāśrayet || 17 ||

jīvītaṃ maraṇāṃ vāpi nābhirkāṃkṣedyatiḥ kvacit |
kālameva pratīkṣeta nityamoṃkāratāyakaḥ || 18 ||

kartavyāssakalanyāsāyatināvaśyamanvaha |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāmavaśyaṃ nirato bhavet || 19 ||

gṛhasamārjanādyaiśca yādṛsaṃ vāhanādibhiḥ |
vastraprakṣālanādyaiśca nityamāvāryasevakaḥ || 20 ||

sarvatramamatāśūnyassarvatrasamatāyutaḥ |
vṛkṣabhūlaniketaśca mumukṣarihaśasyate || 21 ||

snānaṃ śauca tathā bhikṣānityamekāṃtaśīlatā |
yateścatvārikarmāṇiyaṃ carmanopayadyate || 22 ||

vārṣikān caturomāsān vicarennayatiḥ kvacit |
vījjāṃ kurāṇāṃ jaṃtūnāṃ hiṃsā tatra yara yato bhavet || 23 ||

gacchetyariharaharanattaṃtūn pivetkaṃjastraśodhitaṃ |
vācaṃ vadedanudvegosakṛdvākenacitkvacit || 24 ||

codānmasahāyaścanirayekṣonirāśrayaḥti |
samadhyātyaniratonīcakeśanaravodarī || 25 ||

kusumavauṇa iḍāchobhikṣāśīramyātivajitaḥ |
alāvudārumṛdveṇāpātraṃ śastaṃ nayaṃcama || 26 ||

nagrāhyaṃ taijasaṃ saṃpātraṃ bhikṣikeṇa kadācana |
ekākālaṃ varohaikṣyaṃtakuyo tatra vistaraṃ || 27 ||

vidhvamesannamuśalepyaṃgārebhuktavarjite |
dateśarāvasaṃyāt bhikṣāṃ nityaṃ careyatiḥ || 28 ||

alpāhārorahaḥ sthāyīdaṃhiyārthadyalolupaḥ |
rāgadveṣa vinirmukto bhikṣurmokṣāyakalpate || 29 ||

<p. 76a>

āśrameṣu yatiryasya muhūrtamapi viśramet |
kiṃtasvānekataṃtreṇa kṛtakṛtyaḥ sajagatpate || 30 ||

saṃcitaṃ yahṛhasthasyamāyamābharaṇāṃtikaṃ |
nirdṛhivyatitsarvamekarāprovinoyatiḥ || 31 || 

daṣṭvājarābhibhavanamasahyaṃrāgaṣīḍanaṃ |
dehatyatāṃyunagarbhagarbhakleśaṃ ca dāruṇaṃ || 29 ||

nānāyonisahasraṃ cā viyogaṃ ca priyaissaha |
apriyaiḥ sahasaṃyogasadharmaduḥkhasaṃbhavaṃ || 30 || 

punarnirayasaṃnānānerakayātanāḥ (**) |
karmadīṣasasandratānṛṇāṃ jātīranekadhā || 32 ||

dehasyānityatāṃdṛṣṭvānisatāṃ parasātmanaḥ |
kurvaḍetamuktayeyatraṃ yatra kutrāśramerataḥ || 32 ||

brahmacārī gṛhastho vāvanīvābhikṣukāpivā |
avaśyamācāryayadadvaṃdvaśruśrūṣaṇerataḥ || 33 ||

svāśraṃmocitavedotmakarmakurvan dine dine |
raśmividyāsamānyuktanyāsajālaṃ samanvitāṃ || 34 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarījatvā brahmabhūtībhaveddhruvaṃ |
kṛnatretādvāpareśukramādāśramasaṃyutāḥ || 35 ||

saṃti viprāmahātmānonigrahānugrāhākṣamāḥ |
brahmacaryaṃ vanevāsoyugetiṣṭhyena vidyate || 36 ||

yativeṣopiviprāṇāṃ doṣāyai ca kalauyuge |
putramitrakalatrādiyoṣaṇāsaktamānasāḥ || 37 ||

yativeṣadharā viprābhavaṭyasminkalauyuge |
daṃbhatībhānṛtayutāḥ śaucāravivarjitāḥ || 38 ||

akṣyabhojyaghṛtāyūyaniratāḥ pratyahaṃ nṛpa |
vṛthā śāyaṃ vimuṃcati bhikṣārthamapi saṃtataṃ || 39 ||

gatabhartṛkanārīvucaturthāśramavodhakāḥ |
tāsu saṃsarganiratāḥ putradarśanalālasāḥ || 40 ||

yativeṣaṃ kariṣyāti yaṃḍitāścakaloyuge |
gārhasvapnevasakalāśrameṣūtamamucyate || 41 ||

kṛtvāpi yātakaṃ ghoraṃ gṛhasthomatimānnaraḥ |
prāyaścitairvimuktaḥ sthānnānyatrāsakta āme || 42 ||

gṛhastharātra sarveṣāmādhāraḥ parikīrtitaraḥ |
asminkaliyuge ghore gṛhasthā api saṃtataṃ || 43 ||

vedācārayaribhraṣṭāyākhaṃḍāmarasaṃyutāḥ |
paranārīṣuniratādaṃbhalobhānṛtapriyāḥ || 44 ||

abhyasyāpi mahāvidyāmācāryayadiniṃdakāḥ |
eteyamātithībhūtāssarvenarakabhāginaḥ || 45 ||

tasmādvaidikamācārasvāśramonvitamanvahaṃ |
kurvatnācāryaśruśūṣāṃ kurvanprāṇadhanairapi || 46 ||

vedāḥdhyayanavānnisaṃsamastanyāsasaṃyutāṃ |
śrīmadṛṣṭākṣarīṃ japtvā śuddhakaivalyamaśrute || 47 ||

aśaktaḥ somayāgādiyadroṣuniyataḥ vrataḥ |
yauṇaṃ māsyāmamāyāṃvāmāsīmāḥsisamāhitaḥ || 48 ||

<p. 76b>

vidhivat saṃskṛte vahnīmaṃtrairāvaragoditaiḥ |
ekaikaśohunedātyaṃ mūlanāṣṭotaraṃśataṃ || 49 ||

raśmimaṃtraiḥ sakṛdvatvā tata ācāryapādayoḥ |
niṣkatekanadardhaṃ vā pradatvā dakṣiṇāṃ nṛpa || 50 ||

pratyahaṃ vā jape yasya māsimāsi labhet phalaṃ |
amāsomena raviṇā sahitā yadi bhūyate || 51 ||

kṛtvetthaṃ vidhinā homamācāryacaraṇadvaye |
datvā śeṣatoniṣkasuvarṇaṃ vā prayatnataḥ || 52 ||

saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇāyuktadaśāgriṣṭomajaṃkalaṃ |
prasahaṃ labhate vaśyaṃ tasminmāsi na saṃśayaḥ || 53 ||

anadhītyadvijovijñānāniṣkavipulormakhaiḥ |
anusyādyasutānuvipronarakeṣu nimajjati || 54 ||

tasmādavaśyaṃ vedānāṃ kāryamadhyamanaṃvudhaiḥ |
agniṣṭomādayoyāgāḥ kāyoḥ saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇāḥ || 55 ||

utpādanīyāḥ putrāśca ihāmutra sukhapradāḥ |
atha vā sarvayāgīnī phalamicchanmahītale || 56 ||

śrīmāṣṭākṣarī vidyā bhagavadraśmisaṃyutā |
nyāsa yuktā prajaptavyā hotavyā haviṣā sadā || 57 ||

śatasāhasraṃśo yāgadakṣiṇā phalamicchatā |
grahaṇādiṣu koleṣu navarātravrate śubhe || 58 ||

akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāmalabhyārddhaudṛyādiṣu |
yathokta dakṣiṇāsāṃgādātavyā ca sudhāyate || 59 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇīvidhāsahasrārṇāyaśaskarī |
nārāyaṇabhidhaṃ sūtāṃmapi pātakabhaṃjanaṃ || 60 ||

vedapārāyaṇaphalapreśunityaṃ jayedvudhaḥ |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoja śuśrūṣānyahamādarāt || 61 ||

raśmividyānyāsayutaśrīmadaṣṭākṣarīratiḥ |
yāvajjīvaṃ nivāsaśca vārāṇasyāṃ mahīyate || ||

kalevarasya srāgovākṣetre śrīpuruṣottame |
mokṣalakṣmīsādhanāni catvārye tāni bhūyate || 63 ||

paṃcamaṃ sadhanenāstiṃ sākṣānmūtiphalapradaṃ |
tatrāpyācārya śuśrūṣā śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīratiḥ || 64 ||

ihīpi sakalaiśvaryapradāṃte muktisiddhidā |
gṛhastha eva devānāpi gṛhastha eva devānāpi rahaṇāṃ yogināmapi || 65 ||

<p. 77a>

āśrāyassarvabhūtānāṃ nāśrayābhikṣukādayaḥ |
yaṃgadhovadhirā aṃdhāvaidikaṃ kartamakṣamāḥ || 66 ||

yatyāśrama mamamuprāthamuktibhājobhavaṃti hi |
śraute karmarāyaśaktānāṃ caturthāścama īritaḥ || 67 ||

gṛhasthassarvakarmāṇi kurvanprasahamārāt |
kṛtvācāryasya śuśrūṣāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ tayan || 68 ||

pitṛvaṃśasamudbhratomātṛvaṃśaśatānvitaḥ |
brahmanaṃdamaṣīktimāvaśyaṃ abhate nṛpaḥ || 69 ||

ācārya pādāṃvujayugmasevāsaṃsaktacitonvahamādareṇa |
nyāsassahāṣṭārāminuprajāyīhītāṣṭātādyairmithunārcakaśca || 70 ||

brahmemuhartekamalādhinātharaśmiprajāpīgrahaṇeravīdoḥ |
vaiśākhaśukledivasekṣayākhyeyogeghalabhyeṣurameśayoge || 71 ||

śarannavamyāṃ ca mahatsuyavasvamādinebhāskaraṃdrayukte |
japtvā ca hutvā gurupādayumisamarpyavittaṃ vahulaṃ mahīśa || 72 ||

karṇadvaye kuṃḍalayugmamādarāt samarpyapatnīmapi sahīrośca |
tāṭaṃkavālīyugalādibhūṣaṇairabhyarcya viprālathabhojanīyāḥ || 73 ||

pratyabdamithaṃ niyamānvitoyaḥ kaṇaiti vidyājapahomakarma |
āyuṣyamārogyamathārthasiddhiṃ ratnānimaktāhayahastisaṃghān || 74 ||

saṃprāpya putrānathapautrakāṃśca vidyāṃśriyaṃ bhāgyamathākṣayaṃ ca |
mātuḥ piturvaśaśatānvitotedivyaṃ vimānaṃ maṇīkāṃ canāhyaṃ || 75 ||

āruhya sākṣādbhagavatsvarūpo prāmotya yodhyānagaraṃ suramyaṃ |
bhṛgossutāpi dine dine yojasvāvahutvāvidhivanmanuṣyaḥ || 76 ||

ācāryapatnīmapi pūjyavastraurākalpasadyaiḥ śriyameti divyāṃ |
punnaghapautrerassahitāṃ samṛddhiṃ prāpyātha sākṣīddhari hṛyameti || 77 ||

māse māse bhārgave vāsare vāyaṣe kasmin sadguroḥ putrayuktāṃ |
bhakṣyai rājyabhokṣyaiśca vastraiśakalyairvātauṣapitvā dvijāgryaḥ || 78 ||

prāpto savaśyadhanaratnasaṃkulaṃ śriyaṃ tathārogyamanutamaṃca |
vaṃśābhivṛddhiṃ samavāpya cāte viṣṇoḥ padaṃ tatpuramaṃ prayāti || 79 ||

aṣṭārṇavidhā japahomatatparā ācāryapādāṃtujasevakāśca dhānyāḥ |
kṛtārthāmanuje iṃ nityaṃ saṃprātyakāmā athayāṃti muktiṃ || 80 ||

<p. 77b>

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
caturviṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 77b>

rājovāca 

dhanyosmikṛtakṛtyosminārāyaṇajagatpate |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīnyāsa chaṃda ārṣādikaṃvuva || 1 ||

puraścaraṇakṛtyaṃ ca sādhanaṃ kāmyayatha |
ṣaṭmekuruṇāmūrtekṛtyayā dharmanaṃdana || 2 ||

śrībhagavānuvāca 

athātaḥ saṃpratvakṣyāminyāsajālasya siddhidaṃ |
chaṃda āṣādikaṃ sarvaṃ yadvātvā siddhimānbhavet || 3 ||

aṃtarvahirmātakāyā ṛṣirbrahmaprajāpatiḥ |
chaṃdogāyatramuddiṣṭaṃ vidrayā śrīḥsarasvatī || 4 ||

devatākathitā śrīśaprītayeyoga īritaḥ |
aklīvadīrghahrīsvādhavargauḥ ṣaḍbhiḥ ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ || 5 ||

vinyasya bhāvayeddhīmānumātṛkāparameśvarīṃ paṃcāśallipirvibhaktamukhadoḥ 
parāmadhyavakṣasthalāṃ svanmaulinivaddhācaṃdraśakalāmāyīnu tu gustanī |
mudrāmakṣasudhīhāhemakalaśaṃvidyāvahastāṃvujaiviśrāṇāṃ viśadaprabhāṃ 
trinayanāṃ vāgdevatāmāśraye || 6 ||

aṃtarvahirmātṛkākhyamakṛtvānyāsamanvahaṃ |
na siddhilabhate maṃtrīpuraścaryā śatairapi || 7 ||

praṇavādyāṃ nyasesaścānmātṛkāṃ parameśvarī |
kṛtvā pūrvoditanyāsamārṣachaṃdādikaṃ tathā || 8 ||

siṃdūrakāṃtimamitābharaṇaṃ trinetraṃ vidyākṣasūtramṛgayāśavarāndadhāna 
pārśvasthatāṃ |
bhagavaīmapi kāṃcanābhyādhyāyetanyā samārṣachaṃdādikaṃ tathā || 8 ||

sidūrakāṃtimamitābharaṇaṃ trinetraṃ vidyākṣasūtramṛgayāśavarāndadhānaṃ |
pārśvasthitāṃ 
bhagavatīmapikāṃcanābhyādhyāyeskarājjaghṛtapustakavarṇamālāṃ || 9 ||

praṇavādhāmimānyasyamātṛkāṃ sarvasiddhidāṃ |
brahmarūpī bhavatyeva satyānaṃdacidātmakaḥ || 20 ||

vāgādyāṃ mātṛkānyasyet sarvavidyā phalapradāṃ |
ṛṣiḥ prajāpatiḥ chaṃdogāyatradevatāhyāparā || 11 ||

vāgīśvarī mātṛkāsyānnāsaḥ pūrvokta eva hi akṣasrajaṃ hariṇayo 
tadamudagraṭaṃkaṃ vidyākarairaviratadadhatī |
trinetrāṃ advaidamaulimaruṇāparaviṃdabhāvavarṇeśvarī praṇamatastanabhāranannā || 
12 ||

vāgbhadyamimaṃ nyāsaṃ kṛtvā mātṛkayāvudhaḥ |
pāraṃgato sau vidhānāṃ bhavatyeva jaḍopi ca || 13 ||

paṃcabrahmakalānyasyektrayī varṇādikāstataḥ |
ṛṣi prajāpati chaṃdogāyatrasamudāṃhṛtaṃ || 14 ||

kalātmāvarṇajananīdevatāśāradīsmṛtā |
hrasvadīrghāṃtaragataiḥ ṣaḍaṃgaṃ praṇavai smṛtaḥ || 15 ||

<p. 77a>

hastaiḥ praptaṃrathāṃgaṃrāṇamathahariṇaṃ pustakaṃ varṇamālāṃ ṭaṃkaṃ 
śubhraṃkapālaṃdaramamṛtalasadvemakubhaṃ vahaṃtī |
muktāvidyutpayodasphuritanavatayāvaṃdhuraiḥ paṃcavaktraiḥ strarkṣevakṣotanamrāṃ 
sakalaśaśinibhāṃśāradānāṃ namāmi || 16 ||

nivṛttiśca pratiṣṭhā ca vidhāśāṃtistathaiva ca |
rodhikā dīpikā caiva recikā mocikā parā || 17 ||

sūkṣmāsūkṣmāmṛtāyaścījñānāmṛtā tathā |
āpyāpinī vyāpinī ca vyomanī ca ka sāddhamā || 18 ||

sadāśivasamudbhataḥ ṣoḍaśoktā maho || 19 ||

sṛṣṭiṛddhiḥsmatirmedhākāṃtirlakṣmīrdyutiḥ sthirā |
sthitiḥ sīdviriti prīkādeśavahyakalā imāḥ || 20 ||

jarā ca pālinīśāṃtirīśvarī ratikāmike |
varadāhrādinī prītidīghoviṣṇukalādaśa || 21 ||

tīkṣṇaraudrī bhayātridātaṃdāṃśrurtkadhinī kriyā |
utkārī mṛtyurityuktādaśarudradakalā imāḥ || 22 ||

(**) pītāruṇāpaścīdasitā ca catuṣkalāḥ |
īśvarāṃga samudbhatāḥ kalāḥ paṃcāśadīritaḥ || 23 ||

kalānyāmimaṃ kṛtkosākṣādbrahmakalānvitaḥ |
ājñāsiddhiṃ samāsādyatejomayatanurbhavet || 24 ||

śrīkaṃṭhamātṛkānyāsaṃvyomaśaktisamanvitaṃ |
nyasecchīkaṃṭhapūrṇādi paṃcāśān mithunātmakaṃ || 25 ||

taṃtīyapūrvātānyasyetramoṃtāṃ rudrasaṃyutāṃ |
sa dhātuprāṇaśaktyātmayuktāyāhiṣite kramāt || 26 ||

ṛṣiḥsyādakṣiṇāpūrtirgāyatraṃ chaṃda īritaṃ arddhanārīśvaraḥ |
prokto devatāṃ tannavedibhiḥ hasāṣaḍdīrghayuktena kuryādagānideśikaḥ || 27 ||

vaṃdhūkakāṃcananibharucirākṣamīlā pāśāṃkuśau ca varadaṃ nijavāhudadau |
vibhrāṇamidaṃ śakulābharaṇaṃ trinetremardhāvikeśamanīśaṃva purāśrayāmaḥ || 
28 ||

śrīkaṃṭhānaṃta sūkṣmeśāstrimūrtiramareśvaraḥ |
adyoḥśobhārabhūteśotithīśaḥ sthāṇanāṃharaḥ || 29 ||

kaṃṭhośobhautikassadyojātaścānugraheśvaraḥ |
akrāśca mahāsenaḥ śivaṣoḍaśaśamūrtaya || 30 ||

yaścotkodhīśacaṃḍīśaṃyacāsyeśaśicottamāh |
athaikarudrakṛrmokanejñādvacaturānanāḥ || 31 ||

ajeśaśarvasomeśarājahiguladhārakau |
arddhanārīśvāraścīmākāṃtaścāṣājaḍaṃḍinau || 32 ||

<p. 77b>

syuratrimonameṣākhyālohitākhyāṃ śivai tathā |
chagalaṃḍa(**)(?)dviraṃḍeśaumahīkālakapālinau || 33 ||

bhuṃjegeśaḥ pināyīśaḥ khaḍgīśā dravyau vakastataḥ |
śvetabhṛnvīśalakūliśivassaṃvartakustataḥ || 34 ||

ete rudrāḥ sitāraktādhataśūlakapālakāḥ |
pūrṇodarīsthādvirajāśālmalītadanaṃtaraṃ || 35 ||

kolākṣīvartulākṣī ca dīrghakarṇāsamīritā |
sadīrghamusvigomukhyaudīrghajihvā tathaiva ca || 36 ||

kuṃḍodarpūrddhakeśī ca tathavikṛtamukhyapi |
jvālāmukhī tatojñeyā paścādulkāmukhītathā || 37 ||

suśrīmukhī ca vidyāmukhī hyetāḥ svaraśaktayaḥ |
mahākālīsarasvatyau sarvasiddhisamanvitā || 38 ||

gaurītrailokyavidyāsyānmaṃtraśaktistataḥparaṃ |
ātmaśaktibhūtamātā tahā laṃvodarīmatā || 39 ||

śaviṇīnāginī māyākhecarīcāpimaṃjarī |
rūpiṇīvāriṇī paścātkyakodatanā || 40 ||

syādbhadrakālīyoginyauśaṃkhinīgarjinī tathā |
kālarātriśca kubjīsyāt kapardinyapi vajrayā || 41 ||

jayā ca sumukheścaryārevatī ca varā tathā |
vāruṇīvāyavi proktā yaścāddrakṣopadhāriṇī || 42 ||

tataśca sahajālakṣīrvyāpinī māyayānvitā |
etārudrāṃ pīṭhasthāḥ siṃdūṇaruṇavigrahīḥ || 43 ||

raktotpalakapālābhyāmalaṃkṛtakarāṃvujāḥ |
śrīkaṃṭhamātṛkāmetāṃ vinyasyādau dine dine || 44 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ jātahṛvasākṣādbrahmamayī bhavet |
rudramūrtissamahartā kartā sākṣānna saṃśayaḥ || 54 ||

trayīyāramākāmavījapūrvaka iṣṭadaḥ |
kartavyassatataṃnyāso brahmatādātmyasiddhidāḥ || 46 ||

smarādyāṃ vānyasedetāṃ mātṛkābhiṣṭasiddhidāṃ |
sa dhātu prāḍaṇaśaktyātmayuktāyādiṣuviṣṇavaḥ || 47 ||

ṛṣiḥ prajāpatiḥ proto gāyatraṃ yaṃ i iritaṃ |
nārāyaṇodvelakṣmīśodevatānnasamīritā || 48 ||

dīrgha(******)(?) ṣaḍaṃgāni pravinyaset 
astairvibhratsarasijagadāśaṃkhacakrāṇividhāṃ ||
yayādaśau kanakakalaśaṃ meghavidyudvilāsaṃ |
vāmetugastanamaviratākalpamāśleṣalobhādekībhūtaṃ vapuravattunaḥ 
puṃḍarīkākṣalakṣmyoḥ || 49 ||

śaṃkhaṃ cakragahāṃvujāni satataṃ hasrāṃvujaidhāraṃ yatrādarśa ca 
hirāmmayaṃdharamatho vidyatyayodākṛtī |
kepūṇaṃgadahārakuṃḍaladharomāṇikyabhūṣollasadvaktrārghrorddheramānvitovijaya
te nārāyaṇaḥ śrīpatiḥ 50

<p. 78a>

vaiṣṇavīṃ mātṛkāmekāmapi vinyasya ṣānakāhaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ tatvā sākṣānnārāyaṇo bhavet || 51 ||

maṃtrī cātra na saṃdehīnigrahānugrahakṣamaḥ |
bhavedbrahmamayaḥ sākṣādvaiṣṇavīnyasyamātṛkāṃ || 52 ||

śaktipūrvāṃtanaunyasyainmātṛkāṃmanuvittamaḥ |
ṛṣiḥśaktiḥ spṛtaḥ chaṃdīgāyatraṃ devatāvudhaiḥ || 53 ||

saṃproktāvīśvajananī sarvasaubhāgyadāyinī |
dīrghāddhayujāṃgāni kuryānmāyātmanāvudhaḥ || 54 ||

udyatkoṭi 
dvivākarapratibharitāṃgorūponastanīvadvārdvadakirīṭhahāraraśamāmaṃjīrasaṃ 
śobhitā |
vibhrāṇakarapaṃkajaimavaṃrīpāśāṃkuśaupustakaṃ 
divādvojagatīśvarotrinayanāpadmeniṣastāsukhaṃ || 55 ||

śaktivījādikaṃ nyasya mātṛkāṃ sarvasiddhidāṃ |
āśrayassarvabhāgyānāṃ bhavatyatra na saptayaḥ || 55 ||

nyasecchī vījasaṃpannāṃ mātṛkāṃ vidhinātanau |
ṛṣirbhṛguḥ smṛtacchaṃdīgāyatraṃdevatāmatā || 56 ||

samastasaṃyadāpādirjagatāṃnāpikāvudhaiḥ |
prāktrastunena vījena kuryādaṃgānisādhakaḥ || 57 ||

viṃdadāmasahasrābhāṃhibhagiriprakhyaiścatubhirgajaiḥ 
śuṃḍādāṃḍasamuddhatāmṛtamayairāsiṃcyamānāmirbhāṃ |
vibhrāṇāṃ karapaṃkajerjavarīṃ yagradvayaṃ pustakaṃ bhāsvadratvasamujvalāṃ 
kucanatāṃ dhyāyejjagatsvāminīṃ || 58 ||

śrīvījapūrvovinyasyamātṛkāṃ sarvasiddhiddhāṃdāṃ |
ācāryānugrahātsākṣādbhavecchrīkalayānvitaḥ || 59 ||

nyasensmarādyāṃvapuṣimātṛkāṃ maṃgalapradāṃ |
ṛṣiḥ saṃmohanaḥ proktaḥ chaṃdogāyatramucyate || 60 ||

devatāmaṃtribhiḥ proktā samastajananīparā |
smareṇadīrghayuktena vidadhyādaṃgakalpanāṃ || 61 ||

vālārkakoṭirucirāṃ spharikākṣāmālāṃkodaṃḍamikṣujanitaṃ smarayācavāṇān |
vidyāṃ ca hastakamalaidedhatī trinetratrāṃ dhyāyet samastajananīṃ navacaṃdravudha || 
62 ||

smarādyāṃ yātṛkānyasya kardhyasamakāṃtimān |
vaśīkarotinnailokyaṃ kiṃca brahmamayo bhavet || 63 ||

śrīśaktikāmavījādyāṃ mātṛkāṃ vinyasedapi |
ṛṣissaṃmohanachaṃdogāyatraṃ chavatāmanoḥ || 64 ||

trailokyamohinī proktā savelokavaśaṃkarī |
bhāvartitaistribhivījaiḥ ṣaḍaṃgāni prakalpayet || 65 ||

<p. 78b>

dhyeyeyamakṣavalayekṣuśarānsayāśān yamadvayaśukaśarān navapustakaṃ ca |
āvibhratīṃ nijakaraikaruṇāṃ kucārtāṃ saṃmohināṃ trinayaṃnāṃtaruṇeṃda 
cūḍāṃ || 66 ||

vījatrayādyāṃ vinyasya mātṛkāmiṣṭasiddhidāṃ |
sarvasaubhāgyasaṃyamabhassakalaiśvaryasaṃyutaḥ || 67 ||

samastavidyāsaṃpannī jīvecca śaradośataṃ |
haṃsavidyādikāṃ nyasenmātṛkāmakhileṣṭado || 68 ||

ṛṣirbrahmāsamuddiṣṭacchadāṃ gāyatramīritaṃ |
samastavastusaṃprāptikaraṃ tejobhayaśiva || 69 ||

daivaṃtayararmabrahmaparamātmābhidhaṃ nṛpa |
khāhādyauḥ paṃcamunibhiḥ paṃcāgāni prakalpayet || 70 ||

astradikṣu samustanamūlanavasūdyāyatte |
vedādiśaktirajayāparamātmamahāmataḥ || 71 ||

vahnijāyā ca kāthitā paṃcaṃnnāḥ śubhāvahāḥ brahmātādātmyasidhyarthaṃ |
samastaphalasiddhidyāhaṃ sādyomāttakāṃ nyaset parabrahmamayīmatha || 72 ||

tārāhiyuṃcamanubhiḥ puriyimānamānaikagamyamaniśaṃ jagadekamūlaṃ |
saccitsamastabhuvaneśvaramacyutaṃ tattejaḥ paraṃbhajatasāṃdrasudhāṃvurāśiṃ || 73 
||

haṃsādyāṃ mātṛkāṃ nyasya śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃtayan |
aṇimādiguṇauśvaryasahito bhagavānasau || 74 ||

itthamekādaśavidhaṃ mātṛkānyāsamavahaṃ |
ācāryānugrahāllabdhā śrīmadaṣṭākṣarījayanaṃ || 75 ||

sākṣānnārāyaṇo jñeyo nigrahānugrahakṣamaḥ |
sarāvasarvajagatāṃ kartā hartā ca pālakaḥ || 76 ||

vatānāsaṣīṇaṃ ca namaskāryo bhavatyasau |
ekādaśavidhanyāseṣaśaktovasudhāpate || 77 ||

vaiṣṇavīnātkīṃ vāpi vinyaset danvahaśuciḥ |
tatvanyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryādyena tatvamayaḥ pumān || 78 ||

virā ivīhariḥ sākṣīdbhavatyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
ṛṣirbrahmātatacchaṃdogāyatraṃ daivataṃ smṛtaṃ || 79 ||

devatābhagavānsākṣātsarvatatvamayohariḥ |
ṣaḍdīrghamāyayākuryāt ṣaḍaṃgaṃ praṇāvādyayā || 80 ||

bhūtoyāgrimarudviyahuṇamayasarvaprapaṃcātmakaṃ viśvasthitissargasaṃhṛtikaraṃ 
satyātmakacīdvanaṃ viṣṇubrahmaśivākṛtisuramunistūtyaṃ |
hṛdabjasthitaṃ yuktaṃ citkalayāśrayehamaniśaṃ nārāyaṇākhyaṃ mahaḥ || 81 ||

<p. 79a>

jñātvā tatvamayaṃ nyāsamācāryavadanāṃvujāt |
vinyastha śrīmadaṣṭārṇa prajapanvudhaḥ || 82 ||

nārāyaṇāmayaḥ sākṣādājñāsiddho bhavatyasau |
tanmūrtiyaḥ jaranyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryādinanyadhoḥ || 83 ||

apirādipta bhagavānathavarṣiḥ prajāpatiḥ gāyatraṃ devetaṃ |
chaṃdasmṛviturmaṃḍalasthitaḥ ādityātmājagatsyāmīdevonāyaṇaḥ smṛtaḥ || 84 ||

dhyeyassadāsavitumaṃḍalamadhyavatī nārāyaṇaḥ surasijātasanasanniviṣṭāḥ |
keyūravāmakarakuṃḍalavānkirīṭīharīhiraṇmayavupurvṛtaśaṃkhacakraḥ || 85 ||

tanmūrtiyaṃjaranyāsaṃ vinyasyādau dine dine |
bhavet sa bhagavānmūrtiḥ śabdabrahmamayaḥ pumān || 86 ||

varṇanyāsaṃdaśavidhaṃ kuryāddhahmesiddhidaṃ |
ṛṣirasyāhamevāḥsmisādhyānārāyaṇonṛpa || 87 ||

gāyatraṃ daivataṃ chaṃdaḥ sākṣāllakṣmīpatirvibhūḥ |
harirnārāyaṇaḥ svāmīdevatānna samīritaḥ || 88 ||

vaṃdenīlayayodakomalatanuṃ śaṃkhaṃ ca cakragadāṃvibhrāṇaṃ kamalaṃ 
ramāvasumatī saṃśobhiyāścaidvayaṃ |
divyākalpaśatābhirāmamaniśaṃ ratnāsanesaṃsthitaṃ śāṃtaṃ 
suṃdāramacyutasuramuni brahmeśa śakrārcita || 89 ||

varṇatyāsaṃdaśavidhaṃ kṛṣṇetthaṃ nityamādarāt |
ācāryānugrahātpaścādavaśyaṃ harirūpabhāk || 90 ||

ciddrūpamātṛkānyāṃ saṃbhavadbhāvasiddhihaṃ |
kuryādavaśyaṃ sakalanyāsa jātaphalaprahaṃ || 91 ||

munirasyāpyahaṃ proktaḥ sādhyo nārāyaṇaparovibhuḥ |
chaṃdaścadevīgāyatrī paramāśriyaḥpatiḥ || 92 ||

nārāyaṇo jagatsvāmīdevatā saṃsmṛtovudhaiḥ asyāpi bhūlapaṃcāṃganyāsaḥ |
sadbhirūdīritaḥ ṣadbhirvargauḥ ṣaḍaṃgaṃ vā vinyasedvasudhāyate || 93 ||

mūlekalpatarormahāmaye siṃhāsane saṃsthitaṃ devyācitkalayāśriyā ca sahita 
nīlāmahīsevitadivyākalpaśatātirāmamaniśaṃ |
nityaṃ prasannaṃ vibhuṃ vaṃdedevamunīṃdravaṃ hi tapadaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ cidvanaṃ 
|| 94 ||

cirayamātakānyāsaṃ samastaphalasiddhidaṃ |
sarvanyāseṣaṣṭeśaktopi svācāryānugrahānnṛpa || 95 ||

kṛtvādāpanvahadhīmoḥ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī japet |
cidrūyamātṛkāṃ nyasya sākṣānnārāyaṇo bhavet || 96 ||

sarvamaṃtramayaḥ sarvadevairapyaccito bhavet ācāryaṃ vedāṃtapāragaṃ śrotriyaṃ 
dvijaṃ |
sahasraṃ yojanaṃ vāpi gatvā vaśyaṃ mahīyate 
brahmatādātmyamanvicchanamuktimekena janmanā || 98 ||

<p. 79b>

pūrvāṃ saṃprāptyavidyopisaṃsatya sakulānārun |
saṃsevya vahuvarṣaṃvāratpraprāṇārdhanairapi || 99 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ bhagavadraśmisaṃyutāṃ |
avaśyamapi gṛhīyāt samastanyāsagūrvikā || 100 ||

tamācāryaṃ vijānīyānmāmevāmedatassadā |
avaśyaṃ sakalanyāsā ācāryacaṃdanāṃvujāt || 1 ||

nyastavyāścāgṛhītavyādevatābhāvasiddhidāḥ |
avaśyaṃmupadeṣṭavyāḥ karotu na karotu vā || 2 ||

ācāryeṇa svaśiṣyāyavinītāya mahānmune |
ācāryonuprahāhātvānyāsajālamidaṃ śubhaṃ || 3 ||

vinyasya śrīmadaṣṭārṇe śatādhika sahasrakaṃ |
japtvāmāsatrayaṃ yaścāsaśyatyeva śriyaḥpatiṃ || 4 ||

bhagavatkālayāpūrṇaḥ kāmakoṭi samaprabhaḥ |
tejomayaturmṛtyujarāmuktetbhavatyasau || 5 ||

avicchinnoyāsanayāsiddhireṣā prajāyate |
kṛtvā dine dine vaśyaṃ nyājālamidaṃ śubhaṃ || 6 ||

vitācāryānacaṃde tu mātaraṃ piptaraṃ tu vā |
vaṃdyamānī vratavratyena mṛtyuṃ māsānnasaṃśayaḥ || 7 ||

māsatrayādravaṃtyasya śakrādyā api kiṃkarāḥ |
śubhe dine śubhelagne nyāsajālamidaṃ śubhraṃ || 8 ||

gṛhītvai ca tṛtīṣṭārṇāgṛhṇīyāccheyasenṛpa |
sasadvoyavatī bhūrmirdhanadhānyaudyasaṃkulā || 9 ||

dakṣiṇāvihitāśāstre sarvasvamapivānapa |
varṣāśanamitadravyamathavāguraveryayet || 10 ||

sadyaḥ siddhimavānyottitapahīmādikaṃ vinā |
kṛtvā vaśyamidaṃ nyāsajātaṃ pratyahamādarāt || 111 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ vāpi śrīmadaṣṭākṣarījapet |
bhārgavevāsarevāpi yakṣevāmāsimāsi vā || 12 ||

māsatrayevāṣaṇasenyāsajālamidaṃ sanyet |
mahatiṃ siddhimicchadbhirnyastavyaṃ pratyahaṃ budhaiḥ || 13 ||

vedavedītaśāśtraughasārabhūtārthasaṃgrahaṃ |
nyāsajālamidaṃ puṇyaṃ bhagavadrāvasiddhidaṃ || 14 ||

<p. 80a>

akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāṃ ravīdagrahaṇopi vā |
āśvinenavarātre ca vijīyedaśmimīdine || 15 ||

ācāryavadanāṃbhītādbhagadrāśmi saṃyutā |
samastanyāsasahitā śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīśubha || 16 ||

ācāryadakṣiṇāṃ datvā adhyetavyā punaḥ punaḥ |
avaśyaṃ mahatīṃ siddhimaṇimādi guṇānvitāṃ || 17 ||

brahmatādātmyasaṃsihiddhi hetubhūtāṃ sanātanīṃ |
prāprotyatra na saṃdeho vivāhyemajayādikaṃ || 18 ||

sarvanyāseṣca śaktaścenmātṛkāṃ vaiṣṇavīmapi |
tatvanyāsaṃ tataḥ kṛtvānyāsaṃtanmūrmirtīyaṃvrara || 19 ||

varṇanyāsaṃdaśavidhaṃ nyasya cidrayamātṛkāṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭāṃkṣaraṃ maṃtraṃ japennityaṃ mahīyate || 20 ||

tatrāpya śaktomatimānyasya vaiṣṇavamātṛkāṃ |
varṇanyāsaṃ daśavidhaṃ nyasya cidrūyamātṛkaṃ || 21 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ maṃtre japet sakalamiddhidaṃ |
nyāsya avaśyaṃ nyastavyāssavaisandurvanugrahān || 22 ||

vakṣye vā māsamāse vā ṣaṇmāse vā mahīyate |
avaśyaṃ sakalanyāsā kartavyā hariśāsanāt || 23 ||

anyathā mahatīsiddhirlabhyatenaṃ kadācana |
japaṃtīṣṭhāṣi sarvāsu bhārgavāsarepi vā || 24 ||

ekādaśyāmamāyāṃ vāravisaṃkramaṇepivā |
vyatīyāttepi vā kāryaṃ nyāsajālamidaṃ śubhaṃ || 24 ||

nyāsaissahāṣṭārṇamanujāyosvācārya śuśrūṣaṇasaktacittaḥ dine dine |
vaidikayāvakecu hṛtvā havirdādaśadhāpi bhūya || 25 ||

viśeṣato bhārgavāsaretha japtvā ca hutvātha gurupriyāyai bhakṣyaṃ ca |
bhojyaṃ ghṛtasūyasaṃyutaṃ varṇāmuktāphalabhūṣaṇādikaṃ || 26 ||

datvā labhedakṣayaṃ yadaddhiṃ ca śābhivṛddhiṃ ca tathāciyuḥ |
tyadhvāvibhānaṃ maṇihemanirmitaṃ prāprotyathāṃte bhagavatpadaṃ ca || 27 ||

avaśyamāghepi bhṛgordvine vā māsasya samāhitātmā japtvā ca |
hutvā vidhivatsamarcyacāryavalyaimaṇikāṃcanādika || 28 ||

āyuṣyamārogyamakṣākṣayaṃ ca vitaṃ ca muktā phalaratnajātavaḥ |
vaṃśāmivṛddhi samavāpya bhogā āproti sākṣādbhagavatyudaṃ ca || 29 ||

nyāsaisahārṇajapī mahotmānyāsaissahāṣṭāṇaṃ japīvidhātā |
nyāsesmahāṣṭārṇajayī śivaścanyāsaissacūṣṭākṣaramaṃtrajāyī || 30 ||

<p. 80b>

tādbhagavatyadaṃ ca nyāsaisahārṇājayīmahātmānyāsaismahāṣṭārṇajayīvidhātā |
nyāsaissahānārāyaṇassarva carācarasya gururgarīyānapi viśvavaṃdyaḥ || 31 ||

satyaṃ satyaṃ punaḥ satyaṃ na mṛṣā procyate mayā |
etadeva paraṃ tatvaṃ vijānīhamahīpate || 132 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgraheyaṃ ca 
viṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 80b>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāssaddhanassarvasiddhidaṃ |
puraścaryābhidhaṃ karmavakṣyamiva sudhāyate || 1 ||

itthaṃ paṃcadaśanyāsaissanadvanijavigrahaḥ |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojaṃ dhyātvā brahmavileśubhe || 2 ||

hṛtyaprakarṇikāmadhye śrīpatiṃ jātāṃ yati |
dhyātvātha śrīmadaṣṭārṇā yathā śaktyānvahaṃ japet || 3 ||

sahasusādhikaṃ kiṃciṣaṇmāsaṃvatsaraṃ tu vā |
japtvā hṛtvānyahaṃ bhūyatvalite jātavetavedasi || 4 ||

ācāryapatnīputrādīnabhyarcyadhanarāśibhīḥ |
vatsarān mahatīṃ siddhiṃ devānāmapi durlabhāṃ || 5 ||

jarāmaraṇaśūnyatvaṃ dīrghamāpuraṇagatāṃ |
kaṃdarpa samasaubhāgyaṃ vācāṃ siddhimanuttamāṃ || 6 ||

parakāyapraveśādi sāmarthyaṃ calabhedasau |
mṛtānāmapi sāhasrakarasparśanamātrataḥ || 7 ||

saṃjīvayati bhūyālasaśeyonātravidyate |
aṇimādigarṇoryuktovatsarātsvecaro bhavet || 8 ||

aṣṭārṇaviyāsaṃsiddhiḥ puraścaryaṃ vināpi ca |
uktayeta mahābhāga yadivighro na jāyate || 9 ||

caturlakṣaṃkṛto proktaṃ tretāyāmaṣṭalakṣakaṃ |
dvāpareravilakṣaṃ syātkalau ṣoḍaśalakṣakaṃ || 10 ||

gaṃgāgodāvarītīraṃtarmadātīramuttamaṃ |
tathā sarasvatītīraṃ yamunātaṭamapyatha || 11 ||

kāverīkṛṣṇaveṇyāścatugābhīmarathāṃ taṭaṃ |
samudratīraṃgoṣṭhaṃ ca suvarṇāmukharītitaṃ || 12 ||

tulasīvanamadhyaṃ ca praśastajapavūrmasu |
sutedyāccāryasānnidhyaṃ viśiṣṭaṃ prāhuriṣṭada || 13 ||

kurvanvadāṃditaṃ karmapratyahaṃ vijiteṃdriyaḥ |
naktāśyekāṃtarāśī vā phalamūlāśanopi vā || 14 ||

<p. 81a> 

haviṣyamatramaśranvānityaṃ triṣataṇorataḥ |
tayet ṣoḍaśalakṣāṇi śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ manuṃ || 25 ||

vidhivat tvalite vahnau yaptairmavyaghṛtaplutaiḥ |
hunet ṣoḍaśasāhasraṃ tata ācāryayādayoḥ || 16 ||

sarvasvamarpyayedvīmānvasudhāṃśasyasaṃkulāṃgavāṃ |
dvādaśakaṃ vatsaṃ vahukṣīrasamanvitaṃ || 17 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ cāpi vā sonṣundāṣaṇāṣṇikaṃ |
datvācāryapriyāputrānapi saṃtoṣyavastubhiḥ || 18 ||

brāhmaṇānbhojayet paścācchataṃ sāgraṃ savāsinīḥ |
itthaṃ kṛtvā puraścaryāmividhināvakṣudhāyate || 19 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidhā siddhiṃ sadyo vrajatyasau |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī siddhāpado bhavati bhūyate || 20 ||

tadaiva cakṣuṣā sākṣādbhagavaṃtaṃ prapaśyati |
athastaprepivāsākṣāddhāṣvarudrādivivaṃditaṃ || 21 ||

vinakṛtanayārūḍhaṃ śrībhūnilāsamanvitaṃ |
nārāyaṇaṃ parabrahmarūpirṇayaśyati dhruvaṃ || 22 ||

manaurathārthasaṃsiddhirdaivatairapi durlabhā |
bhavatyeva na saṃdehasrasminvarṣe mahīyate || 23 ||

bhagavatkalayāpūrṇaḥ kiṃcāsau bhavati dhruvaṃ |
japahomāccaṃ naṃdānaṃ vrataṃdeva dvijārcana || 24 ||

puraścaraṇakṛtyena vināva saphalaṃ bhavet |
tasmādavaśya kartavyaṃ puraścaraṇamādarāt || 25 ||

na siddhiratyathā bhūajapakoṭiśatairapi |
mahatīpuraccaryā saṃpūrṇoktāmayāta || 26 ||

vidyāsiddhiravaśyaṃ syādvidhānena kṛtāyadi |
ānāyāsenavidhāyāḥ śirdviguptatarāmapi || 27 ||

pravakṣyāmi mahīpālaśūṇudyāvahito bhavān |
vaiśākhemāsi śukevāt tīyākṣayasaṃjñitā || 28 ||

bhṛguvāsa saṃyuktā prājāpatyakṣaṃ saṃyutā |
hohirāyāṃ saṃsthito jīvemeṣarāśigateravau || 29 ||

lakṣmībhavānīyogoyaṃ durlabhaḥ sarvadehināṃ |
yogoyaṃṣaḍvibhirvaṣairllabhyate nānyathā nṛpa || 30 ||

tretāyuṇarghadivasamidameva vadaṃti hi |
pitṛṇāmapi sarveṣāmakṣanaṃdakārakaṃ || 31 ||

tatra gaurī samutpannāmenakāyāṃ himācalāt |
tatraiva bhṛguvāreṇaptahitedevaseśubhe || 32 ||

bhṛgoḥ syātyāṃ samutpannā tapasātoṣitehirā |
asminnevadine bhūyarohiṇyāṃ bhagavān vibhuḥ || 33 ||

valarāmākṛijautodvāparāṃte śriyaḥpatiḥ |
kiṃ ca dharmasyatayasātoṣitovasudhāyate || 34 ||

<p. 81b>

dākṣāyaṇyāṃśamutpannonāmnānārāyaṇosmyahaṃ |
prājāpatyarkṣasahite bhṛguvāsarasaṃyute || 35 ||

prājāpatyarkṣagejīvemeṣarāśisiteravau |
vaiśākheśuklapakṣehamutyanosmindine nṛpa || 36 ||

hitāya sarvajagatāṃ dharmasthāya na siddhayeḥ |
dharmasya tapasātuṣṭodākṣāyaṇyāmahaṃ nṛpa || 37 ||

āvibhūtosti viśvātmā nāmnā nārāyaṇīmuniḥ |
asminnevadine pūrvarīhiṇyāṃ bhṛguvāsare || 38 ||

upayemehariḥ sākṣādbhagāvanidirāṃ hariḥ |
kiṃ cāsminnevadivaserohiṇayāṃśaśiśekharaḥ || 39 ||

upayemevidhānena devī himavataḥ sutāṃ |
tasmādakṣayanāmnīyaṃ tṛtīyā sarvasiddhidā || 40 ||

dinayātrapapiproktamakṣayābhīṣṭasiddhidaṃ |
etai samanvito yogauralakṣyoyoga ītirataḥ || 41 ||

akṣayākhya tṛtīyeyaṃtithiruktāmahīyate |
rohiṇī bhṛgucāreṇa sahitātra bhavedyadi || 42 ||

śrīgaurīyoga ityākhyāṃgatosau sarvasiddhidaḥ |
rīhiṇīsasthitijīvemesurāśigateravau || 43 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇoyāgo bhavānīśaṃkaropi ca |
akṣayākhya tṛtīyaṃ yaṃmahatparvamamerirta || 44 ||

kātikapaurṇamīṃśuklāmārabhyāmaranāyakāḥ |
ṛṣayassiddhasaṃghāśca pratyahaṃ pūjayaṃtimāṃ || 45 ||

etaddvivasaparyaṃtaṃ dine sminvasudhāyate |
matokṣayalaṃ prāpya gacchaṃti tridivaṃsurāḥ || 46 ||

divasesminhutaṃ japtaṃdatamakṣayasiddhidaṃ |
matmasādbhavatyeva diname tatrathāthākṣayaṃ || 47 ||

vadarī ca na madhyasthe nānānārāyaṇesmyahaṃ |
nārāyaṇāśramonāmnātanmanasthā na mucyate || 48 ||

atrāśramesmin divase dharmasyatanayaṃ vibhuṃ |
dākṣāyaṇīsutaṃ nāṣāravyātaṃ nārāyaṇāṃ muniṃ || 49 ||

nareṇa sahitaṃ dṛṣṭvā māmeva jagatīpatiṃ |
koṭijanmārjītaiḥpāyasaṃghairapi sudāruṇaiḥ || 50 ||

vimuktaḥ saṃkarebhyopidehāṃte masvarūpabhāku |
akṣayesmin dine tasmāduktayogobhavedya hi || 51 ||

yogoyaṃ ṣaṣṭibhivarṣeralamyolabhyate nṛpa |
alabhyayoge saṃprāptodivasekṣayasaṃjñite || 52 ||

prātarutthāmahāyaṃpraṇamyācāryamādarāt |
naisakaṃ karmakṛtvātha tadanujñāpurassaraṃ || 53 ||

sahapaṃcadaśanyāsaiḥ śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ jayet |
triśatādhikasāhasraṃ śrīmaṃtrānyatamaṃśataṃ || 54 ||

<p. 82a>

prahvāvidhi vahnau saṃskatevaiṭikopi vā |
vivapatrairghṛtābhyaktaiḥ śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā || 55 ||

triśataṃ tu hṛyāsaścādravyenājyena vāvānṛpa |
śrīmaṃtrānyatamenāthahutvā dvādaśadhā ghṛtaṃ || 56 ||

raśmimaṃtre sakṛddhatvā prāyaścitāhatīhīnet |
utpalairvilvapatrairvāyairvākaravīrakaiḥ || 57 ||

triśataṃ pūjayet paścāddhastavidyāṃ samuccaran |
sāṃgāvaraṇapūjāṃ ca kṛtvādau niyatavrataḥ || 58 ||

pūrvopadiṣṭāpyācārya ca nātvāmnahīpate |
adhyetavyā raśmimālāśiṣyeṇaniyatātmanā || 59 ||

bhūyopi sakalanyāsā ahyetavyāḥ prāyatnataḥ |
avaśyamasyindivase śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīśubhā || 60 ||

upadiṣṭātha bhūyopi svācāryavadanāṃvujāt |
adhyetavyā prayatnena sarvanyāsapurassarā || 61 ||

nārāyaṇī sahṛsrarṇaprāptavyāthapunarnṛpa |
tata ācāryapādābjedhairyagāṃbhāryasaṃyutaḥ || 62 ||

sarvasvaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ dadyātardhaṃ vā tadadhakaṃ |
varṣāśanamitaṃ dravamathavāvaśyamaryarpat || 63 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ ramyaṃtasakāṃcananirmitaṃ |
ācāryakarṇayordeyamavaśyaṃ ratnasaṃyutaṃ || 64 ||

śālagrāmaśilāmekāṃdradyādakṣiṇayānvitaṃ |
pītāṃvarayugaṃdādyātssakṣyakāryāsakaṃtu vā || 64 ||

vibhavesatimūhānaṃ kuryāhrīdānamapyatha |
avaśyaṃ guravedeyaṃyānasaṃ phalapaṃcakaṃ || 65 ||

panasatritayaṃ vāpi vidhāsidhyaryamāharāt |
dṛṣṭvātphulanicānyāni dhanārḍhyā bhūmiyo yadi || 66 ||

muktāratnamaṃyorāśiṃ dhanarāśiṃ samarpayet |
dhānyarāśimathāśvaṃcagatānāṃdolikāṃdikaṃ || 67 ||

samarpyayedbhagavataḥ prāsādārthaṃ mahīyate |
tata dakṣayamevasyādyādyadasmindine kṛtaṃ || 68 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ devamavaśyaṃ vasudhāmate |
avaśyaṃ yānasaphalaṃ yaṃcakaṃtritaḥ prātayaṃtu vā || 69 ||

śālagrāmaśilaikāpihātavyā dakṣiṇānvitā |
varṣośanamitadravyaṃdayamāvaśyakaṃ vudhaiḥ || 70 ||

atha dvādaśaniṣkaṃ vāṣarigraṣkaṃ vā triniṣṇakaṃ |
daridrodhanahīnīpidakṣiṇāṃguraveryat || 71 ||

vāsobhissamalaṃ kṛtya gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ |
avaśyaṃguravederyadarivairapi sādhakaiḥ || 72 ||

akṣayāṃsiddhimanvicchan arthāyāṃśriyamūrtitāṃ |
akṣayāṃ putrapautrādisamṛddhijānamakṣayaṃ || 73 || 

<p. 82b>

akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāmitthaṃ kṛtvā yataḥ |
ākalyamakṣayāsiddhiḥ śrīmadṛṣṭārṇājāpibhiḥ || 74 || 

durlabhāyyamarādīnāṃtabhyate nātrasaṃśayaḥ |
ācāryāliṃganaṃ prāthatadāśībhiḥ kṛtādaraḥ || 75 ||

ācāryapatniṃ saṃpūjyaviśeṣeṇākṣayeddine |
bhojayedvipravarṣoścasuvāsinyoṣṭabhūyate || 76 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojanirṇejanajalaṃśubhaṃ |
pītvā kṛtārthatāṃ prāpyabhuṃjīyādvaṃdhabhissaha || 77 ||

akṣayāyātṛtīyāyāṃpuraścaryāmimāṃ śubhāṃ |
vinūśāṭhyaṃ parityajya kṛtvokta vidhinā śuciḥ || 78 ||

mahatīyāpuraścaryo pūrvabhūktāmayāttṛva |
tādṛśīnāśataṃ sāgraṃ kṛtvā yatphasamaśrute || 79 ||

tatphalaṃbhate sāṃgamavaśyaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ |
śriyācidrayayāthāsthiyoge phalamudīritaṃ || 80 ||

sarasvatyaijyaganmātryaipurāvaikuṃṭhamaṃdire vaiśākhamāsepi ca 
śuklapakṣeviraṃcitīraṇabhṛgoḥ |
sutena yukte viriṃcisthita devadevasadūṇai meṣasthiterkedivasetṛtīye || 81 ||

gaurīramāyorāgasudāharaṃti lakṣmīśanārāyaṇayogamāhuḥ |
umāmaheśābhidhamāhareketatraivagaurocare mātrajātā || 82 ||

dakṣaprajāyaka kanyakāyāṃ dharmasya patnyāmapi lokanāthaḥ |
takṣīpatiḥ prāhurabhūddharitryāṃ nārāyaṇonāmanaraiṇayuktaḥ || 83 ||

madbhaturaṣṭārṇamanuprakṣāponyāsaissamastairapiyoddinetra |
hutvā ca havyaṃ vidhisaṃskṛtegrauyūvauyadiṣṭāmapiraśmimālāṃ || 84 ||

ācāryavaktrāṃvujato gṛhītvānyāsaissahāṣṭārṇamanuṃcayaścīt |
bhūyo gṛhītvā gurupādayugmedayugmedatvā samastaṃ ca dhanaṃ maṇiṃ ca || 85 ||

ramyāṃ pradadyādatha kuṃḍadvayāṃ vāsoyuga brāhmāṇānbhojayecca |
phalatrayaṃ pānasaṃpaṃcakaṃ vāhyatvā sadācārya yadāraviṃde || 86 ||

śriyaṃ vratatyakṣayaralavitahayāśvadhānyaupasamṛddhiyuktāṃ |
putrābhivṛddhisakalāṃścanogāyurmahadbhāgyamathākṣayaṃ ca || 87 ||

pituścamātuḥ kulakoṭiyuktāmamaitadakṣapyayaṃdaṃ prayāti || 88 ||

sarasvatyai purātyoktamitthadhidrayayāśriyā |
dinamātreṇa kṛtvetthaṃ mahatīṃ siddhimaśrute || 89 ||

<p. 83a>

kiṃ punaryaugasahitephalaṃvaktuṃ na śakyate |
anena yogarājena samolabhyonavihvate || 90 ||

akṣayāṃ siddhimanvicchan kuryādvivasaṃvṛthā |
puraścaryorataraṃ vakṣye śṛṇuṣāṃ vahnio nṛpa || 91 ||

yatkṛtvā śrīmadaṣṭārṇasaṃsiddhiṃ labhate parāṃ |
bhāskaragrahaṇeprāpte caṃdrasyadivasepi vā || 92 ||

ekaṃ kālaṃmitāhīrastatpūrvadinapaṃcakaṃ |
grahaṇasparśa samaye gatvā sāgaṇāṃ nadīṃ || 93 ||

srātvā saṃkalpyanāmāni keśavādīnyayoccaran |
snātvā śūmedhāvabhṛthasnānapuṇyasamanvitaḥ || 94 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoja prakṣālanajalaṃ pivet |
aṃtassamastayāyebhyo muktaḥ syāt sadya eva hi || 95 ||

sparśakālaṃ sasārabhyavidhivatsaṃskṛtenale |
kṛṣṇaistilairhunedravyaghṛtaṃ yuktaistataḥ paraṃ || 96 ||

vinā bhārgavavāreṇa tatrāpi juhuyādvataṃ |
śirṣṭerdhanāḍikāmātre smṛtvā brahmāryaṇāhutiṃ || 97 ||

vahusasya samākīrṇāṃ caturvṛṣabhasaṃyutāṃ |
vahavinnayuktāṃ bhūmiṃmāvāryāya samarpayet || 98 ||

dakṣiṇāvihitāśāhyevaṣośanamittaṃ dhanaṃ |
atha dvādaśaniṣkaṃvāṣaḍviṃtā samarpayet || 99 ||

śālagrāmaśilāmekāmācāryāya samarpayet |
dakṣiṇāvasuniṣkaṃ vā triniṣkaṃvātha dakṣiṇāṃ || 100 ||

daridromaṃdabhāgyaścabhikṣitvetthaṃ samarpayet |
dadāti padyadgṛhaṇesavituḥ śaśinopi ca || 1 ||

tatadakṣayarmavasthādā caṃdrārkanasaṃśayaḥ |
grahaṇeva sudhāṃ datvā satyadvīpavatīṃ mahau || 2 ||

datvāyatphalamāpnoti tatphalaṃ samudīritaṃ |
śālagrāmaśilāmekā datvā pūrvoktadakṣiṇāṃ || 3 ||

brahmāṃḍakoṭidānasyaphalamatyaṃta mamaśrute |
dhanaṃ dhānyaṃ ca vā sāṃsibhūṣaṇaṃ kuṃḍalādikaṃ || 4 ||

śrotriyebhyodadhimadhughṛtakuṃbhānsamarpya ca |
samastābhīṣṭasaṃsiddhimatyaṃtaṃ mahatī labhet || 5 ||

jāhnīvīsadṛśaṃtīyaṃ dvaiyāya na samādvijāḥ |
svarṇadānaṃ merusaṃyaṃ prāhuścaṃdrārkaparvaṇi || 6 ||

amerayatyaṃ prathamaṃ hiraṇyaṃ gorveṇavīsūryasutāścagāvaḥ |
dattāstra yastena bhavaṃtilokāyaḥ kāṃcanagācagahīṃ pradṛdyāt || 7 ||

ācāryānugrahāt sadyaḥ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīśubhā |
dadāti mahatīsiddhiṃ daivatairapi durlabhāṃ || 8 ||

<p. 83b>

iṃdirāramaṇastasya bhagavān saṃprasīdati |
kimasādhya bhavet tasya prasannekamalādhiya |
sīdhyarthameva maṃtrāṇiṃ nityaṃ yatnaparo bhavet || 9 ||

aṣṭākṣarī mahāvidyā siddhiryasya yadā bhavet |
tadā tasya prasastābhikalyāṇābhi bhavaṃti hi || 10 ||

āyuṣyamārogyamadhaṃcalāśrīḥ putrābhivṛddhiṃ sukhamakṣayaṃ ca |
vidyāḥ samastā api divyabhogāna prāprotyathāṃte bhagavatyahaṃ ca || 111 ||

mahānubhāvāmunayaḥ purātunānyāsaiḥ sahāṣṭākṣaraṃ maṃtrasatāḥ |
siddhigatā brahmasaṃrūpatāṃ ca śriyaṃ parāṃ sarvagurṇāyayabhāṃ || 12 ||

hutvā ravīṃdagrahaṇe ghṛtena datvā sadācārya yadākṣrayugme dhanaṃ ca |
divyāmaraṇānidhānyaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ paśyati cakṣuṣāsau || 13 ||

dṛṣṭvā haritaṃ syalānvito sau punātivaśān śaṃtasaṃthaśopi |
pituśca mātuścakulānyito sau paraṃpadaṃ yātinaṃ saṃyotra || 14 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre 
vedārthasaṃgrahī ṣadviśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 83b>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

bhūyopyaṣṭārṇavidyāyāḥ sidhyarthaṃ saṃpravakṣyate |
yacchatvā pitaro dhīmān na jñānatimitaṃ viśet || 1 ||

vaiśākhemāsiyābhuktā tṛtīyākṣayasaṃjñitā |
pūrvoktayāgasaditā sarvasiddhipradetā || 2 ||

mahāvuddhipradaṃ sadyo vidhānāṃtaramapyatha |
atiguptataraṃ vakṣye sāvadhānamanāḥ śṛṇuḥ || 3 ||

prātarutthāya susnāto natvā svācāryamīśvaraṃ |
paṃcavādyeṣu natvādaugaṇanāyakaṃ || 5 ||

suvarṇairapi ratnaudyairvāsobhirbhūṣaṇairapi |
alaṃkṛtyasacāryaṃ punarnatvārtha daṃḍavat || 6 ||

ācāryaṃ caraṇardvardvakarayugmaṃ samarpya ca |
śrīmannāvārya sarvajñā yāvajjīva mahaṃtava || 7 ||

prāṇairarthairdhiyāvācākaromi caraṇārcanaṃ |
tvahājñoryūghanaṃ nāhakaromi karaṇanidhi || 8 ||

atra lakṣmīpatiḥ sākṣī tatraiva caraṇadvayaṃ |
śaraṇaṃ mama sarvajña gatirnānyāstime sadā || 9 ||

tavaiva caraṇadvaṃdvamāśrayedvaṃ punaḥ punaḥ |
pitāmātāpi bhayavatvameva mama daivataṃ || 10 ||

dustarādbhavadaḥ svaudhānmuktaṃ māmāṃ kuru saṃtataṃ |
prārthayitvetthamācāryaṃ prārthayitvā mahīyate || 13 ||

nyāsānpūrvedyadiṣṭāṃśca samastānapisādhakaḥ |
ācāryavadanāṃbhotā hṛhṇīyādva sudhāyate || 14 ||

<p. 84a>

tatassayastavidyānāṃ rājñīṃ sakalasiddhidāṃ |
upadiṣṭāṃ ca bhūyopi svācāryavadanāṃvujāt || 15 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ gṛhṇate yādvasudhāpate |
itthaṃ maṃtraṃmayīṃ dīkṣaṃ sarvanyāsamayīmapi || 16 ||

saṃprāpyakṛtakṛtyohamityātmānaṃ viciṃtayet |
svatojyotirmayauvidyāṃgacchaṃtīṃ bhāvayeddharu || 17 ||

āgatāṃ bhāvayecchiṣyo dhanyosmīti punaḥ yutaḥ |
śarīramarthaṃ prāṇaṃśca svācārya caraṇadvaye || 18 ||

samarpya kṛtakṛtyohaṃ dharnyāsmīti viciṃtayet |
akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāṃmihaṃ dīkṣīdvayaṃ śubhaṃ || 19 ||

gṛhītvā kṛtakṛtyaḥ sthādyāvajjīvanaṃ saṃśayaḥ |
avaśyaṃ bhagavāṃstasyatasminmāminyasīdati || 20 ||

ācāryānugrahāddīkṣādvayametadanuttamaṃ |
gṛhītvācāryasadhye pratiṣṭhāpyātha yācakaṃ || 21 ||

ikṣuraghaṃḍairgavyaghṛtābhyaktairaṣṭārṇavidyayā |
homaṃ śatādhikaṃ kuryāddekasāhasramādarāt || 22 ||

yadvā śuddhena gatyena juhuyān yaśrī |
maṃtrānyatamenāpi śatamaṣṭottaraṃ junet || 23 ||

haumaṃ kuryāttatastredhāraśmimaṃtrairapi kramāt |
jayādibhistatohutvātvanyāyaśrittāhatīrhunet || 24 ||

(**) utpalaiḥ kamalaivilvapatrairvātulasīḥ |
mallikākusumaivāpinaṃdyāvartairathāpi vā || 25 ||

 śrīśrīyatyarcayehyaśghrītbrāhmavidyāṃ samuccaran |
sāṃgāvaraṇapūjāṃ ca kṛtvādau niyatavrataḥ || 26 ||

triśataṃ dviśataṃ vāpi śatamaṣṭottaraṃ tu vā |
tata ācāryayādāvuddhitayaṃ praṇipatya ca || 27 ||

dukūlayugalaṃ vāpi sūkṣmaṃ kāryāsakaṃ tu vā |
samarpya pūrvamācāryamalaṃkṛtya tataḥ pare || 28 ||

phalapaṃcakamādāya yānasaṃ tritayaṃ tu vā |
madhyaphaleraṃdhramekaṃ kṛtvārājatayātrakaṃ || 29 ||

kāṃsyapātra mathovāpi paladvitayanirmita |
sarvasvamapi ratnauṣaṃdhanaudyaṃmaṃdirasthitaṃ || 30 ||

saṃsthāthakasānnidhye kiṃcityātrepinikṣipet |
phalasyo paritatyātraṃ raṃdhramadhyonidhāya ca || 31 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇaprītyau bhavatpūrṇe kṛpātyaye |
tvadraśividyāsaṃsidhyau maṃtrarājasya siddhaye || 32 ||

samarpayiṣye vastūni tarttakāmo bhavārṇarvaḥ |
siddhirbhavatumesvābhinnācāryakaruṇānirdha || 33 ||

mamaṃtradvayaṃ proktvā svācāryacaraṇaṃvuje |
arpayet sakalavastu dhanadhānyauva saṃkulaṃ || 34 ||

akṣayāyāṃ tatīyāmakṣayāsiddhimicchatā |
sarvasvaṃ dakṣiṇādeyātadardhevāṃ tadardhakaṃ || 35 ||

<p. 84b>

varṣāśanamitadravyamathavādeyamādarāt |
athavā kuṃḍalayugmaṃ tatyakāṃcananimitaṃ || 36 ||

ācāryakarṇeyugale pradatvā vaśyakaṃ nṛpa |
niṣkadvāsśakasvarṇaṃ sūkṣmavāso yugānvitaṃ || 37 ||

phalapaṃcakasaṃyuktaṃ nikṣityaṃ yātra madhyataḥ |
pradatvā mahātau siddhimakṣayāṃ prāpnuyādasau || 38 ||

maṃdabhāgyodaridraścedyācitvāsakalānapi |
ṣaṇinaṣktamathavādadyāttriniṣkaṃ vā prayatnataḥ || 39 ||

dakṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāmācārya otrayornṛpa |
kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ datvā maheṃdrasadṛśaḥ śriyā || 40 ||


nimagnābhannarakaudyeṣu pihṛnapipitāmahān |
mātāmahāṃśca śataśa uddhatyāsau mahīyate || 41 ||

nārāyaṇayaṃdasadyaḥ prāpayatyeva śāśvataṃ |
akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyā varṣāśanamitaṃdhanaṃ || 42 ||

 pradatvācāryayādārjaśatakoṭimitaṃdhanaṃ |
datvā yathpalamānyoti tatphalaṃ samudīritaṃ || 43 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ datvā niṣkadvādaśakaṃ dhanaṃ |
phalapaṃcakasaṃyuktaṃ datvācārya padāṃvuja || 44 ||

śatakoṇi suvarṇānāṃ dānasya phalamuhyate |
akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāṃ haricadanamuttamaṃ || 45 ||

catvāriṃśatyapalaṃ vāpi datvā viṃśatphalaṃ tu vā |
kalpadamagaṇākoṇe nivasedbhagavatpade || 46 ||

akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāṃ śākasūpadyatādikaṃ |
annaṃ dadhiyutaṃ vāpi datvā viprebhya ādarāt || 47 ||

vimuktassaṃ kalāyadbhāḥ śriyamiṣṭaścadurlabhān |
prāpnotyatra na saṃdehassatyaṃ satyaṃ dāmyahaṃ || 48 ||

mahatīyā puraścaryā sāṃgāpūrvomayeritā |
tādṛśīnāṃśataṃ sāgramakṣayāyāṃ kṛtaṃ bhavet || 49 ||

itthaṃkṛte vidhānena saṃśīyī nātra vidyate |
vājiyeyaśataṃsāgrasaṃpūrṇevaradakṣiṇāṃ || 50 ||

teneṣṭa nātra saṃdeho jyotiṣṭhomasahasrakaṃ |
asminmājjanmadivasetarvukāmobhavārṇarva || 51 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī siddhiṃ mahatīṃ labhate dhruvaṃ |
manorathānāṃ sarveṣāṃ bhavet siddhirihākṣayā || 52 ||

manorathatṛtīyeti tena khyāteyamādarāt |
apyatrapitabhigītaṃ dakṣiṇāmūrtitāpi ca |
śeṣeṇāpi punagītaṃ sarvamapyatra vakṣate || 53 ||

<p. 85a>

mahānubhāvāmunisiddhasaṃghā brahmarṣayaścāpi maharṣaśca |
vaiśāhamāsedavasekṣayāhavyemaṃtreṇa nārāyaṇavācakena || 54 ||

hṛtvā sahasraṃ gurupādayugme samarpya vitraṃ maṇijālamiṣṭaṃ |
saṃtaptahaimaṃ maṇirviduyuktamākalpayugmaṃ gurukarṇayuge || 55 ||

datvā kṛtārthaḥ pitṛmātṛvaṃśaśatairyutā divyayadaṃprayātāḥ |
kiṃ cātra siddho ca parāmavāpyaprātyāḥ syurbhāgāna yadurlabhāṃśca || 56 ||

ācārya pādāṃvujayugmasevāratīstathāṣṭākṣarasaṃtrasaktāḥ |
vaiśākhamāse civasekṣayesmin nārāyaṇoktavratamādareṇa || 57 ||

kṛtvā daridrā api lokavātha naurāyaṇaṃ daivatasārvabhaumaṃ paśyaṃti |
sākṣāhuruḍādhirūḍhaṃ dṛṣṭakattārthāsyuranaṃtabhogāt || 58 ||

pituścamāturnarakeṇamagraṃ kusaṃsamuddhatyavibhānaratnaṃ |
ārūtvasākṣātkamalādhi vā sapadaṃ prayāṃtyaivanasaṃśayonna || 59 ||

jatyaṃ hṛtaṃ sathṛyādayugmedattaṃ tathāsmindivase kṣayaṃ syāt |
aṣṭākṣaro homakalaṃ viśiṣṭa samastapurāyeṣu dinekṣayesmin || 60 ||

lakṣmīpatirdaivatasārvabhaumo nārāyasaurvajñagannivāsaḥ |
itthaṃ kṛteṣṭākṣara homakarmaṇyasya prasīdatyasvisāmareśaḥ || 61 ||

sākṣātyusannejagadekanāthe kimasya sādhyaṃ nabhavedabhīṣṭa |
na rājasūyo na ca vājñimedhonagosavīvāpihinekṣayāstye || 62 ||

aṣṭākṣarī homasamaṃ mahīyasamaṃ na godāna sahasrakaṃ vā |
aṣṭākṣarī homarataṃ dinesmin vaiśākhasāsekṣayasaṃjñitetha || 63 ||

nārāyāṇau daivatasārvabhaumo rudrau vidhirdakṣamukhaprateśāḥ |
śakrādayodikayutayopi siddhāst sadhyāśca sarve samaruhaṇaśca || 64 ||

brahmarṣayaḥ kauśikarṇetamādyāyogānvitādattakumāramukhyāḥ |
gaurīramāvāpnukhaśaktaścaścatuṣṭāḥ prasannāvaradāṃ bhavati || 65 ||

asyamācārya kalatramasminnabhyarcyamatyuttamabhūṣaṇaidyaiḥ |
ssrapṛṣyaupicaṃdanaiśca(-)bhakṣyaiścabhojyairbhikṣunānyathāpi || 66 ||

itthaṃ kṛte sau bhagavatyu sādāddhinyaḥ kṛtārtho munisidvacadyaḥ |
sānyotyavaśyaṃ sakarlāśca kāmānnārāyaṇāpaśyati cakṣurṣeva || 67 ||

iti śeṣādvibhirgītamapi pūrvamahīpate |
akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāmitthaṃ sidhyarthamācaret || 68 ||

<p. 85b>

śrīmācaret madaṣṭākṣarī siddhirakṣayāsyānnasaṃśayaḥ |
śriyaḥpateḥ prasādopi bhavatyevākṣayo nṛpa || 69 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojedattamapyakṣayaṃ bhavet |
bhagavatsannidhāvaṃtebhavejatirathīkṣayā || 70 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidhāyāvithiṣṭaṃ sādhanāṃtaraṃ |
bhūyopi saṃyavakṣyāmi samāhitamanaḥ śṛṇu || 71 ||

māsi bhādrapadeprāse śuklehyekādaśīdine |
atigaṃḍena yogena yadvā yuktetyu karmaṇa || 72 ||

vaiṣṇavarkṣa samāyukte somavāsarasaṃyute |
saumyavāsarayukte vā dvādaśīdivasepi vā || 73 ||

paṃcānanasthitebhānau lakṣmīnārāyaṇābhidhaḥ |
yogarājomajānuktoraviparvaśataprabhaḥ || 74 ||

akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāṃyomāhīn yoga īritaḥ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇoyegaste naiva sama ucyate || 75 ||

atra japtaṃ hutaṃ dattaṃ marvamakṣayasiddhidaṃ |
varṣairdvāśabhirbhūmau labhyateyaṃ mahīpate || 76 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇaḥ sākṣādbhaktānāṃ sarvasiddhidaḥ |
japahomādikartṛṇaṃ dadātyakṣayamāśitaṃ || 77 ||

aśvamedha sahasraṃ vā rājasūyaśataṃ tu vā |
mahādāna sahasraṃ vājiyeyāyuṃtaṃ tu vā || 78 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇoyogenāṇudānena tatsama |
alabhyo nāmayogoyaṃ sarvayogottamomaḥ || 79 ||

alabhyayoge saṃprāptye lakṣmīnārāyaṇāmidhe |
srātvā navāṃvidhānena devānṛṣiyohṛnapi || 80 ||

tarpayitvā manoramyaṃ yāgamaṃdiramāviśet |
ācāryacaraṇaṃbhojayugmaṃ natvā tataḥ paraṃ || 81 ||

saṃpūjyadevaṃ vimeśaṃ kṛtvā puṇyāhavācanaṃ |
triśatādhika sāhasraṃ samasanyāsasaṃyutāṃ || 82 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japtvā dvādaśārṇāṃ śriyastataḥ |
sāmrājyalakṣmīvidyāṃ vā ṣaḍarṇīmathavāśriyaḥ || 83 ||

aṣṭākṣaraṃ vā prajayeccha tatra yamathādarāt |
yathā rucijayedvidyāṃ komalaisulasīhalaiḥ || 84 ||

ketakīsahitairvilvapatrairvāthamarcayet |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇi paścātriśataṃ brahmavidyayā || 85 ||

sāṃgavaraṇapūjāṃ ca kṛtvādau niyatavrataḥ |
vidhivat saṃskṛte vahnau tilairgavyaghṛtaplutaiḥ || 86 ||

triśataṃ juhuyādagnauścomadaṣṭārṇa vidyayā |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ datvā śrīmaṃtreṇājyamādarāt || 87 ||

<p. 84a>

tredhā bhagavato raśmimamaṃtrairājyamathohunet |
prāyaścittāhutā hṛtvā brahmārpaṇāhuti || 88 ||

saṃtasahomaracitaṃ brahmarāgavinirmitaṃ |
ācāryakarṇayordatvā kuṃḍaladvayamādarāt || 89 ||

āthaṃ kṛtya tathācīryaṃ mudrikādyaiścabhūṣaṇaiḥ |
sūkṣmaṃ vāsoyugaṃ datvā śālagrāmaśilāṃśubhāṃ || 90 ||

varṣāśanamitadbhavyadakṣiṇā saṃhitāmatha |
prārthayitvāpi vahuśastilānapi samarpayet || 91 ||

pratigṛhṇāti vāmāvātitvadroṇacatuṣṭāya |
tadardhaṃ vā tadāvāryamaṃciresthāpayedvudhaḥ || 92 ||

godānaṃ tiladānaṃ vuśubhākāryaṣu saṃtataṃ |
pratigṛhyāṇamātraṃ vā pātakaṃ na labhet kvacit || 93 ||

tīvyaivuśubhakāryeṣu tilarāśi pratigrahī mahatyātakasānyodvādaśakaṃ tu vā |
ācāryācaraṇāṃbhojadeyamāvaśyakaṃtitannivṛttirathocyate || 94 ||

svagṛhītārdhavittasyadānena sahitānastiāna |
śrītriyāyatathānyasmaidatvā mucyetapātakān || 95 ||

varṣāśanadhanānābhāveniṣkadvādaśakaṃ tu vā |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojedeyamāvaśyakaṃ dhanaṃ || 96 ||

ekāṃ savatsāṃ dadyānniṣcadakṣiṇayānvitāṃ |
dhenupratinidhidravyaṃ yadvādadyāt sakṣiṇaṃ || 97 ||

vibhavasatibhūdānaṃ dadyādānamathāparaṃ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇenāmnāyogesmin sarvavīmidvide || 98 ||

yadyatkarotitinatsarvamanaṃtaḥsyānnasaṃśayaḥ |
brāhmaṇānbhojayetpaścādbhaujayecca suvāsinīḥ || 99 ||

ācāryānujñayāpaścītsvayarbhujītavāgyataḥ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇoyogeśrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ manuṃ || 100 ||

itthaṃ japtvā tato hutvā datvācāryā yaddakṣiṇaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīsiddhimāvaśyaṃ mahītīmapi || 1 ||

dullemādeva saṃśraiśca saṃprāpyā vaśyamakṣayāṃ |
prāpnotyatra na saṃdehassatyaṃnītra vicāraṇa || 2 ||

mahātīyāraścayīsāṃgā pūrvaṃ mayeritā |
tādagdvādaśākaṃtenakṛtaṃ syānnātra saṃśayaḥ || 3 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇoyoge tilairgavyaghṛtaplutaiḥ |
ekāmāpyāhaṛtirkṛtvā lakṣmīhomaphalaṃ spṛtaṃ || 4 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇe yāge sālagrāmaśilāṃ śubhāṃ |
ekāṃ sa dakṣiṇā datvā koṭi brahmāṃḍadānataḥ || 5 ||

<p. 84b>

phalamānyoti bhūyālavidyate nātraṃ saṃśayaḥ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇe yogeniṣkaṃvākāṃcanaṃ śubhaṃ || 6 ||

datvāmerusamakhaṇaṃ dānasya phalamaśnute |
ācāryakarṇayugale kuṃḍaladvayadāmana || 7 ||

divyālaṃkārakīṭīnāṃ dānasya phalamaśnute |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇe yo sahasrajayamātrataḥ || 8 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ japtvā lakṣasasrakuṃ |
yatphalaṃ sa bhavāpnoti tadeva phalamīritaṃ || 9 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇoyogepuraścaraṇamādarāt |
kṛtvetthaṃ nāmnasaṃdehobhagavaṃtaṃ praśasyati || 111 ||

atha vāgarūḍārūḍhaṃ brahmārudrādivaṃditaṃ |
statyeyaśyatyasau sarvakāmadaṃ bhaktavatsalaṃ || 12 ||

tadārebhyadirāvāse kṛtvā pūrṇaśarīravān |
viyuktaḥ pāparīśibhyaḥ kalyāṇāni dine dine || 13 ||

acalalāṃśriyamāsādya dhanyādi saṃkulāṃ |
vaṃśābhivṛddhimatulāṃ putrapautrādisaṃkulāṃ || 14 ||


saṃprāpya sakalānbhogān divyānapi ca mānuṣān |
divyaṃ vimānamāruhyakulaviṃśatiṃ saṃyutaḥ || 15 ||

akṣayaṃ paramaṃ yāti śāśvataṃ bhagavatpadaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidhāyāsmidhyarthaṃ sādhanaṃ paraṃ |
na divasenoktaṃ punaranyatpravakṣyate || 16 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārasarasaṃgrahe 
saptaviśodhyāyāḥ] ||
<p. 84b>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

sadyassiddhipradaṃ śrīmadaṣṭārṇasya mahāmanoḥ |
bhūyopi saṃpravakṣyāmi śūṇuṣva vasudhāpate || 1 ||

grahaṇaṃ savituśceṃdormahatyavaṃsanīrita |
tatroktā śrīmadaṣṭārṇa puraścaryāmayātava || 2 ||

viśeṣamapi vakṣyanigrahaṇe śaśisūryayoḥ |
śrāvaṇemāsipaurṇabhyāṃ caṃdrasyagrahaṇaṃ yadi || 3 ||

somavāsarasaṃyuktaṃ vaiṣṇavakṣaṃ samanvitaṃ |
vasunakṣatrayuktaṃ vāyogolabhyo mahānayaṃ || 4 ||

caṃdracūḍāmaṇirnāmnyadaivaṃtairapi durlabhaḥ |
sarvāsāmanividyānāmavaśyaṃ siddhiruttamā || 5 ||

jāyate japahomādyairakṣayābhīṣṭasiddhidā |
śrīmadaṣṭarṇavidhāyāssiddhiktuṃ na śakyate || 6 ||

<p. 85a>

ekakālaṃmitāhārastasūrvadivasatrayaṃ |
prātastasmindine srātvā svācāryacaraṇadvayaṃ || 7 ||

praṇamya śrīmadaṣṭārṇāṃ samastanyāsasaṃyutāṃ |
triśatādhika sāhasraṃ prajapetriyatavrātaḥ || 8 ||

śrīmaṃtrānyatamaṃjaptvā śatatritaṣadarāt |
paṃcadhā bhagavadraśmividyāsūktaṃ tato japet || 9 ||

grehaṇe sparśasamaye snātvā nataḥ paraṃ |
keśavādīni nāmānimaunenamanasoccaran || 10 ||

caturviṃśatidhāsnāvimuktaḥ sarvapātakaiḥ |
vāsasīparīdhāyāthatrirācamyayatavrataḥ || 11 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojojaprakṣālitajalaṃśubhaṃ |
pītvā vimuktaḥ payaudyairvahiraṃtasthitairapi || 12 ||

prāṇānāya saṃkalpya vidhivat saṃskṛtenale |
hanedravyājasaṃmiśraistilaikṛṣṇaiḥstataḥ paraṃ || 13 ||

śatādhikasuhasraṃ vā śrīmadaṣṭīrṇavidyayā |
hunityaṃ paṃcaśataṃ vāpi catuḥśatamathāpi vā || 14 ||

śrīmatrāṃnyatamenāthahunaṃ dravyaṃ ghṛtaṃ śataṃ |
ekadhāvādvidhā predhāraśmimaṃtrairhunaittṛtaḥ || 15 ||

prāyāścittahutīrhṛtvā kṛtvā brahmarpaṇāhutiṃ |
pradakṣiṇyaṃ namaskṛtya jātavedasamādarāt || 16 ||

ācāryacaraṇaṃbhojayugalaṃ praṇipatyaṃ ca |
sarvasvamaryadvīmān yadvāvarṣāśanaṃ dhanaṃ || 17 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ datvāniṣkadvādaśakuṃtuvā |
vaṇiṣkaṃ cātriniṣkaṃvātanyūnaṃ na samarpya yat || 18 ||

vitaśāṭhya samāyukto na vidyāsiddhimaśrute |
sālagrāmaśilāmekāmavaśyaṃ guraveryapet || 19 ||

purāṇaṃ dharmaśāstraṃ vāyustakaṃ ca samarpayet |
vibhave sati bhūdānaṃ godvayaṃ ca samarpayet || 20 ||

anyānyayi ca dānāniddadyādācāryapādayoḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāsiddhiṃ sumahatīmapi || 21 ||

prāpnotyakta na saṃdehassadya eva mahīyate |
caṃdracūḍāmaṇirthyojastriṃśadvatsaratī bhavet || 22 ||

caṃdrācūḍāmaṇau yoge kṛtvaikāṃcatilāhutiṃ |
koṭiśastilahomasya phalamānyosanuttamaṃ || 23 ||

<p. 85b>

caṃdracūḍāmaṇauyogedānamācāryapādayoḥ |
tulāpuruṣakoṭīnāmavaśyaṃ labhate phalaṃ || 24 ||

itthaṃ kṛtvā puraśraryaṃ caṃdrecūḍāmaṇau nṛpa |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāpuraścaryāśatātphala || 25 ||

avaśyaṃ prāptyuyātsadyaḥ paśyatyatiramāyati |
tasminnevadirnasvaye yadvā sākṣācchriyaḥ patiṃ || 26 ||

vinatānayārūḍhaṃ brahmārudrā divaṃdivaṃditaṃ |
dṛṣṭvā samastabhāgyānāmāśrīyosaubhaveddhruvaṃ || 27 ||

bhagavatkalayāyukaḥ śriyamaṣṭaguṇanvitāṃ |
cirāyuṣyamathārogyaṃ vācāṃ siddhiṃ ca durlabhāṃ || 28 ||

vaṃśābhivṛddhimatulāmācaṃdrārkaṃ mahīyate |
saṃprāpyasakalānbhogāndivyānapi ca mānuṣān || 29 ||

piturmātuśca vaṃśānāṃ sahasreṇa samīnvitaḥ |
vimānavaramārūṭholabhate bhagavasada || 30 ||

āśvayugmāsisā prāpte pratiyaddiṃnamāditaḥ |
navarātramiti protaṃ navanavapyaṃtaṃ mahīyate || 31 ||

tatraikaikaṃ ca divasaṃ raviyarvasamaprabhaṃ |
divase divaseja saṃhutaṃtta ca bhūyate || 32 ||

ānaṃtakalaṃdaṃ proktā makṣayabrahmasausvayaṃda |
yā mahānavamī proktā navārātre tathāśvirna || 33 ||

caṃdrārkayarvasāhasrasatribhāsāsamīritā |
sakṛjjasaṃhatamapi tatrānaṃta phalapradaṃ || 34 ||

bhṛguvāsa rasaṃyutāvauśca daivasasaṃyutā |
maredyurvaiṣṇavaṃ tāraṃ yadi sā navamī parā || 35 ||

sāmrājyalakṣmīyogauyaṃ durlabhoyaṃ mahītale |
varṣamadhyasthitamidaṃ yarvaratnaṃ mahīpitaṃ || 36 ||

navarātravrataṃbhūyasamasteśitamidvidaṃ |
navarātre pratiyadi svācāryājñāpurassara || 37 ||

prātaḥ srātvā viśuddhātmānityakarmasamātha ca |
saṃpūjyādaugaṇādhīśamadhyarcyācāryamādarāt || 38 ||

alaṃkāraiśca vā sobhirgaṃdha puṣpākṣatairapi |
svācāryacaṇāṃbhojasannidhauśaṃsitavrataḥ || 39 ||

praṇanāyamya saṃkalpyasamastanyāsasaṃyutāṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃvidyāṃ sahasraṃ ca catuḥśataṃ || 40 ||

dine dine japenmaunī śrīmaṃtradvādaśākṣaraṃ |
sāmrājyalakṣmīmaṃtraṃṣāśrīṣaḍarṇamathapi vā || 41 ||

<p. 86a>

aṣṭākṣaraṃ śriyo yadvājapadakaṃ sahasrakaṃ |
catuḥśatādhikaṃ yadvā sahasraṃ pratvatuḥhaṃ japet || 42 ||

śrīmrājyalakṣmīmaṃtraṃ vā śrīṣaḍarṇamathāpi vā || 41 ||

aṣṭākṣaraṃ śriyo yadvā japadarka |

śrīmadaṣṭākṣīrīvidhāmapi bhānusahasrākaṃ |
navarātravṛte yadvākaumāistulasīdalaiḥ || 43 ||

sapuṣpairvilvapatrairvātriśataṃ brahmavidyayā |
śrīśrīpatīsamabhyarcyastāṃgācaraṇapūrvakaṃ || 44 ||

aṣṭettaraśataṃ ślokamaṃtrātmakanuttamaṃ |
ātharvaṇa mahāsūktaṃ lakṣmīdudayanāmakaṃ || 45 ||

navarātre japedekottaravṛddhikāmānnṛpa |
paṃcādhikāṃ vā catvāriṃśavṛtiṃjapennu vā || 46 ||

māhānavamyāṃ prāptā vāmācāyajñipurassaraṃ |
prāṇānāyamya sakalpyajvalite jātavedasi || 47 ||

aṃgāvaraṇamaṃtraiścaghṛtamekaikaśo hunet |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣariṇātha sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 48 ||

gavyājyaṃ juyādagrauyāsena tataḥ paraṃ |
madhutritayayuktena dvādaśārṇa śriyā hunet || 49 ||

aṣṭākṣareṇa vākṣmyāḥ śrīṣaḍarṇevāhunaṃta |
atha sāmrājya lakṣmyāvāśātādhika sahasrakaṃ || 50 ||

hutvā bhagavato raśmi maṃtrairekaikaśoghṛtaṃ |
lakṣmīhṛdayamaṃtraiśca ślokarūpairataḥ paraṃ || 51 ||

pratiślokena hokṣavyaṃyāyasaṃtrimaḥdhutyutaṃ |
jāyādi homaṃ kṛtvātha prāyaścittāhunīrhunet || 52 ||

brahmārpaṇāhurti kṛtvā praṇamyāgnimataḥ puraṃ |
śrīśrīyātī samabhyarcya pūrvavadbrahmaviyā || 53 ||

athācārya yadvāṃ bhojadvayaṃ sāṣṭāṃgamādarāt |
namaskṛtyārpyayedvomānakuṃḍaladvitayaṃ śubhaṃ || 54 ||

bhūṣaṇairapyalaṃkṛtya mudrikādyairmanoharaiḥ |
vāsobhirgaṃdha puṣpādyairvahūśasyaugha saṃkulaṃ || 55 ||

gocarmasasmitāṃ bhūmiṃ nivartanamitāṃ tu vā |
bhagavatmannidhau datvādācāryāyamahātmane || 56 ||

vavarṣāśanamiṃdravyamuttamādakṣiṇāsmṛtā |
niṣkadvādaśakaṃ madhyadakṣiṇā ca trivinirmitā || 57 ||

adhavāmasunityaṃ syāt ṣaṇiṣkamadhamādhamā |
dṛdyādavaśyamācāyekarābjeḥ dakṣiṇānvitāṃ || 58 ||

<p. 86b>

sālagrāmaśilāṃ śuddhāṃ śuddhacakrasamanvitāṃ |
ekāṃ sopaskarāṃ śayyāmapi dakṣiṇaṃ yānvitāṃ || 59 ||

dadyādācāryayādātveagāmekāṃ ca sadakṣiṇāṃ |
caturvṛṣabhasaṃyuktādātavyā satataṃ mahī || 60 ||

mahīpratinidhidravyamathavācāryapādayoḥ |
paṃcaviṃśatinirṣṇuvā tadardhaṃ vātvardhakaṃ || 61 ||

vṛṣapratininidravyaṃ niṣkadvayamudīhṛtaṃ |
ekaniṣkasuvarṇaṃ vā vittalobhaṃ vivarjayet || 62 ||

dhenupratinidhidravyaṃ niṣkaṃmekamudāhṛtaṃ |
niṣkārvamathavādeyaṃ dhenumūlyaṃ mahīyate || 63 ||

sālagrāmaśilādīnamuktacānuktameva vā |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇe sidhyarthaṃ kāryamāvaśyakaṃvudhīḥ || 64 ||

mahānavamyāṃ prāptyāyā śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā |
hutvaikāmāhutimapi koṭihomaphalaṃ labhet || 65 ||

vahusasya samāyuktamahīṃcocarmasammitāṃ |
mahānavamyāṃ datvāsau satyadvīyapradānataḥ || 66 ||

yatphalaṃ samavānyoti tatkoṭi guṇamaśrute |
mahāvamyā prātyāyāṃ kuṃḍalakṣitaṃyaṃ śubhaṃ || 67 ||

divyālakārakoṭīnāṃ datvā tatphalamaśrute |
kiṃ vāsyapitaromagrānarakaudyeśu koṭiśaḥ || 68 ||

vrajaṃti vaiṣṇavaṃdhāma divyābharaṇabhūṣitāḥ |
mahānavamyāṃ bhagavatsālagrāmāśelīśubhāṃ || 69 ||

datvā dakṣiṇayāyuktā brahmāṃgarvudadānataḥ |
phalamāsādyaśuddhātmā bhagavaṃtaṃ prapaśyati || 70 ||

mahānavamyāṃ prāptāyāṃ datvāṣṭaṣā catuṣṭayaṃ |
tanmālya svalpasvarṇamathavālakṣagodānajaṃ phalaṃ || 71 ||

saṃprāpyapitaṃ vaṃśānāṃ sahasreṇa samanvitaḥ |
prāpnoti bhagavaddhāmaśāśvataṃ divyamakṣayaṃ || 72 ||

kurvīta tasmindivase dhanāḍhyo bhūmiyotha vā |
tulāpuruṣamukhyāni hānānivasudhāpate || 73 ||

itthaṃ sāṃgavrataṃ kṛtvā tanmahānavamīdine |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā puraścayo sahasrajaṃ || 74 ||

avaśyaphalamāsāyābhagavatkalayānvitaḥ |
prāpnoti mahatīṃ lakṣmīṃ dhanratnaudyasaṃkulā || 75 ||

āyurārogyasahitāṃ gajāśvarathasaṃkulāṃ |
vidhā siddhiṃ ca mahatī nigrahonugrahakṣīmāṃ || 76 ||

putrapautravatīmṛddhidhogānapi sudurlabhān |
avāpyaiccharīrāṃte prāpnoti hārisatridhiṃ || 77 ||

<p. 87a>

navarātravratasamaṃ vratamanyannavidyate |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī siddhiyādaśī navarātrake || 78 ||

na tādṛśī mahāsiddhirvratadharnyaṣu bhūyate |
navarātravrate yāvat prasāhaḥsyācchriyaḥpateh || 79 ||

vrateṣvanyeṣu bhagavatprasādastādṛśonaṃ hi |
navarātravrataṃsāṃgaṃ kṛtvethāṃ vidhinādarāt || 80 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīsiddhiṃ devānāmapi durlarbhā |
avātha brahmarudrādyauḥ śakrādyairapi pūjitaḥ || 81 ||

mahatī siddhimāsāṣaśāśvatīmanānayāyinīṃ |
prāpnoti bhagavadvāmakulānāṃśatasaṃyutaḥ || 82 ||

navarātravrate nityasarvakalyāṇasiddhide |
ācāryatoṣaṇātuṣṭābrahmaviṣṇumaheśvārā || 83 ||

prāhadyurmahatīṃ siddhimapi daivatallarbhāṃ |
śakrāyā āpi dikpālāḥ keṃkaryaprāpnuvaṃtihi || 84 ||

kapilādyā mahāsiddhāvaradāḥ syurnasaṃśayaḥ |
navarātravratamidaṃ yāvajjīvaṃ samācaret || 85 ||

saṃkaṭepi ca saṃprāpte vaddhaviṣṇoṣu sasvapi |
navarātra pratakuryācchriyaskāmo dvijottamaḥ || 86 ||

vratabhaṃgāṃ bhavedyasya sakṛdapyavanīpatte |
ariṣṭāṃ jāyate tasya tasminvarvenāsaṃśayaḥ || 87 ||

icchan samastkalyāṇarāśiśroyaḥ parayaṃparaṃparāṃ |
navarātravrataṃ kuryācchromadaṣṭārṇe siddhaye || 88 ||

sarvāsāmapividyānāṃ navārātravrate śubhe |
udīritā mahāsiddhirbrahmavidbhisamoṣṭatāḥ || 89 ||

sārātsārataṃ saṃṣurāyaṃ guhyaṃ ratyatamāṃ śubhaṃ |
navarātravratamihaṃ samastādhaudhabhaṃjanaṃ || 90 ||

vāsaṃte navarātrepi saṃprāpto vasudhāpate |
ācāryānujñāyā prātaḥsnātvā pratipadāditaḥ || 91 ||

samastanyāsasahitāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīśubhāṃ |
saṃkalpārkāsahasrīṇi prajayennavarātrake || 92 ||

śrīmaṃtrīnyatamaṃ yaścījjapedake sahasrāka |
prajapedaṣṭasāhasraṃ paṃcasāhasrakaṃ tu vā || 93 ||

naktāśyekāṃtarāśīvāhaviṣyāśī dine dine |
śrīrāmajanmanavamīdivase sarvasiddhide || 94 ||

prātaḥ srātvā viśuddhānmāsvācāyaṃsauvasannidhau | 
vidhivat saṃskṛte vahāvikṣukhaṃḍairghṛtatthatai || 95 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtreṇaśatādhikasahasrakaṃ |
juhuyādvitvāpatrairvāgavyājyatribhadhuplutai || 96 ||

<p. 87b>

madhunnitayasaṃmiśrehaviṣāvāhune nṛpa |
athavā śuddhagavyenadyānena juhuyāśuciḥ || 97 ||

śrīmaṃtreṇahunetyaścāt triśataṃ kevalaṃ ghṛtaṃ |
puratorato juhuyānmaṃtrairṣṭahadāvaraṇoditaiḥ || 98 ||

śrīhomānaṃtaraṃ raśmimaṃtresridhāhunedhadvātaḥ |
jayāhi homaṃ kṛtvātha kṛtvā brahmarpaṇāhatiṃ || 99 ||

agnipradakṣiṇīkṛtya namaskaṛtya tataḥ paraṃ |
ācāryācaraṇāṃbhojadvayasāyyaṃgamādarāt || 100 ||

namaskṛtyāryayeddhomānvarṣāśanamitaṃ dhanaṃ |
sālagrāmaśilāṃ śuddhānikṣityāṃkāpyapātrake || 1 ||

kāṃsyayāllethavā kṛtvā śrīśrīśabrahmavidyayā |
niṣṇerdvādaśabhiḥ svarṇairvasuniṣkairathāpi vā || 2 ||

paṃcaniṣkasuvarṇaivāsaṃpūjyaśrījagatpatī |
prīṇā tu bhagavānsākṣācchīrāmātmāśriyaḥpatiḥ || 3 ||

kauśalyāgarbhasaṃbhuto vratenānenasaṃtataṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāsaṃsiddhimahatīmapi || 4 ||

śrībhūtīnādyatiḥ svāmī datvātratumāṃsahā |
iti tradvayenātha sālagrāmaśilāśubhāṃ || 5 ||

yathokta dakṣiṇāyuktāmācāya nivedayet |
sūkṣmavāsodyugaṃ datvā haricanamuttamaṃ || 6 ||

vibhave satyalaṃkārān hṛdyāt kāṃcananirmitān |
athācāyalatrasyakarṇe laṃkaraṇādikaṃ || 7 ||

arpayitvāramāvudhyāredyurbrāhmaṇānavaṃ |
navabhojyāḥ savāsinyovāsobhirdikṣiṇādibhiḥ || 8 ||

saṃtoṣyavaṃdhubhiḥ sārdhabhujīhannamādarāt |
vāsaṃte navarātrepivrataṃ kṛtvetthamādarāt || 9 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣrīsiddhisaṃghassalabhate dhruvaṃ |
śrīrāmajanmadivase śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyā || 10 ||

homaṃ kṛtvā vidhānena koṭi homaphalalaṃ labhet |
śrīrāmajanmadivisesālagrāmaśilāṃśubhāṃ || 111 ||

yathoktadakṣiṇāyuktādatvācāryāya sasādhakaḥ |
brahmāṇḍakoṭidānasya phalamatyaṃtamaśrutaṃ || 12 ||

vāsaṃte navarātrepi śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ japan |
puraścaryāśataṃphalaṃ  prāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ || 13 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyā daivatairapidallabhāṃ |
āvaśyaṃ mahatīṃsiddhimihaṃ ca prāpyasādhakaḥ || 14 ||

<p. 88a>

cirāpuṣpamathārogyadhaneratnādisaṃkulāṃ |
saṃprāpya mahatīṃ lakṣmīvākyadviṃ vā tulāṃ śubhāṃ || 15 ||

putrapautrādikāmṛdvidviṃkānbhogākṣvamānuṣān |
saṃprathakulasāhasrasrasahito bhagavatpade || 16 ||

ramate nātrasaṃdeho divyakanyāśatācitaḥ |
athāparaṃ pravakṣyāmi viśiṣṭaṃ parvasiddhidaṃ || 17 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāssiddhidaṃ yāmamātrataḥ |
amārkavāsarayutāsomenesahitāpi vā || 18 ||

bhāskaragrahaṇaṃ tatra jāyate yadi bhūyate |
ravicūḍāmaṇirvāmnāyogoyaṃ samudāhṛtaḥ || 19 ||

saṃvatsarairdvaudaśabhirlabhyate yogarāḍayaṃ |
atrajasasaṃkṛdvāpi koṭiśojaptamevahi || 20 ||

atrikapāpivāhatyākoṭihomasamonahi |
atrekaniṣkasvarṇe vā datvācārya yadāṃvuja || 21 ||

śatameru pradānasya phalamāpnoti śāśvataṃ |
raviparvaṇi saṃprāpte tatpūrvadivaṃ satrayaṃ || 22 ||

ekavāraṃ havibhujan manasmannuktamapyatha |
bhāskaragrahaṇesparśakāle prāte tataḥ paraṃ || 23 ||

keśavādi caturviśannāmānyuccārya yatnataḥ |
stutvāmasastupāyaudyairvimuktassadyarāvahi || 24 ||

gurupādodakayītva tridhātaḥ śuddhacittavān |
ācāsannidhāvagniṃ pratiṣṭhāpyavidhānataḥ || 25 ||

uprato jayānmaṃtrīvṛhadāvaraṇoditaiḥ |
maṃtrairātyenagavyena tatastrimadhusatyutīḥ || 26 ||

ghṛtābhyaktaistīlaihomaṃ mokṣakālātamādarāt |
kṛtvā śrīmanunāyaścīcchātamaṣṭottaraṃ hunet || 27 ||

bhagavadraśmividyābhirapi hutvā ghṛtaṃ sakṛt |
prāyaścittahutīrhutvā kṛtvā brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ || 28 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ natvā sāṣṭaṃgamādarāt |
datvā ca strīsūkṣmīsisvarṇa niṣkasahasrakaṃ || 29 ||

dadyātsasyaudyasaṃhitāṃ mahīgāṃ ca sa dakṣiṇaṃ |
yāvacchakāmalaṃkāraṃ datvā śrīguravetha vā || 30 ||

varṣāśanamitadravyamarkaniṣkamathāpi vā |
paṃcaniṣkasuvarṇaṃ vā niṣkatrayamitaṃ tu vā || 31 ||

avaśyaṃ guravedayādvittaśākyavivarjitaḥ |
śrotriyebhyaḥ pradedyānidaśadānānyataḥparaṃ || 32 ||

āśaktaḥ sadguroḥ kamaladvayamevadi |
abhyarcayettriniṣkādiyāvacchavacamitaurdhanaiḥ || 33 ||

<p. 88b>

dvijātivarjyāḥ saṃbhojyāssuvāsinyopiyaṃcadhā |
itthaṃ kṛtvā vidhānenena grahaṇe sāṃgamādarāt || 34 ||

mahatīyāpuraścaryāmayāproktā purātavaḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāstatopi mahatī parāṃ || 35 ||

avaśyasiddhimāpnotidaivatarapidurlabhāṃ |
āyurārogyasahitaḥ śriyādhanadasannibhaḥ || 36 ||

vācaspati samassarvavidyābhirapisaṃtataṃ |
prāpyavaṃśābhivṛddhiṃ ca kalpātaṃ vasudhāpate || 37 ||

mānuṣānapi divyāṃśca bhuktvā bhogānmanoramān |
kulasāhasramādāyavarīdviṣṇuyurrasukhī || 38 ||

ravīṃdragrahaṇeprātyenāpi sūtakaṃ sparśayā |
ramyamokṣāṃte śuddhārāvahitātayaḥ || 39 ||

iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmātatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
aṣṭāviṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 88b>

śrībhagavānapunaranyatpravakṣyāmi śrīmadaṣṭārṇeśādhamaṃ |
ekena divase naiva samāhitamānāḥścarā || 1 ||

yāpūvemabhakṣayānāmnātatīyāsamudīritā |
pūrvoktā yogasahitā daivatairapidullebhā || 2 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārsāvidyāyāssadyassiddhikaṃ paraṃ |
bhūyopi saṃvaḥ pravakṣyāmi viśeṣādvasadhāyate || 3 ||

ākṣayāyāṃtatīyāyāṃ yatrotpannausmyahaṃ nṛpa |
yatrāvirāsotkāmalābhṛgoḥkhyātyāṃtrayīmayī || 4 ||

yattotpannā jaganmātagirijāśaṃkarapriyā |
yatroyamebhagavāncyutaḥ priyamīśvarīṃ || 5 ||

yatrāmūrchakarasyāpi gaurīyāṇi grahaḥ śubhaḥ |
tatrākṣara tṛtīyāyāśrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ manuṃ || 6 ||

samastanyāsasahitaṃ smṛtvā triśātamādarāt |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī siddhiravaśyaṃ bhavati dhruvaṃ || 7 ||

vyatīyāto mahāyogaḥ sarvayogottamaḥ smṛtaḥ |
amāvāsyāpūrṇimā ca tadvādaśa samāsmṛtā || 8 ||  

tadvādaśasamaṃyarnaravisaṃkramaṇaṃ viduḥ |
savivāre saṃkramaṇaṃ tadvādaśasaṃmasmataṃ || 9 ||

tadvādaśasamaḥ prokto vāsarobhārgavaḥ smṛtaḥ |
caṃdracūḍāmaṇisamoyegaśrīddhaudayaḥsmtaḥ || 10 ||

tadvādaśa samoyogo lakṣmīnārāyaṇābhidhaḥ |
vaiśākhemāsiyāścaktratatīyākṣayasaṃjñit || 11 ||

tatsahasrasāpādeyā māhāsiddhivārīśubhā |
akṣayāṃyātatṛtīyāyāṃ muktaṃ yogatrayaṃ śubhaṃ || 12 ||

<p. 89a>

labhyate ṣaṣṭibhirvarṣannanyathāvasudhāyata |
akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyā muktoyogobhavedyadi || 13 ||

hīmāddhi karmaṇaṃ siddhirmatīhyārttadeva hi |
vidhānāmupadiṣṭānāmapitasmin dineśūse || 14 ||

ācāryavadanāṃbhotātpunaradhyanaṃ yadi |
avaśyaṃ mahanīsidvissadyarānākṣayā bhavet || 15 ||

kubjāmattāśca vṛddhāśca vālāḥ kāṇaścavaṃgavaḥ |
napusakāścayurmatrāḥ strīmaṃtrāvaidiṇastathā || 16 ||

ādimitravicekādiviśodhana vivarjitāḥ |
niṣiddhamāsatāreṣu labdhāśca śubhasiddhidāḥ || 17 ||

dīkṣāsaṃskārasahitājapahomavivarjitaḥ |
puraścaraṇanīnāścanyāsahīmāśca saṃtataṃ || 18 ||

ācāryaryadakṣiṇahīnā ācāryavadanāṃvujāt |
prāptā avaśyaṃbhūyopi sacchiṣyairdvityavekṣaye || 19 ||

sadyassiddhābhavatyaṃvalakṣmīśānugrahapradāḥ |
tatra prātaḥ samuhyāyanatvācārya padāṃvujaṃ || 20 ||

brahmavidyāṃ prajaptādau triśataṃ vācatuḥśataṃ |
avaśyaṃ bhagavadraśmimālikaṃ paṃcadyāsmaret || 21 ||

srātvā sahasraṃ gāyatrīṃ japesaṃcaśataṃ tu vā |
triśataṃ vātayecchadvānānprathāsiddhibhāgasau || 22 ||

nityahomasamāpyāthagacchedācaryasatridhi |
prārthadvaṃśaḥ sākṣādīvāṃ bhagavanmayaṃ || 23 ||

śrīmannācārya sarvajñasadguro karuṇanidhi |
bhavatpādāvrayugmasya kiṃkarīssidinedine || 24 ||

kāye na manasā vāānyāṇairarthaiścayuṣkalaiḥ |
karomitavapādātvakaikarpaśāśdhimāṃ vibho || 25 ||

yājjīvamahaṃ svābhinnācārya karuṇānidhe |
avaśyaṃ tavayāddātva kiṃkarosmidyaśādhimāṃ || 26 ||

ityācāryatribhiḥ ślokaiḥ saṃprārthyavahaśānanṛpa |
bhūyaḥ samastavidyānāṃ grahaṇaya samāhitaḥ || 27 ||

prārthayet sakalairarthaiḥ prāṇerapi mahīryata |
(***) ācāryopi kṛpāsidhurvaidikaipi vā || 28 ||

śrīmadaṣṭāṇayā hutvā śatamaṣṭottaraṃghṛtaṃ |
bhagavadraśmividyābhireke kāmāhuti hunet || 29 ||

pradakṣiṇaṃ parītyāgniṃ namaskṛtya tataḥ paraṃ |
hyavāmabhāge saṃsthāpya sacchiṣyaṃ karuṇānidhiḥ || 30 ||

<p. 89b>

svagurumanasānatvābhūyobhūyogaṇadhiyaṃ |
dattātreyaṃ mahātmānaṃ kṛṣṇadvaiyāyanaṃ muniṃ || 31 ||

gāyatrīpāditaḥ kṛtvā bhagavadraśmimālikāṃ |
śiṣyasyadakṣiṇe karṇe prahṛdyādvasudhāpate || 32 ||

nidhāya śiṣyā śirasidvakṣiṇaṃ hastamādarāt |
śiṣyasya dakṣiṇekarṇo pradadyāhraśmimālikāṃ || 33 ||

tasyai kṛtārthatā datvā śiṣyāyācārya ādarāt |
upadiṣṭāṃśca bhūyopinyānuyaddiśedvadhaḥ || 34 ||

dṛtvānyāsānsamastāṃścanyasya pratyagamādarān |
rājñī samastavidyānāśrīmadaṣṭākṣarīśubhāṃ || 35 ||

trivāraṃ dakṣiṇekarṇedadyācchiṣyasya sadguruḥ |
kṛtārthosmītimatvāsāvartavāsīmahāmatiṃ || 36 ||

ācāryācaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ vahavastubhirarcayet |
vidhānāṃ grahaṇārthāya sarvasayassamṛddhaye || 37 ||

dvaudaśavadhipimāseṣu vaiśākhaḥ sarvasiddhidaḥ |
yasminmāsetasamapidattaculukamātrakaṃ || 38 ||

sarvadānaphalaṃ prāhaḥ kimuhavyapradānataḥ |
upānehau ca chatraṃ ca madhudadhyohanādikaṃ || 39 ||

vaiśākhe saṃpradartrānityadadyurbhāgyamakṣayaṃ |
yasmanāsīyaurṇamālīviśārayāsahitāśubhā || 40 ||

sarvasiddhikarī sadyobhogasvagoyavargadā |
yogā bhavaṃti yadyanna mayā pūrvamudīritāḥ || 41 ||

kiṃca śobhanadyogovātthārtigajepi vā bhavet |
rājarājamimaṃ prāhulakṣmī nārāyaṇābhidhaṃ || 42 ||

gaurīśaṃkarayogaṃ ca śrīgaurīyogamayyadha |
āvaśyaṃ sarvavidyānāmacāryavadanāṃvujāt || 43 ||

grahaṇāddevasiddhisyātkimuhīmādibhirnṛpa |
itthaṃ samastavidyānāmācāryavadanāṃvujāt || 44 ||

saṃprāpya grahaṇaṃ śiṣyaḥ kṛtārthessīti ciṃtayet |
ācāryanujñayā tatra vidhivat saṃskṛtenale || 45 ||

ekaikāmāhutiṃ mannaihādāvaraṇoditaiḥ |
kṛtvāpya śrimadīṣṭārṇa manunāsādhakottamaḥ || 46 ||

madhutritayasaṃyuktaṃ pāpasaṃtodyātayutaṃ |
śatādhikaṃhānecchīmaddaṣṭāryo na sahasrakaṃ || 47 ||

śrīmaṃtreṇa hunetya śrīttriśataṃghṛtamādarāt |
bhagavadraśmividyābhirhuneddavyaṃ ghṛtaṃ tridhā || 48 ||

yadvekṣuyarvamirgavyaghṛtayuktairathodarāt |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtraṇaśatādhikasahasrakaṃ || 49 ||

<p. 90a>

hutvā gavyaghṛtenātha triśataṃ ramayā hunet |
bhagavadraśmi vidyābhistridhā hutvājyamādarāt || 50 ||

prāyaścittāhutīḥ kṛtvā kṛtvā brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ |
pradakṣiṇaṃ namaskṛsajātavedasamādarāt || 51 ||

triśataṃ pūjayet paścīcchrīśrīśabrahmavidyayā |
mallikākusumairvāpikarevīrairathapi vā || 52 ||

kamalairutpalairvāpinaṃdyāvarvrairathāpi ca |
ārcadvilvapatre vā tulasīdalamiśritaiḥ || 53 ||

ketakīkususādyairvāsugaṃdhibhirathāceyet |
phalapaṃcakamādāyānasaṃsamanoharaṃ || 54 ||

baddhāsatrayaṃ tramyaṃ sthūlaṃ bahuphalānvitaṃ |
nikṣipya bhūtale śūdve yatkiṃ vitpātramadhyataḥ || 55 ||

pātraṃ vā rājitaṃ kāṃsyapātraṃ va madhyame phale |
nikṣipya bhagavanmūrtisālagrāmaśilāṃśubhāṃ || 56 ||

saṃsthāpya madhyame tatraṃ sāṃgāvaraṇamarcayet |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ niṣkasuvarṇairbrahmavidyayā || 57 ||

(***) ca śatā vāpiyaṃ ca viṃśatiraṃva vā |
brahmavidyāṃ samuccāryalakṣmīnārāyaṇau yajejet || 58 ||

atra sūyājya sahitaṃ śākabhakṣyasamanvitaṃ |
dadhyodanaṃ tato dadyācchīśrīśrībhyāṃ mahīyate || 59 ||

upacāraissamabhyarcya tato nīrājanīdibhiḥ |
ācāryaṃ samalaṃkṛtyaṃ vastrālaṃkaraṇādibhiḥ || 60 ||

avaśyaṃ kuṃḍalayugaṃ datvācāryasya karṇayoḥ |
sūkṣmavāsopugaṃdatvā sālagrāmaśilāṃ śubhāṃ || 61 ||

saṃpūjitadravyayutamimaṃmaṃtraṃ samuccaran |
samāhitamanādayācchīmadaṣṭārṇasiddhaye || 62 ||

phalaṃ manorathakalaṃ pradadāti sadānṛṇaṃ |
phalasyāsyapradīnena mamasaṃtumanorathāḥ || 63 ||

sālagrāmaśilācakre brahmaviṣṇumaheśvarāḥ |
śaktādyā api dikpālānivaṃsaṃtyamarādhiyaḥ || 64 ||

ramāsarasvatīgaurīśacīmukhyāśca śaktayaḥ |
nivasaṃtisadīsarvasiddheyopi jagattrayaṃ || 65 ||

tasmādimābhagavataḥ śālagrāmasisāṃśubhāṃ |
sarvadevamayīṃdīsye prītomestaśriyaḥpatiḥ || 66 ||

itthaṃ phaladravyayutāṃ sālagrāmaśilāśubhāṃ |
dadyādādhāryahastānnaṃ śrīśrīśaprītikāriṇīṃ || 67 ||

phalamadhyasthite pātre yadvā bhagavataḥ śubhāṃ |
sālagrāmaśilāṃ śuddhasāṃpūjya kusumādibhiḥ || 68 ||

datvādadhyodanaṃ tatra phalasūyādisaṃyutaṃ |
tatsannidhāvakṣācāryakarṇayoḥ kuṃḍaladvayaṃ || 69 ||

<p. 90b>

sūkṣmaṃ vāseyugaṃ datvā phalapaṃcaka saṃyutā |
sālagrāmaśilāṃ śraddhāṃ pūtitāṃ yātra saṃyutāṃ || 70 ||

tadyādācāryahastāvre akṣiṇāsahitāmatha |
sarvasvaṃ dakṣiṇaprokā varṣāśanadhanaṃ tu vā || 71 ||

varṣāśanamitaṃ dravyaṃ śataniṣkamudāhṛtaṃ |
tadardhaṃ vā tadardhaṃ vā hācāryahastāvedakṣiṇāsahitābhayasavesvaṃ 
dakṣiṇāprokta varṣāśanadhanaṃ nu vā tannyanaṃ nahi bhūyate || 72 || 

arkaniṣkaṃdaridraścetkuṃḍaladvitayānvita |
samarpya śrīmadaṣṭārṇasaṃsiddhiprāpnuyātparāṃ || 73 ||

athācārya priyāṃ sākṣānmahālakṣmīdhiyārddhayet |
vastrairābharaṇairdivyairbhojanādyairathādarāt || 74 ||

yathāśaktidhanaṃ vāpi maṃdabhāgyaḥ saṃdārpayet |
paṃcaviṃśaṃtisaravyākaviprebhyodadhisaṃyutaṃ || 75 ||

bhakṣyā sūyaṃ ghṛtopetūṃ dadyādabhamathādarāt |
tataḥ ṣaḍgasasūyājyabhakṣyabhojyaiḥ suvāsinīḥ || 77 ||

śrīvudhyādvādaśabhyarcyodakṣiṇābhiścatoṣayet |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoja prakṣyātitajalaṃ śubhaṃ || 78 ||

pītvā sadyo viśuddhātmātaccheṣaṃ bhojayedvatī |
upānahau ca chatrāṇivyaṃ tanānyapi bhūyate || 78 ||

cuktavadbhyodvijāttibhyodadyādakṣiṇayā saha |
ācāryāliṃganaṃ prāpya tadāśīrbhiḥ kṛtādaraḥ || 79 ||

ākṣayāṃ mahatīṃ siddhiṃ prāpnuyādurlabhāṃ tathā |
koṭī sahasrasaṃkhyākasvarṇadakṣiṇayānvitaṃ || 80 ||

āśvamedhaśaṃta kṛtvā yatphalaṃ puruṣoṣṇute |
itthametuddhataṃ sāṃgaṃ kṛtvā tatphalamaśrute || 81 ||

mahātīyāpuraścaryāsāṃgāpūrvaṃ mayeritā |
tādaśīnāṃ śataṃ sāmaṃ kṛtaṃ tena na saṃśayaḥ || 82 ||

ācāryānugrahāt sākṣātsvanyevovāpi śriyaḥ patiṃ |
nivatātanayārūḍhe brahmarudrādibhirvṛrta || 83 ||

sarvasiddhipradātāraṃ śekhacakrādicihnitaṃ |
ikṣā tadāditomāsimāsi svapne śriyaḥpatiṃ || 84 ||

manorathapradātāraṃ paśyatyevamahīte |
sākṣātsvamepi vā dṛṣṭe kamalādhipatauhaṇai || 85 ||

kiṃ kiṃ na sādhyate tena aivatairapi durlabhaṃ |
cirādyuṣyamanārogyaṃ bhāgyaṃ māhadacaṃcalaṃ || 86 ||

śrīraṣṭaguṇāṃ saṃyuktā dhanadhānyādisaṃkulāṃ |
sarvavidyādhiyatyaṃ ca jātismaraṇanuttamaṃ || 87 ||

cikālajñānasaṃpatriḥ sarvajñatvaṃ mānojñatā |
parakāyaṃ praveśādi sāmarthyaṃ vākṣayaṃ nṛpa || 88 ||

<p. 91a>

sirvratyeva hi tasyāśu yogaścīṣṭāṃgasaṃyutaḥ |
trailokyanāyakaḥ svāmī bhagavāniṃdirāpatiḥ || 89 ||

svasārūpyaṃ dadātyasmaidurlabhāṃśca manorathān |
asminnartheśubhaṃjītaṃ dakṣiṇāmūrtināpurā ||
yāryatīnaṃdi caṃḍīśagaṇeśebhyo mahātmanā || 90 ||

vaiśākhamāsedivasekṣayāravye yuktikarmaṇaḥ |
sa śobhane vā bhṛguvārayukte viriṃcitakṣannayute tathaiva || 91 ||

vṛṣasthite daivaguṇai tathārkemeṣugatemeṣaṃgatebhṛgau ca |
yogaṃ mahārājamudāharaṃti lakṣmīpatiyogamathāhuranye || 92 ||

umāmaheśabhidhamāhurekegaurīramāyogamudāharaṃti |
ālabhyarāṣaudhuhavaṣalabhyogādhirājobhūvidyārthiveda || 93 ||

adhītavidyā ādhītavidyāścavaśyaṃmīcāryayusvāraviṃdāt |
prāptāstaddaivākṣayasiddhidāḥ syuratrāpyamutrāpisadādvijānīṃ || 94 ||

anaṃtaśāyī bhagavānmukuṃḍo lakṣmīpatidaivata sārvabhaumaḥ |
svedyā gṛhīturdvivasekṣayesmin homādikartaścavaṇan dadāti || 95 ||

vaiśākhamāsesedivasekṣayesmibhavaśyaśyamācaryamukhāraviṃdāt |
saṃprāptavidyā āpi sarvasiddhisamanvitāḥ syurnahiṃsaṃśavotra || 96 ||

viśeṣataḥ śrīpatimaṃtrarājamaṣṭākṣaraṃ nyāsa rahasyayuktaṃ |
hutvātha japtvāya gurormukhāhādvadhāpi sākṣādbhāvatameti || 97 ||

guroḥ prasādena samastavidyā sarvāpitasminivasesakṣayāraṣye |
uvātha siddhimahatīṃ pitṛṇāṃ śatānvito divyapadaṃ prayāti || 98 ||

vaiśākhemāse divase tṛtīye yogatrayaṃ yasyādyadi tatra bhūya |
avaśyamācāryamukhāraviṃdādṛṣṭākṣaraṃnyāsasametamādau || 99 ||

abdhvātha hutvā haviṣyādhanena svācārya pādāṃvujamarcayitvā |
ihāpi sīddhīṃ mahatīmavāpyasidyaṣṭakaṃ cāpuraṇegatāṃ ca || 100 ||

vaṃśāmivṛddhisaphalārthasiddhimaṃte kulānāṃ śatasaṃyuto sau |
vimānasāruhyaramādhivāṃ saprayāti vaikuṃṭhapadaṃ mahīśa || 1 ||

nāneyogena samosiyogolakṣmīśasākṣītkṛtisiddhidāyī |
anenalakṣmīśamasūtratvāsakṛdvāpi jagatpatiḥ syāt || 2 ||

ācāryapādābjāyugaṃ prapannāḥ prāṇaiśca ratnairmanasāpivā vā |
samastadevairapi pūjyamānāprayāṃti sarveśitasiddhimagryāṃ || 3 ||

<p. 91b>

bhukteśca mukteśca manorathānāmācārya śuśvaṣaṇameva mūlaṃ |
jānī hi māmeva puruṃguruṇāmācāryamīśaṃ jagadevanātha || 4 ||

etāvadevāsvilavedaśāstramāraṃ rahasyaṃ paramaṃ pavitraṃ |
mayāyirakteṇa viriciṃ mukhyairniścityaniścitya ca bhūdhabhūya uktaṃ || 5 ||

nācāryayā vrapuṇadvariṣṭaṃ saṃpūjyamastīhajagatpavitraṃ |
nānena yogena samosti yogaḥ satyapunassatyamidaṃ mahīśa || 6 || 

sadyomahīsiddhikaromanhanāṃ nānena yogena samosti loke |
viśeṣatoṣṭākṣarasiddhidoyamācāryasaṃtoṣaṇatonṛpāla || 7 ||

vaiśākhamāse divasekṣayesmin nyāsauḥ sahādākṣaramaṃtrajāyī |
sahasramekaṃ triśataṃ śataṃ vā sadhomahāsiddhisamauprayāti || 8 ||

viśeṣatoṣṭākṣaravidyayāyohavihunedravyaghṛtena yuktaṃ |
vailvaiścapatraistrimadhutprataṃ ca svācārya pāhāsrayugethabhūya || 9 ||

sākalyuvittānvitayānaptāniphalānivāso yugalānvitāni |
datvāmra saṃbhūta bhavāni sadyoramāramādhīśa mahāprasādāt || 10 ||

saṃprāpyasiddhiṃ jagadekanāthaṃ paśyatyasaunetrayugena sākṣāt |
lakṣmīkalāpūrṇaśarīradhārīkaṃdarpasāhasrasaṃmānatejāḥ || 111 ||

vācaspatiḥ śrīpatiriṣṭābhogānavāpyaputraissahapautrasaṃdyaiḥ |
prayāti lakṣmīpatidhāmadivyaṃ sa prīprāpyadīrghāpurarogatāva || 12 ||

etāvatsarvavedonosārabhūtārthasaṃgrahaṃ |
niṇītamatyakṛṣṇarudramukhyaiḥ surottamaiḥ || 13 ||

mahādaridropyaṣṭārṇamaṃtravānasadyedine |
hutvā japtvāpi vā vidyāṃmāryavātha tatsṛt || 14 ||

gṛhasamārjanālepavastraprakṣālanādibhiḥ |
saṃsevyavatsarayugaṃ pādaṃ saṃvāhanādibhiḥ || 15 ||

saṃtoṣayedayasvasyaputrikāṃ vā samarpayet |
vidyāsiddhimavāpyāsaubhagavaṃtaṃ prapaśyati || 16 ||

iti svāyaṃbhūvenāpi manunā pūrvamīrita |
dīkṣiṇāmūrtināpyetahītaṃ bhatyebhya ādarāt || 17 ||

tvamapi śraddhayā bhūpa sarvayogasamanvitaḥ |
akṣyayesmin dine bhūyakuruvratamanuttamaṃ || 18 ||

avaśyaṃ mahatīsiddhidurlabhā daivataurapi |
bhaviṣyati na saṃdehau mākusadyātrasaṃśayaṃ || 19 ||

vaiṣṇavātsakalāmaṃtrī sāvitrāścamanūtramān |
gāṇayatyamahāmaṃtrīramāyāmanavopi ca || 20 ||

<p. 92a>

pārvatyāśca mahāmaṃtrāstathāmāheśvarādapi |
kṣetrapālakamaṃtrāścacādīmīnavopi ca || 21 ||

japtāhutā akṣayesmin divase sarvasiddhida |
sadyaḥ siddhābhavaṃteva saṃśayonātravidyate || 22 ||

akṣayedinamātrepi kṛtvā hīmatayādikaṃ |
akṣayābhīṣṭasaṃsiddhiṃ prāptot yatra na saṃśayaḥ || 23 ||

iti dāśarathīyesmintaṃtrevedīrthasaṃgrahe |
ekonatriṃśa uto yamadhyāyokhilakāmadhuk || 24 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
ekonatriśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 92a>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

athātaḥ śrīmadaṣṭārṇesādhanaṃ nadharvasiddhidaṃ |
bhūyopi saṃpravakṣyāmi samāhitamanāḥśūṇa || 1 ||

ditvāsthite surācarpisavitaryapisiṃhage |
sārdhatrioṭitīrthānāṃ sa tridhyaṃ gautamītare || 2 ||

āhau puṣkarayogah syādaṃtepidvādaśāhakaṃ |
mahāpuṣkarayogetradevatāmunibhissaha || 3 ||

sratumāyāṃtigodāyājalesiṃhasthiteguṇai |
samastadevasānnidhyaṃ samastamunisamidhiḥ || 4 ||

samayatīrthasānnidhyaṃ siṃharāśigategurau |
āāvaṃte dvāśāhaṃ puṣkareṇa samāgamaḥ || 5 ||

mahāpuṣkarayogetragautamītada uttame |
ekaikaṃ dinamapyatraraviyarvaśataprabhaṃ || 6 ||

mahāpuṣkarayogenna mahāyāyayutopi vā |
stātvā japāṃdikaṃ kṛtvā mucyate sarvapātakaiḥ || 7 ||

nānena sadṛśaḥ puṇyakālosti vasudhātale |
sarvāsāmapi vidhānāmaṃtrahomajapādibhiḥ || 8 ||

ekaikasminnapidīnemahatīsiddhirīritī |
māhāpuṣkarayoyetra snātvā prātaransanyadhīḥ || 9 ||

parimṛtyātha vā gātraṃ lakṛkamonvahaṃ vudhaḥ |
uditetha sahasrāśau nityahomaṃ samāpya ca || 10 ||

āgatya gautamītīraṃ gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ |
abhyarcyagotamīdevīmurācāryamapi prabhuṃ || 11 ||

godāvārījale sratvā vidhinā sāṃgamādarāt |
ācāryānujñayā śrīmadaṣṭārṇanyāsaṃ saṃyutaṃ || 12 ||

triśatādhiḥ abhyarcya gautamīdevī surācāryamapi prabhukasāhasramekaikasmin |
dine dine japet darvalorrāgayussastūnamaskṛtyapi gautamī || 13 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ samastanyāsaṃyutāṃ |
prajayehnautamītīrisvācāryānajñayānvahaṃ || 14 ||

triśataṃ prajapellakṣmīmaṃtreṣṭiṣṭatamaṃmanuṃ |
triśataṃ juhuyādāṃtyamadhutritayamiśritaṃ || 15 ||

vilvapatrasamāyuktaṃ yāyasannilamiśritaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtreṇa śrīmaṃtreṇaśataṃ hunet || 16 ||

<p. 92b>

ekaikāṃ bhagavadraśmimaṃtrairojyāhutiṃ tataḥ | 
ayodhyādhuracakrethalakṣmīnārāyaṇābhidhe || 18 ||

śrīśrīyātīyajetpaścāṃgāvaraṇapūrvakaṃ |
śālagrāmāśitācakre vṛccakretha vā yajet || 19 ||

laghucakretha vānityaṃ śrīśrīyatyarcayetkramat |
kusumairatteyenni saṃvilvapatravimiśritaiḥ || 20 ||

 tulasīdalayutaurvāśrīśrāśabrahmaśvidyayā |
arcayettriśataṃ nityamupacārān samaryat || 21 ||

ācāryapādukāyugmamaccayet tatra sannidhau |
sa vīyacārairabhyarcya śataniṣkaṃdinī naṃdane || 22 ||

arpayetyādatyādakāpuminiṣkadvādaśakaṃ tu vā |
ācāryapādukāyugmetiṣkamekamathāpi vā || 23 ||

ekaikasmin dine datvādyācāryāya samarpayet |
ācāryapādukābhāvepādakāmaṃtramādarāt || 24 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā japtvā svācārya caraṇaṃvuje |
ekaikasmin dine dadyādvanaṃ lobhavivarjitaḥ || 25 ||

ācāryaputrāyācāryābhāvevaśyaṃ samarpayet |
avaśyaṃ tatkalaṃ yatatyautrāyāpi vāryayet || 26 ||

ācāryapatnī sādhāryasutapatnīmathāpi vā |
divase prathame madhyadivasetyadinepi ca || 27 ||

datvā sāṃsisūkṣmīṇi śuddhairākalpasaṃcayaiḥ |
avaśyamantraviddhīmānsarvasaṃyatsamṛddhaye || 28 ||

ekaikasmin dine siddhaṃ kṛtvāṃ sadivasepi ca |
kṛtvā pūrvoditaṃ homajapādikamanukramāt || 29 ||

aṣṭābhikaśataiḥ ślokamaṃtraiḥ śrīhṛdayasthitoḥ |
kāpilājyaṃ hutennedhākevalagavyameva vā || 30 ||

prāyaścintāhutīḥ kṛtvā kuryādbrahmahmārpaṇāhutiṃ |
tataḥ śrīgurūsarūmabhyarcya svācāryaṃ harirūpiṇaṃ || 31 ||

vastrairābharaṇairhomamudrikā kuṃḍalādibhiḥ |
sālagrāmaśilāṃ śuddhāṃvat kīṭavinirmitāṃ || 32 ||

vahudakṣiṇayāyuktāmācādhopa samarpayet |
abhāvevahulavyaratnīdīnāṃ mahīyate || 33 ||

niṣkadvādaśakaṃ dadyādavaśyaṃ śubhadakṣiṇāṃ |
ṣaṇinaṣkamathavādadyāttriniṣkavātha dakṣiṇaṃ || 34 ||

vahukṣīrayutaṃ vatsa sahitādakṣiṇānvitaṃ |
ācāryāprapradātavyamekācāpiyayasvinī || 34 ||

<p. 93a>

ekaikasmindinepyatra brāhmaṇānbhojayedvratī |
ekāsuvāsinī vāpi śrīvadhyānityamarcayet || 36 ||

dvādaśāpi suvāsinyodvādaśabrāhmaṇā api |
mahāpuskarayogitrasaṃbhojyaḥ paścimedine || 37 ||

ācāryacaraṇaṃbhoja prakṣālita tatvaṃ śubhaṃ |
anvahaṃ prapiveddhīmān brahmadarśanasiddhayaṃ || 38 ||

puṣkarākhyamahāyoge kṛtvetthaṃ vratamādarāt |
mahāyātakasaṃghaiśca koṭijanmakṛtairapi || 39 ||

vimuktothahariṃ sākṣātyaśyasevaśriyaḥ patiṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīsiddhirdaivatairapi durlabhāṃ || 42 ||

pronyokadine cāpi viśvāsaṃ kuru bhūyapate |
yatpuraścaraṇaṃ sāṃga mahatprāktaṃ mayā purā || 41 ||

tadvīdaśaphalaṃ sāṃgaṃ labhyate nātra saṃśayaḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣrī siddhirdevatairapidurlabhā || 42 ||

avaśyaṃ labhyate tenena vratakatāṃnusaṃśayaḥ |
mahāpuṣkarayogesminautamītīravāsibhi || 43 ||

tarpitāvaṃdhubhirvāpi nimagrānarakeṣvapi |
prayāṃtodripuraraṇyaṃ yāvaccaṃdradivākarā || 44 ||

dakṣiṇābhakṣyabhojyādyaiḥpitaro yasya tarpitāḥ |
mahāpuṣkarayogete satyalokevasaṃtiti || 45 ||

ācāryamahīyenadīyartadakṣiṇānvitā |
caturṣṭaṣabhasaṃyuktāvaktuṃ śakyaṃ na tatphalaṃ || 46 ||

sālagrāmaśilādānakharṇadānaṃ ca bhūyata | 
mahāpuṣkarayorgatravahmātādātmyesiddhida || 47 ||

dānaṃ kuṃḍalayugmasyamudrikādānamaṣyatha |
sūkṣmanastrapradānaṃ vaca bhagavadvaṣṭisiddhidaṃ || 48 ||

mahāyāyahaṃ rasadyo jīvanmukti phalapradaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇasaṃsiddhipradasadyomahīpate || 49 ||

mahāpuṣkarayogennaśrīmādācāryatoyaṇaṃ |
yathotavidhināvarṣārjjātismāṇasiddhidaṃ || 50 ||

pihṛṇāmapi sarveṣāṃ bhagavatpadasiddhidaṃ |
bhūmiyāledhanāḍhye vāṇarūpaṃ vā nanaṃsthitaḥ || 51 ||

mahāpuṣkarayogepradinadādaśake śubhe |
śvetāśvadānaṃ kurvīta hasnidā na mahatphalaṃ || 54 ||

śivikāṃholikādānaṃ rātradānaṃ ca nityaśaḥ |
vahuvastrapradānaṃ ca dhānyadānaṃ dine dine || 53 ||

sālagrāmaśiādānamapi kurvīta nityathaḥ |
nadārāpūrvakaṃ hānamācāryebhyovidhīyate || 54 ||

pūrvoktapatrānuccāryasaṃkalśubhaguvatpuraḥ |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhojedasāddevya mataḥparaṃ || 55 ||

ācāryamaṃdire dhenusavatsāṃ preṣayenṛpa |
pāritoṣikamevāsmai svācāryāyāryayeddhanaṃ || 56 || 

<p. 93b>

ācāryānujñayai vānyaśrotriyebhyopi bhūyate |
dātavyaṃ sakalaṃ dānaṃ nānyathā siddhibhaścyute || 57 ||

caṇakānyuhṛmāṣāṃścati sānyāyaharānapi |
dadhikṣīraṃ ghṛtaṃ avyaguḍaṃ madhu ca śarkarā || 58 ||

mahāpuṣkarayogenna phalārāśiṃ samarpya ca |
samastasaṃpatsāgrājyasidvayuktoyamutibhāk || 59 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāḥpuraścaraṇamādarāt |
mahāpuṣkarayogetra kṛtvā siddhiṃ vrajet parāṃ || 60 ||

aṣṭākṣare maṃtrarājesamyakusiddhe mahīyate |
paśyatyeva svacakṣurbhyā sākṣādevaśrivaśriyaḥ pati || 61 ||

bhagavadarśanenāsau bhagavatkalayānvitaḥ |
svacchaparaṇe bhūtvānidhissakalasaṃpadāṃ || 62 ||

ādhārassarvavidyānāṃ putrāpautra sukhānvitaḥ |
mānuṣānapi divyāṃśca bhuktvā bhogānmanoramān || 63 ||

kulasāhāsrasahitovaikuṃṭhevasatidhruvaṃ |
puṣpemāddivase viṣṇunakṣatrerkasamanvite || 64 ||

arkavāsarasaṃyukte vyatīyātasamanvite |
bhānūdaye savijñeyoyogoddhodvayānāmakaḥ || 65 ||

sahasrākaṃ grahasamoyogolabhyau mahīyate |
somavāsāsarayuktaścenmahodaya udīrataḥ || 66 ||

avaśyaṃ sāgaresnānaṃ tatra pātakaṃ bhaṃjana |
bhāskaṃrodayavelāyāṃ tadāstātvā mahodadhau || 67 ||

ācāryasannibhāvapiṃ pratiṣṭhābdhi samāhitaḥ |
lakṣmīpatisaṃmārādhyasetkāskṛte jātavedasi || 68 ||

vṛhadāvaraṇaurmaṃtraiḥ kṛtvaikāmathāhātiṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtreṇatilairgavyaghṛtasutaiḥ || 69 ||

triśātādhikāsāhasrāṃ hutvā yaścānmahīyate |
śrīmaṃtretraṇahunedājyaṃ gavyaṃ triśatamādarāt || 70 ||

bhagavadraśmividyābhiḥ kṛtvaikaikāmathāhutiṃ |
jāyāhi homaṃ kṛtvāthā prāyaścittāhutīstataḥ || 71 ||

brahmarpaṇāhutiṃ kṛtvā namaskṛtyāgnimādarāt |
śrīśrīyatyarcayetyaścī triśataṃ brahmavidyayāṃ || 72 ||

ācāryacāraṇāṃbhojadvayaṃ sāṣṭāṃgamādarāt |
namaskṛtya samabhyarcye vāso laṃkaraṇadibhiḥ || 73 ||

vahuśāsya samāmīrṇaṃ catukṛya samavitāṃ |
ācāryāmahāṃdadyādvahṛdaśiṇayāvvitāṃ || 74 ||

mayoktā dakṣiṇatubhyamuttamāmadhyamādhamā |
bhūdānedakṣiṇāṃdadyāṃtta yathā vanmahīpate || 75 ||

<p. 94a>

sālagrāmaśilāṃdadyodavaśyāṃ dakṣiṇānvitāṃ |
ācāryakarṇayodvedhānmuktā saṃkaraṇaṃ śubhaṃ || 76 ||

ratnālaṃkaraṇaṃ vāpi dadyādācāryakarṇayoḥ |
avaśyaṃgodvayaṃ dadyātyasatsaṃdakṣiṇānvitaṃ || 77 ||

mahādānāni kurtrātavibhavesatisādhakaḥ |
brāhmaṇānbhojayetpraścādbhojayecca suvāsinī || 78 ||

samarpayedathācāryapatnyaivāsoyugaṃ śubhaṃ |
samarpayetkāṃsyapātrabhojanārtha sadakṣiṇaṃ || 79 ||

catuḥṣvaṣṭiyalaṃ vāpi viṃśatpalamitaṃ tu vāsinīḥ |
samarpayedathācā itthamardhodaye kṛtvā kṛtvāpi ca mahīdaye || 80 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīsiddhiṃ sadya eva vrajatyasau |
tadārabhyahariṃmāsisvame prapaśyati || 81 ||

manorathārtha sa siddhidaivatairapi durlabhāṃ |
prāpnotyavaśyaṃ bhūpālasaṃśayo nātra vidyate || 82 ||

ardhodayesiṃdhutīre hemābhāra sahasrakaṃ |
datvā yatphalamāpnoti tatphalaṃ niṣkamātrakaṃ || 83 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇahomāṃte samathāddhaudaye nṛpa |
tatīdhikaphalaṃ sāṃgaṃ prāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ || 84 ||

tadīrabhya mahīpālahaṃdrāṃdyamarī api |
satataṃ varadāstasya bhavatpatra na saṃśayaḥ || 85 ||

vaiśākheśca lāyakṣeyā bhaumavāsarasaṃyutā |
caturdaśīvatipātasahitāsvātisaṃghutā || 86 ||

lakṣīnsiṃhayogoyaṃ sāyaṃkāle sa ucyate |
caturviśatibhirvarṣaiyogosaulabhyate bhuvi || 87 ||

ghuṭītrayādastamayāpūrvaṃstānaṃ samācaret |
vāsasīyaridhāyātha pitṛnsaṃtarpya yatnataḥ || 88 ||

kṛtvāsāyatanī saṃdhyāṃ mācārya praṇipatya ca |
ācāyo sānnidhautasya putraṃ patnīmathāpi vā || 89 ||

namaskṛtvāthapitṛnsaṃtarpya yatnataḥ (***) |
saṃkalpyāprāṇānāyamyavāgyataḥ triśatādhikasāhasraṃ samastanyāsaṃ sadyatā || 
90 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāprajayenniyatavrataḥ |
lakṣmīvidyāsusarvāsu vidyāmīṣṭatamāṃtataḥ || 91 ||

prajaptvā triśataṃ yaścīttriśatajātavedasaṃ |
saṃskṛtya jagātānāthaṃ tatrābhyarcyoyacārakaiḥ || 92 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtreṇahunesaṃ ca śataṃ haviḥ |
madhvatritayasaṃmiśraṃ gavyājya srutamādarāt || 93 ||

ghṛtena juhuyāda yāvaṣṭāttaraśataṃ śriyā |
bhagavadraśmividyāmiṣṭatamekaikaśo hunet || 94 ||

prāyaścittāhutiḥ kṛtvā kṛtvā brahmarpaṇāhutiṃ |
namaskṛtyāpimācārya pādābja daṃḍavannabhet || 95 ||

<p. 94b>

śarkarārasasaṃyuktapātraṃ pittalasaṃbhavaṃ |
paṃcaviśasalaṃ vapi viṃśatyalamitaṃ tu vā || 96 ||

paridhānottarīyārthaṃ vāsoyugmaṃ samartha ca |
catvāriṃśatpalamittaṃ viṃśatyatamitaṃ tu vā || 97 ||

ācāryayādāyordvatvā haricaṃdanamuttamaṃ |
sthūlaṃ sumadhuraṃ cataphalarāśiṃ samarpya ca || 98 ||

ācāryapādayordadyādvarṣāśanamitaṃ dhanaṃ |
niṣkadvādāśakaṃ vāminiṣka ṣabdamathāpi vā || ||

vaiśākhamāsepyatha śuklapakṣe caturdaśī 
maṃgalavārayuktāsvātīvyatīpānayutāyadisyāllakṣmīnṛsohoyamalabhyayogaḥ || 1 ||

manmaṃtramaṣṭākṣaramaṃtratatvāhatvāthasāyaṃ gurupādayugme 
svītīvyatīpātayutāyahisyāllakṣmīnṛsiḥ |
samarpyamātotthaphalāni vāso yugyaṃ ca gaṃdhaguḍanīrapātra || 2 ||

samarthavittaṃ vahulaṃ ca paścīdaṣṭākṣarīsiddhimayaityavaśya |
ahaṃprasannocchasamarthasiddhiṃdadīmilakṣbhāvalāṃ ca vidyāṃ || 3 ||

suputrapautrodyavatī samṛddhiṃ dīrghāyurārogyamanaṃtasaukhyaṃ bhuktvā ca |
bhogānatha divyamānuṣānprayāti vaikuṃṭhapadamamāṃte || 4 ||

itthamaṣṭākṣarīvidyā sidhyarthavasudhāyartaṃ |
bhūtvā yatnaparonityamajjeyeddakṣiṇādhanaṃ || 5 ||

atyalpa dakṣiṇo yāgo yajamānaṃ vināśayet |
agnichomādayoyāgājapahomādayo ca || 6 ||

brahmāyajñādayonityaṃ sarjayedakṣiṇādhanuṃ pāgā api |
mahīyate saphalādakṣiṇāyuktā aphalādakṣiṇāṃ vinā || 7 ||

dravyābhāvekuto dharmo dharmahīne kutaḥ sukhaṃ |
tasmādvarmaratonityamarjadyedvanasaṃdharya || 8 ||

pitāmātā tathācāryastatpatnītatsa api |
kṛtvā kāryaśataṃ vāpi yogoyā dine dine || 9 ||

yavānānapibhikṣiptvā śūdrānapyathayaṃ ca |
māna ārcayapatnīputrādyāḥ poṣaṇīyāne dine || 100 ||

na strīṇāṃ vacanaṃ kāryaṃ maṃdaprajñāpataḥ striyaḥ |
ācāryasyājñayānitye śreyaskāmīvasennapa || 111 ||

varṣe varṣe puraścaryo kṛtvai kāmapi sādhakaḥ |
svarvasvadakṣiṇaṃ dadyādvarṣāśanamitaṃ tu vā || 12 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīsiddhiṣevarṣe prajāyate |
ravaudugrahaṇaṃ varṣe varṣepi satataṃ bhavet || 13 ||

avaśyaṃ tatra kartavyaṃ puraścaraṇamādarāt |
tatrāvaśyaṃ puraścaryā kṛtvā sūryasya parvaṇi || 14 ||

<p. 95a>

niṣkadvayadhanaṃ vāpi datvā siddhimavāpnuyāt |
ukteṣvalabhyayogeṣu saṃprāptyeṣu mahīyate || 15 ||

tatrīvaśyaṃ puraścaryāṃ kṛtvā sāṃgāṃ mahīyate |
vittaśāṭhyaṃ parityajya dakṣiṇāmadhamānuvā || 16 ||

samaṣye śrīmadaṣṭārṇamahāsiddhisaṃmaśrute |
kṛtvā vaśyaṃ puraścaryaṃ yoge labhye mahīyate || 17 ||

sogadakṣiṇayāyuktāṃ sadyaḥ siddhisamanvitaḥ |
bhagavatkalayāyuktassadyarāvamavatyasau || 18 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāpuraścryā yaśaskaro |
sāṃgadakṣiṇayāyuktā navarātravratekṛtāḥ || 19 ||

aśvamedha sahasrasyaphalāsānasaṃśayaḥ |
sahasrakoṭisaṃkhyākasvarṇadakṣiṇayāyutaṃ || 20 ||

sahmavāṃjimedhānā navarātra tateśubhe |
puraścaraṇakṛtyenateneṣṭaṃ nātrasaṃśayaḥ || 21 ||

vratāṃtaraṃ pravakṣyāmi caturvargaphalapradaṃ |
gulaṃ samastavedeṣu śāstreṣvapi sugopitaṃ || 22 ||

kārtikemārgaśīrṣe vā meghe vā phālgunetha vā |
vaiśākhe śrāvaṇe vāpi prathame bhṛguvāsare || 23 ||

vratamārabhyakurvātavarṣavarṣetrayaṃta vā |
varṣadvādaśakaṃ vā viprāṇāṃtaṃ vā mahīpate || 24 ||

prathame bhārgavevāre māsimāsi mahīyate |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarījasvāyāthāśaktyā sasāhitaḥ || 25 ||

vidhivatsaṃskṛte vahnau śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā |
triśataṃ juhuyādravyenājyenaniyatavrataḥ || 26 ||

śrīmaṃtreṇāpi juhuyādaṣṭottaraśataṃ ghṛtaṃ |
bhagavadraśmividyāmirekaikāmāhutidṛt || 27 ||

triśataṃ pūjayet puṣpairvilvapatrairathāpi vā |
johvaprāvālairathavāśrīśrīśabrahmavidyayā || 28 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ vāpi pūjayetulasīdalauḥ |
āvaśyabhojayedbhakṣyabhojyairājāyevallabhāṃ || 29 ||

mithunadvitayaṃbhotyamekaṃ mithunameva vā |
bhārgave vāsarevaśyaṃ niṣkeniplārdhamevā vā || 30 ||

samarpayedathācāryayaṃyalyaikāṃcanamuttamaṃ |
satataṃ bhārgavevāridadyāditthaṃ dhanādhikaṃ || 31 ||

prathamebhārgavevāremāsimāsya śravāryayat |
ācāryapatnī saṃbhojyāmāsimāsyathavādine || 32 ||

bhārgavevāsarevaśyaṃ niṣkamānasuvaṇerka |
niṣkādyaṃ vāyaṃ yeddhīmānbhakṣyādyairapitauṣayet || 33 ||

bhojanāṃ tarpayeddhīmānmithunasyāpi dakṣiṇāṃ |
gurupatnyā āsābhidhye lakṣmīlakṣmīśa sannidhau || 34 ||

<p. 95b>

ācāryapatnīmuddiśya saṃkalpyāpyatha dakṣiṇaṃ |
ādimebhārgavevāre gurupādāvatorpayet || 35 ||

natputrāyātha vā dadyātsaṃkalpitadhanaṃ nṛpa |
prathamebhārgavevāre māsmisītthamācaret || 36 ||

mithunadvitayaṃ bhojyamitteraṣu 5 dineṣvapi |
ekaṃ vāmīthunaṃdadyathāśaktyā ca dakṣiṇaṃ || 37 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣārīvidyāsiddhiṃsumahatīparā |
icchanvratamidaṃ kuryādavaśyaṃ siddhimaśnute || 38 ||

āśaucādiputovāpiṇegaissaṃpīḍitothavā |
bhārgavavāsare prāpte prārthayitvā guruṃ vibhuṃ || 39 ||

kārayedguruṇāvapi tatputrarathavā vrataṃ |
dviguṇāddakṣiṇādeyā tadā cāyoyadhīmatā || 40 ||

bhṛguvāravratamidaṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇapriyaṃ |
kṛtvāvaśyaṃ mahāsiddhiṃ vrajatyatra nasyaṃśayaḥ || 41 ||

bhṛguvāravratāruṣodarvāgeva mahīyate |
ācāryānugrahāllakṣmīdhanadhānyādi saṃkulāṃ || 42 ||

ācalāṃ prāpyakaṃ darpasamasaubhāgyasaṃyutaḥ |
āyuṣyaṃ mahadārogyaṃ śriyamṛṣaguṇā api || 43 ||

abhate nātra saṃdehaṣputrapautrādisaṃkulāṃ |
na viyukto bhavetyalyāpatrairvāyaśrubhirdhanaiḥ || 44 ||

neṣṭavaṃdhuviyukto vā bhṛguvāravratād bhavet |
icchatā mahatīṃ sisiddhiṃ śroyaścāpyakṣayaṃ paraṃ || 45 ||

bhṛguvāravratmidaṃ kartavyaṃ vasudhāyate |
etaccharīrayātāṃte daśāpūrverdaśāparaiḥ || 46 ||

sahitaḥ puṣpaṃkadivyaṃ divyakalyāśattācitaṃ |
ārūsvabhagavaddhāmaprayāsatra na saṃśayaḥ || 47 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣīrī siddhirvahvādhoktāmayātava |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāsiddhiyoryadi bhaviṣyati || 48 ||

prayāṃti bhagavadvāmatasyavaṃśodbhavā api |
amuttara brahmatatvarahasye śrutisaṃdehe |
iti dāśarathīyesmin triṃśodhyāya udīritaḥ || 49 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgraheśodhyāyāḥ ]
||
<p. 95b>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtreṇasiddhanetthaṃ mahīyate |
sādhayetkāmyakarmāṇi samastāni tataḥ para || 1 ||

vinātātanayārūḍhamaṣṭavāhuṃ śriyānvitaṃ |
darāricārmāsigadāyārācāyeṣudhāriṇaṃ || 2 ||

<p. 96a>

dhyātvā nārāyaṇaṃ maṃtrī japtvāṣṭārṇaṃ sahasrakaṃ |
sthāvaraṃ jaṃgamaṃ vāpi kṛtimaṃcāpi yadviṣaṃ || 3 ||

taccharīramanaprāpyasadyarāvavīnaśyati |
ravigrahaṇe prāptetaddine sagupoṣitaḥ || 4 ||

sparśakālaṃ samārabhya mokṣakālāṃtamādarāt |
spṛśanbrāhmīraraṃvidhāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ jāpan || 5 ||

tatpītvāmaṃdabuddhirvājaḍomūkopi vā nṛpa |
pāragassarvavidyānāṃ māsābhyaṃtarato bhavet || 6 ||

samudratīragoṣṭhe vā lakṣaṃ japtvā yayo vrataḥ |
palāśā kusumairhutvādaśasāhasramādarāt || 7 ||

maṃdavadvidviddhirapi prajñāsaṃpanna kavitānidhiḥ |
caturṇāmapi vedānāṃ pāragovāgvibhūtimān || 8 ||

pravaktāḍa śrute śāstrāṇāṃ śrātānāmivajāyate |
tulasīvanamadhyastho japtvālakṣaṃ yatavrataḥ || 9 ||

dūrvābhirayutaṃ hutvā sarvarogavivarjitaḥ |
dīrghāpuṣpamavāpnoti svacchaṃdamaraṇe bhavet || 10 ||

śanaiścaradineśvatthaṃ samyagālabhyapāṇinā |
triśatādhikasāhasraṃ samastanyāsasaṃtāṃ || 11 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī japtvā mṛyate nāyamṛtyubhiḥ |
paṃcaviṃśatidhānityamabhirmaṃtrya jalaṃ pivet || 12 ||

vimuktaḥ syānmahāyāyairapi rogaiścadāruṇauḥ |
paṃcaviṃśatidhānityamabhimaṃtryābhamādarāt || 13 ||

bhuṃjānolabhate jātismaraṇaṃ brahmadarśanaṃ |
pratimāsavyatīpāle yoge lakṣmīpatiśriye || 14 ||

triśatādhika sāhasraṃ samastanyāsasaṃyutāṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japtvā śrīmaṃtratriśataṃ japet || 15 ||

tilairgavyojyasaṃmiśraiḥ kevalena ghṛtena vā |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtreṇa triśataṃ juhuyādatha || 16 ||

āṣṭottaraśataṃ paścīcchrīmaṃtreṇa ghṛtehanet |
bhagavaddaśmividyābhirekaikāmāhutiṃ hunet || 17 ||

śatamaṣṭottaraṃ puṣpairarcayeddhastavidyāyā |
niṣkaniṣkārdamathavā svācāryāyā samarpyayet || 18 ||

varṣamekaṃ vyatīyāta vratamitthaṃ samācaran |
mahāyāyoyayāyīdyaurapi rorogairvimucyate || 19 ||

saṃprāpya dhanadhānyāhi saṃkulāmacalāṃśriyaḥ |
bhūvyā samastavidyānāṃ yāragassudarākṛtiḥ || 20 ||

dehāṃte bhagavaddhāmavrajatputra na saṃśayah |
vilvamūle samāsīno maṃtrarājaṃ śriyaḥpateḥ || 21 ||

śatasāhasrakaṃ japtvālvapatrairghṛtalyutaiḥ |
hutvātha daśasāhāsraṃ rājyalakṣmīmavānyuyāt || 22 ||

<p. 96b>

nadītīrethagoṣṭhe vā śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīśubhāṃ |
lakṣamekaṃ prajaptvāthatapatrairghṛtaplutaiḥ || 23 ||

hutvā yutaṃ rājarājasahaśobhavati śriyā |
mārgaśīrṣe paurṇamāsyāmācāryānujñayāśuciḥ || 24 ||

prātaḥ srātvā viśuddhātmāni sakarma samāpya ca |
samastanyāsa sahitāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ śrībhā || 25 ||

triśatādhikasāhasraṃ prajaptvāmiyata vrataḥ |
triśataṃ prajayetyaścādiṣṭamekaṃ śriyomanuṃ || 26 ||

triśataṃ pūjayet puṣpaiḥ śrīśrīśabrahmavidyayā |
sālagrāmaśilāḥ cakramayodhyānagarābhidhaṃ || 27 ||

pratiṣṭhāpya mahaccakramapigutyaṃściyaḥpateḥ |
pa ekadhaivobhayatrāpi lakṣmīnārāyaṇai vibhū || 28 ||

ārcayitvāṃpacāraiśca pūjayedbrahmavidyayā |
pūrṇaṃ niśākaraṃdasūsāyaṃ sadhyāmupāsya ca || 29 ||

madhutritayasaṃyuktaṃ gavyakṣīrānnamādarā |
nniśataṃjuyādagrauśrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā || 30 ||

śrīmaṃtreṇaghṛtaṃ praścādaṣṭottaraśanaṃ hunet |
bhagavadraśmividyābhiryatamekaikaśo hunet || 31 ||

arpyatraya pradāyātha śrīśrīśāmyāmarthadave |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoje niṣkamānasuvarṇakaṃ || 32 ||

niṣkārdhevā pradratvātha kṣīrāhāro bhavedvratī |
haviṣyāśī phalāśīvāvareṣkarmithutadvayaṃ || 33 ||

bhojayitvā dakṣiṇāṃ catāṃkalaṃ ca samarpayet |
bhuṃjīta vaṃdhubhiḥ sārdhamiṣṭamannaṃ tataḥ para || 34 ||

ekasaṃvatsaraṃ vāpi kṛtvetthaṃ vratamādarāt |
bhagavaṃtaṃ śriyāsārdhaṃ paśyatyeva svacakṣuṣā || 35 ||

dhanadhānyagajāśvāhisahītāṃ ratnasaṃkulāṃ |
acalāṃ śriyamānyoti prasādārhidirāyateḥ || 36 ||

nirāmayopi dīrghāyuḥ kāṃtyāṃkaṃharyasannibhaḥ |
mahākavirmahāvāhrīputrapautrāyautrādisaṃyutaḥ || 37 ||

bhakehasakalānbhogānkulaviṃśatisaṃyutaḥ |
prāpnoti bhagavaddhāgaderhāte nātrasaṃśayaḥ || 38 ||

paurṇamāsīvratamidaṃ vatsarannayamādarāt |
yaḥ karoti viśuddhātmājātiṃssaratiyaurvikī || 39 ||

aṇimādi guṇaiśvaryasthe ca ratvaṃ manojāvaṃ |
yogamadyāṃgasahitamajarāmaratāmapi || 40 ||

prāpnotyavaśyaṃ bhūpālasaṃśayo nātra vidyate |
paurṇamāsīvrataṃ puṇyaṃ viśeṣarkṣudinānvitaṃ || 41 ||

pravakṣyāmi samāsena sadyarāveśitapradaṃ |
citrāyukteduvāreṇasahitā caitraptāyā || 42 || 

<p. 97a>

paurṇamāḥ mahatī jñeyā samastādyaudyabhaṃjīnī |
ācāryānujñayā tatra snātvā prātassamāhita || 43 ||

tarpayitvā jalaiḥ kṛṣṇātilamiśrauḥ pitṛnatha āsane samyagā |
sīnāssamastanyāḥdyauvabhaṃjanī ācāryānujñayā tatra sasaṃyutāṃ || 44 ||

triśatādhikasāhasraṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japet |
triśataṃ prajapetyaścīdiṣṭaṃ śrīmanumādarāt || 45 ||

jayecchī hṛt yastotaṃtredhātharvaṇamipūrda |
pūrṇaniśākaraṃ iṣṭvājvalite jātavedasi || 46 ||

madhutritayagavyājyaplutaṃ havirathādarāt |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtreṇa triśataṃ juhayādatha || 47 ||

śatamaṣṭottaraṃ vahnau śrīmaṃtreṇaghṛtaṃ hunet |
āṣṭottarathathaiḥ puṣpaiḥ śrīśrīśadvādaśārṇayā || 48 ||

abhyarcyācāryapādājeniṣkatrayamitaṃdhanaṃ |
dviniṣkamekaniṣkaṃ vā dakṣiṇāmaryayedatha || 49 ||

kṣīrāśīvāhaviṣyāśī paurṇamāsī dine śubhe |
mithunatritayaṃbhojyaparedyuddhiṃtayaṃ tu vā || 50 ||

itthāṃ kṛtvā puraścayophalaṃ prāpnoti sādhakaḥ |
idameva vrataṃ kṛtvā ravisaṃkramaṇānvite || 52 ||

puraśvatthūyāṃ trayaphale prāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
etadevrataṃ kurvannidagrahaṇasaṃyuta || 52 ||

puraścaryā dvādaśākaphalaṃ prāpnoti sodhakaḥ |
ekena divasenetthemavasyaṃ siddhimānbhavet || 53 ||

vaiśākhe paurṇemīsaumyavāsareṇa samanvitā |
viśākhāsahipūṇīvaiśākhāmahatisṛtā || 54 ||

tatrācāryaṃ namaskṛtyanyātaḥ snātvā yatavrataḥ |
naityakaṃ karmakṛtvātha samīmastanyāsasaṃyutāṃ || 55 ||

triśatādhikasāhasraṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣari japet |
trirātraṃ vrajayetpaścādiṣṭaṃ śrīmaṃtramādarā || 56 ||

abhyarcya triśataṃ puṣpeḥpatrair vā brahmavidyāyā |
daṣṭaniśākaraṃ pūrṇejvalitetājātavedasi || 57 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtreṇatrimadhupnutapāyasaṃ |
śrīmaṃtreṇahunedravyamājyaṃ triśatamādarāt || 58 ||

ekaikībhāgavadraśmimaṃtrerājyāhutiṃ tataḥ |
catvāriṃśatpalavīpiviśatpalamittaṃ tu vā || 59 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoje samarpya harivaṃdanaṃ |
śayyāṃ soyaskarāṃ datvā yathā śaktyā sā dakṣiṇaṃ || 60 || 

phalarāśidhadhutasyapanasasyaphaladvayaṃ |
samarcya dakṣiṇāṃ dadyādekaniṣkadhanaṃ tu vā || 61 ||

<p. 97b>

bhakṣyabhojyaghṛtāyūyayutaṃ dadhyovanaṃ śubhaṃ |
mithunadvitayaṃ bhojyaṃ pare pūrvasudhāyate || 62 ||

bhujītavaṃdhubhissyarddhasayamathannamādarāt |
śrīmadaṣṭāṇaividyāyāḥ puraścaryādvayaṃ śubha || 63 ||

kṛtaṃ tena na saṃdehassatyaṃ satyaṃ vādāmyahaṃ |
kṛtetthameva savisuśāṃ krameṇaptamanvite || 64 ||

puraścaryāṣṭakasyā sau prāpnoti phalamakṣayaṃ |
yadīdgrahaṇaṃ tatra vai(**)(?)reva paurṇasī dine || 65 ||

etadevavrata kṛtvā daivatairapi durlabhāṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyā mahatīṃ siddhimaśrute || 66 ||

dviguṇadaśiṇādeyāpūrṇadyāṃ ravisaṃkrame |
triguṇādakṣiṇādayā caṃdraparvasamanvite || 67 ||

paurṇamāsītyeṣṭhamāse yābhṛguvāsarasaṃyutā |
jyeṣṭānakṣatrasaṃyuktā mahatījyeṣṭapaurṇamā || 68 ||

ācāguṇāṃ dakṣiṇādeyācaṃdraparvasamanvite |
ācāryājñāṃ samādāya prāteḥ srātvā viśuddhadhīḥ || 69 ||

āvaśyakaṃ karmakṛtvā samastanyāsa saṃyutāṃ |
triśatādhikasāhasraṃ śrīmaddṛṣṭākṣarītī japet || 
japtvāyīṣṭamanuṃ lakṣmyāḥ sādhakastriṃśataṃ tataḥ || 70 ||

sāyaṃ samdhyāmuyāsyāthajalitejātavedasi |
triśataṃ śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyā trimadhusrātaṃ || 71 ||

pāyasaṃ juhumātyaśrīcchīmaṃtreṇa śataṃ ghṛtaṃ |
bhagavadraśmividyāmirājyena juhuyāttridhā || 72 ||

triśataṃ pūjyayetpaścāccvī śrīśadvādaśārṇayā |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoje niṣkamānadhanaṃ tu vā || 73 ||

samapyepānasadrākṣā phalavrataphalānvitaṃ |
ācāryapatnyai śrīvudhyāsatpālaṃkāramarpayet || 74 ||

niṣkamānasuvarṇaṃ vā niṣkārdhaṃ vā mahīpate |
mithunacitayaṃbhojyattasminneva dine vudhaiḥ || 75 ||

svāyamapyavanīnāthabhūṃjīyādvadhubhissaha |
puraścaryātrayaphalaṃvratenānena jāyate || 76 ||

yadi saṃkramaṇaṃ tatra paurṇamāsyāṃ prajāpate || 78 ||

viśeṣahīmaṃ kṛtvāya śrīmādṛṣṭārṇavidyāyā |
triniṣkadakṣiṇāṃ vāpi datvācārya padāṃvujaḥ || 79 ||

caturviṃśatpuraścaryāphalaṃ prāpnoti śāśvataṃ |
āṣāḍhe paurṇamāsīyavaiśvaddaivatyasaṃyutā || 80 ||

bhānuvāsa sa saṃyuktā mahatī samudīritā |
dvaipāpanaḥ purātasyā mamūnmatvā layānvitaḥ || 81 ||

avaśyaṃ tatra kartavyaṃ vrataṃ sakalasiddhihaṃ |
paurṇemāsyāmāthāṣāṭhyāprātaḥsrātvā viśuddhadhīḥ || 82 ||

prātāḥ saṃdhyāmuyāsyātha nityahomasamāpya ca |
tarpayitvāpi hṛnyaścāt samastanyāsa saṃyutā || 83 ||

triśatādhika sāhasraṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japet |
triśata prajayellakṣmīmaṃtramiṣtataṃmaṃśutaṃ || 84 ||

<p. 98a>

bhagavadraśmisūktaṃ ca yaṃ vadhāvartayate tataḥ |
sāyaṃ saṃdhyāmuyāsyātha madhutyritayamiśritaṃ || 85 ||

pāyasaṃ juhuyācchīmadaṣṭārṇena śatatrayaṃ |
śrīmatreṇa hunet praścīdṛṣṭottaraśataṃ ghṛtaṃ || 86 ||

nagavadraśmividyābhiścījyamevaukaśohunet |
arcayettriśataṃ brahmavidyayākusumādibhiḥ || 87 ||

kṣīrāśīvālāśīvāhinetasmīnvratī bhavet |
gurupādābjayugmetha dadyātriṣkadhanaṃ tu vā || 88 ||

pareṣurbhojayedbhakṣyabhojyādyairmithunadvayaṃ |
itthaṃ kṛtvā puraścaryāphalaṃ sāṃgamavāpnuyāt || 89 ||

śrīmadaṣṭarṇaṃ vidyāyāḥ sudhāḥ siddhiḥ prajāyate |
yadi saṃkramaṇaṃ tatra kṛtvetthevratamādarāt || 90 ||

avaśyaṃ phalamānyoti tripuraścaraṇīdbhavaṃ |
grahaṇaṃ yadi tatra syāt sudhāśorvasudhāyate || 91 ||

etuceva vrataṃ kurvanuraścaraṇapaṃcakāt |
yādṛśī jāyate siddhistāmevāpnoti śāśvāto || 92 ||

śrīvaṇe paurṇomāsī yāvaiṣyaṃ samanvitā |
īdavāsasaṃ yuktā mūratī samudīritī || 93 ||

tasyānādikaṃ puṇyamakṣayānaṃda saukhyadaṃ |
tatrādhāryājñāyāsrātvā kṛtvā dharmāthanaityakaṃ || 94 ||

āsane sagāsī bhasmamastanyāsaṃ sayutāṃ |
triśatādhikasāhasraśrīmadāṣṭākṣarī japet || 95 ||

triśataṃ prajapediṣṭā śriyomatra mataḥparaṃ |
sārye sadhyāmuyāsyāthajvalite jātavedasi || 96 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtreṇa triśataṃ trimadhusutaṃ |
pāyasaṃ juhuyāllakṣmīmaṃtreṇātha ghṛtaṃ śubha || 97 ||

bhagavadraśmividyābhiḥ kṛtvakaikīghṛtāhuti |
arcayettriśataṃ puṣpaiḥ patrervā brahmavidyādyayā || 98 ||

ācāryapādayordatvāniṣkamātradhanaṃ tu vā |
puraścaryāphalaṃ sāgasadyarāva labhedhruvaṃ || 99 ||

ravisaṃkramayaṃ tatra jāyate yadi bhūpate |
puraścaryātra ekalaṃ prāprotyatra na saṃśayaḥ || 100 ||

somasya grahaṇaṃ tatra yadisyādūdhāyate |
caṃdracūḍāmāsinonnāyoṇai labhya udāhṛtaḥ || 1 ||

tatrāvaśyaṃ puraścaryau kṛtvā pūrvamudīritāṃ |
varṣāśanamitadravyamathavāguraverpyayet || 2 ||

śālagrāmśilīśuddhāṃ niṣkitritayadākṣiṇāṃ |
āthavācāryahastā datvā samāhatī parā || 3 ||

siddhimāpnoti śuddhātmāpuraścaryośatīdbhavāṃ |
ājanakṣātrasahitāpūrṇā bhādrapadepiyāḥ || 4 ||

saumyavāsarasaṃyuktāṃ mahatī samudīritā |
tatrācāryajñayā prātarnityakarmasamātha ca || 5 ||

<p. 98b>

triśatādhikasāhasraṃ samastanyāsasaṃyutāṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣīrījāptvā śrīmaṃtraṃ triśataṃ japet || 6 ||

sāyaṃsaṃdhyāpnuyāsyātha saṃskṛtejātavedasi |
madhutritayagavyājyaplutaṃ pāyasasādarāt || 7 ||

triśataṃ juhuyācchrīmadaṣṭākṣapattitaḥ paraṃ |
śrīmaṃtreṇahunedātyamaṣṭottaraśataṃ nṛpa || 8 ||

ājyenāhutimaikekākuryādraśmibhirādarāt |
triśataṃ tulasīrṣatrairarcayadvabrahmavidyāyā || 9 ||

niṣkamātra suvarṇāṃdi pradṛtvācāryapādayoḥ |
kṣīrāśī vā phalāśī vā divasetra tataḥ paraṃ || 10 ||

mithunadviyaṃ yaścīsaredyubhojayadvratī |
puraścaryāphalaṃ prīpyasiddhiprīpnoti śāśvatīṃ || 11 ||

yadi saṃkramaṇāṃ tatra puraścaryā trayodbhavaṃ |
phalaṃ prāpnoti somasyagrahaṇaṃ jāyate yadi || 12 ||

niṣkatrayaṃ dviniṣkaṃ vā pradatvācāryapādayoḥ |
ekaviṃśatpuraścaryāprānyātva yathākṣayaṃścaryātrayodbhavaṃ |
phalaṃ prāpnoti somasya grahaṇṇaṃ jāyate yadi || 13 ||

aśvinakṣatra sahitā paurṇamāsyāśvine yadi |
guruvāsarasaṃyuktāmaktāmahatīsāsasīritā || 14 ||

 śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidhāyājapahomādikaṃ śubhaṃ |
kṛtvā pūrvavadārabhyadatvācāryasya dakṣiṇaṃ || 15 ||

paredyubhaujapedyumratrijapaṃ dakṣiṇānvitaṃ |
puraścaryātrayaphalaṃ sāṃgamaṃtravrajatyasau || 16 ||

ravisakrāṃtisahite kṛtvedaṃ vratamādarāt |
paṃcavārapuraścaryāphalasāṃgamapruyāt || 17 ||

grahaṇaṃ yadi tatrasyājjapahomādikaṃ śubhaṃ |
kṛtvācārya padāṃbhoje samathotha triniṣka || 18 ||

ekādaśapuraścaryāphalaṃ prāpnotyathākṣayaṃ |
kārtike paurṇemāsīyāvahidaivatyasaṃyutā || 19 ||

iṃdūvāsarasaṃ yuktā kārtikīmahītīsmṛtī |
ācāyonujñāyā tatra nityakarmasāmāpya ca || 20 ||

triśatādhikasāhasraṃ samastanyāsasaṃyutāṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣaritasvāśrīmaṃtratriśataṃ japet || 21 ||

divaivajuhuyādagrauyāyasaṃtrimadhuplutaṃ |
 śrīmadṛṣṭvāṇaṃ maṃtreṇa triśataṃ sādhākottamāḥ || 22 ||

śrīmaṃtreṇātha juhuyācchatamaṣṭottaraṃ ghṛtaṃ |
ekaikobhāgavādraśmimaṃtrairājyāhutiṃ hunet ||

dhātrīmūlercayet yaścīddhātrībhirbrahmavidyayā |
rāśiṃdhātrī phalānāṃ ca saṃsthāpyācārya sa sannidhau || 24 ||

niṣkayadvamitaṃ vāpi niṣkadvayāmitaṃ tu vā |
dakṣiṇāṃ gurupāānnedatvādhātrī phalānvitaṃ || 25 ||

tatraiva bhojayedyugmapaṃcakaṃ bhagavaddhiyā |
pūrṇaṃ niśākaradṛṣṭvā pradatvārghyaṃ tridhedave || 26 ||

ācāryapatnīmabhyarcya śrīvudhyāvastrabhūṣaṇaiḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidhā siddhisumahātīmapi || 27 ||

<p. 99a>

prāpnotyavaśyaṃdevānāṃ dullebhāmapi bhūpate |
ravisaṃkramaṇaṃ tatra yadisyādvaṣudhāyate || 28 ||

japahomādirka kṛtvā śrīmadaṣṭārṇe vidyayā |
dviguṇaṃ dakṣiṇāṃ dadyādācāryasya padāṃvuje || 29 ||

puraścaryādvādaśākaphalaṃ sāgamavāpnuyāt |
sudhāṃśugrahaṇe tatra vratamevedamādarāt || 30 ||

kṛtvāthayaṃ ca niṣkaṇiprahṛtvācāryayādayoḥ |
catuḥṣaṣṭhipuraścayāṃ phalaṃ sāṃgramavānyuyāt || 31 ||

mārgaśīrṣe paurṇamāsītyomadaivatyasaṃyutā |
bhūgavāsarasaṃyuktāmahatāsaṃprakīkīrtita || 32 ||

tatrācāryājñayāprātarnityakarmasamātha ca |
trisattādhikāsāhasraṃ samastanyāsasayatāṃ || 33 ||

śrīmadaṣṭakṣarīṃ japtvāsaṃskṛte jātavedasi |
madhutritayagavyājyamiśraṃtilvadṛsānvitaṃ || 34 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇemaṃtreṇa triśataṃ pāpapasaṃ hunet |
śrīmaṃtreṇahunerājyaṃ śatamaṣṭottaraṃ vudhaḥ || 35 ||

 bhagavadraśmibhisredhākuryādājyāhutīstataḥ |
mithunatrinayaṃbhojyaṃ bhakṣyasūpaghṛtādibhiḥ || 36 ||

pradadyādvahalaṃ dravyamācāryasya padāṃvujai |
niṣkaśyaṃ pradātavya haridreṇāpi bhūpate || 37 ||

niṣkamātrasu varṇe vā gurupatnyai samarpyeryat |
sāyaṃ saṃdhyāmupāsyātha japecchrī hṛdayastavaṃ || 38 ||

paṃcadhāśrīmadaṣṭārṇasiddhimatyaṃtikīparāṃ |
āṣṭāvārapuraścaryāsamuddrūtāṃ vrajatyaso || 39 ||

tatrāpirivisaṃkrāṃtiyaṃdisyādvasudhāpate |
vilvapatraissumabhyarcya triśataṃ brahmavidyayā || 40 ||

dakṣiṇaṃ dviguṇaṃ datvā mahāsiddhimavoprayāt |
mṛgāṃkagrahaṇaṃ tatra yadisyadva sudhāyate || 41 ||

(*****) alabhyo sau mahīyonāmnā ciṃtaḥ |
caṃdracūḍāmaṇāvukta homaṃ kṛtvā sadakṣiṇaṃ || 42 ||

puraścayo śataphalamavaśyaṃ labhate dhruvaṃ |
puṣpamāsyarkacāreṇa sahitāyauṇaumīyadi || 43 ||

vācaspatya samādyuktā mahatī samudīritā |
ācāryānujñāyāpyatramātaḥ saṃdhyo samāpya ca || 44 ||

nityahomaṃ samāpyātha samastanyāsasaṃyutāṃ |
triśatādhikasāhasraṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarītayet || 45 ||

triśataṃ prajapetyaścāddiṣṭaṃ śrīmanumādarāt |
ācāryasaccidhāṣvagniṃ saṃskṛtyavidhi ca tataḥ || 46 || 

śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtreṇatilavilvadalānvitaṃ |
triśataṃ juhuyādagnau pāpasaṃtrimadhuplutaṃ || 47 ||

śrīmaṃtreṇahunedātyamaṣṭottaraśataṃ tataḥ |
bhagavadraśmividyābhiḥ kuryādājyāhutiṃ tridhāḥ || 48 ||

utpalairacceyetpaścāttriśataṃ brahmatīdyayā |
tikadvaya suvarṇaṃ vā dṛdhāhācāryapādayo || 49 ||

<p. 99b>

yadyarka saṃkramastatrajāyate vasudhāpate |
cūḍāmaṇirayaṃ yogonāmnālabhya udāhṛtaḥ || 50 ||

hatvā paṃcaśataṃ vahnautinabhadhvājyapāyasaṃ |
triniṣkadakṣiṇāvāpi dṛtvācārya padāṃvuje || 51 ||

caturviśatpuraścaryāphalaṃ sāṃgamavāpnuyāt |
mṛgāṃkagrahaṇaṃ puṇyaṃ yaditaprabhavennṛpa || 52 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇamanunājapahomādikaṃ śubhaṃ |
śuddhamaṃḍalaryaṃta kartasyādviśeṣataḥ || 53 ||

triniṣkadakṣiṇāṃ vāpi sālagrāmaśilāṃśubhāṃ |
kuṃḍaladvayasaṃyuktāṃ pradṛtvācārya pādayoḥ || 54 ||

catuḥṣaṣṭipuraścaryāphalaṃ sāṃgaṃ mahīyate |
prāthāvaśyaparāṃ siddhiṃ vrajatyatra na saṃśayaḥ || 55 ||

yugmadvādaśāśakaṃ bhojyaṃ mithunatritayaṃ tu vā |
mādyamāse paurṇamāso pitṛnakṣatrasaṃyutā || 56 ||

iṃdravāsarasaktāṃ māhatī saṃprakīrtitā |
guroranujñāyāpyatra samāṣyāvaśyakaṃ vidhiṃ || 57 ||

triśatādhikasāhasraṃ samastanyāsaṃyutā |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ jāhvā śrīmatratriśata juhuyāddhaviḥ || 59 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ paścācchrīmaṃtreṇa ghṛtaṃ hunet |
mithunatritayaṃbhojyaṃ bhakṣasūyādikairathai || 60 ||

sāyaṃ saṃdhyāmupāhyātha datvātredhārghyamidave |
utpalairarcayet paścātriśateva vahavidyayā || 61 ||

niṣkamāna suvarṇaṃ vā datvācārya padāṃvuje |
puraścaryātra phalaṃ sāṃgaṃ prāpnoti śāśvataṃ || 62 ||

yadisyādravisaṃkrāti kṛtvedṛṃ vrata matra 
sahiguṇāddakṣiṇāheyāsvācāryapadapaṃaje puraścaraṇa |
ṣaṭkasya labhate phalamuttayaṃyudīdagrarāhaṇaṃ tatra jāyate sudhāpate || 63 ||

caṃḍacūḍāmaṇināmnā yogolabhyopyayaṃ |
nayacaṃdracūḍāmaṇāvuktajapāhikamathādarāt || 64 ||

ātrāpyavaśyaṃ kartavyaṃ mahatīsiddhicchatā |
catuḥṣaṣṭipuraścarya phalaṃsāgaṃgaṃ vrajatyasau || 65 ||

phālgunāṣaurṇemāsīdyābhagadvaivatyāsaṃvutā |
bhānuvāsarasaṃ yuktā mahāte sā samīritā || 66 ||

ācāryānujñayāpyatrasnātvāmaṃ samāpya ca |
japahomādvikaṃ kārya māghavadvasudhāpate || 67 ||

puraścaryā phalaṃ māryamādṛguktaṃ māhīyate |
taddeva kalamuddiṣṭamatrāpi nahi saṃśayaḥ || 68 ||

ekasyāṃ pūrṇiyāyāṃ vāmahatyāṃ vasudhāyayait |
yathoktametatkṛtvāso siddhavidhaḥ prajāyate || 69 ||

<p. 100a>

tatra na kṣatrasahitā prahmārasāmanvitā |
tattanmāsepaurṇamāsī mahatī sā prakīrtitāḥ || 70 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyā icchansiddhimanuttamāṃ |
ekasyāṃ paurṇamāsyā vā vrataṃ kartavyamādarāt || 71 ||

sādhāko sau bhagavatakalayāsahito bhavet |
yeṣu pūvasudyatsāṃgaṃ japahomādi ki śubhaṃ || 72 ||

yadyadduktaṃ mayābhūyata kṛtvā sāṃgamādarāt |
na vidyā sidvimātyoti nāsyasiddhiti vāṃchitaṃ || 73 ||

nānāyeni sahasreṣu janmakarmavimiśritaṃ |
nānarakadaḥ khānicārya ca punaḥ punā || 74 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāssidhyartha yatravānbhavet |
śrīmadāṣṭākṣarisiddhiyādisyāddaṣudhāyarta || 75 ||

bhagavatkalayāyuktaḥ svacchaṃdamaraṇe bhavet |
alabhyayoge saṃprāpte bhikṣitvā śūdrakānapi || 76 ||

ācāryadakṣiṇaṃdatvā japahomādikaṃ caret |
sadya eva pradātavyaṃ hānadravāṃ mahīyate || 77 ||

ṛṇaṃ kṛpibhikṣitvāvidyāsiddhimabhīśatā |
annaṃgrāsamitaṃ vāpi yācayennaguroḥ kuleḥ || 78 ||

ācāryāt pitṛmātṛmyānaṃ grāhyasvarṇama evapi |
prayatne nāpi saṃpādya dātavyaṃ gurave dhanaṃ || 79 ||

manaḥ saṃkalpitaṃ dravyamācārya caraṇāṃvuje |
sadya eva pradātavyamīcchatāsiddhimuttamāṃ || 80 ||

<p. 100b>

navittaśāṭhyaṃ prakurvīta siddhikāmojittamaḥ |
kuṃḍaladvitayāpyātaṃ yadalaṃkaraṇamuttamaṃ || 81 ||

ācāryakarṇayordatvā yoge labhyeyaśāskāre |
sadyasīddhimavāpyā saupīndṛn svargaṃ na yatyati || 82 ||

uttamādakṣīṇāsadyaḥ prahṛtā sarvasīddhitā |
arddhasīddhipradāproktā dakṣiṇāmāsamātrataḥ || 83 ||

adhamā māsayugmena pradatā dharmasīddhidā |
urddhaṃ māsatrayādattāniskalāmātrasaṃśayaḥ || 84 ||

yenakenāpyupāyena gurupādāyādābja sannidhau |
pradakṣīṇā sadyau māsādvāphaladāyinī || 85 ||

imārameśasaṃpūrṇaṃ prasādāryaṃ mahīyate |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīti bhavartavyā phaladāyinī || 86 ||

anuttarabrahmatatvarahasye śrutisaṃgrahe |
adhyā ekatriṃśoyamuktobhīṣṭaphalapradaḥ || 87 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathītaṃtrevedārthasaṃgrahe 
ekatrīṃśodhyāya] ||
<p. 100b>

śrīṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca 

etāvaduktā bhagavān rāmodāśarathīrvibhuḥ |
punarāhakṛhādevaṃ brahmarṣīṇāṃ ca sannidhau || 1 ||

śrībhagavāna uvāca 

śṛṇu śaṃkaragaurīśa bhūyothoṣṭārṇasādhanaṃ |
yacchrutvāpīnarodhīmānasīddhīmetāṃ mahattarāṃ || 2 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāpatpuraścaraṇaṃ mahat |
lakṣaṣoḍaṣakaṃ proktaṃ yadyaitsadyasīddhihetukaṃ || 3 ||

satataṃ dharmacitatvādāyuṣovahvalatvataḥ |
tatpuraścaraṇādevasīddhiḥ kṛtayugādiṣu || 4 ||

asmīnkaliyugeghoreścittaschairyādyabhāvataḥ |
(***) rogādoṣa vahvalatvataḥ tayā tathā || 5 ||

ekenadivase naiva sīddhiḥ kāryāvicakṣaṇaiḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāmasīddhāyāṃ mahītale || 6 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtrasyakoṭi sopi japādībhīḥ |
lakṣmīpatisādasyāleśopī na hi jāyate || 7 ||

<p. 101a>

tasmādavarśaṃ kartavyaṃ puraścaraścaṇamādarāt |
avasyaṃsīddhimāpnoti puraścaraṇakṛtyataḥ || 8 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇeyogeṃkhīdugrahaṇe tathā |
navarātrovrate cāpī puraścaraṇakarmaṇā || 9 ||

avaśyaṃ jāyate sīddhirmaṃtrarājasya sīddhidā |
navarātrevrate prāpte ravīṃvugrahaṇe tathā || 10 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇeyogevaṃdhye kurvīta na kvacīt |
mahāpuskarayogetrayogepyardhodayānidhe || 11 ||

navadhyaṃdīvasaṃ kuryāt sīddhīkāmodvījotamaḥ |
yatpuraścaraṇaṃ muktamādauṣoḍaṣalakṣakaṃ || 12 ||

alabhyayoge kṛtvetthaṃ tādageva bhavetyaṃ |
sarveṣvalabhyayogeṣu puraścaryā yadīrītā || 13 ||

lakṣave ṣoḍaśakaṃ propaṃyat puraścaraṇaṃ mayā |
ākṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāṃ tato daśaguṇoparā || 14 ||

avaśyaṃ jāyate sīddhirācāryasya prasādataḥ |
akṣayedinamātrepī kṛtvā majayādikaṃ || 15 ||

apīnīskatrayaṃ datvā sadyaḥ sīddhīmavāpnuyāt |
kimuktayoge sahite vaiśākhedivasekṣaye || 16 ||

puraścaryā puruṣavaktaṃ harīṇāpīnaśakyate |
ukta vaiśākhe dīvasekṣayemadaṣṭārṇavidyā || 17 ||

(********) siddhiśredhātakathyate |
japahomādibhīrnītyamācāryeṇa dīne dīne || 18 ||

arjijaṃ sukṛtaṃ yasyā caturvargaphalapradaṃ |
sacāsādmapi vidyānāṃ bhūyaḥ ṣīśyopadeśataḥ || 19 ||

tapasārddhaṃ praviśati svaśīṣyakalevaraṃ |
śīṣyaśyadakṣīṇe karṇayāyāṃ vidyāṃ dadātyasau || 20 ||

japahomādikaṃ puṇyamarddhaṃ tasyahī gacchati |
uttamāṃ dakṣīṇāṃ dadyācārya padāṃvuje || 21 ||

varṣāśatamītaṃ dravyamathacottamadakṣīṇāmahāsīddhī |
madhyadakṣiṇayāsīddhirmadhyemeva vidhīyate || 23 ||

<p. 101b>

dakṣīṇāmadhamāṃ datvā kiṃcīsīddhimavāpnuyāt |
taśmādavaśyamācārya pādādvayugale śubhe || 24 ||

yena kenāpyupāyena saṃpadyadravyamādarāt |
uttamāṃ dakṣīṇāmeva datvācāryamukhāṃvujāt || 25 ||

gṛhītvā sakalāvidyāstattayordhasamanvītāḥ |
grahaṇe naiva vidyānāṃ sadya aiṃ vamahattarāṃ || 26 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyādisīddhīṃ prāpnotiśāyīnīṃ |
ācāryaṇāvīśīṣyebhyasma prāpte divasekṣaye || 27 ||

pūrṇānugrahatodeyaṃ vidyājālaṃ phalapradaṃ |
sarvasvasya pradātre vā prāṇānāmapi yatnataḥ || 28 ||

vidyānaguruṇādeyāvaiśākhedivasekṣaye |
ācāryatapasaḥ siddhīryataḥ śīṣyagacchati || 29 ||

dadāti yadīsacchīṣyaḥ prāṇānapī samarpayet |
tadā prabhṛtisacchiṣyaḥ ācāryasya padāṃvuje || 30 ||

śarīramarthaṃ prāśāṃśca dadyāt putrāśca putrikāḥ |
grahaṇādiṣu yogeṣu tatādṛksīddhisīddhirīrītā || 31 ||

akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāṃ dṛk sīddhipurorītā |
homenāpī mahāsīddhīsāravedīvasekṣaye || 32 ||

ācāryadakṣīṇāmīṣṭadharaṃ datvā tataḥ paraṃ |
mithanāni samarbhyarcyatebhyo datvātha dakṣīṇāṃ || 33 ||

nyāsayuktā prajaptavyā punaraṣṭākṣarī śubhā |
triśatādhika sāhasraṃ vā śatādhikaṃ || 34 ||

śatamātraṃ prajapavyaḥ śrīmaṃtraḥ sveṣṭamaṃtra (*) |
vāsu devamahāvidyāṃ vaiṣṇavīṃ ca ṣaḍakṣarī || 35 ||

aṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ paścāt sīddhīkāmo japocchuvī |
taśmīdīnephalāśītavāhaviṣyāśi bhavedvrati || 36 ||

japecchī hṛdayaṃstotraṃtre dhārātrau tataḥ paraṃ |
guruḥ prasādo bhoktavyaḥ paradyurgīrījāyate || 37 ||

ācāryamaṃdireśīṣyaiḥ svagṛhe vā śaśādhakaṃ |
puraścaraṇakṛtyeṣu samāpteṣu tataḥ paraṃ || 38 ||

<p. 102a>

sīṣyai sarvatra bhoktavyaṃ guruśīṣṭānnamādarāt |
anena sarvapāpaidyanīvṛrtiḥ sīddhiruttamā || 39 ||

jñāyate nātrasaṃdehasmatvaṃ satyomayocyate |
tapaḥ sīdvagurorvaktrācchīṣyaiḥ sādhakapuṃgavaiḥ || 40 ||

alabhyayoge saṃprāpte vidyājālaṃ phalapradaṃ |
bhūyopī saṃgrahitavyaṃ datvottamadakṣiṇāṃ || 41 ||

ālabhyayoge saṃprāpte prāṇaiḥ kaṃṭhagatairapī |
vidyājālaṃ na dātavyaṃ taponāśīnadhīmatā || 42 ||

satataṃ gurupādābje dṛḍhabhaktāyadhīyate |
vahūprārthanayādeyaṃ yogelabhye yaśaskare || 43 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī vidyāsīdhyanaṃtaramādarāt |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ vāpī japatvā nītyaṃ labhet phalaṃ || 44 ||

atha homavidhīṃ vakṣye sadyassakalasīddhīdaṃ |
nārāyaṇe nayatproktaṃ janakāya mahātmane || 45 ||

sālagrāmaśīlācakramayodhyācakramīśrītaṃ |
saṃpūjyaṃ dvādaśākṣaryā prajasvāṣṭākṣaraṃ manuṃ || 46 ||

lakṣamekaṃ hūnedājyaṃ gavyaṃ daśāsahasrakaṃ |
aṇīmādiguṇeśvaralabhate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 47 ||

lakṣamekaṃ śucīrjaptvā nāraṃgairghṛtamīśrītaiḥ |
daśasāhasrakaṃ hūtvā dīyudīrghāyusānnīrāyama || 48 ||

jaṃvīraiyutaṃ hutvā ghṛta trimadhumīśrīai |
asaubhāgyena yuktā pīsubhagaḥ kāmavadbhavet || 49 ||

nārīkelaphalairhatvāghṛtatrimadhumīśrītai |
bhagavatkalayāyuktaḥ kāṃtimānarkavadbhavet || 50 ||

hūtvā phalaikharjurairayutatritamadhuplutaiḥ |
jaḍopīparvavīdyābhīrvacasyati samo bhavet || 51 ||

sthūlaiḥ sumudhuraiścatakūlaistīmadhumīśrītai |
bhagavatkalayāyuktaḥ kāṃtimānarkavadbhavet || 52 ||

mahiṃśāti saṃdeho iyuśca nirāmayaḥ (**) |
yanasasya phalaidūrtvānadhūtrimadhusaṃplutaiḥ || 54 ||

akṣayaṃ dhanaratnaughaṃ prāpnautyatraḥ saṃśayaḥ |
hūtvā vilāphalainīrgavyaghṛtātrimadhumīśrītai || 55 ||

rājarārājasamolakṣyā bhavatprabhu na saṃśayaḥ |
ghṛtatrimadhusaṃmīśrāṃ hūtvā pāyasamādarāt || 56 ||

<p. 102b>

rājarāja samolakṣmyāvidyayābhīṣaṇāyate |
ghṛtatrīmadhusaṃmīśraihūtvā tu kadalīphalaiḥ || 57 ||

ayutaṃ sutamāpnoti bhavatkalānvitaṃ || 57 ||

tulasīdassīśrairhūtvā śohūtvā nīlotpalaiḥ śubhaiḥ || 58 ||

adyūtaṃ surarājaina sadṛśīṃ śrīyamaśrute |
drākṣāphalairgavyaghṛtamadhutrītayamīśrītaiḥ || 59 ||

hūtvā yutaṃ nidhānanāmadhīyate jāyate dhruvaṃ |
ikṣūkhaṃḍairghṛtābhyaktairmadhūtritayāmīśrītaiḥ || 60 ||

hūtvā yutaṃ svacakṣurbhyāṃ paśyatyeva śrīyaḥpati |
kṣīravṛkṣasamudbhūtaiphalaiḥ ṣaṣṭhīmītaiśubhaiḥ || 61 ||

gavyājyamadhusaṃmīśrehūrtvā daśasāhasrakaṃ |
aṣṭāṃgayogamāsādyakhecarojāyate dhruvaṃ || 62 ||

juhuyādaraṇauṃbhojairgavyājyā trimadhuplutaiḥ |
ayutaṃ cittamāpnoti vāṃchīnaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ || 63 ||

caṃpakairayutaṃ hūtvā goghṛtatṛmadhūpnutaiḥ |
bhavatyusāvathā puṣpān dhaneśo vākyanirbhavet || 64 ||

madannikākusumaihūtvā goghṛtatṛmadhupnutaiḥ |
ayutadvītīyaṃ svarṇaśarīrobhavati dhruvaṃ || 65 ||

jānīpuṣpaistrīmadhvaktairayutaṃ goghṛtahnutaiḥ |
hūtvā vā laravīprākhyaḥ kāṃtyā bhavati sādhakaḥ || 66 ||

karavīraidhunaidājyamadhutrītayamīśrītaiḥ |
anunadvitayaṃ paścātsuvarṇasadṛśaḥ śrīyā || 67 ||

sthāvaraṃ jaṃgamaṃ vāpī viṣaṃ saṃharatnadhruvaṃ |
sarpī strīmadhusaṃmīśraihūtvā guggulubhīḥ śūcīḥ || 68 ||

ayutaṃ sarvasaubhāgyaprāptotyapi ca vāṃchīnnaṃ |
ayutaṃ sarkharāṃ khaṃḍairgavyājya trīmadhusrutai || 69 ||

hūtvā samastalokeṣu śreyaḥ prāpnotyanumaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vīdyāṃ japtvaikaṃ lakṣamādarāt || 70 ||

asādhyairapīpāpaudyairmucyate nātra saṃśayaḥ |
lakṣadvayaṃ japeyastu śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ manuṃ || 71 ||

asvamedhasahasrasyaphalaṃ prāpnoti śāsvataṃ |
caturlakṣya japādāśrumahatīṃ śrīyamakṣayāṃ || 72 ||

prāpnoti sarvasaubhāgyaṃ lakṣaṣaṭkaprajāpataḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ japtvā vastulakṣaṃ jīteṃdriyaḥ || 73 ||

<p. 103a>

aṇīmādṛṣṭasīddhīnāṃ nāyako bhavatī dhruvaṃ |
lakṣadvādaśakaṃ japtvā śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīmanuṃ || 74 ||

tejasāravīsaṃkāśo vā cāṣaṇasannibhaḥ |
śrīyādhānadaśaṃ bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 75 ||

lakṣaṣoḍaśakaṃ maṃtra śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī japan |
śaṃkhādīnāṃ nidhānānāmapīyo jāyate dhruvaṃ || 76 ||

ekaviṃśabhīrlakṣyaiḥ sādhākṣātsvāyaṃbhuvo manuḥ |
svatyārūpaṃ pradatvā smaikalpāyusmamacaṃcalaṃ || 77 ||

aṇīmādiguṇaiśvaryaṃ pradadāti na saṃśayaḥ |
paṃcaviṃśati lakṣāṇī śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ mamuṃ || 78 ||

prajaptvā sarvalokeṣu śakrādyairapī pūjītaḥ |
divyadṛṣṭau samāsādyakāmakāmarūpī bhavatyasau || 79 ||

dvātriṃśa lakṣajapatiḥ sīddhānāmadhīyā bhavet || 81 ||

dvātriṃśa lakṣajapatogaṃdharvādhīpatirbhavet |
ṣaḍvīṃśannakṣajāpena mahāvidyādhārorbhavet || 81 ||

catvārīśatibhīrlakṣaivīrādrūpī bhavatyasau |
paṃcāśalakṣajapataḥ sīddhānāmajīto bhavet || 81 ||

adhīroti tejaptvī divyakanyā satānvitaḥ || 82 ||

japtvā śaptvatilakṣāṇī manovigīmahāmahāmatiḥ |
ajarāmaraṇo bhūtvā devatvaṃ labhate dhruvaṃ || 83 ||

aśītilīkṣajapatassargasāmrājyabhakṣyayaṃ |
prāpnotidraṃ samo bhūtvā jarāmṛtyu vivarjitaḥ || 84 ||

japtvā navatilakṣāṇī bhīrabhīṣṭutaḥ |
ajarāmaraṇo bhūtvā satyaloyo bhavet || 85 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ śatalakṣamathādarāt |
dakṣīṇāmūrti dṛṣovidyābhīrdīvyadehabhāk || 86 ||

ajarāmaraṇo paṃcaśativārśīkiḥ (***) |
aṇīmādiguṇaiśvaryaṃ pādukādyaṣṭakaṃ tathā || 87 ||

sarvejñatvaṃ manojñatvaṃ kāmarūpī mavāpnuyāt |
aṣṭādhikaśataṃ lakṣajapena niyatavrataḥ || 88 ||

 śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyājarāmaraṇavarjītaḥ |
brahmaviṣṇumaheśānāmapīvaṃdya padāṃvujaḥ || 89 ||

sākṣānmārāyaṇāsāsau bhūtvā khecaratāmapi |
avāpyayogamaṣṭāṃgaṃ sarvajñatvaṃ manojñatāṃ || 90 ||

<p. 103b>

parakāyaveśādi sāmarthyamayī niścalaṃ |
avāpyadi kanyānāṃ sahasreṇa samanvītaṃ || 91 ||

anenaiva sarīṇena mānamadhīrohati |
bhṛtyānāmagragaṇyosau bhūtvā bhagavato mahān || 92 ||

modate paramedhāmnī sannidhāviṃdīrāpare |
ācārya sadṛśaṃ pūjyamaṣṭākṣarasamomanuḥ |
nārāyaṇasamaṃ daivanāstīnāstī mahīpate || 93 ||

vaisākhemāsedīvasekṣayābhīdhejatpūryathā sīrīhaprajāyate |
anyatrayoge japahomatarpaṇaḥ na tādṛśī sīddhimupaiti vipraḥ || 94 ||

ācāryapādārcanasaktavimonyāsaissahāṣṭakṣaramaṃtrajāpī sa eva |
nārāyaṇastayadhārīvaṃdyapūjyaśca gurugarīyān || 95 ||

nācārya pādābdayugātyavitraviṣṭārṇamanu |
prajāpīvaṃdhyaṃ na kuryāddivasaṃmanuṣyaḥ || 97 ||

sarvairūpāyaiḥ phalameva sādhyaṃ phalapradaṣṭārṇamanoḥ prajāpāt |
nyāsaisahāṣṭākṣaramaṃtrajāpīnārāyaṇānamasmanā eva || 98 ||

itthaṃ purā dāśarathīrmahārathī daśarmahātmā rahasyametat |
bhagavānuvāca nārāyaṇenāmaranāyake na rājñe yaduktaṃ paramaṃ pavītraṃ || 99 ||

iti dāśarathīyesmīntaṃtrevedārthasaṃgrahe dvātrīṃśodhyāyaḥ uktoyaṃ 
vedadāṃtāgarbhītaḥ 100 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīyataṃtrevedārthasaṃgrahe 
dvātriṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 103b>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

śṛṇu rājan mahīpālapītāmahasutaḥ purā |
avaśyatsāgarekūrmamahāṃtaṃ divyavarcasaṃ || 1 ||

dhanyosītyāhataṃ dṛṣṭvā nārado bhagavānrūpī |
nāhaṃ dhanya iti prāhakurmastaṃ nāradaṃmunī || 2 ||

imāmadāśrayā ayodhanyāsrailokapāvanaḥ |
dhanyā bhavatya ityāhūto āpo nāradomunīḥ || 3 ||

āpo vanadhanya ityucaḥ pṛthvī dhanyāsmadāśrayā |
nāradastābhuvaṃ prāhadhanyāsīti vasuṃdhane || 4 ||

nāhaṃdhanebhuprāhataṃ brahmajanayaṃ munīṃ |
sādhārabhūtāgīrayadumedhanyāmahāmate || 5 ||

ityukto bhūdharo prāhayūyaṃ dhanyatarā iti |
dhanyānavayamītyāhūrnārabhūdharā apī || 6 ||

<p. 104a>

asmahādi jagarkartādanyodevaḥ pītāmahaḥ |
samīpaṃ brahmaṇo gatvādhanyosītyāhataṃ munīḥ || 7 ||

pītaṃ pramahopītaṃ prāhanāhaṃ dhanyaṃ iti prabhuḥ |
sṛjyaṃte sakalokāvaidainṛtyaṃ sanātaneḥ || 8 ||

pāntyaṃtesaṃhrīyaṃte ca vedādhanyāstātau mune |
ityukto nāradovedānāhanatvādaṃḍavat || 9 ||

dhanyābhavataḥ sarvajñāsṛṣṭīsṭhītīlayādhiyaḥ |
vedāśca nāradaṃ prāhvadhanyā navayamītyapī || 10 ||

vayaṃhīsṛṣṭayajñārthaṃ bhagavadvahanāṃjāt |
yuyaṃdhanyatarāyajñā iti nāra āhatān || 11 ||

ucusrevayaṃ dhanyā asmābhīrabhī saṃtataṃ |
ijyate bhagavān sākṣādevadevaḥ śrīyaḥpati || 12 ||

yajñoṣoyajñapuruṣo harīrnārāyaṇo vibhu |
sarvaviyāmayaḥ svāmī trijagatpatirīśca || 13 ||

sa eva dhanyasmaparatanaṃ parāmātmā sanātanaḥ |
pitāmahastutogatvā sannidhaṃ praramātmānā || 14 ||

dhanyo hi kṛtya kṛtyosīhadevaṃ srīyaḥpatiṃ |
nāradaprāhaviśvātmādakṣiṇābhīssahetyatha || 15 ||

tacchṛtvā bhagadvākyaṃ nārado brahmanaṃdanaḥ |
dakṣiṇābhīssakathaṃ dhanyo bhagavannīdīrā bhave || 16 ||

ityukto bhagavānstatra nāradaṃ brahmanaṃdanaṃ |
uvāca lakṣmī sānīdhyamūrti sa dvedaśanīdhau || 17 ||

dakṣīṇāsīhetyuktaṃmaya yadvacanaṃ mane |
ete vakṣaṃti vedāste niścītaṃ manmukhodbhvaḥ || 18 ||

etāvaduktā bhagavān ramayāsahito vibhuḥ |
bhuṃjahītī bhūstvāyannagāśanavāhanaḥ || 19 ||

vedā apī brahma apīsucustamucastatvaṃ sa nivīścītaṃ || 20 ||

samāhītamanābhūtvā śṛṇusva brahmanaṃdana |
vayaṃ lokahītārthāya sṛṣṭā bhagavate mune || 21 ||

asmābhīrucyate yadyatatsarvaṃ dvijātibhīḥ |
avaśyamapīkartavyaṃmasīdājñāvaliyasī || 22 ||

asmadājñāṃ samudyayastīṣṭati mahītale sovaśyaṃ 
valīyasenarakaudyeṣu majjatyācaṃdratārakaṃ || 23 ||

adhyetavyāḥ sādādevyāṣaḍaṃgapadakramākartavyā |
sakalāyāgāsaṃpūrṇavaradakṣīṇārahītopīca || 24 ||

nītyaṃnaimītikaṃ kāmyakarmakamahaṃ pratyahaṃ |
dakṣīṇāyuktameva karyaṃmate (*****) || 25 ||

<p. 104b>

ācaredvihīnityaṃnisīddhaṃ parīvarjayet |
dakṣīṇābhīsahetyuktaṃ vaco yatparamātmanā || 26 ||

dakṣīrahitaṃ sarvaṃ karmastyā dvaidīkaṃ vṛthā |
svalpadakṣīṇayāgopīdakṣīrahitopīca || 27 ||

yātamāduravadodṛṇaḥmīhāmutrāpī saṃtataṃ |
yajñeśvaro yajño bhoktā sākṣādyajñapumān vibhuḥ || 28 ||

ijyate ijyate sakalaiyajñervedasaṃsūyate sadā |
sakuṭosthe ca locavyaktaḥ paramātmā śrīyapatiḥ || 29 ||

sarvadevamayasarvayajñārūpī parāmāmān |
yaṣṭavymahāyāgaisaṃpūrṇa varadakṣīṇaiḥ || 30 ||

saṃpūrṇādīyate yena mahādāneṣu dakṣīṇā |
avaśaśahitarūpa eva labhate gatiṃ || 31 ||

dānahīnaṃ nṛṇāṃ janmanarakalkeśabhājanaṃ |
darīdreṇāpīdeyasyānītyaṃ śākādīne mune || 32 ||

bhīkṣītvāyī pradātavyaṃ darīdreṇāpi saṃtataṃ |
viśeśataḥ kalau prāpto nārakodā namovahī || 33 ||

yajñeṣu jayayajñosau mahāyāga udāritaḥ |
japahomādīkaṃ karmakṛtvā pratyahamādarāt || 34 ||

ācāryacaraṇaṃbhojedeyayatkiṃcidapyatha |
saṃkapamāsīmāse vā dātavyaṃ bhūtimīcchasī || 35 ||

caturvargapradāvidyā mahāvidyā iti smṛtāḥ |
japahomādikaṃ tāsāṃ kṛyate yai sadakṣīṇaṃ || 36 ||

tajjanmasaphalaṃ jñeyaṃ na eva sukhabhāgīnaḥ |
tatrāpīśrīmadaṣṭārṇomahaṃ naraḥ || 37 ||

tadātmaiva paraṃbrahmamayonārāyaṇaḥ pumān |
tasyaiva raśmayaḥ sarvasṛjaṃvīdyāṃtiyāṃti ca || 38 ||

sarvavidyāmayaḥ sarvanyāsarūpaśrīyaḥpatiḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyātmāharīrnāyaṇo vibhuḥ || 39 ||

puraścaryādibhīryāgaiḥ sayaṣṭavyo jagatpatiḥ |
śrīmadarṇavīdyāyājapohāmādikaṃ śubhaṃ || 40 ||

asvamedhāyādiyāgebhyopyadhīkaṃ phalamaśrūte |
nāsvamedhasadvastrairvānarahādānakoṭibhiḥ || 34 ||

na tīrthayātrākodyāpuraścaraṇakarmabhīḥ lakṣmīnārāyaṇoyoge |
cūṇāvaradakṣīṇāṃ kṛtaṃ tena na saṃdehaḥ paśyapīramāpatiṃ || 44 ||

dṛṣṭenāsyaṇe sākṣādiṃdirāramaṇevibhau |
brahmarūdrādibhīrdevairapyasau pūjyate pune || 45 ||

<p. 105a>

pauraścaraṇīkaṃ karma kṛtvā saṃpūrṇadakṣīṇāṃ |
adatvācārya pādābdenasīddhīṃ mahatiṃjet || 46 ||

stvārjitaṃ sakalaṃ dravyamekasmīnyīvasare |
sarvasvamīti tatmokṣaṃ taduktā pūrṇadakṣīṇā || 47 ||

patnyādikamapīputrāṇāmapībhūṣaṇaṃ |
vastrādikaṃ ca sakalaṃ sarvasvaṃ tatsamīrītaṃ || 48 ||

uttamāṃ dakṣīṇāmijāmāhūrbrahmaikyasīddhidāṃ |
athavarṣāṣanamīnadravyaṃ cottamadakṣiṇāṃ || 49 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavaradajayāyutaṃ vā pītathā sarvasvadakṣīṇaṃ |
aṣṭākṣarīpuraścryāsadṛśaṃ na mahāmate || 64 ||

vedā apī ca vedāṃtā dharmaśāstraṇī saṃtataṃ |
purāṇajātaṃ sakalaṃ kalpasūtrādikaṃ ca yat || 65 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtrasya bhāṣyaṃ vṛddhi mahāmane |
bhagavadṛśīsahitā samastanyāsaṃyūtā || 66 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā sāṃgadakṣīṣāyācitā |
yasya sīddhirthititaṃ vṛddhititaṃ vṛddhī brahmarūpīṇamacyūtaṃ || 67 ||

tasmādavaśyaṃ kartavyo yatnaḥ sīdhyarthamādarāt |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāṃ sīddhāyāṃ divīvā bhuvī || 68 ||

rasātale vānāsādhyaṃ vidyate brahmanaṃdana |
aṇīmādiguṇaisvaryasaṃpūrṇakhyātirakṣayā || 69 ||

acaṃcalaṃ mahabhāgyamajarāmaratārapī ca |
aṣṭāṃgasahitoyāgojātijātiśmaramaṇapyathā || 70 ||

ekena janmanaivāsyasaṃśīti na saṃśayaḥ |
ācāryacaradvaṃdvassalasīddhidā etadevījānīhīparabrahmaikasīddhīdaṃ || 73 ||

aṣṭākṣarīvidyā durlabhaṃ nidānamīti kathyate |
brahmadarśaśaṃsīddhi hetubhūtamudirayet || 74 ||

śrīmaṣṭhārṇavidyāyā japahomādikaṃ śūbhaṃ |
dharmārthamokṣadharmāṇāṃ nidānamamītikathate || 75 ||

nārāyaṇābhīdhaṃ brahmayahasmādibhīrdīne |
kathyate śrūyanityamyarcyate dhyāyae tathā || 76 ||

nārayaṇe mayo vijñānavidhirūcyata sakyate |
sādhakaiprāpnumakṣaramanojayet || 77 ||

bhūyo bhūyo vakṣāmīprāpteśu śubhavartaśu |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣaśrīddhīyatnakartavya ādarāt || 78 ||

bhūyo bhūyo bhūyopī vakṣyāmī brahmanaṃdana |
ācāryavadanāṃbhojātsaṃprāpyāṣṭākṣaraṃ manuṃ || 79 ||

<p. 105b>

puraścaraṇāsaṃsīddhiṃ kṛtvādbrahmayobhayevet |
nārāyaṇamunerjanmadivasekṣayasaṃjñīte || 80 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇasaṃsīdhyaiyatnaḥ kartavya ādarāt |
aṣṭākṣarasyasaṃsīddhirmahādānamahatapaḥ || ||

mahān dharmomahadrānīmetasdadhīkaṃ nahī |
[iti śrīmadanudarabrahmarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahetrayastrīśāyaḥ] ||
<p. 105b>

śrīrājovāca 

bhagavānbhāṣītāṣeṣa viśeṣakaruṇānīdhe |
samastalakṣmīvidyānāṃnyāsadhyānādikaṃ vadha || 1 ||

śrībhagavāna uvāca 

śṛṇurājanmahīpāla bhagavatāpṛṣṭamādarāt |
vidhānamapī saṃkṣīptaṃ śrīmaṃtrāṇāṃ pravakṣate || 2 ||

trayīvījaṃjaleśātvaṃ vāmanetravibhūṣītaṃ |
agnivīṃdu samāyuktaṃ dvītiyaṃ vījamūdhṛtaṃ || 3 ||

śyarśāṃtyaṃ vyomavījaṃ mukhavṛtavibhūṣaṇāṃ |
bhūvijaṃmūkhakṣatatyaṃ vāyumārtaṃḍasaṃyūtaṃ || 4 ||

dvādaśasvarasaṃyūktaṃ hṛdayena samanvitaṃ |
aṣṭākṣarī mahāvidyā mahālakṣmyādudīrītā || 5 ||

samastasaṃyat sāmrājya mahīsīhasaneśvarī |
dārīdradukhasamanīsamastai sarvasīddhida || 6 ||

bhṛgubrahmasutorvraktomunīrasyāmahāmane |
chaṃdogāyatramītyuktaṃ mahālakṣmīstrayīmayī || 7 ||

devatākathītā sarvajagamātāharīprīyā |
śrīvījaṛtyuktaṃ śaktivījaṃ rudirītā || ||

saḍaṃgaṃ vinyaset paścācchrīyā ṣaṭdīrghayuktā || 8 ||

ātāmrārka samastasannibhatatuṃsaubhāgyavārānnidhīṃ |
padmādarśadarāṃ hīraṇyaghaṭaṃ vidyāṃ tathā bhītīṃ || ||

mūle kṛtyataromahāmaṇīmaye divyāsane |
saṃhītāṃ dīvyākalmatirājitāṃ suvadanāṃ || ||

pītāṃ varāṃ laṃkṛtāṃ mahālakṣmīmīti dhyātvā japennityamamemanuṃ || 10 || 

sarvasapatsṛmṛddhīḥ syādbhāgyarāśi pade pade |
aṣṭalakṣaṃ paraścaryadutyatrairvāthapaṃkajaiḥ || 11 ||

madhutṛtayasaṃmīśrairvinyapatrairathāpī vā |
hūtvācārya padāṃbhoje datvā vahvalakṣīṇāṃ || 12 ||

vidyāsīddhimavāpnoti nātra kāryā vicārīṇā |
vaisākhe phālgune vāpīvāyetvā śrāvaṇepīvā || 13 ||

kārtike mārgaśīrṣe vā prathame bhṛguvāsare |
saṃkalpya paurṇamāśyaṃtaṃ paṃcaviṃśatsahakaṃ || 14 ||

prajaptvā jūhūyādājya mahūtritayamīśritaiḥ |
dṛśāṃśaṃ juhuyādmai vilvapatraidathāpīvā || 15 ||

tataḥ cāryapādābje dhenunitayamādarāt |
dakṣīṇāsahitaṃ datvā kāṃcanena vīcanevinirmī || 16 ||

yajñopavītaṃ trayaṃ vāsoyagalayoyatuṃ |
datvā dvādaśabhuṃjīvādalaṃkṛtya suvāsīnīḥ || 17 ||

ācāryapatnīmabhyarca vāsaulakāsaṃ cayai sadyaḥ |
sīddhimavāpnoti vidyāyānātraśaṃśayaḥ || 18 ||

ityameva mahāvidyā dukhadārīdrabhaṃjīnī |
ādhīvyādhī prasamanī sarvasaṃpṛtsamṛddhīye || 19 ||

<p. 106a>

aṣṭākṣarī mahālakṣmyājapedbhāgyasamṛddhaye |
ālakṣmīkalahādhārātadgehenavatyagvacit || 20 ||

āyurārogyarthaṃ putrayau samṛddhaye (***) |
aṣṭākṣarīṃ mahālakṣmyā japedbhāgyasamṛddhaye || 21 ||

āsvīne navarātre vā vā rātre vā vā saṃte vā samāgate |
pradipadvīramābhyanavamyaṃ tathamādarā || 22 ||

ācāryānujñayātatra śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ manuṃ japet |
dvādaśahasraṃ kṛtvā saṃkṛtyamādarāt || 23 ||

paṃcaviṃśat sahasrāṇī japedaṣṭākṣarīṃ śrīyaḥ |
navamyāṃ jvalivahau śūddhaṃ gavyājyamādarāt || 24 ||

hūnedaṣṭārṇamaṃtreṇatādhikasahasrakaṃ |
aṣṭārṇavidyayālakṣmyāmadhutitayamīśrītaṃ || 25 ||

triśatādhikaṃ sahasraṃ hūnejavyājyamīśrītaṃ |
viṣṇvapatra samāyuktaṃ havītīlānvitaṃ || 26 ||

athācarmā namaskṛtya kuṃḍadvītiśubhaṃdatyā |
karṇayopaścādvahūśyaśaudyaśaṃkulāṃ || 27 ||

samarpayenmahīvidvān hūyādakṣīṇānvītāṃ |
sadakṣīṇaṃ tapto dedyāddhe tu dvayamalaṃkṛtaṃ || 28 ||

dhanāḍhyorājaputropidadyādvitaṃ sahasraśaḥ |
alaṃkāraiśca vāsaubhīrdakṣīṇābhīścabhaujane || 29 ||

ācāryavallabhāṃ paścānmahālakṣmīdhiyārcayet |
vivāharahitākanyā avaśaṃpūjayennaraḥ || 30 ||

evarṣadvīvarṣādīnavarṣāṃtakanyakāḥ (**) |
atha vāvau ca nārūḍhāḥ yatra vatyoguṇānvitaḥ || 31  ||

bhojanādyai samabhyarcyanavatirnavalāva nṛpa |
vibhave satyalaṃkāraṃ tāsāṃ vā sāṃsicāryayet || 32 ||

paṃcaviṃśati śaṃkhyābrāhmaṇān vedapāragān |
bhojayitvā mṛṣṭhānnaṃ dakṣīṇābhīścatoṣayet || 33 ||

athācāryāśīṣaḥ prāpyadyūpaṃ bhuṃjīta vaṃdhubhīḥ |
evaṃ kṛte vidhāne navarātravrajeśu (**) || 34 ||

idirāsahitasya bhasya bhagacitovibhuḥ |
daditimahasatisīddhitrailokyanāpīdurbhāṃ || 35 ||

paṃcaviṃśati saṃkhyāka brāhmaṇādapāragān |
bhojayītvāthamīṣṭānnaṃ bhagavātyaṃkulīmahahīśrīyaṃ || 36 ||

mānuṣāmapidīvyāṃścabhogān putrāśca pautrakān |
dadāti bhagavāṃstasmaiśaṃśayonātra vidyayo || 37 ||

japtvā lakṣmāmīmaṃ maṃtraṃ daśāṃśaṃ tarpaye śrutiḥ |
yayajñeśurasedyūrīgu umīśvajalena vā || 38 ||

taddaśāṃśaṃ hūnetpadmaimadhutrītayamīśrītai |
dhanasenasamolathā jīvaṃ bhagavatyasau || 39 ||

śrīvīṣṇumaṃdire vilvamūlamaṃtrāsya maṃtravit |
aṣṭākṣarīṃ mahālakṣmyā japtvā lakṣamataṃdriyaḥ || 40 ||

vilvagvavyaghṛtamadhutritayasaṃplutaiḥ kṛtvā |
saulanatevītavṛddhīṃ (********) || 41 ||

alakṣmīnāsanaṃ nityamīcchītāvijītātmanā |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā japakartādīnedīne || 42 || 

<p. 106b>

aṣṭākṣarī mahālakṣmyā japtavyā vatsyamādarāt |
iti dāśarathīyesmīntaṃtredārthasaṃgrahe adhyāyoyaṃ catustrīṃśa ukto bhagavatā 
parā || 43 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīyetaṃtrevīdārthasaṃgrahe 
catustrīṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 106b>

śrībhagavāna uvāca 

śrīṣaḍarṇamathovakṣe tatrayīsāraṃ mahodayaṃ |
sīdhaṃti yasya japato brahmedrādivībhūtayaḥ || 1 ||

trayīvījaṃ paraṃdhāma pūrvamuccārya yatnatataḥ |
vā tavahnī samārūḍhāṃ vāmalocanabhūṣītaṃ || 2 ||

viṃduyuktaṃ tataḥ saṃdhyāvījaṃ dathākṣī saṃyūtaṃ |
viṃddhahīnaṃ vahnīyutaṃ maṃtasyadyamataḥparaṃ || 3 ||

dvādaśāsvarasaṃyuktaṃ namaskārapadanvitaṃ |
śrīṣaḍakṣaravīdheyamuktāpapaudyabhedīnī || 3 ||

samastayāgatīrthaudyaphaladāśrīsamṛddhīdā |
dhanadhānyagajāścaudyamūktā(-)māṇīkavarṣīṇī || 4 ||

cirāyuṣyapradā sarvamahābhāgyasamadā |
śrīvījasahitāmaṃtrāvairīṇopi mahātmane || 5 ||

japtvāssamastaphaladājapakartu na śaṃśayaḥ |
śrīyuktameva sakalaṃ pūjyatejagatitale || 6 ||

śrīyāvirahitovidyānapībrahmavidutamanaḥ |
na pūjyate bhūtale lakṣmīnkṣūdravadūsudhāpate || 6 ||

śrīyāvirahito rājasārvabhaumanṛpopi ca |
trijagatsvapīnārcya syādbhavasyāpīniditaḥ || 8 ||

śālagrāmśīlādiniśrīyāvirahitāvṛkṣā |
apīpuṣpaphalānvitaḥ na dṛṣṭumapīśakyaṃte || 9 ||

śmaśānamīdhabhūpate śrīyāyuktaṃ tṛṇamapī |
(********) pūjameva jagatpate || 10 || 

śrīyāyuktotyajo vāpī catuthoyavanopīvā |
abhyarcitaḥ svādbhūyādyāladevatsakalairjanaiḥ || 11 ||

adharmatiratovāpīdurācāraratovāpī vā |
saṃpūjyate mahīpāla śrīyāyukto jagariye || 12 ||

śrīyāyuktāṃjo vāpī sakulīnaḥ sapīṃḍītaḥ |
sa eva brahmavidyāna sa evāryo dine dine || 13 ||

yatra śrīstatacchucidravyaṃ tatra dharmomahānapī |
śrīyāvīrahitaḥ sākṣādbhagavānabhūpate || 14 ||

na pūjyaḥ syātrīlokeṣu mīkītānyenadāyaḥ |
ṣaḍaśaramīdaṃ tasmācchīyodevyāḥ phalapradaṃ || 15 ||

avaśyamapī japtavyaṃ śrīsamṛddhīsamīśyatāḥ |
ṣaḍakṣarīḥ śrīyovidyāsargāḍhyītyaṃtakārīṇī || 16 ||

sarvasaṃpadhīṣṭātrī sarvalokeśvareśvarī |
bhṛgurasyamunīśchāṃdonīvṛdgāyatramīrītaṃ || 17 ||

trayīmayī jaganmātādevatā śrīharīprīyā |
dvitivījamaktaṃ ca śaktirnatirudirītā || 18 ||

ṣaḍaṃgāninyasetpaścāccharīyāvadūdīrghayuktayā |
kāṃtyā kāṃcanasannibhāṃ harīgīrīprakhyaiścaturbhīrgajaiḥ ||

sahastotkṣīptaraṇmāyāmṛtaghaṭairāśīṃ ca mānāṃśrīyaṃ |
vibhrāṇāṃvaraṃ mandayugmamabhayaṃhasteḥ kīrīṭojvalāṃ 
kṣomāvaddhaninaṃvadhīṃ valalītāṃvaderavedastītāṃ || 20 ||

<p. 107a>

lakṣalaṣaṭkaṃ japenmaṃtrīdīkṣītoovijīteṃdrīyaḥ |
śrīyamabhyarcayannīsugaṃdhī kusumādibhīḥ || 21 ||

ṣaṭsuhasraṃ cakṣuḥhūyātkamalaistrīmadhuplutaiḥ |
japāṃto juhuyānmaṃtrītilairvāmadhurāplutaiḥ || 22 ||

vilvairyājuhuyāt patrairvāsādhakottamaḥ |
athavā śrīmadaṣṭārṇa catuviṃśata ṣahasrakaṃ || 23 ||

(**) tāvasahasraṃ prajāpenaṃ śrīṣaḍakṣaraṃ |
pāpasaṃjūhūyāt paścātcchīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyā || 24 ||

trisahasraṃ viśuddhatmāniśajādhīkamādarā |
maṃtreṇāpī juhuyātāvadeva ghṛtaṃ śubhaṃ || 25 ||

ācāryakarṇayordatvā kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ śubhaṃ |
sarvasvamarpayeddhīmānathācāryapadāṃvuje || 26 ||

varṣāśanamitaṃ vāpi dakṣiṇādravyamārpayet |
alaṃkāraiścavāsobhirabhyarcāryavallabhā || 27 ||

caturvīṃśatisaṃkhyākāmīnāthūnānyavī bhojayet |
(****) śrīśaḍakṣaravidyāyāḥ kṣarasya ca || 28 ||

prāptanuttamāṃsīdvīdaivatairapīdūrlakartika |
mādyamāsetaṃvibhūtirnatikāṃti puṣṭikīti ca sannitaḥ || ||

vyutirūtkaṣṭīsīddhiśca saṃproktā navaśayaḥ |
(****) atrāvāhvanadevīṃ rasamanvitāṃ || || 

vījādyamāsanaṃ datvā mūrtimūlena kalpaye |
agnīśāsuravāyamadhyadīkṣaṃgapūjanaṃ || 33 ||

vāsudevaṃ saṃkarṣaṇaṃ pradyumnamanirūddhakaṃ |
hīmamītamamāleṃdūnīlāyabhatavāsasaḥ || 34 ||

cakraśaṃkhagadāpadmadhārīṇāstan caturbhujān |
vidigātreṣu pātreṣu damakādinyajedṛthā || 35 ||

muktāmaṇīkyasaṃkāśokāśokiṃcīsmīmukhāṃvubhau |
anadamakaṃ lalitaṃ bhūyo guggulurcakaṭaṃkaṃ || 
yacchechaṃkhanidhidevyādakṣiṇedayitānvītaṃ || 36 ||

nyonyāliṃganaparauśaṃkhapaṃkajadhārīṇau || 37 ||

vigaladratnavarṣābhyāṃ saṃkhābhyāṃ mūrdhni lāṃchītau tudilaṃ kavukanidhīṃ |
vasuṃdhārāthastaniṃtamataḥ paṃkajanidhīṃ prīyayāsahitaṃ yajet || 38 ||

sīṃdūbhauyajecchīṣṭauraktapadmoapdmotpalānvitai |
nisaradalavarṣābhyāṃ padmābhyāṃ mūhvīlāṃchīnau || 39 ||

tuṃdīlaṃ paṃkajanidhiṃ tanviṃvasumatīmapī |
dalāgreyajedevatālākyādyāḥ samatalaḥ || 40 ||

valākīvimālā caiva kamalānavamālikā |
vibhīṣīṇīmālikā ca śāṃkārīvasumālikā || 41 ||

paṃkajadvayadhāriṇo muktāhāra samaprabhāḥ |
lokeśāṃnpūjayedativajrādyāstrāṇī tadvahiḥ || 42 ||

itthaṃ yomatodevīṃdhināsādhakomaḥ |
dhanyadhānyamṛddhīchīyamopnotyaniditāṃ || 43 ||

vakṣaḥ pramāṇe salīkhīmaṃtrabhorjapet trilakṣaṃ |
saṃyuto maṃtrī devīṃdhāyetvārkamaṃḍine || 44 ||

<p. 107b>

tasmīvarṇesalabhatemahadaiśvaryamakṣayaṃ vṣṇugeha |
savilasya mūlasvasya mūlamadhyāsthe maṃtravit || 45 ||

trilakṣaṃ prajapenmataṃ daśāṃśaṃ vilvapatrakai |
(**) madhuratrayuktai juhuyājātavedasai || 46 ||

(**) akṣayaṃ dharalodyaṃ prāptotyatraṃ śaṃsayaḥ |
aśoka vahū juhuyātatpuṣpaurājatolataulatoḥ || 47 ||

vaśayedacīrādevatrailomapī maṃtravīti |
juhuyātadvalaiḥ śuddhairayutaṃ trimadhuplutai || 48 ||

(***) rājaśrīyamadarīdropī mahīyate |
juhuyādvaidike vahnau tadvalergaughṛtahnūtaiḥ || 49 ||

saubhāgyaikanidhīrbhūtvā prāpnoti śrīryamūrjītāṃ vilvachāyāmadhivasa 
viṣṇvamīprahaviṣyabhūk saṃvatsaradvayaṃ hūtvā tatphalairathavāṃvujai ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatarahaṣyedāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
paṃcatrīṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 107b>

śrī bhagavāna uvāca 

dvādaśākṣaravidyāyā mahālakṣmyastataḥ paraḥ |
prakṣāmīmahārājakīcinmātmamīṣṭadaṃ || 1 ||

idirādvādaśārṇasya mahātmaṃ nṛpavakṣe |
teyasyāvijñānamātreṇa palāyaṃ mahāpadaḥ || 2 ||

(**) ādau trayī vījamuddhūtyādyavibhedanaṃ |
vātanaṃ vahnisamārūḍhaṃ vāmanetrāvibhūṣītaṃ || 3 ||

viṃdurādakālāṃkrāṃtaṃ vīduhīnaṃtadeva ca |
vasuṃdharākṣaraṃ paścādvāyuvaikuṃṭhasaṃyutaṃ || 4 ||

dvādaśāsvarasaṃyuktaṃ kṣetrapālākṣaraṃ tataḥ |
viṃduhinaramāvārṇa vaikuṃṭhavasudhākṣaraṃ paścā || 5 ||

mukhavṛttayutaṃ vyomadharītrīvījapyūthaṃ |
vāṇītaṃdrāvāyutaṃ mātṛkāṃtyarṇamavyatha || 6 ||

hṛdanvinabhīyaṃ vidyādvādaśārṇaśrīyaḥ smṛtā |
vedavedāṃtaśāstraughasārabhūtāsanātanī || 7 ||

mahāpālakasahasrīdārīdrādyavibhedadī |
sarvavidyā vibhedinī mahābhāgya samṛddhīdā || 8 ||

sarvasaubhāgyajananī sa kalāpannī vārīṇi |
sīddhavidyāmimāṃ prākūrmunayo brahmavādinaḥ || 9 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā japtāpīśatakoṭīśaḥ |
dvādaśārṇa mahālakṣmīrahitāniḥ sthūlāsmṛtāḥ || 10 ||

brahmarṣayoyi satataṃ tathā devarṣīyopī ca |
yogīnopi mahābhāgājīvamuktājīteṃdrīyāḥ || 11 ||

malālakṣmīkalāmahālakṣmīkalāvāhyai dvādaśārṇajapaṃti hi |
samastaṃ nivṛtyarthaṃ sarvasaṃpadavāptave || 12 ||

dvādaśarṇā mahājaptavyā sarvasīddhidā |
āyuyārārogyajananīmadropadravanāśīnī || 13 ||

samastāpanivṛtyarthaṃ sarvasaṃpadavāptaye |
dvādaśākṣarīvidyāsonāsarādhya brahmadarudrādayopi ca || 14 ||

<p. 108a>

acalaṃ mahadaiśvaryaṃ prāptavaṃtīpīdurlabhaṃ |
ṛṣīrvraṣṭhāsyaimaṃtrasya bhṛgurvāmunīsīsyate || 15 ||

āgataṃ chaṃdayuktaṃ chaṃda ānuṣṭābhatuṃ vā devatā 
sarvasaṃpatimāhāsāmrājyanyāpīkā |
mahālakṣmīrbhṛgusutāproproktānārāyaṇaprīyā śrīvījaṃ 
vījapītyuṃśaktinitirūdirītā |
trayīvījaṃ śrīyaṃ vījaṃvījamaṃtrasamīrīti śaktirnatiḥ samudīṣṭhātataḥ 
paścāt ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ ṣaṭdīrghayuktayālakṣavinyaset praṇavādyayā || 16 ||

catuṣpādedyadvābhyāṃ vinyasedvāṣaḍaṃgakaṃ |
ākarairavīrataṃ sahasrakāṃtimaruṇāmākalpamālojvalākṣmīśākasamāśrītāma(-)
bhayamīṣṭānnalakuṃbhaṃ śubhaṃ vībhrāṇāṃ kamalākararavīratāṃ 
varālakṛtāṃ lakṣmīsamaśrītedhīpadmānivāsanīṃ 
śrūjāṃvūnadābhāmādībhāsāṃ dīvyālaṃkānaśobhītāṃ 
divyalaṃdanaliptāṃgīdīvyapuṣpaśragatvitāṃśmītavaktrāṃ 
viśālākṣmīgarbhasamapramāramya viṃdumavīvāravīṣṭhī raktakaṃcukadhārīṇī 
svamurddhīmuktāralaughavarṣachatreṇaśobhītāṃ || 22 ||

cāmarābhyāṃ vijamātāṃ sakhībhīḥ parivārītāṃ |
sataptahemasākāśapītāṃvarayugāvṛtāṃ || 23 ||

mūlekalatarodivyaratnasiṃhāsaneśubhaṃ |
lasadvāmākanilayānāsīnasya jagatpateḥ || 24 ||

trailokyamātaraṃ vaṃdemahālakṣmītrayīmaṃtrī |
mahālakṣmīṃ bhagavatiṃ dhyātvātha mādarāt || 25 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā japahomaparāyaṇaḥ |
dvādaśāṇaṃ mahālakṣmyāśatamaṣṭādhīkaṃ japet || 26 ||

yujaye bhagavaddhāma vārṣonvityamīmāṃśrīyaṃ |
pratyekamathā lakṣmīsaṃpūjayenṛpaḥ || 27 ||

trikoṇaṃmaṣṭakoṇaṃ ca sūyatramataḥparaṃ |
caturddhāra samāyuktaṃ catusramataḥ paraṃ || 28 ||

āvādyatra śrīyaṃ yaṃtrepūjayedupacārakaiḥ |
āgnīsāśuravāyathāmadhyadikṣvaṃgapūjanaṃ || 29 ||

gādyatrīmapīsāvitrīpīsāvitrīmarcayecca |
sarasvati brāhmyādyā aṣṭakoṇeṣadīrghasvarṇavibhūṣītāḥ || 30 ||

 maheṃdrapramukhānaṣṭadikyānālaṣṭapātrake |
caturasrasyāṣṭadikṣuvajrādinyāyudhānīca || 31 ||

<p. 108b>

itthamāvaṇairyuktaṃ mahālakṣmīṃ harīprītya |
artayedrupacapācadyairupacārairattuttamai || 32 ||

maṃtrasyāsya samṛddharthamakalakṣaṃ japetpuraḥ |
daśāṃśatarpayedikṣurasenapayasāpivā || 33 ||

hūnet dvādaśa sahasraṃ paṃkajaṃ strīmahnutaimīthūnāṃ |
(****) sātāṃ sāgraṃ sṛṣṭānamapībho japet || 34 ||

ācāryacaraṇaṃbhojoniskasāhasramādarāt |
dadyāniskaṃśataṃ vāpī suvarṇakuṃḍalānītaṃ || 35 ||

athavā nityamācārya śuśrūṣaṇaparāyarā |
ācāryasannidhautiṣṭe vādyājītaṃmateṃdriyaḥ || 36 ||

prāpnoti mahatiṃ sīddhiṃ purāṇāmapīdurlabhāṃ dīkṣītaḥ || 38 ||

sīddhirtha dvādaśārṇāyāḥ puraścaraṇamācaret |
na navarātrābhīdhaṃ parvavarṣevarṣyemahattaraṃ || 39 ||

sīddhidaśarvavidyānāṃ prāhūnāgamapāraṇaḥ |
tatrālakṣīvidyānāmatrasīddhiṣeśataḥ || 40 ||

dvādaśārṇamahalakṣyāssiddhivaktuṃ na śakate |
ekaikaṃ divasattaravīparvasumaṃviduḥ || 41 ||

mahati navamī tatraccha ḍāmaṇīśataḥ prabhaḥ ekaikaṃ || 43 ||

tulāsupuruṣadānāśīphaladaṃ nātraśaṃpratipadimārabhyaḥ |
dvādaśāhasraṃ tatra ātharvaṇeritaṃ hṛdayaṃ kamalādevyaṃ hasrakaṃ 
dvādaśārṇaṃ mahāla apītatra mahāmate || 45 ||

japet aṣṭamyaṃ tathādarāt || 44 ||

śrīmadakṣarīvidyāṃ japedarkaśrūtirūpaphalapradaṃ || 46 ||

avaśaṃ prajapetyaṃ ca catvārīṃśatiśaṃkhyayā |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityamarcayt brahmavidyāyā || 47 ||

japasrīyāmayaparyaṃtaṃ puraścaraṇakarmaṇī ata urdhvaṃkṛtajāpe 
dadyāsadakṣīṇāṃśīśyāṃ |
parīcchahasamanvītaṃ rājaputrodhanyādyopīniskasāhasramarthayet || 69 ||

payasvīṃ savastāṃ ca dhenuṃ dadyāt sadakṣīṇāṃ muktāphalāmīratnāni saṃti |
cedguruverpayet sālagrāmaśīlādyānāṃ bhūdānaṃ ca dakṣīṇaṃ || 70 ||

<p. 109a>

godānamapīśayyāpādānamāvaśyakaṃ smṛtaṃ || 71 ||

mahādarīdraḥ kṛpaṇe bhavedyādi mahīpate niskatrayamīvāpīdadyādācāryadarpayoḥ 
tatrāyāyāśaktaputrīṃ |
varādyālakṣaṇaḥ saṃpūtāṃ pautrikanyakāṃdadyātsurāpāṃcasulakṣaṇāṃ || 73 ||

tayorabhoveputre ca patnyāsahitanvitaṃ |
ācāryacaraṇḍadvaṃdvaśuṣruṣaraṇaparo bhavet || 74 ||

ācāryapatnīsaṃpūjyā viśeṣādya śubhe nāraṃ |
kaharācitākādyalaṃkālaṃ kālaiśca vāsanā || 75 ||

bhojātavaśyaṃ tatra suvāsīnyo dṛḍhavratāḥ |
athavā na vijirbhājyāsuvāsīnyo dṛśavratā || 73 ||

athavā saṃpūjyāvāsobhīrbhohaṃ śakto dātāsyādamyahaṃ yataḥ |
itthaṃ tvāpuraścaryāṃ navarātre dṛḍhavrataḥ || 84 ||

ubhayo vidyayossīddhiṃ puraścaryāśatodbhavāṃ |
prāpnotyapībhṛpraśaṃśayaḥ nātra vidyate || 85 ||

neneṣṭamaścamemedhānāṃ sahasraṃ dakṣīṇānvitaṃ |
mahālakṣmīrbhagavate vā tasya trayī mayī || 86 ||

prasīdati na saṃdehassarvasiddhīsamanvītā |
tasmī saṃvatsare tasyā gṛhe ratnodyasaṃkulā || 87 ||

dhanadhānyādisaṃyuktā vasatyevā calāramāṇīmādi |
guṇaiśvryamayī tasyā śuddhīsiti || 88 ||

kṣīṇāyuḥ prāptamṛtyuśca mahorogahatopī ca |
nirāmayodīrādyusmatātu sukhaṃ medhate || 89 ||

nadhanemanayatnāvānaputrervāpī viyujyate |
śreyāṃśrīśalabhate nityakalyāṇānidīnedīne || 90 ||

muktāmuktānīratnānī dhanadhānyamathākṣayaṃ |
gajāsvāsīsamṛddhiśca navarātramṛtādbhavet || 91 ||

(**) puraṇakartvāyonavarātravṛteśubhe |
māmevartivijānīhīsṛddhīmaṃtraṃ jīteṃdrīyaḥ || 92 ||

ihayuktākhīlānbhogān daivatairapī durlabhān |
divyakanyāśatākīrṇaṃ sarvabhogasamṛddhita || 94 ||

vimānamadhīruhyāṃte kulasāhasrasaṃyutaṃ |
bhagavatsannidhautiṣṭhet sākṣādbhagatā || ||
samṛddhīsamṛddhistādaśī bhavet || 95 ||

<p. 109b>

sāṃgadakṣiyāyuktvāmekāmapīhīpatiḥ |
navarātravrate kṛtvā puraścaryāṃ yatavrataḥ || 96 ||

vidyāṃ mahatīsīddhiṃ prāpnotyayī sadurlabhāṃ |
navarātravrata samaṃnānyatsīddhīpadaṃ nṛpa || 97 ||

ekottaraṃ dhanaṃ dadyādathavācāryapādayoḥ |
navarātrenvahaṃ bhaktyāṃ navamyāṃ navaniskamaṃ || 98 ||

bhūdānasahitaṃ dadyātkuṃḍaladvitīyānvitaṃ |
yatheṣṭavidhīnā kṛtvā navarātravrataṃ śubhaṃ || 99 ||

vaṃśābhīvṛddhisahita ācaṃdrārkabhavatyasau |
svacchaṃdamaraṇau bhūtvā śrīyamaṣṭaguṇānvitāṃ || 100 ||

bhukte hasakalānbhojanāṃteyāti parāṃgatiṃ |
vāsaṃte navarātrepīkuryādītthaṃ vrataṃ śubhaṃ || 1 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvepīnāsāṃgāṃ ca dakṣīṇāṃ |
(*****) niskaṃ vā samarpyācāryadakṣīṇāṃ || 2 ||

vidyāsīddhīddhimavāpnoti saṃśayonā sa vidyate |
navarātravrataṃ sāṃgaṃ kṛtamāśvinamāsī caret || 3 ||

navarātravrataṃ śoyasyapuṃ bhavamācaret |
navarātravrataṃ sāṃgaṃ krīyate nāsvīneyadiyadī || 4 ||

navarātravrataṃ caitre sāṃgaṃ kuryāt tadvidhānataḥ |
sūtakepīnasaṃtyājaṃ navarātravṛtaṃ śubhaṃ || 5 ||

svācāryaṃ prārthayitvāpīkāryanavarātrakaṃ |
ācāryaputrairathavākārayedvidhināvrataṃ || 6 ||

navarātravṛtabhraṃśo yasya puṃśaḥ prajāyate |
tasya saṃvatsarehānirbhavīṣyati mahīpate || 7 ||

āśvīnīyadivighnaḥ syādvāsyaṃ tena navarātrakaṃ |
sāṃgadakṣiṇayāyuktamavarśaṃ vratamācaret || 8 ||

sarvatrāpī mahīdānaṃ catuvṛṣabhasaṃyutaṃ |
kartavyaṃ śreya icchadbhissāṃgadakṣīṇāṃ yāyukta || 9 ||

daśamīdīvase viṣṇunakṣatreṇadvaṃdvinīskaṃ |
(**********) vā svarṇamarpayet || 111 ||

(***) guruprasādobhoktavyaḥ svagṛhepī vā |
ekasmīndivase vāpīsīddhīdavamudhāpate || 12 ||

rahasyamapīvakṣāmīpuraścaramādarāt |
vaiśākheśrāvaṇe vāpīkīrtikemādyamāsi vā || 13 ||

puṣpe vā phālgune vā pītattantakṣatrasaṃyutā |
tattadvāsarasaṃyuktā paurṇamāsya bhavedyadi || 14 ||

<p. 110a>

caṃdreṣyagrahaṇaṃ tatra mahāphaladamīrītaṃ |
viśeśātsomavāreṇasahitaṃ caṃdraparvacet || 15 ||

caṃdracūḍāmaṇināmnāyogolabhyoyamīrītaḥ |
amāpīsomasīhitāyogaḥ padmaka ucyate || 16 ||

mahāpadmakayogotraravīparvabhavedyadivīṣeśāchrāvaṇemāsī vaiṣṇvartha 
samanvitaṃ || 17 ||

iṃduvāsarasaṃyuktaṃ somaparvabhavedyadi |
caṃdracūḍāmaṇīrcoyogolabhyoyaṃbhuvīrtudurlabhakaṃ ||

tathaiva pratyahaṃ lakṣmīdvādaśārṇajapedapī || 20 ||

parvakāletha saṃprāpte savituḥ śaśīnopī vā |
snānaṃ kuryātsparśakāle hṛdevāpī na jījale || 17 ||

keśavādi ca cuviṃśanāmnānimanasoccaran |
catuviṃśatidhā snātva vimuktaḥ pāparāśībhīḥ || 22 ||

ācāryaṃ sannīdhāṃ kṛtya vidhīvatsaṃskṛte nale |
śrīmaddaṣṭākṣareṇāditrīṃśataṃ hūyātilaiḥ || 23 ||

madhutrītayasaṃpṛktairgavyonājyenamīśrītaiḥ |
dvādaśārṇamahālakṣmīśuddhaṃgavyājyamādarāt || 24 ||

muktarthanāḍīparyaṃtaṃ homaṃ kuryāt dakṣīṇaḥ |
bhagavadraśmividyātiraikaikāmātiṃ hūnet || 25 ||

pradakṣīṇokṛtya tato jvalitaṃ jātavedasaṃ |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvesāṣṭhāṃganatipūrvakaṃ || 26 ||

sarvasvamaryayedvīmānbhagavadrūpasīddhaye |
atha dvādaśaniskaṃ cāpaṃ ca maniskamathāpī vā || 27 ||

trīniskaṃ vārpayet suvarṇaṃ niskamātraṃ vā tadardhvaṃ vā samarpayet || 29 ||

yugmadvākaṃ bhojyaṃ mṛṣṭā sarvasvadvimān vitalo bhavivarjītaḥ 
śālagrāmaśīlāmekāṃ pustakaṃ ca samarpayet |
ekālaṃkaraṇaṃ vāpī gurupatnyai samarpayet suvarṇaṃniskamṛṣṭāntairdakṣīṇanviteḥ 
ācāryādāśīkhaḥ prāpyasvamyaṃmūnyītavāgyataḥ || 30 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyādvādaśārṇaśriyopī ca |
mahatiṃ sīddhimāpnoti devānāṃmapīdurlabhāṃ || 32 ||

<p. 110b>

ravīṃ dvaparvamātrepīpuraścaryāmīmāṃ śubhāṃ |
kṛtvā sīddhimāpnoti śāśvatī nātra saṃśayaḥ || 33 ||

caṃdracūmaṇauyogeravīcūḍāmaṇautuvāra |
itthaṃkartuḥ puraścaryāṃ sīddhivaktuṃ na śakyate || 34 ||

yadi cūṇāmaṇīyogo labhyate bhūtale nṛpa |
tatra kartupuraścaryāṃ sīddhivaktuṃ na śa || 34 ||

yadi cūḍāmaṇīrgo labhyate bhūtate nṛpa |
tatra kartuḥ puraścaryāṃ puraścaryā śatodbhavaḥ || 35 ||

jāyeti mahati sīddhīdaivatirapīdurlabhā |
śrīśrīśānugrahātrasyatrapautādyaipaśuratnā || 36 ||

sīdhyatyeva mahālakṣmīdhanadhānyādi saṃkulāni |
rāma yathā puṣpaṃ cīraṃjīvanahenatukaṃ || 37 ||

samṛddhiḥ putravarṣātmāgaivadūrlabhādi saṃyutā vācāṃ sīddhiṃ |
kavitvādyāsīddhiḥ kavitvādyāsīddhitvaiva na saṃśayaḥ || 38 ||

śreyorāśībhavetyasya niraṃtaramathākṣayaṃ |
bhagavatyadamaṃtesyādaśapūrverdaśāvarai || 39 ||

bhārgavavāsare prāpte satataṃ saṃsitivrataḥ |
prātaḥ prātvā viśuddhātmā gāyatrīṃ triṃśataṃ japet || 40 ||

arcayet patrapuṣpaiśca śrīśrīśaubrahmavidyayā |
mithūnātriyaṃ tu bhojyaṃ mīthūnadvitiyaṃ tu vā || 144 ||

ekaṃ vāmīthūnaṃ bhojyaṃ mṛṣṭānmairdakṣīṇānvitaiḥ |
ācāryapatnīṃmāsādibhārgavevāsare vrati || 45 ||

samarcayītvā vidhīnāśaṃdhapuṣyādibhīrnṛpa |
niskaṃniskādharmekaṃ vā svarṇaṃ tasyai samarpayet || 46 ||

pradadyādapīmṛṣṭānatāṃ dhūlaṃ dakṣīṇānvitaṃ |
ācāryapatnyasānnidhye bhavatsannidhau nṛpa || 47 ||

<p. 111a>

sannidhau manasācāryaheste vā svarṇamarpayet |
tatputrāyātha vā dadyātatyautrāyātharvārpayet || 48 ||

avasyamāsīmāsītthamāghe bhārgavivāsare |
kṛtvā samastavāre supūjyamīthūnānyatha || 49 ||

dakṣīṇāmīśca daṣṭānmaivarṣyavāvarṣapaṃcakaṃ |
kuryādivyaṃ vṛdhimānyāvajjīvamathā vā || 50 ||

vṛbhuguvāravratamanyatravitte bhṛguvāra kṛtaṃ kṛtvā |
ramāmaraṇabrahmabhaṃ na patnyā vā na putrai vā na yujyeta vaṃdhubhīḥ || 51 ||

atha yuṃmadahaiśvaryaṃ dhanadhyānyādi saṃkulaṃ |
muktāmaṇīgaṇākīrṇaṃ gajavājīrathākulaṃ || 52 ||

saṃprāpyaciramāyūṣmaṃ mahadārogyamakṣayaṃ |
mānuṣānapīdīvyāṃśca bhogānāpnoti śāśvatāścatān || 53 ||

maṃdabhāgyopyanonāśuka tena jagatipate |
kalyāṇaṃ jagatinityaṃ nītyaḥ śreyaḥ parāṃ parāṃ || 54 ||

nityānaṃdamayasā aṣṭārṇa dvādaśārṇābhyāṃ |
(********) keśavasya śrīyopī ca || 56 ||

pratyejaṃ juhūyādājyaṃ gavyaṃ trīṣatamādarāt |
bhagavadṛśmī vidyābhīkṣādaṃte brahmaṇilīyate hūtvaikaikāmathyate hūtiṃ || 57 ||

jayet paṃcaśataṃ brahmavidyayāte vighnapatraikaiḥ |
kumudhaimairvāpī bhojayedyugma paṃcakaṃ || 58 ||

niskatrayaṃ dvīvāniskalabhīskaṃmekamathāpī |
ācāryapatnyaṃ datvāthasīddhiṃ prāpnotyathāthā || 59 ||

bhṛguvāravṛtamīdaṃ mahadatyaṃtavāhanaṃ |
śreyaskāmasmadākuryāṃ brahmasāyujyasīddhidaṃ || 60 ||

yogeṣu ca vyatipāto vāreṣu bhṛguvāsaraḥ |
dvāvevatārakauloke sarvāmadbhyo nīraṃtaraṃ || 61 ||

vyatiprāpte svācāryājñāpurujñāpurassaraṃ |
samastanyāsasahitāṃ śatādhīka sahasrakaṃ || 62 ||

<p. 111b>

śrīmadaṣṭākṣīrī japtvā dvādaśārṇāmayiśriyaḥ |
śatādhika sahasraṃ ca prajaptvā saṃskṛtenale || 63 ||

triśātaṃ juhuyādājyaṃ śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā |
(********) śrīmadaṣṭottaraṃ hūnet || 64 ||

ācārya tathaikaṃgāṃtanmūlyaṃ vā samarpayet |
niskamekṛtarpa vā samarpacāryapādayoḥ || 65 ||

yamīthūnatrīyaṃ bhojyaṃ pāyasānnaṃ sadakṣīṇaṃ |
vyatipāteti kṛthvemāmekaṃ vāsarevratataṃ || 66 ||

śrīśrīśavidyayoḥ soddhiprāpnoti mahatiṃmapī |
mucyate mahāpāpaiścadāruṇaiḥ || 67 ||

āyuṣyaṃ haradāruṇaidhanadhānadhānyādisaṃkulaṃ |
avalaṃ mahadaiśvaryaṃ yogaṃ cāṣṭāṃgasaṃyutaṃ || 68 ||

aśrutānāṃ pranatkṛtvaṃ vidyānāṃ ca mahīyate |
saṃprāpya cākṣayaṃ saukhyāṃ dehāṃte bhagavatyadaṃ || 69 ||

kulasāhasrahitasmaṃ prāpnoti na saṃśayaḥ |
śrīddhīdaśārṇamaṃtreṇa juhuyādaruṇāṃvujaiḥ || 70 ||

vasuvṛṣṭimavāpnoti parāmāsābhyāṃtare nṛpa |
vailaiḥ phalairhunedyastu sahasratritayaṃ śuciḥ || 71 ||

vidyānāmadhiyo bhūtvā saṃprāpnotyakṣayāṃ śriyaṃ |
akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāmācāryājñā purassara ||  ||

punasasyaphalairvījarahitaistrīmadhūlyūtai |
sthūlairgavyaghṛtābhyaktai(-)jvalītavaidasai || 74 ||

triśatādhi sāhasraṃ śīmadaṣṭārṇāvidyāyā |
hūtvā śrīdvādaśārṇaśetriśataṃ jūhuyādvṛtaṃ || 74 ||

 kuryādāhūyatimaikaikāṃgabhavadraśmībhīghṛtaiḥ |
arcayaitrīśataṃ puṣpaiḥ patraibrahmavidyayā hūtvā || 75 ||

ācāryapādayoniskadvādaśakaṃ dhanaṃ |
triniskamathavā datvā gurupatnyai tataḥ param || 76 ||

tāṭaṃkābharaṇaṃ vāpīvāliyugmamathāpīvi |
ciṃtākābharaṇaṃ vāpīniskaṃvārthaṃ tadardhakaṃ || 77 ||

<p. 112a>

datvā suvāsinīḥ paṃcabrāhmaṇānapī bhojayet |
ācāryādāṣīśaḥ prāpyalakṣmīśavīdyayogamaṣṭāṃgasīhītaṃ lakṣmī || 78 ||

akṣayāṃ mahatīṃ sīddhīṃ prāpnotyatra na samśayaḥ |
akṣayaṃ mahadaiśvaryaṃ dhanaratnaughasaṃkulai || 79 ||

saubhāgyamokṣadīrghaṃ māyurārogyamathayaṃ |
athayaṃ yogamaṣṭāṃgasahitaṃ putrapautrakai || 80 ||

sahitāmakṣayāmṛddhiprāthyabhogāṃścadurabhān |
jātismaraściraṃ bhūtvā yāti viṣṇoḥ paraṃ padaṃ || 81 ||

phalairāmrobhavaiḥ pakvairmadhutritayasaṃdyutauḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtreṇahutvāṃ triśatamādarāt || 82 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā dvādaśārṇema ca śriyaḥ |
ghṛtenāhutimekaikākṛtvā śrīpatiraśmibhiḥ || 83 ||

vaiśākhemāsi kṛṣṇayāmekādaśyāmidaṃ vrataṃ |
kṛtvācāryadadvāṃdveniṣkadritayadakṣiṇaṃ || 84 ||

kṛtottha kalasāhasradviśārtadviśata tu vā |
samarpya tatpareṣuścabhojayenmithunāniva || 85 ||

itthaṃ kṛtvā mahābhāgyaprāmotthakṣaya sa padaḥ |
sabhāsupūjyatasarvabhūpālānāṃ ca sannidhau || 86 ||

putrapautravatīmṛdviprāṃthyāṃte muktibhāgbhavet |
śrīmadaṣṭvārṇavidyāyāvidyāśrīdvādaśākṣarī || 87 ||

iyameva pradhānāṃgabhūtotkāparamārṣibhiḥ |
devatāpitṛkāyaiṣu saṃbhojyāḥ paḍiyāvanāḥ || 88 ||

sādhyarāva suvāsindhassaṃbhojyā ca sudhāyāti |
ehiyāva naciprāgyānpravakṣyāmī mahīyate || 89 ||

nityaṃ sahasragāyatrījjapakartā mahītale |
pubhāti paṅktisāhasraṃ dvijānāmapi pāpinā || 90 ||

rudrajāyarato nityaṃ vimuktassarvapātakaiḥ |
phunātyasauyaṅdhiśatapayipāpātmamānṛpa || 91 ||

<p. 112b>

nipaṃcadhāprajapannanvahaṃ paṅktiśataṃ sāgraṃ punātyapi || 194 ||

vīrajāmaṃtraniratīnityaṃ dvādaśadhāśuciḥ |
brahmabhūtaḥ paṅkti śatamapi nityaṃ punātyasau || 195 ||

catuhaut mahāpraśnaniratonvahamādarāt |
apipaṅktiśataṃ sāgramassainityaṃ punātihi || 196 ||

japantuniṣatpraśrayathāśatmādine dine |
brahmabhūtaḥ paṅktiśatayāvamosaubhavatyapi || 177 ||

yāvamāniṃ japannityaṃ paṃcadhānvahamādarāt |
punāti paṃkti sāhasramapi nityaṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 198 ||

japa na śuddhavatīrnityamaṣṭottaraśataṃ pumān |
punāti paṅkti sāhasrāmapithāyavatāḥmasau || 199 ||

na strīṇāṃ maṃtrasaṃskāraḥ yāvanatvādihetukaḥ |
sādhitvāmevanārīṇāṃ pavitratvādikāraṇaṃ || 200 ||

ye paṅktipāvanāḥ proktā śuddhāḥ pāyavivarjitāḥ |
tebhya eva sadādeyaṃ daivepitrye ca karmaṇi || 201 ||

aśretriyebhyo viprebhyo dajaṃ ca dhanamakṣayaṃ |
bhasmānīvahutaṃ vyarthaṃ bhavatvatra na saṃśayaḥ || 202 ||

apātrabhūtotghanadhītavedaḥ pratigrahenādhikārosyadāne |
aśrotriyebhyaḥ pradadātiyosauvyarthaṃ bhaventasya sarvaṃ hi dānaṃ || 203 ||

kiṃ cārkaputrasya puresadyoreśapnoti duḥkhaṃ narakaughamagraḥ |
anmaṃ pradatvāpyānadhīta vipre prāprotyathāṃte narakusṭhaghoraṃ || 204 ||

aṣṭhaśaucavratācāre vipre vedavivarjite |
rohitpannaṃ dīpāmānaṃ kiṃ mayāduḥhṛtaṃ kṛtaṃ || 205 ||

tasmādavaśyāṃ viprāgryāssatataṃ paṅktipāvanāḥ |
ācchādanairbhojanādyaiḥ pūjyā eva samṛddhaye || 206 ||

yahi pāvana sāhasradarpyācāryādhikaḥ smṛtaḥ |
svarṇaṃ cihuṃkamātraṃ vāhutamācāyaryādayoḥ || 207 ||

merutulyaṃ bhavatyaṃte brahmasāyujyasiddhidaṃ |
śrīdvādaśārṇasahitāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīśubhā || 208 ||

prajapennityamekāgraḥ paṅktisāhasrapāvanaḥ |
ālārpacaraṇadvaṃdvedajasarvasvadakṣiṇaḥ || 209 ||

ṣaṣṭhīśanamitasyāpidātādravyasya bhūyate |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāṃ dvādaśārṇepi cāśriyaḥ || 210 ||

japahomādinirataḥ paṅktipāvanapāvanaḥ |
sa eva brahmavidyegītigrahānugrahakṣamaḥ || 211 ||

<p. 113a>

nārāyaṇātmābhagavānsohameva na saṃśayaḥ |
tameva pūjayennityaṃ ratnairathairenekaśaḥ || 212 ||

tatsamonahiviprostisvargemartyerasānale |
paścimaṃ nahiyajjanmanabhavedyomadaśajaḥ || 213 ||

tasya nācārya pādābje dṛḍhābhaktiḥ prajāpate |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvadṛḍhabhaktairnirataraṃ || 214 ||

śrīmadaṣṭhārṇavidyāyāṃ śu(*)yāmanvahaṃ ratiḥ |
dvādaśākṣiravidyāyāṃ mahālakṣmyāssadāratiḥ || 215 ||

bhagavadraśmividyāsuratiranvahamādarāt |
śuddhakaivalyasahitapaścimaṃ janmanatsmṛtaṃ || 216 ||

dvādaśārṇāmahālakṣmīmāhātmyamadyanāśanaṃ |
itite kathirtalakṣmīhṛdayasyātha kathyate || 217 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye 
dāśarathīyetmreṃvedārthasaṃgrahe ṣaṭtriṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 113a>

śrīśivāya namaḥ 

śrībhagavānuḥvaca 

sāmrājyalakṣmīvidyāyāmahātmyaṃ vasudhāyato |
ataḥ paraṃ pracākṣyāmi sāvadhānamanāḥ śūṇḍa || 1 ||

trayīvījaṃ samuccārva śrīrudvāṃ bhuvaneśvarīṃ |
vyajanādyamathādvratyavaikuṃṭākṣaramapyathā || 2 ||

śūvarṇaṃ rudrasahitaṃ brahmavījamataḥ paraṃ |
brahmavījaṃ mahīvījaṃ mukhavṛtavibhūṣitaṃ || 3 ||

vāghamekāśaśaprataṃ maruddhottamataḥ paraṃ |
prasīdayugalaṃ yaścādvrāṃtaṃ vahni samanvitaṃ || 4 ||

vāmākṣi viṃdusahitaṃ vyomavahnisamanvitaṃ |
caturthasvaraviṃdvāṣyamaṃtastha paṃcamaṃ tataḥ || 5 ||

jātaveda samārūḍhaṃ viḍayuktamataḥ paraṃ |
aṃtasthādyāmathoccārya śivaṃ dīrghavibhūṣitaṃ || 6 ||

vasudhā kṣetrapālaṃ ca vāyuvaikuṃṭhabhūṣitaṃ |
savitṛsvarasaṃyuktaṃ tadapaṃcasamuddharet || 7 ||

sāmrājyalakṣmīviṣeyamuktāsakalakāmadhuk |
samastapāyasaṃ hatrīsarvādhivyādhibhaṃjanī || 8 ||

ramāhādādihyadamanīduḥkhasaṃghavibhedinī |
lakṣmīhṛdayanāghrīyaṃ vidyāsakalasiddhida || 9 || 

prabhūṇāṃ hṛdayajāturyayāsokhye dine dine |
tathaiva lakṣmīihṛdayajāturnityasukhaṃ bhavet || 10 ||

trailokyapātuḥ sāmrājyaśriyothṛyamiṣṭhadaṃ |
jñātvaitannpatrasaṃdehe nityaṃ kalyāṇabhāgasau || 11 ||

<p. 113b>

vidyeyaṃ sarvasāmrājyamahāsiṃhāsanaśvarī |
āyurārogyajananī sarvopadravaghātinī || 12 ||

sarvasaṃpakarī sarvaduḥkhadāridramedinī |
satataṃ suprasanneyaṃ mahālakṣmīḥ phalapradā || 13 ||

hrīśvalakṣmīścate palyāṃ vitipuṃsūkra iriṃta |
tasmāttribhuvaneśānīvījaṃ śrīvījamapyatha || 14 ||

yadvidyāṃtargataṃ sākṣātprasīdeti padadvayaṃ |
tasmaditatsamāvidyāna dṛṣṭā kutracit kvacit || 15 ||

saubhāgyajananī loke samastaiśvryanāyikā |
aṇimādi guṇaiśvaryavradā kaivalyasiddhidā || 16 ||

durvāsasaḥ purāśāyahataḥ sarvāmaraprabhuḥ |
vidyomenāṃ samārādhyā prāhmavāmacalāṃ śriyaṃ || 17 ||

kuveropi purārādhyapulastyasyasyopadeśataḥ |
abhūtsamastavitānāṃ nāyakaḥ prabhurīśvaraḥ || 18 ||

sṛṣṭisthityupasaṃhārakāyaiṣu jagatāmāyi |
brahmaviṣṇumaheśādyairapi sarvatrapūjitā || 19 ||

devatāyatyamiṃdreṇa prāptamasyājayātpurā |
agninādāhaśakṣitvaṃ nipatṛtvayamena ca || 20 ||

toyaiśvaryavārūṇena vā paryavāyunā padaṃ |
asyā evopāsanayā prāptaṃ pūrvaṃ mahātmabhiḥ || 21 ||

yasyanopaścimaṃ janmasvayaṃ nārāyaṇo na cet |
lakṣmītdayanāśnīyaṃ mahāvidhāna labhyate || 22 ||

svānvapavyāpinīṃ lakṣmīmāścaṃdrārkamabhīpsatā |
lakṣmīhṛdayanāśrīyaṃmahāvidyānalabhyate || 22 ||

svānvadyavyāpinīṃ lakṣmīmācaṃdrārkamabhīpsatā |
lakṣmītadapavidheyaṃ japtavyā vaśyamanvahaṃ || 23 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ dehaprāṇadhanairapi |
sevyaṃ bhajavānvahaṃ paścādvidyā śrīt dayāmidhā || 24 ||

ādareṇaivajasatataṃ śreya dacchatā alpa |
śrīkāmibhirviprairnajapyeyaṃ mahīyate || 25 ||

maheṃdrapurasāmrājyaśripamicchatyatavrataḥ |
japedetāṃ mahāvidyāṃ mahāsiṃhāsateśvarīṃ || 26 ||

alakāpurasāmrājyalakṣmīmicchadbhirādarāt |
lakṣmītadapavidyeyaṃ jahmavyāvasyamanvahaṃ || 27 ||

kimatra kahunoktena sārvabhaumatvamicchatā |
jasavyāvahuśonityaṃ vidyeyaṃ sarvasiddhīdā || 28 ||

gaṃdharvayakṣasiddhānāṃpisācauṇarakṣasāṃ |
ādhipatyaṃ ca devānāmicchatāni yatātmanā || 29 ||

sāmrājyalakṣmīvidyeyaṃ prajaptavyā dine dine |
sāmrājyalakṣmīvidyepaṃjapyate yena nityaśaḥ || 30 ||

<p. 114a>

āsalakṣmīḥ kalahādhātā tadgāmepi na saṃvaset |
bhūmau samastabhūpānāṃ sannidhāvanimānyatāṃ || 31 ||

icchatānityaśojapyāsādhakenapatātmanā |
yojanānāṃ sahasraṃ vā gatvācāryapadadvaye || 32 ||

sarvasvamapi datvā vā śarīramapi kanyakā |
saṃsevyavahudharṣaṃ ca vidhāmenāṃ śriyonṛpa || 33 ||

gṛhṇīyādbhagavadrayasi dvaye śrīsamṛddheye |
rājyalakṣmī mahāvidyāpradātaivamahānpitā || 34 ||

mātābhrātāguruḥsvāmīsvācāryobhagavānapi |
etatkālevarāṃtepitamācāryaṃ na hityajet || 35 ||

lakṣmīhṛdayavidhāyāḥ prabhāvaṃ varṇituṃ mayā |
na śakyate mahīyālasastravadanairapi || 36 ||

lakṣmīhṛdayavidyāyāḥ pradātārāgurūṃ vibhuṃ |
sākṣānmāmevajānī hi sarvajñatyādilakṣaṇaṃ || 37 ||

tyaktvā ca pitarauyotmīputrannānnādikānapi |
ācāryameva satataṃ pūjayet sarvavastubhiḥ || 38 ||

ācāryatoṣaṇānityaṃ yathātuṣṭo bhavāmyahaṃ |
na tathāvāti medhyānāṃ sahasreṇāpi bhūyate || 39 ||

ācārya eva bhagavānbrahmāviṣṇurmaheśvaraḥ |
tato ṣaṇena saṃtuṣṭaṃ trailokyaṃ sacarācaraṃ || 40 ||

ācāryārādhanaṃ nityaṃ bhogasvargāpavargadaṃ |
āvāyārādhanaṃ hatvā manovāpkāryakarmabhiḥ || 41 ||

lakṣmīhṛdayayidyeye japyate yadi bhūtale |
tasya lakṣmīyatirlakṣmyāsahanityaṃ prasīdati || 42 ||

pādukāsiddhivetālaguṭhikāṃjanasiddhayaḥ |
asyā ārādhanenāśusaṃsidhyaṃti mahītale || 43 ||

siddhayoṣṭhāṇimādyāścaśaṃkhādinidhayopi ca |
tadgahadvāritiṣṭaṃti satataṃ kiṃ karāivi || 44 ||

dakṣaḥ prajāpatiḥ pūrvaṃ bhagavānbrahmanaṃdanaḥ |
rudrākrodhāgninādagdhaḥ punaḥ prācetasobhavet || 45 ||

ācāryārāghanaṃ kṛtvā vidyāmenāmavāpya ca |
trailokyasvargakaraṇasāmarthyaṃ ca parāṃ śriyaṃ || 46 ||

avāpya sumahādbhāgyaṃ maṃtrasyāsyā prabhāvataḥ |
yameya trilokānāṃ mātāsarvatrapīmayī || 47 ||

samastavidyāsāmrājñī sarvasaṃyatsamṛddhidā |
yoginopi mahānāgāmunayopiyatavratā || 48 ||

japaṃtī mā mahāvidyāmaṣṭaiśvarya samṛddhaye |
aśvamegha samoyāgo vidyate vejjagattraye || 49 ||

kṣmīhṛdayamaṃtreṇa sadṛśonyomamyurbhavet |
pārijātena sadṛśo vidyate yadi bhūruha || 50 ||

<p. 114b>

lakṣmīhṛdayamaṃtreṇa samākumanurnṛpa |
gaṃgāsnānasahasrāṇi vājimedhaśatāni ca || 51 ||

asyāḥ sahajjapaphalamayidātuṃ na śayuḥ |
sarvalokasya sāmrājyamapyayodhyāpuraśriyaṃ || 52 ||

śaktāpradātu vidyaiṣāṃ jāyakasya na saṃśayaḥ |
ciṃtāmaṇimayaṃgahamapiralauthasaṃkulaṃ || 53 ||

śaktāpradātuṃ vithiṣāthayākhyā śriyo nṛpa |
kalpadrumagaśānvāpi pārijātavanānyapi || 54 ||

kāmadhonu sāhasraṃ vājāyakasya pramacchati |
padyācārya haṭhābhaktiyāmvajjīvaṃ mahīpate || 55 ||

kaṃdarpaśatasaubhāgyāmajarāmaratāpi ca |
asyā ārādhanenāśusidhyalpasya na saṃśayaḥ || 56 ||

ācāryavaryasya kṛpāmavāpya sāmrājyalakṣmīhṛdayaprajāpī |
kaṃdarpasāhasrasamānakīrtitejasvitāṃ dhārmikatāṃ ca nityaṃ || 57 ||

āyuṣyamārogyapaśobhikṛdviṃdhanaṃ ca dhānyaṃ gajavājiyuktaṃ |
avāpya divyānapi mānuṣāṃśca bhogānathāṃte bhagavanmayaḥ syāt || 58 ||

jātismaraḥ syājjarapāyihīnaḥ svacchaṃdamṛtyuḥ subhagodharitryāṃ |
bhūtvā maheṃdrapratimānalakṣmīmavāpyamuktothā bhavatyavaśyaṃ || 59 ||

ācāryapādābjapuṇarcanenaniraṃtaraṃ śrīhṛdayaprajāyāt |
samastasiddhairapi pūjito sau prāpnotyaśeṣānapivāṃchitārthān || 60 ||

sāmrājyalakṣmīhṛdayākhyavidyāsamastaduḥkhaudyavimuktihetuḥ |
samastasaṃpatsamavāsiheturnānyāstivedeṣu purāṇasaṃghe || 61 ||

vaśiṣṭabhāvannimaharṣimukhyāḥ sureśaviteśamukhāścadevāḥ |
sāmrājyalakṣmīhṛdayaṃ prajaptvā kṛtārthatāmāpusnutamāṃ ca || 62 ||

sāmrājyalakṣmīhṛdayapraprājāpīsiddhādhiyassarvasurādhiyaśca |
sa eva sākṣājjagatāṃvidhātā nārāyaṇo sau bhagavān śivātmā || 63 ||

sāmrājyalakṣmīhṛdayajñamiṃdravinnaimatopeśamukhāścedevāḥ |
ācāryavataṃ paripūjayaṃti datvā samastānapi vīchitārthān || 64 ||

<p. 115a>

sāmrājyālakṣmīhṛdayaprajāpī'gajāśvaralaughayutaṃ sāmyadvaṃ |
aiśvaryamakṣapyāmavāpyamavāpyapaścānnārāyaṇātmābhagavaṃtamiti || 65 ||

sāmrājyalakṣmīvidyāyāmāhātmyamapi bhūyate |
dakṣiṇamūrtināgītamarhaṣīṇāṃ ca sannidhau || 66 ||

ayatsamudraṃ durvāraṃtartumicchanmahītele japet |
sāmrājyākamalāhṛdayākhyāṃ mahāmanuṃ || 67 ||

gaṃgāpravāhavadvāvāmaiśvaryakavinādikaṃ |
putrapautrādisahitāsamṛddhirdhanasaṃkulā || 68 ||

anekakoṭimātaṃgururaṃgarathasaṃkulā |
jarāmaraṇarāṃhityemahadārogyamakṣayaṃ || 69 ||

lakṣmīhṛayavidyāyājaye naivāśu sidhyati |
lakṣmīhṛdayavidyāyājapahomatātmabhiḥ || 70 ||

ācāryapatnī saṃpūjyā viśeṣadivase nṛpa |
bhṛguvāre ca puṣpārkagrahaṇādiṣu parvasu || 71 ||

vyatīpāte madvāyoge navarātravratādiṣu |
vāsobhirapyalaṃkārairgurupatnīsamarcanāt || 72 ||

lakṣmīhṛdayavidyāyami vetsidhiranutamā |
caṃdracūḍāmarṇoyogeravicū.āmaṇāvepi || 73 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇeyogeyoge puṣkaranāmake |
arddhodayābhidheyogejapahomādikaṃ śubhaṃ || 74 ||

prasannalakṣmīvidyāyāviśeṣeṇayatavrataṃ |
kṛtvācārya priyāyaścāddarvapitvā vibhūṣaṇaiḥ || 75 ||

mahātīṃ siddhimāpnoti devānāmapi durlabhāṃ |
rājyapradāyarājñe vā prāṇadāyāyivaṃdhave || 76 ||

lakṣmīhṛdayavidyeyaṃ na deyā vasudhāyate |
lakṣmihṛdayavidyāyāṃ siddhayāṃ vasudhāyate || 77 ||

maheṃdrādyaṣṭhadikālaśrīrapyasyagṛhevaset |
yadicchedātmanaḥ śreyasiddhimatyaṃ tadurlabhāṃ || 78 || 

nāstikāya ca mūrkhāyalubdhāyapiśunāya ca |
pitṛmātṛgurudrohakāriṇe vā'thakāriṇe || 79 ||

śrautācāravihīnāya aṣṭāyāpi svavaṃdhane |
prasannalakṣmīvidyeyaṃ na dātavyāmahīte || 80 ||

yadīdaśāyajaṣṭāya vidyāsyati pradāsyati |
parāmukhosya bhagavānmahālakṣmī samanvitaḥ || 81 ||

vedāssakalamaṃtrāśca bhavaṃtyasya parāṅmukhā |
atyaṃtadāruśāśāyaṃ pradāsyati jagatpatiḥ || 82 ||

<p. 115b>

tasmātparīkṣasidhyāyāvidyāralamimaṃ śriyaḥ |
ācaryeṇa pradātavyaṃ śubhemāliśubhedine || 83 ||

parastrīniratoduṣṭaḥ paradravyāpahāraka |
ācāryasya sakṛddhyāṃyimidhyābhāṣaṇa tatparaḥ || 84 ||

vedarnidāparonityaṃ yāgarnidāparastayā |
pinarnidāparo nityaṃ mūrkha ācāryarnidakaḥ || 85 ||

arthalubdhaḥ krodhaśīlaḥ kāmukaḥ śrutivarjitaḥ |
parityabjedamūnaśiṣyānapi srvasvadāyakān || 86 ||

parīkṣyaṇḍaviraṃ kālaṃ śīlaṃ sarvāduṇānapi |
prasannalakṣmīvidyeyaṃ dātavyātaḥ paraṃ śubhā || 87 ||

navabhāgaśiroratnadviguṇīkṛtarociṣaḥ |
prasannalakṣmīvidyāyājapakartāramanvahaṃ || 88 ||

prayacchaṃtopi sarvasvaṃtaṃ sevaṃte nareśvarāḥ |
asurāṇī ca rājyaśrīḥśakrūṁaṃ ca durātmanāṃ || 89 ||

prasannalakṣmīkṛpāvināyāsaṃ ca sidhyati |
vedavedāṃga tatvajñodharmaśāstreṣuniṣṭitaḥ || 90 ||

prasantalakṣmīkūpayābhavatyāmunasaṃśayaḥ |
iyaṃ samastavidyānāṃ sāmrājñī sarvasiddhidā || 91 ||

satyameva mayoktuṃte viśvāsaṃ kuru bhūyate |
iti dāśarathīyesmintaṃśrevedārthasaṃgrahe || 

saptanniśomayodhyāya uktoyaṃ śrīsamṛddhidaḥ |

[iti śrīmadanugrarabrahmanatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthaṃsaṃgrahe sa 
satriṃśodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 115b>

śrībhagavānuvāca || 

prasannalakṣmīvidyāyāssadhanaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ |
śṛṇu rājanmahīpālayacchatvāmucyate nṛpa || 1 ||

brāhmemuhūrte utthāya saṃsmṛtyācāpaṃ pādukāṃ |
saṃdhyoyāstiṃ tataḥ kṛtvā nityahomaṃ samāpya ca || 2 ||

pramaṃpraṇamyasvācāryabhagavadrūpiṇaṃ vibhuṃ |
prāṇānāyamyamūle nagāpatryāvātridhānṛpa || 3 ||

kuvītajapasaṃkulyaṃ śrīśrīśaptītayottataḥ |
ṛṣirbrahmāsyamaṃtrasya trailokyādhimatirvibhuḥ || 4 ||

dakṣaḥ prajāpatiḥ kaiściṛṣiruktomaharṣibhiḥ |
chaṃdogāyatramityuktamahāsiṃhāsaneśvarī || 5 ||

samastasayaṃ sāmrājyanāyikā bhagavatpriyā |
devatoktājaganmātāmahālakṣmīstrayīmayī || 6 ||

dvitīyacātṛtī(-)paṃcavījaśktīkramānnṛpa |
praṇavaṃkīlakaṃ prāhurathāṃgāni pravinyaset || 7 || 

<p. 116a>

kamalehṛdayaṃ proktaṃ śiraḥ paṃcākṣerairathā |
śikhāyāṃ ca prasīdeti kavacaṃ ca tribhirnyaset || 8 ||

netramastraṃ nyaset paścānnivījasahitaiḥ |
pṛthak aṃgulīnyāsamarpyaṃ kuryādbhapālasādhakaḥ || 9 ||

amṛtāṃvunirdhemadhyeraladvīyemanohare |
kalpadumasamākīrṇepārijātavamāvṛt || 10 ||

tanmadhye maṃḍape svarṇadivyaralamaye śubhe |
pārijātatarormūle navarātravinirmite || 11 ||

divyasiṃhāsaneramye samāsīnaṃ jagatpatiṃ |
divyākalpaśatākīrṇakālāṃbhodharasannibhaṃ || 12 ||

śaṃkhacakragadāpadmalasadvāhucatuṣṭayaṃ |
śrīvatsavakṣaṃsaṃdivyapītāṃvaradharaṃ vibhuṃ || 13 ||

prasannavadanaṃtaṃ padmapatranirbhekṣaṇaṃ |
tasyotsaṃgesamāsīnāṃte pūjāvūnadaprabhāṃ || 14 ||

vālārkāyutasaṃkāśāṃ japākusumasannibhī |
vilasatyamarāgādi divyaratnavinirmitaṃ || 15 ||

mukuṭaṃ vibhratīṃ mūrddhnivālārkaśatasanninibhāṃ |
atha sīmaṃta siṃdūrasahitāṃ caṃcalālikāṃ || 16 ||

prasannavadanīkarṇanāṭakābharaṇānvitāṃ |
muktāratnasamāyuktavālīyugalaśobhitāṃ || 17 ||

padmapatraviśālākṣīmaṃjanāṃcitalocanāṃ |
kāmakodaṃḍasaṃkāśabhūdvayena virājitāṃ || 18 ||

lalāṭapaṭṭasaṃrājatsaṃlagratilakāṃkitāṃ | 
muktāmaṇigaṇākīrṇanāsābharaṇaśobhitāṃ || 19 ||

yakṛviyaṃ phalābhoṣṭhīśaraccaṃdranibhānanāṃ |
dājimīvījalasadaṃtāvalivirājitāṃ || 20 ||

smitavakrāṃviśālākṣīṃvikasatkamalānanā |
sukurṇamaparcitākamuktāhāchibhūpitāṃ || 21 ||

ekāvalīsamāyuktīyadakādivibhūṣitāṃ |
muktāmaṇigaṇakīrṇaṃcukenavirājitā || 22 ||

vālāruṇasamaprakhyadivyavastravirājitāṃ |
kalpabhūruhasaṃbhūta kusuprasavibhūṣitī || 13 || 

<p. 116b>

divyacaṃdanaliptāgīdevarṣigaṇavaṃditī |
suvarṇakaśākārapīnīnnadyanastanī || 24 ||

muktāmāṇikyavilasatsvarṇakācīguṇānvisaṃtā |
śānodī pṛthuśroṇīṃ nimnanabhisamanvitāṃ || 25 ||

kadalī lalitastaṃbhasamānorūdvayānvitāṃ |
kadāphalasaṃkāśajaṃ yugalābhūṣoṣitāṃ || 26 ||

gūḍhaguphacaraktājvanibhayādatalavitī |
suvarṇaratnakhacitahasrapādāṃgulīyakāṃ || 27 ||

lasatkaṃkaṇakeyūravilasatkarapallavī |
muktāsuvarṇaralaudyapūritaṃ vasupātrakaṃ || 18 ||

kamaladvitayaramyamādarśadadhātīmapi |
caturbhujāṃ sphuradratnanūpurāṃbhūṣaṇejvalā || 29 ||

brahmeśaśakraviteśamakuṭodbhatakātibhiḥ |
virājitapaddadvaṃdvāṃ bhaktatrāṇaparāyaṇaṃ || 30 ||

ṛṣibhirdevatāsaṃghaiḥ kusumasragbhirarvināṃ |
ratnaughavarṣiṇamūrdhnidhṛtachatreṇadhīmatā || 31 ||

varuṇena samāyuktāṃ dikpālairaṣṭabhirvatāṃ |
dhṛtanāmaravaryeṇakāmenā ca sutena ca || 32 ||

yāryayorubhayornityaṃ vījyamānāṃtrayīmayī |
sarasvatyāgirijayāśarcamukhyābhirarcitāṃ || 33 ||

arudhatyānusūyādimunipatnībhirarcitāṃ |
purato nṛtyamānābhirdivyakanyabhirāvṛtāṃ || 34 ||

sarvavidyāmayī sarvasaṃyatsāmrājyanāyikāṃ |
sarvasaubhāgyajananīmaṇimādibhiṇavṛtāṃ || 35 ||

śaṃkhayamādinidhibhissamarcina padāṃvujāṃ |
samastasaṃpadādhārāṃ sarvavidyādhināyikī || 36 ||

samastamuktāralaudyavarṣiṇīṃ vedamātaraṃ |
karuṇārasasaṃpūrṇaṃ locanāṃ parameśvarīṃ || 37 ||

sarvapuṣikarīmavā sarvaraṃjanakāriṇīṃ |
sarvasammohanakarīṃ sarvākarṣaṇakāriṇīṃ || 38 ||

samastasiddhidā sarvalokaśrayavaśaṃkarīṃ |
samastaiśvaryasaṃsiddhihetubhūtāṃ sanātanī || 39 ||

vijayaśrīkarīṃ nityasāmrājya śrīpradāyinīṃ |
sarvatatvamayīṃ bhogabhogasvargapavargado || 40 ||

sarvayogamayī sarvadhameśāstrasvarūpiṇīṃ |
sarvadhamaṃmayī sarvatīrthadaivatarūpiṇīṃ || 41 ||

sarvajñānatāpīsarvajagadrakṣaṇa tatparāṃ |
nārāyaṇakanilayāṃ mahālakṣmīmupāsmahe || 42 || 

<p. 117a>

itthaṃ citāṃvujedhyoyanmahālakṣmīhārapriyāṃ |
āthavābhagavadrūpadhāracakrādi brahmāṃraṃdhrāṃtamīśvarīṃ || 43 || 

jvalatīvālasūryodyaśatasāhasrasannibhī |
tejomayīdarādhaṣīṃ brahmāṇḍavyāpinī parāṃ || 44 ||

śuddhajñānamayī sarvanamohatrītrayīmapīṃ |
athavā bhagavadrayamāvāryaṃbhāveyedviyā || 45 ||

ācāryapatnīṃ śrīrūpādhyāyetsākṣaradanatyadhīḥ |
sākṣādācāryapatnī vā mahālakṣmīdhiyānvahaṃ || 46 ||

abhyarcya prajayedvidyāratnaśrīhṛdayaṃda nṛpa |
anenaiva pramāṇena sākṣādācāryamīśvaraṃ || 47 ||

madrūpiṇaṃ vijānīhi tatpatnīmapi ca śriyaṃ |
tasmādavaśyamācāryaṃ patnīputrādibhirvṛtaṃ || 48 ||

sarvayetsakalairathairmatprasādasyasiddhayet |
yaktāsvapitaraupatnīputrabhrātrādikānapi || 49 ||

ācāryapūjayedrthairyadīccheccheyajātmanaḥ |
naratnahematuraṃgaudyasaṃkulaṃ śriyamicchatā || 50 ||

ācāryānujñapavidyāralaṃ saptavyamādarāt |
dhyātvetthamahanvahāṃ viprovidyāratnamabhoṣṭadaṃ || 51 ||

aṣṭhottaraśataṃ japtvā lakṣmī hṛdayamādarāt |
saumyaṃ paramaṃ prāpyādhanaṃ prāpnotirvāchitaṃ || 52 ||

dviśataṃ yojeyannityaṃ hṛdayamiṣṭadaṃ |
acalāṃ labhate śīghraṃ dhanadhātmākulāṃbhiyaṃ || 53 ||

triśataṃ prajayedyastu lakṣmīhṛdayamādarāt |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā ghṛtaṃ dvādaśadhāpi vā || 54 ||

mahedeśvaryamāpnotidhānadhānyādi saṃkulaṃ |
asaubhāgyavinirmuktaḥ kāmavatsubhago bhavet || 55 ||

catuḥśataṃ japedyastu lakṣmīhṛdayamādarāt |
dhanadhānyādisaṃpūrṇaṃ muktāratnau samāṃkulāṃ || 56 ||

acalāṃ labhate lakṣmīmāyurārogyamakṣayaṃ |
kaṃdarpasadaśaḥ kāṃtyā bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 57 ||

japet paṃcaśataṃ yastu lakṣmīhṛdayamanvahaṃ |
gavyājya manalehutvā nityaṃ dvādaśadhāpi vā || 58 ||

muktāralagaṇakīrṇaṃ dhanadhānyādisaṃkulaṃ |
sahasravājisahitaṃ mahadaiśvaryamaṣṭute || 59 ||

<p. 117b>

kāmavatsubhagolākedordhamāyuravāpya ca |
putrapautravatīmṛddhiṃ prāpyārogyamathākṣayaṃ || 60 ||

vaśīkaroti bhūpālānatharājāṃganā api |
sābhāsu pūjyate nityaṃ vāksiddhiṃ cātulāṃ labhet || 61 ||

niyamena japedyastunityaṃ paṃcaśataṃ nṛpa |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā gavyājyaṃ jvalinenale || 62 ||

dīrghāyuṣpamathārogyaṃ prāpyakaṃdarpasannibhaḥ |
bhūtvā rājasahasrāṇanārīṇāṃ prapivallabhaḥ || 63 ||

hemaratnaturaṃgauyagajasaṃdya samākulāṃ |
prāpnotyāśu mahālakṣmīmacalāṃratha saṃkulāṃ || 64 ||

namaṃdabhāgyastadvaṃśeharidro vā prajāyate |
gaṃgāpravāhavatasya vāgvibhūtirvijṛṃbhet || 65 ||

ābhūtasaṃkṣavaṃ lakṣmīstadvaṃśaṃnīvamuṃcati |
vaikuṃṭerametatedivyakanyāśatānvitaḥ || 66 ||

sahasraṃ prajapedyastu prasannaśrīmahāmanuṃ |
saṃprāpya virajīvalvamahadārogyamakṣayaṃ || 67 ||

ajarāmaṇobhūtvāśriyamaṣṭhaguṇānvitāṃ |
aṃprāpyaśaṃkhayamadinidhonāmadhiyo bhavet || 68 ||

maheṃdrasadṛśaśrīmānsārvabhaumobhavatyasau |
kalyāṃtamapi rājyaśrīstaṅgahanavimuṃcati || 69 ||

prasannalakṣmīvidyāratnamidaṃ śubhaṃ |
durlabhabhuvimartyānāṃ sarvakalyāṇasiddhidaṃ || 70 ||

ācāryacaṇadvaṃdvaṭhabhaktoyatavataḥ |
vaidikādhāraniratovidyārallamidaṃ japat || 71 ||

mātṛvadbhaginīvadyadyaranarīṣu saṃtataṃ |
jātasyanigrahakuryāt kāmasyātargatasya ca || 72 ||

ātmānaṃ gaṃdhapuṣpādyairalaṃkuryā dine dine |
śayīta śuddhaśayyāyāṃtarūṇyā sahabhāyayā || 73 ||

paścimābhimukhonityabhuṃjīyādannamādarāt |
ācāryapatnīśrīṣudhyāpūjayedvranasaṃcaryaiḥ || 74 ||

navarātravyatīyā bhṛguvāravratādiṣu |
śrīśrīpatidhiyābhūyamithunānyeva bhojayet || 75 ||

jaṃbūpravālaṃ dasṭaṃ cocchirasādhāryamevahi |
kamalaṃ vilvapatraṃ ca tulasīdalama || 76 ||

na mūrdhnidhārayeddhīmānśreyaskāmodvijottamaḥ |
avaśyaṃnityakarmāṇi kuryāddedyānvahaṃ gṛho || 77 ||

muktāphalāniramyāṇi kuṃḍalādi vibhūṣāṇaṃ |
ācāryāyāryayeddhīmānnityasaṃyatsamṛddhaye || 78 ||

<p. 118a>

suvāsinyassamabhyarcyāvāsolaṃkārabhojanaiḥ |
śrīvidyā ca tathālakṣmīrmahālakṣmīstataḥ paraṃ || 79 ||

triśaktiḥ sarvasāmrājyalakṣmīḥ paṃceṣṭasiddhidāḥ |
khaṃḍatritayasaṃyuktāvidyā paṃcadaśākṣarī || 80 ||

māyātritayasaṃyuktā śrīvidyeti prakīrtitā |
ekākṣarī sadālakṣmīrmahāsāmrājyadāyinī || 81 ||

lakṣmīhṛdayavidyeyaṃ saptaviṃśākṣarī śubhā |
mahālakṣmītivikhyātā sarvasāmrājyanāyikā || 82 ||

tryakṣarāthatriśatmākhyālakṣmīḥ sāmrājyasiddhidā |
ādāvaṃte śriyo vījasahitāṣṭākṣarī śubhā || 83 ||

sāmrājyalakṣmīrvikhyātā mahāsāmrājyasiddhidā |
icchatā sarvasāmrājyalakṣmī trailokyadurlabhāṃ || 84 ||

cakrarāje jaganmāturayodhyānagarātmake |
bhidhekartevyāvidhināphajānavarātravratādiṣu || 85 ||

na strīniṃdā prakurvīta nānya strīṣu sāmāgataṃ |
tāṃvūlaṃ natyajeddhīmāsajedvāsaścakutsitaṃ || 86 ||

rātrau dadhina bhoktavyaṃ na kapitthaphalaṃ tathā |
ācāryaputrepyācāryadhiyapūjanamācaret || 87 ||

ācāryājñāṃ samullaṃghyatrakutrāpi vā nṛpa |
śvākāryapi bhūpeta tulasīviṃlvavṛkṣaṃ ca ||
iṣṭāprāśvānayoniśataṃ gatvā caṃḍālekṣabhijāyate || 88 ||

āvaryanidāśravaṇamasamyagṛhabhojanaṃ |
paranārīṣu saṃsarga'kulepatanahetavaḥ || 89 ||

ācāryaktaṃ sadākāryamakāryanapibhūyeta |
tulasīvilvavṛkṣaṃ ca dṛṣṭvā praṇatimācaret || 90 ||

na bhakṣayet phalaṃ vilvaṃ prāṇāṃte mahīpate |
itthamācāryaniratoviṣṇupūjana tatparaḥ || 91 ||

śriyamāpnoti mahatī devānāmapi durlabhāṃ |
prasannalakṣmī prajapan śrīsūktamapi saṃjapet |
kollāpurana mahālakṣmīślokāṣṭakamathāpi vā || 92 ||

ātharvaṇaṃ japedvāpi lakṣmīhṛdayamiṣṭhadaṃ |
bhārgaveṇa purādṛṣṭhaṃ ślokarūpaṃ yaśaskaraṃ || 93 ||

<p. 118b>

lakṣmī sahasvanāmākhyasrotrarvā pratyaha japet |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāmavaśyaṃ pratyahaṃ japet |
aṣṭādaśākṣarī vidyāmathavā pratyahe japet || 95 ||

nityahomaṃ dvijaḥ kuryāt sāyaṃ prātardine dine |
lakṣmīhṛdayavidyāyāḥ sīddhikāmedinedine || 96 ||

katvetthamahatīsiddhimāprotyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasyedāśārathīyetaṃtredhevedāthasiṃgrahe 
aṣṭatriṃśodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 118b>

śrībhagavānuvāca || 

pūjāvidhānaṃ vakṣyami yaṃtroddhārapurassaraṃ |
yacchutvapinaraudhīmātsarvāpabhyo vimucyate || 1 ||

vedādisthita sādhyānāmayugalaśrīśaktimāyānvitaṃ |
kiṃjalkeṣu dineśapatravilasanmaṃtrākṣaraṃ tadvahiḥ || 2 ||

padmaṃ vyaṃjanakesararavāralasatpatrāṣṭayugmaṃ |
dharāvirbhvābhyāṃ(-)vaṣadurtayātvaritayāyatraṃ likhedveṣitaṃ || 2 || 

bhūparadvayakeṇeṣu hakṣau lekhyau punaḥ punaḥ |
mahālakṣmīyaṃtramirdasarvaiśvaryaphalapradaṃ || 3 ||

sarvaduḥkhapraśamanaṃ sarvāpadvinivāraṇaṃ |
kimatra vahunoktena paramasmānnāvidyate || 4 ||

asminyaṃtre mahālakṣmīmanneyedbhagavahniyāṃ |
ādāvagāni saṃpūjyavahnīśāraturadikṣu ca || 5 ||

śrīdharaṃ ca hṛṣīkeśaṃ vaikuṃṭhaviśvarūpakaṃ |
vāsudevaṃ saṃkarṣaṇī pradyumnamaniruddhakaṃ || 6 ||

patramūleṣu saṃpūjyapatramadhye tataḥ paraṃ |
gāyatrīrpārvatīṃcāṃdrīśavīṃ dikṣu prapūjayet || 7 ||

śrīdharaścahṛṣīkeśovaikuṃṭhoviśvarūpanṛt |
vidikṣu pūjayedetānsarvakāmārthāsiddhaye || 8 ||

tadagreśvardyayedvāṇīnmahālakṣmyāḥ kramādamūn |
anurāgovisaṃvīhovijayovallabhomadaḥ || 9 ||

harṣovalaśrutejasvīpura ārabhya pūjayet |
śakrāhīnaṣṭhadikpālān caturasrāṣṭhadikṣu ca || 10 ||

tadāyudhāni tadvātyekrameṇāparipūjayet |
arcākramāṃtaramathovakṣyami śṛṇu bhūpate || 11 ||

śrīvījenāsanaṃ datvā mūrtimūlena kalpayet |
pūjayedakṣiṇeyāśvedevyāḥ śaṃkaranaṃdanaṃ || 12 ||

<p. 119a>

(*****) anyatra puṣpāṃjalikaraṃ yajet |
aṃgāni upūrvamukteṣusyāneṣu vidhivadyajet || 13 ||

umādyāḥ patramadhyasthā aṣṭauśakturyajet kramāt |
umābhūḥ śrīsarasvatyaudurgādevīratistataḥ || 14 ||

gāyatrīdevyuṣāceti padmahastā'subhūṣaṇāḥ |
jaṅgusūryasutebhyarvyepādaprakṣālanopate || 15 ||

śaṃkhapadmanadhīpūjyepārśvayordhatacāmarau |
dhṛtānapatravaṃruṇarvayetpaścime tataḥ || 16 ||

meṣādirāśīnparitoyajedathayanavagrahān |
arghayedimājān dikṣu caturdaṃtavibhūṣitān || 17 ||

aiśavanaḥ puṃḍarīkovāmanaḥ kumudīṃjanaḥ |
puṣkadaṃtaḥ sārvabhaumaḥ supratīkaśvate kramāt || 18 ||

śakrādīnyardyayet paścādvajrādīnapi tadvahiḥ |
āgamoktena vidhināstugaṃdhaiḥ sumanoharaiḥ || 19 ||

arghayedgaṃdhapuṣpādyairdevīmanvahamādarāt |
itthamabhyarcya vidhivat prasannāṃ kamalālayā || 20 ||

vimuktaḥ sakalāpadmasaṃprāpyamahatīśriyaṃ |
āyuṣyā mahadārībhyaṃ prāpyakaivalyamaśrute || 21 ||

vedāṃteṣvapi vedeṣu purāṇeṣvakhileṣvapi |
sugumamapi vakṣyāmi yaṃtrarājaṃ mahīyate || 22 ||

viṃducakravilikhyādautrikoṇaṃ vilirevadatha |
aṣṭhamaṃcatalekhyaṃdaśāradvitaya tataḥ || 23 ||

manvastraṃ vilikhet paścādvatamaṣṭhadalānvitaṃ |
ṣoḍaśāraṃ tato lekhyaṃ punarvṛta samanvitaṃ || 24 ||

caturasrayaṃ paścāddhaturdvāravibhūṣitaṃ |
ayodhyāpuranāmedaṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇabhidhaṃ || 25 ||

śivaśaktimayaṃ prāḍgaretacchrī cakramityapi |
mātṛkālekhanaṃ kuryādvidhānenātrabhūyate || 26 ||

etadguptataraṃ cakramāgameṣu śrutiṣvapi |
ayodhyānagaraṃ nāmnā mahāsāmrājyasiddhidaṃ || 27 ||

śivarātmātmakaṃ proktaṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇābhidhaṃ |
navayonyātmakaṃ cakraṃ śrīcakraṃ ceti kathyate || 28 ||

śrīdevīyājaganmātācitkaloktānnayīmapī |
tripurālalitānāmnā mahālakṣmīrnigadyate || 29 ||

sāpūjyābhagavatī bhagavatsahitānṛpa |
nava cakrātmakīmidaṃ sarvatsaramaryaśubhaṃ || 30 ||

<p. 119b>

śrīśrīpatīsamabhyarcyāvitromāśaṃkarāvapi |
trailokyamohanaṃ caktaṃ caturaśratrayaṃ smṛtaṃ || 31 ||

sarvāśāpūrakaṃ cakraṃ ṣoḍaśādamiti smṛtaṃ |
sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇaṃ cakramaṣṭayatradvaryaviduḥ || 32 ||

caturdaśāraṃ prathitaṃ sarvasaubhāgyadāyakaṃ |
vahirdaśāraṃ kathitaṃ sarvasaubhāgyadāyakaṃ || 33 ||

aṃtardaśāramatroktaṃ sarvarakṣākaraṃ paraṃ |
sarvarogaharaṃ cakramaṣṭāramiti kathyate || 34 ||

sarvasiddhipradaṃ cakraṃ trikoṇaṃ sumanoharaṃ |
sarvānaṃdamayaṃ cakraṃ vai devapāramaiśvaraṃ || 35 ||

cakrametanmahīpāla navacakrātmakaṃ śubhaṃ |
trailokyākārṣaṇākaraṃ jagadgajanakārakaṃ || 36 ||

parāpavādabhītirghramalyamṛtyunivāraṇaṃ |
sarvasaubhāgyadaṃbha i samastaiśvaryasiddhidaṃ || 37 ||

sarvavidyāpradaṃ sarvamahākalyāṇasiddhidaṃ |
sarvasaṃgrāmajapadaṃ sarvaśatruvimardanaṃ || 38 ||

sarvāriṣṭhapraśamanaṃ mahādādiprabhaṃjanaṃ |
sarvaduḥkhapramanaṃ sarādhivyādhināśanaṃ || 39 ||

samastasaṃyatsāmrājyasiddhidaṃ muktisiddhidaṃ |
atra sā lalitāsākṣātpūjyate kamalālayā || 40 ||

bhagavatsahitānityaṃ mahānyāsanātanī |
pūjātratrividhāprākādevavedāṃtavedibhiḥ || 41 ||

pīṭhapūjādimāproktāyāṃgākhyā tataḥ paraṃ |
bhogāṃgākhyā tṛtīyāsyāditi pūjātridhāmatā || 42 ||

avaśyamatrakartavyālayāṃgārcādinedibhe |
trividhārdhātrakartavyā navarātravrātādiṣu || 43 ||

āmṛtāvudhimārabhyaviśeṣārghyatamanvahaṃ |
kathitāpīṭapūjeyaṃ nityasaubhāgyasiddhidā || 44 ||

upacāraiścatuṣyaṣṭisaṃrapākairbhagavātpriyāṃ |
upacarya ṣaḍaṃgānāṃ nityāmapi pūjanaṃ || 45 ||

gurupadmarcanaṃ paśvāllayāṃgeti prakīrtitā |
aṇimā siddhimārabhya śrīdevīpūjanītimaṃ || 46 ||

bhāgāṃga pūjanaṃ proktaṃ mahāsāmrājyasiddhidaṃ |
trividhā cātukurvāṇe māsamekaṃ tu vā nṛpa || 47 ||

<p. 120a>

sākṣāvyaśyati vakṣubhyaṃ śrīdevīnāṃ ca saṃśayaḥ |
caturviṃśati saṃkhyākairūpacārairathāditaḥ || 48 ||

abhyarcya lakṣmīlakṣmīśauyugmamāktāraṇyavidyāyā |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇai savamithunāvaraṇanvitau || 49 ||

arghayehuṃdhaśuṣyayaibhorgamerakṣasamacchraye |
asmintaṃtre mayā prokte vedasārārthasaṃgrahe || 50 ||

sāmrajyalakṣmīvidyānāṃ paṃcānāmapi sādhanaṃ |
cakrasya pūjāvistorodvitīyeśe pravakṣyate || 51 ||

yā saptaviṃśadarṇeyaṃ sāmrājyāśrīya iṣṭadā |
atra sā kathyate vidyā caturvargaphalapradā || 52 ||

sāmrājya śrīmahāvidyāṃ cakrarajasya sannidhau |
daśadhāpi smarannūyanityaṃ siddhimavāpnuyāt || 53 ||

kalālakamidaṃ cakraṃ prapacātmakumucyate |
sarvavedamapraproktaṃ sarvadvamayataṃthā || 54 ||

mayodhyānagaraṃ ca ṛśālagrānaśilānvitaṃ |
yena prapūjyate nityaṃ sa eva bhagavanmayaḥ || 55 ||

jāhūvīsaritāṃ śroṣṭāyamunā ca sarasvatī |
godāvavarī bhīmararthākāverīkṣaṣyaveṇikā || 56 ||

śatadgarnarmadāsiṃdhurvipāśācapayoṣṇikā |
cakrarājasya sannidhye nivasaṃminaṃ saṃśayaḥ || 5 ||

vaidikācāranirato vedādhyayana tatparaḥ |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ dṛḍhabhakto yatavrataḥ || 58 ||

 cakramabhyarccayeddhrīmānsarvasāmrājyasiddhidaṃ |
laghukracakraṃ vṛhaccakramayodhyā nagaraṃ tu vā || 59 ||

ramāyā patramathyā svācāryājñāpurassaraṃ |
likhitaṃ kāṃcaneraupyetāmre vā bhūrjapatrake || 60 ||

pūjayitvā japedetaṃ vidyāṃ sāmrājyasiddhidāṃ |
etādṛśīmahavidyosarvasākrājyasiddhidā || 61 ||

śrutādṛṣṭhāpi vā vedavedāṃteṣu na kutracit |
saṃpadassarvadevānāmapi yogaratātmanaṃ || 62 ||

rakṣatyāmapi yakṣāṇāṃ gaṃdharvāṇāṃ ca saṃpadaḥ |
kinnaraṇāṃ ca siddhānāmasurāṇāṃ ca bhūyate || 63 ||

prasannalakṣmījapatassarvāssiddhyaṃti siddhayaḥ |
saptadvīparghātaṃ tvaṃ vā gajāśvarayasaṃkulā || 64 ||

<p. 120b>

samastavākyatitvaṃ vā bhogāpyamaradurlabhāḥ |
siddhatyasya na saṃdehaḥ prasanna śrīasādataḥ || 65 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe ekau na 
catvāriṃśodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 120b>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

prasannalakṣmīvidyāyāssādhanaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ |
śṛṇu rājanpravakṣyāmi samāhitamanāḥ śṛṇu || 1 ||

vidyānāmapi sarvāsāṃ purancaryāṃ vinā nṛpa |
na siddhiḥ kathyate loke siddhiṃ kuryātataḥ pumān || 2 ||

puraścaryāṃ vinā homajapakīṭhiśatairapi |
na siddhiḥ sarvamaṃtrārṇakathyate puruṣarṣabha || 3 ||

puraścayakṛtāyena sāṃgahomajapānvitā |
pūrṇadakṣiṇayāyuktā sa sadyassiddhimaśrutaṃ || 4 ||

devatopāsanādyādakphalamiṣṭaṃ prayacchati |
na tādṛśaphalaṃdāna sahasreṇapi labhyate || 5 ||

nārāyaṇassamastasya prapaṃcasyāsyanāyakaḥ |
viśvātmāyajñapuruṣe ekaeveti kathyate || 6 ||

ekaivajagatāṃmātāmahālakṣmīstrayīmayī |
patnībhagavataḥ sargasthitisaṃhārakāriṇī || 7 ||

tasmādgamavatīyuktaṃ bhagavaṃtaṃ jagatpatiṃ |
upāsya bhagavadrūpaṃ saṃprāpnoti hi nānyathā || 8 ||

tadānairnatayobhirvānayāgairakhilairapi |
brahmatādātmyasaṃsiddhiḥ śrīśrīśopasanavinā || 9 ||

tasmādavaśyamaṣṭārṇavidyāyānyaṃ sanātanaṃ |
nārāyaṇaṃ trijagatāṃpatimacyutamīśvaraṃ || 10 ||

upāsyādau trayorūpāṃ patnīmapi jagatpateḥ |
mahālakṣmīmupāsyātha brahmatādātmyasiddhibhak || 11 ||

valīyasī piturupimātāsvasutarakṣāṇe |
bhaktāḥ putrā iti jñeyāḥ śriyaścakamalāyate || 12 ||

bhaktaṃ saṃrakṣaṇe lakṣmīstasmādbhagavaodhikā |
mātaraṃ sarvajagatāṃ mahālakṣmīharipriyāṃ || 13 ||

ye bhajaṃti kṛtārtthāste bhagavadrūpādhāriṇaḥ |
ta eva bhagavatputrāmahālakṣmyāḥ sutā api || 14 ||

tasmādavaśyaṃvidyāyāssidhyartha yatravānnavet |
prāsannakamalāvidyāsiddhāyasyamahītale || 15 ||

<p. 121a>

bhagavatsāhitālakṣmīstaṃ pālayati putravat |
prasannalakṣmīvidyāyāssidhyaniyatavrataḥ || 16 ||

puraśvaryonaraḥ kṛtvā sāṃgadākṣiyānvinā |
sadyassiddhimavāpnoti mahatīṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ || 17 ||

pūrṇadakṣiṇayāyuktā sāṃgahomajyayānvitā |
puraścaryā kṛtoyanagulīlaghī ca vā nṛpa || 18 ||

sa vidyāsiddhimāsādyābhavatyevahariḥ svayaṃ |
ācāryaḥ pūjyate yatra puraścaraṇakarmaṇi || 19 ||

tatrairvāsobhirarthaiśca pūrṇadakṣiṇayānvitaiḥ |
tatpuraścaraṇaṃ sāṃgaṃ sadyaḥ siddhipradaṃ bhavet || 20 ||

vitaśāṭhyena yasyātrakiṃcilloyobhavedyadi |
koṭiśo vipuraścaryā niṣphalā sā prakīrtitā || 21 || 

ācāryaputramācāryā sannidhau tarddhiyārcayet |
ācāryapatnīmathavā tatpautramathavārcayet || 22 ||

pautrābhāveduhinaraṃdauhitraṃ vā prapūjayet |
arcayedbhātaraṃ tasya pautrābhāvemahīpate || 23 ||

tadabhāve bhāgineyaṃ sarvābhāve śriyaḥpataḥ |
sannidhāvarpayitvātha satpātrāya samarpayet || 24 ||

kuryādevālayaṃ vārpi gurudakṣiṇayā nṛpa |
vidhināpi kṛtānīhamahānānibhūriśaḥ || 25 ||

ācaryaniṣkadānasya kalānāṃ haṃti ṣoḍaśīṃ |
śuddheti yāvane deśepuraścaṇamācaret || 26 ||

vaikuṃṭhamiti proktaṃ matpadaṃ vadarīvanaṃ |
yatra sālākanaṃndābhūrnigatāhimavadgireḥ || 27 ||

tato vārāṇasīpuṇyāmahāsiddhipradāyinī |
tīrtharājaḥ prayāgotrayamahāsiddhidharaḥ smṛtaḥ || 28 ||

jagannāthapadaṃ puṇyaṃkṣetraṃ śrīpuruṣottamaṃ |
ayodhyāmathurāmāyākāṃcikāvaṃtikāpurī || 29 ||

dvārakāsiddhidāṃ etāmuktipuryo mahītale |
gokaṇanaiviṣam puṇyaṃ kurukṣetramataḥ paraṃ || 30 ||

gaṃgāsagarasaṃyogaḥ puṇyorāmagiristathā |
prabhāsaṃsiṃdhutīraṃ ca padmanābhamataḥ paraṃ || 31 ||

vaśiṣṭhāsiṃdhusaṃyogaḥ parvatothatryayaṃvakaḥ |
satdyāvalomaheṃdraśca malayaḥ śrīgiristathā || 32 ||

śeṣācaloraṃgadhāmaṣetramatyaṃtapāvanaṃ |
kubhakoṇaṃ setuvaṃdhodakṣiṇemathurāpurī || 33 ||

pāṃḍuraṃgaṃ siddhavaṭamahovatalamātutamaṃ |
atha siṃhācalādīnipurāyakṣetrāṇibhūtale || 34 ||

<p. 121b>

vahūbhisaṃtimartyānāṃ sadyaḥ siddhikarāṇyapi |
gaṃgātīraṃ sarasvatyāyamunāyāstaṭaṃ paraṃ || 35 ||

atha godāvarītīraṃ narmadātīramapyatha |
suvarṇamukharītīraṃ sa godāvarītaṭaṃ || 36 ||

atha mīmarathītīraṃtugabhadrātaṭaṃ śubhaṃ |
kṛṣṇaveṇītaṭaṃ śuddhesadyassiddhipradāyakaṃ || 37 ||

sarvāsāmapi vidyānāṃ puraścaraṇasiddheya |
uktānyetanilokeṣu sadyasmiddhikarāsmitvi || 38 ||

sarvatrācārya sānnidhyaṃ viśiṣṭaṃ maṃgaladaṃ |
matyadepi na siddhiḥ syādvinācāryasya sannidhi || 39 ||

trikaliṃgepi deśo vā yathācāryasyā sannidhiḥ |
tadeva sarvavidyānāṃ siddhidaṃtramīritaṃ || 40 ||

ācāryasannidhau puṇyakṣetre siddhipradāyeka |
prasannalakṣmavidyāyaḥ puraścaṇāmācaret || 41 ||

asatyabhāṣāṇaṃ jaiṣṇyaṃ paranārīraṃtiṃ tathā |
vipradrohamasūryā ca niṣiddhānnasyabhakṣṇa || 42 ||

asabhyamīṣāṇāṃ nityaṃ harataḥ parivarjayet |
ācāryaniṃdāpatrasyātadeśaṃ ca parityajet || 43 ||

ācāryaniṃdāvartāraṃ pitaraṃ mātaraṃ tu vā |
bhātaraṃ svasutaṃvapi patnīputrīmathāpi vā || 44 ||

avaśyaṃ daṃḍayetatrānadoṣosti mahoṣate |
ācāryaniṃdākartāraṃ yadiśakte na daṃḍayet || 45 ||

ācaṃdrākaṃmasaughoranarakeṣu nimajjati |
kiṃcānena kṛtaṃ yāgaśataṃ saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇaṃ || 46 ||

avaśatiṣphalaṃ proktaṃ pūrvācāryermahībhiḥ |
brahmahatyādipāpānāṃ manvādyaiḥ paramarṣibhiḥ || 47 ||

niṣkatiḥ kathitāśāstrena gurudrohaktāriṇaḥ |
ācāryaniṃdāpatra syātaṃ tyajedaṃtyajaṃ yathā || 48 ||

karṇaipidhāyavānyatragaṃtavyam valavarjitaiḥ |
saptadvīpapavatī pṛthvīdhanadhānyaudyasaṃkulāṃ || 49 ||

ṛṇavānevadaṣvāpi svācāryāya dine dine |
niṣkamātraṃ pratijñātamapyācāryāpabhūpate || 50 ||

brahmāṃḍakoṭi sadṛśamṛṇaṃ māsānna saṃśayaḥ |
brahmāṃḍakoṭidānāpātrabhūtebhya kṣādarāt || 51 ||

api sarvasvadānena tadaśāṃtavinaśyati |
māsānmāsadvayādvāpi tribhirmāsairathāpi vā || 52 ||

<p. 122a>

tadarṇabdaddhisahitasyavāṃ || 54 ||

ācāryaṇadvaṃdvadṛḍhabhaktasamo nahi |
na smādācāryayādābja dṛḍhabhaktoyatavrataḥ || 55 ||

vidyāṃ prasannalakṣmākhyām śreyaskāmaḥ sadā japet |
sidhyarthaṃ brahmavānādaupuraścaraṇamācaret || 56 ||

sāṃgadakṣiṇayāyuktapuraścāṇakṛdvijaḥ |
daivatairapi pūjyaḥ syādvidyāsiddhomahītale || 57 ||

phalāsye kāṃtarāśīvālavaṇāmlavivarjitaṃ |
bhuṃjānovāhaviṣyānnamekabhaktāśanopi vā || 58 ||

prājāpatyavratī vā syādyadvācādrāyaṇavratī |
paṃcagavyāśano vāpi nityasrāpī jiteṃdriyaḥ || 59 ||

vaidikācārasahito duṣṭasaṃgavivarjitaḥ |
adhaḥśāyī brahmacārī sahoṣṭhīniratassadā || 60 ||

tulasīvanamadhye vāvanevā bilvamūlagaḥ |
ācāryasannidhī kṛtvasādhayedgavatpriyāṃ || 61 ||

puraścaryā japolakṣasakhyāsyāt kṛte yuge |
lakṣadvayaṃ syāttretāyāṃ trilakṣadvāpareyuge || 62 ||

kalauyuge caturlakṣajapaṃ prāhurmaharṣayaḥ |
kṛte yuge sadā viprāvedādhyayatatatparāḥ || 63 ||

āpatkālepi satataṃ navadaṃtyanṛpaṃ vacaḥ |
gurvarthemeva satatamarjayaṃti dhanaṃ vaddha || 64 ||

ahorātraṃ sadācārya śuśrūṣānirataḥ kṛrto |
agnihotroratā nityaṃ yajvānodhūri dakṣiṇaḥ || 65 ||

yojanānāṃ sahasraṃ vā gatvā cāpayedāṃvujaṃ |
prāṇairathairthimācāpi svācāryārcana tatparāḥ || 66 ||

tretāyāṃ pādadharmotralupyate vasudhāpate |
tasmallakṣadvayaṃ proktaṃ tretāyāṃ siddhaye śriyaḥ || 67 ||

atroktadharmaḥ pādābhyāṃ luptaḥ syādvāpareyuge |
tasmāllakṣatrayaṃ proktaṃ yugedvāparanāmake || 68 ||

kalāvadharmaniratāvedādhyayanavarjitāḥ |
śrautācāravihīnāśca mithyā bhāṣaṇatasyādāḥ || 69 ||

ācāryaniṃdāśravaṇaritāḥ || 71 ||

svavudhyākalpayaṃtīhakuśāstrāṇi mahītale |
svayaṃ naṣṭhāḥ parāḥ srūṣṇīṃ nāśayaṃti pratārakāḥ || 72 ||

<p. 122b>

yavanānaṃtyajānavitadhānyaralaughā saṃyutān |
daṣṭācāryarpinaṃdaṃti maṃtronāstyapadaivataṃ || 73 ||

maṃdaprarjña maṃdabhāgyāḥ paranārīratotsukāḥ |
bhagavanmayamācāryaṃ bhogasvargāpavargadraṃ || 74 ||

tyatkāscayat  śrīṣutrādinityayoṣaṇatatparāḥ |
pitaraṃ mārararmapityajaṃtyeva kalau yuge || 75 ||

asatyabhāṣaṇaṃ jaidanamasūyāmatsaromadaḥ |
prāpte kaliyugedyeriyugyadharmo mahīyate || 76 ||

ācāryavadadanāṃbhojādgṛhītvāpi manūtamān |
datyajaṃtimatsaragrastā ācāryahohakāriṇaḥ || 77 ||

ācāryanāmnaivāhkānaṃ kulauyugetyajaṃti |
vedikācāryatāṃtrikācārajatparāḥ || 78 ||

alpadakṣiṇapātānāṃkatariḥ syuṣkalauyuge |
svapūjārthamathācāryāsapiśāstreṣvapāragāḥ || 79 ||

maṃtramātraṃ pradāsyaṃti śiṣyobhyaḥ sogavarjitāṃ |
nyāsayaṃtradhyānasūktamajñātvāpi mahāmanūn || 80 ||

vitalubdhāḥ adārthatiśiṣyobhyovastudhāyate |
itthaṃ kaliyuge ghore mahāpātakisaṃkule || 81 ||

ācāryacaraṇādvaṃdvabhaktonarasahasrake |
ekesti bhagavadyiṃtātasarovijiteṃdriyaḥ || 82 ||

tasyācārya kṛpālabdhāvidyāssakalasiddhidāḥ |
ācāryacaraṇardvadvaśuśrūṣākṣīṇakelmaṣāḥ || 83 ||

ye setiteṣāmācāryakṛpayāsiddhirīṣyate |
kaveḥ pātakavāhulpyāraprasannaśrīmahāmanoḥ || 84 ||

caturlakṣajapaḥ proktaḥ puraścaryārthamādarāt |
cāturlakṣayaṃ kṛtvā evokti vidhināśuciḥ || 85 ||

daśāṃśatarpayeddhīmānyayasekṣurasena vā |
tadaśāṃśaṃ hunedājyamadhutritayamiśritaiḥ || 86 ||

kamalairvilvapatrairvāhavirbhivamihīpate |
suvāsinīśataṃbhīrjyaviprāṇāṃśatamapyatha || 87 ||

kuṃḍaladitayaṃ datvā pūrvamācāryakarṇayoḥ |
ācāryacaraṇadvādhanarāśisaṃmayet || 88 ||

itthaṃ kṛtvā puraścaryāprāsannāyāḥ śriyo nṛpa |
amarairapi pūjyaḥ syācchiyaṃ paśyati cakṣuṣā || 89 ||

<p. 123a>

prasannāyaṃ jagadvātryāṃ kimasādhyaṃ jagatraye |
śrūyate dūrato vā vārtasaśatayojanagāpi ca || 90 ||

paśyatyapi svacakṣurbhyāṃ śatasāhasrayojanaṃ |
kaiṃkaryartasya kurveti maheṃdraghamarā api || 91 ||

anadhītaṃ ca vedādi vidyājālamenoharaṃ |
svayamevāsya vaktrābjāntirgadyatinasaṃśayaḥ || 92 ||

nidhītāmadhiyaḥ sākṣākuverosya dine dine |
dadāti vaḍgalaṃ dradhyayāvadīpsitamakṣayaṃ || 93 ||

cikiṃtsakobhavatyasyadharmarāṅgadihe svayaṃ |
nāṣṭākṣarī samāvidyāsadaśīramayānapā || 94 ||

nāsti nākhyevanākhye satyaṃ savyarahīpate |
mahavīyaṃ puraśvaryāsāṃgāsaṃpūryādakṣiṇā || 95 ||

kṛtāyena na saṃdehastatodhanyatesanahi |
alpāpuṣpānmanuṣyāṇāṃ cāṃcalyānmanasopi ca || 96 ||

pravakṣyāmi puraścaryāsāṃlaghīmanyāṃ kalauyuge |
iḍuvāsarasaṃyuktāpauṇīmāsīpadābhavet || 97 ||

jamāvāsyeduṃvāreṇa sahitā vā bhavedyadi |
ravivārayutāmāvāyogoyaṃ padmakaḥ smṛtaḥ || 98 ||

somasya parvapūrṇayāmamāyāṃ raviparva vā |
caṃdracūḍamaṇiḥ prokto ravicūḍāmaṇistathā || 99 ||

ācāryaṃ sannivīkṛtyatatpūrvadivasatrayaṃ |
ekabhaktāśanonityamadhaḥśāpī jiteṃdriyaḥ || 100 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāsamastanyāsasaṃgutāṃ |
vārṇanyāsaṃyutāṃ vāpi śatādhikasahasrakaṃ || 101 ||

prajaptvādau mahālakṣmīvidyāmiṣṭhaphalapradāṃ |
triśatāvika sāhasraṃ japtvā śrīhṛdayastavaṃ || 102 ||

trivāraṃ pravayaidvīmānatha prajvaline nale |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhāṅgatvātedamātrādyajaṃgavāḥ || 103 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhāpaścāddhunedaṣṭārṇavidyayā |
prasannabhagavatpatnī(-)vidyayāṣyetaraṃ śataṃ || 104 ||

gavyamajyaṅganedagnau nityamācāryasevakaḥ |
caṃdraparvaṇisaṃprāpteravipavīṇivāpyatha || 105 ||

sparśakāle tataḥ srātvā natvāvāryamathādarāt |
vidhivat saṃstūtevṛhauvaṃdamātrādyataṃ garvā || 106 ||

<p. 123b>

aṣṭāviṃśatidhāṅgatvā śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ ūtvā vilvapatrairghṛtapnutaiḥ || 107 ||

madhutritayasaṃmiśraistilaikṛṣṇethāpi vā |
lakṣmīhṛdayamaṃtreṇa śatādhika sahasrakaṃ || 108 ||

juhuyādanale bhudvekevalena ghṛtena vā |
prāyāścitāṅgānī kṛtvā prāṇamyāgnimataṣparaṃ || 109 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃnatvā sāṣṭāṃgamādarāt |
arpayet sakalaṃ dravyamapi svagṛha saṃsthitaṃ || 110 ||

varṣāśananitadravyāmācāryāyāthavārpayet |
athavā kuṃḍalayumaniṣkadvādaśasaṃyutaṃ || 111 ||

samarpayedathācāryacaraṇadvitaye nṛpa |
karṇalaṃkāramanyaṃ vā yāvacchakyaṃ samarpya ca || 112 ||

sūkṣmaṃ vāsoyugaṃ datvā raviniṣkamitaṃ dhanaṃ |
ṣaṇnikamtha vā ityāniṣkatrayamitaṃ tu vā || 113 |||

samarpyācārya pādābje tata ācāryavallabhāṃ |
yathā śatmāsemābhyarcya vāsolaṃkaraṇādibhiḥ || 114 ||

bhojayedvipravaryāṃśca dvādaśāthasuvāsinīḥ |
anaṃtaramathācāryapūjāyāvasudhāyota || 115 ||

prasarpakebhyoviprebhyo yathāśaktā ca dakṣiṇāṃ |
datvā bhukteṣu vipreṣu dāsaṇī ca samarpayet || 116 ||

bhojanānaṃtaraṃ śatmātoṣayepasuvāsinīḥ |
ācāryānugrahātsadyassiddhimāprovyanuttamāṃ || 117 ||

rājāvārājaputrovāvahuviyuto yadi |
ācāryāya mahīdaṃdyādvahusya samanvitāṃ || 118 ||

bahudakṣiṇayuktāṃ caturvṛṣabhasaṃyutāṃ | 
prasannalakṣmīvidyāyāssidhyarthamatha vā nṛpa || 119 ||

śālagrāmaśilāṃ datvā yathāśatmā sadakṣiṇaṃ |
pūrvokta dakṣidadyādvāsolaṃkārasaṃyutāṃ || 120 ||

cūḍāmaṇi māhāyoge yadyadvastu pradīyate |
ācāryacaraṇardvadve tata dakṣapātāṃ vrajet || 121 ||

puraścaryāmimāṃ kṛtvāyauga cūḍāmoṇā nṛpato |
cūḍāmani prasannalakṣmīvidyāyāssiddhiṃ sa labhate parāṃ || 122 ||

<p. 124a>

tasminsavatsoravaśyadhanaralaughasaṃkulāṃ |
acalāṃściyamāpnoti śāśvatīmanapāpinī || 123 ||

svacchaṃdamaṇobhūtvā dīrghamāyuranuttamaṃ |
saubhāgyaṃ mahadāsādyasamaddhiyaṃtrapautrakaiḥ || 124 ||

śāśvatīṃ muktimāpnoti dehāṃte durlabhāmapi |
itthaṃ kṛtvā puraścaryāṃ grāhaṇe ravicaṃdrayoḥ || 125 ||

tridhyā vā paṃcadhāvāpi śatadvādaśadhāpi vā |
jātismaraściraṃ bhūtvā dhanadhānyājākulā || 126 ||

ratnāśvarathasaṃpūrṇaprāpyaściyamacaṃcalāṃ |
putrapautravātī mūrddhividhī sumahatīmapi || 127 ||

yogamaṣyaṃgamāsādyābhuktvā bhogāścādurlabhyān |
ateva sati vaikuṃṭhe kulasāhasrasaṃyutaḥ || 129 ||

yadvāśvinābhidhemasisaṣāpte navarātrake |
ekaikaṃ divasaṃ tatra cūḍāmaṇi samaprabhaṃ || 129 ||

kathitaṃ sumahatyarvasa samastairbrahmavādibhiḥ |
prasannalakṣmīvidyeyaṃ tatrāvaśyaṃ phalapradā || 130 ||

divasodivame tatraphalaṃ śataguṇottaraṃ |
mahatī navamī tatrāyā proktā paramarṣibhiḥ || 131 ||

ravicūḍāmaṇi śatasahaśīsātithiṃ smṛtā |
bhaguvāsarasaṃyuktā vaiśvadaivatyasaṃyutā || 132 ||

sāmrājyalakṣmīyegoyaṃ tatroktaḥ paramarṣibhiḥ |
ācāryājñāmanuprāpyaprathame pratiyadine || 133 ||

prātaḥsnātvā viśuddhātmā sahasraṃ vedamātaraṃ |
abhyasyatriśataṃ vāpi vidhivājjvalitenale || 134 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā gāyatryājyaṃ gārvāśubhaṃ |
śrīmadaṣparṇayāyaśvādaṣṭāviṃśatidhā hunet || 135 ||

hutedaṣṭottaraśataṃ lakṣmī hṛdayavidyayā |
divase divasepītyaṃ homakarmasamāpyā ca || 136 ||

yathā śaktyā prajaptvādau śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ manuṃ |
sāmrājya śrīmahāvidyāmetāṃ paṃcaśatādhikaṃ || 137 ||

<p. 124b>

sahasraṃ prajapennityaṃ sāvadhānamanāḥ śuciḥ |
yadvā dvādaśasāhasraṃ saṃkalpya navasatrake || 138 ||

prasanna śrīmahāvidyāṃ nityametāṃ japedvudhaḥ |
ātharvaṇaṃ mahuḍgardyalakṣmī hṛdayamiṣadaṃ || 139 ||

catvariśatidhānityaṃ japetpaṃcādhikaṃ śuciḥ |
bhojyāḥ suvāsinyo mahālamīdhiyātṛpa || 140 ||

mahānavamyāṃ prāprāyaṃ vidhivasaṃskṛtenele |
aṣṭaviṃśatidhāṅgatvā vedamātrāpuroghṛtaṃ || 141 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā śrīmadaṣṭhārṇavidyayā |
sāmrājyalakṣmīmāvādyasamabhyarcyopacārakaiḥ || 142 ||

kuśeśapairdyatayutairmadhutritaryasaṃyutaiḥ |
triśatādhikasāhasramiṃdirāviyāhunet || 143 ||

athavāpaya saṃgavyaghṛta trimadhusaṃplutaṃ |
vilvapatrasasāyuktaṃ tilaiḥ kṛṣneḥ samanvitaṃ || 144 ||

triśatādhika sāhasraṃ juhuyānmanunāśriyaḥ |
lakṣmīhṛdayamaṃtraiścallokarūpairataḥ parama || 145 ||

paṃcadhā vā tridhā vahnau juhuyādravirādarāt |
aṣyadaśarṇamaṃtreṇa yathāśaktyāpluhuyānmanuvāśriyaḥ || 
lakṣmīhṛdayamaṃtraiścallokarūpairataḥ pasra tataḥ paraṃ || 146 ||

aṣṭotadaśataṃ vāpi juhuyādgopataṃ śubhaṃ |
japādihomaṃ kṛtvātha prāyaścitāhutastataḥ || 147 ||

brahmārpanahuti kṛtvā praṇamyāgni mataḥparaṃ |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ sāṣṭhāṃgaṃ praṇipatya ca || 148 ||

 gaṃdhākṣatairalaṃkārairvāsobhiśca samarpyayet |
godvayaṃ dakṣiṇāyuktaṃ samarpyācāryapādayoḥ || 149 ||

ācāryacaraṇaṃdvaṃdve vahulaṃ dravyamarpayet |
sahasraṃ śataniṣkaṃ vā tadarthaṃ vā tadardhakaṃ || 150 ||

niṣkadvādaśakaṃ vāpi niṣkaṣaṭkamathāpi vā |
paṃcaniṣkasuvarṇaṃ vā triniṣkavātha sadgurāḥ || 151 ||

caraṇaṃvuruhadvaṃdvetalobhavirvārjataḥ |
samarpyācārya patnyai ca vāsa ākalpasaṃcayaṃ || 152 ||

samarpayedyathāśaktyā śrīdhiyābhyarcyasādaraṃ |
ācāryasannidhau tasya patnī putrādyasannidhau || 153 ||

<p. 125a>

bhagavat saṃnidhau sarvadakṣiṇadravyamayīyet |
ācāryapatnīputrāṇehṛtaddhanaṃ || 153 ||

vibhave sati bhūdānaṃ vahudakṣiṇayānvitaṃ |
caturvaṣabhasaṃyuktaṃ kuṃḍaladvitayānvitaṃ || 155 ||

avaśyamarpyayeddhīmānicchanśreyaḥ paraṃ parāṃ |
bhojyājathasuvāsinyodvādaśa brāhmaṇā api || 156 ||

ācāryāliṃganaṃ prāpyatadāśīrbhiḥ kṛtādaraḥ |
prasannalaptamī vidyāyāmahatīsiddhimaśrute || 157 ||

sāmrājyalakṣmīyogastu labhyate daśavatsaraiḥ |
kṛtvakāryaśataṃ vāpi dravyaṃ pādyayatnataḥ || 158 ||

alaṃkārairalaṃkṛtya svācārye bhagavabhyayaṃ |
sapūrṇadakṣiṇānaṃ kāryaṃ siddhimabhīpsatā || 159 ||

navarātravrataṃ kṛtvā mahadatyaṃtapāvanaṃ |
puraścaryāśataphalaṃ sāṃgamāpnoti niścitaṃ || 160 ||

navarātravrata samaṃvratamanyanna vidyate |
yādṛśī jāyate siddhirnavarātravrate śubhe || 161 ||

puraścaryī sahasrairvānasiddhistādaśī bhavet |
navarātravrataśaṃśopasyapuṃsaḥ prajāpate || 162 ||

tasya saṃvatsareriṣṭaṃ jāpetanātra saṃśayaḥ |
navarātravrataṃ kṛtvā vidhinā sāṃgamādarāt || 163 ||

mahatīṃ siddhimāsādya dīrghamāmurathā kṣayaṃ |
mahṛdārogyamāsādya dhanadhānyaudyasaṃkulāṃ || 164 ||

gajāśvarathasaṃpūrṇāṃ sātvikīṃ puṇyahetuko |
acalāṃ labhate lakṣmī trailokopisudurlabho || 165 ||

ācaṃdrārkanasadaihastadvaṃśavyapinī ramā |
vrasatyeva na saṃdeho dhandhānyādi saṃkulā || 166 ||

itthaṃ katvā puraścryā prasannaśrīmahāmanuṃ |
japtvā paṃcaśataṃ protaṣṭāviṃśamidhāghṛtaṃ || 167 ||

hutvātha sāyaṃ bhūyepi japedaṣṭotaraṃśataṃ |
itthamācarataḥ puṃsobhāgyarāśiḥrmadimane || 168 ||

jayaśrīrakṣayānasya mahatsaubhāgyamuttamaṃ |
jāyate dhanadhānyāśvagajaralasamākulā || 169 ||

tadvaṃśa vyāpinī lakṣmīḥ putrapautrādisaṃkulā |
kaikaryaṃ prāpnuvaṃtyasya sarvenapavarā api || 170 ||

<p. 125b>

rājividvatsabhasvagre pūjyatesau dine dine |
itthaṃ kṛtvā puraścaryāmanvahaṃ prātarādarāt || 171 ||

(**) japtvā paṃcaśataṃ lakṣmīpatra hi gacchati |
tatrā calājayaśrīḥ syāt sanmānaṃ pauruṣaṃ yaśaḥ || 172 ||

maṃdiresya mahālakṣmīrvṛddhiyāmti dine dine |
vaṃśābhivṛddhirācaṃdramārkumasya bhavedvudhaṃ || 173 ||

pade padesya kalyāṇamanvahaṃ bhavati dhruvaṃ |
asādhyāmāpi devānāmapi dvīpāṃtarasthitaṃ || 174 ||

sādhyanyeva  sakalamīpsitaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ |
kulasāhasramuddhatyamagraṃ ca narakārṇave || 175 ||

yātiviṣṇoḥ paradhāmadehāṃte nātra saṃśayaḥ |
vāsaṃte navarātrasya puraścaraṇamādarāt || 176 ||

kṛtvetyameva mahatī siddhimāpnotyanutāmāṃ |
atha vakṣyami bhūpālasādhanātarami || 177 ||

bhṛguvāravrataṃ nāmnālakṣmī hṛdayasādhanaṃ |
śrāvaṇekārtikevāpi mārgaśīrṣetathaśvine || 178 ||

māghe vā phālgune vāpi vaiśākhe vā bhargodine |
prathame śuklapakṣasya svācāryājñāpurassaraṃ || 179 ||

prātaḥsratvā viśuddhātmā sahasraṃ vedamātaraṃ |
prajahvatriśataṃ vāpi jvalite jātavedasi || 180 ||

aṣṭaviṃśatidhāṅgatvā vedamātrāgavāṃ ghṛtaṃ |
śrīmaraṣṭārṇamaṃtreṇāpyaṣṭhāviṃśātidhāṅganat || 181 ||

lakṣmīhṛdayamaṃtreṇaśatamaṣṭottaraṃ tataḥ |
hutyāgavyaghṛtaṃ śuddhaṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇau yajet || 182 ||

sugaṃdhikusumairvilvapatrairvā brahmavidyayā |
triśatādhika sāhasramiṃdirāhṛdayaṃ japet || 183 ||

śrīśrīpatidhiyāmyarcyamithunaśrayamādarāt |
mithunadvitayaṃ vāpi yugmamekamathāpi vā || 184 ||

abhuktvāpyatha bhuktvā vā sāyaṃ bhūyopi sādaraṃ |
prasannaśrīmahāvidyāmaṣṭottaraśataṃ japet || 185 ||

āthavarṇaṃ śrīhṛdayaṃ paṃcadhāvānnidhā tataḥ |
śreyaskāmojecchucchaḥ pratibhārgavavāsaraṃ || 186 ||

itthaṃ kṛtvā japaṃ homamārābhyādimabhārgavaṃ |
śrāvaṇe pūrṇimoyāṃtabhārgavevāsare śubhe || 187 ||

<p. 126a>

varalakṣmīdine nāmnā lakṣmīhṛdayavidyayā |
hutvā triśatamājyena pūrvavat prajapetataḥ || 188 ||

tasmindineguroḥpatnyaigurupādāṃvujepi vā |
niṣkatrayaṃ dviniṣkaṃ vā niṣkamekamathāpi vā || 188 ||

samarpya kārtike śuddhe dvādaśyāmudite ravau |
tatrāpi triśataṃ hutvā lakṣmī hṛdayavidyayā || 189 ||

tatrāpi pūrvavadatvāgurave dakṣiṇādhanaṃ |
mārgaśīrṣe pauṇaimāsyāṃ lakṣmīhṛdayavidyayā || 190 ||

tatrāpi triśataṃ hutvā gavyenājyena sādhakaḥ |
pūrvavadakṣiṇaṃ dadyāt svācārya caraṇadvaye || 191 ||

gurorabhāvetatpalyaitatsutāpasamṛpyeyet |
itthaṃ kṛtvā bhṛgorvārevratamatyaṃdapāvana || 192 ||

prasannalakṣmīvidyāssiddhiṃ prāpnoti varṣataḥ |
prāpnoticirasmāpuṣpaṃsamastāssaṃpadopi ca || 193 ||

ārogya mahadāsādyagajāśvarathasaṃkulāṃ |
avāpya mahatīlakṣmīsaṃtativyāpinīmapi || 194 ||

aṇimādi guṇaiśvaryamapi trailokyadurlabhaṃ |
divyāṃjanamavāpnoti siddhidarśanahetukaṃ || 195 ||

vakrājvātasyaniryāti vidyāḥ sarvāḥ sanātanāḥ |
nadhanena viyujyena na kalatreṇa putrakaiḥ || 196 ||

na ralaiḥ paśumirvāpinaviyujyaitavaṃdhubhiḥ |
bhogānaṣṭavidhāścapi samāsādhāti durlabhān || 197 ||

vaikuṃṭeramateteṃsau kulasāhasrasaṃyutaḥ |
ihāmutrāpi saṃsiddhimicchatāniyatātmanā || 198 ||

karmavyaṃ satataṃ bhūpabhārgavevāseravrātaṃ |
anuttamaṃ yaśolābhaṃ japalakṣmīmacaṃcalāṃ || 199 ||

bhagavatpadamicchadriravaśyaṃ bhargavedine |
viśeṣeṇa vrataṃ kāryaśreyovṛddhikaraṃ nṛpa || 200 ||

lakṣmīhṛdayavidyāyāssidhyārthasādhakottamaḥ |
śaktaśca navarātrādivrataṃ sakalamācaret || 201 ||

bhagavansāhitāsākṣānmahālakṣmīstrayīmayī |
prasīdati na saṃdehassatyaṃ satyaṃ vadāmyahaṃ || 202 ||

<p. 126b>

mahatī supuraścaryā sāṃgāsaṃpūrṇadakṣiṇa |
pūrvamuktāmayābhūyasāhāsiddhidathinī || 203 ||

tayā devyā mahālakṣmyāḥ sākṣātkāraḥ prajāyate |
ipsitā nāmasādhyānāmapi siddhistato bahvet || 204 ||

samīkaroti deveṃdrayadamapyanayānṛpa |
grahaṇena samaḥ puṇyakālonāstijarīttraye || 205 ||

japahomādikaṃ sarvamāśaucesūtekapi ca |
na saṃtyājyamiti prāhumunayo brahmavadinaḥ || 206 ||

yāvadgrahaṇamokṣaḥ syātavanmaimāsyasyasūtakaṃ |
samastadānaṃ saṃghānāṃ mahākālassa eva hi || 207 ||

yadi cūḍāmaṇiryogolabhyate tatra bhūtele |
japahomādikaṃ sarvata trākṣayaphaladaṃ || 208 ||

sarvāsāmapividyānāṃ siddhimacchadbhirādarāt |
graṣuṇeṣu puraścaryākāryāsīgāsadakṣiṇā || 209 ||

navarātravrataṃ sarvamahāpātakarbhajanaṃ |
samastāriṣṭaśamanaṃ varṣe varṣe na saṃśayaḥ || 210 ||

sarvāsāmapi vidyānāṃ mahatīsiddhirakṣayā |
navarātravrate vaśyaṃ bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 211 ||

ihāmutrāpi sakalaśreyaskaramanuttamaṃ |
bhṛguvāravrataṃ proktamavaśya sarvasiddhidaṃ || 212 ||

anuttarabrahmatatvārasye śrutisaṃgrahe |
catvāriṃśopamādhyāya uktassarvayaśaskaraḥ || 213 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
catvāriṃśodhyāyaḥ] 40 || 
<p. 126b>

śrībhagavānuvāca || 

prasannāyāhālakṣmyāvidyayāsiddhayānayā |
sādhayetkāmyakarmāṇi samastāni mahīyate || 1 ||

brahmacārī haviṣyāśī vilvamūlaṃ samābhitaḥ |
lakṣamekaṃ prajaptvaimāṃ vidyāṃ sakalasiddhidāṃ || 2 ||

vilvapatraighṛtābhyaktairmadhunnitapasataiḥ |
hutvā tatra samāpnoti dhanaratnaudyamakṣayaṃ || 3 ||

hutvāraṃ māphalairnityamaṣṭottaraśataṃ śuciḥ |
madhutritayagavyājyasaṃplutairmaṃḍaladvayaṃ || 4 ||

<p. 127a>

maṃḍaladvitayāṃte sau divase mabhagavatpriyā |
sākṣātsvapnepi vā paśya sau vigrahadhāriṇīṃ || 5 ||

gajaraladhamāśvādi saṃkulāśrīrathākṣayā |
jāyate tadgahe sadyo mahatīdurvabhāpi ca || 6 ||

bhagavatkalayāyuktamavaśyaṃ putramāpnuyāt |
aruṇaṃbhohahairnityamaṣṭottaraśataṃtraya || 7 ||

madhutritayagavyājyasaṃplutairjuhuyādyadi |
viramāpuṣpamāsādyasaubhāgyamacalaṃ śubhaṃ || 8 ||

dhanadena samolakṣmyāmaṃnulādbhavati dhruvaṃ |
caṃpakaijuhuyānnityamaṣṭottaraśatatrayaṃ || 9 ||

madhutritayagavyājyasaṃplutaiḥ pūrvavacchuciḥ |
maṃḍalenīnasaṃdehaṣkaṃdarpasamakāṃtimān || 10 ||

vaśīkaro bhūpālānapiḍaṣṭhāmahītale |
rājyalakṣmīmavāpnoti svānvāpavyayinīṃ nṛpa || 11 ||

kusumaiḥ kiṃśukīdgataiḥrmadhutritayasaṃplutaiḥ |
maṃḍalaṃ jvalite vahno hutvānniśatamādarāt || 12 ||

sarvāsāmapi vidyānāmadhiyosau bhaviṣyati |
sāṃgāssamastavidyāścanirgacchaṃti mukhāṃvujāt || 13 ||

dūrvābhirājyasiktābhi hutvā śtasahasrakaṃ |
nirāmayo sau dīrghāprabhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 14 ||

hutvā nīlotpalairaścovayutaṃ trimadhulutaiḥ |
vaśīkaroti bhūpālānatha tatkiṃkarānapi || 15 ||

madhutritayagavyājyahnutaṃ pāyasamādarāt |
hutvā yutaṃ vipraḥ paśyatyeva haripriyāṃ || 16 ||

mahadāpuṣpamāsādyadhanavṛṣṭimavāpnuyāt |
guḍucīrājyasaṃsiktā juhuyāt saptavāsaraṃ || 17 ||

aṣṭottarasahasrayassajīṣecchadadāṃśataṃ |
hutvā tilairghṛtābhyaktaidīrghamādyuravāpnuyāt || 18 ||

arogyaṃ labhatermaṃtrīvāṃchitānyāpi maṃtravit |
śālībhirjuhvatonityamaṣṭottaraśatatrayaṃ || 19 ||

maṃḍalādeva mahatī lakṣmīssaṃjāyate dhruvaṃ |
prasūnairjuhuyānmaṃtrīllakṣmīvallīsamudbhavaiḥ || 20 ||

<p. 127b>

naṃdyāvārtasamutthairvāsiddhārthaiśca ṣataṣṇutaiḥ |
mahatī śriyamāpnoti mānyate sarvajaṃtubhiḥ || 21 ||

marīcajīrakonmiśrairnārīśiṃdhurajoyutaiḥ |
samṛdvairājyasaṃyuktairapūvairījyatolataiḥ || 22 ||

juhuyāt pāyasāhāromaṃtravadvijiteṃdriyaḥ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityaṃ maṃḍalādvanadobhavet || 23 ||

haviṣāguḍamiśreṇa juhuyādannavān bhavet |
japāpuṣpāṇi juhuyādaṣṭottarasahasrakaṃ || 24 ||

gṛhītvā prajapedbhasmanāgavallīrasānvitaṃ |
tilakaṃtanupātena sarvavaśyakaraṃ paraṃ || 25 ||

brahmavṛkṣasamitpuṣpaibrahmiṇacaśeyedvaśī |
jātīpuṣpaiyātāścavaiśyānaraktaut(-)palaiḥ śubhaiḥ || 26 ||

śūdrānnīlotpalairhutvāvaśayenmaṃtravittamaḥ |
puṣpairmanohau hutvāvaśamānayatistriyaḥ || 27 ||

hutvā navapadātmānaṃ maṃḍalaṃ yaṃtrabhūrṣitaṃ |
abhikaṃ prakurvīta vidhināsarvasiddhaye || 28 ||

kalaśānsthāpayenmaṃtravittamaḥ puṣpairmavoteṣu padeṣu 
śubhalakṣaṇān caṃdanāliptasarvāṃgānkūrcākṣarasamanvitān || 29 ||

dukūlaveṣṭitān śuddhāvastrairāveṣṭitāṃ |
sudhātīrthavaribhirāpūryasugaṃdhibhirataḥ paraṃ || 30 ||

 navaratnasamāvarddhakarṣakāṃcanakalpitaṃ |
madhyakuṃbhokṣityapreyaṃtrāvyaṃdeśikottamaḥ || 31 ||

caṃdanīśīrakarpūrajātibjaṃ kīlakuṃkumaṃ |
kuṣṭhāgarutamālailābhāgaṃ saṃghṛṣyabhāgtaḥ || 32 ||

vilopta sarvakuṃbheṣṭharatnānyapi viniḥkṣipet |
lakṣmīharvāsadābhadrāsahadevīmadhuvratā || 33 ||

 muśalīcakravallīcakāṃtāpāmārgapadmajaṃ priyaṃ |
gumudgagodhūmavrīhoścaivatilānupavān || 34 ||

śālītaṃḍulamāṣmaṃśca prakṣyālyaiteṣu nikṣipet |
dhānīpikucavilvānokadalīnārikelayoḥ || 35 ||

kalānyapi vinikṣipya puṣpānyetāni vinvaset |
padmasaugaṃdhikajāti mallikāvakulaṃ tathā || 36 ||

<p. 128a>

caṃpakāśaukāśokapunnāgatulasīketakodbhavaṃ |
pallavānivadyeśvatyahyakṣoduṃvaraśākhilāṃ || 37 ||

brahmakūrcaṃce niḥkṣipyacapakaiḥ saphalākṣataiḥpidhāya |
kuṃbhavaktāṇi vastrairācchādaye tataḥ || 38 ||

āvatdyamadhyākalaśe mahālakṣmī prapūjayet |
yajedumādhāḥ śiṣṭeṣṭhakaleśeṣṭaṣṭasukramāt || 39 ||

gaṃdhairmanoharaiḥ puṣpaidhūpadīpa samanvitaiḥ |
naivedyabhakṣyabhojyadyaistānspṛṣṭā prajayenmanuṃ || 40 ||

madhyamaṃ kalaśaśaṃspṛṣṭyā trisahasrajayecchiyaṃ |
trisahasrājapasyāṃtai sādhyamānīyedeśikaḥ || 41 ||

saṃsthāpya sthaṃḍilepīṭhaṃstasmilaṃ viniveśayet |
ramyairābharaṇaivastrairalaṃkṛtyatamādarāt || 42 ||

sumaṃgalābhirnārībhiḥ kṣiptapuṣpākṣatānvitaḥ |
arcitānāṃ dvijātīnāmāśīrvādapurassaraṃ || 43 ||

nadatsupaṃcacādyeṣu muhnate śibhanesudhīḥ |
madhyasthaṃ kuṃbhamudvatmamahālakṣmīmanusmaran || 44 ||

abhiṣiṃcetkramādanyaiḥ kalaśairapi deśikaḥ puṃsūktena ca |
vā karūktamukhyaiḥ sūktaiścavaichavaiḥ || 45 ||

evamānādisūktaistamābhiṣiṃcyāthadeśikaḥ |
keraṇasyaśiraḥsyaṣkā prayuṃjītāṣiśaṣauguruḥ || 46 ||

bhadramastu śivaṃ cāstu mahālakṣmīḥ |
prasīduturakṣatutvāṃ sādādevī saṃpadassatusarvadā || 48 ||

śāṭināmakasūkraiścāpyabhirṣicetataḥ paraṃ |
athotthāyābhiṣaktaḥ sanvāsasoparidhāya ca || 48 ||

yathāṣividhisamācamyapraṇāmedaṃḍavadguruṃ |
gaṃdhādyairapyalaṃ kṛtya svātmānaṃ sadhakastataḥ || 49 ||

vastrairābharaṇairdhānyadhanergopahiṣādibhiḥ |
dāsīdāsaiśca vidhivatoṣayediṃdirādhiyā || 50 ||

brāhmaṇānbhojayesaścadīnāṃ vṛdhakṛpaṇaissaha |
tadākṛtarthamātmābhaṃ bhāvayedgurvanugrahāt || 51 ||

abhiṣiktonarapatiḥ parānvijayate cirāt |
padecchuḥ padamāpnotirījapujonasaṃśayaḥ || 52 ||

<p. 128b>

abhiṣiktāsatīvaṃdhyāsūteputraṃ mahāmatiṃ |
mahārogeṣu jāteṣu kṛtyāṃdeheṣu deśikaḥ || 53 ||

bhūtaṣudurnimitādauvidadhyādabhiṣecanaṃ |
sarvasaṃpatkaraṃ puṃsāṃ sarvasaubhāgyasiddhidaṃ || 54 ||

sarvarogapraśamanasarvopadravabhāśanaṃ |
abhiṣekamimaṃ prāhurāgamārthaviśyādāḥ || 55 ||

vidhināyobhiṣiktaḥ syāt sa rājyaśriyamakṣayāṃ |
māhadāpuṣparogyagejān ratnānivājinaḥ || 56 ||

mahatsaubhāgyasaprotidhanāni suvahnanyapi |
athāparamahālakṣmī hṛdayasyāsya sādhanaṃ || 57 ||

mahāsiddhipradaṃ vakṣye samāhitamanāḥ śṛṇu |
vaiśākhemāsi saṃpropte amiṇupha siddhide || 58 ||

akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāṃ paurṇamāsyāmathāpi vā 
ācāryasyājñayā prātasrātvā saṃdhyāyussara || 59 ||

samāpyanaityakaṃ karmavidhivatsaṃskṛtenale |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhāhutvādedamātrāghṛtaṃ garvā || 60 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣareṇathaśatamaṣṭottaraghṛtaṃ |
prasannarājyalakṣmyāthayanasasyaphalaiḥ śubhaiḥ || 61 ||

tadvojarahitairājyamathutrisayamiśritaiḥ |
triśatādhikasāhasrajuhuyānniyatavrataḥ || 62 ||

sāmrājyalakṣmīvidhābhiścaturbhiśca tataḥ paraṃ |
pratyekaṃ pānasairhutvā śatamaṣṭottaraṃ phalaiḥ || 63 ||

āthivīṇa mahāmaṃtrairlakṣmīhṛdayasaṃsthiteḥ |
ekaikaśastatohutvā prāyaścitāhutīstataḥ || 64 ||

brahmārpaṇahutiṃ kṛtvā praṇamyagrimataḥparaṃ |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ saṣṭhāṃgaṃ praṇipatyatya ca || 65 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ ramyaṃtasahemavinirmitaṃ |
padmarāgasamāyuktaṃ pradatvācāryakarṇayoḥ || 66 ||

asannidhaukarṇayugotātrasyātha vārpayet |
atha vā karṣemānenataptahe āvinirmitaṃ || 67 ||

tāṭakābharaṇaṃdhavāpivālīyugmamathāpi vā |
ācāryavallabhākarṇayugmaidadyānāhīpate || 68 ||

getadhūpuṣpairalaṃkṛtya svācārya bhagavanmayaṃ |
datvā śrīcaṃdanaṃ sūkṣmavāso yugasamanvitaṃ || 69 ||

<p. 129a>

sthūlaṃ vahuphalopetaṃ pānasaphalayacaka |
daṃdyādācārya sānnidhye vahudakṣiṇayānvitaṃ || 70 ||

phalatrayaṃ vāsusthūlaṃ dadyādakṣiṇānvitaṃ |
paṃcaviṃśoyugaśatinirṣkavāniṣkadvādaśakaṃ tu vā || 71 ||

aśaktaḥ paṃcaniṣkaṃ vā triniṣkaṃ vā samarpayet |
brāhmaṇanbhojayet paścatpaṃcavāpi suvāsinīḥ || 72 ||

dadhyodanaiśūtaphalairūpānadhvajanādibhiḥ |
tauṣayedakṣiṇabhiśca brāhmaṇānvasudhāyate || 73 ||

vaṃdhubhissahabhuṃjītasvayaṃ paśvādyatavrataḥ |
ācāryāliṃganaṃ prāpyatadāśībhiḥ kṛtādaraḥ || 74 ||

paśyatyevaśriyaṃ sākṣānnārāyaṇasamanvitā |
māsmādarvādgasaṃdeho brahmarudrāvivaṃditāṃ || 75 ||

hṛdādimaṃdabhāgyopimahadāpuṣpamakṣayaṃ |
aṇimādi guṇaiśvaryaṃ jātismaraṇamuttaṃ || 76 ||

gajāśvarathasaṃpūrṇadhanaratnaughasaṃkulāṃ mahatīṃ |
śriyamāsādyabhuktvābhogāśca durlabhān || 77 ||

bhagavatsaṃnidhāvaṃtetiṣṭhatyeva na saṃśayaḥ |
bhūyo'pisādhanaṃ vakṣye mahāsiddhipradāyaka || 78 ||

yacchrutvāpi narodhīmānāpatsaṃghairvimucyate |
purādevāsurāssarvesaṃbhūya ca paraspara || ||

pratipadi na mārabhya nārāyaṇa samanvitāḥ |
śāpādurvāsaptonaṣṭaśriyobhagyavivarjitāṃ || 79 ||

darśanāya mahālakṣmyāmukuṃdasyājñayā nṛpa |
samudramadhanaṃ cakruramṛtonmathanāpate || 80 ||

kāle kūṭādikaṃ sarvamutpannadinasaptataḥ |
api yatra vacatāṃ teṣāṃ nāvirāsītrapīmayī || 81 ||

ekādaśīdine tatra kārtikeśuklapakṣake |
surāsurānirāhārālakṣmīhṛdayanāmakaṃ || 83 ||

japaṃto manumekāgrāḥ śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ śubhaṃ |
samudramathanaṃ cakrurharīnāya mahāśriyaḥ || 83 ||

bhānūdaye yadvādaśyāṃ divyā naraṇābhūṣitā |
āvirāsīmmahālakṣmīssasāmudrājjagadaṃvikā || 84 ||

<p. 129b>

kirīṭahārakepūratā ṭaṃkādi vibhūṣitā |
sahasrapatrakamalamālyayuktā trayīmapī || 85 ||

nārāyaṇaṃ ca brahmāṇamīśaṃ śakramukhānapi |
dṛṣṭvā bhagavato vakṣyasthalaṃ prāyasanātānī || 86 ||

tāpānirīkṣitāssādyaḥ śakrādyāḥ samarudgaṇāḥ |
samastasaṃpadādhārā abhabhavanvasudhāyet || 87 ||

tadā bhagavatīlakṣmīḥ prāha sarvasurānapi |
śṛṇudhvaṃ brahmarudrādyāḥ śakrādyāśca saharṣayaḥ || 88 ||

śreyase sarvalokānāṃ pravadāmiyaśaskaraṃ |
nāmnā kārtikamāsesminyomāmartṛsamanvitāṃ || 89 ||

yajaṃti manujābhatmāte sarvebhāgyabhāginaḥ |
yosminmajjanmadivasobhāmarccayati suvrataḥ || 90 ||

matprīteya suvarṇaniguraveyaḥ prayacchati |
vasāmi maṃdire tasye dhanaratnaughasaṃkulā || 91 ||

samastavedavedāṃtasārabhūtaṃ sanātanaṃ |
rahasyabhayi vakṣyāmi sarvasiddhikaraṃ paraṃ || 92 ||

kārtikemāsi saṃpropta pratipaddhinamāditaḥ |
ārabhyācāryayādābjadvitayaṃ praṇipatya ca || 93 ||

ācāryānujñayāprātaḥ snātvā pratidine śuciḥ |
sahasraṃ triśataṃ vāpi prajaptvā vedamātaraṃ || 94 ||

nityahomaṃ samāpyātharjvālatejātavedasi |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā vedamātrāghṛtaṃ juvāṃ || 95 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā |
ājyaṃ prasannāramapādunedaṣṭottaraṃśataṃ || 96 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāmarkasāhasramādarāt |
saṃkalpyatadaśamyaṃtaṃ japedekakāmamānasaḥ || 97 ||

tataḥ paraṃ mahīlakṣmī hṛdayākhyāṃ mahāmanuṃ |
saṃkalpyārka sahasrāṇi daśamyaṃtaṃ japecchiviḥ || 98 ||

haviṣyāmathabhuṃjītalavasāmlavivarjitaṃ |
dvādaśākṣaralakṣmī vā śrīṣaḍarṇamathāpi vā || 99 ||

bhaktiyukto japedvidvānarkasāhasramādadāt |
ekādaśīdinaiyaścādācryājñāpurassaraṃ || 100 ||

prātaḥsrātvāvidhānena nityavumasamāpya ca |
ācāryacaraṇādvamdvaṃ sākṣyaṃgaṃ praṇipatyaca || 101 ||

<p. 130a>

vidhivat saṃskṛte vahnau vedamātrājyamāditaḥ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā || 102 ||

gavyamājyaṃ hunetpaścacchatādhika sahasrakaṃ |
triśatādhikasāhasraṃ kamalairvākuśeśayaiḥ || 103 ||

madhutritayasaṃpūktairgavyenājyena miśritaiḥ |
lakṣmīhṛdayamaṃtreṇa juhuyāt sādhakottamaḥ || 104 ||

dvādaśākṣaralakṣmyā vā ṣaḍakṣaryātha vā hunet |
padmābhavevilvadalairgavyājyamadhumiśritaiḥ || 105 ||

juhuyājjvalite vahno saṃrakṣote vidhivacchuciḥ |
tulasīmiśritairvilvadalaiśvakusumaiḥ śubhaiḥ || 106 ||

vṛhadāvaṇoyetau śrīśrīśāvarcayet surāḥ |
triśatādhikasāhasrāmāvītadbrahmāvidyayā || 107 ||

rātrāvabhyarcyapalenadidyānnīrājaye tataḥ |
brāhmemuhūrte utthāya srātvātha dvādaśīdine || 108 ||

sāvitrīṃ triśataṃ japtvā jvalite jātavedasi |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā gāyatryāghṛtamādarāt || 109 ||

śrīmadaṣṭarṇamaṇtreṇāpyaṣṭotaraśataṃ hunet |
aṣṭottaraḥ śataṃ paścatpadmairmadvidyayā hunet || 110 ||

padmābhāveghṛtaṃ gavyaṃ juhuyadvidyayā mama |
bhagavadraśmibhiḥ yaścodakaikāmāhuniṃ hunet || 111 ||

pūrvedyurapi hutvātha bhagavadraśmibhistridhā |
athācāryadadvaṃdvaṃ sāṣṭhāṃgaṃ praṇipatya ca || 112 ||

gaṃdhapuṣpairalaṃkṛtya ṣaṣṭicivuka hemajaṃ |
padmarāgasamāyuktaṃ kuṃḍaladvayamarpayet || 113 ||

pratyāya suvarṇaṃ vā datvācārya padāṃvuje |
vāso yugmaṃ samarpyātha kṣaumaṃ kāpī sameva vā || 114 ||

sālagrāmaśilāṃ śuddhāṃvastrakīṭavinirmitāṃ |
savatsagaudvayapunāṃvahudākṣmiṇayānvitāṃ || 115 ||

samarpayedayācāryahastābje deśikottamaḥ |
dhanāḍhyorājaputraśca dadyāt sāhasradakṣiṇāṃ || 116 ||

śataṃ tadamayavātadardhārdhamathāpi vā |
paṃcaniṣkacaturniṣkaniṣkavayamitaṃ tu vā || 117 ||

ācāryāyadhanaṃ dadyādvitalobhavivarjitaḥ |
ācāryapatnīmabhyarcyavāsolaṃkaraṇadibhiḥ || 118 ||

<p. 130b>

dvādaśayasuvāsinyobhojyāviprāścatadine |
dakṣiṇābhiścatāṃ kūlaistauyeddevatādhiyā || 119 ||

ācāryādāśiṣaḥ prāpya sahabhuṃjotavaṃdhubhiḥ |
kātikenasi kṛtvetthaṃ vratamatyatapovanaṃ || 120 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtrasyamadvidyā yāśvasāśvātī |
mahatīsiddhimrāpnoti sadya eva na saṃśayaḥ || 121 ||

putravatamahīnityaṃ pālayāmi na saṃśayaḥ |
avaśyaṃ maṃdabhāgyasya sannidhautasya saṃtataṃ || 122 ||

sthitvā samastamaiśvaryaṃ dadāmyaṣṭaguṇāvitaṃ |
śaṃkhādīnāṃ nidhānānāmādhipatyaṃ ca śāśvataṃ || 123 ||

akṣayaṃ dhanaratnaurghaḥ gajāśvatha saṃkulaṃ |
akṣayaṃ mahadāregyamakṣayāpuṣpamapyatha || 123 ||

akṣayānsakalānbhogān divyānapi ca mānuṣyān |
akṣayaṃ sarvasaubhāgyaṃ dadāmyasya na saṃśayaḥ || 124 ||

madvidyāyā prasūnnāyāssāṃgasaṃpūrṇadakṣiṇā || 125 ||

mahatīyā puraścaryā mahāsiddhipradayinī |
tadvā daśaphalaṃ tasya bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 126 ||

itthaṃ kṛtvā puraścaryāṃ kārtikamāsisiddhide |
asādhyamapi devanāṃ sādhayatyeva vāṃchitaṃ || 127 ||

ācāryānugratasyavaṃśyānāmapi śāśvatīṃ |
dādāmi mahatī lakṣmīmaṃtepi paramaṃ padaṃ || 128 ||

ācāryapatnīputrādipoṣāṇāryaṃ dine dine |
kṛtvādhanārjanaṃ nityaṃ datvācārya padāṃvujaṃ || 129 ||

sāṃgadakṣiṇapayuktavājimedha śatodbhavaṃ |
avaśyaṃ phalamāpnoti saṃśayonātravidyeta || 130 ||

ācāryārthaṃ vivāhārthaṃ yāgārthaṃ ca dine dine |
dhanārjanaṃ mahatpuṇyamāhurdivyāmahārṣayaḥ || 131 ||

ācāryacaraṇaddhadvepuraścaṇakarmaṇi |
brahmalāṃ dakṣiṇaṃ datvā brahma prāpnoti śāśvataṃ || 132 ||

śrotriyāya daridrāya vivāhārthaṃ dhanaṃ mitaṃ |
yācitvāpi pradāyātha brahmaprāpnoti śāśvataṃ || 133 ||

ācāryasyātha vā svasya yāgāthaṃ jagatītale |
kṛtvādhanārjanaṃ nityaṃ nimagrairapi koṭiśaḥ || 134 ||

pitṛbhiṣputrapautrādyaissahisauparapadaṃ |
mamayatyurbhagavatastadvāmasamavāpnuyāt 135

<p. 131a>

majjanmadivesayosmintapyācārya padāṃvuje |
dakṣiṇāmapi yatkiṃcidatvā siddhiṃ parāṃ vrajet || 136 ||

tadārabhya pratidinaṃ saptaviṃśākṣarīmimāṃ |
japtvā paṃcaśataprātaḥ sāyamaṣṭhotaraśataṃ || 137 ||

saubhāgyaṃ paramaṃ dīrghamāpurārogyamutamaṃ |
saṃprāpya sadvīyāmacirādadhiyo bhavet || 138 ||

bhagīrathāṃvarīṣādi sadṛśerājyasaṃpadā |
dehāṃte bhagavaddhāmayāti vaṃśasamanvitaḥ || 139 ||

yadyatravasudhādānaṃ sāṃgadakṣiṇamācaret |
tasya puṇyaphalaṃ vaktuṃ nāhaṃ śaktāsmivāmarāḥ || 140 ||

śuddhātṛtīyāvaiśākhemahāsiddhipradāyinī |
paurṇamāsī ca vaiśākhīmahāsiddhikarīmmatā || 141 ||

utthāna dvādaśīmāse kārtike sarvasiddhidā |
ekādaśyapitanmāse mahāsiddhirī smṛtā || 142 ||

sidhyarthaṃ yatnavānisyaṃ yatyurmama ca bhaktimān |
majjanmadivasevaśāṃ kuryādvatamataṃdritaḥ || 143 ||

pratiyaddinamāramya dvādaśyaṃtaṃ dine dine |
kārtike sā sikṛtthaṃ varṣevarṣe vrataṃ śubhaṃ || 144 ||

ihāpi sākṣādbhagavatejasaḥ kalayānvitaḥ |
maṃtramūrtirviśuddhātmā svātmānaṃ brahmarūpiṇī || 145 ||

yanyevasva cakṣubhyaṃ cidānaṃdarasātmakaṃ |
śrūyate dūragāvannākhecarānapipaśyati || 146 ||

pakṣepakṣetha vā māsimāsi vā mātrapīmayīṃ |
paśyatyeva svacakṣurbhyāṃ nārāṇa samanvitāṃ || 147 ||

matprasādakarīvidyāṃ mimāṃ paṃcaśataṃ japan |
svakaṭākṣekṣaṇenānyān śrīsamṛddhānkarotyapi || 148 ||

aiśvaryamapi māheṃdramāsurmapi saṃpadaṃ |
tṛṇīkaroti madbhaktaḥ svaśriyānātrasaṃśayaḥ || 149 ||

ityuktvā sā mahālakṣmīrnārāyaṇasamanvitā |
paśyatāṃ sarvadevānāmapi cātahitā bhavatu || 50 ||

bhūyopi saṃpravakṣyāmi bhārgavevāsare vrataṃ |
yatkṛtvā sādhakoloke mahatī siddhi maśnute || 151 ||

kārtike mārgaśīrṣe vā māghe vā phālānepi vā |
vaiśākhe śrovaṇevapi sāmārabhyāśvinepi vā || 152 ||

<p. 131b>

samārabhyadvijaḥ kuryādbhārgavevāsare vrataṃ |
samastasaṃpatyāśrājyakāraṇaṃ bhuktimuktidaṃ || 153 ||

bhaguvāravrataṃ puṇyamanāyāsaphalapradaṃ |
ukteṣu śubhamāseṣu prathame bhārgavodine || 154 ||

samārabhyavrataṃ kuryāt samastaphalasiddhidaṃ |
nityaṃ paṃcaśataṃ japtvā svācāryājñāpurassaraṃ || 155 ||

bhārgavepidine japtvā tathā paṃcaśate śriyaṃ |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā gāyatryādau gavāṃ ghṛtaṃ || 156 ||

śrīmadaṣyakṣereṇatha śatamaṣṭottaraṃ hunet |
prasannalakṣmīmaṃtreṇa triśataṃ juhuyādvyataṃ || 157 ||

suvāsinī trayaṃ viścatritayaṃ cāpi bhoye tu |
ācāryapatnī saṃpūjyārātanaṃ bhārgadine || 158 ||

ācāryavahubhāyadvā māsādye bhārgavedine |
abhyacyajaṃghapuṣpādyairvāsolaṃkāramarpayet || 159 ||

karṣasvāṇaṃ tadardhaṃ vā niṣkasvarṇatadardhaka |
samarpyasvaguroḥ palyaimahālakṣmīdhiyānṛpa || 160 ||

ekaṃ vā mithunaṃ lakṣmīpatidhiyārcayet |
gurupatnyākṣasānnidhyedradyādācāryapādayoḥ || 161 ||

guruṣutrāya vā dadyātatpautrāyātha vārpayet |
sarveṣāmapya sānnidhye bhagavatsannidhau nṛpa || 162 ||

saṃkalpya dakṣiṇadravyaṃ preṣayecca tataḥ paraṃ |
athavācārya pādābjārūḍha śrīpādukāyuge || 163 ||

samarpyapreṣayetpaścādācārya tato vratī |
bhārgavevāsare kurvaśiṣṭaṃ vratamutamuttamaṃ || 164 ||

japtvā paṃcaśatanityaṃ sāyamaṣṭotaraśataṃ |
labhatamadaṃ bhāgyopi svarṇaratnasamākulāṃ || 165 ||

gajāśvarathasaṃpūrṇāṃ mahālakṣmīmacaṃcalī |
na putrairnakalatreṇa na ratnairnadhanairapi || 166 ||

naviyujyetapaśubhiḥ kutracitkṣupibhūyate |
āyuṣyasyātha vṛddhiḥ syādārogyasvya ca saṃtataṃ || 167 ||

ṛgyajussāmavedānāmapi pāragato bhavet |
mīmāṃsādvayatarkadiśāstrapāragatopi ca || 168 ||

bhūtvā sarvaguṇeyetā prāpyaputrānanutamān |
yogamaṣṭāgamāsābhuktvā bhogāṃścakṣubhān || 169 ||

<p. 132a>

yātyaṃte bhagavaddhāmakulātāṃ śatasaṃyutaḥ |
 mahāsiddhipradānyasyāssaṃtyanyāni śrutau smṛtau || 170 ||

avaśyaṃ sādhayedenāṃstiddhimicchananunnamāmaṃ |
durlabhamimanuṣyāṇāṃ mamarāṇaṃ ca durlabhā || 171 ||

anayāsādhyate sarvaśreyassiddhirmahīyeta |
dīkṣāyuktaḥ śucirnityaṃ virdyasājyaśriyojepan || 172 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī japtvā labhecchuyaḥ paraṃparāṃ |
sāmrājyalakṣmīvidyāyā māhātmyamayanāśanaṃ |
kiṃciraktaṃ mayā tubhyaṃ kiṃ punaḥ śrotumicchasi || 173 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttaraṃ brahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
ekacatvāriṃśedhyāyaḥ] 41 || 
<p. 132a>

rājovācaṃ || 

dīkṣābhiṣekā ityuktastvayā sarvajapyate |
tadvidhānaṃ vadasvādya mama nārāyaṇaprabho || 1 ||

śrībhagavānuvāca || 

athābhiṣekaṃ vakṣyāmi dīkṣāvidhimanuttamaṃ |
upāsanāśatenapi vināyena na sidhyati || 2 ||

bhuṃtevāsi viśuddhātmā svācāryaṃ yatatonvahaṃ |
toṣayetsalalairathaibhaktiśraddhā samanvitaḥ || 3 ||

yadā dadāti saṃtuṣṭaḥ prasanno varado manuṃ |
svayamevā tathā kuryāditi katavyatā kramaṃ || 4 ||

viśuddhadeśakāleṣu śuddhātmāniyatotvahaṃ |
śuśrūṣitaśca satataṃ bhaktyā śiṣyeṇāsādaraṃ || 5 ||

saṃkalpyoyoṣyakartavyamaṃkurāropaṇaṃ nṛpa |
kuryānnāṃdomukhaśrāddhamādau ca svāstivācanaṃ || 6 ||

svagṛkdyoktavidhānena tadetadvidadhītavai |
madhumāse bhaveduḥkhaṃ mādhaṣeratnasayaḥ || 7 ||

aśubhaṃ bhavati jyeṣṭe āṣāḍhe vaṃdhunāśanaṃ |
samṛddhiḥ śrāvaṇenhanavīryāṇaṃ saṃmadāmapi || 8 ||

pīḍābhādrayaddemasi sarvasaṃpada āśvine |
jñānaṃ syāt kārtike saukhyaṃ mārgaśīrṣe bhavatyapi || 9 ||

paurvajñānakṣayomāghe bhavet saṃdarśana mama |
samastabhīṣṭasiddhiḥ syāt phālgunemāsi saṃtataḥ || 10 ||

ravaumurau vudheśukre kartavyaṃ bhānuvāsare |
aśvinīrohiṇīsvātīviśākhāhastabheṣu ca || 11 ||

<p. 132b>

jyeṣṭottarātrayeṣvevakuryānmatrabhiṣecanaṃ |
pūrṇimāpaṃcamī caiva tṛtīyasasamītathā || 12 ||

trayodaśī ca daśaṣīpraśastāssavakīmadāḥ |
paṃcāṃgabhuddhadivase valavatyapi vā kāmau || 13 ||

guruśukrodayeśuddhelagne dvādaśodhite |
caṃdratārānukūle ca śasyate sarvakarmasu || 14 ||

navāramāsadoṣaḥ syādgrahaṇerdhadrasūryayoḥ |
tatra yadyatkṛtaṃ sarvatadanaṃtaphalapradaṃ  || 15 ||

nānyadanveṣaṇacedūraviyarvaṇibhūyate |
savitugraheṇaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ somasya grahaṇadapi || 16 ||

yadiḍāmaṇistaragrahaṇadviteya bhavet |
kṛtasya karmajātasya phalaṃ vaktuṃ na śakyate || 17 ||

yoyomaṃtro gṛhītotra sa sadyassiddhimān bhavet |
gṛhītāpiyunāvidyā tatra dīkṣā purassarā || 19 ||

ācāryavadanāllabdhā mahāsiddhiṃ pradāyinī |
bhūyopi sarvavidyānāṃ grahaṇe caṃdrasūryayoḥ || 19 ||

dīkṣāpurassarāprāptirācārya vadanādyadi |
anāyāsena siddhiḥ syāt sadya eva phalapradā || 20 ||

siddayesavapidyānī tatra tīrthābhiṣecana |
kartavyaṃ sarvayaleranaśiṣyāṇāṃ phalasiddhaye || 21 ||

caturmirvaṇekaissamyagraktapītasitāsitāsitaiḥ |
suramyaṃ maṃḍalaṃ kṛtvā tatra dhānyāṃjalidvayaṃ || 22 ||

nidhāyakalaśaṃ tatra tīrthatoyenapūritaṃ |
veṣṭītaṃ vastrayugmena paṃcaratnasamanvitaṃ || 23 ||

āmrāśvatthaprasūnaiśca śākhābhirūpaśobhitaṃ |
nārikela phalopetaṃ maṃgalaiḥ parito jvalaṃ || 24 ||

sarvotsavasamāyuktaṃ kṛtvā tatrārvadyediṃ |
śriyācitkalayāyuktaṃ yaṃtreṣṭākṣārasiddhide || 25 ||

ṛgyajuḥ sāmasūktaiścastotraiḥ paurāṇikairapi |
maṃtrairāgamikaiścaivaṣvaikṛvairnāthamacceyet || 26 ||

varayedvaiṣvavānviprānutamābharaṇānvitān |
śrāvayetaiśca sūktāni maṃtrānviṣṇutsavetadā || 27 ||

ācāryaḥ pūrvavidhinānyāsa jātaṃ samācaret |
athavā mātṛkāṃ śuddhāṃ mātṛkāṃ vaihuvīmapi || 28 ||

tanmūrtipaṃjaranyāsaṃ tatvanyāsamataḥ paraṃ |
vārṇanyāsaṃ daśavidhacinmayīmātṛkāmapi || 29 ||

paṃcāṃgaṃ puratonyasyanyāsaṃ kṛtvattha mādarāt |
nyāsajālamiti nyasya pūjayetatra pūrvavat || 30 ||

<p. 133a>

pūjanīśca pūrvoktasādhanaiḥ śrīpati vibhuṃ |
uttamaṃ kāyennṛtyagītavādhairmanoharaiḥ || 31 ||

puṇyastrībhyo gṛhasthebhyo dadyādvadusuvistaraṃ |
gaṃdhapuṣpāvṛtāṃ kalasuvāsobhūṣaṇādikaṃ || 32 ||

bhojanaṃ cānnapānīyamanyebhyopitapodhana |
evaṃ tatrotsarvakṛtvātrikālamapi pūjayet || 33 ||

śatrāvapi samabhyarcya trikālaṃ vijiteṃdriyaḥ |
nirāhāraḥ phalāśīṣā pūrvepustri sahasrakaṃ || 34 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī japtvā śatādhika sahasrakaṃ |
lakṣmī hṛdayavidyāṃ vā dvādaśārṇamathapivā || 35 ||

aṣṭākṣarī mahālakṣmyāḥ prajayedvāṣāḍakṣarī |
parehani tathā prātaḥ pūrvavat sarvamācaret || 36 ||

saṃpūja vidhivat sākṣāllakṣmīnārāyaṇo vibhū |
kuṃḍanirmāya vidhivat kṛtvā tatrapi maṃḍalaṃ || 37 ||

tatra vahniṃ pratiṣṭhāpya gṛtdyoktavidhināmuviḥ |
sāṃgāvaraṇamāvātdyatatrābhyacyaśriyapatiḥ || 38 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣareṇātha maṃtraralenabhūyate |
dadhidugdhājyasahitaiḥ sahasraṃ juhupatilaiḥ || 39 ||

śrīmaṃtrānyatametathatriśataṃ juhuyādvātaṃ |
kṛtvā pūrṇahutiṃ tatrā tatatra tatastaṃ kalaśeceyet || 40 ||

tato dikṣu valiṃ datvā pārṣadebhyossamāhitaḥ |
śiṣyavaryamathāhnapabhakti na amakalmaṣaṃ || 41 ||

prāṇānāmamyavidhivadabhiṣekaṃ samācaret |
pāvamānena sūktai na surāstvāmini maṃtrakaiḥ || 42 ||

abhiṣiṃcejratanmūdhitadetatkalaśodakaṃ |
nārāyaṃ svayaṃ viṣṇuḥ śiṣyesaṃnidadhātivai || 43 ||

sarvagassarvatopyassi asīdatidayānidhiḥ |
iti saṃsmṛtyasasmṛtyatajjalairabhiṣecayet || 44 ||

paridhāpyā ca vāsaścacaṃdanānyanullipya ca |
dhārayitvāmgulīyādibhūṣaṇanyaṣi sarvaśaḥ || 45 || 

<p. 133b>

vaiṣṇavīṃ mātṛkāṃ nyasya tatvanyasamataḥparaṃ |
tanmūrtipaṃjaranyāsamṛṣyādinyāsa pūrvakaṃ || 46 ||

ātmavadvidhiyacchipyatanāvevaṃ pravinyaset |
tatastacchi ravi svasya datvā hastaṃ ca dakṣiṇaṃ || 47 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī vidyāmaṣṭottaraśataṃ japet |
śrīmaṃtrānyatamaṃ paścācchatamaṣṭottaraṃ japet || 48 ||

raśmimālāmanusmṛtya sakṛdevatāḥ paraṃ |
ācāryotha prasannausmai śiṣyāyodakapūrvakaṃ || 49 ||

tadakṣiṇakeradadyānmaṃtrarājaṃ mahīpate |
śrīmaṃtrānyatamenāthasveṣṭhamaṃtreṇasaṃyutaṃ || 50 ||

svato jyotirmayī vidyāṃ gacchaṃtī bhāvayedguruḥ |
āgatāṃ bhāvayecchipyodhanyosmīti punaḥ punaḥ || 51 ||

śiṣyasya dakṣiṇe karṇe śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣarī | 
tvātha śrīmadaṣṭārṇayaṃtrarājaṃ samarpayet || 52 ||

mahālakṣmīmanuṃ dadyāheteṣviṣṭhatanaṃ tataḥ |
śiṣyasya dakṣiṇe karṇe tata iṣṭamanūnapi || 53 ||

dadyāghrāyaśiraḥ paścāt kuryādāliṃganaṃ nṛpa |
kṛta kṛtyastataśiṣyastasme sarvaṃ nivedayet || 54 ||

yaccayāvacca tadbhatmāguraveṣṭa mānasaḥ |
gobhūhiraṇyābharaṇagṛhakṣetrādikaṃ nṛpa || 55 ||

noce dardhanadardha vā caturthāśa mamathāpi vā |
aśleśādatra vastrādi dadyādvitānusārataḥ || 56 ||

rājāvāpidhanāthovāgrāmāṇāṃ śatamarpayet |
sahasradakṣiṇaguktamācāryāya prasannadhīḥ || 57 ||

saptarātraṃ paṃcarātraṃ trirātravaikarātrakaṃ |
ādaudī dīkṣāvidhiṃ kṛtvā vidyāṃ dadyādgurustataḥ || 58 ||

grahaṇe samanuprāpte dīkṣīṃ kṛtvaikavāsaraṃ |
kalaśasyāyanādīmi kṛtvā pūrvoditanica || 59 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī japtvānni sahasraṃ samāhitaḥ |
triśatādhikasāhasraṃ śrīmaṃtrānyatamaṃ japet || 60 ||

grahaṇasparśasamayesnātvānadyāṃ svayaṃguruḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣeraṇaśca sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 61 ||

yadadhimudrājyasahitairhutvā kṛṣṇatilaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
śrīmaṃtrānyatamenātha śatamaṣṭottaraṃ hunet || 62 ||

brahmārpaṇahutiṃ kṛtyānūtānodakapūrite |
pūrvavatpūjayet kuṃbhe lakṣmīnārāyaṇavubhau || 63 || 

<p. 134a>

icchabhaktiyutaṃ śiṣyamabhiṣicyodakena ca |
parīdhāpya ca ṣosaścadhārayitvāthābhūṣaṇaṃ || 64 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarītasyaśiraḥ spṛṣṭhāśataṃ japet |
tato dehepi vinyasya vaiṣṇavīmātṛkāṃ tu vā || 65 ||

pacāganyāsamātraṃ vā kārayitvā mahīyate |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ brahmavidyāpurassarāṃ || 66 ||

datvāsya dakṣiṇīkarṇe dadyādiṣṭaṃściyo manuṃ |
paścādiṣṭhamanūnadatvā kārayedāśiṣastataḥ || 67 ||

śirṣyopi kṛtakṛtyātmā svācāryacaraṇadvaye |
sarvasvaṃ vā tādardhaṃ vātadardhārdhaṃ samarpayet || 68 ||

yadvadhenudvayaṃ bhūmiṃ pakvasasyasamanvitāṃ |
paṃcaviśatinikaṃ vā tadardhaṃ vā suvarṇakaṃ || 69 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ datvā nūtanaṃ gṛhamarpyayet |
datvā vahnanivāsāṃsidhānyarāśimathākṣayaṃ || 70 ||

kārāṃtaramālaṃ vyasvācāryaṃ matsvarūpiṇaṃ |
avaśyaṃ vahubhirvitaistoṣayenmanusiddhaye || 71 ||

guruputrakalatrādīnapi saṃtoṣayetataḥ |
arhaṇabhiśca vahudhāvāsolaṃkatāṇadibhiḥ || 72 ||

vitaśāṭhyaṃ parityajya gurayedatadakṣirāḥ |
kṛtatyo bhavet sadyassiddhaṃ maṃtro na saṃśayaḥ || 73 ||

dīkṣābhiṣekavidhināya ācāryamukhāṃvujāt |
upadiṣṭhāṃśca bhūyopi yogahlājimanūtamān || 74 ||

avaśyaṃ mahatīsiddhiṃ prāpnuyāt sadya eva hi |
tāvatkālakṛtaṃ hāmajapādi phalamakṣayaṃ || 72 ||

praviśatyasya śiṣyasya śarīre nātrasaṃśayaḥ |
tasmādācārya pādābje dātavyā pūrṇadakṣiṇā || 73 ||

saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇabhāve samastaṃ niṣphalaṃ bhavet |
vidyāssamastā datvā datvāpi rahasyamupadiśya ca || 74 ||

aṃte vāsināmācāryo vahukālaṃ parīkṣya ca |
upadiṣṭaṃ ca bhūyopi maṃtraratnanidaṃ śubhaṃ || 75 ||

japahomādibhissiddhaṃ dadyādīkṣāpurassaraṃ |
ravīdugrahaṇe puṇyeyadidīkṣābhicanaṃ || 76 ||

prāptamācārya sānnidhyāt sadyassiddhamanurbhavet |
etatkalovārāṃte sau vaikuṃṭhe bhagavatpude || 77 || 

<p. 134b>

surasāsrājyalakṣmyāsāvabhiṣikto bhavedhruvaṃ |
avijñāya valaṃmāsa vāracaṃdrādisaṃbhavaṃ || 78 ||

maṃtramātraṃ svaśiṣyāyayodadyāsahidyātukaḥ |
tasmatsarvajñamācāryamāśreyadbhagavaddhiyā || 79 ||

aṣṭākṣaropadeśāṃte śrīmaṃtrānsakalānapi |
vāsudevādikānmātrānvahnanārāyaṇadikān || 80 ||

śiṣyasya dakṣiṇe karṇe dadyādvāraśmimālikī |
dvayaṃ bhāgavatī proktā dīkṣānārāyaṇīśubhā || 81 ||

nanāstikā padātavyānāśiṣyāya kadācana |
na saṃdigdhāya mūrkhāya vedaniṃ vā parāya vā || 82 ||

dīkṣāvidhimavijñāyatmāsādivalamapyatha |
yo dadāti mahāvidyāṃ śiṣyaṃ cātmānamapyasau || 83 ||

prāpayatyeva narakaṃ yamaloke sudāruṇaṃ |
ajñātvāmāsavārāddivalamācāryavaktrataḥ || 84 ||

yo gṛhṇāti mahāvidyāṃ na sasadgati maśrute |
kiṃcāpyavivadaḥ sarvābhayaṃtīha dine dine || 85 ||

tādadaśenopadiṣṭāśca bhūyopi subhubhedine |
sarvavit sadgurorvaktrādgṛhītvā siddhimaśrutaṃ || 86 ||

iyaṃ narāyaṇī dīkṣā vaiṣṇavī siddhidāyinī |
dīkṣiteṣvapi sarveṣu dīkṣito vaiṣṇavodhikaḥ || 87 ||

aśvamedhādiyāgeṣudīkṣitebhyopyasau mahān |
ekena janmanau vāsau mukta ityabhidhīyate || 88 ||

dīkṣābhiṣyekaṃ saṃprāpya svādhāyarkasaṇāvaśāt |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā sakṛtsmatvāpi mucyate || 89 ||

dīkṣābhiṣekayuktauyaḥ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japet |
aṣṭadaśakṣarīṃ vāpi brahmavidyāpurassarāṃ || 90 ||

sāmrājya śrīmahāvidyāṃ śrīmaṃtrānvātha vaiṣṇavān |
ihāpi siddhividyo saumuktaḥ saṃsārasāgarāt || 91 ||

bhūtvā bhagavadākorābrahmānaṃdamayo bhavet |
sadyaḥ pātakarāśighraṃ vahuśroyovivardhanaṃ || 92 ||

dīkṣābhiṣecanaṃnāma vaiṣṇavaṃbhuktimuktidaṃ |
viṣṇudīkṣābhiṣeko vā yogoṣṭāṃgayutopi vā || 93 ||

bhagavadarśanaṃ vapinnayaṃ kaivalyasādhanaṃ |
nainaścitayatostyanyadbrahmasaṃprāptikāraṇaṃ || 94 ||

<p. 135a>

ṛṣyabhṛṃga uvāca || 

dīkṣībhiṣecanaṃ proktamityaṃrāmeṇādho mātā |
jānakīpatināpūrvaśreyoṣṭhaddhipradāyakaṃ || 95 ||

avaśyaṃ viṣṇudīkṣāṃyādīkṣitā niyatravratāḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarījyahvābhajadhdhvaṃ rāmacyutaṃ || 96 ||

kṛtakṛtyābhavaṃtotha brahmaprāptyatha śāśvataṃ idameva paratapaḥ || 97 ||

idameparaṃpurāyamidemavamahadvrataṃ |
ayameve paro yogo dīkṣeya vaiṣṇavī śubhā || 98 ||

aśvamedhādipyageṣu dīkṣitopi yatavrataḥ |
dīkṣito viṣṇudīkṣāyāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī japan || 99 ||

anaṃtamayutaṃ sākṣātparaṃbrahma praparśyata |
dīkṣābhiṣecānaṃ labdhā paṃcadhāvānnidhaikadhā || 100 ||

siddhimāsādyamahatī brahmatādātmyasiddhibhāk |
nāṣṭāṃgayogābhyāsenanayāgaipūrṇadakṣiṇaiḥ || 101 ||

tādṛśīṃgatimaprotiyādṛśī viṣṇudīkṣayā |
bhūyobhūyaḥ pravakṣyāmi bhagavādīkṣayānviteḥ || 102 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japtvā siddhiṃ prāpyātha śāśvatīṃ |
dīkṣabhiṣecanaṃ proktamiti puṣmabhya ādarāt |
itaḥ paraṃ dvijaśreṣṭhāḥ kiṃ yumaḥ śrotumicchayaḥ 103 || 

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
dvicatvāriṃśodhyāyaḥ] || 42 ||
<p. 135a>

ṛṣaya ūcuḥ ||

ṛṣyaśṛṃgamahābhāgabhavadvadanayaṃkajāt |
śrunamasyabhiratyaṃtarahasyamapi siddhidaṃ || 1 ||

kṛtakṛtyācaryarverkabhūyodhanyatarāvadya |
bhegavacchāstramasmādhiḥ śrutaṃ tvadvadanīvujāt || 2 ||

bhūyopitavadvaktrājvācchrītakāmājagaddhritaṃ |
yogasvarūpaṃ pṛcchāmastadasmākaṃ vadaprābho || 3 ||

yogo nā kimetasya svarūpaṃ kīdṛśaṃ paraṃ |
agānyaṣṭāviti proktamasya tatsakarlaveda || 4 ||

śrīṛṣyabhaṃganuvā || 

śṛṇudhaṃ brāhmāṇaśreṣṭāyathā dāśarathiḥ purā |
vaśiṣṭādi mahaṣīṇaṃ sannidhau janakīpatiḥ || 5 ||

kathayāmāsa yogasya svarūpaṃ śaṃbhave vibhuḥ |
yathā nārāyaṇeyogīnjanakāyamahātmane || 6 ||

<p. 135b>

kathāyāmāsa yogasyasvarūpaṃ brahmasādhanaṃ |

śrībhagavānuvāca 

śṛṇu rājanpravakṣyāmi yogamaṣṭāṃgasaṃyutaṃ || 7 ||

yadabhyāsānnāroyati tatparaṃ brahmaśāśvetaṃ |
nityanaimitikaireva kurvāṇeduritakṣayaṃ || 8 ||

yogābhyāsaratobhūyātatsādhanamathocyate |
ajadurjanasargabajasādhusamāgamaṃ || 9 ||

kurupurāyamahorātrasya viṣṇu sanātanaṃ |
aṣṭāvaṃgāni vakṣyāmi yogasāvasudhāyate || 10 ||

pātakebhyo vimuktaḥ syādyeṣāṃ śravaṇatopi ca |
yamaścaniyamaḥ paścādāsanaṃ ca tṛtīyakaṃ || 11 ||

praṇayāmaścaturthaḥ syāt pratyāhārastu paṃcamaḥ |
dadhāraṇa ca tathādhyānaṃ samādhiriticāṣṭamaṃ || 12 ||

pratyekameṣāṃ vakṣyamilakṣaṇānyapisu |
yamaścaniyamaḥ paścādāsanaṃ ca tṛtīyakaṃ || 13 ||

prāṇayāmāvratatadvibhajya pravakṣyamitatallakṣāṇamapyatha || 13 ||

ahiṃsā satyamasteyaṃ brahmacaryaṃ yārjava |
kṣamādhṛtirmitāhāraḥ śauvaṃ ceti yamādṛśa || 14 ||

sarveṣāmapi bhūtānāmaheśajananaṃ hi sat |
vāṅmanaḥ karmabhirnanamahiṃsetyabhidhīyate || 15 ||

yathādṛṣṭaśrutārthānāṃ svarūpakathanaṃ punaḥ |
svātyamityucyeta dhīraistadbrahmapraptisvadhima || 16 ||

tṛṇāderapyanādānaṃ pareṣāṃ vasudhāpate |
asteyametadapyaṃgaṃ brahmaprāptessanātanaṃ || 17 ||

avasthāsvapisarvāsukarmaṇāmanasāgirā |
strīsaṃgatiparityāgo brahmacaryaṃ pravakṣyate || 18 ||

pareṣāṃ duḥkhamālokakhasyai vā lokyapalataḥ |
utsādanānu saṃdhānaṃdaye procyate vudhaiḥ || 19 ||

vyavahāreṣu sarveṣu manovāpkāyakarmabhiḥ |
sarveṣāmapi kauṭilyarāhityaṃtvārjavaṃtu || 20 ||

sarvatmanā sarvadāpi sarvatrāpyayakāriṣu |
vaṃdhuṣvivasamācāraḥ kṣamāsyādbrahmavitama || 21 ||

icchāprayānnarāhityaṃ jñāteṣu viṣayeṣvapi |
lobhavatsudhatiṃdhīśaḥ pravadaṃti satavara || 22 ||

bhojyesvaiva caturthāṃśabhojanaṃ svasthacetamaḥ |
atyugrahakaṭutiktālasavaṇādivivarjitaṃ || 23 ||

<p. 136a>

hitaṃ medhyaṃ mahīpālamitāhāraṃ pracakṣate |
nirgataṃ navaraṃdhrebhyoromahūyebhya eva ca || 24 ||

malaṃ vadaṃti tadvārakṣālanaṃśocamucyeta |
gṛjjalābhyā vahissamyaṅgirmalīkaraṇaṃ tathā || 25 ||

manaḥ sthairyaṃ vahiḥ śaucamaṃtaḥ śaucaṃ |
vidurbudhāḥ etedaśayagābhūya brāhmatā pratihetavaḥ || 26 ||

tapaścatuṣṭirāstikāmīścarā evanaṃ tathā |
siddhāṃtālocana caiva lajjādānaṃmatistathā || 27 ||

jayovrataṃdaśaitānisutīkṣṇabhiyamāḥ smṛtāḥ |
pratyekameṣāṃ vakṣyamilakṣaṇānihahīyate || 29 ||

tapastvanaśanaṃnāma vidhipūrvakamiṣyate |
anāyāsopapannenatṛṣṇarthe naiva jīvanaṃ || 29 ||

tuṣṭireṣātmātauryeta tatprāptirnānayāvinā |
śrutyādyukteṣyuviśvāsamāstikāṃ pravadaṃti hi || 30 ||

iṣṭedevārcanaṃ samyagvidhipūrvakamanvahaṃ |
trisaṃdhyamekasaṃdhyaṃ vā bhavatyeveśvarārcana || 31 ||

vaiṣṇavāgamāsīddhāṃta śravaṇaṃ manamaṃ tathā |
śruti smṛtipurāṇādi madhyāṃtoktorthadarśanaṃ || 32 ||

siddhāṃtaśravaṇatdyetatprocyate tatvadarśibhiḥ |
śrutyādibhirlekikaiśca yadyadatyaṃtaniṃditaṃ || 33 ||

tatrā pravartanaṃ lajjavāṅmanaḥ karmaṇamapi |
yādiṣṭadevatādhyātvā tadarpaṇādhiyā || 34 ||

sasātredīpatetrādi tadānamabhidhīyate |
tarkeṇapyanusaṃdhānaṃ samyaktadasatorapi || 35 ||

śāstrayormatirīyaṃ tu tatvavidbhirudīryate |
gurorlabdhasya maṃtrasyaśaśvadāvartanaṃ hi yata || 36 ||

ataraṃgākṣarāṇaṃ ca nyāsa pūrvajayo bhavet |
kartavyasya samastasya niyamagrahaṇaṃ vrataṃ || 37 ||

niyamāvyatirekeṇa sarvabhavati niṣphalaṃ |
yamaiścanipamairyadyallataṃ tatsaphalaṃ bhavet || 38 ||

ekamanamucyate || 40 ||

prāṇayamānayo vakṣye mumukṣorūpakārakā nṛpaiḥ |
kṛtairdadyatedyaudyaḥ śuṣkaṃ dhanamivāgninā || 41 ||

tresthirobhāvaḥ pūrvoktainiryamaiḥ |
saha ācāryārpinahraihasyacaitadāsanamucyate || 39 ||

vahuvidyāvatopyekavidyāyāṃ sthiticitatā |
aṃgasvenānyavidyānāṃ japasāsa || ||

iṃdriyeṣvapiyedoṣāyānapitakaphodbhavāḥ |
tvāgasṛprāṃsemadosthimajyāśukrādisaṃbhavāḥ || 42 ||

<p. 136b>

ete sarvepi dadyaṃte praraṇasyāṃtarnirodhanāt |
prāyaścitamadyaudyānāṃ mukhyametadvahaṃtyapi || 43 ||

punarāvṛttirahitaśāśvata brahmakāṃkṣibhiḥ |
prāṇayāmaścasatataṃ kartavyo vidhivansune || 44 ||

samyaṅgirudhya ca praṇānaṃtakaraṇamātmani |
svayamevāvaśiṣṭassanbrahmayāyakalpate || 45 ||

jānuviṃvaṃkarāgreṇa triḥparāmṛrayasaratvaraṃ |
pradadyācchoṭikāmekāmiyaṃ mātrākanīyasī || 46 ||

daśapraṇavasaṃyuktāṃ gāyatrī śirasā saha |
trirjapedāyātaproṇaḥ prāṇāyāmopamucyeta || 47 ||

adhamomadhyāmaścaiva prāṇāyāmastathottamaḥ |
adhamaḥ purakethatrithovāryakuṃbhake pūrvavannṛpa || 50 ||

recaketriśa uccārya prāṇayāmoyamucyate |
prāṇayāmaiḥ kṛtaiḥ śaśvannityaṃ ṣoḍaśabhirnapa || 51 ||

saṃvatsarakṛtaiṣyāyaissadya eva vimucyate |
paropatāya japāyaṃparadravyāyahājaṃ || 52 ||

parastrīmaithunotpannaṃ prāṇāyāmaśataṃ dahet |
mahāmātakarjayāpaśatāvṛtopapātakaṃ || 53 ||

anyāniśatadhāvṛtānyupapāpāni bhūpate |
sarvāṇyapi pradatdyete praṇayāmaiśratuḥ śataiḥ || 54 ||

ādāvaṃte ca yatnena prāraṇāyāmānsamācaret |
karmasvapi ca sarveṣu śubheṣudyaśubheṣu ca || 55 ||

prāṇayāmairvinā pādyātkṣataṃ karmanirarthakaṃ |
āto yatnena kartavyāḥ prāṇāyāmāḥ śubhatithiḥ || 56 ||

yāvacchakyaṃ niyamyāsūnmanasaivajapenmanuṃ |
na nārāyaṇe tadādhyāyanmuhurmahurananyadhiḥ || 57 ||

dhāraya aṃtare vā sūtretre kiṃcinnimotya ca |
paraṃ jyotiḥ paraṃdhyāyataṃtarevamanujīyet || 58 ||

samastakarmaṇaṃ sākṣīprāṇayāmīmahīyate |
daśapraṇavasaṃyuktaṃgātryā sarvakarmasu || 59 ||

ādāvate ca kartavyaḥ prāṇavapi yadvā śaṃkarasta |
piṇaṃ marūpiṇaṃ vā satataṃ smarannarāyaṇadhibhuṃ || 62 ||

<p. 137a>

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ manasauvajayan śuciḥ |
niyamyavāyuṃ kartavyaḥ prāṇayāmodyanāśanaḥ || 63 ||

prāṇāyāmairvinā sarvajapahomārcanakriyāḥ |
na phalaṃtyevatāḥ sarvāyātrenāpi kṛtāḥ kṛtāḥ || 64 ||

iṃdriyāṇāṃ hṛdāsādhaṃ viṣeyabhyo nivartanaṃ |
pratyāhāro bhavatye tatsamyagiṃdriyanigrahaḥ || 65 ||

jīvasya brahmarūpeṇānirdhārovādhuyuktibhiḥ |
pūrvoktotamatrāśca prāṇayāmatrayodbhavāḥ || 66 ||

 ātmanyasisthirībhāvaḥścitasyaivātradhāraṇā |
samyagālokanaṃ dhyānaṃ nidhāyahṛdayevibhuṃ || 67 ||

aṃgāgibhūṣaṇaissārdhavāhanāvaraṇairapi |
satyajñānasukhaikatvaprāyeprāptasādhakaḥ || 68 ||

samādhidharmācatāṃsyādbhavāṃtaraśateṣvapi |
samādhirathavājīvabrahmaṇeremacitaṃ || 69 ||

brahmībhūtaḥ svayaṃjīvoniruddhāsurvilīnahṛt |
svatīpyananyasadbhāvātsvayamevāvaśiṣyate || 70 ||

mūhūrtāvasthito vāpi samādhicodhyate |
evamaṣṭāṃgasaṃpatrayogupraktāssusaṃyataḥ || 71 ||

sūryasyamaṃḍalaṃ bhitvā yāti brahmasanātanaṃ |
ya evamabhyasennityaṃ vinītaḥ śāṃtamānasaḥ || 72 ||

vaśīkṛmedriyagrāmaḥ somṛtatvāya kalpate |
nirastāṣoḍaṣīrataḥ kāmakrodhādivarjitaḥ || 73 ||

evamabhyāsayogena sa yāti paramāṃgati |
karmayogena vā jñānayogenātho bhayena vā || 74 ||

prāpyate punarāvṛtirahitaṃ brahmaśāśvataṃ |
karotyanudinaṃ yastu tatphale vigatasyahaḥ || 75 ||

japahmātmakaṃ karmasāmuniryā tatpadaṃ |
suguṇaṃ nirguṇaṃ vāpi nārāyaṇamajjaṃ vibhuṃ || 76 ||

lakṣmīpatiṃ raghupatiṃ kṛṣṇaṃ viṣṇuhariśivaṃ |
dhyātvā karmānavekṣyātha yātyeṣa paramaṃ padaṃ || 77 ||

dhyānena karmaṇacaivayaubhyasedyāgamanvaha |
sapātyaivotamasthānaṃ yadbhavānānivartate || 78 ||

tasmājjanakaryotmena yogetha vā jñānayoge |
praviśasaniyamaijanmikediṣānuṣṭhitaiḥ || 79 ||

yajñaiśca vividhaissamyābhaktirnārāyaṇe yaṇe |
haṭhāsaṃsārasāgasthāsyayāraṃ prāptu yadocchāse || 80 ||

<p. 137b>

karmayogetha vā jñānayoge pravitrā satvāraṃ |
sarvayū uḥkhabhi bhūtānāṃ āṃtānāṃ hatacetasāṃ || 81 ||

trātāsa ekaevātra saṃsorastrīyatiḥ svayaṃ |
sa eva jānakīmātho brahmarūpī jagatpatiḥ || 83 || 

trātāsaṃsāramagrānātārakonānya ucyate |
prakṣīṇa śeṣapānāṃ jñānayogaḥ praśasyate || 83 ||

karmayogastu sarveṣāṃ bhavennirvāṇa sādhanaṃ |
jñānena karmeśāvāpi devaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ vibhuṃ || 84 ||

ādimadhyāta ititaṃ rāmaṃ samyagihārcayajanayogāḥ praśasyate || 83 ||

karmayogastu sarveṣāṃ bhavennirvā sādhanaṃ |
jñānena karṇavāpi devaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ vibhuṃ || ||

kaitaccharīraṃ hikṣayi vṛḍapiyatiṣṇu || 85 ||

tvagasṛgmāṃsamedesthimajjāśukramayaṃ nṛpa |
śāstreyapāditaṃ samyaganutiṣṭhārtināśanaṃ || 86 ||

karmayogaṃ tadhājñānayogaṃ vā yogavittamaśvaḥ |
karipyaumikartavyamiti kaścidvicitayet || 87 ||

svasyāsyesvamamevāryamadodhūlīṃ hataḥ kṣipet |
śvaḥkāryamadyakuvītamadhyāhne cāparāhnikaṃ || 88 ||

sāyaṃtanaṃ ca madhyāhne vighne vāhulyato nṛpa |
samyagvairāgyamiṣṭasya paratatvasthacetasaḥ || 89 ||

charditānnanibhāḥ sarvadaśyaṃte viṣayāsvasaṃ |
śarīritvamayi prāyo viraktasyaiva śobhayet || 90 ||

viraktasya tadapyāśrutyājyaṃ sarvātmanā bhavet |
anyamedhyaṃ śarīrasyaṃ viṣṭāmidhyagatādapi || 91 ||

tatvaniṣṭoviśeṣeṇaprāṇinaṃ manutehataṃ |
śarīresminnamedhyatvāmīdṛśaṃ nāma hehināṃ || 92 ||

tvagādyaikaikasaṃsparśe jñānameva viśodhanaṃ |
śṛgālairapi ghṛdhraiścanīyete yadyahovidhiḥ || 93 ||

vidhate carmaṇaviṣleśaṃ śarīrāṇi śarīriṇāṃ |
pūtat pratipadaṃ samyagāpadāṃpadamīdaśaṃ tataḥ || 94 ||

śarīraṃ viśvasyaya udāste samūḍhādhīḥ |
duḥkhai kānubhavārthyayavidhinaitatkṛtaṃ unaḥ || 95 ||

paramārthavidapyetadvīkṣamāṇena vīkṣyate |
vyāmohito jagatparenmāpayaiva mahātmanaḥ || 96 ||

<p. 138a>  

viṣṇostatvavidapyā śubhehāṃtaramupaityahau |
sukhaṃ mithyāduḥkhemavabhūyopyanubhavatyayaṃ || 97 ||

āpadya kiṃcano bhūtyā kulaḥ amatyevāturo |
(********) bhūtvā duḥkhāvrtepunaḥ || 98 ||

duḥkhamityapijānatiduḥkhaṃ naiva mahaupate |
sarvātmanā parityājyai sarveṣāmapi duḥkhade || 99 ||

praviśetkobhavenmadohatopyāśu punarhaḥta |
na kiṃcipikarmātraniḥphalaṃ vidyāte mune || 100 ||

taccetpunah. praveśāyā bhavenmuktopi vadhyate |
tato na karmakartavyaphalarthitvena sūribhiḥ || 101 ||

yadi kuryuḥ phalaṃ tatadanayekṣyārtranādikaṃ |
na cevyatatisaṃsāre duḥkhākartarbhavimohitaḥ || 102 ||

īśvāropi samudvartaśaktovati nānyathā |
yogābhyāsarato vāpi guruśuśrūṣāṇerataḥ || 103 ||
śrīmadaṣṭākṣeraṇaiva brahmaprāpnoti śāśvataṃ 103 

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
tricatvāriṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 138a>

rājovāca || 

śrutismṛti puṇārdhaniścayajñānavitama saṃśayaṃ |
chiṃdhipṛcchāmitātātrānugrahaṃ kuru || 1 ||

ātmānubhavarūpeṇa sākṣātkareṇa kevalaṃ |
punarāvṛtiratirahitaṃ śāśvataṃ brahmayātyapi || 2 ||

ityādi śrutitatvajñāḥ pravadaṃti manīpiṇaḥ |
śrīmatābhihitaṃ brahmavidyānuṣṭhānatatparāḥ || 3 ||

bhuktiṃ muktiṃ ca viṃdaṃti kathametannivodhaya |
nivṛtirevamuktistu pravṛtirbhuktirucyate || 4 ||

ubhayorapyeka eva kathaṃ mārgo bhavedvada || 

śrībhagavānuvāca || 

tvayārye sāya uktaṃ tatsatyaṃ satyavidāṃvara || 5 ||

sarvajanyasukhocchitirduḥkhocchiti śvatatvataḥ |
nivṛtilakṣaṇatdveṣāmuktirityabhidhīyate || 6 ||

viṣāyāṃtarasaṃsargaḥ karaṇanāṃ hṛdā saha |
bhuktiṃ pravakṣyetelokevaiṣamyamubhayorapi || 7 ||

tathāpyātmānusaṃdhānamubhayatrāpi dṛśyate |
muktirātmānusaṃdhānenātmāvasthānameva hi || 8 ||

etadakṣtyaiva sarvatrasarvatatvavidāṃvarāṃ |
pravṛtau ca nivṛtau ca sarvadātmānubhāvināṃ || 9 ||

<p. 138b>

brahmaivāhamiti dhyātvā kiṃ ca rāmohamityapi |
yenusmarati satataṃ nate sasāriṇo nṛpa || 10 ||

sākṣādbhagavadātmānasta evajagatītale |
bhoktātra bhagavāneva bhojyamārpabhujiktiyā || 11 ||

ekasminnavaśiṣṭe tu kimusatsatprayojanaṃ |
ato na muktimārgasyarodhinī bhuktirīṣyeta || 12 ||

anena vidhinānityaṃ devaṃ nārāyāṇaṃ vibhuṃ |
śrīrāmamiṃdirānāthaya ekasminnamanutiṣṭhita || 13 ||

sa bhuktimapi muktiṃ ca labhate nātra saṃśayaḥ |
yathavidhiniṣedhautumuktaṃ nevāpasarpataḥ || 14 ||

tathā na sarpato brahmoyāsakaṃ vidhipūrvakaṃ |
brahmaiva satyaṃ tadahaṃ bhagavānahamīśvaraḥ || 15 ||

nārāyaṇehaṃ rāmohaṃ vāsudevosyāhaṃ hariḥ |
iti yenusmaraṃtīha ciṃtayaṃti dine dine || 16 ||

teṣāṃ na vihitaṃ loke niṣiddhamapi vartate |
yathā ghaṭaśca kalaśa ekārthapyabhidhāyakaḥ || 17 ||

tathā brahma ca rāmaśca nūnamekārtha tatvataḥ |
ato rāmo hamityevaṃ brahmaivāhamathāpi vā || 18 ||

yenusmaraṃti satataṃ maṃtramāmuṣṭubhaṃtu vā |
vadaṃti tatvataḥ sākṣāte sarvebrahmarūpiṇaḥ || 19 ||

vihitaṃ vā niṣiddhavāna hyeṣā vidyate kvacit |
maṃtratrasya chaṃdo vā munidhyānādikaṃ tu vā || 20 ||

nāstyeva bramatādātmā siddhidāmanavaḥ smṛtāḥ |
atrānyatamamāyāyānmaṃtraṃ brahmaikyasiddhidaṃ || 21 ||

śubhalagneśubhemāsisaṃprāpyāvaśyamanvahaṃ |
gacchan siṣṭansvāyanmujananugrannapi hasannapi || 22 ||

āsīno vā śayāno vā saṃsmarammaṃtramādarāt |
brahmabhūtamathātmānaṃ svayayeva prapaśyati || 23 ||

nahīmona puraśvayanijaponārcanādikaṃ |
brahmatādātmyavidyāyāḥ smāṇainaiva siddhibhāk || 24 ||

kaleva ramapi prāṇanapi sarvasvamīpsitaṃ |
ācāryāyapyeyeddhrīmānetedvidyāpradāyine || 25 ||

vicāryetādṛśānbrahmabhūtānvipravarānnṛpa |
udakodanavastrādi kiṃcidatvāpi vānvahaṃ || 26 ||

brahmārpaṇadhiyānityaṃ brahmabhūtāmayaṃtite |
ato brahmavidedatamānaṃtyāya prakalpate || 27 ||

<p. 139a>

yedviṣaṃtyapiniṃdaṃti tatpāpaphalabhājanāḥ |
kuṭaṃvinī daridrāśvaduḥkhinaḥ syurnasaṃśayaḥ || 28 ||

svataḥ sutānsamutpādyasvayameva dadahedapi |
kārāgṛheṣu sarvasvayamevanigṛhṇate || 29 ||

ahosyamaṃdabhāgyasya yadyāvatatkṣayaṃ bhavet |
ato brahmavidāṃdveṣo na kartavyaḥ śubhessubhiḥ || 30 ||

nidāpi naiva kartavyāhitameva samācaret |
yestuvaṃtyaṃnumodaṃti vadaṃtyapi manīṣiṇaḥ || 31 ||

tatpuṇyamakhilaṃ labdhāvratahutiprāṃpruvaṃtyapi |
jñātvā tameva viśveśaṃ kṛtyaṃ kuru niraṃtaraṃ || 32 ||

anenaivatavāmīṣṭaṃ bhaviṣyati na saṃśayāḥ |
sahasra kṛtvo gāyatryā japāḥ pratyahamādarāt || 33 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaśuśrūṣāṇāmathācahaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣrīvidyājayotha sarahasyakaḥ || 34 ||

ekana janmanāsākṣāt brahmaprāptipradaṃtrayeṃ |
gurūdaivatamaṃtrāṇāmaikyaṃ sa bhāvayet sadā || 35 ||

dṛṣṭe brahmaṇi karmāṇi kṣīyaṃte sadya eva hi |
bhidyate hṛdayagraṃthirvinaśyaṃtyāpi saṃśayā || 36 ||

sākṣātkaranidānāni paṃcaiva brahmaṇi nṛpa |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoja śuśrūṣā pratyahaṃ śubhā || 37 ||

sahasrakṛtvegāyatro japaśca pratyahaṃ tataḥ |
śrutyāktācārasaṃyatiḥ pratyahaṃ samaye kṛtā || 38 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyājapopisadahasyakaḥ |
niyamavyatirikteṣu samayeṣu niraṃtaraṃ || 39 ||

brahmātādānmyavidyāyāḥ smaraṇaṃ ceti paṃcadhā |
brahmaprāptikarāṇahunaitasmādvidyate paraṃ || 40 ||

guhyamemanmayā proktaṃ sarvavedāṃtasaṃgrahaṃ |
nāstikānāṃ na vaktavyaṃ kṛtaghrānāṃ durātmanāṃ || 41 ||

triśatavāpi gāyatryā jayodvādaśadhā ghṛtaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī japtvā brahmavidyājapaḥ || 42 ||

paṃcaśataṃ tu vā ācāryānugrahādevadvayaṃ |
brahmaikyasiddhidaṃ nārayaṇadhiyānityamācāryaṃ || 43 ||

paritoṣayan vaidikācāraniratogāyatrīṃ |
vaśo japan śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī japtvā brahmavidyāpurassarāṃ || 44 ||

<p. 139b>

śrīmaṃtrasahitāṃ nityaṃ raśmividyāsamanvitāṃ |
mahākālaṃ durādharṣamapijitvā bhayaṃkaraṃ || 45 ||

mahāsidhyaṣṭakaṃ prāpya jarāmṛtyuvivarjitaḥ |
nārāyaṇamayobhūtvāyātitadbrahmaśāśvataṃ || 46 ||

brahmarūpiṇamātmanaṃ dhyātvā tasmādinedine |
brahmadarśanaparyaṃtaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ samarcayet || 47 ||

ārādhanena sāṃgena gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ |
śālagrāmaśilācakrecakrarājasamanvite || 48 ||

ārādhyajagatāṃ nāthaṃ śrīdevīsahitaṃ vibhuṃ |
ihāmutrāpi mahātī siddhiṃ māpnotyanuttamā || 49 ||

na gṛhījñānamātreṇa paratreha ca maṃgalaṃ |
prāpnoti vasudhāmāladānahomādibhirvinā || 50 || 

gṛhastho dakṣiṇadīni na dadyāt tu huyānnacet |
na pūjayedyovidhinārgājaṃ vrājatidāruṇa || 51 ||

na brahmacāriṇo dātu madhikoṇāsti bhūyate |
ācāryerbhyo vinānyatra datvādhāgatimāpnuyāt || 52 ||

nārarāyavāsināṃ śaktirnate saṃti kalauyuge |
parivrāḍajñānamātreṇa dānahomādibhirvinā || 53 ||

sarvaṅgakhapiśaucebhyo mukto bhavati nānyathā |
parivrāḍaviraktaśca viraktaśca gṛhītathā || 54 ||

kuṃbhīyākenimajjetetāvubhauva sudhāyate |
purāyastriyo gṛhasthoścamagalairmaṃgalārthibhiḥ || 55 ||

pūjopakaraṇaiḥ kuyurdadyurdānānicānvahaṃ |
caṃdanāgarūkastūrīkarpūrasahimāṃvubhiḥ || 56 ||

paṃcāmṛtābhiṣekaiśca puṣpaisrāmarasairadapi |
puṣpamālyaiśca vahubhirdūrvābhidhaṃ valākṣataiḥ || 57 ||

nīlotpalairmallikābhiḥ karavīraiśca caṃpakaiḥ |
jātīprasūnairvilvaiśca punnāgairvakulairapi || 59 ||

kadaṃvaketakīpuṣpairaruṇāśokakiṃśukaiḥ |
nāgavāṇadipuṣpaiścaṃgadhavadbhirmanoharai || 59 ||

pratyagraiḥ komaleścaiva pūjayedyuḥ prayatnataḥ |
phalaiśca vahubhiḥ patrairjalasyāla samudbhavai || 60 ||

evamādibhiranyaiśca puṣpairvahubhiravyahaṃ |
samyakusaṃpādyatnenaśatmābhatmāśriyaḥpatiṃ || 61 ||

<p. 140a>

trikālamekakālaṃ vā pūjayepuraharniśaṃ |
atyākaurvaṅgavidhaiḥ piṣṭakairiṣṭasiddhaye || 62 ||

kṣīranīrājyapakvaiśca phalāpūpavaṭādibhiḥ |
dadhyodanānnapānādivyaṃ jānādibhiḥ || 63 ||

yaṭīyaṭoyadaṃśādipadāthaivahubhiściraṃ |
āvartakedhūpadīpaiḥ yajāvṛtyupakalpitaiḥ || 64 ||

śaṃkhacakragadāpadmāgaruḍatvopakalpitaiḥ |
vahnībhirdīpamālābhirarcayepuraharniśaṃ || 65 ||

tatkālasaṃbhavaiḥ puṣpaistathājātīphalairapi |
kapūracūrṇasahitaistāṃvūlaiśca suvāsitaiḥ || 66 ||

mahāhairarhaṇaṃ kuryuḥ kalyāṇarthitayānvahaṃ |
svasvaśatmanusāreṇa sarvaṃ saṃpādya yatnataḥ || 67 ||

gṛhasthānāṃ vikṣirayaṃteteraṣā kadācana |
dadyurdānani juhupurarcitagnauśubhārthinaḥ || 68 ||

kalyāṇaśca varārīhārāmāryaṇadhiyānvahaṃ |
evaṃ gṛhasthaniyamastathaiva brahmacāriṇaṃ || 69 ||

vidhimapyanatikramya yathāśaktyanusārataḥ |
yadikuryuḥ prayatnena pūjāṃtatsādhanairiha || 70 ||

sarvasapadyateṣāmapi daivatadurlabhaṃ |
etenaiva mahīpāla kalyāṇaṃ tava sarvadā || 71 ||

puṇyastriyo gṛhasthāśca tathaiva brahmacāriṇaḥ |
saguṇaṃ viṣṇumārādhyapūrvoktiḥ sādhanairiha || 72 ||

śaktāsaṃpāditaiḥ kaiścitpūjayepuraharniśaṃ |
teṣāṃ bhuktiścamuktiśca bhavatyevahinānyathā || 73 ||

vānaprasthāścayatayoyadyeva kuryuranvahaṃ |
saṃsārānnanivartataṃ vidhyati kramadoṣataḥ || 74 ||

ārūḍhapatitātdvyetebhaveyurduḥkhabhojanāḥ |
ahiṃsāparamodharmasteṣāmeva mahāṃpate || 75 ||

nahasāvyatiraikeṇa labhyaṃte kusumāni hi |
bhāvanākalpitairdravyairpatīnāṃ pūjanaṃ smṛtaṃ || 76 ||

upacārārdhanaṃ maṃdadhisāyāmeva praśasyate |
sevyasevakarūpatvādgṛhīṇīmīśvarasyasya ca || 77 ||

ātmanastatvarcitaiva pūjāstu mahatī smṛtī |
jīvabrahmaikaciṃtātu punarāvṛtivarjitā || 78 ||

ātmānaṃ satataṃ brahmasaṃbhāvya vidharaṃti |
cayenateṣāṃ duṣkṛtaṃ kiṃciduḥkṛtotthānacāpadaḥ || 79 ||

<p. 140b>

rahasyamapi vakṣyāmi śṛṇu brahmavidāṃvada |
yadgātvā mucyate tejaṃturjanmasaṃsāravaṃdhanāt || 80 ||

ayāṇiyādojavanograhītāvīkṣatepyada |
akarṇaḥ samṛṇetyetacchabdarūpaṃ paraṃ mahaḥ || 81 ||

veti vedyaṃ sa sarvajñairavedyovidyete pratuḥ |
samahāpuruṣaḥ puṃsāstrīrṇavyaktivilakṣaṇaḥ || 82 ||

strīpuṃnapuṃsakākārarahitaṃ brahmatatparaṃ |
sarveśvarassarvarūpassarvadevamayohariḥ || 83 ||

satyajñānamayonaṃstenādirānaṃ kṛcyate |
ajaḥ smaraṇamātreṇa janmādi kleśabhaṃjanaḥ || 84 ||

tasyātmatadhīḥ sarveṣāṃ punarāvṛttikartarī |
niyamenaiva sarveṣāṃ svāśramoktena sa prabhuḥ || 85 ||

dhyeyaḥ saṃsāranāśāya nabhedovartate punaḥ |
svāśramoktaṃ parityajya ātmanamupāsate || 86 ||

tadrūpeṇanate bhūpamucyaṃte bhavaṃ |
vaṃdhanāt śrutismṛtipurāṇeṣuyo yonite || 87 ||

yasya yasya śramasthāpanayoktavyo mumukṣubhiḥ |
ato niyamabhādṛtthakuryāddhyānamananyadhīḥ || 88 ||

etaccarācaraṃ sarvaṃ svaprapratyayavatsudhīḥ |
mithyādavyatiriktaṃ yadaśyatvāta tathānṛpa || 89 ||

chagrūpeṇatmanāṃ jñānaṃ satyānaṃdātmanā svayaṃ |
ekākī yatacitātmaciṃtayeadananyadhīḥ || 90 ||

sohamityātmanājñāna svājñānaprikālpitaṃ |
etatsvavyātiriktaṃ yadyatṛḥsvenaiva kalpyate || 91 ||

na pāramārthikaṃ dhūpayadyadvālohikalpayet |
vālājñayāvāṃkobhedaḥ kalpyatatvakvacakṣuṣā || 92 ||

ayaṃ yavyāḥ purāṇaḥ syādanuvitaḥ purātanaiḥ |
adhyātmavidbhikhyavijñāpitaḥ sarvagaḥ smṛtaḥ || 93 ||

ābrahmaṇaḥ śuddhavaṃśyāmātāpitroḥ kulodhaye |
na stridhovyatricāriṇyaḥ puruṣaścaivadhārmikaḥ || 94 ||

yajñāśca vedādhyāyanamedhate pratipūruṣaṃ |
pūjyaṃte tithayo yatra guruśiṣya paraparaṃparāḥ || 95 ||

svāpnepissvalanaṃ nastinarīṣu brahmacāriṇaḥ |
niyamopyāśramasteṣāṃ na kadācintivarjate || 96 ||

tatatkāleṣu dānānitadarthibhyaḥ pradīyate |
yeṣu vaṃśeṣu sarveṣāṃteṣāmeva prakāśate || 97 ||

<p. 141a>

brahmavidāṃ bhūpaguruśiṣyoktāśikṣayā |
svayameva paraṃ brahmatatonpannāsti kiṃcana || 98 ||

tadetadakhilaṃ brahmasatyaṃ satyaṃ prakāśate |
janmakoṭi sahasreṣu prakṣīṇeśoṣaduṣkṛtaiḥ || 99 ||

kaiścidevani yamyāsū na parokṣyaṃ nirīkṣate |
sukhāmṛta  rasāsvāhasatyaikajñānarūpatā || 100 ||

bhāgadheyena viduṣā svayaevānubhūpate |
ahopuṇyamahodharmonātaḥ parataraṃ piyaṃ || 101 ||

akṛtyeṣvapi sarveṣu prayaścitamidaparaṃ |
aṣṭākṣarānusaṃdhānamācaryacāraṇarcanaṃ || 102 ||

bahujanmārjitatapaḥphalametadvayaṃ smṛtaṃ |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaśuśrūṣānvahamādarāt || 103 ||

aṣṭākṣarajapīnālyatapaḥ phalamidaṃ dvayaṃ |
tvadhanyosi mahārājatvameva brahmaviṣvakaḥ || 104 ||

tvamevācārya bhaktānāmagragaṇyosi bhūtale |
bhavadbhāgyādayenaiva parabrāhmāmayo hariḥ || 105 ||

rāyaṇesau bhagavānbhūtvā daśarathātmajaḥ |
rāmābhidhānaḥ svervaṣāmātmārāmaḥ śriyaḥ patiḥ || 106 ||

avaśyaṃtajāmātābhaviṣyāti mahīyate |
yeyaṃ cihnapiṇī sākṣānmahālakṣmīstrapī || 107 ||

bhūtalā utthitā sākṣātavaputrībhaviṣyati |
jānakītpakṣivikhyāṃtā divyakāṃti sāmacitā || 108 ||

ahobhāgyamahopurāyata vaiva mithilāyo |
tanjamaskaroti bhagavantathapādāṃvujadvayaṃ || 109 ||

guhyametanmahacchāstre yogasāraṃ vimuktidaṃ |
gṛhītvā mithilādho śanayācyamapi kutracit || 110 ||

nārāpyaṇīya me tate mayā śāstre purātanaṃ |
tubhyamuktaṃ mahārājavedasārārthasaṃgrahaṃ || 111 ||

saṃsārataraṇoyāyaṃ yadiyāṃchasi suvrata |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī sāṃgāṃ japtvā mukto bhaviṣyasi || 112 ||

nityamācāya śuśrūṣā śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīratiḥ |
nālyena yasālabhyā satya satyaṃ mahīyate || 113 ||

iti dāśarathīyesmintaṃtrevedārthasaṃgrahe adhyāyo 
paṃcatuścatvāriṃvidyāsādhanaṃ mithilāyate bhūyośodyaudya vibhaṃjanaḥ 114 || 

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
catuścatvāriṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 141b>

rājovāca ||

nārāyaṇajagannāthabhagavaktāruṇanidhe |
bhūyopi śrīmadaṣṭārṇasādhanaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ || 1 || 

śrītumicchāmi viśveśa bhavasāgaratārakaṃ || 

śrībhagavānuvāca 

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāsādhanaṃ mithilāpate |
bhūyopi saṃpravakṣyāpi samāhitamanāḥ śṛṇu || 2 ||

sāmrājñī sarvavidyānāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī parā || 3 ||

yasya siddhā bhavatyasya devasvaṃ ca na durlabhaṃ |
vaiśākhemāsiyā muktā tṛtīyākṣayasaṃtitā || 4 ||

akṣayeṣṭa pradātatvāt svabhāvādeva sākṣayatisyāṃ |
prātaḥ śucibhūtvā saṃdhyāmupāsya ca || 5 ||

ācāryājñā gṛhītvātha vidhivat saṃskṛte nale |
panasai vījarahitairmadhutritayamiśritaiḥ || 6 ||

gavyājya sahitairhutvā śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā |
triśatādhika sāhasraṃ śrīmaṃtrānyatamena ca || 7 ||

triśataṃ juhuyādājyaṃ bhagavadraśmibhiruttataḥ |
gavyājyena tridhā hutvā kṛtvā homaṃ japādibhiḥ || 8 ||

prāyaścitāhutīḥ kṛtvā kṛtvā brahmāyāṇahutiṃ |
pradakṣiṇaṃ namaskṛtyajātevada samādarāt || 9 ||

ācāryacaraṇaṃbhojadvitayaṃ praṇipatyatha |
vāsobhirapyalaṃkārairalaṃkṛtyā tataḥ paraṃ || 10 ||

varṣāśanamitaṃ dravyaṃ dadyādāvāryapādayoḥ |
atha dvarūdaśaniṣkavāpaṃcaniṣkamathāpi vā || 11 ||

samarpyācārya patnyai ca datvā bhūṣaṇamīpsitaṃ |
brāhmaṇanbhojayet paścādvādaśātha suvāsinīḥ || 12 ||

ācāryādāśiṣaḥ prāpya datvā coktaṃ ca dakṣiṇaṃ |
tādvine pānasādīni phalāni guraverpyayet || 13 ||

prativarṣatṛtīyāmakṣayāyāṃ mahīyate |
kṛtvotthaṃ mahatī siddhidaivairapi durlabhāṃ || 14 ||

akṣayāḥ saṃdyadaḥ prāpyavidyāṃmāpi tathākṣayāṃ |
akṣayaṃ saukhyamatyaṃtamāropyaṃ ca tathākṣaya || 15 ||

akṣayaputrapautrādi samṛddhiyogamakṣayaṃ |
avāpyākṣayabhogāścamodate bhagavatpade || 16 ||

vratamanyanpravakṣyāmi mahadatyaṃ tapāyanaṃ |
kṛtenaye narājedaṃ sarvasiddhiḥ prajāyate || 17 ||

<p. 142a>

āśvinaṃ navarātrakhyāvratamastimahataraṃ |
sarvāsāmapi vidyānāṃ sidhyarthaṃ kṛyate bhuvi || 18 ||

daivatairmunisadyaiśca yogibhirbrahmavādibhiḥ |
sidhyarthaṃ kṛyate yatrānavarātravrataśubhaṃ || 19 ||

pratisaṃvatsaravarṣa cūḍāmarāyābhidhaṃ vrataṃ |
kriyate satataṃ siddhaissamastaphalasiddhaye || 20 ||

traikaikaṃ dinaṃ proktamanaṃtaphalasiddhidaṃ |
pūrvapūrvadinātpurāpaśutaredivase kṣayaṃ || 21 ||

āyurārogyadaṃ putrapautravṛddhikaraṃ paraṃ |
dhanadhānyagajāśvadimahāsaṃyatsasṛddhidaṃ || 22 ||

samastāpakuṇaharaṃmdhājananamutamaṃ |
ciṃtitārthapradaṃ śreyaskaraṃ sadyodyanāśanaṃ || 23 ||

samastatīrthaphaladaṃ brahmasāyujyakāraṇaṃ |
atrāvaśyaṃ prakartavyaṃ puraścaraṇamādarāt || 24 ||

navarātravrataṃ yena kriyate prativassaraṃ |
satataṃ vijayī bhūtvā duḥkhasadyairvimucyate || 25 ||

bhavatkalayāyukto bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ |
caitramāsavratamapi navarātrābhidhaṃ tathā || 26 ||

sarvaśreyaskaraṃ sadyo mahāpātakabhaṃjanaṃ |
śaktaścedubhayaṃ kuryādekaṃ vā navarātrakaṃ || 27 ||

tadvidhānaṃ pravakṣyāmi samāhitamanāḥ śṛṇu 
pratipaddinamārabhya tatra vamyaṃtamādarāt || 28 ||

navarātravrataṃ proktamahāsiddhikaraṃ nṛpa |
pratipadivasetatra prātarutthāyavāgyataḥ || 29 ||

dvādaśārṇāṃ brahmavidyāṃ japtvā brāhmemuhūrtake |
raśmimālāmanusmatyapacadhāvātridhā tataḥ || 30 ||

srātvā saṃdhyāmupāsyātha gāyatrīṣaḍgaśījapan |
samastanyāsasahitāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ śubhāṃ || 31 ||

yāvacchanmanyāsayutāmathavāṣṭākṣarīṃ śubhāṃ |
saṃkalpārkasahasrāṇi vratī nityaṃ japedbudhaḥ || 32 ||

dvādaśārṇaṃściyovidyāmathavāśrīṣaḍakṣarīṃ |
prasannalakṣmīmathavāsaṃkalpyārkasahasrakaṃ || 33 ||

japtvā śrīhṛdayaścājjayedekottaraṃ nṛpa |
yadvā paṃcādhikāṃ catvāriṃśadāvṛtimabhyaset || 34 ||

bhojayenmithunaṃ nityamekītaramataḥ paraṃ |
padyāśatmāthavābhojyaṃ mithunaṃ bhagavaddhiyā || 35 ||

<p. 142b>

vṛhādāvaraṇoyaṃtaṃ kuyocchīśrīśapūjanaṃ |
patraiḥ puṣpairyajet paścānniśataṃ brahmavidyayā || 36 ||

phalāśīvāhaviṣyāśīnijyamekāśanopi vā |
ātmānaṃ gaṃdhapuṣpādyairalaṃ kuryā dine dine || 37 ||

tāṃvūlacarvaṇaṃ kuryādvetesmin śrīsamṛddhaye |
kuryādinedine vaśyaṃ mahotsavamataṃdritaḥ || 38 ||

śrīśrīśasortrityamathamaṃgalārātrivaṃ śubhaṃ |
sruvāyīnībhirdātavyaṃ sāyaṃkāle mahīyate || 39 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityaṃ śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā |
gavyājyaṃ juhuyādagnau aṣṭāviṃśatidhāśriyā || 40 ||

mahatīnavamīyātrayantravarvaśataprabhā |
sadyassamastavipadāṃhatrīsaṃyatkarīśubhā || 41 ||

tasyāṃ navamyāṃ praptāyāṃ prātarutthāya vāgyataḥ |
ācāryāṃnujñayāsrātvānityakarmasamāpya ca || 42 ||

vidhivatsaṃskṛte vahnau śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā |
ekaikavilvapatreṇa sahitaṃtramadhusutaṃ || 43 ||

gavyājyatilasaṃyuktaṃ sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ |
hutvā śrīmanunāpaścācchatādhikasahasrakaṃ || 44 ||

tathaiva pāpasaṃhutvā kamalairvāghṛtaplutaiḥ |
lakṣmīhṛdayamaṃtraiśca tridhāgavyaghṛtaṃ hunet || 45 ||

paṃcadhāraśmibhirhutvā kṛtvā hīmaṃjayādibhiḥ |
prāyaścitāhutīḥ kṛtvā kṛtvā brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ || 46 ||

agniṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya sahasraṃ brahmavidyayā |
arcayet puṣpasahitairvilvairvātulasīdalaiḥ || 47 ||

arcayitvā paṃcaśatamathavā brahmavidyayā |
ācāryacaraṇaṃ dvaṃdvaṃ sāṣṭāṃgaṃ praṇipatya ca || 48 ||

karṣadvaya suvarṇena nirmitaṃ kuṃḍala dvayaṃ |
suramyapadmarāgākhyamaṇibhissahitaṃ śubhaṃ || 49 ||

ācāryākarṇayordatvādyātsiddhimicchannathā |
kṣayāṃṣacintukasauvarṇamathavā(-)kuṃḍaladvayaṃ || 50 ||

karṣamānasuvarṇenarmitaṃ vāsaratnakaṃ |
kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ dadyādvitalobhavivarjitaḥ || 51 ||

dukūlaṃ vātha kāpīnaṃ vastrādvitayamarpyayet |
kuṃḍaladvitayābhāvetanmānasvarṇamarpayet || 52 ||

mudrikodaravaṃdhādyairalaṃkṛtya tataḥ paraṃ |
vahuśasya samāyuktāṃ vasudhākṣiṇānvitāṃ || 53 ||

<p. 143a>

caturvaṣabhasayuktāṃśālagrāhamaśilānvitāṃ |
datvā godvitayaṃ paśvādadyādakṣiṇayāścitāṃ || 54 ||

pradadyādvasudhābhāvetatpratyā āhema vā 
pradastāvastudhādāneśatāṭhakamitāmahī || 55 ||

tadardhabhūmirvirhitātadabhāvemahīyate |
mahīpratinividravyaṃ paṃcāśatriṣkamutamaṃ || 56 ||

tadadhaṃ medhyamaṃ prokta tadardhamadhamaṃ smṛtaṃ |
adharmasmṛtaṃ adhamādhamamevoktaṃ tatrāpyardhaṃ mahīyate || 57 ||

yacca yāvacca sarvasvaṃ bhūdāne dakṣiṇotamā |
varṣāśanamitaṃ dravyamathavotamadakṣiṇa || 58 ||

varṣāśanamitaṃ dravyaṃ śataniṣkamudāt hṛtaṃ |
tadardhaṃ vā tadardhaṃ vā vitalobhaṃ varityajet || 59 ||

haimaciṃtākatāṭaṃkādyalaṃkāraissuśobhanaiḥ |
ācāryapatnī śrīvudhyāpūjayet tataḥ paraṃ || 60 ||

dukūlaṃ vātha kāryā saṃsūkṣmaṃ vā sassamarpyayet |
paṃcaviṃśati saṃkhyākamithunānnātyathabhojayet || 61 ||

yugmāni paṃcadaśavānava vā bhojapedvratī |
vāsobhidaṃkṣiṇābhiścataṃ kalairapi tauṣayet || 61 ||

āliṃgitothagurūṇatadāśīrbhiḥ kṛtādaraḥ |
sadyassiddhimavāpnoti mahatīdurlabhāmapi || 63 ||

athavā narātraismi athame divase śubhe |
ācāryāya pradātavyaṃ niṣkameka suvarṇakaṃ || 64 ||

dvitīyāyaṃ dviniṣkaṃ ca tṛtīyāṃyāṃ tṛniṣkakaṃ |
caturniṣkaṃ caturthyaṃ ca paṃcamyāyaṃ ca niṣkakaṃ || 65 ||

niṣkaṣaṭkaṃ tataḥ ṣaṣṭyāṃ saptamyāṃ saptanidyākaṃ |
aṣṭaniṣkramayāṣṭamyāṃ navamyānavaniṣkakaṃ || 66 ||

datvātha vasudhī dadyāt sālagrāmaśilānvitāṃ |
kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ datvā godayaṃ dakṣiṇānvitaṃ || 67 ||

śayyāṃsīpāskarāṃ datvā sūkṣmaṃ vā sāyugaṃ śubhaṃ |
ācāryādāśiṣaḥ prāpyasiddhiyāṃ protyanuttamāṃ || 68 ||

suvāsinyastatobhojyānavapaṃcadaśathavā |
paṃcathiṃśatisaṃkhyā vā sahasraṃ vibhave sati || 69 ||

rājā vā rājaputrodhānāpyo vā yatavrataḥ |
sahasradakṣiṇāyaktānaṣṭhaugrāmānsamarpayet || 70 ||

gośataṃva pradātavyaṃ vahudakṣiṇānvitaṃ |
yāvatīdaṃ yāvatī dakṣiṇaṃ dadyātsvācārya caraṇadvayai || 71 ||

<p. 143b>

tāvatyeva bhavet siddhiraṣārṇāya mahīyate |
vitaśāṭhyaṃ tyajeddhīmāśaktassaṃpūrṇadakṣiṇaṃ || 72 ||

datvādyādardhamaśaktaścennānyathāsiddhirīṣyate |
mahādaridraḥ kṛpaṇe yadya sausvasutāṃ śubhāṃ || 73 ||

datvā svapatnīputrādisahito niyatavrataḥ |
ācāryapatnīputrāṇaṃ nityaśuśrūṣakot || 74 ||

puraścaryābhidhāne vā patīnāṃ nahivydate |
gurūrūśuśrūṣaṇadevanityaṃ siddhirdinedine || 75 ||

ekadāpi samullaṃ svācāryājñāṃ viyūmūḍhadhīḥ |
ācaṃdrārka mahāghore narake sau nimajjati || 76 ||

kṛtvā'kārya sahasraṃ vābhikṣitvā śūdrakānapi |
ācāryadakṣiṇedeyāpuraścaryādikarmasu || 77 ||

nācāryaḥ pūjyate yatra śubhakarmasusādhakaiḥ |
tatkāryaniṣyalaptopaścālārakaduḥkhadaṃ || 78 ||

ācāryaḥ pūjyate yatra bhūṣaṇairdakṣiṇādibhiḥ |
tatkarmasaphalaṃ proktaṃ sarvakalyāṇasiddhidaṃ || 79 ||

saṃsārasāgareghore vahuduḥkhasamākule |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyājapastāska ucyate || 80 ||

 ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaśubhūṣaṇamaharniśaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīsiddhideyamevavimuktidaṃ || 81 ||

navarātravratasamaṃ siddhidaṃ nānyadulyate |
mahatīyā puraścaryāmayā pūrvamudīritā || 82 ||

saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇādānādācārya caraṇadvaye |
navarātravrate tādṛkupuraścaryāśatodbhavaṃ || 83 ||

avaśyaṃ phalamāpnoti satyaṃ satyaṃ mayocyate |
navarātravrate kṛtvā puraścaryāmimāṃ śubhāṃ || 84 ||

akāryāṇāṃ śatenāpi vahudakṣiṇayanvitāṃ |
nirāmayaścirāpuṣpaṃ prāpyāṣṭaguṇasamyutāṃ || 85 ||

akṣayāṃ śriyamāpnoti dhanadhānyādi saṃkulāṃ |
gajāśvaratnasaṃpūrṇāṃ saṃtati vyāpinīmapi || 86 ||

avāpya sakalāvidyāgaṃgormisadṛśaḥ śubhāḥ |
saubhāgyaṃ mahadāsādyasarvalokavaśaṃkaraṃ || 87 ||

svacchaṃdamṛtyuḥ putrādi samṛddhiṃ ca mahatarāṃ |
bhuktvāpi sakalānbhogānmahāyogīmahīmatiḥ || 88 ||

<p. 144a>

tadviśoḥ paramedhāmmi daśapūrvardaśāparaiḥ |
modate nātrasaṃdeho divyakanyāśatānvitaḥ || 89 ||

kanyābhāve daridrosya svapatnīsahitoguroḥ |
kuryācchuśrūṣaṇaṃ nityaṃ yāvadehāvasānakaṃ || 90 ||

athāparaṃ mahāsiddhipradaṃ yogaṃ vadāmyahaṃ |
śravaṇādyasya viprāṇāṃ palāyatau mahāpadaḥ || 91 ||

paurṇamāsī puṣpāmāsebhāhuvāsaṃyutā |
puṣpanakṣatrasahitā tatraṃ caṃdrasya parvacet || 92 ||

mahācūḍāmaṇirnāmnāyogolabhya udāhṛtaḥ |
bhānuvāsara saṃyuktā vyatīyāta samanvitā || 93 ||

vaiṣṇavarkṣa samāyuktā tatrāmāyadibhūyate |
alabhyosau mahānukto yogorddhodayanāmakaḥ || 94 ||

tatraivagrahaṇaṃ puṇyaṃ savituryadijāyate |
trailokyaciṃtāmāṇiyoga uktassamastaviyā || 95 ||

phalasiddhidātādahasravarṣerapi |
yogarājo na labhyate sau bhuvilokanātha || 95 ||

kiṃcāthaśrāvaṇemasiśravaṇarkṣa samanvitā |
iṃdravāsarasaṃyuktāyogoyaṃ padmakaḥ smṛtaḥ || 96 ||

somāsyagrahaṇa tatra jāyate yadi bhūyate |
mahānalabhyayogosaucaṃdracūḍāmaṇi smṛtaḥ || 97 ||

tasminmāsepyamāvāsyā somavāsara saṃyutā |
bhānuvāsaravyuktāvāpitṛnakṣatrasaṃyutā || 98 ||

mahāpadmakanāmāyaṃ yogo kṣayaphalapradaḥ |
saviturgrahaṇaṃ tapralabhyate yadi bhūyate || 99 ||

ravicūḍāmaṇimaṇinīmnāyogolabhyopamīritaḥ |
parvasveteṣu catuṣupadyekamapilabhyate || 100 ||

atra jahmaṃ hutaṃdatamanaṃta phalasiddhidaṃ |
vidhānamekamevātrapuraścaraṇa karmaṇi || 101 ||

ucyate mithilānāthasamāhitamanāḥ śṛṇu |
catuṣvateṣu yogeṣu parvokaṃ vā bhavedyadi || 102 ||

ekakālamitāhārastatpūrvadivasatrayaṃ |
triśatādhikasāhasraṃ samastanyāsasaṃyutāṃ || 103 ||

yāvacchakanyāsapunāmayavāṣṭākṣarī śubhāṃ |
japtvā sāmrājyalakṣmī vā dvādaśārṇāṃ śriyo yavo || 104 ||

śrīṣaḍakṣaravidhāṃ vā vasuvarṇamathāpi vā |
japtvā samāhito nityaṃ śatadhika sahasrakaṃ || 105 ||

<p. 144b>

aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityaṃ śrīmaṣṭārṇavidyayā |
gavyājyaṃ juhuyādadāgrauściyāpyaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ || 106 ||

ekaikaśoraśmimaṃtraihunehoghṛtamapyatha |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityamarcayedbrahmavidyayā || 107 ||

tasminparvaṇi saṃprāpte sparśakāle samāhitaḥ |
srātvā nadyāṃ viśuddhātmākeśavādyaiśca nāmabhiḥ || 108 ||

caturviśatidhāsrātvā vimuktaḥ pāyarāśibhiḥ |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvajalaṃpītvā tataḥ paraṃ || 109 ||

aṃtaḥ śuddho vahiḥ svācāryacaraṇa dvayaṃ |
sāṣṭhāṃgaṃ praṇipatyātha tadājñāṃ mūrdhni dhārayana || 110 ||

manutritayasaṃpṛktaiḥ kapilājyena saṃskṛtaiḥ |
triśatādhikasāhasraṃ śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā || 111 ||

śatādhika sahasraṃ vā saṃskṛte grauhunetilaiḥ |
prasannārasayāvayidvādaśārṇa śriyāpi vā || 112 ||

ṣaḍakṣaraśriyāvayivasvarṇaramayāpi vā |
aṣṭhottaraśataṃ hutvā vāsudevena cāpyatha || 113 ||

vaiṣṇavena ṣaḍarṇaināpyaṣṭhārviśatidhā hunet |
ekaikaśobhagavato raśmirbhirjuhuyādvataṃ || 114 ||

japādi homaṃ kṛtvāpadmapaścimāhutīstataḥ |
mahāvyāhatibhirhutvā kṛtvā brahmārpaṇahutiṃ || 115 ||

sāṣṭāṃgaṃ praṇipatyātha jvalitaṃ jātavedasaṃ |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvasāṣṭāṃgaṃ praṇipatya ca || 116 ||

sūkṣmaṃ vāso yugaṃ datvā kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ śubhaṃ |
mahīśasya samāyuktāṃ dadyādavahuladakṣiṇaṃ || 117 ||

dhenudvayaṃ sava vahudakṣiṇayānvitaṃ datvā |
siddhi mama vāpnoti devānāmapi durlabhā || 118 ||

mahādānāni kurvātadhanāḍhyepi mahīpatiḥ |
ācāryāya pradātavyā sālagrāmaśilāśubhā || 119 ||

avaśyaṃ dakṣiṇayuktāgrahoṇacaṃdrasūryayoḥ |
dātavyānyapi vipreyodānānyanyāni bhūyate || 120 ||

ācāryayatmaidadyācca svarṇalaṃkāramuttamaṃ |
bhagavatsannidhau datvā svācāryāsannidhau nṛpa || 121 ||

tadravyaṃ preṣayeddhīmān gurave tatsutāya vā |
saviturgrahasoceṃdoryadyadvastu pradīyate || 121 ||

<p. 145a>

brahmāṃḍa pralayepye tadakṣayānaṃda siddhidaṃ |
cūḍāmarāyādiyogeṣudatadravyasya bhūyeta || 123 ||

phalaṃ na śakyete vaktu mayādhātrā śivema vā |
ekāhuti phalaṃ sūryasāmayorgrahaṇe kṛtaṃ || 124 ||

koṭihomaphalaṃ prāhubrahmādyāssamarudraṇaḥ |
viśeṣācchīmadaṣṭorṇa homāditanitaphalaṃ || 125 ||

vaktunaśakyate sūryasomaparvaṇi bhūyate |
cūḍāmaṇyādi yogeṣuko vā varṇavitaṃ kṣamaḥ || 126 ||

tatracācārya pādābje dakṣiṇadānajaṃ phalaṃ |
himavanmerusadaśaṃprāhārāgamapāragāḥ || 127 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ datvā svāvāryāyeduparvaṇi |
raviparvaṇi vā koṭibhūṣaṇāṃ pradānajaṃ || 128 ||

phalamāsādya śuddhātmā pitṛvaṃśasamudbhavān |
māturanvayasaṃbhūtāna śataśopi sahasraśaḥ || 129 ||

udvratya narakemagrānbrahmalīkaṃ namatyasau |
datāthaṃ vasudhāṃ pakvavahuśasya samanvitāṃ || 130 ||

ācāryapādayugale saptadvīpavatīṃ mahīṃ datvā |
yatphalamuddiṣṭaṃ tatsyātpūryedravarvaṇi || 131 ||

sālagrāmaśilāṃ datvā vahudakṣiṇayānvitāṃ |
ācāryāyavratīdhīmānkoṭibrahmāṃḍadānajaṃ || 132 ||

avaśyaṃ phalamāpnoti siddhiṃ cāprotyanuttamāṃ |
itthamācārya pādābje pradatvā vahudakṣiṇāṃ || 133 ||

prasarpakebhyo vibhyobhyaḥ śaktyādayadyāścadakṣiṇaṃ |
śrotriyāmadaridrāya vedābhyāsaratāya ca || 134 ||

yo dadāti vivāhārthaṃ dhanaṃ sūryeduparvaṇi |
kṣīyaṃte salilānyadhvermāścatrasareṇavaḥ || 135 ||

brahmalokepi kalpāṃte tatphalasya na hi kṣayaḥ |
śakyaṃte pāṃśavobhūmergaṇituṃ vṛṣṭiṃ vivāhārthaṃ dhanaṃ sūryedraparvaṇi 
kṣīyaṃte salilānyabdhermomāścatrasareṇavaḥ || 135 ||

brahmalokepi kalpāṃte tatphalasya na hi kṣayaḥ |
śakyaṃteyāṃśavobhūmergaṇituṃ vṛṣṭiviṃdavaḥ || 136 ||

brahmasthāpanajapuṇyaṃ brahmaṇapi na śakyate |
vivāhārthaṃ dhanaṃ datvā grahaṇe caṃdrasūryoḥ || 137 ||

śrotriyāṇaṃ sahastebhyo yānajjīvanakaṃdhanaṃ |
datvā yatphalamāpnoti tadekasminvivāhite || 138 ||

<p. 145b>

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdve sādhakoniyatavrataḥ |
grahaṇeṣu puraścaryāṃ kṛtvā saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇaṃ || 139 ||

datvāśca medha sāhasre kṛtvā saṃpūrṇa dakṣiṇaṃ |
kṛtvā yatphalamāpnoti tatopyadhikamaśrute || 140 ||

sahasrakoṭiśo hutvā saptakoṭimanūtamaiḥ |
yatphalaṃ samavāpnoti śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā || 141 ||

hutvā sahasraṃ saviturgrahaṇeśaśinopi vā |
tatphalaṃ samavāpnoti bhagavadvacana yathā || 142 ||

avicchinnāṃvasordhāśaṃ hutvā dvādaśavārṣikaṃ |
yatphalaṃ samavāpnoti grahaṇe caṃdrasūryayāḥ || 143 ||

śrīśrīmadaṣṭāṇayā hutvā tadeva phalamāpnuyāt |
koṭī sahasrasaṃkhyākadakṣiṇasahitaṃ nṛpa || 144 ||

sahasraṃ vājimedhyānāṃ kṛtvā varṣa sahasrakaṃ |
sagaṃ dakṣiṇayayuktāṃ grahāṇe caṃdrasūryayoḥ || 145 ||

pūraścaryāmimāṃ kṛtvā śrīmadaṣṭarṇasaptanoḥ |
tatphalaṃ samavāpnoti vajimedha sahasrajaṃ || 146 ||

puraścaraṇa sāhasraṃ matsaṃpūrṇa dakṣiṇaṃ |
kṛtvā yatphalamāpnoti cūḍāmārāyākhyaṃ varveṇi || 147 ||

ekāmapi puraścarṇakṛtvā saṃpūrṇa dakṣiṇaṃ |
avaśyam tatphalaṃ bhūyaprāprotyatra na saṃśayaḥ || 148 ||

aśakto maṃdabhāyopi daridraḥ kṛpaṇepi vā |
sālagrāmaśilāṃ datvā suvarṇaniṣkapaṃcakaṃ || 149 ||

niṣkatrayasuvārṇaṃ vā datvācāryasya dakṣiṇaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭarṇavidyāyāssiddhiprāpnotyunuttamāṃ || 150 ||

grahaṇeṣu puraścaryāmavaśyaṃ yaḥ karoti hri |
tasya lakṣmīpatiḥ sākṣātprasīdati na saṃśayaḥ || 151 ||

śrūyotadūragāvārtādṛśyeta vahujanaṃ |
paradehāpraveśādi sāmarthyaṃ cāṇimādikaṃ || 152 ||

labhyate sādhakenāśupuraścraṇakṛtyataḥ |
bhargavevoraviśeṣassaṃpravakṣyate || 153 ||

<p. 146a>

yacchrutvā sādhakodhīmānsarvāyabhyo vimucyate |
bhārgavevāsare prāpte svācāryājñapurassaraṃ || 154 ||

prātaḥsrātvaviśuddhātmānityakarmasamāpya ca |
vidhivat saṃskṛte vahnau śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā || 155 ||

hutvā paṃcaśataṃ gavyaghṛtenādau samāhitaḥ |
prasannalakṣmīmaṃtreṇadvādaśārṇaśriyāpi vā || 156 ||

ṣaḍakṣaraśriyā vājyaṃ hunedaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ |
vāsudevasya manunāvaiṣvavyāthaṣaḍarṇayā || 157 ||

aṣṭaviṃśatidhā hutvā bahgavadraśmibhirghṛtaṃ |
ekaikaśestatohutvā triśataṃ brahmavidyayā || 158 ||

ārcayitvā tato bhojyaṃ mithunatrayamādarāt |
ekaṃ vaptiyunaṃ bhojyaṃ mṛṣṭhātrerdakṣiṇadibhiḥ || 159 ||

saṃtoṣyācāryapādābjeṣaryamānasuvarṇakaṃ |
ekaniṣkasuvarṇaṃ vā dadyādācārya dakṣiṇaṃ || 160 ||

mahālakṣmīdhiyācārya palyaivatha samarthavajahvāśrīhṛdayapaścatyaṃ ca 
dhāvānnidhāpi vāsvayaṃbhuṃjīta |
niyatovaṃdhubhissahabhūyate bhṛguvāravrataṃ kurvannityaṃ vatsarapaṃcakaṃ || 161 || 

trivarṣamekarṣavāṣarāmāsaṃ vā samāhitaḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāsiddhimānīpranuttamāṃ || 163 ||

ṣaṇmāsādidirādhīśaṃcakṣurmyāsaṃprapaśyati |
athamāsādimaidaityācāryavārepi vā nṛpa || 164 ||

kṛtvetthaṃ homakarmādo svācāryacaraṇadvaye |
karṣamānasuvarṇaṃ vā niṣkamekamathāpi vā || 165 ||

ācāryapatnī pādābje datvā vā dakṣiṇaṃ nṛpa |
prāpnotyanuttamāṃ siddhiṣaṇmāsādvatsarādapi || 166 ||

āpurārogyamacalamaiśvaryamaṇimādikaṃ |
śāyānugrahasāmarthyaṃ mṛddhiṃ putrādisaṃyutāṃ || 167 ||

avāpyakāmarūpitvaṃ manasau vegamakṣayaṃ śriyaṃ ca |
mahatīprāpyadhanadhānyāśvasaṃkulāṃ || 168 ||

matahasti samāyuktā paśuratnaudya saṃkulāṃ |
bhogānaṣṭavidhānkāyaṃsidhyādyaṣṭakamuttamaṃ || 169 ||

kulasāhasrasahito dehāṃte bhagavatpade |
te nātra saṃdehodivyakanyāśatānvitaḥ || 170 ||

na putrapautraiḥ paśubhirnayatrya ca viyujyate |
na dhanena ratnairvāviyogaṃ labhate kvacit || 171 ||

<p. 146b>

bhārgavevāsare yatra kutrāpi niyatavrataḥ |
vratamitthaṃ śuciḥ kṛtvā bhagavatkalamānvitaḥ || 172 ||

svacchaṃdamṛtyuḥśuddhātmākaṃdarpaśatasannibhaḥ |
prāpyāṣṭhaguṇamaiśvaryaṃ yoḍāmaṣṭhāṃga saṃyutaṃ || 173 ||

brahmaṇayujyamāpnoti yogināmapi durlabhaṃ |
anyepi sādhanīyāyaḥ saṃtyasya vasudhāpate || 174 ||

uktā maharṣibhirbhūyasiddhipalaparo bhavet |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā siddhyupāyoyamīritaḥ |
ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi bahmarṣitvādisādhanaṃ || 175 || 

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
paṃcacatvāriṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 146b>

śrībhagavānuvāca || 

śṛṇu rājanmahīpālabrahmarṣitvādisādhanaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭhārṇavidyāyāḥ pravakṣyāmi tataḥ paraṃ || 1 ||

lokesminmānuṣe bhūya janmamṛtyujarākule |
anenaiva śarīreṇa brahmarṣitvādisādhanaṃ śrīkarpadaṃ || 2 ||

durlabhaṃ śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyasidhyādikaṃ vinā |
vedapārāyaṇairvāpivājimedha śatenavā || 3 ||

mahādāna sahasrairvātīrthapātrāśatena vā |
amaratvadikaṃ prāpnutaṃ śakyaṃ vasudhāpate || 4 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyājapahomādikarmabhiḥ |
ācāryasevayānityaṃ dakṣiṇādravyahānataḥ || 5 ||

anenaiva śarīreṇa divyadehībhavatyasau |
tasmādaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ vinānnaiva kalevare || 6 ||

amaratvādyabhīṣṭāniprāptuṃ śakyānino nṛpa |
anenaiva śarīreṇa brahmarṣitvādikaṃ śubhaṃ || 7 ||

saṃprāpyate yathāloke tatpravakṣyāmi sāṃprataṃ |
setuvaṃdho mahatkṣetraṃ 1 raṃgadhāmatataḥ paraṃ 2 | 8 || 

śrīparvatīpiśeṣādriḥ 4 pāṃduraṃgaṃ 5 mahataraṃ |
kīllāpurīmahā 13 puṇyādakṣiṇemadhurāpurī || 14 ||

āhovalamahatkṣetraṃ 15 vāśiṣṭhāsiṃdhusaṃgamaḥ 16 || 
11 sītārāmagiriḥ paścā 11 tprayāgasrīrthanāyakaḥ || 18 ||

avaṃtī 19 dvārakāpurāyā 20 jagannātha padaṃ paraṃ 21 || 12 gaṃgāsāgarasaṃgopi 
22 saptagodāvarītaṭaṃ 23 

<p. 147a>

gokarṇa 24 naimiṣāṇayaṃ 25 gokarṇa ca tathottaraṃ 26 | 13 | āyodhyānagarī puṇyā 27 
madhurāpuramuttamaṃ 28 gaṃgādvāraṃ mahatpuṇyaṃ 29 kurukṣetraṃ ca śobhanaṃ 
30 | 14 sītārāmāśramaḥ purāyo bharatasyāśramopi ca 32 
kedāraṃmānasamapirāmahudamanutamaṃ 35 | 15 padmanābhamahatpurāyaṃ 36 
prabhāsaṃ ca mahataraṃ 37 vṛṃva 38 naṃgokulaṃ ca 39 jāhnavītaṭamapyatha 40 | 16 
sarasvatītaṭaṃ puṇyaṃ 41 yamunātaṭamapyatha 42 godāvarītaṭaṃ 43 eyaṃ 
kṛṣṇaveṇītaṭaṃ śubhaṃ 44 | 17 samudratīraṃ 45 siṃhādri 46 kāverītaṭamuttamaṃ 
47 etānipuṇyakṣetrāṇividyādisiddhikarāṇi hi 18 || samastatīrthakṣetrāṇaṃ rājñī 
vārāṇasī 48 śubhāsarvāsāmapi vidyānāṃ mahāsiddhipradāyinī 19 || tatopi 
matyaṃdapurāyamuktaṃ vadarikāvanaṃ 49 

sadyassiddhipradaṃ prāhurbhogamokṣaphalapradaṃ |
puṇyakṣetrāṇi divyanisaṃtyanyānyapi bhūtale pānidaṣvapi manujaḥ 
pātakaudyairvimucyate 21 ||

śṛṇuṣvā vahitorojanbrahmarṣitvādisādhandraṃ |
yacchrutvāpi na rodhīmānamucyate pāparāśibhiḥ || 22 ||

setuvadhaṃ samāśritya svācārya caraṇadvayaṃ || 22 ||

dhanuṣkoṭi kṛtasnānaḥ sāṣṭāṃgaṃ praṇipatya ca |
sahasra kṛtvo gāyatromabhyasyatriṃśaṃtaṃ tu vā || 23 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ samastanyāsasaṃyutāṃ |
vidrūpamātṛkāyuktāmathavā prajapecchuciḥ || 24 ||

yāvakṛkṣamayaṃ nityaṃ triśataṃ juhuyāhataṃ |
śrīmaṃtramapi japtvaikaṃ lakṣyaṃ śuddhau jiteṃdriyaḥ || 25 ||

dine dinertrayetpuṣpaistriśāṃtabrahmavidyayā |
tadaṃte juhuyādagnautilai strimadhusaṃplutaiḥ || 26 ||

viśuddho daśasāhasraṃ śrīmaṃtreṇa sahasrakaṃ |
sahasraṃ śataniṣkaṃ vā tadardha vā tadardhakaṃ || 27 ||

datvācāryadāṃbhoje kuṃḍaladvitayācitaṃ |
brāhmāṇannojayet paścācchataṃ sāgraṃ suvāsinīḥ || 28 ||

lakṣmaṇena ca śatrughnakaikaryāsutasaṃyutaḥ |
sugrīvavāyuputrādikapināyaka saṃvṛtaṃ || 29 ||

<p. 147b>

jānakīsahitaṃ rāmaṃ ca kṣurbhyāṃ saṃprapaśyati |
tasyānugrahatassadyojarāmaraṇavarjitaḥ || 30 ||

śakrādyaiḥ pūjyamāno saurdavtvaṃ labhate dhruvaṃ |
śrīrāmasyājñayanityaṃ rājarājovibhīṣaṇaḥ || 31 ||

yadyachāṃchadvāṃchati tatsarvamabhīṣṭaṃ |
saprayacchatidhanāni divyavastrāṇi divyānyābharaṇāni ca || 32 ||

dhānyodyamakṣayaṃ nityaṃ sādhakāya prayacchati |
anenaiva śarīre śāmanovegī ca khecaraḥ || 33 ||

śaktrādyaṣṭhadigīśānāṃ lokeṣu viharatyasau |
raṃganāthasya sānnidhyamāśrityanityaṃ sādhatavrataḥ || 34 ||

ācāryaṃ sannidhīkṛtyatacchruśrūṣaṇatatparaḥ |
kurvananniṣavaṇasmānaṃ kuveratanayātaṭe || 35 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāśanasāhasramādarāt |
prajaptvā śrīmanuṃ paścāpaṃcadhājyaṃ tato hunet ipyekalakṣamabhyaset || 36 ||

vāsudevatyekaṃ daśasāhasraṃ prajaptvāniyataḥ śuciḥ || 37 ||

bhagavadraśmisūktaṃ ca śātamaṣṭottaraṃ japet |
madhutritayasammiśrairgavyenājyena saṃplutaiḥ || 38 ||

hutvātha daśasāhasraṃ tilairaṣṭārṇavidyayā |
śrīmaṃtreṇa tato hutvā trisahasraṃ tilairnṛpa || 39 ||

vāsudevasya manunā vaiṣṇava ca urṇayā |
sahasramekaṃ juhuyātilairevaghṛtaplutaiḥ || 40 ||

bhagavadraśmimaṃtraiśca paṃcadhājyaṃ tato hunet |
sālagrāmaśivāṃ datvā śatadakṣiṇayānvitāṃ || 41 ||

paṃcaviṃśatisaṃkyākavipkādavyayutāṃ tu vā |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdva datvā vipraśataṃ tataḥ || 42 ||

suvāsinī śataṃ bhojyaṃ pradadyā dakṣiṇā api |
nasminnevadine sākṣādraṃganāthaṃ prapaśyati || 43 ||

madanugrahatassadyojarāmaṇarvārjjataḥ |
tejomayatunurbhūtvā vaśiṣṭādi prapūjitaḥ || 44 ||

brahmarṣitvamavāpnoti kalyāṃtanātrasaṃśayaḥ |
śeṣācalasya śikhare suvarṇamukharītaṭe || 45 ||

snānaṃ śriṣavāṇaṃ kurvanguru śuśrūṣaṇerataḥ |
sahasra kṛtvo gāyatrīṃ prajaptvātriśataṃ tu vā || 46 ||

nityahomaṃ samāpyatha samastanyāsa saṃyutāṃ |
śrīmadaṣyakṣarīṃvidyāṃ prajaptvā lakṣamādārāt || 47 ||

<p. 148a>

śrīmaṃtrānyatamaṃsveṣṭamayilakṣaṃ japecchuviḥ |
vāsudeva mahavidyā vaiṣṇavī ca ṣaḍakṣarī || 48 ||

daśasāhasrakaṃ japtvā pratyekaṃ niyatavrataḥ |
japedaṣṭhottaraśataṃ bhagavadraśmimālikāṃ || 49 ||

ghṛtatrivadhusammiśraiḥ śrīmadaṣṭhārṇavidyayā |
juhuyādaśasāhasraṃ tilaistatrāpi bhūyate || 50 ||

śrīmaṃtreṇahutnet padme strisahasraṃ ghṛtaputaiḥ |
vidyayā vāsudevasya vaiṣṇvyātha ṣaḍarṇayā || 51 ||

triśatādhikasāhasraṃtyayekaṃ juhuyādvataṃ |
bhagavadraśmibhirhutvā goghṛte naiva paṃcadhā || 52 ||

bhojayenniśataṃ viprānmṛṣṭannaina suvāsinī |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvegośātaṃ dakṣiṇānvitaṃ || 53 ||

tadardha vā tadardhaṃ vā tatpratyānnāya hema vā |
datvātasmindine sākṣāccheṣā valapatiṃ vibhuṃ || 54 ||

śrībhūminīlāsahitaṃ bhagavaṃtaṃ pakṣyati |
tatprasādena sadyo sau sarvavidyādharādhipaḥ || 55 ||

jarāmāṇanirmukto bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 56 ||

tasya vaktrāṃvujāt sarvavirdhavedādikāḥ śubhāḥ |
svayamevahiniryāṃtiryānipurāṇasmṛtayopi ca || 57 ||

tejomayatanurnityaṃ paṃcaviṃśativārṣikaḥ |
yogamaṣṭāmgamāsādyaśriyaṃ cāṣṭhaguṇānvitā || 58 ||

anenaiva śarīreṇa vimānamadhirohatiḥ |
akṣayānsakalānbhogānbhuṅe kalyāṃtamapyasau || 59 ||

āhovalaṃ samāśrītyānityabhiṣavaṇerataḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ samastanyāsasaṃyutāṃ || 60 ||

lakṣamekaṃ śriyo vidyāmapilalakṣaṃ tato japet |
vāsudevarmahāvidyāṃ vaiṣṇuvīṃ ca ṣaḍakṣarīḥ || 61 ||

pratyekamarkasāhasraṃ prajaptvā niyatavrataḥ |
śatamāvartayedvīmānnaḍāvadraśmimalikā || 62 ||

ghṛtatriadhusaṃmiśraṃ pāyasaṃtilamiśritaṃ |
hutvāya daśasāhasraṃ trisāhasraṃ śriyā hunet || 63 ||

bhagavadraśmibhiḥ paścādvatadvādaśadhā hunet |
viprāṇaṃ dviśataṃ bhojyaṃ nārīṇaṃ ca śatadvayaṃ || 64 || 

<p. 148b>

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvemahīsasya samākulā |
saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇaṃ yuktā dātavyāvaśyamādarāt || 65 ||

tanmūlyamathavādravyaṃ datvāvāryayadārvaja |
sākṣātpaśyati cakṣurbhyāmidirāsahitaṃ vibhu || 66 ||

tatprasādena vidyānāmadhiyodivyarūpabhṛtj |
rāmaṇanimuktovimānaṃ sarvakāmadaṃ || 67 ||

adhirutvāthagaṃdharvarājosaumavatidhruvaṃ |
kāṃcīnagaramāsādyanityaṃ triṣavaṇerataḥ || 68 ||

ācāryessannidhīkṛtyaśuśrūṣaṇayaṇaḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭhākṣarīvidyāṃ samastanyāsasaṃyutatā || 69 ||

 japtvālarkṣaśriyovidyāmiṣṭālakṣaṃ japedvadhaḥ |
japedvādaśa sāhasraṃ vāsudeva mahāmanuṃ || 70 ||

ṣaḍarṇaṃ dyuvīvidyāmayitatra tathā japet |
śatamāvartayepaścādbhagavadraśmimālikāṃ || 71 ||

vilvapatrairhūtābhyaktaurmadhutritayamiśritaiḥ |
hutvā dvādaśasāhasraṃ śriyā ca trisahasrakaṃ || 72 ||

vāstudevasya maṃtreṇa vaiṣṇuvyā ca ṣaḍarṇayā |
hutvā sahasraṃ pratyekaṃ ghṛtenaiva mahīyate || 73 ||

bhagavadraśmibhirhutvā ghṛtaṃ dvādaśa vā tataḥ |
brahmārpaṇahutiṃ kṛtvā śatamaṣṭautaraṃ dvijāna || 74 ||

suvāsinī śataṃ cāpi mṛṣṭhānnairathabhojayet |
samarpya pitvā svacāryakārṇayoḥ kuṃḍaladvayaṃ || 75 ||

dukūlayugalaṃ datvā dadyānniṣka sahasrakaṃ |
śataniṣkasuvarṇaṃ vā tadadhavātadardhakaṃ || 76 ||

dadyādācārtya pādābje vitaśātha vivarjitaḥ |
tasminnevadine sākṣātkāṃvīnagaranāyakaṃ || 77 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇaṃ devaṃ garuḍārūṣmacyutaṃ |
paśyatyeva svacakṣubhyo brahmeśādibhirarcitaṃ || 78 ||

tadanugrahatassadyojarāmaraṇavarjitaḥ |
nirāmayaścirāyuśca śriyamaṣṭhaguṇanvitaṃ || 79 ||

avāpya dhanadhānyaughamuktāraktasamākulāṃ |
iṃdrārdvāsanamāsādya daivatairapi pūjitaḥ || 80 ||

anenaiva śarīreṇa kāmarūpī manojavaḥ |
khecaratvamanuprāpyadevaṣitviprayātyasau || 81 ||

atha kṣetre mahāpuṇyevāśiṣṭhaṃ siṃdhusaṃgame |
narasiṃhasya sannidhye svācāryājñāpurassaraṃ || 82 ||

<p. 149a>

māghamāse viśuddhātmāvaiśākhe kārtikopi vā |
śrāvaṇemārgaśīrṣe vā vaddhaṃ bhāskaraparvaṇi || 83 ||

trirātropoṣitaḥ srātvāyaśriyāpyaṣṭhāṃtaraṃ śataṃ |
hutvātha bhagavadraśmi maṃtraisredhāghṛtaṃ hunet || 86 ||

praṇipatya ca sāṣṭāṃgaṃ vidhivajjātavadasiṃ |
tata ācāryayāhājvayugalapraṇiyavya ca || 87 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ datvaniṣkasāhasramādarāt |
śataniṣkasuvarṇaṃ vā tadardhavitadardhakaṃ || 88 ||

dadyādācāryapādābjevitaśaṭhyavivarjitaḥ |
paredyurbrāhmaṇānśatmābhojayeccasuvāsinīḥ || 89 ||

ācāryapatnīputrādīnanyarcya kalpasaṃcayaiḥ |
ācārye dūradeśasthe pādukādvitayori || 90 ||

tadbhāve bhagavatassannidhau vā samarpayet |
ācāryapatnīputrebhyaḥ preṣayedvastu tatpara || 91 ||

grahaṇeṣu puraścaryāṃ vāśiṣṭāsiṃdhusaṃgame |
vidhivatyaṃvadhākṛtvā sāṃgāṃ saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇaṃ || 92 ||

nṛsiṃhānugrahātsadyojitvā mṛtyuṃ ca dussaṃ |
brahmādaṃ paśyati kṣipraṃ daityasāmrājyanāyakaṃ || 93 ||

vahukālaṃ bhavatyasya sakhādaityādhipaḥ prabhuḥ |
prahlādānugrahātsadyoharibhaktima caṃcalo || 94 ||

saṃprāpya cakṣuṣā nityaṃ narasiṃhaṃ jagatpatiṃ |
prapaśyati mahālakṣmīsahitaṃ daivataivṛtaṃ || 95 ||

dinedinesya prahlādoratnānpadbhūraṇīni ca |
vāsāṃsiva mahārhaṇi śriyamaṣṭaguṇamapi || 96 ||

prayacchai carāpuṣpasaṃtativyāpirnīśriyaṃ |
anugrahānnaraharermahārṣirjāyate nṛpa || 97 ||

kollāpuraṃ samāsādya kamalāyāśca sannidhau |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ natvā sāṣṭīgamādarāt || 98 ||

śīmadaṣṭhākṣarījaptvātatrākṣayaphalaṃ labhet |
tadeva sumatyoṭaṃ mahālakṣmāyaśaskaṃ || 99 ||

bhūtale sarvaṃ pīṭeṣu tataḥ parataraṃ na hi |
mahāsiddhipradaṃ sadyo mahāpātakabhaṃjanaṃ || 100 ||

tatpīṭhasadaśaṃsadyassiddhidaṃ nāsti bhūtale |
dyarmārthakāmamokṣadi caturvargaphalāthinaḥ || 101 ||

samastepsitasaṃsiddhyaipīṭhe kollāpure śriyaḥ |
yajeddhīmān mahālakṣmīlakṣmīhṛdayavidyayā || 102 ||

<p. 149b>

tatra vakṣyāmi bhūpālasmāmāhitamanāḥ śṛṇu |
kollāpure mahākṣetre svācāryājñāpurassaraṃ || 103 ||

nityaṃ triṣavaṇākurvansamastanyāsa saṃyutāṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ japtvaikalakṣamādarāt || 104 ||

lakṣmīhṛdayavidyāṃ ca japellakṣamataḥ paraṃ |
dvādaśākṣaralakṣmīvaṃ śrīṣaḍarṇamathapi vā || 105 ||

sudeva mahāvidyāṃ vaiṣṇavī ca ṣaḍakṣarī |
japtvā dvādaśasāhasraṃ bhagavadraśmimālikī || 106 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvāvidhivatsaṃskṛtenale |
ghṛtamrimadhusammiśraistilairvilvadalānvitaiḥ || 107 ||

hatvā dvādaśasāhasraśrīmadaṣṭhārṇavidyayā |
atha prasannalakṣmya ca trisahasraṃ hunevilaiḥ || 108 ||

vāsudevasya manunā vaiṣṇavyā ca ṣadurṇayā |
hutvā sahasramājyena pratyekaṃ jvalitenale || 109 ||

bhagavadraśmividyābhirayadvādaśadhāhune tilaiḥ |
tat japādihomaṃ kṛtvātha kṛtvā brahmāryaṇāhuti || 110 ||

agniṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya svācāryacaraṇadvayaṃ |
sāṣṭāṃgaṃ praṇipatyotha ṣaṣṭicihvakahemaja || 111 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ datvā mudrikābhaṃgulīṣvapi |
api codaravaṃdhādi bhūṣaṇani samarpayet || 112 ||

suvarṇaniṣkamāhasraṃ tadardha vā tadardhakaṃ |
paṃcārvaśatinikaṃ vāsyācaryaraṇeryayet || 113 ||

vitaśāṭhyaṃ parityajyaracācāryasya priyāmapi |
svarṇalaṃkaranaivastrairviśeṣeṇa prapūjayet || 114 ||

bhojayeccaśataṃ sāgraṃ brāhmaṇaścasuvāsinīḥ |
tasmin dine svacakṣubhyaṃ mahālakṣmīsamanvitaṃ || 115 ||

vinatātanayārūḍhaṃ paśyatyevahariṃvibhuṃ |
jagajaratnadhanāśvaudyasaṃkulāmacalāṃ śriyaṃ || 116 ||

tatprasādādavāpyāsau dīrghāpuṣpaṃ nirāmayaṃ |
adhiyaṃ sarvasiddhānāṃ kapilaṃ ca prapaśyati || 117 ||

āyiyatyaṃ ca siddhanāmaṇimādiguṇaṃ śriyaṃ |
saṃprāpyayogamaṣṭāṃgasaṃyutaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ || 118 ||

saṃprāpya khecaratvaṃ ca manovegaṃ tathākṣāyaṃ |
anenaiva śarīreṇa jarāmaraṇavarjitaḥ || 119 ||

<p. 150a>

śvetadvīpādilokeṣu satyalokādikeṣu ca |
kapilānugrahānnityasasauviharatisvarya || 120 ||

dine dine sau cakṣubhyaṃ kipilaṃ saṃprapaśyati |
parakāyapraveśādi sāmartha ca vrajatyasau || 121 ||

puruṣestamamāsādyajagannāthasya sannidhau |
mārkaṃḍeyasaraḥ snātaḥ snātvā siṃdhau tataḥ paraṃ || 121 ||

praṇamyācāryapādābjaṃ samastanyāsa saṃyutāṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ japtavalakṣamerkayatavrataḥ || 123 ||

śriyovidhījapekvakṣaṃ vāsudeva mahāmanuṃ |
daśasāhasrakaṃ japtvā vaiṣṇavaṃ ca ṣaḍakṣaraṃ || 124 ||

śrīmadaṣṭhākṣeraṇathavidhivatsaṃskṛte nale |
tilaistrimadhugavyājyamiśritairayutaṃ hutvā || 125 ||

kṛtvā brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ || 127 ||

namaskṛtyā nāṃ paścādācāryacaraṇadvayaṃ |
praṇamya daṃḍavatasya karṇayoḥ kuṃḍaladvayaṃ || 128 ||

ṣaṣṭhicihukaṃ saṃkhyākataptakāṃcanaṃ nirmitaṃ |
padmarāgamutaṃ sūkṣmavāsau yuktaṃ samarpya ca || 129 ||

sālagrāmaśilādadyāhoyugmena samanvitāṃ |
mahastaṃ dakṣiṇa dadyātadardhavātadardhakaṃ || 130 ||

paṃcaviśaniniṣkaṃ vā yathā śaktyāsamarpayet |
śrenniyārṇāśataṃ sārgrasannaṃ bhojayecca suvāsinīḥ || 31 ||

ācāryapatnyai datvātha vastrālaṃkaraṇādikaṃ |
sadya eva jagannāthaṃ subhadrāsahitaṃ vibhuṃ || 132 ||

brahmarudrādibhirvadyaṃgaruḍāsūkṣmacyutaṃ |
paśyatyeva svacakṣubhyā tejomaṃḍalamadhyagaṃ || 33 ||

tatprasādādayaṃ sadyo mārkaṃḍeyaṃ prapaśyati |
bhavatyasya sakhānityaṃ mṛkaṃḍutanayomuniḥ || 134 ||

prasanne jagatāṃnāthe mahālakṣmīsamanvite |
mahepuraṃ sāmrājyamatha brahmapudaṃ tu vā || 35 ||

nāsādhyaṃ vidyatejasya prasādena śriyaḥyetaḥ |
ayodhyā puramāsādyasrātvāthaśarayūjale || 136 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ praṇipatyātha daṃḍavat |
ravṛhatrakrasamabhyarcya śrīśamāvaraṇanvitaṃ || 137 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ samastanyāsa saṃyutāṃ |
lakṣameka prajaptvātha lakṣamekaṃje yacchriyaṃ || 138 ||

vāstudeva mahāvidyāṃ vaiṣṇavī ca ṣaḍakṣarī |
pratyekamayutaṃ japtvāmālāmaṃtraṃ śriyaḥpateḥ || 139 ||

rājyābhiṣiktarāmasyajepadarkasahasrakaṃ |
vidhivatsīskṛte vahnau śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā || 140 ||
 
<p. 150b>

juhuyādaśasāhasraṃ kāpilājyena sādaraṃ |
guyadvāgavyaghṛtaṃ śrīmadaṣṭārṇe kṣaryāyutaṃ hunet || 141 ||

śrīmaṃtreṇa sāhasraṃ vāsudevasyavidyayā |
vaiṣṇavakāpilājyena sādaraṃ guvadvāgavyaghṛtaṃ || 142 ||

śrīmadaṣṭhārākṣaryāyutaṃ hunet || 141 ||

śrīmaṃtreṇa trisāhasraṃ vāsudevasya vidyayā |
vaiṣṇavyā ca śataṃ hutvā śrīrāmamanunā tataḥ || 142 ||

triśatādhikasāhasre hunedagraugavāṃ ghṛtaṃ |
bhavadraśmibhihutvāṃ paṃcadhāgoghṛtena ca || 143 ||

kṛtvā japādihomaṃ ca tato brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ |
agniṃ pradahakṣiṇīkṛtya svācārya caraṇadvayaṃ || 144 ||

sāṣṭāṃgaṃ praṇipatyātha taptahārakanirmitaṃ |
padmarāgasamāyuktaṃ kuṃḍadvitayaṃ śubhaṃ || 145 ||

ācāryakaṇīyordatvāgodvayaṃ vatsasaṃyutaṃ |
vahukṣīraṃ samarpyāthaniṣkasāhasramādarāt || 146 ||

datvā niṣkaśataṃ vāpi tadardhaṃ vā tadardhakaṃ |
datvācaryapriyāyai ca datvālaṃkaraṇadikayaṃ || 47 ||

paṃcaviṃśatisaṃkhyākamithunānyathabhojayet |
tasmin dine mahārājaṃ bharatādibhiracitaṃ || 48 ||

sugrīvādikapistutyaṃ brahmarudrādibhirvṛtaṃ |
sākṣātpaśyati cakṣubhyāṃ śrīrāmajānakīpatiṃ || 149 ||

asādhyamapi devānāmapi dīpadatarasthitaṃ |
abhīṣṭaṃ savalaṃ datvā śrīsamījagatīpatiḥ || 150 ||

sakhāyamaṃjanāsūrnukarītyasya na saṃśayaḥ |
hanūmataḥ prabhāvena siddhayoṣṭhāsimādayaḥ || 151 ||

pādukājanamukhyāśca siddhyatyasyāśusiddhayaḥ |
jarāmaraṇarāhityamapi dīrghāpurakṣayaṃ || 152 ||

dadātyasyījanāsūnurnityamiṣṭhaṃśca durlabhān | 
vārāṇasī samāsādya viśvanāthasya sannidho || 153 ||

maṇikarṇyākṛtasnānonatvā viśveśvaraṃ vibhuṃ |
viṃdumādhavamabhyarcya natvā svācāryapādukāṃ || 154 ||

samastanyāsasahitāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī śubhāṃ |
lakṣamekaṃ prajaptvātha bhagavatsannidhau śuciḥ || 155 ||

<p. 151a>

jiteṃdriyo haviṣyāśī japellakṣamāyi śriyaṃ |
vāsudevamanupaścādvaiṣṇavaṃ ca ṣaḍakṣarā || 156 ||

pratyekamayutaṃ japtvā śrīmadaṣṭhādaśākṣaraṃ |
japtvā dvādaśasāhasraṃmayutaṃ brahmavidyayā || 157 ||

avitvātha kusumairviṃdumādhavamīśvaraṃ |
tataḥ paraṃ hunedagnau śrīmadaṣṭāṇīvidyayā || 58 ||

tilākṣatasamayuktairvitvapatrairghṛtaplutaiḥ || 159 ||

hutvāyutaṃ māhālakṣmātrisahasramayo hunet |
vāsudevasya maṃtreṇa vaiṣṇavyā ca ṣaḍarṇayā || 160 ||

pratyekatriṃśataṃ hutvā tataudhaṃgiramāyataḥ |
maṃtreṇa juhuyādagnau sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 161 ||

hutvātha bhagavadraśmipatre hutvātha paṃcadhā |
japadihomaṃ kṛtvātha praṇamyagnimataḥ pare || 162 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ paraṇipatya pradakṣiṇaṃ |
ṣaṣṭhicihukasaṃtaptahāṭakena vinirmitaṃ || 163 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayarabhyaṃ datvā caryasya karṇayoḥ |
muddikādyairalaṃkāraissamabhyarcya ca sādaraṃ || 164 ||

kṣaumaṃ vāso yugaṃ datvāniṣka sāhasramarpyayet |
triśataṃ śataniṣka vā tadardhaṃ vā tadardhakaṃ || 65 ||

ācāryayāyaṃ yeddhrīmānvitśāṭhyavivarjitaḥ |
mahālakṣmīdhiyāpaścātatpatnyā api bhūṣāṇī || 66 ||

tāṭaṃkahaṃ marcitākaṃ mudrikāṃ ca samarpayet |
dukūlamathavā sarścakaṃ kaṃcukaṃ ca samarpyayet || 167 ||

paṃcaviṃśati saṃkhyakamithunebhyaśca bhojanaṃ |
datvātha dakṣiṇadyaiścasaṃtoṣyavapathāmati || 168 ||

tasmin dine nirāhārorvidumādhavesennidhau |
bhūtvā padeṣu bhuṃjīta brāhmāṇaissahavaṃdhuniḥ || 169 ||

avaśyaṃ agatāṃ nāthī vidubhyadhavamacyutaṃ |
paśyatyevasvacakṣurbhyāṃ viśveśvara samanvitaṃ || 170 ||

tadanugrahatassarvavidyānāṃ pāragovaśī |
bhūtvā mūkopimahatī śriyā yamaṣṭha guṇanvitāṃ || 171 ||

prāpyā puṣpapuṣpamadhārogyaṃ bhavatkiṃkarādhipaḥ |
bhūtvāṃte yāti sānnidhyaṃ kulakoṭi samanvitaḥ || 172 ||

<p. 151b>

makarastheravaumādye prayāgetīrthanāyake |
prātaḥsnātvānvahaṃbhatmānityakarma samāpya ca || 173 ||

svācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ preṇiyatyāthasādaraṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭhākṣarīvidyāṃ samastanyāsasaṃyutī || 174 ||

lakṣanekaṃ prajaptvātha paṃcaviṃśat sahasrakaṃ |
mahālakṣmī manuṃ japtvā vāsudevamadyatmanuṃ || 175 ||

ṣaḍakṣaravaiṣṇavaṃ ca pratyekamayutaṃ japet |
vidhivat saṃskṛte vahau śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā || 76 ||

hutvā dvādaśasāhasratirlergavyaghṛtaplutaiḥ |
trisahasraṃ tilaidevaghṛtamiśraiḥ śriyāhunet || 177 ||

vāsudevadvādaśārarṇavaiṣṇavābhyāṃdataḥ paraṃ |
hutvā sahasra pratyekaṃ bhagavadraśmibhistridhā || 178 ||

hutvā dvādaśasāhasramarcayedrahmavidyayā |
kuṃḍalādyairalaṃkārairācāryamatha pūjayet || 179 ||

sūkṣmaṃ vāsoyugaṃ datvā niṣkasāhasramapyeyet |
triśataṃ śataniṣka vā tadarthaṃ vā tadardhakaṃ || 180 ||

vitalībhaṃ parityajya śrīdhiyācārya vallabhāṃ |
alaṃkāraiścavāsebhissaṃtoṣyatva tataḥ paraṃ || 181 ||

paṃcaviṃśati saṃkhyākamithunānyapi bhojayet |
śrīśrīpatidhiyāpaścātoye dakṣiṇādibhiḥ || 183 ||

divase māghamāsāṃtye śrīśrīśabrahmavidyayā |
śrīśrīśāvardhayeddhīmānsahastaṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 183 ||

tasmin dine virāhāro bhūtvā rātrau jagatpatiṃ |
sākṣātsvapneyi vā paśyatyasau devaṃ śriyaḥ ratiṃ || 184 ||

tadājñayāṣṭhadikpālāḥ sakṣadvigrahadhāriṇaḥ |
śrīpate rājñayātasya śakrādyālokapālakāḥ || 185 ||

anvahaṃ tasyakaikaryaṃ kurvatyeva na saṃśayaḥ |
kalpahunaṃ kāmadhenuṃvitāratnamabhutamaṃ || 186 ||

datvā mṛtaṃ tato divyaṃ pradathuśca na saṃśayaḥ |
pītvā mṛtamasau divyamajaraśca marastathā || 187 ||

bhūtvā sau kāmarūpī ca manovegī ca khecāraḥ |
viharatyakhilānlokānsasiddhagaṃdharvasevitaḥ || 188 ||

vadarīkānanaṃ prāpyanareṇasahitasyemesnātvā |
cālakanadāyānivyakarmasamāpya ca || 189 ||

<p. 152a>

śrīmadaṣṭhākṣarīvidyā samastanyāsasaṃyutāṃ |
lakṣamekaṃ prajaptvātha svācāryājñāpurassaraṃ || 190 ||

paṃcaviśatsahasraṇisaptaviṃśākṣarīṃ śriyaḥ |
japtvātha vāsudevākhyaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ ca ṣaḍakṣaraṃ || 191 ||

pretyakamarkasāhasraṃ prajaptvā raśmimalikāṃ |
aṣṭhottaraśataṃ japtvāvidhivat saṃskṛtenale || 192 ||

śrīmadaṣṭhārṇamaṃtreṇapāyasaṃ trimadhuplutaṃ |
hunedgavyājyamathavā bhānusāhasramādarāt || 193 ||

prasannalakṣmīmaṃtreṇa trisahasraṃ hunedvataṃ |
vāsudevasya manunāmanunā vaiṣṇavena ca || 194 ||

pratyekaṃ triśataṃ hutvā bhagavadraśmibhistridhā |
hutvājvaṃjyaline vahnau homaṃ kṛtvā japādibhiḥ || 195 ||

agnipratyakṣiṇīkṛtya natvā svācāryapāsyīḥ |
naranārāyaṇaṃ vidyāṃ japedakaṃ sahasrakaṃ || 196 ||

tayaivāgnau hunedājyaṃ sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ |
bhūyojapādihomaṃ ca kṛtvā brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ || 197 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ sāṣṭāṃgaṃ praṇipatya ca |
kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ ramyaṃ datvācāryasya karṇayīḥ || 198 ||

aṃgulīyakamukhyāni datvālaṃkaraṇāni ca |
pītāṃvarayugaṃ datvā svācāryacaraṇadvaye || 199 ||

suvarṇaniṣkasāhasraṃ dadyāt paṃcaśataṃ tu vā |
nniśataṃ śataniṣka vā tādardha vā tadardhakaṃ || 200 ||

vitalobhaṃ parityajya datvācārya dadvaye |
ācāryapatnyai datvā yathā solaṃ karaṇādikaṃ || 201 ||

paṃcaviṃśati saṃkhyā kamithunānyapi bhojayet |
naranārāyaṇīvidhā prajepatadine śuciḥ || 201 ||

dṛḍhavrato nirāharo nareṇa sahitaṃ vibhu |
brahmarudrādibhirvedyaṃ niśimāṃ saṃprayaśyati || 203 ||

madanugrahataḥ sākṣādasaubhānu samaprabhaḥ |
ajarāmaraṇonityaṃ paṃcaviṃśati vārṣikaḥ || 204 ||

siddhatvamamaratvaṃ vā brahmarṣitvāmathāpi vā |
mahāyogitvamathavā brahmatvaṃ vā maheśanāṃ || 205 ||

viṣṇutvāmathavā sākṣādvāṃchitaṃ prāpyasādhakaḥ |
kṣaṇaṃkṛśaḥ kṣaṇasthūlaḥ śriyamaṣṭaguṇāṃ punaḥ || 206 ||

<p. 152b>

prāpyapi yogamaṣṭhāṃgaṃ parakāyaṃ viśatyasau |
tiraśībhāṣitaṃ veti sarvajñatvaṃ ca saṃtata || 207 ||

prapyasvācchaṃdamaraṇaṃ dehāṃteyegidurlabhaṃ |
kulakoṭiyutodhīmān praviśatyeva matpadaṃ || 208 ||

dvārakāmathurāvaṃtī kurukṣetraṃ ca naimiṣaṃ |
kṣetraṇibhūtale saṃti sadyassiddhikarāsayapi || 209 ||

vadaryukta vidhānena kṛtvā homajapādikaṃ |
ācāryānujñayā kṛtvā siddhimiṣṭhāṃ vrajatyapi || 210 ||

sarvatrā cāsānnidhyaṃ siddhidaṃ bhuvi kathyate |
tatpatnīputrapautrāṇāṃ sānnidhyamathavā nṛpa || 211 ||

ācāryapādukāyumyasannidhau vā japadikaṃ |
kāryaṃ tadakṣiṇadānaṃ pādukādvitayopadi || 212 ||

ācāryapatnīputrāṇāmathatadvanamarpayet |
anena vidhināvapi siddhimiṣṭāṃ vrajatyatha || 213 ||

śrīmadaṣṭhākṣarī vidyājapahomādi saṃbhavaṃ |
phalaṃ vaktuṃ na śakyaṃ syānmāyadhātrāpirśabhutanā || 215 ||

nācāryātparamaṃ daivaṃ vidyānāṣṭākṣarī |
samājñātvātha tatparonityaṃ modate brahmarūpabhāk || 215 ||

idemevaparaṃ śreyaskaraṃ brahmavasādhanaṃ |
etasmādadhikaṃ nāsti satyaṃ satyaṃ mahīyate || 216 ||

idamaṣṭāṇīmāhātmāṃ kiṃcidatrāpyudīritaṃ |
vasudharādividyānāṃ pravakṣyate sāvanaṃ tataḥ || 217 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre 
vedārthasaṃgrahe ṣaṭcatvāriṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 152b>

śrībhagavānuvāca | 

atha vakṣyāmi bhūvidyānuṣṭhānavidhimuttamaṃ | 
nīādhidyāvidhāna ca śṛṇuśva śraddhayānvitaḥ || 1 ||

trayīvījaṃ samuccārya caturdaśa samanvitaṃ |
maheṃdrārūṭhagaṇapaviṃdunādasamanvitaṃ || 2 ||

caturthamapyathāṃtasthaṃ viduyutmamataḥ paraṃ |
tadeva viṃduhīnaṃ ca bhṛguṃ paṃcamasaṃyutaṃ || 3 ||

viṃduyuktaṃ na karādyaṃ vahniṃ dīrghasamanvitaṃ |
vāyuṃ dvādaśasaṃyuktaṃ hṛdayena samanvitaṃ || 4 ||

eṣā vasuṃdharā vidyādaśārṇā saṃprakīrtitā |
sarvatīrthamayī sarvakṣetraratnādisiddhidā || 5 ||

<p. 153a>

samastādyaudyaśamanī mahādāridyataṃjanī |
varāhosya muniḥ prokto vairājaṃ chaṃda ucyate || 6 ||

devatā sarvabhūtānāṃ prakṛtirvasudhāmatā |
dvitīyaṃ vījamityuktaṃ hṛtchaktiḥ samudīritā || 7 ||

ṣaḍadīrghe dvitīye vaṣaḍaṃgaṃ vinyasetaḥ |
śyāmā vicitrāṃ pukaratra bhūdyaṇaṃ padyāsanāṃ ||
tu gapayodharānatā daṃdīvaredvenavaśālimaṃjarī |
śukaṃ dadhānāṃ vasudhāṃ bhajāmahe || 8 ||

lakṣamekaṃ japenmaṃtrīdharāyā maṃtramādarāt | 
sarpiṣapāyasena juhuyā tadvaśāṃśataḥ || 9 ||

tāṃ viṣṇoḥ pūjayertyaṭivakṣyamāragavidhānataḥ |
tragāni pūjayedādau bhūvahni jalamārutān || 10 ||

digpatreṣu samabhyarcyakoṇapatreṣunatkalāḥ |
jvaliṣmājvālinīcadhūmrārcirititā kalāḥ || 11 ||

āśāpālāstataḥ pūjyāvajrādyastra samanvitāḥ |
sarvasiddhamanormaṃtrī sādhayet samanorayān || 11 ||

caturviṃśati sāhasrā mahorātraṃ bhagordino |
ekasminnevadivase prajasrātha parodyapi || 13 ||

trihasraṃ hunedagrau ghṛtaṃ trimadhupāyasaṃ |
gauvarmasammitāṃ bhūmiṃ pakvasusya samanvitāṃ || 14 ||

vahudakṣiṇayāyuktāmācāryāyanivedayet |
mahī pratinidhidravyamathavāguraverpayet || 15 ||

vidyāsiddhimavāpnotiṣu lokeṣu durlabhāṃ |
madhutritayasaṃyuktairjuhuyādaruṇotpalaiḥ || 16 ||

sahasraṃ bhūsamṛdvisyādayanīlolairapi |
priyaṃgupuṣpairmadhvaktaihutvā paṃcasahasrakaṃ || 17 ||

dhanṃdhānyaṃ mahīṃpakvasasyāśriyāmakṣayāṃ | 
avirāllabhate maṃtrīnidhānāni ca paśyati || 18 ||

maṃjarīśāli saṃbhūtāṃ madhutritayatolitāṃ |
nityaṃ dvādaśadhā hutvā maṃḍātsyādvarāpatiḥ || 19 ||

śukravāredinamukhegṛhītvā sādhyamūmṛdaṃ |
tāmaṃbhāsivinikṣipyaśovinetracaruṃ pacet || 20 ||

<p. 153b>

payo ghṛtābhyāṃ sahitaṃ juhuyātaṃ hutāśane |
ṣaṇmāsaṃśukravāreṣu hutverthaprāmuyādvarāṃ || 21 ||

aṣṭhojaraśatenāsau varṣādgrāmādhiyo bhavet | 
dharādhidyāṃ prajaptyaikaṃ lakṣaṃ vidhivadarcikte || 22 ||

kuśeśayairhunedagnaughṛtatrimadhumiśritaiḥ |
śuddhātmā ravisāhasraṃ dhanaratnaughasaṃkulā || 23 ||

catuḥsamudraparyaṃtāṃ mahīśāsti na saṃśayāḥ |
varāmevaṃ bhajanmaṃtrī paśuraladhanādibhiḥ || 24 ||

dharāyā vallabhaḥ sasyānnātra kāryā vicāraṇā |
dharāyāṃ maṃtramahātmyamiti kiṃcinmayeritaṃ || 25 ||

vadāmyataḥ paraṃ nīlāmahātmyaṃ vasudhāyato | 
trapīvījaṃ vṃduyutaṃ caturthasvaramapyathā || 26 ||

viṃśatisparśamuccāryavāmalocana saṃyutaṃ |
mukhavṛtamutāṃ bhūmidhyāṃtyaṃ rudrasamanvitaṃ || 27 ||

amṛtaṃ vāyusahitaṃ vāgbhavārūḍhamapyatha |
hṛdayena samāsuktāṃ nīlāvidyoyamīritā || 28 ||

(*****) sarvavimahāsaṃyatsamṛddhidā |
sarvakṣetramayīsarvalokatrayavaśaṃkarī || 29 ||

ṛṣirasya bhavedbrahmāchaṃdogāyatramucyate | 
nīlādevīdevatāsyādvojaṃ syādvāmalocanaṃ || 30 ||

hṛtchaktirīritā dīrghasvaraiḥ kuryā ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ |
kālāṃvudasamākārāṃkasuritilakāṃkitāṃ || 31 ||

divyāṃbharaṇasaṃpannāṃ divyavastra samanvitāṃ |
divyādacaṃdanaliptāgīṃ divyapuṣpasraganvitāṃ || 32 ||

vāmapārśve bhagavataḥścāmaraṃ vinnatīṃ kare |
kamalaṃ dadhanīṃ hasteśaraccaṃdrasāmānanāṃ || 33 ||

smitānanāṃ viśālākṣī nīlāṃ vaṃde haripriyāṃ |
nīlādevīmiti dhyātvā lakṣamekaṃ japetvaciṃ || 34 ||

daśārśayāyaṃ saṃhutvāghṛtatrimadhumiśritaṃ |
ācāryadākṣiṇaṃ datvāvidyāsiddhimavāpnuyāt || 35 ||

paṃcaviṃśati sahasramathavādakṣiṇanvitaḥ |
japtyāhutvātrisāhasraṃ paredyuḥ kamalaisitaiḥ || 36 ||

ghṛtatrimadhusaṃmiśrairvaṣāśanamitaṃ dhanaṃ |
datvācārya yadadvaṃdve siddhiṃ prāpnotyanujamāṃ || 37 ||

anayāsiddhayāmaṃtrīsādhayet sakalepsitaṃ |
vasuṃdharāvatpūjāsyārnnīlāyāpibhūyateḥ || 38 ||

<p. 154a>

lakṣamekaṃ prajaptvomāṃ nīlāvidyāṃ phalapradāṃ |
ghṛtatrimadhusammiśraṃ daśāṃśaṃ juhuyāddhaviḥ || 39 ||

maṃdadhīrapi mūko vā vidyānāṃ pārago bhavet |
palāśakusumairhukhā paṃcasāhasramādarāt || 40 ||

samadhunnilayasaṃmiśraiḥ sarvavidyānidhirbhavet |
aruṇairutpalairhutvā ṣaṭsahasraṃjiteṃdriya || 41 ||

acalaṃ mahadaiśvaryaṃ labhate ratnasaṃkulaṃ |
japtvā lakṣamimaṃ vidyāṃ tulasīvanamdhyataḥ || 42 ||

ghṛtannimadhusaṃmiśrairhutvāthaṃ tulasīdalaiḥ |
labhate sarvasāmrājyaṃ saṃpatimacalāmayaṃ || 43 ||

lājairghṛtaplutairhutvāyaṃ ca sāhasrāmādarāt | 
kanyāmiṣṭhāmavāpnoti rūpaśīlaguṇānvitāṃ || 44 ||

japtvānīlāmahāvidyāṃ pratyahaṃ yataḥ śuciḥ |
dhanaṃdhānye caralānividyāṃ ca mahatīṃ labhet || 45 ||

vidhānaṃ kiṃcidukṛtenīladivyābhuvopi ca | 
vāsudevādividyānyaṃ māhātmyamathavakṣyate || 46 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
saptacatvāriṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 154a>

vāsudeva dvādaśākṣarīmaṃtraḥ 

śrībhagavānuvāca 

śṛṇurājanmahīpālavāsudevasya cakriṇaḥ |
parabrahmātmakasyādyāvidyāṃ sakalāsiddhidāṃ || 1 ||

praṇavaṃ namasāyuktaṃ makāraṃgayaṃ tataḥ |
vateyadamayoccāryamukhavṛtayutāṃ sudhāṃ || 2 ||

bhamuṃsavāmakaṇaṃ ca rudrayuktātrimapyathā |
varuṇaṃ dīrghasahitaṃ mārutākṣaramapyathā || 3 ||

vidheya vāsudevasya brahmaṇaḥ paramātmanaḥ |
samastavedavedāṃtasārabhūtārthasaṃgrahā || 4 || 

mahāpātakaṃ saṃhatrīṃ sarvaduḥkhavibhedinī 
svāyaṃbhuvādayaḥ pūrvaṃ vāsudevamahāmanuṃ || 5 ||

dvādaśārṇe mamuṃ japtvā saṃprāptāḥ siddhimakṣayāṃ |
dhuvopināradādeśādvādaśārṇaṃ śriyaḥ pateḥ || 6 ||

japtvaiva siddhiṃ gatavān trailokyepi sudurlabhāṃ |
āyurārogyamaiśvaryaṃ yaśarthāvanasaṃvayāḥ || 7 ||

<p. 154b>

jvararṇamarasvārāhityaṃ pūrvajāti smṛtiḥ śubhā |
dvādaśārṇamanorjāyātsidhyatyakhilasiddhayaḥ || 8 || 

vāsudevāmidhaṃ brahmaviśvagārbhe vidatmakaṃ |
dvādaśārṇanusaṃvānānnityamasya prakāśate || 9 || 

icchatā brahmatādātmyasiddhimekena janmanā |
vāsudevamahāvidyājasavyādvādaśākṣarī || 10 ||

ṛṣibrahmāsyamaṃtrasyājāgataṃ chaṃdā ucyato |
vāsudevābhidhaṃ brahmakathyate daivataṃ vudhaiḥ || 11 ||

vījamuktaṃnnadhīḥ vījaṃnatiḥ śaktirudīritā |
praṇavena hṛdinyasya namasāśirasinyaset || 12 ||

nyasedbhagavate śabdaṃ śikhāyāṃ vasudhāpate | 
kavacaṃ paṃcamirvarṇaiḥ samaste nāstramācaret || 13 ||

harimujvalacakradarāgadāparighanvitadosita padmagataṃ | 
valayāgadahārakirīṭadharaṃ navakuṃdanirbhapraṇatāmi sadā || 14 ||

dhyātyaivaṃ hṛdayesākṣādvāsudevaṃ jāgatpatiṃ | 
arvaviraṇāsaṃyuktaṃ vāptyapīṭhe prapūjayet ||15 ||

prathamāvaraṇaṃ paṃcakoregagaiḥ paṃcabhiḥ kramāt | 
aṣṭapatre vāsudevaṃ śriyaṃ saṃkarṣaṇaṃ tataḥ || 16 ||

sarasvatī ca prachumnaṃ ratimapya niruddhakaṃ |
prītirdvādaśapatre jvetkeśavamāditaḥ || 17 ||

nārāyaṇaṃ mādhavaṃ ca goviṃdaṃ viṣṇumapyathā |
madhusūdanamabhyarcyatrikramāmathaḥ paraṃ || 18 ||

vāmanaṃ śrīdharaṃ paścādhṛṣīkeśamataḥ paraṃ |
padmanābhaṃ samabhyarcyadāmodaramataḥ paraṃ || 19 ||

śakrādyairaṣṭhādikupālairvrajrādyaiśca tataḥ paraṃ |
itthamabhyarcyaviśveśaṃ vāsudevaṃ jagatpatiṃ || 20 ||

arkatakṣaṃ japenmaṃtrī vidhivatsaṃskṛtenale |
hutvā śubhratilairgavyaghṛtannimadhumiśritaiḥ || 21 ||

arkasāhasrāmācāryadakṣiṇāṃ ca samarthya ca |
vāsudeva mahāvidyāsiddhimāpnoti śāśvatīṃ || 22 ||

<p. 155a>

ekaviṃśāti sāhasramathavaikādaśīne |
dvādaśyāṃ ca samabhyasyā divārātramananyadhīḥ || 23 ||

trayodaśyāṃ hunedājya madhutritayatiśritaiḥ |
visahasraṃ śubhatilairvarṣāśanamitaṃ vasu || 24 ||

datvācārya padāṃbhoje vidyāyāḥ siddhima śrute |
kṣīrāktāmirasyakṣīrasamidbhirjvalite nale || 25 ||

hutvā dvādaśasāhasraṃ triśuddhimavāpnuyāt |
goṣṭhe vṛṃdāvanevāpi lakṣajāpī payovrataḥ || 26 ||

palāśapuṣpairayutaṃ hutvājya trimadhuplutaiḥ |
pāragaḥ sarvavidyānāṃ bhagavatpatra na saṃśayaḥ || 27 ||

nadītīre japellakṣamayutadvitayotaraṃ |
hutvā dvādaśa sāhasraṃ havirājya madhuplutaṃ || 28 ||

dhanadena samolakṣmyāvidyayādhiṣṭhaṇaprabhaḥ |
kaṃdrpasadṛśaḥ kāṃtyā jīveccaśaradāṃśataṃ || 29 ||

dūrvāmirgoghṛtāhlābhirhutvā daśasahasrakaṃ |
mirāmapaścirāpuṣpalabhate nātrasaṃśayaḥ || 30 ||

naṃdyāvartergoghṛtāktairmadhutritayamiśritaiḥ |
ayunatritayaṃ hutvā bhagavatkalayānvitaḥ || 31 ||

aṇimādiguṇaiśvaryaṃ vācāṃ siddhimanujāmāṃ | 
āyurārogyamatulabhadvi putrādi saṃyutāṃ || 32 ||

prāptotyatra na saṃdeho prasādena śriyaḥ pateḥ |
pathurāyāyāmadhaḥ śāyīhaviṣyāśī jiteṃdriyāḥ || 33 ||

lakṣadvādaśakaṃ japtvā dvādaśārṇaṃ śriyaḥ pateḥ |
kimanena japenāśunāsādhayatimaṃtravit || 34 ||

sarvajñatvaṃ manojñatvaṃ mamatvaṃ maharṣitva ca |
(*****) siddhaṃ tvaṃ khecaratvamathāpi vā || 35 || 

asādhyamapidevānāmasau sādhayatīpsitaṃ | 
dyadaśākṣaravidyāpāyakrakukrapi vā japāt || 36 ||

ihāpi sakalān bhogān bhuktvā mānuṣadurlabhān | 
kulānāṃ śatamudhatyaṃ modate paramepade || 37 ||

ṣaḍakṣarī pravakṣyāmi vaiṣṇavīṃ sarvasiddhidāṃ 
yasya vijñānamātreṇa palāyaṃte mahāpadaḥ || 38 ||

praṇavaṃ viṣṇave śabdaṃ namaskārasamanvitaṃ |
udvaredvaiṣṇavovidyāṣaḍarṇeyasudīritā || 39 ||

<p. 155b>

samastasaṃpatsāmrājyahetubhūtāsanātanī |
mahāpātakasaṃhartrī bhuktimukti phalapradā || 40 ||

ṛṣiḥ prajāpatirbrahmāgāyatraṃ chaṃda ucyate |
devatā śrīmahāviṣṇuparamātmā śriyaḥpatiḥ || 41 ||

vījamuktaṃ trayīvījaṃ natiḥ śaktirudāhṛtā |
ekena ca tribhirdvābhyāṃ dvirāvṛtyāṣaḍaṃgakaṃ || 42 ||

vinyasya hṛdayedhyāyetchrīpatijagatāṃpatiṃ |
mūle kalmatarordivyaratnasiṃhāsane śubho || 43 ||

āsīnamiṃdirānāthaṃ navanīlaṃvudadyutiṃ |
śaṃkhacakragadāpadmadharaṃ śrīvatsavakṣasaṃ || 44 ||

pītāṃvāradharaṃ hārakuṃḍalādi vibhūṣitaṃ |
padmapatraviśālākṣaṃ kāmakoṭi samadyutiṃ || 45 ||

kāmākasthitapādevyāśriyākanakabhūṣayā |
sahitaṃ dakṣiṇe pārśve dhatacāmarahastayā || 46 ||

dhrūdevyā vāmapārśve tu nīlādevyāsamanvitāṃ |
vimalotkarṣiragījñānādyaṣṭhaśaktibhirāvṛtaṃ || 47 ||

anaṃtaviśvakṣenādyairgaruḍādyaiśvasaṃstutaṃ |
viṣṇuṃ viśvaṃbharavaṃdejajattrāṇāparāyaṇāṃ || 48 ||

iti dhyātvā mahāviṣṇuṃ sarvalokaikasākṣiṇaṃ |
jayet ṣaḍakṣarīṃ vidyāṃ vaiṣṇavīṃ sarvasiddhidāṃ || 49 ||

lakṣaṣaṭkaṃ jayedādaugoṣṭe vṛṃdāvanepi vā |
ācāryasannidhīkṛtya daśāṃśaṃtarpayetyayaḥ || 50 ||

daśāṃśaṃ ghṛtasaṃyuktairhutvātha tulasīdalaiḥ | 
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdve datvā vahuladakṣiṇāṃ || 51 ||

vidyāsiddhimavāpnoti prasannaṃ kurute vibhuṃ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇeyoge paṃcaviṃśatsahasrakaṃ || 52 || 

ekasmindivase japtvā paredyuḥ saṃskṛte nale | 
hutvātilairghṛtābhyaktaiḥ strisahasraṃ samāhitaḥ || 53 ||

varṣāśanamitaṃ dravyaṃ datvācāryapadāṃvuje |
vidyāsiddhimavāpnoti sadya eva mahartarā || 54 ||

sakalaṃ kārtikaṃ māsaṃ viṣyāśī jiteṃdriyaḥ |
jatvālakṣannayaṃ vidyāṃ vidhivat saṃskṛte nale || 55 ||

hutvā kuśeśayairviladalairvā trimadhuplutaiḥ |
aṇimādi guṇānprāpya sarvajño bhavati dhruvaṃ || 56 ||

<p. 156a>

madhutritagavyājyāmiśritaiḥ tulasīdalaiḥ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityaṃ hutvāgrau vidhivacchuciḥ || 57 ||

ṣaṇmāsānmahatīṃ lakṣmīmavāpyadhanasaṃkulāṃ |
pāragaḥ sarvavidyānāṃ bhavatyatra na saṃśayaḥ || 58 ||

varṣenāproti sakalāndurlabhāṃścāmanorathān |
ataḥ paramasaunityaṃ maheṃdrādīnprapaśyati || 59 ||

siddhobhutvāmarāvatyāṃ kulasāhasrasaṃyutaḥ |
anenaivaśarīreṇa tejomapatanurbhṛśaṃ || 60 ||

kalmāṃtaṃ modate dhīmānmaheṃdreṇa prapūjitaḥ |
ṣaḍakṣarī mahāvidyāmanvahaṃ prajapatrimāṃ || 61 ||

sannidhau śrīpateraṃte vā satyākalpamakṣayā |
praṇavaṃ nāma sāyuktaṃ viṣṇaveśabdamapyathā || 62 ||

avanaścasūkḍapārśvaṃ nābhivījamataḥ paraṃ |
varuṇaṃ dakṣanetrārghā dvitīyoṣmāṇamapyatha || 63 ||

yakṣasparśasamāyuktaṃ jalaṃ rudrasamanvitaṃ |
ekādaśākṣrīvidyā vaiṣṇuvīyamudāhṛtā || 64 ||

smaraṇadadyasaṃhatrī sarvakleśavibhaṃjanī |
āyurārogyasaṃpatikāriṇī bhuktumuktidā || 65 ||

anayāsadṛśīvidhā siddhidānāsti bhūtale | 
mahāpātakasaṃhatrīṃ mahāritaghātinī || 66 ||

juhuyogyā sadāśūdraiḥ strīmiśca praṇāvaṃ vinā |
praṇavena māyuktā japtavyā satataṃ dvijaiḥ || 67 ||

ekena janmanāmuktimihāpi paramāṃ śriyaṃ |
icchatā satataṃ japyā viṣṇyaurekādaśākṣarī || 68 ||

ṛṣirasyavidhirbrahmābhīṣmaḥ śāṃtanavopi vā |
traiṣṭumacchaṃda ukraṃsyānmahāviṣuśriyaḥ patiḥ || 69 ||

devatā jagatānnāthaḥ praṇavovījamucyate |
hṛtdyakriruktālakṣmīśaprītaye viniyujyate || 70 ||

rakākṣareṇa dvābhyāṃ cannibhiḥ paṃcabhirakṣeraiḥ |
punastrivarṇevasubhiḥ ṣaḍaṃganyāsa īritaḥ || 71 ||

dhyānaṃ pūrvavadevoktaṃ sādhanaṃ saṃpravakṣyate |
paṃcalakṣaṃtuyenmonīpuraścaryārthamādarāt || 72 ||

daśāṃśaṃ tarpayeddhīmānpayasekṣurasena vā | 
tadvaśāṃśaṃ hunedagnau tilairājyamadhuplutaiḥ || 73 ||

<p. 156b>

ācāryapādayaprābhyāṃ samarpya vahudakṣiṇaṃ |
sadya eva labhedvidvāsiddhiṃ sumahatīmapi || 74 ||

ekādaśīdinemārgaśīrṣemāsyatha vā nṛpa |
ārabhya paurṇamāsyaṃtaṃ paṃcaviśatsahasrakaṃ || 75 ||

 jatvātilairdyatābhyaktairmadhutritayamiśritaiḥ |
trisahasraṃ paurṇamāsyāṃ niśitvāyatavrataḥ || 76 ||

varṣāśanamitaṃ dravyaṃ datvācārya padābjayoḥ |
prāpnotyatra na saṃdeho vidyāsiddhiṃ mahatarāṃ || 77 ||

hutvā ghṛtaprutān lājān paṃcasāhasramādarāt |
suṃdarīlabhetaṃ kanyārūpaśīlaguṇanvitaṃ || 78 ||

guḍūvīkhaṃḍairayutaṃ hutvājya trimadhuprutaiḥ |
mahadārogyamāsādyajīvedvarṣasahasrakaṃ || 79 ||

ketakī kusumairhutvā ghṛtatrimadhumiśritaiḥ |
arkasāhasrekaṃ sākṣātkaṃdarpaśatasatibhaḥ || 80 || 

prāpnoti mahadaiśvaryamacalaṃ dhanasaṃkulaṃ |
ghṛtannimadhusaṃmiśraṃ pāyasaṃ jvalite nale || 81 ||

hutvāyutaṃ sa samastānāṃ vidyānāṃ pārago bhavet | 
grahaṇe sparśamārabhyamokṣakālāṃtamādarāt || 82 ||

spaṣṭvā brahmīra sa maṃtraṃ japtvā sāhasramādarāt | 
pivedvāpāyayedvāpi sarvavidyāprakāśanaṃ || 83 ||

mahāsārasvataṃ tasya bhaviṣyati na saṃśayaḥ |
skhalahrīspaṣṭa vāgbhūtvā sakṛddhā śravaṇādapi || 84 ||

dhārayet sakalāvidhāna ca viṣṇvarati dhruvaṃ | 
niṣkāṇāṃ paṃcakaṃ vāpi diniṣkaṃ vāpi kāṃcanaṃ || 85 ||

mahāsārasvata prāptyai dadyācārya dakṣiṇaṃ | 
aṣṭhāṃgayogasidhyarthaṃ tulasīvanamadhyagaḥ || 86 ||

japtvā lakṣamimāṃ vidyāmayutaṃ tulasīdalaiḥ |
ghṛtatrimadhusaṃmmiśrerhutvātha jvalite nale || 87 || 

aṣṭhāṃgayogamāsādya bhavatyevājarāmaraḥ |
japādekādaśākṣaryā vaiṣṇavyānityamādarāt || 88 ||

jātismātvamāsādya brahmapaśyati cakṣuṣā |
yaṃtrapūjādikaṃ sarvamanayorvāsudevavat || 89 ||

ekādaśārṇavidyāya anusaṃdhānatonvahaṃ |
guṇavaṃtaṃ śriyāyuktaṃ māyuṣmāṃtaṃ labhesutaṃ || 90 ||

<p. 157a>

āpado vilayaṃ yāṃti saṃpadasyuḥ pade pade |
bhūtvā jñānīlatenmuktiṃ kulānāṃ śatasaṃyutaḥ || 91 ||

vāsudevamatoḥ samyagviṣuvidhādvayasyava | 
kathitaṃte mayā bhūyamāhātmyaṃ kiṃcidiṣṭhadaṃ || 92 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
aṣṭacatvāriṃśodhyāyaḥ] 48 ||
<p. 157a>

śrībhagavānuvāca || 

ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi rahasyamapi bhūyate | 
yajñeśavidyāmahātmyamakhila śrutisaṃgrahaṃ || 1 ||

vedavedāṃtaśāstraughāsārabhūtamabhīṣṭadaṃ |
yajñeśavidyā mahātmyaṃ śṛṇu vakṣyāmi bhūyatai || 2 ||

trayīvījaṃ śriyovījaṃ trayīvījaṃ tataḥ punaḥ |
hṛdayena samāyuktaṃ viduhīnaṃ śriyīkṣaraṃ || 3 ||

jaṭharākṣaramuccāryamukhavṛtayutaṃ cakhaṃ |
vasuṃdharākṣarapaścānmārutena samanvitaṃ || 4 ||

dvādaśasvasaṃyuktajaṭaroṇasamanvitaṃ |
kṣetraiśākṣaramuccārya śrīmadaṣṭārṇamuccaret || 5 ||

arddhāṃgaśrīpatereṣāvidyāyajñayaterhareḥ |
aṣṭādaśākṣarī proktā sarvajñā'jñaparelapradā || 6 ||

sarvapātakasaṃhatrī mahāduḥkhavibhedinī |
ādhivyādhi harīnṛṇāṃ sarvasāmrājyā saṃddhidā || 7 ||

ṛṣyovātaraśanāḥ purāṇa vijiteṃdriyāḥ |
sarvalokahitodyuktā devairāpi sadārcitāḥ || 8 ||

kūṣmīḍanāmakānbrahmamunīndivyānpurānān |
dṛṣṭā praṇamya sāṣṭhāṃgaṃ papraccharidamāhṛtā || 9 ||

trailokyasvāminopūyaṃ bhagavataḥ |purātanāḥ |
namaskurmovayaṃ yuṣmatpādābjebhyomaharṣayaḥ || 10 ||

pūyaṃ pavitraṃ cūtāsmānṛpe nārayasu utamān |
bhaviṣyāmonṛlokesmin kathaṃ vā brahmarūpiṇaḥ || 11 ||

iti pṛṣṭāstadāviprāḥ kūṣmāṃḍā dīrghadarśinaḥ |
avunanvātaraśanānṛṣīndīrghatapasvinaḥ || 12 ||

kūṣmāṃḍā ūcaḥ puṣmabhyaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmaḥ pavitraṃ |
jagatohitaṃ vedāṃteṣvaṣavedeṣu sārabhūtaṃ sanātanaṃ || 13 ||

<p. 157b>

brahmaṇo jāyāmānaosau trāyāṇāmṛṇavānbhuvi |
devatānāmṛṣīṇāṃ ca mahātmanāṃ || 14 ||

ṛṣīṇa brahmacaryeṇa pitṛṇāṃ prajasāya tathā |
yāgairakhiladevānābhaṃ bhavenmukte kaṇatrayāt || 15 ||

kaṣṭasādhyaṃ ṛtuphalaṃ mahāpātakanāśanaṃ |
kathyate sarvavedeṣu vedāṃteṣvapi bhūyeta || 16 ||

pitṛṇā ca maharṣoṇaṃ devatānāṃ caibhūyeta |
ṛṇatrapavimuktiḥ syāttānubherbhūridukṣiṇaiḥ || 17 ||

vedānadhītyavedauvāvedavāvedaṃ vā śaktito |
dvijaḥ saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇaṃ yāgaṃ kṛtvaikamapi vā bhuvi || 18 ||

hutvā sāyaṃ tathā prātaragnihotredinaṃ dine |
paurṇamāsyāṃ tathā darśakṛtveṣṭimadyanāśinī || 19 ||

vatsarevatsarekṛtvā yaśodālabhaṃ nṛpa |
itthaṃ pavitroyajvāsau brahmāryaśādhipabhuviḥ || 20 ||

pūjyate satyalokesau munibhirdevatairapi |
atyatyadakṣiṇe yagopanamānaṃ vināśayet || 21 ||

atyalpadakṣiṇāyāgādakṣiṇarahitā iva |
niḥphalānātra sasaṃdehaḥ kiṃcanārakaduḥkhadāḥ || 22 ||

saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇoyāgaḥ kṛta ekopi bhūtale |
brahmārpaṇadhiyāt yasya brahmasya brahmasālokyasiddhidaḥ || 23 ||

amaṃtrakaṃ vṛthā śrāddhaṃ vṛthā yāgolpadakṣiṇāḥ |
vedahīno vṛthā vipro vṛthā vidyāpya vaidikī || 24 ||

tasmādavaśyavipreṇa kāryāyāgāssadakṣiṇaḥ |
nāmadhādakāviprosāvayajyāsaṃmudīritaḥ || 25 ||

ekaṃ vāpi mahāyāgaṃ kṛtvā saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇaṃ |
punāti sakalaṃ vaśaṃ daśapūrvaṃ daśāvaraṃ || 26 ||

grahaṇe vāpi saṃkrāṃtau navarātravratepi vā |
pūrṇāyāmathadaśavāvaiśākhe kārtikepi vā || 27 ||

yāgārthaṃ vahulaṃ dravyaṃ pātra bhūtāpayīrpayet |
tasyā puṇyaphalaṃ vaktaṃ nāhaṃ śaktomibhūyate || 28 ||

mahādāna sahasrasyaphalaṃ vaktuṃ hi śakyate |
yāgārtha dravyadānasya phalaṃ dhānnāmayātpi vā || 29 ||

rudreṇāpi na śakyaṃ syādvaktuṃ rājanmahīyote |
mahādānaśataṃdataṃ kurukṣetre ravigrahe || 30 ||

yāgārthaṃ dravyadānasya kalānāhatiṣoḍaśī |
śrotriyāyadaridrāyadrāvya vaivāhikaṃ dadan || 31 ||

<p. 158a>

yāvgāthaṃ drevyadānena samaṃ prāhurmahṛrṣayaḥ |
vivāhārthaṃ dhanaṃ datvā viparvaṇivaiṇivairave || 32 ||

mātṛvaṃśyanyitṛvaṃśyānmagrāśca narakārṇāve |
sāhasraśassamutvātyāsahitasraiḥ pitāmahaiḥ || 33 ||

vimānamadhiratdyāṃte brahmatye kevasatyasau |
ahutāgnirayajvā ca durbrāhmaṇa iti smṛtaḥ || 34 ||

nityāgrihotra yatyā ca brāhmāṇetama ucyate |
tasrādavaśyaṃ kartavyoyāgassaṃpūrṇadakṣiṇāḥ || 35 ||

pavitratākaronityaṃ brāhmaṇanāmiti śrutiḥ |
yāgeṣvanadhikarīyassu ācārya yadāṃvuje || 37 ||

yāgārthaṃ bahulaṃ dravyaṃ samarpyavasudhāpate |
vedavidyuḥ śrotriyebhyaḥ suvarṇaṃ śatakoṭiśaḥ || 37 ||

datvā yatphalamāpnoti tatepyadhikamutamaṃ |
phalamāsādya tejasvī sahasrakulasaṃyutaḥ || 38 ||

brahmaṇāpūjitassatyalākesthitvā tataḥ paraṃ |
brahmaṇāsahasāyujyaṃ prāpnovaśriyaḥpateḥ || 39 ||

etadeva dvijātīnāṃ pavitraṃ karmakathyate |
puṣpabhyaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmah. suguptamapi vaidikaṃ || 40 ||

nākhyātaṃ yasya kasyāpi sārātsātamaṃ paraṃ |
yajñanāyaṇīnāmnā śrīmadaṣṭādaśākṣarī || 41 ||

arddhāṃgaśrīmatervidyākhyātā sarvaśrutiṣvapi |
ācārya kṛpapālabdhā sarvaṛtuphalapradā || 42 ||

agnihotraphalaṃ prāpsassāyaṃ prātardinedine |
yajñanārāyaṇīvidyāṃ prajeyā susamāhitaḥ || 43 ||

pūrṇayamapidaśaica śatamaṣṭottaraṃ ghṛtaṃ |
hutvācārya padāṃbhoje datvā śaktyā ca dakṣiṇaṃ || 44 ||

daśeṣṭhipūrṇamāseṣṭhi phalaṃ prāpnoti śāśvataṃ |
mahatīṃ supuraścaryā laghīvāṃ pūrṇadakṣiṇaṃ || 45 ||

vatsare vatsare kṛtvā hayamedhaphala labhet |
samastavidyāsramrājñī śrīmadaṣṭādaśākṣarī || 46 ||

samastakāmadodyīpakāṃ madhenuri vā parā |
anayāsadaśīvidyā jagatotra yayāvanī || 47 ||

na vidyate dvijaśreṣṭhādatvaṣāśvatī śrutiḥ |
śatakoṭimitasvarṇadakṣiṇasahitān ṛtūn || 48 ||

<p. 158b>

rājasūyāśvemadhādīnkṛtvāyatphalamaśrute |
aṣṭādaśārovidyāpuraścaraṇo nṛpa || 49 ||

tadeva phalamāsādya varṣe varṣe mahāmatiḥ |
uddhātyānparakemagrānpitṛnathapitāmahān || 50 ||

sahitastairbrahmalokemodate brahmasannibhaḥ |
aṣṭādaśākṣarīvidyāmunirbrahmā prajāpatiḥ || 51 ||

chaṃdaśca daivīgāyatrī sākṣānnārāyaṇohariḥ |
arddhāṃgaśrīyuto devaḥ kathyate jagatīpatiḥ || 52 ||

vījaṃ vījadaṃ proktadaṃcchaktiḥ samudāhṛtā |
trapyādyayāśriyā kuryāt paścāvyāsaṃ ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ || 53 ||

mātṛkāmathaśaivīṃ ca vaiṣṇavīmathamātṛkāṃ |
nyasya vānyasā vādhīmān dhyāyet svahṛdavāvuje || 54 ||

pārijātate rāmūneratnasiṃhāsane śubhe |
āsīnaṃ jagadābhāsaṃ vīdālasamadyutiṃ || 55 ||

padmapatraviśālākṣaṃ prajyasannamukharva |
karjamuktāphalābhadaṃtāliṃ sasmitā dharavidumaṃ || 56 ||

śaṃkhaṃ rathāṃgamādarśaṃ suvarṇakalaśāṃvuje |
vibhrāṇaṃ ca gadāṃ ghaurāṃ vāmāṃge vidyudāvṛtiṃ || 57 ||

arddhvāgaṃ lakṣmīsahitaṃ pītāvaravirājitaṃ |
kirīṭahārakeyūrakuṃḍalādivibhūṣitāṃ || 58 ||

nīlādevyāmahīdevyā vāmadakṣiṇā pārśvayoḥ |
sahitaṃ vimalādyaṣṭamahiṣībhissamanvitaṃ || 59 ||

anaṃtavihaṇadhīśaviṣvakṣenādibhirvṛtaṃ |
sunaṃdanaṃdapramukhaiḥ pārṣaderūpaśobhitaṃ || 60 ||

brahmarudramaheṃdrādiśiromakuṭakāṃtibhiḥ |
vidājitapadadvaṃdvamāpannārtiharehariṃ || 61 ||

yamanābhaṃ jagannāthasargasthitilayadhiyaṃ |
nārāyaṇaṃ bhajenityaṃ paramātmānmacyutaṃ || 62 ||

yajñanārāyaṇaṃ nityaṃ dhyātvetthaṃ jagatīpatiṃ |
aṣṭādaśākṣarīvidyā japtvā ṛtuphalaṃ labhet || 63 ||

nānyātyavitramastyai tatsadṛśaṃ jagatītaleyaḥ |
pāvano jagatyasmin sarvādyaudya vivarjitaḥ || 64 ||

sa eva bhagavān sākṣādravyuta parameśvaraḥ |
mahāpātakayuktāśca nityamaṣṭādakṣmaṇakṣarī || 65 ||

<p. 159a>

karoti pāvanān jallānityamuktānkaroti hi |
aṣṭādāśākṣarīvidyā japtyeyamepivat || 66 || 

mahāpāpaudyayuktāśca jīvanmuktānkorāti hi |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇavatproktamasyāyaṃnnārcanādikaṃ || 67 ||

puraścaryādikaṃ sarvaviprāḥbhyārtha tu saṃyutāḥ |
jiteṃdriyo haviṣyāśī kṣīrāśī vā phalāśanaḥ || 68 ||

lakṣatraye dvidyāṃ yajñānārāyaṇomimāṃ |
daśāstrārcanāśa juhuyātpatyairutpalairvādyutaplutaiḥ || 69 ||

tilairvāvilvapatrairvādyatātatrimadhusaṃplutaiḥ |
ācāryacaraṇardvadvedatvā saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇāṃ || 70 ||

aṣṭāraśārṇavidyāyassiddhiprāprotyanutamo |
athaṇa vā kārtikemāsivaiśākheśrāvaṇopi vā || 71 ||

āśvinenavarātre vā mādye vā phālgunepi vā |
paṃśaviṃśati sāhasraṃ prajaptvāṣṭā daśākṣārī || 72 ||

dṛśāṃśaṃ juhuyātyaprairghṛtannimadhumiśritaiḥ |
śataniṣkaṃ tadardha vā vaṣīśanamitaṃ tu vā || 73 ||

datvācāryaparyada dvaṃdve vitamākalpa saṃyutaṃ |
paṃcaśitisaṃkhyākamithunānyapi bhojayet || 74 ||

vidyāsiddhimavapnoti mahatī nātra saṃśayaḥ |
atha kāmyāni karmaṇi sādhe yadatayādvijāḥ || 75 ||

japtvā lakṣamāṃ vidyāmālayekamalpayetaḥ |
daśāśakamalairhutvā ghṛtatrimadhumiśritaiḥ || 76 ||

saubhāgyaṃ mahadāprītikaṃdarpaśatasannibhaṃ | 
paścimahāraliṃgetha vṛṣabhūnyevivālaye || 77 ||

māsamekaṃ haviṣyāśīlakṣamekaṃ manuṃ japet |
tatra vilvadalairhutvā gavyājya madhumiśritaiḥ || 78 ||

dhanadhānyasayāyuktaṃbhājāśvaratha saṃkulāṃ |
muktāratnasamākīrṇamacalāṃ ca parāṃ śriyaṃ || 79 ||

āsādyadhanadanāsau sadṛśo bhavati śriyā |
nābhidaghrajalesthitvāmaṃḍalaṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 80 ||

japtvā prācīmukhodgatvā ghṛtamaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ |
śriyādhanadasaṃkāśo vidyayādhiṣaṇayame || 81 ||

aścanthamūlāmāśritya māsamekaṃ niraṃtara |
triśatādhikasāhasraṃ japtvākṛtvā ghṛtaṃ śataṃ || 82 ||

<p. 159b>

kālāmṛtuyai prāptajapatyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
svacchaṃdamaraṇe bhūtvā vyādhibhirnabhibhūyate || 83 ||

nārikalaṃ catuḥkhaṃḍa kṛtvājya trimadhuplutaṃ |
aṣṭonaraśataṃ nityaṃ hutvā prajvalite nale || 84 ||

prāptotyasādhyānidyārthānapyasau maṃḍalāt |
karva āṣṭottaraśataṃ nityaṃ laghubhiḥ kadalīphalaiḥ || 85 ||

ghṛta trimadhusamiśrairhutvā prajvalite nabhe |
maṃḍala dvitayenā sau saptadvīpādhināyakaṃ || 86 ||

viṇyuṣaṃ mahāprajñastuṃ tamāpnotyanuttamaṃ |
madhukaiṭamahaṃ tāraṃ dhyātvārdvāgaśriyaḥpatiṃ || 87 ||

japtvā lakṣamimaṃ maṃtraṃ hutvārkakusupairatha |
duṣṭānajñabhayāti kṣipraṃ nigṛhṇātyapi rājasān || 88 ||

nāgavallīdalairhutvā ghṛtatrimadhumiśritaiḥ |
agnau dvādaśasāhasraṃ saṃprāpya mahatī śriyaṃ || 89 ||

mānyate sakalairbhūparaipidevaissavya savaiḥ |
amāyāṃ paurṇamāsyāṃ ca śatamaṣṭottaraṃ ghṛtaṃ || 90 ||

hutvācārya padadvahe niṣkaṃ niṣkāryameva vā |
suvarṇaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ datvātatpalyaitatsutāyavā || 91 ||

darśeṣṭipūrṇamāseṣṭi phalamāsādya śāśvataṃ |
pūjyatepi mahedyaiḥ kimumartyermahītale || 92 ||

prāpnoti dhanadhānyadisaṃ kulāmacalāṃ śriyaṃ |
vṛhaspati samaḥ sākṣādatvāṃ vidyāsusādhakaḥ || 93 ||

prāpnoti mahatīmṛddhiṃ putrapautrādisaṃyutāṃ |
satyalokevasatyaṃte kulānāṃśatasaṃyutaḥ || 94 ||

māghe vā phālgune vāpi caitre vaiśākhamāsi vā |
yajñanārāyaṇī japtvā paṃcavimśatsahasrakaṃ || 95 ||

madhutritayagavyājyasahitaṃ havirādarāt |
sahasratritayaṃ hutvā varṣāśanamitaṃ dhanaṃ || 96 ||

datvāvāryapadadvaṃdvekoṭiśo dakṣiṇanvitaṃ |
avaśyaṃ hayamedhasya phalaṃ prāpnotyanuttamaṃ || 97 ||

mahāpāpopapāpaughairapi sadye vimucyate |
maheṃdrasadṛśo lakṣmyavidyayādhiṣaṇa prabhaḥ || 98 ||

sthāpayitvānvayaṃ bhūmāvācaṃdrārkaśriyānvitaṃ |
bhuktvā suvipulānbhogān divyānapyatha mānuṣān || 99 ||

<p. 160a>

kulasāhasrasahito bhagavaddhāmnimodate |
svīḍugrahaṇe sarvasaṃkrāṃniṣṭapi saṃtataṃ || 100 ||

vyatīpātādiyogeṣu śrīmadaṣṭādaśākṣarīṃ |
japtvā ca vidhivatilairājyavimiśritaiḥ || 101 ||

aṣyetaraśataṃ sarvapi hṛnnarakaṃ saṃsthitā |
na śataśopi samuddhatya satyaloke nayatyasau || 102 ||

sāyaṃ prātarnityahomaṃ kṛtvā yajñeścaraṃ hari |
arddhāṃgaṃ śrīpati vahnau dhyātvā nārāyaṇaṃ hariṃ || 103 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ śatādhika sahasrakaṃ |
japet paṃcaśataṃ vāpi catuḥśātamathāpi vā || 104 ||

triśataṃ vātaṃ japtvā śrīmadaṣṭhā daśādaśākṣarīṃ |
sāyāṃ kṛśānusānnidhye śatamaṣṭottarajapet || 105 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā vāpi japtvānityaṃ yatavrataḥ |
caturṇamapivedānāṃ phalāṃ pārāyaṇodbhavaṃ || 106 ||

pratyahaṃ samavāpnoti muktaḥ syādipipātakaiḥ |
sāṃgadakṣiṇayāyuktahayamedhaphalaḥ tathā || 107 ||

adyāpya sakalābhīṣṭaṃ prāpyāṃte muktimā prayāt |
kūṣmāṃḍaimunibhiḥ pūvāyajñanārāyaṇeśituḥ || 
yaduktaṃ maṃtramāhātmyaṃ maṃtramāhātmyaṃ mayātatubhyamīritaṃ || 108 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvahasyedāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
ekonapaṃcāśaudhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 160a>

śrībhagavānuvācaṃ || 

brahmanārāyaṇādīnāṃ vidhānamapi vakṣyate |
yeṣāṃ vijñānamātreṇa palāyaṃte vipadgaṇaḥ || 1 ||

aṃtepi praṇavopetā śrīmadaṣṭākṣī śubhā |
brahmanārāyaṇīvidyā saṃproktā paramarṣibhiḥ || 2 ||

āditassaṃhitāṃ kuryāda tatastu na saṃhitāṃ |
navākṣarīyaṃ saṃproktā brahmanārāyaṇī śubhā || 3 ||

ekena janmanaiveyaṃ brahmatādātmyasiddhidā |
brahmadarśanasidhyarmyamāśuvijñānasiddhaye || 4 ||

brahmanārāyaṇīvidyāmācāryānujñayājayet |
ārṣadyaṃdādikaṃ cāsyāḥ sarvamaṣṭārṇamaṃtravat || 5 ||

<p. 160b>

praṇavaṃ haṃsaśabdaṃ ca sohaśabdamataḥ paraṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīyaṃścadvaṃ sa nārāyaṇīritā || 6 ||

ekena janmanāmuktimicchatāmayamādarāt |
haṃsanārāyaṇīvidyā japtavyāmuktisiddhaye || 7 ||

vanibhiyetibhibhirvidyādvayaṃ japyamidaṃ śubhaṃ |
prādhānyena na japtavyaṃ vidyādūyamidaṃ gṛhe || 8 ||

vairāgyaprāpakatvena gṛhasthaiḥ siddhikāṃkṣibhiḥ |
gṛhasthai ca vanasthaiścapatibhirbrahmacaribhiḥ || 9 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyavajaptavyā sarvasiddhaye |
asyapi śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtravatsarvamīritaṃ || 10 ||

artho namo bhagavate caturthyata samanvitaṃ |
nārāyaṇapadaṃ paścādvidyeyaṃ dvādaśākṣarī || 11 ||

mahāsiddhikari sadyassamastādyavidāriṇī |
ārṣādikamapi proktamasyā aṣṭārṇamaṃtravat || 12 ||

trayīvījaṃ śriyovījaṃ caturthyaṃta samanvitaṃ |
śropapadaṃ namasāyuktaṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ tataḥ || 13 ||

catudṛśākṣarīvidyālakṣmīnārāyaṇīritā | 
praṇākamalāvījaṃ caturthyaṃ samanvitaṃ || 14 ||

mahālakṣmīpadayaścannamaskārasamanvitaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīpaścādvidyeṣā ṣoḍaśākṣarī || 15 ||

anyeyamapi vidyoktā lakṣmīnārāyaṇīśubhā |
aṣṭādaśārṇatvadvidyādvayāsvarṣādikaṃ smṛtaṃ || 16 ||

puraścaryādikamapi yaṃtrārccādikamapyatha |
vakṣyethayājuṣīrghā lakṣmīnārāyaṇī śubhā || 17 ||

āvahatīpadaṃ pūrvavitanvānāyadaṃnataḥ |
kurvāṇavīramityuktvāpadamātmana uccaret || 18 ||

vāsāvasimametyuktvāgāvaśveti padaṃ tataḥ |
annapātre ca śabdaṃ ca sarvadā padasapyatha || 19 ||

tato meśriyasuttrāyathadamāvaha tatparaṃ |
lomaṇaṃ paśubhiḥ paścāt sahasvāhonamaḥ padaṃ || 20 ||

nārāyaṇasya dapitāṃ jātaveda sa uccaret |
ayamadhīgalakṣmīśamaṃtroyājuṣa ucyate || 21 ||

dāridraduḥkhasaṃhatrī sakalaiśvaryasiddhidā |
yājuṣīyaṃ mahāvidyālakṣmīnārāyaṇī smṛtā || 22 ||

<p. 161a>

ṛṣirasya kaholaḥ syācchaṃda ānuṣabhaṃ smṛtaṃ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇaḥsvāmīdeva ukto maharṣibhiḥ || 23 ||

hastairviśratsarasijagadāśaṃkhacakrāṇi vidyāṃ padmādaśaukenaka kalaśaṃ 
meghavidyudvilāsaṃ vā |
motuṃgastanamaviratā kalpamāśleṣalebhadekī bhūtaṃ vapuravatuṃnaḥ 
puṃḍarīkākṣalakṣmyoḥ || 24 ||

yaṃtrapūjādikaṃ cāsyāssarvaśaṣṭārṇavannṛpa |
puraścaryā viśoṣonnakṣyate vasudhāyate || 25 ||

lakṣmekaṃ japedvidyāmācāryasyaiva sannidhau |
ghṛtatrimadhuyuktena haviṣā juhuyādatha || 26 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdve datyā vahuladakṣiṇaṃ |
vidyāyāssiddhimāpnoti śāśvatī nātrasaṃśayaḥ || 27 ||

yadyādvādaśa sāhasraṃ prajaptvācārya sannidhau |
ghṛtatriadhusaṃmiśraṃ havihutvā sahasrakaṃ || 28 ||

varṣāśanamitadravyaṃ datvācāryaya padābjāyoḥ |
prāpnoti mahatī siddhiṃ dadyāyā nātrasaṃśayaḥ || 29 ||

nityaṃ dvādaśadhā vahnai hatvā dvādaśadhā haviḥ |
mṛṣṭānnārāśilabhate vipinepi na saṃśayaḥ || 30 ||

nityaṃ prātassamutthāya hutvā hutanāśanaḥ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā vidyāmenāṃ śriyaḥpateḥ || 31 ||

anutamaṃ mahālābhapratyahaṃ samavāpnuyāt |
ācārye sannidhīkṛtya tulasīvanamadhyagaḥ || 32 ||

japtvā lakṣamimāṃ vidyāṃ labhet sarvamanorathān |
svabhāvavaidikīvidyā śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī śubhā || 33 ||

sa vidyānāṃ samastānāṃ sāmrājñī samudīritā |
gāyatryādi mahāvidyā asyārasmaya īritāḥ || 34 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā japāsaktasya saṃtataṃ |
sakṛtsmaraṇatopyetāḥ siddhidāssadya ehi || 35 ||

 śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyājapāsaktirathānvahaṃ |
ācāryacaraṇādvaṃdvaṃ sevāpratyahamādarāt || 36 ||

śrutyuktācārasaṃpatircamermatiracaṃcalā |
calācatvarpitāni bhagavātsānnidhyaṃ prāpayaṃti hi || 37 ||

<p. 161b>

brahmanārāyaṇādīnāṃ vidhānaṃ kiṃcidīritaṃ |
hayagrīvādi vidyānāṃ māhātmyanayakṣyate || 38 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvārahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
paṃcāśodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 161b>
 
śrībhagavānuvāca ||

athāśvaśiraso vidyāṃ pravakṣyāmi mahīyate |
yasya vijñānamātreṇa vācāṃ siddhirbhavet parā || 1 ||

uḍgīśayadamābhāṣyapraṇāvodgīthaśabdaḥ |
sarvavāgīśvaretyaṃte pravadedīśvaretyatha || 2 ||

sarvavedamayāciṃtyayadaṃti sarvamuccāret |
vodhayadvitayotoyaṃ maṃtrastārādirīritaḥ || 3 ||

ṛṣirbrahmāsya nirdiṣṭaḥ chaṃdonuṣṭuvudāhṛtaṃ |
devātāsyāddhayagrīvogaiśvaryaprado vibhuḥ || ||

tādeṇayādairmaṃtasya paṃcāṃgāni pravinyaset || 4 ||

śaracchaśāṃkaprabhamaśvavakraṃ muktāmayairā bharaṇairupete |
rathāṃgasaṃkhāṃcita vāhuyagmaṃ jānudvayanyastakaraṃbhajāmaḥ || 5 ||

gaṇanalakṣaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ kuṃdapuṣpairmadhuṣṇutaiḥ |
daśāṃśaṃ vaiṣṇuve vahnau hātvācārya padāṃvuje || 6 ||

samarpya vahulaṃ dravyavedamūrti samanvitaṃ |
vidyāsiddhimāvāpnoti yadvāvarṇasvahasrakaṃ || 7 ||

prajaptvā kārtikemāsi havirājyamadhuplutaṃ |
trisahasraṃ hunedagnau triśādhikamādarāt || 8 ||

rāmāyaṇaṃ bhārataṃ vā varṣāśanasamanvitaṃ |
praṇama vā datvā svācāryakarapaṃkaje || 9 ||

prāpnoti mahatīsiddhiṃ vidyāyānātrasaṃśayaḥ |
aṣṭākṣarodite yaṃtre hayagrīvaṃ prapūjayet || 10 ||

vījena mūrtisaṃkalpyavījamudvayate yathā |
vipadbhagusthamaghośavidrumadvījamīritaṃ || 11 ||

kesareṣu caturvedān caturdikṣu prapūjayet |
vidikṣvaṃgasmṛtinyāya sarvaṇasrāṇi pūjyet || 12 ||

arghayetpatre madhyeṣu vidhānenāṃgadevatāḥ |
vādyetlokeśvārāsteṣī vajrādyastrīṇiyaṃ yajet || 13 ||

evaṃ yo bhajate devaṃ sākṣādvāgīśvaro bhavet |
vailvaiḥ phalaiḥ kṛto homaḥ śrīkaraḥpati kīrtitaṃ || 14 ||

kuṃdapuṣpāṇi juhuyādicchana vā kaśriyamakṣayāṃ |
manunānena saṃyuktaṃ ghṛtaṃ brāhmī rasānvitaṃ || 15 ||

<p. 162a>

kavitāmāvahetyuṃsāmanargalavijṛṃbhiṇīṃ |
vacāmanena saṃjaptvāṃ bhakṣayet prātaranvahaṃ || 16 ||

sarvavedāgamādinī vyākhyakhyātā jāyate cirāt |
manorasya samonāsti jñānaiśvāryapradāyakaḥ || 17 ||

prāṇavaṃ namasāyuktaṃ padaṃ bhagavate tataḥ |
vedāharaṇaśabdaṃ ca hetubhūtāyaśavṛtaḥ || 18 ||

mahāmatsyāya śabdaṃ ca namaskārasamanvitaṃ |
matsyā kṛteripavidyāśrīpateḥ paramātmanaḥ || 19 ||

mahāmatsyāyaśabdāṃte viṣṇave nama ityapi |
aṃgironni prabhṛtayojayaṃtī mahāmanuṃ || 20 ||

vācāṃ siddhikarī vidyā mahādāridramejenī |
dharmārthakāmamokṣākhya puruṣārtha phalapradā || 21 ||

ṛṣirasya mahārājo manuvaiviṃsvataḥ smṛtaḥ |
chaṃdogāyatramevoktaṃ mahāmatsyā kṛtirhariḥ || 22 ||

devatājagatānāthaḥ paramātmāśriyaḥpatiḥ |
vījaṃnnayīmape proktaṃ hṛcchaktiḥ samudīritā || 23 ||

ṣaḍbhiḥ padaiḥ ṣaḍaṃgāninyasyadhyāyecchriyaḥpatiḥ |
śaratpūrṇedasaṃkāśaṃ śuddhasphaṭikasannibhaṃ || 24 ||

śuklāṃvaradharaṃ śuklārgavamālyavibhūṣitaṃ |
kuṃḍaladvayasaṃśobhimukhābjaṃ matsyarūpiṇāṃ || 25 ||

kirīṭahārakeyūramudrikādi vibhūṣitaṃ |
skaśaṃkhacakradharaṃ mudrocinmayī dakṣiṇe kare || 26 ||

vāmenāliṃgyakamalādivyasiṃhāsanesthitaṃ |
vidhātre sakalānvedānprayacchaṃtaṃ jagatpatiṃ || 27 ||

vaivasvatāyamanaveprayacchaṃtaṃ manorathān |
bhagavaṃtaṃ bhajeviṣṇuṃ sarvadevemarpa vibhuṃ || 28 ||

dhyātvetthamiṃdirānārtha matsyarūpadharaṃ hariṃ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityaṃ japtvā prāpnoti vāchitaṃ || 29 ||

caturlakṣaṃ puraścaryātpalāśīvāhaviṣyabhu |
kutaryaye tadṛśīśena kṣīreṇekṣurasena vā || 30 ||

raṃbhāphalairhunedagnautadaśāṃśena na syādhakaḥ |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdve datvā vahuladakṣiṇāṃ || 31 ||

maṃtrasiddhimavāpnoti śāśvatī sarvasiddhidāṃ |
hutvā nīllotpalaisṣta sahasrāṇi ghṛtaplutaiḥ || 34 ||

<p. 162b>

pāragassarvavidyānī bhavatyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
japtva vidhāmimāṃ lakṣaṃ tato raktāṃvujai hunet || 35 ||

abhīṣṭaṃdha dhanamāsādya bhaveddhanada sannibhaḥ |
mahārṇaveni magnopi smṛtve maṃtramādarāt || 36 ||

daśadhāyitaratyeva sadyorṇavamathākṣayaṃ |
japteyaṃ lakṣamātreṇamūkaṃ maṃdadhiyaṃ tu vā || 37 ||

karoti sarvavāgīśaṃ vṛhasyati mamaprabha |
vilvapatrairghṛtābhyaktairhutvā bhānusahasrakaṃ || 38 ||

vaiveśvataṃ manuṃ sākṣādasau paśyati cakṣuṣā |
tatprasādena labhate vāṃchitaṃ sarvamakṣayaṃ || 39 ||

nabhidadhranelesthitvā prātaḥkāle dine dine |
kuṣvāsahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ nityaṃ haviṣyabhuk || 40 ||

praproti maṃḍalenāsau dullabhāśca manorathān |
samastābhīvṛsaṃpraptihaitu bhūtomanūjamaḥ || 41 ||

anena sadṛśo nāsti vedeṣvatha vahṛṣvapi |
oṃ namaḥ padamābhāṣyapadaṃ bhagavate tataḥ || 42 ||

kūrmarūpāśabdaṃ ca viṣṇave nama uccaret |
vidyāsaptadaśārṇoyaṃ śrīpateḥ kūrmārūpiṇaḥ || 43 ||

iṃdradyunna'nṛpeṇeyedaṣṭhā sakalasiddhidā |
śrīpateḥ kūrmarūpasya brahmasāyujyasiddhidā || 43 ||

iṃdradyumromuniḥ proktaḥ chaṃdaḥ paṅktirudīritaṃ |
kūrmarūpimahāviṣṇurdevatājagatāṃpatiḥ || 45 ||

vījāṃtāronatiḥ śaktiḥ ṣaḍaṃgaṃ ṣaṭpadairnyaset |
śyāmavarṇa caturvāhukaṭamaṭhākṛtimacyutaṃ || 46 ||

nakhāgremaṃdaradharaṃ śaṃkhacakragadādharaṃ |
āsīnamāsanedivye hemaratnamayeśubhe || 47 ||

vāmāṃke jagatāmaṃ vā śriyadevīnnayīmayīṃ |
divyāmaraṇasaṃyuktāṃ divyasragvastradhāriṇī || 48 ||

tāmāliṃgyasthitaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ maharṣibhirabhiṣṭhutaṃ |
vaṃdyamiṃdrādibhirdevaiḥ prasannavadanaṃ vibhuṃ || 49 ||

bhajāmi paramātmānaṃ sarvalokahitaiṣiṇaṃ |
asyāśca matsyavidyāyāyaṃtrapīṭhārcanādikaṃ || 50 ||

sarvamaṣṭhārṇavatproktaṃ viniyogaḥ pravakṣyate |
lakṣameka prajaptvādau daśāśaṃkaravīrakaiḥ || 51 ||

madhutritayasaṃyuktairhucārya padāṃvuje |
vahulāṃ dakṣiṇaṃ datvā maṃtrasiddhimavāpnuyāt || 52 ||

madhūkapuṣpairayutaṃ hutvā madhughṛtataplutaiḥ |
śvāyānugrahasāmarthyaṃ labhate nātrasaṃśayaḥ || 53 ||

<p. 163a>

vakulairājyasahitaihutvā daśasahasrakaṃ |
prāpnoti mahatīṃ lakṣmīdhanadhānyādi saṃkulāṃ || 54 ||

nāgavallīdalaihutvadaśasāhasramādamarāt |
sarvābhīṣṭamavāpnoti muktiṃ cāpnotyanuttamāṃ || 55 ||

aṣṭottaraśamaṃ vāpi japtvā kūrma mahāmanuṃ |
anvahaṃ salabhedbrahmasāyujyamapidurlabhaṃ || 56 ||

hagraśīvādividyānāṃ māhātmāmadyanāśanaṃ |
iti kiṃcinmayāproktaṃ varāhasyātha vakṣyete || 57 ||

matsyakūrmadvayasyāsya sarvamaṣṭārṇamaṃtravat |
yaṃtrārcanaṃ bhūyayatkṛtvā siddhimānbhavet || 57 || 

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
ekaṃpaṃcāśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 163a>

śrībhagavānuvā ||

varāhavidyāmāhātmyamatha kiṃcit pravakṣyeta |
yacchutvāpi na rodhīmānumucyatapāpadāśibhiḥ || 1 ||

tātāraṃ namobhagavate varāhapadamapyatha |
rūpāyabhūrbhuvaḥsvaḥ syātpatayetadanaṃtaraṃ || 2 ||

bhūpatitvaṃ me padāṃte depyaṃte ca dadāpaya |
vahni jāyāvadhirmaṃtraḥ syāccatustriṃśadakṣaraḥ || 3 ||

samastāghīṃgha samanomahādāriprabhaṃjanaḥ |
bhūpatitvādisaṃsiddhiprado duḥkhaudyabhedataḥ || 4 ||

bhārgavomunirākhyātaḥ chedonuṣṭudādṛtaṃ |
devātādivārāhātmā bhagavāniṃdiśapatiḥ || 5 ||

ekadaṃṣṭhāpahṛdayaṃ vyomolkāyāśiraḥ smṛtaṃ |
śikhātejodhipataye viśvarūpāvarma ca || 6 ||

mahādaṃṣṭrā paṃcāstrasyā paṃcāga kalpayet punaḥ || 6 ||

āpādaṃ jānudeśādvarakanaṃkanibhaṃ nābhideśādadhastānmuktābhaṃ 
kaṃṭadeśātaruṇaravinibhaṃmastakānnīlabhāsaṃralehastairdadhānaṃ |
rathacaraṇadaraukhaḍgakheṭaugadākhyaṃ śaktiṃ dānābhaye ca 
kṣitidharaṇalasadaṃṣtamādyaṃ varāhaṃ || 7 ||

lakṣamekaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ madhurāktaissarodvaiḥ |
juhudyāmadaśāṃśena svācāryacaraṇadveya || 8 ||

gocarmasammitāṃ bhūmivahusasya samanvitāṃ |
vahudakṣiṇaṃ pāyuktāṃ datvā siddhimavāpnuyāt || 9 ||

caturviśati sāhasraṃ yadvā japtvā manūttamaṃ |
mārgaśīrṣābhidhemasikamalaistrimadhuchutaiḥ || 10 ||

<p. 163b>

hutvā sahasratrinayamārcācaraṇadvaye |
sadakṣiṇaṃ mahīdatvā siddhamaṃtraḥ prajāpate || 11 ||

aṣṭhākṣerodite pīṭhe pūjayedyajña pūruṣaṃ |
mūrtimūlena saṃkalpya vakṣyamāṇavidhānataḥ || 12 ||

pūrvādiṣu caturdikṣu hṛdādyaṃgāni pūjayet |
astraṃ kīṇeṣvadhaścordhā cakrādyastrāṇi tadvahiḥ || 13 ||

cakraṃ śaṃkhamasikheṭaṃ gadāṃ śaktiṃ varābhyaye |
saṃpūjya vādyet lokeśānvahirastraṇi pūjayet || 14 ||

dhyānādevodhanaṃ dadyājjayā devo vasuṃdharāṃ |
prayacchatyeva pūjādyairdhanadhānyamahīśriyaḥ || 15 ||

ravau siṃhagateṣṭarmyāśuklapakṣesitāṃ śilāṃ |
paṃcagavyeṣu nikṣipya spṛṣṭātāmayutaṃ japet || 16 ||

utarābhimukho bhūtvā tāṃ śilāṃ nikhanedbhavi |
śatrucoramahābhūtaiḥ kṛtāṃ vādhāvi nāśayet || 17 ||

bhānūdaye mānuvāre sādhyakṣetrātsamāharet |
mṛtikāṃsajapenmaṃtratāṃ punarvibhanennidhā || 18|| 

vulyāmekāṃśamālapyapyapātre tathāraṃ |
godugdhe paramālopraśodhitaṃ taṃḍulaṃ kṣipet || 19 ||

saṃskṛtegrau pacetsamyakucarumatrajapanmanuṃ |
avatārya caruṃ paścādagnaudevaṃ yathāvidhi || 20 ||

dhūpadīpādikairiṣṭā punarājyaplutaṃ caruṃ |
juhuyā udite vahnau yāvadaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ || 21 ||

evaṃ satāravāreṣu juhuyākṣetra siddhaye |
prātaḥ kāle bhagorvāremṛdaṃ sādhyamahītalāt || 22 ||

ādāya havirāpādya pūrvavajjuhuyāt sudhīḥ |
virodho naśyati kṣetre sahacārādyupadravaiḥ || 23 ||

rājavṛkṣasamutthābhissamidbhirvidyapānayā |
trisahahṛstraṃ prajuhuyātasyasyussarvasaṃpadaḥ || 24 ||

śālibhirjuhuyānmaṃtrīnityamaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ |
samṛddhadhānyasaṃghātaiḥ śābhate tasya maṃdiraṃ || 25 ||

tāvadājyena juhuyānmaṃḍalāt svarṇamāpnuyāttājaiḥ |
kanyāmavāpnoti madhvaktairnijavāṃchitāṃ || 36 ||

madhuratrayasaṃsiktairjuhuyāhutyapalairnavaiḥ |
mahatī śriyaṃ māpnoti maṃḍalāt pūrvasaṃkhyayā || 
atha yajñavarāhasya yaṃtraṃ vakṣye phalapradaṃ || 37 ||

<p. 164a>

madhyevīsatādahanapurayugacakravarṇān ṣaḍasreṣvālikhyāgāni 
saṃviṣṭathakaraṇadalairaṃvujaṃ kesareṣutha |
aṣṭārṇanyatra madhyelikha tu vastrasumitānmaṃtravarṇāścaturtheśiṣṭaṃ patre 
parastādvasuhalakamalaikesarastha svarādye || 38 ||

maṃtrārṇandhesadaṃkhyāna dalamanudilikhedaṃtyamaṃtye vādyet kiṃjalkaiḥ 
kādivarṇervilasitakamaleṣoḍaśāraṣathāvat 
maṃtrārṇānprabhamaśastaccaramadalagataṃ |
śiṣṭavarṇaṃ likhitvātārakṣmākolavījaistadanu parivṛtaṃ sādhyanāmārṇamadhyaiḥ 
|| 39 ||

darbhitaiḥ sādhyanāmārṇe maṃtravarṇervṛtaṃ vahiḥ |
bhūviṃvenāsya koṇeṣu bhūvījaṃ sādhyaṃ saṃyutaṃ || 40 ||

aṣṭaśūleṣudhārāhaṃ bhūvījasahitaṃ likhet |
sādyīśarvidugaganaṃ vījaṃ vārāhamīritaṃ || 41 ||

rocanāgarukarpūralākṣākuṃkucaṃdanaiḥ |
gomayāṃbhasi saṃpiṣṭairlikhedyaṃtraṃ śubhe dine || 42 ||

lekhanyā hemayāmaṃtrī sarvakāmārthasiddhaye |
svarṇapīṭe likhedyaṃtraṃ rājyaśrīsamavāhyeya || 43 ||

grāmasiddhyaitrājitaithatāmrapaṭṭedhanāptaye |
bhūrjapatrainijeṣṭāsyaikṣaumebhūsiddhayelikhet || 44 ||

japapūjādibhissiddha yaṃtraṃ kuryannijepsitaṃ grāmapadaśārhaṃ 
vidyāmāhātmyamiti kiṃcinmayeritaṃ |
nārasiṃhasyamāhātmyaṃ pravakṣyāmi tataḥ paraṃ rāṣṭreṣu yaṃtrametatsusādhitaṃ 
|| 45 ||

nikhanecchubhavārādausvāgaṃdikṣu samarcayet |
kṣudrāya mṛtyucaurādibhūtavyālamahābhayaiḥ || 46 ||

na śakyate paraṃ daṣṭraṃtaṃ deśaṃ devatāvalāt varā ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
dvipaṃcāśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 164a>

śrībhagavānuvāca ||

nṛsiṃhānuṣṭhubhasyātha vidhānaṃ saṃpravakṣyate |
yasya śravaṇamātreṇa layaṃ yāṃti vipadgaṇaḥ || 1 ||

ugramādyaṃ padaṃ vīraṃ dvitīyaṃ padamucyate |
mahāviṣṇuṃ tṛtīyasyā jvalaṃtaṃ padamapyatha || 2 ||

<p. 164b>

sarvatomukhamuccaryanṛsiṃhaṃ padamapyatha |
bhīṣaṇaṃ bhadramuktvātha mṛtyumathoccaret || 3 ||

namāmyahaṃ padaṃ yaścardvidyaiṣā samudīritā |
maṃtrādau praṇavaṃ vāmalocanakhaṃ samuccaret || 4 ||

aṃtyepyetānivījabhinivilomena samucceret |
āhuṣṭabha mahāvidyāmirtthakecijjapaṃti hi || 5 ||

hṛllekhāmātrasahitāmādau nikṣipya kecana |
śuddhamānunuṣṭabhaṃ maṃtraṃ japaṃti bhuvikecana || 6 ||

vedeṣvāpi purāṇeṣu dharmaśāstreṣu bhūpatai |
nānayā sadṛśī vidyādaṣṭā sakalasiddhidā || 7 ||

muniḥ prajāpatirbrahmāmaṃtrasya jagatpatiḥ |
chaṃda ānuṣṭamaṃ proktaṃ paramātmāsanātanaḥ || 8 ||

devatājagatāṃnāthaḥ śrīnṛsiṃho maheśvaraḥ |
anaṃtāvījamityuktaṃ śaktiḥ śaktirūdīritā || 9 ||

dvābhyāṃ dvābhāṃtathaikenadvābhyāṃ dvābhyāṃ |
tataḥ paraṃ punaḥ padadvāyenāpi ṣaḍaṃgaṃ vinyasetataḥ || 10 ||

śadrīryayutapāśaktānyasedyadvāṣāḍaṃgakaṃ |
śirolalāṭadāyugmamukheṣu karasaṃdhiṣu || 11 ||

padasaṃdhiṣu sāgreṣu jaṭare hṛdihastayoḥ |
galapārśvāsakakudikramādvaṇīnnyasenmanoḥ || 12 ||

dhyāye igrākṛtividyapathaśāṃtākṛtiṃ tu vā 
jānvorāsaktātīkṣṇasvanakharucilasadvāhu saṃspṛṣṭakeśaḥ śaṃkhaṃ cakraṃ ca 
dorbhyāṃ dadhadanala |
samajyotiṣābhagnadaityaḥ jvālāmālāparītaṃ raviśaśidahanatrīkṣaṇaṃ 
dīptajihvadaṃṣṭograṃ bhūtakeśaṃvadanamapivahanyātumānārasiṃhaḥ || 13 ||

yadvā śāṃtākṛtiṃ dhyāyennārasiṃhaṃ jagatpatiṃ || 14 ||

satyajñānasukhasvarūpamamalaṃkṣīrākṣīrādhyi madhyasthitaṃ yogārūḍhamati 
prasannavadanaṃ bhūṣāsahasro jvalaṃ |
tryakṣaṃ cakrapinākasābhayavarān viśraṇamarcchachaviṃchatrī bhūtaphaṇo imṃ 
idhavalaṃ lakṣmī nṛsiṃhaṃ bhaje || 15 ||

pūjayedvaiṣṇuvepīṭe nṛniṃhaṃ kamalānvitaṃ |
mūtiṃ mūlena saṃkalpya pūjayītvepacārakaiḥ || 16 ||

ādyāvaraṇamaṃgaiḥsyādvitīyetu pravakṣyate |
pakṣīdraṃśaṃkarānaṃtaudiṣu brahmāṇamarghayet || 17 ||


<p. 165a>

śriyaṃdriyaṃ catuṣṭiṃ ca puṣṭidevīvidikṣu casraṃ |
bhaskārīvaśyakārītathāmāṇākāryapi || 18 ||

dveṣakāryākarṣakarīyuṣṭhiḥ pramathanītathā |
vidyetpāvaraṇe pūjyāstṛtīye vasudhāpate || 19 ||

cakraṃ śaṃkha mahāpadmemuśalaṃ devadakṣiṇī |
śaṃkhaṃ kheṭhaṃ gadāṃpāśamarcayedevamataḥ || 20 ||

lakṣmīdakṣiṇatastuṣṭiṃ vāme tatraiva kaustubhaṃ |
śrīvatsaṃ dkṣiṇe madhye vanamālāṃ ca pūjayet || 21 ||

pītāṃvaraṃ brahmasūtraṃ nābhipadmaṃkirīṭakaṃ |
bhūṣaṇāni ca sarvāṇi purībhāge tu pūjayet || 22 ||

śraddhāmedhāṃ tathākāmaṃ bhīmāṃ māyāṃ |
bhayānakāṃ ārdradīptiṃ cāṣṭadikṣupūrvādi kramato yajet || 23 ||

iṃdrādīnaṣṭahikpālān vajrādī pūjayet |
yadvā śivāvṛtiṃ dhyātvā nṛsiṃha prajapenmanu || 24 ||

paṃcavakraṃ mahābhīmaṃ kālānala samaprabhaṃ |
āṃtramālādharaṃ raudrakaṃṭhahoraṇaśobhitaṃ || 25 ||

akṣasūtraṃgadīpadmaśaṃkhagokṣīrasannibhaṃ |
dhanuśramuśalaṃ caiva tathā cakraṃ ca bhinnataṃ || 26 ||

khaḍga ca śūlaṃ vāṇaṃ ca nṛharirudrapiṇaṃ |
iṃdraṃ gopakanīlābhaṃ caṃdrasvārṇasannibhaṃ || 27 ||

pūvodicottarāṃtāsya mūrdhvāsya svarsāvārṇakaṃ |
eva mugrahari dhyāyet sarvavyādhinivṛtaye || 28 ||

sarvamṛtyuharaṃ divyaṃ smaraṇāt sarvasiddhidedhye |
yoryayahāmahatkarmatṛdāṣoḍaśahastakān || 9 ||

nṛsiṃhassavalokeśassavībhāraṇabhūṣitaḥ |
dvauvihahaṇakarmāḍhyaudau cāṃtroddhrāraṇocitau || 30 ||

śaṃkhacakradharau dvau tu caṃdravāṇa dhanurdharau |
khaḍgakheṭadharau dvau gadāpadmadhāriṇai || 31 ||

pāśākuśadharaudvau ca dvauripormakuṭārpitau |
iti ṣoḍaśakodaḍaṃmaṃḍinaṃ nṛhariṃ vibhuṃ || 32 ||

dhyoyannīradanīlābhamugrakarmarāpananyadhīḥ |
dhyeyomahatamekāryeṣoḍaśadvayahastanān || 33 ||

nṛharissarvalokeśassarvasiddhi phalapradaḥ |
dakṣiṇe cakrapameva paraśuṃpākṣameva ca || 34 ||

<p. 165b>

halaṃ ca muśala vaiva mabhayaṃ cāṃkuśaṃ |
satathāpadiśaṃtidiyātaṃ cakhe'muhuratomarān || 35 ||

vāmabhāgekaraiḥ svaṃ śaṃkhaḍgayābhaṃ ca |
śūlakaṃ agniṃ ca varadaśaktiṃ kuṃḍikāṃ ca tataḥ paraṃ || 36 ||

kārmukaṃ tarjanīmudrāgaḍamarusarpakaudvābhyāṃ |
karābhyāṃ ca riporjānumastapīḍanaṃ || 37 ||

tathorddhakṛta hastābhyāṃ mīśramālādhaṃ hari |
aṃdhasthitābhyāṃ vāhubhyāṃ hiraṇyakavidāraṇaṃ || 38 ||

priyaṃkaraṃ ca bhaktānāṃ daityānāṃ ca bhavayakaraṃ |
nṛsiṃhaṃ saṃsmaderedittha mahāmṛtyubhavāyahaṃ || 39 ||

yaṃtraṃ sādhyasamanvitaṃ ca 
vilikhenmadhyeṣṭhapatreṣunatmaṃtrāṇaścitureṇavibhajyavinnikhetkṣiptyāvahiveṣṭheyet 
vādyet |
koṇagavaddhavījavasudhāhegehadvayenāvṛtaṃ yaṃtraṃ 
kṣudraviṣagrahāmapariyupradhaṃsanaṃ śrīkaraṃ || 40 ||

asminsaṃsthāpayedyaṃtrenakhakuṃbhān suśībhanān |
sutīrthātoyasaṃpūrṇanyastraralauṣadhānvitān || 41 ||

madhye samardyayadevaṃ nṛsiṃhaṃ śāṃtavigrahaṃ |
nṛsiṃhaṃ pūjayeṣṭau pūrvādiṣu yathā kramaṃ || 42 ||

sahasramannitaistoyairabhirṣicet priyaṃ naraṃ |
abhiragrahonmādāvinaśyaṃtyiribhissaha || 43 ||

abhiṣiktastaviprān bhojayedvatādhiyā |
yathāvatpūjayedbhaktyāśaktyācārya padadvayaṃ || 44 ||

rājāvijayamāpnoti yuddheṣu vidhiḥ nāmunā |
lakṣamekaṃ puraścaryādayutadvitayottaraṃ || 45 ||

daśārāṃtarpyayeddhīmānyayasekṣurasena vā |
trisahasraṃ hunedagnau ghṛtamiśraiḥ kuśeśayaiḥ || 46 ||

ācāryadvaṃdve bahudakṣiṇayānvitaṃ |
kuṃḍaladvitayaṃtvā vidyasiddhimavāpnuyāt || 47 ||

yadvāṃ viśati sāhasraṃ prajaptvānuṣṭhubhaṃ mabhuṃ |
trisahasraṃ hunedagnau ghṛtamiśraiḥ kuśeśayaiḥ || 48 ||

ācāryakarṇayordatvā kuṃḍaladvitaya śubhaṃ |
varṣārānamitaṃ durvyadatvācāryasya dakṣiṇāṃ || 49 ||

vidyā siddhibhayāproti śāśvatīmiṣṭasīdvadāhnavī trikaiśṭha 
sahasrasaṃkhyairārādhyamaṃtrī |
juhuyādathāpsuśāṃtipraṣātyeva tathopasargā ayohiśāṃtā iti ca śrutiḥ syāt || 50 ||

<p. 166a>

yadvānyannijamanasīpsitaṃ ca kāmaṃtaṃ |
prāprotyakhilajanatriyaścābhūyāt || 51 ||

duḥkhapredyayidṛṣṭheṣvaśiṣṭayāṃ jagrato niśāyāṃ |
japamātamaṃtraśaktyāsusvaprobhavati kṣaṇodeva || 52 ||

caranvaneḍhaṣṭamṛgāhicoravyālākulemaṃma jepadyaḥ |
asādhitaṃ sadhitameva tasya bhavatyavaśyaṃ mithileśabhūya || 53 ||

prajannaṣṭasahasraṃ kalaśenāpyahiviṣārthamabhiṣiṃcet |
ativiṣonabhṛṇapiviṣeṇāpyasau vimuktaḥ sukhī bhavatyavaśyaṃ mithileśabhati || 54 ||

bhūyakalūtāvṛścike vahupādādyutthitaviṣaśāmayet |
aṣṭottaraśatajapenābhimaṃtritaṃ ca bhasmādyaṃ sa śiroṣṇi || 55 ||

karṇahṛdgalmakukṣirūnājvaravisartthahikkādīn |
maṃtrauṣadhābhicārakṛtānvikārānayaṃ manuḥ śamayet || 56 ||

brāhmīvacāṣṭhaśataṃ japitvā prātassagavyānṛhariviṃviciṃtya |
saṃprāpyamedhāsaṃtudharmaśāstrairiṣṭārthasiddhiṃ labhate varṣāt || 57 ||

ktaiḥ kimatra vahubhirmanunāmunaiva saṃprāthitaṃ ca sakalaṃ labhate |
vidhijñaḥ tasmādamuṃbhaja tatatpratipannacitāḥ saṃsārasāgarasamuttaraṇārthinoye || 
58 ||

lakṣmīkāmastumaṃtrajñaḥsyamaṃtakusumairhunet |
ayutaṃ nāmadhunāktaiśca daridro na bhavetkule || 59 ||

auduvarasamiddhomādvrānyasiddhiḥ prajāpate |
aṣṭapalakṣahomenadena samogbhavet || 60 ||

hudvalyasannidhaurājño jayedaṣṭhottaraṃ |
śatādyonairmalyamāpnoti prasādaṃ cādhigacchati || 61 ||

kudedustunahomena sarvakalyāṇamaśnute |
madhūkapuṣpahomena sarvābhīṣṭaprajapeta || 62 ||

tulasīdadatahomena kīrtiyāsaṃsayaḥ |
saktuhomenaśālāgnau jagadvaśyaṃ prajāpate || 63 ||

<p. 166b>

haridrākhaṃḍahomenastaṃbhayedvajusaṃtatiṃ |
kadalīphalahomena sarvavighnaurvimucyeta || 64 ||

dadhimadhājyasaṃsiktāḥ gulūcīścaturaṃgulāḥ |
juhuyādayutaṃ yo sauśataṃ jivati roḍājit || 65 ||

śanaiścaradineśvasthaṃsyaścācāṣṭottaraṃśataṃ |
japtvā jihvāsau yamṛtyuśaṃtaṃ vārṣāṇi jīvati || 66 ||

śrīkāmassatataṃ dhyāyet pūrvoktiṃ nṛhariṃ sitaṃ vā |
vāṃkasthitayālakṣmyāliṃgitaṃ padmahastayā || 6 ||

ānuṣṭubhaṃnāsasiṃhaṃ japtvā hutvā dine dine |
siddho bhūtve hasataṃtaṃ sākṣādbrahmamayo bhavet || 68 ||

vakṣyāmi tāpanīyoktaṃ yaṃtrarājamataḥ paraṃ |
padmamaṣṭadalapūrvaṃ viracapya samāhitaḥ || 69 || 

tatkarṇidhūtvehasatetaṃ sākṣādbrahmamayo bhavet kāyāmālikhya |
ṣaṭkoṇaṃ sumanoharaṃ vilikhet praṇavaṃ tatra nṛsiṃhaikādarṇagarbhitaḥ || 70 ||

sudarśānasya ṣaḍavarṇan ṣaṭkoṇeṣu tato likhet |
māpayāveṣṭhayitvātha vasupatraimanohare likhitvā || 72 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇamāpapāviṣṭayedapi |
dvātriṃśāraṃ mahāpadmaṃ tadvahirveṣṭayedathe || 72 ||

ekaikamakṣaraṃ tatranārasiṃhasya saṃlikhet |
dvātriṃśadatpadmapatrāṇiśatmātātyapiveṣṭhayet || 73 ||

tadvahirvṛtamālikhyaṃ kakārādyaṣṭhakaṃ |
tataḥ tatpūrvabhāge saṃlikhyahādīnekā daśākṣarān || 74 ||

tadikṣiṇe vilikhyātha paścādbhāge tataḥ paraṃ |
tadanataravarṇānapyaṣṭau tatra samālikhet || 75 ||

akṣaradvitayaṃ lekhyaṃ bhāge tasyotare tataḥ |
vṛtasya pārśvayorarṇadvalekhyaṃ prapalataḥ || 76 ||

narāsiṃhamidaṃ yaṃtraṃ japahomadisādhitaṃ |
pūjayeddhārayedyadvāsarvapāpaivirmucyeta || 77 ||

śriyamāsādyavipulāṃdhanadhānyadi saṃkulāṃ |
avāpya mahatīmedhāmaṃte brahmamayo bhavet || 78 ||

nārasiṃhamidaṃ patraṃ bhuktimuktiphalapradaṃ |
āyurārogyasaṃpatikāraṇaṃ putravarddhanaṃ || 79 ||

<p. 167a>

nṛsiṃhāṃnuṣṭabhamanomahītmyamadyanāśana |
iti kiṃcinmayā proktaṃ vāmatasyātha vakṣyate || 80 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
tripaṃcāśodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 167a>

śrībhagavānuvāca ||

atha vāmanarūpasya śrīpateḥ paramātmanaḥ |
pathīpadiṣṭāṃ vakṣyamividyāṃ sakalasiddhidāṃ || 1 ||

praṇavaṃ nātasaṃyuktaṃ viṣṇave padamapyatha |
dakṣaśrotrayutaṃ ṣāṃtyaṃ dvitīyāṃ tasya mapyatha || 2 ||

ṣaṣṭhavarmādimaṃ paṃcavarṇadyakṣaramapyatha |
vāyurudrasamāyuktamaṃtasthādyamataḥ paraṃ || 3 ||

mukhavṛttayutaṃ vyomapṛṣṭhadedmabhaṃjanī |
ṛṣirdhanadaputrosya nalakūvā ucyeta || 5 ||

chaṃdeti jāgata proktaṃ dadhivāmarūpaṃ vāṃgaṃ |
vinyaseddhīmān varṇanyāsamathanyesan mūrdhni || 6 ||

dṛkuśravaṇadvaṃdvaṃ nāsikāvadaneṣu ca |
keṭeca vāhuyugale nābhau pṛṣṭhai ca guhyake || 7 ||

jānvopādayuge varṇannyasediti yathākramaṃ || 9 ||

ekedvābhāḥ sītājvesravadamṛtamaṇichatratodhoniviṣṭaḥ |
śrībhūmyāśliṣṭapārśvaḥ sphaṭikamaṇinibhośeṣadāmārvitāṃgaḥ || 
dadhyannakhaṃḍapūrṇaṃ sarajitavaṣakaṃ svarṇapīpūṣakubhaṃ |
vibhracchrī vāmanākhyaḥ satatamavatunoviriṣṭorthadāyī || 10 ||

atisulalitagātraṃ raupyayātrasthabhinnaṃ sudadhilalitakhaṃḍapaṇinādakṣiṇena 
kalaśamamṛtapūrṇaṃ |
savyasahasre dadhānaṃtarati sakalaḍaḥ khādvāmanaṃ bhāvayedyaḥ || 11 ||

dhyātvetthavāmanaṃ viṣṇuhṛdajvemanasāhariṃ |
mūlenamūrtisaṃkalpya vāmanaṃ viṣṇumarcayet || 12 ||

ṣaḍaṃgānyārcayetpaścāduṣāsu manasā tayā |
prītistuṣṭiśca puṣṭiścavṛddhirṣṭatistataḥ paraṃ || 13 ||

saumyāmaracinīpaścātato devyaṃ śumālinī |
śaśinī durmātā caiva lakṣmī chāyā tathaiva ca || 14 ||

saṃpūrṇamaṃḍale caiva mamṛtā ṣoḍaśīkalā |
etābhiḥ śaktibhiḥ proktaṃ dvitīyāvaraṇaṃ śubhaṃ || 15 ||

<p. 167b>

keśavādi caturviṃśadaivataiḥ śaktisaṃyutaiḥ |
tṛtīyāvaraṇaṃ proktakumudaḥ kumudekṣaṇaḥ || 16 ||

puṃḍarakivāmanaścaśaṃkakarṇastataḥparaṃ |
sarpanetraśca sumukhassupratiṣṭhita ityapi || 17 ||

caturthāvaraṇaṃ proktaṃ śaṃkhaṃ cakraṃ gadāmapi |
yamaṃkhaḍgaṃ ca muśalaṃ śārṅavāṇānataḥ paraṃ || 18 ||

paṃcamāvaraṇa proktamiṃdrādyaiḥ ṣaṣṭamīritaṃ |
itthamabhyarvyasatataṃ vāmanaṃ viṣṇumacyutaṃ || 19 ||

samastasiddhisasihitobhagavatkiṃkarobhavet |
turlakṣaṃ japedādau daśāṃśaṃ tarpatyayaḥ || 20 ||

hotavyā mathadadhyannaṃ tadarśāṃśaṃ mahīyet |
gośataṃ dakṣiṇaṃ dadyādāthāryasya padadveye || 21 ||

tadardha vā tadardha vā kuṃḍaladvayasaṃyutaṃ |
paṃciviṃśati sāhasramaya vāmrāvaṇe japet || 22 ||

trisahasraṃ tato hutvā dadhyannena yatadvrataḥ |
varṣāśanamitadravyasahitaṃ ca sa vatsakaṃ || 23 ||

godvayaṃ dakṣiṇāṃ datvā siddhimaṃtraḥ prajāpate |
inityaṃ dvādaśadhā vahnau hutvā dadhyannamādarāt || 24 ||

prāprotyanna samṛddhiṃ ca mokṣayāṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ |
sahasraṃ prajayeprastunityaṃ niyamataḥ śuciḥ || 35 ||

vahulābhamavoprātidehote muktimeti ca |
atra kāmohunennityamaṣṭhāviṃśati saṃkhyayā || 36 ||

sitānnaṃ ghṛtaṃ saṃmiśraṃ prāpnuyādannamakṣayaṃ |
apūyaṣaḍgasoṣetamannameṣṭa sahasrakaṃ || 37 ||

hutvā labheta mahatī śriyaṃ dhanadasannibhī |
dadhyannaṃ śarkamarāyuktaṃ hutvā daśasahasrakaṃ || 38 ||

annaparvatamāpnoti yatra yatra hi gacchati |
hunedvilvasamīpasthaḥ padmākṣairayutaṃ śuciḥ || 39 ||

vasudhārātusā lakṣmīrvasuvarṣāti tatra hi |
vidyāthī prajapellakṣaṃ dhyātvā devaṃ janārdanaṃ || 40 ||

pāyasenāyuta hutvā sākṣādvāgīśvaro bhaveta |
putrakāmo hunellakṣaṃ putrajīvī phalai hunet || 41 ||

<p. 168a>

tatkāṣṭhaṃ dīpite vahnau sasatputrānavāpnuyāt |
dhyātvā trivikramadevaṃ raktābhaṃ karavīrakaiḥ || 42 ||

hutvātha daśasāhasraṃ sarvatravijayī bhavet |
rājyakāmoyikamalairhutvā daśasahasrakaṃ || 43 ||

rājyaiśvaryamavāpnoti yāvādāpurakaṃṭakaṃ |
apārmāgedalairhutvālaivaṃgairvāmadhuplutaiḥ || 44 ||

ayutasāṃdhyanāmāṃtaṃ jagadvaśyamavāpnuyāt |
ārogyakāmo juhuyādayāmāgaissahasrakaṃ || 45 ||

saptāhānmucyetarogaistadbhasmāya ca dhāyatu |
āyuṣkāmastrimadhaktaistiladūrvākuśakṣataiḥ || 46 ||

ayutaṃ juhuyātāvajjayedāyurlabhe pare |
smṛtvā trivikramaṃ devaṃ japtvā daśasahasrakaṃ || 47 ||

muktovadhaṃ na tassadyobhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 47 ||

sa sādhyālakṣmīpraṇavaṃ sa karṇikaṃ maṃtrākṣaradvaṃdadalāṣṭhakaṃ ca |
śiṣṭārāyijñīllasitāṃtyapatramaṣṭhākṣaraihṛjvalapatrakārthaṃ || 48 ||

parītasadvādaśavarṇamaṃtraṃ tato vahirmātṛkayā ca vītaṃ tatovahiḥ |
darṇamakhaṃḍa viṃveyaṃtraṃtvidaṃ śrīmadamīṣṭada ca || 49 ||

upāsyetthaṃ trilokeṣyaṃ dadhivāmanamacyutaṃ |
ihabhuktvārivalānbhogābhaṃte vahyapadaṃ vrajet || 50 ||

athābhārgavarāmasya vidyāṃ vakṣyāmi siddhidāṃ |
yasyā vijñānamātreṇa vinaśyaṃti vipadgaṇāḥ || 51 ||

praṇavaṃ namasāyuktaṃ padaṃ bhagavate tataḥ |
jāmadagnyāyaduṣṭeti kṣānniyeti padaṃ tataḥ || 52 ||

kulakālāṃtakāyeti caturthyaṃta samanvitaṃ |
reṇukāputraśabdaṃ ca hṛdayena samanvitaṃ || 53 ||

eṣābhārgavarāmasyavidyākhilaphalapradā |
samastaduḥkhaśamanīvairivargavidāriṇī || 54 ||

sanīverāmaḥ śrīpatirjagatāpatiḥ vījamuktaṃ |
trayīvījaṃ hṛcchaktiḥ samuddīritā || 56 ||

tribhirvaṇaiśca vasurbhiśca paṃcabhirbhānubhistathā |
ṣaḍbhirdvābhyāṃ ṣaḍaṃgāninyasediti samāhitaḥ || 57 ||

taptakīcanasaṃkāśaṃ japamaṃḍaladhāriṇaṃ |
jamadagnisutaṃ vīraṃ dadhānaṃ paraśuṃ śubhaṃ || 58 ||

<p. 168b>

dhanurdharaṃ viśālākṣaṃ rājarājavimardanaṃ |
namāmibhārgavaṃ rāmaṃ śiṣyaṃ gaurīyetarvibhuṃ || 59 ||

dhyātvetthaṃ bhārgavaṃ bharāmaṃduṣṭakṣatriyāmadanaṃ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā śāśvatīṃ siddhimaśnute || 60 ||

lakṣamekaṃ puraścaryātsādhakaḥ sthiramānasaḥ |
daśāṃśaṃ pāyasaṃ hutvā ghṛtatrimadhumiśritaṃ || 61 ||

samarpyācārya pādābjayugalevadakṣiṇaṃ |
labhate mahatī siddhiṃ samastaphalāsiddhirddā || 62 ||

yadvā dvādaśa sāhasraṃ prajaptvāniyataḥ śuciḥ |
triśatādhikasāhasraṃ hunetyāya samādarāt || 63 ||

varṣāśanāmitaṃ dravyaṃ datvācārya padabjayoḥ |
siddhiprāpnoti mahatī vidyāyānātrasaṃśayaḥ || 64 ||

prāptā susakalāyatyubhayecorārisaṃbhave |
siṃhavyāghrādibhītauvarakṣaḥ kūrṣmādujebhaye || 65 ||

trisahasraṃ manuṃ japtvā bhārgavasya mahātmanaḥ |
vimuktassakalāyadbhyaḥ sadya eva bhavatyasau || 66 ||

ācārya sannidhau nityaṃ śuśrūṣuranahetūtiḥ |
japtvā vidyāmimāṃ nityaṃ sahasratrayamādarāt || 67 ||

jaḍopi sarvavidyānāṃ pāragomaṃḍalādbhavet |
gīṣṭhe samudgatīre vā guroścaraṇasannidhau || 68 ||

japtvā tilakṣamimī vidyāmayutaṃ ghṛtamiśritaiḥ |
hutvā palāśakusumairdatvācāryasya dakṣiṇāṃ || 69 ||

caturṇamapi vedānā pāṇa'śāstrapāragaḥ |
sākṣāddhiṣaṇasaṃkāśo bhavatpatra na saṃśayaḥ || 70 ||

mahatīśriyamanvicchanahatvāraktotpalairnavaiḥ |
arkasāhasramāprīti vipulāṃśriyamakṣayāṃ || 71 ||

parvatāgre japellakṣaṃ phalāśī vā haviṣyabhuku |
sākṣātpaśyati cakṣurbhyāṃ bhārgavaṃ rāmamavyayaṃ || 72 ||

prasanne bhārgavasākṣānnāsādhyaṃ vāṃchitaṃ bhavet |
āyuṇarogyamaiśvaryaṃ vasūni paśavopi ca || 73 ||

bhogā aṣṭavidhāścāsya sidhyaṃtyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
mūrtimūnaṃ na saṃsakalpyapūjayedbhārgavaṃ vibhuṃ || 74 ||

ṣaṭkoṇeṣu ṣaḍaṃgānijamadargnicareṇukāṃ |
atrimapyanasūryā ca datātreyaṃ śriyaṃ tathā || 75 ||

<p. 169a>

kumāraṃ devasenāṃ ca padmevsudale yajet |
iṃdrādīnaṣṭadikālāṃścaturasrāṣṭadiśvapi || 76 ||

itthamabhyarcya satataṃ bhargavaṃ jagatīpati |
vijayī satataṃ bhūtvā ramate brahmāṇathade || 77 ||

dadhivāmanavidyāyābhārgavasya manorapi |
kiṃ citsādhanamuktaṃte śrīrāmasyāthavakṣyate || 78 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasyedāsarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
catuḥpaṃcāśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 169a>

śrībhagavānuvāca ||

tāraka brahmarūpasya śrīrāmasya jagatpateḥ |
pravakṣyāmi mahāvidyāṃ sarvavedāṃtasaṃgrahāṃ || 1 || 

praṇavaṃ hṛdayoyertapadaṃ bhagavate tataḥ |
raghunaṃdanaśabdaṃ ca caturthyamta samanvitaṃ || 2 || 

rakṣoghraliśadāyeti madhureti padaṃ tataḥ | 
(**) prasannavadanāyāmite tajesa udīt || 3 ||

valāpāyaddamuccāryapāvakaṃ dīrghasaṃyutaṃ | 
mukhavṛtayutayādyayārghrātastha tataḥ paraṃ || 4 || 

viṣṇuśabdaṃ caturthyaṃtasahitaṃ namasānvitaṃ | 
uccarejjānakonāthavidyeyaṃ samudīritā || 5 || 

smaraṇagadadyasaṃghānāṃ duḥkhaudyasya ca bhaṃjanī |
mahādāridya śamanīrājyaiśvarya kalapradā || 6 ||

sarvatīrthamapī sarvavidyārāśipradāyinī |
samastasaṃyatsāmrājyahetubhūtāśivaṃkarī || 7 || 

trailokyamohanakarī sarvalokavaśaṃkarī |
samastaiśvarya phaladāsarvavidyāpradāyinī || 8 ||

satyānaṃdacidākāra brahmatādātmyasiddhidā |
vālmīki mukhyāḥ kavayoḥ nāradādyā purātanāḥ || 9 ||

vidyāmetāmupāsyādau siddhimiṣṭhāṃparāgatāḥ |
tārakabrahmavidyeyamakhilānaṃdasiddhidā || 10 || 

munirbrahmāsyamaṃtrasya chaṃdogāyatramucyate |
rājyābhiṣiktaḥ śrīrāmaḥ paramātmā jagatpatiḥ || 11 ||

<p. 169b>

jānakīnāmakoviṣṇurdevatā saṃsmṛto vudhaiḥ |
praṇavākhyaṃ mahavījaṃ śaktirnatirūdīritā || 12 ||

jānakīnāyakaprītyaiviniyoga udāhṛtaḥ |
saptavarṇaiḥ hyataḥ ṣaḍbhiḥ samabhidaṃ śabhistadyā || 13 ||

navabhirvasusaṃkhyākaiḥ ṣaḍaṃganyāsa īritaḥ |
ayodhyānagareramyekalpadumavanāṃtare || 14 ||

yārijatatarormūlerajasiṃhāsane śubhe | 
samāsīnaṃ trijagatāṃ pītanīlāṃvudadyutiṃ || 15 ||

pītāṃvaradharaṃ divyaratnābharaśauśobhitaṃ | 
akalaṃkaśaraccaṃdrasamavakraṃ madvīpatiṃ || 16 ||

kaṃdarpakoṭilāvāṇyaṃ kāmitārtha phalapradaiḥ |
dadhānaṃ cinmayīṃ mudrājānvāsaktamujaṃ vibhuṃ || 17 ||

rājīvāyatanetrānaṃ suprasannasmitānanaṃ | 
vaktrāraṃ sarvavidyānāṃdātāraṃ sarvasaṃpadāṃ || 18 ||

lakṣmaṇena ca śatrughnabharatābhyāṃ niṣevitāṃ | 
vāmāṃkāsūṭajanakakanyayādivyabhūṣayā || 19 ||

āśliṣṭaṃ vāmadevādimaharṣibhirabhiṣṭutaṃ |
vibhīṣaṇāṃ janeyādyaiḥ kiṃkarairnityamarcitaṃ || 20 || 

vaśiṣṭādyairdayāsāraiḥ stutiṃ kurvadbhirāvṛtaṃ |
sugrīvādyaiḥ parivṛtaṃ sumaṃtrādyaṣṭamaṃtribhiḥ || 21 ||

bhūpālairakhilairnityaṃ vaṃdyanāna padāṃvujaṃ | 
śaraṇyaṃ sarvajagatāṃ śaraṇāgatavatsalaṃ || 22 ||

tijomayatanuṃ viṣṇuṃ vaṃdehaṃ hadvunaṃdanaṃ | 
ṣaṭkāṇaṃ padmamaṣṭāraṃ caturasra samacitaṃ || 23 ||
 
sītāyateridaṃ yaṃtraṃ samastābhīṣṭhasiddhidaṃ | 
tanmadhye vilikhet sādhyaṃ vījaṃ kāmasamanvitaṃ || 24 ||

āveṣṭayetasya paṃcavījāni jagatīpateḥ |
daśākṣareṇabhūyopitahlonaṃ keṣṭhayennṛpa || 25 ||

ṣaḍaṃgāmyagnikoṇādikokoṇeṣveṣu kramāllikhet | 
huṃvījaṃ pratikoṇāgraṃ kesarāgresuvasvarān || 26 ||

rājyebhiṣiktaḥ śrīrāmamaṃtrasyāsyā ṣaḍakṣarān |
daledale likhitvāṃtyayatre paṃcākṣarān likhet || 27 ||

digvidikṣu likhehījenarasiṃhavarāhayoḥ |
caturasrasya saṃproktaṃ yaṃtrametadramāyateḥ || 28 ||

mūlamaṃtreṇayaṃtrasminnāvādyatjatīpatiṃ | 
upacāraiḥ samabhyarcya tadvāme janakātmajāṃ || 29 ||

<p. 170a>

ṣaḍaṃgāndyagrikoṇādikoṇaṣaṭkedheyetkramāt | 
ātmāṃtarātmaparamajñānātmānastataḥparaṃ || 30 ||

vāsudevastathālakṣmīrathasaṃkarṣaṇakak |
pradyumnotharatiḥ paścādatiruddhastata'paraṃ || 31 ||

protiretadvitīyaṃ syātṛtīyamathavakṣyate |
āgrehanūmānsugrovo bharatītha vibhīṣaṇa || 32 ||

lakṣmaragovāyutanayaḥ śatrughrojāṃ vavānapi |
dhṛṣṭirjapaṃto vijayaḥ siddhārthaḥścārthasādhanaḥ || 33 ||

aśokodhārmayālaśca sumaṃtrādyaṣṭaṃ maṃtriṇaḥ |
samabhyarcya vaśiṣṭhau vāmadevastataḥpare || 34 ||

jāvālirgotimaḥ paścādbharadvājastataḥparaṃ |
viśvāmitrothavālmīki nīdadaścāmahān ṛṣiḥ || 35 ||

nalonīlaḥ suṣeṇāśca gavākṣogaṃdhaṃmādanaḥ |
śarabhaśca tatormedodvividovitataḥ paraṃ || 36 ||

śaṃkhacakraṃgadāṃpadmaṃ śāṅevāṇāvataḥ paraṃ |
gurutmaṃtaṃ samabhyarcya viṣkakasenaṃ samarcayet || 37 ||

maheṃdrādyaṣṭadigpālānvajrādīnāyudhānica ca |
ityabhyarcya punardhūpadīpādyairapitoṣāyet || 38 ||

itthamabhyayanmaṃtrījānakīnāyakaṃ vibhuṃ | 
vidyaiśvaryanidhirbhūtvā modate bhagavasade || 39 ||

lakṣamekaṃ japedādau puraścaryārthamādarāt | 
ācyaryaṃ sannidhīkṛtya ghṛtatrimadhumiśritaṃ || 40 ||

hutvāgrau pāyasaṃ paścādācāryaṃ caraṇadvāye |
samarpya vahulaṃvitaṃ maṃtrasiddhimavāpnuyāt || 41 ||

raviparvaṇi vā somagrahaṇe vā samāhitaḥ |
ekabhaktāśino bhūtvā tatyurvadivasatrayaṃ || 42 ||

sparśakālamathārabhya śuddhakālāṃtamādarāt | 
hutvā kṛṣṇatilairagraughṛtannimadhumiśritaiḥ || 43 ||

hutvācāryayadadvaṃdvaṃ kuṃḍaladvitayānvitaṃ |
datvā varṣaśanaṃ dravyaṃ vidyāsiddhimāvāpnuyāt || 44 ||

paṃcaviṃśatidhānisaṃmātimaṃtryajalaṃpiva |
ārogyaṃ mahadasādyasarvavidyānidhirbhavet || 45 ||

<p. 170b>

hutvā vilvādaleragnaugavyājya trimadhuplutai |
rājyalakṣmīmavāproti daśasāhasrato nṛpa || 46 ||

samudratīregoṣṭe vā lakṣaṃ japtvā payo vrataḥ |
pāyasenājyayuktena hutvā viṣvānidhi bhavet || 47 || 

vaiśākhemāsi śuddhātmā lakṣatritayamādarāt |
jadyāt paṃcāgnimadhyasthaḥ kamalairmadhumiśritaiḥ || 48 ||

āyutadvitayaṃ hutvā sārvabhaumaḥ prajāyate | 
dūrvābhirājyasiktāmirhutvā daśasahasrakaṃ || 49 ||

nirāmayaścirāyusyāt satyamuktaṃ mahīyate |
hutvā nīlotpalaiḥ samyagayutaṃ sādhakottamaḥ || 50 ||

vaśīkaroti trailokyaṃ yāvajjīvaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
hutvā raktāṃvuje ragrāvayutaṃ ghṛtamiśritaiḥ || 51 ||

vāṃchitaṃ dhanamāpnoniśatasāhaśopi ca | 
ghṛtamiśraṃ yayo hutvā ṣaṭsahasraṃ yatavrataḥ || 52 ||

paśuvṛddhimavāpnoti dhanaṃdhānyamapi dhruvaṃ |
vilvaprasūtairjuhuyādābjatrimadhumiśritaiḥ || 53 ||

daśasāhasrakaṃ rājyalakṣmīmāpnotyanuttamāṃ |
karavīrakusumai hutvā lakṣannimadhumiśritaiḥ || 54 ||

maheṃdrasadaśīlakṣmīmacalāṃciramaśrute |
aṣṭāviṃśādhikaṃ nityaṃ cirāśataṃ yojayetchutiḥ || 55 ||

sa sarvamīpsitaṃ labdhvā brahmaloke mahīyate | 
rājyābhiṣiktā śrīsamavidyeyasamudīritā || 56 ||

śrīkṛṣṇamaṃtramāhātmyamathavakṣyāmi bhūyate |

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatayarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
catuḥpaṃcāśodhyāyaḥ] 54 ||
<p. 170b>

śrībhagavānuvāca ||

śrīkṛṣṇavidyāṃ vakṣyāmi sarvasaubhāgyasiddhidāṃ |
yadanuṣṭānamātreṇa sarvasaubhāgyasiddhibhāk || 1 ||

kāmarājaṃ samuścārya kṛṣṇāya yadamapyatha |
goviṃdāyadaṃ paścāduteyījan padaṃ tastataḥ || 2 ||

vallabhāyadaṃ paścādagnipatnīsamanvitaṃ |
kṛṣṇavidyeyamākhyātāmahāsaubhāgyasiddhibhāk || 3 ||

<p. 171a>

sarvādhivyādhiśamanībhuktimuktiphalapradā |
aināṃ vidyāṃ purādhyā nārado bhagavānapi || 4 ||

trikālajñānamaiśvaryamaṇimādikamāptavān |
jagatritaya sāmrājyahetubhūtāsanātanī || 5 ||

śrīkṛṣṇavidyākathitā sarvalokavaśaṃkarī | 
ṛṣirasya vidhirbrahmāgāyatraṃ chaṃda ucyate || 6 || 

kṛṣṇaśriyaḥpatiḥ svāmīdevatāsamudāhṛtaḥ |
kāmarājaṃ vījamuktaṃ śaktiḥ pāvakavallabhā || 7 || 

ekena tritayenāpi caturbhiścaturakṣaraiḥ |
punaścaturbhirdvābhyāṃ ca ṣaḍāṃganyāsa īritaḥ || 8 ||

aṃsālavita vāmakuṃḍaladharaṃ maṃdonnatabhūlataṃ 
kiṃcitkuvitakomalādharapuṭaṃ sācīprasarikṣaṇaṃ |
ālolāṃgulipallavairmuralikāmāpūraryataṃ mudāmūle 
kalyātarostriṃbhagilalitadhyāyejjaganmohanaṃ || 9 ||

dhyātvetthaṃ sudevasya sutaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ jagatpatiṃ |
caturlakṣaṃ puraścaryātsādhakaḥ śuddhamānasaḥ || 10 ||

daśāṃśaṃ tarpayeddravyayasekṣurasenavā | 
tadaśāṃśaṃ hunedagnau paṃkajairmadhumiśritaiḥ || 11 ||

bhojayedbrāhmaṇaśreṣṭāstadaśāṃśaṃ mahīyate | 
ācāryacaruṇadvaṃdve daśāṃśaṃ suvarṇakaṃ || 12 ||

datvā prāpnoti mahatīṃ vidyāsiddhiṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
yadvāṣṭādaśasāhasraṃ nabhomāsi japcchuciḥ || 13 ||

triśatādhikasāhasraṃ ghṛtannimadhumiśritaiḥ |
hutvā saranuvarargena nirmitaṃ kuṃḍaladvayaṃ || 14 ||

ācāryakaṇīyordatvāvarṣāśanamitaṃ dhanaṃ |
datvācāryayadadvaṃdegoyugmaṃca savatsakaṃ || 15 ||

muhatīṃ kṛṣṇavidyāyāsiddhiṃ prāpnoti śāśvatī |
vilikhya ṣaḍaraṃ pūrvaṃ vasupatrāṇyataḥ paraṃ || 16 ||

tadvahiḥ ṣoḍaśaṃ dalaṃ tatoṣṭādaśapatrakaṃ |
caturviṃśati patrāṇi vilikhyātha mahīyate || 17 ||

<p. 171b>

dvyatriṃśatyamayatrāṇi trivṛtaṃ caturasrakaṃ | 
kāmavījaṃ likhenmandhye sādhyakarmasamanvitaṃ || 18 ||

cakrāyetyuṃgaṣaṭkaṃ ṣaṭkoṇeṣu tato likhet |
kṛṣṇāṣṭākṣaravarṇaśca vasupatreṣvatho likhet || 19 ||

likhet ṣoḍaśadyajeṣuṣoḍaśārṇaściyaḥ yateḥ |
aṣṭādaśasuyameṣu maṃtrarājākṣarāstratha || 20 ||

caturviṃśati patreṣu gāyatrī śrīpaterlikhet | 
tadvataṃ kāmarājena veṣṭayitvā tataḥ paraṃ || 21 ||

dvātriṃśat padma yatreṣu gopālānuṣṭubhaṃ likhet | 
tadvataṃṣiṃḍagopālāmaṃtreṇa pariveṣṭayet || 22 ||

dvitīyaṃ mātṛkāvarṇerviṣṭayitvā tataḥ paraṃ |
pāśenāṃ kuśavījena tṛtīyamatha veṣṭayet || 23 ||

śrīkṛṣṇapatramotate kathitaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ |
sarvaduḥkhaharaṃ sarvadāridryaudyavibhedanaṃ || 24 ||

asmātvarataraṃ yaṃtraṃ nāstiyidvikaraṃ bhuvi |
mūlenāja samāvādyat yajetkṛṣṇaṃ jagamaṃ || 25 ||

ṣaḍaṃgānyagnikoṣena ṣaṭkoṇeṣvarcayet kramāt | 
dvitīyaṃ vāsudevādyaiḥ svasvaśakti samanvitaiḥ || 26 ||

rukmiṇīṃ sasabhāmāṃ ca tato nagrajatāmapi |
sutaṃdāmapi kāliṃdī tato jāṃvavatīmapi || 27 ||

mitravidāṃ suśīlāṃ ca tṛtīyāvaraṇoceyet | 
valabhadraṃ revatīṃ ca ca sudevakī || 28 ||

naṃdaṃ gopaṃ yaśodāṃ ca subhadrāmarjune tathā | 
catuthaviraṇebhyarcya śakrādīnatha pūjayet || 29 ||

itthamabhyarcya satataṃ devakītanayaṃ vibhuṃ |
saṃprāpya sakalābhīṣṭaṃ devavanmodatenvahe || 30 || 

kadaṃvavṛkṣamārūḍhe gopīvasanahārīṇāṃ | 
dhyātvārddarātre saptāhaṃ sahasratritayaṃ japan || 31 ||

ākarṣayatimūpālapatnīmapi dṛṭhavratāṃ | 
goṣṭe gopayasāhutvā sahasratritayaṃ śuciḥ || 32 ||

paśuvṛddhimavāpnoti yāvajjīvaṃ na saṃśayaḥ | 
dadhyodanaṃ hunedyastu nityamaṣṭottaraśataṃ || 33 ||

saṃtati vyāpinīmannasamṛddhiṃmāsatolabhena |
kadaṃvadumamūlakṣyo dhyātvā kṛṣṇaṃ jagatpati || 34 ||

<p. 172a>

lakṣadvayamimaṃ japtvaśrīkṛṣṇamamanumādarāt | 
aṇimādi guṇaiśvaryaṃ labhate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 35 ||

grāmaṃ gacchatragaramapi vā maṃtrajāpī manuṣyodevaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ 
mukhamanumuhuḥstarthadugdhavudhyā śuddhaistoyaiḥ |
satuvahusopetamāhārajātaṃ dadhānnityaṃ pracura dhanadhānyāṃ śukādyaṃ 
murkadaḥ || 36 ||

dhyāyanamaṃtrīmaṃtrajāpī ca nityaṃ pāpādvidvyaṃnmatratraprayāti || 38 ||

tattatmātthā tatprakāmaṃ sutuṣṭhuḥ krīḍannityaṃ |
devavanmānuṣeṣu (*********) || 39 ||

medhākāmaḥ smaranadevaṃ maṃtraṃ praṇavasaṃpuṭaṃ |
ayutaṃ subhurcirbhūtvā saptarātraṃ dvijo jayet || 40 ||

samastavedaśāstrārthavaktā jīvasamo bhavet |
bhikṣāhārojayenmaṃtra saṃvatsaramataṃdritaḥ || 41 ||

vahulāṃ śriyamāpnoti sarvajño bhavati dhruvaṃ |
kanyārthī khādirai hutvā daśasāhasramādarāt || 42 ||

rusmiṇīvalabhaṃ dhyātvā ghatatrimadhumiśritaiḥ |
dadhimadyājayukūlājerpadvā hutvā yutaṃ vudhaḥ || 43 ||

suṃdarīrūpasaṃpannāṃ kanyāmiṣṭhāmavāpnuyāt |
navanītāśanaṃ kṛṣṇa dhyātvo lūkhaladhanaṃ || 44 ||

ayutaṃ navanīte hutvā putramacāpnuyāt |
śatamaṣṭottaraṃ jatvāpivaṃtaṃ pūjanāstanaṃ || 45 ||

kṛṣṇaṃ dhyāyet grahagrastānpalāyaṃte tate grāhāḥ |
samastaviṣanāśārthaṃ kṛṣṇāṃ kālīyamardanaṃ || 46 ||

japtyā tata śataṃ hutvā samastaṃ nāśayedviṣaṃ |
vimatātanapārūḍhaṃ haraṃtaṃ pārijātakaṃ || 47 ||

jāptvā dvādaśasāhasraṃ hutvātha karavīrakaiḥ |
vijayīsatataṃ bhūtvā devavadbhuvimodate || 48 ||

śanaiśvaradineśvatthaṃ japedātyabhyapāṇinā |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ śuddhomiyate nāyamatyubhiḥ || 49 ||

āślīdādanvahaṃ vidvānannaṃsasābhimaṃtritaṃ |
āyurāṇopamāsādyāvalaṃ tejañcāviṃśati || 50 ||

<p. 172b>

japtvā dvādaśalakṣāṇi vidyāmenāṃ jiteṃdriyaḥ |
kaṃdarpasadṛśaḥ kāṃtyāvidyayādhiṣaṇaprabhaḥ || 51 ||

jāṃvavatsadṛśāyuṣmān tejasābhānusannibhaḥ |
bhūtvā bhuktveha sakalān bhogānapi manoramān || 52 ||

brahmalokevasatyaṃte daśāpūrvaidaśāvaraiḥ |
etate kṛṣṇavidyāyāmāhātmyamadhnāśanaṃ || 53 ||

kiṃciduktataporāśe samastesmitasiddhidaṃ ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
paṃcacāśodhyāyaḥ] 
<p. 172b>

śrībhagavānuvāca 

atha buddhādividyānāṃ sādhanaṃ kiṃciducyate | 
pāsāvijñānajīvāpi pāparāśirvinaśyati || 1 ||

trayīvījaṃ hṛdāyuktaṃ padaṃ bhagavate tataḥ |
vedamārga pratiṣṭhāṇakartre padaṃ tataḥ || 2 || 

buddharūpāyaśabdaṃ ca viṣṇave nama uccaret |
buddharūpasya vidyeyaṃ viṣṇostrijagatīpateḥ || 3 ||

samastayātastau vaghnonnī sakalasaṃpadāṃ |
munirasyerito brahmāchaṃdogāyatramīritaṃ || 4 ||

buddharūpomahāviṣṇurdevatāsadbhirīritaḥ |
tribhīrvarṇeścaturvaṇairekāda daśabhirakṣeraiḥ || 5 ||

paṃcabhiścannibhirddhābhyāṃ ṣaḍaṃganyāsaderitaḥ |
śyāmaṃ prasannavadanaṃ catuvāhuṃ kirīṭinaṃ || 6 ||

buddharūpaṃ bhaje viṣṇuṃdevarṣibhiṣṭutaṃ |
buddharūpaṃ mahāviṣṇumiti dhyātvā manuṃ japet || 7 ||

asya lakṣaṃ puraścaryā saṃproktā paramārṣibhiḥ |
daśāṃśaṃ kamalairddhatvāghṛtannimadhumitiśrataiḥ || 8 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdratvā vahuladakṣiṇāṃ |
vidyāsiddhimavāpnoti mucyate pātakairapi || 9 ||

siddhakṣetraṃ samāśritya japtvā lakṣāmimaṃ |
manumāhāpātakasaṃdyaiśca sadya eva vimucyate || 10 ||

aṣṭākṣaroditopiṭe pūjayebuddharūpiṇaṃ |
nārāyaṇa jagannāthāṃ sarvasiddhipradaṃ vibhuṃ || 11 || 

atha kālkisarūpasya śrīpateḥ paramātmanaḥ |
pravakṣyāmi mahāvidyāṃ mahāsiddhipradāpinīṃ || 12 ||

praṇavaṃ nati saṃyuktaṃ padaṃ bhagavate tataḥ |
kalkirūpapadaṃ paścāccaturyyāṃta samanvitaṃ || 13 ||

viṣṇave padamābhāṣya namaḥ śabdaṃ tato vadet ||  23 ||

<p. 173a>

eṣā kalkisvarūpasya vidyāsmakṣātpriyaḥ pateḥ |
samastakāmaphalaptamāhāyākabhedinī || 14 || 

yājñavalkyo mahāyotīmunirasyāḥ samīritaḥ |
paṅktiḥ chaṃdaḥ kalkirūpī śrīviṣṇurdevarucyate ||15 || 

vījamuktaṃ trayīvījaṃ śaktirnatirudīritā |
ekenākṣarayugmena caturbhiḥ paṃcabhistayā || 16 ||

trimirdvābhyāṃ ṣaḍaṃgāni vinyasediti sādhakaṃ |
nīlameṣvanibhaṃ divyaratnasiṃhāsena śrute || 17 ||

samāsīnaṃ jagannāthaṃ kālanīlāṃ vudadyutiṃ |
sarvaduṣṭaharaṃ yogimunisiddhaniṣevitaṃ || 18 ||

dhanurvāṇadharaṃ viṣṇuṃ śriyapādevyā samanvitaṃ |
kalkisvarūpiṇaṃ devaṃ sarvalokahiterataṃ || 19 ||

kalkirūpamiti dhyātvā vāsudevaṃ jāgatpatiṃ |
jātvā lakṣaṃ mahāvidyāṃ daśāṃśaṃ tulasīdalaiḥ || 20 ||

madhutritayasaṃmiśraihetvācārya padāṃvujī |
dakṣiraṇāṃ vasudhāṃ datvā vahusasyaudyasaṃkulāṃ || 21 ||

vidyāsiddhimavāpnoti muktaḥ syāt pāparāśibhiḥ |
aṣṭākṣarodite pīṭhe pūjayet kalkimacyutaṃ || 22 ||

japtvācāryasya sānnidhyaṃ ca ṣaṣṭisahasrakaṃ | 
daśāṃśaṃ kamalairhutvā śvetāśvaṃ sa paricchaṃdaṃ || 23 ||

vahudakṣirāyāyuktaṃ datvā śrīgurave tataḥ |
bhūtvehasārvabhaumausaudehāṃte muktimāpnuyāt || 14 ||

vaktāraṃsarvavidyānāmṛṣibhyo yamunātaṭe |
dhyātvā kalkiṃ mahātmānaṃ jatvā lakṣamataḥ paraṃ || 25 || 

hutvā palāśakusumairvidyānāṃ pārago bhavet |
puccakāmo hunet putrajīvairayutamādarāt || 26 ||

śrīkāmovilvapatraiścarājyakāmastu pakajaiḥ |
vidyākāmaścahaviṣābhogakāmastāthotpalaiḥ || 27 || 

āyuṣyakāmo juhuryāharcābhirayutaṃ śuciḥ |
sahasraṃ triśataṃ vāpi jatvā vā śatamanvahaṃ || 28 || 

tīvanmukto bhavatyeva saṃśayo nātra vidyate |
nāmatrayamahyavidyāmathavakṣyāmi bhūyate || 29 ||

<p. 173b>

yadabhyāsa paromukto bhavet saṃsārasāgarāt | 
acyutānaṃtagoviṃdāścaturthīṃ nati saṃyutāḥ || 30 ||

śrīpūrvakāmahābhāgavidyeyaṃ paramātmanaḥ |
nāmātrayāmi proktā duritaudya vibhedinī || 31 ||

asādhyārogasaṃhartrī muktimukti phalapradā |
vaśiṣṭho nāradoyogī kaśyapopyaṣayaḥ smṛtāḥ || 32 ||

gāyatryādīni chaṃḍāṃsivarāhon haristathā |
vāmanodevatā prokto viniyogastu siddhaye || 33 ||

pūrvoktaṃ yajñavārāhaṃ nṛrorvāmanaṃ vibhu |
dhyātvā nāma trayaṃ nityaṃ japtvāsiddhimavāpnuyāt || 34 ||

siddhavidyāmimāṃ prāhurvedavedātapāragāḥ |
ācāryadakṣiṇaivāsyāpuraścaryāsamīritā || 35 ||

valavadvātarogeṇapīḍitoyadimānavaḥ |
sajapecchatasāhasramadhaḥśāyī jiteṃdriyaḥ || 36 ||

mṛgadābhaṃ tataḥ sāṃgaṃ kṛtvā tasmādvimucyate |
viṣamajvarayuktopi śatasāhasraṃmādarāt || 37 ||

kārayitvā japaṃ viprairjuhuyādāmrapallavaiḥ |
kārayitvā tato homaṃ mamṛtāmirathāpi vā || 38 ||

asādhyena jvareṇapi sadya eva vimucyate || 
dīrghamāyuṣmamanvicchanūdūrvāmirayutaṃ śuciḥ || 39 ||

hutvā nirāmayo dīrghamāyuṣyaṃ labhate dhruvaṃ |
hunetrimadhusammistilairmehasyaśāṃtaye || 40 ||

śāṃtyarthakuṣṭarogasya japtvā lakṣatrayaṃ śuciḥ |
rājitaṃ vṛṣabhaṃ datvā sāṃgadakṣiṇayānvitaṃ || 41 ||

kuṣṭharogādvimucyeta durvircitrādapi dhruvaṃ |
ājīrṇarogaśāṃtyarthaṃ japtvā śatasahasrakaṃ || 42 ||

haviṣādaśasāhasraṃ dutvāgni pratiṣāmathā |
sauvarṇāṃ dakṣiṇāyuktāṃ datvā tasmādimucyate || 43 ||

jiteṃdriyo hāviṣyāśī japtvā lakṣatrayaṃ vudhaḥ |
daśāṃśaṃ goghṛtaṃ hutvā maṃtrauṣadharasāya || 44 ||

asādhyaiḥ sarvarogaiścamuktaḥ syānnātra saṃśayaḥ |
nāmatrayamahāvidyāṇ japannanvahamādarāt || 45 ||

āpuṣpaṃ mahadārogyaṃ mahatīṃ śriyamakṣayāṃ |
putrapautrābhivṛddhiṃ ca bhogānapi sudurlabhāne || 46 ||

<p. 174a>

saṃprāpya bhagavadvāmnivasatyaṃtena saṃśayaḥ |
praṇarvanamasāyuktaṃ padaṃtagavate tataḥ || 47 ||

sarvādyaguṇaśabdāṃte saṃkhyānāya sāmurccaret | 
anaṃtāpadaṃ paścādavyaktāya namaḥ padaṃ || 48 ||

anaṃtasya mahāvidyā sākṣātsaṃkarṣaṇātmanaḥ |
uktāśaṃkarajapteyaṃ mahābhāgyasamṛddhidā || 49 ||

maheśvaro muniḥ prokto maṃtrasyāsya jagatpatiḥ |
gāyātrameva chaṃdosya sākṣātsaṃkarṣarṇagevibhuḥ || 50 ||

pataṃjaliranaṃtosau devamukto manīṣibhiḥ |
śritiścaturbhiraṣṭābhiścaturbhiścaturakṣaraiḥ || 51 ||

dvābhyāṃmiti ṣaḍaṃgānityasetsādhakupuṃgavaḥ |
sahasraṃ śirasaṃ devaṃ pharṇasāhasraśobhitaṃ || 52 ||

vasudhāṃ mūrdhi vibhrāṇaṃ lāṃgalaṃ musalaṃ halaṃ |
vāsukyādi mahānāgaiḥ sarvataḥ parivāritaṃ || 53 ||

sarvavidyānidhi sarvadevarṣigaṇavaṃditaṃ |
ānaṃtaṃ paramātmānaṃbhajāmi jagatīdyatiṃ || 54 ||

dhyātvā nityaṃ japedvidyāmanaṃ tasya jagatpateḥ | 
vidyānāṃ pāragobhūtvā parāṃ muktimupetyasau || 55 ||

arcayedvaiṣuve pīṭe nāgarājaṃgatpatiṃ |
mūrtimūlena saṃkalpya samabhyarcyopacārakaiḥ || 56 ||

agnīśāsukhāyavyamadhyadikṣu ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ | 
abhyarcya vasukitakṣakaṃ karkoṭakamapyathā || 57 ||

tataḥ padmaṃ mahāpadmaṃ śaṃkhaṃ ca gulikāṃ tathā |
kumudaṃ ca tataścitraketuṃ nāradaparvatau || 58 ||

iṃdrādīnayadikayālānāyudhānapyataḥ paraṃ |
itthaṃ saṃkarṣaṇaṃ devabhyarcya trijagasati || 59 ||

japtvā lakṣaṃ mahāvidyāṃ daśāṃśaṃ śannimadhuplutaiḥ |
hutvātha daśasāhasraṃ tilaiḥ śukermahīyate || 60 ||

ācāryapādakamale datvā vahuladakṣiṇāṃ |
vidyāsiddhimavāmmāsau sarvavidyānidhirbhavet || 61 ||

anaṃtasya mahāvidyāṃ jagannanvahāmādarāt |
na sarpabhayamāpnoti na bhayaṃ viṣasabhavaṃ || 62 ||

<p. 174b>

vidyānāpāragobhūtvā bhagavatkalayānvitaḥ |
samṛddhimahatīprāpyadhanadhānyādisaṃkulāṃ || 63 ||

vrajaṃtyaṃte haripadaṃ divyarūpadharo nṛpā |
ityanaṃta mahāvidyāviddhānaṃ kiṃcidīritaṃ || 64 ||

naranārāyaṇīvidyā prabhāvo vakṣyate |

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre 
vedārthasaṃgrahe ṣaṭpaṃcārśādhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 174b>

śrībhagavānuvāca ||

śṛṇurājanmahābhāgavadīvanavāsitaḥ |
mamavidyāṃ pravakṣyāmi sadyaḥ sakalasiddhidāṃ || 1 ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccārya hṛdayena samanvitaṃ |
bhagavatpadadamābhāṣya caturthyaṃta samanvitaṃ || 2 ||

upādyaśamaśīlāyoyeti vākyaṃratāpadaṃ |
nātmyāyāviṃcanapdaṃti tāyapadamapyatha || 3 ||

ṛṣabhāpadaṃ paścānnaranārāyaṇāya ca |
parametyatha haṃsāyaparameti padaṃ tataḥ || 4 ||

gurave padamātmārāmādhītipataye tataḥ |
hṛdayadvitayaṃ paścādvidyaiṣā samudīritā || 5 ||

naranārāyaṇī nāmnā mamavidyāphalapradā |
bhedīnī sarvapāānāduḥkhasaṃdyanivāriṇī || 6 ||

jñānasiddhipradā sākṣānmamasāyujyasiddhidā |
nāradāyapurāproktāmayaiva karuṇāvatā || 7 ||

samastasiddhidāsadyaḥ sarpasaṃpattiherūkī |
ahaṃ samastaloddhanāmācāryaḥ parikīrtitaḥ || 8 ||

madraktānāmiyaṃ sākṣāḍaruvidyeti kīrtitā |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī dātā sohameva mahīyate || 9 ||

madrūpiṇaṃ sadācāryaṃ ye dhyāyaṃ nididine |
teṣāṃ bhuktiṃ ca pradāsyāmina saṃśayaḥ || 10 ||

ahaṃ samastalokānāṃ hitāya jagatītale | 
vadarīkāṃtanenityaṃ nivasāminaranvitaṃ || 11 ||

ahameyaṃtrilokānāṃmīśvaraḥ parameśvaraḥ |
brahmaviṣṇumaheśedradaivatākṛtiracyutaḥ || 12 ||

nārāyaṇosmibhagavānsarvajñaḥ sarvapabhṛt |
dharmeṇa prārthitasya putratvaṃgatavānahāṃ || 13 ||

<p. 175a>

vadarīkānanenipuṃsthitvāhaṃ sarvapālakaḥ |
bhūtvāhaṃ sarvabhaktānāṃ dāsyāmi paramapadaṃ || 14 ||

vadarīkānaṃ purāyamidamatyaṃtapāvataṃ |
matparigrahatobhūyadarśanānmokṣasiddhidaṃ || 15 ||

yatraivālakanaṃdeyaṃ nirgatāmadanujñayā |
srātvai vālakanaṃdāyāṃ sakṛdṛddhāpimāṃ vibhuṃ || 16 ||

masadaṃ prāpnuvaṃtyaṃte brahmānaṃdasukhāvitāḥ |
ṣaṣkakṣarīmimāṃ vidyāṃ naranārāyaṇīṃ mama || 17 ||

yatra kutrāpi vā nityaṃ ye japaṃti yatavratāḥ |
saṃprāpya mahatī siddhite matpadamavāpnuyuḥ || 18 ||

saṃhannīyāsasaṃdyānāṃ sarvapuṇyaphalapyadā |
caturvidhamāhāmuktisiddhideyaṃ sanātanī || 19 ||

yejayaṃtyanvahaṃ bhajmāmamavidyāṃ dṛḍhavratāḥ |
tasyāhaṃ pitṛvannityaṃ pradāsye sarvavāṃchitaṃ || 20 || 

sānnidhye satataṃ tasya tiṣṭāmi sakalāmaraiḥ |
siddhavidyāmomāṃ prāhuryogino vījakaṣma || 21 ||

madvidyānusmṛtirnityaṃ sadyo duritamedino |
madvidyā siddhiruditāgurudakṣiṇayaiva hi || 22 ||

bhagadarśaneyasya sākṣādvācchābhavediha |
mamavidyāṃ japedetāṃ naranārāyaṇī śubhāṃ || 23 ||

ādhipatyaṃ samastānāṃ vidyānāmiha saṃtaṃtaṃ |
aṇimādyaṣṭasiddhīnāmādhiyatyaṃma caṃcalaṃ || 24 ||

śaṃkhādīnānidhānānāmīśatvamapi satataṃ |
ādhipatyaṃ maharṣīṇaṃ brahmarṣīṇāṃ ca yogināṃ || 25 ||

icchatāmamajapyeyaṃ vidyāsakalasiddhidā | 
naranārāyaṇīṃ vidyāṃ nityaṃ mama japan śuciḥ || 26 ||

padrūpiṇamathācāryaṃ satopyānvahamādarāt |
aṣṭākṣarādividhānāṃ mayisiddhiṃ parāṃ vrajet || 27 ||

nināhomaṃ puraścaryāṃ vinātarpayāmanvahaṃ | 
madvidhāyājayenaiva sidhyasaṣṭākṣarīmamā || 28 || 

<p. 175b>

satyakoṭi mahāmaṃtrā api sidhyaṃti bhūyate |
ekāmapi muhāvidyāṃ mamajaptyānvahaṃ śuciḥ || 29 ||

siddho bhavati sarvatrasidhyaṣṭakasamanvitaḥ |
aṣṭhāṃgayogasahitojarāmaraṇavarjitaḥ || 30 ||

aṇimādiguṇānprāpyalokeṣuviharatyasau |
nāradobhagavānasya munirukto maharṣibhiḥ || 31 ||

vadarīkānanādhyakṣobhagavānparameśvaraḥ |
naranārāyaṇāṃ svāmī devatā procyate vudheḥ || 32 ||

viniyogo bhagavataḥ prītyarthaṃ samudīritaṃ |
tāṃganyāsa karanyāsau nāpi nyāsāṃtaraṃ nṛpā || 33 ||

viṣvatesthā mahārājasiddhavidyāyato nṛpa | 
suramyelakanaṃdāyāstare vadarikāśrame || 34 ||

brahmarudramaheṃdrādidaivataiḥ samalaṃkṛte | 
vaśiṣṭavedavyāsādimaharṣimirabhiṣṭute || 35 ||

yogamudrādharaṃ sākṣājjagatkarjāramacyutaṃ |
navanīlāṃvudaśmāmaṃjaṭhāmaṃḍaladhāriṇaṃ || 36 ||

padmarāgamaṇiḥ svarṇakuṃḍaladvayabhūṣitāṃ | 
dhanurvāṇadharaṃ divyapītāṃvaravirājitaṃ || 37 ||

kaustubhodbhāsitāraskaṃ muktāhāravibhūṣitaṃ | 
divyaratnākitaḥ svamakuṭāvṛtamāstakaṃ || 38 ||

ratnāṃgulīyaka svarṇakāṃcīdāmavibhūṣitaṃ |
smitakaṣkaṃviśālākṣaṃ koṭimanmathasuṃdaraṃ || 39 ||

sarvalokahitodyuktaṃ sarvalokaikasākṣiṇaṃ | 
ācāryaṃ sarvalokānāṃ gurūṇaṃ paramaguruṃ || 40 ||

ātmārāmaṃ jagadvaṃdyaṃ nareṇasahitaṃ vibhuṃ |
nārāyaṇaṃ jagadvaṃdyaṃ bhagavaṃtāmupāsmehe || 41 ||

dhyātvethaṃ jagatāmīśvaraṃmāśriyaḥ patiḥ | 
naranārāyaṇīvivāmāmanityaṃ japedbudhaḥ || 42 ||

anabhyarcya sadācāryamajasemaṃ manuṃ mama | 
aṣṭhākṣarādividyānāṃ na siddhiṃ labhate kvacit || 43 ||

avicchinnopāsanāsyā puraścaryāmanoḥ smṛtāḥ | 
naranārayaṇoṃ vidyāmajatvā matavallabhāṃ || 44 ||

<p. 176a>

aṣṭākṣasadi viṣvānāṃ puraścaryā śatairapi |
labhate na parāṃ siddhimiti vedānuśāsanaṃ || 45 ||

nityamācārya śuśrūṣā naranārāyaṇījapaḥ |
dvayameva mahāsiddhipradaṃ lokaṃ ṣubhūyate || 46 ||

caturvedānadhītyāpiyāṃgātkṛtvāpi koṭiśaḥ |
mahādānāni kṛtvāpi puraścaryā śataṃ tu vā || 47 ||

naranārāyaṇīvidyāmānuyāsyanṛsiddhibhāk |
sudarśanamahāvidyāṃ pravakṣyami tataḥ paraṃ || 48 ||

yāmupāsyanaronityaṃ vijayaśrīyutau bhavet |
caṃdravījavyomayarṇaṃ caṃdraṃ dīrghā gnisaṃyuta || 49 ||

vaiśvānaraṃ ca kavacamastravījamataḥ paraṃ |
sudarśanimahāvidyā ṣaḍarṇeyamudīritā || 50 ||

praṇavaṃ nārasiṃhaṃ ca nikṣipyādau dine dine |
jatavyeyaṃ mahāvidyāvighnasaṃghanivāriṇī || 51 ||

bhūtapretapīśācādimahābhayanivāriṇī |
sarvaśatukṣayakarīviṣadāridryaghātinī || 52 ||

ahivuṃghryau muniḥ prokto maṃtrasyāsya mahāmatiṃ |
sudarśanātmābhagavāndevoviṣṇurūdīritaḥ || 53 ||

kavacaṃ vījasityuktaṃ śaktirastramudīritaṃ |
sudarśanān hariprītyarthaṃ viniyujyate || 54 ||

śaṃkhaṃ cakraṃ ca cāpaṃ paraśumasibhi śubhaṃ |
śūlapāśāṃkuśāgrīn vibhrāṇāṃ vajrākheṭaṃ || 55 ||

halamusalagadākuṃtamapyugradaṃṣṭujvālākeśaṃ trinetraṃ jvaladanalanibhaṃ 
hārakepūrabhūṣaṃ dhyāyet |
ṣaṭkoṇe saṃsthaṃ sakalaripugaṇaprāṇasaṃhāracakraṃ || 56 ||

itthaṃ sudarśanātmānaṃ na harīṃ jagatīpatiṃ |
dhyātvā japtvā yathā śaktāvighnasadyavivarjitaḥ || 57 ||

vijityasakalān śakrūn vimuktaḥ sarvapātakaiḥ |
vimuktaḥ sakalāpadyaḥ puruṣārtha catuṣṭayaṃ || 58 ||

avaśyaṃ labhate maṃtrīnityamācāryabhaktimān |
ataḥ paraṃ pravakṣyāmi vāyuputramahāmanuṃ || 59 ||

<p. 176b>

yamupāsyanaronityaṃ mahāvijayasiddhibhāk |
praṇavaṃ namasāyuktaṃ padaṃ bhagavate tataḥ || 60 ||

tryāṃjajaneyapadaṃ paścāccaturthyaṃtasāmanvitaṃ |
padaṃ mahāvalāyeti padaṃ hanumate tataḥ || 62 ||

vahnijāyānvito maṃtrasya trayoviṃśākṣaraḥ smṛtaḥ |
maṃtrarāja iti khyāta āṃjaneyasyamāruteḥ || 62 ||

mahāpātakasaṃdyaghnaḥ sarvakāmaphalapradaḥ |
vijayaśrīpradonityaṃ lokatrayavaśaṃkaraḥ || 63 ||

agastyo bhagavānasya munirityucyate vudhaiḥ |
chaṃdogāyatramityuktaṃ maṃjanānaṃdanovibhuḥ || 64 ||

devatāvāyutanayohanūmānvapināyakaḥ |
vījaṃ trayīmayaṃ proktaṃ śaktirnati rudīritā || 65 || 

ajanāṃnaṃdanaprītyaiviniyoga udīritaḥ |
tribhi aśuturbhiṣaṃcārṇaiḥ paṃcabhiścaturakṣaraiḥ || 66 ||

dvābhyāmiti ṣaḍaṃgāni kṛtvā dhyāyenmarutsutaṃ || 67 ||

vaṃdevāladivākarāyutanibhaṃ devāridarpāpahaṃ |
devedrapramukhāmarastutivahaṃ sītāviśokāyaharmojīrata || 68 ||

vicitrakuṃḍalalasatkaupīnakṛṣṇājinaṃ vajrāṃgaṃtyu mahāvalaṃ kapivaraṃ 
śrīrāmadūtaṃ vibhu |
dhyātvetthamaṃjanātyanūṃ nityaṃ vijayasiddhidaṃ jatvāvijayamāmotidivivāṇe || 69 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ śuśrūsyadine dine | 
puraścaraṇasaṃsiddhikaro proktā maharṣibhiḥ || 70 ||

jayārthināmayaṃ śatrusadhānakaraṇonvahaṃ |
jayalakṣmīpradonṛṇāmaṇimāṣaṣṭasiddhidaḥ || 71 ||

pūjāsyavaiṣṇavepīṭeśaivedhāyisavamīritā |
aṃjanātanapasyāmaṃmupratyahaṃ maṃtranayakaṃ || 72 ||

triśataṃ vā śataṃdhīmānaṣṭākiṃśatidhāpivā |
jvallāvijayamāsodyesarvasiddhiyuto bhavet || 73 ||

yaḥ svargehehanamataṃ maṃtrarājena pūjayet | 
aṇimādiguṇeyetātahuheśrīracaṃcalā || 74 ||

<p. 177a>

rājadvāre mahāghore viladvārepi durgame |
yakṣarākṣasevetālayeśācādi mahābhaye || 75 ||

smarannimaṃ mahāmaṃtraṃ sadyomucyeta saṃkaṭāt | 
aṣṭaviṃśādhikaṃ maṃtraṃ japtvā triśatamanvahaṃ || 76 ||

dvādaśājyāhutīḥ kṛtvā samabhyarcya harīśvaraṃ |
viṃdasavala saubhāgyaṃ saprāpnotyanvahaṃ japaṃ || 76 ||

acalāṃ śriyamāpnoti dhanadhānyādi saṃkulāṃ |
rājānoyāṃtidā satvaṃ śatravomitratāṃ tathā || 77 ||

vimuddhaḥ sukalāpadbhya putrapautrādi saṃkulāṃ |
samṛddhiṃ mahatī labdhvā muktiṃ prāpnoti śāśvatī || 78 ||

garuḍasya mahāvidyā pravakṣyāmi tataḥ paraṃ |
yāmupāsya vimuktasyātkālakūṭabhayādapi || 79 ||

praṇavaṃ namasāyuktaṃ padaṃ bhagavate tataḥ | 
mahāgaruḍaśabdaṃ ca caturthyaṃta samanvitaṃ || 80 ||

padaṃ vajranaravetyuktvā vajratuḍāyatatpadī |
vajrayakṣaliṃ kṛtādyaśarīrāya padaṃ tataḥ || 81 ||

etyethīti mahāśabdaṃ garuḍeti padaṃtaḥ |
duṣṭānnāgān chidhi padaṃ duṣṭānaśroccaret || 82 ||

rākṣasān chiṃchiṃchiṃchīti āveśaya padatrayaṃ |
vadohu phaṭ padaṃ paścaduccarediyamiṣṭhada || 83 ||

garuḍasya mahāvidyā samastaviṣabhedinī |
ṛṣirbrahmāsyamaṃtrasya gāyatraṃ chaṃda īritaṃ || 84 ||

garuḍo devatāprokṛsamastaviṣabhaṃjanaḥ |
hemādriśikharākāraṃpūrṇacaṃdranibhānaṃ || 85 ||

naṃdīrvavāhuṃvṛṣarakaṃ vanāgābharaṇabhūṣitaṃ | 
anaṃto vāmakaṭakoyajñasūtraṃ tu vāsuki || 86 ||

takṣakaḥ kaṭisūtraṃ tu hāraḥ karkoṭakakṣathā |
padmastu dakṣiṇe karṇe mahāpadmastuvāmataḥ || 85 ||

śaṃkhapālaḥ śirodeśe gulikaṃstu bhujāṃtare |
dhyātve devaṃ trisaṃdhyādāvātmānaṃ garuḍānmakaṃ || 86 ||

viṣaṃ nāśayati kṣipraṃ vāyuḥ śīghramivāṃvudaṃ |
ājānuhemavarṇabhamānābhatestu hinaprabhaṃ || 87 ||

<p. 177b>

ānāsaṃśukatulābhaḥ māmūrddhvājanasannibhaṃ yo viśvasya prāṇabhūtastasurapi 
ca hareryo niketasvarūpoyaṃ saṃciṃtyaiva sadyaḥ svayamuragavadhūvargagarbhāḥ 
pataṃti | 
caṃcaḍorutuḍacuṭitapariṇatāsyaṃ vaṃdechaṃdomayaṃtaṃkhaṇapatimamalaṃ 
svarṇavarṇaṃ suparṇaṃ || 88 ||

dhyātvetthaṃ garuḍaṃ vivāhanaṃ pakṣināyakaṃ |
garuḍasya mahāvidyāṃ japtvānityaṃ phalapradāṃ || 89 ||

sādyo vināśayatyeva sthāvarajaṃgamaṃ viṣaṃ |
gāruḍasyāthagāyatrīṃ vaṃdāmi sakaleṣṭadāṃ || 90 ||

yāmupāsya suparṇātmābhavennityamakalmaṣaḥ padaṃ tatpuruṣāyeti vidmahe 
padamapyatha suvarṇapakṣaśabdaṃ ca 
caturthyaṃ samanvitaṃ dhīmahīti padīyetaṃ tatrogaruḍa ityathā || 91 ||

pravodapādini yadaṃ vidyaiṣā samudīritā |
praṇavādyā samastādyabhedinī vivanāśinī || 91 ||

pitāmaho jagadvrātāmunirasya samīritaḥ |
chaṃdogāyatramityuktaṃ devatāgaruḍasmṛtaḥ || 92 ||

pūrvoktaṃ kacchitaṃ dhyānamasyāpimunisatamaiḥ |
jadyātgaruḍagāyatrīsaṃharet sakalaṃ viṣaṃ || 93 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityāmaṣṭaviṃśatidhāpi vā |
jadyānvahaṃ paurṇimāsyā mamoyāṃ vā sammahitaḥ || 94 ||

triśataṃ juhuyādājyaṃ jvalite jātavedasi | 
tataṃ tat putrapautrādinapi pādahatā api || 95 ||

hiṃsati pannagaḥ krūrāḥ śatāsyā api bhūyateḥ ṣasvamāsānaṃtaraṃ tasya 
hastābhyāṃ syarśamātrataḥ hālāhalaṃ mahāghoramapi sadyovinaśyati | 
cakṣurorokṣughoreṣuddhādaśāhamataṃdritaḥ jalmāsahasraṃ gavyājya 
yaṣṭottaraśataṃ hunet || kārayedathavānyena cakṣūrogairvimucyate || 96 ||

<p. 178a>

japtyā triśatamekāṃte pratyahasādhakottamaḥ |
āyurārogyamacalamaiśvaryamaṇimādikaṃ || 97 ||

putrapautrābhivṛddhiṃ ca labdhvābhomānathākṣayāna |
tadviṣṇoḥ paramāṃdhāmayātyaṃte nātra saṃśayaḥ || 98 ||

jayo dvādaśāsāhasraṃ puraścaryāsya kathyate |
gotrayaṃ dakṣiṇā proktā tanmūlyaṃ vā sadakṣiṇaṃ || 99 ||

sahasraṃ juhuyādājyaṃ jvalite jātavedasi |
viprādvādaśasaṃkhyākābhojanīyāḥ prayatnataḥ || 100 ||

kṛtvaivaṃ nātrasaṃdeho garuḍātmā bhavesvarya śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāḥ 
siddhimicchanmahīyate raśmimālāmimāṃ smṛtvā |
siddhiṃ proti śāśvatī api sarvaprayatnena 
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīsubhāyasyasiddhābhavetsvasyanāsādhyaṃ vidyate bhuvi || 101 ||

vidyānāṃtaramapyasti śrīmadaṣṭārṇasiddhidaṃ | 
tatkṛtaṃ cenmahāsiddhirbhaviṣyati na saṃśayaḥ || 102 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīyetaṃtraivedārthasaṃgrahe 
saptapaṃcāśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 178a>

rājovāca ||

bhagavandevadeveśanārāyaṇākṛpānidhe |
bhūyopi śrīmadaṣṭārṇasādhanaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ || 1 || 

vadame sarvajagatāṃ hitāya jagatīpate |

śrībhagavānuvāca 

śṛṇurājanpravakṣyāmi sādhanāṃtaramiṣṭadaraṃ || 2 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāssarvalokopakārakaṃ |
sarvamaṃtramahārājñī śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīśubhā || 3 ||

yasya sidhyaṃti tasyā śusarvāḥ sidhyaṃti siddhayaḥ |
śṛṇurājanpravakṣyāmi śuciḥ prayatamānasaḥ || 4 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāḥ sādhanāṃtaramuttamaṃ |
bhānuvāsarasaṃyuktāsāsaṃsīmāyānigadyate || 5 ||

<p. 178b>

sā tithissarvapāpatprosarvapuṇya phalapradā |
ravisaṃkramaṇaṃ tatra jāyate yadi suvrata || 6 ||

nāmnā cūḍāmaṇiryogodurlabhoyaṃ smṛto budhaiḥ |
āstive tatra saṃkrāṃtiḥ śatakratu phalapradaḥ || 7 ||

rātrau tadardhaphaladaṃyogamāhumehurpyeyaḥ |
brāhmekāle yadi bhavetkratukoṭiphalapradaṃ || 8 ||

udayātpuratonāḍīyaṃ ca kevasudhāyate |
ravisaṃkrāmaṇaṃ vājimedhakoṭiphalapradaṃ || 9 ||

udayānaṃtaraṃ bhānuvāsāroveṃduvāsaraḥ |
bhavedyadihārājatatpurāyaphalamakṣayaṃ || 10 ||

na śakyate mayā vaktukimutānyairmaharṣibhiḥ |
tutrāpi raviṇacāparāśisaṃkramaṇaṃdapadi || 11 ||

brāhmekāle bhave tatrāphalaṃ vaktuṃ na śakyate |
āśvamedhasahasrasya phalaṃ vaktu hi śakyate || 12 ||

na śakyate mayā vaktu me tasya phalaṃ makṣayaṃ |
mahādānasahasrasya rājasūyāyutasya ca || 13 ||

sukṛtaṃ śakyate vaktumatravaktuṃ na śakyate |
yadi brāhme muhūrte syādavisaṃkramaṇaṃ śubhaṃ || 14 ||

somenabhānunāyuktaṃ raviśataprabhaṃ |
mahācūḍāmaṇirnāmnāyogolabhyo yamuttamaḥ || 15 ||

saptāmyāṃ yadi madhyāhne ravisaṃkramaragaṃ bhavet |
somena raviṇavāpi sahitaṃ hastasaṃyutaṃ || 16 ||

ciṃtāmaṇiṃ yomudāharaṃti samastasāmrajyasukhaikahetuṃ |
samastapāpaudyavināsaṃhetulakṣmīrāsaṃpūrṇakaṭhākṣahetuṃ || 17 ||

na tatra purāyaṃgaṇi tu hi śakyate mayā tridhātrā giriśena |
vāpi tatrāpi kadikubhānusaṃkramoyogādhirājyo bhuvi kathyate sau || 18 ||

yadisyāhuṣasaṃkrāṃtissaptamyāṃ hastasaṃyutā |
raviṇavedunāyuktāmadhyāhnavasuvāpate || 19 ||

vijayākhyaṃ mahāyogāmi prāhurmaharṣayaḥ |
cāpasaṃkramaṇaṃ noryadi brāhmemuhūrtake || 20 ||

<p. 179a>

madhyāheṣasaṃkrāṃtistaṃ māsaṃ vijayam viduḥ |
ekaikasmin dine tatra japahomādikaṃ kṛtaṃ || 21 ||

puraścaryāphalaṃ prāhurāgamārthaviśāradāḥ |
mahādānasahasrasya phalaṃ vaktu hi śakyate || 22 ||

ācāryadakṣiṇāpurāyamatravaktuṃ na śakyate |
ekaikasmindinenatra śrīśārcanajaṃ phalaṃ || 23 ||

śatakratuphalaṃ prāhurbrahmādyādyādevatāgaṇaḥ |
ekaikasminhite tatra kṛsaṇohutiṃ śutāṃ || 24 ||

rājasūyāśvamedhānāṃ sahasraphalamāśute |
māse trīśrīmadaṣṭārṇapuraścaraṇamāharāt || 25 ||

kṛtvā kodi puraścaryāphalaṃ nissaṃśayaṃ labhet |
śrīmadaṣṭhārṇavidyāyāmāsetravasudhāyate || 26 ||

puraścaryāṃ pravakṣyāmi samāhitamanāḥ śṛṇu |
utthāyāyararātrāṃnedhanuḥsaṃkramaṇeraveḥ || 27 ||

ācāryadaṃḍavatratvātadājñāṃ pratigṛdyat ca |
ācāryaṃ samalaṃkṛtyavāsolaṃkāracaṃdanaiḥ || 28 ||

snātvā tatra viśuddhātmānityasaṃdhyāmupāsya ca |
śālagrāmasilāvakre śrīyetervasudhāpateḥ || 29 ||

cakrayuktaisamabhyarcya sāṃgāvaraṇamādarāt |
uccaranniṃdirānāthabrahmavidyāphalapradāṃ || 30 ||

komāistulasīpatraivilvapatrerathāpi vā |
āthāmalakaparteyodūrvāgraiḥ kusumānvitaiḥ || 31 ||

śamīpatraiḥ paṃcaśatamacaṃyetpratyahaṃ nṛpa |
jīrakīrdrakasaṃyuktaṃ mudgatraṃ ghṛtasaṃyutaṃ || 32 ||

guḍayuktaṃ samarpyātha datvā daṣyājyaliṃtaḥmā |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃsahasraṃpratyahaṃ japet || 33 ||

japtvā paṃcaśataṃ vāpi vidyāṃ śrīhṛdayābhidhāṃ |
japet paṃcaśataṃ vāpi dvādaśārṇāṃ śriyothavā || 34 ||

pratyahaṃ jvalite vahnau mudrānnāṃgulasaṃyutaṃ |
jīrakārdrakasaṃyuktaṃ goghṛtena samanvitaṃ || 35 ||

hunedaṣṭhottaraśataṃ śrīmadaṣṭārṇāvidyāyā |
tathaivāṣṭotāraśataṃ hunecchī hṛdyena ca || 36 ||

<p. 179b>

dvadaśārsāśriyāvāpinatogavyājyamādarāt |
bhagavadraśmividyābhirekaikāmāhutiṃ hunet || 37 ||

uṣasaṃkrāṃtiyarpatamitthaṃ kṛtvā dine dine |
ūṣāsaṃkramaṇe prāpte tatrābhyarcādipūrvavat || 38 ||

tatrāpi pūrvavajjaptvā mudrānnaṃ guḍasaṃyutaṃ |
vilvapatrasamāyuktaṃ tilagavyājyasaṃyutaṃ || 39 ||

hutvā paṃcaśataṃ pūrva śrīmadaṣṭāraṇavidyāyā |
prasannalakṣmīmaṃtreṇa dvādaśārṇā śriyā vidhā || 40 ||

aṣṭākiṃśādhikaśatādhikasāhasramādarāt |
hutvātharaśividyābhirjuhuyāhoghṛtaṃ tridhā || 41 ||

hutvā japādibhiḥ paścāt kṛtvā brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ |
agniṃ pradakṣiṇī kṛtya bhagavaṃtaṃ śriyaḥ patiṃ || 42 ||

paṃcaśatabrahmavidyāmudhāryātha prapūjayet |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ sāṣāṃgaṃ daṃḍavannamet || 43 ||

samarpya nāso yugatyaṃ navīnasūkṣmamutamaṃ |
padmarāga samāyuktaṃ vajraviṃdu samanvitaṃ || 44 ||

ṣaṣṭicinnukasaṃtaptahāṭakena vinirmitaṃ |
kuṃḍaladvitaṃ padadyādavaśyaṃ tasya karṇayoḥ || 45 ||

vahuśasya samāyuktā vahudakṣiṇayānvitāṃ |
ācāryāyārdyayedvīmānmahatīsuvasuṃdharāṃ || 46 ||

dhenuṃ payasvinī dadyātsāṃ dakṣiṇānvitāṃ |
paṃcāṭhakamitāmudgādeyā ācāryamaṃdire || 47 ||

dhanāḍhyā rājaputrastu grāmamekaṃ samarpayet |
grāmasya dakṣiṇā proktātiṣkasāhasrakāṃcanaṃ || 48 ||

yathāśaktidhanaṃ vāpi vitalobhaṃ parityajet |
nālpasasyāmahodeyānakaklośāvaduḥkhadā || 49 ||

nālyakṣīsa pradātavyā dhenuralya phalāpradā |
mahādānāni kurvīta rājāvārājaputrakaḥ || 50 ||

śrotriyāyadaridrāya kūṣmāṃḍaṃ dakṣiṇānvitaṃ |
putrapautrābhivṛdhyarthaṃ dadyātyāyanikaṃ || 51 ||

<p. 180a>

daśadānādideyānivibhavesanisādhakaiḥ |
uṣasaṃkramaṇe tasminnekāhatyānaleśubhe || 52 || 

lakṣahomaphalaṃ prāhuḥ purāragāḥ paramarṣayaḥ |
tatrācārya yadāṃbhoje datvā sasyayutāṃmahīṃ || 53 ||

saptadīpavatīmūmisaratnākaramekhalī |
datvā yatphalamāprātitadavaśyamavāpnuyāt || 54 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ datvā tatrācāryasya varṇayoḥ |
ākalpakoṭi dānasya phalamakṣayamaśrute || 55 ||

divyālaṃkārasubhagodivyaṃ caṃdanacarcitaḥ |
divyavastradharaḥsragvījarāmaraṇavarjitaḥ || 56 ||

piturmātuśca yatmyaścanimagrārakārṇaveyit |
nāṃśatamudvatyasudharṇadhvajabhūṣitaṃ || 57 ||

vimānamadhirudyāṃte divyakanyāśatānvitaḥ |
bhagavatsadṛśākāromodate paramepade || 58 ||

datvā payanvinīṃ dhenuṃ mudgānnaṃgaṣasaṃkrame |
mahādānasahasrasya phalamakṣayamakṣutai || 59 ||

māsaṃ kṛtvā puraścaryāmitthaṃ makarasaṃkrāme |
viśeṣahomaṃ kṛtvātra datvācārya padakṣiṇa || 60 ||

puraścaryā sahasrasya sīṃgasya phalamakṣayaṃ |
saṃprāpya sākṣātsvapnevāpaśyatyeva śriyapatiṃ || 61 ||

dhanadhānya samāyuktā muktāralaudyāsaṃ |
kulātanmaṃdirenivasanimahālakṣmīracaṃcalā || 62 ||

vidyānāmapi sarvāsāmādhipatyamathākṣayaṃ |
saṃprāpya putrapautrādi samṛddhi mahatomavi || 63 ||

va avāpya sakalānbhogānbhuktvehāpi sudurlabhān |
avāśyamuktimāpnoti sahasrakulasaṃyutaḥ || 64 ||

śatāṭhakamitābhūmirvahusasyā samanvitā |
dānārthaṃ śasyate bhūya vahudakṣiṇayānvitā || 65 ||

paṃcāśahāṭhakamitāya dvāśastādāne |
vasuṃdhūrā sahsradhenudānāścahaya sāhasradānataḥ || 66 ||

hastisāhasradānādyamahīdābhaviśiṣyate |
mahīdānaṃ mahādāna sahasrādapi siddhidaṃ || 67 ||

<p. 180b>

sūmāhurmaharṣayodivyavedābrahmādayopi ca |
aśaktomaṃdabhāgvaśrodbhiśitvā śūdrakānapi || 68 ||

sūkṣmaṃ vāso yugaṃ datvā vā solaṃkaraṇādibhiḥ |
ācāryapatnīmabhyarcyapaṃcāniṣkamitaṃ dhanaṃ || 69 ||

dadyādācārya pādābje tatrāśaktopi bhūyate |
dhenuṃ payasvinī datvā caturviṣkamitaṃ dhanaṃ || 70 ||

datvā paṃcāṭakamitānmudgānāpi samayeyet |
avaśyaṃ siddhimāpnoti daridropi na saṃśayaḥ || 71 ||

nārī vā puruṣo vāpi puṇyakāle samāgate |
kūṣmāṃḍaṃ saphalaṃ datvā śrotriyāya kuṭuṃvine || 72 ||

vimucyate mahāpāpairapi saubhāgyasutamaṃ |
prāpyaṃ vaśābhivṛddhiṃ ca maheṃdrayadabhāgbhavet || 73 ||

kārtike paurṇāmāsyāṃ ca maṣasaṃ kramaṇe śubhe |
kūṣmāṃḍaṃ saṃpradāyāśubhaphalaṃ sumahadaśrute || 74 ||

kārtike paurṇamāsīyātṛguvāsarasaṃyutā |
dhyatīpāta samāyuktā mahatī tithirucyate || 75 ||

prasannalakṣmīpati yogamāhusnāsmindine sarvayaśaskaraṃ ca |
srātvā ca hutvā ca guroḥ padābje datvā parāṃsiddhimupaiti martyaḥ || 76 ||

vāreṣu bhārgavovāraḥ paurṇamāsītithiṣvapi |
yogeṣu ca vyatīyāto mahāsiddhiṃ prayacchati || 77 ||

tritayaṃmilitaṃ yatratatparvamahadīritaṃta |
snātvā mahānvidyāṃ śrīmadāṣṭākṣarośubhāṃ || 78 ||

prātarjaptvāyathā śaktyāvidhivatsaṃskṛtenale |
hutvā paṃcaśataṃ śrīmadaṣṭārnenāditaḥ śuciḥ || 79 ||

lakṣmīhṛdayamaṃtreṇa śatādhika sahasrakaṃ |
vilvapatrairghṛtābhyaktairmadhutritayamiśritaiḥ || 80 ||

dvādaśārṇa śriyā vāpi hutvā śrīpatiraśmibhiḥ |
gavyājye na tridha hutvā kṛtvā brahmārpaṇahutiṃ || 81 || 

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdveniṣkadvādaśakaṃdhanaṃ |
ṣaṇniṣkaṃ vā triniṣkaṃ vā niṣkadvayamitaṃ tu vā || 82 ||

<p. 181a>

samarpya vā sau datvātha tatpatnyai kamalādhiyā |
alaṃkāra tathā dadyādyathā svaktidhanaṃ tu vā || 83 ||

mithunatritayaṃ pūjyaṃ mṛṣṭānnairdakṣiṇādibhiḥ |
śrotriyāyadaridrāyakūṣmāṃḍaphalamuttamaṃ || 84 ||

sadakṣiṇaṃ yathā śaktyā datvā sakalapātakaiḥ |
vimukto mahatīṃ siddhiṃ prāpnotyeva mahīyate || 85 ||

adhaḥśāpī haviṣyāśī bhavetasmindīne nṛpā |
māsimāsihariṃ sākṣāsvapreyāpi prapaśyati || 86 ||

puraścaryātrayaphalaṃ prāpya siddhimanuttamāṃ |
avāpya mahatī lakṣmī dhanaṃdhānyādisaṃkulāṃ || 87 ||

saṃprāpya sumarudgāyaṃkavitāṃ ca manoramāṃ |
putrapautrābhivṛddhiṃ ca bhogānapi sudullībhāt || 88 ||

aṃte lakṣmīpaterdhāmnimodate mānātra saṃśayaḥ |
nārī vā puruṣo vāpi kārtike paurṇamīdine || 89 ||

sadakṣiṇaṃ yathā śaktyā datvā kūṣmāṃḍamunamaṃ |
saubhāgyamakṣayaṃ lakṣmīdhanadhānyādi saṃkulāṃ || 90 ||

vaṃśābhivṛddhimākalyaṃ prāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
bharturāpuṣpamicchaṃto saubhāgyaṃ ca manoramaṃ || 91 ||

putrapautrābhivṛddhinvadhanadhānyā kulāṃ śriyaṃ |
dadyādavaśyaṃ kūṣmāṃḍaṃ kārtike paurṇamīdine || 92 ||

kūṣmāṃḍadānaṃ kurvītamakarasthepi bhāskare | 
bhūyopi saṃpravakṣyāmi navārātravrataṃ śubhaṃ || 93 ||

ākarṇayaikacitastvasadyassakalasiddhidaṃ |
navarātra maharatparvavarṣamadhyāmaṇivrataṃ || 94 ||

siddhidaṃ sarvavidyānāṃ pātakaudya vibhedanaṃ |
ekaikaṃ ca dinaṃ tatra cūḍāmaṇi samaṃ viduḥ || 95 ||

samastaduḥkhaśamanaṃ bhavasāgaratārakaṃ |
tatra dataṃ kataṃjatyaṃ śreyorāśikalapradaṃ || 96 ||

āyuṣkaraṃdhanakaramapamṛtyunivāraṇaṃ |
svargāpavargadaṃ sadyassamastepsitasiddhidaṃ || 97 ||

navarātravratasamaṃ nānyaduktaṃ mahadvrataṃ |
ācāryānujñāyātatra vrataṃ kṛtyāmahannaraṃ || 98 ||

<p. 181b>

siddho bhavati sarvatra nigrahānugrahakṣanaḥ |
āśvinemāsi saṃprāpte pratipadivaseśubhe || 99 ||

ācāryānujñayā prātaḥsnātvānadyāṃ vidhānataḥ |
sahasraṃ prajayedvedamātaraṃ triśalatuvā || 100 ||

divākāramupasthāmya nityahomaṃ samāpya ca |
vidhivatsaṃskṛte vahnau dvādaśākṣaravidyayā || 101 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇai tatrāvādyātbhyarcyopacārakaiḥ |
aṣṭautraraśataṃ hutvā ghṛtamaṣṭhārṇavidyayā || 102 ||

prasanmalakṣmīmaṃtreṇa dvādaśārṇā śriyā pivā |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā ṣaḍarśona śriyopi vā || 103 ||
 
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ saṃkalpyārka sahasrakaṃ |
japecchī dvādaśārṇāṃ ca saṃkalpārka sahasrakaṃ || 104 ||

aṣṭamyataṃjapeditthaṃ tata ātharvaṇeritaṃ |
ekottaraṃ japellakṣmīhṛdayaṃ sarvakāmadaṃ || 105 ||

paṃcādhikaṃ vā catvāriṃśadvāraṃ vā japet sudhīḥ |
mahābhavamyāṃ trimadhughṛtavilvadalānvitaṃ || 106 ||

pāyasaṃ tilasaṃyuktaṃ vidhivat saṃskṛtenale |
vṛhadābharaṇairhutvā ghṛtena purataḥ śuciḥ || 107 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇamaṃtreṇa śatādhika sahasrakaṃ |
pūrvoktaṃ pāpasaṃhutvā dvādaśārṇaśriyāpi ca || 108 ||

triśatādhika sāhasraṃ pāpasaṃjuhuyācchuciḥ |
bhagavadraśmibhirhutvā tridhā ghṛtamataḥ paraṃ || 109 ||

hutvā japādibhiḥ paścātkṛtvā snārpaṇahutiṃ |
nityaṃ paṃcaśataṃ brahmavidyāyā pūjayet vratī || 110 ||

dine dine mahālakṣmīdhiyābhyarcya suvāsinīḥ |
vimalādidhiyācaikāmarcayenna suvāsusinī || 111 ||

ādau madhye tathāṃte ca bhūnīkādhiyā nṛpa |
suvāsinī rūpaṃ pūjyaṃ brāhmaṇaṃ vedapāragaṃ || 112 ||

abhyarcya bhagavaddhudhyānityamatrarasādibhiḥ |
tāṃkulairdakṣiṇabhiścatoṣayeścasuvāsinīḥ || 113 ||

<p. 182a>

haviṣyāśī kalāśīvā caikabhaktāśanīpivā |
phalāśanodhaḥ śāpī ca jiteṃdriyayutopi ca || 114 ||

ekāṃtaramathā cāryacaraṇājvayuge śubhe |
pradadyādakṣiṇadravyaṃ vāso laṃkaraṇādikaṃ || 115 ||

mahānavamyāṃ hutvārtha namaskṛtyāgnimādarāt |
śrīśadvādaśākṣaryālakṣmīnārāyaṇau vibhū || 116 ||

pūrvoktavidhinābhyarcya gatvācāryasya maṃdiraṃ |
ṣaṣṭhicihrukasauvarṇānarmitaṃ kuṃḍaladvayaṃ || 117 ||

tatkārṇayugahye datvā vāso yugmaṃ samarpya ca |
sauvarṇamudrikādyaiśca samabhyarvya tataḥparaṃ || 118 ||

sālagrāmaśilāmekāṃ datvā dakṣiṇayānvitāṃ |
dadyādvasudhārāyaścādvahusāsyaudya saṃkulāṃ || 119 ||

atha dakṣiṇayāyuktaṃ yugmaṃ ca samarpayet |
deyā anadruhaḥ paścāccaturobhāravāhekāḥ || 120 ||

grāmāṇāṃ daśakaṃdadyādvranāḍhyo rājanaṃdanaḥ |
aśvayugmāsi mahatī navamīyā prakīrtitā || 121 ||

sārkagrahasahasrābhāsaṃ proktā paramirṣibhiḥ |
ekaikaṃ dinamapyatra navarātravrate śubhe || 122 ||

arddhodayasaptaṃ prāhuḥ purāṇāḥ paramarṣayaḥ |
mahatī navamīpātra tatsamaṃ parvasiddhidaṃ || 123 ||

na jānehaṃ mahābhāgasiddhiryatrākṣayā bhavet |
mahānavamyāṃ vijayalakṣmīmicchatracaṃcatma || 124 ||

abhīṣṭadevatāpūjāṃ kṛtvā yasya dakṣiṇaṃ |
samarpya vahulāṃ nityaṃ japalakṣmīmavāpnuyā || 125 ||

ekasmaivipramātrā yadatvā bhojanamapyatha |
avaśyaṃ phalamāpnoti viprāṇaṃ koṭibhojanāt || 126 ||

<p. 182b>

mahālakṣmīdhiyābhyarcyatatraikāṃvāsuvāsinīṃ |
suvāsīno sahasrāṇāṃ mūjāphalamavāpnuyāt || 127 ||

tatrācarya padāṃbhoje samarpya vasudhābhāṃ |
datvā dvādaśadhā bhūmiṃ dhanaratnaudya saṃkulāṃ || 128 ||

saptadvīpa samāyuktāṃ yatphalaṃ puruṣoṣṇute |
avaśyaṃ matphalaṃ sāṃgaṃ labhate nātrasaṃśayaḥ || 129 ||

datvā dhenu dvayaṃ vatsadakṣiṇānvitamādarāt |
dhenukoṭiprādānasyaphalaṃ sīgaṃ vrajatyartha || 130 ||

śālagrāmāśilānātkoṭi brahmāṃḍadānajaḥ |
phalamāsādyaśuddhātmījīvanmuktaḥyusukhī bhavet || 131 ||

dhanāḍhyorājaputraśredāścine navamīdine |
grāmadvādakṣakaṃ datvāścetāśvaṃchatrasaṃyutaṃ || 132 ||

dadyānmataṃgajamapidadyādāṃdolikāṃ śubhāṃ |
sālakṛtāṃ svaputrīcaṃ svācāryāya samarpayet || 133 ||

vahulairapyalaṃkārairvāsobhiḥ kamalādhiyā |
ācāryapatnīmabhyarcya siddhimāpnoti śāśvatī || 134 ||

sakṛdapyāhutiṃ hutvā tanmahānavamīdine |
koṭi satāhutiphalaṃ samagraṃ puruṣoplute || 135 ||

yadyatatra suvarṇadīdīpate gurupādayoḥ |
tatanmerusamaṃdānaṃ prāhurdivyāmaharṣayaḥ || 136 ||

kṛtvādau rājitaṃ pātraṃ paladvayamitaṃcha śubhaṃ |
ācāryāya ṛtudravyaṃ tatra nikṣipyasādhakaḥ || 137 ||

poryaye tasya sukṛtaṃ mayā vaktuṃ na śakyate |
dahaivatasyetejīśaṃ mamadāsyāmi suvrata || 138 ||

tatpitṛnnarakasthāśca brahmalokaṃ nayātyahaṃ |
aṃtepi samahedrādipadaṃ kṛtvā tṛṇopamaṃ || 139 ||

bhagavatsadṛśākāromodate paramepade |
śrīmadaṣṭakṣarī siddhidvādaśārṇaśriyopi ca || 140 ||

sāṃgāṃ kṛtvā puraścaryā sīṃgadakṣiṇayāvitāṃ |
puraścaryā sahasrastha sāṃgasya phalamakṣayaṃ || 142 ||

saṃprāpyaśaṃkha vaktrādidhāriṇaṃ jagatīpatiṃ |
nārāyaṇamanādyaṃtaṃ paśyatyevaściyaḥ patiḥ || 143 ||

<p. 183a>

ihāpi mahadaiśvaryamaṇimādiguṇanvita |
dhanadhyanyapaśuvrānayuktāralaughaṃ saṃkulaṃ || 143 ||

hayahasti samāyuktaṃ dīrghāpuṣpamacaṃcalaṃ |
saṃprāpya sarvaśreyāṃsi vidyāṃ ca mahatīśubhāṃ || 144 ||

putrapautrādi vṛddhiṃ ca bhuktvābhogāṃśca durlabhān |
sahasrakulaṃ yuktasradviṣṇoḥ paramaṃpadaṃ || 145 ||

kalevarāṃte viśati saṃśayo nātravidyate |
lakṣmīhayāvidyāyāviśeṣotra pravakṣyate || 146 ||

ācāryādau pragṛdyādau pratipadivaseśubhe |
srātvā prātarviśuddhītmānityasaṃdhyāmupāsya ca || 147 ||

gāyatrīṃ vahuśo japtvā nityahomasamāpya ca |
āṣṭhojaraśataṃ hutvā madaṣṭhārṇavidyayā || 148 ||

hunedaṣṭottaraśātaṃ lakṣmīhṛdayavidyayā japet |
paṃcaśataṃ nityamaṣṭārṇāṃ sarvasiddhidī || 149 ||

lakṣmīhṛdayavidyāṃ tu saṃkalpyārkasahasrakaṃ |
aṣṭamyataṃ japecchudraḥ phalāśīvāhaviṣyabhuk || 150 ||

adhaḥśāpīsakṛdyadvāmitamaśranadinedine |
avaśyamevatāṃ vṛlabhakṣyako bhūṣaṇānvitaḥ || 151 ||

ācāryaṃ vātha tatpatnītaṃtputraṃ vādite dine |
saṃtoṣya sakalairarthe hṛdayaṃ śriya ādarāt || 152 ||

paṃcāpikaṃ ca catvāriśadvāraṃ ca prajayedbudhīḥ |
suvāsinyaḥ samabhyarcyāḥ pūrvoktavidhinānṛpa || 153 ||

mahānavamyāmabhyarcyāḥ suvāsinyaḥ sahasra |
mahālakṣmīvidyā sākṣādathavādvādaśārcayet || 154 ||

dvādaśabrāhmaṇānbhojyānārāyaṇadhiyā nṛpa |
ācāryapatnīḥ śrīvudhyāṃ vāsolaṃkaraṇādibhiḥ || 155 ||

viśeṣeṇārmayeddhīmānvratasya paripūrtaye |
mahānavamyāṃ jvalite jātavedasisādhakaḥ || 156 ||

gavyājyaṃ vedadamāṃtrādāvaṣṭāviṃśatidhā hunet |
śrīśrīpatīsamāvādyatatrāgrau brahmavidyayā || 157 ||

<p. 183b>

śrīmadaṣṭākṣereṇādau hutvāya ca śataṃ ghṛta |
prasannayā mahālakṣmyāvidyayā trimadhuplutaṃ || 158 ||

tilavilvadalopetaṃ sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ |
gavyājyasahitaṃ hutvā pāyasaṃ jvalite nale || 159 ||

lakṣmīhṛdayamaṃtraiścapāyasaṃ juhuyā tridhādhai |
vaiṣṇuvairīśmibhisredhāghṛtaṃ hutvā tataḥ paraṃ || 160 ||

japādihomaṃ kṛtvātha kṛtvā brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ |
pradakṣiṇaṃ namaskṛtya jātavedasamādarāt || 161 ||

śrīśrīpatī samabhyarcya triśataṃ brahmavidyayā |
tatrāryapadāṃbhojadvitayaṃ praṇipatya ca || 162 ||

gaṃdhādibhiralaṃkṛtya tatpatnīṃ tatsutaṃ tu vā |
kuṃḍalādvitayaṃ datvā tatkarṇayugale śubhe || 163 ||

sagṛhasthita sarvasvaṃ pradadyādakṣiṇādhannaṃ |
sūkṣmavāso yugaṃ datvā varṣāśanamitaṃ tu vā || 164 ||

tatrāpyaśaktoniṣkāṇi tatra dvādaśabhūyate |
tatrāpya śaktomati mānadaśaniṣkamitaṃ dhanaṃ || 165 ||

vasuniṣkapyadhanaṃ vāpi paṃcaniṣkadhanaṃ tu vā |
pradadyādgodvayaṃ vatsavahukṣīrasamanvitaṃ || 166 ||

vahusayutāṃ pṛthvīmathavādakṣiṇanvitāṃ |
datvā siddhimavāpnoti mahatīṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ || 167 ||

saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇāyuktaṃ puraścaraṇamādarāt |
sakṛtkṛtvāpi vā sākṣādbhagavatkalayānvitaḥ || 168 ||

siddhiṃ prāpnoti mahatīṃ devānāmapi durlabhāṃ |
tamanvahaṃ pālayati mahālakṣmīssvaputravat || 169 ||

vāsaṃte navarātrepi kṛtvetthaṃ vratamādarāt |
bhagavat kalayāyukto jīvanneva vimucyate || 170 ||

maheṃdrādyaṣṭaṣṭidikpālā apitadvāsitaṃtaṃ |
niṣṭaṃti bhṛtyavatatsyasākṣātsakalasiddhidāḥ || 171 ||

dvādaśārṇaśriyāyuktavratepyaṣṭhākṣarasya ca |
prasannalakṣmīsahitāśrīmaṣṭhākṣarasyava || 172 ||

<p. 184a>

sarvasvamutamāproktā dakṣiṇasarvasiddhidā |
varṣāśanamitadravyamathavādakṣiṇoktamā || 173 ||

athavā vahusasyādyācaturvṛṣabhasaṃyutā |
dakṣiṇāsahitā sarvasiddhidoktāvasuṃdharā || 174 ||

jarāmaraṇarāhityaṃ brahmānaṃdasukhaṃ paraṃ |
śriyamaṣṭhaguṇeyatāmicchatāni yatātmanā || 175 ||

avaśyamapikartavyāpuraścaryetthamādarāt |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇeyogeyogepyarvodayen sa || 176 ||

japahomādikaṃ kṛtvā siddhiṃ prāpnoti śāśvatī |
siṃharāśisthite jīveyogepuṣkaranāmake || 177 ||

goviṃdadvādaśeyoge kṛtvāpi vasudhāyate |
japahomādikaṃ sākṣātparaṃbrahmaprapaśyati || 178 ||

puṣpārke puṣpasāsepi pūrṇimācaṃdraparvaṇi |
ārdvodaya sahasraṃ vānatatrāsadṛśaṃ bhavet || 179 ||

śuklātṛtīyāvaiśākhe paurṇamāsī ca kārtike |
mahāsiddhikarī proktā japahomādibhirnṛpa || 180 ||

bhṛguvāravrate nāpi navarātravratena ca |
dhanurmāsavratenapi mahatī siddhirīritā || 181 ||

vaiśākhe paurṇamāsī vā māghamāsepi pūrṇimā |
dina dvayamidaṃ śreṣṭaṃ sadyassiddhipradāyakaṃ || 182 ||

ekādaśyaṃtimaṃ māghasasamīdivasādikaṃ |
bhīṣmapaṃcakamityuktaṃ mahāsiddhikaraṃ smṛtaṃ || 183 ||

vahunā kimihoktena sārabhūtaṃ vacaḥ śṛṇu |
karukṣārya śukraṣāṃ saivasiddhikarī smṛtā || 184 ||

tyajet pativratāpatnīṃ pitaragaisvasutānapi |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ śarīrāṃtepinatyajet || 185 ||

nityaṃ guruvacaḥ kāryamaśivāṃ śivameva vā |
kartavyācāryapyu śrūṣā prāṇairapi dhanairapi || 186 ||

etadeva tayotyugraṃ brahmasyakasāvanaṃda |
itthaṃ viditvā satataṃ kṛtvāpi vasudhāpate || 187 ||

prāpnoti paramaṃ dhāmayogināmapi durlabhaṃ |
ācāryājñāṃ samullaṃpya sakṛdapyavanīyate || 188 ||

<p. 185a>

putraputrādisahitaḥ pitṛbhiḥ sahadāruṇī |
ākalyaṃ narake bhūyanimajjati na saṃśayaḥ || 189 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ sevyamanvahamādarāt |
prajaptvā mahāvidyābhogasvargāpavargadā || 190 ||

datyuktā janakaṃ sākṣānnareṇa sahito vibhuḥ |
nārāyaṇe mahāyogī jannaivāṃtaravīyata || 191 ||

ṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca 

iti nārāyaṇenāduktaṃ rājño mahātmane |
rāmo dāśarathiḥ prāharudrāya paripṛcchate || 192 ||

anuttarabrahmatatvarahasye śrutisaṃgrakuhe |
taṃtre dāśarathīyākhye pūrvīśassamudīritaḥ || 193 ||

atrācāryamukhāṃbhojñācchraśekamekaṃ paṭatrapi |
śṛṇavanvāyi vimuktosau mahāpātakarāśibhiḥ || 194 ||

prāpnoti yaśmadhāmardulabhaṃ daivatairapi | 

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
ekonaṣaṣṭitamodhyāyaḥ] śrī ||
<p. 1>

śrīrāmacaṃdrāya namaḥ 

ṛṣaya ūcuḥ || 

ṛṣyābhṛṃgamahābhāśasarvajñānavatāṃvara |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇamāhātmyaṃśrutaṃsāgarahasyakaṃ || 1 ||

śrīvidyā ca tathālakṣmīḥrmahālakṣmīstriśaktikā |
sāmrājyalakṣmīḥ paṃcetisāmrājyaśriyaīritāḥ || 2 ||

tannādyā sāmrālakṣmīśrīvidyākathitātvayā |
tasyā māhātmamakhrlaṃvadanaḥ karuṇānidhe || 3 || 

ṛṣya śṛṃga uvāca || 

ityuktaṃ vaṃtanṛpatiṃ rāmaṃ trijagatīpatiṃ |
prāhasītāpratimrudroḍauryāsaha jagatpatiḥ || 4 || 

śrīrudra uvāca || 

brahmatādātmyasaṃsiddhidbhoturbhūtaṃ satāśrunaṃ |
brahmāparokṣavijñānarahasyaṃ bhuktimuktidaṃ || 5 ||

śrutaṃ tava mukhāṃbhojāt sadyaḥpātakabhaṃjanaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīmānnamāhātmyamakhilaśrutaṃ || 6 ||

śrīvidyājagatāṃdhātrī sūcitānaprakāśitā |
māhātmyamakhilaṃ tasyā vadamahyaṃ jagatyeta || 7 || 

śrībhagavānuvāca || 

yajannārāyaṇonībhuṃjanakāya mahātmane |
māhātmyamakhilaṃ śabho śrīvidyāyā vadāmyahaṃ || 8 || 

śrīnārāyaṇa uvāca || 

śṛṇu rāśrībhagavānujanmahīpāla saubhāgyodayanāmakaṃ |
taṃtre nārāyaṇīye smin sahasyaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ || 9 ||

ahaṃ dāśarathirbhūtvāṣṭaṣṭoruddhayadhīmate |
punardāśarathīyākhyaṃ taṃtraṃ vakṣyāmi sādaraṃ || 10 ||

rahasyametallalitāvidyāsāraṃ yaśaskaraṃ |
saubhāgyodayanāmaitacchaṇurājan mahīyate || 11 ||

śrutvā smṛtvāpi dṛṣṭāvātaṃtrametajjagaddhitaṃ |
bhūtvā sakalabhāgyānāmādhāromuktimetyaṣi || 12 ||

yaḥ paraḥ sarvajagatāṃtahinasinātanaḥ |
paramātmā parānaṃdaḥ sarvajñaḥ parameśvaraḥ || 13 ||

tasya paṃcamukhebhyaścayaṃ vāmnāyā vinitāḥ |
pūrvaśca paścimaścaivadakṣiṇaścottarastathā || 14 ||

ūhāmnāyaścayaṃ caite mokṣāmārgāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
pūrvāmnāyastu ṛgvedo yajurvedastu dakṣiṇaḥ || 14 ||

paścimasāmavedaś ca syādātharvaṇaunnaraḥ |
sarvopaniṣadāṃjālamūrddhāmnāyaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 17 ||

<p. 1b>

hāṃta ukta āmnāya gaśeṣu pravadāmitaṃ |
śaṭiṃśatiḥ sāstatvāniśarīraṃ viśvaramaiśvaraṃ || 18 ||

kaṃcuko jīva ātmāsaṃsārirūpa niṣkacuko |
(*****) jagaddhātā śrīśonārāṇobhiva || 19 ||

nityā varṇātmakāḥ śabdoyebhyo viśvamidaṃ tataṃ |
aciṃttha śaktitā sarvamaṃtrāṇā jagatīyateṣa || ||

satsaṃpradāyādāvāryabhagasiddhiḥ parā smṛtā |
ācāryavadanobhūtavacaneṣu pramāṇatā || 12 ||

mahāsiddhikarī sarvidyānāmucyate nṛpa |
ācāryavatsadācāryapatnīputreṣu saṃtataṃ || 13 ||

dṛḍhabhaktiyato bhūtvā vajatyevonnamāgati |
gurudevatamaṃtrāṇāmaikyaṃ dhyāyet sadā dhiyā || 23 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃdvadvānvāparaṃśaṇī vrajet | 
ayameva hi siddhāṃta ukto vedāṃtavādibhiḥ || 26 ||

vedaśāstrapurāṇāni sāmānyagaṇikā iva |
iyaṃ śrīlālitā vidyāyoṣyākulavadhūriva || 24 ||

ācāryacaraṇadviṃdvadṛḍhabhakto jiteṃdriyaḥ |
śarīraprāṇavittānāmapyācāryasasarpakaḥ || 25 ||

vaidikācāraniratodharmamārgaparāyaṇaḥ |
parasto vimukho mānī satyadhāgatasūyakāḥ || 26 ||

ahaṃkāraviyuktātmā gāyatrī japa tatparaḥ |
etādṛśāyaśiṣyāya vidyādeyāśubhārthinaṃ || 27 ||

ācāryaḥ putravannityaṃtamaṃte vāsinaṃ bhuvi |
pālayet sakalāyabhyorahasyamapivodhayan || 28 ||

avaśyadīkṣito bhūtvāravācāryājñāpurassaraṃ |
śrīvidyāṃ prajapeddhīmānbrahmānaṃdasmāptaye || 29 ||

dīkṣāstihraḥ sumākhyātāṃ sarvapāpapranāśanāḥ |
ādyāyāśuyato dīkṣāvaiṣṇavīvataḥ paro || 30 ||

ayarātraipurīdīkṣā mahāsiddhikarī smṛtā |
ekatradīkṣito vāpi śucirbhavati saṃtataṃ || 31 ||

dīkṣādvitayasaṃyukto bhavedvahāsabhāyatiḥ |
dīkṣānnitayasaṃyuktaḥ srimūrtirbhagavāvet || 32 ||

ekatradīkṣito vāpi samastādya vivajitaḥ |
jasasakalavidyātāmadhikārī bhavecchruciḥ || 34 ||

dīkṣāvidhi pravakṣyāmiyena śiṣyuḥ sukhī bhavet |
dīyate sakalaṃ vastu gurevaprāṇasaṃyutaṃ || 34 ||

navaratnasuvaṇādipaṭṭavannastrasamuccayaḥ kṣayaṃ |
prāpnoti hīnāyāvāraśūnyāyamaṃtradoṣayaṇyā ca niṃdakāya ca 
mūrkhāyatīrthadveṣaparāya || 37 ||

<p. 2a>

bhaktihīnāya bhūpāla na deyā malināya ca |
bhaktiyuktāyaśuddhāya nārāyaṇa kalātmane || 39 ||

sānmārgavartine rājñe devadvijapahitāya ca |
sarvaśāstrārthavedārthajñānine suvratāya ca || 47 ||

dīkṣādeyāmahīpālayāyabhāgatyathā bhavet |
maṃḍapaṃ vedikāṃ kṛtvā puṣpavaitānamaṃḍitāṃ || 41 ||

dīpamālāvaloranmāṃ nānābhūṣaṇabhūṣitāṃ |
siṃdūraragamālābhirmaṃḍitaṃ ca vicitrakaṃ || 42 ||

vedikāyāṃ manohāriṃ kuṃkuṃmenātha vā nṛpa |
siṃdūrarajasāvāpilikhitaṃ cakrumattamaṃ || 43 ||

madhyacakremanohārinavakoṇāvirājitaṃ |
caturastaṃ ca vilikhet suvarṇakalśānnava || 44 ||

raupyatāmnādiracitānmṛbhikāracitāṃstathā |
jalapūrṇānviśeṣāḍhyānratnakharṇādibhūṣitān || 45 ||

phalapuṣpaiśca subhagaissugaṃdhena ca carcitān |
vaśinyādyaṣṭakaṃ tatra kalāḥ kuṃbheṣu pūjayet || 46 ||

madhyakuṃbhemahīyālaśrīvidyoparitoṣat |
kramasamastamabhyarcyavidhivatsaṃskṛtenale || 47 ||

raśmimaṃtraissakṛdbhutvā śatamaṣṭottaraṃ śriyā |
hutvāthavīmata śiṣyaṃ svāsanesthāpayecchaciḥ || 47 ||

sarvaśṛṃgākheṣāpyaṃtannaśiṣyaṃ samarcayet |
ṣaḍadhvarūpaṃ śrīcakraṃ tasya mūrdhni viciṃtaye || 48 ||

dṛṣṭāvalokayettaṃ tu dṛṣṭyādyaṣṭā tu melayet |
ājñā saṃkramaṇaṃ kuryādyāvaliścalūtā bhavet || 50 ||

niścaṭalaḥ śāṃbhavodehaḥ śūnyāśūnya vivarjitaḥ |
śūnyāśevamayaṃ vastu puruṣaḥ parameśvaraḥ || 51 ||

aśūnyaṃ śaktirādyāhi prākṛtissarvakāraṇam |
(*****) gvusthaulyaṃ saṃyogāśivayoryadā || 52 ||

svapnāvasthā tadājñeyā yogaśaktyādhikatvataḥ |
śaktijognariti khyātā śivoniścalatā tathā || 53 ||

suṣusiritividvadbhiḥ kathitā niścalāyataḥ |
guṇānnayaṃ tu kathitā jāgnatkhapnaguṇa (**) || 54 ||

(***) suṣrūsistuśivaniścalarūpiṇī |
śivādhikya duṇātītaṃ vastu jānī hi bhūyate || 54 ||

śivaśaktisamāyogācchivādhikyaṃ yadā bhavet |
tadātuyaṃ vijānī hi sarvadranikṛṃjanaṃ || 56 ||

<p. 2b>

kalāḥ ṣoḍaṣabhūpālahyātmajñāna vyavasthitāḥ |
śrīvidyāvojasaṃlīmāḥ śiṣyadehe prakāśayet (*) || 57 ||

śrīvidyājagatāṃdhājī sarvasiṃhāsaneśvarī |
taddhyānānmanasasthairyamumnānīti nigadyate || 58 ||

brahmajñāne jagakṛpe tṛṣṇācaṃcuvilakṣitaḥ |
saṃkalpena vikalpena prakṣābhyāṃ caṃcalassadā || 59 ||

mohamatsarakāmaiśca krodhāhaṃkāralobhakaiḥ |
sannadvapiva ūlaḥ kṛtyākṛtya yadadvāyaḥ || 61 ||

saṃsāravṛkṣe vahuśodhanaputrādimūlake |
avidyāviśmṛte niṃdāstuti śākhāsuśobhite || 62 ||

abhilāṣa sphuratpuṣpabhariteyātakādibhiḥ |
parṇamahīpāla pāpapuṇya phalānvite || 63 ||

tatvaśākhāśvādvaye sthūle śrutadṛṣṭādivet bhedataḥ |
kṣisāṃta samākramya jñānapāśena pāśanut || 64 ||

tadā samunmanīta (****) makhāniśca yānnṛṣa |
sarvarsakalparahitā kalā saptadaśī bhavet || 65 ||

pakṣikhelanatonityaṃ kaṭākṣaṃ śrīgurorbhavet |
tena pakṣadvayaṃ bhinnaṃ yadā bhavati niścayaḥ || 66 ||

unmanī nāma sā proktā bhavayāśanikṛtānī |
unmanyāsahito yogīnonmanīyogināṃ parā || 67 ||

yathā karpūragodīpo na dīpo na punaḥ śaśī |
ata eva mahīpāladṛṣṭyāsaṃkramarṇa yajet || 68 ||

tatvamasyādi vākyena paścādvākyāhiyā jayet |
jādaukaracca saṃyojyasya śanairamahīṣatte || 69 ||

sparśahasta ivābhāti śrīgurokarasaṃbhavaḥ |
svarṇādyāghātavaḥ sarvelohāthā vasudhīyate || 70 ||

suvarṇanāmayāsmarveviśiṣṭābharaṇocitāḥ |
karasparśena mūpālaprapaṃcamānilādikaṃ || 71 ||

lohatvaṃ nāśayitvaiva suvarṇa tatkaroti hi |
kerapuṣpaphalānkṛtvā brahmaraṃdhre tataḥ kṣipet || 72 ||

tasmādbrahmatvamevāsi tadvākyārthakarād bhavet |
anirvācyopadeśoyaṃ sparśanādbrahmaraṃdhrake || 73 ||

brahmaraṃdhre sahasrāre karpūradhavaleguruḥ |
varābhayakaronityo brahmarūpī sadānaghaḥ || 74 ||

jāgarti vasudhāpālanijasthāna prakāśakaḥ |
paścāgra ṣaṭ cakra vijñānaṃ śiṣyāyaprātivodhayet || 75 ||

<p. 3a>

ādharikharṇavarṇāṃ ca caturdalasuśobhanaṃ |
vādisāṃtaiścaturvarṇaṃstaptahamasamaprabhai || 76 ||

garṇaśasahitaṃ viddhiṣṭāna mataḥ paraṃ |
iṃdragopapratīkāśaispharādvidumasannibhaiḥ || 77 ||

vādilāṃtaisphuradvarṇaibrahmaṇāmaṃḍitaṃ nṛpa |
nīlavarṇā tṛtīyaṃ himaṇipūrakaṃ daśārakaṃ || 58 ||

vidyutkoṭi pratīkāśaurḍādiphāṃtaiścamaṃḍitaṃ |
gadādharaharipraucchaṃ caturthaṃ vasudhāyeta || 79 ||

piṃgābhaṃ dvādaśāṃkhamnavarṇakalāsrakaṃ || 78 ||

sphullairmāṇikyasaṃkāśairmaḍitaṃ vasudhāpate |
jīvātmanādhiṣṭitaṃ tajjārnahitadanaṃtaraṃ || 79 ||

ājñācakre mahīpālavidyuskoṭisamaprabha |
dvidalaṃ hakṣavarṇābhyām āmrābhyāṃ parimaṃḍitaṃ || 80 ||

paramātmakharūpāḍhyadyaṃnādarūpaṃ hi sannabhaṃ |
 nādīvilīnoyasmānnutasmādbrahma taducya || 81 ||

dehekṣarāṇi bhūyālanāda evānnakāraṇa |
nādaḥ paramasayogātkalinyāmutoyādā || 82 ||

prasaranvasudhāpālaṣaṭvakrāṇāṃ daleṣu ca |
paṃcāśadvarṇarūpatvaṃ prāptāvān parameśvaraḥ || 83 ||

avyaktasvaratāṃ prāpta udātrādyaisvarakramāt |
itthaṃ sarvajñatāṃ tasmaiśiṣyāyasadguruḥ || 84 ||

ācāryasya tadā śiṣyaḥ pūjāṃ kuryāt sulakṣaṇāṃ |
ratnābharaṇaśobhādyāyadṛvastadhanānvitāṃ || 85 ||

gajāścasahitāṃ bhadramahisogo samanvitāṃ |
kṣitignāmamahārāmaramyavedī śatānvitāṃ || 86 ||

suvarṇayāśīsahitāṃ kastūrīcaṃdanānvitā |
gurusaṃtoṣyavidhivatprasādaṃ prītisaṃṣuta || 87 ||

gṛhītvā śivavargothakhācāryavadanāt nṛpa |
vālāṃ prakāśayet karṇedakṣiṇepūrvamādarāt || 88 ||

raśmimātāṃ pradatvārthā śreyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarīṃ |
sarvavidyāmayodadyāt sarvasiṃhāsaneśvarī || 89 ||

sarvasābhāgyajananīṃbhogamokṣaphalapradāṃ |
na dadyātprāṇādāyāpinidhānamiva saṃsmara || 90 ||

udarelavaṇaṃ lonaṃ yatiṣṭati bhūryata |
tathābrahmamayometāṃ vidviśāstreṣuṇāpinī || 91 ||

vālāmādau pravahvātha raśmimālyaṃ mahīpate |
sāmrājyanāyikā vidyāṃ datvā paṃcadaśarakṣaro || 92 ||

<p. 3b>

śriyaḥ prakāśyeddakṣekarṇe śiṣyasyabhūyate |
anena dīkṣāvidhinādīkṣiteyābhavedbuvi || 93 ||

aśvedhasahasreṣu dīkṣitassābhavennṛpa |
nnidhādokṣeyamākhyātāplujamādhyamādhamā || 95 ||

ḍāṇirmahāyogo navarātre mahīpate |
uttamāsā samākhyātā dīkṣāsaṃpūrṇadakṣiṇā || 95 ||

arddhodayādauyādīkṣāmadhyamāsā prakārtitā |
śubhamāseśubhadine dīkṣāsyādayamānṛpa || 96 ||

ācāyanugnahāditthaṃ dīkṣitaḥ sādhakottamaḥ |
avaśyaṃ mahatīṃ siddhiṃ prāptotyanna na saṃśayaḥ || 97 ||

tatre dāśarathīyesmitsaubhāgyodayanāmake |
mahārahasye saṃprokta ekodhyāyo mahīpate || 98 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmarahasye dāśarathīyetaṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe ḍaṣaribhāge 
saubhāgyavidyodayepayamodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 3b>

śrībhagavānuvāca ||

mahābhadyarikādevyāḥ śrīvidyāyāstataḥ paraṃ |
māhātmyaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi yaduktaṃ śaṃbhunā purā || 1 ||

kailāsaśikharāsonaṃdakṣiṇamūrtiyośvanaṃ |
ginijāparipapracchaśaṃkaraṃ lokanākaraṃ || 2 || 

śrīdevyuvāca || 

bhagavansarvamaṃtrāśca bhavatā me pradarśitāḥ |
catuṣyaṣṭiśva taṃtrāṇi mātṛṇāmuttamāni ca || 3 ||

mahāmāyāśaṃ paraṃ ca yoginījālaśaṃvaraṃ |
tatvaśavarakaṃ caiva bhainavāṣṭakameva ca || 4 ||

caṃdrajñānaṃ vāsukiṃcamahāsaṃmohanaṃ tathā |
mahochuṣaṃ mahādeva lātulātuḥ lobhanaṃ || 5 ||

hṛbhedanaṃ maṃtrabhedaṃ guhyataṃtrakāmikaṃ |
kalāvādaṃ kalāsāraṃ tathānyatkubjikāmatāṃ || 6 ||

toyottaraṃ ca vīṇāvyaṃtrotalaṃtrotalobhanaṃ |
paṃcāmṛtaṃ rūpabhedaṃ bhūtaḍāmarameva ca || 7 ||

kalāsāraṃkulodrīśaṃ kulacūḍāmaṇistathā |
sarvajñānottanadevamahāpicumaṃta tathā || 8 ||

mahālakṣmīmataṃ caiva siddhayogīśvarīmataṃ |
kulodrīśaṃkulacūḍāmaṇistathā sarvajñānottanaṃdevamahāgnicumattaṃ tathā || 8 || 

<p. 4a> 

mahālakṣmīmataṃ caiva siddhayogīśvarīmataṃ |
kumānīkāmadaṃ devarūpikāmatameva ca || 9 ||

sarvavīnamatadevavimalāmatamuttamaṃ |
aruṇeśaṃ mohaneśaṃ viśuddhīśvarameva ca || 10 ||
ṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁṁ
evametāniśāstrāṇi tathānyānyapi koṭi |
bhavatoktyānimedevasarvajñānamayāni ca || 11 ||

mahānityeti vidvadbhiḥ kathyate yā parā kalā |
tasyā māhātmyamakhilaṃ śrotumicchāmyahaṃ prabho || 12 ||

lakṣmīmaṃtrasya māhātmyaṃ mahālakṣmī manorapi |
triśaktilakṣmīvidyāyāḥ sāmrājyaśrīmattorapi || 13 ||

śrīvidyāraśmimālāyāmāhātmyaṃ me vada prabho |

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca || 

śṛṇudevimahāvidyā māhātmyamadyanāśanaṃ || 14 ||

yasyasmaraṇamātreṇa vinaśyaṃtya tritayamoritaṃ || 16 ||

avasāneṣu hṛllekhāvījaistisṛbhiranvitāḥ |
śrīmahāsutīvarṇā etatitakathitāṃ śive || 17 ||

vāgbhavaṃ prathamaṃ khaṃḍaṃ paṃcadharṇaphalapradaṃ |
dvitīyaṃ kāmarājākhyaṃ lokannayadhaśaṃkaraṃ || 18 ||

ṣaḍvarṇasakalaiśvaryasiddhidaṃ abhadāyakaṃ |
tṛtīyaṃ syāt parākhaṃḍaṃ jarāmṛtyuvināśanaṃ || 19 ||

caturvarṇaṃ mahābhāgyapradaṃ saṃsāratāratā |
ikaṃ śrīvidyānāmakaṃ vastu viṃdunnayavibhūṣitaṃ || 20 ||

brahmeti kathyate vedāṃteṣvapi suvrate |
śrīvidyākhyeyane tatve vidunnayavibhūṣite || 21 ||

paṃcānāmātṛkāvarṇā aṃtarbhūtāḥ sanātananmaḥ |
vedaśāstrapurāṇādyā vidyāḥ sarvāḥ sanātanāḥ || 22 ||

asmādevasamutpannāṃ śriyaḥ paṃcadaśāṇatiḥ |
mātṛkā sarvavidyānāṃ paṃcadvarṇarūpiṇī || 23 ||

anayaiva samutpannā viṃdunnayaviṃdunnaya vibhūṣitā |
praṇavarivyā brahmāvidyāyaṃ cāśadvarṇamātṛkā || 24 ||

vidunnanya samāyuktāhaṃsavidyāpi śailaje |
brahmatādātmyasisadvipradā etānasaṃśayaḥ || 25 ||

śriyaḥ paṃca itryākṣayaḥ samutpannādamā api |
ekaikamasyakhaḍaṃvāya upāste dṛḍhavrataḥ || 26 ||

sopi brahmamayaḥ sākṣādbhavanna na saṃśayaḥ |
vedānānnitayānhinnayaṃ kālannayaṃ tathā || 27 ||

kharāṇā tritayam lokannayaṃ pādannayaṃ hareḥ |
puṣkarannitayaṃ varṇannayāmātmannayaṃ tathā || 28 ||

<p. 4b>

avasthānnayamapyasyāḥ khaṃḍatritayasaṃbhavaṃ |
hṛllekhātritayaṃ yatra viṃdutritayamiṣṭadaṃ || 29 ||

saiva śrīrucyate sākṣāccidrayā paradevatā |
bhanyannammopadaṃ gaurāyāvṛtyaiva kathite || 30 ||

imamemahālakṣmīrnārāyamanoha |
iyameva gireḥ ṣunnidevīśaṃkaravallabhā || 31 ||

iyameva brahmava 4 lovāṇosarvatrayīmayī |
iyameva jaganmātāturīyā paramākalā || 32 ||

etadaṃśāśasaṃbhūtāvihnisarvāśca devatāḥ |
strīpunnapuṃsakākāraṃ yadbhūtamudaṃcitaṃ || 33 ||

tattadevāṃvinānāsti samastamiti niścayaḥ |
iyaṃ nārāyaṇīlakṣmīgaudurgāsarasvatī || 34 ||

śrīvidyaivannarṇamātāsāvitrī ca sarasvatī |
sarvavidyāmayo sarvakṣetratīrthasvarūpiṇī || 35 ||

sarvavidyā mahārājñī sarvasiṃhāsaneśvarī |
sarvajñānamayo sarvapāpaghnīmaṃgalamama || 36 ||

rājñīsastajagatāṃ sarvasaubhāgyasiddhidā |
yasyanopavimaṃ janmayaṃ yo vā na śaṃkaraḥ || 37 ||

natauvalabhyate vidyā śrīmatyaṃvadaśākṣarī |
vaktrakoṭi samāpi dātavyaṃ śipihasrairvījīhvākoṭiśatairapi || 38 ||

varṇiturnavaśakyeyaṃ śriyaḥṣaṃ ca daśākṣarī |
sājyapradā yajñevāsvasutāyāpivaṃdhave || 39 ||

sāmrājyamapi dātavyaṃ śiropi prāṇaṃ saṃyutaṃ |
śriyaḥ paṃcadaśārṇoyaṃ na dātavyā kathaṃcanaṃ || 40 ||

śatasāhasraśodevyāvedamāturjapādapaḥ |
nayāṇāmapi vedānāṃ pārāyaṇaśaṃtu vā || 41 ||

ekavārasmṛterasyāḥ sulāṃnārhaṃti ṣoḍaśī |
aśvamedha sahasrāṇi vā japeyasya koṭayaḥ || 42 ||

bhūprādakṣirāya sāhasraṃ rājasūyataśatānyapi |
kāśyāditpatīrthayānnāścatulāṃ nāyāṃti ṣoḍaśīṃ || 43 ||

prajāpateriyaṃ mātāviṣṇorapi maheśituḥ |
sa nāmārādhyadhātāsau sṛṣṭeḥ kartāpurābhavat || 44 ||

ārādhaināṃpurāviṣṇuḥsthitikarttājagatpatiḥ |
kāmāmiyimāṃ rudramohaṣāmāsaṃ śailaje || 45 ||

mṛtyuṃjayokhyāṃ japtvā śriyaḥ yadaśākṣarī |
sarvāsāmapi vidyātāmīśvaratvamavāptavān || 46 ||

<p. 5a>

caṃdrasūryāvapi purājaptvā paṃcadaśākṣarīṃ |
sargasthityupasahārākartārājaigataḥ śive || 47 ||

kāmadevopi japtvaimīśriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarī |
trailokyaṃ mohayāmāsanaranārī guṇairyutaṃ || 48 ||

devānapyasurānyakṣīnāṃdharvāśca mahoragān |
sidhyanmaharṣisaṃghāśca munivayoścakinnarān || 49 ||

icchatāravavaśīkartuṃ japyāśrīranvahaṃ |
śivasuṃdarīrdevagaṃdharvakanyā api manoharāḥ || 50 ||

kanyā akṣarasoyakṣakiṃnarāṇāṃ ca kanyakāḥ |
raṃbhorvaśyādivyāśarasopi mama priye || 51 ||

icchatāsvavaśīkartujapyāṃ paṃcadaśākṣarī |
yaḥ paraḥ puruṣaḥ sākṣādbrahmarudrādisaṃjñitaḥ || 52 ||

nārāyaṇastrijagatāṃ nāyakaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
tasya śaktiriyaṃdevīsuṃdarīnāmacitkalā || 53 ||

paropiśaktirahitaḥ śaktyā yukto bhavedyadi |
sṛṣṭisthililayātkartumahaśaktaḥ śakta eva hi || 54 ||

gāyatrībhāyayāvidyāsāvitrīpārameśvarī |
asyā saṃśasamudbhūtā vedamātāpiśailaje || 55 ||

caturvedeṣuvedaṃteṣvapileśvayisuvrate |
vidyācatuṣṭayaṃ sarvāvidyāsihāsaneśvaraṃ || 56 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā praṇavaśvatātaḥ paraṃ |
śriyaḥ paṃcadaśārṇoyaṃ vedamātāpiśailaje || 57 ||

etadvidyā samāvidyā adhikāvānasaṃtihi |
caturvagepradānityamaṇimādyaṣṭāsiddhidā || 58 ||

śriyaḥ paṃcadakṣārṇeyaṃ brahmatvādipadapradā |
samastaviṣṇudyāsāmrājñī sarvasaṃpattihetukī || 59 ||

sarvayogamayī sasalorvavidyājapaphalapradī |
mahākālātmikā vidyātithinakṣatrarūpiṇī || 60 ||

brahmaviṣṇumaheśānarūpiṇīsurarūpiṇīyaṃ |
ca bhūtamayī saptalokādhārāsanātano || 61 ||

sarvavidyāmayīmetātasmātpaṃcadaśākṣarī |
jahasrakoṭiyoginyaptvā pratyahanekāṃte svācāryānugnahāchive || 62 ||

brahmaviṣṇumaheśādyairapi saṃpūjyate |
viputratparirakṣaṃtitaṃ brahmīṇyādimārataḥ || 63 ||

sahasrakoṭiyoginyasmāvaṃtaubhairavā api |
amarā āpi śakrādyāḥ samakoṭi maharṣayaḥ || 64 ||

śrīvidyājapakarmārapālayaṃti khaputravat |
sahasrayojanaṃ vāpi gatvācāryaṃ śivātmakaṃ || 65 ||

<p. 5b>

brahmavuddhyātamābhyarcya kṛtvā śubhūśrūyaṇaṃ |
sadāsarvakhamapi vā datvā prāṇānputrāṃśca kanyakaḥ || 66 ||

gṛhītavyāśriyovidyārājño paṃcadaśākṣarī |
lalitājapakarbhṛṇāṃ gṛhyasvargāyate bhuvi || 67 ||

garvitāḥ praṇamatyastadveṣībhinnati saṃtataṃ |
strīṃ sagamopi kaivalyaheturasya na saṃśayaḥ || 68 ||

bhobhagoyogāyate tasya pāpaṃ ca sukṛtāyate |
mokṣāye ca saṃsāro lalitāṃ vā muvāsituḥ || 69 ||

yannāsti bhogonadittannamokṣoyannāsti mokṣinaṃditannarbhogaḥ |
śrīsuṃdarītarpaṇa tatparāṇāṃ bhogaśnamokṣaścakarasya eva || 70 ||

arddhādaye puṇyatīrthe hemassahasrakaṃ |
ekoccāraṇavidyāyāstulānārhatiṣoḍaśī || 71 ||

vaiṣarovācyabhāvatvā daśaktāguṇavarṇāne |
yattonirakṣaraṃ vastu parātannatukāraṇaṃ || 72 ||

mūko bhūtā hi paśyaṃtī madhyamāmadhyamādhyamā bhavet |
brahmavidyā svarūpayaṃ bhuktimuktiphalapradā || 73 ||

śriyaḥ paṃcadaśārṇeyanaṃ prakāśyā kadācana |
gopitavyā sadā bhadresvayonirivasaṃ tata || 74 ||

śivaśakti mahāyoge yadyatkarma prajāyate |
vedyatannabhavetyaṃ icchiyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarī || 75 ||

vinācāryopadeśatavidyāṃ paṃcadaśākṣarī |
dṛṣṭā prajapate yastu samākṣoyoginogaṇaiḥ || 76 ||

ācāryakṛpayālabdhāsarṣasāmnādāyinī |
bhuvanatrayasmaubhāgyaṃ dadāti vipulāṃ śriyaṃ || 77 ||

kaṃdarpaśatasaubhāgyaṃ maṃtrailosākarṣaṇakṣamaṃ |
sudhātaṃragiṇīvegaścavṛcāturyadāyinī || 78 ||

saubhāgyabhāgyasaṃpannakalāpaṭaladāyinī |
parabrahmaṇilīnatvaṃ dadāti yaśaṭhannataṃ || 79 ||

prabhaṃ sāgolonānudvaredviriyaparā yasyā |
kaṭhākṣanodevibhuvanāni caturdaśa || 80 ||

bhavaṃti bhāktavaśyānikimunārīnarādikāḥ |
catussāgaraparyaṃtamahīsāmrājyapālanaṃ || 81 ||

śrīvidyāsīgajaḥ syādācāyonugnahācchive |
brahmāṃḍakoṭijanaṃ bhūyo vācāṃ vijṛṃbhaṇaṃ || 82 ||

punardevananuṣyādisarjanaṃ ca mamapriye |
śrīvidyājapakṛtpuṃsonāsādhyaṃ bhavati priye || 83 ||

<p. 6a>

parakāyapraveśādi sāmarthyaṃ cāṇimādikaṃ |
śrīvidyākṛtpuṃsonadurlabhamihapriye || 84 ||

śṛṇudyātyanmahadguptamapyuktaṃ brahmaṇāpurā |
nārāyaṇe na cāpyuktaṃ śrutvā guptikarābhava || 85 ||

trikhaṃḍāṃtegni mārūcchaṃ vādyaṃ vā mākṣisaṃyutaṃ |
viduyuktaṃ śriyo vījamidaṃ saṃyojyayoginaḥ || 86 ||

ṣoḍaśārṇāṃ mahāvidyāṃ japatyakhilasiddhidāṃ |
dātavyāṃ khapriyādārādeyāḥ punnāśca kanyakāḥ || 87 ||

dātavyamapi sāmrājyaṃ na deyā ṣoḍaśākṣarī |
yasyopadeśaḥ kriyatejayādijatitaṃ phalaṃ || 88 ||

taddehaṃ praviśatyevadanā cetpūrṇadakṣiṇā |
saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇādānātpuraścaryādikaṃ vinā || 89 ||

siddhirbhavati vidyānāṃ sadyaḥ pratyayakāriṇī |
catvāraṃ ihyibhratikṣemayaṃta iti saṃtataṃ || 90 ||

ṛcovadaṃti girije śrīvidyāṃ ṣoḍaśākṣarī |
nityāyaṃ ca śākhyātā mahānityā tu ṣoḍaśī || 91 ||

saiva cidrūpiṇī sātsarvajñānamayī parā |
ciṃtāmarāyādi ratnāni kalpavṛkṣādibhūruhāḥ || 92 ||

śrīvidyājāpinogehetiṣṭhaṃtyeva na saṃśayaḥ |
śrīvidyāṃ prajayedyastu satataṃ sādhakottamaḥ || 93 ||

dhanyātajjānanīlokekṛtārthasrutpitātpitāpriye |
tadvaṃśa saṃbhavā purāyāḥ pūtāstanmitravāṃdhavāḥ || 95 ||

śrīvidyājipanaṃ smṛvāhayamedhaphalaṃ labhet |
śrīvidyājāpiṃ na natvā tulādānaphalalabhet || 96 ||

śrīvidyājāpinaṃ nityaṃ saṃbhāṣyāpi mama priye |
vājapeyaphalaprāpyabhuktiṃ muktica viṃdati || 97 ||

yatra śrīlalitāvāyāvidyājāpīyatavrataḥ |
taddivyakṣennamuddiṣṭaṃ samaṃtādyo janāyataṃ || 98 ||

nidhayaḥ śaṃkhapadmādyāstasya dvāre vatsatihi |
dharmārthakāmamokṣāstatkaretiṣṭaṃti saṃtataṃ || 99 ||

māhātmyaṃ suṃdanī devyānidhānamivasaṃtataṃ |
gopitavyaṃ prayatnenayadīcchedātmanohitaṃ || 100 ||

agirobhṛgudakṣādyājagatsṛṣṭikalā api |
vaśiṣṭavāmadevādyādivyādaharṣayogyamī || 101 ||

kapilādyāmahāsiddhā api nārāyaṇātmakāḥ |
sanakādyāśca yogośāmārka upādayopi ca || 102 ||

<p. 6b>

lalitādhāṃ śriyaṃ devīprajaptvaivapatavratāḥ |
samprāpya sakalābhīṣṭaṃ japatyadyāpimatpriye || 103 ||

etadevatayotyugnāmidamevamahadvataṃ |
ayameva paroyoga idameva paraṃ phalaṃ || 104 ||

iyameva parādīkṣāgatineṣā parātparā |
iti matvā śriyo vidyāmanvahaṃ prajapecchive || 105 ||

samastavedavedāṃtasārabhūtārthasaṃgrahā |
ithameva mahāvidyānānyoktā paramaṣibhiḥ || 106 ||

siddhatvamathadevatvamathāpi vā kinaradhaṃ |
mahārṣatvaṃ śaktatva ca vidhātṛtāṃ || 107 ||

viṣṇutvaṃ vātha rudratvamicchatā niyatātmanā |
śrīvidyaiva prajaptavyā nānyā vidyā varānane || 108 ||

śāyānugnahasāmarthyamajanāmunatāmapi |
avaśyamicchatājapyā śrīnidyava varānane || 109 ||

ṣoḍaśārṇaṃ mahāvidyāṃ yadvā paṃcadaśākṣarī |
japtvā sakalabhāgyānāmādhorādevavadbhavet || 110 ||

samastasaṃpadādhosmamastāyadvivarjitaḥ | 
śrīvidyājāpakonityaṃ bhavatyeva jaḍātpatiḥ || 111 ||

māhātmyalitāṃ vāyā iti kicinmayeritaṃ |
samastādyaharaṃ puṇyaṃ kiṃ punaḥ śrotumicchasi || 112 || 

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe 
saubhāgyavidyodaya uttarabhāge dvitīyodhyāyaḥ] || 2 ||
<p. 6b>

śrīṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca ||

iti śrutvā mahādevī dakṣiṇāmūrtimīśvaraṃ |
kṛtāṃjali puṭā bhūtvā punārāha girīṃdrajā || 1 ||

śrīdevyuvāca ||

bhagavandevadeveśavidyāguptatarāśubhā |
śriyaḥ paṃcadaśārṇoyaṃ śrutā sarvasamṛddhidā || 2 ||

tadanuṣṭānamakhilavadame karuṇānidhe |

vaśrīdaścakṣiramāmūrtiruvāca || 

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi rahasyaṃ śriya ādarāt || 3 ||

yacchrutvāpi na rodhīmān pūjyatennidaśairapi |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā śrīvidyaivatataḥ paraṃ || 4 ||

dvayameva mahāsiddhipradamanyaśraṃ vidyate |
vedāṃteṣvapi vedeṣu rahasyaṃ mahadbhutaṃ || 5 ||

māhātmyaṃ lalitāṃ vāyā śṛṇuṣvā vahitāpriye |
brāhmemuhūrte utthāya brahmaraṃdhre nijaṃ guruṃ || 6 ||

<p. 7a>

varābhayakaraṃ śuddhasphāṭekābhaṃ śivātmakaṃ |
nārādhaṇā kṛtivāṃpikhaśaktisahitaṃ vibhuṃ || 7 ||

smṛtvā tatpādayugalavigaladbhiḥ sudharaseḥ |
dhyātvā plāvitamātmānaṃ smaredācāryapādukāṃ || 8 ||

mūlādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ jvalaṃtī parasaṃvidaṃ |
udyatvaḍūryasahasrābhāṃ tejorūpāmatha smaret || 9 ||

tadīya tejaḥ puṃjenapi jarokṛta vigrahaḥ |
brahmavidyāṃ prajaptvādau bhagavadraśmimālikāṃ || 10 ||

traipurī raśmimālāṃ ca saṃsmṛtya girikanyake smṛtvā |
dvādaśadhā vidyāṃ śriyaḥ sakalasiddhidā || 11 ||

vahirnirgatya mūlādi visarjana mathācaret |
mukhaprakṣālanādīni kṛtvā campa prayatnataḥ || 12 ||
 
prāṇānāyamya saṃkalpya snātyā nadyā mataḥ |
paraṃtoyāṃjaliṃ tridhā mūlamuccāryā śirasi kṣipet || 13 ||

mūlābhimaṃtritā āpastridhā pītvā tataḥ paraṃ |
tridhā sutartha mūlena lalitāṃ vānnayīmayo || 14 ||

tridhā saṃmārjya mūlo vāsaso parighāya ca |
nityasaṃdhyāmupāsyātha drāṁ hrīṁ draṁ sa itīrayet || 15 ||

mārtāṃḍa bhairavāyeti prakāśeti tataḥ paraṃ |
bhaktyādya sahitāyeti vahijāyāmathoccaret || 16 ||

anayā ravi gāyatryā savinnorghyāṃ tridhāryayet |
ravimaṃḍalamadhyetha smṛtvā śrīcakramādarāt || 17 ||

vāgnavaṃdhījamuccāryapadaṃnnirasuṃdari |
vidmeha padamuccārya kāmarāja mataḥ paraṃ || 18 ||

pīṭhakāmini śabdaṃ ca dhīmahīti tataḥ paraṃ |
śaktivījaṃ samuccārya tannaḥ klinna pracodayāt || 19 ||

anayā lalitā vāyai dadyādarghyaṃ tata stridhā |
athācārya padāṃbhoja dvitayaṃ sarvakāmadaṃ || 20 ||

brahmaṃ raṃdhre sahasrāre dhyātvā natvāmunaḥ prunaḥ |
kumārīṃ prajapadādau yathā śaktyā girīṃdraje || 21 ||

annapūrṇāmatha smṛtvā vidyāmaśvāsanāmatha |
pādukā saṃsmaret paścānmūlācāryasya siddhidā || 22 ||

rāmodāśārathiḥ sāmīvidyākulaguruḥ smṛtaḥ |
sa eva saccidānanṃdanātha ācārya īśvaraḥ || 23 ||

tatpādukāma japtvāyaḥ śrīvidyāṃ saṃtataḥ japet |
kalpakoṭi śatenāpi na siddhistasya jāyate || 24 ||

<p. 7b>

yosaudāśarapiḥ sākṣādbhagavān jānakī patiḥ |
vogaṃvaśinī tatpādukā manusmṛtya śrīvidyāmanvahaṃ japet || 25 ||

āsane samyagosīnaḥ prāṇānāyamya vāgyatāḥ |
śrīvidyājasakalpaṃ kuryādādau yatavrataḥ || 26 ||

dakṣiṇāmūrtināmāmṛṣīrasyokta īśvaraḥ |
chaṃdaḥ pāḍūmiti prāhurdevatā vinmayī parā || 27 ||

śrīmahātripuretyutktāsuṃdarī paradevatā || 30 ||

lalitā śrīmahābhaṭṭārikā lakṣmīrūpayīmayī || 28 ||

devatā kathitā sarvajagabhyātā maheśvarī || 31 ||

vāgbhavaṃ prathamaṃ khaṃḍavījamuktaṃ trayīmayaṃ || 29 ||

śaktyādyaṃ śaktikhaṃḍaṃ ca śaktirityucyate śriyaḥ || 32 ||

kāmādyaṃ kāmarājaṃ ca kīlakaṃ samudāhṛtaṃ || 30 ||

śrīdevīlalitāprītyai viniyoga udāhṛtaḥ |
śrīkaṃṭhānaṃtatātoyai dvirāvṛtyāṃgulīṣvatha || 31 ||

madhyamāṃguli mārabhyatalāṃtaṃ vinyasecchive |
śrīvidyāṣvadevīlalitā protyai viniyoga udāhṛtaḥ |
śrīcakramaṃtrāṇāṃ vāṅmāyāyā kamalāpuraḥ || 32 ||

ācārya vinyaseccakre pūjanapi samācaret |
kumārikā dvirāvṛtyā ṣaḍaṃganyā samācaret || 33 ||

aṃtarvahirmātṛkā ca nyasedapi tataḥ paraṃ |
vaśinyādyaṣṭa kanyā saṃtataḥ kuryādananyadhīḥ || 34 ||

tārannitayamuccāryakharaṣoḍakāśa tataḥ |
uccāryābhāgaṃtyaṃ bhūsaṃsthaṃ vāmakarṇa samānvitaṃ || 35 ||

viṃduyuktaṃ varārohevaśinī vījavuddhṛtaṃ |
uccārya vaśinoti padaṃ tataḥ || 36 ||

vāgdeva vā padaṃ paścāccaturthī hṛdayānvitaṃ |
anena śirasi nyasyaka varga proccaredatha || 37 ||

brahmabhūbhavaneśānī padaṃ kāmeśvarītyatha uvāgdevapadaṃ |
paścāccaturthī hṛdagdevatā padaṃ paścāccaturthyaṃtaṃ namonvitaṃ || 38 ||

vinyasyāpi lalāṭetha ca vargaṃ proccaredapi |
mātabhūmi sudhārūḍhaṃ vidruvāmākṣi saṃyutaṃ || 39 ||

modinī vāgdevatāyai namo bhūmadhyame nyaset |
ṭadhargovasudhārūḍhaṃ vāyuṃ ṣaṣṭa samanvitaṃ || 40 ||

vimalāvāgdevatāvai namaḥ kaṃṭhetha vinyaset |
tavargaṃ cakravagāṃtyiṃ vaikuṃṭhārūṭhamapyatha || 41 ||

<p. 8a>

vāmākṣirvidrasahitamaruṇā padamapyatha |
vāgdevatā padaṃ paścāccaturthyaṃtaṃ namonvitaṃ || 42 ||

hṛdinyasya yavagaṃ cihasalavyūmanaḥ paraṃ |
jayinī vārgdevatāyai namo nābhauma vinyaset || 43 ||

yakārādi caturvarṇān vā yutaṃdra samānvitaṃ |
saviṭharuvākarṇa ca tataḥ sarveśvaropadaṃ || 44 ||

vāgdevatāpadaṃ paścāccaturthyaṃtaṃmonvitaṃ |
liṃgenyasya śakarādi ṣaṭkakṣmīmiti vījakaṃ || 45 ||

kaulinī vāgdevatāyai namo mūletha vinyaset |
vaśinyādyaṣṭakanyāsa uktoyaṃ sarvasiddhidaḥ || 46 ||

anena nyāsa yogena saṃvatsaramataṃtadritaḥ |
vācāṃ siddhi samāsādya saṃpadāmāśrayo bhavet || 47 ||

mūdvi mūle ca hṛdaye locana tritayepyatha |
śrutidvaye ca vadane bhujayugme tataḥ paraṃ || 48 ||

pṛṣṭe jānu yuge viṃdu namoṃtānvīja pūrvakān |
mūlavidyākṣarāntyasma sākṣādbrahmamayo bhavet || 49 ||

nyāsepi vakrapūjāyāṃ vāṇīmāpāramānvitāṃ |
sarvepi mātrā uccāryā devatābhāva siddhaye || 50 ||

ghātṛkā dvitayaṃ nyasya nyasya vāgdevatāṣṭakaṃ |
mūlavidyākṣaranyāsaṃ nyasya sākṣājjagātpatiḥ || 51 ||

parabrahmathayo brahmaviṣṇurudrākṛtirbhavet |
ṣoḍānyāsama kṛtvāpi śrocanyāsamapyatha || 52 ||

akṛtvāpi ca kṛtvā vā dhyāye cidrūpiṇīṃ parāṃ |
ṣoḍā śrīcakra vinyāsau durlabhau bhuvanatraye || 53 ||

māsāṃtarepya sau kṛtvā brahmarūpi na saṃśayaḥ |
naitya kanyā sa ukroyaṃ samastaphalasiddhidaḥ || 54 ||

nyāsatrayamidaṃ nityaṃ vinyasyādau dine japtvā |
viyāmimāṃ sākṣātparabrahmasvarūpiṇī || 55 ||

śivaviṣṇūkṛtissākṣāsa bhavet parameśvaraḥ |
itthaṃ vinyasya vidhivannyāsajālaṃ dine dine || 56 ||

tejomayī trayī rūpādhyāyeddevī śriyavarāṃ tataḥ |
padmanibhādevīṃ vālārkakiraṇāruṇāṃ ||56 ||

japākusumasaṃkāśīdāḍimī kusumopamāṃ |
padmarāga pratīkāśāṃ kuṃkumādarasannibhī || 57 ||

sphuranmukuṭamāṇikya kiṃkiṇī jālamaṃḍitāṃ |
kolāli kulasakāśa kuṭilāla kaṣaluvīṃ || 58 ||

<p. 8b>

gnāruṇa saṃkāśavadanāṃbhoja maṃḍalāṃ |
kiṃcidardedu kuṭilalalāṭa mḍupaṭṭikā || 59 ||

pināki dhanuṣākāra bhrūlatāṃ parameśvarīṃ |
ānaṃdamuditollāsa līlāṃdolita locanāṃ || 60 ||

sphuran mayūraṃ saṣāta vilasaddhesaddhema kukudulāṃ |
khaṃgaḍamaṃḍitā bhogajitedvamṛtaṃ kuṃḍalāṃ || 61 ||

piśvakarmāti nirmāṇa sūtrasuspaṣṭa na nāsikāṃ |
tāmravidrumaviṃvābha raktāmṛtarasādhanāṃ || 62 || 

dāḍimī vījasaṃkāśadaṃjipakta virājitāṃ |
raktayā jagadbhāsi jihvāṃ madhurabhāṣiṇīṃ || 63 ||

smitamādhuryavijitamādhurya rasasāgarāṃ |
anūpama guṇopeta cuvukoddeśa śobhitāṃ || 64 ||

kaṃvugnīvāṃ mahādevī mṛṇālala lalitairbhujaiḥ |
raktotpala dalākāra sukumāra karāṃvujī || 65 ||

karāṃvuja nakhajyotsnā vitānita narbhasthalā |
muktā hāralatopeta samunnatayodharī || 66 ||

trivalovalanāyukta madhye daśa suśobhitāṃ |
lavaṇya sa tilāvartākāranābhi vibhūṣitāṃ || 67 ||

anarghya ratnakhacitakāṃcīyuta nitaṃvino |
vitaṃ varvivadviradaromaṇajī varāṃśukāṃ || 68 ||

kadalī lalitastaṃbha sukumārorumīśvarī |
kaṃdarpa kadalītulya jaṃghāyugalamaṃḍitī || 69 ||

gūḍhagulphaya dvaṃdva prapadāṣajitakachayāṃ |
tanudīrghāṃgulībhokhannakha caṃdravirājitāṃ || 70 ||

brahmaviṣṇu śiroratna nighṛṣṭa caraṇāṃvujāṃ |
śītāṃśu śatasaṃkāśakāṃti saṃtānahāsinī || 71 ||

lauhityajita siṃdūrajapā dāḍimṛrāgiṇīṃ |
raktavastraparīdhānāṃ pāśāṃkuśa karāghanāṃ || 72 ||

raktapuṣpa niviṣṭāṃ ca ratnābharaṇabhūṣitāṃ |
caturbhujāṃ trinetrāṃ ca vāṇadhanurddharāṃ || 73 ||

karpūraśakalonmiśratāṃkūlāṃ pūritānanāṃ |
mahāmṛgamadoddāma kuṃkumāruṇavignahāṃ || 74 ||

sarvaśṛṃgāviṣāmāṃsavī laṃkārabhūṣitāṃ |
jagadāhvādajatojadraṃjanakāriṇī || 75 ||

<p. 9a>

jagadākarṣaṇakarīṃ jagatkāriṇī rūpiṇī |
sarvamaṃtramayī devīṃ sarvasaubhāgyasuṃdarī || 76 ||

sarvalakṣmīmayī nityāṃ paramānaṃdaditīṃ |
vaṃde pāśāṃkuśābhīṣṭyaṃ ca vāṇadhabhurddharāṃ || 77 ||

raktāṃgaśamaveṣāḍhyā padmasthā parameśvarīṃ |
vālārkamaṃḍalābhāsāṃ catuvuddhi trilocana || 78 ||

pāśāṃkuśarāṃścāpaṃ dhārayaṃtī śivāśraye || 79 ||

caturbhuje caṃdrakalāvataṃse kuconnate kukumarāgaśoṇe |
yudekṣu cāpāṃkuśapāśavāṇahaste namaste jagodakamātaḥ || 80 ||

aruṇāṃ karuṇātaraṃgitāk.īghṛta pāśāṃkuśayu ca vāṇacāpāṃ |
aṇidibhirāvṛtāṃ mayūkhairaharmityevavimā bhāvayebhavānī || 81 ||

kadaṃvavana madhyagāṃ kanakamaṃ sthitāṃ ṣaḍaṃvuruhavāsinīṃ satasiddhi 
saudāminī |
nitavita ujayāruciṃ viśadacaṃdacūḍāmaṇi trilocana kaduṃvinī 
tripurasuṃdarīmāśraye || 82 ||

sa kuṃkumavilayanāmalakacuṃvikastūrikāṃ samaṃdahasitekṣaṇāṃ 
saśakhāyayākuśāṃ |
aśeṣajanamohinī saruṇa mālyābhūṣo jvalāṃ japākusumabhāsurāṃ japavidhau 
smarāmyaṃvikāṃ || 83 ||

ikṣu kārmuka puṣpeṣu pāśāṃkuśa dharāparāṃ |
udyat sūryanibhāṃ vaṃde mahātripurasuṃdarī || 84 ||

sudhāccaukalpakodyāneratnamaṃjya madhyagā |
amṛtānaṃda saṃdoha sayutyaitā bhajāmyahaṃ || 85 ||

dhyātvettha mātṛkā lakṣmī mātripurasuṃdarī |
yavoya cārān kṛtvātha daśamudrāḥ pradarśya || 86 ||

sahasraṃ prajaped vidyāmatha paṃcaśatuṃ tu yātriśātaṃ prajapennitya |
maṣṭauttaraśataṃ tu vāmahatī siddhimāsādya sākṣadvratyamayo bhavet || 87 ||

paścimadvārage liṃgavṛṣaśūnyai śivālaye |
nārāyaṇālaye vāpi parvatāgnetha vā śuciḥ || 88 ||

ācārya sannidhau vāpi japellakṣatrayaśriyaṃ || 89 ||

daśāṃśatarpayedvidvān kiṃśukairājyalolitaiḥ || 89 ||

daddaśāṃśaṃ hunedagnau madhutritayamiśritaiḥ |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoje datvā sasyayutāṃ maho || 90 ||

caturvṛṣabha saṃyuktāṃ vahudākṣiṇayāyutāṃ |
kuḍaladvitayaṃ datvā śrīvidyāyāḥ phalapradā || 91 ||

<p. 9b>

mṛhatī siddhimāsādya sarvabhāgya nidhirbhavat |
athavāgnahaṇe prāpte savituḥ śaśinī pivā || 92 ||

dinatrayaṃmitāhāra sahasraṃ niśatādhikaṃ |
japtvā tatsparśa samaye snātvā nadyāṃ samāhitaḥ || 93 ||

ācārya caraṇadvaṃdva prākṣālita jalīvet |
ācārya sannidhāvagnau vidhivat saskṛte śubhe || 94 ||

triśatādhika sāhasraṃ huvadyāṃ samāhitaḥ nehavyājyamādarāt |
madhu tritaya saṃmiśraghṛta saṃmiśra kiṃśukaiḥ || 95 ||

(****) athavā juhuyād vahnau japādibhiḥ |
brahmāpāṇāhutiṃ kṛtvā namaskṛtyāgnimādarāt || 96 ||

ācārya caraṇadvaṃdvṛsāṣṭāṃgaṃ praṇipatya ca |
ṣaṣṭi cihnuka sauvarṇa kuṃḍala dvitayaṃ śubhaṃ || 97 ||

divyaratna samāyuktaṃ datvācāryasya karṇāyoḥ |
vasudhāṃsasya saṃpūrṇaṃ datvā dakṣiṇayānvitāṃ || 98 ||

siddhimāpnoti vidyāyā devānāmapi durlabhā |
nidhissakalavidyānāmādhārassarvasaṃpadāṃ || 99 ||

samṛddhi mahatīṃ prāpya putrapautrādi saṃyutāṃ |
aṇimādyaṣṭa siddhīnye nāyako jagatīpatiḥ || 100 ||

bhūtvā virāyurvijayo sarvajñassubhagasmukhī |
ācāryapatnī śrīvudhyāvāsolaṃkaraṇādibhiḥ || 101 ||

avaśyamarccayeddhīmān puraścaraṇasiddhaye |
itthaṃ kṛtvā puraścaryā lalitāyāṃ mama priye || 102 ||

kaṃdarpa sadṛśaḥ kāṃtyā dhanadena samaḥ śriyā |
bhūtvāṃte paramadhīmayātiṃvaśa samanvitaḥ || 103 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasyadāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahatta uttarabhagi 
tṛtīyodhyāyaḥ] || 3 ||
<p. 9b>

śrīdakṣiṇamūrtiruvāca ||

śṛṇadevi pravakṣyāmi śriyaḥ sādhanamuttamaṃ |
yacchatvāpi narasyarva saubhāgyaibhāgyaikanidhirbhavet || 1 ||

yenānena vidhānena sādhakena dine dine |
japyate lalitā vidyā śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarī || 2 ||

niyamāt triśataṃ bhattā cakraṃ saṃpūjya sādaraṃ |
sasnaṃ cakramabhyarvya madhyacakramathāpivā || 3 ||

<p. 10a>

deśe vā nāgatenāme jagatkṣobhaḥ prajāyate |
jvalatkāmāgni saṃtāpa pratamāstaptamānasāḥ || 4 ||

pililikādinyāthena dūrādāyātiyoṣitaḥ |
maṃtrasaṃṣūḍha hṛdayoḥ sphuratjaghanamaṃḍalāḥ || 5 ||

taddarśanān mahādevi jāyaṃte sarvayopitaḥ |
ekāmapi puraścaryā kṛtvā sāgā mama priye || 6 ||

niyatastriśataṃ japtvā śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarī |
madhyaṃ vā cakramabhyarcya vaidike jātavedasi || 7 ||

raśmimaṃtraiḥ sakṛcchatvā nityābhiśca tataḥ para |
gurubhiśca sakṛcchrutvā hyaṣṭāviṃśatidhā śriyā || 8 ||

itthamācarato nityaṃ sādhakasya mahītala |
kaṃdarpasadṛśīkātirjāthotanyakalevo || 9 ||

aśīti varṣavṛddhīpi yuvā bhavati saṃtataṃ |
navaratna samāyukta mukuṭhāvṛtamastakāḥ || 10 ||

prayacchatopi vā sevate tānnareśvarāḥ |
jvalatkāmāgni saṃtaptāḥ sauṃdaryamadagarvitāḥ || 11 ||

āyāṃtitena kriḍārthamatha bhūyāṃganā api |
saṃpadasmakalā divyā mānuṣā api saṃpadaḥ || 12 ||

kauveryassaṃpadopyasya gṛhatiṣṭaṃti saṃtataṃ |
jaḍastādho maṃdamatirapi prajñā vivarjitaḥ || 13 ||

ācārya kṛpayā sākṣāt sarvavidyānidhirbhayet |
gaṃgāpravāhavattasyavāgvibhūtirvijṛṃbhate || 14 ||

anugnaho bhavedyannasopi  vidyānidhirbhavet |
vyāsavālmīki sadṛśaḥ sarakhatyā bhavatyasau || 15 ||

prāpnoti durlabhān bhogāvatha divyāṃśca mānuṣān |
vaṃśābhivṛddhi sahito bhavatyā caṃdatārakaṃ || 16 ||

cirāyurmahadārogyaṃ prāpyakadarpa sannibhaḥ |
vaśīkaroti trailokyaṃ yāvajjīvaṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 17 ||

dehāṃte paramaṃdhāma yāti devaiśca durlabhaṃ |
kṣamātreyaṃ japte tu kṣubhyate bhūte leṃganaḥ || 18 ||

suṃdayo madamannāścataruṇyo hariṇakṣaṇāḥ |
yadi na kṣubhyate davi sādhakasya manāmanāk || 19 ||

saṃkṣubhyaṃte tataḥ sarvāḥ pātāle nāgakanyakāḥ |
tāsāmapi yadā nāsau kṣobhaneti manāgapi || 20 ||

tataṃ svarganivāsinyo vidravaṃti surāṃganāḥ |
gaṃdharvakanyākinnarayorūpavatyau manoharāḥ || 21 ||

<p. 10b>

itthaṃ lakṣatayaṃ japtvā sādhakasthismānasaḥ |
saṃkṣobhayati viśveśīnnaikyaṃ sa carācaraṃ || 22 ||

lakṣatraya japaṃ kṛtvā ṣaṣṭi cihnukīdanajaṃ |
divyaratna śamāyuktaṃ kuṃḍalayamuttamaṃ || 23 ||

ācāryakarṇayordatvā vahusasyamākulāṃ |
vahudakṣiṇayā yuktāṃ pradatvātha vasuṃdharāṃ || 24 ||

ācāryapatnyaitādaṃkāragha laṃkārān samarpayet |
sūkṣmaṃ vāso yugaṃ datvā kṣauma kāryāsakaṃ tu vā || 25 ||

avaśyaṃ mahatītiddhiṃ daivatairapi durlabhāṃ |
prāpnotpanna na saṃdehasmatyaṃ satyaṃ vadāmyahaṃ || 26 ||

athavāgnahaṇe kṛtvā puraścaryā puroditāṃ |
siddhimāsādya mahatīṃ sarvabhāgya nidhirbhavet || 27 ||

athātassaṃpravakṣyāmi vratāṃtaramanuttamaṃ |
kathita sarvadeṣursavaśāstreṣvapi priye || 28 ||

mahāpātakasaṃghātāṃ nāśanaṃ saṃpadāspadaṃ |
sarvasiddhipradaṃ sadyo mahāsaubhāgya siddhidaṃ || 29 ||

āśvinemāsi sumahannavarātrābhidhaṃ vrataṃ |
caitrepi navarātrākhyaṃ vratamasti mahattaraṃ || 30 ||

tasminvrate puraścaryāṃ kṛtvā sādhaka puṃgavaḥ |
saṃprāpya nahatī siddhi daivatairāye pūjyate || 31 ||

pratipaddina mārabhya navamyaṃtamadyāpahaṃ |
navarātravrataṃ proktaṃ samastābhīṣṭa siddhidaṃ || 32 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ pratipaddivase priye |
sāṣṭāṃgaṃ daṃḍavannatvā tadanujñā purasmaraṃ || 33 ||

prātasnātvā vibhudvātmā nityasaṃdhyāmupāsya ca |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ natvā brahmavile śubhe || 34 ||

āsane samyagā sonaḥ kumāryādi caturmanūn |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā vāpi na raptvādau niyatavrataḥ || 35 ||

prāṇāyāmaṃtridhā kṛtvā tataḥ saṃkalpapūrvakaṃ |
varṇasāhasraṃkhyāka saṃkalpa navarātrake || 36 ||

kṛtvā pūrvoditā nyāsān dhyātvā bhagavato śriyaṃ |
japtvā samastācaraṇasahitaṃ cakramarcayet || 37 ||

raśmimaṃtrai sakṛddhutvā nityābhirgurubhismakṛt |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityaṃn hunecchī vidyayānala || 38 ||

suvasinyaḥ samabhyarcya nityamekottarāḥ |
piye ekaiko vā samabhyarkanityamatra suvāsini || 39 ||

<p. 11a>

ekakālaṃmitāhāro bhūtvā nityamalaṃ kṛtaḥ |
tāṃvūla carvaṇarato nityamādhāryapūjakaḥ || 40 ||

mahānavamyāṃ prāptāyāmācāryājñā purasmaraṃ |
vidhivat saṃskṛte vahau raśmimaṃtrai sakṛddhunet || 41 ||

nityābhirgurubhirhutvā sakṛdeva tataḥ paraṃ |
kiṃśukairhṛtasamiśraiḥ kamalairvāghṛtaplutaiḥ || 42 ||

utpalairmaśrairvā kevalena ghṛtena vā |
athavā pāyasenāgnau madhvājya sahitena ca || 43 ||

tila vilvavimiśraiṇa sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ |
hutvā śrīvidyayā lakṣmīvidyayāṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ || 44 ||

prasanna lakṣmīmanunā triśaktyā ca tataḥ paraṃ |
sāmrājya lakṣmīmanunāpyaṣṭottaraśaṃ hunet || 45 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣareṇāpi śatamaṣṭottaraṃ tataḥ |
hutvā japādibhirhutvā kṛtvā brahmārpaṇāktyāṃ hutiṃ || 46 ||

pradakṣiṇāṃ namaskṛtya jvalitaṃ jātavedasaṃ |
svācārya caraṇadvaṃdvaṃ natvā sāṣṭāṃgamādarāt || 47 ||

karṣadvayamitaṃ hemaṣaṣṭiṃ cihnakameva vā |
kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ kṛtvā divyaratna samanvitaṃ || 48 ||

ācāryakarṇayordatvā vahu samākulāṃ |
vahudakṣiṇayā yuktāmācāryāya samarpayet || 49 ||

savatsagodvayaṃ datvā dākṣiṇānvitamādarāt |
dukūlaṃ vātha kāryā sasūkṣma vā sasmamarpya || 50 ||

sākṣāchī lalitāṃ vudhyā dhyātvācāryasya vallabhāṃ |
tāṭaṃka svarṇaciṃtākādyalaṃkaraissuśobhanaiḥ ||51 ||

vāsaubhiśca samabhyarcya sāṃgaśo cakramarcayet |
aśaktena daridreṇāpyavaśyaṃ niṣkapaṃcakaṃ || 52 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdve dātavyaṃ girikanyake |
ācāryapatnyai niṣkaṃ vā su varṇa vā sasārpayet || 53 ||

atha bhojyāḥ suvāsinyomiṣṭānmairdakṣiṇādibhiḥ |
itthaṃ kṛtvā puraścaryā navarātravate śubhe || 54 ||

avaśyaṃ mahatī siddhiṃ saṃprāpnoti na saṃśayaḥ |
paladvayamitaṃ raupyapātraṃ ṣalamitaṃ tu vā || 55 ||

kṛtvācārya padāṃbhoja dvitayaṃ praṇipat sava |
yāgadavyaṃ pradadyādyaḥ sa eva parameśvaraḥ || 56 ||

tadanvaya samudratā śatasāhaśopi ca |
brahmaloke ca satyeva magnāśca narakārṇave || 57 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdve yāgadravya pradāyakaḥ |
mahānavamyāṃ tatpuṇyaphalaṃ vaktuṃ na śakyate || 58 ||

<p. 11b>

teneṣṭamaścamedhānāṃ śataṃ saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇaṃ |
tulāpuruṣasāhasraṃ kṛtaṃ tena na saṃśayaḥ || 59 ||

śrottiyāsya daridrāyatanāhānaṣamīndine |
vivāhārthaṃ dhanaṃ datvā gosahasraphalaṃ labhet || 60 ||

yāvaṃtaḥ pāṃśavo bhūme yāvaṃto vṛṣṭi vidavaḥ |
tāvatkasahesrāṇi kulānāṃ śatasaṃprutaḥ || 61 ||

vaikuṃṭheramate divyakanyā sāhasrasaṃyutaḥ |
avaśyaṃ vasudhādānaṃ kuṃḍaladayasaṃyutaṃ || 62 ||

mahānavamyāṃ kartavyaṃ sāṃgadakṣiṇāyāncitaṃ |
ācāryapatnyalaṃkāradānamāvaśyakaṃ smṛtaṃ || 63 ||

navarātravrate kṛtvā puraścaryāmimāṃ priye |
puraścaryā śataphalaṃ prāpnotyakhilasiddhidaṃ || 64 ||

saptadvīpavato bhūmiṃ dhanaratnaudyasaṃkulāṃ |
datvāya phalamāpnoti svācāryacaraṇadvaye || 65 ||

mahānavamyāṃ vasudhāṃ datvā tatphalamaśrute |
mahīpratinidhirdravyamathavā guraverpayet || 66 ||

dakṣiṇādravyasahitaṃ kuṃḍaladvitayānvitaṃ |
mahīpratinidhi dravyaṃ śataniṣkamudāhṛtaṃ || 67 ||

tadardhaṃ vā tadardha vā tadardhārdhamathāpi vā |
dakṣiṇādravyadravyamayuktaṃ tathaiva girikanyoke || 68 ||

kuṃḍaladvayamācārtha karṇayugme samartha ca |
maheṃdrasadṛśī lakṣmī prāpnotyavana saṃśayaḥ || 69 ||

ācāryapatnai śrīvudhyā datvālaṃkaraṇādikaṃ |
subhagaḥ suṃdarovāgmīśriyaḥ putro bhavatyasau || 70 ||

itthaṃ kṛtvā puraścaryāṃ navarātre mama priye |
sākṣādbrahmamayaḥ siddho bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 71 ||

śriyamaiva labhennityamacalāṃ dhanasaṃkulāṃ |
daṃdarpa śatasaubhāgyaṃ jaga ayavaśaṃkaraṃ || 72 ||

saṃprāpya sarvavidyānāmadhiyo jīvasannibhaḥ |
vahukālamaiso jīvatyāpurorāgyaṃsataḥ || 73 ||

pūjyate devaṃ sadyaiśca yogibhiṣya imarṣibhiḥ |
prārthyate divyakanyābhiraharniśamesau priye || 74 ||

śrīcakrapūjānirataḥ śrīcakrapūjānirataḥ |

śrīvidyājapa tatparaḥ 

sa evāhaṃ na saṃdehasya eva hariracyutaḥ || 75 ||

<p. 12a>

sa eva muktassa brahmā sa eva jagatīpatiḥ |
yasyā vārye dṛḍhā bhaktiḥ śrīvidyāyāṃ ca saṃtataṃ || 76 ||

sa brahmassaśidṛssākṣāt sa eva bhagavān hariḥ |
navarātravrate vidyā siddhirbhavṛtiyādṛśī || 77 ||

puraścaryāśatena siddhyati tathā priye |
ācāryaniṃdākartāramapi svapitaraṃ guruṃ || 78 ||

daṃḍayedavicoryeva pāpabhāganyathā bhavet |
ācāryaniṃdā śravaṇāddevatāśāpa bhāgasau || 79 ||

pitaraṃ mātaramapi bhrātaṃ ravīdhavaṃ sutaṃ |
ācāryaniṃdākartāraṃ daṃḍayaida vicārayan || 80 ||

karṇepidhāya gaṃtavyama śakte vānyataḥ priye |
itthaṃ kṛtvā puraścaryāṃ japet sāhasramanvahaṃ || 81 ||

prativarṣaṃ puraścayo kṛtvaikāmapi sādhakaḥ |
sahasraṃ prajapennityaṃ triśataṃ vā catuḥśataṃ || 82 ||

dṛṣṭvā karoti vāgīśaṃ jaḍaṃ maṃdamatituṃ vā |
dṛṣṭyā karoti dāridyai sahitaṃ ca śriyaḥ patiṃ || 83 ||

dṛṣṭyai vā karṣayannārīrdivyājapi manoharāḥ |
dṛṣṭyā vināśayatyāśu jvarānogāśca dāruṇān || 84 ||

dṛṣṭyā viṣaṃ nāśayati sthāvaraṃ vāthaṃ jagamaṃ |
svacchaṃdamṛtyuḥ sarvatra siddho bhūtvā jagattraye || 85 ||

aṇimādyaṣṭa siddhīnāṃ nāyako viharatyasau |
iti śrījānakīnātha vadanāṃbhojanisṛtaṃ || 86 ||

atiguptataraṃ śāstramuktaṃ tubhyaṃ mayā priye |
ita ūrdhvaṃ mayā devi kiṃ punaḥ śrotumicchasi || 87 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedāsārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye caturthodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 12a>

śrīdevyuvāca ||

maheśa śrotumicchāmi sarvajña karuṇānidhe |
ṣoḍhānyāsa vidhāna ca cakranyāsavidhiṃ tathā || 1 ||

cakroddhāra tathā cakrapūjāsāṃgāmapi prabho |

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi yanmāṃtvaṃ pariṣṭacchasi || 2 ||

api guptataraṃ puṇyamupitubhya vadāmyahaṃ |
ajñātvā samayācāra maya(*)(?) gurupādukā || 3 ||

<p. 12b>

yosminyaṃ pravartate devanāśāyabhāgasau |
brahmatādātmyasaṃ siddhikāraṇaṃ bhuktimuktidaṃ || 4 ||

pūjāsaṃketa madhunā kathayāmita vā nadye |
yasya vijñāna mātreṇa jīvanmuktaḥ prammete || 5 ||

tatra nityoditā pūjā tribhirbhedairvyavaśitā |
parācāpya parāgauri tṛtīyā ca parā parā || 6 ||

prathamādvita bhāvasthā sarvapravaṇe carā |
dvitīyāhya parā pūjā sadā niṣpādyate mayo || 7 ||

śuddhajñānamayā devi tṛtīyākha pradhāmayo |
uttamāsā parā proktā vidhānaṃ śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ || 8 ||

mahāyaśca parā pūjā sadā niṣpādyate ma (*) pradalāṃ tasye vāgbhave gurupādukāṃ 
|
āpyāyī taja śuddhajñānamayodevi tṛtīyākha pradhāmayī uttamāsā parā proktā 
vidhānaṃ śṛṇu sāṃprataṃ || 8 ||

mahāpadmadalāṃ casthe vāgbhadhe gurupādukāṃ |
āpyāyī tajajadrūpāṃ paramāmṛtavarṣiṇīṃ || 9 ||

saṃciṃtya paramādvaita bhāvanā madaghūrṇinaḥ |
dahanāṃtaraṃ sa sarvannādāloka na tatparaṃ || 10 ||

vikalparūpa saṃkalpa vimukhoṃtarmukhassadā |
vitkallolābhi dalitasaṃkocastvati suṃdaraḥ || 11 ||

iṃdriya prīṇanairdravyairvihitakhātmapūjanaḥ |
nyāsaṃ vivartayeheha ṣoḍhānyāsa puraḥsaraṃ || 12 ||

prathamoṃguli vinyāsaḥ ṣaḍaṃkhyo parastathā |
aṃtarvahirmātṛkākhyasṛtīyonyāsa ucyate || 13 ||

vāgdevatāṣṭakanyāsaḥ caturthaḥ siarvasiddhidaḥ |
mūlaṃ vidyākṣaranyāsaṃ paṃcama phaladāyakaḥ || 14 ||

ayaṃ paṃcavidhonyāso vaśyaṃ kāryo dine |
ṣḍhā cakrādikanyāsaṃ kṛtvā kṛtvāpi vānvaha || 15 ||

kṛtvā paṃcavidhaṃ nyāsaṃ mūlavidyāṃ sadā japet |
ṣoḍhānyāsaṃ pravakṣyāmi brahmarūpa phalapradaṃ || 16 ||

sata puṇyaphalaṃ sarvapātakabhaṃjanaṃ |
ṣoḍhānyāsaṃ nāḥ kuryādyena brahmāṃḍanāyakaḥ || 17 ||

virāṭ kharūpī vasyītmā śivaḥ sākṣānna saṃśayaḥ |
gaṇeśai prathamonyāso dvitīyastugnahairmataḥ || 18 ||

tṛtīyastā rajālenathoginībhiścaturthakaḥ |
rāśibhiḥ paṃcamonyāsaḥ ṣaṣṭa pīṭhairnigadyate || 19 ||

ṣoḍhānyāsastvayaṃ proktaḥ sarvannāpya parājitaḥ |
evaṃ yonyastagātraḥ syāt sapūjyaḥ sarvayogitiḥ || 20 ||

<p. 13a>

nārūpasya pūjyo lokeṣu pitṛmātṛ mukhojanaḥ |
sa eva pūjyaṃ sarveṣāṃ sa svayaṃ parameśvaraḥ || 21 ||

ṣoḍhānyāsa vihīnaṃ yaṃ praṇamatyeṣa sādhakaḥ |
socirāt mṛtyumāpnoti narakaṃ ca prapadyate || 22 ||

gurubhyo nama uccārya namet sarvatra saṃtataṃ |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ dhyātvā kuryānnatiṃ sadā || 23 ||

ṣoḍhānyāsa prakāraṃ ca kathayāmita vā nadye |
śravaṇādapi yasyā śujāyaṃte sarvasiddhayaḥ || 24 ||

taruṇāditya saṃkāśān gajavakrāṃsti locanān |
pāśāṃkuśa vā bhītikarān śakti samanvitān || 25 ||

vinyesadvidhivaddehe mātṛkānyāsa ca sriye |
vighneśvarastathā śrīśca vighnarājastathā hriyā || 26 ||

vināyakastathā tuṣṭi śāṃtiṃ yuktaḥ śivāttamaḥ |
vighnakṛtyuṣṭi yuktaśca vighnacca sarasvatī || 27 ||

vighnarāhūti yuktaśca medhā vā nāṇānāyakaḥ |
ekadaṃtaścakāṃtiścāddidaṃtaḥ kāmino yutaḥ || 28 ||

gajavaktrognodīnī ca niraṃjanajaṭhe tathā |
kapardabhṛttathā tīvrādīrghavaktrastataḥ priye || 29 ||

jvālinīsāhitaḥ paścānmaṃthā samarṣadaṇau tataḥ |
pṛṣa dhvajaśca subhagāgaṇanāthena saṃyutā || 30 ||

kāmarūpiṇikāpaścāgajedraḥ śubhrayāyutaḥ |
sūyaṃ karṇaścajayinī trinetraḥ satyayānvitaḥ || 31 ||

laṃvodaraścā vighnauśī mahānaṃda surūpiṇī |
caturmūtiḥ kāmadā ca sadāśivayutā tataḥ || 32 ||

madavihvalalanāmnī ca āmoda vikaṭe tataḥ |
durmadaśca tathā ghūrṇī sumukhā bhūtimāṃstataḥ || 33 ||

pramodaśca tathā bhūmirekayādastathā satī |
dvijihvaścaramāyuktaḥ śūraścaiva tu mānuṣī || 34 ||

vīreṇasahitā paścācchailajema karabjā |
ṣaṇmukhaśca vivarṇā ca varadā bhrukuṭīlatā || 35 ||

vāmadevastathā lajjāt vakratuṃḍastathā niśā |
doghaṃ ghoṇānvitā paścādviraṃḍā vā dhanurdharaṃ || 36 ||

senānoryāminī yuktāgnāmaṇoratri saṃyutaḥ  |
mataśca caṃdrikāyukto vimalaśca śaśiprabhā || 37 ||

mattavāhanaleli ca jaṭī ca capalakṣaṇā |
muṃḍī paścāpaddaṃḍī durbhayānvitaḥ || 38 ||

<p. 13b>

vaṇyaścaiva subhagā vṛṣaketustathā śivā |
bhakṣya priyaśca durgā ca meghanādaśca kālikā || 39 ||

gaṇeśaḥ kālakujvā ca gaṇayau vighnahāriṇī |
etāstu vinyasaddevi mātṛkā varṇavatpriye || 39 ||

mātṛkākṣara pūrvāścagnahanyā saṃvadāmyatha |
raktaṃ śvetaṃ tathā raktaṃ śyāmaṃ pītaṃ ca pāṃḍuraṃ || 40 ||

dhūmrakṛṣṇadhūmraṃ dhūmraṃ viciṃtayet |
dravi mukhyān kāmarūpānkansarvābharaṇabhūṣitān || 41 ||

svarairarkaṃ hṛdinyasya kavargeṇe dumapyatha |
śrūmadhye ca ca vargeṇa bhaumaṃ netra trayenyaset || 42 ||

budhaṃ hṛdi ṭavargeṇa targeṇa vṛhaspatiṃ |
hṛdayoparideveśipargeṇa gale bhṛguṃ || 43 ||

pavargeṇeṃdu mapyatha nābhau rāhuvaktreśa vargeṇaka |
lakṣābhyāṃ tu gude ketuṃ nyasedevaṃ varānane || 44 ||

atha nakṣatrarvṛṃdasyanyāsaṃ kuryāt sukhapradaṃ |
jvalat kālāgni saṃkāśāḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitāḥ || 45 ||

nati pāṇyośvinī mukhyā bhavadābhayapāṇayaḥ |
yugmaṃ yugmaṃ tathā yugmaṃ yugma yugma sarohiṇī || 46 ||

ekamekaṃ tathā dvaṃdvamekaṃ ṣuṣyāṃta mucyate |
laluṭo netrayoḥ paścādvāmadakṣiṇakarṇayoḥ || 47 ||

aṃsadvaye vāmaṃkaṭhe dakṣakaṃṭhe kramānnyaset |
puṣpāṃtaṃ ca pravinyasyaṃ khagārṇābhyāṃ tu sāryakaṃ || 48 ||

dakṣaskaṃdhe dhaṅābhyāṃ tu gadyāṃ saṃdhi dvitīyake |
pūrvāphalgunī dakṣe carparecchaja pūrvikāṃ || 49 ||

uttarāṃ phalgunī vāmakūrpare vinyaset priye |
jha ña varṇasthitaṃ hastaṃ maṇivaṃdhetha dakṣiṇe || 50 ||

<p. 14a>

citrāṃṭhaṭhasthāṃ vāme ca maṇivaṃdhe nyaset priye |
kāreṇayutāṃ svātiṃ dakṣahaste pravinyaset || 51 ||

ḍhaṇayuktāṃ viśākhāṃ tu vāmahaste pravinyaset |
tathadasthāmanūrādhāṃ nābhau vinyasya pārvati || 52 ||

dhvākāreṇa yutāṃ jyeṣṭāṃ nyaseddakṣakaṭau priye |
tapayūsyaṃ tathā mūlaṃ nyased vāmakaṭau priye || 53 ||

pūrvāṣāḍāṃvakoṇadakṣorau vinyasesniṣe |
bhakoraṇottarāṣāḍāṃ vāmorau tadanaṃtaraṃ || 54 ||

makāreṇa yuktaṃ śravaṇaṃ dakṣajānuni vinyāset |
parasthitāṃ dhaniṣṭāṃ tu vāmajānuni vinyaset || 55 ||

lakāreṇa tato devi śatatāṃrānyaset priye |
dakṣajaṃghogatāṃ paścāt pūrvābhādra padāṃ tataḥ || 56 ||

vaśavaṇa sthitāṃ nyasya vā na jaṃghādhagatāṃ kramāt |
ṣasahasthottarā bhādrapadāṃ dakṣiṇapādake || 57 ||

kṣakāreṇa visargādya visargābhyāṃ cārevatī |
vāmapāde pravinyasya yoginī nyāsamāttare || 58 ||

sitāsitāsitarūṇavabhruciprāpītā viciṃtayet |
caturbhujāsaṃmairvaktrauḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitāḥ || 59 ||

ḍāṃ ḍīṃ vījadvayaṃ cotkāḍamalāvarayā priye |
vāmakarṇedunādāḍhyaṃ ḍākinyai nama ityapi || 60 ||

svarāṃte tu pravaktavyaṃmate rakṣapadadvayaṃ |
tvagātmane kaṃṭhadeśe viśuddhau vinyaset priye || 61 ||

kaṭhavarṇe rākinī tu kaṃkārādyakṣauḥ kramāt |
pūrvavadvīja saṃyuktai rasṛṇāt mātra saṃvadet || 62 ||

<p. 14b>

anāhate nyasyenyasenyasyenpaścādukāśādi phakārakaiḥ |
lākinī ca tathā devi māṃsātmā maṇipūke || 63 ||

valavarṇaiḥ kākinī tu khādhimāne tathāvidhāṃ |
bhedasvarūpā vinyasya vasavarṇaistu yākinī || 64 ||

asthirūpāṃ ca pūrvoktavījaṃ dakṣāṃ ca saṃvadet |
hakṣavarṇa sthitāṃ tadvaddhākinī dvidale nyaset || 65 ||

haṃsabdeneveśi tadvadyākinikānyaset |
brahmaraṃdhre maheśāni nyāsoyaṃ yoginī yutaḥ || 66 ||

rāśinyā saṃtataḥ kuryāt sarvarakṣākaraṃ sadā |
raktaṃ śvetaharidvarṇaṃ pāṃḍacitrāsitān smaret || 67 ||

piśaṃga pigalau vabhrakarvurāsitadhūmalān |
akārādi caturvaṇairvinyaset sukhaṃdite || 68 ||

meṣaṃ dakṣiṇagulphe tu tato dvadvena vai vṛṣaṃ |
nyasejjānu nivedaistu mithunaṃ vṛṣaṇe tataḥ || 69 ||

dvābhyāṃ karkāṭakaṃ akṣaudvābhyāṃ skaṃdhe ca |
siṃhakaṃ anusvāra visargābhyāṃ śavargeṇa ca kanyakāṃ || 70 ||

dakṣiṇe ca śiṇe ca śirobhāge vinyasedvīravaṃdite |
tathā dāma śirobhāge kavargeṇa tu lābhṛtā || 71 ||

ca vargeṇa tathārgeṇa tathā skaṃdhe vṛścikaṃ nityaset priye || 69 ||

ṭavergeṇa tathā kukṣau dhanvinaṃ vinyaset priye |
makaraṃ tu tavargeṇa vinyasedvṛṣaṇe kramāt || 70 ||

pavargeṇa tathā kuṃbhaṃ vāma jānuni vinyaset |
yadargeṇa kṣakāreṇa mīnaṃ gulphetha vinyaset || 71 ||

pīṭhāni vinyaseddevi mātṛkāsthānake punaḥ |
teṣā nāmāni kaṣathyaṃte śṛṇuthā vahitā priye || 72 ||

kāmarūpaṃ vā raṇasonaipālaṃ pauṃḍavardhanaṃ |
varasthiraṃ kanyākubjaṃ pūrṇaśailaṃ tathārvudaṃ || 73 ||

<p. 15a>

āmrātakeścaraikāmraṃ śrīsnātaḥ kāmakroṭakaṃ |
kailāsaṃ bhṛgunagaraṃ kaṃdāraṃ caṃdrapūjakaṃ || 74 ||

śrīpīṭhamekārapīdaṃ tālāghraṃ mālavaṃ tathā |
kulūtthaṃ devakūaṃ ca gokarṇamārukteśvaraṃ || 75 ||

aṭṭahāsaṃ vavirajaṃ rājagṛhaṃ mahāpathaṃ |
kollāpuramelāpuramoṃkāraṃ svajayāṃtikaṃ || 76 ||

ujjayanyavicitrākhyaṃ kṣīrakaṃ hastināpuraṃ |
uḍḍīśaṃ ca prayāgākhyaṃ vilvaṃ māyāpuraṃ tathā || 77 ||

jaleśaṃ malayaṃ śailaṃ merugirivaraṃ tathā |
maheṃdravāmanaṃ caiva hiraṇyapurameva ca || 78 ||

mahālakṣmīpuroḍyaṇaṃ chāyāchatramataḥ paraṃ |
ete pīṭhāsmaddiṣṭā mātṛkārūpamāsthitā || 79 ||

uktaḥ ṣoḍābhidhanyāso brahmasārūpya siddhidaḥ |
kṛtvā ṣoḍābhidhaṃ nyāsāṃ virāḍatmāhariskhayaṃ || 80 ||

sākṣāt paraśivākāro bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ |
ṣoḍānyāsamimaṃ kṛtvā śrīcakranyāsamācarebhet || 81 ||

nyastena yena bhavati brahmarūpī jagatpatiḥ |
navayonyabhidhaṃ nyasedādauma priye || 82 ||

śrotrayo śruvuke caiva śaṃkhyasyeṣu dṛśornasi |
hṛṃsadvaye ca hṛdayenyaset kūrparakukṣiṣu || 83 ||

jānyaṃdhu pādaguhyeṣu pāśvahṛtsusta na dvaye |
sakaṃṭhe navayonyākhyaṃ nyasedvīja trayātmakaṃ || 84 ||

punarvālāṃ samuccārya śrīvidyāṃ paritonyaset |
punarvālāṃ samuccārya caturasraṃ viciṃtayet || 85 ||

golakanyā sa yogena śrīcakraṃ pariciṃtayet |
ṣaṭcakreṣu lalāṭe ca sīmaṃte ca nirāvile || 86 ||

navasthāneṣu saṃkalpya nyasedvevi tataḥ paraṃ |
śrīvidyāṃ brahmaraṃdhre ca pṛṣṭatto guravaḥ kramāt || 87 ||

tithinityāstatau devi mātṛkā kharasaṃyutāḥ |
kharaparvenyasedvakte sarvasaubhāgyadāyakaḥ || 88 ||

<p. 15b>

prakaṭādyannyaset paścādā dhārādiṣu maṃtravit |
aṃtaḥ śrīcakra vinyāsa uktoyaṃ sarvasiddhidaḥ || 89 ||

aṃtaḥ śrīcakravibhyāsaṃ kṛtvā sakṛdapi priye |
brahmaviṣṇumaheśādyairapi lokeṣu pūjyate || 90 ||

vāhya śrīcakra vinyāsaṃ śṛṇumatprāṇavallabhe |
yasya vijñānatṇe vāpi brahmarūpī bhavatyasau || 91 ||

mahānipurasuṃdaryāścakranyāsaṃ śṛṇu priye |
ghannavusya vidākhyātaṃ sarvasiddhikaraṃ paraṃ || 92 ||

caturasrādye rakhāyai nama ityādito nyaset |
dakṣā sa pṛṣṭhaṣṭha pārāyagrasthitapārāgulodyatha || 93 ||

vāmāṃdhruguliṣusthi kvapāṇyayecāṃ saṣṭhaṣṭhake |
samūlatala pṛṣṭhayuvyāpakakatvena suṃdari || 94 ||

atraivasthānadaśake aṇimādyāḥ pravinyaset |
siddhāṃstadaṃtaśca tanu vyāpakatvena suṃdari || 95 ||

caturasra madhyarekhāyai nama ityapi vallabhe |
vinyasya tasyā sthāneṣu brāhmāṇyādyāstathāṣṭasu || 96 ||

pādāṃguṣṭha dvaye pārśve vakṣe śūrvyaṃnyapārśvake |
vāmadakṣiṇa jānvośca vahiraṃsadvaye tathā || 97 ||

nyasyātha caturasrāta rekhāyai nama ityapi |
vinyased vyāpakatvena pūrvoktā tasya vigrahe || 98 ||

tasyāsthaniṣu daśasumudrāṇāṃ daśakanyaset |
brahmāṇyādyaṣṭa sthānītasthā mānaṣṭānnyasedatha || 99 ||

śiṣṭeddhe dvādaśāṃte ca pādāṃguṣṭhe ca vinyaset |
tadaṃtaḥ ṣoḍaśadala padmāya nama ityapi || 100 ||

vinyata dale kāmākarpiṇyādyāśca vinyaset |
dalāni dakṣiṇa śrotra pṛsṭamaṃsaṃ ca kūrparaṃ || 101 ||

karapṛṣṭa coruttāmugulpha pādadalaṃ tathā |
vāmapādatalādyevameva devāṣṭakaṃ mataṃ || 102 ||

tadaṃtare cāṣṭadala padmāya nama ityapi |
vinyasetra daleṣveṣu dakṣaśaṃkhe ca jatruke ||103 ||

truvata gulphaṇulphorujatra śaṃkhai ca vāmataḥ |
anekusumādyāśca śaktīraṣṭāraṣṭā ca vinyaset || 104 ||

tadaṃtaścaturdaśāra cakrāyatamatyapi |
vinyaset tasya koṇeṣu nyasecchakrīścaturdaśa || 105 ||

sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇī mukhyāstasya koṇāni vacārha |
lalāhdakṣabhāgaṃ ca dakṣagaṃḍī sa madhyataḥ || 106 ||

pārśvāṃtarūrujaṃghāṃtarvāmataṃ yādi pārvati |
vāmorvatarvāna pārśva vāmāsaṃ vāmagaṃḍakaṃ || 107 ||

lalāṭa vāmabhāgaṃ ca tathā vai pṛṣṭhamityapi |
tatādaśoracakrāya nama ityapi pārvati || 108 ||

asya doṇādi dakṣokṣi nāsā mūlānya netrake |
kukṣīśa vāyukoṇeṣu jātu dvaya gudeṣu ca || 108 ||

kakṣinaitryattavadyodya koṇayoścanyase sunaḥ |
sarvasiddhipradādyānāṃ śaktīnāṃ daśakaṃ tathā || 109 ||

tadaṃtaśca daśārādi cakrāya nama ityapi |
vinyaset tasya koṇeṣu sarvājñādyaḥ pravinyaset || 110 ||

dakṣanāsāsṛkviṇī ca stanaṃ vṛṣaṇameva ca |
śivanī vāmamuṣka ca stanaṃ sakviṇi nāsike || 111 ||

nāsāgraṃcehi vijñeyaṃ kośānāṃ daśakaṃ tathā |
tadaṃtara vṛṣṭakoṇādi cakrāya nama ityapi || 112 ||

<p. 16a>

vinyasya tasya koṇeṣu vaśinyādyaṣṭakaṃ punaḥ |
cuvukaṃ kaṃṭha hṛdayanābhīnāṃ caiva dakṣiṇaṃ || 113 ||

jñeyaṃ pārśva catuṣkaṃ ca maṇi ghūrādi vāmakaṃ |
catuṣṭayaṃ ca pārśvānāme tatkoṇāṣṭakaṃ punaḥ || 114 ||

hṛdayastha trikoṇasya caturdikṣu vahirnyaste |
śaracāyau pāśāsṛṇī trikoṇāya namastathā || 115 ||

vinyasya tasya koṇeṣu agnadakṣitteṣu ca |
kāmeśvaryādi devīnāṃ madhye devīṃ ca vinyaset || 116 ||

evaṃ tu yodito devinyāso guptatama kramaḥ |
etadguptatarakāryatvayāmat prāṇavallabhe || 117 ||

samayasthāya dātavyaṃ nā śiṣyāya kadācana |
guptāguptataraṃ cai tattavādya prakaṭīkṛtaṃ || 118 ||

mūladevyādi kanyā samaṇimāṃtaṃ punarnyaset |
śirastrikoṇe pūrvādi kāmeśvaryādika nyaset || 119 ||

vāṇānnetrabhruvoścayaukaṇe pāśadvayaṃ nyaset |
sṛṇidvayaṃ tu nyānāsāgne dakṣiṇādyaṃ tu vinyaset || 120 ||

muhumālā kramaṇaivanyasedvā devatāṣṭakaṃ |
davādīni cakrāṇinyastavyāni varānane || 121 ||

netramūle tvayāṃge ca karṇa pūrvottare punaḥ |
cūḍādike ca nimnorddha śikhorddhakarṇapṛṣṭake || 122 ||

karṇapūrvetvayāṃge ca tasya mūleya vinyaset |
sarvasidhyādikaṃ ye ca prādakṣiṇyena vinyaset || 123 ||

hṛdaye sanukoṇastha śaktayopi ca pūjayet |
nābhau tvaṣṭadalattuvaṃśe vāme ca pārśvake || 124 ||

udaresavya pārśve ca nyasedādi catuṣṭayaṃ |
vaṃśabhavāmāṃtarādinyanyedanyaśca catuṣṭayaṃ || 125 ||

svādhiṣṭhānedyaṣṭadale kāmākārṣiṇi pūrvikāḥ |
śaktayo vinyaset tasya pūrvāddakṣāvasānakaṃ |
mūlādhāre nyasenmudrā daśakaṃ sādhakottamaḥ || 126 ||

punasacye ca vaṃśe ca vāme caivāṃtarālake |
ūrdhvādho daśamudrāśca ūrddhvādho varjitaṃ puna || 127 ||

brahmaṇyādyaṣṭakaṃ tatra tadyāyāṃ tāsu pūrvavat || 128 ||

vāmajaṃghāṃ samārabhya vāmādi kramatopi ca || 128 ||

sidhyaṣṭakaṃ nyasetteṣu dvayaṃ ṣādatalenyaset |
kāraṇāt prasṛtaṃ nyāsaṃ dīpādīpasivosthitaṃ || ||

itthaṃ vinyasya deveśi svābhedena viciṃtayet || 130 ||

tataścakara śudhyādinyāsaṃ kuryāt samāhitaḥ |
mūrdhni guhye ca hṛdaye netra tritaya eva ca || 131 ||

śrotra yugme tato devi mukhe ca bhuyottaḥ punaḥ |
pṛṣṭhe jānuni nābhau ca vidyānyāsaṃ samācaret || 132 ||

karaśuddhiḥ punaścaiva āsanādi ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ |
śrīkaṃṭhādi ca vāgdevī rādhā (**)daye punaḥ || 133 ||

śikhāryā vaiṃdavasthānehyagni cakrādikānyaset |
calatrayaiḥ samasta ca vidyāvīna trayānvitaṃ || 134 ||

pādādinābhiparyaṃtamāgalaṃ śirasastathā |
vyāpakaṃ caiva nyasya khālī kṛtya prasyuṃnaḥ || 135 ||

<p. 16b>

saṃtarpayet punardevī saumyā seyā mṛtadravaiḥ |
ṣoḍhānyāsoṇimādiśca mūladevyādikaḥ priye || 136 ||

kasyudyādikaṃ caiva sādhakenāśu siddhaye |
ṣoḍānyāsa samāyuktaṃ śrīcakranyāsamiṣṭadaṃ || 137 ||

sakṛt kṛtvāpi vā sākṣāt parabrahmamayaḥ pumān |
tejomaya tanurbhūtvā jīvanmuktaḥ sukhī bhavet || 138 ||

trideśerapi cadyosau yogibhiśca maharṣibhiḥ |
siddhāṣṭaka manuprāpya trailoke viharatyasau || 139 ||

māsamāsi jaye vāpi ṣaṇmāse vatsarepi vā |
kṛtvā ṣoḍābhidhaṃ nyāsaṃ śrīcakranyāsamapyatha || 140 ||

prāpnoti mahatī siddhiṃ daivatairapi durlabhāṃ |
tejomaya tanurbhūtvā śriyamaṣṭaguṇānvitāṃ || 131 ||

yogamaṣṭāṃgamāsādya sarvalokeṣu pūjyate |
kartānyāsa dvayasyāsya tadajñaṃ pitaraṃ tu vā || 132 ||

praṇamedyadimāsena samatyuṃ labhate dhruvaṃ |
praṇamennāpi daivaṃ vā vinā svācāryamīśvaraṃ || 133 ||

kartānyā sadvayasyāsya yatra tiṣṭhati sādhakaḥ |
siddhakṣetraṃ taduddiṣṭaṃ samaṃtā yojanatrayaṃ || 134 ||

kartānyā sadvayasyāsya yatra tiṣṭhati bhāmini |
tatra gaṃgāgayākāśīkurukṣetraṃ dhanaimisvaṃ || 135 ||

daivataissaha siddhāśca tatra tiṣṭhaṃti saṃtataḥ |
ājñā siddhikaraṃnyāsa dvayame tatsūdurlabhaṃ || 136 ||

karoti viśuddhātmāt tasya siddhiḥ pade pade |
ṣaṇmāsābhyā sa yogena vidhiviṣṇu śivātmakaḥ || 137 ||

bhavatyasau jagatsṛṣṭi sthiti saṃhārakārakaḥ |
na vaktavyamidaṃ nyāsa sa dvayaṃ sakalasiddhidaṃ || 138 ||

bhraṣṭāya sādhakāyāpi pratikūlāya sadguroḥ |
śrīviyāyā japo nityanitya samācāryayoṣaṇaṃ || 139 ||

nyāsa dvayaṃ praveśaścanālyasya tapasaḥ phalaṃ |
hṛdanyāsadvayaṃ nityaṃ kṛtvā kṛtvāpi kāśuciḥ || 140 ||

dhyātvā nirāmayaṃ vastu sarvabrahmāṃḍanāyakaṃ |
cidrūpaṃ paramaṃdhāmaṃtraipurī kṛtā vigrahaḥ || 141 ||

japtvā śriyo mahāvidyāṃ sākṣādbrahmamayo bhavet |
nyāsa jātamidaṃ tubhyaṃ kathitaṃ girikanyake || 1 ||

śrīsuṃdaryā mahādevyā yajaṃ saṃpravakṣyate || 2 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye paṃcamodhyāyaḥ] || 5 ||
<p. 16b>

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

akṛtvāpyatha kṛtvā vānyāsattālamidaṃ śriyaḥ |
dhyātvā devaṃ vījagadvātrīṃ śriyaṃ saubhāgyadevatā || 1 ||

yathā etā prajaptvātha śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarī |
maunena praviśedyāgamanuṃ parasyamīśvari || 2 ||

vāgbharvabhuvaneśānī śriya yamuccāyaṃ yatnataḥ |
ādhāraśakti kamalāsanāya nama uccaret || 3 ||

anenā samamaṃtreṇa sūpaviḥ sthirāsane |
tṛṇāsaneya śohādbhirdaurbhāgyaṃ dārukāsane || 4 ||

<p. 17a>

pāṣāṇe duḥkhamāneti vyādhijātaṃ mahītale |
vicitrakaṃ valesiddhirmokṣa śrīrvyāghracarmaṇi || 5 ||

dṛsyājinebhavenmuktirvāsasi śrīracaṃcalā |
kuśāsane bhavedgānaṃ ratnapīṭheṣṭa siddhayaḥ || 6 ||

upaviśyāsane śuddhapiṭhamaṃtreṇa sādhakaḥ |
uccāryatā ratritayaṃ raktā vā daśataḥ pethara || 7 ||

uccāryaśaktiyuktā yadvīpanāthā yathāśaktitaḥ |
uccāryahṛdayaścādbhūmau puṣpāṃjalīḥ kṣipet || 8 ||

śrīcaṃdana viliptāṃgassarvā kalpavibhūṣitaḥ |
mānasālaṃkṛto vāpi śuklāṃvaradharaḥ śuciḥ || 9 ||

haime vā rājate tāmre bhūrje vā cakramālikhet |
paṃcaśakti catuḥśaṃbhurūpaṃ cakraṃ manoharaṃ || 10 ||

viṃducakraṃ vilikhyādau trikoṇaṃ syāt tataḥ paraṃ |
vasukoṇaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā daśāra dvitayaṃ tataḥ || 11 ||

manukoṇaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā vṛttamaṣṭa dalānvitaṃ |
tataḥ ṣoḍaśa patrāṇi likhedvattayutānyapi || 12 ||

vṛttamekaṃ tato lekhyaṃ bhūpura tritayānvitaṃ |
samastayātakahara samastaphalasiddhidaṃ || 13 ||

jādākarṣaṇakaramaṇimādyaṣṭa siddhidaṃ |
mohanaṃ sarvajagatāṃ sarvatīrthaphalapradaṃ || 14 ||

samastayāgaphaladaṃ sarvadāna phalapradaṃ |
nityānaṃdakaraṃ bhaktabhoigare vargāpavargadaṃ || 15 ||

ādhāraṃ sarvajagatāṃ sarvakāma phalapradaṃ |
sarvadharmamayaṃ sarvaratnavittaphalapradaṃ || 16 ||

sarvavidyākaraṃ sarvarakṣākaramanuttamaṃ |
bhūtapretapiśādi sarvabhīti nivārakaṃ || 17 ||

samastaviṣasaṃhārahetu bhūtaṃ sanātanaṃ |
āyurārogpadaṃ svasti putrapautrābhivṛddhikaṃ || 18 ||

dhanadhānya gajāśvādi sarvaiśvarya phalapradaṃ |
lokāyavādabhītighnaṃ mayamṛtyu vināśanaṃ || 19 ||

sarvasaṃgrāma jayadam sarvaśatru vimardanaṃ |
alakṣmīnāśanaṃ dhanyaṃ ciṃtāmarāyādi siddhidaṃ || 20 ||

sarvasaubhāgya phaladaṃ brahmānaṃda sukhapradaṃ |
vedavedāṃtaśāstraudya sārabhūtaṃ yaśaskaraṃ || 21 ||

kledanaṃdrākaṇaṃ caiva kṣobhaṇaṃ mohanaṃ tathā |
ākarṣaṇakaraṃ sarvastaṃbhanaṃ jaṃbhanaṃ tathā || 22 ||

vyādhidāri praśamanaṃ sarvadurgati bhedanaṃ |
śāṃti vṛṣṭi dhanārogya maṃtrasiddhikaraṃ paraṃ || 23 ||

khecaratvakara sarvakāryasiddhikaraṃ paraṃ |
sarvasiddhikaraṃ śreyaskara manuptayaṃ || 24 ||

sarvamaṃtramayaṃ sarvayogasiddhi phalapradaṃ |
sarvajñānamayaṃ sarvavācāṃ siddhitvapradaṃ || 25 ||

sarvatatvamaya sarvaśubhadaṃ kratu siddhidaṃ |
sarvavratamayaṃ devi sarvāmṛtamayaṃ tathā || 26 ||

sarvaduḥkhapraśamanaṃ rogaśokanivāraṇaṃ |
sarvonmādakaraṃ devi sarvāhlādakānarekaṃ || 27 ||

sarvadaurbhāgya śamanaṃ sarvavighnavināśanaṃ |
raudrāmicārako daṃḍa paramaṃtraugha bhakṣaṇaṃ || 28 ||

<p. 17b>

paravidyākarṣaṇaṃ ca parājñākarṣaṇāṃ tathā |
parasainyastaṃbhakaraṃ śastrastaṃbhanakārakaṃ || 29 ||

mahācamaṭakārakaraṃ mahāvuddhi pravartakaṃ |
mahājvaraharaṃ devi mahāmṛtyuvināśanaṃ || 30 ||

mahāpura kṣobhakaraṃ mahāśubhakaraṃ sadā |
mahālakṣmīmayaṃ devi mahāmāṃgalyasiddhidaṃ || 31 ||

mahāprabhāvaphaladaṃ mahāsukha samṛddhidaṃ |
itthame tasya cakrasya prabhāvo varṇito mayā || 32 ||

uktamāraṇyakairetadadyodhyāyu nāmakaṃ |
śrīcakrameta devoktaṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇābhidhaṃ || 33 ||

śivaśaktimayaṃ prāhure tadeva maharṣayaḥ |
śaktāśyakti vinirbhiya punarvahni purena vai || 34 ||

saṃpaṭīkṛtya sarvorddhāṃ śaktiṃ vistārayedhaḥ |
nāmādi cakrādhaḥ śaktiṃ vahninorddhvaṃ vibhedayet || 35 ||

punaḥ pūrvavadevādyāṃ klaktiṃ vistārya bhedayet |
ūrdhvaśaktimadho vahni madhyavahni vivarjitaṃ || 36 ||

vistārya bhedayecchakti madhastādādya vahninā |
tato madhyādi śaktyardhaṃ śaktivistārayedadhaḥ || 37 ||

tathaiva saṃpuṭā kuryāt sarvacakraṃ sureśvari |
vācatena maheśāni vahnicakrecaṇa bhedayet || 38 ||

graṃthi bhedakrameṇaiva sarvordhvaṃ sarvavāhyataḥ |
madhyodhvarśati paryaṃtamādirā avadhipriye || 39 ||

tato vāhyastha rātrāṃtaḥ śaktimūrddhvaṃ vikāśayet |
tato vikāśayecchaktimādyāmapyūrddhamīśvara || 40 ||

sarvorddha vahnadho bhāgagraṃthiparyaṃ tataḥ priye |
vistārya vāhyaśaktiṃ tu sarvāṣastādvi bhedayet || 41 ||

etadā yugataṃ padmamaṣṭapatraṃ samālikhet |
tadvāhyatopi deveśi ṣoḍaśāraṃ tataḥ paraṃ || 42 ||

pariveṣa samāyuktaṃ caturdvāropaśobhitaṃ |
tataḥ sṛṣṭe mahācakraṃ tṛtīyaṃ tu hutāśanaḥ || 43 ||

madhyamaṣṭerdvitīyaṃ tu saṃhāra prathamaṃ trayat |
evametanmahācakraṃ śriyo devyā udīritaṃ || 44 ||

idaṃ samastasāmrājyalakṣmīcakra mudāhṛtaṃ |
agnīṣomātmakamidaṃ sarvavidyāmayaṃ priye || 45 ||

idameva jagatsṛṣṭisthiti saṃhṛtikāraṇaṃ |
mātṛkāvarṇayustūjyamatha tadrahitaṃ tu vā || 46 ||

catuṣkaṣṭiryataḥ kodyo yoginīnāṃ mahaujasāṃ |
cakresmin sa viśeṣāstāsmādhakaṃ mānayaṃti hi || 47 ||

caturasraṃ mātṛkārṇairmaṃditaṃ siddhi hetave |
muktāmāṇikyaghaṭita samasthala virājitaṃ || 48 ||

trailokyamohanaṃ nāma kalpadruma phalapradaṃ |
ṣoḍaśāraṃ caṃdraviṃvarūpaṃ tu sakalālaya || 49 ||

sarvāśākpūrakaṃ bhedasnavayī yūṣavarṣaṇaṃ |
aṣṭapatraṃ maheśāni japākusuma sannibhaṃ || 50 ||

sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇaṃ nāma sarvakāmadhapūrakaṃ |
etat trayaṃ maheśāni sṛṣṭicakraṃ sukhapradaṃ || 51 ||

anaṃta phaladaṃ bhadre sarvasaubhāgyasaṃpadāṃ |
dvitīyamapi padmapyaṃ japākusuma sānnibhaṃ || 52 ||

<p. 18a>

pūrvāmrāyādhi devyā tu maṃḍitaṃ sarvakāmadaṃ |
caturdaśāraṃ devevaśidādimī kusumaprabhaṃ || 53 ||

sarvarakṣākaraṃ cakraṃ mahājñānamayaṃ priye |
etat trayaṃ maheśāni sthiticakraṃ sthitipradaṃ || 54 ||

dakṣiṇāmrāya saṃsevyaṃ yathepsittta phalapradaṃ |
aṣṭapatraṃ varārohe vālārka kiraṇāruṇaṃ || 55 ||

padmarāga maṇiprakhyaṃ sarvarogaharaṃ sadā |
upatsūrya sahasrābhaṃ vaṃdhūka kusumaprabhaṃ || 56 ||

sarvasiddhipradaṃ cakraṃtya kalālayamīśvari |
trikoṇaṃ sarvasaṃbhūtikāraṇabhūtidaṃ sadā || 57 ||

viṃdu catraṃ varārohe sarvānaṃdamayaṃ paraṃ |
sadāśivamayaṃ camranāyakaṃ parameśvari || 58 ||

etaccakraṃ tu saṃhārarūpaṃ brahmamayaṃ sadā |
paścimāmrāya saṃsevyaṃ trayāmuttarapūjitaṃ || 59 ||

asmicakre ṣaḍadhvāno vartaṃte vīravaṃdite |
cakrapatreṣu deveśi padādhvātu nigadyate || 60 ||

cakre trisaṃdhi bhāgeṣu bhuvanādhvā vyavasthitaḥ |
varṇādhvā mātṛkārūpī kathayāmita vā nadye || 61 ||

vargāṣṭakaṃ mātṛkāyā dikṣu siddhaṃ yataḥ priye |
pārthivaṃ tanmayaṃ viddhi ṣoḍaśāṃskalāśrakaṃ || 62 ||

aṣṭapatraṃ kādivargaiḥ kṣāṃtairdikṣu vidikṣu ca |
kādiśaṃtāḥ śakraparṇāḥ śakrakoṇeṣu saṃsthitāḥ || 63 ||

ṇakārādi bhavarṇānān vilikhecca daśārake |
makārādi kṣakārāṃtān dvitīyepi daśārake || 64 ||

vargāṣṭakaṃ cāṣṭakoṇe trikoṇe kathayamite |
akathādi trikoṇāṃtaṃ hākṣayugmaṃ tu madhyagaṃ || 65 ||

varṇādhvā kathito devi mātṛkā pīṭharūpakaḥ |
ṣaṭtriṃśattatvabharituṃ cakraṃ mūlānusārataḥ || 66 ||

paṃcasiṃhāsanā naṃdakalādhvā cakra śāsanāt |
sa kālā bharavīyuktā mahātripurasuṃdarī || 67 ||

tripuṇyaṃ vikāṃtāḍhyā cakra vyāpyame va jramaṃte |
maṃtrādhvāyaṃ samākhyātau niścayena sadānaghe || 68 ||

evaṃ ṣaḍadhva vimalaṃ śrīcakraṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ |
merurūpaṃ mahīrūpaṃ dvidhā pūjārthamīṣyate || 69 ||

siṃdūrarajasā vāpi kuṃkumenātha vā likhet |
yadā suvarṇa lekhinyā likhitaṃ saṃprapūjayet || 70 ||

haimaṃ vā rājitaṃ tāmraṃ ratnajaṃ sphāṭikaṃ tu vā |
ayodhyānagaraṃ cakrarājaṃ nitya samarcayet || 71 ||

paścimāśāmukho devi yathā cakra samarcayet |
(*)śri māśāttayā jñeyā pūrvā śaiva nigadyate || 72 ||

vāyukoṇaṃ tathā jñeya mīśānaṃ rākṣasaṃ bhavet |
dakṣiṇāśāmukho devi yathā cakraṃ samarcayet || 73 ||

sā pūrvā śaiva saṃproktā rasakoṇaṃ tu vahnibhāk |
uttarāśā mukhye devi yathācakraṃ samarcayet || 74 ||

uttarāśā tadā jñeyā pūrvā saiva na saṃśayaḥ |
īśānakoṇaṃ deveśi tadāgreyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 75 ||

etaccakraṃ merurūpaṃ śrīvidyārṇaṃ samudanaṃ |
sarvāgamamayaṃ devi kathitaṃ vīravaṃdite || 76 ||

<p. 18b>

anyarcite cakrarāje nityaṃ sarvopacārakaiḥ |
sthāvaraṃ jaṃgamaṃ viśvamarcidaṃ tasyānnaṃ saṃśayaḥ || 77 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdva ratnairarthaiśvabhūribhiḥ |
abhyarcātha gṛhītvaitaccakraṃ sakalasiddhidaḥ || 78 ||

tadārabhyārcayeccita kalpitairvopacārakaiḥ |
ajarāmaraṇo bhūtvā siddhiṃ prāprauti śāśvatīṃ || 79 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedārthasaṃgraha uttarabhāge 
saubhāgyavidyodaye ṣaṣṭodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 18b>

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

cakroddhāro mayā proktaḥ sādhakepsita siddhidaḥ |
śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi pūjāvidhi mataḥ paraṃ || 1 ||

ayodhyāpuranāmaitacchrīcakraṃ pāramaiśvaraṃ |
pratiṣṭhāpyārcayeddhīmān sādhakaḥ śuddhamānasaḥ || 2 ||

uddhāryāmanavaḥ sarvetāra tritaya saṃyutāḥ |
amṛtāṃbho nidhiḥ pūvaṃ ratnadvīpa mataḥ paraṃ || 3 ||

nānāvṛkṣa mahodyānatha syāt kalpavāṭikā |
saṃtānavāṭikā paścāddhari caṃdanavāṭikā || 4 ||

maṃdāravāṭikā pārijātavāṭī tataḥ paraṃ |
kadevavanavāṭī ca vāṭikā paṃcakīrtitāḥ || 5||

caturthāhṛt samāyuktā ādau tāratrayānvitāḥ |
uccāryāḥ sakalārmatrā japahomārcanīdiṣudaṃ || 6 ||

puṣparathā mahāratnaprākaraṃ pūrvamucyate |
padmarāga mahāratna prākaraśca tataḥ paraṃ || 7 ||

gomedharatna prākāro vajraprākāra ityapi |
vaiḍūryaratna prākāra iṃdranīlābhidhastathā || 8 ||

muktāralva mahāprākāraścamārakatastathā |
vidrumākhya mahāratnaprākāro navamaṃ smṛtaḥ || 9 ||

māṇikyamaṃḍapa paścāt sahasrastaṃbhamaṃḍapaṃ |
atha mṛtākhyavāṭīsyāttata ānaṃdavāṭikā || 10 ||

vimarśavāṭikāvālā tapoddhārastataḥ paraṃ |
caṃdrikoddhāramabhyarcya tataḥ śaileṃdra kanyake || 11 ||

mahāśṛṃgāra paritvā mahāryagnāravī tataḥ |
ciṃtāmaṇi mahāratna gṛharājastataḥ paraṃ || 12 ||

pūrvāmrāyamayaṃ pūrvadvāraṃ prathamatorcayet |
dakṣiṇāmrāya rūpaṃ taddakṣiṇadvāramapyatha || 13 ||

paścimāmrāya rūpaṃ ca paścimadvāramapyatha |
uttarāmnāya rūpaṃ cottaradvāraṃ tatocayet || 14 ||

ratnapradīpavalayaṃ mahāsiṃhāsanaṃ tataḥ |
atha brahmamayaṃ madhva pādamekaṃ samarcayet || 15 ||

tato viṣṇumayaṃ maṃca pādamekaṃ mama priye |
tato rudramayaṃ maṃca pādamekaṃ samarcayet || 16 ||

maṃcapādeṃ yajedekamīśvarāt sakamapyatha |
sadāśivamayamaṃ ca phalakaṃ ca tataḥ paraṃ || 17 ||

haṃsatūlākhyātalamaṃ samabhyarcya prayatnataḥ |
haṃtūla mahopādyadhānamabhyarcayedartha || 18 ||

kausuṃbhāstaraṇaṃ paścān mahāvitānakaṃ tataḥ |
mahāyavanikāṃ paścāddevī medirapūjakāḥ || 19 ||

<p. 19a>

caturuttara catvāriṃśanmaṃtrāḥ kathitā mayāḥ |
bhāvayanmaṃdiraṃ devyāmatraitaiḥ samarcayet || 20 ||

sthāpayitvātmano dakṣabhāge puṣpākṣatādikaṃ |
datvābhitastatodīpāṃścakraṃ mūlena pūjayet || 21 ||

mūlatrikhaṃḍai prathamamatryasramabhyarcayedatha |
vādyagni jalasaṃyukta prāṇāyāmaistribhi priye || 22 ||

śoṣaṇaṃ dahanaṃ kṛtvā kuryādā plāvanaṃ tataḥ |
mūlavidyāṃ samuccāya prāṇānāyamya ca tridhā || 23 ||

ārṣachaṃdo daivataṃ ca nyasya vījādikaṃ tataḥ |
aya sarpaṃtuye bhūtāye bhūtā bhuvi saṃsthitāḥ || 24 ||

ye bhūtā vighnakartārastenaśyaṃ tu śivājñayā |
iti maṃtreṇa savyānya pārśvāṣṇi pātena śailaje || 25 ||

karatālatrapaṇāpi vighnānutsārya yatnataḥ |
devyahaṃ bhāvanāyuktaḥ saśarīre tataḥ priye || 26 ||

vajrapaṃjaranāmāthanyāsajata samācaret |
karaśuddhiṃ puraḥ kṛtvā kumārīmuccaredatha || 27 ||

śrīmahāpadamuccāryamuccārya tripuretyatha |
ātmānaṃ rakṣkṣetimikṣipya hṛdayeṃñjaliṃ || 29 ||

māyāṃ ca kāmarājaṃ ca śaktimuccārya yatnataḥ |
devyātmāsa na śadaṃ ca caturthyaṃta namonvitaṃ || 30 ||

uccāryānena maṃtreṇādadyāha ca syāsanaṃ tataḥ |
śriyaṃ māyāṃ kumārīṃ ca proccārya manunāmunā || 31 ||

śrīcakrāsanaśabdaṃ ca caturthī hṛdayānvitaṃ |
uccārya bhuvaneśānī parāvījaṃ kumārikāṃ || 32 ||

uccārya sarvamaṃtrāsanāyāthanama ucaḥ caret |
trilokeśī kāmarājaṃ klamakṣaramataḥ paraṃ || 33 ||

 sādhyasiddhāsanapadaṃ caturthyaṃta hṛdanvitaṃ |
uccāryānena maṃtrāṇāṃ tritayena ca sādhakuḥ || 34 ||

datvā puṣpāṃjaliṃ cakreṣaḍaṃganyā samācaret |
vinyasya mātṛkāṃ paścadviśinyādyavakuṃ tataḥ || 35 ||

mūlavidyākṣaranyāsaṃ vinyasyātha mama priye |
ṣoḍhā cakrābhidhanyāsa dvitayaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ || 36 ||

vinyasyānyasya vā dhyātvā dhyāna sūktena citkalāṃ |
śuddhāṃbhasā vāmabhāge savṛtta caturasrakaṃ || 37 ||

kṛtvāmanyarcya sādhāraṃ cākhamapyatha |
pratiṣṭhāpya ṣaḍaṃgena samabhyarcya tataḥ paraṃ || 38 ||

śuddhodakamathā pūrya spṛṣṭvā mūla tridhā japet |
tena saṃprokṣeyadarcā ityamātmona tathatha || 39 ||

kurvaṃti kecidatraiva viśeṣārghyaṃ phaladapradaṃ |
kṛtvā tatra viśeṣārghyaṃ kṛtvāpyarvayecchrityāṃ || 40 ||

tajjaelena triṣaṭkorṇavṛttaṃ ca caturasrakaṃ |
tvāmalena madhye ca vidyā (**) trikoṇake || 41 ||

ṣaḍasraṃ tadvirāvṛtyā saṃpūjya samavallabhe |
athavā bhava muccārya caturthyaṃta samāśvitaṃ || 42 ||

agnimaṃḍala śabdaṃ ca tato daśakalātmane |
arghyapātrāyāraśakaṃ caturthī nati saṃyutaṃ || 43 ||

<p. 19b>

anena manunādhāraṃ tatra saṃsthāya yecchive |
dhūmrārcirūṣmājvalinī jvālinī visphurliṃginī || 44 ||

suśrī sarūpādhyatā rūpaka vyavahātathā |
vahnerdaśakalāṃ proktāyādi varṇasamudbhavāḥ || 45 ||

tatra saṃpūjya madanaṃ samuccārya tataḥ paraṃ |
sūryamaṃḍala śabdaṃ ca caturthī sahitaṃ tataḥ || 46 ||

dvādaśeti padaṃ paścādatha cāpi kalātmane |
arghyapātrapadaṃ paścāccaturthī hṛdayanvitaṃ || 47 ||

iti pātraṃ pratiṣṭhāpyattapinī tāpinī tataḥ |
dhūmrāmarīcirapi ca jvālinī rucirapyatha || 48 ||

suṣumṇa bhogadā viśvāvodhinī dhāriṇīkṣamā |
kalā dvādaśa saṃproktā etāḥ mavituriṣṭadāḥ || 49 ||

kabhāyakṣā yugmohyāsma pūjyāstatra śailaje |
parāṃ somapadaṃ paścānmaṃḍalāya paraṃ tataḥ || 50 ||

ṣoḍaśeti padaṃ paścāduktaṃ tatra kalātmane |
arghyā mṛtā yadā kaṃcanamaskāra samanvitaṃ || 51 ||

tatrāmṛtamathā pūrvakṣīramadhvadikaṃ śive |
amṛtāmānadā pūṣā tuṣṭiṃtpuṣṭiratirdhṛtiḥ || 52 ||

śaśinī caṃdrikākāṃtirjyotsnāśrīḥ prītiraṃganā |
pūrṇāpūrṇā mṛtākā sadāyinyaḥ ṣoḍaśeṣṭadāḥ || 53 ||

kalā somasya vikhyātāḥ ṣoḍaśasvarasaṃbhavāḥ |
tatrābhyārcyā namaskāryā akathāyakṣarātmakaṃ || 54 ||

halakṣavarṇasahitaṃ trikoṇaṃ haṃsamadhyagaṃ |
(*)kkāma śaktisahita koṇe tritayamupyatha || 55 ||

haṃsākhya manunābhyarcā ṣaṭkoṇeṇaṃ vṛttavāhyataḥ |
kṛtvā dhyātvā ṣaḍaṃgena samabhyarcya tataḥ paraṃ || 56 ||

mūlena saptadhābhimaṃ adhyāyejyetirmayī śive |
caturnavati saṃkhyākān maṃtrān spṛṣṭvā japedatha || 57 ||

tṛtīrīnati saṃyuktā vahyarkedukalāḥ kramāt |
aṣṭatriṃśati saṃkhyākā uktāḥ parvata kanyake || 58 ||

sṛṣṭirvuddhiḥ smṛtirmaṃdhā kāṃtilakṣmīryuti sthirā |
sthitiśca siddhirityuktā daśabrahmakalā imāḥ || 59 ||

jarā ca pālinī śātirīścārī ratikāmika |
varadāndrādinī prīti dīrghā viṣṇukalā imāḥ || 60 ||

tīkṣṇā raudrī bhyānidrātaṃdrākṣutkrothinī kriyā |
utkārī mṛtyurityuktā daśarudrakalā imāḥ || 61 ||

pītā śvetāruṇāścādasiteścara saṃbhavāḥ |
catvāra uktā etāśca kalāḥ sarvaphalapradāḥ || 62 ||

kādi kṣāṃtā kṣarodbhūtāścatustriṃśadimāḥ kalāḥ |
nivṛttiśca pratiṣṭhā ca vidyāśāṃtistathaiva ca || 63 ||

rodhikā dīpikā caiva recikā mocikā tataḥ parā |
sūkṣmā tato sūkṣmāmṛtā jñānā tataḥ paraṃ || 64 ||

jñānāmṛtāpyāyinī ca vyāpinī vyomabhīti ca |
sadāśiva kalā etāḥ ṣoḍaśasthara saṃbhavāḥ || 65 ||

<p. 20a>

tatra pūjyā namaskāryāstrikatārī nati saṃyutāḥ |
saḥśuciṣadityuktvā vasuraṃ tadekṣetyātha || 66 ||

sadvotā vidiṣatvoktvā padamapyatithisra |
taduroṇū sadatha prokta nṛṣadvarasadityatha || 67 ||

ata sadvyoma satyaścāda jvāgojā ataṃ vahat |
maṃtrāṃte ca pratadviṣṇusrapyaṃvakaṃ manustataḥ || 68 ||

tadviṣṇoritirmartra ca tadviptāsastataḥ paraṃ |
mūlavidyātha saṃproktāścaturtavati maṃtrakāḥ || 69 ||

athākhaṃḍādibhirmaṃtraiḥ kecit siddhā maharṣayaḥ |
caturnavati maṃtraṃti pravadaṃtyibhi maṃtraṇaṃ || 70 ||

akhaṃḍaivara sānaṃda kalevaratarātmanista |
chaṃda sphuraṇāmātranidhehya kulavanāyike || 71 ||

akulasthā mṛtākāra śuddhajñānakare pare |
amṛtatvaṃ nidhehyasmin vastuvitkinmarūpiṇī || 72 ||

tvadrūpeṇaikarasyatvaṃ kṛtvāsye tatsvarūpiṇī |
bhūtvā parāmṛtākāraṃmayī citsphuraṇaṃ kuru || 73 ||

praṇavaṃ vāgbhavallūṁ snauṁ mlūṁ jūṁ sa ityakṣāṇyatha |
amṛte padamuccārya padamapya mṛtodbhāve || 74 ||

amṛteśvari śabdaṃdha padaṃ cāmṛtavarṣiṇi |
amṛtaṃ srāvaya yugaṃ vahni jñātayā samānvitaṃ || 75 ||

uccaraidamṛteśvaryā vidyaiṣā samudīritā |
vāgbhavaṃ vadayugmaṃ ca padaṃ vāgvādinītyatha || 76 ||

vāgbhavaṃ kāmarājaṃ ca klinne kledini cāpyatha |
kledaya dvitayaṃ paścāt mahākṣobhaṃ kuru dvayaṃ || 77 ||

mādakadanaṃ śaktimuccāryamokṣaṃ kuru yugānvitaṃ |
anaṃtaṃ caṃdramavanaṃ manusvara samanvitaṃ || 78 ||

viṃdunā sahitaṃ paścāccaṃdraviṣṇu yathānvitaṃ |
manusvara visargādhyamuccarediti paṃcamī || 79 ||

ukteyaṃ dīpinī vidyā samastābhīṣṭasiddhidā |
etābhissarvavidyābhirabhimaṃtryāmitaṃ śivā || 80 ||

jyotirmayaṃ vidhāyātha maṃtritaṃ paramāmṛtaṃ |
tadviṃdubhirbrahmaraṃdhre guru tritayapādukāḥ || 81 ||

saṭarpyācāryatāmrātha saṃtarpyācārya pādukāṃ |
ātmanaḥ kuṃḍalinyāṃ ca tadviṃduṃ vodhasiddhidaṃ || 82 ||

ārdraṃ jvalati maṃtreṇa juhuyāllokamātṛka |
iti kṛtvā viśeṣārghyaṃ vatsarevatsarepi vā || 83 ||

catrūrājaṃ samabhyarcya sārvabhaumau jagatpatiḥ |
sarvajñaḥ kṛtakṛtyaḥsyājjīvanmukto na saṃśayaḥ || 84 ||

kṛtvā kṛtvāpi vā nityaṃ viśeṣārghya vidhiṃ śive |
śrīcakraṃ pūjayitvāśu sarvabhāgyabhidhirbhavat || 85 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttara brahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīyetaṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye saptamodhyāyaḥ] | 
<p. 20a>

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi layāṃgārcanamādarāt |
yatkṛtvāpi śucinirtyarbhahā saubhāgyavān bhavet || 1 ||

<p. 20b>

tataḥ padmanibhāṃdovīmiti sūktena śailaje |
dhyādhatvā saṃvinmayī devī mahātripurasuṃdarī || 2 ||

dhyātvā hṛccakra madhyasthāṃ śriya devī trayībhayīṃ |
aṃtaḥ suṣumṇā kamalādi vinirbhedana kṣamāṃ || 3 ||

nirasta mohatimirāṃ śivasya jagatīpateḥ |
samastaloka dīpasya dīptibhutī sanātanī || 4 ||

ādyāṃ saṃvinmayīṃ śuddhā brahmaviṣṇvīśavaṃditāṃ |
jñānāṃ sāpuṭe nirgamayya līlā saṃkalpitā kṛtiṃ || 5 ||

saubhāgyasuṃdarī sākṣācchriyaṃ tejomayīṃ parāṃ |
trikhaṃḍamudrāsahito khāṃjalau kusumānvite || 6 ||

samānīya mahāmāyāṃ lakṣmīṃ śaktiṃ samuccaret |
śrīmahātripuret yuktvā suṃdarīti padaṃ tataḥ || 7 ||

amṛteti padaṃ paścā caitanyeti padaṃ śive |
tato mūrtikalpaṣāmi nama ityamunā śive || 8 ||

maṃtreṇa cakre śrīdevyāḥ kalpayenmūrtimuttamāṃ |
vījatrayamidaṃ bhūyopyuccārya girikanyake || 9 ||

hasaraiṃ hasa śabdāṃte kalarīhaṃsarauratha |
mahāpadmavanāṃtasthe kāraṇānaṃtavigrahe || 10 ||

sarvabhūtahite mātarehyehi parameśvari |
iti maṃtreṇa paramāmicchā kalpitavigrahāṃ || 11 ||

niveśayitvā hṛccakrasthitāṃ śrīcakramadhyame |
catuḥṣaṣṭyupacārāṃśca kuryāddaivyai tataḥ paraṃ || 12 ||

tritārīdevināmāttapādyaṃ kalpe sataḥ paraṃ |
yāmīti namasāyuktā upacāsmanūttamāḥ || 13 ||

itthaṃ sarve samuccāryā śricakre satataśriyaḥ |
śrīdevyai pādyamuccārya kalpayāmi namaḥ (**) || 14 ||

śrīdevyā arghyamityuktvā kalpayāmi namastata |
ityādi maṃtrān sakulānupacārābhidhānusmaret || 15 ||

suyaṃdhi tailābhyagaṃ tu majjanaśālā praveśanaṃ |
atha maṃjanamaṃḍapaṇi pīṭhopaveśanaṃ || 16 ||

divyasnānīyamatha ca kuryādudvartanaśubhaṃ |
tata ullodakasnānaṃ kanaketi pada tataḥ || 17 ||

kalaśacyutta śabdāṃta savatīrthābhiṣecanaṃ |
rthota vastraparītyuktvāmārjanaṃta tataḥ paraṃ || 18 ||

aruṇena dukūlena parīdhāna mataḥ paraṃ |
aruṇena dukūlenottarīyamathaṃ kalpayet || 19 ||

athālepana śabdāṃte maṃḍapāṃte praveśanaṃ |
athālepana maṃḍapamaṇapīṭhopaveśanaṃ || 20 ||

caṃdanāgaruśabdāṃte kuṃkumeti padaṃ tataḥ |
atha śaṃkumadetyuktvā padaṃ mṛgamadetyatha || 21 ||

atha karpūrakastūrī padaṃ gorocanādyapi |
divyagaṃdha padaṃ sarvāgāṇāṃtace vilepanaṃ || 22 ||

kālāgaru mahādhūpamatha keśabharasya ca |
mallikā mālatī jāti caṃpakāśoka śabdataḥ || 23 ||

śatapatrapadaṃ pūgakuharī padamapyatha |
punnāgatyatha kahlāramukhya savartuśabdataḥ || 24 ||

<p. 21a>

puṣpamālā kalpayāmi namaḥ sragmanurīstiḥ |
atha bhūṣaṇa śabdāṃte maṃḍapāte praveśanaṃ || 25 ||

bhūyo bhūṣaṇa śabdāṃte maṃḍapāṃte maṇīpyatha |
pīṭhopavaiśarna paścādupacāra prakalpaye || 26 ||

navamaṇikya makuṭaṃ caṃdrasya śakalaṃ tataḥ | 
atha sīmetā siṃdūraṃ tatastilaka ratnakaṃ || 27 ||

kālāṃjanaṃ tataḥ vālī yugalaṃ ca samarpayet |
maṇikuṃdulayugmaṃ ca nāsābharaṇamatha || 28 ||

athavā teyāvakaṃ ukalpayedādyabhūṣaṇa |
saṃtapta hemaciṃtākaṃvarakaṃ ca tataḥ paraṃ || 29 ||

sumahatvadakaṃ paścānmuktā valimataḥ paraṃ |
ekāvalī tato devicchanna vīramataḥ || 30 ||

devikepūrayugala catuṣṭhayamataḥ paraṃ |
valayāvalimapyatra kalpayitvomikāvalī || 31 ||

kāṃcīdāmakādya sūtra saubhāgyābharaṇaṃ tataḥ |
kalpayet pādakaṭekaṃ ratnanūpuramapyatha || 32 ||

pādāṃgulīyakaṃ paścāt pāśamekakare tataḥ |
anyahasteṃkuśaṃ paścādapya pradrakṣu saṃbhavaṃ || 33 ||

cāpacāparahastosyāḥ puṣpavāṇānkare pare |
śrīmanmāṇikya śabdāṃte pāduke kalpayedatha || 34 ||

svasamāneti veṣābhiḥ padamāvaraṇepyatha |
devatābhissahetyuktvā mahācakrādhiṇehṛṇaṃ || 35 ||

kāmeśvarāṃ kaparyaṃ kopaveśana mataḥ paraṃ |
sudhā savākhya caṣakaṃ tata ānamanīyakaṃ || 36 ||

karpūravīṭiṭikāṃ paścādānaṃdollāsa śabdaḥ |
paraṃ vilāsahāsaṃcamaṃgalā rātrika tataḥ || 37 ||

chatraṃ ca cāmarayugadarpaṇaṃ tālavṛṃtakaṃ |
gaṃdhaṃ puṣpaṃ dhūpadīpanaivedyāni ca kalpayet || 38 ||

upacārāṃścatuḥ ṣaṣṭisaṃkhyākāccakranāyake |
samarpayitvā śrī devyai navamudrāḥ pradarśya ca || 39 ||

tridhā mūlena saṃtarpya śrīdevīpādukāṃ tataḥ |
agnīśāsura vāyavya madhyādikṣu girīdraṃje || 40 ||

ṣaḍaṃgānarcayeddevyā śrīcakrasya mama priye |
atha nityārcana vakṣye śṛṇuthaikāgnamānasā || 41 ||

śravaṇādapi yasya syāt sādhakassarvasiddhimān |
vā ca sakalaśabdaṃ ca bhuvaneśī mataḥ paraṃ || 42 ||

nityaklinnemadapadaṃ dravesaurityathoccaret |
eṣā kāmeśvarī vidyā sarvakāma samṛddhidā || 43 ||

nityeyaṃ prathamā sākṣāt pratipattithi nāyikā |
ādau vidyāṃ samuccārya padaṃ kāmeśvrītyatha || 44 ||

nityā śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmīti manumuccaret |
samasta nityā vidyāṃte tattannityābhityābhidhānvita 45 ||

pādukāṣṭākṣaraṃ maṃtraṃ samuccārya prapūjayet |
vācaṃ bhagabhuge śabdaṃ bhaginīti bhagodari || 46 ||

bhagamāle padaṃ paścāt padadevi bhago vahe |
bhagaguhye bhagetyuktvā yoginī ca bhagetyatha || 47 ||

nipātanīti sarveti bhagetyatha dharśakari |
bhagarūpetha nityādya klinne bhaga pada tataḥ || 48 ||

<p. 21b>

tataḥ svarūpe sarvāṇi bhagānīti padaṃ tataḥ |
mehyānaya padaṃ paścādvarade pāmapyartha || 49 ||

rete surete ca bhaga klinne klinnadrave tataḥ |
kledayadrāvayet yuktvā śramodye padamapyatha || 50 ||

bhagaviccekṣubhekṣuktrā kṣobhayeti padātparaṃ |
sarvasarvānathoccārya bhageśvari padaṃ tataḥ || 51 ||

vācaṃ krūkāṣṭamaṃ kṛcabhūṁtsacavlūmodhūmataḥ |
parayektadomityathoccārya klinne sarvāṇi śabdataḥ || 52 ||

bhagānimevaśaṃ paścādānayaṃ strī mataḥ paraṃ |
padaharapalaṃ māyāṃ nityaiṣā bhagamālinī || 53 ||

vācaṃ māyāṃ samuccārya nityaklinne madadrave |
vahnijāyeti nityoktvā nityaklinnābhidhā parā || 54 ||

praṇavaṃ pāśavījaṃ camrau krauṃ drauṃṣṭrā mataḥ paraṃ |
jrauṁ svāheti caturthyeṣābhe rudrāṃ sarvasiddhidā || 55 ||

praṇavaṃ pūrvamuccāryāni lokeśī mataḥ paraṃ |
padaṃ ca vahni vāsinyai namasānvitamapyatha || 56 ||

samastasiddhidā proktā nityaiṣā vahnivāsinī |
hrī klinne vā ca muccārya vījamaṃkuśanāmakaṃ || 57 ||

padaṃ nityamadāṃte ca drave hrīmiti coccaret |
mahāvajreśvarī nityā ṣaṣṭhīyaṃ sarvadvidā || 58 ||

praṇavaṃ bhuvaneśānīśi dūtyai namastataḥ |
śivādūtyabhidhā nityā saptamī samuvīritā || 59 ||

trayī bhayī ca kavacaṃ khecarīti padaṃ tataḥ |
kṣuśrī hūṃ kṣetrilokeśī padamastra mataḥ paraṃ || 60 ||

nityeyaṃ tvaritā proktā samastaphaladāyinī |
kumāryeva tataḥ proktā nityātha kulasuṃdarī || 61 ||

haseti kalaretyuktvā vogaviṃduyutadākṣaraṃ |
hasāyakatrāretyuktvādārṇa viṃdusmarānvitaṃ || 62 ||

haseti kalaretyuktvāduṃ viṃdu manu saṃyutaṃ |
nityābhidhe yamuddiṣṭānitthā sarvaśubhapradā || 63 ||

hrīṃ prestu mityathoccārya vījamaṃkuśanāmakaṃ |
mukhavṛtta kāmarājaṃ vācyaglmāmityathoccaret || 64 ||

nityādyamadaśabdīte drave kavacamuccaret |
pre jrauṁ nīlapatākeyaṃ nityā sarvaphalapradā || 65 ||

bhamarāṃte marudvījaṃ vāmakarṇa vibhūṣitaṃ |
viṃdvaṃ kitamiyaṃ nityā vijayāśu phalapradā || 66 ||

caṃdraṃ varuṇamārūḍhaṃ manurvidu samanvitaṃ |
uktā samastaphaladā nittheyaṃ sarvamaṃgalā || 67 ||

trayī vījaṃ nati yutaṃ pada bhagavatītyatha |
jvālāmāliniśakāṃte devadeva pada tataḥ || 68 ||

sarvabhūtapadaṃ saṃhārāte śabdaṃ ca kāriṇe |
jātavedasi śabdāṃte jvaladvitayamapyatha || 69 ||

prajvaladvitayaṃ paścānmāyāṃ jāti trayānvitāṃ |
raphasamakamuccārya jvālāmālinyathādrite || 70 ||

<p. 22a>

kacacāstre tato nityā jvālāmālinyatharitā |
samastaiśvarya phaladā rogaśokanikṛṃtanā || 71 ||

cāghamagni samāyuktaṃ manu viṃdu vibhūṣitaṃ |
klinnā paṃcadaśī nityāmā mahāsiddhipradā smṛtā || 72 ||

ṣoḍaśī sarvajagatā mātā sakalasiddhidā |
śrīvidyaiva mahāvidyā lalitā parameśvarī || 73 ||

etāḥ svarādyā ābhyarcyā śrīdevī lalitākāḥ |
nityā paṃcaśa prāktāyā etā girikanyake || 74 ||

pratipatyaurṇamāsyaṃtathinīmadhi devabhāḥ |
ṣoḍaśīyā mahānityā mūlaprakṛtirīśvarī || 75 ||

samasta jagatāṃ mātā nityānāmapi nāyikā |
pratipatyaurṇamāsyaṃta divaseṣva khileṣvapi || 76 ||

ekaikāṃ pūjayannityāṃ caturviśāpacārakaiḥ |
nityā paṃcadaśārcāṃta maṃtramuccārya yatnataḥ || 77 ||

tirthi nityāṃ tridhābhyarcya saubhāgyamatulāṃ labhet |
nityā maṃtra japaṃ homamarcanaṃ yodite dine || 78 ||

karoti sādhako bhūmau sa ena parameśvaraḥ |
nityā paṃcadaśātyarcya tithi nityā phalapradāṃ || 79 ||

anyatyīrcyātha mahānityāṃ tridhā vā paṃcadhārcayat |
mahadbhāgyama vāpnoti devānāmapi dullābhaṃ || 80 ||

nityā paṃcadaśābhyarcyanithi nityā mataḥ paraṃ |
janabhyacyātha vā nityaṃ śrīdevī lalitāṃ parāṃ || 81 ||

mahānityāṃ samabhyarcya paṃcadhā vā tridhāpi vā |
gururpāduḥ samabhyarcya śreyo rāśi mavāpnuyāt || 82 ||

gurupadbhiṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇughvā vahitā śive |
gurupaṅkti manabhyarcya na vṛddhiṃ yāti bhūtale || 86 ||

parameśvara śabdāṃte parameśvaryathāṃvikā |
śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmītyaṣṭārṇaṃ yojayestriye || 87 ||

anayaiva mahāvidyā vikhyātā jagatītale |
pareśa parameśyaṃvāṃ gururūpāṃ purorcayat || 88 ||

mitreśamatha ṣaṣṭhī śamodbhīśaṃ ca tataḥ |
paracaryānātha tato lopāmudrāṃ vāgastya saṃjñakau || 89 ||

devānāṃ lalitā dīkṣā pradācāryā ime smṛtāḥ |
sarvatrā naṃdanātha śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāni ca || 90 ||

anenaiva vidhānena guru paṅkti samarcayet |
ānaṃdanātha śabdo na lopāmudrā gurau śive || 91 ||

lopāmudrā prabhāvena devāsīyuṃratāṃgatā |
pati brahmāmukhāllabdhā vidyā salasiddhidāḥ || 92 ||

pativratā śivo nityaṃyaḥ prāpnoti dine dine |
dinedinesya śreyāṃsi varddhate sarvasaṃpadaḥ || 93 ||

tasmādācārya patnīyā sādhvī putravatī śive |
tāmabhyarcya naro nityaṃ śrīdhiyā sarvasiddhibhāk || 94 ||

ācāryādapinatpatnī vāso laṃkaraṇādibhiḥ |
jaganmāt dhiyābhyayā viśepeṇa mahotsave || 95 ||

ādhārastparva bhāgyānāpihāmutrāpi jāyate |
divyaughamādāvabhyarcya siddhauyamatha pūjaptena || 96 ||

<p. 22b>

kālatāpanamabhyarcya dharmācāryamataḥ paraṃ |
muktakeśīśvaraṃ dīpakalānāthamathoryayet || 97 ||

siddhānāṃ guravaḥ proktārame catvāra iṣṭadāḥ |
siddhauyamiti saṃpūjya mānavaughamathārcayet || 98 ||

viṣṇudevaṃ purobhyarcya prabhākaramataḥ paraṃ |
tejodevamathābhyarcya manojaṃ ca tataḥ priye || 99 ||

kalyāṇaṃ ratnavevaṃ ca vāsudeva mataḥ paraṃ |
paraṃ śrīrāmānaṃdanāthākhyamarcayejjagatāṃ guruṃ || 100 ||

paṃcadhā brahmaraṃdhratha pādukāmaṃtramuccaran |
viśeṣatārcayettredhā tataḥ svagurupādukāṃ || 101 ||

arcayediti saṃproktā layāṃgāccā mayā śive |
kṛtvālayogapūjāṃ vā pratyahaṃ sādhakottamaḥ || 102 ||

sarvajñatvamavāpnoti siddhiṃ prāpnotyanuttamāṃ ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasyadāśarathīyetaṃtre vedārthasaṃgrahe uttarabhāge 
saubhāgyavidyodaye aṣṭamodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 22b>

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

athāvaraṇa devīnāmarcana saṃpravakṣyeta |
bhogāṃgākhyaṃ mahādevi bhogasvargāpavargadaṃ || 1 ||

aṇimāṃ laghimāṃ mahimāmīśatvamataḥ paraṃ |
vaśitva siddhiṃ prākāmya siddhiṃ bhuktimataḥ paraṃ || 2 ||

icchāsiddhiṃ prāptisiddhiṃ sarvakāmābhidhāmatha |
caturasre prāthamike pūjyā etā mama priye || 3 ||

dvitīye caharasretha brāhmī māheśvarīmapi |
kaumārī vaiṣṇavīmaṃ vā vārāhī ca tataḥ paraṃ || 4 ||

māheṃdrīmapi cāmuṃḍāṃ mahālakṣmī samarcayet |
tṛtīye caturasretha mudrāṃ saṃkṣobhiṇīyapi || 5 ||

sarvavidrāviṇīmudrāṃ sarvākarṣaṇikāmapi |
sarvavaśyābhidhāṃ mudrāṃ sarvonmādanikāṃ tathā || 6 ||

mudrāṃ mahākuśāṃ sarvakhecarī yonimapyatha |
sarvatrikhaṃḍamudrāṃ ca pūjeyadiri kanyake || 7 ||

aṇimāyāḥ paścimādi dikṣvabhyarcyā vidikṣu ca |
pūrvādi kramatobhyarcyā brāhmādyāḥ sarvamātaraḥ || 8 ||

kṣobhiṇyāyāḥ paścimādi dikṣu pūjyā vidikṣapi |
etāḥ stritārī vījādyāḥ pādukāṃtāḥ prapūjayet || 9||

tritāraitāḥ padaṃ paścāt prakaṭeti padaṃ tataḥ |
yoginyaḥ padamābhāṣya padaṃ trailokya mohanai || 10 ||

cakre samudrā ityuktvā sa siddhaya itīrayet |
sāyudhāḥ padamābhāṣya padapaścāt saśaktayaḥ || 11 ||

savāhanāstya parīvārāḥ sa vopapadaṃ tataḥ |
vāraismapūjitāssaṃtu maṃtreṇānena suṃdari || 12 ||

trailokyamohanaracakre prakaṭāyoginītyajet |
tāratritayamuccārya karaśuddhikaramatuṃ || 13 ||

uccārya tripurācakreśvaryerśabdaṃ namonvitaṃ |
uccārya tripurācakreśvarya vā śrīpadaṃ tataḥ || 14 ||

pādukāṃ pūjayāmīti yajeccakreśvarī sive |
sarvaṃ saṃkṣobhiṇī mudrāṃ vījapūrvāṃ pradarśayet || 15 ||

<p. 23a>

prathamāvaraṇāṃ proktamitthaṃ sakalasiddhidaṃ |
kalāsretha mahāpadme vakṣye pūjāvidhiṃ śṛṇu || 16 ||

tāratritayamuccārya svaramekaikaśopi ca |
pūjayet sakalānityāṃ kalā ṣoḍaśaśailaje || 17 ||

kāmākarṣiṇikā vudhyākarṣiṇī ca tataḥ paraṃ || 18 ||

ahaṃkārākarṣiṇī ca śabdākarṣikā tathā |
sparśākarṣaṇikā rūpākarṣiṇī ca tataḥ paraṃ || 19 ||

rasākarṣaṇikā gaṃdhākarṣiṇyatha himādrije |
cittākarṣaṇikā dhairyākarṣiṇī ca tataḥ paraṃ || 20 ||

smṛtyākarṣiṇīkā nāmākarṣiṇī ca mama priyai |
vījākārṣeṇikācātmākarṣiṇī ca tataḥ paraṃ || 21 ||

amṛtākarṣiṇī yaścāccharīrākarṣiṇī tathā |
etānityā kalāṃtāḥ syuḥ ṣoḍaśārādhi devatāḥ || 22 ||

aṃte vasvarṇasahitāḥ pūjanīyāḥ prayatnataḥ |
etā guptapadāṃte ca yoginyaḥ padamuccaret || 24 ||

sarvāśā pariśabdāṃtapūraketi padaṃ tataḥ |
cakre samudrā ityādi śeṣaṃ pūrvavaduccaret || 25 ||

tāratraya kumāryaṃte tripureśī padātparaṃ |
cakreśvaryai namaḥ śabdaṃ samuccārya tataḥ paraṃ || 26 ||

tripureśvara śabdāṃte cakreśvaryaṃ vā padātparaṃ |
śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmītyuktvā cakreśvarīṃ yajet || 27 ||

sarvāśāpūrakaṃ cakramitthamabhyarcyasādaraṃ |
sarvaviṇīmudrāṃ vījapūrvaṃ pradarśayet || 28 ||

sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇe cakre devatā arghayedatha |
tāratritayamuccārya kavargādyaṣṭakaṃ tataḥ || 29 ||

uccārya pūjayet paścādanaṃga kusumādikāḥ |
anaṃga kusumānaṃga mekhalā ca tataḥ paraṃ || 30 ||

anaṃgadaṃmenā paścānaṃga madanāturā |
anaṃgarekhācānaṃgaveginī yamalocane || 31 ||

anaṃgāvaṃ kuśānaṃgamālinī ca tataḥ śive |
devī śrīpādukā muktvā pūjayāmīti yojayet || 32 ||

tritāryaitāḥ padaṃ guptatarayoginya ityatha |
sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇe cakre śiṣṭaṃ pūrvavaduccaret || 33 ||

ātmāsanasahāvidyāmatha tripurasuṃdarī |
cakreśvaryai namaḥ paścātpunastripurasuṃdarī || 34 ||

cakreśvaryaṃvikā paścādvasvakṣaramataḥ paraṃ |
itthaṃ tṛtīyāvaraṇaiśvarī tripurasuṃdarī || 35 ||

abhyarcya darśayedvīja pūrvāmākarṣiṇīmatha |
devatā arthayet paścāt sarvasaubhāgyadāyake || 36 ||

kakārādi ḍhakārāṃssaṃkṣobhiṇyādikāḥ kramāt |
sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇī śaktissarvavidrāviṇī tathā || 37 ||

sarvākarṣiṇīkā paścāt sarvāhlādanikāpi ca |
sarvasammohinī sarvastaṃbhinī ca tataḥ paraṃ || 38 ||

sarvajaṃbhanikā śaktistathā sarvavaśaṃkarī |
sarvaraṃjanikā sarvonmādinī ca tataḥ śive || 39 ||

<p. 23b>

sarvārthasādhakā śaktissarvasaṃpattipūraṇī |
sarvamaṃtramayīśakti sarvadvaṃdva kṣayaṃkarī || 40 ||

śakti śrīpādukāmuktvā pūjayāmīti yojayet |
tritāraitāssaṃpradāya yogibhyaśca tataḥ paraṃ || 41 ||

sarvasaubhāgyaśabdaṃtidārake cakra īrayet |
śiṣṭaṃ pūrvavaduccārya cakre saubhāgyakecaye || 42 ||

cakrāsana mahāvidyāmuccārya tripuratyatha |
vāsinīti padaṃ cakreśvarye śabdaṃ namonvitaṃ || 43 ||

uccārya tripurāṃvāsinī cakreśvarī padaṃ |
cakreśvarī padaṃ paścādvasuvarṇaṃ samuccaret || 44 ||

itthaṃ cakreśvarībhiṣṭāvaśyamudrī pradarśayet |
sarvārthasādhake cakre devatārcā pravakṣyeta || 45 ||

sarvasiddhipradā devī sarvasaṃpatpradā tathā |
sarvapriyaṃkarī devī sarvamaṃgalakāriṇī || 46 ||

sarvakāmapradādevī sarvaduḥkhavimocanī |
sarvamṛtyupraśamanī sarvavighnanivāriṇī || 47 ||

sarvāṃgasuṃdarī devī sarvasaubhāgyadāyinī |
ṇakārādi phakārāṃtā etā devīssamarcayet || 48 ||

tritāryetāḥ kuralottīrṇayogipurā śrīcakreśvaryaṃ vā padaṃ tataḥ |
śrīpādukā pūjayāmītyuktvā cakreśvarī yajet || 51 ||

vījapūrvaṃti tassarvonmādamudrāṃ ca darśayet |
sarvarakṣākare cakre devatā pūjayedatha || 52 ||

sarvājñā sarvaśaktiśca sarvaiśvaryapradā tathā |
sarvajñānmayī devī sarvavyādhi vināśinī || 53 ||

sarvācāra svarūpā ca sarvapāpaharā tathā |
sarvānaṃdamayī devī sarvarakṣā svarūpiṇī || 54 ||

sarvepsitapradāmāti dakṣāṃtā etāssamarcayet |
tretāryātāni garbhādya yoginyaḥ padamapyatha || 55 ||

sarvarakṣāko cakre śeṣaṃ pūrvavaduccaret |
samaṣṭi pūjā kṛtvātha sādhya siddhāsanātparaṃ || 56 ||

tripurāmālinī cakreśverye śabda namonvitaṃ |
uccārya tripuret yuktvā mālinī padamapyatha || 57 ||

cakreśvaryaṃcikā śabdaṃ pādukāmaṃtra saṃyutaṃ |
uccārya pūjayeccakrarājñī tripuramālinī || 58 ||

mudrāṃ mahāṃkuśāṃ kṛtvā vījapūrvāṃgirīdraje |
sarvaṇyo hare cakre devatā arghayedatha || 59 ||

vāgdevatāṣṭakaṃ tattadvīja pūrva himādrije |
pūjāmaṃtra samāyuktaṃ namaḥ sthāne sayaccāyat || 60 ||

etā rahasyayoginyaḥ sarvarājaherapadaṃ |
cakre śeṣamathoccārya tritārādyāssamarcayet || 61 ||

yajet tripurasiddhāṃ ca mūrtividyā purassarāṃ |
vīmathoyāryamudrāṃ kuryācca khecarī || 62 ||

tryasra vāhya caturdikṣu vāṇādyarcanamācaret |
drāṁ drīṁ klī ṣṇū mathoccāryasaḥ sarvapadamapyatha || 63 ||

jaṃbhanebhyaḥ padaṃ paścādvāṇebhyo nama uccaret |
atha tretārinādyaṃte sarvasaṃmohanīya ca || 64 ||

dhanuṣenama uccārya māyā vījamataḥ paraṃ |
vaśīkaraṇaśabdaṃ ca caturthī hṛdayānvitaṃ || 65 ||

<p. 24a>

aṃkuśaṃ sarvaśabdāyastaṃbhanāyāṃkuśāya ca |
nama uktvā caturdikṣu vāṇādīniti pūrayet || 66 ||

trikoṇetha pravakṣyāmi mahākāmeśvarīpuraḥ |
mahāvajreśvarī paścānmahāśrībhagamālinī || 67 ||

vākvāmaśakti khaṃḍāyā etāstihyassamarpayet |
mahāśrīsuṃdarī paṃścāt khaṃḍatritayapūrvikāṃ || 68 ||

kumārī pūrvikāṃ caiva madhye saṃpūjayedatha |
yoginī navamī cakradevī ca navamī tathā || 69 ||

nityānāṃ ṣoḍaśī cātra mahāśrīsuṃdarī tathā |
atha vaidava cakrasthā lalitā paradevatā || 70 ||

ekaiveti samākhyātā na bhedokrāsti pārvati |
na maṃtra devatā bhedo vidye tatra samapriye || 71 ||

etā api rahasyākhyā yogibhyaḥ padamapyatha |
sarvasiddhipradecakre śeṣaṃ pūrvavaduccaret || 72 ||

samaṣṭyarcā samāpyesthaṃ vidyāmāvāhnīmatha |
uccārya tripurāvāṃ cakraiśvaryai nama uccaret || 73 ||

tripurāṃ vā padaṃ cakreśvaryaṃ vā padamapyatha |
śrīpākā pūjayāmītyuktvā cakreśvarīṃ yajet || 74 ||

vījamudrāṃ pradarśyātharīja varṇapurassarā |
vaidaṃvetha mahācakre sāmrājī saṃvidaṃ yajet || 75 ||

tāratrayaṃ mūlaviyāṃ śrīmahātripuretyatha |
suṃdari śrīmahāśabdaṃ tataśca parameśvarī || 76 ||

śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmītyaṣṭākṣaramataḥ paraṃ |
uktvābhyacyotratāryaiṣā parāpara padaṃ tataḥ || 77 ||

rahasyayoginī paścāt sarvānaṃdamaye padaṃ |
cakre samudrā śabdaṃ ca sa siddhissāyudhā padaṃ || 78 ||

saśaktiḥ padamābhāṣyapadaṃ cātha savāhanā |
padaṃ sadyarivārā sarvopacārairataḥ paraṃ || 79 ||

saṃpūjitā stviti proktvā mūlavidyāmataḥ punaḥ |
uktvātha śrīmahāśabdaṃ tripureti padātparaṃ || 80 ||

suṃdarī śrīmahācakreśvaryai śabdadanvitaṃ |
uktvātha śrīmahāśabdaṃ tripuretyatha suṃdarī || 81 ||

śrīmahāūrvaka cakreśvarya vā padamapyatha |
śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmītyarcayesaradevatāṃ || 82 ||

vāgbhavādyāṃ yonimudrāṃ darśayitvā tataḥ paraṃ |
dhūpaṃ dīpanivedyātha navamudrāḥ pradarśayet || 83 ||

paṃcadhā vā tridhā mūlavidyāmuccārya yatnataḥ |
tarpayitvātha naivedya bhagavatyai samarpayet || 84 ||

datvātha madhye pānīya muttarāpośanaṃ tataḥ |
hastā prakṣālane datvā tāṃvūlaṃ ca nivedayet || 85 ||

saṃkalpa viṃdunā cakraṃ kucau viṃdudvaye na hi |
yoniṃ dhyātvā (**)dhenaṃ ciṃtayettaradhomasyaṃ || 86 ||

darpa kāmakalārūpaṃ dhyātvā sakalabhāgyadaṃ |
japet saubhāgya hṛdayaṃ bhogamokṣa phalapradaṃ || 87 ||

<p. 24b>

(*)maḥ puṃvatkaraṃ saṃdidaruṇetaruragimayaṃ |
kalāpaṃcadaśārabdhaṃ namanīyaṃ paraṃ mahaḥ || 88 ||

tanmahaḥ paramaṃ naimi kṛtyaiḥ paṃcabhiraṃkitaṃ |
aśeṣa viśvamedātmā pūrṇahṛtātmakaṃ śivaṃ || 89 ||

tridhā vibhaktaṃ padvastustotṛstutyastuti kramāt |
ekasmaimahatye tasmai namassakala cakṣuṣe || 90 ||

smarāmitāṃ parāṃ vācaṃ paśyaṃtyādi kramāthayāṃ |
nānāvidha mahākārasānu bhavakāraṇaṃ || 91 ||

deśakāla padāthātmīyadyadvastu yathā pathā |
tattadrūpeṇayābhātitāṃ śrayehaṃvidho kalāṃ || 92 ||

mūlādi valaparyaṃtaṃ mahātripurasuṃdari |
yā tanustenaḍit prakhyātāṃ bhajebhavaśālinīṃ || 93 ||

yonau kanakavarṇābhaṃ hyādi vidupayojvalaṃ |
ājñāyāṃ caṃdrasaṃkāśaṃ mahasta ca maheśvari || 94 ||

prasṛtāmṛtarannaugha saṃtarpita carācarāṃ |
bhavāni bhavaśītyaitvāṃ bhāvayāmya mṛteśvari || 95 ||

varṇāḥ kalāpadaṃ tatvaṃ maṃtro bhuvanameva ca |
ityaṣva ṣaṣṭiṃ deveśi bhātitvapi cidātmani || 96 ||

anyāśritādi kālādārudrāṃtaṃ citramadbhutaṃ |
uśrīlayasimātastva prakāśa vapuṣitvapi || 97 ||

yadīdaṃ bhāsate devināmarūpī kriyātmaka |
prakāśavapuṣastva ca tatsarvaṃ nātiricyate || 98 ||

netrādi mūlakopāṃte hṛtyamāsanalīlayā |
vāraṃvāraṃtvayā devi rūpādi madhusevyate || 99 ||

saṃvidevyassamākramya viṣayā namṛtāsavaṃ |
yogīnāṃ prīṣayatvāryatva pūjārthaṃ hi sarvadā || 100 ||

saubhāgya hṛdayaṃ guhyaṃ śivānaṃdena yoginā |
samārādhana pūrvarthaṃ smṛtaṃ sakalakāmadaṃ || 101 ||

iti viracita metatraipuraṃstotramāsaṃ prakaṭita paramārthaṃ yogivaryo yajuṣṭaṃ |
makaladurita rogadhvaṃsanānanyakāryaṃ pratiyajatavidhānaṃ sevyatāṃ śaktiyukteḥ || 
102 ||

naivedyānaṃtaraṃ mūlavidyāṃ japtvā yathā ruci |
saubhāgya hṛdayaṃ japtvā vāmabhāge tataḥ paraṃ || 103 ||

caturasra samabhyuktaṃ vṛtta kṛtvā manoharaṃ |
vāgmarva paścādvayakāṃte tataḥ paraṃ || 104 ||

maṃḍalāya namastatra maṃḍalaṃ saṃprapūjayet |
tatra pātraṃ pratiṣṭhāpya praṇavaṃ bhuvaneśvarī || 105 ||

sarvavighnapadaṃ kṛbhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhya ityatha |
(*) vahni bhāminī mityaṃ triruccārya tataḥ paraṃ || 106 ||

datvā bhūtapadaṃ paścādadyānnīrājaṃ śive |
mūlavidyāṃ samuccārya tāratritayamapyatha || 107 ||

samastacakra cakreśī yute devi navātmike |
ārātrikamidaṃ dīpaṃ gṛhāṇā mama siddhaye || 108 ||

iti nīrājanaṃ datvā mūlavidyāṃ samuccaran |
datvā puṣpāṃjaliṃ samyak tridhā kṛtvā pradakṣiṇāṃ || 109 ||

<p. 25a>

sāṣṭāṃga daṃḍavannatvāstutvāstotrairanekaśaḥ |
śrīvidyābhyarcya gaṃdhādyaistāṃvūlādyaissuvāsinī || 110 ||

anabhyarcyāpi vā mudrāṃ khecarī saṃpradarśya ca |
kṣamasveti śriyaṃ devīmātmanyudvāsanettataḥ || 111 ||

cakrarājasya kṛtvettha sakṛdapyarcanaṃ śive |
śriyamaṣṭaguṇāṃ prāpya brahmarūpo bhavatyasau || 112 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedāsārārthasaṃgrahe(-)
saubhāgyāvidyodaye navamodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 25a>

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

śṛṇu devi mahābhāge cakrārcana phalaṃ śubhaṃ |
śravaṇādapi yasyasyussiddhayoṣṭāṇimādayaḥ || 1 ||

uttamānityapūjāsyān madhyamaṃ pakṣapūjanaṃ |
māsapūjādhamā proktā pātakaudya vibhedinī || 2 ||

ya icchatyapi māheṃdrī kauverīmapi saṃpadaṃ |
ṣaṇmāsamanvahaṃ bhaktyā cakrarājārcanā śubhaṃ || 3 ||

kṛtvā vaśyamāpnoti dhanadena samaṃ śriyaṃ |
yaḥ kuryādvatsaranityāṃ navāvaraṇapūjanaṃ || 4 ||

svaśriyā dhanadaiśvaryaṃtarāleśāyatehyasau |
vedaśāstrapurāṇādi vidyā api sudurlabhāḥ || 5 ||

asya vakvādi niryāṃti (*)nadhītā api svayaṃ |
dharmārtha kāmokṣāthi prakṣavārthā sudurlabhāḥ || 6 ||

tiṣṭhaṃti tatkare nityamājñayāstrigurorvibhāḥ |
ādau maṃdirapūjāsyāllayāṃgāryā tataḥ paraṃ || 7 ||

bhāgāṃgāryā tṛtīyāsyā tridhā pūjayemīritā |
layāṃgā pūjā kṛtvā vā satataṃ sādhakottamaḥ || 8 ||

devīvaṃdanamālākhya vidyāmuccārya tatparaṃ |
arghayan sarvasaubhāgyasaṃpannassiddhimātravet || 9 ||

samastacakrapūjāṃ vā madhya cakrārcana tu |
vāhvahvā triśapte makātejayanyaṃ vadaśākṣarī || 10 ||

aṣṭā viṃśatidhā hutvā gavyājyaṃ jātavedasi |
āṇimādyaṣṭa siddhīnāṃ nāyako jagatītale || 11 ||

devatānāṃ sahaṣīṇāmapi vagho bhavatyasau |
cakrasihāsanaṃ devi deśe vā nagarepi vā || 12 ||

yatrānena vidhānena sādhakena prapūjyate |
svagṛhe vā vane grāme jagatkṣobhaḥ prajāyate || 13 ||

jvalatkāmāgni saṃtāpa prataptā saptamānasāḥ |
pipīlikādinyāyena dūrādāyāṃtiyoṣitaḥ || 14 ||

maṃtrasaṃmūḍhahṛdayāḥ sphurajjaghanamaṃḍalāḥ |
taddarśanān mahādevi jāyaṃte sarvayoṣitaḥ || 15 ||

tāmre vilaṃbhitaṃ cakraṃ yena saṃpūjyatenvahaṃ |
tasyāpi siddhirmahatī jāyate na cirādiha || 16 ||

ratneṣu likhitaṃ cakraṃ sphāṭikaṃ vāmanodamaṃ |
dadāti sakalānarthānvatsaravrittayesmahi || 17 ||

likhitaṃ rājitaṃ cakramācāryānujñayā caruṃ |
sāṃgaṃ prapūjyate yatra dhanadhānyādi saṃkulā || 18 ||

<p. 25b>

tanmaṃdire mahālakṣmīścaṃcalāpya ca lābhavet |
dhiṣaṇādhiya sādṛśyaṃ vidyābhiścāsya sidhyati || 19 ||

kaṃdarpa sadṛśī kāṃtiḥ śrayo rāśiḥ pade pade |
putrapautrādi saṃpattiracirādasya sidhyati || 20 ||

brahmānaṃda sukhā vāmire kasminneva janmani |
bhavatyasya na saṃdeho viśvāsaṃ kurubhāmini || 21 ||

sauvarṇaṃ likhitaṃ cakramācāryasya kṛpāvaśāt |
vījagarbhamavījaṃ vā yena mityaṃ prapūjyate || 22 ||

avaśya maṇimādyaṣṭa siddhayastasyayaṃdire |
kiṃkarādavaniṣṭaṃti mūrtimatyo mama triye || 23 ||

dhanadhānyādi saṃpūrṇā muktāralaugha saṃkulā |
gajāśvaratha saṃyuktā paśubhṛtya gaṇānvitā || 24 ||

ākalyaṃ maṃdire taya saṃtati vyāpinī parā |
tiṣṭhatye vā valā lakṣmīrdaivatairapi durlabhā || 25 ||

sarvāsāmapi vidyānāmadhiyaḥ syājjaḍopyayaṃ |
putrapautrābhivṛthyāsau kaśyapa pratimo bhavet || 26 ||

kāṃtyā śithilapatnyāśu pativratyaṃrapi |
rājāno rājamāścattadbhṛtyāḥ sacivā api || 27 ||

kiṃkarā iva tiṣṭhaṃti kiṃ kartavyadhiyānvitāḥ |
nivasaṃti gṛhe yasya teṣāmapi naro gatā || 28 ||

pīḍā bhavati sarpāṇāṃ prāpipīḍādāruṇā |
svacchaṃdamaraṇaṃ tasya vaśyānāmapi jāyate || 29 ||

sauvarṇa cakrasānnidhye śarīraṃ yo vimuṃcati |
śrapacānāgṛhaṃ vāpita uktaṃ vadarīvanaṃ || 30 ||

cakrarājasya sānnidhyaṃ sadākāśī nigadyate |
cakrarājārcanaṃ samya kurvannanvahamādarāt || 31 ||

tṛṇī karoti devāṃśca kimumatyīn mahītale |
haima cakrārcanaṃ nityaṃ kṛtvā pratyahamādarāt || 32 ||

niyata striśataṃ japtvā śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarī |
maṃḍala dvitayādvarddhaṃ rājānaṃ nagaraṃ tu vā || 33 ||

deśaṃ grāmaṃ manuṣyāṃśca svavaśī kurute dhruvaṃ |
ṣaṇmāsaṃ pūjayedyastu varṇa cakranāyakaṃ || 34 ||

devānapi sa gaṃdharvān yakṣakinnararākṣasān |
brahmaṣīnapi devaṣīnyatragānu surānapi || 35 ||

dāsabhūtānkarotyeva saṃśayo nātra vidyate |
śrīcakra manvahaṃ haimaṃ sāṃśaṃ varṇaṃ prapūjayan || 36 ||

ācārya sadṛśo rājñāṃ nārīṇāṃ madanoyamaḥ |
vaśīkaroti trailokyaṃ sa devā surarākṣasaṃ || 37 ||

kakinnaraṃ sa gaṃdharvaṃ sa yakṣapatayoṇaṃ |
raṃbhorvaśyādikā divyākṣarasopi manoharā || 38 ||

nāgakanyāśca devānāṃ gaṃdharvāṇāṃ ca kanyakāḥ |
vaśībhūtā bhavaṃtyasyadāsīvannātra saṃśayaḥ || 39 ||

mahadā puṣpamārogyamaiśvaryamaṇimādikaṃ |
sarvavidyādhipatyaṃ ca jarāmṛtyu nivartanaṃ || 40 ||

<p. 26a>

putrapautrābhi vṛddhiśca samaddhirdhāna saṃpadāṃ |
muktāratna samṛddhiśca śreyo vṛddhirdine dine || 41 ||

sidhyatyasya na saṃdeho varṣārūrdhvaṃ mama priye |
atha vakṣye maheśāni śrīvidyāpūjanaṃ mahat || 42 ||

brahmahatyādi doṣāṇāṃ sayonāśakaraṃ paraṃ |
brahmapuṣpairmaheśāni sāṃgaṃ śrīcakramanvahaṃ || 43 ||

māsamātraṃ samābhyarcya mahāpātaka koṭibhiḥ |
vimukto mahatīṃ lakṣmī dhanadhānyādi saṃkulāṃ || 44 ||

avāpya sarvavidyābhirbharvatyaṃgisoremaḥ |
japāpuṣpaissamabhyarcya śrīkraṃsāṃgamanvahaṃ || 45 ||

brahmahatyāsibhirdoṣairjanmāṃtara kṛtairapi |
vimukto nātra saṃdeho dhanavāna jāyate vudhaḥ || 46 ||

ketakīruṇaiḥ patrairnityamabhyarcya sādaraṃ |
upapātakasaṃghāṃśca māsamātreṇa nāśayet || 47 ||

kaṃdarpya samasaubhāgyaṃ prāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
karavīrai samabhyarcya śrīcakraṃ sāṃgamanvahaṃ || 55 ||

mahāpāpopa pāpaurghairvimukto māsamātrataḥ |
vidhayājīva saṃkāśodhanena dhanadopamaḥ || 56 ||

māsatrayādbhavatyeva kāṃtyā kāma samaprabhaḥ |
śatapatrairmanoramyairmāsamadhaṃ samarcayan || 57 ||

mahāpātaka rāśibhyo vimukto māsamātrataḥ |
saubhāgyamatulaṃ prāpya śriyaṃ prāpnotya caṃcalāṃ || 58 ||

caṃpakaiḥ sumanoramyai śrīcakraṃ nityamarcayan |
māsamātreṇa muktosau mahāpāpopapātakaiḥ || 59 ||

saṃprāpya mahatī lakṣmīṃ dhanaraghnaugha saṃkulāṃ |
adhiyassarvavidyānāṃ bhūtvā kāma samaprabhaḥ || 60 ||

bhukteha sakalānbhogān vrajatyaṃte paraṃ pādaṃ |
vaṃdhūka kusumairnityaṃ māsamātraṃ samarjayan || 61 ||

vaśīkaroti trailokyaṃ pāpaudyairapi mucyate |
vilvapatraissamabhyarcya māsamātraṃ niraṃtaraṃ || 62 ||

vimuktaḥ sarvapāpebhyaḥ prāpnotya kṣaya saṃpadaṃ |
vilvapatraiśca jalajasahitaiḥ paripūjyan || 63 ||

śatajanmakṛtaiḥ pāpasaṃghairapi vimucyate |
āpuṣpaṃ mahṛdārogyaṃ samṛddhiṃ ca mahattarāṃ || 64 ||

māsādvadhamavāpyāsau jīvanmukto bhaveddhruvaṃ |
mallikā kusumaiścakrarājamabhyarcyasādaraṃ || 65 ||

mahāpātakā rāśibhyo vimukto māsamāsamātrataḥ |
saṃprāpya vipulā lakṣmīṃ prāpnotyaṃte paraṃ padaṃ || 66 ||

mallikā mālatī jātī kuṃdaiśca śatapatravaiḥ |
śaitotvalairvā miśraiśca pratyahaṃ cakramarcayan || 67 ||

śatajanmakṛtaiḥ pāparāśibhiśca vivarjitaḥ |
māsādvardhamavāpnoti śriyaṃ vidyāṃ ca durlabhāṃ || 68 ||

mallikākulamairnityaṃ tulasādalamiśritaiḥ |
cakrarājaṃ samābhyarcya māsaṃ sāṃgaṃ prasannadhīḥ || 69 ||

<p. 26b>

vācā jīva samasmākṣāṣṭiyā dhanada sannibhaḥ |
tejasā ravisaṃkāśo bhūtvā pātaka varjitaḥ || 70 ||

samṛddhiṃ mahatī labdhvā jīvanmukto bhavatyasau |
jaṃvūpravālairabhyarcya cakrarājaṃ dine dine || 71 ||

mahāpātaka saṃghaiśca māsamātreṇa mucyate |
avalāṃ śriya māsādya putrapautra sakhānvitaḥ || 72 ||

cirāyussakalānbhogānbhuktvāṃte bhuktimāpnuyāt |
śamī dūrvāṃ kurairvāpi cakrarājaṃ samarcayan || 73 ||

sahasrajanmajanitaiḥ pātakairapi mucyate |
saubhāgyamatulaṃ prāpya śriyamā protya caṃcalāṃ || 74 ||

raktotpalai samabhyarcya māsaṃ nīlotpalaistuvā |
vimuktaḥ sakalaiḥ pāpairlabhate kṣayasaṃpadaḥ || 75 ||

pāṭalairvakulairnāgakaisarairvā dine dine |
cakrarājaṃ samabhyarcya māsamekaṃ prasannadhīḥ || 76 ||

duritaudyairvimukto sau samṛddhiṃ labhate calāṃ |
sugaṃdhi kusumairnityaṃ pallavairvā sugaṃdhibhiḥ || 77 ||

cakrarājaṃ samabhyarcya sāṃga manvahamādarāt |
samasta pāparāśibhyo vimuktaḥ śriyamakṣayaṃ || 78 ||

avāpyāṃ caṃcalaṃ śreyo brahmaloke mahīyate |
ratnapūjāvidhānaṃ ca kathayāmita vā naye || 79 ||

acaṇādapi yasya syāt sarvasaubhāgya saṃyutaḥ |
nānāpuṣpaissugaṃdhaiśca karpūrakṣoda caṃdanaiḥ || 80 ||

ekaviṃśati rātrāṃtaṃ viṃśatirdharaṇībhujaḥ |
dāsabhūtā karotyeva mahārogāṃścānāśāyet || 81 ||

sūryavaktā vimānmaṃtrī jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ |
muktāralaiśca racayet svarṇa puṣpāṇi suṃdari || 82 ||

ekaviṃśati rātrāṃtaiḥ kartavyaṃ cakrapūjanaṃ |
ekaviṃśati rātreṇa paśya bhūyāna saṃśayaḥ || 83 ||

caṃdravat kāṃtimānmaṃtrī prāpnotya kṣayasaṃpadaḥ |
pravālaghaṭitaiḥ svarṇapuṣpaiḥ śrīcakramarcayan || 84 ||

trisamāhān mahādevi vairi vargānvi nāśayet |
vaśyā bhavaṃti duṣṭāśca bhūpālā nātra saṃśayaḥ || 85 ||

tathā marakatakṣipta svarṇapuṣpaiḥ samarcayan |
vināśayati śakraṃśca vivudhānvaśamānayet || 86 ||

puṣparāga mahāratnaghaṭitaiḥ svarṇaḥnirmitaiḥ |
kusumaiḥ pūjayeccakraṃ trisaptāhāt sureśvari || 87 ||

avaśyā apyamarāstasya varadāssaṃ bhavaṃti ca |
vidyayā jīva sadṛśo bhavatyatra na saṃśayaḥ || 88 ||

suvarṇanirmitaiḥ puṣpairvajrakesarātitaiḥ |
ekaviṃśati rātreṇayorcayeccakranāyakaiṃ || 89 ||

vivudhā api daityāśca vaśāstasya na saṃśayaḥ |
vaśīkaroti trailokyaṃ sa devāsuramānavaṃ || 90 ||

iṃdranīlayutaiḥ svarṇapuṣpaiśca (*) samarcayan |
trailokyaṃ staṃbhayannyeva trisamādānna saṃśayaḥ || 91 ||

<p. 27a>

ekaviṃśati rātreṇa vairivargānvināśayet |
dāsībhūtāstaruropāpināryo yauvanagarvitāḥ || 92 ||

gopte dhṛghaṭitaiḥ svarṇapuṣpaiścakraṃ samarcayet |
saptāhādvairiṇo vaśyā rājānopi na saṃśayaḥ || 93 ||

trisamāhān mahāpāpasaṃghopya vinaśyati |
vaiḍūryaghaṭitaiḥ svarṇapuṣpaiścakraṃ samarcayan || 94 ||

trailokyarataṃ bhayatyeva ciptāhānna saṃśayaḥ |
sarvevaśyā bhavaṃtyeva pāpaudyaiśca vimucyate || 95 ||

puṣpaiḥ puryuṣṭitairdevi nācayet svarṇajairapi |
nirmālya bhūtaiḥ kusumairucchiṣṭhaiḥ parameśvari || 96 ||

navaratnamayaiḥ svarṇapuṣpairyadi śivāṃ yajet |
tadā devāsuranarāḥ pannagā rākṣasā api || 97 ||

savervaśyā bhavaṃtyedhagri saptāhānna saṃśayaḥ |
janmakoṭi kṛtaiyā pairapi māsādvinucyate || 98 ||

svarārilamayaiḥ puṣpaiḥ satataṃ saṃprapūjayan |
daśāśvamaṃdhajatitaṃ phalamāpnonmanuttamaṃ || 99 ||

ratnādi paripūrṇatva padānāstvitadā śṛṇu |
tairiva puṣpaiḥ pūjādi kartavyaṃ sādhakottamaiḥ || 100 ||

yadyat puṣpaṃ patra yatrataṃ datvā mureśvari |
tatra tatra pradātavyaṃ na dātavyaṃ yathecchayo || 101 ||

karavīrādi sahiteḥ svaśāpuṣpaiḥ samarcayan |
koṭijanmakṛtaiḥ pāpairapi māsādimucyate || 102 ||

tulasīmiśritai vilvadalamiśrairathāpi vā |
sugaṃdhi puṣpayuktairvāsujaṃ kṛpallavaistuvāḥ || 103 ||

navāla samāyukta suvarṇa kusumaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
cakrarāja samābhyarcya nimuktassarvapātakaiḥ || 104 ||

śriyamaṣṭamuṇḍeyetāṃ vidyāṃ ca mahatīṃ śubhāṃ |
saṃprāpya śāśvatā puṣpaṃ putrapautrevatīṃ śriyaṃ || 105 ||

saṃprāpya sakalān bhogān brahma sāyujya maśnute |
kārtike mārgaśīṣe vā māghe vā phālgunepi vā || 106 ||

vaiśākhe vāścinemāsi śrāvaṇe vā śubhe dine |
saṃprārthya vahudhācāryaṃ śrīcakraṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ || 107 ||

ācāryahastādgṛhṇīyādāśīrvādapurassaraṃ |
pūjitaṃ yena sauvarṇa śrīcakraṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ || 108 ||

sa patra bhūmyāṃ ca satitamayodhyāpuraṃ viduḥ |
tadeva meruśikharaṃ kailāsasthāna mucyate || 109 ||

ācārya kṛpayā svarṇacakrarājaṃ manoharaṃ |
yasmindine sau gṛhṇāti svācārya karayaṃkajāt || 110 ||

karṣadvayamitaṃ haimahyathadhā ṣaṣṭi cihnakaṃ |
ācāryapatnyai śrīvudhyā dadyādābharaṇa śubhaṃ || 111 ||

trirāccihnuka haimaṃ vā gurupatnyai samarcaya ca |
yathāśaktatā samabhyarcya svācāryamapi bhūṣaṇaiḥ || 112 ||

śrīvidyāyā mahāsiddhiṃ māpnotya ca calasaṃpadaṃ |
taṃ pālayaṃti sutavadyoginyo mātaropi ca || 113 ||

<p. 27b>

padmahastāḥ subhūṣaṇāḥ || 51 ||

pādaprakṣālanodyuktejahu sūryasutepuraḥ |
arcayitvā śaṃkhapadmaunidhī ca dhṛta cāmarau || 52 ||

abhyarcya pārśvayugale varuṇaṃ yādasāṃ patiṃ |
paścādbhāge svarṇaṃ daṃḍayuta chatradharaṃ yajet || 53 ||

saṃpūjya meṣarāśyādīnarcayitvā tataḥ paraṃ |
arkamiṃduṃkujaṃ saimyaṃ jīvabhārgavamapyatha || 54 ||

śaniṃrāhuṃ ca ketuṃ ca yajaidetānnavagrahāt |
arcayeddimājān dikṣu caturdaja vibhūṣitān || 55 ||

airāvataṃ puṃḍarīkaṃ vāmanaṃ kumudoṃjanau |
puṣpadaṃtaṃ sārvabhaumaṃ supratīkamiti kramāt || 56 ||

maheṃdrādyaṣṭa dikpālānaṣṭa dikṣvatha pūjayet |
brahmaṇa mūrdhvādigbhāgeyattedviṣṇumadhopi ca || 57 ||

vajraśaktyādyāyudhāni daśadikṣvatha pūjayet |
itthamāvaraṇopetāṃ mahālakṣmīṃ haripriyāṃ || 58 ||

abhyarcya dhūpadīpādyairathanī rājanādibhiḥ |
saṃprāpnoti mahadbhāgyaṃ śāśvataṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ || 59 ||

kalpayitvātha vā mūrti lakṣmīhṛdaya vidyayā |
datvā siṃhāsanādīni samabhyarcyātha vidyayā || 60 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā paścāt kuryādācaraṇārcana |
śrīdharaṃ ca hṛṣīkeśaṃ vaikuṃṭhaṃ viśvarūpakaṃ || 61 ||

vāsudevaṃ saṃkarṣabhṛṇaṃ pradyumna praniruddhakaṃ |
patramūleṣu saṃpūjya dalamadhye tataḥ paraṃ || 62 ||

gāyatrīpārvatīcāṃḍīmīśvarī damakārikā |
tadannetha ca yedvārṇān mahālakṣmyāḥ kramādamūn || 63 ||

anurāgaṃ visaṃvādaṃ vijayaṃ vallabhaṃ mada |
poṣaṃ calaṃ ca tejaśca maheṃdrādidigīśvarān || 64 ||

dikṣvabhyarcya tadasrāṇi vāhyā dikṣu samarcayet |
anena vidhinarevī mahālakṣmī yajaṃtiye || 65 ||

eteṣu nivasellakṣmarismaraṃtī nijālayaṃ |
yena kenāpi vidhinā pratyahaṃ sādhakottamaḥ || 66 ||

prasanna lakṣmīmabhya ca nidhissakalasaṃpadāṃ |
bhūtvā sakalavidyāmā māśrayo durlabhānapi || 67 ||

bhuktveha sakalān bhogānaṃte yāti paraṃ padaṃ |
athavānyanmahadbhuptamarcanaṃ śṛṇu vallabhe || 68 ||

aṣṭāviṃśākṣarīyādyā lakṣmīnārāyaṇī śubhā |
samastavedataṃtreṣu guptā tatvārthavedibhiḥ || 69 ||

kathitāyā mahānnapramī mahānārāyaṇī śive |
tāṃtrivāraṃ sayuccārya lakṣmīmetāṃ samuccaran || 70 ||

sālagrāma śilāyukte śrīcakre sumanohare |
śrīpatī samāvāhya dvādaśākṣaraviyayā || 71 ||

caturviṃśati saṃkhyākānupacārān prakalpayet |
keśavādi caturviśannāmabhiḥ sādaraṃ vibhuṃ || 72 ||

nārāyaṇa samabhyarcya namaḥ śaktyākhya mālayā |
samabhyarcya mahālakṣmīvratya vidyāmataḥ paraṃ || 73 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityamaṣṭāviṃśatidhāpi vā |
uccārya pūjayitvātha datvā naivedyamādarāt || 74 ||

<p. 28a>

rājopacāraissakalaiḥ pratyahaṃ paripūjayana |
jaśvāmedhaśa tasyāsau pratyahaṃ phalamaśrute || 75 ||

aṇimādi guṇaiśvaryaṃ vācāṃ siddhiṃ ca durlabhāṃ |
prāpnoti ca mahadbhāgyamāyurārogyamakṣayaṃ || 76 ||

putrapautravatī mūrdhni bhojānapi sudurlabhān |
avāpya śāśvataṃ dhāma vratyaṃtena saṃśayaḥ || 77 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇārceyamati guptāpi vaidikī |
prakāśiteyaṃ kalyāṇi na kutrāpi prakāśaya || 78 ||

anayā brahmavidhvādivadaṃ ca nahi durlabhaṃ |
aṣṭāviṃśākṣarī vidyāmapi guptāṃ ca śailaje || 79 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇī smṛtvā daśadhāpi dine dine |
rājyalakṣmī mahāvidyāṃ yojayatyanvahaśuciḥ || 80 ||

tulā puruṣa sāhasraṃ sauvarṇatena nakṛtaṃ |
sāṃga dakṣiṇayā bhuktaṃ pratyahaṃ bhavati dhruvaṃ || 81 ||

vājimedha sahasraṃ ca sāṃgadakṣiṇayānvitaṃ |
kṛtaṃ tena na saṃdeho bhū prādakṣiṇyamapyatha || 82 ||

pratyahaṃ śailatanaye viśvāsaṃ kuru saṃtataṃ |
śrīpīṭhamathavābhyarcya pratyekaṃ pratyahaṃ śuciḥ || 83 ||

aṣṭā viṃśākṣarī vidyāṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇīthumartha |
smṛtvā prasannalakṣmīṃ ca śālāgrāma śilānvite || 84 ||

prasanna kamalāyaṃtre lakṣmīnārāyaṇau vibhū |
samabhyarcya viśuddhātmā pratyahaṃ sādhakottamaḥ || 85 ||

aṣṭāviṃśākṣarī vidyāṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇābhidhāṃ |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā smṛtvā vidyāṃ śrīhṛdayābhidhāṃ || 86 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā paścāt prajaptvā pratyahaṃ śive |
mahādāna sahasrasyadājimedhaśa tasya || 87 ||

gajadāna sahasrasya dhenudānāyu tasya ca |
phalaṃ prāpya viśuddhātvā dhanadena samaḥ priyā || 88 ||

vācaspati samaḥ sarvavidyābhiḥ putrapautrakaiḥ |
kaśya yena samobhūtvā kāṃtyā kaṃdarpasannibhaḥ || 89 ||

maheṃdra sadṛśo bhogairāyuṣā brahmasannibhaḥ |
svacchaṃdamaraṇo bhūtvā kulasāhatprasaṃyuta || 90 ||

bhagavat sannidhiṃ yāti dehītaṃ bhagavatpriyaḥ |
(*)satra lakṣmīvidyāyā māhātmyamadyanāsanaṃ || 91 ||

nahi varāyituṃ śakyamayiseṃdra surāsuraiḥ |
yatra tiṣṭhati sā lakṣmīstatraiva satataṃ sukhaṃ || 92 ||

putrapautrābhivṛddhiśca dhanadhānyādi saṃpadaḥ |
nityaṃ dharmābhivṛddhiśca tasmāllakṣmī sadārcayet || 93 ||

prasanna lakṣmīpūjāyā māhātmyaṃ kiṃcidīritaṃ |
śreyaskaramihāmutra kiṃ bhūyaḥ śrotumicchasi || 94 ||

[iti śrimadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyāvayodaye ekonaviṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||

<p. 28a>

śrīdevyuvāca ||

śrīreva tripurā proktā lalitā jagadaṃvikā |
lakṣmī saṃprāpya nityaṃ kalyāṇaṃ bhogānapi sudurlabhān ||
kulasāhasrasahito labhate parame padaṃ || 114 ||

<p. 28b>

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgraha 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye daśamodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 28b>

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

śṛṇu sarvānavaṣāṃgi śrīvidyāyajanaṃ paraṃ |
yasya vijñānataḥ sākṣātkartāhartā bhavet svarya || 1 ||

anena vidhināyatra śrīcakra sarvasiddhidaṃ |
pūjyate tatra sakataṃvaśī kuryānna saṃśayaḥ || 2 ||

nagaraṃ vaśamāyāti deśāmaṃḍalamadrije |
poṣitassakalāvaśyā jvalatkāmāgnipīḍitā || 3 ||

vidyā vimūḍha hṛdayāssādhakenyastamānasāḥ |
taddarśanātra saṃdeho jāyaṃte sarvayoṣitaḥ || 4 ||

akṣamālāṃ samāśritya mātṛkāṃ pūrṇārūpiṇī |
japedavaśyaṃ śreyothī śrīvidyāṃ viśvamātṛkāṃ || 5 ||

atha muktā phalamayī vāṅmanokṣa phaladāyinī |
sarvasiddhipradā nityaṃ sarvarājavaśaṃkarī || 6 ||

yathā muktā phalamayī tathā sphaṭika nirmitā |
rudrākṣa mālikā mokṣa sarvakāma samṛddhidā || 7 ||

pravālamālikā sarvasiddhidā bhogamokṣadā |
mohinī sarvajagatāṃ sarvasaṃpat samṛddhidā || 8 ||

maṇikyamālā sakala sāmrājya phaladāyinī |
putrajīvakamālātu vidyālakṣmīpradāsatāṃ || 9 ||

padmākṣamālayā lakṣmīrjāyateti mahīyasī |
raktacaṃdanamālā tu sarvabhogamadāmatā || 10 ||

kuśagraṃthimayīmālā nityakalyāṇadvidā |
akṣamālāṃ samabhyarcya ca senānulepitāṃ || 11 ||

samāśritya japedvidyo lakṣamātraṃ yadā vudhaḥ |
yoṣito bhrāmayaṃtyeva mano yadi suniścalaṃ || 12 ||

tadā dvitīyalakṣaṃ tu prajapet sādhakottamaḥ |
pātālatala nāgeṃdra kanyakāḥ kṣobhayaṃtitaṃ || 13 ||

tāsāṃ kaṭākṣa jālena mohito yadi nakhayaṃ |
tadā lakṣatrayaṃ kuryāt sādhakaḥ sthiramānasaḥ || 14 ||

tṛtīya lakṣe saṃjaptaidvākyaṃti surāṃganāḥ |
abhimānena sauṃdarya saubhāgyamadasaṃyutāḥ || 15 ||

sādhakaṃ drāvayaṃtyeva sthiracitto bhaveṣadi |
japtena kṣatrayaṃ sadyo mahāpāpaudya bhedanaṃ || 16 ||

mahāsiddhipradaṃ sadyassakalaiśvaryasiddhidaṃ |
itthaṃ lakṣatrayaṃ japtvā sādhakaḥ sthiramānasaḥ || 17 ||

saṃkṣobhayati bhūlokastarlokatalavāsinaḥ |
pūruṣā yośitovaśyāścarācaragatāḥ priye || 18 ||

gorocanādibhirdravyaiścakrarājaṃ samālikhet |
atīvasuṃrarīramyāṃ tanmadhye pratimāṃ parāṃ || 19 ||

jvalaṃtīnāmasahitāṃ kāmarāja vidarbhitāṃ |
ciṃtayedyāṃta tasmānu yojanānāṃ śatādapi || 20 ||

adṛṣṭa pūrvādeveśi śrutamātrāpi durlabhā |
rājakanyātha vā patnī bhayalajjā vivarjitā || 21 ||

<p. 29a>

jāyāti sādhakaṃ samyaṅmaṃtra mūṭhā satī priye |
cakra madhyagato bhūtvā sādhakaściṃtayedyadi || 22 ||

utsūrya sahastābhamātmānamaruṇaṃ tathā |
sādhyamapya rūṇībhūtaṃ ciṃtayitvā japecchriyaṃ || 23 ||

anena kramayogena svayaṃ kaṃdarpa rūpavāra |
sarvasauṃdarya subhagaḥ kāminī vallabho bhavet || 24 ||

sarvalokeṣu subhagassarvalokavarśakaraḥ |
dāsabhūtā karotyeva naranārī nṛpādikān || 25 ||

sarvaraktopacāraistu mudrāsannaddhavigrāhaḥ |
cakraṃ samarcayeyastu yasya nāma vidarbhitaṃ || 26 ||

samavedā sarvavidhanāṭhyo vā mahīpatiḥ |
cakra madhyagataṃ kurvannāma yasyāstu yoṣitaḥ || 27 ||

adṛṣṭāyā api śiveyaṃni mudrādharo japat |
tadānate śīghraṃ yakṣiṇī rājakanyakāṃ || 28 ||

rājakanyāmakṣarasaṃkhacarī vā surāṃganāṃ |
vidyādharī divyakanyāṣu kanyāṃ ripu striyaṃ || 29 ||

madanodbhava saṃtāpāṃ sphurajjayana maṃḍalāṃ |
kāmavāṇaprabhinnāṃtaḥ karaṇāṃ divyasuṃdarī || 30 ||

mahākāmakalā dhyāna yogena sukhaṃdite |
saṃkṣobhayati bhūloka pātāla jaṭāyoṣitaḥ || 31 ||

rocanādikamekaṃ tu bhāgamekaṃ tu kuṃkumaṃ |
athaṃ bhāgadvayaṃ devi caṃdanaṃmaranet sudhīḥ || 32 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtaṃ tilakaṃ dhāryate yadi |
jagattrayaṃ vaśīkayīnnaranārī kulānvitaṃ || 33 ||

tāṃvūlaṃ dhūpamudakaṃ patraṃ puṣpaṃ phalaṃ dadhi |
dugdhaṃ ghṛtaṃ ruṇamagnaṃ vastraṃ karpūramapyatha || 34 ||

śatamaṣṭottaraṃ rajaptvāyasmaiyasmai yasmai prayacchati |
savaśyo jāyate devi nātra kāyā vivāraṇā || 35 ||

striyastu sakalā vaśyādāsī bhūtā bhavati hi |
ākarṣaṇamidaṃ proktaṃ niścitaṃ lokamohanaṃ || 36 ||

rahasyasthānake maṃtrī likhedrocanayā bhuvi |
cāruthaṃ gāraveṣāḍhyāṃ savarlikāraka śobhitāṃ || 37 ||

pratimāṃ suṃdarī nārīṃ vilikhya sumanoharāṃ |
tadvāla kaṃṭhahṛnnābhi janmamaṃḍalayoṣitāṃ || 38 ||

janmanāma mahāvidyāmuṃkuśena vihṛvidarbhitāṃ |
sarvasaṃdhiṣu dehasya madanākṣaramālikhet || 39 ||

na dāḍimaśpuṣpāṃ ciṃtayeddeha saṃdhiṣu |
tadāśābhi mukho bhūtvā svayaṃ devīsvarūpavān || 40 ||

vimudrāṃ saṃkṣobhiṇīṃ vadhvā vidyā maṣṭaśataṃ japat |
niyojya dahanāṃgāre caṃdrasūryakalātmake || 41 ||

tato vikala survāṃgīṃ kāmavāṇaprapūtāṃ |
ananya mānasāṃ premabhrāmyamāṇāṃ tadātmanā || 42 ||

itthamākarṣayennārī yojanānāṃ śatādapi |
mātṛkāṃ vilikheccakre vāhyasassakalāṃ priye || 43 ||

svarṇapatre raupyapatre bhūrje vā tāmrakapikā |
taddhārayedgaledakṣakoravāmetha vā priye || 44 ||

avadhyaḥ sarvajaṃtūnā vyāghrādīnāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
tathaiva mātṛkāyuktamanvahaṃ cakramarcayan || 44 ||

<p. 29b>

ajarāmaraṇo bhūtvā lokeṣu viharatyasau |
anena vidhinā devirocanāgara kuṃkumaiḥ || 45 ||

likhitaṃ cakrayogena sādhyanāma varānate |
vidarbhitaṃ tvanāmnāpi yasminkasminnapi sthitaṃ || 46 ||

sthāraṃ jaṃgamaṃ vāpi sakalaṃ janamaṃḍalaṃ |
vaśīkuryān maheśāni pādākrāṃtaṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 47 ||

mahātripurasuṃdaryāḥ kāmakūdetabhāsvatā |
ekanekamavaṣṭabhya sādhyanāmākṣā priyaṃ || 48 ||

vahirapya khilairvarṇairmātṛkāṃ ca praveṣṭayet |
hema madhyagataṃ kṛtvā śikhāyāṃ vā bhujadvaye || 49 ||

dhāsye yatra kutrāpi trailokyavaśakārakaṃ |
eteṃdramapi deveśi dāsabhūtaṃ karoti hi || 50 ||

rājāno vā janaḥ sarpāgajā duṣṭa mahotkarāḥ |
vyāghrāḥ kesariṇo duṣṭā api vaśyā bhavaṃti hi || 51 ||

pūrva krameṇa tadrābhra nāma saṃdarbhyaśainaje |
madhye datuṣyathe vāpi caturdikṣu nidhāpayet || 52 ||

mahākṣobho yoṣitāṃ kṣājjanānāṃ mahatāmapi |
tathaiva sarvaduṣṭābhāṃpura sthānāṃ ca jāyeta || 53 ||

etanmadhyagatāṃ pṛthvīṃ sa śailavanakānanāṃ |
jvalaṃtī sarvarājeṃdramaṃḍitāṃ sāgarāṃ varāṃ || 54 ||

māsaṣaṣṭīṃ ciṃtayedyassākṣātkāmopamābhacet |
kaṭākṣākṣepamātreṇa tārpastasyavaśāḥ priye || 55 ||

rājāto brāhmaṇāvaiśyāḥ śūdrāśca paśavo jagat |
dṛṣṭaivākarcayeddevi trailokyaṃ sa carācaraṃ || 56 ||

sapalānmārayedṛṣṭyā nātra kāryā vicāraṇā |
bhūtapretapiśācāśca jvarāṃścāturthikānapi || 57 ||

śūtailu gulmādi rogāṃśca dṛṣṭyā nāśayati kṣaṇāt |
etatsiṃdūra subhagaṃ rātrau saṃpūjitaṃ priye || 58 ||

yojanā māṃsahasrādvā samyagā karṣayet priyaṃ |
yadā dikṣu vidikṣvaivaṃ vidhiva kṛtamīśvari || 59 ||

vaśamānayati kṣipra sa putra paśuvāṃdhave |
bhūrjapatre samālikhya rocanāgaru kuṃkumaiḥ || 60 ||

tanmadhye nagaraṃ deśaṃ maṃḍala khaṃḍameva vā |
nāmnā vidarbhitaṃ samyaṅmāṃsamātraṃ prapūjayan || 61 ||

vaśīkaroti trailokyāṃvajjīvaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
athavādhārayet kaṃṭhe śikhāyāṃ vā bhujadvaye || 62 ||

yatra kutrasthikte bhadre kṣobhaye dīpapaṭṭaṇaṃ |
arkakṣīreṇa sahitaṃ dhuttūrakarasaṃtathā || 63 ||

rocanā kuṃkuma yuttaṃ lākṣā kuṃkumasaṃyutaṃ |
kastūrī camṃdrasaṃyuktamekīkṛtya tataḥ paraṃ || 64 ||

cakrama tat samālikhya yasya nāmnārcayan trayet |
tasya vyāghari puṣpādhi jagata sarpa bhayādikaṃ || 65 ||

coragrahajalāriṣṭaśākinī ḍākinī bhayaṃ |
na jāyate mahādevi paramaṃtrābhicārataṃ || 66 ||

cakraṃ saṃdhāravannityaṃ kālamṛtyuṃ vināśayet |
athavā madhyagāṃ devi trikoṇo bhayapārśvagāṃ || 67 ||

adhaḥsya nāma saṃyuktāṃ rocanā kuṃkumāṃkitāṃ |
nidhāpayecca saptāhāṭṭāsavāt kiṃ karo bhavat || 68 ||

<p. 29b>

pītadravyaissamālikhya pītapuṣpaiḥ samarcayet |
pūrvāśābhimukho bhūtvāstaṃ bhayet paravāditaḥ || 69 ||

saṃvādādari saṃghosya mūko bhavati tatkṣaṇāt || 70 ||

nāthāyasya sa vāṅmī ca pāṣāṇa iva jāyate |
cakraṃ vilikhya deveśi mahānīla rasena ca || 71 ||

nāma saṃyojya vidhivaddakṣiṇāśāmurayovudhaḥ || 71 ||

vahnau dagdhvā maheśāni mārayedvairiṇaṃ priye |
māhiṣyasya purīṣasya cassamākṛṣyaśaulaje || 72 ||

gomūtrevasu saṃlikhyanā na saṃdarpya pūrvavat |
kṣiptvāra nāla madhyeri vidveṣaṇakaraṃ bhavet || 73 ||

kṛtvā rocanayā nāma kākapakṣasya madhyagaṃ |
laṃvamāne tadākāśe śaktraccāṭana kāravāṃ || 74 ||

mahānīlā rocanābhyo dugdhalākṣārasena ca |
vilikhya dhārayanmaṃtrī sarvavarṇānvaśenayet || 75 ||

vilikhyadhārayan maṃtrī sarvavarṇānvaśenayet |
anenaiva vidhānena sthāpayedvāri madhyarga || 76 ||

tenodakena saṃsnātaṃ pītaṃ sakalavaśyakṛt |
saubhāgyaṃ jāyate tasya yānī yena na saṃśayaḥ || 77 ||

etanmadhyagatāṃ pṛthvīṃ nagarīṃ vā sulocane |
samāhātho bhayet samyājvalamānāṃ viciṃtayet || 78 ||

sauvarṇaṃ cakramabhyarcya puṣpairvāpakṛvaiḥ śrutaiḥ |
mahāpāpopapāpauḥ yairapi māsādvivarjitaḥ || 79 ||

maheṃdrasadṛśīṃ lakṣmīṃ dhananādi saṃkulāṃ |
saṃprāpya dīrghamāyuṣyaṃ śriyaṃ cāṣṭaguṇānvitāṃ || 80 ||

saṃprāpya yogamaṣṭāṃgaṃ daivatirapi pūjitaḥ |
putrapautrādi saṃpattisahito divyabhogavān || 81 ||

avyāhatagatissarvalokeṣu viharatyasau |
rātritaṃ cakramabhyarcya rājyalakṣmīmacaṃcalāṃ || 82 ||

saṃprāpya dīrghayāpuṣpaṃ vidyāṃ sumahatīyapi |
putrapautra samṛddhiṃ ca saṃprāpyāṃ ca paraṃ padaṃ || 83 ||

kulānāṃ śatamādāya labhate nātra saṃśayaḥ |
tāmracakraṃ samabhyarcya vimuktaḥ sarvapātakaiḥ || 84 ||

dhanātho mahatīṃ medhāmapi putrādi saṃyutaḥ |
mukteha sakalānbhogānaṃte brahmapadaṃ labhet || 85 ||

cakraṃ ratnamayaṃ nityamabhyarcyāsvila siddhidaṃ |
śreyo rāśimiha prāpya dhanadena samaśriyā || 86 ||

vācā jīva samobhūtvā putrapautrasukhānvitaḥ |
cirāyurvipulā bhogānbhuktāṃte muktimāpnuyāt || 87 ||

pūrvāśābhi mukho bhūtvā caṃdanena samālikhet |
pītadravyaissamabhyarcyastaṃbhayet sarvavādinaḥ || 88 ||

uttarāśā mukho bhūtvā siṃharāja mālikhet |
pūjayanvidhivadvidvān sarvalokaṃ vaśaṃ nayet || 89 ||

paścimāśāmukho bhūtvā caṃdanena samālikhet |
saṃpūjya vidhivadvidvān yoṣitāṃ vallabho bhavet || 90 ||

yamāśābhi mukho bhūtvā kṛṣṇaṃ cakra samarcayet |
yasya nāmāṃkitaṃ tasya maṃtrahāniḥ prajāyeta || 91 ||

<p. 30a>

api rākṣasavya śaṃbhu koṇeṣu pūjitaṃ staṃbha |
vidveṣaṇavyādhi śatrūccāṭanakārakaṃ || 92 ||

lekhinyā haimayā cakraṃ rocanā kuṃkumādibhiḥ |
likhitaṃ pūjitaṃ nityaṃ mahāsiddhimadaṃ smṛtaṃ || 93 ||

rocanā likhitaṃ cakraṃ kṣīramadhye vinikṣipet |
sarvavaśyakaraṃ devi bhavatyatra na saṃśayaḥ || 94 ||

gomūtra madhyagaṃ samyak śakraccāṭanakārakaṃ |
 tailasthaṃ cakrarājaṃ tu śatruviddeṣakārakaṃ || 95 ||

jvalajjvalana madhyastha śatrunāśakaraṃ bhavet |
yadaikāṃte ca dhurmārge siṃdūra satasā likhet || 96 ||

sādhakaḥ khecaro devi jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ |
girāvekatarau tadvadavayan cakrarājakaṃ || 97 ||

ajarāmaraṇo bhūtvā sukhī bhavatirmātrikaḥ |
śmaśani pūjayeccakraṃ mahābhūta dine vudhaḥ || 98 ||

niśīthe vilvapatreśca praśastaiḥ kusumairapimairapi |
labhate sadya evāsau cuṭikāṃ janapādukāḥ || 99 ||

khaḍgasiddhiṃ ca metālasiddhiṃ ca mahatīmapi |
mahāvivarasiddhiṃ ca yakṣiṇī siddhimapyatha || 100 ||

labhate nātra saṃdehassatyaṃ satyaṃ satye mayodita |
mahābhūta dine bhaumavārayukteyamānvite || 101 ||

upoṣaṇa parastatra sahasra tritaryadi vā |
japtvā ca triśataṃ paścāsādyaṃ saṃdhyāmupāsya ca || 102 ||

śatādhika sahasraṃ ca tatra japtvā punaḥ śive |
śrīcakraṃ sāgamudvṛtya patraiḥ puṣpaiḥ sugaṃdhibhiḥ || 103 ||

tatsaṃnidhau pratiṣṭhāpya vidhinā jātavedasaṃ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā gāyatryā purataḥ śuciḥ || 104 ||

lalitā raśmibhirhutvā sakṛdeva tataḥ paraṃ |
navyavaraṇadevīnāṃ sakṛdevaghṛta haret || 105 ||

triśatādhika sāhasraṃ śuddhaṃ gavyājya mādarāt |
hutvā śrīvidyayā vahnau catuḥśrīmanubhistataḥ || 106 ||

aṣṭāviśatidhā hutvā pratyekaṃ jātavedasi |
japādibhistato hutvā kṛtvā brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ || 107 ||

agniṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya svācārya caraṇadvayaṃ |
sāṣṭāṃga daṃḍavannatvā vāso laṃkāraṇādibhiḥ || 108 ||

abhyarcya gaṃdhapuṣpādyairyacca yāvadya saṃtata |
sarvasvamarpayeddravyamācārya caraṇadvayaḥ || 109 ||

yaṣīśa namitaṃ dravyamathavācāryapādayoḥ |
samarpyacāryapatnyai ca dadyādākalpasaṃcayaṃ || 110 ||

puraścaryā śataphalaṃ sadyaḥ saṃprāpya sādhakaḥ |
khaḍgaṃ ca pādukā yugmadivyāṃ janamanuttamaṃ || 111 ||

metālasiddhiṃ ca parāṃ ghurikā siddhimapyatha |
kehasiddhi manuprāpya vā siddhiṃ mahatīmapi || 112 ||

āṇimādi guṇānnyāpya jarāmaraṇavarjitaḥ |
paṃcaviṃśati varṣausau bhūtvā kaṃdarpasannibhaḥ || 113 ||

anenaiva śarīreṇa naṃdanādi vaneṣu ca |
krīḍāte divyakanyābhirbhuṃjanbhogānyathepsitān || 114 ||

<p. 30a>

śrīvidyāsadṛśaṃ vastu na kutrāpi pradṛśyate |
śrīcakrasadṛśaṃ pūjyaṃ nāsti lokatrayepi ca || 115 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye ekādaśodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 30a>

śrīdevyuvāca ||

śrīvidyeyaṃ trikūṭākhyā lalitā śrīrudīritā |
vījatrayasya kathayasādhanaṃ me jagatpate || 1 ||

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

śṛṇu devi mahājñānaṃ sarveṣāmuttamottamaṃ |
yettānuṣṭhitamātreṇa bhavādhauta nimajjati || 1 ||

tripurā paramāśaktirādyā jñānayanā priye |
sthūla sūkṣmavibhāgena trailokyetyattimātṛkā || 2 ||

kavalīkṛta niśśeṣa tatvagrāsa svarūpiṇī |
tasyāṃ pariṇatāyāṃ tu na kaścit paradṛṣyate || 3 ||

paropi śaktirahitaḥ śaktaḥ kartuṃ na kiṃcana |
śaktaḥ syāt parameśāni śaktiyukto yadā bhavet || 4 ||

śaktādinā śive sūkṣme nāmadhā manavidyate |
jñātenāpirmahaśani karmaśarma na kiṃcana || 5 ||

dhyānāvaṣṭaṃbhakāle tu na matirnadṛtiḥ sthitiḥ |
praviśya paramāgaṃtu sūkṣmākāra svarūpiṇī || 6 ||

kavalīkṛniśśeṣā vījāṃkuratayā sthitā |
vāmā śivā tathā jyeṣṭhā śṛṃgāṭikāratāṃgatā || 7 ||

rauvadrī tu parameśāni jagadrasanarūpiṇī |
evaṃ sā jparamāśaktirekaiva parameśvarī || 8 ||

tripurā trividhā devi brahmaviṣṇvīśarūpiṇī |
jñānaśaktiḥ kriyāśaktiriricchāśaktitmikā priye || 9 ||

trailokyaṃ saṃsṛjatyekā tripurā parakīrtitā |
yadollasati śṛṃgāṭa pīṭhāt kuṭilarūpiṇī || 10 ||

śivārkamaṃḍalaṃ bhitvā drāvayaṃtīṃ drumahulaṃ |
tadudbhavāmṛtā svāda paramānaṃdanaṃditā || 11 ||

kadhayoṣitkuletyuktā parapuruṣameti sā |
nirlakṣyaṃ nirguṇaṃ caiva kūlarūpa vivarjitaṃ || 12 ||

tataḥ svacchaṃda rūpā tu paribhrāmya jagatprabhāṃ |
tena mārgeṇa saṃtuṣṭā punare kākinī satī || 13 ||

ramate svayamavyaktā tripurā vyaktimāgatā |
tatva traya vinirdiṣṭā varṇaśakti śivātmikā || 14 ||

vāgīśvarī jñānaśakti vāgbhave mokṣarūpiṇī |
kāmarāje kāmakalā kāmarūpa kriyātmikā || 15 ||

śaktivīje parāśaktiricchaiva śivarūpiṇī |
evaṃ devī tryakṣarā śrīrmahātripurasuṃdarī || 16 ||

pāraṃpayerṇa vijñātā bhavavaṃdha vimocanī |
saṃsmṛtā pāpaśamanī japtā mṛtyuvināśinī || 17 ||

pūjitā duḥkhadaurbhāgyavyādhidāridryanāśinī |
hutāvidhaudya śamanī dhyātā sarvārdhasādhakī || 18 ||

etasyāḥ śṛṇu deveśi vīja tritayasādhanaṃ |
śuklāṃvaraṃ parīdhānaḥ śubhracaṃdanacārcitaḥ || 19 ||

<p. 30b>

muktāphala sphuradrūpābhūṣaṇāḥ śuklamālyabhṛt |
pūjayedvalaiḥ puṣpairbrahmacaryaratonaraḥ || 20 ||

dhavalaireva naivedyairdadhikṣirodanādibhiḥ |
saṃkalpya dhavale vāpi naivedyairmānasaiḥ śive || 21 ||

vāgīśīmarcayechudvabhra gaṃdhapuṣpairmanoharaiḥ |
karpūradhvalāṃ śubhrapuṣpābharaṇaśobhitāṃ || 22 ||

atyaṃta śubhravasanāṃ vajramauktikabhūṣaṇāṃ |
muktāphalāmalyamaṇi japamālālasatkarāṃ || 23 ||

pustakaṃ varadānaṃ ca dadhanīma bhayapradāṃ |
evaṃ dhyāyet maheśāni sarvavidyādherā bhavet || 24 ||

mūlādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ sruvat pīyūṣavarṣiṇīṃ |
brahmajyotirmayīṃ dhyāyejjihvāgre dīparūpiṇīṃ || 25 ||

prajapanvāgmavaṃ khaṃḍaṃ sahasraṃ maṃḍalaṃ śuciḥ |
pāṣāṇena samo vāpi mūkaḥ paśu samopi vā || 26 ||

grāmyo mūrkhaḥ pātakī vā vajño mātra vidharjitaḥ |
naṣṭacittotimeṃdo vā grāmyo mūrkhoti pātakī || 27 ||

śaṭhopiyaḥ padaṃ spaṣṭamakṣaraṃ vaktumakṣamaḥ |
jaḍomakaḥ paśu samopi vā raṣṭotidvarmedhāgataprajovinaṣṭadhīḥ || 28 ||

sopi saṃjāyate vāṅmī vācaspatiri vā paraḥ |
satyaṃḍitabhāpaṭoyajetā pratihata prabhaḥ || 29 ||

satarka padavākyārtha śabdālaṃkāra sarvavit |
vātāhata samudrormimālātuyairupanyaset || 30 ||

suku	mārata isphāra rūpālaṃkārapūrvakaiḥ |
pradaguphairmahākāvyakartā deveśi jāyate || 31 ||

vedavedāṃga vedīta siddhāṃtajñānapāragaḥ |
jyotiḥ śāstretihyasādimīmāsā smṛti vākyavit || 32 ||

purāṇara savādādigāruḍāne karmatravit |
pātālaśāstravijñātamūta taṃtrāyartatvavit || 33 ||

vicitracitra karmādi śilpāne kavi cakṣaṇaḥ |
mahāvyākaraṇodāra śabdasaṃkaramarmavit || 34 ||

sarvabhāṣāruttajñānī samastalimi karmakṛt |
nānāśāstrārtha śikṣādivettā bhuvanavistṛtaḥ || 35 ||

sarvavāṅmayavettā ca sarvajño devi jāyate |
vāgmavasyasrayā devi māhātmyaṃ kathitaṃ tava || 36 ||

kāmarājasya māhātmyaṃ pravakṣyāmi tataḥ |
atha kāmavulāsaktaḥ sādhakaḥ parameśvaraḥ || 37 ||

raktālaṃkāra subhago raktagaṃdhānulepataḥ |
raktavastrāvṛtassamyaṅmadhyakāma kalātmanā || 38 ||

raktapuṣpaiścavidhaiḥ kuṃkumādibhirarcayat |
mūlādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃta sphura dīpasvarūpiṇīṃ || 39 ||

vaṃdhūka kusumākārakāṃtibhūṣaṇabhūṣitāṃ |
ikṣuko daṃḍapuṣpeṣu varābhayalasatkarāṃ || 40 ||

tadīyākāra siṃdūrabharitaṃ bhuvana trayaṃ |
ciṃtayat parameśāni kāmarājaṃ tato japet || 41 ||

trailokyaṃ mohayatyevatakṣaṇāddeva sādhakaḥ |
rājāno vaśamāyāṃti pannagā rākṣasā surāḥ || 42 ||

<p. 31a>

kaṃdarparavadeveśiyo pitāmānahārakaḥ |
manaściṃtitayopi tu dāsī ca vaśagā bhavet || 43 ||

taddṛṣṭi paścagācārī surīvāpyatha vā surī |
vidyādharī kinnarī vā yakṣanāgāṃganātha vā || 44 ||

pracaṃḍa narabhūpāla kanyakā nāgakanyakā |
prajvalanmadanot(*)dahamaśraptamātasā || 45 ||

klinnā pracalitāyāgaṃ vimūḍhā madavihvalā |
niveditātmasavasvāvaśagā devi jāyeta || 46 ||

calajjaledu saṃkāśā vālārka viraṇāruṇā |
cititāyāṣitāyonaumaṃkṣobhāti tatkṣaṇā || 47 ||

eṣaiva ciṃtitājasā siṃdūrābhāhṛdakṣiṇāt |
ākarṣayenna saṃdehāraṃ bhāvapi tilottamāṃ || 48 ||

raktavarṇāṃ śriyaṃ dhyātvā tadīya mahasāvṛtaḥ |
tasyā mūrdhni smaredvījaṃ sravatpīyūṣavarṣṭaṇaṃ || 49 ||

japtaṃ saṃmohayatyevaraṃbhācca surasuṃdarī |
nāḍī dvitayassarvatrailokyamapi mohayet || 50 ||

kiṃ ca kāmakalā dhyānāt paṃcakāmā varānane |
mohayaṃti jagatsarvaṃ prayogaṃ śṛṇuṣāvaṃti || 51 ||

pūrvoktakāmā deveśi jñātavyāḥ paṃcasaṃjñakāḥ |
vidarbhyādyena kāmenamatmathāṃtargataṃ kuru || 52 ||

kaṃdarpa saṃpuṭaṃ kṛtvā koṇa madhyaganeṣu tajaḥ |
makaradhvaja saṃjñaṃ va sarvame tadvarānane || 53 ||

mīneka tu gataṃ kuryān mohayejjagatīmimāṃ |
trailokye mohanonāma yogoyaṃ parikīrtita || 54 ||

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi śaktivījasya sādhanaṃ |
mūlādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ śarīraciṃtayet parāṃ || 55 ||

sravat pīyūṣadhārābhirvarṣetī viṣahāriṇī |
hemaprabhā māsamānāṃ vidyutyuja samaprabhāṃ || 56 ||

syulaccaṃdra kalāpūrṇa kalaśaṃ varadābhaye |
jñānamudrāṃ ca dadhatī sākṣādamṛtarūpiṇī || 57 ||

dhyāyanviṣaṃ harenmaṃtrī nānākāravyavasthitaṃ |
etasyāḥ smaraṇāhevi nīlakaṃṭhatvamāgataṃ ||| 58 ||

ahaṃ mṛtyuṃjayo bhūtvā dvicarāmitātraye vai |
na teya samo maṃtrī viṣabhāra sahasranut || 59 ||

bhūtapretapiśācāścanāśayedrogasaṃcayaṃ |
cāturthika jvarānuṣṭāna yasmārāṃśca nāśayet || 60 ||

nāgānāṃ darśanādevajaḍīkaraṇākārakaḥ |
dāhinā mamṛtākāraḥ kṣīradhāropamaḥ smṛtaḥ || 61 ||

sthirakṛttimaśaṃkākhya viṣopaviṣanāśakaḥ |
duṣṭavyādhi grahānīkaśakinīrūpikāgaṇaiḥ || 62 ||

bhūtapretapiśāyai strinetradavaṃ dṛśyate |
atha trikūṭa saṃpūrṇā mahātripurasuṃdari || 63 ||

prajaptā sādhakasyāśu sarvapātakamedinī |
samasta puṇyaphaladā sarvalokavaśaṃkarī || 64 ||

nābhimaṃḍala madhyasthā vālārka śatasannibhā |
prātarjaptātha madhyāhne hṛtpadmasthāruṇa prabhā || 65 ||

<p. 31b>

taptakāṃcana saṃkāśā sāyaṃkāle tataḥ paraṃ |
mukhamaṃḍala madhyāsthāpayarāga maṇiprabhā || 66 ||

smṛtvā japtvā sādhakasya prāgevatturtrayācchive |
sidhyatyaṣṭaguṇaiśvaryaṃ saubhāgyaṃ ca mahattaraṃ || 67 ||

tatrāmase smaranvāpi yoginīnāṃ priyo bhavet |
śriyo vidyānusaṃdhāne yasya svārya kṛpā bhavet || 68 ||

sūtakādi bhayaṃ tasya nāsti nityaṃ śucismite |
tipato yojayennityaṃ mahātripurasuṃdarīṃ || 69 ||

tathaiva mātṛ vakrājñā saṃkramatyasya vigrahe |
sarvāsāṃ sarvasaṃsthānāṃ yoginīnāṃ bhavet priyaḥ || 70 ||

sādhako sau bhavatyā sāṃsākṣat putra ivāparaḥ |
paripūrṇaiva satataṃ japyate śrīryadi priye || 71 ||

khecarī siddhiratulāyogoṣyasyāśu sidhyati |
catuḥṣaṣṭiryataḥ kodyoyoginīnāmahaujasāṃ || 72 ||

cakrame tatsamāśrityasasthitāvarivaṃḍite |
japtvā trikūṭīṃ saṃpūrṇāṃ mahātripurasuṃdarī || 73 ||

ṛtauṣaṣṭaiṣṭame vāpi daśame dvādaśepi vā |
ṣoḍaśe divase vāpi kṣāmāṃgachana striyaṃ niśi || 74 ||

nārāyaṇa samaṃ putramāpuṣmaṃtaṃ paśīkhanaṃ |
pāṇe sarvavidyānāṃ dhanāḍhyaṃ bhāgya saṃyutaṃ || 75 ||

saṃprāpya sarvaśreyomissahito sau bhavet sadā |
naitayā sadṛśī kācidvidyā deveśi vidyate || 76 ||

etāmeva purārādhyavidyāṃ trailokyamohinī |
trailokyamohanaṃrūpa prāptavān bhagavānhariḥ || 77 ||

kāmadevopi deveśi mahātripurasuṃdarī |
samārādhyā bhavalloke sarvasaubhāgya suṃdaraḥ || 78 ||

mayāpye tadvratasthena kriyatedyāpi suvrate |
japa stri saṃdhyametasyāssamastaphalasiddhaye || 79 ||

layāṃga pūjanānnityaṃ lakṣmī saubhāgya vākyatiḥ |
mahābhāgya nidhi bhūtvā prāpnotyaṃte paraṃ padaṃ || 80 ||

madhyāṃta cakrācaṃkirvanyakṣepakṣepimāsi vā |
saṃprāpya sarvaśreyāṃsi pūjyate daivatairapi || 81 ||

etadārādhanādeva brahmāsṛṣṭikaro bhavat |
caṃdrasūryāvapi jagatsṛṣṭi saṃhārakārakau || 82 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye dvādaśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 31b>

śrīdevyuvāca ||

japahovidhiṃ vrūhi yena vidhno vinaśyati |
sādhakānāṃ hitāya tvaṃ va daśaṃkara suvrata || 1 ||

śrīdakṣimūrtiruvāca ||

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi japahomavidhi priye |
śravaṇādapi yasya syāt sādhako brahmarūpabhāka || 2 ||

cakraṃ samarcayeddevi sakalasāṃgamanvahaṃ |
aśvamedhaphalaṃ sāṃgaṃ prāpnotyanvahamakṣayaṃ || 3 ||

sayoga pūjāṃ kṛtvā vāpatī nityaṃ jiteṃdriyaḥ |
vājapeya phalaṃ prāpya sarvapāpaiḥ pramucyate || 4 ||

<p. 32a>

tāmrajaṃ cakramabhyarcyā śriyaṃ japtvānvahaṃ śuciḥ |
vimuktassavaryāyebhyo mahatī śriya makṣayāṃ || 5 ||

saṃprāpya mahatī vidyāṃ putrapautra samṛddhibhāka |
brahmalokeva satyaṃte daśa pūrvairdaśāvaraiḥ || 6 ||

rātitaṃ cakrabhyarcya śriyaṃ japtvā dina dine |
mahāpāpopapāpaudyairapi muktaḥ sudāruṇaiḥ || 7 ||

rājyalakṣmīmavāpnoti vidyānāṃ pārago bhavet |
mahatī mṛddhi māsādya putrapautrādi saṃyutāṃ || 8 ||

bhukteha sakalānbhogān dīrghāyurvijayī sadā |
kulānāṃ śatumuddhanyavaikuṃṭheniva satyasau || 9 ||

sauvarṇa cakramabhyarcya sādhakonvahamādarāt |
aśvamedhaphalaṃ sāṃgaṃ manvahaṃ prāpya sādhakaḥ || 10 ||

vimuktaḥ pātakairghoraiḥ koṭijanmakṛtairapi |
muktāratnāri saṃpūrṇāṃ dhanadhānyaudya saṃkulāṃ || 11 ||

maheṃdra sadṛśīṃ lakṣmīmihaiva prāpya sādhakaḥ |
ārogyaṃ na hṛdā puṣpaṃ kāṃtiṃ kaṃdarpa sannibhāṃ || 12 ||

saṃprāpya sarvavidyānāṃ (*)ṇodhiṣaṇa prabhaḥ |
āyuḥ śrīkīrtisahitaḥ putrapautrādi saṃyutāṃ || 13 ||

samṛddhi mahatī prāpya bhuktvā bhogāṃśca durlabhān |
sahasrakula saṃyukto modate yāme pade || 14 ||

cakraṃ ratnamayaṃ nityamabhyarcya śucirādarāt |
kāmavatsubhagoloke vidyayādhiṣaṇaprabhaḥ || 15 ||

dhanadena samolakṣmyā vidyayādhiṣaṇa prabhaḥ |
bhukteha sakalān bhogān vrajatyaṃte paraṃ padaṃ || 16 ||

sarvopacārairārādhya cakrarājaṃ phalapradaṃ |
sahasraṃ prajapennityamatha paṃcaśataṃ tu vā || 17 ||

catuḥśataṃ japennityaṃ triśata dviśataṃ tu (*) |
vāpi nocet prāpnotyadhogati (******) || 18 ||

samagraṃ phalamakṣapya nityamāpnoti siddhidaṃ |
paścimābhimukhellimaṃge vṛṣaśūnye śivāye || 19 ||

athavācārya sānnidhye bhagavanmaṃdirepi vā |
cakrarājārddhabhaṃ yatra yatrācāryasya sannidhiḥ || 20 ||

divyakṣetraṃ tu duddiṣṭaṃ samaṃ tadyojanāyataṃ |
ekādaśyāṃ māghamāse dvādaśyāṃ vā śuciḥ śive || 21 ||

ārabhyā śivarātryaṃtaṃ sādhako niyatavrataḥ |
ācāryaṃ sannidhīkṛtya cakrarājaṃ samarcayan || 22 ||

phalāśī vā haviṣyāśī kṣīrāśī vā jiteṃdriyaḥ |
ekabhaktāśano devi gāyatrī vahuśo japan || 23 ||

cakrarāja samabhyarcya sāṃgāvaraṇamādarāt |
sahasraṃ prajapennityaṃ śriyaṃ paṃcadaśākṣarī || 24 ||

śatādhikaṃ tato hutvā nityamaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ |
savāsinī trayaṃ nityamekaikāṃ vāsuvāsinīṃ || 25 ||

bhojayitvātha mṛṣṭānnairdakṣiṇābhiśca toṣayan |
māghamāsasya bhūyāṃ nirāhāro yata vrataḥ || 26 ||

<p. 32b>

snātvā sāyamathāyodhyānagarāmidhamiṣṭadaṃ |
cakrarājaṃ samābhyarcya sāgācaraṇamādarāt || 27 ||

yāmopari tato rātrau vidhivat saṃskṛte nale |
laitāṃ śriyamārādhya jātavedasi sādhakaḥ || 28 ||

sakṛdādau ghṛtaṃ dratvā raśmividyābhirādarāt |
navāvaraṇā devīnāṃ ghṛtamekaikaśo hunet || 29 ||

śuddhena goghṛtenātha sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ |
hutvā paṃcadaśākṣaryā śriya ācārya sannidhau || 30 ||

lakṣmīmaṃtraiścaturbhiśca hutvāṣṭā viṃśadhā ghṛtaṃ |
(********) tato japādibhi hunet || 29 ||

śuddhena goghṛtenātha sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ |
hutvā paṃcadaśākṣaryā śriya ācārya sannidhau || 30 ||

lakṣmīmaṃtraiścaturbhiśca hutvāṣṭā viṃśadhā ghṛtaṃ |
tato japādibhirhutvā kṛtvā brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ || 31 ||

agniṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya śriya mudvāsya cātmani |
cakrarājaṃ samabhyarcya sāṃgaṃ bhūyopi śailaje || 32 ||

ācārya caraṇadvaṃdvaṃ natvā sāṣṭāṃgamādarāt |
ratnaviṃdu samāyukta ṣaṣṭi cihnuka hemajaṃ || 33 ||

kuṃḍala dvitaye dadyādācāryasyātha karṇayoḥ |
pratyāmnāya suvarṇaṃ vā dūtvā vāso yugaṃ śubha || 34 ||

aṃgulīyaka mukhyāni bhūṣaṇāni samarpyayet |
dadyāddhāmānanekāścaralaudyaṃ cākṣaye dhanaṃ || 35 ||

vahukṣīssamāyuktāṃgāṃ dadyādvat saṃyutāṃ |
athavācārya pādābje varṣāśanamitaṃ dhanaṃ || 36 ||

vāso yuga samāyuktamarpayenniya taru vrataḥ |
varṣāśanamitaṃ dravyaṃ śataniṣkamudāhṛtaṃ || 37 ||

jadarvaṃ vā tadardhaṃ vākti lobhaṃ parityajet |
ekaviṃśati niṣkaṃ vā varṇa niṣkamathāpi vā || 38 ||

arpayedarka niṣkaṃ vā siddhi nichanmahattarāṃ |
kṛtvaivaṃ niyamaṃ ghoraṃ puraścaraṇarmastiraṃ || 39 ||

avaśyaṃ siddhimāpnoti durlabhāṃ ca mahattarāṃ |
ācāryayapatnyai sauvarṇa karṣamānamathāpi vā || 40 ||

triṃśaccihnuka sauvarṇamalaṃkāraṃ samarpayet |
dadyāt sūkṣmataraṃ vastraṃ kṣaumaṃ kāryāsakaṃ tu vā || 41 ||

kṛtvā jāgaraṇaṃ rātrau śriyamabhyarcayan śuciḥ |
śāśvatīṃ siddhimāpnoti śriyaṃ cāpi mahattarāṃ || 42 ||

caturdaśī niśīthe sā yadi bhauma samanvitāṃ |
kṛtvesyaṃ tatra vidyāyāḥ puraścaryā sahasrajaṃ || 43 ||

avaśyaṃ phalamāpnoti sādhako nātra saṃśayaḥ |
brahmahatyādi pāpau yopyasya naśyati tatkṣaṇāt || 44 ||

vājimedha sahasrasya vājapeyāyu tasya ca |
phalaṃ sāṃgamavāpnoti prabhāte sādhakastataḥ || 45 ||

kṛtvādau nautyakaṃ karmasāṃgāvaraṇamādarāt |
cakrarājaṃ samabhyarcya savatsāṃgāṃ payasvinīṃ || 46 ||

ācāryāya samarpyātha datvā rātryātha dakṣiṇāṃ |
suvāsinī paṃcadamaśaṣṭānnaistoṣayedvratī || 47 ||

<p. 33a>

vāsobhirdakṣiṇādyaiśca vibhave sati sādhakaḥ |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdva prakṣālita jalaṃ śuciḥ || 48 ||

pītvāllīyādatho tasya bhukta śiṣṭānnamādarāt |
tasminne vane svameśriyaṃ devīṃ prapaśyati || 49 ||

yadyācārya padāṃbhoje dadyāduttama dakṣiṇāṃ |
paśyatyasau śriyaṃ sākṣāccakṣurbhyāmeva sādhakaḥ || 50 ||

madhyamāṃ dakṣiṇāṃ datvā kaniṣṭhāmapi dakṣiṇāṃ |
śriyaṃ śriyaṃ madārikāṃtāsmin dine svapne prapaśyati || 51 ||

tadārabhya mahadbhāgyaṃ bhavatyasya dinaṃ (**) |
akṣayā mahatī lakṣmīrdhanadhānyādi saṃkulā || 52 ||

tadvāri kiṃkarī bhūtvā tiṣṭhatyeva na saṃśayaṃ |
vāci vāgdevatā tasya bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 53 ||

āśvine navarātre vā vāsaṃte navarātrake |
japtvāvarṇa sahasrāṇi śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarī || 54 ||

pūrvoktavidhinā hutvā datvā pūrvokta dakṣiṇāṃ |
mahātīṃ siddhimāsādya bhavatyevedaṃ sannibhaḥ || 55 ||

akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyā mārabhya niyata vrataḥ |
ācāryānujñayāvaṇa sāhasraṃ śriyamiṣṭadāṃ || 56 ||

pūrṇimāṃtaṃ prajaptvātha pūrṇimāyāṃ tataḥ paraṃ |
dadhi madhvājya sahitodanena yanasodbhavaiḥ || 57 ||

vījaśūnyaiḥ phalairvājya sahitaistri śatādhikaṃ |
sahasraṃ vidhayā hutvā raśmi vidyāpurassaraṃ || 58 ||

jayādibhiratho hutvā kṛtvā brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ |
cakrarājaṃ samabhyarcya sāṃgāvaraṇamanvahaṃ || 59 ||

atha paṃcadaśābhyarcya pramadāḥ śrīdhiyā śuciḥ |
guḍodakena dadhyannaiḥ phalairapi manoharaiḥ || 60 ||

dakṣiṇābhiścatāṃ kṛtyaissaṃtoṣya ca tataḥ paraṃ |
śrīcakra sannidhau paścādācāryaṃ daṃḍavannaset || 61 ||

datvā dhenudvayaṃ vatsa vahukṣīra samanvitaṃ |
alaṃkārairalaṃkṛtya vāso yugamaṃ samarpya ca || 62 ||

varśāsanamitaṃ dravyaṃ tadardhaṃ vā tada cakra |
sannidhau paścādādhāryaṃ daṃḍavannaset || 61 ||

datvā dhena dvayaṃ vatsa vahukṣīra samanvitaṃ |
alaṃkārairalaṃ kṛtya vāso yugmaṃ samarpya ca || 62 ||

varṣāśanamitaṃ dravyaṃ tadardhaṃ vā tadardhakaṃ |
paṃcaniṣkamitaṃ vāpi pradadyād dakṣiṇādhanaṃ || 63 ||

ācāryapatnyai sauvarṇamalaṃkāraṃ yathā ruci |
vāsopi ca samarpyāthā taccheṣaṃ bhojayedvratī || 64 ||

itthaṃ kṛtvāpi mahatīṃ siddhiṃ prāpnoti śāśvatīṃ |
mahadā puṣpamārogyaṃ śrīrapyaṣṭa guṇānvitā || 65 ||

dhanadhānya samṛddhiśca pa(**)ddhirmahattarā |
kaṃdarpa samasaubhāgyaṃ vidyā vahuvidhāpi ca || 66 ||

sidhyatyasya na saṃdehastesminne vahi vatsare |
siddhiṃ vinā na kāsyānāṃ siddhiruktā manīṣibhiḥ || 67 ||

sādhayedvāṃchittānarthān sidhyanaṃtarame vahi |
yena kenāśupāyena pūrṇānugrahato guroḥ || 68 ||

vidyā siddhyati tasyātha devatvaṃ ca na durlabhaṃ |
dhyātvātha vā cakrarājamanaḥ pūjā samanvitaṃ || 69 ||

<p. 33b>

japāraṃbhaṃ sudhīḥ kuryān mahāpāpaḥ pramucyate |
nigadeno pāṃśunā vāmana sā vā japet sadā || 70 ||

nigadaḥ parameśāni sphuṭa vācā nigadyate |
avyaktataḥ sphurānane upāṃśuḥ parikīrtitaḥ || 71 ||

mānasastu vārohe ciṃtanāttavarūpabhak |
jihvāyā japyate yena sopi mānasa ucyate || 72 ||

nigadena tu yajjamaṃ lakṣamātraṃ varānane |
upāṃśu smaraṇenai tulyaṃ bhavati śailaje || 73 ||

upāṃśunā lakṣamātraṃ yajjasaṃ kamale kṣaṇe |
mānasoccāraṇe naiva tulyamekena suṃdari || 74 ||

dhiyāyadakṣara śrerāyā varṇādvarṇaṃ padātpadaṃ |
japyeta sa japaḥ prokto mānaso kṣaya siddhidaḥ || 75 ||

mudrāsannaddha dehassan sāṃgaṃ cakraṃ samarcayan |
lakṣamātraṃ japedyastu cakrarājaṃ samarcayan || 76 ||

lakṣamātraṃ japedyastu mahāpāpaiśca dāruṇaiḥ |
vārdhake yauvane vālye jāgrat svapnasuṣuptiṣu || 77 ||

manasā karmaṇā vācā jñānājñānakṛtairapi |
upapātaka saṃyaiśca mucyate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 78 ||

lakṣadvayaṃ jaedyastu śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarīṃ |
brahmahatyā surāyā nasvarṇasteyādikairapi || 79 ||

mahāpātaka saṃdyaiśca upapātakarāśibhiḥ |
mucyate nātra saṃdeha koṭi janmakṛtairapi || 80 ||

cakrarājaṃ samabhyarcya śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarī |
japtvā lakṣatrayaṃ maṃtrī hayamedha sahasrajaṃ || 81 ||

phalaṃ śrāpya viśuddhātmā daivatairapi pūjyate |
caturlakṣaṃ japedyastu yakrarājaṃ samarcayan || 82 ||

jaḍopi sarvavidyā api bhāṃtyasya cakratahḥ || 84 ||

mahākavirmahāvāṅmī bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ |
paṃcalakṣaṃ japedyastu niyataḥ śriyamiṣṭadāṃ || 85 ||

sarvavidyānidhirayaṃ vyāsavālmīkasannibhaḥ |
bhūtvā dhanadasaṃkāśaḥ śriyā bhavati saṃtataḥ || 86 ||

ajaraṇo bhūtvā prāpnotyā puṣpamakṣayo || 87 ||

lakṣa ṣaṭkaṃ japedyastu cakrarājaṃ samarcayan || 87 ||

pāraṃgatosau vidyānāṃ bhūtvā vidyādharādhiyaḥ |
sarvajñatva manuprāpya cirā puṣpamahattaraṃ || 88 ||

avāpya divyabhogāḍhyo labhate sarvavāṃchitaṃ |
prāpnoti mahadaiśvaryaṃ muktāratnādi saṃkulaṃ || 89 ||

gajāśvaratha saṃpūrṇadāsīdāsa samanvitaṃ |
saptalakṣaṃ japedyastu śriyo vidyāṃ phalapradāṃ || 90 ||

ajarāmaraṇo bhūtvā paṃcaviṃśati vārṣikaḥ |
saubhāgyaṃ paramaṃ labdhvā dhanadhānyādi saṃkulāṃ || 91 ||

śakrādyairaṣṭa dikpālairapi nityaṃ prapūjyate |
aṣṭalakṣaṃ japedyastu mahātripurasuṃdarī || 92 ||

aṣṭāṃgasahitaṃ yogaṃ triyaṃ cāṣtaguṇānvitāṃ |
saṃprāpya kālamṛtyu ca vinirjityā jarāmaraḥ || 93 ||

khecaratvaṃ samāsādya vimānamadhi rohatiṃ |
ciṃtāmaṇigaṇākīrṇe kāmadhenu samanvite || 94 ||

<p. 34a>

kalpadrumavanāṃtasthe surarājādi maṃdire |
krīḍate divyakanyābhiḥ kaṃdarpa iva suṃdaraḥ || 95 ||

navalakṣa pramāṇaṃ yojayet tripurasuṃdarī |
adhiyassarvasiddhānāṃ bhūtvā viṃśati vārṣikaḥ || 96 ||

jarāmaraṇa nirmukto valīpalitavarjitaḥ |
aṇimādi guśvaṇaiśvaryaṃ labdhā khecaratāmapi || 97 ||

krīḍate divyakanyābhissatataṃ devannudira |
varṇalakṣaṃ japedyastu śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarīṃ || 98 ||

sa eva jagatāṃ kartāhartā saṃrakṣakepi ca |
sarvajñaḥ subhago vāgmī sarvavidyāsu pāraga || 99 ||

anenaiva śarīreṇa jarāmaraṇavajitaḥ |
paṃcaviṃśati varṣaśca śriyamaṣṭa guṇānvitāṃ || 100 ||

saṃprāpya brahmaviṣṇvīśa śakrādyaiśca marudvaṇaiḥ |
pūjiṭato yogamaṣṭāṃgaṃ labdhvā khecaratāmapi || 101 ||

prārthyate divyakanyāmistiraścāṃvetti bhāṣitaṃ |
parakāyaṃ praviśati jāyate divyabhogavān || 102 ||

brahmarṣibhirvaśiṣṭāyairapi nityaṃ samarcitaḥ |
śatayojanaparyaṃtamapi paśyati cakṣuṣā || 103 ||

mehaṃdrapuramukhyeṣu divyalokeṣu saṃtataṃ |
viharatyeva gaṃdharvaissaṃstutopsarasāṃgaṇaiḥ || 104 ||

divyakanyāśatāṃkīrṇaṃ vimānamadhiruhya ca |
bhuktvā kalpaṃ mahābhogān brahma tādātmyaṃ siddhibhāk || 105 ||

yadāmaka rasakrāṃti savitā saṃkramatyasau |
tadārabhya dinaṃ nityamācāryānujñayā śive || 106 ||

ekabhaktāśanovidyāṃ japtvā sāhasra manvahaṃ |
adhaḥ śāyījitā mitro guruśuśrūṣaṇerataḥ || 107 ||

kuṃbhasaṃkrāṃtiparyaṃtaṃ taddine gurvanujña |
vidhivat saṃskṛte vahnau palāśa kusumaiḥ śubhaiḥ || 108 ||

triśatādhika sāhasraṃ juhuyāt triptadhulutaiḥ |
pūrvavadrāśmi vidyābhirbhūtvai kāmāhutiṃ śive || 109 ||

catuḥśrīmanubhiḥ paścādaṣṭādhi śatidhā ghṛtaṃ |
hutvā japādibhirhutvā kuryād brahmārpaṇāhuti || 110 ||

palāśa kusumābhāvepamairghṛta madhulutaiḥ |
padmābhāve vilvapatraiḥ kevalena ghṛtena vā || 111 ||

hutvā cāpa padāṃbhoje dadyādvarṣāśanaṃ dhanaṃ |
athāvā varṣaniṣkaṃkhaṃ paṃcaniṣkamathāpi vā || 112 ||

samarpyācārya yava dadyādvāso vibhūṣaṇaṃ |
vaṇa saṃkhyāssuvāsinyassaṃtoṣya bhojanādibhi || 113 ||

vaṃdhubhissahabhuṃjīta svayamācārya sannidhau |
itthaṃ kṛtvā mahāsiddhiṃ puraścaryā śatodbhavāṃ || 114 ||

saṃproṣya jagatāṃdhātrī śriye devī prapaśyati |
kaṃdarpa śatasaubhāgyaṃ śriyaṃ cāṣṭaguṇānvitāṃ || 115 ||

vācaspati samāṃ vidyāṃ jātismaraṇāmuttamaṃ |
yogamuṣṭāṃgasahitaṃ dhanadhānyākulāṃ śriyaṃ || 116 ||

<p. 34b>

divyakanyāyatitvaṃ ca samānottamatāmapi |
pūjyatāṃ nṛpa sānnidhye daivatairapi pūjyatāṃ || 117 ||

avāpya vatsare tasmin divyānbhogāśca durlabhān |
vrajatyaṃte paraṃdhāma kulasāhasra saṃyutaḥ || 118 ||

dāsabhūtānṛpālāḥsyuryoṣito dāsya eva hi |
ca setati vyāpinī lakṣmīrgajāścarathasaṃkulā || 119 ||

muktāratnaudya saṃpūrṇā svarṇaraupya samākulā |
avalā jāyate tasya maṃdire nātra saṃśayaḥ || 120 ||

ṛṣitva mamaratvaṃ vā gaṃdharvavatvamathāpi vā |
siddhatvaṃ vātha devatvaṃ labhatesmin kalevera || 121 ||

puraścaraṇa karmedamuktaṃte girikanyako |
viśeṣahemi dravyāṇi pravakṣyāmi tataḥ paraṃ || 122 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye trayodaśodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 34b>

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

viśeṣa homa dravyāṇāṃ vidhānamatha vakṣyate |
yacchrūtvāpi na rodhīmānduritaudyairvimucyate || 1 ||

dīpasthānaṃ samāśritya japahomārcanādikaṃ |
kuryāt samastavidyānāṃ sidhyathersādhakottamaḥ || 2 ||

vatulaṃ uracayeddevi kūrmākṛti sulocane |
tanmadhye navakoṣṭhānikatvā varṇān samālikhet || 3 ||

madhyakoṣṭhe kṣetranāma likhedvarṇānathāṣṭasu |
svarayugma krameṇaivakādicāṣṭa suyojayet || 4 ||

avarga kramato devi kavargādi tataḥ paraṃ |
lakṣavarṇau śaṃbhukoṇe vilikhet kūrmasaṃjñikaṃ || 5 ||

yasminkoṣṭhe kṣetranāma tanmukhaṃ viddhi pārvati |
mukhasya pārśvayoḥ pāṇīdvayaṃ jānī hi pārvati || 6 ||

tataḥ paścādvayaṃ kukṣisthānaṃ hi sukhaṃdite |
tataḥ pādadvayaṃ viddhi tadaṃte pucchamīritaṃ || 7 ||

mukhe kāryāṇi sidhyaṃti manoratha śatānyapi |
karasthāne mahākleśaḥ sarvakārya vināśakṛt || 8 ||

udare duḥkhamadhikaṃ pādayorhāniravyutā |
pucchetu dhanahāniśca jāyate nānyathā priye || 9 ||

dīpasthānaṃ mayā proktaṃ trailokyepi sudurlabhaṃ |
dīpasthānaṃ purekṣetre grāmepi viṣayepi vā || 10 ||

yatra kutrāpi vā kṛtvā japahomārcanādikaṃ |
kuryādanaṃta phaladaṃ viddhi parvata kanyake || 11 ||

nitya homaḥ purā prokto mayā pātakarbhajanaḥ |
kāmanāhauma karmāṇi vakṣyāmi phaladānyatha || 12 ||

mallikā mālatī jātī kusumairmadhumiśritaiḥ |
caitramāse pūrṇimāyāṃ sahasra tritayaṃ hunet || 13 ||

maṃdopi sarvavidyānāṃ pārago jīvasannibhaḥ |
bhavatyeva varārohe mahāvāgmī mahākaviḥ || 14 ||

japāpuṣpairājyayuktaiḥ karavīrairathāpi vā |
sahasra tritayaṃ hutvā gaukṣīra trimadhusutaiḥ || 15 ||

<p. 35a>

kāmokāmavat subhagaḥ kāṃtyā mohayejjagatīmimāṃ |
vasorājakule vāpi viladvāre vanepi vā || 16 ||

vijayāśriya māpnoti hanūmāni ca saṃtataṃ |
saubhāgyena vilāsena sāmarthyenāpi suvrate || 17 ||

pūrvokta kusumairhutvā taruṇīśca madānvitāḥ |
saṃmohayati bhūpānāṃ kanyā api manoharāḥ || 18 ||

karpūra kuṃkumaṃ deviṃ miśraṃ mṛgamadena ca |
laghukolasamaṃ hutvā sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 19 ||

rājyalakṣmī mavāpnoti saṃtati vyāpinī naraḥ |
caṃpakaiḥ pāṭalairhutvā yata trimadhumiśritaiḥ || 20 ||

trisahasraṃ viśuddhātmā triśatādhika mādarāt |
dhanadhānyā kulāṃ muktāralarāśi samākulāṃ || 21 ||

mahatīṃ śriyamāpnoti śāśvatī manapāpinī |
śrīkhaṃḍaṃ guguluṃ caṃdranāgaraṃ juhuyā yadi || 22 ||

pratyekamekasāhasraṃ kaṃdarpasadṛśaḥ śriyā |
rājanājeṃdradevānāṃpuraṃ (*)rvaśamānayet || 23 ||

sarvelokā vaśībhūtā bhavatyasya na śaṃśayaḥ |
ghṛta trimadhu sasmiśralākṣāṃ hutvā sahasraśaḥ || 24 ||

rājyalakṣmī samāsāya dāridryeṇa vimucyate |
mabhutritathadvometa sahasra tritayaṃ śuciḥ || 25 ||

vimuktaḥ sakulāyadbhāḥ khecaratvamavāpnuyāt |
kṣīraṃ madhu ca dadhyājyaṃ pṛthagdyutvā sahasraśaḥ || 26 ||

āyurdha namahārogya samṛddhiṃ ca labhet parāṃ |
kṣīreṇa madhutā hutvā pratyekaṃ trisahasrakaṃ || 27 ||

amamṛtyuṃ vinirjityakālaṃ mṛtyuṃ ca sādhakaḥ |
mahadāpuṣpamāpnoti sarvādhinyādhikartitaḥ || 28 ||

dadhimākṣika homena pratyekaṃ trisahasrakaṃ |
saubhāgyaṃ mahadā sādya dhanamakṣayamāpnuyāt || 29 ||

saghṛtena sitenātha hutvā daśasahasrakaṃ |
mahatīṃ śriyamāsādya vairiṇastaṃbhayatyasau || 30 ||

homā dadhimadhukṣīlājābhi vīravaṃdina |
vimuktassarvarogaiśca svacchaṃdamaraṇo bhavet || 31 ||

kamalairuṇairhutvādyuta trimadhumiśritaiḥ |
trisahasraṃ viśuddhātmā dvitīya ivayakṣarāṭ || 32 ||

raktotpalaistrimadhvaktairjuhyādoghṛtaputaiḥ |
samāhaṃ sarvabhūyālā dāsabhūtā bhavati hi || 33 ||

triśatādhika sāhasrāt pratyahaṃ girikanyake |
ayaṃ dhanayavāpnoti vīchitaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ || 34 ||

nīlotpalaitpalaistrimadhvaktaiḥ śatādhika sahasrakaṃ |
hutvā samāhamātreṇa krūrā bhūpanayopi ca || 35 ||

dāsabhūtā bhavatyasya duḥsādhyājapi yoṣitaḥ |
śvetātpalai strimadhvaktaiṃ śatādhika sahasrakaṃ || 36 ||

hutvā samāhamātreṇa mahatī śriyamakṣayāṃ |
saṃprāpya sarvavidyānāṃ pārago bhavati dhruvaṃ || 37 ||

śvetapadmaustri madhvaktaiśa śatādhika sahasrakaṃ |
hutvā samāhamātreṇa kāṃtiṃ kaṃdarpa sannibhāṃ || 38 ||

<p. 35b>

saṃprāpya mahatī lakṣmīṃ prāpnotīṃdra samaprabhāṃ |
kahlāra havanānmaṃtrī triśatādhika sahasrakaṃ || 39 ||

saptāhāt sarvasaubhāgyaṃ dhanamakṣaya māpnuyāt |
mānuluṃga phalairhutvā sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 40 ||

samāhāt kṣatriyā vaiśyā bhavaṃtyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
nāraṃga phalahomena sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 41 ||

tryahāt sakalā vaiśyā dāsabhūtā na saṃśayaḥ |
kuṣmāṃḍa phalahomena sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 42 ||

paṃcāhāt sarvasaubhāgyaṃ dhanamakṣayamāpnuyāt |
mānuluṃgaphalairhutvā sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 40 ||

samāhāt kṣatriyāvaiśyā bhavaṃtyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
nāraṃgaphalahomena sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 41 ||

tryahāt sakalā vaiśyādāsabhūtā na saṃśayaḥ |
kūṣmāṃḍaphalahomena sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 42 ||

paṃcāhāt sarvaśūdrāśca vaśyā atrabha saṃśayaḥ |
drākṣā phalaistrimadhvaktaissahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 43 ||

hutvaika viṃśati dinaṃ sidhyaṣṭakaṃ mavāpnuyāt |
kadalīphala homena lakṣamātreṇa bhūbhujaḥ || 44 ||

daśatraśyāna saṃdeho yāvajjīvaṃ bhavaṃti hi |
kharjūraphalaho na lakṣamātreṇabhūjaḥ || 45 ||

vaśyā viṃśati saṃkhyākā ityājñā pārameśvarī |
rikelayūlairhutvā lakṣaṃ trimadhumiśritaiḥ || 46 ||

saptadvīpādhiyo rājā yāvajīvaṃ bhavatyasau |
pakvānna pūla homena lakṣamātreṇa suṃdari || 47 ||

catuḥsāgaravayaṃti bhūpatirjāyate sadā |
panasasya phalai vījarahitai strimadhuplutaiḥ || 48 ||

lakṣaṃ hutvā mahālakṣmīṃ prāpnotīṃdra samaprabhā |
vaśīkaroti bhūyālan kiṃkarā iva saṃtataṃ || 49 ||

hutvā kṛṣṇatilairganyaghṛta trimadhumiśritaiḥ |
triśatādhika sāhasraṃ pakṣamekaṃ niraṃtaraṃ || 50 ||

iṣṭasiddhimavāpnoti durlabhāmapi daivataiḥ |
guggulasya ca hāmena ṣaṭhastreṇa suṃdari || 51 ||

sarvaduḥkhanivṛttiḥ syādakṣayaṃ sukhamaśrute |
kuṃkumadyata saṃyuktaṃ madhu tritayamiśritaṃ || 52 ||

sahasra paṃcakaṃ hutvā kāyavat suṃdarākṛtiḥ |
vaśīkaroti trailokyaṃ yāvajīvaṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 53 ||

caṃdane ghṛtasaṃmiśraṃ madhutritayāmiśritaṃ |
sahasratritayaṃ hutvā vairiṇo śamānayet || 54 ||

raktaṃ caṃdana homena sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ |
striyo vaśyā bhavaṃtyasya puruṣā api saṃtata || 55 ||

kapūraṃ juhuyādyastu ghṛta trimadhumiśritaṃ |
triśatādhika sāhasraṃdita tritayamīśvari || 56 ||

dīrghamāyuṣya māsādya kāṃtyā kaṃdarpa sannibhaḥ |
vācaspati saptaḥ sākṣādvidyayehāpi jāyate || 57 ||

kūstūrī homataḥ samyak sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ |
ekaṃ na divase naiva vaśyāḥ sphurrājamaṃtriṇaḥ || 58 ||

<p. 36a>

tilataṃdula taṃdula homena sahasraṃ saptavāsaraṃ |
sarvapāpa nivṛttiḥ syāddroga śāṃtiśca jāyeta || 59 ||

ghṛtatrimadhusaṃmiśra śarkarāhomataḥ śivo |
triśatādhika sāhasraṃ saptāha sādhakottamaḥ || 60 ||

vaśīkaroti trailokyaṃ śriyamapya calāṃ labhet |
ghṛta trimadhusaṃmiśra pāyasaṃ juhuyādyadi || 61 ||

triśatādhika sāhasraṃ daśāhaṃ kamalekṣaṇe |
trailokyaṃ svavaśīkṛtya śriyamaṣṭaguṇānvitāṃ || 62 ||

prāpnotyatra na saṃdaihassatyaṃdhu satyaṃ varānane |
nānāvidhānnā homena māsi māsi śatrayaṃ || 63 ||

atra rāśi mavāpnoti dhānyamakṣayamaśnute |
sopaskaraiśca kaṭukaissahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 64 ||

hutvā saptāha mātreṇa rogajālaissuruṇaiḥ |
apanetu maśakyaiśca matrauṣadhassāyanaiḥ || 65 ||

muvyate nātra saṃdehakṣayakuṣṭādikairapi |
japāpuṣpaistrimadhuktaissaptāhaṃ juhuyādyadi || 66 ||

triśatādhika sāhasraṃ prāpya lakṣmīmacaṃcalāṃ |
srvavidyānidhirbhūtvā kāmavatsuṃdaro bhavet || 67 ||

vakulasya hunatpuṣpaistrisahasraṃ śatādhikaṃ |
saubhāgyaṃ mahadāsāpavṛddhoṣi taruṇāyate || 68 ||

daśāṃgadhūpahomenāpyasau saubhāgyadhān bhavet |
jaṃbūphalaistrimadhvaktaistrisahasraṃ śatādhikaṃ || 69 ||

caturdivasahomena taruṇyo rūpagarvitāḥ |
dāsībhūtā bhavatyeva rājakanyā api dhruvaṃ || 70 ||

kūṣmāṃḍa phalahomena trisahasraṃ śatādhikaṃ |
saptāhārdetya kanyāśca dāsībhūtā bhavaṃti hi || 71 ||

śrīphalaiśuddhayādagnau paṃcāhaṃ trimadhuplutaiḥ |
triśatādhika sāhasraṃ rājyalakṣmīrmahīyasī || 72 ||

tanmaṃdire bhavatyeva dhanaratnaudya saṃkulā |
ikṣu khaṃḍaiścaturaha śatādhika sahasrakaṃ || 73 ||

hutvā trimadhusaṃmiśraiḥ śriya sākṣāt prapaśyati |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityamaṣṭāviṃśatidhāpivā || 74 ||

hutvā śuddhena gavyena ghṛte naiva dine dine |
vidyāsiddhimavāpnoti śreyosi suvahūnyapi || 75 ||

kevalaṃ ghṛtahomena pratyekaṃ jātavedasi |
samastābhīṣṭa saṃsiddhiṃ prāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ || 76 ||

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi mānaṃ havanā siddhidaṃ |
puṣpaṃ magraṃ juhuyādūtyailaṃ kamalaṃ tu vā || 77 ||

kusumāni ca puṣpāṇi yatheṣṭāni hunesriye |
śatasaṃkhyāstilā proktāstaṃḍulāśca tathaiva hi || 78 ||

lājāmuṣṭi pramāṇāśca māṣamagnaghṛtaṃ smṛtaṃ |
culukārddhamatakṣīramaṃtravādarasammitaṃ || 79 ||

sthalīṃ phalaṃ maheśāni kūṣmāṃḍamāṃtu luṃgakaṃ |
manaḥ prītikaraiḥ khaṃḍairjuhuyān manalocane || 80 ||

<p. 36b>

raṃbhāphalaṃ catuḥkhaṃḍaṃ laghucet khaṃḍitaṃ na hi |
nārikelaṃ catuḥkhaṃḍamuktaṃ śāstreṣu suṃdāri || 81 ||

pratiparvahune dikṣu khaṃḍasaṃkalasiddhidaṃ |
drākṣāphalaṃ samagrasyāṃ nāraṃgaṃ ca dvidhā smṛtaṃ || 81 ||

kharjūramekameka syāt kramukādhā ca guggulaṃ |
guṃjā samaṃ ca karpūraṃ kastūrī kuṃkumaṃ tathā || 82 ||

manaḥ priyāṇi cānyāni phalāni juhuyāt priyekaṃ |
lākṣā guggula saṃkhyāśyādyadvastu sumanoharaṃ || 83 ||

manaḥ priyā hutiṃ kṛtvā homakuryāstulocane |
etadā huti mānaṃte kathitaṃ sarvavighnahṛt || 84 ||

yena kenāpyu pāyena svācāryānu grahācchive |
śriyaṃ saṃtoṣayennityaṃ japahomārcanādibhiḥ || 85 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīyetaṃtravedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye caturdaśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 36b>

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi viśeṣamidhimuttamaṃ |
ādau kuṃḍaṃ samutpādya caturasraṃ sulakṣaṇaṃ || 1 ||

sarvalakṣaṇa saṃyuktaṃ śatahomarddha hastakaṃ |
sahasre hastamātraṃ syādvisahasre dvihastakaṃ || 2 ||

trihastamayute proktaṃ lakṣe hasta catuṣṭayaṃ |
koṭi homeṣṭa hastaṃ ca kṛtvā kuṃḍasya lakṣaṇaṃ || 3 ||

śāṃtike caturasraṃ ca vaśye caivārddha caṃdrakaṃ |
ṣaṭkoṇaṃ staṃbhane proktaṃ māraṇe tadvadevahi || 4 ||

ākarṣaṇe trikoṇaṃ ca vṛttamuccāṭane tathā |
nānāsiddhikaraṃ proktaṃ padmakoṇaṃ maheśvari || 5 ||

uttare śāṃtikarma syāddhāruṇyāṃ staṃbhaṭanaṃ bhavet |
māraṇe dakṣiṇa proktā paścimārvakṣyakarmaṇi || 6 ||

dāhakarmaṇi vā dasmagnepī vidveṣene ṛtī |
tathā muccāṭanaṃ syādvāyanve īśānye sarvasiddhidaṃ || 7 ||

vidyāsiddhikaraṃ pūrvadiṅmukhaṃ homakarmaṇi |
kṛttikākarṣaṇe proktā maraṇī māraṇe tathā || 8 ||

svātī vaśye tathoccāṭe jyeṣṭhāstaṃbhanakarmaṇi |
vidveṣe śatatārāsyādahi vundhyaṃ tu śāṃtidaṃ || 9 ||

akarṣaṇaṃ somavāre māraṇaṃ maṃgale tathā |
vudhe ca staṃbhanaṃ kāryaṃ guruvāre ca pauṣṭikaṃ || 10 ||

bhārgave sarvasiddhiḥ syāha vausavaṃ śubhaṃ bhavet |
rājavṛttasya samidho hottavyāḥ staṃbhane śive || 11 ||

mahiṣīkṛta homaśca lokatraya vaśaṃkaraḥ |
dāḍimī samidho home praśastā māraṇādike || 12 ||

ajā ghṛtena homaḥ syājjagattritayamohanaḥ |
vidveṣe caiva hotavyā unmatta samidhastathā || 13 ||

atasītaila saṃyuktā mahāvidveṣakārakāḥ |
sarvakāryārthasiddhiśca sarvavighnanivāraṇaṃ || 14 ||

<p. 37a>

goghṛte naiva havanādanvahaṃ girikanyake |
bhārgave vāsare vāpi navamyāṃ pūrṇimāsuvā || 15 ||

avaśyaṃ pūjayeddevi kanyakāssu manoharāḥ |
paṃcamavarṣamārabhya yāvadvādaśavatsaraṃ || 16 ||

avivāhita kanyānāṃ pūjanāt sarvasiddhayaḥ |
kanyakāḥ pūjitā yena trailokyaṃ tena pūjitaṃ || 17 ||

vivāhitā api sadārajodarśala varjitāḥ |
kanyakā iti saṃproktā yāvadvādaśavatsaraṃ || 18 ||

śrīdhiyā kanyakāḥ pūjyāḥ samastaphalasiddhaye |
suvāsinyopi saṃpūjyā bhūṣaṇācchādanāśanaiḥ || 19 ||

ācāryapatnī saṃpūjyā sākṣāllakṣmīdhiyānvahaṃ |
saiva lakṣmīrjajammātā saiva gaurī sarasvatī || 20 ||

ācāryapatnyovaḍhyaścet tatrayā putra saṃyutā |
saiva sākṣānmahālakṣmīdhiyā pūjyā vibhūvaṇaiḥ || 21 ||

tatpatnyopītarāmāt sadṛśā nātra saṃśayaḥ |
damapnāropaṇaṃ vakṣye sādhakānāṃ hitāya ca || 22 ||

saṃvatsakṛtā pūjā yena pūrṇā prajāyate |
tapobhagāṃyamadannomaya śailasute yadā || 23 ||

lakṣmībhūtastadā patnyai ratiḥ prītiśca duḥkhite |
saṃtuṣṭa manasā tābhyāṃ varodato mayāptiye || 24 ||

tannetra vāri saṃbhūtā damanasya latādrije |
tatsauramya samudbhūta saukhyamāsīt sulocane || 25 ||

ratyai prītyai ca tasmāttu madanaḥ prakīṭīkṛtaḥ |
damanena tuyo maṃtrī var'madhye sa pūjayet || 26 ||

tasya sāṃvatsarī pūjāmadanāya bhaviṣyati |
itisyai varodato mayaiva sukhaṃdite || 27 ||

tasmāddamana pūjā hi kartavyā sādhakottamaiḥ |
śrīśrīśapūjāniratairgaurīśaṃkara pūjakaiḥ || 28 ||

ravipūjāparaiścāpi gaṇeśārcana tatparaiḥ |
śrīcakrapūjānirataiḥ śālagrāmārcakairapi || 29 ||

liṃgācanarataiścāpi vapukārcana tatparaiḥ |
maheṃdrā yaṣṭā dikpāla pūjanā saktamānasaiḥ || 30 ||

yasya yatra bhavet prītistadarcana parairapi |
vatsare vatsare vaśyaṃ kartavyaṃ damanārcanaṃ || 31 ||

anyathā tatphalaṃ varṣakṛtaṃ kāmasya jāyate |
caitrādayastrayomāsāpakṣausitasitetarau || 32 ||

eteṣu pūrvapūrvastu kālaḥ sarvottamottamaḥ |
aṣṭamyāṃ ca caturdaśyāṃ paurṇamāsyā madhyāpi vā || 33 ||

pūrvarātrau prakurvīta sadyo vādhini vāsanaṃ |
svayamutyādyadamanaṃ samūlaṃ pūrvastu kāllarveyutaṃ || 34 ||

ānītamathavānyena maulyādātṛtameva vā |
vāmataḥ sthāpayeddevi sarvatau bhadraje vuje || 35 ||

vasvare dāmanaṃ pātraṃ prasthāpyā paścāṣṭavarṇārati vidyā varānane |
prītiṃ vade iti sthāne prītimaṃtroṣṭa varṇayet sudhīḥ vāgbhavaṃ bhuvaneśānīṃ 
śriyaṃ kāmamataḥ paraṃ || 36 ||

kāmadevāya hṛdayaṃ vidyaiṣārudravarṇi |
pūrvavījñānicoddhārya praremātmanamuccaret || 37 ||

ravyai namaścāṣṭa varṇārati vidyā varānane |
prītiṃ vade iti sthāne prīti maṃtroṣṭa varṇakaḥ || 38 ||

<p. 37b>

navaprakārabhinnaṃ taddamanaṃ pūjayet kramāt |
pūrvoktāyāṃ dakṣiṇasyāṃ diśi siṃhāsanopari || 39 ||

jastreṇa rakṣaṇaṃ kuryāt kavacenāva kuṃṭhanaṃ |
vadhvā stri śūlakuṃdrā ca bhrāmayeddamanopari || 40 ||

śrīkhaṃḍadyusaṇeṃdvāḍhyairapadhivāsaṃ tu kārayet |
prathame divase kuryādadhivāsanamuttamaṃ || 41 ||

sadyo divyatha rātrau vā varṣapūjāphalāptaye prātaḥ |
kāle mahāpūjāṃ kṛtvā yodhyā purābhidhe || 42 ||

navakoṇaṃ vidhāyātha siṃhareṇa mahāprabhaṃ |
kalaśānnavasaṃsthāpya hemaralādi pūritān || 43 ||

ekaṃ vā kalaśaṃ nityaṃ sthāpayeddeśikottamaḥ |
dakṣiṇe maṃḍalaṃ kṛtvā kuṃkumādyairvicipatritaṃ || 44 ||

aśoka tarumūlekhya trikoṇaṃ maṃḍalaṃ likhet |
tanmadhye pūjayet kāmaṃ taruṇaṃ cāruṇaprabhaṃ || 45 ||

raktamālya vastrabhūṣaṃ vāmadakṣiṇayoḥ priye |
ratiprīti viśobhāḍhyaṃ paṃcavāṇa dhanurdharaṃ || 46 ||

vasaṃtasahitaṃ kāmaṃ kadaṃvavana madhyagaṃ |
pūrvokti manunā samyagarcayot siddhi hetave || 47 ||

gauraśyāme ratiprīti krameṇa maṇibhūṣite |
padmatāṃvūlahaste ca raktavastra virājite || 48 ||

divyābharaṇa saṃyukte divyamālya virājite |
vāmadakṣiṇayordhyātvā kāmasya tadanaṃtaraṃ || 49 ||

vasaṃtaṃ pūjayet paścāt kadaṃvavana madhyagaṃ |
gauravarṇa vāmahaste sudhāpūrṇa ghaṭānvitaṃ || 50 ||

dakṣahastena vibhrāṇaṃ nānā puṣpa samuccayaṃ |
sāṃgaṃ kāmaṃ prapūjyātha mahātripurasuṃdarī || 51 ||

kramaṃ samarcayet samyāgācārya caraṇadvayaṃ |
svarṇabhāra sahasraiśca divyasragvastrabhūṣaṇaiḥ || 52 ||

ratnairmuktā phalairvittairarcayediṣṭa siddhaye |
ācārya pūjyate yatra tatkarma sa phalaṃ smṛtaṃ || 53 ||

ācārya pūjārahitaṃ niṣphalaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ |
guṇe bhāve tatputraṃ tatpatnīṃ vā samarpayet || 54 ||

ācārya pautramatha vā taddohi bhramathāpi vā |
teṣāmabhāve tadbhātṛnatha vā saṃprapūjayet || 55 ||

kanyakā arcayet paścānmaṣṭānneśca suvāsinīḥ |
śrīvidyayā hunedājyamatha triśatamādarāt || 56 ||

brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ kṛtvā brāhmaṇābhojayedatha |
itthaṃ kṛtvā narastyamyagdamanāropaṇa vrataṃ || 57 ||

vatsarevatsare samyagāpa homārcanādikaṃ |
kṛtvā sāṃgamavāpnoti phalaṃ nātra vicāraṇā || 58 ||

saṃvatsarakṛtāṃ pūjā japahomādikaṃ śive |
anyathā madanāyaiva kṛtaṃ syādiri kanyake || 59 ||

<p. 38a>

lalitāyā mahārājñāḥ śriyo vidyā parāyaṇaḥ |
bhakṣayennekṣu khaṃḍāni na bhavet strīṣu niṣṭhuraḥ || 60 ||

na bhavelloka vidveṣī malināna bhavet kvacit |
nānṛtaṃ kasya ciddhayādviśeṣeṇa guroḥ śive || 61 ||

ācāryaniṃdā śravaṇaṃ śreyaskāmī parityajet |
daridro vā dhanāḍhyo vā mūrkho ca paṃḍitopi vā || 62 ||

ācārya eva bhagavān harirbrahmāpāraḥ śivaḥ |
kimatra vahunoktena parameśvara macyutaṃ || 63 ||

ācāryarūpiṇaṃ viddhi satyaṃ na satyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
bhaktimānnāja vidyāyāṃ lakṣmyādīnapi sanmanūn || 64 ||

yathā śaktyā japet vidvāt siddhi prāpnotyanuttamāṃ |
māhātmyate tacchrī devyā sāgare culukāṃvuvat || 65 ||

kiṃciduktaṃ mayā devi kiṃ punaḥ śrotumicchasi || 65 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodapaṃcadaśodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 38a>

śrīdevyuvāca ||

bhagavan dakṣiṇāmūrte sarvajña karuṇānidhe |
caturlakṣmī sevyamānā śriyo vidyātvaparitā || 1 ||

lakṣmyādi vidyāralānāṃ vidhānaṃ kathaya prabho |

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

śrīdevīlalitā sarvajagatkāraṇārūpiṇī || 2 ||

caturlakṣmī sevyamānā sākṣātkāmadudyāsmṛtā || 3 ||

śrīvidyā ca tathā lakṣmīrmahālakṣmīstataḥ paraṃ |
triśaktiḥ sarvasāmrājyalakṣmīḥ paṃcaprakīrtitāḥ || 4 ||

śriyastrijagadaṃvāyā mūlavidyāgarīyasī || 4 ||

siṃhāsenaśvarī proktā sarvavidyāmayī śubhā |
ekākṣarī mahāvidyāṃ lakṣmīmatha vadāmyahaṃ || 5 ||

vāruṇāṃtaṃ vahni saṃsthaṃ vāmanetra vibhūṣitaṃ |
viṃdunādayutaṃ lakṣmī vījame tadudāhṛtaṃ || 6 ||

pūrvasiṃsaneśānī lakṣmīreṣātrayī mayī |
samasta saṃpat sukhadā vidhātrā pūjitā purā || 7 ||

brāhmaṇenu grahāddakṣa kaśyapādyāḥ prajeśvarāḥ |
lakṣmī vījametadudāhṛtaṃ mārādhya lokānāmādhiyatyaṃ prayedire || 8 ||

ṛṣirbhaśurmahāyogīnicchachaṃda udāhṛtaṃ |
śrīlakṣmīrdevatā proktā sarvasaṃyat samṛddhidā || 9 ||

śaturthe vījaśaktī ca kīlakaṃ rephala ucyate |
dvitīyena tṛtīyena ṣasṭhenārṇena caimiti || 10 ||

iṃdreṇa caṃdrakalayā vidyāṃ saṃbheya suṃdarī |
ṣaḍaṃgāni nyasenmaṃtrī hacchiraśca śikhāṃ tataḥ || 11 ||

kavacaṃ netramastraṃ ca namaḥ svāhā krameṇa ca |
vaṣaḍhuṃ vauṣaḍaṃtaṃ ca puṭebhiryojayet kramāt || 12 ||

aṣṭa patra likhedyaṃtraṃ vahirbhūviṃdumālikhet |
madhye puṣpaṃ vinikṣipye pīṭhaśaktīḥ samarcayet || 13 ||

<p. 38b>

vibhūti runnatiḥ kāṃtiḥ puṣṭhiḥ kīrtiśca satnatiḥ |
vyuṣṭirutkṛṣṭi ṛddhaśca vasu dikṣu prapūjayet || 14 ||

madhye siṃhāsanaṃ pūjyaṃ sarvaśaktimayaṃ priye |
dhyāyettataḥ śriyaṃ ramyāṃ sarvadeva namaskṛtāṃ || 15 ||

taptakārtakṣarābhāsāṃ divyaratna vibhūṣitāṃ |
āsiṃcya mānāmamṛtairmuktāratna dravairapi || 16 ||

śubhrābhrāmena yugmena muhurmuhurapi priye |
ratnaudya vahu makuṭā śuddha saumāṃgarāgiṇī || 17 ||

padmākṣīyaṃ manābhasya vāmāṃke saṃsthitāṃbhaje |
evaṃ dhyātvā yajeddevī padmayugmadharāṃ sadā || 18 ||

varadā bhaya śobhāḍhyāṃ caturvāhu trilocanāṃ |
āvāhanādi mudrāśca krameṇaiva pradarśayet || 19 ||

uccājalimadhaḥ kuryādiyamāvāhanī bhavet |
iyaṃ tu viparītāsyāttadā vai sthāpanī bhavet || 20 ||

ūrdhvāṃguṣṭaṃ muṣṭiyutaṃ tadeyaṃ sannidhāpanī |
aṃtaraṃguṣṭhamuṣṭibhyāṃ tatheyaṃ tannirodhanī || 21 ||

tarjanībhyāṃ paribhrāmya sakalīkaraṇaṃ bhavet |
aṃjaliṃ cārghyavat kṛtvā paramīkaraṇaṃ bhavet || 22 ||

parivartyakarau netrī tarjanyau ca kaniṣṭhike |
madhyamānāmikā yugme sthāpayettu parasparaṃ || 23 ||

amṛtīkaraṇaṃ nāma mudreyaṃ dhenurūpiṇī |
etāssādhāraṇamudrādarśayitvā japet priye || 24 ||

gaṃdhapuṣpādibhiścaiva sarvakāmārtha siddhaye |
agnīśāsura vāyavya madhyadikṣvaṃgapūjanaṃ || 25 ||

vālākā vimalā caiva kamalā vanamālikā |
vibhīṣikā mālikā ca śāṃkarī vasumālikā || 26 ||

pūrvādi kramato devi prādakṣiṇyena pūjayet |
iṃdrāgni yamarakṣorādvaruṇāni na saṃjñakān || 27 ||

kuvereśāna lokośā bhūmirvivekamādyajet |
brahmāviṣṇuśca lokeśāvūrddhādi kramato yajet || 28 ||

arkalakṣaṃ japenmaṃtraṃ taddaśāṃśena sādhakaḥ |
tapetyayasāsamyakkamalairājyatolitaiḥ || 29 ||

hutvā dvādaśa sahasramācārya caraṇadvaye |
palamāna suvarṇena racitaṃ kamalaṃ kṣubhaṃ śubhaṃ || 30 ||

datvā siddhimavāpnoti labhate sarvasaṃpadaḥ |
caturviṃśati sāhasramathavā sādhakottamaḥ || 31 ||

nirāhāro japedvidvā kārtikaidaśī dine |
trisaharaṃ hunedagnaupamairgavyājyatolitaiḥ || 32 ||

palamāna suvarṇaṃ vā dhenu dvādaśa sāhasraṃ |
vilvapatrairghṛtaplutaiḥ triśattādhika sāhasraṃ juhuyāt saṃskṛtenale || 35 ||

suvāsinīḥ samabhyarcya paṃcaśailasute śive |
vatsarān mahatī lakṣmīṃ labhate vanasaṃkulāṃ || 36 ||

<p. 39a>

japtvā dvādaśa sāhasraṃ caturmāsaṃ dine dine |
sahasrapaṃcakaṃ vāpi sahasra tritayaṃ tu vā || 37 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā gavyenājyena sādhakaḥ |
acalāṃ mahatīṃ lakṣmīṃ dhanavānyādi saṃkulāṃ || 38 ||

prāpnotyatra na saṃdehassatyaṃ satyaṃ vadāmyahaṃ |
ekākṣaramikāṃmimāṃ lakṣmī japannavahamādarāt || 39 ||

rājyalakṣmī mavāpnoti gurubhakto yadi svayaṃ |
lakṣmīvidyā vidhāṃte kiṃcide tanmayeritaṃ mahādāridryaśamanaṃ kiṃ punaḥ 
śromicchasi || 40 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīyetaṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye ṣoḍaśodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 39a>

ṛṣaya ūcuḥ || 

ṛṣyaśṛṃga mahābhāga divyajñāna vatāvara |
prasannalakṣmīvidyāyāḥ pārvatyai parameśvaraḥ || 1 ||

yadā hatadvayaṃ bhūyaḥ śrotumicchāma he prabho |
yadāha bhagavākto mahālakṣmīmanoḥ śubhaṃ || 2 ||

māhātmyaṃ sarvapāpaghnaṃ tadbhūyaḥ kathayasvanaḥ |

śrīṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca || 

lakṣmīvidyāvidhi śrutvā girijā tuṣṭamānasāḥ |
dakṣiṇāmūrtirmāhedaṃ vacanaṃ lokasammitaṃ || 

śrīdevyuvāca ||

devadeva namastestu maheśa karuṇādhidhe || 4 ||

māhātmyaṃ lalitāṃ vādyā lakṣmyā api mayā śrutaṃ |
mahālakṣmī mahāvidyāvidhānaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ || 5 ||

suguptamapi me brūhi kṛpayā jagatāṃguro |

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

samyak pṛṣṭaṃ mahābhāge lokābhāmupakārakaṃ || 6 ||

prasannalakṣmī māhātmyaṃ sadyaḥ kalmakhanāśanaṃ |
purā nārāyaṇe noktaṃ janakāya mahātmane || 7 ||

tato dāśarathiḥ prāha vaśiṣṭādibhya ādarāt |
ahamapyatra vakṣyāmi tubhyaṃ rājīvalocane || 8 ||

guhyādguhyatamaṃ puṇyaṃ sārān saratayaṃ paraṃ |
prasannalakṣmī māhātmyamadhunā kathayāmite || 9 ||

trayī vijaṃ śriyā ruddhāṃ bhuvaneśī mataḥ paraṃ |
sparśādyaṃ brahmapūrvaṃ ca mahīṃ rudra samanvitāṃ || 10 ||

smaraṃ jaṭharavarṇaṃ ca mukhavṛttaṃ yuto bhuvaṃ |
valānujaṃ tato vāyuṃ rudrasvara samanvitaṃ ||11 ||

prasīda yugalaṃ bhūyaḥ śrīruddhāṃ bhuvaneśvarī |
mahālakṣmī padapaścāccaturthāyānvitaṃ || 12 ||

saptaviṃśākṣarī vidyā mahālakṣmyā itīritā |
dakṣasiṃhāsaneśānī viṣṇunā pūjitā purā || 13 ||

pragajāśca muktāralaugdyavarṣiṇī jagadīśvare |
ayodhyāpura vaikuṃṭha sarvasāmrājyanāyikā || 14 ||

<p. 39b>

mahālakṣmīritikhyātā vedavetāṃta saṃstutā |
prasannaśrīritikhyātā vedavetāṃtavedibhiḥ || 15 ||

bhaktānāṃ śaṃkhapadmādi nidhi saṃpatkarī śubhā |
upāsakānāṃ viprāṇāṃ māheṃdra śrīphalapradā || 16 ||

alakāpura sāmrājyadāyinī dhanavarṣiṇī |
vedavedāṃgavedāṃta pūrvavāksiddhikāriṇī || 17 ||

sarvakṣetramayī sarvayogaśāstrasvarūpiṇī |
sarvatīrthamayī sarvapātakaudyavidyātinī || 18 ||

anugrahādbhagavato brahmādyā devatāgaṇāḥ |
yoginassatakathāśca vaśiṣṭāyā maharṣayaḥ || 19 ||

puraṃdrādayassarvadikpālā amṛtāśanāḥ |
vasavoṣṭau mahābhāgāruhā ekāśāpi ca || 20 ||

dvādaśāpi tathā divyā mahālakṣmīṃ haripriyāṃ |
ārādhyāṣṭa uṇaiśvaryamavāpyādyāpi pārvati || 21 ||

japaṃti niyatānityaṃ samastaphalasiddhidāṃ |
alakāpurasāmrājyaṃ maheṃdrapurasaṃpadaṃ || 22 ||

aṇimādi guṇaiśvaryamartha brahmapadaṃ tu vā |
icchateyaṃ mahālakṣmīrjaptavyāniyatā nityaṃ samastaphalasiddhidāṃ |
alakāpurasāmrājyaṃ maheṃdrapurasaṃpadaṃ uyatātmanā || 23 ||

na vedairnāgamaiḥ śāstrairnapurāṇaissuvistaraiḥ |
jñātu śaṃdhanyā mahālakṣmīrācāryānugrahaṃvinā || 24 ||

prasannalakṣmīvidyāṃ yodṛṣṭā pustakasaṃsthitāṃ |
japet sayoginī vṛṃdairbhakṣyate māsaṣaṭkataḥ || 25 ||

ācāryānugrahānnityaṃ mahālakṣmīmimāṃ japan |
aṇimāṇi guṇaiśvaryaṃ muktāralaudyamakṣayaṃ || 26 ||

mahāvāksiddhimatulāṃ dhanarāśimakṣayaṃ |
mattānanekāmātaṃgānvājinopi vahnūn paśūn || 27 ||

saṃprāpya divyabhogāṃśca putrapautravatīmapi |
samṛddhiṃ mahatī labdhvā vaikuṃṭheva satiṃ labhet || 28 ||

nāvyaṃ śrīkāmibhirjapyā prānnaśrīriyaṃ śive |
sāmrājyalakṣmīkāmena bhogamokṣārthinā sadā || 29 ||

mahālakṣmīriyaṃ japyā mahāsaṃpatsamṛddhidā |
acalaṃ mahadaiśvaryaṃ mahāsiddhima caṃcalāṃ || 30 ||

icchatā satataṃ japyā prasannaśrīriyaṃ śive |
devāviyatyanirdraṇatiyaṃ hṛdayamena ca || 31 ||

varuṇena jalaiśvarya vāyavyaṃ vāyunāpdaṃ |
tejasvitvaṃ sa vitrā ca sucāśutvamathedunā || 32 ||

kośaiśvaryaṃ kuvereṇa guruṇā śakra gauravaṃ |
agninā tāpaśaktitvamoṣadhīśatvamiṃdunā || 33 ||

<p. 40a>

pātālarājyaṃ nāgena śakrādyaidigadhīśvaraiḥ |
lokaiśvaryarca saṃprāptamacalaṃ bhayavarjitaṃ || 34 ||

devasenāniyatṛtvaṃ prāptamīśvarasūnunā |
gaṇaiśvarya gaṇeśena naṃdinā śivatulyatā || 35 ||

mahālakṣī prabhāvena nānyatha vīravaṃdite |
yatra yatra mahadbhāgyaṃ prāptaṃ devarṣisiḥ purā || 36 ||

anugrahāt prasannāyāḥ śriya eva na saṃśayaḥ |
prasannalakṣmīmāhātmyaṃ brahmāpi jagatāṃpatiḥ || 37 ||

ahanārāyaṇo vāpi na śaktyāvaktumīścari |
yadā urvāsasaḥ śāpācchakropya naranāyakaḥ || 38 ||

naṣṭaśrīko bhavatyaścāt saṃprārthyāṃgira saṃguruṃ |
tadanugrahataḥ prāpya mahālakṣmīmimāṃ śive || 39 ||

samudramathato bhūtā dṛṣṭā sākṣācchiyaṃ parāṃ |
anuttamaṃ mahadbhāgyaṃ prāptavāna marādhipaḥ || 40 ||

acalā śrīyuto bhūtvā tadārabhya śacīpatiḥ |
trayāṇāmapi lokānāṃ māvipatyamavān || 41 ||

trailokya japitaṃ lebhe matte mairāvataṃ gataṃ |
hayaratnaṃ manovegamuccaiḥ śravasamānivamān || 42 ||

rājā vai śravaṇaḥ pūrvatapastasvāsuduścaraṃ |
pakṣarākṣasarājatvaṃ prāpyālakāpurī śubhāṃ || 43 ||

dhikkato rāvaṇenātha pulastyānugrahāt punaḥ |
prasannaśrīmahāvidyāṃ japtvā hutvā tataḥ paraṃ || 44 ||

matsakhitva manuprāpya dhaneśatva manuttamaṃ |
alakāpurasāmrājyaṃ prāptvān girikanyake || 45 ||

rājyalakṣmīriyaṃ vidyā mahālakṣmīriti smṛtā |
prasannalakṣmīrvikhyātā samastāmīṣṭasiddhidā || 46 ||

na vaktavyā durācāraratāyapiśunāya vā krodhine cāti |
mūrkhāya lubdhāyā mahālakṣmīriti smṛtā prasanṛtavādine || 47 ||

niṃdākatre piturmāturācāryordvaṣakāriṇi |
vedanidāparāyāpiyaṇa niṃdā parāya ca || 48 ||

parāṃganāsaṃgarataṃ para dravyeṣu lolupaṃ |
maṃdabuddhiṃ jaḍaṃ mūrkhaṃ durācārarataṃ tathā || 49 ||

vedavāhyaṃ durātmānaṃ vedaniṃdā parāyaṇaṃ |
śrutyuktācāra rahitaṃ śiṣyatve parivarjayet || 50 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdve dṛḍha bhaktaṃ jiteṃdriyaṃ |
paradravya parastrīṣu parāṅmukhamataṃdritaṃ || 51 ||

vaidikācāranirataṃ satataṃ satyavādinaṃ |
śāṃtaṃ niṣkalmaṣaṃ śuddhaṃ haripūjā parāyaṇaṃ || 52 ||

saṃvatsaratrayaṃ śiṣyaṃ parīkṣya parameśvari |
dayādimāṃ mahālakṣmīvidyāṃ sakalasiddhidaṃ || 53 ||

<p. 40b>

purā sarasvatī mūrtidhāriṇī vedamātṛkā |
āgatya brāhmaṇaṃ prāha prasannā śriyamiṣṭadāṃ || 54 ||

tubhyaṃ dāsyāmyahaṃ guptākuruṣva satataṃ dvija |
asūyakāyānṛjave jaḍāyānṛjavādine || 55 ||

na prapacchasi cetubhyamasmi vīryavatī tadā |
rakṣaṇī yātvāyā nitya madatvā pāpakāriṇe || 56 ||

yadi guptātvayā vidyā mahālakṣmīriyaṃ dvija |
tadā maheṃdrasadṛśaṃ padaṃ dāsyamite dvija || 57 ||

sarasvatyeti gaditaṃ purā vipnottamaṃ prati |
tasmādeṣā mahālakṣmīnaṃ prakāśyāpi kutracit || 58 ||

maheṃdrasadṛśī lakṣmīmicchan vipropi bhutale |
japedimāṃ mahālakṣmīmācāryānugrahācchive || 59 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdva śuśrūṣā nityamādarāt |
sarvasve nāpi kartavyā bhogamokṣa phalāptaye || 60 ||

ācāryasannidhāvevasthātavyaṃ niyatātmabhiḥ |
pūjyamācārya pādābja dvayameva dine dine || 61 ||

ācārya evasto tavyo rājavidvarat sabhāsu |
cajyajetsvapi naraṃ patnīmātaraṃ ca sutānapi || 62 ||

mahālakṣmī pradācarbhyaṃ dehāṃtepi na saṃtyajet |
sevyamācārya pāābja dvayameva dine dine || 63 ||

japyā prasannaśrīrevabhogasvargapavargadā |
brahmānaṃda rasāvāpti maṇimādi guṇāṃ śriyaṃ || 64 ||

avaśyamicchatā rājyalakṣmīrjapyā dine dine |
etadeva paraśreya ena detadeva paraṃstapaḥ || 65 ||

etadeva paraṃ tīrthametadeva paraṃ phalaṃ |
ayameva mahāyāga iyameva gatiḥ parā || 66 ||

iti matvānvahaṃ rājyalakṣmī vidyāṃ japocchaciḥ |
yojanānāṃ sahasraṃ vā gatvācāryaṃ dvijottamaṃ || 67 ||

saṃsevya śatavarṣaṃ vā prāṇairathaiśca suvrate |
prasannakamalāvidyāṃ tadanugrahato japet || 68 ||

kārtravīryaśca sagaromāṃdhātā ca purūravāḥ |
radyurdaśaratho rājā duṣṣaṃttobharatopi ca || 69 ||

svāyaṃbhuvādyā manavassārvabhaumā nṛpā api |
rājyalakṣmīmimāṃ japtvā saṃsevyācāryamādarāt || 70 ||

durlabhaṃ devasaṃdyaiśca saṃprāptā śreya uttamaṃ |
śvetadvīpādhi yatvaṃ vā suvarṇagirisaṃpadaṃ || 71 ||

ya icchatena rājya śrīreva japyā dine dine |
brahmaviṣṇumaheśādyā api trailokyanāyakāḥ || 72 ||

prasannalakṣmīmāhātmyaṃ na hi varṇapittuṃ kṣamāḥ |
nāstu śaktirmahaṣīṇāmasyā māhātmyavarṇane || 73 ||

maṃda prajñāvatāṃ bhūmau manujānāṃ tu kākathā |
prasannalakṣmīvidyeyaṃ nimivaṃśa samudbhavaiḥ || 74 ||

<p. 41a>

gautamānugrahājjaptāsave muktāstato bhavan |
prasannalakṣmistadvaṃśe janakasyā bhavat sutā || 75 ||

tadā prabhṛti sarvesya bhūyā vaṃśa samudbhavāḥ |
janakā iti vikhyātā muktā jīvaṃta evate || 76 ||

iyameva parā gaurī himā vala sutā śivā |
iyameva mahāvāṇī sāvitrī ca sarasvatī || 77 ||

vedājjapi ca vedāṃtā mama vaktra samudbhvā |
ataḥ paraṃ samudbhūta purāṇaṃ ca mahattaraṃ || 78 ||

dharmaśāstrāṇi sarvāṇi munibhiḥ kīrtitīnyapi |
etat samādhikā vidyāna dṛṣṭā kutracicchrutā || 79 ||

bhramaṃti munayopīha mahādāridrya duḥkhitāḥ |
rājyalakṣmī na labdhāste bhogasvargāyavargadāṃ || 80 ||

iyaṃ kāmadhudyānṛṇāṃ sarvakāma phalapradā |
iyaṃ kalpalatā sākṣānmataḥ saṃkalpasiddhidā || 81 ||

kiṃ tāratnamiyaṃ sākṣāyiṃtitārtha phalapradaṃ |
ye siddhā munayopīha divyabhoga samanvitaḥ || 82 ||

jānīhitān mahālakṣmīvidyā saktān dine dine |
vācaḥ padāni catvāri parākhyaṃ prathamaṃ padaṃ || 83 ||

paśyaṃtyākhyaṃ dvitīyaṃ kṣyātṛtīyaṃ madhyamābhidhaṃ |
jānāratīśvara evaitatsarvasvatyāḥ padatrayaṃ || 84 ||

maharṣayopi jānaṃti bhagavatkṛpayānvitāḥ |
vaidavarīnāmakaṃ paścāccaturthaṃ vāmadaṃ vibhuḥ || 85 ||

vācaḥ padāni catvāri brahmaviṣṇumaheśvarāḥ |
maharṣayopi jānaṃti tapasā dagdha kilviṣāḥ || 86 ||

caturtha vauvarīrūpaṃ mayā yatpadamīritaṃ |
prasīddhameta devānna bhūtale girikanyake || 87 ||

mānuṣeṣu prasiddhaṃ ca pakṣiṣvapi paśuṣvapi |
pipīlikā sunāgeṣu sarveṣu ca mṛteṣu ca || 88 ||

ācāryānugrahādrājyalakṣmīvidyā japāt sadā |
vidyājālamidaṃ sarvaṃ nirgacchalyasya vaktrataḥ || 89 ||

kimatra vahunoktena rājyalakṣmī mahāmanoḥ |
adhikaṃ sadṛśaṃ vāpi vastu vidhātmakaṃ nāhi || 90 ||

mahānubhāvā munayaḥ purātanā prasannalakṣmī sakalārthadātrīṃ |
upāsya dharmaṃ ca na bhogamokṣāna vā purutkṛṣṭapadaṃ cardova || 91 ||

[iti śrīyadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye saptadaśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 41a>

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi rājyalakṣmī mahāmanoḥ |
anuṣṭhānavidhiṃ samyag yatkatvā siddhimāpnuyāt || 1 ||

ṛṣirbrahmā samuddiṣṭo dakṣo vātha prajāpatiḥ |
gāyatraṃ chaṃda ityuktaṃ samasta jagadaṃvikā || 2 ||

<p. 41b>

jagattritaya sāmrājya mahāsiṃhāsaneśvarī |
mahālakṣmīrjaganmātādevatā kathitā śive || 3 ||

śrīruddhā bhuvaneśānī vījamaṃtra samīritaṃ |
hṛdevaśaktiruddiṣṭā viniyogaruvabhīṣṭadaḥ || 4 ||

kamale hṛdayaṃ proktaṃ śiraḥ syāt kamalālaye |
śikhā prasīdate naiva kavacaṃ tribhirakṣaraiḥ || 5 ||

netramastraṃ ca śeṣe vā śrīvījapuṭitaṃ pṛthak || 5 ||

māṇikya pravima prabho hi manimaistuṃgaiścaturbhirgajairhastagrāhima ratnakuṃbha 
salilairāsiṃdhyamānāṃ sadā hastābjairvaradānamaṃvujayugādhīni dadhānāṃ 
hareḥ kāṃtāṃ kāṃkṣita pārijātalatikāṃ vaṃde sarojananāṃ || 6 ||

sudhāṃbho nidhi madhyastha mudyā nava namadbhutaṃ |
putrāga pāṭalāśoka caṃpakairūpaśobhitaṃ || 7 ||

maṃdavāyu samudbhūta puṣpamadbhi virājitaṃ |
samerumādhavī vilva devadārulavaṃgakaiḥ || 8 ||

saṃtāna pārijātādyaiḥ puṣpitailakalpabhūṣaṇaiḥ |
mātuluṃgaiḥ karṇikāraiścaṃdanairvuṃjulairapi || 9 ||

aṃkoladāḍinī pūgairdrumaiḥ kuravakairapi |
sarvartu puṣṭyasahitairnamadbhiḥ suvirājita || 10 ||

tanmadhye paṃkajaiḥ prakumurotpalarāśibhiḥ |
sugaṃdhibhiśca kahlāraiḥ phullaiḥ kuvalayairapi || 11 ||

bhramarairhasaṃkāraṃḍa cakravākārdibhirvṛte |
tānmadhye puline rasme mahāsurasita śobhite || 12 ||

sarvataḥ pārijātādyaiḥ śobhituṃ ratnamaṃḍapaṃ |
caturdvārayuta divyahemaprākāra śobhitaṃ || 13 ||

udyadarka sahasrābhaṃ bhāsvaraṃ caṃdraśītalaṃ |
divyaratna samāyukta kapāṭāṣṭaka śobhitaṃ || 14 ||

divyamāṇikyasahitatuṃga gopurasaṃvṛtaṃ |
hemadaṃ uśilālavidvija paṃṅkti pariṣkṛtaṃ || 15 ||

navaratna samāyuktaṃ staṃbha paṃkti vicitritaṃ |
divyasāhasra saṃśobhidīptastaṃbha virājitaṃ || 16 ||

taptahāṭaka saṃśobhivātāyana samanvitaṃ |
vicitrāṃśuka saṃvarddhakāṃcanairapi koṭiśaḥ || 17 ||

suvarṇa kiṃkiṇīyuktaṃ ratnamaṃdupamujvalaṃ |
mālatīkaṃtakījātī ca yakotpalakesaraiḥ || 18 ||

tulasīmallikā savāsī naṃdyākarta kadaṃvakaiḥ |
divyairanyaiḥ puṣpageṇeralaṃkṛta mahītalaṃ || 19 ||

kāśmīramṛganābhibhyāṃ kastūryā ca tamālakaiḥ |
caṃdanaṇarukarpūrairāmoditadigaṃtaraṃ || 20 ||

itthaṃ saṃciṃtya manasā ratnamaṃḍapa mulvalaṃ |
tanmaṃḍapasya madhyastha pārijātaṃ suradrumaṃ || 21 ||

tadadho navamāṇikya siṃhāsana manuttamaṃ |
tatrāsīnaṃ jagannāthaṃ kāla nīlāṃvuda prabhaṃ || 22 ||

kāmakoṭi pratīkāśaṃ pītāṃvara yugāvṛtaṃ |
padmarāga mahāratna vajramāṇikyaviṃdubhiḥ || 23 ||

khacitaṃ tapta sauvarṇaṃ vibhrāṇaṃ kuṃḍala dvayaṃ |
kirīṭa hārakeyūra kaṭakādi vibhūṣitaṃ || 24 ||

<p. 42a>

kaustubhodbhāsitoraskaṃ tulasīvanamālayā |
śobhitaṃ pārijātādi puṣpamālya virājitaṃ || 25 ||

prasannavadanaṃ śāṃtaṃ rājīvāyata locana |
śaṃkhacakrā bhayavaradharaṃ yogini ṣevitaṃ || 26 ||

divyamāṇikya saṃvaddha hemakāṃcī virājitaṃ |
prācīnā nāmapi girāgocaramanūpamaṃ || 27 ||

vaṃditaṃ devatāvṛdaissaṃstutaṃ paramarṣibhiḥ |
nārāyaṇaṃ purānaṃda satyacidvanamacyutaṃ || 28 ||

tadvāyāṃke mahālakṣmī vālārka śatasannibhāṃ |
dāḍimī kusumaprakhyāṃ japāṃ puṣpa samaprabhāṃ || 29 ||

tadā jāṃvūnada nibhāṃ vidyut sāhasrasannibhāṃ |
dṛśaṃ jannūpuraṃ saṃśobhipādayaṃ kaṇamaṃḍitāṃ || 30 ||

lāktālakapadāṃbhojāṃgulīyaka virājitāṃ |
sthalā raviṃda pratima padābjayugaśobhitā || 31 ||

brahmarudra maheṃdrādimaunbhimāṇikya kāṃtibhiḥ |
virājita padāṃbhojāṃ bhaktārti haraṇo ghṛtāṃ || 34 ||

ratnakāṃcana saṃvarddhakāṃcī dāmavirājitī |
tanu mādhyāṃ pṛthu śroṇī nimnanābhi samanvitāṃ || 35 ||

svarṇakuṃbhatamaṃ prakhya pīnottuṃga samanvitāṃ |
viśālorusthalāṃ rājatkaustubheta virājitāṃ || 36 ||

kastūrī kuṃkumayuta divyaṃ padabhacarvitāṃ |
ratnamuktāphaloyetta svarṇaciṃtākaśobhitāṃ || 37 ||

mahāpadaka saṃyuktāṃ padakena vibhūṣitāṃ |
muktāvalī samāyuktāmekāvalikhirājitī || 38 ||

divyaratna samāyukta kāṃcajāṃguli mudrikāṃ |
svarṇakeyūrasahitāṃ valayāvaliśobhitāṃ || 39 ||

sauvarṇa kaṃkaṇa lasatkārāṃvuja virājitāṃ |
prathamābharaṇoyeta kaṃvugrīva virājitāṃ || 40 ||

muktā kāṃcana saṃnaddhakaṃcukena vibhūṣitāṃ |
smitavaktrāṃ viśālākṣyaṃ pakvaviṃvaphalādharāṃ || 41 ||

vajraviṃdu samaprakhyadaṃtapaṃkti vibhūṣitāṃ |
vāṇī vilāsanilaparakta jihvāgraśobhitāṃ || 42 ||

muktāralasamāvaddhanāsikā bharaṇānvitāṃ |
taptasauvarṇatāṭaṃkṛvālī yugalaśobhitā || 43 ||

rājat sauvarṇa kusumakaṇāṃ paṃkajalocanāṃ |
kāmako daṃḍasaudarvanirjitabhrūtatāyugāṃ || 44 ||

lalāṭapaṭṭasaṃ rājat saṃlagnatilakāṃkitāṃ |
jātī caṃpaka punnāga puṣpatālya vibhūṣitāṃ || 45 ||

nīlabhramarasaṃkāśa keśapāśa vibhūṣitāṃ |
navamāṇikyasaṃvaddha kirīṭāvṛtamastakāṃ || 46 ||

padmagarbhaprabhāṃ padmasvarṇaratna prapūritaṃ |
vibhratīvaṃ supātraṃ ca muktāratnamayīṃ srajaṃ || 47 ||

jagatsaṃmohanakarīṃ jagattraya vaśaṃkarī |
akalaṃkaśarat pūrṇacaṃdraṃ viṃva samānanāṃ || 48 ||

<p. 42b>

sarvavidyāmayīṃ sarvamaharṣigaṇavaṃditāṃ |
vāṇī gaurīṃdrapatnyādi sevitāṃ pārśvayordvayoḥ || 49 ||

arudhatya na sūyādi satībhiḥ pariveṣṭitāṃ |
suvarṇasrāviṇā mūrdhni śvetachatreṇa śobhitāṃ || 50 ||

atha cāmara hastābhyāṃ sakhībhyāṃ pariveṣṭitāṃ |
śakrādi maulimāṇikya virājita padāṃvujāṃ || 51 ||

sarvayogījanastutyāṃ brahmarṣigaṇasevitāṃ |
devatāvṛṃda saṃsevyāṃ mahāsiddhaughavaṃditāṃ || 52 ||

jagattritayasaṃpatti hetu bhūtāṃ sanātanīṃ |
trailokyākarṣaṇakarīṃ trailokya hlādakāriṇī || 53 ||

trailokyaraṃjanakarī jaganmohana vigrahāṃ |
aṇimādi guṇādhārāṃ sarvasāmrājyasiddhidāṃ || 54 ||

divyāvaṃkāra subhagaṃ divyasragvastraśobhitāṃ |
divyacaṃdanaliptāṃgī divyakanyā pariṣṭutāṃ || 55 ||

nārāyaṇāṃkanilayāṃ nārāyaṇa manoharāṃ |
trilocanī catuhasrī suprasannānanāṃvujāṃ || 56 ||

jagattritaya sāmrājya mahāsiṃhāsaneśvarīṃ |
mahālakṣmīmahaṃ nitya bhajāmya khilasiddhidāṃ || 57 ||

itthaṃ dhyāyen mahālakṣmīṃ trayīrūpāṃ hārī priyo |
yadvā mūlādhādi raṃdhrāṃtaṃ vālārkayuta sannibhāṃ || 58 ||

jvalaṃtī saṃvidadhyāye tejorūpāṃ sanātanīṃ |
nirguṇāṃ saguṇāṃ vāpi mahālakṣmī haripriyāṃ || 59 ||

dhyātvā hṛtya pranilayāṃ vidyāṃ śrīhṛsyābhidhā |
japtvā nityaṃ viśuddhātmā saṃpadāṃ māśreyā bhavet || 60 ||

ācāryapatnīmatha vā yadi śiṣyo jiteṃdriyaḥ |
mahālakṣmīṃ trayī rūpāṃ divyālaṃkāraśobhitāṃ || 61 ||

divyarcadana liptāṃgī divyasraṃ vastra śobhitāṃ |
dhyātvā nārāyaṇadhiyādhyāyedācāryamacyutaṃ || 62 ||

ācāryapatnī dhyānena mahālakṣmī dhiyānvahaṃ |
samastābhīṣṭa phaladā bhavatyusya haripriyā || 63 ||

anenaiva pramāṇena gurupatnīṃ trayīmayīṃ |
mahālakṣmīṃ vijānī himā kurudyātraṃ saṃśayaḥ || 64 ||

tasmādavasyamācārya valī saṃtatu mādarāt |
mahālakṣmīdhiyābhyarcyā bhūṣaṇācchādanāśanaiḥ || 65 ||

śubha vrateṣu sarveṣu purāya parasu sādhakaiḥ |
ācāryapatnīmabhyarcya bhūṣaṇācchādanāśanaiḥ || 66 ||

paśyatveva śriyaṃ sākṣāccakṣurbhyāmeva sādhakaḥ |
tāṭaṃkābharaṇa dvaṃdvavālī yugalamuttama || 67 ||

atha sauvarṇa cittākaṃ nāsikābharaṇaṃ śubhaṃ |
aṃgulīyaka mukhyāni divyānyā bharaṇāni ca || 68 ||

mṛduvastraṃ yugaṃ ślakṣṇaṃ pratimāsaṃ himādrije |
datvā prāpnoti mahatī siddhiṃ cāmara durlabhāṃ || 69 ||

<p. 43a>

yatra kutrāpi saṃpāya vatsarevatsarepi vā |
ācāryapatnyai śrīvudhyā pradatvā kalpasaṃnayaṃ || 70 ||

paśyatyeva svacakṣurbhyā mahālakṣmīṃ haripriyāṃ |
ācāryapatnyo vadvyaścet putriṇī tatrayā bhavet || 71 ||

saiva sākṣān mahālakṣmīrptā kuruṣvātra saṃśayaṃ |
anyā ācāryapatnyaśca vijñeyā sā tṛptannibhāḥ || 72 ||

yadi bhartravi ca hatā gurupatnī himādrije |
vahudūrasthitā vāpi māyāssannidhau śive || 73 ||

samarpyā bharaṇādīni tadātmaja karerpya yat |
ācāryaputrapatnyai vā pradadyāt sādhakottamaḥ || 74 ||

akalaṃke namasā vivāhādyutsaveṣvapi |
ācāryapatnīmabhyarcya purato bhūṣaṇādibhiḥ || 75 ||

ācāryamapi saṃpūjya tataḥ kuryān mahotsarva |
itthaṃ dhyātvā mahālakṣmīṃ vidyāṃ śrīhṛdayābhidhāṃ || 76 ||

japtvā paṃcaśataṃ nityaṃ catuḥ śatamathāpi vā |
tṛśataṃ vā japaṃ kṛtvā ghṛtaṃ hutvā dine dine || 77 ||

śubhānyeva labhennityaṃ sa tapibhyo vimucyate |
samasta duritaudyāstena spṛśaṃti kadācana || 78 ||

alakṣmīḥ kalahādhāṇa tadgehe navacakrecit |
tadgrahe paśuvṛddhiḥ syāt vanavṛddhirdine dine || 79 ||

pratyahaṃ dhānyavṛddhiḥ syācchreyo vṛddhiśca saṃtataṃ |
muktā ratnaudya saṃkīrṇā dhanadhānya samākulā || 80 ||

gajāśca saṃkulādāsīdāsasaṃgha samākulā |
acalā tadvahe lakṣmīstiṣṭhatyā caṃdratārakaṃ || 81 ||

tadanvaya mamudbhūtā api lakṣmī samanvitāḥ |
śreyo rāśi samākīrṇā āyurārogya saṃyutāḥ || 82 ||

saṃpadāmāśrayā devi bhavaṃtyā caṃdratārakaṃ |
sa yatra vasane devi kṣetreyā pālayepi vā || 83 ||

tatkollāpuramevoktaṃ lakṣmīkṣetramabhīṣṭadaṃ |
ihāmutrāpi lakṣmī vā trirguṇopi guṇānvitāḥ || 84 ||

avāpnot yakṣayān bhogān divyānapi mānuṣān |
tadvaṃśyāvāmupi śive bhavenmuktissanātanī || 85 ||

dhyānasūktamidaṃ akṣmyā uktaṃ sakalasiddhidaṃ |
sarvaduḥkhaharaṃ dhanyaṃ pūjanaṃ cātha vakṣyate || 86 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye aṣṭādaśodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 43a>

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi śriyorcanavidhi paraṃ |
yatkṛtvā maṃda bhāgyamibhāgya vā tihajāyate || 1 ||

brāhmemuhūrte utthāya sādhakaḥ śayane sthitaḥ |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoja dvitayaṃ sarvasiddhidaḥ || 2 ||

kartāṃjai puṭo brahmaraṃdhre dvādaśadhānamet |
ācāryapādukā vidyāṃ daśadvādaśadhāpi vā || 3 ||

smṛtvā svamurupāpājva dvitayaṃ svarṇanirmitaṃ |
rātritaṃ śatitaṃ vā svacakṣurbhyāṃ dṛṣṭvā natvā ca sādaraṃ || 4 ||

<p. 43b>

tulasīṃ vā na dīvāpi paśyan viṣṇu parāyaṇaḥ |
ācāryavadanāṃ dṛṣṭvā pūrvamācārya pādayoḥ || 5 ||

namedācārya sānnidhye śaucaṃ kuryācca natparaṃ | 
snātvā saṃdhyāmupāsyātha prajaptvā vedamātaraṃ || 6 ||

savitāramupasthāya śrīmadaṣṭārṇamādarāt |
yathā śaktyā prajaptvātha vidyāṃ śrīharayābhidhāṃ || 7 ||

japtvā paṃcaśataṃ nityaṃ catuḥśatamathāpi vā |
prasannalakṣmīstotreṇa stutvā śrīhṛdayena vā || 8 ||

prasannalakṣmī hṛdayaṃ koratrāṣṭakamudīritaṃ || 8 ||

agastyena purāyauriramye kollāpure śubhe |
ārtharvaṇa mahadguhyaṃ lakṣmī hṛdayamiṣṭadaṃ || 9 ||

bhārgaveṇa purā dṛṣṭaṃ maṃtrarūpaṃ carānane |
nityahomaṃ samāpyātha jvalitaṃ vedasi || 10 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā lakṣmīhṛdaya vidyayā |
yāgāmāraṃ praviśyātha smṛtvācārya padadvayaṃ || 11 ||

ācāryapādukā pūjāṃ kṛtvā sarvopacārakaiḥ |
kṣīraṃ vā śarkarāmājyaṃ datvā naivedyamādarāt || 12 ||

yathāśakti dhanaṃ nityaṃ niṣkaṃniṣkādhanave vā |
tadardhe vā tadardha vā cihnuka vā tadardhakaṃ || 13 ||

tadardhaṃ vārpya yeddhrīmānācārya caraṇadvaye |
rajitaṃ vā yathā śaktyā tāmraṃ tāṃvūlameva vā || 14 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdva sannidhau samarpya ca |
udvāsyātha mahālakṣmī cakre saṃpūjayet sudhīḥ || 15 ||

yā pūrvamuktā sāmrājñī śrīvigrālokanāyikā |
yaduttaṃ tanmalla kramayodhyā nagarābhidhaṃ || 16 ||

brahmānaṃda sukhā vāptikaraṃ sakalasiddhidaṃ |
samastaduritadhvasiptavapurāya phalapradaṃ || 17 ||

jagadākarṣaṇakaraṃ jagatraya vaśaṃkara |
aṇimādi guṇā vāptikaraṃ trailokyamohanaṃ || 18 ||

sarvasaṃpadadhiṣṭhānaṃ sarvavidyāvaśaṃkaraṃ |
putraprapautra tatpautrādyabhi vṛddhikaraṃ sadā || 19 ||

pādukāṃjana dehādi mahāsiddhikaraṃ paraṃ |
samastopa dravaharaṃ samastabhayanāśanaṃ || 20 ||

samastavighnaśamanaṃ sarvakalyāṇasiddhidaṃ |
sarvāśubhaharaṃ puṃsāṃ samastādya vibhedanaṃ || 21 ||

sarvasaubhāgya japadaṃ sarvaśatru vimardanaṃ |
apamṛtyu praśamanaṃ kāṃti medhā vivardhanaṃ || 22 ||

mahārahasyaṃ lokeṣu dīrghā puṣpaphalapradaṃ |
ārogyajananaṃ puṃsāṃ rogaśokanivāraṇaṃ || 23 ||

samastaiśvarṣaphaladaṃ sa sarvakāma phalapradaṃ |
śrīcakraṃ tanmahadguptamarcayitvā dine dine || 24 ||

samastadevatārcāyāssāṃgaṃ phalamāpnuyāt |
sarvavidyāmayaṃ yasmācchrīcakraṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ || 25 ||

śrīcakrasannidhau sarvavidyāptidviḥ prajāyate |
pradhya prapūjanaṃ vāpi kṛtvā saṃtatamādarāt || 26 ||

triśātaṃ lalitāṃ japtvā śrīdevīṃ sarvasiddhidāṃ |
lakṣmīhṛdayavidyāṃ ca japtvā paṃcaśataṃ śuciḥ || 27 ||

<p. 44a>

jarāmaraṇa nirmukto dīrghamāmuṣyamuttamaṃ |
aṇimādi guṇaiśvaryaṃ dhanasaṃpattimakṣayāṃ || 28 ||

saubhāgyaṃ kāmasadṛśaṃ putrapautrādi saṃpade |
divyānapi mahābhogāni hāpyā sādyasādhakaḥ || 29 ||

lakṣmīpati prasādena kulasāhasra saṃyutaḥ |
ayodhyānagare tiṣṭhatyaṃte nātra vicāraṇā || 30 ||

śrīpīṭhapūjayā brahmanārāyaṇa maheśvarāḥ |
śakrādyā aṣṭadikpālāstvaṃ ca lakṣmīssarasvatī || 31 ||

mātaraścaḍikādyāśca bhāskarādyā navagrahāḥ |
pūjitā api saṃtuṣṭā bhavatyaṃsya phalapradā || 32 ||

ayodhyāpuranāmeda śrīdevīcakramuttamaṃ |
yena saṃpūjyate nityaṃ trailokyaṃ yena pūjitaṃ || 33 ||

śrīdevījagatāṃdhātrī trayīrūpātra suṃdarī |
pūjyate satataṃ yena sa sarvajño jagatpatiḥ || 34 ||

lakṣmīprasannalakṣmīṃ vā triśaktyākhyā matherāṃ |
sāmrājyalakṣmīmathavā pūjayikta dine dine || 35 ||

siddhiṃ prāpnoti mahatīṃ yogināmapi durlabhāṃ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇā vacasāṃgāvaṇa saṃyutau || 36 ||

pūjanīyau viśeṣeṇa kalyāṇārthimirādarāt |
bhavānīśaṃkaro yadvā sāṃgāvaraṇa saṃyutau || 37 ||

pūjitau sarvaphaladau bhavetāṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ |
amahālakṣmīṃ samabhyarcya pratyekamathavā śive || 38 ||

śrīpīṭhetra mahāgyaṃ prāpnotya mamurtamaṃ |
atrāśakto mahālakṣmīṃ pīṭhenyatrātha vārcayet || 39 ||

tatpīṭhamapi vakṣyāmi śṛṇuṣvaikāgramānasā |
trikoṇamatha ṣaṭkoṇaṃ dvādaśāramataḥ paraṃ || 40 ||

vṛttaṃ ṣoḍaśadalaṃ bhūpura dvitayānvitaṃ |
praṇavaṃ vilikhenmadhye sādhyakarma vidarbhiti || 41 ||

koṇatrayetha śrīvījaṃ śaktiṃ ca bhuvaneśvarī |
ṣaḍaṃgānyagni koṇādikoṇā ṣaṭke kramāllikhet || 42 ||

dvādaśārṇa mahālakṣmyā dvādaśoralikhedatha |
ṣoḍaśasvara saṃyuktaṃ kuryāt ṣoḍaśa patrakaṃ || 43 ||

tvaritāyā maṃtra veṇerbhūpuraṃ vedyayet |
dvidhā dvitīyamapi bhūgehaṃta tathaiva pariveṣṭhayet || 44 ||

bhūpura dvayakoṇeṣu hakṣau lesvekhyau prayatnataḥ |
uktame tanmahālakṣmyā yaṃtra duritabhedanaṃ || 45 ||

samastaiścarya phaladaṃ sarvadāridryabhedanaṃ |
sarvaduḥkhapraśamanaṃ samastaśubhasiddhidaṃ || 46 ||

vahunātrami muktena paramasmānna vidyate |
atra mūrti samanvitaṃ agrataḥ puṣpadhanvānaṃ rati devyā samanvitaṃ || 47 ||

puṭhyāṃjalikaraṃ kāmaṃ yajet parvata kanyake |
utthāni pūrvamukteṣu sthāneṣudhidhiva yajet || 50 ||

dharā ca śrīsarasvatyau durgācātirapyatha |
gāyatrī devyuṣāvetirapi mahālakṣmīstriśaktyākhyaṃ jagatpate || 1 ||

<p. 44b>

sāmrājyalakṣmīrapi ca śrīreva kathitā tvayā |
sarvadyā mayaṃ prokta mayo dhyānagaṇabhidhaṃ || 2 ||

śrīcakraṃ jagatāṃ nātha tatsvarūpaṃ mahītale |
vadame kṛpayānātha yadinesti kṛpāmayi || 3 ||

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

śriyo devyāḥ pravakṣyāmi pīṭhāni girikanyake |
mahītalesyānāmāni śṛṇuṣvā vahitā bhava || 4 ||

kollāpure mahālakṣmī vodhyā parvatakanyake |
tathā sannati pīṭhasthā mahālakṣmīrharipriyā || 5 ||

śrīśaileśrāmarākhyātā vijayaśrī pradāyinī |
pāṃduraṃge triśaktyākhyā lakṣmī viṭṭhala vallabhā || 6 ||

saptādrodhakavīrākhyā reṇukā rūpiṇī ramā |
yoginyalaṃ purakhyātā yogasiddhipradāyinī || 7 ||

kāṃcikānagarī proktā kāmākṣī śaṃkarapriyā |
mīnākṣīti samākhyātā dakṣiṇe mathurāpure || 8 ||

cidaṃvarepi vikhyātā śivakāmādya suṃdarī |
śeṣā cale mahālakṣmīrvikhyātā girikanyake || 9 ||

ujjayamāṃ mahākālī mahākālasya vallabhā |
laṃkāpurercitā nityaṃ śāṃkarī śaṃkarapriyā || 10 ||

kāmarūpe mahāpīṭhe kāmākṣī kāmarūpiṇī |
maheṃdra parvate durgā mahiṣāsuramardinī || 11 ||

padmākṣīti samākhyātā munibhissiddha parvate |
gaṃgāsāgaraṃ sargopa vikhyātā kamalālaya || 12 ||

tatraiva pārvatīkhyātā śaṃkarārdha śarīriṇī |
nīlācale samākhyātā subhadrā bhuktidā || 13 ||

māyādenīti vikhyānāgayāyāṃ śrīrharipriyā |
vārāṇasyāṃ viśālākṣīttattu mṛṣṭānna siddhidā || 14 ||

tatraivāste mahālakṣmīrnitya sāmrājya siddhidā |
prayābhagemādhavī tāmrākhyātā nārāyaṇapriyā || 15 ||

citrakūṭā calekhyātā jānakī rāmavallabhā |
rukmiṇī dvārakāyāṃ ca rāmamā mā haripriyā || 16 ||

mathurānagare kṛṣṇamātā devakakanyakā |
yaśodāgokule proktā rādhāvṛṃdāvane vane || 17 ||

subhadrāhāstinpure viṃdhye śubhaṃ nivarhiṇī |
durgādevīti vikhyāviṃdhyādriśikheraśubhesī || 18 ||

tārāmāśrame proktā vaidehī rāghavapriyā |
gaṃgādvāre mahokṣetre sītā janakakanyakā || 19 ||

himavat parvatarathātā śrīdevī lalitāṃvikā |
vikhyātā śrīpure sākṣān mahātripurasuṃdarī || 20 ||

merau sarasvatīkhyātā tārākiṣkiṃdhaparvate |
mataṃgaparvatekhyātā śrīdevīmaṃtriṇī smṛtā || 21 ||

varāha parvatekhyātā bhūdevī kamalālayā |
kurukṣetrepi vikhyātā pārvatī śaṃkarapriyā || 22 ||

<p. 46a>

ayodhyānagare khyātā jānakīti haripriyā |
śrīraṃgaparvate khyātā śrīdevī kamalālayā || 23 ||

khyātā siddhavaṭe sākṣāt sītādāśarārthe priyā |
tryaṃvaka girau khyātā rudrāṇī śaṃkarapriyā || 24 ||

tulajānagare khyātā bhavānī rūpiṇī ramā |
cakrarājātmakānyāsāṃ pīṭhāni giri kanyake || 25 ||

etasmaraṇato vāpi pāparāśiḥ praṇaśyati |
etāni siddhakṣetrāṇi saṃtyanyānyapi bhūtale || 26 ||

smṛtvā nāmānyamūnīha bhavati kṣīṇakalmaṣaḥ |
prasannalakṣmī pīṭhāni sarvāṇyetāni suṃdari || 27 ||

śrīcakrarūpāṇyuktāni sarvasiddhi karāṇyalaṃ |
śucirjiteṃdriyo nityaṃ guru śuśrūṣaṇerataḥ || 28 ||

rājyalakṣmī mahāvidhī prajaptvāni yata vrataḥ |
divasatriteyanaiva mahatī siddhimāpnuyāt || 29 ||

satyatyānyaṣi pīṭhāni siddhidāni mahītale |
tātitubhyaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇudyā vahitā śive || 30 ||

kuṃbhakoṇaṃ mahadgāma setuvaṃdhastataḥ |
paraṃ anaṃtaśayana puṇyaṃ caṃdra prakāriṇī taṭaṃ || 31 ||

vīrarādyavadhāmātha kṣetraṃ paramapāvanaṃ |
āhovalaṃ mahākṣetramalāpuramataḥ paraṃ || 32 ||

gomanaṃ nāmakaṃ dhāmamūkāṃ vā kṣetramapyatha |
kanyākubja mahadgāma vedāraṇyamataḥ paraṃ || 33 ||

kālahāstīśvarakṣetraṃ maṃgalā calanāmakaṃ |
varāha śikharaṃ puṇyavedāri śikharaṃ tataḥ || 34 ||

kṣetraṃ dharmapuraṃ nāmnākāśeśvaramataḥ paraṃ |
ratnādri śikhaṃ puṇyaṃ lakṣmīśa kṣetramapyatha || 35 ||

nāmnātha jānakī kṣetraṃ vāśiṣṭhā siṃdhusaṃgamaḥ |
dākṣāṇyābhidha kṣetraṃ brahmeśvarama mataḥ paraṃ || 36 ||

nārāyaṇābhiva kṣetraṃ siṃhāghri śikhara tathā |
śrīkūrmapadamadyuktaṃ mārkaṃḍeya padābhidhaṃ || 37 ||

ānaṃdeśābhi ca kṣetramokārakṣetramapyatha |
paṃcaprayogakṣetrāṇi kedārakṣetramapyatha || 38 ||

govarddhanādi śikhāṃ prabhāsakṣetramuttamaṃ |
jaṃjṛmārgaṃ mahākṣetraṃ gaṃgāsāgarasaṃgamaḥ || 39 ||

kāpilākhyaṃ padaṃ puṇyaṃ bharatā amanāmakaṃ |
naṃdigrāmābhidhakṣetra mahadatyaṃta pāvanaṃ || 40 ||

vadarī kānanaṃ puṇyaṃ sarvebhyopi mahattaraṃ |
yatrāste bhagavān sākṣādyogarūḍhaḥ śriyaḥ patiḥ || 41 ||

trayāṇāmapi lokānāṃ hitāya jagatīpatiḥ |
pālayanna khilaṃ lokaṃ śiṣṭānāṃ hitamācaran || 42 ||

sargasthityu saṃhārakartāsau ca sati prabhuḥ |
bhāgyodayena tatkṣetraṃ labhyāte sukṛtātmabhiḥ || 43 ||

<p. 46b>

brahmahatyādipya paudyairati tatkṣetra darśanāt |
sadya eva vimuktaḥ syān mahāpātakavānapi || 44 ||

tatra sākṣān mahāyogī harirnārāyaṇebhyutaḥ |
vaikuṃṭhalokādāgahā siddhikarāṣvapi || 45 ||

tīrthāni saṃpravakṣyāmi siddhidāni mahītale || 47 ||

jāhnavī saritāṃ śreṣṭā yamunā ca sarasvatī |
godāvarī kṛṣṇuveṇī kāverī saritāṃvarā || 48 ||

narmā ca mahāpuṇyā caṃdrabhāgā śatadrukāya |
yoṣṇī ca tathā siṃdhunadī paramapāvatī || 49 ||

tuṃgabhadrā bhīmarathīyaṃ yākhyaṃ ca sarovaraṃ |
bhadrādri śikharasvāmi sānnidhyaṃ gautamī taṭaṃ || 50 ||

saptagodāvarī tīraṃ jānakīkuṃḍa bheṣyatha |
rāmahūdaṃ mahāpuṇyaṃ rāmatīrtha manuttamaṃ || 51 ||

puṣkarākhyaṃ mahatīrthaṃ suvarṇamukharītaṭaṃ |
lakṣmīsarovaraṃ puṇyaṃ phalgunī tīrthamapyatha || 52 ||

uttamaṃ sarayūtīraṃ tāpī tīramataḥ paraṃ |
maṃdākinā tadaṃ puṇyatīrthaṃ vāśiṣṭa saṃjñitaṃ || 53 ||

gokarṇa naimiṣāṇayaṃ gaurī tīrtha mataḥ paraṃ |
śivagaṃgā mahāpuṇyā dhanuṣkoṭirataḥ paraṃ || 54 ||

gautamī siṃdhusaṃgārakaṃ veṇī siṃdhusamāgamaḥ |
tulasīkānanaṃ puṇyaṃ vilvadrumavījaṃ paraṃ || 55 ||

gaumatītaṭamapyuktaṃ gaṃḍakī tīrthamuktamaṃ |
kamalālayatīrtha ca sāvitrī tīrthamuttamaṃ || 56 ||

etānnidhyaṃ ca tataḥ paraṃ uktamācārya sānnidhya |
tīrthābhīmuttamaṃ śive sā lagnāma silācakrasānnidhye śrīdyayaṃ viduḥ || 59 ||

tulasīvana madhyaṃ ca tīrtha mahadudīritaṃ |
vilvavṛkṣavanaṃ puṇyaṃ mahāsiddhikaraṃ smṛtaṃ || 60 ||

prasannalakṣmīrūpāṇi sarvāṇyetāni suṃdari |
darśanādapyathai teṣā bhavet siddhiśca śāśvatī || 61 ||

uktāni lakṣmīpīṭhāni cakrarājātmakāni ca |
ekāhamapi jadhvā vā vidyāṃ śrīhṛdayābhidhāṃ || 62 ||

avaśyaṃ siddhimāpnoti mahatīṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye viṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 46b>

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

puraścaraṇa karmāhaṃ pravakṣyāmi tataḥ śive |
yada kṛtvā naro vidyā siddhiṃ na labhate kvacit || 1 ||

lakṣamekaṃ kṛte proktaṃ tretāyāṃ tu dvilakṣakaṃ |
trilakṣadvaṃ pare proktaṃ cāturlakṣaṃ kalauyuge || 2 ||

kāye namana sāvādyā duritā saktavuddhayaḥ |
kalauyuge sadāmartyāḥ parastrī dhanalolupāḥ || 3 ||

<p. 47a>

tasmādalya jape maiṣāṃ maṃtrasiddhinarjāyate |
puroditeṣu pītīpyeṣvaṃpi mama priye || 4 ||

puraścaraṇa kṛbhūmau siddhiṃ viṃdatyanuttamāṃ |
tulasīvana madhye vā vinvadrumavanepi vā || 5 ||

aśvasya taru mūle vā bhagavanmaṃdirepi vā |
bhavānī maṃdire vāpi kamalalāyatanepi vā || 6 ||

śaṃkarasyālaye vā yapi maṃdire vā gaṇeśituḥ |
ācāryaṃ sannidhīkṛtya puraścaraṇamāsmat || 7 ||

api kīkaṭadeśeṣu sānnidhya śrīguroryadi |
vadarīkānanaṃ proktaṃ tadevāśu phalapradaṃ || 8 ||

ācāryasannidhikṛtya nityakarmarataḥ śuciḥ |
śātodāṃtojita krodho maunī saṃdhyā su saṃyataḥ || 9 ||

phaleṣu nispṛho bhūtvā pāṣaṃḍālāpavarjitaḥ |
nāstikairvedavāhyairvani saṃbhāṣāpara kvacit || 10 ||

mātṛvuddhi parastrīṣu paradravyedyanolupaḥ |
rajasvalāṃtyajādīnāma saṃbhāṣaṇa tatparaḥ || 11 ||

cāṃdrāyaṇa vratī vāhyān prājāptya paropi vā |
tapta kṛcchra paro cāpi paṃcagavyāśanopi vā || 12 ||

kṣīrāgī vā phalāśī vā śākāhāri paripi vā |
kaṃdamūla phalāśī vā havira annathāpi vā || 13 ||

ekabhaktāśano vāpi svācārya vijñayā śive |
mahālakṣmyā jape dvidyāṃ śuddho nirmalamānasaḥ || 14 ||

yāmatritaya partyataṃ japennityaṃ prasannadhīḥ |
asadgoṣṭhīma saṃvaddhālāyaṃ paiśūnyameva ca || 15 ||

akṣakrīḍā matha dyūta durjanairapi saṃgamaṃ |
avadaśāstraniṣṭhāṃ ca varjayenmatimānnaraḥ || 16 ||

niṃdāṃ bhagavato vedaniṃdāmācārya niṃdane |
śṛṇu yānna kvacidyāga niṃdāṃ ca duritapradāṃ || 17 ||

taṃtu mātrepya hiṃsāyā māsakta hṛyassadā |
samadaśī ca sarvatra mitrāritanayeṣu || 18 ||

samyairapi namāṣeta japahomādi karmasu |
cakrarājārcanaṃ nityaṃ kurvāṇo niyatavrataḥ || 19 ||

cakṣurlakṣaṃ mahāvidyāṃ prajaptvāsūdhakottamaḥ |
daśāṃśaṃ tarpayeddhīmānyayasekṣurasenadhā || 20 ||

guḍodakena vā devi tarpayedudakena vā |
taddaśāṃśaṃ hunedagnau kamalairghṛtamiśritaiḥ || 21 ||

madhutritayasaṃyuktairapya vilvaphalaisu vā |
suvāsinyaḥ śataṃ bhījyāstāvaṃto brāhmaṇājapi || 22 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoje svarṇabhāra sahasrakaṃ |
niṣkasāhasramatha vā śataniṣkamathapi vā || 23 ||

datvā siddhiṃ samahatīṃ trailokyenāpi durlabhāṃ |
rājyalakṣmyā avāpnoti dehāṃtepi paṇātiṃ || 24 ||

<p. 47b>

mahatīyaṃ puraścaryā mahāsiddhikarī śubhā |
asādhyamapi devānāmapi dvīpāṃtaraṇyitaṃ || 25 ||

puraścaraṇa kṛtyena sādhyamenena suvraṃte |
atrāśaktaḥ puraścaryāṃ kuryāllaghvīṃ yata vrataṃ || 26 ||

tadvidhānaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇudhvā vahitā śive |
śaradādyāśvine māsi vrataṃ paramapāvanaṃ || 27 ||

navarātrābhidha nāmnā samastaduritāyahaṃ |
sarvakalmaṣarogaghna sarvaduḥkhavibhedanaṃ || 28 ||

mahadāridryadalanaṃ pāvanaṃ bhuktidaṃ |
rājyalakṣmī mahāvidyā sidhyarthāninata vrataḥ || 29 ||

navarātravrataṃ kuryāttadavaśyaṃ mama priye |
duḥkha pranāśanaṃ dhanye tuṣṭipuṣṭikaraṃ paraṃ || 30 ||

sarvakalyāṇajananaṃ navarātravrataṃ śive |
tadvidhā namatho vakṣye śṛṇudhvā vahitā śive || 31 ||

pratipadi na mārabhya dinamekaikamīśvari |
raviparvasamaṃ prakurāgamārtha viśāradāḥ || 32 ||

tatra mūlarkṣya mārabhya viṣṇutārāṃtamanvahaṃ |
addhaudaya samaṃ prāhurvedavedātavedinaḥ || 33 ||

tatrāpi navamī tulyā raviparvaśataprabhī |
mahatīti samākhyātā mahāsiddhi phalapradā || 34 ||

vijayādārīmī yatra japalakṣmī pradāyinī |
sarvasiddhikarī proktā bhoga svargāpavargadā || 35 ||

pratipaddivase tatra prātarutthāya vāgyataḥ |
kṛtvādau maṃgata snānamāryājñā purassaraṃ || 36 ||

gaṇādhipaṃ vāpi saṃkalpya prajapecchuciḥ || 38 ||

prasanna śrīmahāvidyāṃ saṃkalpyārka sahasrakaṃ |
sahasraṃ prajapennityaṃ yadvāyaṃ ca śatādikaṃ || 39 ||

cakrarājaṃ samabhyarcya sāṃgāvaraṇasaṃyutaṃ |
sālegrāmaśilācakramathavā girikanyake || 40 ||

laghuśrīcakrasahitaṃ vidhinā saṃprapūjayet |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā nityaṃ śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā || 41 ||

hutvā prasannannakṣmyāthagavyabhājyaṃ sunirmalaṃ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā nataḥ paṃcadaśārṇayā || 42 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā catuḥśrīṣanubhirghṛtaṃ |
ekaikaśastahutvāstotramārtharvaṇaṃ śubhaṃ || 43 ||

paṃcāvṛtyapikaṃ catvāriṃśadāvṛtti mapyatha |
navarātre yedekottara vṛddhikramoṇa || 44 ||

triśataṃ dviśataṃ vāpi śataṃ vā brahmavidyayā |
śrīśrīśāvarcayeddhīmānbhojayecca suvāsinīḥ || 45 ||

paṃcatrayastathaikya vā pratyahaṃ niyatavrataḥ |
śrīśrīpatidhiyā yadvā bhojayenmithunaṃ śive || 46 ||

nityamācārya pādābje dayā dravyaṃ yathā ruci |
yadvācārya priyāṃ sākṣān mahālakṣmīdhiyā śive || 47 ||

<p. 48a>

nityamabhyarcayenmālyabhūṣaṇācchādanāśanaiḥ |
aśakto maṃdabhāgyopiyācidhvā śūdrakānapi || 48 ||

mahānavamyāmācāryapatnīṃ dvastraiśca bhūṣaṇaiḥ |
ardhayitvā viśeṣeṇa tata ācāryamarcayet || 49 ||

vāṇīmabhyarcayennityaṃ pustakeṣu yata vrataḥ |
mahānavamyāṃ prāptāyī prātarudvāda bhāgyataḥ || 50 ||

snātvā kṛtvā hrikaḥ pūścājjvalite jātavedasi |
aṣṭāviṃśati hutvā gāyatryā jātavedasi || 51 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣareṇātha ghṛtaṃ vaṃcaśataṃ tataḥ |
hutvā prasannalakṣmyātha sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 52 ||

mudhu tritayasasmiśraṃ tilavilvadalānvitaṃ |
gavyājya saṃplutaṃ hutvā bhagavadraśmibhirghṛte || 53 ||

sakṛdbhutvātha lalitāraśmividyābhirādarāt |
hutvā paṃcadaśākṣathīghṛtaṃ triśatamamādarāt || 54 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ vāpi hutvā gavyājya mapyatha |
lakṣmyā prasannalakṣmyārtha triśaktyā ca tataḥ paraṃ || 55 ||

sāmrājya lakṣmyā juhuyādaṣṭā viṃśatidhādarāt |
japādi homaṃ kṛtvātha prāyaścittāhutīstataḥ || 56 ||

brahmārpaṇāhuti kṛtvā praṇamyāgni mataḥ paraṃ |
atha paṃcaśataṃ lakṣmī lakṣmīśau kusumairyajet || 57 ||

cakrarājārcanaṃ sāṃgaṃ kṛtvā tatsannidhau śive |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ praṇipatya samāhisaḥ || 58 ||

ṣaṣṭi cihnuka sauvarṇaṃ yamarāga vinirmita |
vajraviṃdu samāyuktaṃ kuṃḍala dvaya marpayet || 59 ||

svarṇabhāraṃ tato dadyādakṣiṇārthaṃ guroḥ śive |
svarṇa niṣka sahasraṃ vā śataniṣkamathāpi vā || 60 ||

tadardhaṃ vā tadardhaṃ vā niṣkadvādaśahaṃtu vā |
sūkṣmaṃ vastrayugāṃ dadyāhṛhṇīyādāṣi śiṣaḥ śibhāḥ || 61 ||

ācāryapatnyai śrīvudhyātāṭaṃkābharaṇaṃ śubhaṃ |
kanakat na kacitākaṃ nāsābharaṇamapyatha || 62 ||

iyādavaśyamabhyāni bhūṣaṇānyapi sādhakaḥ |
tāṭaṃkābharaṇaṃ vāpi ciṃtākaṃ haimajaṃ tu vā || 63 ||

ekamābharaṇaṃ dadyādasaktaḥ sādhakaḥ śive |
sūkṣmaṃ vā sastato dadyān mahālakṣmīdhiyā tataḥ || 64 ||

suvāsinyaḥ śataṃ bhojyāstadardhaṃ vā tadardhakaṃ |
yadvā paṃcadaśābhyarcāssuvāsinyona vāpi vā || 65 ||

śrīśrīpatidhiyā padmamithunāni samarcayet |
dakṣiṇābhiścatāṃ kūlairbrāhmaṇānapi nāpayet || 66 ||

itthaṃ kṛtena saṃdeho vrataṃ saṃpūrṇatābhidyāt |
daridropi vrataṃ kṛtvā svācārya varaṇadvaye || 67 ||

ādau dhenudvayaṃ datvā vahukṣīraṃ savatsakaṃ |
dakṣiṇāmarpyaṣṭajīta vāgyataḥ || 68 ||

<p. 48b>

itthaṃ kṛtvā puraścaryāṃ navarātravrate śubhe || 70 ||

rājyalakṣmī mahāvidyāsiddhi māpnomanuttamāṃ |
agniṣṭhoma sahasrasya vājapayeyakṣatasya ca || 71 ||

tulā hiraṇyagarbhādi mahānadana śatodbhavaṃ |
phalaṃ prāpya viśuddhātmā nārāyaṇasanvitāṃ || 72 ||

paśyatya sau mahālakṣmīṃ tasmin sevatsare dhruvaṃ |
janmakoṭi amudbhūtairmahāpāpaiścadāruṇaiḥ || 73 ||

vimukto mahadāṇeyaṃ dīrghamā puṣpamajñayaṃ |
avāpya ca na dhānyaudya muktāratnasamākulāṃ || 74 ||

gajāśca paśu saṃkīrṇāṃ mahālakṣmīmaṃ caṃcalāṃ |
saṃtati vyāpinīṃ labdhvā sarvasaubhāgyasaṃyutaḥ || 75 ||

kāyavat suṃdaṇe bhūtvā vidyārbhijīvasannibhaḥ |
bhūtvā samṛddhiṃ mahatīṃ putrapautrādi saṃkulāṃ || 76 ||

saṃprāpyāṣṭa guṇaiśvaryaṃ svacchaṃda maraṇo bhuvi |
bhuktvātha mānuyā divyān bhogānapi sudurlabhān || 77 ||

kulānāṃ śatamuddhṛtya nimagnaṃ narakeṣu ca |
divyakanyā śatayutaṃ vimānaṃ kāmagaṃ śubhaṃ || 78 ||

āruhya bhagavaddhā mayātyaṃte nātra saṃśayaḥ |
navarātravratamida sarvasiddhikaraṃ śubhaṃ || 79 ||

uktaṃ samāsataḥ siddhikaraṃ cānyat pravakṣyate |
saptamyāṃ ravisaṃkrāṃtirbhānuvāsara saṃyutā || 80 ||

jayakṛḍāmaṇirnāmnā yogolabhya udāhṛtaḥ |
arkasaṃkramaṇaṃ tatra brāhmekāse bhavedyadi || 81 ||

rājarājaṃ mahāyoge vadeti paramarṣayaḥ |
nakṣatraṃ bhagadaivatyaṃ bhavatyatra yadi priye || 82 ||

tatar vaktu phalaṃ śaktānāhaṃ brahmāpi vā hariḥ |
athacottara saṃkrāṃtissaptamyārmiduvāsare || 83 ||

sāvitratāra sahitā madhyāhne yadi labhyate |
vijayākhyaṃ mahāyogevaraṃtīmaṃ maharṣayaḥ || 84 ||

brāhmekāle mārgaśīrṣe saptamyāṃ bhānuvāsare |
dhanussaṃkramaṇaṃ bhānoryayaṃ tadasamanvitaṃ || 85 ||

rājarāja maheṃdrākhyaṃ yogamāhurimaṃ vudhāḥ |
puṣpamāsetha saptamyāmiṃduvāsra saṃyutā |
madhyāhne hṛṣasaṃkrāṃtiryadi sāvitra saṃyutā || 86 ||

trailokyaṃ ciṃtāmaṇi yogamāhurimaṃ mahāsiddhikaraṃ praśastaṃ |
samasta saṃpatsamavāpti hetuṃ samastapāpaudya vināśahetuṃ || 87 ||

dhanyaṃ yaśasyaṃ kalikalmaṣaghnaṃ duḥkhapravirdhvasakaraṃ |
pavitraṃ ciṃtāmaṇiṃ yogamudāharaṃti dharmārthakāmā divyamarthahetuṃ || 88 ||

cāparāśiṃ saṃkramate yadā bhānussahagunukta |
yoga samāyuktaṃ tanmāsaṃ ca sakalaṃ śive || 89 ||

jayalakṣmīkaraṃ yogaṃ prāhu divyāmaharṣayaḥ |
hṛṣasaṃkrāṃti paryaṃtaṃ prathametra pravakṣyate || 90 ||

<p. 49a>

brāhmekāle yadā bhānuḥ saṃkramedranuṣaḥ śive |
tatrotthāya viśuddhātmā śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣarī || 91 ||

smṛtvā nityaṃ tataḥ snātvā chatvā saṃdhyādikā kriyāḥ |
śālagrāma śilācakrecakrarāja samanvite || 92 ||

śrīśrīśāvarcayeddhīmān svācāryājñāpurarusaraṃ |
triśataṃ vā śataṃ nityamarcayedbrahmavidyayā || 93 ||

vilvapatraiḥ praśastaiśca puṣpairvā tulasīdalaiḥ |
jaṃvū pravālairdūrvāgnaiḥ śamīpatrairathāpi vā || 94 ||

abhyarcya dhūpadīpādīnupacārān samarpya ca |
kṛsaraṃ śarkarāyuktaṃ sārdrakaṃ goghṛtaplutaṃ || 95 ||

śrīśrīśrīpatibhyāṃ datvātha śrīdevyai ca pṛthaktataḥ |
vidhivat saṃkṛskṛte vahnau tadeva kṛsaraṃ śubhaṃ || 96 ||

madhukritayasasmiśraṃ gavyenājyenaṃ saplutaṃ |
juhuyādveda mātrādāvaṣṭā viśatidhā śive || 97 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇayā paścādaṣṭā viṃśatidhā hunet |
kevalena ghṛtenātha lakṣmī hṛdaya vidyayā || 98 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā śriyaḥ paṃcadaśārṇayā |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā catuḥ śrīmanubhistataḥ || 99 ||

arkāvṛtyā hunedājyaṃ tataḥ śrīhṛdayaṃ manuṃ |
japetyaṃ ca śataṃ nityaṃ japtvāṣṭākṣaramāditaḥ || 100 ||

prasannalakṣmīpati vidyayātha hutvārkavaridyūtameva |
gavyakoṭī sahasrāyuta homa puṇyaṃ dine dine sau labhate girīṃdraje || 101 ||

vijaya śrīmahāyogenasminmāsi dine dine |
kṛtvetthaṃ makaraṃ bhānuryathā saṃkramate śive || 102 ||

tatra prātassamutthāya kṛta pūrvāhnika kriyaḥ |
triśataṃ juhuyādagnau ramā hṛdayavidyayā || 103 ||

abhyarcya pūrva vacchrīmadaṣṭākṣaryā tataḥ paraṃ |
ghṛtaṃ ca triśataṃ hutvā bhagavadraśmibhistataḥ || 104 ||

ekaikaśo ghṛtaṃ hutvā śrīdevyāraśmirghṛta |
hutvaikadhā śriyo devyā vidyayāṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ || 105 ||

(****************) |
(*****) hutvā śrīmaṣṭā viṃśatidhāpi vā || 107 ||

prasannalakṣmī hṛdayavidyāṃ paṃcaśataṃ japet |
ūṣa saṃkramaṇe kālestātvācārya padadvayaṃ || 108 ||

natvā pādodakaṃ pītvā vimuktaḥ sarvapātakaiḥ |
ācārya sannidhāvagniṃ pratiṣṭhāpya tataḥ paraṃ || 109 ||

vedamātrāhunedādāvaṣṭā viṃśatidhā ghṛtaṃ |
aṣṭā viṃśatidhā brahmavidyayāpi hunedghṛtaṃ || 110 ||

bhagavadraśmividyābhirghṛtamekaikaśo hunet |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇayā paścāt triśataṃ juhuyād ghṛtaṃ || 111 ||

mahālakṣmī mathā vāhya jvaliṃte jātavedasi || 112 ||

sarvopacārairārācya śriyaṃ devī haripriyāṃ |
prasannayā mahālakṣmyā sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 113 ||

<p. 49b>

tilairvyājya saṃmmiśrairvilvapatra samanvitaiḥ |
madhu tritaya saṃyuktairhutvācāryasya sannidhau || 114 ||

lalitā raśmividyāpirghṛtamekaikaśo hunet |
śriyā paṃcadaśākṣaryā śatamaṣṭottaraṃ ghṛtaṃ || 115 ||

hutvātha lakṣmīmaṃtreṇa śrīdevīhṛdayena ca |
triśakti lakṣmyā sāmrājya lakṣmyā ca ghṛtamīśvari || 116 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā pratyekaṃ jātavedasi hutvā |
japādibhiḥ paścāt kṛtvā brahmārpaṇahuti || 117 ||

agniṃ pradakṣiṇī kṛtya natvā sāṣṭāṃgamādarāt |
ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoja dvitayaṃ praṇipatya vai || 18 ||

alaṃkṛtya yathā śaktyā sūkṣmavāso yugena ca |
kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ dadyāt karṇayugme tataḥ paraṃ || 19 ||

anyadābharaṇaṃ vāpi karṇayugme samarpya ca |
varṣāśanamitaṃ dravyaṃ dātavyaṃ caraṇadvaye || 20 ||

ekaviṃśatiṣkaṃ vā tadabhāve tadardhakaṃ |
tadardhaṃ vārpayeddhīmān vittalobhaṃ varityajet || 121 ||

yaṃtrāḍhakamitā mutāḥ preṣaṇīyā gurorgṛhaṃ |
ārdrakaṃ ca pradātavyaṃ paṃcāḍhakamitaṃ śive || 122 ||

tadardhaṃ vā tadardhaṃ vā śāthaṃ tatrāpi saṃtyajet |
dhenudvayaṃ pradātavyaṃ vahukṣīraṃ saṃvatsakaṃ || 123 ||

aśaktaśce daridroi niṣka paṃcakamādarāt |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdve dadyāt sidhyarthamāśvari || 124 ||

ācāryapatnyai śrīvudhyātāṭaṃkābharaṇaṃ śubhaṃ |
kanatkunaka ciṃtākamarghyayedatha vā śive || 125 ||

nāsikābharaṇaṃ tatrāśakto niṣkoṇa nirmitaṃ |
datvā vastreṇa saṃmoṣya bhojayecca suvāsinīḥ || 126 ||

vibhavesati sauvarṇa kaṭakaṃ dvayamuttamaṃ |
karayugmerpayeddhrīmān paladvaya vinirmitaṃ || 127 ||

palamāna suvarṇena nirmitaṃ vārpayecchive |
atannāśaktotha raupyeṇa suśubhreṇa vinirmiti || 128 ||

paladvayamitaṃ dadyāt palamānamathāpi vā |
suvāsinī śataṃ bhojyaṃ tadadhāṃ vā tadardhakaṃ || 129 ||

tadadhāṃ vā prasannaśrīdhiyā bhojyaṃ prayatnataḥ |
kūṣmāṃḍaṃ vahuvītāḍhyaṃ śrotriyāya dvijātaye || 130 ||

dhānyasthopari saṃsthāpya tasminkāle samarpayet |
sthalaṃ sudīrgha kūṣmāṃḍaṃ tasminkāle mama priye || 131 ||

yadi dadyāt svapatnī vā svayaṃ caikāgramānasaḥ |
dakṣiṇāsahitaṃ bhūmau sadyaḥpyata karāśibhi || 132 ||

vimuktastatra vījāniyāvaṃti giri kanyake |
tāvat kalpa sahasrāṇi vaikuṃṭhe nivasatyasau || 133 ||

vahuvittānvitastatra vasudhāṃ vahudakṣiṇāṃ |
dhenudvādaśakaṃ dadyāttilarāśiṃ sudakṣiṇaṃ || 134 ||

dadyā mahādānamapi rājya śrīkaruṇāptaye |
yadyaddattaṃ mahāyoge tasminkāle maheśvari || 135 ||

<p. 50a>

tattanmeru samaṃ prāṅgaḥ purāṇāḥ paramarṣayaḥ |
itthaṃ kṛtvānna havanaṃ varṣa sāhasramādarāt || 136 ||

paṃcāgni madhyago bhūtvā tapasā yatphalaṃtamet |
tatphalaṃ labhataṃ nātra saṃdehomīnalaudhane || 137 ||

asminmāsi puraścaryāṃ yaḥ karoti jiteṃdriyaḥ |
uktenānena vidhinā vājimadhān sahasraśaḥ || 138 ||

kṛtvā yatphalamāpnoti tatopi dviguṇaṃ śive |
phalamāpnoti tejasvī lakṣmīścāsya prasīdati || 139 ||

ācāryapatnyai śrīvudhyātadyoge girikanyake |
samarpyābharaṇaṃ haimaṃ sūkṣmavstra samanvitaṃ || 140 ||

śriyaḥ putra iti tejo bhūtale bhāgya saṃyutaḥ |
itthaṃ kṛtvā puraścaryāmatra yogeti durlabhe || 141 ||

janmakoṭi samudbhūtairapi pātakarāśibhiḥ |
vimukto hayamadhānāṃ sahasrajanitaṃ phalaṃ || 142 ||

mahādāna sahasrasyāpya kṣayaṃ sukṛta śive |
labdhvā nityaṃ viśuddhātmā mahadārogyāmakṣayaṃ || 143 ||

āyaṣyaṃ ciramāsādya bhramalaipya saṃkulāṃ |
hastyaścarathasaṃkīrṇaṃ mahatīṃ śriyamakṣayāṃ || 144 ||

avāpya sakrasadṛśīṃ vidyābhinnīva sannibhaḥ |
bhūtvā sidhyaṣṭakaṃ prāpya putrapautravatīṃ śriya || 145 ||

saṃprāpya yogamaṣṭāṃgaṃ bhūtvā jātismaraściraṃ |
divyakatyā sahasreṇa sahitaṃ sarvabhogadaṃ || 146 ||

vimānamadhiruhyāṃte kulasāhasra saṃyutaḥ |
ajarāmaraṇo bhūtvā paṃcaviṃśati vārṣikaḥ || 147 ||

bhagavat saṃnidhau tiṣṭhatyaṃtai bhagavadāhutiḥ |
ṣaḍtriṃśadvatsarairyogarājoyaṃ labhyate śive || 148 ||

atra dattasya dānasya havanasya kṛtasya ca nāhaśaktaḥ |
phalaṃ vaktuṃ satyaṃ paṃkaja locane || 149 ||

athaika divasepi dvirmahālakṣmyāḥ pravakṣyate |
yacchrutvā sādhako bhūmau kṛtakṛtyo bhaviṣyati || 150 ||

māsi bhādrapade śukle śravaṇarkṣa samanvite |
ekādaśīdine somavāsareṇa samanvite || 151 ||

sausyavāsarayukte vā sukarma sahite tathā |
ati ṣaḍayute vāpi divā saṃdhyāstu vā niśi || 152 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇo nāmnā mahādyoga udāhṛtaḥ |
alabhyaḥ kathito loke sarvakalyāṇasiddhidaḥ || 151 ||

atra japtaṃ hutaṃ dattaṃ sarvasiddhikaraṃ smṛtaṃ |
nānena sadṛśo yaugaḥ kathyate paramarṣibhiḥ || 152 ||

saṃprāpte yogasattesmin bhagavatsahitāramā |
japahomādikahṛṇāṃ mahālakṣmīḥ prasīdati || 153 ||

puraścaryāṃ pravakṣyāmi yogarājenna siddhide |
alabhyayoge saṃprāpte divā vā saṃdhyayorniśi || 156 ||

<p. 50b>

kṛtvādau maṃgalastānaṃ nadyāṃ snātvātha vā śive |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ sāṣṭāṃgaṃ daṃḍavannamet || 157 ||

tadājñāṃ śirasā dhṛtvā lakṣmīnārāyaṇau vibhū |
caturviśati saṃkhyākairupacāraissamarcayan || 158 ||

ārcayitvā paṃcaśataṃ śrīśrīśabdādaśārṇa |
yājvaline saṃskṛte vahnau gurupādābja sannidhau || 159 ||

tilairgavyājya sammiśraiḥ śrīmadaṣṭārṇa vidyayā |
madhutritayasaṃmiśraiḥ śatādhika sahasrakaṃ || 160 ||

tilairevahunedagnau vilvapatra ghṛtānvitaiḥ |
bhagavadvidya pāpaścā daṣṭāviṃśati varṇayā || 161 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā śrīdevī raśmibhirghṛtaṃ |
ekaikaśastato hutvā śriyāyaḥ ca daśārṇayā || 162 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā catuḥ śrīmanubhistataḥ |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā pratyekaṃ jātavedasi || 163 ||

kevalena ghṛtenaiva tatohutvā japādibhiḥ |
prāyaścittāhutīḥ kṛtvā kuryādbrahmārpaṇāhutiṃ || 164 ||

athācārya padadvaṃdvaṃ praṇipatyāgni sannidhau |
ṣaṣṭi cihuka sauvarṇaṃ padmarāga samanvitaṃ || 165 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ ramyamavaśyaṃ vajraviṃdubhiḥ |
aṃkitaṃ svaguṇṭhe karṇayuge dātavyamādarāt || 166 ||

tata ācāryapatnī śrīdhiyābhūṣaṇasaṃcayaiḥ |
bhūṣitavyā prayatnena sūkṣmaṃ vā sassamarpya ca || 167 ||

tilāssamarpitavyāśca svācārya padapaṃkaje |
paṃcāḍhakamitā vāpi caturāḍhakasasmitāḥ || 168 ||

dātavyā athavā śubhra taṃḍulādro sammitāḥ |
śataniṣka suvarṇa vā tadardhyaṃ vā tadardhakaṃ || 169 ||

svarṇamāvaśyakaṃ deyaṃ niṣkadvādaśakaṃ tu vā |
datvettha dakṣiṇā dravyaṃ kuṃḍala dvitayānvitaṃ || 170 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvegāṃ savatsāṃ yayasvinīṃ |
dadyādavaśyaṃgiri medhanādhyaścet pravakṣate || 171 ||

grāmadvādaśakaṃ dadyāho śataṃ ca sadakṣiṇaṃ |
pāritoṣika dānena saṃtoṣyācārya mādarāt || 172 ||

asānnidhye gurostasyatanayāya maheśvari |
datvoktaṃ dakṣiṇādravyaṃ kuṃḍala dvitayānvitaṃ || 173 ||

niśi jāgaraṇaṃ kuryācchrī śrīśārcana tatparaḥ |
paurāṇikaṃ vrataṃ yena kṛtaṃ tatra mama priye || 174 ||

vājapeya śataṃ tena kṛtaṃ syānnātra saṃśayaḥ |
tasmin dine nirāhāraḥ kṣīrāśī vā phalāśanaḥ || 175 ||

niśi jāgaraṇaṃ kṛtvā dvādaśa saṃkhyākāmṛṣṭānnaiśyāṃ |
prātarutthitaḥ snātvā kṛtāhnikobhyarnya lakṣmīnārāyaṇau vibhū || 176 ||

<p. 51a>

caturviṃśati saṃkhyāka brāhmaṇāṃśca suvāsinīḥ |
yadvā dvādaśasaṃkhyākāmṛṣṭāśrairbhojayedvratī || 177 ||

tāṃvūla dakṣiṇādyaiśca svatoṣyavidhivacchuciḥ |
ācāryā dāśiṣaḥ prāpya bhuṃjīyādvaṃdhūbhissaha || 178 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇe yoge puraścaryāmimāṃ śiveyaḥ |
karoti viśuddhātmā sa siddho bhavati dhruvaṃ || 179 ||

janmakoṭi samudbhūtairmahāpātakarāśibhiḥ |
kāyena manasā vācā jñānājñāna kṛtainapi || 180 ||

upapātakasaṃdyaiśca sadya eva vimucyeta |
sāṃga dakṣiṇayāyukta puraścaryā śatodbhavaṃ || 181 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇe yoge prāpnoti phalamuttamaṃ |
atrāvaśyaṃ pradātavyā śālagrāmaśilā śubhā || 182 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇe yoge sālagrāma śilārpaṇān |
brahmāṃḍakoṭi dānasya phalaṃ prāpnoti śāśvataṃ || 183 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇe yoge kṛtvaikāṃ vā tilāhutiṃ |
koṭī sahasra homasya phalamakṣaya maśnute || 184 ||

varṣāśanamitaṃ dravyeśata niṣkamudāhṛtaṃ |
tadardhaṃ vā tadardhaṃ vā vittalobhaṃ parityajet || 185 ||

varṣāśanamitaṃ dravyaṃ yoge lakṣmīśanāmūke |
niṣka dvādaśakaṃ vāpi datvācārya padāṃvuje || 186 ||

hivanmerusadṛśa suvarṇa cala dānajaṃ |
phalamāsādya śuddhātmā bhagavat kiṃ karo bhavet || 187 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇe yoge sauvarṇa kuṃḍaladvayaṃ |
ācārya karṇayugale datvā svarṇā calārpaṇāt || 188 ||

yatphalaṃ labhate bhūmau tatmāprotyakṣayaṃ phalaṃ || 189 ||

kiṃcāsau pitṛsāhasraṃ vimagnaṃ narakārṇave |
uddhṛtya prāpayatyāśau satyalokaṃ sanātanaṃ || 190 ||

ācāryapatnyaitādṛṃkādyalaṃkāraṃ samarpya ca |
śriyaṃ paśyati cakṣurbhyāṃ sākṣā bhagavadanvitī || 191 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇe yoge dhenuṃ datvā tapasvinī |
gavāmayutadānasya samagraṃ phalamaśrute || 192 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇe yoge puraścaraṇamādarāt |
kṛtvācāryasya sānnidhye śriyamaṣṭa guṇānvitāṃ || 193 ||

maheṃdrasadṛśīṃ prāpya dhanadhānyādi saṃkulāṃ |
muktāratnādi saṃpūrṇā kaṃdarpasadṛśaḥ śriyā || 194 ||

sarvāsāmapi vidyānāṃ bhūtvā pāraṃgatopi ca |
samastasaṃpadādhāro bhūtvā putrādi saṃyutaṃ || 195 ||

śreyo rāśi manuprāpya kalyāṇāni dine dine |
ciramāyuṣya māsādya sarvabhoga samanvitaḥ || 196 ||

jātismaraściraṃ bhūtvā brahmadṛṣṭhā sanātanaṃ |
dehāṃte paramaṃ dhāma yogināmapi durlabhaṃ || 197 ||

<p. 51b>

prayāt yatra na saṃdehassatyaṃ satyaṃ mayoditaṃ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇa samo yogo labhyo na vidyate || 198 ||

atra yayatkṛtaṃ karma tadanaṃta phalaṃ smṛtaṃ |
ityeka divase naiva vidyāsiddhihadīritā |
bhūyopi saṃpravakṣyāmi vidyāsiddhikaraṃ śive || 199 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthāṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodayeṭakaviṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 51b>

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi mahālakṣmī mahāmanoḥ |
bhūyopi siddhidaṃ kṛtyaṃ yatkṛtvā siddhimma bhavet || 1 ||

vatsarādau caitramāse pratipaddinamāditaḥ |
vāsaṃtaṃ tava rātrākhyaṃ kṣatamasti mahatpuraṃ || 2 ||

śreyaskaraṃ mahādyaudyadhināśakaramiṣṭadaṃ |
putrapautrādi saṃpatti phaladaṃ japasiddhidaṃ || 3 ||

samasta saṃpadāṃ hetu bhūtaṃ ṛtuphalapradaṃ |
muktāratma suvarṇādi dravyarāśikaraṃ gṛhe || 4 ||

dhavyaṃ yaśaskaraṃ puṣṭikaraṃ kīrti pravarddhanaṃ |
māsi caitrābhicai prāpte pratipadinamāditaḥ || 5 ||

śrīrāmajanma navamīyāvattanna varānnakaṃ |
ekaikadivasaṃ tatra mahodaya samaprabhaṃ || 6 ||

śrīrāmajanma navamī śatakratu phalasadā |
tāraṃ vāditi daivatyaṃ vārhasyatyamathāpi vā || 7 ||

tasyāṃ navamyāṃ prāptaṃ cetsā mahāsiddhidāyinī |
tatphalaṃ na mayāvaktuṃ śakyate vedhasāpi ca || 8 ||

sītārāma jayaṃtī sā saṃproktā sarvasiddhidā |
japahomādijanitaṃ phala tatra mahattaraṃ || 9 ||

na śakyate mayā vaktuṃ brahmaṇā hariṇāpi ca |
śrīrāmajanmadivasaṃ yāvaṃdhyaṃ kurute bhuvi || 10 ||

sa eva kṛtakṛtyotra bhūtale girikanyake |
śrīrāmajanmadivase yatkiṃcidapi kāṃcanaṃ || 11 ||

pradatvācārya pādābje mahādāne sahasrajaṃ |
phalamāpya viśuddhātmā brahmasāyujya yaśrute || 12 ||

avaśyabhikṣu khaṃḍaṃ vā kadalī phalameva vā |
śrīrāmajanmadivase datvācārya padāṃvuje || 13 ||

kalpadrumavane ramye dehāṃte vasatiṃ vrajet |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇa maṃtreṇa rājyalakṣmyāpitadine || 14 ||

kṛtvaikāṃ vāhutiṃ vahnau śattakratuphalaṃ labhet |
vidhānaṃ tatra vakṣyāmi vāsaṭena varānnake || 15 ||

prasannalakṣmī hṛdayamaṃtrasyāṣṭhākṣarasya ca |
navarātra yadā proktaṃ vāsaṃtaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ || 16 ||

pratipaddivase tatra svācāryākṣampurassaraṃ |
snātvā tatra viśuddhātmā kṛta pūrvāhnika kriyaḥ || 17 ||

aptvā sahasraṃ gāyatrīmatha paṃcaśataṃ tu vā|
catuḥśataṃta vā triśataṃ jvalite jātavedasi || 18 ||

<p. 52a>

vaidike laukike vāpi vedamātrā ghṛtaṃ gavāṃ |
aṣṭā viṃśatidhā hutvā dvādaśa brahmavidyayā || 19 ||

śrīadaṣṭāṇayā paścādaṣṭottaraśataṃ hunet |
tataḥ prasannalakṣmyāpi hunedaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ || 20 ||

śrīvidyayāghṛtaṃ paścādaṣṭottaraśataṃ hunet |
japet paṃcaśataṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ manuṃ || 21 ||

pratipadinamārabhya divasāṣṭakamādarāt |
saṃkalpārka sahasrāṇi japecchrī hṛdayaṃ śive || 22 ||

triśataṃ japennityamaṣṭā viṃśottaraṃ śiyaṃ |
siṃhāṃsaneścarī paṃcadaśārṇāmadri kanyake || 23 ||

rājarājeśvrīvidyāṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇābhidhāṃ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityamaṣṭā viṃśatidhāpi vā || 24 ||

japtvā śrīhṛdayaṃ stotramātharvaṇamanuttamaṃ |
japet paṃcādhikaṃ catvāriṃśadā vṛttimādarāt || 25 ||

śrīcakramarccayennityaṃ śālagrāma śilānvitaṃ |
mahālakṣmīdhiyā nityaṃ bhojayecca suvāsinī || 26 ||

ekaṃ vā mithubhanityaṃ mṛṣṭānnaistoṣayedvratī |
tataḥ śrīrāmacaṃdrasya navamyāṃ prātarutthitaḥ || 27 ||

snātvā japtvātha gāyatrīṃ nityahomaṃ samāpya ca |
ācāryasannidhau paścāt saṃskṛte jātavedasi || 28 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā vedamātrādau goghṛtaṃ hunet |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā śrīśrīśabdā daśārṇayā || 29 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣeraṇātha hunet paṃcaśataṃ ghṛtaṃ |
mahālakṣmīmathā vāhya tasminnagrau trayīmayīṃ || 30 ||

caturviṃśati saṃkhyākānupacārān prakalpayet |
tadā varaṇadevī nāmekaikāmāhuti hunet || 31 ||

ārṣachaṃdādikaṃ nyasya prasannaściyamīśvarī |
yajñanāśayaṇāṃ kasthāṃ dhyātvānna niyatavrataḥ || 32 ||

madhu tritayasaṃmiśraṃ tilavilvadalānvitaṃ |
kadalīphala saṃmiśraṃ kapilājya samanvitaṃ || 33 ||

śuddhagavyājyayuktaṃ vā sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ |
ūṣatvā prasannalakṣmyātha gavyenājyena tatparaṃ || 34 ||

bhagavadraśmividyābhirekaikāmāhutiṃ hunet |
atha śriyo mahārājñā raśmividyāmirādaśat || 35 ||

ekaikāṇa hutiṃ hutvā śriyaḥ paṃcadaśārṇayā |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ gavyenājyena juhuyādatha || 36 ||

rājarāja mahālakṣmīnārāyaṇā tataḥ paraṃ |
hunedaṣṭottara śatamaṣṭā viṃśatidhā pivā || 37 ||

rājarāja mahālakṣmīnārāyaṇā śucivrate |
juhuyāt parvakāleya ekāmapyāhutiṃ ghṛtiṃ || 38 ||

<p. 52b>

sahasrakoṭi homasya sa labhedakṣayaṃ phalaṃ |
puraścaraṇa homāṃte hutvāṣṭā viṃśadarṇayā || 39 ||

puraścaryā śataphalaṃ sadyaḥ māpnotya saṃśayaṃ |
tasmādavaśyaṃ homāṃtaṃvyamaṣṭā viṃśati varṇayā || 40 ||

tato japādibhirhutva kṛtvā brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ |
agniṃ pradakṣiṇī kṛtya namaskṛtya girīṃdraje || 41 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ sāṣṭāṃgaṃ praṇipatya ca |
kuṃḍala dvitayaṃ haimaṃ ṣaṣṭi cihnuka nirmitaṃ || 42 ||

vajravidu samāyuktaṃ padmaṇā samanvitaṃ |
dadyādavaśyamācārya karṇayugmegni sanmidhau || 43 ||

yajñanārāyaṇātmāu rāmodāśarathirvibhuḥ |
jānakīsahitastasya puraścaryā śatodbhavāṃ || 44 ||

dadāti mahatī siddhiṃ sadya eva na saṃśayaḥ |
dukūla yugalaṃ vāpi kāryā samatha vāmadu || 45 ||

arthayedvastrayugalaṃ mudrikājjapyanekathaḥ |
datvā dhanāḍhyo bhūyo vā svarṇasāhasramarpayet || 46 ||

yadvā varṣāśanaṃ dravyaṃ niṣkadvādaśakaṃ tu vā |
tarāśaktopi ṣaṇinaṣkāṃnniniṣkaṃ vā samarpayet || 47 ||

kadalīphala saṃdyaṃ ca tatra śrīguraverpayet 
ikṣu daṃḍagaṇopetaṃ nārikela phalānvitaṃ || 48 ||

avaśyamarpayedvīmānācārya caraṇadvaye |
daridro maṃdabhāgyopi bhikṣitvā sarvavarṇajān || 49 ||

niṣkannaya suvarṇa vā datvācārya padāṃvuje |
kanyāṃ rūpavatī dadyācchīlaudārya guṇāvitāṃ || 50 ||

kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ dātu maśaktaḥ kanyakāmapi |
sūkṣmaṃ vā sassamarpyādau phalarāśi mataḥ paraṃ || 51 ||

paṃcaniṣkamitaṃ dravyamavaśyaṃ guraverpayet |
dādāti yadi tanmūnaṃ na siddhimadhi gacchati || 52 ||

na kāryo dakṣiṇā lobhaḥ siddhimicchanmahattaraṃ |
mahālakṣmīdhiyācāryapatnī mākalpasaṃcayaiḥ || 53 ||

avaśyamarcayeddhimānsusūkṣmeṇa ca vāsasā |
śrīrāmajanmadivaseya itthaṃ samācaret || 54 ||

lakṣmīhṛdayavidyāyāḥ prāpya siddhimahattarāṃ |
jānakīśa prasādena śriyaṃ maiṃdrīma caṃcalāṃ || 55 ||

ihaivāsādya dīrghāyu dhanaratnaudya saṃkulāṃ |
putrapautra samṛddhiṃ ca kalyāṇāni dine dine || 56 ||

dehāṃte paramaṃ dhāma yāti devaiśca durlabhaṃ |
tasmindine nirāhāraḥ kṣīrāśī vā phalāśanaḥ || 57 ||

kaṃdamūlāśano vāpi bhūtvā sādhaka puṃgavaḥ |
paredyuḥ śrīdhiyābhyarcyamṛṣṭarannaiḥ suvāsinīḥ || 58 ||

jānakīśadhiyā viprānno japitvātha sādhakaḥ |
bhuṃjīta vaṃdhubhiḥ sārdhaṃ vipraśeṣānnamādarāt || 59 ||

<p. 53a>

vāsaṃte navarātreyaḥ puraścaraṇamuttamaṃ |
karoti sa bhavedrāma caṃdrānu grahato bhuvi || 60 ||

pāragaḥ sarvavidyānāṃ maheṃdra sadṛśaḥ śriyā |
putrapautrā śriyā yukto dīrghāpuṣpa samanvitaḥ || 61 ||

samastabhogasahito nityaṃ kalyāṇa saṃyutaḥ |
bhūtvā jātismaraḥ paścādgrāmaṃ daṣṭvā jagatati || 62 ||

vimānavaramāruhya dehāṃte kāmagaśubhaṃ |
kulaṇahasra sahito ramate hari sannidhau || 63 ||

athānyat saṃpravakṣyāmi sadyaḥ siddhikaraṃ bhuvi |
samastasaṃpat sāmrājya hetubhūtaṃ girīṃdraje || 64 ||

vaiśākhe śuklapakṣe yā tṛtīyākṣaya saṃjñitā |
vudhena bhṛguṇā vāpi sahitā vahi saṃyutā || 65 ||

prajāpati yutā vāpi samastaphalasiddhidā |
samastādyau ghṛśamanī sarvapuṇya phalapradā || 66 ||

dṛṣṭi tritayasaṃkhyākadi ca saṃvatsare bhuvi |
anayā sadṛśī nāsti tithissakalasiddhidā || 67 ||

japtamatra hutaṃ vakta sarvamakṣayasiddhidaṃ |
atra jāgarti satataṃ lakṣmīśaḥ karuṇānidhiḥ || 68 ||

nārāyaṇo mahāyogī vadarīva na madhyagaḥ |
svadarśanotsukānṛṣṭvājanān paramadhārmikān || 69 ||

vadatīttha mahāyogī tadvadāmi vacaḥ śṛṇu |
akṣayākhya tṛtīyāyāṃ yo māmatrā gajājanaḥ || 70 ||

snātvā cākanaṃdīnāmāṃ paśyati śucivrataḥ |
avaśyaṃ mama sāyujyaṃ dāsyāmya saṃśayaḥ || 71 ||

yatra kutrāpi vā bhūmau dinesminnakṣayābhidhe |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī vidyāṃ japedye niyatavrataḥ || 72 ||

juhuyādāhutiṃ vaikāṃ lakṣmīhṛdaya vidyayā |
tasyākṣayā mahāsiddhimihadatvā maha āṃ || 73 ||

tadvaṃśasaṃmavānāṃ ca dehati gatimuttamāṃ |
akṣayāṃ saṃpradāsyāni vaikuṃṭha mamasmannidhau || 74 ||

ācārya padāṃbhojeya iṣṭārthaṃ prayacchati |
sunaṇīṃ ca hukumasya dadāsyasyā calāśriyaṃ || 76 ||

adyakṣareṇa vā homaṃ lakṣmīhṛdayavidyayāḥ |
atrākṣayavine kṛtvā madanagrahato bhuvi || 76 ||

mahatī siddhimāsādya daivataraipi pūjyate |
ityāha bhagavān yogī harinārāyaṇo vibhuḥ || 78 ||

nareṇa sahitassarvadevaṣāṇāṃ ca sannidhau |
tasmādavaśyaṃ vaiśākhe divase kṣayasaṃjñite || 79 ||

viśeṣa japadomādikama kuryādvijottamaḥ |
yadyakṣa ca mahāsiddhimicchatyatra narā bhuvi || 80 ||

akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāmavaśyaṃ vaiśākhe divase kṣaya saṃjñite |
viśeṣa japahomādikarma kuryādvijottamaḥ yadyakṣaya mahāsiddhimicchatyatra naro 
bhuvi || 80 ||

<p. 53b>

akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāmavaśyaṃ vratamācaret |
etadvratasamaṃ nānyadvratanāstipālapradaṃ || 81 ||

akṣayeṣṭa pradātatvā dakṣayaṃ diṣu saṃvidruḥ |
akṣaye brahmasāyujya pradātṛtvena cākṣayaṃ || 82 ||

divasaṃ procyate sadbhirbrahmādyaiścāmahātmaniḥ |
akṣayāyā tṛtīyāyāṃ prasannakamalāmanoḥ || 83 ||

mahāsiddhiṣka ivaṃkṣye puraścaraṇamuttamaṃ |
brāhmekāle samutthāya brahmavidyāṃ prajapya ca || 84 ||

raśmimālā manusmṛtya natvācāryapadāṃvujaṃ |
kṛta śaucastataḥ snātvā kṛtasaṃdhyā japakriyaḥ || 85 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ sāṣṭāṃgaṃ praṇipatya ca |
nityahomaṃ samāpyātha śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ manu || 86 ||

aptvā paṃcaśataṃ rājyalakṣmī vidyāmataḥ paraṃ |
śuciḥ paṃcaśataṃ japtvā gurupādābja sannidhau || 87 ||

vaiśvānaraṃ pratiṣṭhāpya vedamātrā tataḥ paraṃ |
aṣṭāviṃśati bhāgavyamājya hutvā girīṃdraje || 88 ||

gavyapluttadadhyannaṃ śrīmadaṣṭārṇa vidyayā |
hutvā paṃcaśataṃ devi lakṣmīhṛdayavidyayā || 89 ||

pagnasastha phalairvījarahitairmadhumiśritaiḥ |
ghṛtaplutairhunedagnau sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 90 ||

tadaḥ ghṛtamekaikaṇe hutvā śriyā paṃcadaśārṇayā |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ gavyenājyena juhuyadatha || 93 ||

hutvā japādibhiḥ paścāt kṛtvā brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ |
agniṃ prayakṣiṇīkṛtya namaskṛtya ca sādaraṃ || 94 ||

cakrarājaṃ samabhyarcya sālagrāma śilāmapi |
śrīśrīśa dvādaśākṣayapijet paṃcaśataṃ śive || 95 ||

panasasyaphalopetaṃ sūpāyūya phalānvite |
dadhyannasahitaṃ devi naivedyaṃ ca samarpayet || 96 ||

tatrācāryamalaṃ kṛtya praṇipatya ca sādaraṃ |
datvā go dvitayaṃ vatsa vahukṣīra samanvitaṃ || 97 ||

varṣāśanamitaṃ dravyaṃ tadardhaṃ vā tadardhakaṃ |
triniṣkamathavā datvā gurupatnyai ramādhiyā || 98 ||

sūkṣmavāsopyalaṃkāraṃ datvā saṃbhojayedvijān |
suvāsinīśca saṃbhojya siddhimāpnotyanuttamā || 99 ||

bhagavatsahitā tasya mahālakṣmīḥ prasīdati |
saṃtati vyāpinīṃ lakṣmīṃ dhanadhānyādisaṃkulāṃ || 100 ||

akṣayaṃ mahadārogyamāyuṣya ca mahattaraṃ |
akṣayāmapi vāksiddhimakṣayāṃ putrasaṃtati || 101 ||

akṣayāna khilānbhogān dadātīha haripriyā |
akṣayaṃ brahmasāyujyaṃ dehāṃtesya prayacchati || 102 ||

śriyaḥ prasāda sidhyarthamavaśyaṃ divasekṣaye |
vaiśākhemāsi kartavyaṃ vratame tadanuttamaṃ || 103 ||

<p. 54a>

yadvākṣaya tṛtīyāyāmitthaṃ kṛtvā girīṃdraje |
niṣkamekaṃ pradatvā svācārya caraṇadvaye || 104 ||

pūrṇimāṃtaṃ vrataṃ kuryāt siddhimicchan mahattarāṃ |
akṣayāyāṃ tṛtīyāyāṃ kṛtvetthaṃ homamādarāt || 105 ||

datvā niṣkadvayaṃ vāpi svācārya caraṇadvaye |
ācāryapatnyai niṣkārvalakṣmī vudhyā samarpya ca || 106 ||

śrīmadhyannaṃ ghṛtamiśritaṃ || 108 ||

aṣṭottaraśata hutvā ramāhṛdayavidyayā |
dadhyannameva juhuyācchuddhadhenughṛta ghṛtaṃ || 109 ||

bhagavadraśmi vidyābhirghṛtamekaikaśo hunet |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā tatoṣṭā viśaṃdarṇayā || 110 ||

suṃdarī raśmividyābhighṛtamekaikaśo hunet |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā śriyaḥ paṃcadaśārṇayā || 111 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇaprītyai mithunaṃ bhojayedapi |
pūrṇimāṃtamidaṃ kṛtvā pūrṇimādiva saṃtataḥ || 112 ||

snātvā prātarviśuddhātmākṛta pūrvāhnika kriyaḥ |
samāpyāvaśyakaṃ karma saṃskṛte jātavedasi || 113 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā vedamātrādau juhuyādghṛtaṃ |
dadhyannaṃ ghṛtasaṃmiśraṃ śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā || 114 ||

ādau paṃcaśataṃ hutvā ramāhṛdaya vidyayā |
dadhyannameva juhuyātyanepsamya phalānvita || 115 ||

śatādhika sahasraṃ ca ghṛtamiśraṃ giriṃdraje |
bhagavadraśmividyābhirekaikāmāhutiṃ hunet || 116 ||

goghṛtai naiva juhuyādaṣṭāviṃśati varṇayā |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā paścācchriyo raśmibhirapyatha || 117 ||

ekaikaśo hunedājya madhupaṃcadaśārṇayā |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā ghṛtenaiva girīṃdraje || 118 ||

japādi homaṃ kṛtvātha prāyaścittāhuratīrayapi |
brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ kṛtvā namaskṛtvātha pāvakaṃ || 119 ||

ācārya samalaṃkṛtya gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatāribhiḥ |
avaśyamapi dātavyaṃ kuṃḍaladvayamādarāt || 120 ||

kuṃḍala dvitayaṃ dātumaśakto yadi pāvati |
muktālaṃkaraṇaṃ vāpi ratnālaṃkaraṇaṃ tu vā || 121 ||

yāvacchaktya malaṃkāraṃ datvācāryasya karṇayo |
palameka suvarṇaṃ vā tadardhaṃ vā tadardhakaṃ || 122 ||

tatrāśaktastri niṣkaṃ vā guru pādāṃvujerpayet |
avaśyaṃgauḥ pradātavyā vahukṣmīrā savatsakā || 123 ||

radyātphalāni paṃcāthayānasāni trayaṃ tu vā |
vahūsthūlāni dīrghāṇi phalasaṃdyayutānyapi || 124 ||

kadalīphalasaṃdyaṃ ca dadyāt svagurave śive || 122 ||

upānahau ca chatrāṇi śrotriyebhyaḥ samarpayet |
dadhyannāpūya bhakṣyādyairbhojayakṣa suvāsinīḥ || 123 ||

<p. 54b>

ācāryapatnīṃ śrīvudhyāvāsovaṃkaraṇādibhiḥ |
arcāyedatha vā lakṣmī sannidhau vā samarpayet || 124 ||

preṣayedarpi tadravyaṃ gurave tatsutāyavā |
tatpatnyai vā tatsutāyai tatpautrāyātha vārpayet || 125 ||

ācāryādāśiṣaḥ prāpya svayaṃ bhuṃjīta vāgyataḥ |
puraścaryā vratamidaṃ vaiśākhemāsi pārvati || 126 ||

yaḥ karoti viśuddhātmā daivatairapi durlabhāṃ |
siddhimāpnoti mahatīsaṃdyaḥ pratyayakāriṇī || 127 ||

vratena hīnopi vimūḍhadhī mūrkho daridraḥ kṛpaṇopi vā |
dhanaiśca dhānyairmaṇimiśca saṃkulāṃ lakṣmīmavāpnoti ramāprasādāt || 128 ||

avaśyamāpnotya navīnavidyā api śriyonugrahatotha rājyaṃ |
rathāśvamatto bhayadāti pūrṇāṃ rājyaśriyaṃ viṃdati vatseratra || 129 ||

ākalyāmasyānvaya saṃbhavāścaviṃdaṃti rājyaśriyamṛkṣayāṃ ca |
āyuṣyamārogya dhanābhivṛddhiṃ vaṃśābhivṛddhiṃ ca maheṃdra tulyāṃ || 130 ||

avāpya lakṣmīmatulāśca bhogānyogaṃ tathāṣṭāṃgamupetya paścāt |
kalevarāṃte haripārśvatī niraṃjanassāmyamupaiti divyaṃ || 131 ||

sahasraśopyasya kule prasūtā ramāptasādānnirayepimagnāḥ |
dhātuḥ padayāṃtyati bhogayuktā āruhyanaṃgirirājakanye || 132 ||

samastasaṃsiddhikara vratena nānena tulyaṃ girirāja kanyeśutu |
smṛtau vātha purāṇa saṃcaye saghoramānu grahadāyakena || 133 ||

vaiśāmāedina makṣayākhyamārabhya tatpūṇadine samāpye nāpnoti |
kiṃ kiṃ varamiṣṭajātaṃ śriyeḥ prasādādirijeṃdrakanye || 134 ||

dakṣaḥ pulastyaḥ pulaho vaśiṣṭaḥ śukro girāḥ kauśika vaṃśadīpaḥ |
kṛtvā vratvaṃ prāpya mahārthasiddhiṃ caraṃ tilokeṣu vimuktavaṃdhāḥ || 135 ||

puraścaryā vratamidaṃ vaiśākhemāsi siddhidaṃ |
kṛtvā vaśyaṃ naraḥ sākṣān mahālakṣmī prapaśyati || 136 ||

masannāyāṃ jugaddhātryāma sādhyaṃ kiṃ jagattraye |
brahmarṣayo vaśiṣṭādyāḥ śakrādyāścādegīśvrāḥ || 137 ||

brahādayopi kṛtva tadvratamatyaṃtayāvanaṃ |
mahālakṣmīprasādena lakṣmīśānugrahādapi || 138 ||

asādhāraṇa sāmarthyaṃ śriya maṣṭaguṇānvitāṃ |
saṃprāpya bhagavatsāmye satataṃ sukhino bhavan || 139 ||

puraścaryā vrataṃ vakṣye bhūyonyat siddhidāyaka |
mahāpāpaudya dalanaṃ śatakratu phalapradaṃ || 140 ||

<p. 55a>

siṃharāśiṃ surācāryogīmiṣyati yadā śive |
tatrārkadivasaṃ vādāvaṃte puṣkara saṃyutaṃ || 141 ||

godāvaryā mahatpuṇyaṃ parvoktam yasmarṣibhiḥ |
koti tritayā tīrthāni sārdhakoṭi yutāni ca || 142 ||

siṃhasaṃsthe surācārye samāyāṃtyeva gautamīṃ |
dinadvādaśakaṃ tatra puṣkarastīrthanāyakaḥ || 143 ||

ādāvaṃte samāyāti sarvapāpaudya bhedāna |
bhikṣvānnamapi datvā vā gautamyāṃ puṣkarāgame || 144 ||

marutulyānnadānasya phalamāpnoti śāśvataṃ |
brahmapno vā surāpāyīsteyī vā gurutalpakaḥ || 145 ||

tatsaṃyogī paśupto vā vālaghnastaskaropi vā |
viśvastaviṣadātāragarbhaḥ ghātī sahasraśaḥ || 146 ||

bhrūṇagno vīrahā vāpi mātṛhā pitṛhāpi vā |
ahāraniyamaṃ kṛtvā yoge puṣkaranāmake || 147 ||

gautamyāṃ prātarutthāyastātvā nityaṃ viśuddhīḥ |
dinadvādaśakānmuktaḥ sarvapāpairbhavavyasau || 148 ||

bhāṣāracitaṃ maṃtraṃ vā tatra japtvā dine dine |
tānugrahaṃ prāpya siddhimiṣṭāṃ vrajatyasau || 149 ||

ācāryāyātha vānyassai yatkiṃcidapi kāṃcanaṃ |
datvā meru sahasrasya phalaṃ prāpnotyanuttamāṃ || 150 ||

ekāmapyā hutiṃ tatra kṛtvā sādhaka puṃgavaḥ |
koṭihoma phalanityaṃ prāpnoti girikanyake || 151 ||

ayaṃ dvādaśabhirvarṣairlabhyate yogarātra śive |
godāvarī taṭe ramye nānyatra bhuvi pāvati || 152 ||

puraścaryābhidhaṃ tatra mahāsiddhi pradāyakaṃ |
tatra vakṣyāmi girije śṛṇuṣva su samāhitā || 153 ||

yasmindine surācāryassiṃharāśiṃ gamiṣyati |
godāvarītaṭaṃ ganvātamaskṛtyāthagautatamī || 154 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdva praṇipatya ca daṃḍavat |
godāvadyatitaḥ snātvā kṛta pūrvāhnika kriyaḥ || 155 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ bhūyopi praṇipatya ca |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā gāyatryājyaṃ dine dine || 156 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣareṇāpi śatamaṣṭottaraṃ hunet |
kṣīṇannaṃ madhusaṃmiśraṃ kapilājyena saṃplutaṃ || 157 ||

tilavilvadalopetaṃ lakṣmīhṛdayavidyayā |
api paṃcaśataṃ hutvā śrīyuktāṣṭāṇayopyatha || 158 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā bhagavadraśmimaṃtrakaiḥ |
ghṛtamekaikaśo hutvā suṃdarī raśmibhistata || 159 ||

ekaikaśo hunedājyamatha paṃcadaśārṇayā |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā prāyaścittāhutīrhudhveta || 60 ||

brahmārpaṇāhuti kṛtvā natvāgniṃ tata ādarāt |
bhojayenmithuna dvaṃdvaṃ śriyaṃ paṃcaśataṃ japan || 61 ||

<p. 55b>

divasa dvādaśake kuryān mahāsiddhikaraṃ vrataṃ |
dānakramaṃ pravakṣyāmi dineṣu dvādaśāsvatha || 62 ||

ādyogo paṃcakaṃ dadyādvahukṣakṣiṇayānvitaṃ |
pakva samyayutāṃ bhūmiṃ dvitīye divasepayet || 63 ||

paṃcāḍhakamitaṃ dadyāt tilarāśiṃ tṛtīyake |
sahasradakṣiṇāduktaṃ varṣadravyayutaṃ tu vā || 64 ||

palamāna suvarṇaṃ vā caturthe divaserpayet |
dukūladyugalaṃ vāpi kāryā sa dvitayaṃ tu vā || 65 ||

pradadyā dakṣiṇāyuktaṃ paṃcamedivase śive |
khāsadvādaśakaṃ dhānyaṃ yadvā khārī catuṣṭayaṃ || 66 ||

ṣaṣṭedine vratī dṛdyāvatehu dakṣiṇayānvitaṃ |
saptame divase dadyādguḍaṃdakṣiṇayunvite || 67 ||

paṃcāḍhakamitaṃ yadvā pradadyādāḍhakaṃ guḍaṃ |
paladvādaśakaṃ raupyaṃ catuḥpalamitaṃ tu vā || 68 ||

aṣṭame divase dadyāllavaṇā calamapyatha |
paṃcācchakamitaṃ vāpi pradadyānnavame dine || 69 ||

āṃdolikāṃ manoramyāṃ vahudakṣiṇayānvitāṃ |
ahastyaścaratha saṃpūrṇī navame divaserpyayet || 70 ||

karṣāśanamitaṃ dravyasahitaṃ navamaṃdiraṃ |
daśame divase dadyādvāsona karaṇānvitaṃ || 71 ||

muktāphalāni ratnāni dadyādekādaśe dine |
dvādaśe divase dadyāt suvarṇāni sahasraśaḥ || 72 ||

dhanāḍhyo rājaputraścadīkṣāmitthaṃ mayā caret |
athavācārya pādābje dadyādekottaraṃ dhanaṃ || 73 ||

ekaikāṃ dhenumatha vā dadyāt pratidinaṃ vudhaḥ |
kuṃḍalādīnalaṃkārān tasminyoge samarpayat || 74 ||

ekaikaṃ niṣkamathavā puṣkare gautamītaḍhe |
ācāryāyāryayet svarṇaṃ dviguṇaṃ dvādaśe dine || 75 ||

tatrāpya śakto niṣkārdhaṃ pratyahaṃ guraverpayet |
tatrāpa śaktastasyārthavitalobhaṃ parityajet || 76 ||

saptadvīpavatī bhūmiṃ dhanadhānyādi saṃkulāṃ |
ācāryāyāryayitvapi syādṛṇī pratyahaṃ śive || 177 ||

datvā mahīṃ samagrāṃ ca dhanaratnaudya saṃkulāṃ |
vastra prakṣālanādyaiśca pāda saṃvāhanādibhiḥ || 78 ||

ucchiṣṭamārjanādyaiśca gṛhasaṃmārjanādibhiḥ |
śuśrūṣāṃ niyataḥ kuryādavaśyaṃ pratyahaṃ vudhaḥ || 179 ||

mahāpuṣkarayogosmin sākṣāllakṣmīdhiyā punaḥ |
ācāryapatnīṃ vāsobhirbhūṣayeddivyabhūṣaṇaiḥ || 80 ||

yugma dvādaśakaṃ bhojyaṃ mṛṣṭānnairdvādaśe dine |
itthaṃ puṣkarayogesmin kṛtvā godāvarī taṭe || 181 ||

puraścaryā vrataṃ lakṣmyā labhet siddhiṃ mahattarāṃ |
sāṃgadakṣiṇayāyukta puraścaryā sahasrajaṃ || 182 ||

<p. 56a>

avaśyaṃ phalamāpnoti saṃśayo nātra vidyate |
dhanadhānya gajāśvādi saṃpūrṇāṃ ratnasaṃkulī || 183 ||

acalāṃ mahatīṃ lakṣmīṃ varṣāt prāgeva sādhakaḥ |
prāpya śakradhaneśakradhaneśādi śriyaṃ tṛṇagaṇāyate || 184 ||

kaṃdarpa sadṛśaḥ kāṃtyā vṛddhopi taruṇāyate |
navarāga śiroratna dviguṇī kṛtarociṣaḥ || 185 ||

prayacchaṃtopi sarvasvaṃ sevaṃte tānnarādhiyāḥ |
maṃdabuddhirjaḍo vāpi vidyā svaṣṭādaśasvapi || 186 ||

bhūtvā pāṇataḥ sākṣādvācaspati samo bhavet |
svacchaṃdamaraṇo bhūtvāyamaṃ tatkiṃ karāna pitṛṇī || 187 ||

kṛtya padaṃ yāti śarīrāṃte śriyaḥ pateḥ |
piturmātuśca bhāryā yāni magraṃ nararakārṇave || 188 ||

uddhṛtya kulasāhasraṃ na yati brahmaśāśvataṃ |
vaṃśābhi vṛddhi mākalyaṃ prāpnoti śrīsamanvitāṃ || 189 ||

itthaṃ puṣkarayogesmin puraścaryā mayeritā |
anugrahakarī lakṣmyānā parāsti śrutau smṛtau || 190 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge dvāvaraviṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 56a>

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

saṣasmiddhikaraṃ bhūmau mahālakṣmyā girīṃdraje |
bhūyopi saṃpravakṣyāmi śrotuṃtvaṃ niyatā bhava || 1 ||

avamāvāsyā paurṇamāsī mahāparva dvayaṃ smṛtaṃ |
amāpratipadossaṃdhau rāhugrasto raviryadi || 2 ||

grasthotha ketunā vāpi grahaṇaṃ pavartadviduḥ |
pūrṇāpratipadossaṃdhaurāhuṇā ketunā api || 3 ||

grastasyā yadi śītāṃśussomagrahaṇamucyate |
bhānuvāsara saṃyuktarmiduvāra yutaṃ tu vā || 4 ||

cūḍāmarāyabhirdhayarva taduktaṃ yasmarṣibhiḥ |
prakṣaṃ sarvalokānāṃ dugrahaṇāṃ śubhaṃ || 5 ||

sadyaḥ pātarāśighraṃ sadyaḥ puṇyaphalaṃ pradaṃ |
apamṛtyu praśamanaṃ vijayaśrī phalapradaṃ || 6 ||

sadyaḥ siddhikaraṃ naitatsadṛśaṃ vidyate bhuvi |
yatkiṃcidapi japtaṃ vāhutaṃdattamathāpi vā || 7 ||

ravīṃdugrahaṇe puṇyaṃ koṭi koṭi guṇāṃ viduḥ |
jātakaṃ mṛtakaṃ vātra sūtrakaṃ naiva vidyate || 8 ||

mahodadhau vā nadyo vāravīduṃ grahaṇe śive |
srākyanamācarītaṃ yena sa sadyaḥ pāparāśibhiḥ || 9 ||

koṭijanmasamubhūtairapi vipro vimucyate |
gocarma sasmitā bhūmiryena tatra pradīyate || 10 ||

vahusasya samāyuktā dakṣiṇā sahitā bhuvi |
saptadvīpavatī pṛthvīṃ dhanādhānyādi saṃkulā || 11 ||

śatakṛtvaḥ pradatvā yatphalaṃ prāpnoti bhūtale |
tadavaśyaṃ phalaṃ martyaḥ prāpnoti tu visādhakaḥ || 12 ||

suvarṇa maṃtrayodayādapi cihnakamātrakaṃ |
hemādri sadṛśa svarṇadānasya phalamaśrute || 13 ||

<p. 56b>

yotraikāṃgāṃ vahukṣīro dadyādvat samanvitāṃ |
gokoṭidānaṃ japuṇyaṃ prāpnot yatra na saṃśayaḥ || 14 ||

agnerayatyaṃ prathamaṃ hiraṇyaṃ bhūrveṃsuvī sūryasutāścagāvaḥ |
duttāstrayaste na bhavaṃ tilokāyaḥ kāṃcanaṃgāṃ ca mahīṃ pradadyāt || 15 ||

tulā hiraṇyagarbhādidānānāmatra pārvati |
mahāphalaḥ kālo brahmavidbhirudīritaḥ || 16 ||

yaṃkaṃcidapi vā maṃtramācāryājñā purassaraṃ |
hutvā japtvātravācārya pādābja yugale śive || 17 ||

yātkiṃcidapi vā datvā dāridropi mahatphalaṃ |
ācāryasiddhimāpnoti śrīprasādaṃ vrajatyapi || 18 ||

rājā vā rājaputro vā dhanāḍhyo cātra bhūtale |
yacca yāvacca sarvasvaṃ ravīṃdu grahaṇe śubhe || 19 ||

dadyādācārya pādābje sākṣādbrahma prapaśyati |
pitaraṃ mātaraṃ vāpi samuddiśya mṛtānapi || 20 ||

vahukṣīrāṃ savasāṃgāṃ yo dadāt yatra sādhakaḥ |
mahāpāpaudya sahitā apite pitaraḥ śive || 21 ||

magnāśca narake ghore vimuktā narakārākhīt |
prayāṃti sadya evairate satyalokaṃ sanātanaṃ || 22 ||

samastethapi śāstreṣu parvagrahaṇasannibhaṃ |
sadyaḥ siddhikaraṃ noktaṃ tasmādatra pravakṣyate || 23 ||

ravīṃdragrahaṇāt pūrvaṃ na dinapaṃcakamādarāt |
dinatrayaṃ vā prayato brahmacārī phalāśanaḥ || 24 ||

kṣīrāśī vā haviṣyāśī phalairvilvairghṛtaplutaiḥ |
yadvā ghṛtaplutairvilvapatraistila samanvitaiḥ || 25 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā śrīmadaṣṭārṇa vidyayā |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ rājyalakṣmyāpi juhuyādatha || 26 ||

suṃdarī bhagavadvidyayāpi dvādaśadhā huna vā srātvā |
durvalo rogapīḍitaḥ gurupādābjayugalaṃ praṇamya bhuvi daṃḍavat || 27 ||

vaiśvānaraṃ pratiṣṭhāpya saṃskṛvidhivacchuci |
utpalairjuhudyādagnau tilagavyājyamiśritaiḥ || 30 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ pūrvaṃ śrāmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā |
atha prasannalakṣmyāpi prātādhika sahasrakaṃ || 31 ||

juhuyāt saṃskṛte vahāvutpalairghṛtamiśritaiḥ |
utpalānāma bhāvetu vilvapatrairghṛtaplutaiḥ || 32 ||

tilamiśrairhunedagnau tadabhāve girīṃdraje |
hunecchudgatilairevaghṛta trimadhumiśritaiḥ || 33 ||

bhagavadraśmi vidyābhirghṛtamekaikaśo hunet |
lalitā raśmividyābhirekaikāmāhutiṃ ghṛtaṃ || 34 ||

hutvā paṃcadaśākṣaryā śriyoṣṭā viṃśatīrhunet |
prāyaścittāhutīḥ kṛtvā kuryādbrahmārpaṇāhutiṃ || 35 ||

agniṃ pradakṣiṇī vṛtya svācārya caraṇadvayaṃ sāṣṭāṃgaṃ daṃḍavat kṛtvā 
paṃcadaśākṣaryā |
śriyoṣṭā viṃśatīrhunet prāyaścittānnatvā tata ākalpa saṃcayaiḥ || 36 ||

<p. 57a>

kuṃḍavādyairalaṃkṛtya vāso yugmaṃ samarpya ca |
samarpayedgrāmamekaṃ vahudhānyadhanānvitaṃ || 37 ||

sālagrāma śilāmevāṃgo dvayaṃ payasānvitaṃ |
apyosoyaskarāṃ dadyājajānaśvān paśūnapi || 38 ||

āṃdolikāṃ ca śivikāṃśveta chatraṃ sa cāmaraṃ |
tulā hiraṇyagarbhādi dānānyapi samarpayet || 39 ||

teva śaktasya vakṣyāmi dakṣiṇā dravyamīśvari |
kuṃḍala dvitayaṃ datvā guroḥ karṇayuga śiveḥ || 40 ||

muktālaṃkaraṇaṃ dadyāttatrā śakto girīṃdraje |
ratnāsalaṃkaraṇaṃ yadvā rudrākṣābharaṇaṃ tu vā || 41 ||

avaśyamapi dātavyā sālagrāma śilābhujā |
gocarmasammitā bhūmirvahusasya samanvitā || 42 ||

avaśyamapi dātavyā śatāḍhakamitā tu vā |
tasyā abhāve tanmūlyaṃ vaṣārśanamitaṃ smṛtaṃ || 43 ||

vakaṃ viṃśati niṣkaṃ vā niska dvādaśakaṃ tu vā |
vārānadyūmatha vā dadyādvittalobhaṃ parityajet || 44 ||

dhenudvayaṃ pradātavyamavaśyaṃgiri kanyake |
tanmūlyamathavā dadyājataḥ sākṣādramādhiyā || 45 ||

dadyādācārya patnyai ca tāṭaṃkābharaṇādikaṃ |
yugma dvādaśakaṃ bhojyaṃ maṣṭānnena tataḥ paraṃ || 46 ||

ācāryāliṃganaṃ prāpya gṛhītvātha tadā śiṣaḥ |
prāpnoti mahatīṃ siddhiṃ yogināmapi durlabhā || 47 ||

prāgeva vatsarāllakṣmī dhanadhānyādi saṃkulāṃ |
muktāratnagaṇākīrṇāmacalāṃ prāpnuyādasau || 48 ||

rājāno gajaputrāśca sacivāstasya maṃtriṇaḥ |
dāsabhūtā bhavatyasya prayacchaṃtya vivāṃchitaṃ || 49 ||

pūjyate sarvalokeṣu satataṃ vijayī bhavet |
putrapautra prayautrādyaurbhogānbhuṅkte khilānapi || 50 ||

vāktiddhiṃ mahātīṃ prāpya surācārya samaprabhāṃ |
dīrghamāyuṣyamāsādya vimukto rogarāga saṃciyai || 51 ||

kulasāhara sahito divyabhoga samanvitaḥ |
ajaraścāmaro bhūtvā bhagavat sadṛśā kṛtiḥ || 52 ||

divyakanyā śatayute vimānaṃ sarvakāmadaṃ |
āruhyabhagaṃ vaddhvānniva satyaṃ tena saṃśayaḥ || 53 ||

grahaṇa divtaye kṛtvā grahaṇacittayepi vā |
puraścaryāmimāṃ devi mahālakṣmīṃ haripriyāṃ || 54 ||

sākṣāt paśyati ca kṣurbhyāṃ nārāyaṇa samanvitāṃ |
aṇimādi guṇā āpyajātiṃ smṛtvātha paurvikī || 55 ||

maheṃdra sadṛśo lakṣmyā putrapautra sukhānvitaḥ |
brahmeṃdrādyamarānnityaṃ paśya har' samanvitaḥ || 56 ||

svacchaṃdamaraṇo bhūtvā yogamaṣṭāṃga saṃyutaṃ |
saṃprāpya brahmasāyujyaṃ prāpnotyeva suniścitaṃ || 57 ||

<p. 57b>

vaiṣṇavarkṣasthite bhānau vaiṣṇuvarkṣa samanvitā |
mādyamāsādyamāvāsya bhānuvāsara saṃyutā || 58 ||

vyatīpāta samāyuktā tatrārddhodayanāmakaḥ |
alabhya yoga uktoyaṃ labhyate vahuvatsaraiḥ || 59 ||

iṃduvāsara yuktācon mahodaya iti smṛtaḥ |
yogadvayamidaṃ prāhuralabhyaṃ bhuvi durlabhaṃ || 60 ||

sadyaḥ pātakarāśighnaṃ sarvaroganivarhaṇaṃ |
samastaduḥkha śamanaṃ saṃsārārṇavatārakaṃ || 61 ||

yogetsmin samanuprāpte guro rājñā purassaraṃ |
snātvā mahoradhau nadyāṃ taḍādhe vā gṛhepi vā || 62 ||

samāpya naityakaṃ karma vidhivat saṃskṛte nale |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā vedamātrā ghṛtaṃ gavā || 63 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ śrīmadaṣṭāṇe nāthapāyasaṃ |
madhutritaya saṃyuktaṃ gavyājyena vimiśritaṃ || 64 ||

triśatādhika sāhasraṃ lakṣmīhṛdayavidyayā |
hutvātha bhagavadraśmi vidyābhirjuhuyādvataṃ || 65 ||

lalitārāśmividyābhirghṛtamekaikaśo hunet |
śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣaryā śatamaṣṭottaraṃ ghṛtaṃ || 66 ||

hutvā catuḥ śrīmanubhirhuneddvādaśādhā ghṛtaṃ |
suṃdarī bhagavadvidyayāṣṭā viṃśatidhāpyatha || 67 ||

hutvā japādibhirhutvā prāyaścittāhutī kramāt |
mahāvyāhṛtimirhutvā kṛtvā brahmārpaṇā hutiṃ || 68 ||

agniṃ pradakṣiṇī kṛtya svācārya caraṇadvayaṃ |
sādaraṃ praṇipatyātha svarṇālaṃkaraṇaiḥ śubhaiḥ || 69 ||

alaṃkṛtya tataḥ kāṃsyapātrekṣinākṣipya kāṃcana |
śatamānaṃ tadardhaṃ vā tadardhaṃ vā tadardhakaṃ || 70 ||

vittaśāṭhyaṃ parityajyaṃ datvācārya padābjayoḥ |
savatsāṃ sukuhukṣīrāṃ dadyādrāṃ ca payasvinīṃ || 71 ||

catuḥṣaṣṭhipalaṃ kāṃsyapātraṃ viṃśatyalaṃ tu vā |
navavastra samāyuktaṃ bhūṣaṇādibhiranvitaṃ || 72 ||

samarpayeduroḥ patnyai mahālakṣmīdhiyā śiva |
suvāsinīśca virpāśca yathā śaktyātha toṣayet || 73 ||

lakṣmīhṛdayavidyāyāḥ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarasya ca |
mahātripurasuṃdaryāḥ saṃdaryāḥ saṃsiddhiṃ prāśūyātparāṃ || 74 ||

alabhyerddhodaye prāpte yoge yadvā mahodaye |
itthaṃ kuryāt puraścaryāṃ vidhinānena sādhakaḥ || 75 ||

śatakratu phalaṃ samyaktuṃga dakṣiṇayānvitaṃ |
avāpya mahatīṃ lakṣmīpuraścryā śatodbhavāṃ || 76 ||

vimuktassarvapāpaudyaissarvadevamayo bhavet |
aiśvaryā rogyasaṃtānaiḥ kaśyaṣena samaprabhaḥ || 77 ||

avāmya mahadaiśvarya maṇimādi guṇānvitaṃ |
kulasāhasradvatya bhagavaddhāmni modate || 78 ||

advodaye ca saṃprāpte saṃprāpte vā mahodaye |
śaktaścet sarvadānāni dadyādviprebhya ādarāt || 79 ||

<p. 58a>

pāyasaṃ kāṃsyapātrasthaṃ viprāyāvaśya marpayet |
tiladhenuṃ dudhidhenuṃ guḍadhenumathāpi vā || 80 ||

kṣīragāmathavā dadyāt dvimukhīṃgāṃ sadakṣiṇāṃ |
dhanāḍhyo lavaṇādyādi giridānamathā caret || 81 ||

tulā hiraṇyagarbhādi dātānyapi samarpayet |
suvarṇaṃ raṃjitaṃgāṃ ca lavaṇaṃ ca tilānyapi || 82 ||

dadyādvāso guḍamapi grahaṇe ca mahodaye |
dānānyetāni viprebhyaḥ śrotriyebhyaḥ samarpayet || 83 ||

paladvayamitaṃ raupya pātraṃ palamitaṃ tu vā |
suvarṇaracitaṃ pātraṃ dhanāḍhyaścet samarpya ca || 84 ||

yāgadravyaṃ pradadyādyaḥ svācārya padapaṃkaje |
sahasraṃ triśataṃ vāpi śataṃ vā dvādaśadhikaṃ || 85 ||

mahodaye vā prahaṇe pradatvā sādhakottamaḥ |
yatpuṇyāṃ samavāpnoti tadvaktuṃ naiva śakyate || 86 ||

ācāryapādayugale nārāyaṇadhiyādhivaṃ |
sāṃgaṃ yāgadhanaṃ datvā kulakoṭi samanvitaḥ || 87 ||

avaśyaṃ bhagavaddhānni modate nātra saṃśayaḥ |
brāhmemuhūrte utthāya śrīśrīśādvādaśākṣarī || 88 ||

triśataṃ vāpi prajaptvāṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ |
raśmimālā manusmṛtya kṛtvā saṃdhyādikāḥ kriyāḥ || 89 ||

sahasraṃ prajapennityaṃ śrīnadaṣṭākṣaraṃ śubhaṃ |
atha paṃcaśataṃ cāpi japtvā vā triśataṃ śive || 90 ||

rājyalakṣmī mahāvidyāṃ śriyaḥ paṃcadaśārṇayā |
bhṛguvarā vrataṃ kurvan cakrarājaṃ samarcayat || 91 ||

dhaneśa surarājābhyāṃ sadṛśī macalāṃ śriyaṃ |
saṃprāpya ciramāyuṣyamārogyaṃ ca mahattaraṃ || 92 ||

kaṃdarpa sadṛśaḥ kāṃtyā vidyayā gurusannibhaḥ |
bhūtvā bhūpāla sānnidhye mānya ācāryavat sadā || 93 ||

prārthito bhūṣa kanyābhistaruṇībhiśca kāmavat |
putrapautrādi sahito bhogān divyāṃśca mānuṣāt || 94 ||

bhuktvā kāle varāṃte sau bhagavaddhāmniyodate |
yastu dvādaśa saṃkhyā kalakṣaṃ śrīhṛdayaṃ japet || 95 ||

kimane na dvijā preṇasādhyate na girīṃdraje |
ākāśagamanaṃ yogamaṣṭāṃgasahitaṃ śubhaṃ || 96 ||

aṇimādi guṇaiśvaryajāti smaraṇamakṣayaṃ |
ṛṣitvamatha siddhatvaṃ gaṃdharvatvaṃ ca yogitāṃ || 97 ||

devatvamatha rudratvaṃ prāpnoti brāhmatāmapi |
anenaiva śarīreṇa kaṃdarpa śatasannibhaḥ || 98 ||

ājaraścāmaro bhūtvā paṃcaviṃśātivārṣikaḥ |
tejomaya tanurdivya kanyābhiḥ prārthitonvahaṃ || 99 ||

śvetadvīpādi lokeṣu modate divyabhogavān |

ṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca ||

prasannalakṣmīvidyāyā dakṣiṇāmūrtināpurā || 100 ||

<p. 58b>

uktāni sādhanānītyaṃ bhaktānāṃ hitakāmyayā |
anyepi yogā atraiva pūrṇaśa samudīritāḥ || 101 ||

ekāmapi mahāvidyāṃ mahālakṣmyā imāṃ śuciḥ |
pratyahaṃ prajapan sākṣānnārāyaṇa ivāparaḥ || 102 ||

devavat pūjyate nityamihāmutrāpi sarvadā |
tadvaṃśe maṃdabhāgyo vā dāridro vā na jāyate || 103 ||

anvaya vyāpinī lakṣmīmācaṃdrārkaṃ mahattarā |
tadanvayeva satyeva satyaṃ satyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 104 ||

lakṣmīhṛdayavidyāyā iti sādhanamīritaṃ |
triśakti lakṣmīvidyāyāstato vakṣyāmi sādhanaṃ || 105 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye trayoviṃśodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 58b>

śrīdevyuvāca ||

prasannalakṣmīvidyāyā vidhānaṃ śrūtamādarāt |
triśaktilakṣmīvidyāyāvidhānaṃ vada sāṃ sāṃprataṃ || 1 ||

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

triśaktikamalāvidyāṃ pravakṣyāmi tataḥ śive |
yasyā vijñānataḥ sākṣānnārāyaṇamayaḥ pumān || 2 ||

vāṃtaṃ vahni samārūḍha miṃduvāmākṣi saṃyutaḥ |
ādyaṃ vījamiti proktaṃ vyoma vāmākṣi saṃyutaṃ || 3 ||

vahni viṃdu samāyuktaṃ dvitīyaṃ vījamudghṛtaṃ |
vyaṃjanāṣaṃ mahīyuktaṃ caturthasvara saṃyutaṃ || 4 ||

viṃdunā sahitaṃ vījaṃ tṛtīyāmidamīritaṃ |
triśaktyākhyā mahālakṣmīriyaṃ vidyā samīritā || 5 ||

lakṣmīgiriṃdrajā vāṇī rūpaiṣā sarvasiddhidā |
sarvapāpaudya saṃhartrī sarvapuṇya phalapradā || 6 ||

sarvavidyāmayī sarvatīrthakratu mayī parā |
brahmaviṣṇumaheśādyairapi nityamupāsitā || 7 ||

muktārala suvarṇādi vṛṣṭikatrī gṛhe satāṃ |
sāmrājyasiddhidā dharmavittakāma phalapradā || 8 ||

nityānaṃda sukhaprāpti hetu bhūtā sanātanī |
triśakti lakṣmyāṃ siddhāyāṃ nāsādhyaṃ trijarāt svapi || 9 ||

bhaktānāṃ nidhi pāleṃdraṃ rājyalakṣmī pradāyinī |
śrīdevyāḥ paścime bhāge mahāsiṃhāsaneśvari || 10 ||

ṛṣirasyāḥ samudiṣṭo brahmālokapit samahaḥ |
sammohana ṛṣirvāsyāḥ kathito brahmavittamaiḥ || 11 ||

chaṃdo gāyatramuddiṣṭaṃ yāṅchaṃdotha vā śive |
triśaktyākhyā mahālakṣmīrdevatā harivalābhā || 12 ||

jādyaṃ vījamiti proktaṃ śaktiḥ śrībhuvaneśvarī |
kīakaṃ kāmarājaṃ syādviniyogastu siddhaye || 13 ||

dvirāvṛtyā ṣaḍaṃgāni vīrajairevanyasedvudhaḥ |
sudhāṃbho nidhi madhyastharalaṃ dvīpe manohare || 14 ||

<p. 59a>

nave hemasphura bhūmau ratnakuḍimamaṃtraye |
pārijātavanāṃtasthe sarvatassamalaṃkṛte || 15 ||

mahāpadmāṭavī madhyaratnasiṃhāsane śubhaṃ |
nārāyaṇāṃ kanilayāṃ vidyutkoṭi samaprabhāṃ || 16 ||

taptakārta svarābhāsāṃ vālārka śatasannibhāṃ |
sphuradratnalasat svarṇakirīṭāvṛtamastakāṃ || 17 ||

ratnakaṃ kāṇake daśūgraiveyāṃgada śobhitāṃ |
vālī yugala tāṭaṃka svarṇa ciṃtākaṭaka hemakāṃcī guṇānvitāṃ || 20 ||

anekālakhacitanānā bhūṣaṇa bhūṣitāṃ |
kolāṃkuśābja yugalapāśacāpāni vibhraṃtī || 21 ||

cāru cāmara hastābhyāṃ sakhīnyāṃ pārśvayordvayoḥ |
vījyamānāṃ surastrībhirmāṇikyā daśaryāṇibhiḥ || 22 ||

tāṃvūlasahita svarṇapātra hastābhirāvṛtāṃ divyaratnamaya svacāmara 
hastābhyāṃ sakhībhyāṃ suvarṇapāda kaṭaka hemakāṃcī guṇānvitāṃ || 20 ||

anekaratnakhacita nānābhūṣaṇabhūṣitāṃ |
vālāṃkuśābja yugalapāśa cāpāni vibhratīṃ || 21 ||

cārucāmara hastābhyāṃ sakhībhyāṃ pārśvayordvayoḥ |
vījyamānāṃ surastrībhirmāṇikyā darśayāṇibhiḥ || 22 ||

tāṃvūlasahita svarṇapātra hastābhirāvṛttāṃ |
divyaratnamaya svarṇapeyaṃ hastābhirādarāt || 23 ||

niṣevitāṃ priyugalāṃ brahmarudrādi daivataiḥ |
saṃpūjita padāṃ nityaṃ bhaktatrāṇaṃ parāyaṇāṃ || 24 ||

mahālakṣmīṃ trijagatāṃ mātaraṃ parameśvrī |
trayīmayī mahaṃ vaṃdeśaraṇāgata vatsalāṃ || 25 ||

trisākhyāṃ mahālakṣmīmitthaṃ dhyātvā dine dine |
trisahasraṃ japedvidyāṃ sahasra dvitayaṃ tu vā || 26 ||

aṣṭottara sahasraṃ vā triśataṃ vā śataṃ tu vā |
aṣṭā viṃśatidhā vāpi japtvā siddhimavāpnuyāt || 27 ||

ṣaṭkoṇaṃ pūrvamālikhaṃ madhye vidyāṃ likhet sudhīḥ |
dvirāvṛtyā trivījāni koṇa ṣaṭke kramāllikhet || 28 ||

vāhye vasudalaṃ kuryā dīrgha svara vibhūṣita |
caturasraṃ caturdvāra bhūṣitaṃ maṃḍalaṃ likhet || 29 ||

śriyamāvāhayen madhyo vidyā metāṃ samuccaran |
upacāraissamārādhya tatoṃgāvaraṇaṃ yajet || 30 ||

pūrvat parameśāni parivārānathārcayet |
agrakoṇaṃ samārabhya mahālakṣmī hripriyāṃ || 31 ||

girijāśaṃkaraṃ paścādratiṃ kaṃdarpamapyatha |
ṣaṭkoṇa pārśvayugale śaṃkhapapranidhī yajet || 32 ||

aṣṭapatre maheśāni brāhmī māheśvarīṃ tathā |
kaumārī vaiṣṇuvīṃ paścādvarāhamadanāmatha || 33 ||

māheṃdrīmapi vā mutrā mahālakṣmī mataḥ paraṃ |
maheṃdrādyāḥ samaparvāścaturasrāṣṭadikṣvatha || 34 ||

<p. 59b>

triśaktirūpiṇīṃ lakṣmī nityama arghyasādhakaḥ |
vījatraya mahāvidyāṃ japet sarvājamṛddhaye || 35 ||

mahātripurasuṃdaryāḥ paścādbhāgetha vā śive |
cakrarāje samabhyarcya siddhimiṣṭāṃ vrajatyasau || 36 ||

samasta jagadādhāre caturvedātmake śubhe |
sarvepicorairādhya śrīdevīcakranāyake || 37 ||

trimūrtīnāṃ triśaktīnāṃ pratyahaṃ sāṃgamarcanāt |
avaśyaṃ phalamāpnoti cakrarājasya sannidhau || 38 ||

maṃkaṃcipi vā maṃtraṃ japtvā nityaṃ yata vrataḥ |
avaśyaṃ mahatīṃ siddhi prāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ || 39 ||

śrīcakrapūjā śrīdivyāḥ kṛyate yena nityaśaḥ |
brahmaviṣṇu maheśādyāḥ śakrādyāścadigīśvarāḥ || 40 ||

lakṣmīsarasvatīgaurī śacī muravyāśca śaktayaḥ |
sāṃgaṃ saṃpūjitātastuṣṭā bhavaṃti pratyahaṃ śive || 42 ||

śrīcakrapūjako nityaṃ sa cakrāt samarcayet upāsateyaḥ prādhānyādekamapya 
prasannamanutenārcanaṃ |
prakaṭīvyaṃ tatadyaṃtre girīṃdraje śrīcakra sannidhau vatrāṃtara nityaṃ samarcayet || 
43 ||

sarvadevamayī devī śrīdevīlalitāṃvikā |
sarvavidyāpīṭhamayaṃ śrīcakraṃ kathitaṃ vudhaiḥ || 44 ||

tasmādavaśyaṃ śrīpīṭhamarcaya pratyahaṃ śuciḥ |
samasta devatācāryāḥ sāṃgaṃ sukṛtamaśrute || 45 ||

itthamabhyarcya vidhinā triśaktiṃ harivallabhāṃ |
lakṣatrayaṃ japedvidyāṃ vijiteṃdriyamānasaḥ || 46 ||

daśāṃśaṃ tarpayeddhīmānyadyase kṣurasena vā |
daśāṃśaṃ kiṃśukairhutvā gavyājya trimadhulutaiḥ || 47 ||

datvā niṣkaśataṃ sāṃdraṃ vidyā siddhimavāpnuyāt |
makarastheravaumādye yadvārka dinamāditaḥ || 48 ||

paṃcaviṃśati sāhasramekādaśyaṃtamādarāt |
ekādaśyāṃ hunedājya madhutritayamiśritai || 49 ||

trisahasraṃ saṃskṛtegnau kamalairutpalaistu vā |
athavā vilvapatraiśca pāyasenātha vā hunet || 50 ||

varṣāśanamitaṃ dravyaṃ datvācārya padāṃvuje |
vidyāsiddhimavāpnoti nātra kāryā vicāraṇāṃ || 51 ||

sarvasammohanakarī mahāvāksiddhidāyinī |
aṇimādi guṇaiśvaryapradā pāpaudyabhejanī || 52 ||

triśakti lakṣmīvidyeyaṃ sarvarājavaśaṃkarī |
nābhidaghnajale sthitvā sūryamaṃḍalamavyaṇaṃ || 53 ||

sahasra tritayaṃ japtvā nityaṃ niyatamānasaḥ |
maṃḍalāṃtya dine sākṣān mahālakṣmīṃ prapaśyati || 54 ||

<p. 60a>

dhanadhānyādi saṃpūrṇāṃ gajāśvaratha saṃkulāṃ |
muktāralaughasahitāṃ saṃtati vyāpinīṃ śriyaṃ || 55 ||

tasmaidadātyavaśyaṃ sā lakṣmīrbhagavadanvitā |
tilairājyaplutairhutvā ṣadvahasraṃ yata vrataḥ || 56 ||

nirāmayaścirāyuḥ syādvigatāyurapi dhruvaṃ |
madhu tritapasammiśraṃ pāyasaṃ jvalitenale || 57 ||

sahasra paṃcakaṃ hutvā jvalite jātavedasi |
sarvavidyā nidhirayaṃ sarvaiśvarya nidhirbhavet || 58 ||

paurṇamāsyāṃ japitvā muṃsahasra tritayaṃ |
manuṃ pāyasaṃ juhuyādagnai triśataṃ trimadhuplutaṃ || 59 ||

gurupādābjayugale yatkiṃcidapi datvātha |
huta śiṣṭāśī tasyāṃ niśībharvadvratī || 60 ||

varṣatrayaṃ dvivarṣaṃ vā varṣamekamathāpi vā |
puraścaryā vratamidaṃ kṛtvā sādhaka puṃgavaḥ || 61 ||

śaṃkha yamādi nidhibhirmūrtimadbhirupasthitaiḥ |
sevyāte pratyarhasākṣāddha naralaughavarṣiḥ || 62 ||

ārābhyonnara nakṣatre śrīcakraṃ sāṃgamādarāt |
sahasra tritayaṃ japtvā triśataṃ juhuyādvrataṃ || 63 ||

paṃcamyāṃ viśadāṃ bhojairaṣṭottaraśataṃ hunet |
raktotpalairhunedagnau pūrṇimāyāṃ śatatrayaṃ || 64 ||

itthaṃ saṃvatsaraṃ kṛtvā puraścaryā vrataṃ vudhaḥ |
avāpya mahatīṃ lakṣmīṃ maheṃdra dhanadaprabhāṃ || 65 ||

kaṃdarpa samasaubhāgyamāyurogyamuttamaṃ |
avāpya sakalālokānnaranāru nṛpādikān || 66 ||

yāvajjīvaṃvaśī kuryāddavonapi narānkimu |
gaṃgāpravāhasadṛśīṃ vāgvibhūtimavāpyate || 67 ||

jīvanneva vimukto sau brahmasāyujya bhāgbhavet |
āśvine navarātre vā vāsaṃte vā samāhitaḥ || 68 ||

paṃcaviṃśati sāhasraṃ japtvā vidyāmimāṃ śriya |
mahāmadhamyāṃ jvalite vahnau madhughṛtaplutaṃ || 69 ||

sahasrutitayaṃ hutvā pāyasaṃ tilamiśrituṃ |
ācāryapatnīmācāryamabhyarcyā bharaṇīdibhiḥ || 70 ||

ācāryāyā vālmīki sadṛśo vidyābhirdhana saṃpadā || 71 ||

dhanadapratimo bhūtvā kāṃtyā madanasannibha || 72 ||

bhukteha vipulān bhogān dehāṃte yāti tatpadaṃ |
triśakti lakṣmīvidyāyāmeva bhaktiyutonvahaṃ || 73 ||

sahasra tritayaṃ jātvā sahasradvitayaṃ tu vā || 74 ||

triśatādhikāhasre japtvā yadvānvahaṃ śuciḥ || 74 ||

samastapāparāśibhyo vimukto bhāgya saṃpadāṃ || 75 ||

ādhārassarvavidyānāmapi pautra sukhānvitaḥ || 75 ||

<p. 60b>

avāpyātyaṃtaṇai bhāgyaṃ vaśīkṛtya jagattrayuṃ |
cirāyustyakalānbhogān bhuktvā divyāṃśca mānuṣān || 76 ||

dehāṃte paramaṃ dhāma yāti vikṣuṣṇossanātanaṃ |
triśakti lakṣmīmāhātmyamitite kathitaṃ mayā 
sāmrājyalakṣmīvidyāyāmāhātmyamatha vakṣyate ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye caturviṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 60b>

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

sāmrājya lakṣmīvidyāyā māhātmyaṃ girikanyake |
sarvārthasiddhidaṃ vakṣye samastaduritāyahaṃ || 1 ||

caṃdravījaṃ samuddhṛtyā vyomamādanamapyatha |
kṣamāvījaṃ śivavījaṃ ca vahni vāmākṣi maṃḍitaṃ || 2 ||

viṃva yuktaṃ varārohe sāmrājya śrīrūdīritā |
śrīruddheyaṃ mahāvidyā saptavarṇājvalocane || 3 ||

vicchūpāsita vidyeya mudak siṃhāsaneśvarī |
upāsakānāṃ sāmrājya śrīkarī bhuktimuktidā || 4 ||

mahāpātakarāśighrī mahādāridryabhedinī |
mahāsārasvatakarī mahāsaubhāgyasiddhidā || 5 ||

vauradarī śriyavādi śriyaṃ pakṣapaterapi |
dadyādrupāsakastheyaṃ bhūtale girikanyake || 6 ||

pūjitā sarvasaubhāgyadāyinī bhogasiddhidā |
prajaptā sakalābhīṣṭapradogdhī kāmadhugyathā || 7 ||

hutā sakala vā vittaddhikarī sarvasamṛddhidā |
dharmamarthaṃ ca kāmaṃ ca kaivayaṃ cāṇimādikaṃ || 8 ||

icchateyaṃ mahāvidyā japtavyāvaśyamādarāt |
ṛṣirnārāyaṇaḥ sākṣācchaṃdo gāyatramīritaṃ || 9 ||

trailokyamohinī sarvasāmrājyaphaladāyinī |
mahālakṣmī jaganmātā devatānna samīritā || 10 ||

vījaṃ kūṭaṃ samākhyātaṃ śaktiḥ śrīvījamucyate |
śriyā ṣaḍdīrghayutayā ṣaḍaṃgajanyā samācaret || 11 ||

kṣīrāṃbho nidhi madhyastha dvīpe maṇimaye śubhe |
saṃtāna pārijātā dikṣuradrumavanāvṛtte || 12 ||

adhastāt kalpavṛkṣasya pīṭhe svarṇamaye śubhe |
navamāṇikya khacite mukta vidrumabhūṣite || 13 ||

āsīnasya pareśasya śrīpateḥ paramātmanaḥ |
aṃkevāme samāsīnāmattasī kusumaprabhāṃ || 14 ||

nīlotpalanibhāṃ yadvā taptakānnakhira prabhāṃ |
vālāditya śataprakhyāṃ nānābhūṣaṇabhūṣitāṃ || 15 ||

divyapītāṃ varadharāṃ divyacaṃdana carcitāṃ |
sanāna pārijātādi pravyamālya virājitāṃ || 16 ||

<p. 61a>

śaṃkhacakragadāpadmaśārhavāṇa dharokaraiḥ |
abhayaṃ ca prayacchaṃtīvarā niṣṭāśca vibhratī || 17 ||

śriyamaṣṭabhujāṃ sākṣāt sarvasāmrājyanāyikāṃ |
cāmarādarśahastābhiḥ chatrahastābhirādarāt || 18 ||

sevitī surakanyābhiḥsmita pūrvābhibhāṣiṇīṃ |
śakrādi maulimāṇikya virājita padāṃvujāṃ || 19 ||

suṃdarībhiḥ surastrībhiḥ pārśvayoḥ samalaṃkṛtāṃ |
trayīmayīṃ mahālakṣmīṃbhaje siṃhāsaneśvarīṃ || 20 ||

samastasaṃpat sāmrājyanāyikāṃ śriyamīśvarīṃ |
dhyātvā saṃpūjya satataṃ cakrarāje manohare || 21 ||

śrīdevyāḥ sannidhau nityaṃ yajet sāmrājyanāyikī |
tatrā śaktotha yaṃtresminnarcayet sādhakottamaḥ || 22 ||

trikoṇamaṣṭakoṇaṃ ca caturasraṃ samālikhet |
catudvari samāyuktaṃ yaṃtraṃ sāmrājya siddhide || 23 ||

mūlavidyāṃ samuccārya mūrtiṃ saṃkalpya sādhakaḥ |
āvāhyopacaret sarvairupacārairmanoharaiḥ || 24 ||

pūrvavat pūjayeddevi ṣaḍagāvarāṃ tataḥ |
trikoṇa madhye sāmrājya śriya mamyacya sādaraṃ || 25 ||

koṇa trayetha sāvitrī gāyatrī ca sarasvatīṃ |
aṣṭadīrgha svarayutā brāhmyādyā aṣṭarmātaraḥ || 26 ||

mabhyarcyā aṣṭakoṇe bhaktānāṃ sarvasiddhidāḥ |
iṃdrādīnatha dikpālān caturasrāṣṭa dikṣvapi || 27 ||

abhyarcya pūjayet sarva sāmrājya śriyabhiṣṭadāṃ |
lakṣatrayaṃ puraścaryāt sāmrājya śrīphalāptaye || 28 ||

daśāśaṃtarpyayedvidvānnadhunāyapasāpi vā |
tadvaśāṃśaṃ hunedagnau kiṃjukairājyamiśritaiḥ || 29 ||

guravekṣiṇāṃtvā dhenudvādaśakaṃ śive |
maṃtrasiddhimavāpnoti labhate vāṃchitaphalaṃ || 30 ||

athavā navarātreṣu paṃcaviṃśat sadasrakaṃ |
japtvā palāśa kusumai rājya trimadhutolitaiḥ || 31 ||

hutvā sahasra tritayamācārya caraṇābjayoḥ |
samarthya dhenudaśākaṃ vidyāsiddhimavāpnuyāt || 32 ||

japtvā lakṣamimaṃtrīghṛta trimadhumiśritaiḥ |
hutvā raktāṃvujai ratnau sārvabaumau bhaveddhruvaṃ || 33 ||

ghṛtatrimadhusaṃmiśraṃ pāyasaṃ jvalitenale |
hutvā dvādaśa sāhasraṃ rājyalakṣmīmacaṃcalāṃ || 34 ||

āsādyaṃ maṃdabhāgyopi rājārājo bhaviṣyati |
sālibhirtudvato nityamaṣṭottara sahasrakaṃ || 35 ||

saptadvīpa samāyukta bhūpati ca manuttamaṃ |
avāpya maṃḍale nāsau dhanadena samo bhavet || 36 ||

sahasraṃ pratyahaṃ japtvā hutvā ghṛtamathośataṃ |
rājyaśriyamavāpnoti sarvavidyānivirbhavet || 37 ||

<p. 61b>

kadaṃvīka sumairhutvā daśāhaṃ sahasrakaṃ |
kaṃdarpa sadṛśaḥ kātyānaranārī nṛpādikān || 38 ||

yāvajjīvaṃ vaśīkuryā ūrdhva vā namarānapi |
kimatra vahunoktena savarmasmāda vāpnuyāt || 39 ||

naitayā sadṛśī kācidvidyāsti bhuvanatraye |
vidhānameta dvidyānāṃ caturṇāṃ kiṃcidīritaṃ |
śrotumicchasi kiṃbhūyo vadamaṣāṇavakṣubhe || 40 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye paṃcaviṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 61b>

śrīdevyuvāca ||

bhagavanyāḥ śriyo raśmimālā japyātvayeritā |
raśmimālābhidhaṃ sūktaṃ śriyaḥ pravūhime prabho || 1 ||

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi raśmimālāṃ śriyaḥ śive |
yasmāḥ smaraṇa mātreṇa nityaṃ prātassamāhitaḥ || 2 ||

samastapātakairmuktassarvasaubhāgyavān bhavet |
ādyā sakalavedānāṃ mātā sakalasiddhidā || 3 ||

abhayaṃkāra māheṃdrī dvitīyā ca samīritā |
sāvitrāṣṭākṣarī vidyā tṛtīyā kāṃtivarddhanī || 4 ||

praṇavākhyā mahāvidyā brahmasāyujya siddhidā |
tatasturīyagā patrī sāyujya phaladāyinī || 5 ||

cakṣuṣmatī tate vidyādūradṛṣṭi phalapradā |
gaṃdharvarājavidyāva vivāha phaladāyinī || 6 ||

yadhiyapadrura vidyā ca mārga saṃkaṭarakṣiṇī |
tatastārā mahāvidyā jalāyacchamanī smṛtā || 7 ||

nāmatraya mahāvidyāroga saṃghavibhedinī |
mahāgaṇeśavidyāva prayūhagaṇabhedinī || 8 ||

umāmaheśavidyātha samastābhīṣṭa siddhidā |
mṛtyuṃjaya daśārṇātha mṛtyubhīti nivāriṇī || 9 ||

tataḥ śrutadharīvidyā sarvavidyā phalapradā |
matṛkākhyā mahāvidyā sarvajñatva phalapradā || 10 ||

kāmeśvara mahāvidyā śivatādātmya siddhidā |
saṃpatsarasvatīvidyā mahāsaṃyatpradāyinī || 11 ||

kālasaṃkarṣiṇīvidyā dīrghā puṣpa phalapradā |
paraśaṃbhu mahāvidyā nityānaṃda sukhapradā || 12 ||

tataḥ parakalāvidyā mahāvāktiddhidāyinī tataḥ |
kumārikāvidyā samastepsitasiddhidā || 13 ||

annapūrṇābhidhāvidyā vahūnna phaladāyinī |
aśvārūṭhā mahāvidyā sarvalokavaśaṃkarī || 14 ||

tataḥ śrīpādukāvidyā śrīvidyāsiddhidāyinī |
śrīdevyā mūlaviyāthā samastaphalabhogadā || 15 ||

laghuśyāmā tato vidyā naranārī vaśaṃkarī |
vāgvādinī tato vidyā vācāṃ siddhikarī parā || 16 ||

<p. 62a>

nakulīnāmavidyātha sarvavidyā phalapradā |
śyāmalā pādukā paścāśyāmāvidyā phalapradā || 17 ||

rājaśyāmā tato vidyā manoratha phalapradā |
vidyātha laghu vārāhī sarvavairinikṛṃtanī || 18 ||

vidyātha svapravārtālī svapravakti śubhā śubhaṃ |
tiraskaraṇa vārāhī tiraskaraṇakāriṇi || 19 ||

vārtālī pādukā paścādvārtālī siddhidāyinī |
vidyātha rājavārtālī bhaktānu grahakāriṇī || 20 ||

atha śrīpūrtividyākhyā śrīkarī muktidāyinī |
mahatī pādukāpaścāccaturvarga phalapradā || 21 ||

ṣaḍvighnadevatāḥ paścācchriyo devyāḥ phalapradāḥ |
rājaśyāmā mahāvidyā vighnadevī tataḥ paraṃ || 22 ||

vighnaugha śamanī paścādvārtālī vighnadevatā |
raśmimāeti saṃproktā śrīdevyā sarvasiddhidā || 23||

etāsāṃ maṃtramālāṃ yaḥ prātaḥ prātardirnadine |
sakṛddhedhā tridhā vāpi yonusmati sādhakaḥ || 24 ||

sa sarvapātakaudyebhyo vimuktonu dinaṃ śive |
avāpya mahatīṃ lakṣmīṃ vāksiddhimatulāmapi || 25 ||

saubhāgyaṃ mahadā sādya bhuktvā bhogān yathepsitān |
brahmasāyujyamāpnoti dehāṃte nātra saṃśayaḥ || 26 ||

ekāmapi mahāvidyā matrayonudinaṃ japet |
sa mahābhāgyasīhitassamastābhīṣṭa bhāgbhavet || 27 ||

śrīdevī siddhikāmena raśmimālā dine dine |
sakṛt dvedhā tridhā vāpismartavyā sarvasiddhidā || 28 ||

vidyānāmatra sarvāsāṃ nāma mātraṃ prakāśitaṃ |
tatra taṃtreṣu munibhistattanmāhātmyamīritaṃ || 29 ||

etāssakalavidyāścarājñā eva samīritāḥ |
śrīdevyāssarva rājñitvādraśmibhūtasmṛtā imāḥ || 30 ||

śrīdevyupāsako nityaṃ cakrarājñārcanestaḥ |
raśmimālā manusmṛtya sakṛdvādhi dine dine || 31 ||

siddhiṃ sakalavidyānāṃ prāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
jagattriya sāmrājñī śrīdevī parameśvarī || 32 ||

yasya siddhā bhavat yasya nāsādhyaṃ jagatsvapi |
raśmimālā pradatāramācāryaṃ paramaṃ guru || 33 ||

sākṣādbrahmadhiyā nityamarcayennānyathā śive |
śrīdevī raśmimālāyāḥ pradātaivapi tāṃvikā || 34 ||

jyeṣṭhabhrātāpitṛpitā tatpitāpoṣakopi ca |
sa eva vaṃdhussasakhā sa ācāryo mahānguruḥ || 35 ||

sa eva dhātāipidyuśca sa eva parameśvaraḥ |
ityeva mavyā satataṃ raśmimālāpradaṃ guruṃ || 36 ||

ācāryamarcayeddhimān ralairarthairdine dine |
raśmimālā svarūpaṃte śriya uktaṃ karānate |
itaḥ paraṃ girisute kiṃ bhūyaḥ śrotumicchasi || 37 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye ṣaḍviṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 62b>

śrīsītālakṣmīrāmanārāyaṇābhyāṃ namaḥ || 

śrīdevyuvāca ||

bhagavateva deveśa sarvajña na gajīpate |
suguptamapi vededeṣupurāṇeṣva khileṣvapi || 1 ||

uktaṃ tvayā darānmahyaṃ sayāpi śrūtamādarāt |
sāṃprataṃ praṣṭumicchāmi hṛdaye kiṃcidastime || 2 ||

vedādhyayana hīnānāṃ brāhmaṇyaṃ na hi vidyate |
yāgānuṣvāna hīnāśca viprāḥ sādhāraṇāḥ smṛtāḥ || 3 ||

arthāva vodhanīnāye pāragāśca śrutau smṛtau |
tepi sādhāraṇāḥ proktā viprā vedavidopiva || 4 ||

saṃsāraṃ duḥkhabhūyiṣṭaṃkadupātaka saṃkulaṃ |
saṃprāpya na hi varttaṃta cehu janmaśatairapi || 5 ||

aṣṭārṇopāsanā proktā bhavasāgaratāriṇī |
tatrāpi raśmividyānīmālā sūkta mudīritaṃ || 6 ||

nyāsajālaṃ ca kathitaṃ cakrācaraṇapūjanaṃ |
śrīdevyuyāmanā proktā raśmimālā samanvitaḥ || 7 ||

śrīcakrārcana saṃyuktā bhavasāgaratāriṇī |
jaḍānāṃ madavuddhīnāṃ vidyāgrahaṇadhāraṇe || 8 ||

na śaktirvidyataideva kathaṃte vāṃgatiḥ parā |
vedādhyayana hīnīścayāgānuṣṭhānavarjitāḥ || 9 ||

vedārtha vodhahīnāśca teṣāṃ kāvāgatiḥ prabho |
saṃsārasāgarottārahe tu bhūtaṃ sanātanaṃ || 10 ||

caturṇāmapi vedānāṃ pārāyaṇaṃ phalapradaṃ |
vedārtha vodhaphalaṃ sarvakratu phalapradaṃ || 11 ||

śrīpradaṣṭārṇa vidyāyāḥ śrīdevadyāyāśca śamkara |
sāṃgānuṣṭhānajanita phaladaṃ smṛti mātrataḥ || 12 ||

asti ceddakṣiṇāmūrte tanmahyavaṃ darśakaraḥ |

śrīṛṣyaśṛṃga uvāca ||

ityukto girijā devyāśaṃkaro lokaśaṃkaraḥ || 13 ||

hitāya sarvalokānāṃ kathayāmāsa tatvataḥ |

śrīdakṣiṇāmūrtiruvāca ||

śṛṇuṣvā vahitā devi bhadre kalyāṇi suṃdari || 14 ||

tvayā pṛṣṭamidaṃ guptamapi vedeṣu saṃtataṃ |
kṛpayāte pravakṣyāmi rāmeṇa yadudīritaṃ || 15 ||

sāketanagare pūrvaṃ divyaprāsādaśobhite |
suramye maṃdire hemaratnaharya suśobhite || 16 ||

saṃtāna pārijātādiva na madhye manohare |
navaratnamaye svarṇa divyasiṃhāsane śubhe || 17 ||

āsīnaṃ jānakīnāthaṃ rāmaṃ dāśarathiṃ vibhuṃ |
kirīṭahārakeyūra kūṃḍalādi vibhūṣitaṃ || 18 ||

pītāṃvaradharaṃ śrīmatkaustubhodbhāsitorasaṃ |
smitavaktraṃ vijaśālākṣavīrāsana samāśritaṃ || 19 ||

<p. 63a>

kaṃdarpakoṭi lāvaṇyaṃ jānakyā sahitaṃ vidhuṃ |
saumitri bharatādyaiśca saṃsevita padāṃvujaṃ || 20 ||

āṃjanedyādikapibhissumaṃtrādyaṣṭa maṃtribhiḥ |
vaśiṣṭa vāmadevādyaissevitaṃ ca maharṣibhiḥ || 21 ||

abhiṣiktaṃ mahīpālairdivyālairakhilairapi |
līlā na dainarākṛti devaṃ trijagadrakṣaṇodyataṃ || 22 ||

draṣṭumabhyāyayau brahmātrijagatsvargakṛdvituḥ |
sanakādyairmahāyogināyavairmānasaissutaiḥ || 23 ||

marīci dakṣamukhyaiśca prajāpatibhirāvṛtaḥ |
vedairmūrtidharaissākṣādvāgdevyā ca samanvitaḥ || 24 ||

tamāgataṃ vidhātari vijñāya jagatīpatiḥ |
māyāmānuṣadehatvāt pratyutthāyārghyamādade || 25 ||

āliṃgito vidhātrātha divyaratnāsana śubhaṃ |
dadau hiraṇyagarbhāya putrebhyopi yathāktamaṃ || 26 ||

vaṃditotha vaśiṣṭādyai brahmaṣibhirakalmaṣaiḥ |
saumitri bharatādyaiśca vidhātā lokanāyakaḥ || 27 ||

tuṣṭāva jānakīnārtharāmaṃ dāśarathiṃ vibhuṃ |

brahmovāca ||

amūrtaṃ yatparadhāmanirguṇaṃ ca niraṃjanaṃ || 28 ||

satyānaṃdacidākāraṃtamaḥ pāre pratiṣṭhitaṃ |
vedāṃtavedyaṃ vimalaṃ paraṃbrahmeti kathyate || 29 ||

tatvameva jagannātha niviṣṭaṃ yadguhāsvapi svapi |
yadā pityātmakaṃ vahni caṃdrarūpaṃ sanātanaṃ || 30 ||

brahmaviṣṇuśivādīnāmapi kāraṇamadbhutaṃ |
trayīmayaṃ trayīvedyaṃ kāraṇaṃ jagato bhavān || 31 ||

sahasraśīrṣā puruṣassahasrākṣassahasrapāt |
virāṭ svarāṭvasaṃmrāddhatvame varadyunaṃdana || 32 ||

tava niścasitaṃ vedāvedāṃtā nikhilā api |
purāṇa dharmaśāstrāṇitvanuñjāvirbhavasuta || 33 ||

saṃsāratāraka brahmavācyaṃ ca praṇavenayat |
tatvameva mahāvāhoṣiśvarūpaṃ parātparaṃ || 34 ||

navaśaktiriyaṃ sītājaganmātā trayīmayī |
tvaṃ pitā sarvajagatāṃ svatassarvamidaṃ tataṃ || 35 ||

aṇiyā nṛṇuto pitvaṃ mahatopi mahānasi |
tvanmukhyādagniriṃdraśca caṃdramā manaso bhavat || 36 ||

tvannetrādudabhūddhānurghorāsīcchirasastava |
brāhmaṇāstvammukhājjātā vāhubhyāṃ kṣatriyāstathā || 37 ||

urūdbhavāstathā vaiśyā śūdrāḥ yabhyāmudīritāḥ |
ahaṃ tvannābhi saṃbhūto rudromanyu sadbhavaḥ || 38 ||

gauryādyāḥ śaktayassarvāstvacchat saṃśaya samudbhavāḥ |
vedā api ca vedāṃtā ahahaṃ rudropi devatāḥ || 39 ||

ṛṣayaśca mahābhāgā siddhā api jagatpate |
tavāyutāyuktaṃ śāṃśā māhātmyarmāya tatvataḥ || 40 ||

na vijānaṃti rājeṃdra kiṃ punamani vā bhuvi |
madyā śaṃkaraśakrādyairapi saṃprārthito bhavān || 41 ||

<p. 63b>

mānuṣākṛtimāśritya lokānāṃ hitakāraṇāt |
avatīrṇosi kauśalyāgarbhādaśārathānnṛpāt || 42 ||

varṇituṃ kena vāśavyaṃ guṇajālaṃ tava prabho |
rāmastvaṃ sarvalokānāmabhirāmosi bhūtale || 43 ||

yatrānaṃda cidākāret vadrūye sarvayoginaḥ |
ramaṃte satataṃ tasmādrāmosi brahmatūpadhṛt || 44 ||

nigrahāya ca duṣṭānāṃ śiṣṭānāṃ rakṣaṇāya ca |
satvaṃ dāśarathirbhūtvā koṭiśo rajanīcarān || 45 ||

hṛtvā samastalokānāṃ kṛtvā bhayanivāraṇaṃ |
ābhiṣiktosya yodhyāyāṃ śriyā devyā na yānvitaḥ || 46 ||

ādinārāyaṇassākṣābhūvān sarvagajatpatiḥ |
prasīda satataṃ mahyaṃ jānakīnāyaka prabho || 47 ||

savenānena saṃtuṣṭo bhagavān jānakīpatiḥ |
brahmāṇamavravīdvātmaṃdhātāraṃ parameśvaraḥ || 48 ||

śrībhagavānuvāca ||

kacitte kuśalaṃ brahmannavamargettapaśyati |
agnihotreṣutvatsuteṣu mahātmasu || 49 ||

samasta vedādhyayane yogepyaṣṭāṃga saṃyute |
kimarthamāgatositvaṃ putrairetairsyahātmabhiḥ || 50 ||

kiṃvābhīṣṭaṃ pradāsyāmitubhyaṃ brahmanvada prabho |
ittha bhagavatā brahmāpreritastapasāṃ nidhiḥ || 51 ||

uvāca vacanaṃ rāmaṃ paramātmā namacyutaṃ |

brahmovāca ||

eta siddhā mahābhāgāṃjita krodhā jiteṃdriyāḥ || 52 ||

mānasā mama putrāścasana kāyādigaṃ varāḥ |
devarṣayo nāradāyā vā lakhilyā api prabho || 53 ||

saṃśayaṃ paripṛcchaṃtimāṃ sarvajagato hitaṃ |
kratvanuṣṭhāna rahitā vadādhyayana varjitāḥ || 54 ||

agnihortrairvirahitāḥ śrautācāra vivarjitāḥ |
tiṣṭaṃti vahavo viprā aśakto api karmasu || 55 ||

daridrā kṛpaṇā mūḍhā dānadharma vivarjitāḥ |
eteṣāṃ narakānmuktiḥ kalpāṃtepi na vidyate || 56 ||

adhye tavyāḥ sadā vedā dharmaḥ kāryopi vaidikaḥ |
avaśyamapirtavyā yāgāssaṃpūrṇadakṣiṇāḥ || 57 ||

avaśyamapi deyāni dānānyapi mahītale |
abhyastavyo mahāyogo nityamaṣṭāṃga saṃyutaḥ || 58 ||

tīrthayātrāpi kartavyā srātavyaṃtīrya koṭiṣu |
saṃsāratārako pāyo bhavatyetaissu karmabhiḥ || 59 ||

kathaṃ saṃsāramagnā nāmaktānāṃ jagatpate |
saṃsāratāraṇopāyaḥ kathaṃ narakamocanaṃ || 60 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇāyā vāpi śriyaḥ paṃcadaśārṇayā |
ekana janmanā muktiruktā sarvaśrutiṣvapi || 61 ||

<p.  64a>

tatrāpi raśmimālākhya sūktamasti mahattaraṃ |
nyāsajālaṃ tathā pūjāsatra vākulyamastyapi || 62 ||

ekavidyopāsanayāyadyācārya kṛpāvaśāt |
dhrmārtha kāmamokṣādiyumarthāḥ sakalā api || 63 ||

sidhyaṃti cet mahābhāgaḥ tadebhyo vadame prabho |
guruśuśrūṣayā vidyā smaraṇādapi kevalaṃ || 64 ||

yadi kratu phalaṃ sidhye vedādhyayanataṃ phalaṃ |
saptakoṭi mahāmaṃtra puraścaryā phalaṃ tathā || 65 ||

yadi sidhyati viśveśa tādṛśīṃ sarvasiddhidāṃ |
rājavidyāṃ mama vrūhi matsutebhyaśca sādaraṃ || 66 ||

iti pṛṣṭastadā rāmo bhṛgavāniṃdirāpatiḥ |
tasmāra sarvasiddhānāmadhiyaṃ kapilaṃ vibhu || 67 ||

kardamasya sutaṃ sarvasiddhādhipati mucyate |
yogābhyāsarataṃ śāṃtaṃ jagatryā hitaiṣiṇaṃ || 68 ||

sāṃkhyācāryo mahāyogī tasya saṃsmṛti mātrataḥ |
tatrāgatastathaivāsau siddhayogi gaṇāvṛtaḥ || 69 ||

dvādaśāditya saṃkāśastayasāṃ nidhiracyutaḥ |
taṃdṛṣṭā vismitassarve sahasosthāya vāyatāḥ || 70 ||

praṇemussarvajgatāmadhiyaṃ kapilaṃ muniṃ |
jānukīyatinā tatra pādyārghyairap pūjitaḥ || 71 ||

sāṃkhyācāryo mahāyogī rāmaṃ prāha jagatpatiṃ |
jāhūtosmitvayā sākṣānnārāyaṇa raghūttama || 72 ||

tavaivāṃśa samudbhūtosmyahaṃ yogavidāṃvaraḥ |
kiṃ vaktavyaṃ mayā svāminnājñāpaya jagatpate || 73 ||

ityuktaḥ kapile nāsau rāmo dāśarathirvibhuḥ |
uvāca svāśa saṃbhūtaṃ kapilaṃ kardamātmanaṃ || 74 ||

śrībhagavānuvāca ||

bhavānnārāyaṇonaṃ tassarvajñaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
sarvayogavidācāryassarvalokahiterataḥ || 75 ||

sanakādyā mahābhāgā brahmaputrā yatavratāḥ |
pitāmahena sahitā atri bhṛtvādayopyamī || 76 ||

saṃśayaṃ paripṛcchaṃtimāṃ sarvajagatīpatiṃ |
ahaṃ mānuṣa yonistho rājāsanagatohaṃ || 77 ||

sarvajñassarvasiddhānāmapi yastvaṃ sanātanaḥ |
nārāyaṇosi vidyānāṃ hetu stvamasivrata || 78 ||

ha ahaṃ nopadiśāmyebhyo rājeṃdratvān mahāmate |
matsannidhau bhavānebhyaḥ kathaya svagururbhavān || 79 ||

ityukto bhagavānyogīrāmeṇa paramātmanā |
visyasya kiṃcisrovā ca rāmaṃ dāśarathiṃ vibhuṃ || 80 ||

<p. 64b>

śrīkapicārya uvāca ||

bhavānnārāyaṇo viṣṇuḥ sarvajñaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
ādi madhyāṃtarahi tassatyānaṃda cidātmakaḥ || 81 ||

saṃsāratārakassākṣādbrahmarūpī niraṃjana |
arūpo viśvarūpastvaṃ puruṣaḥ prakṛteḥ paraḥ || 81 ||

yogidhyeyo mahāyogī vidhivillīśasatarvṛt |
brahmaviṣṇu maheśānāmapyācāryo bhavānasi || 82 ||

māyāmānuṣa dehatvaṃ māsthāya jagatīpate |
dharmasaṃsthāpanārthyā paraghoranvaya saṃbhavaḥ || 83 ||

rājāsanagato sitvaṃ martya dharmamupāśritaḥ |
devatā ṛṣayassiddhāvayaṃ brahmādayopyamī || 84 ||

tvadājñā kiṃkarāḥ svāminnājñā cettavabhūpate |
tvadaśaṃ saṃbhavatvena sarvajñosmi sanātanaḥ || 85 ||

ājñayā tava rājeṃdraguptaṃ sarvaśrutiṣvapi |
etebhyo brahmaputrebhyo rahasyaṃ kathayāmyahaṃ || 86 ||

śrutvā bhagavato vāmaṃ brahmaputrā maharṣayaḥ |
saṃtuṣṭā vismitā bhūtvā praṇemuḥ kapilaṃ vibhuṃ || 87 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidyodaye saptaviṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 64b>

<p. 65a>

aśaktānāṃ daridrāṇāṃ maṃdānāṃ ca mahītale |
saṃsārataraṇoyāya ajāyāsādbhavennavā || 13 ||

ihāpi sarvasaubhāgyasaṃpattiḥ sakalepsitaṃ |
yadi sidhyatyanāyā sā tadupāyaṃvada svataḥ || 14 ||

ityamukto mahāyogī kapilo jagatāṃ yatiḥ |
sanakādīn mahābhāgānuvāca kapilaḥ prabhuḥ || 15 ||

śrīkapilācāya uvāca ||

samyak pṛṣṭaṃ mahābhāgā brahmaputrāstayodhanāḥ |
yūyaṃ sakalavidyānāṃ pāragā dīrghadarśinaḥ || 16 || 

ayaṃ sītāpatiḥsvāmī paramātmā jagatpatiḥ |
bhajadyamenaṃ saṃsāratāraka brahmasaṃjñitaṃ || 17 ||

pṛṣṭanārāyaṇaḥ svāmī mahāviṣṇu śriyaḥ patiḥ |
asya niśvasitaṃ vedāssa rahasyāssanātanāḥ || 18 ||

etardaśāṃśa saṃbhūtā prakṛtirjagadam.vikā |
etat kṛṭākṣaleśena viśvaṃ sarvamudetyapi || 19 ||

asya krodhāgnileśo na viśvaṃ sarvapralīyate |
guhāsu sarvabhūtānāṃ niviṣṭaḥ parameśvaraḥ || 20 ||

ādityamaṃḍalagataḥ kālasya janakopyasau |
vedānadhītya sakalā niṣṭāyāgan sa dakṣiṇān || 21 ||

maṃtrarājaṃ prajaptvāpi guruṃ saṃtosyasādaraṃ |
etatkaikarya sidhyartaṃ prārthayaṃti mahaṣvapiḥ || 22 ||

japahomādibhidonairyāgaissaṃpūrṇadakṣiṇaiḥ |
yoginaḥ prārthayaṃtyetatsāyujyaṃ sarvāsaiddhikhyaṃ || 23 ||

amūrta yatparaṃ brahmasatyānaṃdādi lakṣaṇaṃ |
mānuṣākṛti māyannaṃtadetaddrāmanāmakaṃ || 24 ||

vedyoyaṃ sakalaiderdarvedāṃtairakhilairapi |
ijyoyamakhilairyāgaissaṃpūrṇavaradakṣiṇaiḥ || 25 ||

dhyeyoyaṃ yoganiratairhṛdayāṃvuja madhyame |
ayaṃ vedamayo maṃtramūrtiryajñamayo vibhuḥ || 26 ||

gāyatrī pratipādyoyaṃ śrīmadaṣṭārṇa rūpadhṛt |
iyaṃ sīmā mahābhāgācicchaktiḥ śrīrudīritā || 27 ||

sarvavedota tatvajñaistrayī rūpā sanātanī |
etadaṃśāṃśa saṃbhūto brahmāyaṃ viśvasargakṛt || 28 ||

etakrodhāṃśa saṃbhūto rudrasaṃkarṣaṇātmakaḥ |
yajvāno dakṣiṇā yuktā vedādhyayana tatpurāḥ || 29 ||

etat kaiṃkaryā sidhyarthaṃ vāṃchatiratataṃ bhuvi |
adhītya sakalācedāniṣṭāpi sakalānkratūn || 30 ||

upāsanāṃ vinā brahmasāyujya nahi vidyate |
brahma tādātmya saṃsiddhi rācāryānugrahaṃ vinā || 31 ||

ācāryānujñayā brahmaparaṃ nārāyaṇātmakaṃ |
rāmābhidhaṃ mahat dhāma samupāsya vicakṣaṇāḥ || 32 ||

<p. 65b>

labhaṃte brahmasāyujyameke naiva hi janmanā |
puṇyaṃ pāpamiti proktaṃ dvividhaṃ karmabhūtale || 33 ||

svargasaukhyapradaṃ puṇyaṃ pāpaṃ naraka duḥkhada |
vedasyādhyayanaṃ puṇyaṃ vedānāmarthaciṃtanaṃ || 34 ||

śrutyuktācāra saṃpattistanniṣiddhasya varjanaṃ |
saṃpūrṇadakṣiṇā yuktaṃ yāgakarma phalapradaṃ || 35 ||

samastakalmaṣaghnaṃ ca svargenaṃta sukhapradaṃ |
japaḥ vaṃśakaravidyāyā vedamāturjayonvahaṃ || 36 ||

nivāsa hetussatyākhye loke nityasukhāpradaḥ |
śrīvidyāyā jayo nityaṃ brahmavidyā japonvahaṃ || 37 ||

mahāsaṃhārakālāṃtaṃ satyaloka sukhapradaḥ |
śrīmaṣṭārṇavidyāyānyāsa raśmi samanvitaṃ || 38 ||

japahomādikaṃ sāṃgaṃ vaikuṃṭhapurabhogadaṃ |
kṣīṇe samastayāyaudy vahujanmabhirjite || 39 ||

dharmeṣvevācalā vuddhirjāyate dvijapuṃgavāḥ || 40 ||

svakarmaniṣṭhaḥ śatajanmanoṃte dhātṛtva māpnoti |
tataḥ śivatvaṃ nārāyaṇāṃ yāsti ratobhyupaiti tataḥ || 41 ||

paraṃ śāśvatamacyutatvaṃ || 41 ||

brahmahā ca surāpāyīstepī ca gurutalpagaḥ |
tatsaṃyogīrti vikhyātāḥ paṃcapātakinastvamī || 42 ||

janakadyotha mātṛghnā bhrātṛghnogoghra eva ca |
viśvasta viṣadātā ca vālaghrogarbhapātakaḥ || 43 ||

strīghra ete samuddiṣṭā brahmaghnā eva dāruṇāḥ |
ekādaśasyurmadyāni tālajādīni bhūtale || 44 ||

surāsamāni proktāni tatyānānmadyayaḥ smṛtaḥ |
ācāryapatnī tatputrī svamātā svabhaginyapi || 45 ||

bhrātṛpatnī putrapatnī rājapatnī svaputrikā |
etāmātaradratyuktāstatsaṃgāduruttalyaṃgaḥ || 46 ||

cauryeṇayohare svarṇaṃ muktāratnādikaṃ dvijāḥ |
vidyācauryaṃ dukūlānāṃ cauryaṃsteyamudīritaṃ || 47 ||

brahmahatyā samānāni vakṣyāmi duritānyatha |
ācāryaniṃdā śravaṇaṃ svayamācārya dvaḍhyaṇaṃ  || 48 ||

ājñollaṃghana pretasya vidyācauryamataḥ paraṃ |
brahmahatyā samānisyuḥ pātakāni dvijottamāḥ || 49 ||

ityādi pāpa vāhulyaṃ vidyate śāstracoditaṃ |
ākalyaṃ narake duḥkhameteṣāṃ karmaṇāṃ phale || 50 ||

dharmaśāstreṣu yatproktaṃ bheṣajaṃ tanniyevartakaṃ |
tatkṛtvaiva vimuktaḥ syāt pāpebhyo nānyathā dvijā || 51 ||

nivṛttissarvapāpānāṃ yadā bhavati bhūtale |
tadaiva paramaṃ jñānamutyatsyati kalevare || 52 ||

ācāryakṛpayā śrīmadaṣṭākṣara japādibhiḥ |
utpatsyati mahahānamapavargapradāyakaṃ || 53 ||

<p. 66a>

atraivodāharaṃtī mamitihāsaṃ purātanaṃ |
pituḥ putrasya saṃvādaṃ pāpe kalvedvijṛrṣabhāḥ || 54 ||

brāhmarṇā bhārgavaḥ kaścit sutamāhamahāmatiḥ |
kṛto yanayanaṃ śāṃtaṃ sumatiṃ jaḍarūpiṇaṃ || 55 ||

vedānadhīṣvasumate yathānukramamāditaḥ |
guruśuśrūṣaṇa vyagro bhikṣānnakṛta bhojanaḥ || 56 ||

tato gāhastyamāśrityayāgāniṣṭā sadakṣiṇāt |
iṣṭamutpādayāpatyamāśrayethā vanaṃ tataḥ || 57 ||

bhavethāstvaṃ tato vatsaparibrāhmiṣparigrahaḥ |
evamāṣṭyasitahya yatra gatvā na śocati || 58 ||

śrīkapilācārya uvāca ||

ityeva mukto vahuśo jaḍavannāha kiṃcana |
pitāputrasu vahuśaḥ prāhaprītyā punaḥ punaḥ || 59 ||

iti pitrāsutaḥ snehāt pralobha madhurākṣaraṃ |
saṃcodya māno vahuśaḥ prahasyedamathāvravīt || 60 ||

tāta tadvraśobhyastaṃ yatva yādyopadiśyate |
tathaivānya niśāstrāṇi śilpāni vividhāni || 61 ||

janmanāmayutaṃ sāgraṃ mama smṛti yathaṃ gataṃ |
nirvedāḥ paritoyāścaye ca vṛdhnudayetathā || 62 ||

śatrumitrakalayāṇādi yogāssaṃgamāstathā |
mātaro vahudhā hṛṣāḥ pitaro vahavastathā || 63 ||

anubhūtāni duḥkhāni sukhāni ca sahasraśaḥ |
vādhavāhavaḥ prāptāḥ pitaraśca pṛthagvidhāḥ || 64 ||

viṇmūtrapichite strīṇāṃ tathākoṣṭhe mayoṣitaṃ |
garbhaduḥkhānyanekāni vālatve yovane tathā || 65 ||

vṛddhatveyānyavamānittani survāṇi saṃsmare |
brāhmaṇakṣatriyaviśāṃ śūdrāṇāṃ caiva yoniṣu || 66 ||

prataśca paśukīṭānāṃ mṛgāṇāmathapakṣiṇāṃ |
tathaiva rājabhṛtyānāṃ rājñāmāhavaśālināṃ || 67 ||

samutpannaśca geheṣu tathaivāvaraveśmasu |
bhṛtyatāṃdātatāṃ cāpi gatosmi vahuśo nṛṇāṃ || 68 ||

svāmitvamīśvaratvaṃ ca daridratvaṃ gatastathā |
hṛtaṃ mayāhṛtaṃ cānyairhatavānūdyātitastathā || 69 ||

dapta mamānyairanyebhyo mayā dattamanekaśāḥ |
pitṛmātṛsuta bhrātṛ kalatrādi kṛtena ca || 70 ||

hṛso sakṛttathādainya maśrudhautānanogataḥ |
itthayaṃ sāracakresmin bhramatānāta saṃkaṭe || 71 ||

jñānametanmayāprāpta mukti saṃsiddhi hetukaṃ |
vijñāte yatra sarvoyamṛgyayuḥ sāmasaṃjñitaḥ || 72 ||

kriyākalāpo viguṇo na samyak pratibhātime |
tasmādutyanna vodhesya vedaiḥ kiṃ me prayojane || 73 ||

<p. 66b>

ṣaṭprakārakriyā duḥkhasukhataṣṭaṃ rasaiḥ svayaṃ |
guṇaiśca varjitaṃ brahman tatmākṣyāmi paraṃ padaṃ || 74 ||

rasatarṣabhayodvega harṣānanyajavāgurā |
vijñātānya mṛgagrāhī saṃgapāśa śatākulā || 75 ||

tasmādyāsyāsya hṛtā tatyatkaimaṃ duḥkhasannidhiṃ |
trayī dharmamadharmākhyaṃ kiṃ pākaphalasannibhaḥ || 76 ||

tasya tadvacane śrūtvā harṣavismayagadgadaḥ |
pitā prāha mahābhāgaṃ svasutaṃ hṛṣṭamānasaḥ || 77 ||

kimetadbhāṣase vatsakutaste jñāna saṃbhavaḥ |
kena teja utā pūrvamidānīṃ ca prabuddhatā || 78 ||

kiṃtu śāpa vikāroyaṃ munideva kṛtastava |
yatte jñāṃtiro bhūtamāvirbhāvamupāgataṃ || 79 ||

putra uvāca ||

jṛṇutāta yathā vṛttaṃ mame daṃḍa sukhaṃ duḥkhadaṃ |
yaścā hṛmā samanyasmin janmanyasmāt yasmāt yasra tat || 80 ||

ahamāsaṃ purā vipronyastātmā paramātmani |
ātmaniṣṭhā vicāreṣu yaniṣṭhāṃ parāṃgataḥ || 81 ||

satataṃ yogayuktasya satatābhyāsa saṃgamāt |
satsaṃyogāt satsvabhāvā dvicāraṇā gati vodhanāt || 82 ||

tasminneva parāmītirmamāsīdyuṃ tataḥ pare |
ācāryatī ca saṃprāptaḥ śiṣyasaṃdehahṛttamaḥ || 83 ||

tataḥ kālena mahatā roga saṃpīḍito bhṛśaṃ |
athāyāto prahāyogī sākṣācchiṣyo vivasvataḥ || 84 ||

yājñavalkya iti proktessarvayoga vidāṃvaraḥ |
tadṛṣṭvā tithimāyāṃtaṃ yājñavalkyaṃ mahāmati || 85 ||

dattavānarghya pādyādi rogasaṃpīḍitopyahaṃ |
brahmasāyujya sidhyarthaṃ yācāṃ ca kṛtavānahaṃ || 86 ||

dhanadhānyādikaṃ vastu dāsīdāsādikaṃ tathā |
gomahiṣyādikaṃ muktāralarāśiṃ gṛhe sthitaṃ || 87 ||

tatpādābjaṃ nivedyāhaṃ brahmadarśana siddhidaṃ |
viyājñānaṃ mama vrūhītyevaṃ prārthitavānahaṃ || 88 ||

tatonugṛhya bhagavān yājñavalkyo mahāmuniḥ |
rājarājeśvarīṃ vidyāṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇīṃ parāṃ || 89 ||

dattavānme mahāyogī bhagavatya dahetukīṃ |
tāmevānusmaran vidyāṃ taddine pārameśvarīṃ || 90 ||

ekāṃ tatvamupāgatyuttāmevānusmaran |
hṛdi ajñātāniṣṭa sadbhāvo vipannaśca prasādataḥ || 91 ||

ekāhni rājavidyāyāḥ smaraṇādgurupūjanāt |
utkrāṃti kālādārabhya smṛti lopo name bhavat || 92 ||

yāvadadyā yutaṃ caiva janmanāṃ smṛtimāgataṃ |
pūrvābhyāse na tenaiva sāhaṃtāta jiteṃdriyaḥ || 93 ||

yatiṣyāmi tathā kartuṃ na bhaviṣye yathā punaḥ |
jñānadāna phalaṃ hyeta ghṛjjāti smaraṇaṃ mama || 94 ||

<p. 67a>

nahye tatmādhyatenā tatrayī dharmāśritairnaraiḥ |
sohaṃ pūrvāśramā devabhiṣṭhā dharmamupāgataḥ || 95 ||

tameva gurumācāryasmarāmi sattamaṃ hṛdi |
ekāṃtatvamupāśritya yatiṣyāmyātmamokṣaṇe || 96 ||

tatraivāhaṃ gamiṣyāmi yatra yogī gururmama |
tadvrūhitvaṃ mahābhāgatyaṃ yatesaṃśaṃśamitaṃ hṛdi || 97 ||

etāvatāpite prīti mutyāyān rāghamāmuyāṃ || 98 ||

pitā prāha tataḥ putraṃ śradadhānaśca tadvacaḥ |
bhavatā yadvayaṃṣṭāssaṃsāragahanāśrayaṃ || 99 ||

putra uvāca ||

śṛṇutāta yathāhye tadanu bhūtaṃ mayā sakṛt |
saṃsāracakra sataraṃ sthitiryatra na vidyate || 100 ||

sohaṃ vadāmite sarvaṃ tavaivānujñayāpitaḥ |
utkrāṃti kālādārabhyathā nānyo vadiṣyati || 101 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge rājarājavidyāmāhātmye aṣṭāviṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||

<p. 67a>

putra uvāca ||

śṛṇu tāta mayaivānya janmanāmayute purā |
anubhūtaṃ mahat karmaphalaṃ vakṣyāmi tacchṛṇu || 1 ||

uṣmā prakupitaḥ kāye tīvravāyu samanvitaḥ |
bhinatri marmasthānāni dīvyamānoniriṃdhanaḥ || 2 ||

udānonāma yavatastatakruddhaṃ pravartate |
bhuktānāmaṃvu bhakṣāṇā madhogati nirodhakṛt || 3 ||

tato yenāṃ vudānāni kṛtānyannaśa'sāstathā |
dattāssatasyāmāhlādamāyadi pratipadyate || 4 ||

annāni yena dattāni śraddhā pūtena cetasā |
soti tṛpti mavāpnoti vināpyannena vai tadā || 5 ||

yenānṛtāni noktāni prīti bhedaḥ kṛto na ca |
āstikaḥ śraddhadānaśca sa sukhaṃ mṛtyumṛcchati || 6 ||

devabrāhmaṇapūjāsu niratā yena rūpakāḥ |
śuklā vadāmyāhrī maṃtaste narāssukhamṛtyavaḥ || 7 ||

yo na kāmānnasaraṃbhānna dveṣāddharmamutsṛjet |
yathoktakārī saumyaśca sa sukhaṃ mṛtyumacchati || 8 ||

āgāra dāhnio dāhaṃ kṣudhaṃ cānannadāyinaḥ |
prāpnuvaṃti narāḥ kāle tasmin mṛtyāvupasthite || 9 ||

śīte nayāti jaladāstāpenodakadvaṣiṇaḥ |
prāṇighnā vedanāṃ kaṣṭāṃyenye codvega kāriṇaḥ || 10 ||

mohaṃ jñāna prahartārastamaścālokahāriṇaḥ |
kūṭasākṣī mṛṣāvādī āśāsyānanuśāstiyaḥ || 11 ||

<p. 67b>

temo hṛmatyavaḥ sarve tathā vai vedaniṃdakāḥ |
vibhīṣaṇāḥ pūtigaṃdhāḥ kūṭamuharapāṇayaḥ || 12 ||

āgacchaṃti durātmāno yamasya puruṣāstathā |
prāteṣu kūpathaṃ teṣu jāyate tasyavpathuḥ || 13 ||

kramatyavi etaṃ sotha bhrātṛmātṛsutān smaran |
sāsya vāgasphuṭā tata ekavarṇā vibhāvyate || 14 ||

dṛṣṭirvibhrāmyate trāsācchvāsācchuṣyati cānanaṃ |
tatassavedanāviṣṭastaccharīraṃ vimuṃcati || 15 ||

vāyvagnasāritadrūpe dehamanyatma padyate |
tatkarma japātanotthaṃ samātṛtṛ saṃbhave || 16 ||

tatprayāṇavayovasthā saṃsthānaṃ prāgbhavṛṃyathā |
tatodvatāyamasyāśupāśairvadhvāti dāruṇaiḥ || 17 ||

daṃḍa prahāra saṃbhrāṃtaṃ karṣaṃte dakṣiṇāṃ diśaṃ |
kuśakaṃṭaka valmīkaśaṃku pāṣāṇakarkaśe || 18 ||

tathā pradīpta jvalane kvacicchabhraśatotkaṭe |
pradīptāditya tapte ca datvamānastadaṃ śubhiḥ || 19 ||

kṛṣyateyamadvataiścakṣi vā sannādabhīṣaṇe |
vikṛṣyamāṇastairdyorai bhakṣyamāṇaḥ śivāśataiḥ || 20 ||

prayāti doruṇe mārge pāpakarmāyamālayaṃ |
chatroyānat pradātmaroye ca veśma pradā narāḥ || 21 ||

teyāṃti manujā mārgaṃ sukhe naiva tathānnadaḥ | 
evaṃ kṛśānanu bhavannavaśaḥ pāpapīḍitaḥ || 22 ||

nīyate dvādaśāhena dharmarājapuraṃ naraḥ |
kalevare dahyamāne mahāṃtaṃ dāhamṛcchati || 23 ||

bhakṣyamāṇe tathaivāticchidyamāne sudāruṇe |
sidyamāneṣya virataṃ jaṃturduḥkhamupāśrute || 24 ||

kheva karma vipākenūhehāṃtaragatopi san |
tatra yadvāṃ dhavāstoyaṃ prayacchaṃti tilaissaha || 25 ||

yacchadṛpiṃḍaṃ prayacchaṃti nīyamātastadattiḥ |
tailābhyaṃgaṃ vāṃdhavānāmaṃga saṃvāhanaṃ ca yat || 26 ||

tena cāpyāyata jaṃturyacca śraṃti svadhāṃdhavāḥ |
bhūmau svapadbhirnātyartha kleśamāpnoti vāṃdhavaiḥ || 27 ||

dānaṃdadadbhiśca tathā jaṃturāpyāyate mṛtaḥ |
tasmādannāni deyāni pretatṛptyārthamādarāt || 28 ||

mobhūhirāya vastrādīnyātmaśatmanusārataḥ |
nīyamānaḥ svavaṃgohaṃ dvādaśāhaṃ sa paśyati || 29 ||

upabhūṅkte tathā dattaṃ toyaṃ piṃḍādikaṃ bhuvi |
dvādaśāhāt paraṃ ghoraṃ vāya saṃbhīṣaṇā kṛtiṃ || 30 ||

yāmyaṃ paśyatyatho jaṃtuḥ kreṣyamāṇa itastataḥ |
gattamātrātirakākṣaṃ bhinnāṃjana samaprabhaṃ || 31 ||

mṛtyukālāṃta kādīnāṃ madhye paśyatyasaupamaṃ |
daṃṣṭrā karālavadanaṃ bhrukuṭī kuṭilākṛtiṃ || 32 ||

virūpairbhayaṇairvaktrairvṛtavyādhi śatairapi |
daṃḍāsakta mahāvāhuṃ pāśahastaṃ su bhairavaṃ || 33 ||

<p. 68a>

tatrirdiṣṭāṃ tato yāti gatiṃ jaṃtuḥ śubhāśubhāṃ |
raurave kūṭasākṣī tu yāti paścānṛto naraḥ || 34 ||

tasya svarūpaṃ vadato rauravasya niśāmaya |
yojanānāṃ sahasredve rauravopi pramāṇataḥ || 35 ||

jānumātrāmāṇa ca tatraśvabhraṃsudutadaṃ |
tatrāṃgāra cayopetaṃ kṛtaṃ cadvaraṇī samaṃ || 36 ||

jvalatā cāti tīvreṇa tāpitāṃ varabhūminā |
tanmadhye pāpakarmāṇaṃ vimuṃcaṃti yamānugāḥ || 37 ||

sadahyamānastīvreṇa vahninā tena dhāvatti |
padeṣade ca pādosyaśīryate jāyate punaḥ || 38 ||

ahorātreṇodvaraṇaṃ pādayośca sa gacchati |
evaṃ sahasraṃ vistīrṇaṃ yojajanānāṃ vimucyate || 39 ||

tatonyat pāpaśudhyarthaṃ tādṛdrirayamṛcchati |
tataḥ sarveṣu nistīrṇaḥ pāpītiryakṛmaśrute || 40 ||

krimikīṭapataṃgeṣuśvāpadaikaśakādiṣu |
gatvādumagajādyeṣu gośvaśveṣu tathaiva ca || 41 ||

anyāsu caiva pāpāsu duḥkhadāsu ca yoniṣu |
mānuṣyaṃ prāpya kubjo vā kutsito vāmanopi vā || 42 ||

caṃḍātvapulkasodyāsu naro yoniṣu jāyate |
avaśiṣṭena pāpena puṇyena ca samanvitaḥ || 44 ||

tataḥ śubhatarāṃjātiṃ labhate tadanaṃtarāṃ |
tataścārohiṇīṃ yoniṃ śūdravaiśyatṛvādikāṃ || 45 ||

vipradeveṃdratāṃ cāpi kvadācidava rohiṇī |
evaṃ hi pāpakarmāṇo narakeṣu yataṃtyadhaḥ || 46 ||

yathā puṇyakṛtoyāṃti tanmenigattataḥ śṛṇu |
teya mena vinirdiṣṭā yāṃti puṇyāṃ gatiṃ narāḥ || 47 ||

pragīta gaṃdharvagaṇāḥ  pranṛttāpsarasāgaṇāḥ |
hāranūpuramādhuryaśobhitānya malāni ca || 48 ||

prayāṃtyāśu vimānāni divyagaṃdhasra ujvalāḥ |
tessācca pracyutā rājñā manyeṣā ca mahātmanaṃ || 49 ||

jāyaṃte nīrūjāṃge he sadvṛta paripālakāḥ |
bhogān saṃprāsuvaṃtyagryāt tathāyāṃtyūrddhamanyathā || 50 ||

avarohiṇīṃ vā saṃprāpya pūrvavadyāṃti mānavāḥ |
etatte sarvamākhyātaṃ yathā jaṃturvipadyate || 51 ||

tataḥ śṛṇuṣva viprarṣe yathā garbhaṃ prayātyasau |
niṣekemāna vastrīṇāṃ vīje prāpte rajasyatha || 52 ||

vimuktamātro narakāṃt svargādvāpi prapadyate |
nāmisūle tataḥ sthairyaṃ yāti vījadvayaṃ hhi tat || 53 ||

kalalatvaṃ vuddhudatvaṃ ca tṛpaṃśitvameva ca |
peśyāṃ yathāṇu vījasya aṃvurastadva ucyate || 54 ||

aṃgānāṃ ca tatotpattiḥ paṃcānāmanubhāgaśaḥ |
auyogānyaṃgulīnetranāsāsya śraṇāni ca || 55 ||

<p. 68b>

prarohaṃ yāṃti cāṃgebhyastadvattebhyo nakhālakāḥ |
tvagamyo romāṇi jāsaṃte keśāścaiva tataḥ paraṃ || 56 ||

sa samaṃdvaddhimāyāti tenaivodbhavakośakaṃ |
nārikela phalayaṃ itsakośaṃ vṛddhimṛcchati || 57 ||

tadvat prayātyasau vṛddhiṃ sakośodho mukhasthitaḥ |
taletu jānu pārśvābhyāṃ varayornyasyavarddhate || 58 ||

aṃguṣṭhāvu parinyasya jānvohayetalāṃgulīḥ |
jānupṛṣṭhe tathā netre jānumadhye ca nāsikā || 59 ||

sijau pārśvadvayasthau ca vāhūrjadyā vahiḥ sthitau |
eva mṛddhiṃ kramādyāti jaṃtu strīgarbhasaṃsthitaḥ || 60 ||

apṛnya satvodare jaṃturyathā rūpaṃ tathāsthitaḥ |
kāṭhinyamagnināyāti bhuktapīte na jīvati || 61 ||

puṇyāpuṇyāśayamayī sthitirjaṃtaustathodare |
nāḍī cāpyāpinī nāmanābhyāṃtasya nivadhyate || 62 ||

strīṇāṃ tathāṃtassucciresāniradvoya jāyate |
krāmaṃti bhuktapītāni strīṇā garbhodare tayā || 63 ||

tairapyāpita dehosau jaṃturvṛddhimupaitivai |
sthitiṃ tatra prayāṃtyasya vasvaḥ saṃsārabhūmayaḥ || 64 ||

tāmirnirṣedamāyāti pīdryamāna itastataḥ |
punanairva kariṣyāmi muktamātra ihodarāt || 65 ||

tathā tathā kariṣyāmi garbhaṃ nāpsyāmyahaṃ yathā |
śaṃkhacakragadāpāṇiṃ pītavā sa samacyutaṃ || 66 ||

nārāyaṇaṃ nahātmānaṃ sargasthitilayādhiyaṃ |
ciṃtayabhavaduḥkhaudyādbhaviṣyāmi vimocitaḥ || 67 ||

iti ciṃtayate smṛtvā jaṃturduḥkha śatāni vai |
yāni pūrdhānu bhūtāni daivabhūtātmakāni vai || 68 ||

tataḥ kālakramājjaṃtuḥ parivartatyadhomukhaḥ |
bhavamedaśameṣāpi māsi saṃjāyate tataḥ || 69 ||

niṣkrāmyamāṇo vā tena prājāpatyena pīḍyate |
niṣkampate ca vilayan tadā duḥkhena pīḍitaḥ || 70 ||

niṣkrāṃtaścodarān mūrchā saptāṃ pratipadyate |
prāpnoti cetanāṃ vāsau vāyusparśāyute punaḥ || 71 ||

tataśca vaiṣṇavī māyā samāskaṃdati mohinī |
tapāṣi mohitātmāsau jñānabhraṃśamavāpnute || 72 ||

bhraṣṭājñāno vā labhāvaṃ tato jaṃtuḥ prapadyate |
rudanmatkuṇavādhādi pīḍito bhṛśamāturaḥ || 73 ||

tataḥ kaumārakāvasthāṃtāruṇyamapi caṃcalaṃ |
prāpya kāmāturo nityaṃ taruṇī saṃgalolupaḥ || 74 ||

na pāralaukikaṃ dharmaṃ manasāpi smaratyasau |
vṛddhatāmapi saṃprāpya śleṣmavānādipīḍitaḥ || 75 ||

śūtvā mṛtyumavāpnoti punarjanma punarmṛti tataḥ |
saṃsāracakresminnāmyate ghāṭī yaṃtravat || 76 ||

<p. 69a>

kadācit svargamāpnoti kadācinnirayaṃ tathā |
svargaṃ ca bharakaṃ caiva kadācidvayamaśrute || 77 ||

kadācidatraiva punarjātaḥ svakarma vā śrute |
kadācidvyutakarmā ca itaḥ svalpena gacchati || 78 ||

kadāciddalpaiśca tato jāyateva śubhāśubhaiḥ |
svargaloke ca narake bhukta prāyairdvijottamai || 79 ||

narakeṣu mahaduḥkhameta yatsvargavāsinaḥ |
dṛśyaṃte tātamodaṃtaḥ pātya mānaistu nārakaiḥ || 80 ||

svargepi duḥkhamattulayadārohaṇa kālataḥ |
prabhṛtyahaṃ patiṣyāmītye tanmanasi vartate || 81 ||

narakāṃścaiva saṃprekṣya mahaduḥkhamavāpyate |
etāṃ yati mahagaṃtetyaharniśa manirvṛtaḥ || 82 ||

garbhavāse mahaduḥkhaṃ jāyamānasya cādhikaṃ |
jātasya vā labhāve ca vṛddhatve duḥkhameva ca || 83 ||

bhakāme darṣyā krodha saṃvaṃdhe yauvane duḥkhamuttamaṃ |
duḥkhaprāyāvṛddhatā ca maraṇo duḥkhamuttamaṃ || 84 ||

kṛṣyamāṇasya yāmyaiśca narakeṣu ca yātyataḥ |
punaśca garbhe janmātha maraṇaṃ narakaṃ tathā || 85 ||

itthaṃ saṃsāra cakresmin jaṃtavorghāṭī yaṃtravat |
bhrāmyaṃte prākṛtairvaṃdhairvaddhvāvatyaṃticā sakṛt || 86 ||

nāstitāta sukhaṃ kiṃcidatra duḥkhaśatākule |
evaṃ mokṣāya yatatā kathaṃ sevyā trayī mayī || 87 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvārahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge rājarājavidyāmāhātmye ekonatriṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||

<p. 69a>

pitovāca ||

sādhuvatsatvayā rūpātaṃ saṃsāragahanaṃ paraṃ |
jñānapradāna saṃbhūtaṃ samāśrityu mahatphalaṃ || 1 ||

tatrate narakāssarve yathā vai rauravastathā |
varṇitastanmahācakṣye vistareṇa mahāmate || 2 ||

putra uvāca ||

rauravaste samākhyātaḥ prathamaṃ narako mayā |
mahārauravasaṃjñaṃ tu śṛṇuṣva narakaṃ pitaḥ || 3 ||

yojanānāṃ catuḥpaṃca sahasrāṇi samaṃ tataḥ |
tatra tāmramayī bhūmiradhastasyā hutāśanaḥ || 4 ||

tannāya saptā sā sarvāprodyadvidyutyu prabhā |
vibhāsyati mahāraudrādarśana sparśanādiṣu || 5 ||

vasyāṃ vaddhaḥ karābhyāṃ ca yamyāṃ caiva mānugaiḥ |
mucyate pāpakṛnmadhye luṭhasānassa gacchati || 6 ||

kākairvakairvṛkolūkairvṛścikairmaśakaistathā |
bhakṣamāṇastathāgṛdhraidaṃtāmārge vikṛṣyate || 7 ||

dahyamānaḥ pitarmātarbhrātastānetidhākulaḥ |
vadatya sakṛdudvignonaśāṃtimupagacchati || 8 ||

evaṃ kasmānnarairmokṣaḥ kuśaṃ bhrāṃtaira vāpyate |
varṣāyutāyuta pāpayaiḥ kṛtaṃ duṣṭavuddhibhiḥ || 9 ||

tathānyastutamonāmasoti śītaḥ svabhāvataḥ |
mahārauravavaddīrghastathāṃdhamahasāvṛtaḥ || 10 ||

<p. 69b>

śītārtāstatradhāvaṃti narāstamasiddhāruṇe |
paraspadaṃ samāsādya parirabhyāśrayaṃti || 11 ||

daṃtāsteṣyaṃ ca bhakṣyaṃte śītātharti paripīḍitāḥ |
kṣudraṣṇāti valodignāstathā cānyepyupa ivāḥ || 12 ||

himakhaṃḍa vaho vāyurbhinatyasthīti dāruṇaḥ |
majjāsṛgālitaṃ tasmādaśraṃte cakṣudhānvitāḥ || 13 ||

asahyamānā bhrāmyaṃte yadastpara samāgame |
evaṃ tatrāpi sumahākleśastamasi mānavaiḥ || 14 ||

prāpyate brāhmaṇa śreṣṭhayā vaduḥkṛta saṃkṣayaḥ |
nikṛṃta iti khyātastatonyo narakottamaḥ || 15 ||

tasmin kulāla cakrāṇi bhramaṃtya virataṃ tataḥ |
teṣvāropya nikṛsyaṃte kālasūtrenamānavāḥ || 16 ||

yamānugānāṃ hastena āpādatalamastakaṃ |
na teṣāṃ jīvita bhraṃśo jayate dvijasattama || 17 ||

citrāni teṣāṃ śataśaḥ khaṃḍāṃsyaikyaṃ vrajaṃtyapi |
evaṃ vārṣa sahasrāṇi bhrāmyaṃte pāpakarmiṇaḥ || 18 ||

tāvadyāvada śeṣaṃ vai tatpāpaṃ saṃkṣayaṃ gataṃ |
apratiṣṭhaṃ ca narakaṃ śṛṇuṣvagadato mama || 19 ||

yatrasthai narikairduḥkhamasahyamanubhūyate |
tānyeva tatra cakrāṇi ghaṭī yaṃtrāṇi cāpyuta || 20 ||

dukhasya hetu bhūtāni pāpakarmakṛtāṃ nṛṇāṃ |
cakreṣvā ropitāḥ kecidbhrāmyaṃte tatra mānavāḥ || 21 ||

yāvadvarṣa sahasrāṇi na teṣāṃ sthitiṃ ratarā ghaṭī |
yaṃtreṣu caivānyevadvāstoya ghaṭī yathā || 22 ||

bhrāmyaṃte mānavā raktamudiraṃte punaḥ punaḥ |
āṃtrairmukheṣu nighnāṃtairnetrairāṃ śrāvalaṃvibhiḥ || 23 ||

duḥkhānite prāpnuvatiyānya saptāni jaṃtuvabhiḥ |
asipatravanaṃ nāma naraka śṛṇu cāparayojanānāṃ || 24 ||

(****) sahasraṃ yojvaladagnyāstṛtāvaniḥ |
saptasūrya karaiḥ channaiḥ kalpāṃtānaladāruṇaiḥ || 25 ||

prāparyati tadā tatra prāṇino navarakaukasaḥ |
tanmadhye ca vanaṃ śītamapi patraṃ vibhāvyate || 26 ||

putrāṇi tatradgāśri tīkṣṇānidvijasāttama |
śvānaśca tatra śavalāḥ svanaṃtyayutaśobhitaḥ || 27 ||

mahāvaktrā mahādaṃṣṭrā vyāghrāśva mahānakhāḥ |
tattastadvanamālokya śiśiracchāyamagrātaḥ || 28 ||

prayāṃti prāṇinastatra tadgāya paripīḍitāḥ |
hātātahāmātaritikraṃdaṃtotīvaduḥkhitāḥ || 29 ||

ghṛtamānaṃghri yugalā dharaṇīsthena vahninā |
teṣāṃ gatānāṃ tatrāpi patrapātī samīraṇaḥ || 30 ||

<p. 70a>

pravātite niyātyaṃte teṣāṃ khaḍgāstathopari tataḥ |
pataṃtite bhūmau jvalatyākūka saṃcaye || 31 ||

lelihyamānevān yatravyā sa śeṣa mahītale |
sārameyāstataḥ śīghrīśātayaṃti śarīriṇaḥ || 32 ||

teṣāṃ khaṃḍāni rudatā manekānyati bhīṣaṇāḥ |
asi yatradyanaṃ tatra mayai tatkīrtitaṃ tava || 33 ||

ataḥ parataraṃ ghoraṃ taptakuṃbhaṃ nivodhama |
samaṃ tatasta sa kuṃbhā vahni jvālā samāvṛtāḥ || 34 ||

jvaladagni mayāstaptatailā paścūrṇapūritāḥ |
teṣu duṣṭata karmāṇebhyāmyaiḥ kṣiptādyadho mukhāḥ || 35 ||

kvāthyaṃte visphuṭa chātragalanmajjā jalāvilāḥ |
sphuṭat kapālanetrāsthi vidyamānā vibhīṣaṇai || 36 ||

gṛdhairutpādyamucyate punasteṣevavośataiḥ |
punaḥ śimiśimāyaṃte tailenaikyaṃ vrajaṃtite || 37 ||

dravībhūtaiḥ śiro netraiḥ snāyu māṃsatvagasthibhiḥ |
tatoyāmyairbhadūrā pradavīghanavattathā || 38 ||

kṛtāvarte mahāvālaiḥ kvāthyaṃtai pāpakarmiṇaḥ |
pṛṣate visteraṇoktastapta kuṃbho mayāpitaḥ || 39 ||

ahaṃ vaiśyakule jāto janmanyasmāttu sa same |
samatīte gavārodhaṃ vipāne kṛtavātpurā || 40 ||

vipākāt karmaṇastasya narakaṃ bhṛśadāruṇaṃ |
maṃprāptosmi śivādyo ramayo mukha khagākulaṃ || 41 ||

yaṃtrapīḍita vaktrāsṛt pravāho bhūtakardamaṃ |
vikṛṣyamāṇoduṣkarmastanitartikhākulaṃ || 42 ||

yātyamānasya me taysya sāgraṃ varṣaśataṃ gataṃ |
mahātvāyārtitaptasya tṛṣṇādāvārddhi tasya ca || 43 ||

athāhādṛkā sadyaḥ pavaḥ sukhalītalaḥ |
karaṃ bhavālukā taptamadhyasthassamupāgataḥ || 44 ||

tatsaṃparkāda śeṣoṇāmathaghātanā nṛṇāṃ |
mama cāpi yathā svarge svargiṇāṃ nivṛttiḥ parāḥ || 45 ||

kimetaditi cāhlāda vistārāstimitekṣaṇaiḥ |
iṣṭamasmābhirāsannaṃ nararatnamanuttamaṃ || 46 ||

yāmyaśca puruṣo ghoro daṃnnahastoti suprabhuḥ |
purato darśayanmārgamiti ehīti mānada || 47 ||

puruṣassa tadā dṛṣṭvā yātanā śatasaṃkule |
narakaṃ prāhataṃ yāmyaṃ kiṃ karaṃ kṛpayānvitaḥ || 48 ||

puruṣa uvāca ||

he yāmya puruṣācakṣva kiṃ kṛtaṃ duṣkṛtaṃ |
dumayāyenedaṃ yātanānīṣmaṃ prāptosmi narakaṃ paraṃ || 49 ||

vipaściditi vikhyāto janakānāmahaṃ kule |
jāto videha viṣaye samyaṅmanujapālakaḥ || 50 ||

<p. 70b>

yajñairmayeṣṭaṃ vdrabhirdharmataḥ pālitā mahī |
notsṛṣṭaścaiva saṃgrāmo nātiyirvimukho gataḥ || 51 ||

pitṛdevarṣi bṛtyāścana ca pūrvāṃsitā mayā |
kṛttāspṛhā na ca mayā parastrī vidhāvādiṣu || 52 ||

parvakāleṣu pitarassiddhikāle ca devatāḥ |
puruṣaṃ svayamāyāṃtimipānamivadhe navaḥ || 53 ||

yataste vimukhāyāṃti niścasya gṛhamedhitaḥ |
tasmādiṣṭaśca pūrtaśca dharmau dvāvapi naśyataḥ || 54 ||

pitṛniścāsavidhvaṃsāt saptajanmārjitaṃ śubhaṃ |
trijanmasaṃbhavaṃ devaniśvāsohaṃtya saṃśayaḥ || 55 ||

tasmāddeve ca pitrye ca nityamevodyato bhavet |
sohaṃ kathamimaṃ prāpto narakaṃ mṛśadāruṇaṃ || 56 ||

putra uvāca ||

iti pṛṣṭastadā tena śṛṇvatāṃnau mahāpumān |
uvāca puruṣo yāmyo ghorotha prastutaṃ vaca || 57 ||

kiṃkaṇuvāca ||

mahārāja yathātthatvaṃ tannātra saṃśayaḥ |
kistusvalpaṃ kṛtaṃ pāpe bhavatāsmārayāmi tat || 58 ||

tvayeṣṭaṃ sakalairyajñaissapūrṇāvaradakṣiṇaiḥ |
mahādānāni dattāni śrotriyebhyastvayādarāt || 59 ||

ācārya pitṛmukhyāśca satataṃ pūjitāstvayā |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā tvayā samyagupāsitā || 60 ||

bhagavadraśmi sahitā kāle kāle mahīkte |
caṃdrasūryagrahabhānu saṃkrameṣu bhṛgordine || 61 ||

viśeṣato japahomaṃ kṛtvācāryasya dakṣiṇā |
datvā sahasraśaḥ svarṇapaśuratna samākulā || 62 ||

divyālaṃkāravāsobhirācāryadapitā tvayā |
mahālakṣmīdhiyā sākṣāt pūjitā māsimāsyapi || 63 ||

ācāryaputrāssatataṃ rattaiarthaiśca puṣkalaiḥ |
upāsitāstvayā samyaka pautrā na tṛmukhā api || 64 ||

ācāryānujñayā sarvaṃ pratyahaṃ dīyate tvayā |
ācāryaniṃdā karuṇāṃ samyak śikṣātvayā kṛtā || 65 ||

tatraikasmindine rājan daridrāya dvijātaye |
dīnārāṇāṃ sahasrāṇi paṃcadehītite guruḥ || 66 ||

uktavān bhavatāpyasmaidattaṃ trinyūnamādarāt |
dāruṇaṃ narakaṃ dṛṣṭaṃ tena pāpena bhūyate || 67 ||

vidyeta pāpaleśastenānyaḥ kaścana suvrata |
tadehigaccha puṇyānāsupabho vajrattugāyapārthiva || 68 ||

rājovāca ||

yāsyāmi devānucara yatramāṃtu na yiṣyasi |
citpṛcchāmi tatnmetvaṃ yathāvadvaktumarhasi || 69 ||

<pd 522, p. 71a>

vajratuṃḍā amīkākyaḥ puṃsāṃ nayanahāriṇaḥ |
punaḥ punaśca netrāṇi tadvadeṣāṃ bhavaṃti ca || 70 ||

kiṃ karmakṛtavaṃtaśra kathayai tajjugupsitaṃ |
haraṃ tyeṣāṃ tathā jihvāṃ jāyamānāṃ punastathā || 71 ||

kiṃ karmakṛtavaṃ taścayenaita duḥkhābhāginaḥ |
karapatreṇayātyaṃte tasmādeteti duḥkhitāḥ || 72 ||

karaṃ bhavālukā svetetarthaite kvāthyatailagāḥ |
ayo mukhaiḥ khagaiścaiva kṛṣyaṃte kiṃ vidhau vada || 73 ||

viśiṣṭaṃ dehavaṃ dhārtirmahārāvavirāviṇaḥ |
āpaścaṃcu nipātena sarvāṃgakṣatiduḥkhitāḥ || 74 ||

kimetanniśca saṃtopitudyaṃte harniśaṃ jarāḥ |
etā eścānyāśca dṛśyaṃte yojanāḥ pāpakarmaṇāṃ || 75 ||

yena karmavipākena tanmamoddeśato vada |

kiṃkara uvāca ||

yanmāṃ pṛcchasi bhūpāla pāpakarma phalodayaṃ || 76 ||

tannehaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi saṃkṣepeṇa yathā tathaṃ |
puṇyā puṇye tu puruṣaḥ paryāyesā samaśrute || 77 ||

bhuṃjataśca kṣayaṃ yāti puṇyaṃ pāpaṃ tathāpi ca |
na tu bhogādṛte pāpaṃ puṇyaṃ vā karmamābhavaṃ || 77	 ||

parityajati bhogāṃśca puṇye naiva nivodhame |
durbhikṣā devadurbhikṣaṃ kleśākleśaṃ bhayādayaṃ || 79 ||

mṛttermṛliṃ tathāyāṃti daridrāḥ pāpakāriṇaḥ |
utsavādut savaṃ yāṃti svargāt svargaṃ sūkhātsukhaṃ || 80 ||

adadhānāśca dāṃtāśca dhanāḍhyāḥ śubhakāriṇaḥ |
vyālakuṃjara durgāṇikhyaṃ ghorabhayāni ca || 81 ||

hatāḥ pāpena gacchaṃti pāpinaḥ kimataḥ paraṃ |
sugaṃdhimālyaṃ dvastra sādhuyānāṃ śubhāsanāḥ || 82 ||

sūyamānāssadāryāti puṇyāṃ śūnyāṭavīṣvapi |
anekajanma sāhasrajanma saṃcayasaṃcitaṃ || 83 ||

puṇyāt puṇyaṃ nṛṇāṃ tadvat sukhaduḥkhāṃ kurodbhavaṃ |
yathā hi vījaṃ bhūpālayayāṃsi samavīkṣate || 84 ||

puṇyātpuṇya tathākāladeśādyaṃ karmavīkṣeta |
svalpaṃ pāpaṃ kṛtaṃ puṃsāṃ deśo kālopapāditaṃ || 85 ||

pādanyāsā sahaṃ duḥkhaṃ kaṃṭakotthaṃ prayacchati |
tatprabhūtataraṃ sthūlaṃ śaṃku kīlakasaṃbhavaṃ || 86 ||

duḥkhaṃ yacchati tadvayā śiro rogādi duḥkhadaṃ |
apathyāśana śītolla śramatāpādditārakaṃ || 87 ||

tathānyānapyapekṣeta pāpāni kalasaṃgame |
evaṃ mahāṃti pāpāni dīrgharogādika krame || 88 ||

tapacchatāni kṛcchrāṇi vaṃdhanāni phalāya vai |
alpaṃ puṇyaṃ śubhaṃ gaṃdhaṃ helayā saṃprayacchati || 89 ||

sparśaṃ vāpyathavā śabdaṃ rūpaṃ rasamathāpi vā |
virādgurutaraṃ yadvanmahāṃtamapi kālajaṃ || 90 ||

<p. 71b>

evaṃ ca sukhaduḥkhāni puṇyapāpodbhavāni ca |
bhuṃjānoneka saṃsāre saṃbhavannihatiṣṭhati || 91 ||

jātideśāviruddhāni jñānājñāna kṛtāni ca |
tiṣṭhaṃti kiṃ tatra pakvāni ligamātretaṣvarātmani || 92 ||

karmaṇā manasā vācā na kadācit kvacinnaraḥ |
akurvan pātarkakamu puṇyaṃ vāpya vatiṣṭhate || 93 ||

yadyadāpnoti puruṣassukhaṃduḥkhamathāpi vā |
prabhūta mathavā svalpaṃ vikriyākāracetasaḥ || 94 ||

tāvatā yātanā puṃsaḥ pāpaṃ prāpyāthavettaraṃ |
upabhogākṣayaṃ yāti bhajyamānamivāśanaṃ || 95 ||

evamete mahāpāpaṃ yātanābhirahaniṃśaṃ |
kṣapayaṃti narāghoraṃ narakāṃtaravartinaḥ || 96 ||

tathaiva rājan puṇyāni svargalokemaraiḥssaha |
gaṃdharva siddhāpsarasī gītāthairuparbhujate || 97 ||

devatvetha manuṣyatvetiryakte ca śubhāśubhaṃ |
puṇyapāpodbharvabhuṅkte sukhaduḥkhopalakṣaṇaṃ || 98 ||

yattu pṛcchasimī rājanyāttanāṃ pāpakarmiṇī |
kena kena vipākena tanne vakṣyāśestataḥ || 99 ||

duṣṭena cakṣuṣā dṛṣṭāḥ paradārā narādhamaiḥ |
mānasena ca dṛṣṭena paradravyaṃ ca saspṛhaiḥ || 100 ||

vajratuṃḍāḥ khagāsteṣāṃ haraṃtyete vilocane |
punaṣpunaśca saṃbhūti rakṣṇoreṣāṃ bhavatyapi || 101 ||

yāvaṃtokṣi nimeṣāstu pāpamebhirnṛbhiḥ kṛtaṃ |
tāvadvarṣāṇi netrārtimete prāptyāṃtyavāritāṃ || 102 ||

asacchāstropadeśāsturyairdṛttāyaiśca maṃtritāḥ |
samyak pṛṣṭe vināśāparipūṇāmapi mānavai || 103 ||

yaiḥ śāstramanyathā proktaṃ yaira sadvāgudāhṛtā |
tadame parvatasyāgrātyataṃtyeva punaḥ punaḥ || 104 ||

devaveda dvijātīnāṃ guruniṃdā cadauḥkṛtā |
haraṃti teṣāṃ jihvāṃjajāyamānāṃ punaḥ punaḥ || 105 ||

tāvato vatsarānek vajratuṃḍāssudāruṇāḥ |
śrīsadaṣṭārṇavidyāyā ācāryasya mahātmanaḥ || 106 ||

yāvatyo ghaṭikā niṃdā śrutā dṛṣṭāpi vā kṛtā |
tāvat kalpasahasrāṇi jihvāmeṣāṃ punaḥ punaḥ || 107 ||

haraṃti viṣṭhāṃ vadane karṇayo nikṣipaṃtyapi |
śrīyadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarī || 108 ||

ye gṛhītvā tadācāryaṃ nārcayaṃti dine dine |
tasyodaraṃ khaḍgapatrairbhāgaśaḥ khaṃdarpatyapi || 109 ||

yāvatyo nāḍikāstāvat kalpeṣu śataśaḥ pitaḥ |
ācāryama parāmṛśya gṛhastheyo dine dine || 110 ||

<p. 72a>

bhuṃkte sakalpa sāhasraṃ viṣṭāṃ bhuṅkte na saṃśayaḥ |
vivāha yāgakāryeṣu puraścaryādi karmasu || 111 ||

saṃpūrṇā dakṣiṇācārya pādābja yugale śubhe |
bhikṣitvāpi nayairdartā patnīputrādipoṣakaiḥ || 12 ||

śuṣkarkaṭhoṣṭa jihvāśca kṣutarpayāsā samanvitāḥ |
etatkalpasāhasraṃ majjaṃti narakārṇave || 13 ||

mitrabhedastathā pitrāputrasya svajanasya ca |
yājyoyādhyāyayormātrāsutasya sahacāriṇaḥ || 114 ||

bhāryāpatyoścayecidbhedaṃ kuryurnarādhamāḥ |
tadrame paśyayātyaṃte karapatreṇa pārthivaḥ || 115 ||

paropatāpakārāyeyecāhlādaniṣedhakāḥ |
tālavṛṃtānisra snānacaṃdanośīrahāriṇaḥ || 116 ||

prāṇāṃtikaṃdadustāyamaduṣṭānāṃ cayedhamā |
karaṃ bhavālukā saṃsthāsta ime pāpabhoginaḥ || 117 ||

bhukte śrāddhe tu yonyasya na roponyanimaṃtritaḥ |
daivevāpyatha vā pitrye sa dvidhā kṛṣyate khagaiḥ || 118 ||

marmāṇi yaśca sādhūnā vadanvāgbhirnikṛttati |
tamevamadyamānāstu khagastiṣṭhaṃtyavāritāḥ || 119 ||

yaḥ karoti tu paiśūnyamanya vā ganyathāmatiḥ |
pādyate hṛdvidhā jihvā tasya tanni hitaiḥ kṣuraiḥ || 120 ||

mātāpitrorgurūṇāṃ ca yevattāṃ ca kuruddhatāḥ |
tadramepūya viṇmūtra garte marjatyadho mukhāḥ || 121 ||

devatātithibhṛtyeṣu bhūteṣvabhyāgateṣu ca |
abhuktavatsuyeśraṃti tadvalpitrāgni yakṣiṣu || 22 ||

duṣṭāste pūyaniyasiṃ sūcī vaktrāstu bhuṃjate |
jāyate girivarṣmāṇaḥ paśyaite yādṛśā narāḥ || 123 ||

ekapaṃṅmāṃtuye vipramathavettā varṇajaṃ |
viṣamaṃ bhojayaṃtī havidbhujāsta imeyathā || 24 ||

gobrāhmaṇāgnayaḥ spṛṣṭāyairacchiṣṭairnareśvaraḥ |
teṣāmetegni kuṃbheṣu prajvalatkhāhitāḥ karāḥ || 125 ||

sūryeṃdutārakā dṛṣṭaṣṭāyairucchiṣṭaistukāmataḥ |
teṣāṃ yāmyairnarairmaṃtranyasto vahnissamedhate || 126 ||

gauragnirjanani vipro jyeṣṭho bhrātā pitāsvasā |
jāmayo guravo vṛddhāḥ spṛṣṭāyaistu padānṛbhiḥ || 127 ||

vidhāṃghrayaste nigaḍairlohairagni prajāpitaiḥ |
aṃgārarāśi madhyasthāstiṣṭhatyājānudāhinaḥ || 128 ||

pāpasaṃkṛsāṃ chāgaṃ devānnāni ca yāni vai |
muktāniyairasaṃskṛtya teṣā māṃtrāṇi pāpināḥ || 129 ||

nipātitānāṃ bhūpṛṣṭhe viddhūtāgniṃ nirīkṣatāṃ |
saṃśairapakṛṣyate narairyāmyairmukhā tataḥ || 130 ||

<p. 72b>

ācāryaniṃdākarṇābhyāṃyaiḥ sakṛdvā niśāmitā |
ayomayāni śūlāni tatkarṇeṣu punaḥ punaḥ || 131 ||

ākalyaṃ pūrarpatyeteya mūtāssudāruṇāḥ |
ekasmin divase vāpi yajjācāye spaśāsanaṃ || 132 ||

ullaṃghayati duṣṭātmā tanmukhe yamakiṃkarāḥ |
ākalyapūrayet yete śūlāni vasudhāyeta || 133 ||

gurudeva dvijātīnāṃ sādhūnāṃ ca narādhamaiḥ |
nidāniśāmitāyaiśca pāpānāmabhiniṃdatāṃ || 134 ||

teṣāmayo mayānkīlānagnivarṇānpunaḥ punaḥ |
karṇeṣu pūrayetthete yāmyā vilapatāmayi || 135 ||

vaiprayādeva viprauko devālayasabhā śubhāḥ |
bhaddhāvidhaṃ samānītāḥ krodhalobhānuvartibhiḥ || 36 ||

teṣṭāmeteśitaiḥ śastrairmuhuvirlapatāṃ tvacaṃ |
pṛthakurvaṃtite yāmyāḥ śarīrādatidāruṇāḥ || 137 ||

gobrāhmaṇārkamārgeṣuye ca meva mehaṃti mānavāḥ |
teṣāmeptā nivṛṣyaṃtagudenāṃtrāpivāyasaiḥ || 138 ||

datvā kanyāṃ parā kasmai dvitīyāya prayacchati |
satvevenaikadhāchinnaḥ kṣāranadyī pravātyate || 139 ||

svapoṣaṇa paroyastu pāstyajatimā navaḥ |
putramṛtyukalatrādi vaṃdhuvargama kiṃcanaṃ || 140 ||

durbhikṣaṃ saṃbhreme vāpi sopyevaṃ yamakiṃkaraiḥ |
dvakṛtya dattāni mukhe svamāsānyaplutakṣudhā || 141 ||

putramitra kalatrādi vaṃdhuyoṣaṇa tatparaḥ |
durbhikṣe saṃbhrame vāpi svācāryaṃ bhagavanmayaṃ || 143 ||

ācāryapatnī putrādīn parityajatiyo nṛjpa |
tasya vaktre male mūtramākalpaṃ kiṃkarāḥ || 143 ||

pūrayaṃtyudadaṃ cāsya khaṃḍayaṃti punaḥ punaḥ |
prāraṇāgataṃ yastyajati lobhādukto ca jīvanaḥ || 144 ||

sopyevaṃ yaṃtra pīḍābhiḥ pīḍyate yama kiṃkaraiḥ |
sukṛtaṃ ye prayacchaṃti yāvajjīvakṛtaṃ narāḥ || 145 ||

tepiṣyaṃte śilāṃ peṣaṃ yathaite pāpakāriṇaḥ |
nyāsā pahāriṇo vadvāssarvagātreṣu vaṃdhanaiḥ || 146 ||

kṛmiraścika kākolairbhajyaṃte harniśaṃ narāḥ |
kṣuttāpatṛdbhapta jihvātālavo vedanātarāḥ || 147 ||

divā maithunaniṣṭhātā paradāraratāścaye |
tathaiva kaṃṭakaistīkṣṇairāyasaiḥ paśya śālmalīṃ 148 ||

āropitā vitunnāṃgā prabhūtāsṛkta vā viāḥ |
mūṣāyāmapi paśyaitāndhyāyamānānyamānugaiḥ || 149 ||

puruṣaiḥ puruṣaiḥ puruṣavyāghraparadārābhimarśinaḥ |
udhyāyamadhaḥ kṛtvā taccauryādhyayanaṃ naraḥ || 50 ||

<p. 73a>

gṛhṇāti śilpamathavāsopyervaśirasāśitāṃ |
vibhrat kleśamavāpnoti yamamārgeti pīḍitaḥ || 51 ||

kṣutkṣāmoharniśaṃbhārapīḍā dūṣitamastakaḥ |
śleṣma mūtrapurīṣāṇiyairut sṛṣṭānivāriṇi || 52 ||

tadrame śreṣma viṇmūtra durgadhi narakaṃ gatāḥ |
parasparaṃ ca māṃsāni bhakṣayaṃti kṣudhārditāḥ || 153 ||

ikṛmitva māpannā bhujyaṃtetrapi pīlakaiḥ |
patit pratigrahādānādyājunābhritya sevanāt || 154 ||

pāṣāṇa madhye kīṭatvaṃ narassa tatamaśrute |
paśyato mṛtyavargesya mitrāṇāmatithestathā || 155 ||

ekomaṣṭānna bhojīsyājjvaladaṃgārasaṃcayevṛkairbhate |
ayaṃ kṛtaghno mitrāṇāmayakārī sudurmatiḥ || 158 ||

taptaḥ kuṃbhe vilayati tato yāsyati śoṣaṇaṃ |
karaṃbha vālukāṃ tasmāttato yaṃtrāvapīḍitaḥ || 159 ||

apti patravanaṃ tasmāt karapatreṇaṃ pāṭanaṃ |
kālasūtraṃ tathācchedamanekāścaivayātanāḥ || 160 ||

prāpyā niṣkṛtime tasmānnavepti kathameṣyati |
śrāddhasaṃgatino viprāssamupetya parasparaṃ || 161 ||

spṛṣṭā sṛdmiśriṃ tatoyaṃ pivaṃtyada sahasrakaṃ |
svarṇasteyī ca vicavipraghna surāpagurukṛtyagāḥ || 162 ||

adhaścordhvaṃ ca dīptāgnau dahyamānāssamaṃtataḥ |
tiṣṭhaṃtyabda sahasrāṇi suvahvani punaḥ punaḥ || 163 ||

jāyaṃtemā mānavāḥ kuṣṭhakṣayarogādi cihnitāḥ |
mṛtāḥ punaśca narakaṃ punarjvātāścatā dṛṣṭāṃ || 164 ||

vyādhimṛcchaṃti kalpāṃta parimāṇaṃ narādhipa |
brahmaghno vā pitṛghne vā surāye gurutalyagau || 165 ||

niṣkṛtirdharmaśāstreṣu manvadibhirudīritā |
nāstyācāryadruho vedadharmaśāstreṣu niṣkṛtiḥ || 166 ||

mahāpralayakālttamācārya drohakāriṇaḥ |
narake vasatiḥ proktāmanvādyairdharmapāragaiḥ || 167 ||

[goghno nyūnataraṃ yāti narakeṣu trijanmaśrī madanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye 
dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe uttarabhāge rājarājavidyāmāhātmye 
triṃśodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 73a>

kiṃkaruvāca ||

śṛṇu rājanmahābhāgapātakaudya vibhedanaṃ |
dharmaṃ dharmabhṛtāṃ śreṣṭhavedaśāstreṣu niścitaṃ || 1 ||

sukhamicchannihāmutra vedoktaṃ dharmamuttamaṃ |
ācaran sarvapāpebhyo vimuktassukhamaṣṇute || 2 ||

gaṃdhapuṣpākṣatādīni nityaṃ datvā dvijāyate |
vimukta upapāpebhyo gaṃdharvaissamodate || 3 ||

<p. 73b>

kadalī panasādīni phalānirasarvati ca |
śrotiyobhyaḥ pradatvāsau sarvapāpa vivarjitaḥ || 4 ||

vidyādharāṇī lokeṣuvase yugaracatuṣṭayaṃ |
abhyāgatātithibhyo yo dadātpannaṃ dine dite|| 5 ||

śakralokaṃ samāsādya yāvanmanvaṃtaraṃ vaset |
datvā vāsāṃsi śuddhātmā śrotriyebhyo dine dine || 6 ||

alakāpuramāsādya kalpāṃtaṃ bhogavān bhavet |
alaṃkārāṃścaralāni śrotriyebhyaḥ samapya ca || 7 ||

kuverārdhāsanaṃ prāpya modate kālasakṣayaṃ |
aśvadānaṃtuya kuryācchrotriyāya dvijātaye || 8 ||

sāvitraṃ lokamāsādya kalpāṃtaṃ divyabhogavān |
gajadānaṃ naraḥ kṛtvā vedavedāṃgavedine || 9 ||

iṃdrārddhāsanamārūḍho bhavedbhoga samanvitaḥ |
dadātyāṃdolikāṃ yastu sarvopaskarasaṃyutāṃ || 10 ||

vimānavaramārūḍhassatyalokaṃ vrajatyasau |
payasvinīṃ savatsāṃgāṃ yo dadāti dvijātaye || 11 ||

śivalokamavāpnoti divyakanyā śatānvitaḥ |
dvimukhīṃ go narodatvā sāṃga dakṣiṇayānvitāṃ || 12 ||

mahāpāpopapāpaudyaismadya eva vimucyate |
vimānavaramārūḍhasmiddha devamunistutaḥ || 13 ||

divyakanyā sahasreṇaptahito brahmalokabhāk |
tulāpuruṣa mukhyāni mahādānāni suvrataḥ || 14 ||

kṛtvā brahmapade divye pūjyate sarvadaivataiḥ |
gocarma sammitāṃ bhūmiṃ kaḍusasya samanvitāṃ || 15 ||

yo dadāti dvijāpyāya mahāpāpopapātakaiḥ |
vimuktassakalān bhogāni haladhvāpi durlabhān || 16 ||

kubja sāhasrasahito ārūḍho divyapuṣpakaṃ |
sastutassukartairdevairdivyakanyā śatānvitaḥ || 17 ||

prayātyasau paraṃ dhāma ya hutvā na nivartate |
dvijāḥ sakalavarṇebhyaḥ pūjyāḥ śreṣṭhā mahītale || 18 ||

tebhyo vedavidāḥ śreṣṭhāstebhyopi jñāninodhikāḥ |
jñānibhyopyādhikāḥ proktarayajvāno bhūri dakṣiṇāḥ || 19 ||

yajvābhyopi brahmavidaḥ śreṣṭhāḥ pūjyā mahīyate |
dakṣaṃ brahmavide kiṃcidapye kasmindine nṛpa || 20 ||

kalpāyuta mahāsaukhyapradaṃ tatpara preyade |
sahasrā brahmavibhyo yo dadāti dhanamakṣayaṃ || 21 ||

bhūṣaṇāni ca ratnāni mahīsaṃsya samanvitāṃ |
kulāpnutaṃ samuddhṛtyamayaṃ ca narakārṇave || 22 ||

tadviṣṇoḥ paramaṃ dhāmayātyaya sukhānvitaṃ |
daridrāya dvijāyāpi vivāha dhanamādarāt || 23 ||

datvā phalamavāpnoti pūrvoktaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ |
śataṃ vivāhya viprāṇāṃ dhanaṃ datvā supuṣkalaṃ || 67 ||

<p. 74a>

prāṇāṃdhanaṃ datvā supuṣkalaṃ avaśyaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ dhāma prayāt yatra na 
saṃśayaḥ |
śatasāhasrasaṃkhyāka brahmavidbhyo dine dine || 68 ||

hutvā suvarṇa lakṣāṇi muktārastādi saṃcayaṃ |
daridrāṇāṃ sahasraṃ ca vivāhya dhanasaṃcayaiḥ || 69 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhoje niṣkaṃ datvāpi kāṃcanaṃ |
tatodhikaphalaṃ prāpya bhagavat kiṃkaro bhavet || 70 ||

śrīśrīthati dvādaśārṇā yena dattā mahīpatesu |
su ācārya iti proktassarva tatvārtha vittamaiḥ || 71 ||

raśmimālā samāyuktā śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarī |
yena dattā mahābhāga tatopyācārya uttamaḥ || 72 ||

bhagavadraśmi sahitā śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī śubhā |
dīyateyebha kṛpayāsa sākṣādbhagavanmayaḥ || 73 ||

tābhyā mapyadhika prokto mahānācārya īśvaraḥ |
tameva sākṣādbrahmāṇaṃtame vācyutamīśvaraṃ || 74 ||

nārāyaṇaṃ vijānīhi mā kuruṣvātra saṃśayaṃ |
rājarājeśvarīn maṃtrā lakṣmīnārāyaṇīṃ śubhāṃ || 75 ||

guptāṃ sakalavedeśu sarvaśāstreṣu gepitī |
yo dadāti tamācārya māhussarvetimaṃ vudhāḥ || 76 ||

ayameva jagatkartā brahmāviṣṇurmaheśvaraḥ |
sarvajñoyaṃ vahadbhānurgoga svarṇapavargadaḥ || 77 ||

ācāryebhyo pradattaṃ yatkāṃcanaṃ cihlukaṃ tu vā |
sahasrame hṛdānetyodhikaṃ viddhi bhūpate || 78 ||

pātrāṇāmuttamaṃ pātraṃ tīrthānāmapi cottamaṃ |
ācāryameva jānīhisyakṣādbhagavadākṛtiṃ || 79 ||

svarṇameru sahasraṃ vā tulādāna śataṃ tu vā |
niṣkamātraṃ pradānena svācārya caraṇāṃvucce || 80 ||

na tulyamuktaṃ munibhirbrahmavidbhiḥ prātanaiḥ |
paraniṃdākṛtaghratvaṃ paramarmopaghaṭanaṃ || 81 ||

naiṣṭhuryaṃ nirghṛṇatvaṃ ca paradāropa sevanaṃ |
parasvaharaṇāśauraṃ devatānāṃ ca kutsanaṃ || 82 ||

nikṛtyā vaṃcanaṃ nṛṇāṃ kāryaṇyaṃ ca nyūṇaṃ vadhaḥ |
ācāryaniṃdā śravaṇaṃ tadājñollaṃghana tathā || 83 ||

vedanidāṃdhamaśāstreṣva viśvāsaśca saṃtataṃ |
cihnaṃ nārakiṇāmetadekaikamapi vā nṛpa || 84 ||

alakṣaṇāni jñānīyān muktānāṃ narakādanu |
dayāruteṣu sadbhāvaḥ paralokaṃ pratikriyā || 85 ||

satyā bhūta hitā coktirveda prāmaṇyadarśanaṃ |
gurudevarṣi siddhārthipūjanaṃ sādhusaṃgamaḥ || 86 ||

satkriyāmyasanaṃ maitrīmati vuddhopi paṃḍitaḥ |
anyāni daivasadgarmakriyā bhūtāni yāni ca || 87 ||

svargacyutānāṃ cihnāni puruṣāṇāmayāpināṃ |
etaddude śatorājyanbhavataḥ kathitaṃ mayā || 88 ||

<p. 74b>

svakarma phalabhoktṝṇāṃ puṇyānāṃ pāpināṃ tathā |
tedahyanyatrāchāvodṛśaṃ sarvāṃ tvayādhunā || 89 ||

tvayāhi dṛṣṭo narakarstadehyanyatra gacchatāṃ |
tatastamagrataḥ kṛtvā surājāgaṃtumudyataḥ || 90 ||

tataśca sarvairut sṛṣṭaṃ yātagnāstāpirnṛbhiḥ |
prasādaṃ kurudeveśatiṣṭha tāvanmuhurtake || 91 ||

tvadaṃgasaṃgīya ghanomanohrādayatīhataḥ |
paritā paṃcagātrebhyaḥ pīśavāvośca kṛtanaśaḥ || 92 ||

ayahaṃti naravyāghra kṛpo kuru mahāmate |
etacchratvāvacasteṣāṃta yāsyaṃ puruṣaṃ nṛpa || 93 ||

papraccha kathame teṣāmāhlādaumapi tiṣṭhati |
kiṃ mayā karma tatpuṇyaṃ satyaloke mahatkṛtaṃ || 94 ||

āhlādadāyinī puṣṭiryasyedatadudīraya |

yāmya uvāca ||

pitṛdevā tithi preṣya śiṣṭenānnena tena tu || 95 ||

puṣṭimabhyāgataṃ yasmātta hutaṃ ca manoyataḥ |
tattahṛtvadgātra saṃparkāt pavanohlādadāyakaḥ || 96 ||

pāpakarmakṛtaṃ rājanyātanāna pravādhate |
aśvamedhādayo yāgāstvayeṣṭā vidhivadyataḥ || 97 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyātvayānityamupāsitā |
bhagavadraśmi sahitā sadguroḥ kṛpayā nṛpa || 98 ||

samasta vedavedāṃta sārabhūtārtha saṃgrahā |
rājarājeśvarīviṣā lakṣmīnārāyaṇī parā || 99 ||

upāsitātvayācārya kṛpā labdhvā dine dine |
ācāryapatnī putrādi bhuktā śiṣṭaṃ dine dine || 100 ||

ādarādbhavatā bhuktaṃ kiṃvācārya padadvaye |
maṇimuktā suvarṇādi sarvasvaṃ bhavatārthitaṃ || 101 ||

tattatvaddarśanādyāmyā yaṃtra śastrāgni vādyasāḥ |
pīḍana chedadāhādi mahāduḥkhasya hetavaḥ || 102 ||

mṛdutva māgatā rājestejasā pahṛtāstavaḥ |

rājovāca ||

yadimatsannidhā vetānyāsanā na pravādhateḥ || 103 ||

tato bhadramukhātrāhaṃsthāsyesthāṇuri vā calaḥ |

bhadramukha uvāca ||

ehi rājeṃdra gacchāvo nijapuṇya amārtitān || 104 ||

bhoktuṃ bhogā na yāsye māyātanāḥ pāpakarmaṇāṃ |

rājovāca ||

na svarge brahmaloke vā tatsukhaṃ labhyate naraiḥ || 105 ||

padārtajana nirvāṇādānetthamiti me mati |
tasmānnatāvayāsyāmiyā yāvadetesu dukhitāḥ || 106 ||

tatsannidhānāt sukhino bhavaṃti narakaukasā |
dhikṛsya jīvitaṃ puṃsaḥ śaraṇārthi navāgataṃ || 107 ||

yonārja manugṛhṇāti vairipakṣamapi dhruvaṃ |
yajñadānataṃpī sāhaparatra na ca bhūtaya || 108 ||

<p. 75a>

bhavaṃti tasya yasyārta paritrāṇena mānasaṃ |
sutpiyā sodbhavaṃ duḥkhaṃ yacca mūrdhvaśapradaṃ mahāt || 111 ||

eteṣāṃ prāṇadānāttumanye svarga sukhātparaṃ |
prāptyaṃtyete yadi sukhaṃ vahavo duḥkhitemapi || 112 ||

kiṃ vā prāptaṃ mayā nasyāttasmātvaṃ vrajamāciraṃ |

puruṣa uvāca ||

eṣa dharmaśca śakraścatvāṃ na tu samupāgatau |
avaśyamasmādgatavyaṃ tasmāt pārthivagamyatāṃ || 113 ||

dharma uvāca ||

nayāmitvāmahaṃ svargatvayā samyagupāsitaḥ || 114 ||

vimāname tadārutthamāvilaṃ vasvagamyatāṃ ||

rājovāca ||

narakemānavātharmapīḍyamānāssahasraśaḥ |
trāhītyamīhikraṃdaṃti māmato na vrajāmyahaṃ || 

iṃdra uvāca ||

karmaṇā narakaprāptiratrai pāpāpakarmaṇāṃ |
svargastvayāva gaṃtavyo nṛpa puṇyena karmaṇā ||

rājovāca ||

yadi jānāsi dharmatvaṃ ratvaṃ vadiva śatakrato || 17 ||

mama yāvat pramāṇāṃtu bhubhaṃ tadvaktumarhasi |

dharma uvāca ||

adhiṃdavopathāṃbhodheryathā vā divitārakāḥ || 118 ||

yathā vai varṣato dharāgaṃgāyāṃsikatā yathā |
asaṃkhyeyāstathā rājanyathā yoniṣu jaṃtavaḥ || 119 ||

tathāta vāpi puṇyasya saṃkhyā naivopa padyate |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā raśmimālā samanvitā || 20 ||

upāsitā tvāyā nityaṃ japahomādikarmabhiḥ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇīnāmnā rājarājeśvarī parā || 121 ||

guptāpyācārya kṛpayātvayāsamyagupāsitā |
apyācārya padadvadve pratyahaṃ vāṃchitaṃ || 122 ||

tvayā dattaṃ mahārājarala muktā phalādikaṃ |
arpitaṃ gośataṃ nityaṃ tvayācārya padāṃvuje || 123 ||

ācāryakarṇayugale kuṃḍaladvitayaṃ śubhaṃ |
vahuvāraṃ tvayāstamudrikā bharaṇādikaṃ || 124 ||

ācāryayatvī bhavatā divyālaṃkaraṇi śubhaiḥ |
mahālakṣmīdhiyā sākṣāt savaryerdha supūjitā || 125 ||

ācāryaputrāḥ pautrāśca samyak saṃtoṣitāstvayā |
anena suvṛte naiṣāṃ yātanāvilayaṃgatāḥ || 126 ||

mātṛvaṃśa sahasraṃ ca pitṛvaṃśa sahasrakaṃ |
brahmalokagataṃ rājanagurusaṃtoṣaṇāttava || 127 ||

anukaṃpā mimāmadyanārakaṣvikurvataḥ |
tadeva śatasāhasrasaṃkhyāmupagataṃ tava || 128 ||

tadgacchatvaṃ nṛpa śreṣṭha tadbhoktu mamarālayaṃ |
ete tu narake pāpaṃ kṣayayaṃ tu svakarmajaṃ || 129 ||

<p. 75b>

rājovāca ||

kathaṃ spṛhāṃ kariṣyaṃti satsaṃparkāyamānavāḥ |
yadi tatsannidhāveṣāmutkarṣonopajāyate || 130 ||

tasmādyat sukṛtaṃ kiṃcidācārya caraṇārcanāt |
mamāstitetsurādhīśa vedaprāmāṇyamasticet || 131 ||

mucyaṃtāṃ tena narakātyāpinoyāta nāratāḥ |

dharmaśakrānūcatuḥ ||

eva muccataraṃ sthānatvayai vāptaṃ mahīpate || 132 ||

etāṃścānarakātyaśya vimuktānpāpakamiṇaḥ ||

putra uvāca ||

tato yatatpuṣpavṛṣṭistasyopari mahīyate || 133 ||

āgatā bhagavadūtāścakraśaṃkhādicihnitāḥ |
vimānamadhiropyainaṃ divyabhogasamyadgidaṃ || 134 ||

anayanbhagavaddhāma yatra sākṣācchriyaḥ patiḥ |
ahaṃ cānye ca yate yātṛnābhyaḥ paricyutāḥ || 135 ||

svakarma phalanirdiṣṭaṃ tato yonyaṃ taraṃgatāḥ |
purānubhavajaṃ jñānamavāpyodīritaṃ mayā || 136 ||

ataḥ paraṃ mahābhāga kimanyat kathayāmita |
[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīyataṃtrevedasārāvedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge rājarājeśvarīścapīmāhātmye ekatriṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 75b>

pitovāca ||

kathitāmetva yāvatsa saṃsārasya vyavasthitiḥ |
svarūpapathihrehasya ghaṭīyaṃtravadavyayaṃ || 1 ||

tadeva metadakhilaṃ mamā'vāttamīdṛśaṃ |
kiṃ yayā putravaikāryaṃvadacāsmin vyavasthite || 2 ||

putra uvāca ||

yadi madvacanaṃ tāta śraddhadhāsya viśaṃkitaḥ |
rājarājeśvarīvidyāṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇī parāṃ || 3 ||

ācāryānugrahāllabdhvā jīvanmukto bhaviṣyasi |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīmādau japan vidyāṃ dine dine || 4 ||

rājarājeśvarī paścādyathā śaktānvaha japan |
ihāpyaṣṭaguṇaiśvaryaṃ prāpyā khilamanorathān || 5 ||

avasthaṃ bhagavaddhāma prāptyasevaṃśa saṃyutaḥ |
yato nā vartate mūmau saṃsāre duḥkhasaṃkule || 6 ||

pitovāca ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīkāvātvayoktā sarvasiddhidā |
rājarājeśvarīvidyākātva yoktātya phalapradā || 7 ||

anayorvidyayoḥ putramāhātmyamakhilaṃ vada |
anadhītyāpivā vedānvedadhyayanaphalaṃṭu || 8 ||

mahāyajñāna kṛtvāpi kratūnāṃ phalamakṣayaṃ |
kathaṃ saṃprāpyate puṃbhistatsarvamakhilaṃ vada || 9 ||

putra uvāca ||

śṛṇutā tāta pravakṣyāmi yanmatvaṃ paripṛcchasi |
hitāya sarvajagatāṃ bhavasāgaratārakaṃ || 10 ||

bhūtvāddijātissatataṃ śrautasaṃskārasaṃyutaḥ |
nityaṃ saṃdhyāmupāsīta triṣu kāleṣu suvrataḥ || 11 ||

<p. 76a>

adhyetavyaḥ sadā vedassamaḍaṃga padakramaḥ |
hotavya magnau satataṃ sāyaṃ prātaryatātmanā || 12 ||

brahmayajñādikānyaṃ ca maṇankuryāddine dine |
dharmaśāstra purāṇāni iṣṭavyāni dine dine || 13 ||

dharma eva matiḥ kāryā śrutyukte niyatātmanā |
ete dharmā gṛhasthasyapuritadhvaṃsa hetavaḥ || 14 ||

samyajñānodayaḥ puṃsāduritasya nivāraṇe |
avaśyamapi kartavyā yāgāssaṃpūrṇadakṣiṇāḥ || 15 ||

akṣaya svargaphaladāssarvapāpa nivartakāḥ |
amarairbhujyate svargasukhaṃ śāśvatamakṣayaṃ || 16 ||

tadeva bhujyate puṇyakartṛbhiḥ pāpavarjitaiḥ |
sāṃgadakṣiṇayāyukta yāgakartrā niraṃtaraṃ || 17 ||

vedādhyayananiṣṭena sāvitrī niratātmanā |
caturyugaśataṃ svargasauravyamakṣayamuttamaṃ || 18 ||

māheṃdre bhujyate loke maheṃdra sadṛśa śriyā |
agnihotrarataḥ sāyaṃ prātavedareśuciḥ || 19 ||

nityānnadāna nirato bhuktvā svargasukha paraṃ |
punarbhūtalamāssadya satkarma niratassadā || 20 ||

punassvargasukhaṃ bhuṅkte punarbhūtalamāśritaḥ |
sānitrī jāpanirataḥ pitṛmātṛ prapūjakaḥ || 21 ||

vedādhyayana niṣṭhaśca tadarthajñāna tatparaḥ |
sāṃga dakṣiṇayāyukta yāgakartā mahītale || 22 ||

nityānnadānanirata āhasāniratonvahaṃ |
satyalokaṃ samāsādya sukhaṃ kalpāṃtamakṣayaṃ || 23 ||

purbhūtalamāsādya mahaṣīṇāṃ kule śubhe |
utpannassarṣavidyānāṃ pārago tithipūjakaḥ || 24 ||

mātāpitṛgurubhrātṛpūjako vaṃdhupoṣakaḥ |
satkarmanirao dāṃto dehāṃte bhūlokabhāka || 25 ||

tatrāpi sucidaṃkālaṃ sthitvā bhūyopi bhūtale |
maharṣīṇāṃ kule jātassarvavidyā suniṣṭhitaḥ || 26 ||

jāismṛtimānuprapya nityamācārya sevayā |
brahmajñānaṃ samāsādya tadviṣṇoḥ paramaṃ padaṃ || 27 ||

prāpnoti punarāścatti rahitaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ |
nānā yoniṣu sabhūya prāpyajasānma śatānyapi || 28 ||

bhuktvā bhogān punarbhūmau bhuktvā sarvāśca yātanāḥ |
malamūtrādi saṃkīrṇo garbheṣu vahuleccasau || 29 ||

sthitvā yonimukhādbhūmiṃ prāpya karmavaśādasau |
vālyayauvanakaumāsvārddhākādīnyanu kramāt || 30 ||

anubhūyatato mṛtyuṃ prāpya kālavaśādbhuvi |
puṇyapāpavaśāt svargasukhaṃduḥkhaṃ ca nārakaṃ || 31 ||

bhuktvā bhūyau punarjanmakarmaśeṣādvrajatyasau |
brahmārpaṇādhiyā kṛtvā karma vedeṣu coditaṃ || 32 ||

paṃcabhirjanmabhiḥ paṣvabhirjanmabhiḥ paścādbrahmabhūto |
bhaviṣyati vaidikācāranitara ācāryacaraṇārcakaḥ || 33 ||

<p. 76b>

brahmavidyāṃ japannityaṃ śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣarī |
divyarūpadharaḥ paścāt kalpāṃtaṃ brahmalokabhāk || 34 ||

śrīpradaṣṭākṣarī japtvā nityamācāryasevakaḥ |
tadviṣṇoḥ paramaṃdhāma prayāt yatra na saṃśayaḥ || 35 ||

rājarājeśvarī japtvā lakṣmīnārāyaṇīṃ śubhāṃ |
prāṇairarthairdhiyāvācā kāyena manasāpi ca || 36 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvasevako nityamādarāt |
kulasāhasrasahito divyabhoga samanvitaḥ || 37 ||

ayodhyānagaraṃ sākṣābhadbhagasadametyasau |
mūlamācārya śuśrūṣā bhuktermukteśca bhūtale || 38 ||

sarvasvamapi vā datvā kanyakāśca manoharān |
kiṃkarā nūtanayān kṛtvā svayaṃ tatyādakiṃkaraḥ || 39 ||

rājarāja mahāvidyāṃ sakṛdvā pratyahaṃ smaran |
avaśyaṃ brahmasāyujyaṃ prāpnotyekena janmanā || 40 ||

ācāryaṃ pratyahaṃ sākṣādbhagavadrūpiṇaṃ vibhuṃ |
anādṛttha mahādānairapi yāma sahasrakaiḥ || 41 ||

vedapārāyaṇairvāpi na gati prāpnuyātparī |
na vrūyāda nṛtaṃ vākyaṃ kvacit kutrāpi sadguroḥ || 42 ||

na niṃdāṃ śṛṇuyānmātuḥpiturvāvadanā bhuvi |
śikṣayet pitarau vāpi svācāryasya viniṃdakau || 43 ||

karṇaupidhāya gaṃtavyama śaktena mahītale |
vimuktā ratnagajāśvādi dhanaṃdhānyaṃ mahītale || 44 ||

ācāryāya pratijñārtamatasāka preraṇāgiṇa |
ekamapyanṛtaṃ vākyaṃ saṃbhāḍyācārya sannidhau || 45 ||

janmādi saṃcitāt puṇyādbhūṣṭo bhavati sādhakaḥ |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdva sannidhau niṣkapātrakaṃ || 46 ||

api vācā pratijñātaṃ māsānmaṃdarasānnibhaṃ |
māsābhyaṃtarato deyaṃ tadūrdhva vṛddhiprayutaṃ || 46 ||

māsot prāgeva dātavyaṃ māsannitratayatothavā || 45 ||

māsa paṃcakataḥ prāgvādeyaṃ vṛddhi samanvitaṃ || 48 ||

tadūrdhva dviguṇaṃ deyaṃ vatsarāt triguṇaṃ tathā || 46 ||

tadūrdhva marusaṃkāśadhanaṃ ācāryapādayo |
pradatvā taddaṇānmuktaḥ kalyāṃtepi bhavennahi || 47 ||

svarṇasteya sahasra vā kṛtva śrutyukta niṣkṛtiṃ |
kṛtvā śuddhimavāpnoktaṃ mā kuruṣvātra saṃśayaṃ || 48 ||

yādīcchasi mahāsiddhi maṃtranissaṃśayo bhava || 50 ||

ācāryanidakaiḥ saṃgaṃ dūrataḥ parivarjayet |
saṃbhāṣaṇanamapi tyājyaṃ tairācārya viniṃdakaiḥ || 51 ||

yatrācāryastuti kathā taddharmaguṇakīrtataṃ |
avaśyaṃ tatra gaṃtavyaṃ śrotavyamapi sādaraṃ || 53 ||

<p. 77a>

prātaṃ prātaḥ amutthāya dṛḍhabhakti samanvitaḥ |
ācāryatoṣaṇe palaṃ kṛtvā siddhiśraṃ vrajet || 53 ||

kanatkanakarcitākaṃ tāṭaṃkaṃ yugalaṃ tu vā |
kaṭaka dvitayaṃ vāpi vālī yugmamathāpi vā || 54 ||

karṣadvayamitaṃ vāpi karṣasvarṇamitaṃ tu vā |
ācāryapatnyaiyo dadyāt ṣaṇmāsevatsaretu vā || 55 ||

mahālakṣmīdhiyā sākṣātsa māheṃdra śriyaṃ bhuvi |
bhuktvā tadaṃte paramaṃ śāśvataṃ prāpnuyāt padaṃ || 56 ||

ācāryaputrapautrādīnapyācāryavadarcayet |
ācāryatatvaṃ sakalavedaśāstreṣu gaupitaṃ || 57 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdva bhaktireva mahītale |
bhuktermuktermahadvījaṃ nānyaduktaṃ manīṣibhiḥ || 58 ||

itthamācārya pādābja dṛḍhabhakto dine dine |
śrīmadṛṣṭākṣaṇe japtvā rājarājeśvarī parāṃ || 59 ||

anusmṛtya sakṛdvāpi brahmabhūtā bhaviṣyati || 60 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīyetaṃtredāśarathīye taṃtre 
vedasārārthe(-)saṃgrahe uttarabhāge rājarājavidyāmāhātmyedvātriṃśodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 77a>

putra uvāca ||

śṛṇu tāta pravakṣyāmi rājarājeśvarī parāṃ |
prathamaṃ syāt trayīvījaṃ śrīvījaṃ tadanaṃtaraṃ || 1 ||

lokeśvarī vrāmarājaṃ kūṭatraya mataḥ paraṃ |
bhūyopi śriyamuccārya śrīmadṛṣṭākṣarī tataḥ || 2 ||

ucceradrājarāja śrīlakṣmīnārāyaṇo śubhā |
vidyeyamuktāṃ bhaktānāṃ bhogasvagāryavargadā || 3 ||

sarvavidyā mahārājñī sarvasiṃhāsaneśvarī |
mahāpātakarāśighnī sarvapuṇyaphalapradāḥ || 4 ||

sarvavedamayī sarvapurāṇa smṛtirūpiṇī |
sarvadarśana siddhāṃtarūpiṇī yogarūpiṇī || 5 ||

sarvakarmamayī sarvatīrthayāga svarūpiṇī |
sāmrājñī sarvavidyānā samastāyannivāriṇī || 6 ||

caturṇāmapi vedānāṃ prathamaṃ vījamāditaḥ |
paraṃ brahmātmakaṃ vā mamaharmibhirudīritaṃ || 7 ||

śuddhakaivalyaphaladaṃ sadyaḥ pāpaudyabhedanaṃ |
paścāt triśaktilakṣmīḥsyādvidyā vījatrayātmikā || 8 ||

trailokyamohinī sarvapuruṣa śrīvaśaṃkarī |
sarvasaṃpatkarī sarvavidyāsiddhi phalapradā || 9 ||

tataḥ śriyo mahāvidyā trikūṭā parameśvarī |
gaṃgātaraṃga kallola mahāvāksiddhidāyinī || 10 ||

aṇiyādi guṇaiśvarya pradāyātakabhaṃjanī |
ghuṭikā pādukādyaṣṭa siddhidā bhuktimuktidā || 11 ||

<p. 77b>

ekākṣarī śriyaḥ paścādvidyā cidrūpiṇī parā |
nityānaṃda mahāsiddhipradā dāridryanāśināṃ || 12 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī paścādbhoga svargāpavargadā |
brahmavidyā triśakti śrīkūṭa tritayacidyutā || 13 ||

rājarājeśvarīnāmnā lakṣmīnārāyaṇī smṛtā |
ṛṣayopi na jānaṃti rājarājeśvarīmimāṃ || 14 ||

tāṃganyāsa karanyāsau na puraścaraṇādikaṃ |
rājarājoraṣyavidyāyāṃ āgameṣu prapaṭhyate || 15 ||

siddhavidyāmimāṃ prāhuḥ purāṇāḥ paramarṣayaḥ |
rājarājamanornityaṃ sakṛt smaraṇatopi vā || 16 ||

caturṇāmapi vedānāṃ sāṃgapārāyaṇāt phalaṃ |
śatakratu phalaṃ sāṃgaṃ bhavatyasya na saṃśayaḥ || 17 ||

mahādāya na sahasrasya kurukṣetrera vigrahe |
bhavatyeva phalaṃ rājarājavidyāt smṛteḥ sakṛt || 18 ||

sāṃga dakṣiṇayā yuktaṃ vājapeya sahasrakaṃ |
kṛtaṃ tena na saṃdeho rājavidyā smṛtesyakṛt || 19 ||

pradakṣiṇīkṛtya mahīṃ pratyahaṃ yatphalaṃ labhet |
rājarāja mahāvidyā smṛtestallabhyate sakṛt || 20 ||

gaṃgādi sarvatīrtheṣu snātvā yatphalamaśrute |
rājarāja mahāvidyāsmaraṇāt tatsakṛllabhet || 21 ||

ciṃtāmaṇi sahasraṃ vā pārijātaśataṃ tu vā |
kāmadhenu sahasraṃ vā kalpadrumaśataṃ tu vā || 22 ||

rājarāja mahāvidyā kalānāṃ hīta ṣoḍaśī |
ekavāramapi smṛtvā rājarājeśvarī parāṃ || 23 ||

yatyakṣa mavāpnoti tatkratsāṇatairapi na śukyate |
padaṃ labdhuṃ mahādānaiśca koṭiśaḥ || 24 ||

aṣṭāṃgayoga yuktasya yāgatissamudāhṛtā |
sāgatirlabhyate rājavidyānusmaraṇāt sakṛt || 25 ||

suṃdarī vallabhākhyeyaṃ vidyāsiṃhāsaneśvarī |
mahānārāyaṇīṃ vidyāṃ kecidāhurmaharṣayaḥ || 26 ||

anuttara brahmavidyāṃ kacidāruḥ purātanāḥ |
pravadāmovaya rājarājākhyāṃ sarvasiddhidāṃ || 27 ||

vaikharī mātṛkā proktā paṃcāśadvarṇarūpiṇī |
vedāssakala śāstroṇi purāṇāgamarāśayaḥ || 28 ||

vaikharī mātṛkodbhūtā vaidavari paramākalāyā |
kūṭa tritayākārāśriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣmī || 29 ||

asyā evāṃśa saṃbhūtā vidyā aṣṭādaśāpi ca |
brahmavidyā triśakti śrīkūṭa tritayamiśritāṃ || 30 ||

rājarājeśvarīvidyāṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇī parāṃ |
sakṛt smaraṇāto vāpi pratyahaṃ sarvasiddhidāṃ || 31 ||

<p. 78a>

adhītāssakalovedā iṣṭāyāgāssadakṣiṇāḥ |
kṛtāste nānvahaṃ bhuptā bhavaṃtyanna na saṃśayaḥ || 32 ||

gāyatrī lakṣajapena yatphalaṃ prāpyate dvijaiḥ |
avaśyaṃ tatphalaṃ rājarājavidyā sakṛt smṛteḥ || 33 ||

prāpyate pratyahaṃ bhuptā saṃśayo nātra vidyate |
śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣaryā lakṣajāpena yatphalaṃ || 34 ||

suṃdarī vallabhākhyāyāḥ sakṛt tatsmaraṇāllabhet |
samastanyāsasahita śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ manuṃ || 33 ||

japtvā paṃcāyutaṃ sāṃgaṃ labhate yatphalaṃ dvijaḥ |
tatphalaṃ labhaṃte rājarājavidyāsacchajjapāt || 34 ||

datvā sahasraṃ dhenūnāṃ sāṃgadakṣiṇadyānvitaṃ |
rājarājamanuṃ japtvā tatphalaṃ sakṛdaśṇute || 35 ||

athairvaiśvātmya saṃsiddhi hetu bhūtā sanātanī |
syame ca mahāvidyā rājarājeśvarī śubhā || 36 ||

carācara samotāni bhuvanāni caturdāśa |
rājarājamanorjāpi dehe tiṣṭhaṃti saṃtataṃ || 37 ||

rājarājamahāvidyā prajāpī yatra bhūtale |
tadevālaka naṃdāyāstudaṃvadarikāśramaḥ || 38 ||

rājarājeśvarīvidyājāpī yatrāśramevaset |
jāhnavyādīni tīrthāni tatraiva nivasati hi || 39 ||

nābhiṣekona dīkṣā vā rājarājeśvarī grahe |
śuśrūṣai ca sadācārya pādayossarvasiddhidā || 40 ||

saptadvīpavatī bhūmiṃsmalākaramekhalāṃ |
dhanadhānyagejāśvādi sāhitāṃ ratnasaṃkulāṃ || 41 ||

datvāpi pratyahaṃ śiṣya ācāryacaraṇābjeyoḥ |
patnīputrādisahitaḥ śuśrūṣānisto bhavet || 42 ||

dhenūnāmayutaṃ vāpi svarṇakoṭi mathāpi vā |
datvā pratyahamācārya caraṇābja yuge śubhe || 43 ||

śuśrūṣā nirato nityaṃ rāṇairarthaidhiyā bhavet |
pradātre sarvaralānāmapi vikṣasya koṭiśaḥ || 44 ||

dātre grāma sahasrasyāḥ rājarājeśvarī śubhā |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇīvidyā na dātavyā kathaṃcana || 45 ||

satakoti mahāvidyāssāṃganyāsādi saṃyutāḥ |
koṭiśonena japtāsyāja rājeśvarī japāt || 46 ||

rājarājeśvarīvidyā pradātaiva mahānāhaḥ |
ayameva paro brahmārudroviṣṇuḥ prajāpatiḥ || 47 ||

nārāyaṇosau bhagavān parasmānna vidyate |
saṃsevya varṣa sāhasraṃ prāthaiṇairathaidhiyānvahaṃ || 48 ||

avaśyamapya cāptavyā rājarājeśvarī śubhā |
dātre sarvasya ca prāṇāt kanyakānāṃ ca deguro || 49 ||

na dātavyā mahāvidyā rājarājeśvarī śubhā |
puraścamasihasraṃ vācājjimedhaśataṃ tu vā || 50 ||

<p. 78b>

ācārya karuṇāleśakalāṃ nārhati ṣoḍaśīṃ |
ācārya sannidhaustheyaṃ kāryamācāryatoyaṇaṃ || 51 ||

kartavyācārya śuśrūṣā smartavyācāryayādukā |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdva sāmīpyaṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ || 52 ||

samastapātakaharaṃ bhogasvargapavargadaṃ |
tadeva divyakṣetraṃ syātta deva vadarīvanaṃ || 53 ||

tadeva jāhnavī tīraṃ tadeva yamunātaṭaṃ |
tadeva tīraṃ vāgdevyāstatkurukṣetramīritaṃ || 54 ||

tadeva naimiṣāraṇyaṃta tīrthaṃ pravarābhivaṃ |
sarvatīrthasnānaphalamicchatāniyatātmanā || 55 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdva jalaṃ peyaṃ brahmahmattaḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyādi siddhimicchanmadattarāṃ || 56 ||

ācāryadakṣiṇāṃdadyadvittaralādi saṃkulāṃ |
prasādārthaṃ japanmāturbrahmālaṃkaraṇaiḥ śubhai || 57 ||

ācāryapatnī saṃpūjyā mahālakṣmīścayā sadā |
brahmaviṣṇvādi devānāmapyatu grahamicchatā || 58 ||

ācāryaputrāssaṃpūjyā vāsolaṃkaraṇādibhiḥ |
caturṇāmapi vedānāṃ nityaṃ pārāyaṇātphalaṃ || 59 ||

aśvayadhaphalaṃ nityaṃ sāṃgadakṣiṇayānvitaṃ |
gosahasra pradānasya phalaṃ dakṣiṇayānvitaṃ || 60 ||

śrīśrīśabdādaśākṣaryāḥ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarasya ca |
śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣaryāḥ puraśca vaphilaṃ śubhaṃ || 61 ||

icchatā pratyahaṃ japyā rājarājeśvarī śubhā |
daśadvādaśadhā vāpi japyāptakṛta phalapradā || 62 ||

aṇimādi guṇaiśvaryaṃ pādukākdyaṣṭakaṃ tathā |
dharmārthakāmamokṣāścāsumicchan yatavrataḥ || 63 ||

rājarājeśvarīvidyāṃ sakṛdvāpi smarecchuciḥ |
purakāya praveśādi sāmarthyaṃciṇimādikaṃ || 64 ||

suṃdarīvallabhākhyāyāssakṛjjaptuśca sidhyati |
vedānāmādi bhūtatvāt praṇavasya mahāmanoḥ || 65 ||

smaraṇādanvahaṃ sākṣāt parabrahma prakāśeta |
triśakti lakṣmīvidyāyāsmaraṇādanvahaṃ bhuvi || 66 ||

mahālakṣmīrjaganmātāpārvatī śaṃkarapriyā |
atha kāmakalā sākṣācchaktiḥ śrīpārameśvarī || 67 ||

tuṣṭā bhaktasya varadā bhavaṃtyasya na saṃśayaḥ |
atha trikūṇa saṃpūrṇā śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarī || 68 ||

bhūtalaṃ puramādyaṃsyā dvitīyaṃ tu bhuvaḥ padaṃ |
tṛtīyaṃ svargalokākhyaṃ puramatra samīritaṃ || 69 ||

agnitrayaṃ trayovedāḥ śakti tritayamapyathā |
brahmeśaviṣṇumatritayaṃ svaratritayamapyatha || 70 ||

puṣkaratṛtayacyapi padānāṃ trittaye hareḥ 
tejastrayaṃcītrapurānāmoktaṃ śriya iṣṭadaṃ || 71 ||

<p. 79a>

nāmedamādyaṃ śrīdevyāstripureti mahattaraṃ |
etadusataraṃ nāma vedāṃteṣu śrutiṣvapi || 72 ||

saṃdarīti padaṃ paścāt sarvaśruti manoharaṃ |
anyāsāṃ divyakanyānāṃ suṃdaryākhyāna vidyate || 73 ||

subhagāsuṃdarītye tacchriyo mānodimaṃ smṛtaṃ |
laliteti māhannāma śriyaḥ sarvaphalapradaṃ || 74 ||

nāmānyetāni guptāni śriyo devyāḥ śrutiṣvapi |
śriyo devyā mahacchabdo viśvādhikyaṃ vadātyapi || 75 ||

mahātripuraśabdāṃte suṃdarī śriyaḥ padaṃ |
na vaktavyamidaṃ guptaṃ putrāyāpi kadācana || 76 ||

mahāśrīsuṃdarī devī mahātripurasuṃdarī |
nāmadvayamidadevyāḥ śriya uktaṃ mahattaraṃ || 77 ||

iyameva trayī rūpāmāsṛkāvarṇarūpiṇi |
etasyāḥ smaraṇānnityamumā lakṣmīḥi sarasvatī || 78 ||

durgā ca bhadrakālyādyā bhavaṃtya khilasiddhidāḥ |
adhītāścaturo vedābhavaṃtyasya dine dine || 79 ||

śatakoṭi mahāyāgāste neṣṭāḥ pūrṇadakṣiṇāḥ |
saptakoṭi mahāmahāmaṃtrā api japtāssahasraśaḥ || 80 ||

bhavaṃti pratyahaṃ tena dakṣiṇā hema saṃyutāḥ |
tata ekākṣarī sākṣācchrī devyā citkalā śubhā || 81 ||

parabrahmamayī viśvamātṛkā parameśvarī |
cicchaktiḥ śrīritirjñayā śaktirnārāyaṇīt parā || 82 ||

parasya brahmaṇo bhinnā cicchaktiḥ śrīriyaṃ parā |
etadbhyā sato nityaṃ cidrūpī puruṣo bhavet || 83 ||

śrīśabdavācyā śrīdevīlakṣmīstripurasiṃdarī |
mātṛkā ca mahālakṣmīrlalitā parameśvarī || 84 ||

citkatmārājyalakṣmīścetyādgardivyā maharṣayaḥ |
kūṭa tritayavācyeyaṃ śrīstrayīrūpiṇī parā || 85 ||

tadaṃte bhagavadvidyā śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī śubhya |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī vācyaṃ brahmanārāyaṇābhidhaṃ || 86 ||

viśvagabhanirātaṃkaṃ sargasthitthādikāraṇaṃ |
sarvavidyāmaya sarvavījabhūtaṃ yaśatparaṃ || 87 ||

svargā vargadaṃ bhaktā japatāṃ sarvasiddhidaṃ |
svabhāva praṇavādyeyaṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī parā || 88 ||

guptalakṣmī mahāvījasahiteyaṃ phalapradā |
praṇāvādya triśakti śrīsuṃdarī śrīsamanvitā || 89 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā suṃdarī vallabhābhidhā |
rājarājeśvarī nāmnā sarvavidyāmayī smṛtā || 90 ||

ācāryānu grahāllabdhā vidyeyaṃ viśvanāpikā |
dadāt puṣṭaguṇaiśvaryaṃ vidyājālaṃ manoharaṃ || 91 ||

arvaṇa mahāvedasārabhūtā sanātanī rājarājaśvarīvidyā satyānaṃdavidātmikā |
jamā dine dine ratnadhanadhānyaudyarvalokānāṃ sa eva hariracyutaḥ nidhayaḥ 
śaṃkhapadmādyāstaddvārinivasaṃti hi || 95 ||

<p. 79b>

aṇimā mahimādyaṣṭa siddhayosya kalevaraṃ |
praviśaṃtyaṃ janādyāśca sidhyaṃtyasya na saṃśayaḥ || 96 ||

janmakoṭi sahasrāṇāmapi tasya smṛtirbhavet |
rājarājeśvarīvidyā japtāraṃ pratyahaṃ śuciṃ || 97 ||

maharṣayo vaśiṣṭādyā arcayati hari yathā |
śakravitteśa mukhyāścataṃ sevaṃte digīśvrāḥ || 98 ||

sanmānayaṃti siddhāśca nāradādyā maharṣayaḥ |
lakṣmīstanmaṃdire sākṣāttiṣṭhatyā bhūtasaṃplavaṃ || 99 ||

kiṃkarī vāhya jihvāyāṃ nṛtyate ca sarasvatī |
yāvadācārya pādābje suvarṇaṃ saṃprayacchati || 100 ||

tāvat yasya puraścaryā kṛtyāni kathitānyaho |
suvarṇasya suvarṇatvaṃ triṃtrā cihnukamānataḥ || 101 ||

iti saṃkramaṇe vāpi darśe pūrṇā dinepi vā |
dhyātīyātaipi vā bhānugraharasoma parvaṇi || 102 ||

paṃcamyāṃ bhṛguvāre vā yogi vā hariyamayoḥ |
dvādaśyāṃ kārtike vāpi rājarājākhyavidyayo || 103 ||

hutvāṃ triśatamājyena svācārya caraṇadvaye |
suvarṇamekaṃ datvātha gurupatnīpadrāṃvuje || 104 ||

suvarṇa tatra datvāpi puraścaryāṃ phalapradāṃ |
kṛtavāneva bhavati sadyaḥ pratyayakāriṇīṃ || 105 ||

itthasasyāḥ prabhāvothaṃ sadyaḥ sakalasiddhidaḥ |
vārṇetuka na śakyaḥ syādvedānāmapyagocaraḥ || 106 ||

tyaktvā sakalavedāṃśca dharmaśāstrāṇi yāni ca |
tyaktvā sarvapurāṇāni sarvopaniṣadopi ca || 107 ||

bhagavadraśmi sūktaṃ ca raśmisūktamapi śriyaḥ |
nyāsajālamapi tyaktvā rājarājeśvarīmimāṃ || 108 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇīṃ japtvā vedādhyayanajaṃ phalaṃ |
vedapārāyaṇaphalaṃ śāstrādhyayanajaṃ phalaṃ || 109 ||

sarvatīrtha snānaphalaṃ vedāṃtādhyayanāt phalaṃ |
śatakratu phalaṃ nityaṃ sarvadānaphalaṃ paraṃ || 110 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā puraścaryā phalaṃ śubhaṃ |
śriyo vidyā puraścaryā phalaṃ sāṃge dine dine || 111 ||

labhate nātra saṃdehonnākuruṣvātra saṃśayaḥ || 111 ||

ātharvaṇo vedasuto mahātmā vedāṃśca śāstrāṇi purāṇa saṃghān |
dṛṣṭvā mahāmaṃtramamuṃ trivedīsāraṃ kṛtāthebhivadīśarūpī || 112 ||

dharmasya putro bhagavān mahātmā japtvātha paśvādaṣitāmavāpa |
sa eva sākṣādbhagavānmukuṃdovidyā prabhāvāda bhavanmahātma || 113 ||

śrīrāmaḥ śrīpatiḥ śrīśaḥ śrīmāḥ śrīyavallabhastathā |
śrīkāṃtaḥ śrīmahāyogī śrīnārāyaṇa ucyate || 114 ||

śrīnārāyaṇa śabdena samaḥ śabdo naviyadyate |
śrīnārāyaṇānāmāpismatvā smṛtvā dine dine || 115 ||

<p. 80a>

vimuktaḥ pāparāśibhyo jīvanmukto na saṃśayaḥ |
nārāyaṇa samaṃ nāmayātakaudya vibhedanaṃ || 116 ||

nāsti nāstyeva nāstyeva satyaṃ satyaṃ vadāmyahaṃ |
nārāyaṇa parā vedānārāyaṇa parā makhāḥ || 117 ||

nārāyaṇa paraṃ śāstra nārāyaṇa parā smṛtiḥ |
mātaṃga yuktvaso vāpi paṃcamaḥścapacopi vā || 118 ||

śrīnārāyaṇanāmāṃte smṛtvā mukti prayāti hi |
tadaṣyācārya vaktrājvātmāptavyaṃ nānyathā guro || 119 ||

paṃcākṣaṇemimāṃ vidyāṃ prāhurnārāyaṇī parāṃ |
śuddhopya śuddhaḥ satarta smṛtvā paṃcākṣarīmimāṃ || 120 ||

parāṃgati mavāpnoti yogināmapi durlabhāṃ |
kiṃ punaḥ śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyājaparatātmanāṃ || 121 ||

rājarājeśvarīvidyā japahomaratātmanāṃ |
prabhāvodharṇituṃ naiva śakyate vidhināṃ pivā || 122 ||

rājarājeśvarīvidyā smartāpi sakṛdanvahaṃ |
surāṇāmapi vaṃdyaḥ syanmahṛṣīṇāṃ yatātmanāṃ || 123 ||

ācāryakṛpayaṃ labdhvā rājarājeśvarīmimāṃ |
daśadvādaśadhā vāpi yonu smarati saṃtataṃ || 124 ||

sa gurussayati proktassadaivajñassa sādhakaḥ |
sayajvā sadvijaśraṣṭeḥ sa tapasvī mahāmatiḥ |
sapūtātmā sapṛthvīśassa bhrātā sa pitā tathā || 125 ||

sa eva mātā vaṃdhuśca sognihotrī paraṃ tapaḥ |
sa mahāvāsadevaśca sa yogī sa mahīmuniḥ || 126 ||

sa brahmarṣirvidhātā ca sa viṣṇussa śivaḥ smṛtaḥ |
sa eva jagatāṃ sargāsthiti saṃhārakṛdvibhuḥ || 127 ||

tadvaṃśa eva bhūloke yāvanassaṃprakīrtitaḥ |
tasyaiva mātā satataṃ dhanyā proktā mahītale || 128 ||

kṛtakṛtyaṣyitaidhyasya pūtāstasmitra vāṃdhakāḥ |
muktiṃ yāti na saṃdehaṣyitarosyapitsa mahā || 129 ||

kimatra vahūnoktena vakṣye vedārthasaṃgraha |
rājarājeśvarīvidyā samāvāpyadhikānahi || 130 ||

yāmāheṃdrī mahālakṣmīrdhanada śrīracaṃcalā |
yāvāruṇī rājyalakṣmīrvaiva saṃsthitā || 131 ||

gaṃdharvaiṣucayā vidyāyā vidyādaivateṣu ca |
yāvidyā brahmavaktrasthā sā vidyāsya mukhe bhavet || 132 ||

ācāryadakṣisau vāsyāḥ puraścaryābhidhīyate || 134 ||

śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣaryā aṣṭārṇāyāśca homataḥ |
koṭiśo yatphalaṃ prokta māgameṣu maharṣibhiḥ || 135 ||

ekā hutvā rājarāvidyāyā tatphalaṃ smṛtaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā puraścaryādi karmasu || 136 ||

<p. 80b>

śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣaryā puraścaryādi karmasu |
hutvā dvādaśadhā vāpi rājarājākhya vidyayā || 137 ||

arkasakhyapuraścaryā phalaṃ prāpnoti śāśvataṃ |
cakṣurbhyāṃ tatparaṃ brahma paśyatveva mahītale || 138 ||

kiṃkarājasya dikpālāściṃtāmaṇigaṇānapi |
kalpadruma sahasraṃ ca kāmadhenu śataṃ tathā || 139 ||

prayacchaṃtyaṇimāyaṣṭaguṇaiśvaryaṃ ca śāśvataṃ |
idameva tayotyugnamidameva mahadgataṃ || 140 ||

iyameva parāvidyā iyameva parāgatiḥ |
etadeva paraṃ śreya etadeva paraṃ phalaṃ || 141 ||

iyameva parā dīkṣā mahāyogoyamuttamaḥ |
ayameva paroyauga idameva mahadvrataṃ || 142 ||

idameva paraṃbrahma jñāname tanmahattaraṃ |
rājarājeśvarīvidyā matvetthaṃ satataṃ smaret || 143 ||

rājarājeśvarīpyātithā kartavyaṃ gurupūjanaṃ |
dvayameva mahanmukti vījamanyanna vidyate || 144 ||

kathayitveti sumatiḥ pitre brahmavidāṃvaraḥ |
yājñavalkyaṃ mahātmānaṃ svapitrāsahitonvagāt || 145 ||

gomahiṣyādikaṃ sarvaṃ dhanaratnādikaṃ tathā |
samarpya yājñavalkyāya sarvasvadakṣiṇādhanaṃ || 146 ||

katvā caraṇa śuśrūṣāṃ varṣatritayamādarāt |
ucchiṣṭamārjanādyaiścapāda saṃvāhanādibhiḥ || 147 ||

vastra prakṣālanādyaiścanirnidrā tasya sevakau |
tatpatnī kiṃkarau bhūtvā bhūṣaṇādyaissamarcakau || 148 ||

toṣayaṃtau ca tatputrānbhikṣitvāpyartha saṃcayaiḥ |
rājarājeśvarīvidyāṃ prāptavaṃtau gurormukhāt || 149 ||

guruśuśrūṣakau nityaṃ śriyamaṣṭaguṇānvitāṃ |
avāpya sarvaśreyāṃsi brahmadṛṣṭā sanātanaṃ || 150 ||

kulasāhasramuddhatya prāpatuḥ paramaṃ padaṃ |

śrīkapilācārya uvāca ||

rājarājeśvarīvidyā prabhāvo vrahībhradanāḥ |
īdṛśo varṇituṃ naiva śakyate na mayāpyaho || 152 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge rājarājalakṣmīnārāyaṇavidyāmāhātmye trayastriṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 80b>

śrīkapilācārya uvāca ||

etaduktaṃ mayā tatvaṃ dasārārtha saṃgrahaṃ |
āgameṣu purāṇeṣu naitasmādvidhate paraṃ || 1 ||

ayaṃ nārāyaṇo yogī bhagavān parameśvaraḥ |
bhūtvā dāśarathirbhūmau śrīrāma iti kathyate || 2 ||

bhūtalādutthitā sākṣācchrīdiyaṃ paramākalā |
anayā ramamāṇesau śrīrāma iti kathyate || 3 ||

rājarājeśvarīvidyā vācyoya puruṣottamaḥ |
śrīnārāyaṇanāmādyamasyeva prathitaṃ śrūtau || 4 ||

<p. 81a>

nārāyaṇābhidhaṃ brahmaparaṃ vedāṃtasaṃgrahaṃ |
nārāyaṇa paraṃbrahmanavaṃ nārāyaṇaḥ paraṃ || 5 ||

nārāyaṇaḥ paraṃ jyotirātmā nārāyaṇaḥ paraḥ |
vahujanmārjitaiḥ puṇyasaṃvapaiḥ pāpanāśanaiḥ || 6 ||

nārāyaṇānusmaraṇe haṭhabhaktiḥ prajāyate |
dvitīyamapi sarvādyabhedanaṃ bhuktimuktidaṃ || 7 ||

śrīrāmanāmavedeṣu samyak dṛṣṭaṃ maharṣibhiḥ |
tṛtīyaṃ vāsudevākhyamasyanāma nigadyate || 8 ||

nāmatrilayatonānyadasti sarvaphalaprada |
mahāpātaka yuktopi smṛtvā nārāyaṇaṃ sakṛt || 9 ||

avāptavān paraṃ tatva majāmīlo dvijādhamaḥ |
vedāvāra paribhraṣṭaḥ kirāto saṃgatiściraṃ || 10 ||

śrīrāmanāma satataṃ smṛtvā pāṃkhopadeśataḥ |
vālmīkiḥ prathittaḥ sākṣādabhūdṛṣi kulādhipaḥ || 11 ||

dhruvādamo mahābhāgā vāsudeva padāśrayāḥ |
avāyuḥ paramedhāma śakrādyairapi durlabhaṃ || 12 ||

yeyaṃ sītā mahābhāgā prādurbhūtā mahītalāt |
sākṣāt paṃcadaśārṇeye śrīrdevī sarvamātṛkā || 13 ||

vicchaktiḥ prathamaṃ nāma śrīrityeva nigadyate |
dvitīye tu mahālakṣmīnāmadheyamudīritaṃ || 14 ||

mahāśrīsuṃdarīnāma tṛtīyaṃgupta samucyate |
sītānāmavaturthesyājjānakītyapi tatparaṃ || 15 ||

nārāyaṇasya śrīdevyā vahunāmāmi saṃtyapi |
samastādya harāṇi syussadya eva dvijottamāḥ || 16 ||

nāmānyetānijasṛṇāṃ sadyo muktikarāṇihi |
śrīnārāyaṇanāmādyaṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇetyatha || 17 ||

śrīvāsudevanāmātha śrīśametyathagīye |
tasmācchrī saṃyutā japyā śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī śubhā || 18 ||

ātharvaṇī sakṛdvāpi pratyahaṃ sarvasiddhidā |
rājarājeśvarī japturnavratanāstyu poṣaṇaṃ || 19 ||

na vedānnyayanāpekṣā na yāgo na tastathā |
na raśmimālādhyayanaṃnyāsāpekṣāhivāna hi || 20 ||

śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣaryāḥ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarasya ca |
rājarājeśvarīvidya smaraṇāt siddhirīritvā || 21 ||

rājarājeśvarīvidyā sarvavidyāsvarūpiṇī |
sarvayogamayī sarvadharmaśāstra svarūpiṇī || 22 ||

sarvakṣetramayī sarvatīrtha kratumayī parā |
sarvavedamayī sarvamaharṣi brahmarūpiṇī || 23 ||

sarvaviśvamayī sarvaśaktipīṭhasvarūpiṇī |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇīmenāṃ rājarājeśvarī parāṃ || 24 ||

samastajagatāṃ dhātrī vidyāsiṃhāsaneśvarī |
ācāryakṛpayā labdhvāmaṣṭā viṃśatidhānvahaṃ || 25 ||

daśadvādaśadhā vāpiyaḥ smaret sādhakottamaḥ |
jalpojapaphale nidrāsamādhirabhidhīyate || 26 ||

<p. 81b>

prādakṣiṇyaṃ bhuvaḥ proktaṃ gatirasya na saṃśayaḥ |
śilpaṃ samastaṃ mudrāṇāṃ racanā bhavati dhruvaṃ || 27 ||

bhojanaṃ nityahomaḥ syāt praṇāmanūpaveśanaṃ |
cittasya bhagavaddhyānaṃntatkriyā tapa ucyate || 28 ||

tasmāde tādṛśī vidyā prāṇaiḥ kaṃtha gatairapi |
avaśyamapi goptavyā nidhānamiva taskarāt || 29 ||

sarvasvamapi dātavyaṃ paśuratna dhanādikaṃ |
kanyakā api dātavyā rūpavatyaḥ svalaṃkṛtāḥ || 30 ||

putrā api pradātavyā vidyāvinayasaṃyutāḥ |
sādhvī svapatnī taruṇī sarvāvayavasuṃdarī || 31 ||

sāpyarthine pradātavyā rājyaśrīramya caṃcalī |
śiropi prāṇasahitaṃ dātavya madanītale || 32 ||

rājarājamahāvidyā na dātavyā kathaṃcana |
rājyapradāya rājñe vā bhrātṛputrāyavaṃdhava || 33 ||

rājarājeśvarīvidyā na dātavyā mahīyasī |
prāṇānapi ca sarvasvaṃ patnīṃ putrāṃśra kanyakāḥ || 34 ||

ācāryacaraṇādhīnāyaḥ karoti mahītale |
nirmatsarobhahaṃkārijitakrādho jiteṃdriyaḥ || 35 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvavauṃkaryanirataḥ sadā |
śiṣyatve sapariyāhyo nānyo rājyapradopi ca || 36 ||

mitaṃ dadāti janako mitaṃ mātāmitaṃ sutaḥ |
ihāmutrāmitābhīṣṭa pradātācārya ucyate || 37 ||

ācāryājñāṃ samullaṃghya sakṛdapyavanītale |
mitraputrakalatrādi saṃyabhyaḥ pracyuto cirāt || 38 ||

bhūtvā nirataṃ duḥkhī dehāṃte munako bhavet |
sahasrajanma suśvāno gardabhaḥ syāt tataḥ paraṃ || 39 ||

ācāryājñāmanullaṃghya niraṃtara mananyadhīḥ |
ihāmi sakalaiśvaryayuto nityasukhāśrayaḥ || 40 ||

avaśyaṃ muktimāpnoti sahasrakulasaṃyutaḥ |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdva sannidhau cihnukaṃ tu vā || 41 ||

kāṃcanānāṃ sahasraṃ vā dāsyāmīti dvijottamaiḥ |
yadādhā vā pratijñānaṃ tadṛṇaṃ mahadīritaṃ || 42 ||

tanmāsābhyaṃtare deyaṃ tadvardhva vṛddhi saṃyutaṃ |
tabhyā sannitayā darvārdayaṃ vṛddhi samanvitaṃ || 43 ||

tadūrdhvaṃ dviguṇaṃ deyaṃ ṣaṇmāsānni guṇaṃ smṛtaṃ |
vatsarātyaṃ ca guṇitaṃ tadūrdhvaṃ nāstini niṣkṛtiḥ || 44 ||

ihā mutrā paraṃ saukhyaṃ mahadaiśvarya makṣayaṃ |
brahmatādātmya saṃsiddhiṃ ya icchet sādhakomuvi || 45 ||

sa ācārya padadvaṃdva kiṃkaraḥsyā dine dine |
ya icchet paramaṃ duḥkhanete narakayātanāṃ || 46 ||

ācāryājñāṃ samullaṃghya tenastheyaṃ mahītale |
pitṛmātṛvadhe brahmaṣkṛtirucyate || 47 ||

gurvājñā laṃghane nṛṇāṃ na niṣkṛtirudīritā |
patnīputrakalatrādyā niraṃtara sukhānvitaḥ || 48 ||

<p. 82a>

muktāratnagaṃgāśvādi saṃpadaḥ syuḥ pade pade |
ācāryasya kṛpāle śānnānyathā brahmanaṃdanāḥ || 49 ||

yadi suhurukāruṇyaṃ śiṣyasya pratyaha bhuvi |
ihāvi sakalaiśvarya matamuktistu śāśvatī || 50 ||

ācāryapūrṇa karuṇā labdhāṃ sakalasiddhidāṃ |
rājarājeśvarī vidyāyānusmarati saṃtataṃ || 51 ||

bhogo yogāyate tasya pāpaṃ sukṛtāpate |
mokṣāyate ca saṃsāro rājarājaśvarī japāt || 52 ||

rājarāja mahāvidyā smaraṇad brahmanaṃdanāḥ |
brahmaviṣṇumaheśādi padaṃ cāsya na durlabhaṃ || 53 ||

pitṛmātṛ sahasreṇa samamācārya daivataṃ |
ācārya sadṛśaṃ daivaṃ vidyate yadi bhūtale || 54 ||

rājarāja mahāvidyā sadṛśī varṇapatte tadā |
aśvamedha sahasreṇa samaṃ sukṛtamasti cet || 55 ||

rājarāja mahāvidyā sadṛśī vidyate tadā |
ratnamerusamaṃ dānaṃ yadi tiṣṭhati pāpahaṃ || 56 ||

rājarāja mahāvidyā sadṛśī varṇyate tadā |
jāhnavī sadṛśaṃ tīrthamasticet pātakāpaha || 57 ||

śeṣācalasamaṃ kṣetra mamasticet sārvasiddhide |
vārāṇasī samaṃ kṣetramasti cenmuktidāyakaṃ || 58 ||

vaharīvana ekāṃśaṃ yadi sadyaḥ phalapradaṃ |
rājarāja mahāvidyā sadṛśī vidyate tadā || 59 ||

vahunātra kimuktena rājarājeśvarī parā |
sarvavidyāyayī proktā sarvabrahmāramāyikā || 60 ||

tasmādimāṃ mahāvidyāmācārya vadanāṃvujā tu |
paripūrṇa kṛpālavāṃ yonu smarati saṃtataṃ || 61 ||

savirādra puruṣaḥ sākṣādbhavannārāyaṇātmakaḥ |
rājarājamahāvidyā māhātmya madyanāśanaṃ || 62 ||

iti kiṃcinmayā proktamatha vakṣyāmi sādhanaṃ || 63 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge rājarājavidyāmāhātmyaṃ catustriṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 82a>

śrībhagavānuvāca ||

rājarājamahāvidyānuṣṭhānavidhiviṣṭadaṃ |
vakṣye brahmasutā yūyaṃ śṛṇudhva śuddhayānvitāḥ || 1 ||

brāhmemuhūrte utthāya śayanasthita eva hi |
ācārya caraṇadvaṃdvaṃ dhyāyedbrahmavile śubhe || 2 ||

rahmaraṃdhre sahasraskamale vikasaddale |
śuddhasphaṭika saṃkāśaṃ varābhaya karānvitaṃ || 3 ||

prasannavadanaṃ śāṃtaṃ divyābharaṇabhūṣitaṃ |
ardhanārī naramayaṃ brahmarūpadharaṃ tu vā || 4 ||

maheśvarākṛtiṃ vāpi sākṣānnārāyaṇātmakaṃ |
dhyātvācāryaṃ mahātmānaṃ sarvajñaṃ karuṇānidhiṃ || 5 ||

<p. 82b>

tatpadābjayugaṃ bhūyo bhūyo natvātha sādaraṃ |
tatpādapaprayugalagalatpīyūṣaviṃdubhiḥ || 6 ||

ātmānaṃ plāvitaṃ dhyātvā vimuktaḥ sarvapātakaiḥ |
mūlādi brahmaraṃdhrāṃtaṃ bhānu koṭi śataprabhāṃ || 7 ||

taptajāṃ kanadaprakhyāṃ jvalaṃtī parasaṃvidaṃ |
dhyātyā tattejasaḥ puṃjapiṃjarīkṛta vigrahaḥ || 8 ||

ācāryacaraṇāṃbhejā rūḍha śrīpādukāyugaṃ |
sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ vāpi dṛṣṭvā japtvā ca pādukāṃ || 9 ||

tulasīṃ śrotriya dvaṃdvaṃ paśyaṃ sapta mahāmunīn |
mahānadī valadvahniṃ dṛṣṭā smṛtvā śriyaḥ pati || 10 ||

prakṣālitakarāṃghriśca brahavidyāmatho japet |
yadvā brāhme samutthāya muhūrte yatamānasaḥ || 11 ||

pūrvamācārya vaktrājyaṃ dṛṣṭāyābjayornamet |
asānnidhye guroḥ pādārūḍha śrīpādukāṃ namet || 12 ||

tato nadyādikaṃ paśyetyānukā maṃtramuccaret |
aṣṭā viṃśatidhā smṛtvā daśadvādaśadhā daśadhāpivā || 13 ||

brahmavidyāṃ japet paścācchrī śrīśadvādaśākṣarī |
bhagavadraśmi sūktaṃ ca smṛtvā traidhaikadhāpi vā || 14 ||

śriyo raśmisrajaṃ paścāt smaret tredhāpi vā |
sakṛt raśmimālābhidhaṃ sūktaṃ śriyaḥ pūrvamudīritaṃ || 15 ||

atha siṃhāsana mahāvidyāme saṃsmaret sakṛt |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā japtvā śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarī || 16 ||

saṃsmaret suprabhātādistotraṃ bhagavataḥ priyaṃ || 17 ||

brahmāmurāristripurāṃtakaśca bhānuḥ śaśībhūmi suto vudhaśca |
guruśca śukraḥ śanirāhuketavaḥ kurvaṃ tu sarve mama suprabhātaṃ || 18 ||

bhṛgurvaśiṣṭaḥ kraturaṃgirāśca manuḥ pulastyaḥ pulahaśca gotamaḥ |
raibhyo marīciścya vano maharṣiḥ kurvaṃtu sarve mama suprabhātaṃ || 19 ||

sanatkumārassakasmanaṃdanasmanātanopyāsuripiṃgalau ca |
saptasvarāssaptarasāttalāśca kurvaṃtu sarve mama suprabhātaṃ || 20 ||

pṛthvīsa gaṃdhāsarasāstathāyaḥsyaśīca vāyurjvalitaṃ ca tejaḥ nabhaḥ |
sa śabdo mahatta sahaiva kurvaṃtu sarve mama suprabhātaṃ || 21 ||

saptārṇavāssaptakulā calāśca saptarthayo dvīpa parāśca |
sapta bhūrādi kṛtvā bhuvanāni sapta kurvaṃtu sarve mama suprabhātaṃ || 23 ||

itthaṃ prabhāte pravaraṃ vicitraṃ smarat paṭhedyaḥ śṛṇuyācca bhaktā || 23 ||

duḥsvapnanāśodyana suprabhāto bhavecca satya bhagavat prasādāt || 24 ||

paṭhedyaḥ suprabhātākhyaṃ prātarbhagavataḥ priyaṃ |
sarvapadadhiṣṭhātā bhūtvā mukti mavāpnuyāt || 25 ||

prajapedbhagavaddharma yadi śaktaḥ śucistadā |
vimuktassakalā padbhyo nārāyaṇa mayo bhavet || 26 ||

<p. 83a>

vahirnirgatya mūtrādi visarjanakarastataḥ |
khādireṇātha kāṣṭhena daṃtadhā vanamācaret || 27 ||

apāmārgeṇa vā kuryādicchan saubhāgyamuttame |
snānaṃ kuryāt tato nadyāṃ tadāge vā samāhitaḥ || 28 ||

ārdreṇa vā saptā vāpi parimṛjya kalevaraṃ |
saṃdhyopāstiṃ tataḥ kuryāt sarvapāpaugha bhaṃjanīṃ || 29 ||

saṃdhyopāstiṃ parityajya yotpatra kurutetiṃ |
sa śūdra va dahikvāryassavasmādvi prakarmaṇaḥ || 30 ||

ṛṣayo dīrghamuṃcyatvāt sarvadīrghāyuṣo bhavet |
mātā sakalavidyānāṃ sāvitrī paramākalā || 31 ||

kahuśastāmupāsyaiva vidyopāstiṃ samācaret |
sahasra prajapedyastu gāyatrī vedamātaraṃ || 32 ||

taṃ vaśiṣṭhāṃsya saṃbhūtaṃ jānīdhvaṃ brahmanaṃdanāḥ |
sahasraṃ prajapennityamatha paṃcaśataṃ tu vā || 33 ||

catuḥśataṃ japadyadvā triśataṃ tu vā |
aṣṭāviśādhikaṃ nityaṃ śataṃ vā prajapet sudhīḥ || 34 ||

śatamaṣṭottaranityaṃ yojayet sādhakottamaḥ |
taṃ brāhmaṇaṃ vijānīyāt sarvakarmasu pāvanaṃ || 35 ||

sāvitrīyāṃ japedekakālaṃ dviśatamādarāt |
sa mahāpuruṣa śreṣṭho brāhmaṇottama ucyate || 36 ||

ekakālaṃ japedyastu triśataṃ vedamātaraṃ |
ṛṣiḥ ma ukto vidvadbhiḥ paṅkti pāvana prāvanaḥ || 37 ||

vedamātaramabhyasya catuḥśattamathānvahaṃ |
maharṣiḥ sarvalokeṣu sa uttā vipraḥ kathyate vudhaiḥ || 38 ||

ekakāla paṃcaśataṃ sāvitrī yojayecchuciḥ |
brahmarṣiḥ sa mahānukto daivatopi pūjitaḥ || 39 ||

sahasramekakālaṃ yaḥ prajapedademātaraṃ |
sa eva bhagavān sākṣānnārāyaṇa iti smṛtaḥ || 40 ||

brahmarṣibhirvaśiṣṭādyairapi saṃpūjyate sahi |
patitānāṃ sahasraṃ ca sapāvarpati pāvanaḥ || 41 ||

sahasraṃ triśataṃ vāpi catuḥpaṃcaśataṃ tu vā |
dviśataṃ vā śataṃ vāpi sāvitrīṃ vedamātaraṃ || 42 ||

yathā śaktyā prajaptvādāvupasthā yadi vā karaṃ |
ajapā smaraṇaṃ kṛtvā yathāktyāvi mātṛkā || 43 ||

kṛtvā nārāyaṇīṃ saṃdhyāṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī śubhāṃ |
yathā śaktyā prajaptvātha sūktaṃ nārāyaṇabhidhaṃ || 44 ||

ādityābhi mukhottaptvā sakṛdvedhā tridhāpi vā |
paṃcadhā ravivāraṃ vā jedhvā svagurupādayoḥ || 45 ||

namaskṛtyāgnimārādhya vedamātrā ghṛtaṃ śubhaṃ |
hutvā dvādaśadhā paścācchrī madaṣṭārṇa vidyayā || 46 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityamaṣṭāviṃśatidhāpivā |
hatvātha vāsudevenaṃ vaiṣṇavena ghṛtaṃ hunet || 47 ||

śrīdvādaśārṇayā paścādrājyalakṣmyātha vā tataḥ |
ājyaṃ dvāsaṣoṇe vidyayā (*******) || 46 ||

hunedvādaśadhā paścādrājarājākhya vidyayā |
daśadhā paṃcadhā vāpi hucetvāvyā hṛtibhistataḥ || 49 ||

brahmārpaṇāhutiṃ kṛtvā vahnimudvāsayetyuraṃ |
yadiṃ śaktaḥ śriyo devyā raśmibhirghṛtemekadhā || 50 ||

hutvā hutvāpi vājyena vālayā cānna pūrṇayā |
aśvānanākhya manunā guruṃ vā duktayā sakṛt || 51 ||

hutvā tataḥ śriyo devyāghṛta paṃcadaśārṇayā |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā kṛtvā tatuḥ śrīmanubhistataḥ || 52 ||

ekāmapyāhutiṃ kṛtvā rājarājākhyavidyayā |
hutvā dvādaśadhāt yena hutvā vyāhṛtibhidhavaṃ || 53 ||

prāṇānāyamyastena samāsī nassukhāsane |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī vividyā japasaṃkalpamuccaret || 54 ||

<p. 83b>

chaṃda ārṣādikaṃ nyasya nyāsajātaṃto nyaset |
yadvā ṣaḍaṃgaṃ vinyasyavaiṣṇavīṃ mātṛkāṃ parāṃ || 55 ||

vinyasya daśadhā varṇanyāsaṃ kṛtvā tataḥ paraṃ |
cidrūpa mātṛkānyāsaṃ kṛtvā dhyātvā śriyaḥ patiṃ || 56 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ |
śatādhika sahasraṃ vājyet paṃcaśataṃ  tu vā || 57 ||

catuḥśataṃ vā triśataṃ dviśātaṃ vā śataṃ japaṃt |
sāyannātaśca madhyāṃhneghrāhmāṃ kāletha vā niśi || 58 ||

nārāyaṇāsasmāṇaṃmupi phalakarmajanaṃ |
nārāyaṇai yainābhī nityaṃ smṛtamīdvijai || 59 ||

tena dhanyataraṃ loke nāsti nāsti tapodhanāḥ |
nārāyaṇanusmaraṇaṃ yahāṃmādikamaṃsa || 60 ||

kṣutaprasravalanādyeṣṭaḥ kṛtaṃ saṃpūrṇasiddhidaṃ |
brahmaghno vā surāpīvāstepī vā gurutalpaga || 61 ||

tatsaṃyogābhūṇa vā pitṛmātṛ vidhātakaḥ |
nārāyaṇān smāṇaṃ kṛtvā prahamādarāt || 62 ||

parāṃgīto mavāpnoti vimuktaṃ pāparāśibhiḥ |
nārāyaṇānusmāraṇovatarpaṇaṃ śvavaṃmāḥ || 63 ||

annādhikāriṇaktāḥ pāpaimāktā bhavaṃtyapi nādhikāro bhavetye parāṃ 
gītamavāpnoti vimuktaḥ |
pāparāśibhiḥ nārāyaṇānusmaraṇe caturvarṇāśca paṃcamāḥ vedavākya 
śruvāvapi || 64 ||

śrīnārāyaṇanāmādyaṃ brahmaṇaḥ aramālanaḥ |
vedevedāṃtaśāstraihyasārabhūtaṃ sanātanaṃ || 65 ||

śrīnārāyaṇanāmādyaṃ smṛtvā smṛtyaṃtvajā api |
etatva kalevaraṃtyaktvā dvijātitvamavānyuyu || 66 ||

bhūtvā dvijātayaḥ paścādāryavadanāṃvujāt |
śrīmadṛṣṭākṣarīṃ labdhvā gatiṃ prāpyūnumāṃ || 67 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā japato yādṛśī gatiḥ |
tulā pūruṣamavāpnuyuḥ kovā pitāddarśānagātirbhavat || 68 ||

nārāyaṇānusmaraṇādapi nṛṇāṃ gatiḥ parā |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇa ja(*)ṇaṃ gatiḥ śakyā narvaṇiṃ tu || 69 ||

ayaṃ nārāyaṇai yogī vadarīvana madhyagaḥ |
dharmaputra prasannātmārsarvaloguruḥ smṛtaḥ || 70 ||

yatīnāṃ vaṃdane kāle śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīyaṇā |
upāryai vana maṃtyatra traparogati mubhāpsavā || 71 ||

tasmādavaśyamaṣṭārṇā vedavedavedāṃtasaṃgrahā |
ācāryakaraṇāprātyājapyā svargāyavagardā || 72 ||

avaidikaṃthā japyaṃ vṛthā dāna madakṣiṇaṃ |
anācārye vṛthahmātmakaṃ paraṃ niścalaṃkaṃ nirūpaṃ me satyānaṃda 
vidātyakaṃ || 75 ||

nirajanaṃ nirādhāraṃ nityaśuddhaṃ sanātanaṃ |
caturvedamayaṃ śabdabrahmasūyaṃ parāt yaṣṭākṣarī |
vācyaṃ vastvu brahmātmakaṃ paraṃ niśrutara || 76 ||

<p. 84a>

guṇātītaṃ guṇādhāraṃ vidhiviṣva śivārcitaṃ |
anaṃta macalaṃ sūkṣmaṃ manovāyāmagocaraṃ || 77 ||

śrīmadeṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃnu saṃdhānāt prakāśate 
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ aṣṭottaraśataṃ japan || 78 ||

anvahaṃ mucyaṃte pāpairbrahmadtyādikairapi |
dviśataṃ yojayonnityaṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī parāṃ || 79 ||

brahmahatyā supānasteya gurvaganāgemaiḥ |
pitṛmātṛvadhādyaiśca mahāpātakasucayaiḥ || 80 ||

upapātakajālaiśca sādhyairapi mucyate duṣkṛtaiḥ |
vārddhakeke yauvane vālye jāgrat svan prasuṃṣuptiṣu || 81 ||

manasā karmaṇā vajanājñāna kṛtairapi |
upātakajālai ca narakaprāpti hetubhiḥ || 82 ||

vimukto nātra saṃdeho gatiṃ prāpnotyathā kṣayāṃ |
traśataṃ yojayennityaṃ śrīyadaṣṭākṣaraṃ manuṃ || 83 ||

sarvavedeṣu yasurāṃyaṃ sarvakratuṣu yatphalaṃ |
vaṃdāneṣu yatparāyaṃ sarvatīrtheṣu yatphalaṃ || 84 ||

tadakṣaya phalaṃ prāpya labhate nupta māṃgatiṃ |
śrīpradaṣṭākṣīri nitya prajapedyaścatuḥśataṃ || 85 ||

tasyahe he sadātiṣṭaṃtyaṇimādyaṣṭa siddhayaḥ |
acaṃcalā mahālakṣmīrdhanadhānādi saṃkulā || 86 ||

tadīni vatyatyeva sāvadā caṃdratāratārakaṃ |
dīdhamo puṣpamārogyatesya dine dine || 87 ||

dhamortha kāmamokṣa ivyāḥ puruṣārthāścatuvidhāḥ |
tatkarā vrevasatyeva saṃśayo nātra vidyate || 88 ||

japtvāyaṃ vamāṃtaṃ nityaṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī parāṃ |
pādukāṃ janatyohādi sidhyakamanuttamaṃ || 89 ||

prāpnotyavaśyamaiśvarya maṇiyādi guṇānvitaṃ |
śaṃkhādinidhayastasya dvāritiṣṭhaṃtya caṃcalāḥ || 90 ||

kiṃkarīcāsya jihvāyāṃ brahmapalī vijṛṃbhate |
taṃ pālayaṃti mātiva mahālakṣmīḥ sutaṃ yathā || 91 ||

bhūtvā jātissaraḥ śīghraṃ svacchaṃ maraṇepi ca |
piturmātuḥ svapalyāśca kulairdvādaśabhiryutaḥ || 92 ||

kalevarāṃte viśati tadvai kuṭhayaṃdahareḥ |
śatādhikaṃ jastu sahasraṃ pratyahaṃ śuciḥ || 93 ||

saṣṭakokto mahahāyogī sākṣannārāyeṇe vibhu |
sa eva pūrvajagatāmācārya ṛṣirucyate || 94 ||

pūtāmavāti sarvesya darśanādapi pāpinaḥ |
tatsaṃbhāṣuṇatinhaṇamāgriyīmaṃ phalaṃ bhavet || 95 ||

varṣo dūrdha maheṃdrādyā api sākṣādvigīśvarāḥ |
kiṃkārāṃ tiṣṭhaṃti siddhāḥ kiṃ puruṣā api || 96 ||

samarcayaṃtiṃ munayo viśvāmitrādayopi ca |
taṃpāpalaṃ yati brāhmadyāmatarormeravā api || 97 ||

pārijātādayo vakṣāḥ kāmadhenugaṇā āpārvatā |
mahāyādiralānitahuhenivasaṃti hi || 98 ||

<p. 84b>

tadvaṃśa saṃbhavānāṃvu mukti lakṣmīkhacalā |
hastāṃvuje vasatyeva nātra kāryo vicāraṇā || 99 ||

sa eva dhātā viṣṇuśca śaṃkaraparameśvaraḥ |
sa eva jagataḥ karmāhatṛpīlayitāpi ca || 100 ||

tameva satata viprā jaganārdha harimucyataṃ |
triśatādhiku sahasraṃ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī parāṃ || 101 ||

yojayet pratyahaṃ śrāddhasta puṇyaphalaṃ paraṃ |
na śakyate mayā vaktaṃ hmarudrādrikairati || 102 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīnitthaṃ japtvā dine dine |
vāsudeva mahāvidyāṃ vaiṣṇavi ca ṣaḍakṣarī || 103 ||

yakṣa śaktya prajaptvātha raśamāyā dvādaśākṣarī |
lakṣmīhṛdayavidyāṃ vā śrīṣaḍarṇamathāpi vā || 104 ||

aṣṭārṇe vā mahālakṣāmyāḥ śatamaṣṭottaraṃ japet |
śaktaśvet sādhakavo nityaṃtyaṃ śriyaḥ yaṃ ca daśāṣmarī || 105 ||

triśataṃ dviṃśata vāpi yaśatamarthataratuṃ vā |
aṣṭaviṃśatidhāvapi jaṣmapaścādvinādīne || 106 ||

rājarājeśvarīṃ vidyāṃ suṃdarīvallumāmirdhā |
uttara brahmaṃ vidyāmaṣṭāviṃśāsurīyārāṃ || 107 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇī paścācchatamaṣṭottaraṃ japet |
āṣṭāti śātidhā vāpi jape dvādaśadhānvāha || 108 ||

rājarājākhyā vidyāyā yāvadābjīttaranvahaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāstā vallakṣa japāt phala || 109 ||

uktayāgaḥmaśāstreṣu bahmavidbhiḥ purātanaiḥ |
rājarājamahāvidyāṃ maṣṭāviṃśatidhānvahaṃ || 110 ||

prajaptvā śrīmadaṣṭāṇaṃ vidyāyāsyaṃga dakṣiṇāṃ |
aṣṭāviṃśati saṃkhyā kapuraścayaphilaṃ labhe || 111 ||

aṣṭaviṃśatita saṃkhyāka vedavārāyāṇāt kalaṃ |
aṣṭāti viṃśati saṃkhyāka mahādānaṣṭa lakṣabhaṃ || 112 ||

prāpnoti nātra saṃdehaḥ pratyahaṃ brahmanaṃdanā  |
rājārāja mahāvidyā sukṛtyaraṇatonvahaṃ || 113 ||

caturṇāmapiḥ vedānātāṃ vatpārāyaṇe |
phalaṃ śatakta phalaṃ sāṃgamaṣṭā viṃśati saṃkhyayā || 114 ||

rājarājamahāvaṃśatidhā japāt akṣayapta |
vāmauti sākṣād brahmameyau dvari || 115 ||

asau nārāyaṇaḥ syākṣaṇeḥ sākṣādbhagavānanyuto vibhuḥ |
amedha sahasra ca mahādānāyutaṃ tathā ||| 116 ||

bhūprā dakṣiṇya sahasra rājarājākhya vidyayā |
brahmaṇā tulitaṃ parvaṃ tathā vedacatuṣṭayaṃ || 117 ||

suṃdarī vallabhā rājārājavidyadhikā bhavat |
rājarājeśvarīvidyā suṃdarīllābhābhidhī || 118 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ jatyuḥ phalaṃ vaktu na śakyate |
rājarājeśvarījaverderdyejña śatairapī || 119 ||

prayojanmastīha brahmānaṃ pradīnaṃtaḥ |
rājarājeśvarījasurjātakaṃ mṛtaṃ tuva nā śaucaṃ || 120 ||

vidyate tasya pūrṇāvāyaṃ kṛpāpapidi || 120 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge rājarājāvadyā māhātmye paṃcatriṃśodhyāyaḥ] 
<p. 85a>

śrībhagavānuvāca ||

ṛṣirasyā mahāyogīdhame putro jarātyateḥ |
sādhyo nārāyaṇe pāpegī sarvejñau bhagavānvibhuḥ || 1 ||

sammohanastathā naṃdabhairavaścarvitā gaṃtau |
gāyatrama gāyatraṃ daivatayaṃ irityapi || 2 ||

chaṃda uktaṃ mahāyogī suṃdarīllabho vibhuḥ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇaḥ svāmīdeva raktāḥ purātanai || 3 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇa prītyautyai niyogaradāhṛtaḥ |
nāṃganyā karanyāsau nāṃginīcānyadevatā || 4 ||

svayameva purā prāha parabrahmamayī parā |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇīvidyā rājarājeśvarī kalā || 5 ||

sakatsmarati vā nityaṃ niyato yāghṛtraḥ tasyāhaṃ |
bhagavadyaktā mahāśrīsuṃdarīramāhadāsī || 6 ||

vanmare tasya vasova saṃbhyāvaṃ itārakaṃ |
itthaṃ bhagavatī gītaṃ śrurāvataśca śriyaḥ pate || 7 ||

aśvemedha sahasra ca samagra varadaukṣiṇāṃ |
mahepura sāmrājya bhogaṃ ca japisyatha || 8 ||

rājarājeśvarī vismaraṇī vānvahaṃ sakṛt |
brahmānaṃda sukhaprapti hetubhūta manaśvaraṃ || 9 ||

rājarājeśvarīvidyāmācāryojñā purassaraṃ |
praptuḥ śrīmadaṣṭārṇo śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarī || 10 ||

nyāsaṃ vinā puraścaryāṃ vināpi brahmanaṃdanāḥ |
siddhā bhavati bhaktānāṃ sarvasiddhipradāyinī || 11 ||

chaṃda ārṣādi mātraṃ ca vijñāya brahmanaṃ paṃcaṃ |
śākṣarīṃdanī śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī japtvā siddhau mevati sādhakaḥ || 12 ||

rājarājeśvarī japtvā svācārya caraṇādvaye |
vahulāṃ dakṣiṇāṃ datvā dhanadhānyādi saṃkulā || 13 ||

puraścaraṇā kṛtyena vināpi brahmanaṃdanā |
śrīṣadṛṣṭākṣīrī viṣṇvā siddhi prāpnoti śāśvatī || 14 ||

vīrajāyāḥ pare pāpare sudhāmo nidhi madhyamai |
ratnadviye manoramyeyāsijāta valāvūṃte || 15 ||

kalpabhūrudva saṃtāna haricaṃdana saṃvṛte |
ayodhyānagare tu tradivya prāsādaśobhite || 16 ||

anekayojanosuṃṣite garalaharmyo virājite |
vahuyojana vistīrṇe mamarvātkikaṃ mānvite || 17 ||

nityamuktaismamākorṇe siddhasādhyāgaṇaṃ vṛte |
tanmadhye maṃḍape tatyajāṃ kanada vibhūṣite || 18 ||

navamāṇikya khacite tanmadhye sumanohare |
navaṇikya sāhasrabhaṃ kāṃti virṇīrti || 19 ||

ciṃtāmaṇimaye tatra maṃḍape bhagavanniye |
bhagavā kiṃkara śreṣṭhaissarvatassamarpya kṛte || 20 ||

<p. 85b>

brahmavidyāmaheśādyaiścaturdvāreṣu śobhite |
urgāgaṇapati kṣetrayā na bhairavasobhite || 21 ||

śaṃkhayayāhude nidhibhismassarvatassamalaṃ |
kṛte madhye siṃhāsane ramye pārijātasya mūvage navaratnabhayeta tyajāṃvūnada 
vibhūṣite || 23 ||

tatrāsīnaṃ mahātmānaṃ kāla nīlāṃvada prabhaṃ || 23 ||

koṭi manmatha saṃkāśaṃ suṃdarāsyaṃ caturbhaja |
navaratnamaya śrīmajjāṃvūnada kirīṭinaṃ || 24 ||

kasūtī tilakopeta lalāṭaṃ kuṭilālaṃkaṃ |
padma yatra viśālākṣaṃ kāmacāpa samabhravaṃ || 25 ||

udyādakaṃ śataprakhya kuṃdadvayaśobhitaṃ |
smitavaktraṃ viśālākṣaṃ dāḍimī sadaśadvija || 26 ||

kaṃvugrīvaṃ muhoraskaṃ kasūrāgadabhūṣitaṃ |
aṃgulīyaka ratnaiśca muktāhāreṇa śobhitaṃ || 27 ||

kaistubhodbhāsthiteraskaṃ vanamālāvirājitaṃ |
śaṃkhavakrābhayavarakara śrīvatsavakṣatya || 28 ||

vidyutyujuhyatīkāśa pītāṃvaradhara vibhuṃ |
vīrāsana samāsīnaṃ varerāvaradaṃ vibhuṃ || 29 ||

nārāyaṇe jagannārthaparaṃ śrīsamamacyutaṃ |
asya vāmāṃkaparyaṃka sthito davītrāyī yaī || 30 ||

mahālakṣmīrjaganmātā tatyajāṃ kṛtadaprabhā |
vidyutkoṭi pratīśkaśayī varayugāvṛtā || 31 ||

navamāṇikyasāhita kirīṭāvṛta mastakāṃ |
lalāṭaya haṃsarājatkaskarītilakaṃkitā || 32 ||

kuṭilālakasaṃktā divyamālya vibhūṣitā |
divyacaṃnaliptāṃgīrājīvāyata locanā || 33 ||

aṃjanīcita netrāṃtā nīlotpaladalekṣaṇā |
śukraphalasamāktahema tāṭaṃkabhūṣitā || 34 ||

ratnamuktā phalopeta svaṇe vālī yugānvitā |
yamarāja samāyutanosikā bharaṇānvitā || 35 ||

srita vaktrā viśālākṣī pūṇai usacchānanāya |
kaviṃva phalaprakhyādharayuttama vibhūṣitā || 36 ||

dāḍimī vījāvajrābha daṃtayaṃdri vibhūṣitā |
muktāhārayuta grīvāpadakādi vibhūṣitā || 37 ||

caturbhujā kharṇaghaṭaktā mālā lasatkarāya |
prāśaṃkarā svarṇaciṃtākādi vibhūṣitā || 38 ||

kaṭakāṃgadakeyūra ratnabhūṣaṇabhūṣitā |
suvṛtta vimalortagahemakuṃbhānibhastanī || 39 ||

tanu madhyā pṛthuśroraginibhrānābhi vibhūṣitā |
kaladaīlītastaṃbha sukumāroru śobhitā || 40 ||

sauvarṇe pādakaṭakāṃgulīyuka vibhūṣitā |
māhārhābharaṇoyotā save sāmrājyānayikā || 41 ||

ayodhyāpura sāmrājyanāyikā viśvamātṛkā |
mahāśrīsurīdevī dakṣiṇesya śriyaḥ pate || 42 ||

udyat sūrya sahasrābhā japā kusuma sannibhā |
yamarāga mahāratna sunnibhā viśvanāyikā || 43 ||

divyaratnāṃvaradhara divyacaṃdana carcitā |
ikṣu vāmaṃ vayapyeṣu pāśāṃkuśālasatkarā || 44 ||

<p. 86a>

hārakepūra kaṭakamudrikābhiralekṛtā |
svaṇaṃ kāṃcī guṇeyetāratnakaṃcukasaṃyutā || 45 ||

navaratna samāyukta sauvarṇa makuṭāvṛtā |
yapra yatra viśālākṣīdinya kuṃḍalaśobhītā || 46 ||

ādyamūnaṇavitā yuktvā valilabhūṣitā |
suvṛtta hemakuṃbhābhustanayugma virājitā || 47 ||

suva vidyāmayī sa vabhihā siṃhāsaneśvarī |
sarvasammohakarī savalokavaśaṃkarī || 48 ||

trailokyakarṣaṇakarī devatā vṛṃdavaṃditā |
tatpartāvūnada prakhyātāṃ kanada vibhūcchitā || 49 ||

triputrā tripureśyādi divyavyaśaktibhirāvṛtā |
brahmaviṣṇumaheśeṃdra vadyaṃ māna pādaṃvujā || 50 ||

triśakti lakṣmīrayauva vāmabhagościyaḥ yate |
ūgoyakasaṃkośā vidyut sāhasra sannibhā || 51 ||

mātulugagavoyabha hemakubhalasatkarā |
divyapītāṃ varadharā kirīṭādi vibhūṣitā || 52 ||

kanatkanakaciṃtākahostu puraśebhitā divyasrava |
sragvasra saṃchaṃnnā divyagaṃdha vibhūṣitā || 53 ||

tāṃvūla carvaṇa sakṛmukhayamī virājitā |
rājovayatra sadṛśa netra yugma vibhūṣitā || 54 ||

sauvarṇavālīṃ ugalātāṭaṃkadvayamūpitā |
prasannavaṃdanāsubhūḥ saṃsmītāna na paṃkajā || 55 ||

ratnamuktā phaloyeta kāṃcīdīma virājitā |
sudhāpūrita sauvaṇa kilaśopamasustanī || 56 ||

śuddhamuktā kalaśrībhadratnakaṃcukaśobhitā |
āṃgalīyakakeyūra divyakaṃkaṇā bhūṣitā || 57 ||

gaurīlakṣmī mahāvārṇo rūpiṇī vedamātṛkā |
icchājñānakriyo śāktirūpiṇī parasūpikaṃcukaśobhitā || 58 ||

āṃgulīyaka keyūra divyakaṃkaṇābhūṣitā |
ṇī vedamātṛkā icchājñāna kriyośāktirūpiṇī pararūpiṇī || 58 ||

brahmarudramahehādi sevyamāna padāṃvujā |
trīmūrti rūpātrayyaṃt rūpiṇī ca trayī mayī || 59 ||

trailokyarūpā trailokyarūpiṇī ca trayī yauśāktirūpiṇī |
pararūpiṇī patyātrau lokyarūpiṇī ca trayīmayī trisraṃ śaktilakṣmīḥ 
sāmrājyālakṣmīrviśvaṃbharā triyā || 60 ||

cāmara dvayaghāṭīdoyo vāmakṣiṇayoḥ śutrapīmayi |
trailokya śrubhe nīlodevī mahīdevyau divyākalpavibhūṣite || 61 ||

divya cāmara hastāśca vimalādya mṛśa kṛpa |
divyābharaṇa saṃpannā divyasragvasra saṃvatāḥ || 62 ||

nārāyaṇasya jagatāṃ nāthasya kamalāyate |
paścābhāge sthitā devyaḥ smita vaktrāṃvujāḥ śubhā || 63 ||

pārśvayo īśadhātoro gaurī vāṣṇī savitau |
suvarṇo ratnasaṃvarṣi śvetacchatravaro vibhuḥ || 64 ||

<p. 86b>

paśvādbhāge sthito viṣṇūrlakṣmīyukto jagatyaviḥ |
mūrtimaṃtaścaturvedāścaturdikṣvasya saṃsthitāḥ || 65 ||

yajeśvaro jagatsvāmīrvayajñamayo vibhūḥ |
sāmrājyalakṣmīsahitaḥ puratosya virājate || 66 ||

kratavo dakṣiṇā yuktā mūrtimaṃtastrayī mayāḥ |
divyarūpadharābhāṃti puratīsyaści padyate || 67 ||

mahāśrīsuṃdarī devyā mahālakṣmyā samanvitaṃ |
triśaktilakṣmyasahitaṃ nīlābhūmi samānvitaṃ || 68 ||

vimalādyamṛmahiṣī sahitaṃ parameśvaraṃ |
mūrtimabhiścaturvadaussaṃstutaṃ jagatāṃ patiṃ || 69 ||

śrīyukta vāsudevādyaiḥścatudviṃkṣavirājitaṃ |
brahmaviṣṇumaheśaṃ ipramadāmarasevitaṃ || 70 ||

anaṃtavihagādhīśavidyakonādibhirvṛtaṃ |
sarvayajapatiṃ sadyaṃ jagatāṃpati macyutaṃ || 71 ||

ādityaṃ maṃḍalāṃtasthaṃ caṃdramaṃḍalamadhyagaṃ |
vahnimaṃḍalamadhyasthaṃ paramaṃ purulaṃ vibhuṃ || 72 ||

satyānaṃda cidākāraṃtamaḥ vāre pratighitaṃ |
nārāyaṇaṃ jagannāthamanaṃtaṃ parameśvaraṃ || 73 ||

āśraye praraprāmātmānaṃ yogīdhyeyaṃ śriyaḥ pati |
ardhvega śrīpatirvadvādhyāyennārāyaṇīrvibhuṃ || 74 ||

saṃtapta hemavara ratnavibhūṣaṇacchāyītāṃ |
varaṃ suvadanaṃ varamālyabhūyaṃ yamādiśaṃ |
khavilasatkarapuṃjāḍhyamarddheddire śamaniśaṃ harimāśrayāmaḥ || 75 ||

yogāsanaṃ vividha bhūṣaṇābhūṣitāṃgaṃ yogīṃ |
imānahyasamurcitayādayamaṃ hemāṃvujā || 76 ||

bhamumalaṃ kamalaṃ kamalāyatākṣa maheṃdire |
śamaniśeharimāśrāyāmaḥ || 77 ||

māṇikyamuktā phalaśobhikaṃṭaṃ yatāvaraṃ mālya sa gaṃdhapaktaṃ |
kirīṭa cakrātva vibhūṣaṇāhyamaddhāṃga lakṣmīrpāṃtamarcayāmaḥ || 77 ||

ādarśa śaṃkha jalajarilāsatkarātvamanyonyayāśvekarallavabhūṣaṇachaṃrāma 
suvarṇatunumīśavidhīravaṃdya maheṃdire śamaniśaṃ harimāśrayehaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ 
mahātmānaṃ rājarājeśvarī vibhusyai lakṣmīpatirdhyātvā hṛdayovuja madhyame 
rājarājeśvarīvidyāṃ sakṛdvāpyanvahaṃ japan sarvāsāmapi vidyābhāṃ puraścaryā 
phalaṃ śubhaṃ || 80 ||

saṃprāpya sarvapāpaudyaurvimuktaḥ susvapnaśrute |
avāpya sarvaśreyāṃsi brahmasāyujya siddhibhāk || 81 ||

ācāryamevahṛtyame yadvā nārāyaṇāptakaṃ |
śrīrūpīṇyā svayalyācya sahitaṃ parameśvaraṃ || 82 ||

rājarājamahāvidyāṃ makhila siddhibhāk |
jagattritaya sāmrājya hetubhūtāṃ sanātanī || 83 ||

rājarājeśvarī nityaṃ svānārāyaṇe bhavet |
gatyame tadapi dhyāna sūklaṃ yugmabhya ādarāt || 84 ||

kathitaṃ sarvapāpaghnaṃ sarvapurā phalapradaṃ |
pratyahaṃ dhyāna sūktaṃ vā paṭhedvānanyayāṃnasaḥ ||
mahatīṃ sīddhimāsādya prāpnoti bhagavatpadaṃ || 

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge rājarājavidyāhāthaṣaṭtriṃśodhyāyaḥ] |
<p. 87a>

śrībhagavānuvāca ||

upāsanā kramaṃ vakṣye sācakānāṃ hitāyavaḥ |
mayokta vidhino yāmya jīvanmūkto bhavetpumān || 1 ||

brāhmemuhūrta utthāya smartve gurupādakāṃ |
brahmavidyāṃ praptvātha śrīśrīsāśadvādaśākṣarī || 2 ||

raśmimālā manusmṛtyatredhā vā paṃcadyaukadhā |
suprābhātamahāsmotraṃ paṭhitvā tadanaṃtaraṃ || 3 ||

nārāyaṇābhidhe carmaśaktaśvesujayenūthā |
nārāyaṇātmakaṃ divyaṃ kavacaṃ vajraṃ yajaraṃ || 4 ||

brāhekāleva vā prātarmadhyāhne sāmeva vā |
niśāyāyamarddharātraivāptvācaryā purassaraṃ || 5 ||

yatra japtvā sarve vidyodyairvimuktonurritairataipi |
siddhimānyoti mahatīṃ trailokyenāpi durlabhāṃ || 6 ||

śriyaḥ paṃcadaśārṇeyā raśmimūktamataḥ paraṃ |
anusmṛtya sakṛdvāpi śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarī || 7 ||

āṣṭaviṃśātadhā japtvā vahirnirgatya sādhakaḥ |
kṛta śaucastataḥ srātvā saṃdhyāṃ katvo tataḥ paraṃ || 8 ||

nityahomaṃ samāpyātha bhūyopyācārya pādukāṃ |
kṛtāṃjali puṭo natvā śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ śubhāṃ || 9 ||

nyāsapūrvaṃ japennityaṃ sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ |
sahasramatharvā paṃcaśataṃ vāpi catuḥśataṃ || 10 ||

triśataṃ vājapennityamathavāṣṭottaraṃ śubhaṃ |
nocedadhogatipro bhaviṣyati na saṃśayaḥ || 11 ||

vāsudeva dvādaśārṇa vaityuvīṃ ca ṣaḍakṣarī |
yathā śaktyā prajapatvātha dvādaśāṇāṃ śriyo japet || 12 ||

mahālakṣmī japedyadvā tataḥ paṃcadaśākṣarīḥ |
aṣṭottarasāte nitya umadhyaviṃśatidhāpivā || 13 ||

lakṣmīvidyā catuṣkaṃ ca daśadvādaśadhā japet |
rājeśvarīvidyāṃ mahāsiṃhāsaneśvarī āṣṭa || 14 ||

viṃśa aṣṭottaraśataṃ nitya umaṣṭa viṃśatidhāpivā |
lakṣmīvidyā ca tidhā nityasaṃmoratsādhakoktamaḥ |
athavā samaye brāhme saṃsasṛtyācāryapādukā || 15 ||

brahmavidyāṃ prajapatvātha gabhaṭavadrasmimālikāṃ |
snātvā saṃdhyāmuyāsyātha śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī śubhāṃ || 16 ||

nyāsa pūrvājapenyāsarahitāṃ vājapevuśvīḥ |
vāsudeva mahāvidyāṃ vaiṣṇavīvaṃ ṣaḍakṣārī || 17 ||

yathā śaktyātha saṃskṛtya kamalā dvādaśākṣarī |
lakṣmīṃ hṛdayavidyāṃ vā prajaptvāṣṭottavaṃraśata || 18 ||

rājarājeśvarīvidyā japet mūrṇa kalānyaye |
ātrāpya śākto bhagavaddha ca vidyāṃ dine dine || 19 ||

saṃsmṛtya samupeghrāṃ saṃdhyāmuyāsya ca |
nityahomaṃ ca nirvartya śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī parā || 20 ||

ṣaḍaṃga mātṛkānyāsa keśavanyosa pūrvikāṃ |
cihnaya mātṛkārvamavaśya pratyahaṃ japet || 21 ||

<p. 87b>

atrāpya śaktau devāṣe chaṃdāṃsi nyasya vānvahaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāmācāryājñā purassara || 22 ||

triśatādhika sāhasra sahasraṃ vānvahaṃ japet |
japet paṃcaśataṃ yadvā triśataṃ vā catuḥśataṃ || 23 ||

dvādaśāṇaṃ śriyaḥ yaśvājjaiyadaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ |
lakṣmīhṛdayavidyāṃ vā yathā śaktyā prajapyatha || 24 ||

rājarājeśvarī viṃmuyānmahat || 26 ||

rājarājeśvarīvidyā smaraṇādanvahaṃ dvijāḥ |
bhāgavadraśmi sūktasya mahasrādvatitaṃ phalaṃ || 27 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyā lakṣajñāya phalaṃ tathā |
prāpnoti pratyaha bhūmau saṃśayo nātra vidyate || 28 ||

śrīrāmaḥ ||

nārāyaṇatmakaṃ varmavakṣethahyanaṃdanāḥ |
yajjaptvā pratyahaṃ dhīmābhārāyaṇa meyo bhavet || 29 ||

ṛṣirnāsiyaṇaiyogī dharmaputrā jagatpatiḥ |

daivī gāyatrī |

chaṃdaḥ lakṣmīnārāyaṇe vimu || 30 ||

paramātmā mahāyogī devatā samudīritaḥ |
yādajānūhaṃ yugale vīdare hṛdivorasi || 31 ||

vaktramūrdhvānu pūrṣoṇa śrīmadaṣṭākṣarānyaset śiraḥ |
prabhṛti pādāṃtaṃ sūyopyāṣṭekṣaṇarānprāset || 32 ||

prasāvādhān sarvavarṇanbhayotān vinyaet sadā |
tarjanyādika niṣkāṃtu maṃguṣṭha dviteyapi ca || 33 ||

vāsudeva mahāvidyāvarṇān parvasucanyaset |
pūrvavat praṇavādyāṃścajñamotāṃ vinyasedadha || 34 ||

kāraṃ hṛdi vinyasyāvikāraṃ mūrdhni vinyaset |
ṣavaṇaṃ cebhyormadhye śikhāyāṃṇakṣā tathā || 35 ||

vekāraṃ netrayugale na kara saṃvaseviṣṭha |
makāramastraṃ vinyasya sa visarga ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ || 36 |||

maṃtramūrtirbhavetso bhārāyaṇa mayāḥ pumān |
dhyāye svahṛdayāṃbhojeva devaṃ jagatpati na || 37 ||

kāraṃ sarvasaṃcivaṣumakāramastraṃ visasya sa visrga ṣaḍaṃga |
paṇayaḥ pumān dhyoyehva hṛdayābhoje devadevaṃ jagatpati || 37 ||

dhyeyassadā sa vitṛmaṃḍala madhyavatto nārāyaṇassa rasijānā sanniviṣṭaḥ |
keyūravānmakarakuṃḍalavānkirīṭīhārīra rāmayavayurdhataśaṃ śvacakraḥ || 38 ||

ardhāṃga śrīpatiṃ yadvā dhyoyennārāyaṇaṃ vibhuṃ || 39 ||

hastau vibhrāṃt sarasijadā śaṃkhacakrāṇi vidyāṃ papādaśaṃkina kaleśaṃ meva 
vidyudvilāsaṃ |
vāmottaṃgastanāviratā kalpamāśleṣu lobhodekī bhūtaṃ kara ravatanaḥ 
puṃḍarīkākṣa lakṣmyauḥ || 40 ||

<p. 88a>

traiṣṭrabhoyaṃ mahāmaṃtrā dhyāna śloka udīritaḥ |
gacchan stiṣṭanasvapanarbhūtan jāgratānnapi || 41 ||

hasannapi dhyānaślokamamuṃ smṛtvā vrajatyeva |
mahadyaśaḥ rājarājeśvarī vidyā japahomādikarmasu || 42 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā japahomādi karma |
sudhyāna maṃtramamuṃ smṛtva siddhiṃ prāpnotyanumaṃ || 43 ||

svātmānamathavā dhyāyennārāyaṇamanāptayaṃ vaṃcchakti sahitaṃ |
sarvavidyā tejastayomayaṃ nārāyaṇīṃ varmavidyāṃ prayatotha smuccare || 44 ||

oṃ ||

hariviṃda dhyān mamasarvarakṣāṃ nyaṃstāṃghri padmaḥ yategeṃ |
iṣṭaṣvedarācarmāsigadesvāyaṃ pāśāndadhānoṣṭa guṇeṣṭa vāhuḥ || 45 ||

jaleṣumāṃ rakṣatu matsya mūrtirpādo gaṇebhyo varuṇasya |
pāśāt syalevamāyāvadu vāmanovyāṃ trivikramaḥ khecatu viśvarūpaḥ || 46 ||

durgeśvaravyājimukhaṃ diṣu pramuḥdyāyānnasihosurapṛthavāriḥ |
vīmuṃcato yasya mahyadahāṃ saṃdiśo vinedranyayastaṃścagamāḥ || 47 ||

rakṣatvasau mādyani yajñakalpaḥ svavaṃṣṭayonnītardharo varāhaḥ |
rāmodrikūṭe śūrthe vipravo sa salakṣmāṇevyādbhātāgratomā || 48 ||

māmugra dharmadī khilāt prapādānnārāyaṇaḥ pātu naraścahyasā tadattastvayoge 
varāhaḥ |
romādidiṣṭatha vipravo sa sanakṣmoṇevyādbhātāgrajomāṃ śaḥ kapilaḥ 
karmavaṃdhāt || 49 ||

sanatkumārovatu kāmadevā iyaṃ śeṣāṃmāṃ pathi devehelanātū |
devadhiviryuḥ sūṣārvanāṃtarān karmoharirmāṃ nirayāṃdaśeṣāt || 50 ||

vanvatari bhagavāgnyātmā pathyādvadvādbhayā ibho nirjitātmā |
yajñaśca lokādavati rahitāṃtādvalogaṇā krodhavaśādehīdaḥ || 51 ||

dvaipāyano bhagavān pravodhā uddhaśca pāṣaṃḍagaṇatpramādāt |
kākiḥkaleḥ kālamalāt prayātu dharmāvanāyorukṛtāṃvatāraḥ || 52 ||

māṃ keśavogadayā prītaravyāho vidabhāsaṃgavamābhaveṇaḥ |
nāyaṇaḥ prāhū udābhaśaktirmadhyāṃ dine viṣṭararī iyāṇiḥ || 53 ||

devo parānhe madhuhogradhanyāsāya tridhāmāvatu mādhavomāṃ |
doṣai hṛsīkerā utārdharātre niśātha ekova tuṣannanāthaḥ || 54 ||

śrīvatsadhāmāpararānna īśaḥ prahṛṣa īśo sidhaṇai janārdanaḥ |
dāmodaro vyādan sadhyaṃ prabhāte viśveśvaro bhagavān kālāmūrtiḥ || 55 ||

<p. 88b>

cakraṃ yugāṃtānalatigmanemi bhramatsamaṃtāṃdbhāgavastrayuktaṃ |
daṃdagdhidaṃgdhyarisainyamāśukakṣaṃ yathāvāta sakho hutāśanāḥ || 56 ||

gadeśa nisparśana visphuliṃge niṣpiḍinipyiṃhyajita priyāsikaṣa |
pāṃḍavaināyakayakṣarakṣobhūtagrahāṃścarṇayacūrṇayārīna || 57 ||

tvaṃ pātu dhāna pramatha pretamātṛpiśācāva pragrahaghoradaṣṭān |
dareravīśa ca yakasya pūrito bhīma svaneri hṛdiyā'nikaṃpan || 58 ||

tvaṃtimmādhāṇasi vaṇarisaināmīśa prayukto macchicicchiṃdhi |
cakṣūṣinarman chatacaṃ icchādayadviṣāmaghotāṃ harapāpa cakṣuṣaṃ || 59 ||

pannobhayaṃ grehebhyo bhūkte tubhyo nṛpa eva ca |
sarīsmāyebhyo |daṃṣṭribhyo bhūtebhyādyebhya enavā || 60 ||

sarpārāyetāniga bhagavābhāmarūpastra kīrtanāt |
prayāṃtu saṃkṣayaṃ sadyo yonaḥ śreyaḥ pratīyakā || 61 ||

guruḍo bhagarvāstotrastobhaṃ chaṃdo mayaḥ prabhuḥ |
rakṣatve śeṣakṛcchebhyo viṣvavaenaḥ svanāmabhiḥ || 62 ||

sarvāphanoharernāma rūpāyānāyudhāminaḥ |
vuddhīdriya manaḥ prāṇanyāṃ tu pārṣada bhūṣaṇāḥ || 63 ||

yathā hi bhagavāneva vasutaḥ sadasaccayat |
satyenānenanaḥ sairve pāṃtunā śamuyardravā || 64 ||

yathaikālyānubhāvānāṃ vikalpā rahitaḥ svāyaṃ |
bhūṣāṇayudhaliṃgāravyādhatteśaktīḥ khamā yayā || 65 ||

tenaiva satyamānena sarvajño bhagavān hariḥ |
pātu sairvesvarūpainasidā sarvakti sarvagi || 66 ||

vidikṣādi dikṣūrdhamadhaḥ samaṃtādaṃtarvadi |bhagivānnāgamihaṃ |
prahāpayan lokabhayaṃ svanena svatejasāgrasta samastatejāḥ || 67 ||

oṃ trayoviṃśati saṃkhyāka ślokātmakaṃmidaṃbhaṃ |
ekaviṃśati sa ekabhaṃtra rūpaṃ śaskaraṃ || 68 ||

nārāyaṇātmakaṃ varma pronname tatphalapradaṃ |
samasta uritaudyaghnaṃ sarvavighnavināśanaṃ || 69 ||

samastaiśvarya phaladaṃ sarvadā rikṣyābhajanaṃ |
samastāpahaṇaharaṃ sarvavidyāphalapradaṃ || 70 ||

ajñābhatimidaudya aṃvaturṣarga phalapradaṃ |
vaiṣṇavaṃ kacaṃ divyaṃ sarvatrā vījayapradaṃ || 71 ||

śubhemasiśurbhalagre divase ca śubhetathā |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ prāṇiyāta purassaraṃ || 72 ||

arcaṃ pitvā khilairarthervastrevarābhāṇaurapi |
dāsīdāsangajāśvādyau vaiplavaṃ kavacaṃ śubhaṃ || 73 ||

ācāryānugrahāt prāpya satataṃ vijayī bhavet |
dervoyadiṣṭāmayitāśrīmādaṣṭākṣarī parāṃ || 74 ||

ācāryavadanāṃbhorūdītvādau kṛtāṃjaliḥ |
vāsudeva mahāmaṃtra vaiṣṇavaṃ ca ṣaḍakṣaraṃ || 75 ||

gṛhītvā tatyāṃ carmagrahītavyamidaṃ paraṃ |
iyaṃ nārāyanārāyaṇī sarvadevatārūpiṇī parā || 76 ||

kavacākhyā mahāvidyā japyalakṣmī samṛddhidā |
kavacaṃ vaiṣṇavāṃ rivyaṃ vedavedāṃtasaṃgrahaṃ || 77 ||

śrīyaskaraṃ śubhakaraṃ nityavijayaṃ siddhidaṃ |
nārāyaṇe mahayogīdhamaṃ putro jagatpatiḥ || 78 ||

<p. 89a>

vidyāmetāṃ purā dṛṣṭvā brahmaṇe śaṃkurāya ca |
vivivasvatedadhī vā padattavān sarvasiddhidāṃ || 79 ||

nāradāyāṃjane pāpavivasvānupapidiṣṭavān |
devārṣevarye bhaṃgavā bhārado brahmanaṃdana || 80 ||

jīvanmukte bhavajjatvā vidyāmetāṃ phalapradāṃ |
hiṇayakasutāyātha prahrādāya sadattavāt || 81 ||

asyā eva prabhāvena prāhrādo bhagavasriyaḥ viṣaśastrāgnityā |
dhairavardhyo vadhyatva manaprāpyānatyaṃ vijayamātavān || 84 ||

davīvassatataṃ taptvā bhavarma nārāyaṇatmakaṃ |
śiṣyāya dattavā tvaṃ dyetvaghrāsopirātmāhāsvaiyu vibhu || 85 ||

dattavān viśvasūpāya viśvarūpo māhāyaśāḥ |
prārthiti vahuśā pūrvaṃ maheśayayā pradattavān || 86 ||

maheṃdrosyāḥ prabhāvervana jitvā sugaṇānyu |
nārāyaṇamavilokānāṃ rājyaśriyāmavāptavān || 87 ||

āvāpyā sarvasāmrājyaṃ lakṣmī suguṇānvitāṃ |
drohamasya ca koraṃdromannosajya śriyā vibhūḥ || 88 ||

ācārya rohāto brahmahatyā sāhasrātodhikaṃ |
prāpāvānpātakaṃ ghoraṃ bhraṣṭaṃ śrīrāmavattathā || 89 ||

vācaspati prasadina hayamedha sahasravaṃ |
saṃpūrṇa dakṣiṇakraṃ ca kāyāraranāyaka || 90 ||

tathāyāka nadya devarājasyanā bhavat bhūyoyoyita gatyatiḥ |
daityadā bhavadaṃ kṣebhiḥ kāle kalitiraracchātaḥ bhūyopi mraṣṭavukṣmīko bhūyopi 
śriyamāt pravān svāyaṃbhurvādibhi śāstre viprahatyātāsya ca || 94 ||

micchatirvihitācāryardrāhakurtananiṣkatiḥ |
vāpi surāyā nāyutaṃ tuṃ vā || 95 ||

svarṇasteyu yutaṃ vāpi gurutalpāyutaṃ tu vā |
manvādi dharmaśāstrokta prāyaścita śruti || 96 ||

ācāryasyā nṛtaṃ vā vāmuktāhaṃ kṛtya vā sakṛt |
tvakṛṃtya vā māhādānānāyutairapi na śudhyati || 97 ||

satyamidaṃ satyaṃ nātra saṃśayakaya kāraṇaṃ |
tasmādavaśyacāyaṃ prinairarthordhiyāgirā || 98 ||

arcayenniyato nityasimacchanmahattarāva tu |
mukho vidhātā sau svasatebhyaḥ prattavān || 99 ||

brahmā putrā mahātyānassanakādyā mahaujasaḥ |
saptvā nārāyaṇīvidyāṃ prāsriddhimattamāṃ || 100 ||

brahmaputrovaśiṣye sauyotrāya kathayiṣyati |
nārāyaṇe mahāyogī tasya putro bhaviṣyati || 101 ||

kṛṣṇa dvaipānonāmrā vedavyāso mahātayāḥ |
syāpi bhagavān śaṃbhurdakṣiṇemūtrirīśvaraḥ || 102 ||

bhaviṣyati śuko nāmnāsu ānaṃda vaddenaḥ |
naumiṣṭe sumahāraroyeśaunakādibhya ādarāt || 103 ||

vidyāmetāṃ māmaha yogo kathayiṣyatitvātaḥ |
tepi sarve mahāprājñā vidhā metāmāko nāmnā || 104 ||

suta ānadavaddhanaḥ naumiṣyesumugavidāṃ varāṃ |
śukācārya svenaiva bhūmau vidyā prakāśitā || 105 ||

vidyāmetāmadhītyeśaḥ śaṃkaraḥ parameśvaraḥ |
tripurādyari saṃhāraṃ kṛtvābhū bhagavān śivaḥ || 106 ||

<p. 89b>

sarvajñatva mavāpyātha kumārāya pradattavān |
trailokya japinaṃ raudramavaśyamapi daivato || 107 ||

tārakaṃ jitavsanasyāḥ prabhāvādīśvarātmavajaḥ |
asyāḥ paṭhanato bhūmau deśikaṃ ghriprasādataḥ || 108 ||

ekana janmanā mukti prāṃpravatti dvijarṣabhāḥ |
vyatīvāte mahāyoge ravisaṃkramaṇepi vā || 109 ||

ekādaśī dine yadvā deśikājñā purasāsmaraṃ |
śrīmadaṣyakṣarīvidyāṃ japet paṃcaśatādhikaṃ || 110 ||

sahasraṃ prayato bhūtvā vāsudevaṃ mahāmanuṃ |
japtvapiśanamekāṃte vaidyevaṃ ca ṣaḍaśaraṃ || 111 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā śrīvidyā dvādaśākṣarīṃ |
prajaptvā triśataṃ prājño vidyāmaṣṭā daśākṣarī || 112 ||

aṣṭottare śataṃ japtva rājarājeśvarīmatha |
śatamaṣṭottaraṃ japtvā vidyāmetā mataḥ paraṃ || 113 ||

cādhikaṃ ca catvāriśaṃ dvāraṃ prajapet sudhī |
vidhivat saṃskṛte vahnau svācāryājñā purussaraṃ || 114 ||

ājyaṃ paṃcaśataṃ hutvā śrīmadaṣṭārṇe vidyāyā |
vidyayā vāsudevasya śatamaṣṭottaraṃ hunet || 115 ||

vaidyavyā vidyayāya paścādaṣṭā viśatidhāghṛte |
ekaviṃśati saṃkhyāṃkamaṃtraiḥ śrīpatimavarmaṇaḥ || 116 ||

ghetana paṃcadhā hutvā dvādaśarṇa śriyā ghṛtaṃ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā vidyayā dvādaśārṇayā || 117 ||

aṣṭā viṃśatidhā hutvā rājarājāravya vidyayā |
āṣṭaviṃśatidhā hutvā prāyaścitterhunevṛtaḥ || 118 ||

mahāvyāhṛtibhirjātvā kṛtvāṃ brahmārpamāryaṇahutiṃ |
deśikāghriṃ yugaṃ natvā sāṣṭāṃgaṃ daṃḍavat sudhīḥ || 119 ||

vastrairābharaṇairhemairabhyarcyācāyemādarāt |
vaṣṭāśinamitta dravyamarpayeccaraṇadvaye || 120 ||

tadardhā vā tadardha vā triniṣkamathavārpayet |
vastrerābharaṇaipalomācāryasyātha pūjayet || 121 ||

samyagbhojyāmmavāsinyo dvādaśa brāhmarāga āpi |
deśikānugrahāt siddhiṃ prāyotpanna na saṃśayaḥ || 122 ||

tadārasya jayonnityaṃ paṃcādhāvātridhai japet |
kadhā samāstarastaravyādhi saṃdyaddhaṃsi yaṭī yasī || 123 ||

anayā sadṛśī vidyā triṣṭu lokeṣu durlabhā |
āraṇyevā naraṇye vā vokhyāghra samākule || 124 ||

jagāsiṃha mahāvyāghra saṃkeṭe bhūta saṃkaṭe |
brahmarākṣasavetālayakṣakūṣyaṃḍasaṃkaṭe || 125 ||

sakṛdeva prajapye vedaṃ vaiṣṇuvaṃ kavacaṃ śubhaṃ |
tyuktaḥ sakalamītimyojayaṃ prāpnoti śāśvataṃ || 126 ||

yatrai tatpadhyate nityaṃ vauṣṇuvaṃ kavacaṃ śubhaṃ |
gṛhadauyādaśādoṣāḥ pūrva karmānugāstathā || 127 ||

vātapittakaphobhakṣarogā api sudāruṇaḥ |
ariṣṭānyapi naśyaṃti kavacesya japādvijāḥ || 128 ||

<p. 90a>

dustare jalasaṃvāte tajjalaṃ sthalatāṃ vrajet |
siṃhā api mṛgāyaṃte hārāyaṃte phaṇīśrarāma || 129 ||

araṇye prāktare vāpi dāvāgni parivārite |
dasyābhiḥ pīḍito vāpi jṛdiṃto vāpi śatrubhiḥ || 130 ||

kruddhena rājñā vājñatyo vadhavaṃdhakora paramāt |
vātenā ghūrṇito vāpi vimagnaśva mahārṇave || 131 ||

nārāyaṇātmakaṃ maṃ smṛtvā sakṛdapi dvijāḥ |
prāpnoti vijayaṃ sadyo muktasmakala saṃkaṭāt || 132 ||

sarvasva prāṇahoṇajāmavedyadi paṃcavāramidaṃ |
japtvā svācārya varaṇadvaye || 133 ||

yatkiṃcidapi vā vittaṃ dattvā gacche tataḥ paraṃ |
rājā dāso bhavettasya prāṇairapi dhanerapi || 134 ||

nityaṃ paṃcadaśāvṛtyā japan varṣamataṃ dritaṃ |
śāyān grahasrāmarthyaṃ prāpya nityajapaṃ śubhaṃ || 135 ||

svacchaṃdamarṇe bhūtvā prāpnotyevottamāṃ gatiṃ |
āyuṣyaṃ mahadārogyamaiśvaryamaṇimādikaṃ || 136 ||

svacchaṃdamaraṇāṃ jātismāraṇaṃ ca mahattaraṃ |
chatraya nimukti svārājya padavīmapi || 137 ||

kavacasyāsya māhātmanyot yatratra na saṃśayaḥ |
rahasyame tatkavacaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ vajrapaṃjara || 138 ||

japtvā nitya viśuddhātmāmūtyuṃ japati sādhakaḥ |
sthāvaragamamapi kṛtrimaṃ ca mahadviṣaṃ || 139 ||

hālāhalaṃ madahīyāra sumapi tasya śarīragaṃ |
satya evāmṛtī bhūtvā vinaśyati na saṃśaya || 140 ||

maṃtraṃ tatra mahāyaṃtra kṛtyā api sudāruṇaḥ |
tadveśapi vinaśyati dvijāgryaurapi coditāḥ || 141 ||

japtvā paṃcadaśākalā bhavamaṃ nārāyaṇātmakaṃ saṃśayaḥ |
varṇanapāṇātmātmakaṃ ekākī purato gacchetyaṃ grāmāmi mukhaḥ śuciḥ || 142 ||

devāsura māhīsena nā samaṃ tatsainyaprapyasau |
nārāyaṇātmako bhūtvā vijityāri niṣkaṃdanaḥ || 143 ||

yamuloprāṃpaniyutarā gacchati dhruvaṃ na |
kurvaṃti kṣatitasya mahāstrārīyā saṃtata || 144 ||

mahādaridra yukto vā mahāroga hatopi vā |
japtvaidaṃ vaiṣṇavaṃ varma dhanadhānyādi saṃkulāṃ || 145 ||

acalāṃ śriya sāptākṣati tasya māhāsrāṃrāyapi |
saṃtataṃ ciraṃjātismorā bhūvā labdhvā sarvamanorathān || 146 ||

bhukteha sakalān bhogānaṃte haripadaṃ labhet |
tiṣṭhaṃti [sādhadasārārthasagre uttarabhāge |
rājarājavidyā māhālye satyatriśodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 90a>

śrībhagavānuvāca ||

rājarājā mahāvidyā yajanaṃ saṃpravakṣyotaṃ |
śrūṇudhva yoginassarve brahmayuktā dṛḍhavratāḥ || 1 ||

rājarāja mahāvidyāṃ nityamaṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ |
aṣṭā viśatidhā vāpi daśadvādaśadhāpivā || 2 ||

japtvātya sahamekāṃte sahasraraṇaṃ mahāmanuṃ |
śriyaḥ paterbhagavatassakṛjjaptvā tataḥ paraṃ || 3 ||

<p. 90b>

śriyo devyāḥ suhasrārṇaṃ mātāmaṃtra manussasmaret |
pīṭhapūjāṃ vidhāyādau ca yodhyāpuranāmakaṃ || 4 ||

śrīcakraṃ saṃpratiṣṭhāpya mahāsiṃhāsanāsakaṃ |
layāṃga pūjāṃ mātraṃ vā kṛtvādau mini yatvrataḥ || 5 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇau paścāt sālagrāmā śilānvite |
cakrarājārdyayennityaṃ sugaṃdhi kusumaiḥ śrībhaiḥ || 6 ||

nauvedyakāle śrīdevyaibhama uccārya yatnataḥ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇīvidyāṃ daśārāmāmātha prāptānna lakṣmīvidyāṃ ca bhūnolā 
manuyugmakaṃ || 9 ||

vāsudevaṃ manuṃ paśvādvaiṣṇuva ca ṣaḍakṣara |
yajñabhāṇarāṇī vidyāse kṛtacārya yatnataḥ || 10 ||

rājarājeśvarī vidyāmuccāya triśa ādarāt |
brahmavidyāṃ samuccārya sālagrāma śilānvite || 11 ||

cakrarāje samāvāhya lakṣmīnārāyaṇe vibhū |
caturviṃśati saṃkhyākaranupavārān samarpayet || 13 ||

śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣaryā paṃcadhābhyarcya tatparaṃ śataṃ || 14 |||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā vāpī putreḥ puṣpaissamarcayet |
kṛtvetthaṃ pratyahaṃ bhūtāṃ katkādvādaṃ śaṃvatsaraṃ || 15 ||

yatphulaṃ samavānyoti tadeva phalamaśnute |
layāge pūjāṃ kṛtvādāvitthaṃ cābhyacye yatnataḥ || 16 ||

sahasravarṣa pūjāyāḥ pratyahaṃ yatnamānyunyāt |
pūrvokta vidhinā yadvā samāvāhya jagatpatīḥ || 17 ||

upacāraissamabhyarcya nāmabhiḥ keśavādibhiḥ |
caturviṃśati saṃkhyākairabhyavyakṣi dṛḍhavrataḥ || 18 ||

paṃcāśānmithunairnityaṃ keśavādyoḥssamarcayat |
śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣavayau tataḥ pratyahamarcayat || 19 ||

yugyaiḥ keśavakītyo dheryaḥ sakṛt prātyahaṃ yajet |
sahasravarṣa pūjāyāḥ phalaṃ pratyahamānyuyāt || 20 ||

yugmaiḥ keśavakīrtyadhirdve cātredhāpi vārpayet |
sarvatīrtha snānaphalaṃ sarvakratuṣu yatphalaṃ || 21 ||

sarvadāneṣu yatpurāya sarvapūjāsu yatphalaṃ |
tatyulaṃ sāgamāpnoti pretyahaṃ ca dṛḍhaṃ vrataṃ || 22 ||

jātismāratvamānyoti brahmajñānaṃ sanātanaṃ |
daśikānu grahātmākṣānnārāyaṇa padaṃ labhet || 23 ||

deśikāṃghri yugāpada pādukā yugmamādarāt |
abhyārcya pratyahaṃ pūrvaṃ tataḥ śrīpatirpayot || 24 ||

tatpādukāyugaṃ brahmavile saṃsthāpya sādhakaḥ |
pratyāhaṃ sarvarvayāyaudyo virmukteḥ koṭidānajaṃ || 25 ||

phalaṃ saṃprāpya vidyānāṃ siddhiṃ cānyoti śāśvatīṃ |
sālagrāmaśilāyuktaṃ cakrarājamahattaraṃ || 26 ||

<p. 91a>

uktena vidhinābhyarcya yatraiḥ puṣpaiḥ sugaṃdhibhiḥ |
kulasāhasrasahito ramate bhagavatpae || 27 ||

vadarīkāmanaṃ purāya suṃdarī vallābhātvātmanaḥ |
lakṣmīyeterbhagavataḥ kṣetramuktaṃ marurṣibhiḥ || 28 ||

raṃgadhāma mahatkṣetraṃ saṃharī vallamātmanaḥ |
kṣetraṃ lakṣmīpateḥ proktaṃ sadyassakalasiddhidaṃ || 29 ||

śrīnivāsābhidyaṃ kṣotramaṃjanācalanāmakaṃ |
śriyaḥ paterbhagavataḥ suṃdrī vallabhātmana || 30 ||

kṣetraṃ sāgaratīrepi puruṣottamamākaṃ |
suṃdarī vacchabhasyokta macyutasya śriyaḥ pate || 31 ||

ayodhyāmathurāmāyākāśikā kāṃcyavaṃtikā |
dvārakāravyāpurīramyā satyaite muditāḥ smṛtāḥ || 32 ||

nārāyaṇesya śrīmasyasuṃdarā vallabhātmanaḥ |
nivāsū bhūtā evāḥsyu daśarninikkti siddhidāḥ || 33 ||

rājarājeśvarīvidhāmeṣu kṣetreyu sādhakaḥ |
kṣīrāśī vā phalāśī vā paṃcarātraṃ dine dine || 34 ||

sālagrāmā śilāyuktaṃ cakramabhya ca sādhakaḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidhā japtvā sāhasra manvahaṃ || 35 ||

rājarājeśvarīvidyāṃ prajaptvā triśataṃ śuciḥ |
vahuvāṃ dakṣiṇaṃ datvā svadesika padāṃvuje || 36 ||

lakṣmīpatiṃ mahārāja bhagavataṃ jagatpati |
paśyateva svakṣurbhyā varade bhaktavatsalaṃ || 37 ||

devatvādi mahāmihā siddhi sādhanāni tata paraṃ |
pravakṣyāmi samāsauna na śūṇadhaṃ nahyanaṃdanāḥ || 38 ||

ācāryānu grahātyāpya śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīrāṃ |
yajñāyaṇīṃ vidyāṃ brahmadyāṃ yata vrataḥ || 39 ||

saṃpūrṇe siddhimānvicchanā rājārājaśvāji jayet |
āyaṃpanā nārāyaṇaḥ sākṣāṇaso dāśarathātmataḥ || 40 ||

māyāmānuṣadeho sākauśanyānaṃdavaddhanaḥ |
āsyaivaṃ kalayā pūrṇe jātosmi jagatītale || 41 ||

asyevānujñayā vakṣyeśvaṇardha brahmanaṃdanāḥ |
madhumādhavamāṇaidvodha saṃtu ṛturītaḥ || 42 ||

ṛtuṣyapi samasteṣu średyāsau vrāmanaṃdanāḥ |
tatra caitrābhidyemasi pratipadvinamāditaḥ || 43 ||

navamyaṃtaṃ mahatparva navarātrābhidhaṃ |
mahāpātaka rāśīghrāṃ kalilpraṣabhedanaṃ || 44 ||

dāridradana sarvamahāsvavināśanaṃ |
sarvasaṃkaṭabhītighraṃ sarvaroga vibhaṃjanaṃ || 45 ||

aṇimā nakṣatra yuktā vā jayaṃtī jñānaṃ kāyataṃ |
tatra madhyāhnasamaye sākṣānnārāyaṇo vibhūḥ || 48 ||

<p. 91b>

hitāya sarvalokānāṃ māvirāsīn mahītale |
rāmo dāśarathinasti parabrahma bhayosyuḥ || 49 ||

daśamyāṃtā janakīdevī prādarbhūto sanātanī |
cicchaktiḥ sadarīsākṣācchīriyaṃ rasākalā || 50 ||

dinadvaṣirāsīn mahītale rāmo dāśarathirnāmnā |
parabrahmamayomuḥyaṃ mahatpurāyaṃ tatrāpi brahmanaṃdanāṃ ||

yajadāna tapa strīrtha vratakodi phalapralamonyāti śāśvataṃ || 53 ||

ravi parvaśataṃ vāpinai tadvina samaṃ bhavet |
śrīrāmanavamī prāthyava āvāyāsteṣāśveyo na nidyaṃti || 56 ||

yatra bhavetnītirvidyāyāṃ brahmanaṃdanāḥ |
vāsaṃte navarātre sājatyāvya || 57 ||

pratipradvināmārabhya navamyaṃta mahavrataṃ |
kaktaṃ svaṃ sarvaphaladaṃ vidyānāṃ siddhimicchā || 58 ||

rāme veṣṇutirvidyāyā śrīmadaṣṭākṣarasyā ca |
mahātī siddhimanvicchakuyādatravata śubhaṃ || 59 ||

deśikān jñayā tatra vratame tatsamāvadet |
madhumāse śuklapakṣe pratipadvidyase śubhe || 60 ||

brahmesamaya utthāyatpaṇabhyā cāpa pādayoḥ |
brahmavidyā manusmṛtya raśmibhaṃ sūkta mataḥ paraṃ || 61 ||

tataḥ srātvā viśuddhātmā nityasaṃdhyā kṛṣṇapakṣe |
kpratipadvivasepāsya ca nityahomaṃ samāyyotha natvā deśikāmādarāt || 62 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ nyāsa jātapurassarāṃ |
triśatā śātādhika sāhasraṃ pratyahaṃ prajapecchaciḥ || 63 ||

aśaktaḥ sakalanyāsaṃ kartaṃ vaiṣṇuva satṛkāṃ |
avaśyamapī vinyasya nyasya cidrūmamātṛkāṃ || 64 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣaṇīri vivāṃ japetye ca śatādhikaṃ |
sahasraṃ prajapennityaṃ mathavānni śatādhikaṃ || 65 ||

vāsudeva mahāvidyā vaiṣṇavīvaṃ ṣaḍakṣarī |
āṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā dvādaśāṇāṃ śriyo manaṃ || 66 ||

matriśataṃ prajapennityaṃ rājarājeśvarītha |
aṣṭottaraśatanityamumaṣṭā viṃśatiyuṣī vā || 67 ||

prajaptvā vaiṣṇavaṃ varma pratyahaṃ paṃcadhā japet |
pūrvekta vidhinābhyarcya śrīśrīśadvādaśāṇayā || 68 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityamaceyed brahmaviṣṇuyā |
yajñanarāyaṇīvidyāṃ nityamaṣṭottara śataṃ || 69 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā vāpi sāyaṃkāle japecchaviḥ |
pratyahaṃtikvamekaikaṃ deśikāṃghri yugeyaṃ yat || 70 ||

tadadhaṣotadardhavā vinnaśāṭhyaṃ vivarjayet |
śrīrāmatanmadivase prātarutthāya vā yataḥ || 71 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīrādīnāṃ pūrvavarjayamācaret |
paṃcaviṃśatidhā varmanārāyaṇamayaṃ japat || 72 ||

vidhivat saṃskṛta vahnau daśamyāṃ prātarutthitaḥ |
sāvitryā juhuyā pūrvamaṣṭottaraśataṃ || 73 ||

<p. 92a>

śrīmadaṣṭarṇayā paścāt sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ |
kāpitvātyaṃ hunedagnau siddhikāmassamahiḥ || 74 ||

śuddhagavyājya mathavā surevasya vidyayāḥ |
aṣṭaviṃśatidhā hutvā vaiṣṇavyārvavedyayāpi ca || 75 ||

śrīdvādaśāryā paścā triśataṃ juhuyādvataṃ |
āṣṭārvisidhā rājyalakṣmyā ca dvayādvataṃ || 76 ||

advauga lakṣmīpatitā tathaiva juhuyāṃtaṃ |
magava raśmividyabhirikaikāmāhutiranet || 77 ||

aṣṭāviṃśātedhā paścādrājārājā svadhayā |
hyetvaikavīśaṃ saṃkhyake varmatrairataḥ paraṃ || 78 ||

patravāraṃ hunedājye kāpilaṃ goghṛtaṃ tu vā |
hutvā japadibhiḥ paścīt prāyaścittai hunet || 79 ||

brahmārpaṇaharti kṛtvā natvātvā vaiśvānaraṃ tataḥ |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ sāṣṭāgraṃṇityaca || 80 ||

sālagrāma śilāmekāṃ datvā taddaśamī dine ca |
ṣośanamitaṃ dravye dakṣiṇārthaṃ samarpayet || 81 ||

avaśyaṃ kuḍadvaṃdvaṃ gāge yat |
anyaurā bharaṇairvastrai rasaṃ kuryācca deśikaṃ || 82 ||

aśaktopi caturvarṇān bhikṣetvā sādhakottamaḥ |
pratyaha niṣkamekaṃ vā tadardhaṃ vā tadardhaka || 83 ||

samarpyācārya yādābje śrīrāmanavamī dine |
dvigudakṣiṇāṃ datvā hū	tvā hutvātha daśamī dine || 84 ||

sālagrāmaśilāṃ datvā guroḥ karṇayugo yuga |
yovacchakayamalaṃkāraṃ datvā yāsepinimalaṃ || 85 ||

vaṣāśanamitaṃ dravyaṃ dakṣiṇartha samarcayet |
vittalībhaṃ parityajya tadadhaṃvo tadardhake || 86 ||

niṣka tritavavittavāpyavaśya guraverpayet |
sākṣākṣītānaki vudhyā vāsolaṃkaraṇādikaṃ || 87 ||

dadyādavaśyamācārya patnyai paścādvijarṣabhāḥ |
āthayaṃ ca śataṃ patre puṣpeśca vratyaviṣayā || 88 ||

śrīpatyadyayeyoddhīmān gaṃdhāyau sumano haraiḥ |
suvāsinīḥ paṃcadaśā viprān paṃcadaśāpyatha || 89 ||

mūṣṭānnairdakṣiṇabhiścatāṃ kalādyaiśca toṣayet |
deśikottama pādābja prakṣālita jalaṃ śubhaṃ || 90 ||

pītvā deśika padmau ca bhujīyācchiṣṭa mapyatha |
deśikottama hastākrā liṃgito mutrānataraṃ || 91 ||

bhagavatkalayāpūrṇaṃ siddhipya proti śāśvoto |
aṣṭāviśitidhā hutvā rājārāravyā vidhadyayā || 92 ||

katvātra śrīmakarmakartarasya nisarṣajñatvaṃ na saṃśayaḥ |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇe vidyāyāḥ puraścaraṇa kṛtyataḥ || 93 ||

ayaṃ nāśayarasīḥ sākṣāddrāmoddāśarīthirvibhuḥ |
tuṣṭā prasalodhādo bhaktatrāṇa parāyāṇaḥ | 98 ||

śriyamaṣṭaguṇe potāṃ saṃviyapradi saṃyutāṃ |
 āyurārāgyamatulaṃ gṛtyorapi bhayaṃ vā karaṃ || 99 ||

<p. 565, <p. 92b>

svakiṃkarāgra garāyatvaṃ sakalā pūrṇatāṃ tathā |
akṣayān sarvabhogāṃśca vimānaṃ ca mahattaraṃ || 100 ||

dharmārtha kāmamokṣāṃśca prayacchati na saṃśayaḥ |
mahītīyā puraścaryā sāṃgadakṣiṇayānvitā || 101 ||

tatsahasrā phalaṃ sāṃgaṃ dadātyassai śriyaḥ pato |
vāsudevasya metreṇa hutvā tada daśamī dine || 102 ||

yoptau hirāya garbhātmā virārayu śrīrbhāvaṣyati |
vaiṣṇavyā vidyayā hutvā ghṛtaṃta daśamodine || 103 ||

bhūtyānāmagrarāyatvat prāṃtyeva śriyaḥ pateḥ |
śrīdvādaśārṇayā tatra hutvā saṃdajyaṃ daśamīdine || 104 ||

śriyaṃ paśyati cakṣurbhyāvamavaśyaṃ jānakīmimā |
sītāprasādān mahatī dhanadhānyaudya saṃkulī || 105 ||

muktāratnagaṇākīrṇaṃ gajāśvaratha saṃkulāṃ |
prāpnoti mahātīṃ lakṣmītīsminvarṣena saṃśayaḥ || 106 ||

mātṛtvā sarvavidyānāmiyaṃ cidrūpirūpayiṇī |
ramāvidyā siddhidaṃ dāsasmaivyāsa vālmīki satritāṃ || 107 ||

asyāḥ sātāhālakṣmyāśaṃkhavadyādayaḥ śubhāḥ |
tiṣṭhaṃti bhūrtri matosya gṛhe ratnaugha varṣiṇaḥ || 108 ||

vaṃśābhivṛddhistulā vadake niśākarau |
bhavatyasya na saṃdehassarvabhāgya samākulā || 109 ||

na viyogodanekṣyā śaṃkhaputraiḥ patyādhiyā bhavet |
bhasya hastāṃvujeṣṭatyakṣayā muktiruttamā || 110 ||

advegī śrīśāmaṃtreṇa hutvājyaṃ daśamīdine |
aśvamedha sahasrasya vājapeyāyuta tasya ca || 111 ||

pūrṇe dakṣiṇayuktamavaśyaṃ phalamaśrute |
rājarodhyayā tatra daśayīdīvase śubhe || 112 ||

kāmapyāhuti kṛtvā gatyenājyena sādhakaḥ |
ājyena koṭiśo hutvā śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā || 113 ||

avaśyaṃ tatphalaṃ tatra hutvā prāptyetya saṃśayaṃ |
agnigho māyute vāpi vājapeya sahasrakaṃ || 114 ||

ekāhutyāna tulyaṃ syādrājākhya vidyayā |
rājarājeśvarīvidyā homena sadṛśaṃ phalaṃ || 115 ||

vaktuṃ na śakyate tatra daśamādikase dvijāḥ |
śrīrāmajanmā navamīyāto daśamīne || 116 ||

ekāmapyāhuti katvā rājarājākhya vidhayā |
āṇimādi guṇeśvaryaṃ putrapautrādi saṃpada || 117 ||

brahmānaṃda sukhāvāt viprāṃtyatra na kṣaśayāḥ |
bhagavadraśmividyābhirekaikāhuti homata || 118 ||

bhagavadraśmi vidyānāṃ sarvosā siddhimaśrute |
hutvātha paṃcadhā vamurmaṃtrairnāsiyaṇeditaiḥ || 119 ||

sādhya nārāyaṇaṃ devamāṃ caṃdrāśaśiṃ vibhuṃ |
nṛsiṃhamasya kūrmādi rūpiṇaṃ parameśvaraṃ || 120 ||

<p. 93a>

paśyatyevasva cakṣurbhyātā sthinvarṣena saṃśayaḥ |
cakrādīnyāyudhānyasya mūrtimato dine dine || 121 ||

bhatyavatparirakṣaṃti prapacchaṃtya śiślekṣitaṃ |
sādhya nārāyaṇe yogī trijatpatisyata || 122 ||

danṛtre yogī bhṛgvādyā ṛṣyopi cataṃ |
rakṣatyanvahaṃ siddhāssādhyāśca samarudraṇaḥ || 23 ||

ayaṃdāgāthi svāmījānakīpatiravyutaḥ |
sakhāyaṃ kurutekhasya kiṃkaraṃ vāyunaṃdanaṃ || 24 ||

aṇimādi guṇeśvarya vācāṃ siddhi manuttamāṃ |
aṣṭāṃga hitaṃ yogaṃ janmakoṭi smṛtiṃ śubhāṃ || 25 ||

vijayaṃ kālamṛtyośca mahadrasa śriyaṃ |
ākṣayāṃ putrapautradi samūddhiṃ ca mahattarāṃ || 26 ||

vahānaṃdeka vijñānaṃ dadātyassau śriyaḥ patiḥ |
yadvā dinatrayaṃ kāryaṃ vrataṃ bhagavataḥ priyaṃ || 127 ||

nārāyaṇo mahāyogī jatā patiravyataḥ hitāya |
sarvalokānā draṣṭānāṃ nigrahāya ca || 128 ||

prārthito braharudrauraśeṣairdevatāgaṇaiḥ |
cautramāseśakṛpakṣe madhyāhne navamīdine || 129 ||

amūtto mūtrimānāsīt kauśalyāyāḥ paraḥ |
pumān daśamyaṃ bharato jātaḥ śaṃkhamūrtirjagatpatiḥ || 130 ||

ubhāvanaṃta cakrāṃśāvekādaśyāṃ jalatpatī |
jātau lakṣmārā śatrumau samitrāyāṃ sureśvarau || 131 ||

daśamīdivase sākṣājjānakī kamalālayā |
avirāsīn māhānakṣyorbhatalā ityitā satī || 132 ||

navamīdinamārabhyadina tritayamānādarāt |
puraścaryā vrataṃ kāryaṃ jānakīrādyavaṃ priya || 133 ||

daśamyāmeva caitrasmin daivateśva mahamibhiḥ |
kattorājyābhiṣekosyāmāsya paramāmaḥ || 134 ||

ekādaśyā māhorākraṃbhyaṃssyaṃ leśita |
prahadī rāmaḥ prasannau bhaktatmala || 135 ||

japalakṣmī mahāyogaṃ tasmāde tadvi na trayaṃ |
prāddhadmaharṣayassiddhā bhaktasyā kṣayakārakaṃ || 136 ||

dinatrayevrataṃ yena lakṣmīnārāyaṇī prayaṃ |
kriyate tasyasyā bhaktasya sākṣānnāpyo vibhu || 137 ||

brahānaṃdaika vijñānaṃ kaivatsaṃ ca prapadyīti || 138 ||

atrāharāryā managīti yuktāṃ gārthā purāvarddhamagītimiśrā |
śrīrāma vaidrasya dina trayesmin vrataprabhāvena yutāṃ dvijāpyāḥ || 139 ||

uccasthe grahapaṃcakesaraguṇaisidhau navamyātirtholagre karkaṭake punarvasu 
yuteṣaṃgapūṣaṇi nirdvagdhanivilāḥ 
palāśatyamirdhāmedhmādayodhyaraṇerāvibhūnimamūtayū bhavaṃ ghṛtkicidekaṃ 
maha || 141 ||

<p. 93b>

śrīrāmajanmanavamī saranādyahatrī sarvārthasādhanakarī savimuktidātrī |
asyāmupoṣaṇa parāgupāda yugme datvā dhanaṃ vidhi harīśapadaṃ labhaṃte || 141 ||

saṃtarpyaja hutanayādi sutīrthato ekaikraistilaiḥ pitṛkulānī ca mātṛvaśyān sa 
prāyatihā ratnākamanaṃtaṃ saukhyaṃ datvātha deśika padābjayu yuge ca vitaṃ || 142 ||

śrīrāmajanmadivase maṇivijamuktāvastuṇi deśika padābjayuge phalāni |
datvāmu sarmaruśata dānaphalaṃ vakvavaṃśānvito bhagavataḥ || 143 ||

niśākarārkagraha koṭitulyaṃ śrīrāmajanmadivasaṃ kathita munīṃdra |
aṣṭārṇa maṃtrajapahoma samaccanādyarnārāyaṇaṃ suraguruṃ na pare na paśyet || 144 
||

śrīrāmajanmanavamīdanāmīparastādekādaśotidivasa tritayevratesmin |
aṣṭākṣarasya japahoma samarcananikatvātha rājamanunāhiti mātrakakte || 145 ||

datvātha dethika yadābja yugetha vittaṃ varṣāśanaṃ 
punarathārddhadvattadarddhamānaṃ |
karṣetrayātmakamathokatakaṃ dvikarṣaṃ karṣekamānamathakyate daśaktaśiṣyaḥ || 146 
||

ākaly vastrasahitaṃ ca samarpya loke patnī gurorapi samarcye vibhūṣaṇādyauḥ |
hemācalāyuta samarpaṇā purāyajātaṃ samāpya vaṃśasahito bhagavanmayaḥ syāt || 
147 ||

jasmanmātāmarhanetthe gītaṃ pitrāvabhūsurāḥ |
tābhyāṃ dinatreye proktaṃ vatama pravakṣyet || 148 ||

śrīrāmajanmanavamīdivase sarvasiddhide |
brāhmemuhūrte utthāya praṇamyācārthapādayoḥ || 149 ||

brahmavidyāṃ prajaptvātha lakṣmīnārāyaṇī parā |
śanayālā manusmṛtya kṛtaśauco jiteṃdriyaḥ || 150 ||

snātvā saṃdhyāmupāsyātha nityahomaṃ samāpya ca |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃ sādaraṃ praṇipatya ca || 151 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ śatādhika sahasrakaṃ |
japtvāthaṃ vāsudevāravyāṃ vaiṣṇavī ca śataṃ japet || 152 ||

catuḥśatajapet paścīdramāyā dvādaśākṣaraṃ |
prasannalakṣmīvidyāṃ vā śrīṣaḍarṇamanuṃ tu vā || 153 ||

rājarājamahāvīdyāmaṣṭāviṃśatidhā japet |
prajayedvaiṣṇavaṃ varmaya ca viṃśatidhānvahaṃ || 154 ||

kṣīrāśavi vā phalāśī vā paṃcagavyāśanopi |
vātiteṃdriyo haviṣyāśītyaktā tāṃvūlalabhaṇaṃ || 155 ||

ekakarṣapti tasyārṇadeśikāṃghri yugenvahaṃ |
samarpayet tadardha vā tṛtīyāṃ śamuthāpi vā || 156 ||

asādhye deśikasya pradatvācyuta sannidhaupi |
māyai deśikasyātha śrīvudhyā bharaṇādikaṃ || 157 ||

āpayesuhadhāṃ mānavittalobha vivarjitaḥ |
dvādaśyaṃ prātarutthāya nityakame samāpya ca || 158 ||

ācārya sannidhāvagnau vidhisaṃskārasmasakate |
aṣṭāviṃśātidhā hutvā sāvitryādaugavāṃ ghṛtaṃ ||| 159 ||

<p. 94a>

śrīmadaṣṭārṇamatreṇa kāpikaṃ ghṛtamādarāt |
śrāddhagavyajyamathavā vā sahasraṃ juhuyācchat || 160 ||

vāsudevasya manutā vaiṣṇavyā caḍarṇāyā |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā lakṣmādvaśavarṇayā || 161 ||

prasannāramāmayāvātha śātamamaṣṭottaraṃ hunet |
āṣya viṃśatidhā hutvā yajñeśamanā tataḥ || 162 ||

māhārājñāthājahuḥ pādaṣṭā viṃśati saṃkhyayā |
bhagagavadraśmibhiḥ pūrvaṃ hutvaikaikāṃ ghṛtāhutiṃ || 163 ||

paṃcavāravaṃ maṃtrai hutvā prajyālite nale |
hutvā japatvāyadibhiḥ paścāt kṛtvā brahmārpaṇā hutiṃ || 164 ||

agnipradarakṣiṇīkṛtyat sāṣṭaraṃgaṃ prasiyatya ca |
ācāyasimalaṃkṛtyagaṃdhapuṣpaiśca vāsasā || 165 ||

kuṃḍala dvitayaṃ ramyaṃ dadyāddeśika karṇayoḥ |
dhyāvacchasāmalaṃkaraṃ dauśikāyātha vārpayet || 166 ||

ācāryapatnyai śrīvudhyā lakṣmī vāssamarpayet |
auviprāsmuvāvāsi varṇā caladānānāṃ sahasraphalamakṣaya || 169 ||

koṭikoṭi mahāvidyā koṭi sāhasrahāmajaṃbhū prādakṣirāya sāhasraphalaṃ ca 
śubhamakṣayaṃ || 170 ||

prāpya vipro viśuddhātyā deśikānu grahātpāraṃ |
bhagavaṃtaṃ śriyā yuktaṃ nārāyaṇamajaṃ vibhuṃ || 171 ||

avaśyaṃ vatsare tasmin paśyatyeva svacakṣuṣā |
sāṃgadakṣiṇayā yukta puraścarya sahasrataḥ || 172 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyā yādṛśī siddhirucyate |
rājarājeśvarīvidyā prabhāvāhuvenugrahāt || 173 ||

tādṛśīṃ siddhimānyoti bhaktotra divasa traya |
vaiṣṇuvyāvarmavidyāyāḥ puraścayośatātyaṃ || 174 ||

yādaśī siddhiratrekta purāṇaiḥ paramapibhiḥ |
tādṛśī mahatī siddhirjāyatesya na saṃśayaḥ || 175 ||

prasanna lakṣāmāṃtreṇa dvāśārṇa śriyāpi vā |
hutvātra prāpnuyāt siddhiṃ puraścayo śatodbhavā || 176 ||

dhanāḍhye rājaputraścedyāśamaśaṃtu gurāḥ |
niṣkāṇaṃ śatasāhāsramapi dhenu sahasrakaṃ || 171 ||

alaṃkāra sahasraṃ yatvāsyādbhagavanmayaḥ |
ācāryasannidhau yadvā pratijñāyātha dakṣiṇāṃ || 178 ||

māsābhyaṃtarato deyata kujālaṃ vā na goyana |mṛṇaṃtuṃ vā |
kalpāṃte jñāninaḥ śuddhyadeśikāya mahātmane || 181 ||

na naśyati pratijñāta mṛṇaṃ naraka duḥkhakhadaṃ |
ṣaṇamāsānaṃtaraṃ deryadviguṇaṃ dravyamādarāt || 82 ||

puraścryā vrāṃta kuryād brahmānaṃda sukhapradaṃ asyānmātāmaheneda sa 
muktaṃ pitrā ca dhīmatā || 85 ||

<p. 94b>

rājarājeśvarīṃ vidyā mudviśyā khilasiddhiṃ manvicchandaivatairapi |
durlabhāṃdaṃ divasa tritaye vāpi navarātrepi vā vrataṃ || 86 ||

yaḥ karoti viśuddhātyā deśikātūnugrahādvijāḥ |
sa eva sarvaviprāṇāmagragaroyo mahān vibhūḥ || 187 ||

variṣṭho yatvānā muktaḥ yāvanānaṃ cāyāvanaḥ |
dinatrayavrataṃ śreṣṭhaṃ navarātranātādapi || 188 ||

divasa tritaye kṛtvā puraścaryā vrataṃ śubhaṃ |
vimuktaḥ pāparāśibhyaḥ samagra sukṛkatānvitaḥ || 189 ||

mahākavirmahāvāṅmī jīvabhārgava sannibhaḥ |
jaḍopi bhavati kṣipraṃ sītārāma prasādataḥ || 190 ||

muktāphalāṃ mahāratna dhanadhānādi saṃkulāṃ |
saṃtati vyāpinī lakṣmīṃ prāpnotye vācalāṃ dhruva || 191 ||

āyurārogyasahita vidyauśvarya samanvitāḥ |
bhavaṃti putrāḥ pautrāśva prapautrā pitādṛśāḥ || 192 ||

jarā samaraṇaṇahitya māyurārogyamakṣayaṃ |
yakṣarājāmarādhīśasadaśī śriya mūrjitāṃ || 193 ||

avāpya rogamapyagaṃ vadrajanma smṛtiṃ śubhāṃ |
divyakanyā sahasreṇasāhitaṃ savarbhāgayuk || 194 ||

vimānamadhi hṛtyaṃte kulasāhasrasaṃyutaḥ |
svarvadeva priyo bhūtvā sarvardhigaṇa sammataḥ || 195 ||

yakṣakiṃnaragaṃdharva siddhavidyādharārcitaḥ |
tejomaya tanurbhūtvāṃ paṃcaviṃśati vārpirka || 196 ||

attaraścamaro nityaṃ divyālaṃkāra śobhitaḥ |
divyavastradharo bhūtvā divyabhoga sukhānvitaḥ || 197 ||

brahmāṃḍapaṭanaṃ bhitvā yāti brahma sanātanaṃ |
dvinatraye vrataṃ katvā sādhyā nārāyaṇaṃ vibhuṃ || 198 ||

rāmaṃdāśarathiṃt sītālakṣmaṇādibhiranvitaṃ |
vatserevatyevaśyaṃ cakṣurbhyā saṃpraśayati || 199 ||

anenaiva pramāṇo na vratādātmyakṣayaṃ |
svakarasthamiti dhyāyedapi svakatārthatāṃ || 200 ||

dinatraya vratasyāsya māhāṇādbrahmanaṃdanāḥ |
svegamartyepi pātālo tasyā sādhyaṃ na vidyete || 201 ||

gaurīlakṣmīmahāvāṇī mukhyāsya kalaśaktayaḥ |
brahmārviṣṇumaheśāśca maheśaṃ yādigīśvarāḥ || 202 ||

dinatraya vratasyāsya prabhāvādvaśayopyamī |
pālayaṃti divārātraṃ sākṣānnārāyaṇatmakaṃ || 203 ||

ayameva mahāyogī harirnārāyaṇe vibhuḥ |
itthaṃ suniścitaṃ sarvaṃjābhīdhaṃ brahmanaṃdanāḥ || 204 ||

<p. 95a>

rājarājamahāvidyā smaraṇādakhileṣṭādā |
śrīmadaṣṭaṇī siddhiryasmabhyaṃ yadīritā || 205 ||

ta ūrdhva dvijaśrīṣṭā kiṃ punaḥ śrotumicchayaḥ || 206 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge rājarājāvidyāmāhāsye aṣṭātriṃśodhyāyaḥ] || 
<p. 95a>

yoginaṃ ūcuḥ ||

bhagavan kapilācārya nārāyaṇa jagatpate sītāpato bhagavataḥ |
sanidhau karuṇātyanātyayā sagaprasapyetakāḥthitaṃ divyasādhanaṃ || 1 ||

canmukhatva vadhaḥ śrītvānaṣṭīna saṃśayo mahān || 2 ||

nārāyaṇī mahāvidyā sahasrārṇātvayoditā |
śriyo devyāḥ sahasrārṇa sūcitāna na prakāśitā || 3 ||

tadvidyā dvitayaṃ svāmin prākāyamahate |

śrībhagavānuvācā ||

nārāyaṇīṃ sahasrāṇaṃsi yūrgā phalasiddhidaṃ |
śṛṇadhvaṃ saṃpravakṣyāmi niyatā brahmanaṃdanāḥ ||
nārāyaṇe mahāyogīmuni svasmṛto vudhauḥ || 5 ||

gāyatraṃ daivataṃ chaṃdī lakṣmīnārāyaṇo vibhuḥ |
devatā jāganāthaḥ paramānmāsanāttanaḥ || 6 ||

trayī vījaṃ namoterthe padaṃ bhagavate tataḥ |
keśavetyatha nārāyāṇā mādhava yadda tataḥ || 7 ||

goviṃda vicchomadyete sūdanotī trivikrama |
vāman śrīdhanetyutkā hṛṣṭīkośayadaṃtataḥ || 8 ||

pūyanā bhayadaṃdā mohana saṃkarṣaṇetyatha |
vāsudeva padaṃ paścāt pradyumna padamapyatha || 9 ||

aninuddhapadaṃ paścātyut paruṣottama nāma caḥ |
adhokṣajanārasihācyuta śabdaṃ janārdana || 10 ||

upedvetihane paścācchrī kṛṣṇapadamapyatha |
jāpa dvaṃdvaṃ jaganmūrti jagannātha padaṃ tataḥi || 11 ||

jagarakṣāmaṇe śabdaṃ divyamaṃgala vigraha |
devadedotyuktvā devatā sārvabhauma ca || 12 ||

devavadyaṃ padāṃbhota viśvasūya padātparaṃ |
viśvātman viśviṃbhana ca viśveśvana padaṃ tataḥ || 13 ||

viśvarūpadharen yuktvā japayugma mataḥ pāraṃ |
vadevedyā padāṃ vedāṃta saṃstutaṃ padaṃ tataḥ || 14 ||

tataścaturvidmayapaturbhūte tataḥ panaṃ |
caturyāṃ dravaturvyeha prasrīdayugalaṃ tataḥ || 15 ||

puṃḍarīkāsa śabda vayupkanekṣaṇa nāma ca |
praṇāvātān parātparaparamātmannataḥ paraṃ || 16 ||

śūbrahmavarūpāṭe parameśvaranāma vraca |
yuyugmaṃ hayagrīvaptavaṃ vidyā nidheyahaṃ || 17 ||

<p. 95b>

sarvavāgīśvareśvanā bhaktavatsalanāma ca |
tataścakataṇasidhokāṃmapāla kṛpānidhe || 18 ||

kāmetejanaket yuktvā kāmaprada kṛpālaya |
kṛtāṃta bhayaśabdāṃte nāśaneti padaṃ tataḥ || 19 ||

kāraṇatman kṛtāṃtātman kamanīyā kṛte tataḥ |
japadvaṃdvaṃ mukuṃdeni mucukuṃdastatetyatha || 20 ||

mucukuṃdeti varada jagatpālakanāma ca |
jamātha maraṇenyuktvā rahiteti yadātparaṃ || 21 ||

jālātmaketi bhūdyetmibhūvaṃdya padaṃ tataḥ |
bhūsutākuva śabdāṃto bhūṣaṇeti japadvayaṃ || 22 ||

tato hāmatsya rūpapadaṃ kūrmālute tataḥ |
yajetyatha varāheti padaṃ na tahana na hare tataḥ || 23 ||

śamanāṃ tejāmadagtya rāmaśabda sataḥ paraṃ |
padaṃ dāśarathītyaktvā rāmetivalari rāma || 24 ||

buddharūpe yeti katkyaṃte rūpa yajñamayetyatha |
yajñeti phalade suktvā yajñeśvara japa dvayaṃ || 25 ||

sahasrāsya sahasretikyaṇeti padaṃ tataḥ |
sahasraṇīṣeśabda ca sahasrākṣarpi tataḥ || 26 ||

sahasrakara sarvajñasya samāstā suranāma ca |
saṃhānakārakenyatkā samastasukharanāma ca || 27 ||

saṃpūjya sarvademaya sarvapadaṃ tataḥ |
bhūtatakapadaṃ khāmin suṇīlasulābhetyatha || 28 ||

padaṃ saṃdara hayoti tataḥ sa vitṛsūya ca |
sāvitrī pravidyeti sarvaloka guro padaṃ || 29 ||

prasīda yugalaṃ paścāttrāyī bhūte trayīśvana |
triguṇaka karaśabdaṃte padaṃ trailokyanāyaka || 30 ||

trautyamayaśadvayaṃ tatastrailothanāyaka |
japadvaṃdva tataḥ sītāpate rādhāpate tataḥ || 31 ||

nīlāpatojñayatetha rukmiṇī satyanāma ca |
bhāmādyaṣṭayadaṃ paścāduccerenmahiṣīyate || 32 ||

ṣoḍasī sahasrīśa gopījana manohara |
japayugmaṃ daśarathātmajanāsannānaḥ para || 33 ||

kauśalyāgarbha saṃbhūta śrīrāmaśaraṇāgata |
vatsāleti śāraroyeti śaṃkarārcya padāṃvuja || 34 ||

bharatātman lakṣmīṇātman śanughnānmanvataḥ |
prāra āṃjaneyu gurotparvavānanetpatyarthaṃ vaṃdita || 35 ||

mahārāja mahāśabdaṃ puruṣyeti vibhīṣaṇa |
vanadeti varīyati vimānārūḍhanāma ca || 36 ||

prahādavaradetyaktvā sarvadaṣṭāṃtaketyartha |
japadvaṃva ca brahmaṇyadetaṃ dātmajetyathaḥ || 37 ||

<p. 96a>

vasudevātmajetyuktvā devakītanayetyatha |
śaṃkhacakragadāpadmadhana śrīvatlāṃchana || 38 ||

ganuḍadhvajaśabdāṃte maheṃdrāvajanāma ca |
maheṃdraṃ vaṃdita padaṃ maheśāviḥdhiprajita || 39 ||

mahopaniṣadādhāra maheṃdrādyāmara prabho |
uapayugmaṃ gokaleti saṃrakṣaka padaṃ tataḥ || 40 ||

pārtha saṃrakṣaketyuktvā satyānaṃdamayotyatha |
nityānaṃdasya rūpoti cinmayeti cidīśvara || 41 ||

cidākṛte padaṃ paścādviraṃtana padaṃ tataḥ |
paramānaṃda rūpeti parameṣintataḥ panaṃ || 42 ||

purāṇa puruṣait yuktvā puṇya mūrte punātana |
purastutyeni bhakteti padaprītikanetyatha || 43 ||

vigitāre padaṃthaśrādvimalākāna nāma ca |
vīrarāghavaśabdaṃ ca vīreti puruṣetyatha || 44 ||

jayayugmamanaṃ tālunnanaṃtaśayanetyatha |
anaṃtarūpānaṃteti saukhyadā bhadanāma ca || 45 ||

māhāyogīśvarapadaṃ yogācārya padaṃ tataḥ |
dattātreyeti kadyīla dvaiyāya na padaṃ tataḥ || 46 ||

siddhavidyādhanet yuktvā yakṣarākṣāsa kiṃnara |
surāsura mahāṣīti devarṣi padamapyatha || 47 ||

brahmarṣi vaghamānoti padāṃvuja padātparaṃ |
mahānubhāghaśārdvica japayugma mataḥ paraṃ || 48 ||

sṛṣṭistitīti saṃhārakānakati tataḥ paraṃ |
yogithṛtyaprānilāya yogi dhyeya padāṃvujaṃ || 49 ||

sarvasiddhiprada pada sarvalokeśvaretyatha |
pṛthivyudakarūpeti tejo vāyu mayetyatha || 50 ||

vyomahi kārūpoti jīvaprāṇamayetyatha |
sarvatatvamayet yaktvā sarveṃdriya manomaya || 51 ||

sarvasatvaguṇau yetabhi kalaṃka niraṃjana |
nityaṃ śāśvata śuddheti japadvaṃdva mataḥ paraṃ || 52 ||

vahni rūpeti sūryeti padaṃ somastetyatha |
prajāyati mayet yuktvā gaṃdhavadhivate padaṃ || 53 ||

japayugmaṃ tataḥ śeṣaśayaneti padātparaṃ |
sāketanagarādhīśamathurādhiyate padaṃ || 54 ||

māyāpurī nāyaketi tataḥ kāśīyate padaṃ |
kāṃcī punnīnāyakāṃtīhyavaṃtī nāyakītyatha || 55 ||

dvārakānāyākasīṇacciśāpinyadamasyatha |
śreta dvīpādviśadvāṃte nāyaketi padātparaṃ || 56 ||

satyalokapate paścādvaikuṃṭhapuranāyaka |
ayodhyānagarīdhīśa bhaktannīṇaparāyaṇa || 57 ||

caturvedamayāṃte ca siṃhasanārūḍhanāma |
śrīvatsakaustustaloraska vanamālā vibhūṣitaḥ || 58 ||

<p. 96b>

divyābhūṣaṇa śabdāṃte bhūṣiteti padaṃ tataḥ |
divyamālyapadaṃ paścādvirājita padaṃ tataḥ || 59 ||

divyacaṃdana śabdaṃ carciteti japa dvayaṃ |
suprasannapadaṃ paścād vadanāṃvuja nāma ca || 60 ||

divyapītāṃvaradhana kirīṭakaṭakāṃgada |
hānarūpunakeyūra kuṃḍaladvaya śobhita || 61 ||

samastalokanāthāṃte sayastā yannivāraka |
sāmasta bhaktā sāmājya bhogasvagapivrgāda || 62 ||

jānakivakabhayadaṃ ruściṇī valkabhetyatha |
rādhāvallabhabhūnīlāvatkṛbheti japadvayaṃ || 63 ||

mahāmaheśvarapadaṃ mahāyugmataḥ paraṃ |
puruṣāṃte mahāyugmaṃ rājanāmahādvayaṃ || 64 ||

vibhūte deva śabdāte tataśvaḍāṇe padaṃ |
bhūtanātha padaṃ lokanāthannādayataḥ paraṃ || 65 ||

viśvanāthanaṃta koṭi brahmāṃḍāviyate padaṃ |
lakṣmīpatī mahālakṣmīpate śabdā mataḥ paraṃ || 66 ||

rājyalakṣmīpate śabdaṃ padaṃ paścī śriyaḥ pate |
japayugmaṃ sasamuccārya śrīnārāyaṇanāma ca || 67 ||

namaste tritayaṃ paścādvidheṣā samudviritā rājīvo yatalocana surugurūṃ 
kaṃdayakauṭi vidyunmeya samānakīti mamalaṃ 
śrīvatsavakṣaḥsyalaṃkeyūrogahārakuṃḍadhaṃravakrādisaṃśobhitaṃ 
lakṣamyāligita vāmabhāgamaniśaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ vitaye || 69 ||

hastairvibhraditi śrokarū paṃcamanunāyaka || 70 ||

ādāvatatesmaredvinnārāyaṇa kṛpātyaye |
aṣṭaviṃśākṣarādhikya triśatākṣara saṃvutā || 72 ||

nārāyaṇī sahasrārṇa vidyeyaṃ kathināmayā |
sarvapātakasaṃhatrīśokanivāriṇī || 73 ||

sāmātya lakṣmīphaladā mahādārityabhedinī |
rājarāja mahāvidyā japāṃte dine dine || 74 ||

mahānārāyaṇīṃ vidyāṃ sahasrārṇamiyāṃ vudhaḥ |
sakṛt smaratiyo nityaṃ tasya syuḥ sarvasaṃdvapra || 75 ||

adaiva daivatakuryādaivata cāpya dainataṃ |
sahasrākṣara vidyāyāḥ prajāpī sādhakottamaḥ || 76 ||

satmābhāḥ sarvatīrthoṣu sarvakratuṃ yadītiḥ |
sahasrāṇamī mahāvidyā pratāyī satataṃ bhavet || 77 ||

nabhiṣeko na saṃskāro na dīkṣā vaidivī kriyā |
ācāryakaruṇaivāsyādīkṣīktā paramārṣibhiḥ || 78 ||

<p. 97a>

satyadvīpavatī bhūmirdhanadhānyauva saṃkulā |
dakṣiṇā gurupādābjā yugale kathitā bhuvi || 79 ||

anāṣṭadyi bhaye prāptehīhadajalosmirataḥ |
prajaptvā paṃcadhā vidyāmighnāṃ saṃkha phalapradāṃ || 80 ||

sūtatyeva mahāvṛṣṭi sadyaḥ sakala bhūtale |
ativṛṣṭe maye vahni saṃnidhau paṃcadhā japeta || 81 ||

śamayatyeva sadyotyāvati vṛṣṭista dārūṇaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā rājarājeśvarī parā || 82 ||

nārāyaṇabhidhāvamarvidhā vedāṃta saṃgrahā |
puraścarya vināpyasya siddhidaṃ dadyānmāhatarāṃ || 83 ||

deṇikaṃ kṛpā pūṇayidityājjagatī tale |
sahasrākṣara vidyeya tasya siddhā bhaviṣyati || 84 ||

nāsādhyaṃ tasya jagatītalesmin brahmanaṃdanāḥ |
meheṃdrapurasāprājya lakṣmīrapi sarasvatī || 85 ||

tanmaṃdireva satyeva yāvadā caṃdratārakaṃ |
aya mṛtyuṇamanī sarvāriṣṭa nivāriṇī || 86 ||

sarvasaṃpat pradātrīyaṃ bhogasvargāpavargadā |
deśikāṃdhi yuge vittaśāṭhyaṃ tyaktvādvigottamāḥ || 87 ||

dhanadhānya yaśavrāta muktāratna samākṛtvāṃ |
dakṣiṇaṃ vahudatvā sahasrārṇamimāṃ truciḥ || 88 ||

deśikasya mukhāṃbhojārūhītvātha dine dine |
sakṛt smarati vā rājarājavidyā japātparaṃ || 89 ||

saṃlagnā mahadaiśvaryaṃ sarvavidyā supādyāḥ |
prāpyā puṣpaṃ mahadbhāgyaṃ putrapautravatī śriyaṃ || 90 ||

jātisyaraściraṃ bhūtvā brahmādaṇa sanātanaṃ |
tejomaya tanurbhūtvāṃ prāteparapada || 91 ||

nārāyaṇī sahasrāṇamiye ye samudīritā |
śriyo devyāḥ sahasrāṇaṃ pravakṣyāmi tataḥ paraṃ || 92 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge rājarājavidyāmāhātmye ekonacatvāriṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 97a>

hastairvibhrat sarasi jagadā śaṃkhacakrāṇi vidyāṃ padmādṛśau 
kinakakaśyaśaṃmedya vidyudvilāsaṃ vāmotrīgastanayaviratā 
kalpamāśeṣalobhādekībhūtaṃ vapukhatunaḥ puṃḍakākṣa lakṣmyāḥ ||  1 ||

śrībhagavānuvāca ||

sahasrāṇaṃ śriyo devyā vakṣyāmi brahmabhaṃdanāḥ |
yasya vijñānatopīha pūjyato trijagatsvapi || 1 ||

tritārī praṇavāṃtetha namastripurāsuṃdari |
padaṃ hṛdayadevīti śiro devi padaṃ tataḥ || 2 ||

śaśidevi padaṃ paścāt padaṃ kavaca detyatha |
netra devyastra devīti kāmeśvari padaṃ tataḥ || 3 ||

<p. 97b>

bhagamāli niśabdāṃto nityaklinne padaṃ tataḥ |
bheruṃḍa vahni śabdāṃte vāsinīti mahāpadaṃ || 4 ||

vajreśvari śivārūtityaritekasta suṃdari |
nitye nīlapatāketha vijaye sarvamaṃgale || 5 ||

bhūtvā mālinī citretha mahānitye padaṃ tataḥ |
parameśvara śavāṃte parameśvari śadvātaḥ || 6 ||

mitreśamapi ṣaṣṭīśa māḍḍīśamayītyathacaryā |
nāthama viprotyaloyāmadrāmāyītyatha || 7 ||

agastyamapi kālāṃtetāyā pādyamayītyatha |
dharmāvāryamapi prītrya muktakeśīśvaretyatha || 8 ||

mapidīya kalānāthamapi vilayadāsara |
paṭṭaṃdevamayītyuktvā prabhākarapadaṃ tataḥ || 9 ||

padaṃ devamayīt yuktvā tajo devamayītyatha |
manojadevaśabdagatemapi kalāṇa śabdātaḥ || 10 ||

padaṃ devamayītyatkāratnā devamayotyatha |
vāsudevamapi śrīrāmānaṃdāyamayītyatha || 11 ||

tatpaścādaṇimāsiddhe laghimā siddha ityapi |
mahimāsiddha īśitva siddhe pada mataḥ paraṃ || 12 ||

vasitvā siddhe prākāmya siddhaṃ prākāmya siddhe |padamātaḥ |
parabhuktiṃ siddhe padaṃ cecchyā siddhe pretyi padātparaṃ || 13 || 

siddhe ca sarvakāmāṃte siddhe brāhmītyataḥ paraṃ |
māheśvari ca kaumāri vaiṣṇavīti padātparaṃ || 14 ||

vārāhyapyatha māheṃdri cāmuṃḍe śabdamapyatha |
māhālakṣmi padaṃ sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇi yadātpāraṃ || 15 ||

sarvaviśaviṇīt yuktvā sarvākaṣiṇi śabdataḥ |
paraṃ sarṣavaśītvatkākaraṇīpi padātparaṃ || 16 ||

savonmādini śabdāṃtaṃ padaṃ sarvamāhāṃkuśe |
sarvakhecarite sarvavījī padaṃ tataḥ || 17 ||

sarvātrikhaṃḍe trailokyamohano nipadaṃ tataḥ |
cakrasvāmini śabdāṃte prakaṭetyatha yogini || 18 ||

kāmākarṣiṇi vāghrākirṣāṇi haṃkāra śabdataḥ |
ākarṣiṇi padaṃ śadvākaviṇīti padaṃ tataḥ || 19 ||

sparśākaṣiṃ sā śabdāṃte rūpākarṣiṇyataḥ paraṃ |
sākarṣiṇi śabdāṃte gaṃdhāṃ karṣiṇyataḥ paraṃ || 20 ||

citākarṣiṇā śabdāṃte dhauryo karṣiṇyataḥ |
parastṛtyākaṣīni śabdāṃtenāmākarṣiṇyataḥ paraṃ || 21 ||

vījākarṣiṇi śabdāṃte vālākārṣiṇyāthoccarataḥ |
amūtākarṣiṇīyudhkaraśaraṇakarṣiṇītyatha || 22 ||

sarvāśā paripūrādyaka cakra svāminītyatha |
guptayoginyaṃ namādya kusumenaṃga mekhale || 23 ||

anaṃgamadane paścāddanagaṃmadanātūre |
anaṃgarekhenaṃgādyaveginīti padaṃ tataḥ || 24 ||

anaṃgaukuśa ityaktvā padve cānagamāliṃ na |
savaṃ saṃkṣībhāṇetyuktvā cakrasvāminyathoccaret || 25 ||

<p. 98a>

padaṃ gatyataret yuktvā yoginīti padaṃ tataḥ |
sarvasaṃkṣībhiṇī suktvā sarvavidāviṇītyatha || 26 ||

sarvokarṣi siddhāṣṭāṃte sarvādinyathoccareta |
sarvasaṃmohinī yuktvā sarvastāṃbhinyataḥ paraṃ || 27 ||

sarvajṛṃbhininā dṛte padaṃ sarvavaśaṃkari |
sarvaraṃjini śabdāte sarvonmādinyathoccaret || 28 ||

sarvārthasādhakekṣadaṃ sasaṃpati pūraṇi |
sarvamaṃtramayī yuktvā sarvadvaṃkṣayaṃ kari || 29 ||

sarvasaubhāgyaśadvāṃta dāyaketi pādātvāraṃ |
cakrāsvāmī niśadvaṃvaṃ saṃpradāyādyayogini || 30 ||

supraśamani sarvavighnānivāriṇī || 32 ||

sarvāṃga saṃdari padaṃ sarvasaubhāgyadāyini |
sarvārthasādhaketyuktvā cakra svāminmathecceret || 33 ||

kulottīṇayedeśraścādyoginīti padaṃ tataḥ |
sarvajña savaśaktaṃtha sarveśvarya prādāpīni || 34 ||

sarvajñānamayīit yuktvā sarvavyāpi vināśini |
sarvaṣārākhāyetha sarvayāya hareṣadaṃ || 35 ||

sarvanaṃdaṃmayītaktā sarvarakṣā sthāpiṇi |
sarvośita phaletyukāprade sarvayadṛta || 36 ||

rakṣākarapadaṃ vakrasvāminīti padaṃ tataḥ |
nigabhādhogiṃ padaṃ vaśiniti padātpara || 37 ||

kāmeśvari padaṃ paścānmohinīti padaṃ tataḥ |
vimaleśa marūṇejami nīti yatparaṃ || 38 ||

sarveśvarī pade paścāt kaulinīti padaṃ tataḥ |
sarvaroga haret yuktvā cakrakhāminyathoccaret || 39 ||

rahasyayoginī padaṃ tato vāṇini vapini |
vāśinyaṃ kuśinot yuktvā mahākāmeśvarītyatha || 40 ||

mahāvaloptvari yuktvā māhāśrībhagamālini |
māhāśrīsuṃdarītyuktvā sarvasiddhi mahetyatha || 41 ||

vasvāminyati rahasyayoginīti padaṃ tataḥ |
śrīśrīmāhāpadaṃbhadyarikeya mataḥ paraṃ || 42 ||

sarvānahaṃ mayet yuktvā vakrasvāminyathoccaret |
parāpara rahasyāya yoginīti pada taptaḥ || 43 ||

tripure tripureśīti padaṃ tripurasuṃdari |
tripurāṃte vāsinīti tripurāśrīḥ padaṃ tataḥ || 44 ||

tripurāṃte mālini tripurasiddho padaṃ tataḥ |
tripurāṃ ca padaṃ paścānmātripurasuṃdari || 45 ||

māhāmāheśvarī mahāmāhārājñī padāspadaṃ |
mahāmāhāpūrvaśaktopada paścān mahāpadaṃ || 46 ||

māhāgupte mahāśabdaṃ mahājñaptye yadātparaṃ |
mahāmahānaṃda iti māhāśabda mataḥ paraṃ || 47 ||

mahāmahe mahāmūrve mahāmāya itīrayeha |
mahāśrīcakranagasāmrājñīti padaṃ tataḥ || 48 ||

<p. 98b>

namaste tritayaṃ yadi dayitā ca tritāri ca |
ayaṃ manaḥ śriyo dovyā yuṣmabyaṃ kathito mayā || 49 ||

ekatriṃśat sahasrārṇa strilokī mohanakṣamaḥ |
dakṣiṇāmūrtirasyoktavṛṣiḥ sarvajña īśvaraḥ || 50 ||

paṃktiḥ chaṃdaḥ samuddiṣṭaṃ śrīdevīdevatā smṛtā |
pāśaṃ cāṃkuṣṭā maikṣavaṃdhanurathośokādi || 51 ||

puṣpātmākān vāṇān paṃcadadhānamudhadaruṇā |
nekobhābhāsuraṃ divyākalpa śatānvitaṃ || 52 ||

subhukuṭaṃ brahmaṃśa viddhāti vidrayaṃ |
imahadāśrayāmī paramaṃ sāmrājyalakṣmīmayaṃ || 53 ||

mahāśrīsuṃdarī devī śriyaṃ tejomayo parāṃ |
dhyātvā hṛtkamale nityaṃ sahasrārṇe manuṃ japet || 54 ||

navāraṇa devīnāṃ śriyordevāstrayīmayī |
ekatra gaṇanārūpā vedavedāṃgagocarā || 55 ||

iyaṃ vidyā mahārājñīsmaraṇatyāyanāśinī |
sarvāṃgamarahasyārtha sarvapuṇya kalapradā || 56 ||

śrīcakrapūjāṃ satatāṃ vistarāt kartā makṣīmaḥ |
sakṛnnityaṃ paṭhitvatāṃ sāṃgajā phalaṃ labhet || 57 ||

aṃtaḥpare mahārājyāṃ śrīvidyāḥ śaktāṣokhilāḥ |
prakāśitāḥ suguptāśca smaraṇatyāya bhaṃjanāḥ || 58 ||

āsāṃ smaraṇa mātreṇa kalyāṇine pade pade |
bhava savabhaktānāṃ saṃpadaśca pade pade || 59 ||

naravaśyaṃ nareṃdrāṇāvaśyaṃ nārīvaśaṃkaraṃ |
āṇamādi guṇaiśvarya raṃjanaṃ pāpabhaṃjanaṃ || 60 ||

sahasrākṣara vidyāyā smaraṇallabhyate vahaṃ |
sahasrārṇamayaṃ guhyaṃ paraṃ dhāma praśasyate || 61 ||

śriyo devyāḥ mahārājña pālā manurayaṃ paraḥ |
gotyavyeḥ satata patnyāvāṇaiḥ kaṃṭhagataurapi || 62 ||

rājarājeśvarī vidyā japāṃtetvaha pādarāt |
nārāyaṇī sahasrāso sahyatrārṇe sahasrāṇa śriyopi ca || 63 ||

sakṛdvidyā dvayaṃ tatvā kṛtārthaḥ syānnava saṃśayaḥ |
nāśiṣyapi prādātavyāta jāyāpi vaṃdhave || 64 ||

sahasrākṣara vidyeyaṃśviyoddevyāgarīyasī |
āyurārogya jananī savepi ivanāśinī || 65 ||

sarvarogaharī sarvabhayaṇīkanivāṇiri |
ayodhyā cakrastha sarvaśaktimayī parā || 66 ||

smaraṇān sarvapapastī sarvakratu phalapradā |
dhamarthikāmamokṣāravya purūṣārtha phalapradā || 67 ||

<p. 99a>

paṃcaivoktāściyo devyāḥ paṃcoktāḥ puruṣasya ca |
dvadvavidyāśvayaṃ coktāḥ iti paṃcadaśa kramāt || 68 ||

śuddhānamotāṃ khāhāṃtāstarpaṇāṃtagajiyāṃtakāḥ |
śuddhasaṃvuddhiśabdātaḥ prathao manurucyate || 69 ||

caturthyaṃte nāmaḥ svāhā śabdo vidyādvaye tathā |
dvitīyāṃte tarpayāmītyevaṃ maṃtraścaturthakaḥ || 70 ||

saṃvuddhāṃte japadvaṃdvaṃstuti ruktātu paṃcamī |
itthaṃ paṃcadaśa proktā mālāṃ maṃtrāḥ phalapradāḥ || 71 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇai yadvā bhavānī śaṃkarāyubhau |
upāsyau cakrarājetra māsāmaṃtraurvicakṣaṇaiḥ || 72 ||

sarvadodha mayaṃ yasmāt sarvavidyāmaya tathā |
sarvadharmavayaṃ yasmāt sarvasiddhimayaṃ yataḥ || 73 ||

tasmādayodhyānāracakro śrīcitkatvāgṛhe |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇe pūjyau rājarājākhyaviyā || 74 ||

bhavānīśaṃkareyeddhā samabhyatyau vṛśārṇayā |
daśa paṃcasrajo vidyāḥ prakṣepakṣethamāsi vā || 75 ||

ṣaṇmāse vatsare vā visakadyaḥ saṃsmaredyuciḥ |
satadvine mahārajaṃ bhāgavaṃtaṃ śriyānvite || 76 ||

nārāyaṇaṃ dāśārathi śaraṇagata vatsalaṃ |
rāmaṃ paśya patyatyau svanye satyameva na saṃśayaḥ || 77 ||

daśaṃ yasrato vidyāmāsa ṣaḍvamabhanyadhīḥ |
japtvā pratyahamekāṃte nirghnavījiteṃdriyaḥ || 78 ||

śrīdevīsahitaṃ sākṣānārāyaṇaṃ vibhaṃ |
devatva mamaratvaṃ vāmaṃ dharvatva mathāpi vā || 79 ||

yakṣatvaṃ kitaratvaṃ vā dovarṣitva mathāpi vā |
khevarāvaṃ maharṣitvaṃ brahmarṣitvāmathāpi vā || 80 ||

prānyonyatra na saṃdehaḥ prasādārddidirāyateḥ |
khadaśca pādukā siddhirajanaṃvila siddhimadāda || 81 ||

vāgdeha lohāḥmicchāṃtī khāṇimādyaṣṭā siddhayaḥ |
vaśyākarṣaṇaṃ saṃmohastaṃbhanāni ca sarvataḥ || 82 ||

atha savaryumarthaśva nityānaṃdaśca muktātā |
etāḥ paṃcadaśamīktā dvidyānāṃ siddhayaḥ kramāt || 83 ||

spṛṣṭvā pūrṇaghaṭaṃtauyaiḥ sugāṃdhibhirādarāt |
satyāṣṭa mālā japanaṃ sakvatkatka dine dine || 84 ||

satyāhaṃseṣanaṃ karyādvaṃdhyā putravatī bhavet |
satyāṣu mālikājīvoṣarāmā saṃvatmaraṃ tu vā || 85 ||

<p. 99b>

bhagavat kalamāpūrāstijasā bhāskara prabhaḥ |
idādīnaṣṭadikapālānāpīdāsārakanotyasau || 86 ||

satyāṣṭa vidyājāpayanaṃ pratyahakartamakṣamaḥ |
śriyo devyā mahāvidyāṃ śraddhāmeva triśo japet || 87 ||

satyāṣṭāṃ vidyātayana phalaṃ pratyahamaśrute |
śruyo devyāḥ sahasrāṇaṃ vedavedota saṃgrahaṃ || 88 ||

cakrāvaraṇa devīnāṃ satyanāma mayaṃ paraṃ |
asmin prajatyepi sakṛtṛ sarvāḥ siddhyati sīddhayaḥ || 89 ||

nāmiyekīna saṃskārorna dīkṣīha ca nādikaṃ |
sahasrārṇe padeśārthāmācārya karuṇa parā || 90 ||

sarvasvaṃ dakṣiṇādvavyaṃ devāṃ priyuge smṛtaṃ |
vaṣāśinamitaṃ dravyamathavā dakṣiṇa smṛtā || 89 ||

ayodhāyu cakresmina lākṣmīnārāyaṇe śituḥ |
śālagrāmaśelāyukteyā pūjāpūvamīritā || 91 ||

asyāḥ smaraṇa mātreṇa tātsāṃgārvavarjaphala |
siddhyatyasya na saṃdehaḥ kiṃ ca brahmamayo bhavet || 93 ||

aṃgāraṇa devīnāṃ śrīdevyā brahmanaṃdanāḥ |
smāraṇādatra vidyāyāṃ tāsāṃ yumo bhavet || 94 ||

pālayaṃti yathā putraṃ mārataraḥ sutavatsalāḥ |
vidyāyāṃ smaraṇī naitāḥ pālayaṃti svaputravat || 95 ||

śrīdevī sarvasamrājñī nityaṃ bhaganadanvitā |
mātṛvan maṃdire tasya rakṣatyā caṃdratārakaṃ || 96 ||

pūjāṃ kartumaktaśca havanaṃ tarpaṇaṃ tu stutiṃ |
sahasrāṇaṃ mahāvidyāṃ śriyo devyāḥ sakajjapet || 97 ||

samastavidyāṇaṃ siddhimicchatā niyatātmanā |
sahasrā prajaptavyā śriyaḥ sarvaphalapradā || 98 ||

śriyateḥ śriyā devyā sahasrārṇaminu dvayaṃ |
itīdaṃ kathitaṃ viprāḥ kiṃ bhūyaḥ śrītumicchatha || 99 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge rājarājavidyāmāhātmye catvoriṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 99b>

yogina ūcuḥ ||

nārāyaṇī sahasrārṇa satyāṇī śriyaḥ parā |
śrutvāva mukhāṃbhojāt purātyāpi prakāśitā || 1 ||

anuttara brahmavidyāmakhileṣṭādaṃ bhūyopi |
śrītumicchāmaḥ kṛpayāktu marhasi || 2 ||

śrībhagavānudhā ||

vīśrāṇudhvā brahmaputrāgryāḥ sanakādyādu vratāḥ |
rājarājeśvarīvidyā sādhanaṃ mahadiṣṭadaṃ || 3 ||

<p. 100a>

yomaṇe yogījānadīniriścyaḥ purā vaikaṃṭa |
(******) nare prāhaddevyai śriyai hariḥ || 4 ||

kathayāmāsa sā devī kardamāya mahātmane |
sopyasymajjanako yogī kardamo bhagavānṛṣiḥ || 5 ||

śvaṇato mama śiṣyebhyo mahāyogibhya uktaṣāt |
lakṣmīpatī raghupati yadiyānāṃ yatirhariḥ || 6 ||

nārāyaṇastri jagatāṃpatirānaṃda vinmayaḥ |
aṃsau dāśarathī rāmo ukārāya yāvanaḥ || 7 ||


rājajarājahāvadyā sādhanaṃ bhavabheṣajaṃ |
kathayāmāsasyomi trimaratādibhya ādarāt || 8 ||

ekāṃte tat dahaṃ vakṣye sagutyamapi sādhanaṃ |
deśaṃ kālaṃ ca vīkṣyāhau bhavasāgaratāratāraṇaṃ || 9 ||

brahmānaṃdaiki jñānaṃ rājarājeśvarī phalaṃ |
yo dadāti svājñiṣyāya deśikaḥ sa udāhṛtaḥ || 10 ||

aṃte vāsinamācāramuktaṃ svāyaṃbhabhuvādibhiḥ |
yaḥ śikṣayatitaṃ prārāvāyīmīśvaraṃ || 11 ||

śrīmatvāśā vidyāyā vidhānaṃ sāṃgamādarāt |
yaḥ sikṣayati śiṣyebhyasta mācāryaṃ vidurvadhāḥ || 12 ||

bhagavadraśmi sūktaṃ yo brahmavidyāṃ sanātanīṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyāṃ yaḥ śiṣyebhyaḥ prakāśayet || 13 ||

tamādhāryaṃ mahāprājñaṃ kathayaṃti hari vibhuṃ |
samastaraśmisahitāṃ śriyaḥ padaśākṣīrī || 14 ||

kathayiṣyati śi.ey yattannārāyaṇatmakaṃ |
vadaṃti paramācāṃ brahmāṇaśaṃkaraṃ vibhaṃ || 15 ||

rājarājeśvarīvidyāṃ lakṣmīnārāyaṇīṃ śubhā |
yuguptāṃ sakalavedeṣu ṣaṇaṣāgameṣvapi || 16 ||

kathayiṣyati yaḥ karṇe śiṣyasya vimalātmanaḥ |
taṃdeśikīttamaṃ prājñāṃ sākṣādbhādākṛti || 17 ||

sarvajñaṃ sarvakartaraṃ śaṃkara parameśvaraṃ |
tamevotamamācorya vidurnārāyaṇaṃ vibhuṃ || 18 ||

sarvatra gauravārhutvā gururukto mahaṣimigarīyā |
brahmaṃ rudrādidavevobhyarvanādviṣu || 19 ||

gururit ucyatetyadirbhakti bhakti hpalapradaḥ |
avijñāyamaṃ kolaṃ sudeśamanavekṣya ca || 20 ||

yo dadāti mahāvidyāṃ na sasadgururutpatai |
madhumāse bhaveduḥkhaṃ mādhave ratna saṃpadaḥ || 21 ||

jyeṣṭhetu maraṇaṃ proktamāravode vudhaṃ saṃkṣayaḥ |
syamastābhīṣṭasiddhiḥ syācchrāvaṇemāsi saṃtataṃ || 22 ||

<p. 100b>

śarīrapījā mahaī māsi bhādrā pade bhavetva |
āśvine dhanadhānyādi saṃpadaḥ syuḥ pade pade || 23 ||

brahmānaṃdaikavijñānaṃ kārtikemāsi jāyate |
japalakṣmīrmārgāśīṣe bhavatyasya na saṃśayaḥ || 24 ||

jñānakṣayo bhavetyuye vidyā prāraṃbhakarmasu |
mādhamāse bhaveśokṣādragavadarśanaṃ vudhāḥ || 25 ||

samastakāryasaṃsīddhiḥ phālgunemāsi jāyate |
dvitīyā vā tṛrīyā casyekādaśī tathā deśamo || 26 ||

paṃcamī pūrṇadvādaśī ca trayodaśīmī ca |
mahapurāyā etāḥ syustithayaḥ trubhāḥ || 27 ||

navāramāsadoṣāḥ syādahaṇī caṃdrasūryavoḥ |
deśākālaṃ parokṣyetthaṃ śiṣyasya guṇāguṇan || 28 ||

vidyāṃ prakāśayeddhīmān guruḥ kāruṇiko vibhuḥ |
kālevaramapi prāṇansaṃrakherājya saṃpadadaṃ || 29 ||

samarpyadhiya pādābja patnī putrādikānapi |
ācāryapatnī prādhrāṇaṃ kaikayaṃ prisahaṃ śaci || 30 ||

yaḥ karoti mahāprojñaṃtaṃ viduḥ śiṣyamuttamaṃ |
yadapanatījiṃtodāṣī hastārbhyā tāḍitopivā || 31 ||

vahusaṃtāḍitośathikaśādyātaiḥ sudārīṇaiḥ |
pūrṇanugraha evāyemiti yomanyate bhṛśaṃ || 32 ||

niṣkalsana manasā sa śiṣyo mukta ucyate |
tathā vidyasya śiṣyasya bhavasāgaratāriṇī || 33 ||

mukti lakṣmīḥ karakasteti pūtyevana saṃśayaḥ |
śathamācarya pādābja kiṃkarāyātamānasaḥ || 34 ||

śrīmadassākṣārīṃ vidyāṃ japtvā prātyahamādarāt |
rājarājeśvarī vidyā mayanayaṃ pratyahaṃ japet || 35 ||

sādhanāni pravakṣyāmi śṛṇudhvaṃ brahmavaṃdanāḥ |
yeṣāṃ śruvaṇato vāpi bhavato siddhiranuttamā || 36 ||

vātaṃ navarātrādi vrata dvitayupnuttamaṃ |
tadevā bhūyo vayāmi śṛkhaṃtu paramarṣayaḥ || 37 ||

yadukta navarātraṃ ca divasatriya vratavā |
saṃtamadhumāse tuduktaṃ sakalasiddhidaṃ || 38 ||

vāsaṃtaṃ navarātraṃ vavā divasa tritayaṃ tu vā |
vatsane vatsane kṛtvāniyāṣatamānasaḥ || 39 ||

parabrahmamayo bhūtvā tejo maya tanuḥ svayaṃ |
svarūvṛṣaiva bhagavatssaṃbhrāriṇamīśvaraṃ || 40 ||

<p. 101a>

paśyatyevātmanātmānaṃ brahmānaṃdarasāśrayaṃ |
athavā madhumāse trayati pādinamāditaḥ || 41 ||

ācāryānujñayāstātvā sahasraṃ triśataṃ |
kṣudhā vedamātaramabhya nityahomaṃ samāprava || 42 ||

sūryamaṃḍalamadhyasthaṃ nārāyaṇamuje vibhaṃ |
katāṃjali rūpāsīta sūktaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ japan || 43 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ śatādhikasyusrakaṃ |
japtvā pratyahamekāṃte vāsudeva mahāmanuṃ || 44 ||

triśataṃ prajapet paścādvaira pūrvadyavaḍakṣaraṃ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā dvādaśāṇa ramā manuṃ || 45 ||

japtvāyaṃ vaśaṃtaṃ nityaṃ rājarājeśvarīmatha |
aṣṭāviṃśādhā japtvā sahasraṇi dviyaṃ sakṛt || 46 ||

japtvāthavaumavaṃ varma pratyahaṃ paṃcadhā japet |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdve pratyahaṃ pūrva sasmitaṃ || 47 ||

suvarṇa yayaṃ yeddhīmānniṣkamekamathapi vā |
tadaddhavānvahaṃ bhaktyā vittalobhaṃ parityajet || 48 ||

aṃdhaḥśāyī jitakrodhaḥ phalāśī vā haviṣyabhuk |
ekabhaktāśano vāpi navamyādi dinatraye || 49 ||

kṣīrāśī vā phatkāśīvā sāvitrī pūrvavajjapet |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīṃ vidyā vīsu devādikānapi || 50 ||

prajaptvā pūrva tadvarma vaityaṃvaṃva japaṃtaraṃ |
paṃcaviṃśatidhā nityaṃ divasa tritaye japet || 51 ||

ācāryaraṇadvaṃdve savarṇakaṃ simirganiphaṃ |
mekaikamathavā divasa tritayerpayet || 52 ||

mahālakṣmīdhiyācārya patnyā api va sādaraṃ |
karṣamānamalaṃkāramekaika divaserpayet || 53 ||

ekaika niṣkamātha vā tadarddhavāsā samarpayo |
śrīrāmajanmadivase yadvālaṃkārayuttamaṃ || 54 ||

divasa dvitaye niṣkaṃ tarddhaṃ  vā samarpayet |
śrīrāmajanmādivasa maheṃdiyaśata prabhaṃ || 55 ||

mahādānamukhaṃ proktaṃ vedavedādatavedimiḥ |
daśamyekādaśī vā pitatmamaiyāvyate vudhauḥ || 56 ||

ekaikaidita tatra dvādaśyaṃtaṃ dvijaṣṭaṃbhāḥ |
akaṃ parva samaṃ prāhurmāhāmiddhi pradāyakaṃ || 57 ||

dvādaśyāmudito bhānau dauśikottama saṃnidhau |
saṃskṛtyā vidivadvahisāṃvi āgoghṛtaṃ abhaṃ || 58 ||

<p. 101b>

aṣṭottaraṃ śataṃ hutvā śrīmadaṣṭāṇa vidyayā |
kāpilājyaṃ hunedagnau śatādhika sahasrakaṃ || 59 ||

athavā śuddhagavyājyaṃ hunedaṣṭārṇa vidyayā |
vāsudevasya manutā vaiṣṇavyā ca ṣaḍaṇayā || 60 ||

aṣṭāviṃśātidhā datvā dvādaśāṇe śriyā tataḥ |
hatvāya ca śataṃ vahnau tryaddhagavyātyamādarāt || 61 ||

aṣṭāviṃśātidhā hutvā rājarājāravya vidyāyā |
paṃcadhā juhuyādvarma maṃtrairātya mataḥ paraṃ || 62 ||

hutvā japādibhiḥ paścā kṛtvā brahmārpaṇahatiṃ |
praṇipatya ca sāṣṭāṃgaṃ hmāṃte jātavedasaṃ || 63 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdva praṇipatya ca sādaraṃ |
gṛhavāsāḥ samapyadi kuṃḍa dvitayaṃbhubha || 64 ||

ācāryo karṇayordadyādanyālaṃkaraṇaṃ tu vā |
udrākṣā bharaṇaṃ vāpi muktālakaraṇaṃ tu vā || 65 ||

ratnābharaṇamanyadvā datvācāryasya karṇayoḥ |
śālagrāma śilāṃ dadyāddakṣiṇāsahitā guroḥ || 66 ||

ikṣurā śivāṃ na sāni phalāni sukavadvānyapi |
kadalī phalarāśiṃ ca śarkanāṃ ca guḍaṃ tathā || 67 ||

deśikāṃghri yuge dadyāddhari caṃdanamuttamaṃ |
dvādaśātha suvāsinyo dvādaśa brāhmaṇā api || 68 ||

miṣṭhānnaiḥ proṣaṇīyāścatā phalairdākṣiṇadibhiḥ |
ācāryaśeṣa bhuṃjīta svayaṃdhubhiranvitaḥ || 69 ||

rahasyamanyadvakṣyāmi śṛṇabdhaṃ brahmanaṃdanāḥ |
yasya vijñānatau vāpī pūjyate saṃcarācarau || 70 ||

pakṣepakṣo vā māsi ṣadyāsevatsere vidhā |
viśeṣadivase vāṣijvalite jātavedasi || 71 ||

keśavādi caturviśanmithunairgautaṃ śubhaṃ |
(*****)  hutvādau śrīdhayā huti mācaret || 72 ||

paṃcāśatkoṭi vistīrṇa bhūtalo sādhakottamaḥ |
avyāhatagati siddhaḥ sarvabhāgyanyidhirbharvat || 73 ||

aśrayaṃ sarvabhāgyānāmārcayūḥ sarvasaṃpadāṃ |
bhūtvaṃ hatkata kṛtyotha sākṣīnnārāyaṇe bhavet || 74 ||

madhumāse mahādīkṣāṃdi dvādaśakeyubhā |
kṛtvā brahmamayaḥ sākṣādvimuktaḥ pāparāśibhiḥ || 75 ||

mahākavirmahāvāgmīmaṃdhvu dvijaṃ pivā nidhiḥ |
sakalā vidyāṃ nāma nadhītopi sādhakaḥ || 76 ||

deśikānugrahādbhūtvā sudhāriṣṭa vivarjitaḥ |
muktāratnagajāśvādi saṃkalāṃ dhanasaṃkulaṃ || 77 ||

<p. 102a>

saṃprāpya mahatī lakṣmīṃ putrapautrādi saṃyutāṃ |
dīrghamādyuṣya māsādya vimuktaḥ sakalairgadauḥ || 78 ||

bhukteha sakalān bhogān divyānapi ca mānuṣān |
paramaṃ padamānyoti kulasāhasaṃ yataḥ || 79 ||

madhumāse viśraddhātmādina dvādaśake vratī |
puraścaryāmimā kṛtvā siddho bhavati raṇadhakaḥ || 80 ||

varṣobhyaṃtaratā sākṣādavaśyaṃ jāttanīpatiṃ |
nārāyaṇaṃ māhātmānaṃ bharatādimiranvitaṃ || 81 ||

paśyatyevasya ca surghamāyuṣyaṃ bhaktomāṇeyadita |
darśanena labhate mahāsāmarthyamuttamaṃ || 82 ||

aṇimādi guṇeśvaryaṃ vācāṃ siddhimanuttamā |
arogyaṃ dīrghāmāyuṣyaṃ śaṃkhāṃdī śrīnidhīnnava || 83 ||

dhanarāśiṃ ca ratnānāṃ rāśiṃ divyaścā kanyakāḥ |
saṃprāpyā tatparaṃ dhāmadehāṃte viśati svayaṃ || 84 ||

varṣepirṣeyaḥ kupāddhitame tadanuttamaṃ |
tasya puṇya phalaṃ vaktraṃ nāhaṃśakroṇi bhūsurāḥ || 85 ||

dvivāraṃyaḥ karotī vatvataṃ paramapāvanaṃ |
nārāyaṇe mahātmāsau rāmādāśarathirvibhuḥ || 86 ||

jānakīsyahitaḥ svāmīlakṣmaramādibhiranvitaḥ |
brahmarṣirbhirvaśiṣṭādyauḥ sahitaḥ sapibhiṣṭaṃtaḥ || 87 ||

trivāramasya cakṣurbhyāṃ deṣṭo bhavati dhruve |
sākṣītkate jagannāthe śrīrāme paramātmani || 88 ||

brahmaṃ bhavaṃti siddhayaḥ sarvā asādhyā api |
bhūtale svarge mertyepi pātāle sākṣānnārāyaṇātmana || 89 ||

kimasādhyaṃ bhave loke māsanme śrīniketanaṃ |
brahmānaṃdaika vijñānaṃ jāti smaraṇamuttamaṃ || 90 ||

paradeka praveśadi sāmathyaṃ cāṇimādikaṃ |
durlabhaṃ devasaṃdyaiścā durlabhaṃ paramarṣibhiḥ || 91 ||

nāsādhyaṃ vidyate tasya svarge martyo rasātale |
trivārayaḥ karotīidaṃ vrataṃ paramapāvana || 92 ||

māsimāsi jagannāthaṃ jānakīpati macyutaṃ |
nārāyaṇaṃ brahmatmānaṃ paśyatyeva svacakṣuṣā || 93 ||

aṣṭāṃga yogamālādya khecaratva manatamaṃ |
prārthya taddivya kanyābhiḥ kaṃdapaṃ sadṛśaḥ śriyā || 94 ||

paṃcadhāyaḥ karotīdaṃ vrataṃ paramapāvanaṃ |
anenaiva śarīreṇa jarāmaraṇa varjitaḥ || 95 ||

tejasā ravisaṃkāśaḥ paṃcaviṃśati vārṣikaḥ |
siddha gaṃdharva pakṣaiścaṃdravadānayakinaraiḥ || 96 ||

<p.  102b>

saṃstutaḥ prahaṃ sākṣālakṣmī nārāyaṇi śituḥ |
prasādān mahatī siddhiṃ prāpyade vaiśvadurlabhāṃ || 97 ||

vimāna vanamāruhya divyakanyā śatānvitaṃ |
tejomaya tanurbhūtvā divyabhoga samanvitaḥ || 98 ||

sasalikādi lokaparamatekālamakṣayaṃ |
kalpāṃte hari sāyujyaṃ kukoṭi sāmāvitaḥ || 99 ||

prāpnotyatra na saṃdehaḥ satyaṃ satyaṃ dvijottamāḥ |
na saṃśayonna viśvāsaṃkurudhaṃ brahmanaṃdanā || 100 ||

atrātharvāṃgiro gītājāthaṃ saṃpratiḥ vakṣyate || 101 ||

vāsaṃta caitrakaṃ dineṣu śabdo guroḥ prasodenamahīdirāyataḥ |
aṣṭārṇavidyāṃ śrītisāssaṃgrahāṃ japtvā sahasrāṃ triśatāṃ dineṣu || 102 ||

śatādhikaṃ vā prathamaṃ prajaptvā śrīvāsudevaṃ triśataṃ japedya |
śrīvisavidyāṃ śajñamādareṇa japtvārka varṇaṃ pranumiṃdirāyāḥ || 13 ||

śatatrayaṃ pratyahamādareṇa rājādhirāja manumaṣṭadhāpi |
smṛtvātha varma prajayecca paṃcanārā praṇasyākhila lokasākṣiṇaḥ || 104 ||

śrīrāmajanmādi dinatrayetha paṃcādhikaṃ viśati vāramatra |
jagaptvā mahadvāmaṃ dinejakha deśikasyāṃ priyage samarpaṇaṃ || 105 ||

karṣa pramāṇaṃ praṇipatya dadyānniṣkaṃtaddarddhadaśaktimāśca |
śrīrāmajanmādi dinatraye tu karṣaṃ pradadyādatha niṣkameka || 106 ||

nyūnanaṃdadyādakhilārtha siddhimicchanesunaṇaṃ bhāraṇeḥ |
savasuḥ ācāryapatnīṃ kamalādhiyārcayedarūparmatrāpi dinatrayesmin || 107 ||

hare dine prajvaliteva ca vahnau hutvā sahasraṃ ghṛtamādareṇa |
aṣṭākṣareṇatha manudvayena sataṃ tathāṣṭādhikamatra hutvā || 108 ||

śriyātha hutvā triśataṃ tathājyaṃ rājādhirājena tu vadyedhapi |
tadvarma maṃtrairapivaṃ ca hutvā natvāgremabhyarcya puru praṇamya || 109 ||

saṃtatyasau varṇa suratnamuktaṃ dadyādavaśyaṃ vanakuṃḍala dvayaṃ |
vāsobhisarakalpagaṇairathārcayeda śakta ekena vibhūṣaṇena || 110 ||

samarpayitvekṣagaṇān phalāni datvātha gaṃdhaṃ varadhenumekāṃ |
kṣīrapradāṃ vatsayutāṃ pradadyādavaśyamācāryāyadāravide || 111 ||

idaṃ vratayā padavā nalākhyaṃ nārāyaṇasyākhila lokahetoḥ |
tuṣṭipradaṃ bhūktikaraṃ praśastaṃ khagāṃ pavarāgaṃ pradamādareṇa || 112 ||

<p. 103a>

kṛtvātra bhaktā āṇimādi yuktāṃ śriyaṃ parāṃ prāpya māhānubhāvāḥ |
vāḥpituśca mātuḥkalajaiḥ sametā āruddhyānaṃ sakalārtha yuktaṃ || 113 ||

saṃprāpya jāti smṛtimartha siddhiṃ prayāṃti lakṣmīpati dhāmatraddhadrātha 
mātharvaṇe |
gītaṃ vrataṃ dvādaśarāḥtrakaṃ vāsaṃte adhumāsessin brahmānaṃda rasaprade || 114 
||

vrataṃ dina dvādaśakaṃ japalakṣmīpratābhidhaṃ |
kṛtvā nārāyaṇātmāsau bhavatyatra na saṃśayaḥ || 115 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge rājarājavidyāmāhātmye ekacatvariśodhyāmaḥ] ||
<p. 103a>

śrībhāgavānuvāca ||

rājarājamahāvidyā māhātmyamakhileṣṭadaṃ |
bhūyopi saṃpravakṣyāmiścarāpūr' brahmanaṃdanāḥ || 1 ||

vaiśākhamāsya pātatīyā sobhye bhṛguneduṃ |
nāvā tretāyugādyāvala rāmajanmatithirbhaganī tithirisṭadātrī || 2 ||

akṣapyā saṃpūrṇa phalapradā trītāmakṣapāravyāṃtithamāhurīśāḥ 
svargāpavargākṣaya bhogadātrī sastapāyaudya vināśakatrī upatkicidannāpi japādi 
karma datvā guṇernikamapīhavittaṃ phalaṃ labhatekṣa bhogasoravya padaṃ 
parabrahmaṇilīnatā ca || 4 ||

tatra pramāte sumanāvigrahaḥ snatvāsa sadācarya yadatratayagmaṃ natvā 
tadājñāṃ śisāpragarahya saṃdhyā mayāsyatha viśuddhacetāḥ || 5 ||

aṣṭākṣareṇātha manūttamena vahnau vidhimaṃtra pūte hutvā sahasraya na 
sauravījairmadhutrayākairghṛtamiśritaiśva madhutrayuktairjuhuyā 
tulairvāghṛtamutaiḥmāpa śataṃ sahasra śataṃ tato gavya ghṛtena hutvā śrīvāsudeva 
na ca vaikṛvena || 7 ||

śrīdvādaśāṇenūttamaṃ na śatatrayaṃ gavyaghṛtena hatvā |
rājādhirājena mārameśaṃ manūttame nātha ghṛtaṃ sugavyaṃ || 8 ||

śataṃ purārāśmabhirādareṇa datvātyakarta trihunidvījāgryaḥ |
paṃcātha hutyā harivarma maṃtrerjayādibhirgavya ghṛtena hutvā || 9 ||

pradakṣiṇī kṛtya samiddhamagrimocārya varyaṃ praṇipatyaścāt |
haimaṃ suraramya gurukaṇī yugmesu kuṃḍalā saṃkaraṇaṃ pradadyāt || 10 ||

<p. 103b>

tatrāpya śaktaḥ prasamarpya ca sa ācāryapatnyai ca guroḥ padābjo |
varṣāśanaṃ vyamatha pradadyācchataṃ sahasraṃ dhananansamarpayet || 11 ||

yadvā tarddha gurupādayugme yadvā triniṣkaṃ dhanamarcayecca |
tanmanavittaṃ na hi śikasya dadyāt padābje manusiddhikāmaḥ || 12 ||

itthaṃ guruṃ dakṣiṇayā prapūjya samāpya homādika mādareṇa |
phalatrayaṃ phavālavakaṃ vāramyaṃ vahusyūlamalamari prasiddhaṃ || 13 ||

samarpayetyā na samādareṇa ramyāṇi paścāt kaṃdalī phalāni |
upānaho chara varāṇi dadyo dvetāṃ tayāṃragatta sādhakebhyaḥ || 14 ||

śrīcaṃdanaṃ ṣaṣṭīpalaṃ praśastaṃ viṃśatyalaṃ vā gurave pradatvā |
mṛṣṭhānnatāṃ phalasudakṣiṇadyaiḥ saṃtovya viprāṃśc suvāsinīścaḥ || 15 ||

siddhiḥ parāṃ prāpya maharddhi makṣayāṃ guroḥ prasādādbhavatīha |
muktaḥ mahemaheṃdra viśvaramāna lakṣmīmākalpamakṣapya samṛddhiyaktā || 16 ||

cirāyurārogyamavāyya vidyāmīśāna vācaspati saṃnibhaḥ |
syāt kaṃdarghya sāhasra samānakāṃtimi vāya putrānsurāṇamirāmān || 17 ||

bhukteha bhogānhividralabhāśca śatakulānāṃ bharake nimagnaṃ |
uddhatā divyaṃ vararālā bhūṣaṇaṃ vimānumārudyara viprakāśaḥ || 18 ||

tejomayo divyabhūṣaṇadhyaḥ samanvitosau varakanyakābhiḥ |
sudurlabha yogivarai rapītdyaṃ prāpnoti lakṣmīpati dhāma paścāt || 19 ||

tṛtīyāyāṃ kṣayā proktā vaiśākhemāsi siddhidā |
vatsare vatsare vaśyaṃ  japahomādikāḥ krīyāḥ || 20 ||

uktena vidhinā kṛtvā datvācāryasya dakṣaṇā |
kṛtvā phalapradānaṃ catvāva harivaṃdanaṃ || 21 ||

akṣayāṃ siddhimāpnoti mogakhaga vivargadāṃ |
akṣayaṃ cirāyuṣya makṣayā rogyamuttamaṃ || 22 ||

akṣayāṃ mahatīṃ lakṣmīmiṃdra citteśa sannibhāṃ |
akṣayā mahatīṃ vidyāṃ gaṃgākalolasaṃnibhāṃ || 23 ||

akṣayāṃ putrapautrādi samṛddhi ca mahattarāṃ |
akṣayān divyabhogāśca mānuṣānayo dalebhān || 24 ||

bhuktehāṃte mahaddhāma prānyo kṣayamūrjitaṃ |
akṣayābhīṣṭadā tṛtvā dakṣavaṃdiya saṃviduḥ || 25 ||

<p. 104a>

akṣaya śrīprātyikarī tṛtīyāmāhurakṣayāṃ |
ṣaṣṭi triśata saṃkhyāka tithi (*)yamanuttamā || 26 ||

śuklapakṣe tṛtīyeyaṃ vaiśākhe kṣaya siddhi |
rājarājeśvarīvidyā homasaṃmiśritāṃ śubhāṃ || 27 ||

śrimadaṣṭārṇavidyāyāḥ puraścaryāmimāṃ śaciḥ |
akṣayāvāṃ tṛtīyātyāṃ deśikānujñayādvijāḥ || 28 ||

ekena divase naiva mahatīṃ siddhimāpnuyāt |
puraścaraṇame tadyaḥ karoti prativatsaraṃ || 29 ||

śubhānanyeva labhānnityamakṣayāḥ saṃpadovi ca pitṛnsaṃtādayatyeva |
nimagnānnarakaṣvapi etatkalarvarasyāṃte yoginamapidurlabhaṃ || 30 ||

ghamāti tatparaṃ dhāma kulasāhasraṃ saṃyutaḥ |
ekena dvivase naiva puraścaryā śātodbhavā || 32 ||

lakṣmīpati kṛṣā pūrṇā mahatī siddhirīritā |
athaikasmindine siddhiranyāpyatra pravakṣyate || 33 ||

suklapakṣe nabhasyokhye vai sa vakṣe samanvitā |
api gaṃḍena yogena yuktvā yadvā sukarmaṇā || 34 ||

saumyena vedunāyuktātithirekādaśī yadi prabhāte vā |
pradoṣe vā madhyāhne vātha saṃdhyaṣḥ || 35 ||

brāhmekāle niśīthe vā mahāyogamimaṃ śubhaṃ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇaṃ nāmnā yogarājaṃ vadaṃti || 36 ||

muhūrtā tapa vāpi yorāṣadva samanvitaṃ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇaṃ yogavadaṃti paramarṣayaḥ || 37 ||

yā kiṃcijjapahomādikartarapyatra bhūtale |
mahālakṣmipatiḥ sākṣāt prasīdati dayānidhiḥ || 38 ||

tatvaninaśana mṛtyugraṃ vatsarayuta mādarāt |
nityaṃ paṃcāgni madhyasyeyāṃ siddhiṃ mahatī labhāt || 39 ||

tatopi dviguṇāṃ siddhimatrācārya padāṃvuje |
yatkiṃcidāpi datvāso prāpnotyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 40 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyāṃ varṣa sāhasrakaṃ śuciḥ |
ayutaṃ pratyahaṃ japtvā hutvā sāhasra manvahaṃ || 41 ||

yatphalaṃ samavāpnoti rājarājāravyavidyayā |
ekāmapyāhutiṃ kṛtvā tatopi dviguṇaṃ phalaṃ || 42 ||

lakṣmīnārāyaṇo yoge prāpnotyatra na saṃśayaḥ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇonisaṃ sahasraṃ brahmavidyayā || 43 ||

abhyarcya tulasīmiśrauḥ pratyahaṃ kamalotpalaiḥ |
datvātra kusumaṃ caikaṃ tatopi dviguṇaṃ phalaṃ || 44 ||

prāpnotya vaśyaṃ matimān sutyameva dvijarṣabhāḥ |
tulā puruṣa mukhyāni mahādānāni ṣoḍaśa || 45 ||

<p. 104b>

yo dadāti dvijā aibhyo varṣasāhasra manvahaṃ |
atrācāpidābhoje nikamātraṃ ca kāṃcanaṃ || 46 ||

dadatvā tatopi dviguṇamavaśyaṃ phalamaśrute |
labhyate sau mahāyogo māhābhāgyena nānyatha || 47 ||

vratakratu phalastīrtha dānakoṭi phalapradaḥ |
yogosmin samanu prāpto niśāyāmahivāśraviḥ || 48 ||

praṇamyācārya pādābja yugalaṃ bhukti muktidaṃ |
deśikānujñayāstātvā tīrthe sarasī vā śuci || 49 ||

ācārya caraṇaṃbhoja prakṣālita jalaṃ pivet |
ayodhyānagare cakre śālagrāma śilānvite || 50 ||

pūrvokta vidhinābhyarcya lakṣmīlakṣmīpatī vibhū |
triśatādhika sāhasra mamarcayed brahmanidyayā || 51 ||

varṣāyutaṃ pratidinaṃ kumairhomanmirmitaiḥ |
triśatādhika sāhasramarcaya brahmavidyayā || 52 ||

sukṛtaṃ padavāpnoti tadasmin yoganāyake |
ekaika puṣpadānena brahmavidyāṃ samuccaran || 53||

varṣāyutārdhana phalaṃ labhate nātra saṃśayaḥ |
tata ācārya sānnidhye vidhivat saṃskṛte nale || 54 ||

tilairgavya gṛtābhyaktairmadhu tritayamiśritaiḥ |
sāvitryā juhuyādādāvaṣṭottaśataṃ vudhaiḥ || 55 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣīreṇatha tilaurgavyaghṛtatpataiḥ |
sahasraṃ juhuyādagrau śatādhikamataḥ paraṃ || 56 ||

vāsudevasya manunā vaiṣṇvanyā ca ṣaḍarṇayā |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā pratyekaṃ jātavedasi || 57 ||

dvādaśārṇa mahālakṣmā śuddhājyena tataḥ paraṃ |
hutvā paṃcaśataṃ vahnau rasmibhirjuhuyāt sukṛt || 58 ||

rājadhirājalakṣmīśā vidyayā tatparaṃ śuciḥ |
aṣṭāviśatidhā gavyaṃ juhuyāddvātamādarāt || 59 ||

ekaviṃśati saṃkhyākairvarmamaṃtre itaḥ paraṃ |
paṃcadhā juhuyādamrau śuddhenājyena sādhakaḥ || 60 ||

hutvā japādibhiḥ paścāt katvā brahmārpaṇā huti |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvaṃ praṇipatyātha sādaraṃ || 61 ||

ṣaṣṭicihnukāsauvarṇa padmarāga samanvitaṃ |
ācāryakarṇa yugale pradadyāt kuṃḍala dvayaṃ || 62 ||

vastra dvayaṃ samarpyātha susūkṣmaṃ mṛdu nirmalaṃ |
śālagrāmāmaśilāṃ kṣaddhāṃ tasya haste samarpayet || 63 ||

sarvakhaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ dadyādvarṣāśāśanadhanaṃ tu vā |
caturviṃśātini kanānika dvādaśakaṃ tu vā || 64 ||

avaśyaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ dadyātanyūnaṃ na samarpayet |
ekādhenurvahukṣīrā pradātavyāṃ savatsakā || 65 ||

dakṣiṇā sahitā paścāccaturākasammitāḥ |
preṣaṇīyāstinnāstasya maṃdiraṃ siddhimicchatāḥ || 66 ||

<p. 105a>

māvaśyakaṃ dānaṃ kartavyaṃ bhūtimīcchatā |
śāktānāṃ dhanādhyānāṃ tu vakṣyotāddī || 67 ||

khārīdvaya nirtābhūsasma vṛddhi sānvitāṃ |
vahudakṣiṇayā yuktā deśikāya samarpayet || 68 ||

kuṃḍala dvitayaṃ deya mavaśyaṃ brahmanaṃdanāḥ |
mudrikodaravaṃdhādīna laṃkārān samarpayet ||69 ||

dhenu dvādaśakaṃ dadyāt savatsa dakṣiṇānvitaṃ |
śālagrāmaśilāṃ niṣkaśata sāhasradākṣiṇāṃ || 70 ||

datvā samarpayet paścattilarāśiṃ sadakṣiṇaṃ |
mahādānāni cānyāni dadyādā jādhanī tu vā || 71 ||

aśektenāpi dātavyaṃ pūrvoktaṃ dānamuttamaṃ |
yogarāje mahtyatra lakṣīkṣī nārāyaṇābhidhe || 72 ||

ekānapyāhuti kṛtvā tilaimadhughṛtaptataiḥ |
koṭiśastilahomasya phalaṃ dviguṇamaṣṇute || 73 ||

niṣkamātraṃ suvaṇevāṃ datvo deśikayādapīḥ |
savaṇe meru dānasya phayanyoti śāśvataṃ || 74 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā rājarājerājena goghṛtaṃ |
gāyatrā koṭi homasya sukṛtaṃ sāgamakṣayaṃ || 75 ||

koṭi dvādaśa saṃkhyāka śrīmadaṣṭārṇa homataḥ |
akṣayaṃ yatphalaṃ bhoktaṃ purāṇaiḥ paramarṣibhiḥ || 76 ||

ramayā dvādaśārṇena koṭi homena yatphalaṃ |
saṃpūrṇa dakṣiṇā yukta vājimedhā yutena ca || 77 ||

yatphala vedavihītaṃtopi dviguṇaṃ phalaṃ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇe yoga protyevanaṃ saṃśayaḥ || 78 ||

brahmahatyā śatenāpi surāyānā yutena vā |
khaṇesteya śatenāpi gurupaśatena vā || 79 ||

anekajanmahasrakṛta na privimucyate |
saṃprāpyātyaṃta saubhāgyaṃ kaṃdayesa daśa prabhaṃ || 80 ||

śāśvataṃ hadaiśvarya dhānadhānyādi saṃkulaṃ |
ratnaṇaṃśi samākīṇemavāpye jagatītale || 81 ||

bhūtvāyāṃragataḥ sarvavidyānāṃ jīvasannibhaḥ |
vimuktaḥssakalāphalaḥ sarvaroga vivarjitaḥ || 82 ||

dīrghāyussakalān bhogān divyānapi ca mānuṣya |
mukulakoṭi saṃmuddhṛtya brahmānaṃdarasāspadaṃ || 83 ||

śāśvataṃ padamāpnoti sākṣānmārāyaṇātmakaḥ |
rājarājamahāvidyā sādhanaṃ sakaleṣṭadaṃ || 84 ||

kiṃciduktamida viprā bhūyopyatra pravakṣyate |
[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīyetaṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge rājarājavidyā māhātmye dvicatvāriṃśodhyāyāḥ] ||

<p. 105a>

śrībhagavānuvāca ||

śūṇadhaṃ yogināṃ śreṣṭhā brahmaputrā dṛḍhavratāḥ |
rājarāja mahāvidyāśeṣa māhāhyamanuttamaṃ || 1 ||

<p. 105b>

ācāryānu smṛtiḥ pūrvabrāhmetkale dino dine |
brahmavidyānusaṃdhānaṃ yathā śaktyā tataḥ paraṃ || 2 ||

bhagavadraśmimālāyā janusmaraṇamapyathe |
śrīdevīrāśmi vidyānāṃ smaraṇaṃ ca tataḥ paraṃ || 3 ||

lalitānu smṛtiḥ paścādaṣṭā viṃśatidhāpi vā |
gāyatrāyāsanāyaścābhitya homastataḥ paraṃ || 4 ||

śrīdasadaṣṭākṣaropāstiraṃgavidyā samanvitā śriyaḥ |
paṃcadaśārṇayā upāstiśca dine dine || 5 ||

rājarāja mahāvidyoyosanā pratyahaṃ tataḥ |
sahasrārṇa mahāvidyā dvayo yāstistataḥ paraṃ || 6 ||

brāhmekāletha vā prātarmadhyāhaṃ vāpi saṃdhyayoḥ |
varmaṇe vaiṣṇavasyātha ghaṭanaṃ pratyahaṃ tathā || 7 ||

yajñeśvara mahāvidyo yātissāya mataḥ paraṃ |
saṃpūrṇo yāstirityuktā sarvasiddhikarī śubhā || 8 ||

brahmavidyā japo brāhme kāle śrīpādukā smṛtiḥ |
bhagavadraśmi sūktasya smaraṇaṃ ca tataḥ paraṃ || 9 ||

saṃdhyopāstiratha proktā nityahomastataḥ paraṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā japo nityaṃ sahasraśaḥ || 10 ||

atha paṃcaśataṃ vāpi śatavrayamathāpi vā |
vāsudevādi vidyānāṃ yathā rātryājamojvaḥ || 11 ||

śrīdvādaśārṇavidyāyā rājyalakṣyā japothavā |
catuḥśataṃ paṃcaśataṃ triśataṃ vā śataṃ tu vā || 12 ||

śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣayo śatatraya japonvahe |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ nityamaviśatidhāpi vā || 93 ||

anuttara brahmavidyā smaraṇaṃ ca tataḥ paraṃ |
yajñeśvara mahāvidyā smaraṇaṃ sāyamapyatha || 14 ||

yakṣātaramidaṃ proktaṃ saṃpūrṇa phalāsiddhidaṃ |
brahmavidyā japonityaṃ sadhyo yāstirataḥ paraṃ || 15 ||

nityahomastata śrīmadaṣṭārṇe yāsanā tathā |
vāsudevasya vaiṣṇavyā yathā sakti japonvahe || 16 ||

prasanna lakṣmamyāḥ kamalā dvādaśārṇasya vānvaha |
āṣṭottaraśataṃ vepi yāvacchakya japothavā || 17 ||

aṣṭaviśavacchavya japonvahaṃ || 19 ||

aśaktāmayamapi pūrṇeyāsti rudīritau |
rājarājamahāvidyā smaraṇaṃ yena saṃtataṃ || 20 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā vāpi daśadvādaśa cāpi vā |
kaṃapte yena saṃpūrṇeyāsanā janitaṃ phalaṃ || 21 ||

labhyate nātra saṃdehasyatthameva mayocyate |
anahīta śrutirapi yāgahīnopi vānvahaṃ || 22 ||

śrautāgnihotra hīnopi rājarājeśvarī parāṃ |
lakṣmīnārāyaṇīvidyāṃ taptvā sarvaśrutiṣvapi || 23 || 

prajaptvātha yathā śaktyā gurubhakto dṛḍhavrataḥ |
pārāyarāṇa phalaṃ nityaṃ vedābhāṃ sāgamādaśat || 24 ||

<p. 106a>

anadhītopyathānyoti pratyahaṃ nātra saṃśayaḥ |
ekāmapyāhuti ghṛtvā rājarājyavidyayā || 25 ||

vājapeya phalaṃ nityaṃ labhate pūrṇadakṣiṇaṃ |
rājarāja mahāvidyā smṛteranvahamādarāt || 26 ||

koṭi mahāmaṃtrā japahomādibhirvinā puraścaraṇa |
saṃsīddhā bhavaṃtyatra na saṃśayaḥ || 27 ||

ekādaśī śuklapakṣepatīyā samanvitā |
bhṛguvāsara saṃyuktā citrā nakṣatra saṃyutā || 28 ||

prasannalakṣmī yogoyaṃ durlabhā jagatī tale |
varṣe dvādaśabhiryogaḥ prāpyateya sanātana || 29 ||

yogeṣu vavyatīpātaḥ śreṣṭhaḥ sakalasiddhidaḥ |
vāreṣu bhārgavovārastithiṣṭhekādaśīśramā || 30 ||

sarvatoṣu vitrāpyā yogoyaṃ durlabho bhuvi |
brahmatātmā saṃsiddhipradoyamakhileṣṭadaḥ || 31 ||

atra homa japādīni yaḥ karotī jiteṃdriyaḥ |
tasya nārāyaṇaḥ svāmī rājyalakṣmī samanvitaḥ || 32 ||

pādati na saṃdehassatyasatyamayocyataṃ |
lakṣmīssakalaṃ bhaktabhāṃ prasannā kamalāyā || 33 ||

iṣṭārthadā bhavatyevat kartṛ hari priyā |
samasta jagatāṃ māthaḥ sākṣānnārāyaṇaḥ || 34 ||

svayaṃ vadatya sakṛdeveṣa bhaktā vaikuṃṭha maṃdire |
prasanna kamalāyoge saṃprayoganoyāke || 35 ||

yogamāṣṭārṇayā rājārājamaṃtraṃ vā ghṛtaṃ |
juhāti su samidvedagnaudyatkividapi kāṃcanaṃ || 36 ||

deśikāṃghrige datvā siddhānāmadyiyo bhavet |
bhūtyā nāmagragarā paraṃ tvamahaṃ dāsyāmimatyade || 37 ||

cicchaktirmadabhinneya mahālakṣmī srīyayī |
prasīdatyasya bhaktasya satyameva na saṃśayaḥ || 38 ||

prasannalakṣmīyo gautra suprāptyosu srvasiddhide |
deśikānutathā srātvā nityakarma samāpya ca || 39 ||

saṃskṛte pāvake paścācchīmadaṣṭārṇa vidyāyā |
triśātādhika sāhasraṃ juhuyāt kāpilaṃ ghṛta || 40 ||

nīladhenvājyamatha vā śuddhagavyaghṛtaṃ tu vā |
hutvātha ca vāsudeva svamanunāṣṭottaśata || 41 ||

hutvātha viṣṇumaṃtreṇa śatamaṣṭottare hunet |
tadvādaśārṇa śriyāya śrīrājyalakṣmyātha vā tataḥ || 42 ||

hutvā paṃcaśataṃ vahnau rājarājāravyā vidyayā |
hunedaṣṭottaraśatamaṣṭāviṃśatidhāpi vā || 43 ||

bhagavaddharma bhatraiśra paṃcadhā juhuyādvataṃ |
tāto japāgadībhirhotvā katvā brahmarparāgahuti || 44 ||

agniṃ pradakṣiṇī kṛttha natvā deśika pādayoḥ |
gaṃdhapuṣpairatnaṃ kṛtya dhanu dvitayamādarāt || 45 ||

vahakṣmīra samāyukta savatsa dakṣitānvitaṃ || 45 ||

arpayedvakṣiṇā tatra vaśośananitaṃ dhana || 46 ||

<p. 106b>

tadardha vā tadardha vā suvarṇa dvitayaṃ tu vā |
ācayedapitāṃ vastrairalaṃkāraissamarcayet || 47 ||

mahatī siddhimāpnoti kimanyairvahubhāṣaṇe |
puṣpamāse paurṇamāsyāmakaṃ vāro bhavedyadi || 48 ||

nakṣatraṃ yadi puṣpāvyaṃ sa yogo rājanāmakaḥ |
bhūteśvaranāmāyaṃ mahalakṣmīpatidhiyaḥ || 49 ||

somasya grahaṇaṃ tatra yadisyādbrahmanaṃdanāḥ |
mahāciṃtāmaṇirmnā yogoyaṃ durlabho bhuvi || 50 ||

divasatritaya tasmāt pūrvanityaṃ jiteṃdriyaḥ |
adhaḥśāyī haviṣyaśī śrīmadaṣṭākṣaraṃ manuṃ || 51 ||

sahasra prajapottanā nityaṃ paṃcaśatādhikaṃ |
vāsudeva mahavidyo vaudyavivaṃ ṣaḍakṣarī || 52 ||

aṣṭottaraśata japtvā dvādaśārṇa mahāmanaṃ |
prasanna lakṣmīmatha vinitya paṃcaśataṃ japet || 53 ||

rājarāja mahāvidyā maṣṭottaraśataṃ japet |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā yadvā saṃprāpto caṃdravayarvaṇi || 54 ||

srātvā tatra viśuddhātmāna svādesikapādayoḥ |
saṃskṛtyovārdhavaddhā tatrāvātva śripaiḥ || 55 ||

athāviṃśatidhā vedamātrādau goghṛtaṃdunet |
ghṛtamiśrīstīlau paścacchaṃtādhika sahasraka || 56 ||

śrīmadatharṇayā hutvā vāsudevasya vidyayā |
hutvā dvādaśadhāva vadahau vaiṣṇavyā vidyayāpyatha || 57 ||

dvādaśākṣarakakṣyā vā rājyalakṣyātha vā tataḥ |
triśata juhuyādājya śuddhāmeva śatata vā || 58 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā suṃdarīvaddha bhāravya |
yājayāḥdibhistato hatvā kṛtvā brahmārpaṇahuni || 59 ||

namaskatya ca sāṣṭāṃgaṃ pradākṣiṇa purassara |
agnitra jvalitaṃ paścannatvācārya padadvayaṃ || 60 ||

saṃbhatya hema vaciaṃ ṣaṣṭhicihukamānakuṃ |
avaśyaṃ kuṃḍala dvaṃdvaṃ deśikāya samarpayet || 61 ||

divyā saṃkaraṇairvasyābhyarcyātha deśikaṃ |
sarvasvamarpayeddhīmānyaccayā vadāho sthita || 62 ||

varṣoṭaśanamita dravyamatha ca guraverpayet |
caturviṃśatiti niṣkavāṃ tadardhavā samarpayet || 63 ||

avaśyaṃ vasudhāṃ dadyādvahuśasya samāḥ kulāṃ |
sālāgrāma śilāṃ dadhādyā vicchasaṃ dakṣiṇa || 64 ||

dhenvādi daśadānāni śrotriryabhyassamarpayet |
tulahirāya garbhādi dānadyānmahīpatiḥ || 65 ||

ciṃtāmarāyabhidhe yoge trailokye nāpi durlabhe |
yadyatvorātit sarvamanatu phaladaṃ smṛta || 66 ||

mahālakṣmīdhiyā sākṣādeśikasya priyāmatha |
vāsobhirapya laṃkārairarcayet sādhakottamaḥ || 67 ||

<p. 107a>

aśakto maṃdabhāgyepi kṣiptvā śūdrakānapipi |
yāvacchavyamalaṃkāgatvā deśikakarṇayāḥ || 69 ||

ekaṃ vāsassamarpyātha navaṃ sūkṣma sūdrasya |
sūniṣka dvādaśakaṃ dadyāt vaṇinaṣkamathavārpayat || 69 ||

sākṣāllakṣmīdhimācāryapatnyai vāsaṃ sunirmalaṃ |
datvālaṃ datvālaṃkaraṇaṃ yāvacchakyaṃ dadyojottamā || 70 ||

ācāryaputrapotrādīnapi saṃpūjayet tadā |
pratyayekeyo viprebhyaḥ pradadyāddakṣiṇamatha || 71 ||

varāhamākhānmuktaṃ hacchāsrāyāttataḥ paraṃ |
paradyurbrāhaṇā bhojyā suvāsinyokaṃ saṃkhyayā || 72 ||

caṃdrayavoṇi vā bhānugrahaṇe vā dvijonnameḥ |
śālagrāhamāśelāśyaṃ dātavyā dakṣiṇanvitā || 73 ||

itthaṃ kṛtvā bharaścadragrahaṇe vā kaṃpatrīṇa |
janekakoṭi brahmāṃḍa sāgadāna yabhet || 74 ||

sūrṇe dakṣiṇayukta puraścaryā śatasya |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī siddhimānyātyeva mahattarī || 75 ||

asābhyamapi devānāṃ mahaṣīṇaṃ ca durlabhaṃ |
prāmāṃti savulābhīṣṭanaiśvaryaṃ vaṇimādikaṃ || 76 || 

avyāhatājñā sarvatra siddho bhavati sādhakaḥ |
taṃ mānayaṃti śakrāyā dikpālāśca maharyayaḥ || 77 ||

kadarpapṛśīkaṃti rājarāja samaśriyaṃgaṃ |
gātaraga sadṛśī vidyāṃ ca dhiṣyaṇeyamā || 78 ||

svacchaṃdamaraṇaṃ jātismārāṃ vāyurastamaṃ |
putrapautrādi saṃpattiṃ bhogāna vivānapi || 79 ||

datvārā parasākṣājjvāvajjīvaṃ jagatpatiḥ |
dote svayadataṃrasme pracchatya calaṃ śubhaṃ || 80 ||

amāvāsyā puṣpamāse somavāsasāyutāvya |
tīpāta samāyuktā vaiṣṇavarkṣa samanvitā || 81 ||

nāmnā mahodayaḥ proyogoyaṃ bhagavatyiyaiḥ |
yadyarkavāsaserotrasyāddadhaudiya iti smṛtaḥ || 82 ||

yoga dvayamidaṃ purāṃ durlabhaṃ bhuvanatraye |
caturviśatimirvaryairvaṣa dvādaśakena vā || 83 ||

labhyate yogarājo yamakaṃ parvarātamrabhaḥ |
etat sarvasaṃnāmaṃ nāsti pāṭatālodi vivā bhuvi || 84 ||

atra yadyahabhaṃ karbhā kriyeta sādhakottamaiḥ |
ravidyarva sahasrepi kṛtaṃ tadṛśaṃ na hi || 85 ||

arddhodaya mahāyoge yoge vāpi mahodaye |
phalaṃ na śatyate vaktaṃka tasya śubhakarmaṇaḥ || 86 ||

arddhodaye vāpi mahoye vā japasyohāmasya gugaiḥ padāvre |
dānasya kartaṃ sukataṃ hi vaktamanataṃdevana na śakyatepi || 87 ||

sahasraśīrṣā bhagavānaṃtaḥ pacānaro vā jagatāmadhīrāḥ |
caturmukho vā jalajātalāta janmāṣaḍānano vagiśasya ṣatra || 88 ||

<p. 107b>

mahodaye puṇyaphalaṃ pravaktaṃ śaktāna sarve vibhavaṃti devāḥ |
mahodaye yogavarenna samyak snātvā sadācāryaya praṇamya || 89 ||

śrīviṣṇuvarmāpi sakṛjjapitvā nārāyaṇaṃ paśyati |
sārvabhaumaṃ mahodayābhidye yoge vārddhīdayabhidhe || 90 ||

yatkiṃcida vā kṛtvā homa dānādikaṃ śubhaṃ |
koṭi koṭi puraścaryā phala prāpnoti śāśvataṃ || 91 ||

atrāvaśyaṃ deśikāṃghri yuge niṣka samarpya |
vamiru sāhasra dānasya phalaṃ prāpnotya saṃśaya || 92 ||

mahodaya samoyogo nāsti nāsti mahītale |
ekāhutyāpi sadṛśaṃ purāyaṃ nāsmatra bhūsurāḥ || 93 ||

merudānaṃ ca niṣkasyado na nātra samaṃ na hitadvidhā |
na pravakṣyāmi śṛṇudhvaṃ brahmanaṃdanāḥ || 94 ||

mahodayābhidhe yoge saṃśradvaudayepi vā |
sāmudreṇāṃbhusāsrānaṃ tatra kartavyamādarāt || 95 ||

atha bāgīrathī godāyamunādyadakena vā |
snātavya sarvapādyānāṃ nivṛtyathaṃ samāhitaiḥ || 96 ||

tatra prātassaṃmatthāyanatvo daśika pādayoḥ prātaḥ |
snātvā viśuddhātmā nityaṃ saṃdhyāmuyāsya ca || 97 ||

tataḥ khagṛhamāgatya saṃpratiṣṭhāpya yādhakaṃ |
kāpilājyaṃ samādāyaṃ śuddheyavyājyameva vā || 98 ||

aṣṭāpi śatidhā hutvā sāvitryādau bhṛtaṃgavāṃ |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā brahmavidyayāpighṛpitaṃ hunet || 99 ||

lakṣmīpatiṃ jagannāthaṃ nārāyaṇamanāmayaṃ |
tatrāvāhyasamiddhegnau śatādhika sahasrakaṃ || 100 ||

gavyamājyaṃ hunet paścācchī madaṣṭāṇavidyayā |
vāsudevena manunā viṣvoratha ṣaḍarṇayā || 101 ||

āṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvā pratyekaṃ jātavedasi |
śrīdvādaśārśā maṃtreṇa rājyalakṣamyātha vā tataḥ || 102 ||

triśataṃ juhuyādājyaṃ rājarājavya vidyayā |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hutvārvo maṃtrairataḥpradaṃ || 103 ||

paṃcadhā juhuyādagnau hutvā tatra japādibhiḥ |
prāyaścittāhutīḥ kṛtvā kṛtvā brahmārpaṇāhāti || 104 ||

agniṃ pradakṣiṇī kṛtya natvā deśikamādarāt |
sarvasvāmayeyeddhīmānala kṛtya tataḥ paraṃ || 105 ||

vāsobhirbhūṣaṇaiḥ paścādvahukṣīrāṃ savasakāṃ |
avaśyamaryaddhene vahusasya samanvite || 106 ||

dadyādavaśyaṃ vasudhāṃ daśadānānyataḥ |
paraṃ datvā dvijātivaryebhyo deśikasya priyāmatha || 107 ||

alaṃkuryātatya haimairbhūkā avaśyamarpaye |
(******) ddhānuṃ vahusasya samanvitī || 106 ||

dadyādavaśya vasuvīdaśadānānyataḥ praparaṃ |
datvā dvijātivaryebhyo deśikasya priyāprāmatha || 107 ||

alāṃkuryātatya haimai bhūṣaṇaivasrā saṃcayaiḥ |
samarpayen mahadānānyatha bhūyādi svayaṃ || 108 ||

<p. 108a>

athavā deśikaṃ natvā yathā śaktyā ca ca bhūṣaṇaṃ |
datvā sasūkṣma vāsepi varṣāśanamitaṃ dhanaṃ || 108 ||

caturviprātinikaṃ vā tadardha vā tadardhakaṃ |
vittalomaṃ parityajya dadyāddeśika pādayoḥ || 109 ||

gurupatnye paramā vudhyā catuḥṣayiyalaṃ śubhaṃ |
kāsya pātraṃ tadadardhaṃ vā phalaśi samanvitaṃ || 110 ||

svarṇalaṃkaraṇe yeta sūkṣmavastramanvitiṃ |
dakṣiṇā sahita dadyādavaśya sādhakottamaḥ || 111 |||

prasarya kebhyo ca vaprobhyo yathā śaktā ca dakṣiṇaṃ |
datvā suvāsinī rekaviṃśatsakhyā manoharāḥ || 112 ||

bhojayedvipravaryāṃśra tataḥ paṃcadaśāpivā |
dakṣiṇābhiścatāṃ kalaistoṣayitvā tataḥ paraṃ || 113 ||

guruputra prapautrādī niṣṭairadhaiśca toṣayet |
deśikānujñayā paścādbhaṃjīyādvaṃdhubhissaha || 14 ||

itthaṃ mahodayekatvāraśvaraṇamādarāt |
arddhodaye vā kṛtvetthaṃsi prāpnoti śāśvatī || 15 ||

janmadvakoṭi sahasrotthairapiyāta karāśibhiḥ |
sadyo vimucyate vaśyaṃ purāsīyutī bhavet || 116 ||

tanmāse jagatānārtha brahmemānādibhivaṃtaṃ |
paśyatyeva svacakṣurbhyāṃ lakṣmīsaditamacyutaṃ || 117 ||

bhagavat kalayāpūrṇaśāmagra sukṛtānvitaḥ |
asādhyamavidevānāma sādhyaṃ yogināmapi || 118 ||

samastābhiṣṭhāmāsādya śriyaṃ capi mahattarī |
dhanadhīnyayuśruvāta saṃkulāṃ ratnasaṃkulī || 119 ||

acalāṃ saṃmanuprāpya saṃtati vyāpinīmapi |
yāṃraṃgatosau vidyānāṃ śāstrāṇāmapi  pāragaḥ || 20 ||

avāpya dīrghamāyuṣya bhogānapī sudarlabhān |
ciraṃjāti smaro bhūtvā brahma dṛṣṭvā sanātanaṃ || 21 ||

chaṃda mṛtyuhote divyakanyā śatānvitaḥ |
kulakoṭiṃ sasamudbhṛtyanmayāti paramaṃ padaṃ || 22 ||

rājādhirāja vidyāyāḥ śrīmadaṣṭākṣarasya ca |
sādhanāni na śavāṃte sayāvaktaṃ dvajarṣabhāḥ || 123 ||

śrīrāmānujñayā sarve yoginopi māharṣeyaḥ |
tattacchāstreṣa vakṣyati sinyānyu vudhyādvijarṣabhā || 124 ||

suguptyamāpi yuṣmabhyamayau tatkathita dvijāḥ |
rājādhirāja vidyāyā śrīmadaṣṭākṣarasya ca || 125 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasyedāsarathīsaṃtaṃtrevedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge kāpilataṃ tretrayaścatvāriṃśāṃdhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 108a>

śrībhagavānuvāca ||

suguptyamapi vakṣyāmi sādhanaṃ brahmanaṃdanāḥ |
yacchatvāpi dvijā bhūdyau jīvanmuktussukhī bhavet || 1 ||

yosauvadārikārarāyedhamayutro mahātapāḥ |
ṛṣinasiyaṇo yogī śāśvataḥ śaṃkarocyutaḥ || 2 ||

<p. 108b>

neraṇā sahitassarvalokānāṃ hitakāmyayā |
sa eva viṃdhyadeśasyā janānā nāpi bhūtale || 3||

āvīrāsīn mahāyogī kṣetre śrīpuruṣottamo |
muktido darśanādeva narāṇamatra sastaṃ tataṃ || 4 ||

nesa eva mathurāyā yāvadvārākāyābhabhūddhariḥ |
muktidaḥ sarvamartthānāṃ bhūtale darśanādapi || 5 ||

naranārāyaṇīvidyā samastādha vibhedinī |
āsmin taṃtre purā proktā sadyaḥ pratyayakāriṇī || 6 ||

purāya vadārikārarāyenathurāmathapivā |
dvārakānagare vāpi kṣetre vā puruṣottame || 7 ||

ekameva pravakṣyāmi sādhana sarvasiddhidaṃ |
etedyanyatamaṃ kṣotramāgatya niyatra vrataḥ || 8 ||

ācāryasannidhīkṛtya tadanujñā purassaraṃ |
srātvā prātarviśuddhātmā nityaṃ saṃdhyāmupāsya ca || 9 ||

gāyatrīṃ vahuśī japtvā sahasra triṃśataṃ vā |
nityahoma samāpyātha śrīmadaṣṭākṣī śubhāṃ || 10 ||

sahasra prajapaddhābhān śatādhikamathadarāt |
vāsudeva mahāvidyā vaiṣṇavī ca śate japet || 11 ||

japet paṃcaśataṃ nityaṃ prasannakamalā manu |
dvādaśāṇaṃ śriyaṃ vāpi rājarājeśvarīmatha || 12 ||

aṣṭāviṃśatidhā japtvā varma nārāyaṇātmakaṃ |
paṃcaviṃśatidha nityaṃ japet paṃcāhamādarāt || 13 ||

bhagavaddharśnaṃ katvā bhagavanmaṃdire tataḥ |
naranārāyaṇīvidyāṃ japedaṣṭottareśataṃ || 14 ||

utsarvaṃ pratyahaṃ kuryādbhavanmaṃdire tataḥ |
ekabhaktāśano nityaṃ phalāśī vā haviṣyabhuk || 15 ||

itthayaṃ caṃḍibhaṃ kṛtvā prātaḥ ṣaṣṭhehni suvrataḥ |
snātvā deśikayādāva prakṣālitalaṃ yovet || 16 ||

saṃdhyā samāpyavidhivanmitya homamataḥ paraṃ |
ācārya sābherdhāvagni pratiṣṭhāpya saṃmāhitaṃ || 17 ||

kāpilājye samādāya gavyājya vāthaṃ nirmalaṃ |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā pūrvasāvitryājvalite nale || 18 ||

hutvātha dvādaśākṣarmaṃ tathaiva juhuyādvate |
śriyaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ paścāt samāvāhya yata vrataḥ || 19 ||

upacārai samabhyarcyayaṃ vā śanmidhunaiṣṭha śubhauḥ |
ekaikāmārhate katvā śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā || 20 ||

sahasre juhuyādājya śatādhika mataḥ paraṃ |
vāsudevasya manunā vaiṣṇavyā ca ṣaḍarṇayā || 21 ||

āṣṭottaraśata davā pratyekaṃ jātaedasi |
śrādaśārṇayā paścāt prasanna ramayāpi vā || 22 ||

<p. 109a>

triśataṃ juhuyādājyaṃ maṣṭāviṃśādhikaṃ tataḥ |
bhagavadraśmi vidyābhidyaitamekaikaśo hunet || 23 ||

rājādhirāja manunopyaṣṭā viṃśatidhā ghṛtaṃ |
hutvātha ca maṃtraiśca paṃcadhā huthātte || 24 ||

naranārāyaṇa mahāvidyayā ca tataḥ paraṃ |
aṣṭottaraśata hutvā kṛtvā homaṃ japodibhiḥ || 25 ||

prāyaścittarathī huktāvṛtvā brahmarpaṇahutiṃ |
pāvake praṇipatyātha svācārya caraṇadvaye || 26 ||

rakāṃte praṇipatyātha sāṣṭāṃga daṃḍavacchaciḥ |
alekatyathānyāyaṃ kudralādyaissuvāsasā || 27 ||

āryaye dak'ye vittarāśiṃ tatpādakaṃje |
(**)ṇaśi ca datvātha samarpya ca vasuṃdharī || 28 ||

mahālakṣmīdhiyā tasya yalpā api vibhūṣaṇaṃ |
asānnidhyepi saṃkalpya sūkṣmaṃ vā sopi nirmalaṃ || 29 ||

dāsodāsamajāśvādīnapi svaguraveṣṭayet |
aśaktaścāpyathācārya pādābjaṃ praṇipatya ca || 30 ||

yāvaccha samalaṃkāraṃ datvā tatkarṇayoḥ |
śubhaṃ paridhānottarīyārtha vāso yumaṃ samarpya ca || 31 ||

śatāniṣkamita dravyaṃ dadyādeśikapādayoḥ |
tadardhā vā tadhardhe vā vittaśādhyā vivarjitaḥ || 32 ||

tanpṛna dakṣiṇāṃ datvā siddhināṃ proti śāśvatī |
kanatkanaka ciṃtākaṃ tāṭakakarakaṃtu vā || 33 ||

yathā śaktyātha vādudyāt tatpatnyai bhūṣaṇaṃ |
śubhapratyāmrāpa suvarṇa vā vastrayuktaṃ samarpayet || 34 ||

prasaryakabhyo viprebhyo dadyācchaktyatha dakṣiṇāṃ |
paṃcaviṃśati saravyākā atha paṃcaddaśāpivā || 35 ||

suvāsinyo dvijāgryāśca bhojanīyāstaḥ paraṃ |
kṛtvā mahotsāvaṃ tatra svācāryānujñayā hareḥ || 36 ||

bhoktavyaṃ deśikānujñā purassaramataḥ paraṃ |
itthavadarikāraroga mathurāyāmathāpi vā || 37 ||

dvārakānagare vāpi śūtre vā puruṣottame |
ihākhyaṃ vrataṃ puṇyaṃ sadyaḥ pratyayakārakaṃ || 38 ||

dina tritayamadyesau sākṣāt svapnepi vā hariṃ |
nareṇa sehitaṃ sākṣānnārāyaṇamajaṃ vibhaṃ || 39 ||

lakṣmīsahāya vasudhā nīlādevī samanvitāṃ |
suṃdarī vallabhaṃ brahmarudra śakrādibhirvṛte || 40 ||

vinatātanayā rūḍhaṃ śaṃkhacakrādinihitaṃ |
paśyatyaṃvana saṃdehastadārabhya jagatpateḥ || 41 ||

<p. 109b>

kalevare viśatyasya divyā bhagavataḥ kalā |
aṇimodi guṇeśvasūve jāti samūtiḥ śubhā || 42 ||

dhanadhānyayutā lakṣmīracalāratnasaṃkalā |
maharārogyamayūpyaṃ vaugaśvamenuttamaṃ || 43 ||

varddhate hararastasya saṃpadasyaḥyedayade |
uputrapātrābhivṛddhiśca brahmajñānama caṃcalaṃ || 44 ||

sukrīlakṣmīḥ śarīresya viṃśatyaṃ tena saṃśayaḥ |
vatsare vatsare tasya dattātreyodi yoginaḥ || 45 ||

sākṣāddaṣṭā bhaviṣyaṃti varadāsyurna saṃśayaḥ |
ayaṃ dāśarathiḥ sākṣādbhāgavānacyuto vibhuḥ || 46 ||

śabdabrahmamayo viṣṇulakṣamīpatiradhvokṣajaḥ |
anugrahyāyalīkānāṃ suvarṇamukharītaṭe || 47 ||

ṛṣibhidaivatā saṃghaiḥ prārthitaḥ sarvadhātṛbhiḥ |
anaṃtaśayano yogo śeṣāḍāvaṃjanā cale || 48 ||

ānirāsījjagatkārtā jānakī sahitaḥ pusānutamena |
vāyaputrādyā oṃ janācalanāyakaṃ || 49 ||

vekaṃṭherśāmitikhyāte sevaṃtagatāryāti |
adyodhyānagarapīṭha tasyā bhūdaṃjanācale || 50 ||

śrīraṃgadhāma yatproktaṃ tatrāpi bhagavānasau |
rāmodāśathisvāmīraṃganātha iti smṛtaḥ || 51 ||

tatrāpyayodhyājagaracakraṃ siṃhāsanaṃ śubhaṃ |
tatra tiṣṭhati vidhviśoṇamosauragaṃnāyakaḥ || 52 ||

purame tadayodhyākhyaṃ daśenānmuktidāyakaṃ |
dvitīyaṃ naimiṣārāyaṃ sadyo mukti phalaprade || 53 ||

tṛtīyaṃ śrānivāsāravyaṃ bhavavaṃdha vimocanaṃ |
caturtharagadhāmāravya bhukrikṣetramudīrite || 54 ||

śrīnivāsabhicā vidyātiṣṭhatyakātrayīmayī |
sarvapīṭhamayīsa vā vidyādharma tapomayī || 55 ||

śrīmadaṣṭārṇe vidyāṃte śrīninā sabhidhaṃ |
manu yatra kutrāpiyo nityajapenniyatavrataḥ || 56 ||

sakīkaṭeṣvapi mṛto mṛtāyodhyāpure bhavet |
śrīnivāsaṃ mahāvidyā kṣetreṣveteṣuyaḥ śuciḥ || 57 ||

prajapatyeka rātraṃ vā sa siddho bhavati dhruvaṃ |
śrīnivāsa mahāvidyā sadyaḥ pratyayakāriṇī || 58 ||

sarvasīddhikarī jñeyā yātakauya vibhedinī |
śrīnivāsa mahāvidyāmācāryavadanāṃvujāt || 59 ||

gṛhītvā prajapedyastka sa siddhādhi patirbhavat |
śrīnivāsa mahāvidyā bhavavaṃdha vimocanī || 60 ||

āyurārogya jananī samastaiścayo siddhidā |
śrīnivāsetiyo nāmamātraṃ vā pratyahaṃ smoret || 61 ||

tasyasyaḥ siddhayaḥ sarvā japahomaḥdibhirvinā |
śrīnivāsābhirdha kṣetraṃ śrīnivāso jagatpatiḥ || 62 ||

<p. 110a>

śrīnivāsa mahāvidyā trayame tatsudurlabhaṃ |
smaraṇācchre nivāsasya yatra kutrāpi saṃtataṃ || 63 ||

vimuktaḥ pāpa rāśibhyo vrahā paśyati tatparaṃ |
arcanācchrī nivāsasyā tridinaṃ vā dvijottamāḥ || 64 ||

brahmarūdra maheṃdrādaurapyamatra sa pūjate |
darśatācchrī nivāsasyā vimuktaḥ pāparāśibhiḥ || 65 ||

sākṣāt paśyati cakṣubhyamitmānaṃ brahmarūpiṇaṃ |
śrīnivāsa mahāvidyā japataḥ pratyahitryaciḥ || 66 ||

ihāpyaidrīśriyaṃ bhuktvā parame dhāmni modate |
asminnayodhyānagare naimiṣepi mahāvabhe || 67 ||

kṣetre śrīraṃgadhāmākhyeśeṣā śavapyasau dvijāḥ |
rāmodāśarathiḥ śrīmānparabrahmamayo vibhuḥ || 68 ||

nārāyaṇe jagatsvāmī śrīvivāsābhivānvitaḥ |
kṣetreṣveteṣṭa satataṃ sarvasiddhikarī śubhā || 69 ||

śrīnivāsa mahāvidyā japtavyā vaśyamiṣṭadā |
ādau trayīmayī vījaṃ prāṇavākhyaṃ mahattaraṃ || 70 ||

vātaṃ vahni samārūḍhaṃ viṃdu vāmākṣi saṃyutaṃ |
śriyo pitanmahāvījaṃ tadanatamuccaret || 71 ||

sadīghaṃ śivavījaṃ vavāhni viṃdu samānvataṃ |
māyāvījamidaṃ yamvrāccaturthamatmathākṣaraṃ || 72 ||

virahīna śriyovījaṃ nivāsāpa hṛdanvitaṃ |
trayodaśā videye vahi valī samānvita || 73 ||

sanmitraṃ mahārājñī samastaphaladāyinī |
aṇimādi guṇeśvarya pradāyuṣya vivarddhanī || 74 ||

vidyāmetāṃ purāsīkṣadanaṃtavadanāvujāt |
nārado bhagavāt prāpya brahmaputro mahātayā || 75 ||

japtvaṃ sarvajñatāṃ prāpya daivatairapi pūjitaḥ |
kṣaṇimā dviguṇan prāpyate trailokya saṃcaratyasau || 76 ||

tasmādasyā ṛṣiryogo nāradau bhagavāna bhūt |
āvitābhāva saṃvaṃdhā śrīdevyā jagatītiḥ || 77 ||

śrīnivāsa iti prokte sarāmosoḥ phameśvaraḥ |
muktilamīnivāsyeyaṃ śrīnivāsaḥ parātparaḥ || 78 ||

khārājyaśrīti nivāsoye śrīnivāso jagatpati |
mahālakṣmīnivāsauya śrīnivāsa iti smṛtaḥ || 79 ||

rājālakṣīnivāsoyaṃ śrīnivāsa itīritaḥ |
śrīnivāsa mahāmaṃtraṃ trayī sāraṃ mahodayaṃ || 80 ||

yojayennityamekāgraḥ śrīnivāsassa ucyata |
śrīnivāsāśrayatvena śrīnivāsodrirucyate || 81

<p. 110b>

kṣetredyeteṣu utriṣu śarīraṃ yaḥ parityajet |
śrīnivāso mahāyogī sabhavet parame pade || 82 ||

śrīnivāsa mahāvedyāṃ yatra krunnaye vā japan |
hāpi śrīnivāsaḥsyodaṃte mukti śrīyaṃ vrajet || 83 ||

śrīnivāsa mahāvidyā pratyakṣa phaladāyinī |
goptavyā sarvakaladā prāṇai kaṃṭha gatairapi || 84 ||

śrīnivāsa mahāvidyāyetra kutrāpi vā japan |
śrīnivāsasya labhate pūrṇanugrahamiṣṭadaṃ || 85 ||

ṛṣirasya mahāyogīnārado brahmanaṃdanaḥ |
chaṃdo jāgatamityukte gāyatrametha vā smṛtaṃ || 86 ||

śrīnivāsastrijagatāṃ nāyakaḥ parameśvaraḥ |
nārāyaṇo mahālakṣmīpatirdevata mucyate || 87 ||

śrīvījāṃ vijivityuktaṃ śaktirbhuvanamātṛkā |
kījakaṃ kāmarājaṃ syādiṣṭāthai viniyujyate || 88 ||

ṣaḍaṃgaṃ praṇavopeta śriyādṛṣṭī yaktayā karyā |
lakṣyāridi vījaivadvirāvṛtyā ṣaḍaṃgakaṃ || 89 ||

vāmāṃkārūḍha lakṣmīsahita marigadākhaḍgaśaṃkhakhajāṣvabhūlisovitaṃ 
vivimalamaṇilasadraṣaṇaṃ yuprasanna |
brahmeśāneṃdramukhyeḥ stuti padamaniśaṃ yogi hṛtyaṃ praniṣvavaṃ vaṃde 
lakṣmīnivāsa jagadabhayakare viśvavadhabhukudaṃ || 90 ||

śrīnivāsa mahāvidyaṃ dhyātvittha pratyahaṃ yet |
puraścayoḥ karmāṇi nāsya saṃti mahāmanoḥ || 91 ||

siddhavidyāmīmā brahmavidaḥ prāhurmaharṣayaḥ |
viniyoge pravakṣyāmi mṛtyudhaṃ brahmanaṃdanāḥ || 92 ||

vatṛṣṭhanyutamekṣetre sāvadhāna manāḥ śucī |
dhṛtvā bhūrddhi gurorājāṃ prātaḥ srātvā samāhitaḥ || 93 ||

yavāhabhiyatāhārāḥ śrīmadaṣṭākṣasanuṃ |
triśetādhika sāhasraṃ prajaptvā niyatavrataḥ || 94 ||

vāsudevamanuṃ paścādvaiṣṇuvaṃ ca ṣaḍakṣaraṃ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā maṃtraṃ śrīhṛdayābhidhaṃ || 95 ||

dvādaśārṇa śriyaṃ vāpi nityaṃ paṃcaśataṃ japet |
rājarājeśvarī vidyāmaṣṭā viṃśātitadhā japet || 96 ||

paṃcaviśaṃtidhā nityaṃ japedvamotha vaiṣṇavaṃ |
śrīnivāsamanuṃ rātrau sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ || 97 ||

japet paṃcadinaṃ kṛtvā vratame tatsupāvanaṃ |
ṣaṣṭehni prātarutthāye prātaḥ srātvā samāhitaḥ || 98 ||

deśikaṃ sannidhā katya sahasraṃ triśatādhikaṃ |
kāpilājyaṃ hunedagnau śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyayā || 99 ||

athavā śuddhagavyājyaṃ vāsudevena viṣṇunā |
āṣṭāviṃśatidhā hatvā śrīmaṃtreṇa tataḥ paraṃ || 100 ||	

hatvā paṃcaśātaṃ vahau rājarājākhya vidyayā |
aṣṭāviṃśatidhā hatvā varma vidyābhirapyatha || 101 ||

<p. 111a>

paṃcadhā hayādvahnau śrīnivāsasyā vidyayā |
triśataṃ juhuyādātyāṃ yādibhiratho hunet || 102 ||

brahmārpaṇaśatiṃ kṛtvā prajñipatya ca pāvake |
deśikāṃghri yugaṃ paścāt sāṣṭaṃgi daṃḍavannamet || 103 ||

alaṃkāreralaṃ kṛtya varasobhiśca tataḥ paraṃ |
pradadyānniṣka sāhasrīmācāryaṃ caraṇadvaye || 104 ||

niṣkāṇaṃ triśate vā pittaviṣkamathāpi vā |
tadardha vā tadardha vā vittaśāṭhya vivārjitaḥ || 105 ||

ācāryapatnyai vastrāṇi hemālaṃkaraṇadikī |
datvā paṃcaśābhya vrāhāṇaśca nagasanīḥ || 106 ||

nyaibhakṣyeśvanokale dakṣiṇāṃbhiṇabhiścato |
yaṣet bhūṃjati gurubhukrā aśeṣa vaṃdhabhiranvitaḥ || 107 ||

deśikasya mukhābhojādāśiṣaḥ prāpya siddhidāḥ |
niśitasmin dine khaprebharatādibhiranvitaṃ || 108 ||

śrīnivāsāṃ mahātmānaṃ jānākīsahitaṃvitu |
nārāyaṇa jagannāthamāṃjaneyābhirhata || 109 ||

avaśyamene vrahośa śakrādyaurapi pūjitaṃ |
paśyatyeva svacakṣarbhyārbhyo saprasannamukhāṃvuvajaṃ || 110 ||

tadābhya hāriṃ māsi māsi svapre jagatpatiṃ |
jānakī ramaṇaṃ sākṣāt paśyasvīlakādaṃ || 111 ||

jaḍopi  maṃdabhāgyosau tadāraya dine dine |
bhūtvā pāraṃgataḥ sarvavidyānāmadadhīrapi || 112 ||

mahākāvihāvāgmī bhūtvādhiṣaṇasabhibhaḥ |
rājamaheṃdrābhyāṃ sa sudṛśī śriyamukṣayaṃ || 113 ||

dhanadhānyayu śuvrāta muktā ratnādi saṃkulāṃ |
saṃprāpyāṣṭa gaṇaiśvarya māyurāroyamuttamaṃ || 114 ||

yogamaṣṭāṃgasahitaṃ pūrvajanmasmṛti śubhrāṃ |
dṛṣṭā nārāyaṇātmāniṃ svayameva svacakṣuṣā || 115 ||

kulasāhasamarūtyanimagnaṃ nirayedyāpi |
divyabhogayuto divyakanyāśat samanvitaḥ || 116 ||

kaṃdarpa śatasaṃkāśo bhūtvā divyavayudharaḥ |
modate paramedhāmni sannidhā viṃdirāyute || 117 ||

śrīnivāsa vratamidaṃ kṣetre dyeteṣu yāvanaṃ |
ekasminmapi vā kṣetreyaḥ karoti jiteṃdriyaḥ || 118 ||

taṃ sākṣājjānakīlakṣmīranvahaṃ yāti putravat |
vinīr'ṇaṃ janeyādyāḥ suhṛtva prāpnuvaṃtyapi || 119 ||

<p. 111b>

citāmayārādi ratnāni prayacchaṃti digīśvarā |
mānayaṃti vaśiṣṭādyāstaṃbhaktau jānakīpatau || 120 ||

nāradādyā mahābhāgā brahmayuvrāstayasvinaḥ |
tasyā bhīṣṭaphalaṃ nityaṃ prayacchaṃti na saṃśayaḥ || 121 ||

godāvarī bhīmarathī kṛṣṭhaveṇa ca narmadā |
sarasvātī ca yamunākāverīsaritīvarā || 122 ||

jāhnavī caṃdrabhāgā ca gaṃḍakī ca mahānadī |
āsāmanyatamasthāne yatra kutrapivā śuciḥ || 123 ||

śrīnivāsa vratamidaṃ yaḥ karoti vidhānataḥ |
samadhāvī mahāvāmmovidyābhirdhiṣaṇaprabhaḥ || 124 ||

dhanasamolakṣamyā kāṃtyā kaṃdarpatyā sannibhaḥ |
dīrghamāyuṣya māsādya yogaṃ cāṣṭāṃgayutaṃ || 125 ||

ekena janmanauvāsau yogināmapi durlabhā |
parāṃ gatimavāpnoti punarāvṛtti varjitāṃ || 126 ||

yena kenāpyuyāyena deśikānu japādvijāḥ |
puraścayā sahasraṃ vā puraścaryā śataṃ tu vā || 127 ||

puraścaryā dvādaśavaṃ puraścayoṣṭaka tu vā |
puraścaryā triyaṃ vāpi kṛtvā saṃpūrṇa dakṣiṇa || 128 ||

bhagavaddarśanārthāya satataṃ yalavānbhavet |
saṃpūrṇa dakṣiṇā yuktau dvadyānmadhyamadākṣiṇaṃ || 129 ||

tatrāpya śakra ācaryepādādhama dākṣiṇāṃ |
vitaśāṭhyaṃ parityajye pradadyādiṣṭasiddhaye || 130 ||

pauraśvaraṇivaṃ karma vidhāmena vivarjitithaḥ |
karoti vratī tasya hānireva prajāyate || 131 ||

dakṣiṇa rahitaṃ karma puraścaryāṃbhidhaṃ śubhaṃ |
sahasraśepi kṛtvāso na siddhiṃ labhate kvacit || 132 ||

vijñaśāṭhyaṃ parityatya bhikṣatvapi mahītale |
deśikāṃghri yuge datvā dākṣiṇaṃ śastracoditāṃ || 133 ||

puraścaryāṃ vināpīha vidyā siddhisuṃ viṃdati |
anekābhāgya saṃpattirbhavet taya pade pade || 134 ||

koṭī sāhasrasakhyākamapi datvā mahaddhanaṃ |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvakaikarpa nirato bhavet || 135 ||

siddhātyeva mahadbhāgyaṃ sārvasaubhatvamakṣayaṃ |
siddhyatyasya mahāvidyā devatvamapi sīddhyati || 136 ||

brahmatādātmyase siddhirapi puṇya sahasrakaiḥ |
na siddhyatyeva saṃpūrṇa kraubhistuvā || 137 ||

deśikājñā manurlabdhya tatpadīvujākikaraḥ |
tamevaṃ nityamabhyarcya brahmatādātmyasiddhibhāk || 138 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyādeśikājñāpurassarīṃ |
upāsya pratyahaṃ śraddho brahmatādātmya siddhibhāk || 139 ||

sarvavidyāmayīkīdyāṃ śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣaro |
yathāśaktyapyanu smṛtya deśikānujñayānvahaṃ || 140 ||

<p. 112a>

ṣadagauśvaryasahito brahmatādātmya siddhibhāk |
brahmavidyā manusmṛtya śrīśrīśadvādaśākṣari || 141 ||

brāhmekāle yathāśatrsa vrahātādālya siddhibhāk |
rājarājeśvarīdyāmavaśyaṃ pratyahaṃ śuciḥ || 142 ||

ācāryānujñayāṃ smṛtvāhmatmadālmami |
siddhibhāk brahmatādātmya saṃsiddhi hetu bhūtāni bhūtale || 143 ||

paṃcevīktāni manimirbrahmavidbhiḥ purātanaiḥ |
anyāpi mahāvidyā ratnāni jagatītalai || 144 ||

devatvādi pradānyeva punarāvattaṃkāni hi |
śrīmadaṣṭārṇavidyāyādotevaśameśvaraḥ || 145 ||

śrīyaḥ paṃcadaśārṇayā dātāpi harirucyate |
rājarājamavidyā pradātāpi maheśvaraḥ || 146 ||

sarvajña ukto lokeṣu maharṣirbrahmavittamaiḥ |
brahmavidyā pradātāpi sākṣānnārāyaṇaḥ smṛtaḥ || 147 ||

nārāyaṇātmakā ete deśikā bhūsarottamā |
samastavidyā sāmrājñī brahmavidheti kathyate || 148 ||

tato vīvā sāmrājñī śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣrī |
tatepi śrīmadaṣṭāro sāmrājñī sarve saddhidaḥ || 149 ||

rājarājamahāvidyā tatopi ca mahattarā |
ekāpyatra mahāvidyā labhyate yanmukhāṃvujāt || 150 ||

taṃdośikottamaṃ prājñā āhurnārāyaṇātmake |
tatpadardvaṃdva pūjaiva brahmatādāsya siddhidā || 151 ||

vidyādvitaṃ yamapyatra vidyā traya mathāpi vā |
labhyate hi mukhāṃ bhāṃjādyasya viprasya sādhakaiḥ || 152 ||

tasyācāryasya kaikaryakovāvarṇapi tu kṣamaḥ |
vidyā catuṣṭayaṃ yasya vadanāllamyate bhuvi || 153 ||

brahmaviṣṇu maheśādyā api devāmaharṣayaḥ |
tatpadadvaṃdvaśaścaṣī na hi carṇapituṃ kṣamāḥ || 154 ||

yasyasti devatā vuddhirdośike bhagavanmaye |
bhāṣāracita maṃtropi tasya siddho bhavatyalaṃ || 155 ||

śrīnivāsādikā maṃtrāṃ koṭikoṭi guṇetarāḥ |
yeṣāsyaraṇataḥ sidhyaṃtyukhilā api siddhayaḥ || 156 ||

śrīnivāsa mahāvidyātra kutrāpi sādhakaiḥ |
deśikānujñayā japtyā sadyaḥ pratyayakāriṇī || 157 ||

śrīnivāsa mahāvidyāmakāmapi mahītale |
ācāryānujñayā nityaṃ japtvā niyatamānasaḥ || 158 ||

sasiddhiṃprāpya mahatī paśyatyeva śriyaḥ patiṃ |
satyaṃ vacmi hitavacmi sāraṃvacmi punaḥ punaḥ || 159 ||

ācābhyaṃ caraṇadvaṃmavaśyaṃ sevyamanvahaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭakṣarīvidyā japyā sakalasiddhidā || 160 ||

<112b>

prajaptavyā tato vidyā śriyaḥ paṃcadaśākṣarī |
smartavyā pratyahī vidyā rājarājeśvarī śubhā || 161 ||

catuṣṭayāmidaṃ muktilakṣmīsādhanamīritaṃ |
anyadāyāsa phaladamuktaṃ sarvaṃ maharṣibhiḥ || 162 ||

satyame tatparabrahmā tādātmya phaladāyakaṃ |
devatvādi mahāsiddhikasme tataccatuṣṭayaṃ || 163 ||

ayaṃ dāśarathī rāmo bhagavān parameśvaraḥ |
nārāyaṇe jagatkatto sarptānaṃda cidātmakaḥ || 164 ||

etatkaiṃkarya sidhyarthaṃ nityadarśanaṃ siddhaye |
sādhanāni mayoktāni catvāri jagatītale || 165 ||

vicārya sakānvedan vicārya ca punaḥ punaḥ |
ācāryacaraṇadvaṃse vā daṣṭāditaḥ parā || 166 ||

dvitīyā brahmavidyātha śrīmadaṣṭākṣarī tataḥ |
śriyaḥ paṃcadaśārṇatha rājarājeśvarī śubhā || 167 ||

anāyāse sakala mahāsiddhiyakaṃ dṛṣṭe mata |
mayā pūrvaṃ mukarektima sādhanapaṃcakaṃ || 168 ||

ekapyatra phaladaṃ makti śrīvījamīritaṃ |
mukti śrītavaḥ pacayena nityamuyattasāḥ || 169 ||

nārāyaṇaṃ vijānī dhurtanarākṛtimacyu |
ityuktka bhagavānyogī kapilaḥ kardamātmajaḥ || 170 ||

śrīrāmānujñayā tatra svāśramaṃ prapayau vibhuḥ |
śratvai tatkāpilaṃ śāstraṃ brahmaputrostapodhanāḥ || 171 ||

brahmaṇā sahitāṃ rāmamāṣṭadya jagatīpatiṃ |
sarvasaṃśayanirmuktassatyaloka mathogatāḥ || 172 ||

śiṣṭa vāmadevādyāgunayaḥ śaṃsitavratāḥ |
śruktvā sakalavedātasaraṃ śāstramanuttamaṃ || 173 ||

hṛṣṭā pramuditā janmukhāśramaṃ rāma pūjitāḥ |

śrīdakṣiṇārtiruvāca ||

rājarājeśvarī vidyāmāhātmyamadynāśanaṃ || 174 ||

śrutvā kapilavakrābjādvaśiṣṭādyā maharṣayaḥ |
sanatkumāra pramukhā yoginaścathata vratāḥ || 175 ||

bhagavaṃtaṃ samārādhya tatkapālaccavainavāḥ dṛṣā |
sākṣajjagannāthaṃ jīvanmuktāstato bhavan || 176 ||

rājamahātavidyā māhāsmyamadyanāśanaṃ |
kiṃcidukta māyā tubhyaṃ deviparvaja kanyake || 175 ||

[iti śrīmanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubāgyavidyodayeśarājavidyāmāhāmye catuścatvāriṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 112b>

śrīdakṣiṇamūrtiruvāca ||

ayodhyānagare pūrvasākṣālārāmaṇe vibhuḥ |
rāmodāśarāthi bhūtvā kośatva śālyāgarbhasavaḥ || 1 ||

<p. 113a>

kaṃdarpāyuta saṃkāśotukī sahitonyahaṃ |
āṃjaneyādibhirnityaṃ sevito bharatāribhiḥ || 2 ||

brahmarṣibhirvaśiṣyadyaiḥ sumaṃtrāccaṣṭamaṃtribhiḥ |
sevitaḥ satataṃ sākṣāviṣṭhurmānuṣa rūpadhṛk || 3 ||

iṣṭānāṃ nigrahaṃ kakaṃniṣṭānī paripālabhaṃ |
umādi deśa sakalāndharmān khilasiddhidān || 4 ||

brahmajñāna mahadvīja śāstraṃ vedāṃta saṃgraha |
dāśarathīyādavyaṃ kathayānā sa bhūpatiḥ || 5 ||

atra prādhānyataḥ proktā gāyaryādau sanātanī |
brahmavidyā tataḥ proktā śrīśrīśadvāśākṣarī || 6 ||

śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā sarahasyā sanātanī |
uktātha vadradhā muktihetukī sarvasiddhidā || 7 ||

saiva vedeṣṭu śāstreṣu purāṇeṣyāgameṣvapi |
mukti sāmrājya kuvamālā hetukī nā parā smṛtā || 8 ||

śrīdvādaśarṇa vidyātha prokto prādhānyataḥ priye |
prānnalakṣmīvidyātha kathitā sarvasiddhidā || 9 ||

parāṃ nārāyaṇīvidyā prādhānyebhatatheritā |
śrīdevyā atha saṃprokta vidyā paṃcadaśākṣarī || 10 ||

bhūyopi kathitā rājyalakṣmīsyakala siddhi |
rājarājeśvarīvidyā tato vahuśa īritā || 11 ||

anyā api mahāvidyāstatresmin samudīritāḥ |
aṣṭākṣrāṃga bhūtatvātran māhātmyamadyāpahaṃ || 12 ||

taṃtre dāśarathīyesmin kiṃcideva samīritaṃ |
dattātreyo mahāyogī sākṣādbhagavadaṃśajaḥ || 13 ||

śrutvai tatparamaṃ taṃtraṃ saṃhitāṃ śrutisaṃmitāṃ |
anugrahāya jagatāṃ cakāra jagatīpatiḥ || 14 ||

sanakumāro bhagavān sarvajñastapasāṃnidhiḥ |
cakāra sumahatratnaṃ svanāmnā sarvāsiddhidaṃ || 15 ||

nārāyaṇāṃśajaḥ sākṣādraṃgukā tanayo vibhuḥ |
brahmavidyā vilāsāravyaṃ taṃtraṃ vedāṃtasāmmitaṃ || 16 ||

cakāra sumamahacchāstraṃ sarvaloko yakārakaṃ |
brahmaputro mahyatejā vaśiṣṭā ruṃdhatīpatiḥ || 17 ||

ṛṣibhyaḥ kathayāmāsaśāstraṃ vedārtha saṃgrahaṃ |
dvauyānātmajaḥ sākṣācchaṃkarāṃśa samudbhavaḥ || 18 ||

sārasvatābhidhaṃ taṃtra kathayāsāsa sādare |
mūlaṃ dāśarathīyākhyaṃ śāstraṃ vedāṃta saṃgrahaṃ || 19 ||

saṃhitā paṃcakaṃ paśrīdṛṣibhi samudīriti |
ajanātanayaḥ paścāt kiṃkaro jānakīpateḥ || 20 ||

saṃhitā kathayāmāsa munibhya śrutisaṃmitī |
chaṃdo mayotha bhagavān vinatā tayo vibhuḥ || 21 ||

upādideśa yogibhyaḥ śāstraṃ guhyamapīṣṭade |
sarveṣāmapi śāstrārṇāmūlaśāstramidaṃ paraṃ || 22 ||

<p. 113b>

asmintaṃtre yadyadaktaṃ tatadveda samaṃ smṛtaṃ |
nāviśvāsotra kartavyo muktilakṣmīmabhīṣṇatā || 23 ||

ācāryacaraṇadvaṃdvamavaśyaṃ sevyamanvahaṃ |
śrīmadaṣṭākṣarīvidyā japyā śuddhaiva siddhidā || 24 ||

śrīdakṣiṇābhūtistavācaḥ idaṃ guhyatamaṃ śāstraṃ |
vedavedāṃtasammitaṃ purā nārāyaṇe noktaṃ janakāya mahātmane || 25 ||

atha nārāyaṇa sākṣājjānakīpatirīśvaraḥ |
vaśiṣṭādi mahaṣīṇā sannidyauṣṭachotā mama || 26 ||

kathayāmāsa bhagavān śāstraṃ guhyataraṃ śubhaṃ |
tasyāṃ śenātīrṇesmi rudro mṛtyuṃjayaḥ śivaḥ || 27 ||

śrīdevyaṃ śasamadbhatātvaṃ devi girikanyake |
mama śrīrāmacaṃdrasya yaḥ karotibhidībhuvi || 28 ||

saraurave mahāghoreva satyā caṃdratīrakaṃ |
rāma eva parabrahmamudro viṣṇuḥ prajāpaktiḥ || 29 ||

sākṣānnārāyāṇinaṃto vāmanī narakekṣarīta |
raktame tatparamaṃ taṃtre guhyataraṃ śubhaṃ || 30 ||

śrāvyamācārya vaktrābjācchiṣyeṇa niyatātmanā |
śrutvā guhyatamaṃ śāstramidaṃ dāśarathīritaṃ || 31 ||

deśikaṃ pūjayedarthairvastrairābharaṇirapi |
deśikaṃ śastrivaktārama saṃpūjya vimūḍhadhīḥ || 32 ||

kriyāhānimavāpnoti kāryasiddhi na viṃdatiyaḥ |
pūjayati vaktāraṃ śāstrasyā mahāmanāḥ || 33 ||

śāśvataṃ padamāpnoti punarāvṛtti varjitaṃ kuṃḍaṃ ca |
vṛddhiṃ na dhānyavṛddhiṃ sau bhāgyavṛddhiṃ ca śubhāni nitya || 34 ||

avāpya śāstraśravaṇena paścāt paraṃ padaṃ yātiramādhivāsaṃ |

ṛṣyaśṛṃga uvācā 

ityuktaṃ girijādevyai śivena paramātmanā || 35 ||

citkalā manumāhāsyamārabhyauta ihasyaka |
pūrvaḥ nārāyaṇenoktamuttaraṃ śaṃkareritaṃ || 36 ||

taṃtraṃ dāśarathīyākhyaṃ vedasārārthasaṃgrahaṃ | 
atraikamapi vādhyāyamarthajñāna puraḥsaraṃ || 37 ||

paṭhedyaḥ śūṇayādvāpi vimuktaḥ pāparāśibhiḥ |
prayāti paramaṃdhāma sanātanamunuttamaṃ || 38 ||

ṛṣyaśṛṃga mukhāṃbhojācchrutvai tatparamarṣayaḥ |
matvātmānaṃ paraṃbrahma rāmaṃ nārāyaṇaṃ vibhuṃ || 39 ||

ṛṣyaśṛṃgaṃ samābhāṣya jñātvātvā dharmarahasyakaṃ |
kṛtakṛtyāstato jagmuḥkhā śrīmānmuditānanāḥ || 40 ||

<p.  114a>

idataṃtra mahahatyaṃ tāraka brahmarūpiṇā |
vaidaśāsarthasaṃgrahe jānakīpātinā proktaṃ jagadānuṃhetaka || 41 ||

[iti śrīmadanuttarabrahmatatvarahasye dāśarathīye taṃtre vedasārārthasaṃgrahe 
uttarabhāge saubhāgyavidhodaye rājavidyāmāhātmyeśāstrarahasyakathanaṃnāma 
paṃcacatvārīṃśodhyāyaḥ] ||
<p. 114a>

iṃdirāsametāya śrīnārāyaṇāya namaḥ śrī rāmaḥ śrīḥ rāma śrīvīdvarāsaṃdalī 
sukudharājat padāṃbhoruho yasyā saccivudhayatitā harinīdhiḥ 
śrīratnāratnasuṃdaryapi mātākṛmeriśvajanmadharaṇīnāmāpi vaṃśīdharo 
bhāradvāja kulośva vedayatnaṃ yato ya nāmāyapi ca || 1 ||

śrīdevīkamalā triśaktiti kamalā śrīrājyalakṣmīvṛto bhūnīlā vimalādiśakrinigama 
brahmadisaṃsevitaḥ aṃtarjyotirayaṃ sadā raghupatiḥ śrīsuṃdarīvallabhaḥ sūyāḥ 
śaraṇaguruḥ tenedamullāsitaṃ || 2 ||

śrīmahādaśarather mukhāṃvujagaladvaṇe sudhālī mamaṃ tailapyāli pito 
lilekhanikhelaṃ taṃtraṃ rahasyaṃ hi yaḥ tasmai śrīraghunaṃdanodharaṇijāyug 
rājarājeśvarīmaṃtrātmābhabhavata kipārdranayano vaṃśīdharaṃ yātvahaṃ || 3 ||

śrīdevīharicaraṇai kaniṣṭhabhaktau śrīcakrārcanadṛḍhavuddhi sadvilāsedeyaṃno 
haṭhavati mātṛjāravad vai prāṇāṃtaṃ kuṭilamatāvidaṃkate || 4 ||

śakeṃ guhaśvabhūyaunmite śrāveṇamāsyadra kṛṣṇe cakṣetithau ṣaṣīkāyāṃ guṇai 
vedasāraṃ raghūttaṃ sa taṃtraṃ lilikhehaṃ vaṃśīdharaḥ śrīśatuṣṭyai || 5 ||





